ocation":"","start":"2024-01-17","startObj":1705449600000,"title":"國一銜接講義一校改完"},{"description":"國三下 會考講義3\n目錄\n\n一 會考單字 \n1. 重點單字（從會考單字片語書裡面挑出重要單字，依難度分成三章，一章15個單字，要有單字、詞性、中文、例句、用法） @Frank Lin 前兩章、 @Christopher Chang 後一章，參考圖一，版型不論\n\n二 文法 @小揚 （全部上傳雲端完後跟我說一下）\n1. 助動詞\n2. 副詞\n3. 倒裝句\n4. 時態\n5. 各種代名詞\n6. 動狀詞\n7. 比較級\n8. 特殊動詞\n9. 副詞子句\n10. 名詞子句\n11. 形容詞子句\n12. 特殊句型\n\n三 主題式閱測/克漏字+單字 @庭Ting \n一個主題5-6篇，總共不少於30篇（閱測跟克漏字來源從段考卷以及103-106會考中擷取） @彥旭 \n主題ㄧ \n主題二\n主題三\n主題四\n主題五\n\n附錄\n1. 一字多義 共50個\n@陳禹甯 Linda 1-25個\n@Christopher Chang 26-50個\n2. 三態表\n\n總整排版 @庭Ting","end":"20240119","id":"f86gln9eh8m6pjvr02ltr3iclc_google_com","isAllDay":true,"location":"","start":"2024-01-18","startObj":1705536000000,"title":"國三會考講義3交稿"},{"description":"","end":"20240119","id":"pi6ggabjll9esq7hvrrnjrgb8o_google_com","isAllDay":true,"location":"","start":"2024-01-18","startObj":1705536000000,"title":"高一下講義交稿"},{"description":"","end":"20240121","id":"87tjpjd3v26a11bq1cjui7bfd0_google_com","isAllDay":true,"location":"","start":"2024-01-20","startObj":1705708800000,"title":"學測翻譯解答謄寫"},{"description":"Linda P1-17\nFrank P18-35\nChristopher P36-53\nDemian P54-71\nChris P72-85","end":"20240121","id":"42f5gk7hl8hijp98760lcak680_google_com","isAllDay":true,"location":"","start":"2024-01-20","startObj":1705708800000,"title":"多益初階單字書二校"},{"description":"","end":"20240122","id":"0iblnfu20inj6ebav6uittq3nc_google_com","isAllDay":true,"location":"","start":"2024-01-21","startObj":1705795200000,"title":"國三會考講義3排完"},{"description":"","end":"20240123","id":"6gvpmjb6grbfq6coj4jca6b010_google_com","isAllDay":true,"location":"","start":"2024-01-22","startObj":1705881600000,"title":"五千單給要加的單字"},{"description":"一 會考單字  Linda\n\n二 文法 Frank\n\n三 主題式閱測/克漏字+單字  Christopher\n\n附錄 1.一字多義 Chris","end":"20240124","id":"l24kgeg97c9dfq43q0vdu37hi4_google_com","isAllDay":true,"location":"","start":"2024-01-23","startObj":1705968000000,"title":"國三會考講義3一校"},{"description":"","end":"20240124","id":"185hpoq5fg01sjkaslv3j03q74_google_