any decided to ramp up production to meet the increased demand from international markets.","translation":"該公司決定擴大生產以滿足來自國際市場的增加需求。"}},"0ecb0d9d1dc336961c469a422ed8c02d":{"createdAt":1784168198375,"data":{"sentence":"The child began to choke on a piece of candy and turned red as her mother rushed to help.","translation":"那個小孩開始被一塊糖果哽噎，臉色漲紅，她的母親急忙趕來幫助她。"}},"0edbcca6accbed7883b2e4745a1803dd":{"createdAt":1788229847291,"data":{"sentence":"After weeks of fighting, the two sides agreed to a truce to allow humanitarian aid to reach the affected civilians.","translation":"經過數週的戰鬥後，雙方同意停火以便允許人道主義援助抵達受影響的平民。"}},"0ee0d0265cbfc0dfcfdc1c574023e62d":{"createdAt":1789122045451,"data":{"sentence":"The elderly woman's grandchildren took her in their care after she broke her hip.","translation":"老婦人摔斷髖骨後，她的孫子孫女把她收留在他們的照顧下。"}},"0efb996fb83728aa194a42baae6b3154":{"createdAt":1786003059958,"data":{"sentence":"The road ahead takes a sharp curve to the left, so drivers need to slow down.","translation":"前面的道路向左轉彎，形成一個急彎，所以駕駛員需要放慢速度。"}},"0f0a4a3614c88768d5122e8f7ae4576c":{"createdAt":1787482882644,"data":{"sentence":"The court questioned the validity of the contract because it was signed under duress.","translation":"法院質疑該合約的有效性，因為它是在脅迫下簽署的。"}},"0f0c912a2899194bce2e2b17a9815a5f":{"createdAt":1783846831306,"data":{"sentence":"It is appropriate to wear formal attire to a business meeting.","translation":"穿著正式服裝參加商務會議是適當的。"}},"0f0f799528b869c372dedf4b9f9c2a23":{"createdAt":1782056078147,"data":{"sentence":"The accident disabled him permanently, leaving him unable to walk without assistance.","translation":"那場意外使他永久失去行動能力，導致他沒有協助就無法行走。"}},"0f0fb026ab66046132dec1bfb52cdffd":{"createdAt":1786157991806,"data":{"sentence":"Now that you have finished your exams, you can finally take a vacation.","translation":"既然你已經完成了考試，你終於可以去度假了。"}},"0f12ff083185a0edfc6852ba84638442":{"createdAt":1783072599673,"data":{"sentence":"You can take the train to the airport, or alternatively, you could drive there your