23712,"data":{"sentence":"The philosopher's theory was criticized for being too much of an abstraction that failed to address real-world problems.","translation":"這位哲學家的理論因為過於空泛，未能解決現實世界的問題而遭到批評。"}},"3047e3e8c220fa607578099335f770cd":{"createdAt":1789607239621,"data":{"sentence":"Innovation has been the driving force behind the company's rapid growth over the past decade.","translation":"創新一直是該公司在過去十年來快速成長的推動力。"}},"304e9a4eeb0014c732f1261a14826efe":{"createdAt":1781665237989,"data":{"sentence":"The doctor ran several tests to diagnose the patient's mysterious illness.","translation":"醫生進行了多項檢查以診斷患者的神祕疾病。"}},"3058bf3f724e70241c3a00059700fc82":{"createdAt":1781737677924,"data":{"sentence":"The new technology will displace many traditional jobs in the manufacturing industry.","translation":"新技術將取代製造業中許多傳統工作。"}},"3062a72705bbc95e1f16684dbdc7e38c":{"createdAt":1781893774828,"data":{"sentence":"The company's intent is to expand into new markets and increase their market share.","translation":"該公司的目的是進入新市場並增加其市場佔有率。"}},"306cc61c4f0a1e44b0e8028280d58103":{"createdAt":1783911153434,"data":{"sentence":"She wore her hair in a long braided style that hung down her back.","translation":"她的頭髮編成長辮子，垂掛在她的背後。"}},"307001532a83f3f88a086b011b1e458b":{"createdAt":1789640852836,"data":{"sentence":"The river followed a sinuous path through the valley, winding back and forth like a ribbon.","translation":"這條河流蜿蜒曲折地穿過山谷，像絲帶一樣來回迂迴。"}},"307d504633310e5000fed2e98fe510bb":{"createdAt":1781367476521,"data":{"sentence":"We need to ensure that all safety protocols are followed before starting the project.","translation":"我們需要擔保在開始專案之前所有安全規程都得到遵守。"}},"308b63db6578cf987622aeb83828707d":{"createdAt":1786548937039,"data":{"sentence":"The occurrence of earthquakes in this region has become more frequent over the past decade.","translation":"這個地區地震的發生在過去十年變得越來越頻繁。"}},"30a245c5c4396455a9c367396276fcad":{"createdAt":1783569635447,"data":{"sentence":"He spent the entire dinner ranting about how the government has failed to address the housing crisis.","translation":"他在整個晚餐期間長篇大論地抱怨政府未能解決住房危機。"}},"30a2ef8c8b46a48897cbbed5e0875a74":{"createdAt":1789640899258,"data":{"sentence":"The densely populated city of Tokyo is home to over 37 million people.","translation":"人口密集的東京市是超過3700萬人的家園。"}},"30a5a67febe28266bd497d26d8796367":{"createdAt":1784258216071,"data":{"sentence":"The restaurant caters to customers who prefer vegetarian options by offering a diverse menu.","translation":"這家餐廳通過提供多樣化的菜單來滿足喜歡素食選項的顧客需求。"}},"30a97fced0bd9cea5ee2f7150aa887c5":{"createdAt":1786633584261,"data":{"sentence":"The enemy forces outnumber our troops by a ratio of three to one.","translation":"敵軍在人數上超過我們的部隊，比例為三比一。"}},"30b035cba8b368207d16744b21b29015":{"createdAt":1785852903698,"data":{"sentence":"The cappuccino was topped with a thick layer of foam.","translation":"卡布奇諾咖啡的頂部覆蓋著一層厚厚的泡沫。"}},"30f44f48132e6a3d8f62fe165abc0b1f":{"createdAt":1784691526184,"data":{"sentence":"The wooden carving displayed in the museum was an impressive example of traditional craftsmanship.","translation":"博物館展示的木製雕塑是傳統工藝的一個令人印象深刻的例子。"}},"310c73e4b6650e64037c490b1f31492e":{"createdAt":1789572255276,"data":{"sentence":"Her realization that she had been wasting her time on a dead-end job prompted her to pursue a new career.","translation":"她意識到自己一直在浪費時間做一份沒有前途的工作，這個領悟促使她追求新的職業。"}},"310f5ffae9e0e8009fe717d2f3859e39":{"createdAt":1786582218822,"data":{"sentence":"The doctor examined the stomach lining to check for any inflammation or damage.","translation":"醫生檢查了胃內膜，以檢查是否有任何發炎或損傷。"}},"3119a5e373e58042c4e1f46af0da0d10":{"createdAt":1786289587004,"data":{"sentence":"The elderly woman needed assistance crossing the busy street safely.","translation":"那位年長的婦女需要協助安全地穿過繁忙的街道。"}},"311aa70ada85032900b14f10e85851d9":{"createdAt":1786582170513,"data":{"sentence":"The toxic chemicals will eventually degrade into harmless substances in the soil.","translation":"這些有毒化學物質最終會在土壤中自然分解成無害的物質。"}},"31373988ac25a33eb5c6733831e33921":{"creat