y stripped the city of all its valuable resources and treasures.","translation":"入侵的軍隊奪去了城市所有寶貴的資源和財寶。"}},"3af0abf81bc649cc9609b6ef91ef53aa":{"createdAt":1786162226485,"data":{"sentence":"The water purification system removes harmful chemicals and bacteria to make the drinking water safe.","translation":"淨水系統透過去除有害的化學物質和細菌來使飲用水變得安全。"}},"3af43186b9592e9e52a96392f9691541":{"createdAt":1784607292170,"data":{"sentence":"She didn't blink when the teacher announced the surprise exam.","translation":"當老師宣佈突擊考試時，她沒有眨眼。"}},"3b13b3831d74288d3dc69b0345283815":{"createdAt":1783527040143,"data":{"sentence":"The severe drought lasted for three years, causing widespread crop failures across the region.","translation":"嚴重的旱災持續了三年，造成整個地區農作物廣泛歉收。"}},"3b1d112f75c3c1464a7a2af5cf4f8978":{"createdAt":1786665518039,"data":{"sentence":"The indigenous inhabitants of the island have lived there for thousands of years.","translation":"該島的原住民已經在那裡生活了數千年。"}},"3b2a6e27d5b0eb6558d37b8dda5afc5d":{"createdAt":1783326690428,"data":{"sentence":"The microphone will amplify your voice so everyone in the auditorium can hear you clearly.","translation":"麥克風會擴大你的聲音，使禮堂裡的每個人都能清楚地聽到你的話。"}},"3b303c8d73251ad5b083c15456aa235b":{"createdAt":1787444700541,"data":{"sentence":"India is one of the most populous countries in the world, with over 1.4 billion people.","translation":"印度是世界上人口最眾多的國家之一，人口超過14億。"}},"3b37263e99555b29038e90ff651b563c":{"createdAt":1788162803306,"data":{"sentence":"The championship game features the Lakers versus the Celtics in a battle for the title.","translation":"這場冠軍賽是湖人隊對陣塞爾蒂克隊，爭奪冠軍的一場激烈對決。"}},"3b38ca733212424a06aa2e60f843c7de":{"createdAt":1781367581484,"data":{"sentence":"The magician entertained the children with amazing card tricks at the birthday party.","translation":"魔術師在生日派對上用驚人的紙牌魔術來娛樂孩子們。"}},"3b3a7e1dfe2a50e7c2c2f172bcda6d3e":{"createdAt":1787240822027,"data":{"sentence":"Despite the challenges ahead, her optimism about the future inspired everyone around her.","translation":