-intensity interval training classes.","translation":"最新的健身風潮讓健身房裡的每個人都在嘗試新的高強度間歇訓練課程。"}},"6467405f8c70c2fbd90fb0168c22e2c7":{"createdAt":1781485722487,"data":{"sentence":"The discovery of penicillin was largely accidental when Alexander Fleming noticed mold growing on his bacterial culture.","translation":"當亞歷山大·弗萊明發現黴菌生長在他的細菌培養皿上時，青黴素的發現在很大程度上是偶然的。"}},"64767c278c72e744063a6b7f84aca926":{"createdAt":1785255329065,"data":{"sentence":"After finishing their work, the tourists decided to roam around the old city and explore its narrow streets.","translation":"完成工作後，遊客們決定在老城區閒逛，探索其狹窄的街道。"}},"6476d4048de95751d80474b624968586":{"createdAt":1789102964710,"data":{"sentence":"The different departments need to harmonize their schedules to ensure the project runs smoothly.","translation":"不同的部門需要協調他們的時間表，以確保項目順利進行。"}},"647f669328a1eb141a4cc43351085454":{"createdAt":1785254573137,"data":{"sentence":"Like thriving colonies of ants working together toward their goal, you too can achieve great things by staying determined and supporting those around you.","translation":"就像一群群螞蟻齊心協力朝著目標前進一樣，只要你保持決心並互相支持，你也能成就偉大的事物。"}},"64805ac05e01d81f107d14181502c5a1":{"createdAt":1782646391108,"data":{"sentence":"The new regulations confine employees to working within the office during business hours.","translation":"新的規定將員工限制在營業時間內在辦公室工作。"}},"6485013df371dabcbec97e5f337bfbab":{"createdAt":1783832490208,"data":{"sentence":"The basketball lost its bounce after being left outside in the cold for weeks.","translation":"籃球在寒冷的室外放置數週後失去了彈力。"}},"64877adf6eff43c2542c603b16a0b58f":{"createdAt":1781451606448,"data":{"sentence":"She always follows the latest fashion trends to keep her wardrobe modern and stylish.","translation":"她總是追隨最新的流行款式，使她的衣櫥保持現代和時尚。"}},"648f914cd52c00ce55c4209385507b38":{"createdAt":1781664900852,"data":{"sentence":"His juvenile behavior at the meeting, such as making jokes and not taking anything seriously, frustrated the other team members.","translation":"他在會議上的不成熟行為，例如開玩笑和不認真對待任何