reds of tiny gears working together in perfect harmony.","translation":"這只古董手錶設計得精巧複雜，有數百個微小的齒輪完美地協調運作。"}},"6eafdeff319af9534cffb97120c0d2a4":{"createdAt":1785840281281,"data":{"sentence":"She tenderly brushed the hair away from her sleeping child's forehead.","translation":"她溫柔地撥開熟睡孩子額頭上的頭髮。"}},"6eba088bd47528f3b914b28513ddc775":{"createdAt":1783577380760,"data":{"sentence":"The university has several faculties including engineering, medicine, and arts.","translation":"該大學擁有包括工程、醫學和文科在內的多個學院。"}},"6ec1719164adb77b91afdefce2ab6a55":{"createdAt":1785829623803,"data":{"sentence":"She finished the project ahead of the deadline.","translation":"她在截止日期之前完成了這個項目。"}},"6ec5f2d48b1058200c589ca123f92020":{"createdAt":1783832311070,"data":{"sentence":"The old wooden deck had become bleached by years of exposure to the sun and salt water.","translation":"這座老木製甲板經過多年的日曬和鹽水侵蝕，已經變得褪色了。"}},"6ed43ade69d74021fdf8569c25a196d0":{"createdAt":1786464383231,"data":{"sentence":"The rising sea levels pose a serious menace to coastal cities around the world.","translation":"上升的海平面對世界各地的沿海城市構成了嚴重的威脅。"}},"6ed6cab07da5a0be58c99ad2e9ff1905":{"createdAt":1786636161995,"data":{"sentence":"Everyone passed the exam except for Tom, who needs to retake it next month.","translation":"除了湯姆以外，每個人都通過了考試，他需要在下個月重新參加考試。"}},"6ee29542566b195f9a3a54f67f0688bf":{"createdAt":1784800063558,"data":{"sentence":"2Pac is considered one of the most influential hip-hop artists of all time, with his legacy continuing to inspire new generations of rappers.","translation":"2Pac被認為是有史以來最具影響力的嘻哈藝術家之一，他的遺產持續激勵著新一代的饒舌歌手。"}},"6ee544298db1e837195900d9a7e7c4cc":{"createdAt":1785154203175,"data":{"sentence":"The soft music and dim lighting created a soothing atmosphere that helped me relax after a stressful day.","translation":"柔和的音樂和昏暗的燈光營造出一個令人放鬆的氛圍，幫助我在壓力重重的一天後恢復平靜。"}},"6eeed05231741e59d176e56999e48c92":{"createdAt":1782365769184,"data":{"sentence":"The marine biologist spent years studying coral reef ecosystems.","translation"