ack because she was afraid of hurting his feelings.","translation":"她想告訴他真相，但她退縮了，因為她害怕傷害他的感受。"}},"768d92488df9faf51792d4c24f2b57d1":{"createdAt":1785852106653,"data":{"sentence":"The constant noise from the construction site next door has become intolerable, and I can no longer concentrate on my work.","translation":"隔壁建築工地持續不斷的噪音已經變得難以忍受，我再也無法專注於工作。"}},"768fbd782345988b3c047e406f4b73af":{"createdAt":1784217808055,"data":{"sentence":"When you groan at a difficult problem, remember that each struggle is just one step closer to mastery and success!","translation":"當你對困難的問題感到呻吟時，請記住每一次奮鬥都只是離掌握知識和成功更近一步！"}},"76a4ecf300fa60d3268c1fb510f6fce7":{"createdAt":1788769967854,"data":{"sentence":"Smartphone usage has become increasingly prevalent among teenagers in recent years.","translation":"近年來，智慧型手機的使用在青少年中變得越來越普遍。"}},"76a74005e99609841ece495ecaf5c9b3":{"createdAt":1781451711832,"data":{"sentence":"The young activist decided to defy the government's ban on peaceful protests.","translation":"這位年輕的社運人士決定違抗政府對和平抗議的禁令。"}},"76b38a7dab3d18ffed8193b951e770b4":{"createdAt":1785853007830,"data":{"sentence":"The home team scored three runs in the fifth inning to take the lead.","translation":"主隊在第五局得了三分以領先。"}},"76b9f6df2189ec1e94dfab65256de685":{"createdAt":1785769726749,"data":{"sentence":"We need to set realistic goals for the project rather than hoping for overnight success.","translation":"我們需要為這個專案設定務實的目標，而不是期望一夜成功。"}},"76bfe3157cfd4fecaf202fe013848252":{"createdAt":1782646406177,"data":{"sentence":"She was considerate enough to call ahead and let us know she would be late.","translation":"她很體貼地提前打電話告訴我們她會遲到。"}},"76e6ab874cd3e937c79cbb34ad7a3b73":{"createdAt":1783133321957,"data":{"sentence":"The film adaptation of the novel was so successful that it won several international awards.","translation":"這部小說的電影改編作品非常成功，贏得了多個國際獎項。"}},"76e706ea5739f04111be288524b70f54":{"createdAt":1782350659653,"data":{"sentence":"He comes from a decent family with a good reputation in the community