ses connecting the different floors throughout the building.","translation":"這棟老宅邸有多段樓梯連接整棟建築物的不同樓層。"}},"b322ef5c18baf68c33092c69f56fe126":{"createdAt":1788778979347,"data":{"sentence":"After several washes, the cheap fabric started pilling up, creating small balls of fiber on the surface.","translation":"經過多次洗滌後，這種便宜的布料開始起球，表面上出現了許多小纖維球。"}},"b32d5aa2150e5fdeca74e3c8369599f8":{"createdAt":1785235621262,"data":{"sentence":"She won the lottery and decided to quit her job to travel around the world.","translation":"她中了彩票，決定辭掉工作去環遊世界。"}},"b338a1cc12cd894043596a3ca0008a0c":{"createdAt":1785971617513,"data":{"sentence":"The experienced pilot skillfully navigated the aircraft through the storm.","translation":"這位經驗豐富的飛行員熟練地引導飛機通過暴風雨。"}},"b338c5b6521762afd69cf79758faf2a3":{"createdAt":1786091595146,"data":{"sentence":"Despite his anger, he showed great restraint and didn't respond to the insult.","translation":"儘管他很生氣，他仍然表現出很大的克制力，沒有回應那句侮辱。"}},"b346a325628585e62da2990e280efafc":{"createdAt":1789228882074,"data":{"sentence":"With consistent effort and a stable foundation of self-belief, you can achieve anything you set your mind to.","translation":"只要持之以恆地努力，並建立穩定的自信基礎，你就能達成任何你立定的目標。"}},"b354025611b7ebeb5fb36a5e398e016e":{"createdAt":1786695161681,"data":{"sentence":"The novelist spent years writing a voluminous manuscript that stretched over a thousand pages.","translation":"那位小說家花了數年時間撰寫一部篇幅龐大的手稿，超過一千頁。"}},"b356babc6281c60dd751e47c24a343be":{"createdAt":1781806166458,"data":{"sentence":"The company's innovative approach to renewable energy has revolutionized the entire industry.","translation":"該公司對再生能源的創新方法已經徹底改變了整個產業。"}},"b35ab86b7a354fa06ee50c361a114583":{"createdAt":1781275751417,"data":{"sentence":"The teacher gave clear directions on how to complete the project.","translation":"老師對如何完成這個專案給出了清晰的指導。"}},"b35f1aa97f3bc23c4026732e1657f95c":{"createdAt":1788676517394,"data":{"sentence":"The coach decided to humilate the player in front of the entire team for his poor performance.","translation":"教練決定在整個隊伍面前羞辱那名球員，因為他的表現不佳。"}},"b362fd6dd6c956bb73340b99e87c8df9":{"createdAt":1783509714558,"data":{"sentence":"The classroom was absolutely chaotic when the teacher left the room for a few minutes.","translation":"當老師離開教室幾分鐘後，教室變得絕對混亂無序。"}},"b363f77fd7421c1dffe8364387cb2604":{"createdAt":1781767775217,"data":{"sentence":"After years of hard work and dedication, she finally launched a successful business that generated millions in revenue.","translation":"經過多年的努力和奉獻，她終於開創了一個成功的事業，創造了數百萬的收入。"}},"b36b628326ab67ed6320fcc712cac971":{"createdAt":1782216715245,"data":{"sentence":"There is a clear contradiction between what he said yesterday and what he claims today.","translation":"他昨天說的話和他今天聲稱的話之間存在明顯的矛盾。"}},"b38628b872b994dd682723ecf13757bf":{"createdAt":1782982611123,"data":{"sentence":"She maintains a regular exercise routine by going to the gym every morning at 6 AM.","translation":"她透過每天早上六點去健身房來維持規律的運動習慣。"}},"b39020641426e6030ccfa870337dd8c4":{"createdAt":1781507479250,"data":{"sentence":"The architect had to carefully measure the dimensions of the room before designing the new furniture layout.","translation":"建築師在設計新家具佈局之前，必須仔細測量房間的尺寸。"}},"b3a5128ae4e03fdd6306a5afb7ed2097":{"createdAt":1781368742261,"data":{"sentence":"Based on my estimation, the project will cost around $50,000 and take six months to complete.","translation":"根據我的估計，該專案將花費約五萬美元，並需要六個月才能完成。"}},"b3b2b20176252aa9c5a5f2e9b7b9e55a":{"createdAt":1787839889425,"data":{"sentence":"The garbage can started to stink after we forgot to take out the trash for a week.","translation":"我們一週沒倒垃圾後，垃圾桶開始散發難聞的氣味。"}},"b3b415a4a4b7ad3c098be545d716085a":{"createdAt":1781777312175,"data":{"sentence":"The doctor said that her health condition has improved significantly after three months of treatment.","translation":"醫生說她經過三個月的治療後，健康狀況已經明顯好轉。"}},"b3bcfe0146e6b0ddccaca5de7fb15f2d":{"createdAt":1787105010930,"data":{"sentence":"I found that book to be an excellent reference for learning about ancient history.","translation":"我發現那本書是學習古代歷史的絕佳參考書。"}},"b3d12b2f84505240546ac967ee323e1f":{"createdAt":1788403983560,"data":{"sentence":"She consulted with a heart specialist to discuss her treatment options.","translation":"她諮詢了一位心臟專家來討論她的治療方案。"}},"b3d1a00d03dd4f308ae92b4ba70428e2":{"createdAt":1783569759826,"data":{"sentence":"The country's maritime laws regulate all commercial shipping activities in its territorial waters.","translation":"該國的海事法規監管其領海內的所有商業航運活動。"}},"b3d3804e70c9ef815023920b513a783c":{"createdAt":1781737376646,"data":{"sentence":"The boxer delivered a powerful blow to his opponent's jaw.","translation":"拳擊手向對手的下巴猛擊了一拳。"}},"b3fbe3a8aecd858979935660cf7368f8":{"createdAt":1781325472059,"data":{"sentence":"Only a fraction of the students passed the difficult exam on their first attempt.","translation":"只有一小部分學生在第一次嘗試時通過了這場困難的考試。"}},"b3fdc88c24ffe5652b156460e2af2b95":{"createdAt":1786860215195,"data":{"sentence":"Despite failing the exam, he walked out of the classroom with a nonchalant shrug, as if it didn't matter at all.","translation":"儘管考試不及格，他還是若無其事地聳了聳肩走出教室，彷彿這一點都不重要。"}},"b4191aece9c96a9149a27d63ba900da1":{"createdAt":1788795125867,"data":{"sentence":"The construction site used a large crane to lift heavy steel beams onto the upper floors of the building.","translation":"建築工地使用一台大型起重機將沉重的鋼樑吊起來放到建築物的上層樓板。"}},"b42a796e81f84324b66eeb53d309c287":{"createdAt":1784293312515,"data":{"sentence":"Let the sting of past failures motivate you to work harder and achieve greater success tomorrow.","translation":"讓過去失敗的刺痛激勵你明天更加努力並取得更大的成功。"}},"b42ddd9307854adc51b8e3fe0f1fa355":{"createdAt":1781768531635,"data":{"sentence":"From a business angle, the merger makes perfect sense for both companies.","translation":"從商業的角度來看，這次合併對兩家公司都是完全合理的。"}},"b42e94bbb71c6367a2fde5b83556e0cc":{"createdAt":1781768757513,"data":{"sentence":"The foundation of their business plan was based on solid market research and customer feedback.","translation":"他們的商業計劃的基礎是建立在紮實的市場調查和客戶反饋之上。"