atever they want without any discipline.","translation":"那位祖母傾向於溺愛她的孫子女，給他們任何他們想要的東西而不加任何管教。"}},"b69885154024e2eedba2a1a717215c6b":{"createdAt":1784167644237,"data":{"sentence":"The teacher's harsh criticism of his work left him feeling discouraged and upset.","translation":"老師對他作品的尖銳批評讓他感到沮喪和難過。"}},"b6a086222d0bb554765122e8961bc56c":{"createdAt":1782341801442,"data":{"sentence":"She pulled up the zipper on her jacket to stay warm in the cold weather.","translation":"她拉起外套上的拉鍊以在寒冷的天氣中保持溫暖。"}},"b6a43fb4eb0221e9707b92ab0c078106":{"createdAt":1782349155079,"data":{"sentence":"The factory workers negotiated for a higher wage to match the rising cost of living.","translation":"工廠工人協商要求提高薪資以應對生活成本的上升。"}},"b6b42cf05dc962dbfd064ffb0cb19a15":{"createdAt":1784800216491,"data":{"sentence":"Charlie Kirk is a prominent conservative political commentator who founded the youth-focused organization Turning Point USA.","translation":"查理·柯克是一位知名的保守派政治評論員，他創立了專注於青年的組織「轉折點美國」。"}},"b6d76fc2c5f88e9747fd8e918b634ac7":{"createdAt":1783500436165,"data":{"sentence":"We had dinner at the restaurant, and afterwards we went for a walk in the park.","translation":"我們在餐廳吃了晚餐，之後我們在公園散步。"}},"b6dab01fe7bed91391faa09ea942877d":{"createdAt":1784700175219,"data":{"sentence":"The doctor examined the patient's abdomen to check for any signs of internal injury.","translation":"醫生檢查了患者的腹部，以檢查是否有任何內傷的跡象。"}},"b6e7d13338d42ef4fa82329686b3dab0":{"createdAt":1787587254012,"data":{"sentence":"The smartphone came with a two-year warranty that covers manufacturing defects.","translation":"這部智慧型手機附帶一張兩年保用卡，涵蓋製造缺陷。"}},"b6f2d541b4a3d3c8e61401776914d673":{"createdAt":1783862241619,"data":{"sentence":"The new policy has created a host of problems for small businesses.","translation":"這項新政策為小型企業帶來了許多問題。"}},"b6fd071425e8994d917e6d7c0158392d":{"createdAt":1781856533166,"data":{"sentence":"The new library has an accessible entrance for people with disabilities.","translation":"這家新圖書館為身障人士提供了易接近的入口。"}},"b71319d04eeffa5d31d3