ent and friendly manner that immediately put everyone at ease.","translation":"她以自信且友善的態度對聽眾說話，立即讓每個人都感到放心。"}},"c739eb935a934d73067cb12cab375287":{"createdAt":1783926014858,"data":{"sentence":"After running up the stairs, I was out of breath and had to sit down to recover.","translation":"跑上樓梯後，我氣喘吁吁，不得不坐下來恢復體力。"}},"c74817f8d541dcff5da6611854738147":{"createdAt":1788779096760,"data":{"sentence":"The baby crawled across the living room floor toward her mother.","translation":"嬰兒在客廳地板上爬行，朝著她的母親爬去。"}},"c793229d9dfb9425761348363cefa240":{"createdAt":1784782328947,"data":{"sentence":"Congress will legislate new environmental protection laws next year.","translation":"國會將在明年制定新的環境保護法律。"}},"c7958b8de77fdbb18c13d50a00db5873":{"createdAt":1786288467854,"data":{"sentence":"She persistently applied for the scholarship year after year until she finally succeeded.","translation":"她年復一年地持續不懈地申請獎學金，直到最後終於成功了。"}},"c79820dfbc7187234a6e2526413f5a0f":{"createdAt":1785254926352,"data":{"sentence":"After a stressful day at work, I like to wind down by taking a relaxing bath and reading a book.","translation":"經過緊張的工作日後，我喜歡通過洗個舒適的澡和讀書來逐漸放鬆。"}},"c7ca470d3919b1862930f7bb14be58c5":{"createdAt":1785830975517,"data":{"sentence":"When I arrived at the party, my friends came to the door to greet me warmly.","translation":"當我到達派對時，我的朋友們來到門口熱情地問候我。"}},"c7cdd4098f1e9e7e97b82e15f97513c2":{"createdAt":1784298836284,"data":{"sentence":"The organic structure of the human body is composed of interconnected systems that work together to maintain life.","translation":"人體的有機結構由相互連接的系統組成，這些系統協同作用以維持生命。"}},"c7d412b61e97b7cdc74df36ab1bd0033":{"createdAt":1781894247530,"data":{"sentence":"She decided to make a significant investment in renewable energy stocks because she believed in the long-term potential of the industry.","translation":"她決定在再生能源股票中進行重大投資，因為她相信該產業的長期潛力。"}},"c7d709e3551aa7c908ade6d51815636e":{"createdAt":1787104992529,"data":{"sentence":"After the company merged with its competitor, hundreds 