ational park during the winter season to protect the environment.","translation":"政府決定在冬季限制進入國家公園的通道，以保護環境。"}},"c8d52e9ebd61208e2ea4d322dade9c16":{"createdAt":1785279526521,"data":{"sentence":"The greedy businessman accumulated wealth by exploiting his workers and cutting corners on safety standards.","translation":"那位貪婪的商人通過剝削工人和降低安全標準來積累財富。"}},"c8d910f4379855573d37f954051d775c":{"createdAt":1785288589459,"data":{"sentence":"He made an ignorant comment about the historical event because he had never bothered to read about it.","translation":"他對這個歷史事件做出了無知的評論，因為他從未費力去了解它。"}},"c8eacc137eba727dabc2c921d5eee204":{"createdAt":1789387571339,"data":{"sentence":"Scientists hypothesize that the recent climate changes are primarily caused by human activities.","translation":"科學家假設最近的氣候變化主要是由人類活動引起的。"}},"c8ef5b69b68ddba16065efc0d8705f88":{"createdAt":1789196978883,"data":{"sentence":"The evacuation of the building was completed safely within thirty minutes after the fire alarm was triggered.","translation":"火警警報觸發後，建築物的疏散在三十分鐘內安全完成。"}},"c8f518a12cc0f7287b6ebd4ce618c881":{"createdAt":1785255143822,"data":{"sentence":"Behind her cheerful facade, she was struggling with depression and anxiety.","translation":"在她開朗的外表背後，她正在與抑鬱症和焦慮症作鬥爭。"}},"c90ce07de593d7cf14629128bd7f7ad8":{"createdAt":1786550578808,"data":{"sentence":"The prevalence of smartphone usage among teenagers has increased dramatically over the past decade.","translation":"過去十年間，智慧型手機在青少年中的普遍使用率大幅上升。"}},"c9125fcabc12a488bd40bc991de56a7f":{"createdAt":1782618944847,"data":{"sentence":"When the child saw the hot stove, her instinctive reaction was to pull her hand away immediately.","translation":"當孩子看到燙的爐子時，她本能的反應是立即縮回她的手。"}},"c9189a6a5b4f0f9099c81e955ca31fb4":{"createdAt":1782139789707,"data":{"sentence":"She has a liberal attitude toward different cultures and welcomes people from all backgrounds.","translation":"她對不同文化持開放的態度，歡迎來自各種背景的人。"}},"c91e0730e975040664273d3e2269cad7":{"createdAt":1783671799153,"data":{"sentence":"I can't bore the thought of sitting through another boring meeting.","translation":"我無法忍受再坐著參加另一場令人厭倦的會議。"}},"c920400a328ea11fd60f4bd02e6c6036":{"createdAt":1786026632050,"data":{"sentence":"She joined the local tennis league to compete against other players in the community.","translation":"她加入了當地的網球聯賽，以便與社區中的其他選手競爭。"}},"c9244a2c0421e66d529e93e7efb413b4":{"createdAt":1786248541440,"data":{"sentence":"The new shopping mall is still under construction and should be completed next year.","translation":"這座新購物中心仍在建築中，應該會在明年完工。"}},"c937f8e210b4731eaeb3a3abdac26da2":{"createdAt":1782984189065,"data":{"sentence":"After running a marathon, my legs ache so badly that I can barely walk up the stairs.","translation":"跑完馬拉松後，我的腿疼痛得厲害，我幾乎無法走上樓梯。"}},"c94274024b004e839decfe96b8dfbe63":{"createdAt":1781566444334,"data":{"sentence":"The renowned columnist for the New York Times writes a weekly article about politics and social issues.","translation":"紐約時報的著名專欄作家每週撰寫一篇關於政治和社會問題的文章。"}},"c94ecce50a5a173cf7e6293765297711":{"createdAt":1784800104419,"data":{"sentence":"The bird pecked at the ground and found a worm to eat.","translation":"那隻鳥啄著地面，找到了一條蟲來吃。"}},"c95ce0ff2afeaff2455dd4eaf8e93922":{"createdAt":1782037836461,"data":{"sentence":"The repetitive nature of assembly line work can make employees feel bored and unmotivated.","translation":"組裝線工作的重複性質會讓員工感到無聊和沒有動力。"}},"c95e2509dbdf5050cb0d2834d29c881d":{"createdAt":1784086540581,"data":{"sentence":"The proportion of students who passed the exam was higher this year compared to last year.","translation":"今年通過考試的學生比例比去年更高。"}},"c967028253c2fbee4792e8fb558beb43":{"createdAt":1786000871656,"data":{"sentence":"She poured the milk from the carton into a glass container.","translation":"她把牛奶從紙盒倒進玻璃容器裡。"}},"c96e6b47dcb2d13f61e46e59134dd339":{"createdAt":1781452947274,"data":{"sentence":"The desire to spend time with loved ones is a universal human experience that transcends cultural boundaries.","translation":"與摯愛的人共度時光的渴望是一種超越文化界限的普遍人類經驗。"}},"c96eb5e296d305aa53afa47f48d7af99":{"createdAt":1784161072477,"data":{"sentence":"The doctor said that my vision has improved significantly after the eye surgery.","translation":"醫生說我的眼睛手術後視力有了顯著改善。"}},"c971abc4264dd2c99e920733d55075b1":{"createdAt":1782058076575,"data":{"sentence":"Every emission of your passion and creativity into the world brings you one step closer to achieving your dreams!","translation":"你將激情和創意的每一次散發投入到世界中，都使你更接近實現夢想！"}},"c989bb3b3ef1cc47b0dd830ae165c532":{"createdAt":1787634618519,"data":{"sentence":"After running a marathon, the athlete had to sit down and respire deeply to recover.","translation":"跑完馬拉松後，運動員不得不坐下來深呼吸以恢復體力。"}},"c993b5d8ba9b15919f524bec39ff1b18":{"createdAt":1784280987801,"data":{"sentence":"The company mailed out promotional circulars to all households in the neighborhood to advertise their new products.","translation":"該公司向鄰近地區的所有住戶郵寄了宣傳傳單，以推廣他們的新產品。"}},"c9bfd1309c5cc0512891f6b8315367db":{"createdAt":1781777821587,"data":{"sentence":"The architect paid close attention to every detail of the building's design.","translation":"建築師對建築設計的每一個細節都給予了密切關注。"}},"c9e0fe490e6ea69535c8b06176de1a59":{"createdAt":1786770771363,"data":{"sentence":"Our trip to Japan was truly memorable, with experiences we will cherish for the rest of our lives.","translation":"我們的日本之旅真的值得紀念，這些經歷我們將終身珍惜。"}},"c9e2ccac1309a8e80bbe80357fba9e33":{"createdAt":1781366765244,"data":{"sentence":"The teacher decided to emphasize the importance of regular practice by assigning extra homework.","translation":"老師決定透過指派額外作業來強調定期練習的重要性。"}},"c9f911a8870581482ee46667bc19dd89":{"createdAt":1782221592172,"data":{"sentence":"The teacher used a red marker to circle the spelling mistakes on the student's essay.","translation":"老師用紅色記號筆在學生的作文上圈出拼寫錯誤。"}},"c9fb01f4c57f2e05ad6bdeb335daa641":{"createdAt":1781511000486,"data":{"sentence":"The absence of clear communication between the two teams led to misunderstandings.","translation":"兩個團隊之間缺乏清晰的溝通導致了誤解。"}},"ca2116edf9d09f71592