at was happening in the neighbor's yard.","translation":"那個好奇的孩子試圖從柵欄的縫隙中窺視，看看鄰居院子裡發生了什麼。"}},"cab8ff677474ffea44072849b923c87b":{"createdAt":1783832325907,"data":{"sentence":"He couldn't resist bragging about his new sports car to everyone at the party.","translation":"他在派對上忍不住向每個人吹噓他的新跑車。"}},"cac6431e33d11beb768978fe796018b0":{"createdAt":1781665081725,"data":{"sentence":"The pianist played a beautiful major chord that resonated throughout the concert hall.","translation":"鋼琴家彈奏了一個美妙的大和弦，聲音在音樂廳裡迴盪。"}},"cacbcf45d84dc32c75f17baebced8153":{"createdAt":1789445969382,"data":{"sentence":"The government launched a major initiative to reforest the areas that were devastated by last year's wildfires.","translation":"政府啟動了一項大規模計畫，對去年野火摧毀的地區進行重新造林。"}},"cada199dfa2f13e198716d64af391091":{"createdAt":1782965735129,"data":{"sentence":"She wore a plain white dress without any decorations to the casual dinner party.","translation":"她穿著樸素的白色連衣裙，沒有任何裝飾品，去參加了這個隨意的晚宴。"}},"cae25171a090f6171690d8e671e2b80e":{"createdAt":1786695199490,"data":{"sentence":"The clergy gathered at the cathedral to discuss the upcoming religious reforms.","translation":"聖職人員在大教堂集合，討論即將進行的宗教改革。"}},"cae5259d3347ab0e3896380587e06205":{"createdAt":1786416195531,"data":{"sentence":"The deterioration of the old building's foundation made it unsafe for residents to occupy.","translation":"這棟老建築地基的惡化使得居民無法安全居住。"}},"cb19e5afc89768d3b21dcf3e1698f745":{"createdAt":1782574490604,"data":{"sentence":"She reluctantly agreed to attend the meeting even though she had other plans.","translation":"儘管她有其他計畫，她還是不願意地同意參加這場會議。"}},"cb62af177556b8f4dcc1277f730589eb":{"createdAt":1781450807544,"data":{"sentence":"The lifeguard blew his whistle and rushed into the water to rescue the struggling swimmer.","translation":"救生員吹響了他的哨子，衝入水中去救那位掙扎的游泳者。"}},"cb7e9fb4a9805ee7a7034f727e481ae9":{"createdAt":1785715016600,"data":{"sentence":"The hostile government refused to negotiate with its neighboring country.","translation":"敵對的政府拒絕與鄰國談判。"}},"