 help.","translation":"他為自己的酗酒傾向所苦惱，最終決定尋求專業協助。"}},"e520672bc3e09f5a060f5fbc61b83cb3":{"createdAt":1784444656352,"data":{"sentence":"The endangered species is threatened by habitat loss and climate change.","translation":"這個瀕危物種受到棲息地喪失和氣候變化的威脅。"}},"e524206f5e6a3596a1e2b83f908c15a7":{"createdAt":1785829385563,"data":{"sentence":"The sphinx posed a famous riddle to travelers, and anyone who couldn't solve it would face dire consequences.","translation":"獅身人面像向旅行者提出了一個著名的謎語，任何無法解開謎語的人都會面臨嚴重的後果。"}},"e528cf8334f38ea6855d04b2001fda95":{"createdAt":1788436441392,"data":{"sentence":"She got so carried away by the excitement of winning that she forgot to thank her teammates.","translation":"她因為贏得比賽而興奮得失去控制，竟然忘記了感謝她的隊友。"}},"e53dc358a4cd51bcec6b5aa1751578ed":{"createdAt":1781564240704,"data":{"sentence":"The witness described the suspect as a tall man with red hair and a distinctive scar on his left cheek.","translation":"證人將嫌疑人描述為一個身材高大、紅頭髮、左臉頰上有明顯傷疤的男子。"}},"e53e88a65919e7f39fe6f6a0d30268ac":{"createdAt":1785157958911,"data":{"sentence":"After spending two weeks at the beach, she developed a beautiful tan that made her look healthier.","translation":"在海灘度過兩週後，她曬成了棕褐色的膚色，看起來更健康了。"}},"e5681e44a338fa27adede672e171149b":{"createdAt":1782646103028,"data":{"sentence":"She began to blush when her crush complimented her in front of everyone.","translation":"當她的暗戀對象在眾人面前稱讚她時，她開始臉紅了。"}},"e56a62eb1ea288f0fc48c3d84f7f6738":{"createdAt":1784277971855,"data":{"sentence":"Before signing the contract, we need to discuss the terms and conditions carefully.","translation":"在簽署合約之前，我們需要仔細討論條款和條件。"}},"e56eca0ab87800cc8e6fc7e487e8bebb":{"createdAt":1782482353581,"data":{"sentence":"It's hard to tell the difference from these two paintings because they look almost identical.","translation":"很難從這兩幅畫中分辨出區別，因為它們看起來幾乎一樣。"}},"e57388859c5e22ce55da9c81d3d60b61":{"createdAt":1785231018671,"data":{"sentence":"The old hermit lived a solitary life in a remote cabin deep in the mountains.","translation":"那位年邁