 keep making poor financial decisions, you'll wind up in serious debt.","translation":"如果你繼續做出糟糕的財務決定，你最終會陷入嚴重的債務中。"}},"e650c2bd3e6616f22ffe4abe1bb7c9bf":{"createdAt":1781769061043,"data":{"sentence":"Her brilliant idea to reorganize the workflow saved the company thousands of dollars.","translation":"她那個相當聰明的想法重新整理了工作流程，為公司省下了數千美元。"}},"e664f29cb383be7e306232a00fc07c41":{"createdAt":1781790477843,"data":{"sentence":"She was determined to finish her degree despite the financial difficulties she faced.","translation":"儘管面臨經濟困難，她仍然下定決心要完成她的學位。"}},"e669ec528974173a96c0715aea849e15":{"createdAt":1782428503701,"data":{"sentence":"Regular exercise can contribute to better health and improved mental well-being.","translation":"定期運動有助於改善健康狀況和增進心理健康。"}},"e66f90507a1206b8f348d1d269406ddb":{"createdAt":1782365619067,"data":{"sentence":"The stout oak door withstood the battering ram during the siege.","translation":"那扇粗壯的橡木門在圍城期間經受住了撞城槌的衝擊。"}},"e679b425508098df90915a2d23ffb6a0":{"createdAt":1782645938193,"data":{"sentence":"Italian cuisine is renowned for its use of fresh pasta and olive oil.","translation":"義大利烹飪以使用新鮮麵食和橄欖油而聞名。"}},"e67dcd5625f573be325202f40a25408a":{"createdAt":1789056265964,"data":{"sentence":"Every small act of kindness you do creates a ripple of positive change that spreads far beyond what you can see.","translation":"你所做的每一個小善舉都會激起一道漣漪，將正面的改變傳播到遠超你所能看到的地方。"}},"e68b331eb6e8ee15536516c7a89c0f29":{"createdAt":1783830531404,"data":{"sentence":"The magician's performance was so incredible that the entire audience gasped in amazement.","translation":"魔術師的表演難以置信地精彩，整個觀眾席都驚呼了起來。"}},"e69399630744ef7815b5da3a6a1ffcb2":{"createdAt":1781415485410,"data":{"sentence":"She was eligibly qualified for the scholarship because she met all the academic requirements.","translation":"她符合獲得獎學金的資格，因為她滿足了所有的學術要求。"}},"e6978e22b6c04f22daed8de48045d01e":{"createdAt":1782982156902,"data":{"sentence":"If you want to pass the exam, you need to study the material properly.","translation":