6847,"data":{"sentence":"After losing his job, he spent a miserable week feeling hopeless and depressed.","translation":"失去工作後，他度過了一個不幸的一週，感到絕望和沮喪。"}},"f41e94a28b05ec83da1960ac67c4f0e8":{"createdAt":1785993922524,"data":{"sentence":"The university built new dormitories to accommodate the increasing number of international students.","translation":"這所大學建造了新的學生宿舍，以容納越來越多的國際學生。"}},"f43ca438a86c4070d879d3a3a2319eab":{"createdAt":1783934894357,"data":{"sentence":"The car's fuel tank was nearly empty, so I stopped at the gas station to fill it up with gasoline.","translation":"汽車的油箱幾乎是空的，所以我停在加油站用汽油加滿它。"}},"f4412054432efde712febdff7c8f324f":{"createdAt":1785070905029,"data":{"sentence":"I think that movie is overrated; it wasn't nearly as good as everyone said it would be.","translation":"我認為那部電影被高估了；它遠沒有人們說的那麼好。"}},"f445bb236c95290749290ea294c0d257":{"createdAt":1781856723426,"data":{"sentence":"The adverse weather conditions forced the outdoor event to be postponed.","translation":"不利的天氣條件迫使這場戶外活動被延期。"}},"f452e8069e735a4c8fbed3aead04fa28":{"createdAt":1781366761256,"data":{"sentence":"The teacher placed great emphasis on the importance of regular practice when learning a new language.","translation":"老師在教導學習新語言時，特別強調定期練習的重要性。"}},"f456da8927e294f9de7397effaf45c2f":{"createdAt":1781337607200,"data":{"sentence":"It was not my fault that the project failed; the deadline was unrealistic from the start.","translation":"專案失敗不是我的過錯；從一開始截止日期就不切實際。"}},"f459108e365ecbc936af53f955087e27":{"createdAt":1783862248291,"data":{"sentence":"The company hired a temporary worker in place of the employee who was on maternity leave.","translation":"該公司聘請了一名臨時工人來代替正在育嬰假的員工。"}},"f45c2f6ef738bdb8e1f4be7aaf1a73e2":{"createdAt":1787028123061,"data":{"sentence":"Apple established a subsidiary company in India to manage its manufacturing operations in South Asia.","translation":"蘋果公司在印度成立了一家子公司，以管理其在南亞的製造業務。"}},"f462b8ba752ced0856c38ae2494ac584":{"createdAt":1784168273911,"data":{"sentence":"After y