045,"data":{"sentence":"She quickly dodged the falling branch to avoid getting hit.","translation":"她迅速閃避掉落的樹枝以避免被擊中。"}},"f55f0b991c3ac19ee7ce2296f7d14e7c":{"createdAt":1786461610701,"data":{"sentence":"The Netflix series has released five seasons over the past three years.","translation":"這部Netflix劇集在過去三年內已經推出了五季。"}},"f5607f581ac3c548e67aa9c4c595ae2f":{"createdAt":1789313880664,"data":{"sentence":"Losing my job turned out to be a blessing in disguise because it forced me to pursue my passion for writing, which eventually became my successful career.","translation":"失去工作結果反而是因禍得福，因為它迫使我追求我對寫作的熱情，最終成為了我成功的職業。"}},"f560fd2a5bc501e61cdb1cea3eedcca0":{"createdAt":1789273029367,"data":{"sentence":"The manager gave an unequivocal answer that the project would be completed by the end of the month, leaving no room for doubt or misinterpretation.","translation":"經理給出了明確的答案，該項目將在月底前完成，不留任何疑問或誤解的餘地。"}},"f563f31fbfacb74e616dccf21875b637":{"createdAt":1785485363988,"data":{"sentence":"The company filed a patent for their innovative smartphone design to protect their intellectual property.","translation":"該公司為其創新的智慧型手機設計申請了專利權以保護其智慧財產權。"}},"f57937210d60f4d7656403bf4770fafa":{"createdAt":1782216983995,"data":{"sentence":"The powerful performance of the orchestra compelled the audience to stand up and applaud.","translation":"樂團強大的表演激起了觀眾站起來鼓掌。"}},"f57d717e9d1061bd658480272ddfb420":{"createdAt":1782315144617,"data":{"sentence":"We need to find a larger storage space for all the boxes we've been collecting.","translation":"我們需要找到一個更大的儲存空間來放置我們一直收集的所有箱子。"}},"f58038f50b2d5937f80824f0f5a70109":{"createdAt":1787978028613,"data":{"sentence":"My friend is such a phubber that he didn't even notice when I arrived at the restaurant because he was too busy scrolling through his phone.","translation":"我的朋友是個低頭族，他沉迷於滑手機而沒有注意到我到達餐廳。"}},"f58a6b069b78d77daced26578bb5b9a9":{"createdAt":1784712547413,"data":{"sentence":"The correspondence between the two theories suggests they may be describing the s