13028,"data":{"sentence":"Every small step you take today will form the foundation of your success tomorrow, so keep pushing forward!","translation":"你今天邁出的每一小步都將為明天的成功奠定基礎，所以要繼續向前！"}},"f807868bc9b43eb865337866d255c40c":{"createdAt":1786349453398,"data":{"sentence":"Only a handful of people showed up to the meeting yesterday.","translation":"昨天只有一把人出現在會議上。"}},"f81ea6ad8c426fadea566372c2e4701f":{"createdAt":1781738046408,"data":{"sentence":"What matters most to me is spending time with my family.","translation":"對我來說最重要的事情是與家人一起度過時光。"}},"f8297aac0117311fa956cc840f26e67b":{"createdAt":1787068159349,"data":{"sentence":"The artist sat by the window in quiet muse, waiting for inspiration to strike.","translation":"那位藝術家靜坐在窗邊沉思，等待靈感的降臨。"}},"f82ae56f34ab09ed0ad4cf1cb92550e1":{"createdAt":1785921674875,"data":{"sentence":"Many of the company's current problems stem from poor management decisions made years ago.","translation":"公司目前的許多問題源於多年前糟糕的管理決策。"}},"f83036b4a1fa25f930f789cc3590ee6a":{"createdAt":1785641718464,"data":{"sentence":"The school added environmental science to its curricular offerings to better prepare students for modern challenges.","translation":"學校將環境科學納入其課程設置中，以便更好地為學生應對現代挑戰做準備。"}},"f8371eb0c415b0383bb422ce6a6613df":{"createdAt":1786892424138,"data":{"sentence":"She is an ardent supporter of environmental conservation and dedicates much of her time to raising awareness about climate change.","translation":"她是環境保護的熱烈支持者，並將大部分時間用於提高人們對氣候變化的認識。"}},"f840a8163cc4514662fe5a9cbe65ec9e":{"createdAt":1781856584537,"data":{"sentence":"She decided to pursue a career in accounting after discovering her passion for numbers and financial analysis.","translation":"在發現自己對數字和財務分析的熱情後，她決定從事會計事業。"}},"f8547e1a1ea24988e90806f99a4768d5":{"createdAt":1785157952949,"data":{"sentence":"The garbage can stank so badly that we had to move it outside.","translation":"垃圾桶發出的惡臭非常難聞，我們不得不把它搬到外面去。"}},"f857aa6a9634d5506e414b8ba57f2d60":{"createdAt":1789378117685,"data":{"sentence":"The pu