ing the new project deadline.","translation":"經理召開了一場關於新專案截止日期的會議。"}},"ff7b5ad239ef0c23df803178a5b1f962":{"createdAt":1785741601020,"data":{"sentence":"We need to rush to the airport or we'll miss our flight.","translation":"我們需要匆忙趕往機場，否則會錯過班機。"}},"ff803923ebc43b2ea90a5f66ec3c62a0":{"createdAt":1782984495214,"data":{"sentence":"The carpenter used rude tools to shape the wood before finishing it with finer instruments.","translation":"木匠用粗糙的工具塑形木料，之後再用更精細的工具進行精加工。"}},"ff80a53dcef9db603086f88fc676a497":{"createdAt":1782255248400,"data":{"sentence":"Beethoven's Ninth Symphony is considered one of the greatest musical compositions ever written.","translation":"貝多芬的第九交響樂被認為是有史以來最偉大的音樂作品之一。"}},"ff877e0e39b1edef2a73f807779ce8d1":{"createdAt":1782391340449,"data":{"sentence":"The customer filed a formal complaint with the manager about the poor service at the restaurant.","translation":"那位顧客向經理提出了一份關於餐廳服務不佳的正式申訴。"}},"ffae5c00aa0a7acb6a11fa2090a6104c":{"createdAt":1789549114836,"data":{"sentence":"The aristocrats gathered in the elegant salon to discuss philosophy and literature.","translation":"貴族們聚集在優雅的沙龍裡討論哲學和文學。"}},"ffb13e74372da63f5e4125efd2ecd92b":{"createdAt":1787635688933,"data":{"sentence":"The scientist's groundbreaking research on artificial intelligence has revolutionized the entire field.","translation":"這位科學家關於人工智能的突破性研究徹底改變了整個領域。"}},"ffb2fcfeb3f8dc634d912415e82eaa5d":{"createdAt":1782646451302,"data":{"sentence":"The jury decided to convict the defendant based on the overwhelming evidence presented during the trial.","translation":"陪審團根據審判期間提交的大量證據，決定宣判被告有罪。"}},"ffb8d627fdc9c6f9700d04c8f65e0501":{"createdAt":1788168594100,"data":{"sentence":"I need to get rid of all these old clothes that I don't wear anymore.","translation":"我需要清除掉所有這些我不再穿的舊衣服。"}},"ffc492020ad521a73e96e1c6d239998c":{"createdAt":1781737730988,"data":{"sentence":"I expect the package to arrive tomorrow based on the tracking information.","translation":"根據追蹤資訊，我預料包裹明天會送達。"}},"ffcc7a2c14dd7e54dc17d9f74eaf8a2a":{"createdAt":1782542024247,"data":{"sentence":"A cluster of grapes hung from the vine, ready to be picked.","translation":"一串葡萄掛在藤蔓上，準備被採摘。"}},"ffd32904f6e51d44e4bcf067a900de2e":{"createdAt":1783500645657,"data":{"sentence":"The manager's instructions were ambiguous, leaving the team uncertain about what they were supposed to do.","translation":"經理的指示含義不清，讓團隊不確定他們應該做什麼。"}},"ffd6216592025e7a709556f6c3f390e8":{"createdAt":1781793023777,"data":{"sentence":"The hungry lion devoured the antelope in just a few minutes.","translation":"飢餓的獅子在短短幾分鐘內就狼吞虎嚥地吃掉了那隻羚羊。"}},"ffdf75ef8a1dae7b0589c5f313c235af":{"createdAt":1781487089354,"data":{"sentence":"The dense fog rolled across the highway, reducing visibility to just a few meters.","translation":"濃厚的霧氣籠罩著高速公路，能見度降低到只有幾米。"}},"ffedfc5a6c6a4b4f682e0486ea8d4f3e":{"createdAt":1788186457800,"data":{"sentence":"She reached for a fork, which is a common eating utensil found in every kitchen.","translation":"她伸手拿了一把叉子，這是每個廚房裡都能找到的常見餐具。"}},"ffeebfe08db1e6eb7e3d493ea775af71":{"createdAt":1787130180507,"data":{"sentence":"Her ace in the hole was a trump card that she had been saving for the final negotiation.","translation":"她的殺手鐧是一張她一直留到最後談判的王牌。"}},"fff4962afb3773a80fc18d5ae405c3ea":{"createdAt":1785753434062,"data":{"sentence":"Her pronunciation of French words improved significantly after spending a year in Paris.","translation":"在巴黎住了一年後，她的法語發音有了顯著的進步。"}}},"file-search-intents":{"Ucc2288bf1bdfa7b6c2414622c0df2ba4":{"expireAt":1776952398298}},"onedrive-auth":{"folders":{"admin":{"driveId":"ED0685DFF9D8666E","itemId":"ED0685DFF9D8666E!44098","name":"Wisdom English 唯思英文","path":"/drives/ED0685DFF9D8666E/root:/Wisdom English 唯思英文","url":"https://1drv.ms/f/c/ed0685dff9d8666e/IgBuZtj534UGIIDtQqwAAAAAAV2J_orqMl9nG5riCaVAVIo?e=JE0eNi"},"shared":{"driveId":"ED0685DFF9D8666E","itemId":"ED0685DFF9D8666E!44100","name":"#團隊事項","path":"/drives/ED0685DFF9D8666E/root:/Wisdom English 唯思英文/#團隊事項","url":"https://1drv.ms/f/c/ed0685dff9d8666e/IgBuZtj534UGIIDtRKwAAAAAAUoMQOQ4c1iafODy-Wz-ISc?e=VLgQDG"}},"refreshToken":"M.C547_BL2.0.U.-Clv0SUBbj5DLJX!57r2*cOod*nmmEuAKV9Fqa0NLVdOGpA82rTiyQx84YcQ8mSdvEM8ynRYbCHDYs24Uwsje92M!olEMHcm0hPNSLo56vNePrAcqA9AW06kr4wr4bSDS94pjgGZa2HNFbJEXFjmV2RHf*9wV4lMh!ZVmWI8s7z1wjV2sAC8dhPVnL*01sJAAKLJgLoeHZMBsmGoakjTAd!K3wceGrn7BavFeea9EgFlnWIkTFF9DKs7cZMLRFfesnmCPyfrMj2UEMS3CCNj0Xzld6jumyk23oBmq5R2ZteHxgUwCfe*0EKDU2pb6Qvz*DvFIKYjOFAIzsWh!vI9mZftUeiRX4S4N73vn9n6A6vvESqqjs25TbLdZxVPkdUPU4Q$$","savedAt":1776994065013},"pending-rewrite":{"U0b447e2c94d48454717a23f8aaabc28c":{"expiresAt":1787974247966,"level":"批改"}},"pending-solve":{"U010bf9e8afc2bf7e0bddf9d6a904f1a8":{"expiresAt":1789031238378},"U1e6470f5d2a51d089f046358e664ff41":{"expiresAt":1789718234957},"U7262fbca5285604959e6ee95ab90dfd2":{"expiresAt":1788162916390}},"published":{"article":"The High-Stakes Confrontation: Trump and Iran\nThe geopolitical tension between Donald Trump and Iran remains one of the most volatile issues in modern international relations. To understand the origins of this conflict, we must examine the 2015 Iran Nuclear Deal (JCPOA). While the Obama administration viewed the deal as a diplomatic breakthrough to prevent Iran from developing nuclear weapons, Trump campaigned against it, calling it \"the worst deal ever negotiated.\" He argued that the agreement was fundamentally flawed because it failed to address Iran’s ballistic missile program and its support for various proxy groups across the Middle East.\n\nIn May 2018, the situation reached a critical turning point when Trump officially withdrew the United States from the nuclear deal. This move initiated a strategy known as the \"Maximum Pressure\" campaign. The primary objective was to cripple Iran’s economy through heavy sanctions, specifically targeting their oil exports—the nation's economic lifeline. By cutting off Iran's primary source of revenue, Trump aimed to force the Iranian leadership back to the negotiating table to sign a much stricter, more comprehensive \"grand bargain.\"\n\nThe process of escalation moved rapidly from economic warfare to direct military confrontation. In 2019, tensions spiked after several oil tankers were attacked in the Strait of Hormuz, and Iran shot down a high-tech U.S. surveillance drone. However, the most significant moment occurred in January 2020, when Trump authorized a drone strike that killed the powerful Iranian General Qasem Soleimani in Baghdad. This targeted killing brought both nations to the very brink of a full-scale war. Iran responded by launching ballistic missiles at U.S. bases in Iraq, though both sides eventually stepped back to avoid a total catastrophe.\n\nCurrently, with Trump’s return to office in 2026, the strategy remains focused on strategic containment. While the military threat is always present, Trump’s approach often involves a unique blend of extreme rhetoric and the possibility of high-level diplomacy. He frequently oscillates between threatening \"obliteration\" and expressing a desire to meet with Iranian leaders to resolve the dispute. As the international community watches closely, the world remains uncertain whether this pressure will lead to a new diplomatic breakthrough or an accidental escalation into a regional conflict. The line between deterrence and open war remains incredibly thin.","articleTitle":"The High-Stakes Confrontation: Trump and Iran","data":{"discussion":[{"q":"Do you think economic sanctions are more effective than military action in resolving international conflicts? Why or why not?","zh":"中文提示：比較經濟制裁與軍事行動的效果和後果"},{"q":"How should world leaders balance between showing strength and pursuing diplomatic solutions when dealing with adversaries?","zh":"中文提示：探討領導人在展現強硬與外交之間的平衡"}],"fill":[{"blanks":["Maximum Pressure","oil"],"sentence":"Trump withdrew from the nuclear deal to initiate a strategy called ___ which targeted Iran's ___ exports.","zh_hint":"中文提示：川普的經濟制裁策略"},{"blanks":["Qasem Soleimani","full-scale war"],"sentence":"The killing of General ___ in January 2020 brought both nations to the brink of ___.","zh_hint":"中文提示：2020年的軍事衝突事件"}],"mcq":[{"ans":1,"explain":"中文解題說明：文中指出川普認為協議未處理飛彈計畫和代理人組織問題","opts":["A. Iran violated the agreement's terms","B. The deal didn't address missiles and proxy groups","C. Obama requested the withdrawal","D. Iran refused to negotiate further"],"q":"Why did Trump withdraw from the Iran Nuclear Deal?"},{"ans":1,"explain":"中文解題說明：目標是透過經濟制裁迫使伊朗重回談判桌並簽署更嚴格協議","opts":["A. To start a military war immediately","B. To force Iran to negotiate a stricter deal","C. To support Iran's economy","D. To help Iran export more oil"],"q":"What was the primary goal of the 'Maximum Pressure' campaign?"},{"ans":2,"explain":"中文解題說明：文中描述川普的策略是極端言論與高層外交可能性的結合","opts":["A. Pure military aggression only","B. Complete diplomatic cooperation","C. A mix of threats and diplomatic possibilities","D. Total withdrawal from the region"],"q":"What characterizes Trump's current approach to Iran?"}],"vocab":[{"pos":"adj.","word":"volatile","zh":"不穩定的；易變的"},{"pos":"n.","word":"diplomatic breakthrough","zh":"外交突破"},{"pos":"adj.","word":"fundamentally flawed","zh":"根本上有缺陷的"},{"pos":"v.","word":"cripple","zh":"削弱；使癱瘓"},{"pos":"n.","word":"escalation","zh":"升級；惡化"},{"pos":"n.","word":"brink","zh":"邊緣"},{"pos":"v.","word":"oscillates","zh":"搖擺；振盪"},{"pos":"n.","word":"deterrence","zh":"威懾；遏制"}]},"fillCount":2,"level":"B2","publishedAt":"2026-03-26T18:31:40.453Z"},"quiz-cache":{"a_lack_of":{"createdAt":1782361629314,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"a lack of 短語表示「缺乏」或「缺少」，用來描述某種必要元素或資源的不足。","options":["an abundance of","a lack of","a surplus of","excessive"],"sentence":"The project failed due to ______ proper planning and coordination between the departments. Without clear communication and detailed timelines, the team couldn't meet the deadline.","translation":"該項目因為缺乏各部門之間的適當規劃和協調而失敗。沒有清晰的溝通和詳細的時間表，團隊無法按時完成。","word":"a lack of"}},"abandoned":{"createdAt":1782533789080,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"abandoned 意思是被遺棄的或被拋棄的，用來描述被長期無人照管的地方或物品。","options":["occupied","abandoned","renovated","modern"],"sentence":"The ______ house at the end of the street had broken windows and overgrown weeds everywhere. No one had lived there for over twenty years.","translation":"街道盡頭那間被遺棄的房子破窗戶和雜草叢生。沒有人在那裡住了超過二十年。","word":"abandoned"}},"abbreviate":{"createdAt":1781268630478,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"abbreviate表示縮寫或簡短，使某事變得更簡潔或更短。","options":["extend","abbreviate","reschedule","postpone"],"sentence":"We decided to ______ the meeting because time was running short. We removed all unnecessary discussions and covered only the essential points.","translation":"因為時間不夠，我們決定縮短會議時間。我們刪除了所有不必要的討論，只涵蓋了要點。","word":"abbreviate"}},"abbreviated":{"createdAt":1782660244675,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"abbreviated 意指縮寫或簡稱的形式，USA 就是 United States of America 的縮寫。","options":["full","abbreviated","correct","standard"],"sentence":"The teacher wrote the ______ form of the United States on the board as 'USA'. The students understood this was a shortened version used for convenience in writing.","translation":"老師在黑板上寫下了美利堅合眾國的縮寫形式為「USA」。學生們理解這是一種為了方便而使用的縮短版本。","word":"abbreviated"}},"abbreviation":{"createdAt":1781581336195,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"abbreviation指的是用縮短形式表示的單詞或短語。","options":["definition","abbreviation","translation","description"],"sentence":"The ______ 'USA' stands for United States of America and is widely recognized worldwide. Using such shortened forms helps save time in writing and speaking.","translation":"'美國'的縮寫代表美利堅合眾國，在世界各地廣為人知。使用這樣的簡稱有助於節省寫作和演講的時間。","word":"abbreviation"}},"abdomen":{"createdAt":1785140695726,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"abdomen 指的是腹部，位於腰部以下到腿部之間的身體部分。","options":["shoulder","abdomen","neck","thigh"],"sentence":"The boxer received a painful punch directly to his ______ during the match. The referee examined the area below his ribs and above his hips to ensure he wasn't seriously injured.","translation":"拳擊手在比賽中腹部遭受了一次痛苦的打擊。裁判檢查了他肋骨下方和臀部上方的區域，以確保他沒有受到嚴重傷害。","word":"abdomen"}},"abduct":{"createdAt":1783318346302,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"abduct 作為動詞表示「誘拐」或「綁架」，指非法將他人帶走或強行帶離，通常涉及犯罪行為。","options":["adopt","abduct","assist","educate"],"sentence":"The criminal was arrested for attempting to ______ the wealthy businessman's daughter from the school parking lot. Police discovered evidence that the suspect had been planning the kidnapping for several months.","translation":"該罪犯因試圖在學校停車場誘拐富商女兒而被逮捕。警方發現證據表明嫌疑人已計劃綁架數個月。","word":"abduct"}},"abide":{"createdAt":1782831931915,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"abide 在此表示「遵守」或「遵循」，意為要符合並遵守既定的規則或協議。","options":["violate","abide","ignore","question"],"sentence":"All employees must ______ by the company's strict code of conduct. Violations of these rules will result in immediate disciplinary action.","translation":"所有員工必須遵守公司的嚴格行為準則。違反這些規則將導致立即採取紀律處分。","word":"abide"}},"ability":{"createdAt":1782977936095,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ability意為能力或才能，用來描述某人完成特定任務或展現特定技能的力量。","options":["disability","ability","possibility","probability"],"sentence":"She demonstrated remarkable ______ in solving complex mathematical problems. The professor noted that her skill in this area far exceeded that of most students her age.","translation":"她在解決複雜數學問題時展現了傑出的能力。教授指出她在這方面的才能遠超同齡大多數學生。","word":"ability"}},"able":{"createdAt":1783146059981,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「able」表示有能力或有本領做某事，常用於「be able to + 動詞」的結構中，表示具備做某事的能力。","options":["willing","able","eager","lucky"],"sentence":"After years of practice, she became ______ to speak five languages fluently. Her dedication and hard work had finally paid off, and she could now communicate with ease in each one.","translation":"經過多年的練習，她變得能夠流暢地說五種語言。她的奉獻和辛勤工作終於得到了回報，她現在可以輕鬆地用每一種語言交流。","word":"able"}},"abnormal":{"createdAt":1781527602363,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"abnormal 表示偏離常規、不正常或異於尋常的；在醫學檢查中特指超出正常範圍的結果。","options":["typical","expected","abnormal","regular"],"sentence":"The doctor noticed ______ test results when reviewing the patient's blood work. The values were so far outside the standard range that immediate investigation was required.","translation":"醫生在檢查患者的血液檢查結果時發現了異常的數值。這些數值遠在標準範圍之外，需要立即進行調查。","word":"abnormal"}},"aboard":{"createdAt":1783133907033,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"aboard是介詞，表示搭上或位於船、飛機、車等交通工具之上。","options":["outside","aboard","near","beside"],"sentence":"All passengers must be ______ the ship by 5 PM to ensure departure on schedule. The crew will conduct a final safety briefing once everyone has boarded and the gangway is removed.","translation":"所有乘客必須在下午5點前登上船隻，以確保按時出發。一旦所有人都登船且舷梯被移除，船員將進行最後的安全簡報。","word":"aboard"}},"abolish":{"createdAt":1781227315831,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"abolish 的意思是「廢除、廢止」，指完全消除或終止某項法律、制度或習慣，通常用於正式的政治或法律行為。","options":["strengthen","abolish","amend","enforce"],"sentence":"The government voted to ______ the outdated law that had been in effect for over fifty years. After the new policy took effect, citizens no longer had to follow those old regulations.","translation":"政府投票廢除了已實施超過五十年的過時法律。新政策生效後，市民不再需要遵守那些舊規定。","word":"abolish"}},"abolition":{"createdAt":1781598671071,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"abolition 作名詞表示廢止或廢除，特別指正式終止某項制度或法律","options":["expansion","abolition","continuation","regulation"],"sentence":"The ______ of slavery was a major turning point in American history. The Emancipation Proclamation and the 13th Amendment formally ended this institution in the United States.","translation":"廢除奴隸制是美國歷史上的重要轉折點。《解放宣言》和第13條憲法修正案正式結束了美國的這一制度。","word":"abolition"}},"aborigene":{"createdAt":1784773941959,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Aborigene 指的是某地區的原始居民或土著民族，特別是澳洲的原住民。","options":["immigrant","Aborigene","tourist","settler"],"sentence":"The ______ peoples of Australia have lived on the continent for over 65,000 years. Their ancient traditions and connection to the land remain central to their cultural identity.","translation":"澳洲的土著民族在這塊大陸上生活了6萬多年。他們的古老傳統和與土地的聯繫仍然是他們文化認同的核心。","word":"Aborigene"}},"aboriginal":{"createdAt":1781360906188,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"aboriginal 意思是原住民的或原始的，指最早的本土居民及其文化。","options":["modern","aboriginal","imported","contemporary"],"sentence":"The museum exhibits ______ artifacts and artwork from the native peoples of Australia. These pieces date back thousands of years to the earliest inhabitants.","translation":"博物館展示了澳洲土著民族的原住民文物和藝術作品。這些作品可以追溯到最早居民的數千年前。","word":"aboriginal"}},"aborigine":{"createdAt":1781362281647,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"aborigine指的是某地的原始居民，特別是澳大利亞的土著人民。","options":["immigrant","aborigine","settler","visitor"],"sentence":"The ______ of Australia have lived on the continent for thousands of years. Their ancient cultures and traditions date back to the earliest inhabitants of the land.","translation":"澳大利亞的原住民已經在這個大陸上生活了數千年。他們古老的文化和傳統可以追溯到這片土地最早的居民。","word":"aborigine"}},"abortion":{"createdAt":1783066793843,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"abortion 是指終止懷孕的醫療程序，通常指胎兒成形之前終止妊娠。","options":["pregnancy","abortion","delivery","surgery"],"sentence":"The medical procedure of ______ is a complex ethical and legal issue in many countries. Different nations have varying laws and regulations regarding when and under what circumstances this procedure is permitted.","translation":"墮胎這種醫療程序在許多國家都是一個複雜的倫理和法律問題。不同的國家對於何時以及在什麼情況下允許進行此程序有著不同的法律和規定。","word":"abortion"}},"abound":{"createdAt":1782374070896,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"abound 表示「大量存在；有很多」，用來形容某物在某地大量出現或廣泛存在。","options":["disappear","abound","wilt","scatter"],"sentence":"Beautiful gardens ______ throughout the city during spring. You can see thousands of blooming flowers in nearly every neighborhood.","translation":"在春天，整個城市到處都有美麗的花園。你可以在幾乎每個社區看到數千朵盛開的花。","word":"abound"}},"abroad":{"createdAt":1781275226791,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"此處abroad作副詞表示「在國外；到國外」，指離開本國到其他國家","options":["abroad","controversial","breast","feast"],"sentence":"She decided to study ______ in France for a full year to improve her language skills. Living in Paris would give her immersion in the French culture and environment.","translation":"她決定在法國國外生活一整年以提高她的語言技能。住在巴黎將使她沉浸在法國文化和環境中。","word":"abroad"}},"abrupt":{"createdAt":1781360906188,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"abrupt 意思是突然的或陡峭的，指沒有預警或漸進過程就立即發生的事情。","options":["gradual","abrupt","smooth","expected"],"sentence":"The train made an ______ stop when the brakes were applied suddenly. Passengers were thrown forward without warning.","translation":"當緊急剎車被啟動時，火車突然停止了。乘客在沒有警告的情況下向前衝去。","word":"abrupt"}},"abscisic_acid":{"createdAt":1783926514170,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"離層酸是一種植物激素，主要功能是幫助植物適應環境壓力，如乾旱、低溫等，透過調控氣孔開度和促進脫落來保護植物。","options":["auxin","abscisic acid","gibberellin","cytokinin"],"sentence":"Plants produce ______ to regulate the closure of stomata during drought conditions and to promote seed dormancy. This plant hormone plays a crucial role in stress responses by signaling the plant to conserve water and restrict growth.","translation":"植物在乾旱條件下產生離層酸來調節氣孔的關閉，並促進種子的休眠。這種植物激素透過向植物發出信號以節約水分並限制生長，在壓力反應中發揮關鍵作用。","word":"abscisic acid"}},"absence":{"createdAt":1781598671085,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"absence 作名詞表示缺席或缺少，指某物或某人不在場或不存在的狀態","options":["presence","absence","abundance","storage"],"sentence":"The ______ of fresh water made it difficult for the village to survive the drought. Residents had to travel miles to find any source of drinking water.","translation":"缺乏淡水使村莊很難在乾旱中生存。居民必須走幾英里才能找到任何飲用水源。","word":"absence"}},"absent":{"createdAt":1782957728278,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"absent 作為形容詞表示「缺席的」或「不在的」，指某人沒有出現在應該出現的地方。","options":["absent","careless","confused","late"],"sentence":"The teacher noticed that Mark was ______ from class for the third time this week. When questioned about his whereabouts, Mark admitted he had skipped school to play video games with friends.","translation":"老師注意到馬克本週第三次缺席課堂。當被問及他的去向時，馬克承認他逃課去和朋友玩電子遊戲。","word":"absent"}},"absentminded":{"createdAt":1784900082695,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"absentminded 是指一個人心不在焉、注意力不集中，常因為疲勞、分心或缺乏專注力而犯錯，無法留意周遭的事物。","options":["intelligent","absentminded","enthusiastic","organized"],"sentence":"My professor was so ______ during the lecture that he wrote the wrong equation on the board and didn't notice. He had been up all night grading papers and couldn't focus on what he was doing.","translation":"我的教授在講課時心不在焉，甚至在黑板上寫錯了方程式都沒有注意到。他整夜都在批改作業，無法專注於他正在做的事情。","word":"absentminded"}},"absolute":{"createdAt":1782977936103,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"absolute意為完全的或絕對的，表示毫無疑問、沒有例外或限制條件的狀態。","options":["relative","conditional","absolute","tentative"],"sentence":"The judge made an ______ decision that could not be appealed or changed. The ruling was final and binding with no room for reconsideration or modification.","translation":"法官做出了無法上訴或改變的絕對決定。該判決是最終的、具有約束力的，沒有重新考慮或修改的餘地。","word":"absolute"}},"absorb":{"createdAt":1781360906182,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"absorb 意思是吸收或理解，這裡用來描述海綿吸收水分的能力。","options":["release","absorb","pour","spill"],"sentence":"The sponge can ______ large amounts of water. When you squeeze it, all the liquid comes back out.","translation":"海綿可以吸收大量的水。當你擠它時，所有的液體都會流出來。","word":"absorb"}},"absorbed":{"createdAt":1781581336210,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"absorbed表示完全沉浸於某事物中，給予全部的注意力。","options":["distracted","absorbed","bored","confused"],"sentence":"The student was completely ______ in the fascinating novel during class and didn't notice the teacher calling his name. His full concentration on the story made him oblivious to his surroundings.","translation":"這個學生在課堂上完全沉浸在迷人的小說中，沒有注意到老師叫他的名字。他對故事的全神貫注使他對周圍環境視而不見。","word":"absorbed"}},"absorption":{"createdAt":1781360885490,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"absorption在商業中指一個公司被另一個公司吞併或合併，成為更大企業的一部分。","options":["rejection","absorption","separation","division"],"sentence":"The ______ of the smaller company by the larger corporation was completed last year. The two businesses are now operating as a single unified entity.","translation":"較小公司被較大公司的並購去年完成。這兩家業務現在作為一個統一的實體運營。","word":"absorption"}},"abstract":{"createdAt":1781336858156,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"abstract 形容詞表示不具體、不以真實物體為基礎，而是基於概念或想象的事物，尤其在藝術中常見。","options":["realistic","concrete","abstract","literal"],"sentence":"The ______ painting confused many visitors at the modern art museum. Without recognizable objects or clear representations, viewers had to use their imagination to interpret its meaning.","translation":"這幅抽象畫在現代藝術博物館中令許多訪客感到困惑。沒有可識別的物體或清晰的表現形式，觀眾必須使用想像力來解釋其意義。","word":"abstract"}},"abstraction":{"createdAt":1783259812520,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"abstraction 指抽象的品質或事物，指不具體、不現實的藝術或思想表達方式。","options":["realism","clarity","abstraction","representation"],"sentence":"The artist's latest painting was filled with ______ and symbolic imagery rather than realistic details. Viewers found it difficult to identify any concrete objects or familiar scenes.","translation":"這位藝術家最新的畫作充滿了抽象和象徵性的意象，而不是寫實的細節。觀眾很難識別出任何具體的物體或熟悉的場景。","word":"abstraction"}},"absurd":{"createdAt":1782953855187,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"absurd 用來形容完全不合理、令人難以置信的想法或主張，與科學事實相悖","options":["reasonable","absurd","common","popular"],"sentence":"The idea that the Earth is flat in the modern age is completely ______. Scientists have proven through countless observations and satellite imagery that our planet is spherical.","translation":"在現代，地球是平的這個想法完全是荒唐的。科學家已經通過無數觀察和衛星圖像證明我們的星球是球形的。","word":"absurd"}},"abundance":{"createdAt":1781532967157,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"abundance 表示豐富、充足，與句中「從未見過這麼多」的描述相符。","options":["scarcity","abundance","shortage","deficit"],"sentence":"The farmer was pleased to see an ______ of fresh vegetables in the market this season. He had never seen so many crops available at once.","translation":"農民很高興看到這個季節市場上有______(豐富)的新鮮蔬菜。他以前從未見過這麼多的農產品一次性上市。","word":"abundance"}},"abundant":{"createdAt":1781843473807,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"abundant 用來形容大量且充足的事物，在這裡指降雨量豐富，導致水庫充滿，農民不再需要人工灌溉。","options":["scarce","abundant","moderate","unpredictable"],"sentence":"The ______ rainfall this season has filled all the reservoirs to capacity. The farmers are celebrating because they won't need to irrigate their crops for months.","translation":"這個季節充足的降雨量已經將所有水庫填滿至容量。農民們在慶祝，因為他們在未來幾個月內不需要灌溉他們的莊稼。","word":"abundant"}},"abuse":{"createdAt":1782651710253,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"abuse 在此指濫用或不當使用規則和權力，違反既定的規範。","options":["follow","abuse","support","protect"],"sentence":"The company was criticized for its decision to ______ environmental regulations and dump toxic waste illegally. Government inspectors found evidence of willful violations dating back years.","translation":"該公司因決定濫用環境法規並非法傾倒有毒廢料而受到批評。政府檢查員發現了可追溯到多年前的故意違規證據。","word":"abuse"}},"academic":{"createdAt":1781493458242,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"academic 形容詞指與學院、學術或教育有關的，這裡指大學研究和學術工作","options":["athletic","commercial","academic","musical"],"sentence":"She pursued an ______ career studying ancient history at the university. Her research papers were published in peer-reviewed journals and presented at scholarly conferences.","translation":"她追求了在大學研究古代歷史的學術生涯。她的研究論文發表在同行評審期刊上，並在學術會議上發表。","word":"academic"}},"academy":{"createdAt":1783066793839,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"academy 是指教育機構，特別是專門培養藝術、科學或特殊技能的學校或學院。","options":["orchestra","academy","theater","concert"],"sentence":"She attended a prestigious ______ to study music and performance. The institution was founded in 1920 and is known for training professional musicians.","translation":"她進入一所享有盛譽的學院學習音樂和表演。這個機構成立於1920年，以培訓專業音樂家而聞名。","word":"academy"}},"accelerate":{"createdAt":1781484539654,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"accelerate 的意思是加快速度或增加移動的快度，與減速或停止的行為相對。","options":["brake","decelerate","accelerate","reverse"],"sentence":"The driver decided to ______ the car when he saw the green traffic light. His vehicle quickly moved faster down the highway.","translation":"當司機看到綠燈時，他決定加速汽車。他的車輛在高速公路上快速加快速度。","word":"accelerate"}},"accelerated":{"createdAt":1781360906190,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"accelerated 意思是加速的或促進的，指速度或進度增加的過程。","options":["standard","accelerated","delayed","normal"],"sentence":"The ______ program allows gifted students to complete their studies faster than usual. These students advance through the curriculum at twice the normal pace.","translation":"加速課程允許天才學生比平常更快地完成他們的學習。這些學生以兩倍的正常速度推進課程。","word":"accelerated"}},"accent":{"createdAt":1783066793845,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"accent 是指說話時的口音或腔調，反映了說話者的地域或語言背景。","options":["language","accent","vocabulary","tone"],"sentence":"Her ______ was distinctly Scottish, with rolling r's and unique vowel sounds. Listeners could immediately identify where she came from based on her speech patterns.","translation":"她的口音明顯帶有蘇格蘭特色，有著翹舌的r音和獨特的元音。聽眾可以根據她的說話方式立即識別出她來自哪裡。","word":"accent"}},"access":{"createdAt":1781581336205,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"access作為名詞指進入某個地方或使用某個東西的權利或途徑。","options":["knowledge","access","permission","approval"],"sentence":"Employees need a special card to gain ______ to the restricted areas of the office building. Without this security credential, entry is strictly prohibited.","translation":"員工需要特殊卡才能進入辦公樓的受限制區域。沒有此安全憑證，進入受到嚴格禁止。","word":"access"}},"accessible":{"createdAt":1781360906189,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"accessible 意思是易接近的或易取得的，指可以方便地到達或使用。","options":["isolated","accessible","restricted","remote"],"sentence":"The new library is very ______ to students with disabilities. The building has ramps, elevators, and specialized facilities for everyone.","translation":"新圖書館對有殘疾的學生非常容易接近。該建築為每個人配備了斜坡、電梯和專業設施。","word":"accessible"}},"accessory":{"createdAt":1781256485494,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"accessory指的是附件或配件，用來完善或裝飾主要物品","options":["weapon","accessory","vehicle","ingredient"],"sentence":"The leather belt was the perfect ______ to complete her outfit. It matched well with her jacket and shoes.","translation":"這條皮帶是完成她服裝搭配的完美配件。它與她的夾克和鞋子搭配得很好。","word":"accessory"}},"accident":{"createdAt":1781532967166,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"accident 表示事故、意外，與「兩車相撞、司機失控」的描述相符。","options":["meeting","accident","event","incident"],"sentence":"The traffic ______ on the highway caused a three-hour delay for all commuters. Two cars had collided when one driver lost control.","translation":"高速公路上的______(事故)造成所有通勤者延誤三小時。兩輛車在一名司機失控時相撞。","word":"accident"}},"accidental":{"createdAt":1783066793847,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"accidental 是形容詞，表示某事是無意中發生的、意外的、非故意的。","options":["intentional","deliberate","accidental","calculated"],"sentence":"The damage to the painting was ______, caused by a clumsy visitor who knocked over a vase. It was not intentional or planned by anyone.","translation":"這幅畫的損毀是偶然的，由一位笨拙的訪客打翻花瓶造成的。這不是任何人故意的或計畫的行為。","word":"accidental"}},"accidentally":{"createdAt":1789080502645,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"「accidentally」是副詞，表示「意外地；偶然地；不小心地」，用來描述非故意發生的動作或事件。","options":["deliberately","intentionally","accidentally","purposely"],"sentence":"Sarah ______ spilled her coffee all over her important documents this morning. She did not intend to knock over the cup at all.","translation":"莎拉今早不小心把咖啡灑在她的重要文件上。她根本不是故意打翻杯子的。","word":"accidentally"}},"acclaim":{"createdAt":1781360906190,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"acclaim 意思是讚揚或公開的稱譽，指公眾對某人成就的認可和歡迎。","options":["criticism","acclaim","rejection","complaint"],"sentence":"The actor received ______ from critics and audiences for his powerful performance. Newspapers praised his outstanding talent and dedication.","translation":"該演員因其強大的表演而獲得了評論家和觀眾的讚揚。報紙讚揚了他傑出的才華和奉獻精神。","word":"acclaim"}},"accommodate":{"createdAt":1782957728274,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"accommodate 意為「適應於」或「容納」，指提供足夠的空間、設施或資源來滿足某人的需求或要求。","options":["abandon","accommodate","arrange","assign"],"sentence":"The hotel was able to ______ all 200 guests despite the unexpected surge in bookings. The staff rearranged rooms, added extra beds, and opened previously closed sections to ensure everyone had a comfortable place to stay.","translation":"飯店儘管預訂突然激增，仍能夠適應所有200位客人。員工重新安排房間、增加額外床位並打開之前關閉的區域，以確保每個人都有舒適的住處。","word":"accommodate"}},"accommodation":{"createdAt":1781581336202,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"accommodation指的是提供給人們居住或停留的住所或房間。","options":["transportation","accommodation","meals","entertainment"],"sentence":"The hotel provided comfortable ______ for all the conference attendees during their week-long stay. Rooms were spacious and located in a convenient downtown area.","translation":"酒店為所有會議與會者在一週長的逗留期間提供舒適的住所。房間寬敞，位於方便的市中心區域。","word":"accommodation"}},"accompany":{"createdAt":1782610887955,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"accompany是指陪同或伴隨，在音樂中表示與另一部分一起演奏來補充或支持。","options":["followed","accompany","recorded","interrupted"],"sentence":"The musician's guitar solo was ______ by a beautiful violin part. The two instruments played together seamlessly throughout the entire song.","translation":"音樂家的吉他獨奏由優美的小提琴樂段伴奏。這兩種樂器在整首歌曲中無縫地一起演奏。","word":"accompany"}},"accomplish":{"createdAt":1781360906183,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"accomplish 意思是完成或達成，強調成功地實現了目標。","options":["attempt","accomplish","ignore","abandon"],"sentence":"She worked hard to ______ her goal of finishing the marathon. By crossing the finish line, she proved her determination.","translation":"她努力工作以完成馬拉松的目標。通過衝過終點線，她證明了她的決心。","word":"accomplish"}},"accomplishment":{"createdAt":1781360885487,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"accomplishment指成功完成的事情，通常需要努力和技能，令人感到自豪。","options":["failure","accomplishment","setback","delay"],"sentence":"Graduating from university was a major ______ for her family. It represented years of hard work and dedication to education.","translation":"從大學畢業是她家族的重大成就。這代表了多年來對教育的努力和奉獻。","word":"accomplishment"}},"accord":{"createdAt":1782303283391,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"accord 在此作為動詞，意為符合或達成協議，通常用於表示不同方之間的一致或共識。","options":["accord","retreat","ignore","separate"],"sentence":"The two countries could not ______ on a trade agreement despite weeks of negotiation. Their conflicting economic interests made it impossible to reach a mutually acceptable deal.","translation":"儘管談判了數週，這兩個國家仍無法就貿易協議達成協議。他們衝突的經濟利益使得達成相互接受的協議成為不可能。","word":"accord"}},"accordance":{"createdAt":1782977936100,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"accordance意為一致或和諧，表示某事物與某標準或規則相符合或相一致。","options":["conflict","accordance","contradiction","opposition"],"sentence":"The new company policy was implemented in ______ with the government regulations. All departments received the official guidelines that mandated this specific approach.","translation":"新的公司政策是按照政府規定實施的。所有部門都收到了強制這一具體做法的官方指南。","word":"accordance"}},"according":{"createdAt":1781849622416,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"根據是介詞，用於表示基於某項規則、聲明或來源，引入信息的根據或依據。","options":["Despite","According","Contrary","Opposed"],"sentence":"______ to the new company policy, all employees must complete training by next month. The human resources department issued this requirement in writing last week.","translation":"根據新的公司政策，所有員工必須在下個月前完成培訓。人力資源部上週以書面形式發出了這項要求。","word":"according"}},"accordingly":{"createdAt":1781581336209,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"accordingly是副詞，表示根據特定的情況或條件而採取相應的行動。","options":["hastily","accordingly","reluctantly","abruptly"],"sentence":"The weather forecast predicted heavy rain for tomorrow morning, so we adjusted our plans ______. We decided to move the outdoor picnic to the following weekend.","translation":"天氣預報預測明天上午會下大雨，所以我們相應地調整了計劃。我們決定將戶外野餐改到下週末。","word":"accordingly"}},"account":{"createdAt":1782660040406,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"account 在此指銀行帳戶，是存放金錢的地方，可以用卡片和憑證訪問。","options":["journal","account","receipt","contract"],"sentence":"She opened a new ______ at the bank to save money for her vacation next summer. The bank manager provided her with a card and login credentials to access her funds.","translation":"她在銀行開設了一個新帳戶，為明年夏天的假期存錢。銀行經理為她提供了卡片和登錄憑證以訪問她的資金。","word":"account"}},"accountable":{"createdAt":1781360885486,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"accountable表示必須對自己的行為或決定承擔責任，並可以被要求解釋或說明。","options":["irresponsible","accountable","unaware","innocent"],"sentence":"The manager is ______ for all the mistakes made by his team members. He must explain to the director why the project failed.","translation":"經理對他的團隊成員所犯的所有錯誤負責。他必須向主管解釋該項目為什麼失敗。","word":"accountable"}},"accountant":{"createdAt":1781360885497,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"accountant是指專門從事會計工作的專業人士，負責管理和審計財務記錄。","options":["lawyer","accountant","engineer","designer"],"sentence":"The company hired an experienced ______ to manage their financial records and taxes. She will prepare financial statements and ensure all accounts are balanced correctly.","translation":"公司聘請了一位經驗豐富的會計師來管理他們的財務記錄和稅務。她將準備財務報表並確保所有帳戶平衡正確。","word":"accountant"}},"accounting":{"createdAt":1781424157175,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"accounting 是一門學科和專業領域，涉及記錄和管理財務交易。","options":["marketing","law","accounting","engineering"],"sentence":"Maria studied ______ in university to prepare for a career managing financial records and budgets. Her courses included auditing, tax preparation, and financial statement analysis.","translation":"瑪麗亞在大學學習會計，為從事財務記錄和預算管理的職業做準備。她的課程包括審計、稅務準備和財務報表分析。","word":"accounting"}},"accumulate":{"createdAt":1781840667146,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"accumulate意思是逐漸聚集或堆積，表示數量或量度隨時間增加。","options":["disappear","scatter","accumulate","settle"],"sentence":"Over the years, dust and dirt began to ______ in the attic. By the time they cleaned it out, there were piles of forgotten items stacked everywhere.","translation":"多年來，灰塵和污垢開始在閣樓堆積。到他們清理時，到處都是堆積的遺忘物品。","word":"accumulate"}},"accumulation":{"createdAt":1783312791647,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"accumulation是名詞，表示事物逐漸堆積或聚集的過程或結果。","options":["removal","accumulation","distribution","organization"],"sentence":"The ______ of dust on the shelves made it difficult to see the books clearly. Years of neglecting to clean the room had created layers of debris.","translation":"書架上灰塵的累積使得很難清楚地看到書籍。多年不打掃房間造成了多層碎屑。","word":"accumulation"}},"accuracy":{"createdAt":1783141117692,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"accuracy 是名詞，表示「準確性」，指測量、陳述或行動的精確程度和正確程度。","options":["speed","accuracy","patience","creativity"],"sentence":"The scientist emphasized the importance of ______ when conducting laboratory experiments. Even a small measurement error could invalidate months of research and lead to incorrect conclusions.","translation":"科學家強調在進行實驗室實驗時準確性的重要性。即使是很小的測量誤差也可能使數月的研究失效，並導致錯誤的結論。","word":"accuracy"}},"accurate":{"createdAt":1781360885491,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"accurate指信息、測量或預測非常準確，沒有或很少有誤差。","options":["vague","accurate","misleading","approximate"],"sentence":"The weather forecast was ______ and predicted the storm within an hour. The meteorologists had correctly identified the exact time and location of the rainfall.","translation":"天氣預報是準確的，並在一小時內預測了風暴。氣象學家準確地確定了降雨的確切時間和地點。","word":"accurate"}},"accusation":{"createdAt":1781360885493,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"accusation指指控某人犯罪或做錯事，通常需要有證據來支持。","options":["praise","accusation","compliment","support"],"sentence":"The ______ against the politician was made by several witnesses who claimed to have evidence. However, the charges were later proven false.","translation":"對政治家的控訴是由幾位聲稱擁有證據的證人提出的。但是，這些指控後來被證明是虛假的。","word":"accusation"}},"accuse":{"createdAt":1781337343696,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"accuse意為指控或控告某人犯了某種過錯或罪行。","options":["praise","accuse","invite","assist"],"sentence":"The detective decided to ______ the suspect of stealing the priceless painting from the museum. However, security footage later proved the suspect's innocence.","translation":"偵探決定指控嫌疑人從博物館竊取了無價的畫作。然而，監控錄影後來證明了嫌疑人的清白。","word":"accuse"}},"accustom":{"createdAt":1783066793846,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"accustom 是動詞，意思是使某人逐漸習慣於某事物，通常需要時間和重複接觸。","options":["forget","accustom","resist","abandon"],"sentence":"New employees need time to ______ themselves to the company's working culture and procedures. After several weeks of training and observation, they gradually become comfortable with the daily routines.","translation":"新員工需要時間去適應公司的工作文化和程序。經過幾週的培訓和觀察後，他們漸漸對日常工作習以為常。","word":"accustom"}},"ache":{"createdAt":1783312791640,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ache是動詞，表示持續的疼痛或酸痛感，特別是肌肉或身體部位的不適。","options":["break","ache","stretch","improve"],"sentence":"My muscles ______ after the intense workout yesterday. I had to take pain medication to relieve the soreness throughout my entire body.","translation":"我昨天激烈運動後肌肉疼痛。我必須服用止痛藥來緩解全身的酸痛。","word":"ache"}},"achieve":{"createdAt":1781672973707,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"achieve表示「完成；達成」，指通過努力最終實現目標或願望。","options":["abandon","achieve","avoid","accuse"],"sentence":"After years of hard work and dedication, she finally managed to ______ her dream of becoming a doctor. The medical license hanging on her wall was proof of her success.","translation":"經過多年的辛苦工作和奉獻，她終於設法完成了成為醫生的夢想。掛在她牆上的醫學執照是她成功的證明。","word":"achieve"}},"achievement":{"createdAt":1783064457798,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"achievement 是名詞，指通過努力而取得的成功結果或成就；在此句中強調學生經過多年努力後的成功。","options":["failure","achievement","attempt","mistake"],"sentence":"Winning the national science competition was a major ______ for the young student. She had spent three years developing her project and finally earned the recognition she deserved.","translation":"贏得全國科學競賽是這位年輕學生的一項重大成就。她花了三年時間開發她的項目，最終獲得了她應得的認可。","word":"achievement"}},"acid":{"createdAt":1781849511875,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"酸是一種化學物質，具有腐蝕性，pH值低於7，能夠溶解某些物質。","options":["base","acid","salt","alkali"],"sentence":"The chemistry teacher warned students to handle the ______ carefully because it could burn through metal and skin. We all wore protective gloves and goggles when working with this corrosive substance in the lab.","translation":"化學老師警告學生要小心處理酸，因為它可能會腐蝕金屬和皮膚。我們在實驗室處理這種腐蝕性物質時都穿著保護手套和護目鏡。","word":"acid"}},"acidity":{"createdAt":1781417610416,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"acidity是指物質所含的酸性或酸度，在飲食中特別指酸味的強度。","options":["sweetness","texture","acidity","aroma"],"sentence":"The ______ of the vinegar made it unsuitable for use in the delicate recipe. The chef needed to dilute it significantly because the sourness would overpower all other flavors.","translation":"醋的酸性使其不適合用於這個精緻的食譜。廚師需要大量稀釋它，因為這種酸味會蓋過所有其他的味道。","word":"acidity"}},"acknowledge":{"createdAt":1781693304923,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"acknowledge 表示承認或感謝他人的貢獻，與忽視或輕視相反。","options":["ignore","acknowledge","overlook","dismiss"],"sentence":"The author failed to ______ the contributions of her research team in the book's introduction. This oversight angered the colleagues who had spent months assisting her.","translation":"作者在書籍序言中未能承認她的研究團隊的貢獻。這個疏忽激怒了那些花了數個月協助她的同事。","word":"acknowledge"}},"acknowledgement":{"createdAt":1781860901467,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"acknowledgement表示承認或感謝，常指對他人貢獻的正式認可和表達感謝","options":["introduction","acknowledgement","conclusion","preface"],"sentence":"The author included an ______ in her book thanking all the people who helped her. She named her family, colleagues, and mentors who supported her throughout the writing process.","translation":"作者在她的書中包含了一份致謝，感謝所有幫助她的人。她列舉了在整個寫作過程中支持她的家人、同事和導師。","word":"acknowledgement"}},"acknowledgment":{"createdAt":1781449095511,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"acknowledgment意為承認或感謝，用來表示對某人的貢獻或幫助的認可。","options":["criticism","acknowledgment","complaint","disagreement"],"sentence":"In the book's introduction, the author gave special ______ to her mentor. She expressed deep gratitude for all the guidance and support he had provided.","translation":"在書的序言中，作者特別感謝了她的導師。她表達了對他所提供的所有指導和支持的深深感激。","word":"acknowledgment"}},"acne":{"createdAt":1781395428239,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"acne 是一種皮膚疾病，特徵是出現粉刺、丘疹和黑頭，通常在青春期出現。","options":["eczema","acne","psoriasis","melanoma"],"sentence":"Many teenagers struggle with ______ during puberty due to hormonal changes. This skin condition causes inflamed pimples and blemishes primarily on the face and chest.","translation":"許多青少年在青春期因激素變化而與粉刺作鬥爭。這種皮膚狀況主要在臉部和胸部引起發炎的粉刺和瑕疵。","word":"acne"}},"acoustic":{"createdAt":1781738105695,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"acoustic 指的是與聲音相關的，或指樂器能夠不通過電子放大而產生自然聲音。","options":["electric","acoustic","synthesized","digital"],"sentence":"The musician preferred playing an ______ guitar rather than an electric one for his intimate concert. The natural sound of the wooden instrument resonated beautifully in the small venue.","translation":"這位音樂家更喜歡在親密音樂會上演奏原聲吉他而不是電吉他。這件木製樂器的自然聲音在小場地中美妙地迴蕩。","word":"acoustic"}},"acoustics":{"createdAt":1783133907029,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"acoustics是名詞，指聲學或音響效果，涉及聲音在空間中的傳播和質量。","options":["lighting","acoustics","seating","ventilation"],"sentence":"The concert hall's ______ were carefully engineered to provide perfect sound quality. The architects designed the walls and ceiling to minimize echoes and enhance the clarity of the orchestra's performance.","translation":"音樂廳的音響效果經過精心設計，以提供完美的音質。建築師設計了牆壁和天花板，以最小化迴聲並增強管弦樂隊演奏的清晰度。","word":"acoustics"}},"acquaint":{"createdAt":1781484539652,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"acquaint 的意思是使某人變得熟悉或了解某事物，常用於 acquaint oneself with（使自己熟悉）的結構。","options":["distance","acquaint","separate","isolate"],"sentence":"The new employee needs time to ______ herself with the company's policies and procedures. By next month, she should be completely familiar with all the systems.","translation":"新員工需要時間使自己熟悉公司的政策和程序。到下個月，她應該會完全熟悉所有的系統。","word":"acquaint"}},"acquaintance":{"createdAt":1781484415232,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"acquaintance是指認識但不是親密朋友的人，表示較為淡薄的人際關係。","options":["stranger","acquaintance","relative","enemy"],"sentence":"She ran into an old ______ at the grocery store and they chatted for a few minutes. They weren't close friends, just people who had met a couple of times before.","translation":"她在雜貨店遇到了一位老相識，他們聊了幾分鐘。他們不是親密的朋友，只是之前見過幾次面的人。","word":"acquaintance"}},"acquainted":{"createdAt":1781360906184,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"acquainted 意思是相識的或熟悉的，表示對某人或某事有基本的了解。","options":["separated","acquainted","confused","estranged"],"sentence":"Before the project started, the team members became ______ with each other. They attended a meeting where they introduced themselves and shared their backgrounds.","translation":"在項目開始前，團隊成員彼此熟悉了。他們參加了一次會議，在會議上相互介紹並分享了他們的背景。","word":"acquainted"}},"acquire":{"createdAt":1781672973746,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"acquire是動詞，表示「取得；獲得；學會」，指通過購買、學習或其他方式獲得某物。","options":["lose","acquire","destroy","donate"],"sentence":"Over the past five years, she has ______ a comprehensive collection of rare art pieces from around the world. Her museum now houses one of the most valuable private collections in the country.","translation":"在過去五年中，她從世界各地獲得了一套全面的罕見藝術品收藏。她的博物館現在擁有該國最有價值的私人收藏品之一。","word":"acquire"}},"acquisition":{"createdAt":1781434900600,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"acquisition指獲得或購買某物，特別是在正式或官方的背景下。","options":["loss","acquisition","removal","donation"],"sentence":"The museum's recent ______ of a rare painting from the Renaissance period attracted thousands of visitors. The purchase significantly enhanced the collection's historical value.","translation":"博物館最近獲得了一幅罕見的文藝復興時期繪畫，吸引了數千名遊客。這次購買大大提高了藏品的歷史價值。","word":"acquisition"}},"acre":{"createdAt":1781256547736,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Acre是一個面積測量單位，常用於測量土地面積，特別是在英美地區。","options":["meter","acre","pound","minute"],"sentence":"The farmer owns 50 ______ of fertile land in the countryside. This vast property provides enough space for growing crops, raising cattle, and maintaining various farm buildings.","translation":"這位農民在鄉間擁有50英畝的肥沃土地。這片廣大的地產提供了足夠的空間來種植作物、飼養牲畜和維護各種農舍。","word":"acre"}},"active":{"createdAt":1781965320890,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"active 表示積極參與和忙於某項活動，與被動或不參與的狀態相反。","options":["passive","retired","active","isolated"],"sentence":"She is very ______ in her community, volunteering at the local food bank every weekend. Her constant involvement has earned her several awards from the city.","translation":"她在社區中非常積極，每個週末都在當地食物銀行做志願服務。她持續的參與為她贏得了城市的幾個獎項。","word":"active"}},"actively":{"createdAt":1781672973739,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"actively是副詞，表示「積極地」，修飾動詞表示以主動和積極的方式進行某項活動。","options":["passively","actively","reluctantly","occasionally"],"sentence":"She ______ participated in community service projects throughout the year. Her volunteer hours exceeded everyone else's because of her constant involvement and dedication.","translation":"她全年積極參與社區服務項目。由於她的持續參與和奉獻，她的志願服務時數超過了其他所有人。","word":"actively"}},"activist":{"createdAt":1781395428237,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"activist 指積極推動社會或政治變革的人，強調主動採取行動。","options":["observer","activist","politician","journalist"],"sentence":"Sarah is a passionate environmental ______ who organizes protests against pollution. She dedicates her time to taking direct action and promoting change in her community.","translation":"莎拉是一位熱情的環境積極分子，她組織抗議污染的遊行活動。她致力於採取直接行動並推動社區的改變。","word":"activist"}},"actual":{"createdAt":1781360906183,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"actual 意思是實際的或真實的，指的是真正發生或存在的情況。","options":["projected","actual","assumed","theoretical"],"sentence":"The ______ cost of the project was higher than the estimate. The accountant showed us the real expenses in the final report.","translation":"該項目的實際成本高於估計。會計師在最終報告中向我們展示了真實費用。","word":"actual"}},"acute":{"createdAt":1781429945502,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"acute 表示急性的或劇烈的，通常用來描述突然發生且症狀嚴重的疾病。","options":["chronic","acute","mild","imaginary"],"sentence":"The patient suffered from an ______ case of pneumonia that required immediate hospitalization. The severe infection developed suddenly and needed urgent medical treatment within days.","translation":"這位患者患有急性肺炎，需要立即住院治療。嚴重的感染突然發展，需要在數天內進行緊急醫療。","word":"acute"}},"adapt":{"createdAt":1783064457799,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"adapt 是動詞，表示改編或使某物適應新環境；在此句中指將文學作品改編成電影形式。","options":["adopt","adapt","adore","advance"],"sentence":"When the film director decided to ______ the classic novel for the big screen, she had to condense many scenes. The movie version maintained the main plot but changed several character backstories to fit the time constraints.","translation":"當電影導演決定將經典小說改編成電影時，她必須刪減許多場景。電影版本保留了主要情節，但改變了幾個角色的背景故事以符合時間限制。","word":"adapt"}},"adaptation":{"createdAt":1783066793846,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"adaptation 是指對原著進行的改編或調整，使其適應不同的形式或媒體。","options":["translation","adaptation","summary","review"],"sentence":"The film director created an ______ of the classic novel for the screen. The screenplay changed several plot points and characters from the original story to suit the visual medium.","translation":"電影導演為銀幕創作了這部經典小說的改編版本。劇本改變了原著故事中的幾個情節點和人物，以適應視覺媒體的需要。","word":"adaptation"}},"add":{"createdAt":1782569936430,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"add 是動詞，表示將數字或物品加起來得到總數，或增加某物的數量。","options":["subtract","add","divide","multiply"],"sentence":"If you ______ two and three together, you get five. The mathematical operation requires combining numbers to get a total.","translation":"如果你把二和三加起來，你會得到五。這個數學運算需要把數字組合起來得到總數。","word":"add"}},"addict":{"createdAt":1781484415234,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"addict是指對某事物成癮或依賴的人，無法控制地沉迷其中。","options":["trainer","teacher","addict","player"],"sentence":"He became a video game ______ and spent twelve hours every day playing online. His family grew worried about his excessive gaming and neglect of school and social life.","translation":"他成為了一個電玩遊戲成癮者，每天花費十二小時在線上遊戲。他的家人對他過度遊戲以及忽視學業和社交生活感到擔心。","word":"addict"}},"addicted":{"createdAt":1781664082511,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"addicted 表示對某事物有癮，沉迷於某事物，通常帶有負面含義。","options":["immune","addicted","resistant","opposed"],"sentence":"Many teenagers are ______ to social media and spend hours scrolling through their phones. Their parents have noticed they cannot go a single day without checking their accounts.","translation":"許多青少年對社交媒體上癮，花數小時滾動瀏覽手機。他們的父母注意到他們一天都無法不檢查自己的帳戶。","word":"addicted"}},"addiction":{"createdAt":1783064457799,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"addiction 是名詞，指對某物的強烈依賴或上癮；在此句中強調對社交媒體的過度成癮導致的負面影響。","options":["enthusiasm","addiction","participation","connection"],"sentence":"Her ______ to social media was affecting her sleep and grades, so her parents implemented strict phone usage rules. Without this intervention, she would spend twelve hours daily scrolling through various apps.","translation":"她對社交媒體的成癮正在影響她的睡眠和成績，所以她的父母制定了嚴格的手機使用規則。如果沒有這項干預，她每天會花十二個小時滾動各種應用程式。","word":"addiction"}},"addition":{"createdAt":1781961517452,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"addition 在短語 \"in addition to\" 中表示「除…之外還有」，表示增加或補充。","options":["contrast","addition","relation","comparison"],"sentence":"In ______ to the main courses, the restaurant offered several delicious desserts on the menu. These sweet treats were available as optional extras that customers could order separately.","translation":"除了主菜外，餐廳菜單上還提供了幾種美味的甜點。這些甜點可以作為顧客可以單獨訂購的可選附加項。","word":"addition"}},"additional":{"createdAt":1781598671077,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"additional 作形容詞表示附加的或額外的，指除了原有的以外還有的東西","options":["main","additional","basic","standard"],"sentence":"The restaurant offered ______ toppings at no extra charge during the promotion. Customers could choose pizza, pasta, or salad as complimentary accompaniments to their main courses.","translation":"該餐廳在促銷期間免費提供額外的配菜。客戶可以選擇披薩、義大利麵或沙拉作為主菜的免費配菜。","word":"additional"}},"additionally":{"createdAt":1782022372248,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"additionally 意為「此外、另外」，用於在陳述事實後添加額外的相關信息或論點。","options":["unfortunately","additionally","previously","rarely"],"sentence":"The restaurant offers excellent food at reasonable prices, and ______, the service staff are incredibly friendly and attentive. These extra positive qualities make it the most popular dining establishment in town.","translation":"這家餐廳提供優質的食物和合理的價格，此外，服務員非常友善和周到。這些額外的優點使其成為城鎮中最受歡迎的用餐場所。","word":"additionally"}},"address":{"createdAt":1782980445618,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"address 在此句中表示「地址」，指某個地方的具體位置和郵寄信息。","options":["name","phone","address","signature"],"sentence":"Please write your complete ______ on the envelope so the postman can deliver the letter. Include your street, city, and postal code.","translation":"請在信封上寫下你完整的地址，以便郵差能夠送達信件。包括你的街道、城市和郵遞區號。","word":"address"}},"adequate":{"createdAt":1783158653352,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"adequate 表示「足夠的、充分的」，指某事物達到所需或必要的程度，既不過多也不過少，恰好滿足需求。","options":["excessive","adequate","minimal","abundant"],"sentence":"The company's current budget is ______ to cover all the project expenses. However, if unexpected costs arise, we will need to request additional funding.","translation":"公司目前的預算足以涵蓋所有項目費用。然而，如果出現意外成本，我們將需要要求額外資金。","word":"adequate"}},"adjust":{"createdAt":1781693538702,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"adjust 表示調整、改變或修改某物使其處於更好的狀態或位置。","options":["break","adjust","ignore","destroy"],"sentence":"I need to ______ the microscope to see the cells more clearly. After turning the focus knob slightly, the image became perfectly sharp.","translation":"我需要調整顯微鏡以更清楚地看到細胞。轉動對焦旋鈕後，影像變得完全清晰。","word":"adjust"}},"adjustment":{"createdAt":1781360885490,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"adjustment指為了適應新環境或情況而進行的改變或調整，通常需要一段時間。","options":["rejection","adjustment","resistance","refusal"],"sentence":"After moving to a new country, she needed time for ______ to the different culture and lifestyle. Within six months, she had made significant changes to her daily routines.","translation":"搬到新國家後，她需要時間來適應不同的文化和生活方式。在六個月內，她對日常生活做出了重大改變。","word":"adjustment"}},"administer":{"createdAt":1781360885497,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"administer指提供或施放藥物、測試或管理某項服務，通常由授權人員進行。","options":["refuse","administer","deny","withhold"],"sentence":"The nurse will ______ the vaccine to all the children at the health center this morning. The medical staff has prepared everything needed for the immunization program.","translation":"護士今早將在衛生中心向所有兒童施打疫苗。醫療人員已為免疫接種計劃準備好了一切所需物品。","word":"administer"}},"administration":{"createdAt":1781437435166,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"administration 指經營、管理或行政機關，特別是組織的管理部門或經營機構。","options":["decoration","administration","conclusion","celebration"],"sentence":"The ______ of the hospital hired new staff to improve patient care services. The management team implemented new policies across all departments.","translation":"醫院的行政管理部門聘請了新員工以改進患者護理服務。管理團隊在所有部門實施了新政策。","word":"administration"}},"administrative":{"createdAt":1781360885488,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"administrative與管理和組織相關，特別是涉及辦公室工作和官方程序的工作。","options":["creative","administrative","technical","marketing"],"sentence":"The ______ staff handles all the paperwork and scheduling for the company. They manage office operations, files, and coordinate meetings.","translation":"行政人員處理公司的所有文書工作和日程安排。他們管理辦公室運營、文件並協調會議。","word":"administrative"}},"administrator":{"createdAt":1782529318038,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"administrator 意為管理人員或行政人員，用於指負責管理機構或組織事務的人。","options":["teacher","administrator","counselor","coach"],"sentence":"The school ______ announced that classes would be suspended due to the severe weather condition. His decision was communicated to all teachers and parents through official channels.","translation":"學校行政人員宣布由於惡劣天氣條件將暫停上課。他的決定通過官方渠道傳達給了所有教師和家長。","word":"administrator"}},"admiral":{"createdAt":1783005778365,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"admiral 意為「海軍上將」或「艦隊司令」，指海軍中最高或最資深的軍事領導者。","options":["teacher","sailor","admiral","merchant"],"sentence":"The ______ commanded the entire naval fleet with decades of military experience. His strategic decisions during the battle impressed even the highest-ranking officials in the defense ministry.","translation":"這位海軍上將以數十年的軍事經驗指揮整個海軍艦隊。他在戰鬥中的戰略決定甚至印象深刻的國防部最高級別官員。","word":"admiral"}},"admiration":{"createdAt":1781360906186,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"admiration 意思是欽佩或讚賞，表示對某人的成就或品質的高度評價。","options":["criticism","admiration","jealousy","indifference"],"sentence":"The young athlete earned the ______ of millions of fans worldwide. People respected his dedication and outstanding performance in the sport.","translation":"這位年輕運動員贏得了全球數百萬粉絲的欽佩。人們尊敬他在運動中的奉獻精神和傑出表現。","word":"admiration"}},"admire":{"createdAt":1781360885492,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"admire指對某人的品質、成就或行為表達敬佩和讚美之情。","options":["despise","admire","ignore","criticize"],"sentence":"I ______ my grandmother for her courage and wisdom throughout her life. She faced many challenges with grace and dignity.","translation":"我欽佩我祖母在整個人生中的勇氣和智慧。她以優雅和尊嚴面對了許多挑戰。","word":"admire"}},"admission":{"createdAt":1781484539654,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"admission 在這裡表示被接納或錄取進入某個機構或組織，與被拒絕或被排除的意思完全相反。","options":["rejection","dismissal","admission","exclusion"],"sentence":"His ______ to Harvard University was a dream come true after years of hard work. The acceptance letter confirmed that he had been approved as a new student.","translation":"經過多年的努力，他被哈佛大學錄取是夢想成真。錄取通知書確認了他被批准為新生。","word":"admission"}},"admit":{"createdAt":1781598671162,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"admit 作動詞表示允許入場或承認，在這裡指允許某人進入學校或組織","options":["reject","admit","defer","waitlist"],"sentence":"The university will ______ only 200 students from the 5,000 applications received this year. The acceptance rate is expected to be highly competitive.","translation":"大學將在今年收到的5,000份申請中只錄取200名學生。錄取率預計將非常具競爭力。","word":"admit"}},"admonition":{"createdAt":1781582278976,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"admonition是指針對某人的不當行為而進行的嚴肅警告或責備，通常帶有威脅性的後果。","options":["admonition","celebration","promotion","suggestion"],"sentence":"The coach's harsh ______ about poor sportsmanship echoed through the locker room after the game. He sternly told the players they would face serious consequences if they continued behaving disrespectfully toward opponents.","translation":"教練在比賽後在更衣室裡發出了關於運動精神不佳的嚴厲告誡。他嚴肅地告訴球員們，如果他們繼續對對手表現不尊重，將面臨嚴重後果。","word":"admonition"}},"adolescence":{"createdAt":1783133907027,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"adolescence是名詞，指青春期或青少年期，是人生中從兒童到成人的發展階段。","options":["childhood","adulthood","adolescence","infancy"],"sentence":"During ______, teenagers often experience rapid physical changes and emotional development. This period typically spans from the early teens through the late teens, marked by increased independence and self-discovery.","translation":"在青春期，青少年經常經歷快速的身體變化和情感發展。這個時期通常從青少年早期延伸到青少年晚期，以增加獨立性和自我發現為特點。","word":"adolescence"}},"adolescent":{"createdAt":1783133907018,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"adolescent是名詞，指的是處於青春期的年輕人，通常指13至19歲之間的人。","options":["adult","adolescent","child","infant"],"sentence":"The ______ in the study showed increased interest in social activities and independence. Researchers found that boys and girls aged 13 to 18 displayed similar patterns of behavior during this developmental stage.","translation":"研究中的青少年顯示出對社交活動和獨立性的興趣增加。研究人員發現，13至18歲的男孩和女孩在這個發展階段表現出相似的行為模式。","word":"adolescent"}},"adopt":{"createdAt":1781704395606,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"adopt作為動詞表示「採取」或「採納」，指官方或正式地接受並實施某項計畫或政策","options":["reject","threaten","adopt","tension"],"sentence":"The government decided to ______ a new environmental policy to reduce carbon emissions. Scientists provided evidence showing this strategy would be most effective at lowering pollution levels.","translation":"政府決定採取新的環保政策來減少碳排放。科學家提供證據表明這項策略在降低污染水準方面最為有效。","word":"adopt"}},"adopted":{"createdAt":1783146059983,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"「adopted」指經過法律程序正式成為某人的孩子或成員，通常用來描述領養關係或移居他處後獲得的身份。","options":["biological","orphaned","adopted","fostered"],"sentence":"The family decided to raise an ______ child from the local orphanage. They had gone through all the legal procedures and paperwork to officially bring the young boy into their home.","translation":"這個家庭決定從當地孤兒院撫養一個被領養的孩子。他們已經完成了所有的法律程序和文件工作，以正式將這個小男孩帶進他們的家。","word":"adopted"}},"adoption":{"createdAt":1781360906185,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"adoption 意思是採用或接納，表示接受並開始使用或實施某事。","options":["rejection","adoption","avoidance","criticism"],"sentence":"The ______ of new technology improved the company's efficiency. The management team decided to implement the latest software system.","translation":"新技術的採用提高了公司的效率。管理團隊決定實施最新的軟體系統。","word":"adoption"}},"adoptions":{"createdAt":1782202151142,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"adoptions 是領養的複數形式，指的是法律程序，讓非生物父母成為兒童的監護人。","options":["donations","adoptions","adoptees","applications"],"sentence":"The child welfare agency facilitated over fifty ______ last year, providing homes for orphaned children. Each family had to complete legal paperwork and background checks to become the legal guardian of these children.","translation":"兒童福利機構去年促成了五十多項領養，為孤兒提供了家庭。每個家庭都必須完成法律文件和背景調查，才能成為這些兒童的法定監護人。","word":"adoptions"}},"adore":{"createdAt":1781360906186,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"adore 意思是熱愛或崇拜，表示非常喜歡和珍視某人或某物。","options":["avoid","adore","ignore","hate"],"sentence":"The children absolutely ______ the theme park and visit it every summer. They cannot wait to ride the roller coasters and enjoy the attractions.","translation":"孩子們非常熱愛主題公園，每年夏天都去參觀。他們迫不及待地想乘坐過山車並享受各種景點。","word":"adore"}},"adult":{"createdAt":1782980445595,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"adult 在此句中表示「成人」，指達到法定年齡的人，有法律責任和權利。","options":["child","friend","adult","employee"],"sentence":"Only an ______ can sign the legal contract on behalf of the company. Children and teenagers are not permitted to do so.","translation":"只有成人才能代表公司簽署法律合約。兒童和青少年不被允許這樣做。","word":"adult"}},"advance":{"createdAt":1782980445597,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"advance 在此句中表示「前進、進展」，指向前移動或取得進步。","options":["retreat","delay","advance","pause"],"sentence":"The army made a significant ______ across enemy territory last week. They moved forward several miles despite heavy resistance.","translation":"軍隊上週在敵方領土上取得了顯著的進展。他們儘管遭到激烈抵抗，仍然向前推進了幾英里。","word":"advance"}},"advanced":{"createdAt":1783133907035,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"advanced是形容詞，表示先進的或高等的，通常用來描述更複雜、更高級的課程或技術。","options":["basic","advanced","introductory","elementary"],"sentence":"The university offers ______ courses in computer science for students who have completed the foundational program. These classes cover cutting-edge topics like artificial intelligence and machine learning that are at the forefront of technology.","translation":"大學為完成基礎課程的學生提供高等電腦科學課程。這些課程涵蓋人工智能和機器學習等最前沿的話題。","word":"advanced"}},"advantage":{"createdAt":1781360885493,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"advantage指比他人更有利的條件或優勢，有助於達成目標。","options":["disadvantage","advantage","liability","burden"],"sentence":"Speaking multiple languages gives her a significant ______ in her career. She can communicate with clients from different countries and access more job opportunities.","translation":"說多種語言在她的職業生涯中給了她顯著的優勢。她可以與來自不同國家的客戶溝通，並獲得更多工作機會。","word":"advantage"}},"adventure":{"createdAt":1783260254100,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"adventure 指充滿刺激、危險或新奇經歷的冒險活動，通常涉及未知的探索和挑戰。","options":["journey","adventure","vacation","tour"],"sentence":"Sarah's trip to the Amazon rainforest was an unforgettable ______ filled with exciting discoveries. She encountered exotic animals, explored hidden waterfalls, and faced unexpected challenges that tested her courage.","translation":"莎拉前往亞馬遜雨林的旅程是一次難忘的冒險，充滿了令人興奮的發現。她遇到了異國動物、探索了隱藏的瀑布，並面臨了考驗她勇氣的意外挑戰。","word":"adventure"}},"adverse":{"createdAt":1781256485491,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"adverse表示不利的、有害的或相反的影響","options":["positive","adverse","neutral","minor"],"sentence":"The storm had ______ effects on the harvest. Farmers lost most of their crops due to the heavy rain and strong winds.","translation":"這場暴風雨對收穫產生了不利影響。由於大雨和強風，農民損失了大部分莊稼。","word":"adverse"}},"adversity":{"createdAt":1783346573167,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"adversity 意為逆境、厄運或災禍，指困難或不幸的情況和時期。","options":["prosperity","growth","adversity","abundance"],"sentence":"During the economic ______, many families lost their homes and jobs. However, this challenging period ultimately strengthened their resilience and determination.","translation":"在經濟逆境中，許多家庭失去了房屋和工作。然而，這個充滿挑戰的時期最終增強了他們的韌性和決心。","word":"adversity"}},"advertise":{"createdAt":1783260254098,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"advertise 是指透過各種媒體手段向大眾推廣產品或服務，特別強調商業性的推廣活動。","options":["promote","advertise","announce","display"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ their new product on television and social media. They spent millions of dollars on commercials to reach as many customers as possible.","translation":"這家公司決定在電視和社群媒體上為他們的新產品做廣告。他們花了數百萬美元製作廣告以吸引盡可能多的客戶。","word":"advertise"}},"advertisement":{"createdAt":1781836375368,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"advertisement是廣告，指用來宣傳商品、服務或想法的公開宣傳。","options":["campaign","advertisement","announcement","broadcast"],"sentence":"The company spent millions on a television ______ to promote their new product. The commercial aired during prime time to reach the largest audience.","translation":"公司花費數百萬在電視廣告上推廣他們的新產品。該商業廣告在黃金時間播放以吸引最多觀眾。","word":"advertisement"}},"advice":{"createdAt":1782980445621,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"advice 在此句中表示「建議、勸告」，指基於經驗或知識給他人的意見和指導。","options":["money","tools","advice","documents"],"sentence":"My father gave me valuable ______ before I started my new business venture. He suggested that I save money and plan carefully.","translation":"在我開始新的商業冒險之前，我的父親給了我寶貴的建議。他建議我存錢並仔細計劃。","word":"advice"}},"advisable":{"createdAt":1784648623651,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"advisable 表示「明智的、可取的、值得推薦的」，用於描述被建議或推薦的行動。","options":["forbidden","advisable","impossible","irrelevant"],"sentence":"It is ______ to wear a seatbelt while driving. Safety experts strongly recommend this practice to reduce the risk of serious injury in accidents.","translation":"開車時繫安全帶是明智的。安全專家強烈建議這種做法以降低事故中重傷的風險。","word":"advisable"}},"advise":{"createdAt":1782786424040,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"advise作為動詞，表示向某人提供建議或忠告，基於經驗和知識。","options":["ignore","advise","mislead","confuse"],"sentence":"The financial consultant will ______ you on the best investment strategies for your future. She has over twenty years of experience and will guide you through all your options.","translation":"這位財務顧問將就您未來的最佳投資策略向您進行勸告。她擁有超過二十年的經驗，將為您指導所有選項。","word":"advise"}},"adviser":{"createdAt":1781360906187,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"adviser 意思是顧問，指提供專業意見和指導的人。","options":["student","adviser","customer","employee"],"sentence":"The financial ______ helped the family plan their investments wisely. His expert recommendations saved them thousands of dollars.","translation":"財務顧問幫助家庭明智地規劃他們的投資。他的專家建議為他們節省了數千美元。","word":"adviser"}},"advisory":{"createdAt":1781360906185,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"advisory 意思是給予建議的或諮詢性的，用來描述提供指導和意見的角色。","options":["mandatory","advisory","executive","administrative"],"sentence":"The company hired an ______ board to provide guidance on business strategy. These experts met monthly to offer recommendations and feedback.","translation":"公司聘請了一個諮詢委員會來提供商業策略指導。這些專家每月開會提供建議和反饋。","word":"advisory"}},"advocate":{"createdAt":1781581336189,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"advocate是指主張或擁護某項事業的人，表示積極的推動者。","options":["politician","advocate","scientist","journalist"],"sentence":"As a passionate ______ for climate action, she spent years promoting renewable energy. Her tireless efforts convinced thousands of people to support environmental policies.","translation":"作為氣候行動的熱情倡導者，她花了多年時間推廣可再生能源。她不懈的努力說服了數千人支持環保政策。","word":"advocate"}},"aerial":{"createdAt":1781580511761,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"aerial 是指來自空中或與飛行相關的事物，常用於形容航空攝影","options":["underground","surface","aerial","microscopic"],"sentence":"The ______ photography captured stunning views of the entire city from above. The drone flying high in the sky provided perspectives impossible to get from the ground.","translation":"航空攝影從上方捕捉了整個城市的壯麗景色。在高空飛行的無人機提供了從地面無法獲得的視角。","word":"aerial"}},"aesthetic":{"createdAt":1781362281666,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"aesthetic與美感、藝術價值相關，強調事物的視覺美感和藝術性。","options":["practical","aesthetic","structural","functional"],"sentence":"The ______ design of the building combines beauty with functionality. The architect paid careful attention to visual appeal and artistic elements.","translation":"這棟建築的美感設計結合了美感和功能性。建築師仔細注意視覺吸引力和藝術元素。","word":"aesthetic"}},"affair":{"createdAt":1781256485493,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"affair指的是重要的或引起公眾注意的事件或事情","options":["hobby","affair","game","sport"],"sentence":"The scandal became a major international ______ when the government's corruption was exposed. News outlets worldwide reported on the shocking revelations for months.","translation":"當政府的腐敗行為被揭露時，這個醜聞成為了一樁重大的國際事件。世界各地的新聞媒體數月來都在報導這些令人震驚的揭露。","word":"affair"}},"affect":{"createdAt":1782648229315,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"affect 作為動詞意指影響或對某人/某事產生作用或改變，通常後面接受影響的對象。","options":["ignore","separate","affect","explain"],"sentence":"The sudden changes in weather can ______ people's moods and overall mental well-being significantly. Studies show that rainy days often make individuals feel more depressed and unmotivated.","translation":"天氣的突然變化會顯著影響人們的心情和整體心理健康。研究表明雨天通常會使個人感到更加沮喪和沒有動力。","word":"affect"}},"affectation":{"createdAt":1782228357818,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"affectation 表示為了給人留下印象而故意採用不自然或虛假的行為或風格。","options":["sincerity","affectation","clarity","humility"],"sentence":"Her speaking style was filled with ______, using unnecessarily complex vocabulary and exaggerated gestures. Critics noted she was trying too hard to impress others rather than being genuine.","translation":"她的說話風格充滿了矯飾，使用不必要的複雜詞彙和誇張的手勢。評論家指出她過於用力試圖打動他人，而不是真誠待人。","word":"affectation"}},"affected":{"createdAt":1781775363749,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"affected 表示受到影響或罹患，用來描述那些遭受地震災害的地區和居民。","options":["protected","affected","warned","prepared"],"sentence":"The communities ______ by the earthquake received emergency aid from the government. Thousands of residents had lost their homes and needed immediate assistance.","translation":"受到地震______的社區獲得了政府的緊急援助。數千名居民失去了家園，需要立即援助。","word":"affected"}},"affection":{"createdAt":1781693270387,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"affection指「感情、親情、喜愛」，通常用來表達對他人溫暖、關心和愛護的感受。","options":["indifference","hostility","affection","resentment"],"sentence":"She showed deep ______ toward her elderly parents by visiting them every weekend. Her consistent care and warm hugs demonstrated how much she loved them.","translation":"她通過每週末拜訪年邁的父母來表達對他們的深厚感情。她一致的照顧和溫暖的擁抱表明了她有多愛他們。","word":"affection"}},"affectionate":{"createdAt":1783133907025,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"affectionate是形容詞，表示充滿愛的、關愛的，通常用來形容那些表達愛和溫暖的人或行為。","options":["strict","affectionate","distant","indifferent"],"sentence":"My grandmother is very ______ with her grandchildren, always hugging and kissing them. She shows her love and warmth through physical gestures and tender words every time they visit.","translation":"我的祖母對她的孫子孫女們非常摯愛，總是擁抱和親吻他們。每次他們拜訪時，她都通過身體接觸和溫柔的言語來表達她的愛和溫暖。","word":"affectionate"}},"affiliate":{"createdAt":1781360906192,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"affiliate 意思是附屬機構或分支機構，指與更大組織相關聯的較小業務單位。","options":["competitor","affiliate","subsidiary","partner"],"sentence":"The small bookstore is an ______ of the larger national chain. It operates under the same brand name and follows the company's policies.","translation":"這家小書店是更大的全國連鎖店的分支機構。它在相同的品牌名稱下運營並遵循公司的政策。","word":"affiliate"}},"affirm":{"createdAt":1781746685502,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"affirm指的是證實、斷言、肯定某事為真，表示以有力的方式確認某個事實或觀點。","options":["affirm","cooperate","entertain","terminate"],"sentence":"The witness came to court to ______ the defendant's guilt. His testimony provided clear evidence that matched the facts presented by the prosecution.","translation":"證人來法庭證實被告的有罪。他的證詞提供了與檢察機關提出的事實相符的明確證據。","word":"affirm"}},"afford":{"createdAt":1783260254099,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"afford 表示有足夠的金錢或資源來支付或承擔某件事情的成本。","options":["attempt","afford","agree","accept"],"sentence":"My family cannot ______ to buy a luxury car right now because our savings are limited. We will need to save money for several more years before we can make such an expensive purchase.","translation":"我的家庭現在負擔不起購買豪華車，因為我們的儲蓄有限。我們需要再存幾年才能進行這麼昂貴的購買。","word":"afford"}},"affordable":{"createdAt":1783159252224,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"affordable 表示「負擔得起的」或「價格合理的」，用來形容商品或服務的價格在普通人的經濟承受能力範圍內。","options":["expensive","luxurious","affordable","premium"],"sentence":"The new housing development offers homes at ______ prices that most families in the area can purchase. Without the financial aid program, these properties would be out of reach for average workers.","translation":"這個新住宅開發提供該地區大多數家庭能夠購買的負擔得起的價格房屋。沒有財務援助計畫，這些房產對普通工人來說將無法承受。","word":"affordable"}},"afterwards":{"createdAt":1783145934993,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"afterwards 是副詞，表示「之後」或「後來」，用來描述某事件發生後隨之而來的時間順序。","options":["before","afterwards","during","meanwhile"],"sentence":"We finished dinner at 7 PM, and ______ we went for a walk in the park. By that time it was already dark outside.","translation":"我們在下午七點吃完晚餐，之後我們在公園裡散步。到那時天色已經黑了。","word":"afterwards"}},"agency":{"createdAt":1781429945501,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"agency 表示代理機構或仲介，特別是指幫助人們尋找服務或工作的組織。","options":["rival","agency","competition","restaurant"],"sentence":"My sister found her dream job through an employment ______ that specializes in matching candidates with companies. The recruiter spent weeks reviewing her skills before connecting her with the perfect position.","translation":"我的姐姐通過一家專門將求職者與公司配對的人力資源代理機構找到了她夢想中的工作。招聘人員花了數周時間審查她的技能，然後將她與完美的職位聯繫在一起。","word":"agency"}},"agenda":{"createdAt":1781437013478,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"agenda 指會議的議事日程，是會議中將要討論的各項事項的清單。","options":["budget","agenda","resolution","minutes"],"sentence":"The chairman reviewed the ______ before the board meeting to ensure all important topics would be discussed. The list included quarterly financial reports, new product launches, and strategic planning items.","translation":"主席在董事會會議前審查了議程，以確保所有重要議題都將被討論。該清單包括季度財務報告、新產品發布和戰略規劃項目。","word":"agenda"}},"agent":{"createdAt":1781360906189,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"agent 意思是代理人或經紀人，指代表他人進行交易或談判的人。","options":["architect","agent","tenant","inspector"],"sentence":"The real estate ______ showed us several houses in the neighborhood. She had years of experience helping buyers find their perfect homes.","translation":"房地產經紀人向我們展示了附近的幾所房屋。她有多年幫助買家找到完美家園的經驗。","word":"agent"}},"aggression":{"createdAt":1781360885489,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"aggression指主動的敵對行為或攻擊，通常帶有暴力或對抗的意圖。","options":["cooperation","aggression","friendship","alliance"],"sentence":"The country's ______ toward its neighbor led to military conflict. Troops were sent across the border without warning or declaration of war.","translation":"該國對鄰國的侵略導致了軍事衝突。部隊未經警告或宣戰就被派過邊境。","word":"aggression"}},"aggressive":{"createdAt":1781613113024,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"aggressive 形容好鬥、積極進攻或充滿攻擊性的","options":["passive","defensive","aggressive","cautious"],"sentence":"The team's ______ playing style intimidated their opponents from the start. They attacked relentlessly and never backed down.","translation":"球隊從一開始就採取了好鬥的比賽風格嚇唬對手。他們無情地進攻，從不退縮。","word":"aggressive"}},"aggressively":{"createdAt":1783652404152,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"aggressively 是副詞，表示以強硬、有侵略性或主動積極的方式去做某事，通常帶有決心和力量。","options":["cautiously","passively","aggressively","reluctantly"],"sentence":"The company ______ pursued new market opportunities to expand its business empire. Its management team was willing to take bold risks and engage in intense competition to achieve rapid growth.","translation":"該公司積極主動地追求新的市場機會以擴展其商業帝國。其管理團隊願意冒大膽的風險並參與激烈競爭以實現快速增長。","word":"aggressively"}},"agile":{"createdAt":1785487324255,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"agile意指身體或思維敏捷靈活，能夠迅速做出反應或移動。","options":["rigid","clumsy","agile","tired"],"sentence":"The ______ dancer leaped across the stage with incredible speed and precision. Her movements were so quick and nimble that the audience could barely follow her footsteps.","translation":"敏捷的舞者以難以置信的速度和精準度在舞台上跳躍。她的動作非常迅速而靈活，觀眾幾乎無法跟上她的腳步。","word":"agile"}},"agitated":{"createdAt":1782401868810,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"agitated 表示焦躁不安、激動的狀態。","options":["calm","agitated","confident","relaxed"],"sentence":"The nervous student felt ______ during the final exam, unable to focus on the questions. His hands trembled as he tried to write his answers.","translation":"這個緊張的學生在期末考試中感到激動不安，無法專注於問題。當他試圖寫下答案時，他的雙手顫抖。","word":"agitated"}},"agony":{"createdAt":1782982841047,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"agony 意為極度痛苦，指身體上或精神上的極端折磨和痛苦。","options":["joy","agony","confusion","excitement"],"sentence":"The athlete was in ______ after breaking her leg during the championship match. The intense physical pain combined with the disappointment of missing the rest of the season made her suffering unbearable.","translation":"這位運動員在錦標賽中腿骨折後陷入極度痛苦。劇烈的身體疼痛加上錯過賽季其餘比賽的失望使她的痛苦難以忍受。","word":"agony"}},"agreeable":{"createdAt":1781336858148,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"agreeable 形容某事令人愉悅、宜人或令人滿意，通常指天氣、情況或他人的舉止。","options":["terrible","harsh","agreeable","stormy"],"sentence":"The weather was ______ and perfect for the outdoor wedding ceremony. Everyone enjoyed the mild temperature and clear blue sky throughout the entire event.","translation":"天氣令人愉悅且完美適合戶外婚禮儀式。在整個活動中，每個人都享受了溫和的溫度和晴朗的藍天。","word":"agreeable"}},"agreement":{"createdAt":1781360906196,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"agreement 意思是同意或協議，表示兩個或更多當事人對某事達成共識。","options":["disagreement","agreement","conflict","dispute"],"sentence":"After hours of negotiation, both parties reached an ______ on the contract terms. They signed the document, confirming their mutual consent.","translation":"經過數小時的談判後，雙方在合同條款上達成了一致。他們簽署了文件，確認了相互同意。","word":"agreement"}},"agricultural":{"createdAt":1783841833210,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"agricultural 是形容詞，意為「農業的」，用來描述與農業相關的事物、產業或活動。","options":["industrial","agricultural","commercial","technological"],"sentence":"The ______ sector is crucial to the country's economy and food security. Farmers in this industry use modern machinery and techniques to grow crops and raise livestock.","translation":"農業部門對國家的經濟和糧食安全至關重要。該產業的農民使用現代機械和技術來種植農作物和飼養牲畜。","word":"agricultural"}},"agriculture":{"createdAt":1781360885496,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"agriculture是指農業及相關的耕作和種植活動，是許多國家的主要經濟產業。","options":["manufacturing","agriculture","technology","tourism"],"sentence":"The country's economy heavily depends on ______ as most of the population works in farming. They grow crops like rice, wheat, and corn for both domestic use and export.","translation":"該國經濟主要依靠農業，因為大部分人口從事農業工作。他們種植水稻、小麥和玉米供國內使用和出口。","word":"agriculture"}},"aground":{"createdAt":1781478568767,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"aground 表示船隻被困在淺灘或岩石上，無法航行。","options":["smoothly","aground","safely","swiftly"],"sentence":"The cargo ship ran ______ on the shallow rocks near the coastline. It took several days for rescue vessels to refloat it.","translation":"貨輪在海岸附近的淺灘岩石上擱淺。花了幾天時間才讓救援船隻將其重新浮起。","word":"aground"}},"aim":{"createdAt":1781531595652,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"aim 作動詞表示瞄準、對準某目標，特別是在射擊時的準備動作。","options":["guess","aim","shoot","throw"],"sentence":"The archer carefully raised his bow to ______ at the distant target. After taking a deep breath, he released the arrow with perfect precision and hit the bullseye.","translation":"弓箭手小心地抬起弓對準遠處的靶子。深吸一口氣後，他以完美的精準度放出箭，擊中了靶心。","word":"aim"}},"air_conditioned":{"createdAt":1781360906192,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"air-conditioned 意思是安裝了空調設備的，指通過人工製冷系統控制室內溫度。","options":["heated","air-conditioned","ventilated","decorated"],"sentence":"The office building is fully ______, making it comfortable during hot summers. Employees can work in a cool environment regardless of the weather outside.","translation":"辦公樓配有完整的空調設備，在炎熱的夏天使其舒適。無論外面天氣如何，員工都可以在涼爽的環境中工作。","word":"air-conditioned"}},"airbus":{"createdAt":1784773941954,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"airbus 是指大型民用客運飛機，特別是能容納數百名乘客的寬體飛機。","options":["bicycle","airbus","submarine","train"],"sentence":"The ______ carried over 400 passengers on its transatlantic flight to London. Its massive fuselage and four engines made it one of the largest commercial aircraft ever built.","translation":"這架大型客運飛機在飛往倫敦的跨大西洋航班上搭載了400多名乘客。它巨大的機身和四個引擎使其成為有史以來最大的商用飛機之一。","word":"airbus"}},"aircraft":{"createdAt":1781360885498,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"aircraft是指所有能夠飛行的運輸工具，包括飛機、直升機等，用於運輸人員和貨物。","options":["boat","aircraft","train","car"],"sentence":"The ______ took off from the runway at exactly 8 AM and headed toward its destination. Hundreds of passengers were on board the commercial flight.","translation":"飛機在上午8點整從跑道起飛，前往目的地。商業航班上有數百名乘客。","word":"aircraft"}},"airline":{"createdAt":1783312791646,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"airline是名詞，指的是提供航空運輸服務、經營飛行路線的商業公司。","options":["airline","hotel","restaurant","railway"],"sentence":"She booked her international flight with a major ______ that offers excellent customer service. The company operates hundreds of routes across six continents.","translation":"她用一家提供優質客服的主要航空公司預訂了國際航班。該公司在六個大陸經營數百條航線。","word":"airline"}},"airway":{"createdAt":1782084127072,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"airway 是一個醫學術語，指的是呼吸系統中允許空氣進入肺部的通道。","options":["heartbeat","airway","stomach","nerve"],"sentence":"The patient's ______ was blocked, making it difficult for him to breathe properly. The doctor immediately inserted a tube to restore normal oxygen flow to his lungs.","translation":"患者的氣道被堵塞，導致他呼吸困難。醫生立即插入一根管子以恢復肺部的正常氧氣流動。","word":"airway"}},"aisle":{"createdAt":1781837419090,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Aisle指的是飛機、電影院或教堂等場所中座位之間的走道。","options":["cabin","aisle","cockpit","wing"],"sentence":"The flight attendant walked down the ______ of the airplane to distribute beverages and snacks. Passengers could easily access this narrow pathway between the rows of seats.","translation":"空服員沿著飛機的走道走動，分發飲料和零食。乘客可以輕鬆進入這條座位行之間的狹窄通路。","word":"aisle"}},"alarm":{"createdAt":1782981571688,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"alarm 作為名詞表示「警報、警報裝置」，指能夠發出警告聲音的安全設備或系統。","options":["door","alarm","window","light"],"sentence":"The fire ______ went off loudly at 3 AM, waking everyone in the building. The security team quickly checked the building and found no actual fire.","translation":"火警警報在上午 3 點大聲響起，喚醒了整棟樓的每個人。保安團隊迅速檢查了建築物，發現沒有實際火災。","word":"alarm"}},"alcohol":{"createdAt":1781581336189,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"alcohol指的是酒精飲料中的成分，會對身體健康造成影響。","options":["beverage","alcohol","medicine","liquid"],"sentence":"The doctor warned that consuming too much ______ can damage your liver. He specifically mentioned beer, wine, and spirits as common examples.","translation":"醫生警告說過量飲用酒精會傷害你的肝臟。他特別提到啤酒、葡萄酒和烈酒是常見的例子。","word":"alcohol"}},"alcoholic":{"createdAt":1781613113029,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"alcoholic 形容含酒精的或與酒精相關的","options":["soft","carbonated","alcoholic","herbal"],"sentence":"The ______ beverages were kept in a separate section of the store away from children. The drinks contained significant amounts of ethanol.","translation":"含酒精飲料被放在商店的一個單獨區域，遠離兒童。這些飲料含有大量的乙醇。","word":"alcoholic"}},"alert":{"createdAt":1781395428238,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"alert 作為動詞表示提醒或警告某人注意潛在的危險或重要信息。","options":["ignore","alert","confuse","discourage"],"sentence":"The security system will ______ the guards immediately if any suspicious activity is detected. They must stay vigilant and ready to respond within seconds.","translation":"如果偵測到任何可疑活動，安全系統將立即警告警衛。他們必須保持警覺，準備在幾秒內做出反應。","word":"alert"}},"alien":{"createdAt":1781581336196,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"alien作為名詞指來自外國的人或外國人。","options":["resident","alien","citizen","worker"],"sentence":"The customs officer questioned the ______ about his reason for entering the country. His unusual accent and unfamiliar documents required additional verification.","translation":"海關官員詢問了這名外僑進入該國的原因。他不尋常的口音和陌生的文件需要額外驗證。","word":"alien"}},"alienate":{"createdAt":1781395428240,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"alienate 表示使某人感到被孤立、不被接納或與他人產生距離和敵對感。","options":["attract","alienate","motivate","reward"],"sentence":"The company's unpopular decision to raise prices will likely ______ many loyal customers. Those long-time supporters now feel unvalued and may switch to competitors.","translation":"公司提高價格的不受歡迎決定可能會使許多忠實客戶疏遠。那些長期支持者現在感到被低估，可能會轉向競爭對手。","word":"alienate"}},"alienated":{"createdAt":1781360885486,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"alienated表示被隔絕或與他人產生隔閡，導致關係破裂或感到被排斥。","options":["connected","alienated","devoted","attached"],"sentence":"After the argument, John felt ______ from his best friend. They didn't speak for months and grew distant from each other.","translation":"爭執後，約翰感到與他最好的朋友疏遠了。他們好幾個月沒有說話，彼此漸漸變得陌生。","word":"alienated"}},"aliens":{"createdAt":1782006620281,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"aliens指的是外星人，特別是來自太空的生物，與第二句中「extraterrestrial invaders from outer space」（來自外太空的地外入侵者）相符。","options":["robots","aliens","soldiers","scientists"],"sentence":"In the science fiction movie, ______ from distant galaxies invaded Earth with advanced technology. The characters in the film had to work together to fight against these extraterrestrial invaders from outer space.","translation":"在這部科幻電影中，來自遠方星系的外星人以先進技術入侵地球。電影中的角色必須團結起來對抗這些來自外太空的地外入侵者。","word":"aliens"}},"align":{"createdAt":1781672973743,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"align是動詞，表示「使成一條直線；對準；校直」，指將事物排列成一直線或正確位置。","options":["damage","align","separate","bend"],"sentence":"The engineer carefully used a laser to ______ the two metal beams perfectly. Even a millimeter of misalignment could compromise the structural integrity of the entire building.","translation":"工程師小心地使用激光器完美地對齊兩根金屬梁。即使只是毫米級的偏差也可能危及整棟建築的結構完整性。","word":"align"}},"alike":{"createdAt":1782467634135,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"alike 表示兩個或多個人或事物具有相似或相同的特質。","options":["tick","alike","attack","attach"],"sentence":"The two sisters look very ______ to each other. Strangers often mistake them for the same person because they share identical facial features.","translation":"這兩個姐妹看起來彼此非常相似。陌生人經常把她們誤認為同一個人，因為她們有相同的面部特徵。","word":"alike"}},"alive":{"createdAt":1782610887957,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"alive是指活著的或在世的，表示生命狀態是活的而不是死亡的。","options":["missing","alive","located","found"],"sentence":"The explorer was relieved to find the missing hiker still ______ after three days in the wilderness. The rescue team immediately provided medical assistance to the survivor.","translation":"探險家在野外三天後發現失蹤的登山者仍然活著，感到欣慰。救援隊立即為倖存者提供了醫療援助。","word":"alive"}},"allegation":{"createdAt":1785339147830,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"allegation指未經證實的聲稱或指控，通常涉及不當或非法的行為。","options":["interview","allegation","report","statement"],"sentence":"The newspaper printed an ______ that the politician had accepted bribes from foreign investors. The official strongly denied the claim and threatened to sue for defamation.","translation":"報紙刊登了一項指控，聲稱這位政治人物接受了外國投資者的賄賂。該官員堅決否認了這一聲稱並威脅要起訴誹謗罪。","word":"allegation"}},"allege":{"createdAt":1781425093248,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"allege 表示未經證實地聲稱或指控某事，強調這些說法還未被證明為事實。","options":["prove","allege","demonstrate","verify"],"sentence":"The witness decided to ______ that the defendant had stolen the valuable painting. However, without any concrete evidence or documentation, the court could not confirm whether this claim was actually true.","translation":"證人決定聲稱被告偷了那幅名畫。然而，沒有任何具體證據或文件，法庭無法確認這項指控是否真實。","word":"allege"}},"allergic":{"createdAt":1781824968058,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"allergic 表示對某種物質有過敏反應，通常會導致身體不適或不良症狀。","options":["addicted","allergic","attracted","accustomed"],"sentence":"My brother is ______ to peanuts and must carry an EpiPen everywhere. He breaks out in hives whenever he accidentally consumes any peanut product.","translation":"我的哥哥對花生過敏，必須隨身攜帶腎上腺素自動注射器。每當他不小心吃到任何花生製品時，他就會起蕁麻疹。","word":"allergic"}},"allergy":{"createdAt":1781672973744,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"allergy是名詞，表示「過敏反應；過敏性」，指身體對某些物質的異常免疫反應。","options":["preference","allergy","talent","skill"],"sentence":"He developed a severe ______ to peanuts after a childhood accident involving anaphylactic shock. Now he must carry an EpiPen at all times and avoid all peanut products.","translation":"在童年時期發生過敏性休克事故後，他對花生產生了嚴重的過敏反應。現在他必須隨時攜帶腎上腺素自動注射器，並避免所有花生製品。","word":"allergy"}},"alley":{"createdAt":1781775363748,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"alley 是指小街或小巷，通常是指城市中狹窄的通道或胡同。","options":["hallway","highway","alley","avenue"],"sentence":"The detectives chased the suspect through a narrow ______ behind the old buildings. The passage was only wide enough for one person to walk through at a time.","translation":"偵探們在舊建築物後面的狹窄______追捕嫌疑人。這條通道寬度只能容納一個人同時通過。","word":"alley"}},"alliance":{"createdAt":1781256547735,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Alliance表示兩個或多個國家、組織或人之間的聯盟或合作關係，通常是為了達成共同目標。","options":["competition","alliance","dispute","separation"],"sentence":"The two countries formed a strong ______ to face their common enemies. This partnership allowed them to combine their military forces and resources.","translation":"兩個國家形成了一個強大的聯盟來面對他們的共同敵人。這種夥伴關係使他們能夠合併他們的軍事力量和資源。","word":"alliance"}},"allocate":{"createdAt":1781581336206,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"allocate指的是分配或撥出特定的資源、資金或物品。","options":["investigate","allocate","calculate","regulate"],"sentence":"The government decided to ______ additional funds to improve public transportation in rural areas. This budget increase was announced as part of their new development initiative.","translation":"政府決定撥出額外資金以改善農村地區的公共交通。這個預算增加是他們新發展計劃的一部分公開宣布的。","word":"allocate"}},"allow":{"createdAt":1781672973743,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"allow是動詞，表示「允許；聽任」，指給予他人做某事的許可或機會。","options":["forbid","allow","prevent","restrict"],"sentence":"The manager decided to ______ employees to work from home two days a week. This new policy was implemented to improve their work-life balance and productivity.","translation":"經理決定允許員工每週有兩天在家工作。這項新政策的實施是為了改善他們的工作生活平衡和生產力。","word":"allow"}},"allowance":{"createdAt":1783332861018,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「allowance」名詞表示「零用錢」，指定期給予某人可自由支配的金額。","options":["punishment","allowance","homework","chore"],"sentence":"Parents give their children a weekly ______ to teach them about money management. The kids can spend or save this amount as they choose.","translation":"父母給孩子每週的零用錢來教他們如何管理金錢。孩子可以按照他們的選擇花費或存儲這筆金額。","word":"allowance"}},"ally":{"createdAt":1781360885494,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ally指在戰爭、政治或商業中與自己站在同一邊的國家或人，提供支持與合作。","options":["enemy","ally","rival","competitor"],"sentence":"During the war, France was Britain's most important ______ in the fight against the enemy. The two nations worked together and supported each other militarily.","translation":"戰爭期間，法國是英國在對抗敵人中最重要的盟友。兩個國家一起工作並在軍事上相互支持。","word":"ally"}},"almond":{"createdAt":1781531595649,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"almond 是一種扁桃樹的果實，具有獨特的堅果風味，常用於烘焙和甜點。","options":["walnut","almond","peanut","cashew"],"sentence":"She added crushed ______ to the dessert for a nutty flavor. The recipe specifically called for this tree nut that grows in warm Mediterranean climates.","translation":"她在甜點中加入了碎杏仁以增添堅果風味。食譜特別要求這種在溫暖的地中海氣候中生長的樹堅果。","word":"almond"}},"altar":{"createdAt":1781484539654,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"altar 是指教堂中的祭壇或聖壇，用於宗教儀式和崇拜活動，特別是婚禮和彌撒。","options":["altar","carpet","podium","stage"],"sentence":"The priest placed flowers on the ______ during the wedding ceremony. The bride and groom stood before this sacred platform to exchange their vows.","translation":"在婚禮中，神父把花放在聖壇上。新郎新娘站在這個神聖的平台前交換誓言。","word":"altar"}},"alter":{"createdAt":1781693304924,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"alter 表示對某物進行改變或調整，通常涉及修改細節而非完全重新製作。","options":["design","alter","create","ruin"],"sentence":"The tailor needed to ______ the wedding dress to fit the bride's measurements perfectly. She carefully adjusted the seams and hemline without changing the overall design.","translation":"裁縫師需要修改婚禮服裝以完美貼合新娘的尺寸。她仔細調整了接縫和褶邊，但沒有改變整體設計。","word":"alter"}},"alternate":{"createdAt":1781311922066,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"alternate 表示兩個或多個事物輪流出現或交替進行。","options":["compete","alternate","rest","sprint"],"sentence":"In the relay race, runners must ______ positions every 400 meters to give each teammate a turn. The coach organized the schedule so that person A runs, then person B, then person A again.","translation":"在接力賽中，跑步者必須每400公尺交替位置以讓每個隊友輪流參賽。教練安排時間表使得甲先跑，然後乙跑，接著甲再跑。","word":"alternate"}},"alternation":{"createdAt":1783652404139,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"alternation 指的是兩件事物有規律地輪流出現或交替發生的狀態，特別強調有秩序的週期性轉換。","options":["variation","alternation","duration","rotation"],"sentence":"The ______ between day and night creates our natural sleep-wake cycle. This regular switching between two states happens every twelve hours without fail.","translation":"晝夜之間的交替創造了我們的自然睡眠-清醒週期。這種兩種狀態之間的規律性轉換每十二小時就會發生一次，從不間斷。","word":"alternation"}},"alternative":{"createdAt":1781651775059,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"alternative 表示用來取代或代替原有事物的方案或選擇。","options":["frustration","alternative","discussion","childhood"],"sentence":"When the original plan fell through, we needed to find an ______ solution. Since we had no other options left, this new approach became our only choice.","translation":"當原計畫破裂時，我們需要找到一個替代方案。由於我們已經沒有其他選擇，這個新方法成為了我們唯一的出路。","word":"alternative"}},"alternatively":{"createdAt":1782953855196,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"alternatively 用來提供另一種選擇或不同的方式，表示其他可行的選項","options":["additionally","alternatively","ultimately","suddenly"],"sentence":"If you don't want to drive to the airport, you can take a taxi; ______, you could use public transportation like the bus or train. Both options will get you there on time for your flight.","translation":"如果你不想開車去機場，你可以乘坐計程車；要不，你可以使用公共交通工具，如公車或火車。兩種選擇都能讓你準時趕上飛機。","word":"alternatively"}},"altitude":{"createdAt":1781360906189,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"altitude 意思是高度或海拔，指物體或地點相對於海平面的垂直距離。","options":["speed","altitude","direction","distance"],"sentence":"As the airplane climbed higher, the ______ increased and the outside temperature dropped. The pilot reported they had reached 35,000 feet.","translation":"當飛機攀升得更高時，高度增加了，外部溫度下降了。飛行員報告他們已經達到了35,000英尺。","word":"altitude"}},"aluminium":{"createdAt":1781360906184,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"aluminium 是輕金屬，具有良好的可回收性，廣泛應用於工業。","options":["Iron","Aluminium","Gold","Copper"],"sentence":"This lightweight metal can be recycled many times. ______ is commonly used in beverage cans and aircraft parts.","translation":"這種輕金屬可以多次回收。鋁通常用於飲料罐和飛機零件。","word":"aluminium"}},"amateur":{"createdAt":1781837419092,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Amateur指的是出於愛好而進行某項活動的人，而不是職業人士。","options":["professional","amateur","seasoned","expert"],"sentence":"Though he was just an ______ musician, his talent was undeniable and impressive. He had never received formal training or studied music professionally.","translation":"雖然他只是業餘音樂家，但他的天賦是無可否認和令人印象深刻的。他從未接受過正式培訓或專業學習音樂。","word":"amateur"}},"ambassador":{"createdAt":1781360906185,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ambassador 意思是大使或使節，是由政府派遣的官方代表。","options":["journalist","ambassador","tourist","athlete"],"sentence":"The ______ represented her country at the international conference. She had been appointed by the government to serve as their official delegate.","translation":"大使在國際會議上代表她的國家。她被政府任命為官方代表。","word":"ambassador"}},"ambiguity":{"createdAt":1781672973735,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ambiguity是名詞，表示「模稜兩可；意義含糊」，指某事物可能有多種解釋或不清楚的情況。","options":["clarity","ambiguity","precision","specificity"],"sentence":"The ______ in the contract's wording led to a serious dispute between the two companies. Both parties interpreted the terms completely differently because of the unclear language.","translation":"合同措辭中的模稜兩可導致了兩家公司之間的嚴重紛爭。由於語言不清楚，雙方對條款的解釋完全不同。","word":"ambiguity"}},"ambiguous":{"createdAt":1781360885495,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ambiguous指表達不清楚或可能有多種解釋的，容易造成誤解。","options":["clear","ambiguous","detailed","explicit"],"sentence":"The instructions were ______ and left many team members confused about what they should do. Several different interpretations of the requirements were possible.","translation":"這些指示模糊不清，讓許多團隊成員困惑於他們應該做什麼。對要求有幾種不同的解釋是可能的。","word":"ambiguous"}},"ambition":{"createdAt":1784107370102,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ambition 指的是強烈的抱負或志向，即想要達成某個重要目標的決心和渴望。","options":["curiosity","ambition","talent","confidence"],"sentence":"She has always had a strong ______ to become a successful entrepreneur. Her drive to build her own company and create jobs for others shows that she is willing to work hard every day to achieve this goal.","translation":"她一直有著成為成功企業家的強烈抱負。她想要創辦自己的公司並為他人創造就業機會的動力，說明她願意每天努力工作來實現這個目標。","word":"ambition"}},"ambitious":{"createdAt":1781360885486,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ambitious指擁有強烈的慾望和決心去達成偉大或困難的目標。","options":["lazy","ambitious","modest","indifferent"],"sentence":"She is an ______ young entrepreneur who wants to build a global business empire. By age thirty, she aims to expand her company to fifty countries.","translation":"她是一位有雄心的年輕企業家，想要建立一個全球商業帝國。到三十歲時，她的目標是將公司擴展到五十個國家。","word":"ambitious"}},"amend":{"createdAt":1781747309099,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"amend 指對文件、法案或計畫進行正式的修改或改進，使其變得更好或更完善。","options":["reject","amend","publish","review"],"sentence":"The committee decided to ______ the original proposal to include better environmental protections. The revised version was significantly different from what was initially submitted.","translation":"委員會決定修訂原始提案以納入更好的環境保護措施。修訂版本與最初提交的版本有很大的不同。","word":"amend"}},"amid":{"createdAt":1783848010692,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"amid 表示「在...中間；被...環繞」，用來描述某人或某物被周圍的人或事物包圍的位置。","options":["before","amid","after","beyond"],"sentence":"The young couple danced ______ the cheering crowd at the wedding reception. The guests formed a circle around them, clapping and celebrating their union.","translation":"年輕的夫婦在婚禮招待會上在歡呼的人群中跳舞。客人們在他們周圍形成一個圓圈，拍手慶祝他們的結合。","word":"amid"}},"ample":{"createdAt":1781581336208,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ample表示充足的、足夠多的數量。","options":["meager","ample","limited","scarce"],"sentence":"The host prepared ______ food for the party, ensuring no guest would leave hungry. There were multiple courses and abundant servings of every dish.","translation":"主人為派對準備了充足的食物，確保沒有客人會挨餓。有多道菜肴和每道菜的充足份量。","word":"ample"}},"amplify":{"createdAt":1781581336201,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"amplify指的是使聲音或信號變得更大或更強。","options":["translate","amplify","record","repeat"],"sentence":"The speaker used a microphone to ______ his voice so everyone in the large hall could hear clearly. Without this device, the audience in the back would have missed his important message.","translation":"演講者使用麥克風來放大他的聲音，使大廳裡的每個人都能清楚地聽到。沒有這個裝置，後面的觀眾會錯過他的重要信息。","word":"amplify"}},"amylase":{"createdAt":1783243389244,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"澱粉酶是一種特定的消化酶，專門用來分解澱粉，在唾液和胰液中都能找到。","options":["protein","amylase","hormone","lipase"],"sentence":"The enzyme ______ is found in saliva and breaks down starch into simpler sugars. This digestive protein begins the breakdown of carbohydrates the moment food enters your mouth.","translation":"酶澱粉酶存在於唾液中，將澱粉分解成更簡單的糖類。這種消化蛋白在食物進入口腔時就開始分解碳水化合物。","word":"amylase"}},"analogy":{"createdAt":1781360885487,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"analogy是通過比較兩個不同事物之間的相似之處來解釋或理解某個概念的方法。","options":["definition","analogy","fact","summary"],"sentence":"The teacher used an ______ to help students understand the concept. She compared the heart to a pump that moves water through pipes, just as it moves blood through the body.","translation":"老師用類比幫助學生理解這個概念。她將心臟比作一個通過管道泵送水的泵，就像它通過身體泵送血液一樣。","word":"analogy"}},"analysis":{"createdAt":1782660040405,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"analysis 表示對事物的詳細檢查或分解，用來理解其性質或結構。","options":["summary","analysis","observation","hypothesis"],"sentence":"The scientist conducted a detailed ______ of the chemical samples to identify their components. By breaking down each element and examining the results, she was able to determine the exact composition.","translation":"科學家對化學樣品進行了詳細的分析，以確定其成分。通過分解每種元素並檢查結果，她能夠確定確切的組成。","word":"analysis"}},"analyst":{"createdAt":1782101579246,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"analyst 指專門分析和解釋資料、資訊或情況的專業人士，通常在財務、業務或研究領域工作。","options":["teacher","analyst","gardener","musician"],"sentence":"The ______ examined the company's financial data to identify trends and potential risks. Her detailed report revealed that profits had declined by 15% over the past quarter.","translation":"分析家檢查了該公司的財務數據，以確定趨勢和潛在風險。她的詳細報告顯示利潤在過去一季下降了15%。","word":"analyst"}},"analytical":{"createdAt":1781360885494,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"analytical指擅長分析和檢查信息，通過邏輯思維來解決問題的能力。","options":["emotional","analytical","impulsive","careless"],"sentence":"As an ______ person, she carefully examines all the data before making a decision. She breaks down complex problems into smaller parts to understand them better.","translation":"作為一個善於分析的人，她在做決定前仔細檢查所有數據。她將複雜的問題分解成更小的部分以更好地理解它們。","word":"analytical"}},"analyze":{"createdAt":1783323014707,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"analyze意思是分析或檢查，指的是對信息進行詳細的審視和研究，以理解其結構和意義。","options":["ignore","analyze","summarize","organize"],"sentence":"The scientist decided to ______ the experimental data carefully. She examined each variable and its relationship to the results in detail.","translation":"科學家決定仔細地分析實驗數據。她詳細檢查了每個變數及其與結果的關係。","word":"analyze"}},"ancestor":{"createdAt":1781360885485,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"祖先指的是過去的世代成員，通常是指父母、祖父母或更早之前的家族成員。","options":["descendant","ancestor","relative","contemporary"],"sentence":"My ______ came to this country over 200 years ago. He was my great-great-grandfather who settled here during the colonial period.","translation":"我的祖先在200多年前來到這個國家。他是我在殖民地時期定居在這裡的曾曾祖父。","word":"ancestor"}},"anchor":{"createdAt":1781581336193,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"anchor作為名詞指用來固定船隻的重金屬裝置。","options":["sail","anchor","rudder","rope"],"sentence":"The ship dropped its ______ to prevent drifting in the strong current. The heavy metal device held the vessel firmly in place throughout the night.","translation":"船隻放下錨以防止在強流中漂流。這個沉重的金屬裝置整晚都將船牢牢地固定在原地。","word":"anchor"}},"ancient":{"createdAt":1781564440922,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ancient 作形容詞表示古代的、古老的，指很久以前的時代或事物。","options":["modern","ancient","contemporary","recent"],"sentence":"The museum displays many artifacts from ______ Egypt. These objects were created thousands of years ago during the time of the pharaohs.","translation":"博物館展示了許多來自古代埃及的文物。這些物品是在法老時代數千年前製造的。","word":"ancient"}},"anger":{"createdAt":1784899764064,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"anger是一種強烈的情感，表示對某事感到很生氣、不滿或暴怒的狀態。","options":["sadness","anger","confusion","surprise"],"sentence":"His ______ grew when he discovered that his car had been stolen. He slammed his fist on the table in frustration and rage.","translation":"當他發現他的車被偷了時，他的憤怒增加了。他沮喪和憤怒地猛擊桌子。","word":"anger"}},"angle":{"createdAt":1782980445620,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"angle 在此句中表示「角度、立場、觀點」，指看待或考慮某個問題的特定方式。","options":["speed","height","angle","color"],"sentence":"From my ______, the government should focus more on healthcare reform. However, others may view this issue differently.","translation":"從我的立場來看，政府應該更加關注醫療改革。然而，其他人可能對這個問題有不同的看法。","word":"angle"}},"anguish":{"createdAt":1787554448283,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"anguish 指極度的心理或身體痛苦，通常伴隨著強烈的悲傷、絕望或折磨。","options":["boredom","excitement","anguish","confusion"],"sentence":"The mother experienced profound ______ when she learned that her son had gone missing. Her tears and desperate pleas revealed the depths of her suffering and despair.","translation":"當母親得知兒子失蹤時，她經歷了深深的痛苦。她的眼淚和絕望的哀求揭示了她痛苦和絕望的深度。","word":"anguish"}},"animate":{"createdAt":1781527602362,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"animate 作為動詞表示使某人或某事變得生氣勃勃、充滿活力和生命力。","options":["depress","animate","freeze","tire"],"sentence":"The talented dancer's passionate performance seemed to ______ the entire audience. By the end, everyone was cheering and clapping with infectious energy.","translation":"這位天才舞者充滿熱情的表演似乎讓整個觀眾席充滿活力。最後，每個人都在歡呼和鼓掌，散發出感染力十足的能量。","word":"animate"}},"animated":{"createdAt":1781360906190,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"animated 意思是有生命的或充滿活力的，在電影中通常指用動畫技術製作的影片。","options":["documentary","animated","live-action","educational"],"sentence":"The children watched the ______ movie with excitement and laughter. The colorful characters and fun story kept them entertained for two hours.","translation":"孩子們興高采烈地觀看了這部動畫電影。彩色角色和有趣的故事使他們娛樂了兩個小時。","word":"animated"}},"anniversary":{"createdAt":1781424574160,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"anniversary 是指重要事件的週年紀念日，通常用於婚姻、公司成立等重要日期。","options":["birthday","anniversary","vacation","promotion"],"sentence":"The couple celebrated their 25th ______ with a special dinner at their favorite restaurant. This milestone marked a quarter-century of marriage and love.","translation":"這對夫婦在他們最喜歡的餐廳享用特別晚宴來慶祝他們的25週年紀念。這個里程碑標誌著他們婚姻和愛情的四分之一世紀。","word":"anniversary"}},"announce":{"createdAt":1781360906186,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"announce 意思是宣佈或公開表達，將信息傳達給大眾。","options":["conceal","announce","whisper","ignore"],"sentence":"The principal will ______ the exam results at the assembly tomorrow. Everyone will hear the official declaration during the school gathering.","translation":"校長將在明天的集會上宣佈考試結果。每個人都將在學校集會期間聽到官方聲明。","word":"announce"}},"announcement":{"createdAt":1781835517795,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"announcement 意為宣布或公開發表某項資訊，通常是向大眾或特定群體傳達重要訊息。","options":["argument","announcement","complaint","question"],"sentence":"The principal made an important ______ at the school assembly this morning. All students gathered in the hall to hear the news about the upcoming holiday schedule.","translation":"校長在今早的學校集會上做了一項重要的宣布。所有學生聚集在大廳裡聽取有關即將到來假期日程的消息。","word":"announcement"}},"annoy":{"createdAt":1782140900232,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"annoy 是指使某人感到不適或不滿，通常指一些小的、持續的煩擾。","options":["assist","annoy","comfort","entertain"],"sentence":"The constant buzzing of the mosquito began to ______ me as I tried to sleep. By the tenth minute of swatting at the air, I felt completely irritated and frustrated.","translation":"當我試圖睡覺時，蚊子不斷的嗡嗡聲開始令我感到苦惱。在揮打空氣十分鐘後，我感到完全被激怒和沮喪。","word":"annoy"}},"annoyed":{"createdAt":1783255886716,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"annoyed是指感到輕微的不快或氣惱，通常由於被打擾或惹惱而產生。","options":["delighted","annoyed","confused","excited"],"sentence":"Sarah felt ______ when her coworker interrupted her for the third time during the meeting. She took a deep breath and tried to refocus on her work instead of expressing her frustration.","translation":"當莎拉在會議中第三次被同事打斷時，她感到氣惱。她深呼吸，試著重新專注於工作，而不是表達她的沮喪。","word":"annoyed"}},"annoying":{"createdAt":1781527602360,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"annoying 用來描述令人感到不快、厭煩或困擾的人或事物。","options":["amusing","calming","annoying","helpful"],"sentence":"The constant buzzing sound of the mosquito was ______ to everyone in the room. We finally managed to kill the insect to restore peace and quiet.","translation":"蚊子持續的嗡嗡聲讓房間裡的每個人都感到惱人。我們最終設法殺死了這隻昆蟲以恢復安寧和寧靜。","word":"annoying"}},"annual":{"createdAt":1781581336207,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"annual表示每年發生一次或持續一年的事物。","options":["monthly","annual","weekly","daily"],"sentence":"The company holds an ______ conference every year to bring together employees from all departments. This year's event is scheduled for November and will include workshops and networking opportunities.","translation":"公司每年舉辦一次年度會議，匯聚來自所有部門的員工。今年的活動定於十一月舉行，將包括研討會和社交機會。","word":"annual"}},"anonymous":{"createdAt":1781564440922,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"anonymous 表示匿名的、無名的，指不願透露或沒有署名的身份。","options":["named","anonymous","public","famous"],"sentence":"The ______ donation was received by the charity without a donor's name. The organization had no way to identify or contact the generous benefactor.","translation":"慈善機構收到了一筆匿名捐款，沒有捐贈人的名字。該組織無法識別或聯繫這位慷慨的捐贈者。","word":"anonymous"}},"anthem":{"createdAt":1781841505534,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"anthem 是指國歌或團體組織的讚歌，在正式場合演奏以代表國家或群體的身份。","options":["pollution","anthem","wonder","healthcare"],"sentence":"The ______ of our nation is played at the beginning of every Olympic ceremony. Every athlete stands respectfully as the music representing their country fills the stadium.","translation":"我們國家的國歌在每場奧運會開幕式開始時演奏。每位運動員在代表他們國家的音樂響起時恭敬地站著。","word":"anthem"}},"antibiotic":{"createdAt":1781360885492,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"antibiotic是一種藥物，能夠殺死或阻止細菌的生長，用於治療細菌感染。","options":["vitamin","antibiotic","painkiller","vaccine"],"sentence":"The doctor prescribed an ______ to treat the bacterial infection. The medication killed the harmful bacteria and allowed the patient to recover.","translation":"醫生開了一種抗生素來治療細菌感染。該藥物殺死了有害細菌，使患者得以恢復。","word":"antibiotic"}},"anticipate":{"createdAt":1782651710255,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"anticipate 意為預期或期待即將發生的事件，基於現有的信息或跡象。","options":["ignore","remember","anticipate","observe"],"sentence":"The meteorologists ______ heavy snowfall in the coming days based on weather patterns and atmospheric conditions. Residents were advised to prepare supplies and stay indoors.","translation":"氣象學家根據天氣模式和大氣條件預期未來幾天會有大雪。居民被建議準備物資並留在室內。","word":"anticipate"}},"anticipation":{"createdAt":1783259812511,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"anticipation 指對未來事件的期望或預料，通常帶有興奮或樂觀的情緒。","options":["boredom","anticipation","confusion","hesitation"],"sentence":"The children waited with great ______ for their birthday party to arrive. Their excitement grew stronger each day as the event drew closer.","translation":"孩子們懷著極大的期待等待他們的生日派對到來。隨著活動日期臨近，他們的興奮感日益增強。","word":"anticipation"}},"antidisestablishmentarianism":{"createdAt":1783926514170,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"反對政教分離主義是一個政治立場，主張維護英國教會與政府的聯繫，反對將宗教機構與國家權力分開。","options":["ultraliberalism","antidisestablishmentarianism","separatism","secularism"],"sentence":"The 19th-century British political movement of ______ sought to preserve the Church of England's established status within the state. Opponents of disestablishment rallied behind this ideology to prevent the separation of church and government.","translation":"十九世紀英國的反對政教分離主義政治運動致力於維護英國聖公會在國家中的既定地位。反對政教分離的人們聚集在這一意識形態背後，以防止教會與政府的分離。","word":"antidisestablishmentarianism"}},"antifragile":{"createdAt":1784818310066,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"antifragile 是指不僅能抵抗困難，而且能從中受益並變得更強大的特性，超越單純的韌性。","options":["stable","flexible","antifragile","resilient"],"sentence":"The ______ company actually grew stronger during the economic crisis by adapting its business model. The more challenges it faced, the more resilient and innovative it became, turning adversity into advantage.","translation":"這個反脆弱的公司在經濟危機期間通過調整其商業模式而變得更強。它面臨的挑戰越多，它就變得越有韌性和創新，將逆境轉化為優勢。","word":"antifragile"}},"anxiety":{"createdAt":1781837419094,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Anxiety指的是對未來不確定性或潛在危險而感到的焦慮和擔憂。","options":["excitement","anxiety","relief","confidence"],"sentence":"Before her final exam, she felt overwhelming ______ about whether she would pass. The nervous tension kept her awake at night as the test date approached.","translation":"在期末考試前，她對是否能通過感到巨大的焦慮。當考試日期臨近時，緊張感讓她夜不能寐。","word":"anxiety"}},"anxious":{"createdAt":1781331945985,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"anxious 表示對即將發生或未知的事情感到擔心或緊張，常伴隨不安的行為。","options":["excited","bored","anxious","confused"],"sentence":"Sarah felt ______ as she waited for her exam results to be announced. She couldn't sleep the night before and kept checking her phone every few minutes.","translation":"莎拉在等待考試成績宣布時感到焦慮。她前一晚無法入睡，每隔幾分鐘就檢查一次手機。","word":"anxious"}},"anxiously":{"createdAt":1781274836864,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"anxiously是副詞，表示以焦慮、擔心或緊張的態度做某事，通常伴隨著不安的情緒。","options":["calmly","happily","anxiously","excitedly"],"sentence":"She waited ______ by the phone for news about her exam results. Her heart pounded and she couldn't sit still because she was worried about what she would learn.","translation":"她焦慮地在電話旁等待關於考試成績的消息。她的心猛烈地跳動，因為擔心結果而無法靜坐。","word":"anxiously"}},"anyhow":{"createdAt":1782824834614,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"anyhow（隨隨便便地；雜亂無章地）表示不按照特定方式、沒有計畫或順序地做某事。","options":["carefully","neatly","anyhow","systematically"],"sentence":"The instructions said to organize the files by date, but Tom just put them in the drawer ______ without following any system. His boss was frustrated because none of the documents could be found later.","translation":"說明書說要按日期整理文件，但湯姆只是無序地把它們放進抽屜裡，沒有遵循任何系統。他的老闆很沮喪，因為後來找不到任何文件。","word":"anyhow"}},"apart":{"createdAt":1781323901185,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"apart在此表示「相距」或「分開」，用來描述兩人之間的地理距離。","options":["together","close","apart","nearby"],"sentence":"The two friends live ______ and only see each other during summer vacation. They are separated by several hundred miles of distance.","translation":"這兩個朋友相距很遠，只在暑假期間見面。他們被數百英里的距離隔開。","word":"apart"}},"apologize":{"createdAt":1781360906184,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"apologize 意思是道歉，表示為自己的錯誤或冒犯表示遺憾。","options":["explain","apologize","deny","justify"],"sentence":"He had to ______ for arriving late to the meeting. His manager accepted his sincere words of regret.","translation":"他必須為遲到的會議道歉。他的經理接受了他誠摯的遺憾之詞。","word":"apologize"}},"apology":{"createdAt":1781418481461,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"apology作為名詞，指為自己的過錯或不當行為向他人表達歉意和遺憾的言詞或行為。","options":["criticism","apology","compliment","explanation"],"sentence":"He offered a sincere ______ for his hurtful words after realizing the damage he had caused. She accepted his statement and they moved forward with their relationship.","translation":"他在意識到自己造成的傷害後，為傷人的言論提出了真誠的道歉。她接受了他的表示，他們的關係向前發展。","word":"apology"}},"apparent":{"createdAt":1781360885489,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"apparent指明顯可見或容易被注意到的，不需要深入探究就能理解。","options":["hidden","apparent","uncertain","questionable"],"sentence":"It was ______ that the student had not studied for the exam. He could not answer even the most basic questions.","translation":"很明顯該學生沒有為考試準備。他甚至無法回答最基本的問題。","word":"apparent"}},"apparently":{"createdAt":1781360906187,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"apparently 意思是顯然地，表示根據表面跡象或傳聞而看起來是這樣的情況。","options":["Certainly","Apparently","Deliberately","Intentionally"],"sentence":"______, the meeting was cancelled due to the weather, though no official announcement was made. People found out from rumors and social media posts.","translation":"顯然地，會議因天氣原因被取消了，儘管沒有官方公告。人們從謠言和社交媒體帖子中了解到。","word":"apparently"}},"appeal":{"createdAt":1781362281728,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"appeal表示懇求或呼籲，也可指吸引力，在此句中表示懇求他人幫助。","options":["announcement","appeal","complaint","question"],"sentence":"The charity organization made an ______ for donations to help disaster victims. They urged the public to contribute financially to aid relief efforts.","translation":"慈善組織呼籲捐款以幫助災難受害者。他們敦促公眾貢獻資金以支持救災努力。","word":"appeal"}},"appealing":{"createdAt":1781360906187,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"appealing 意思是迷人的或吸引人的，指能引起人們興趣和好感的事物。","options":["boring","appealing","confusing","ugly"],"sentence":"The restaurant's new menu design is very ______, attracting many more customers than before. The colorful presentation of dishes caught everyone's attention.","translation":"餐廳的新菜單設計非常迷人，吸引了比以前多得多的顧客。菜肴的彩色呈現引起了每個人的注意。","word":"appealing"}},"appear":{"createdAt":1781503378956,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"appear 在這裡表示「看起來、似乎」，用來描述事物外在的樣子或印象。","options":["become","appear","turn","seem"],"sentence":"The sky began to ______ darker as the storm approached. The clouds grew thicker and the sun disappeared behind them.","translation":"當暴風雨靠近時，天空開始顯得更暗。烏雲變得更濃密，太陽在它們後面消失了。","word":"appear"}},"appearance":{"createdAt":1781581336204,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"appearance指的是某人的外貌或呈現給他人的樣子。","options":["behavior","appearance","attitude","performance"],"sentence":"Her elegant ______ at the gala impressed everyone in attendance that evening. The stunning dress and refined makeup enhanced her natural beauty.","translation":"她在晚宴上的優雅外貌給所有出席者留下了深刻印象。這套華麗的連衣裙和精緻的妝容提升了她與生俱來的美貌。","word":"appearance"}},"appetite":{"createdAt":1781595752123,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"appetite 指對食物的慾望或食慾，是名詞。","options":["thirst","appetite","energy","strength"],"sentence":"After playing sports for two hours, he had a huge ______ and ate three large plates of food. His stomach was rumbling loudly, demanding substantial nourishment.","translation":"運動兩小時後，他有巨大的食慾，吃了三大盤食物。他的肚子在咕嚕咕嚕叫，需要大量的營養補充。","word":"appetite"}},"appetizer":{"createdAt":1783326301100,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"appetizer 是開胃食物，在正餐前食用，用來刺激食慾；此詞特指主菜之前的小食物。","options":["dessert","appetizer","beverage","utensil"],"sentence":"Before the main course arrives, the restaurant serves a small ______ to stimulate the guests' hunger. This dish is designed to be light and flavorful, preparing the palate for the larger meal to follow.","translation":"在主菜到達之前，餐廳會為客人提供一小份 ______ 來刺激他們的食慾。這道菜的設計目的是清淡美味，為隨後的大餐做好準備。","word":"appetizer"}},"applaud":{"createdAt":1783323014718,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"applaud意思是鼓掌或讚賞，特別是指用雙手拍打來表示贊同和欣賞的行為。","options":["applaud","cheer","whistle","celebrate"],"sentence":"The audience began to ______ loudly when the performer finished the breathtaking solo. Their hands came together in rhythmic clapping to show their appreciation.","translation":"當表演者完成驚人的獨奏後，觀眾開始大聲鼓掌。他們的雙手有節奏地拍打在一起以表示讚賞。","word":"applaud"}},"applause":{"createdAt":1781836375368,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"applause是指觀眾鼓掌表達讚同或欣賞的掌聲。","options":["silence","applause","music","laughter"],"sentence":"After the pianist finished her stunning performance, the audience erupted in loud ______. Everyone in the concert hall stood up to honour her talent.","translation":"鋼琴家結束她驚人的表演後，觀眾爆發出響亮的掌聲。音樂廳裡的每個人都站起來向她的才華致敬。","word":"applause"}},"appliance":{"createdAt":1781581336190,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"appliance指的是用於家庭或工業用途的電器設備。","options":["utensil","appliance","furniture","decoration"],"sentence":"The new kitchen ______ she purchased can wash dishes automatically in just one hour. It has revolutionized how she manages her daily household chores.","translation":"她購買的新廚房電器只需一小時就能自動洗碗。它徹底改變了她管理日常家務的方式。","word":"appliance"}},"applicable":{"createdAt":1782265565189,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"applicable 指法律、規則或條件是有效的並且必須被遵守的，對特定情況或人群適用。","options":["irrelevant","outdated","applicable","optional"],"sentence":"The new traffic regulations are ______ to all drivers starting next month. Anyone who fails to follow these rules will face fines, regardless of their location or vehicle type.","translation":"新的交通法規從下個月開始對所有駕駛員生效。任何不遵守這些規則的人都將被罰款，無論其位置或車輛類型如何。","word":"applicable"}},"applicant":{"createdAt":1781360906186,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"applicant 意思是申請人，指申請職位或入學機會的人。","options":["employer","applicant","customer","supervisor"],"sentence":"Each ______ submitted a resume and cover letter for the job position. The human resources department reviewed all twenty candidates' materials.","translation":"每位申請人都為該工作職位提交了履歷和求職信。人力資源部審查了所有二十位候選人的材料。","word":"applicant"}},"application":{"createdAt":1781345237582,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"application作名詞表示「申請」，指為了獲得某物或進入某機構而提交的正式請求。","options":["rejection","application","certificate","acceptance"],"sentence":"She submitted her college ______ before the deadline in January. The form included her test scores, personal essay, and letters of recommendation.","translation":"她在1月的截止日期前提交了大學申請。該表格包括她的考試成績、個人文章和推薦信。","word":"application"}},"apply":{"createdAt":1782980445586,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"apply 在此句中表示「塗抹、敷用」，指將物質塗在表面上。","options":["remove","apply","wash","dry"],"sentence":"You need to ______ the sunscreen to your skin before going to the beach. Make sure to cover all exposed areas evenly.","translation":"你需要在去海灘前將防曬霜塗抹在皮膚上。確保均勻覆蓋所有暴露的區域。","word":"apply"}},"appoint":{"createdAt":1781581336202,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"appoint指的是正式任命或指派某人擔任特定職位。","options":["interview","appoint","recruit","promote"],"sentence":"The board of directors decided to ______ a new chief executive officer to lead the company. The announcement was made public during the company's annual shareholders meeting.","translation":"董事會決定任命一位新的首席執行官來領導公司。該任命在公司年度股東大會期間向公眾宣布。","word":"appoint"}},"appointment":{"createdAt":1782746247863,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"appointment 是指對某人的正式任命或指派到某個職位，通常由權威人士或機構做出。","options":["retirement","dismissal","appointment","promotion"],"sentence":"The ______ of the new director was announced during the board meeting yesterday. The company's executives voted unanimously to give her the position of leadership.","translation":"新任主任的任命在昨天的董事會會議上宣布。公司的高層一致投票給予她領導職位。","word":"appointment"}},"appraisal":{"createdAt":1787049198628,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"appraisal是對某人的工作表現或某物價值的正式評估或評價。","options":["vacation","promotion","appraisal","training"],"sentence":"During her annual ______ at work, her manager discussed her performance over the past year. The evaluation covered her strengths, weaknesses, and areas for improvement.","translation":"在她年度工作評估中，經理討論了她過去一年的表現。評估涵蓋了她的優勢、劣勢和改進空間。","word":"appraisal"}},"appreciate":{"createdAt":1782980445617,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"appreciate 在此句中表示「感激、欣賞」，指認識到某人的價值並表示感謝。","options":["ignore","criticize","appreciate","forget"],"sentence":"I truly ______ your hard work and dedication to this project. Without your effort, we would not have succeeded.","translation":"我真摯地感謝你對這個項目的辛勤工作和奉獻。沒有你的努力，我們不會成功。","word":"appreciate"}},"appreciation":{"createdAt":1783243350910,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"appreciation 意為欣賞、鑑賞力或感謝，特別是對藝術、音樂或他人努力的認可和理解。","options":["appreciation","criticism","dismissal","indifference"],"sentence":"The art teacher showed great ______ for the students' creative paintings. She spent time explaining the techniques and artistic choices in each work.","translation":"美術老師對學生們富有創意的繪畫表現出很大的欣賞。她花時間解釋每件作品中的技巧和藝術選擇。","word":"appreciation"}},"appreciative":{"createdAt":1783403425348,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"appreciative 表示對某事有欣賞力、表示感謝或讚賞的態度，通常用來形容一個人能夠認可和讚美他人的優點。","options":["critical","appreciative","indifferent","dismissive"],"sentence":"The audience was very ______ of the musician's outstanding performance. They stood up and applauded for several minutes to show their genuine gratitude and recognition.","translation":"觀眾對音樂家傑出的表演非常有欣賞力。他們站起來鼓掌好幾分鐘，以表示他們真誠的感謝和認可。","word":"appreciative"}},"apprehension":{"createdAt":1785487324262,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"apprehension是指對未來可能發生的不好事情的擔憂或恐懼。","options":["excitement","joy","apprehension","confidence"],"sentence":"Despite her years of experience, the pilot felt ______ as she prepared for the dangerous storm. Her worry about the severe weather conditions grew stronger as dark clouds approached.","translation":"儘管有多年的經驗，飛行員在為危險的暴風雨做準備時感到憂慮。當烏雲靠近時，她對惡劣天氣狀況的擔憂愈發加重。","word":"apprehension"}},"apprentice":{"createdAt":1783402916389,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"apprentice 是指在學習某種職業或技藝的人，通常在有經驗的師傅或工匠的指導下工作。","options":["manager","apprentice","customer","owner"],"sentence":"Young Marco began working as an ______ at the carpentry workshop when he was sixteen years old. He spent three years learning traditional woodworking techniques from the master craftsman.","translation":"年輕的馬可在十六歲時開始在木工工坊做學徒。他花了三年時間從師傅那裡學習傳統的木工技術。","word":"apprentice"}},"approach":{"createdAt":1781581336190,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"approach作為名詞表示處理或解決問題的方法和策略。","options":["schedule","approach","classroom","textbook"],"sentence":"The teacher's ______ to teaching mathematics focuses on hands-on problem-solving rather than memorization. Students found this method much more engaging and effective.","translation":"這位老師教授數學的方法側重於動手解決問題，而不是死記硬背。學生們發現這種方法更加有趣且有效。","word":"approach"}},"appropriate":{"createdAt":1782477376589,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"appropriate是指適合特定情況或場合的；符合場景、時間或社會規範的得體選擇。","options":["inappropriate","casual","appropriate","uncommon"],"sentence":"Wearing a formal suit is ______ for a job interview at a corporate office. Business casual or casual attire would not create the right impression.","translation":"穿著正式西裝適合在公司辦公室的工作面試。商務休閒或休閒服裝無法留下正確的印象。","word":"appropriate"}},"approval":{"createdAt":1783987848721,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"approval 意指同意或認可，通常用於正式場合，表示獲得權威人士或相關機構的許可或贊同。","options":["rejection","approval","confusion","delay"],"sentence":"The project cannot proceed without the manager's ______ on the budget plan. The director has already reviewed all the documents and signed off on the proposal yesterday.","translation":"該專案未經理的同意就無法進行預算計畫。主任已經審閱了所有文件，並在昨天簽署了該提案。","word":"approval"}},"approve":{"createdAt":1781527602364,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"approve 表示正式同意、認可或批准某個計劃、提案或決定。","options":["reject","ignore","approve","delay"],"sentence":"The school principal had to ______ the new curriculum before it could be implemented in classrooms. After reviewing all the educational standards, she signed the official documentation to move forward.","translation":"學校校長必須認可新課程才能在教室中實施。在審查所有教育標準後，她簽署了正式文件以推進該計劃。","word":"approve"}},"approximate":{"createdAt":1781581336203,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"approximate表示大概的或近似的數字，而不是精確的。","options":["final","approximate","total","actual"],"sentence":"The ______ cost of the renovation project is fifty thousand dollars, though the exact figure may vary. The contractor provided this rough estimate based on initial assessments.","translation":"裝修項目的大約成本是五萬美元，儘管確切數字可能會有所不同。承包商根據初步評估提供了這個粗略估計。","word":"approximate"}},"approximately":{"createdAt":1782312212036,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"approximately表示大約或接近某個數字，用來描述不精確但接近的數量或時間。","options":["exactly","approximately","definitely","certainly"],"sentence":"The project will cost ______ five million dollars to complete. The final budget estimate showed it would be between four point eight and five point two million.","translation":"完成這個項目大約需要五百萬美元。最終預算估計顯示將在四百八十萬到五百二十萬之間。","word":"approximately"}},"apron":{"createdAt":1781336858145,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"apron 是穿在身體前面用來保護衣服的服裝，通常在廚房或進行髒亂工作時穿著。","options":["hat","apron","uniform","glove"],"sentence":"The chef wore a white ______ to protect his clothes while cooking. He tied it around his waist before starting to prepare the elaborate meal.","translation":"廚師穿著白色圍裙以在烹飪時保護他的衣服。他在開始準備這頓豐盛的食物之前在腰部繫上了它。","word":"apron"}},"apt":{"createdAt":1782982841050,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"apt 意為有傾向的、容易的，描述某事容易發生或有可能發生的傾向。","options":["unlikely","apt","unable","forbidden"],"sentence":"Children are ______ to imitate the behavior they see in their parents and teachers. Research shows that young people naturally tend to copy adult actions and attitudes.","translation":"孩子容易模仿他們在父母和教師身上看到的行為。研究表明年輕人自然傾向於複製成人的行為和態度。","word":"apt"}},"aptitude":{"createdAt":1783390227928,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"aptitude 指的是某人在特定領域中與生俱來的天賦或能力，通常是自然而然的才華。","options":["weakness","aptitude","interest","experience"],"sentence":"Sarah has a natural ______ for mathematics and problem-solving. Her teachers recognized this talent early and encouraged her to pursue advanced courses in the subject.","translation":"莎拉在數學和解題方面具有天生的資質。她的老師很早就認出了這項才能，並鼓勵她修習該科目的進階課程。","word":"aptitude"}},"aptitudes":{"createdAt":1781581336197,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"aptitudes指的是某人在特定領域的天生才能和適應能力。","options":["hobbies","aptitudes","grades","interests"],"sentence":"The career counselor assessed the student's ______ and recommended fields in mathematics and engineering. Her natural talents in these areas made the decision clear.","translation":"職業顧問評估了學生的天賦才能，並推薦數學和工程領域。她在這些領域的天然才能使決定變得清晰。","word":"aptitudes"}},"aquarium":{"createdAt":1781709854485,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"aquarium（水族館）指展示水生生物的地方，與marine creatures（海洋生物）、fish（魚）和tanks（水箱）的描述完全吻合。","options":["aquarium","library","gallery","museum"],"sentence":"The children pressed their faces against the glass at the local ______ to watch the colorful fish swim. Inside, thousands of marine creatures from around the world were on display in large tanks.","translation":"孩子們在當地水族館的玻璃前貼著臉觀看彩色魚兒游泳。館內的大水箱中展示著來自世界各地的數千種海洋生物。","word":"aquarium"}},"aquatic":{"createdAt":1781434900595,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"aquatic指與水有關的或發生在水中的事物。","options":["terrestrial","aquatic","aerial","underground"],"sentence":"The children's ______ activities at the summer camp included swimming, diving, and water polo. All events took place in the Olympic-sized pool.","translation":"夏令營中兒童的水上活動包括游泳、跳水和水球。所有活動都在奧運規模的游泳池進行。","word":"aquatic"}},"archaeology":{"createdAt":1781798927521,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"archaeology 是研究古代人類文明的學科，通過發掘和分析古代遺物來了解過去。","options":["history","archaeology","geology","anthropology"],"sentence":"Dr. Chen devoted her entire career to ______ and made several groundbreaking discoveries. Her team uncovered ancient pottery, stone tools, and human remains from civilizations thousands of years old.","translation":"陳博士把整個職業生涯投入考古學，並取得了多項突破性發現。她的團隊發掘了數千年前文明的古代陶器、石器和人類遺骸。","word":"archaeology"}},"archipelago":{"createdAt":1781581336194,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"archipelago指的是由許多島嶼組成的群島系統。","options":["continent","archipelago","peninsula","island"],"sentence":"The ______ of Indonesia consists of thousands of islands spread across the Indian and Pacific Oceans. This unique geography makes it one of the most biodiverse regions on Earth.","translation":"印度尼西亞群島由分佈在印度洋和太平洋上的數千個島嶼組成。這種獨特的地理特徵使其成為地球上生物多樣性最豐富的地區之一。","word":"archipelago"}},"architect":{"createdAt":1782660146221,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"architect是指從事建築設計工作的專業人士，通常具有深厚的藝術和工程背景。","options":["engineer","architect","builder","contractor"],"sentence":"The famous ______ designed a stunning modern building for the city center. She spent years studying engineering and art to master her profession.","translation":"那位著名的建築師為市中心設計了一棟令人驚嘆的現代建築。她花了多年時間學習工程學和藝術來掌握自己的專業。","word":"architect"}},"architecture":{"createdAt":1782007262075,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"architecture 指的是建築物的設計風格和結構特徵，在此語境中強調的是建築物的物理設計方式。","options":["decoration","architecture","location","history"],"sentence":"The ______ of the ancient Roman buildings featured massive stone arches and columns. Engineers studied these structural designs to understand how they distributed weight so effectively.","translation":"古羅馬建築物的建築風格採用了巨大的石拱和圓柱。工程師研究這些結構設計，以了解它們如何有效地分散重量。","word":"architecture"}},"archive":{"createdAt":1781401361945,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"archive作為動詞表示將文件或資料妥善存檔和保存，以便日後查閱和研究。","options":["destroy","display","archive","distribute"],"sentence":"The library decided to ______ all the old newspapers and historical documents in a climate-controlled vault. These materials will be preserved and organized digitally so future researchers can access them safely.","translation":"圖書館決定將所有舊報紙和歷史文件存檔到一個氣候控制的保險庫中。這些材料將被保存和數位化組織，以便未來的研究人員能夠安全地訪問它們。","word":"archive"}},"arena":{"createdAt":1781311983482,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"arena 表示競爭或活動的場所，這裡指政治競爭的場域。","options":["timer","arena","syndrome","offshore"],"sentence":"The political ______ has become increasingly competitive in recent years. Candidates from both parties are actively campaigning in this space where major decisions are made.","translation":"近年來政治舞臺變得越來越競爭激烈。來自兩黨的候選人在這個做出重大決定的場所中積極進行競選活動。","word":"arena"}},"arguably":{"createdAt":1784648623658,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"arguably 表示「可以說、據說、可謂」，用於提出可辯論或可論證的觀點，而非絕對事實。","options":["definitively","arguably","impossibly","unfortunately"],"sentence":"The Mona Lisa is ______ the most famous painting in the world. No other artwork has captured the imagination of audiences across so many centuries and cultures.","translation":"蒙娜麗莎可以說是世界上最著名的繪畫。沒有其他藝術作品能在如此多個世紀和文化中都能如此吸引觀眾的想像。","word":"arguably"}},"argue":{"createdAt":1782228357813,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"argue 表示為某事進行激烈的討論或辯論，通常涉及不同的觀點和相互反駁。","options":["agree","argue","ignore","separate"],"sentence":"The two neighbors decided to ______ about the property line for over an hour. They presented evidence and counterarguments until they finally reached a compromise.","translation":"這兩個鄰居決定為了地產邊界線爭吵了一個多小時。他們提出證據和反駁意見，直到最後達成妥協。","word":"argue"}},"argument":{"createdAt":1781274836865,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"argument表示兩個或多個人之間的爭論或不同意見的交換，通常涉及對立的立場。","options":["agreement","discussion","argument","conversation"],"sentence":"The two neighbors had a heated ______ about whose fence was on whose property. They presented different pieces of evidence to support their conflicting claims.","translation":"兩個鄰居就誰的籬笆在誰的地產上發生了激烈的爭論。他們提出了不同的證據來支持他們相互衝突的主張。","word":"argument"}},"arid":{"createdAt":1783260805488,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"arid意為「乾燥的」，用來描述極其缺乏水分和降雨的地區或氣候。","options":["tropical","fertile","arid","marshy"],"sentence":"The ______ desert landscape stretched for hundreds of miles without a single drop of rain in sight. The extreme lack of moisture made it nearly impossible for vegetation to survive in this region.","translation":"乾燥的沙漠景觀延伸了數百英里，看不到一滴雨水。極端缺乏水分使得植被幾乎不可能在這個地區生存。","word":"arid"}},"arise":{"createdAt":1783243988718,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"arise意為出現、發生、產生，用來描述問題或困難的出現","options":["resolve","arise","disappear","improve"],"sentence":"A serious problem will ______ if we do not address this issue immediately. The consequences could affect the entire project timeline.","translation":"如果我們不立即解決這個問題，一個嚴重的問題就會______。其後果可能會影響整個項目時間表。","word":"arise"}},"arises":{"createdAt":1783489104901,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"arises表示某事物開始出現、產生或發生，常用來描述問題、情況或事件的開始。","options":["resolves","arises","concludes","diminishes"],"sentence":"A conflict ______ between the two neighboring countries over territorial disputes. The tension continued to escalate for several years.","translation":"兩個相鄰國家之間因領土爭議而出現衝突。緊張局勢持續升級多年。","word":"arises"}},"armageddon":{"createdAt":1784818310063,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Armageddon 是指哈米吉多頓或末日決戰，通常在宗教背景中指最終的世界末日之戰。","options":["resurrection","Armageddon","prophecy","apocalypse"],"sentence":"The ancient text contained prophecies about ______, describing a final catastrophic battle between good and evil. Religious scholars spent decades interpreting these visions of the ultimate end of the world.","translation":"這份古老文獻包含關於末日決戰的預言，描述善惡之間的最終災難性戰鬥。宗教學者花費了幾十年來詮釋這些世界末日的願景。","word":"Armageddon"}},"armed":{"createdAt":1781581336200,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"armed表示被武裝或配備武器的狀態。","options":["trained","armed","dressed","equipped"],"sentence":"The security guards at the bank were ______ with weapons to protect against potential robberies. Their visible firearms served as a strong deterrent to criminals.","translation":"銀行的保安人員持有武器以防止可能的搶劫。他們明顯的火槍對罪犯起到了強大的威懾作用。","word":"armed"}},"arms":{"createdAt":1781693303267,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"arms 在此指「武器」，通常指用於戰爭或軍事目的的工具，特別是槍支、炸彈等致命武器。","options":["supplies","arms","uniforms","food"],"sentence":"The soldiers carried ______ and ammunition as they prepared for the military operation. Their weapons included rifles, grenades, and tactical gear.","translation":"士兵們攜帶武器和彈藥，準備進行軍事行動。他們的武器包括步槍、手榴彈和戰術裝備。","word":"arms"}},"army":{"createdAt":1781274836865,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"army指國家的陸軍部隊，是由大量士兵組成的軍事組織，負責陸地防禦。","options":["navy","police","army","guard"],"sentence":"The ______ was deployed to the border region to strengthen national security. Thousands of soldiers were stationed there to protect the country's territorial integrity.","translation":"陸軍被派遣到邊境地區以加強國家安全。數千名士兵駐紮在那裡以保護國家的領土完整。","word":"army"}},"aroma":{"createdAt":1783683369582,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"aroma 是指食物或飲料散發出來的香味或芳香，通常用來形容令人愉快的氣味。","options":["sound","aroma","texture","color"],"sentence":"The ______ of freshly baked bread filled the entire bakery. The pleasant scent came specifically from the oven where the loaves were cooling.","translation":"新烤麵包的香氣充滿了整個麵包店。那股令人愉悅的氣味特別來自麵包冷卻的烤箱。","word":"aroma"}},"arose":{"createdAt":1783683369587,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"arose 是 arise 的過去式，表示「出現」或「發生」，用來描述某個情況或問題突然出現。","options":["disappeared","arose","continued","finished"],"sentence":"A serious problem ______ during the meeting yesterday. The team had to immediately stop discussing the original agenda to address this unexpected issue.","translation":"昨天開會時出現了一個嚴重問題。團隊必須立即停止討論原本的議程來處理這個意外狀況。","word":"arose"}},"arouse":{"createdAt":1781847052512,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"arouse是動詞，意思是喚起或引起某種情感、興趣或反應，通常帶有積極的行動結果。","options":["suppress","arouse","ignore","delay"],"sentence":"The documentary about endangered species managed to ______ strong emotions in the audience members. After watching it, many viewers decided to donate to wildlife conservation organizations.","translation":"這部關於瀕危物種的紀錄片成功地在觀眾中喚起了強烈的情感。看完後，許多觀眾決定向野生動物保護組織捐款。","word":"arouse"}},"arrange":{"createdAt":1782981571688,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"arrange 作為動詞表示「安排、商定」，指計畫或協調某件事情使其能夠發生，常涉及與他人協商時間或地點。","options":["cancel","arrange","attend","delay"],"sentence":"I need to ______ a meeting with the team before the project starts next month. Let me contact everyone by email to find a time that works for all of us.","translation":"在專案下個月開始前，我需要安排與團隊的一次會議。讓我通過電子郵件聯繫每個人，找到一個對大家都合適的時間。","word":"arrange"}},"arrangement":{"createdAt":1781437220551,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「Arrangement」指事先計畫和組織的各種準備或安排。","options":["ceremony","arrangement","celebration","invitation"],"sentence":"The wedding ______ took three months to complete successfully. Every detail from the flowers to the seating chart was planned by a professional coordinator.","translation":"婚禮的安排花了三個月才順利完成。從鮮花到座位表，每個細節都由專業協調員規劃。","word":"arrangement"}},"array":{"createdAt":1781437013479,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"array 指種類繁多、數量眾多的一系列事物或物品的集合展示。","options":["collection","array","shortage","sample"],"sentence":"The museum displayed a magnificent ______ of ancient artifacts from different civilizations. Visitors could see Egyptian mummies, Greek sculptures, Roman coins, and Persian jewelry all in one exhibition hall.","translation":"博物館展出了來自不同文明的古代文物的宏偉陣列。遊客可以在一個展覽廳裡看到埃及木乃伊、希臘雕像、羅馬硬幣和波斯珠寶。","word":"array"}},"arrest":{"createdAt":1782533789093,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"arrest 作動詞意思是逮捕或拘捕犯罪嫌疑人，是執法中的正式行為。","options":["question","arrest","warn","follow"],"sentence":"The police officers attempted to ______ the robbery suspect as he fled through the downtown streets. They successfully detained him before he could escape the city.","translation":"警官試圖逮捕搶劫嫌疑人，他正在市中心街道上逃竄。他們在他逃離城市之前成功拘留了他。","word":"arrest"}},"arrogant":{"createdAt":1781835134541,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"arrogant 指一個人過度自信且對他人缺乏尊重，通常表現出自認高人一等的態度。","options":["humble","arrogant","generous","curious"],"sentence":"The ______ CEO refused to listen to any suggestions from his employees. His behavior made it clear that he believed he was superior to everyone else in the company.","translation":"那位傲慢的執行長拒絕聽取員工的任何建議。他的行為清楚表明，他認為自己優於公司裡的每個人。","word":"arrogant"}},"artery":{"createdAt":1781839950962,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"artery 是指從心臟輸送血液到身體各部分的血管。","options":["vein","artery","nerve","organ"],"sentence":"The patient's ______ was blocked, restricting blood flow to his heart. The cardiologist performed emergency surgery to clear the main vessel carrying blood from the heart.","translation":"患者的動脈被堵塞,限制了流向心臟的血流。心臟科醫生進行了緊急手術以清除從心臟輸送血液的主要血管。","word":"artery"}},"article":{"createdAt":1781429945503,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"article 表示報紙或雜誌上的文章或報導，是新聞或評論的書面形式。","options":["cartoon","advertisement","article","recipe"],"sentence":"The journalist wrote an excellent ______ about climate change for the newspaper's Sunday edition. Her in-depth investigation and research were published across five pages of the magazine.","translation":"這名記者為報紙的週日版寫了一篇關於氣候變化的優秀文章。她深入的調查和研究在雜誌的五頁上發表。","word":"article"}},"articulate":{"createdAt":1781437220552,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「Articulate」形容詞表示一個人能夠清楚、有效地表達自己的想法。","options":["quiet","articulate","nervous","confused"],"sentence":"The ______ speaker explained the complex theory so clearly that even children could understand it. His ability to communicate difficult concepts with precision impressed the entire audience.","translation":"這位善於表達的演講者解釋複雜理論的方式如此清晰，甚至連小孩都能理解。他用精確的方式傳達困難概念的能力給全體聽眾留下了深刻印象。","word":"articulate"}},"artificial":{"createdAt":1781613113027,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"artificial 表示人造的、非天然的或用人工方法製造的","options":["natural","artificial","fresh","real"],"sentence":"The ______ flowers looked so realistic that visitors couldn't tell they weren't genuine. However, they would never wilt or need watering.","translation":"人造花看起來非常逼真，遊客無法分辨它們不是真的。然而，它們永遠不會凋謝或需要澆水。","word":"artificial"}},"ascend":{"createdAt":1781424157170,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ascend 表示向上爬或上升，與達到山頂的結果相符。","options":["descend","ascend","traverse","avoid"],"sentence":"The mountaineers decided to ______ the peak early in the morning when the weather was clear. By noon, they had successfully reached the summit at 3,000 meters above sea level.","translation":"登山者決定在天氣晴朗的清晨攀登山峰。到了中午，他們已經成功到達了海拔3,000公尺的山頂。","word":"ascend"}},"ascendant":{"createdAt":1783481598213,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ascendant 作為名詞表示「優越地位、權位、影響力」，通常指某人或某國在政治、社會或權力上佔據上風或主導地位。","options":["descendant","ascendant","distant","resonant"],"sentence":"Throughout the 19th century, the British Empire held ______ over much of the world. This dominant position allowed Britain to control trade routes and influence global politics for decades.","translation":"整個十九世紀，大英帝國在世界大部分地區佔據著優越的地位。這種主導地位使英國能夠控制貿易路線並在數十年間影響全球政治。","word":"ascendant"}},"ascribe":{"createdAt":1789363793855,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ascribe 意指把某事歸因於或歸咎於某個原因或責任方。","options":["ignore","ascribe","celebrate","dispute"],"sentence":"Many historians ______ the fall of the empire to a combination of military defeats and internal corruption. However, some scholars dispute this interpretation and offer alternative explanations.","translation":"許多歷史學家將帝國的衰落歸因於軍事失敗和內部腐敗的結合。然而，一些學者對這種解釋提出異議，並提供了替代解釋。","word":"ascribe"}},"ashamed":{"createdAt":1783402916389,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"ashamed 表示因為做了不當或不光榮的事情而感到的羞愧或內疚感。","options":["proud","excited","ashamed","relieved"],"sentence":"After cheating on the test, Tom felt deeply ______ and could not look his teacher in the eye. He decided to confess his dishonesty and accept the consequences.","translation":"在考試作弊後，湯姆感到深深的羞愧，無法直視他的老師。他決定坦白自己的不誠實並接受後果。","word":"ashamed"}},"aspect":{"createdAt":1781664082524,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"aspect 表示事物的方面或觀點，指事物的某一個具體的特徵或部分。","options":["result","aspect","location","date"],"sentence":"One important ______ of the job interview is demonstrating your communication skills. Employers want to see how clearly and confidently you can express your ideas.","translation":"工作面試的一個重要方面是展示你的溝通技能。僱主想看你如何清楚而自信地表達你的想法。","word":"aspect"}},"aspire":{"createdAt":1781672973739,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"aspire是動詞，表示「追求；渴望；有志於」，指對遠大目標的強烈渴望和追求。","options":["refuse","aspire","fear","forget"],"sentence":"Since childhood, he has ______ to become a professional musician and perform on world stages. His passion for music has never wavered despite the many challenges he faced.","translation":"從童年起，他就渴望成為專業音樂家並在世界舞台上表演。儘管面臨許多挑戰，他對音樂的熱情從未動搖。","word":"aspire"}},"assassinate":{"createdAt":1781850287959,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"assassinate 指秘密地或突然地殺害重要人物，通常是出於政治目的。","options":["arrest","betray","assassinate","exile"],"sentence":"The dictator feared that his enemies would ______ him while he slept. Security forces doubled the number of guards around his bedroom each night because of these persistent threats.","translation":"獨裁者擔心他的敵人會在他睡眠中暗殺他。由於這些持續的威脅，安全部隊每晚都將他臥室周圍的警衛數量加倍。","word":"assassinate"}},"assassination":{"createdAt":1781613113021,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"assassination 是暗殺或有預謀地殺害重要人物的行為","options":["election","inauguration","assassination","resignation"],"sentence":"The ______ of the president shocked the entire nation. The sudden violent death of the leader created chaos and uncertainty.","translation":"總統遇刺震驚了整個國家。領導人的突然暴力死亡造成了混亂和不確定。","word":"assassination"}},"assault":{"createdAt":1781779647059,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"assault表示對他人進行暴力攻擊或襲擊","options":["assistance","assault","assembly","assessment"],"sentence":"The police arrested a man for ______ on Main Street. According to witnesses, he attacked another person without any provocation.","translation":"警方逮捕了一名在主街發起攻擊的男子。根據目擊者所說，他無故攻擊了另一個人。","word":"assault"}},"assemble":{"createdAt":1781613113029,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"assemble 表示集合、組裝或把分散的部分聚集在一起","options":["disassemble","assemble","inspect","separate"],"sentence":"The workers needed to ______ all the furniture parts together carefully. Following the instruction manual, they put each piece in the correct position.","translation":"工人們需要小心地將所有家具零件組裝在一起。按照說明書，他們把每一件放在正確的位置。","word":"assemble"}},"assembly":{"createdAt":1781672973737,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"assembly是名詞，表示「大會；議會；集合」，指人們聚集在一起的正式活動或集會。","options":["dismissal","assembly","recess","detention"],"sentence":"The school held a special ______ in the gymnasium to announce the scholarship winners. All students and teachers gathered together to celebrate the achievements of their peers.","translation":"學校在體育館舉辦了特別集會，宣布獎學金獲得者。所有學生和教師聚集在一起慶祝他們同學的成就。","word":"assembly"}},"assert":{"createdAt":1781417610419,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"assert是指堅定地聲稱或斷言某事為真，通常帶有信心和把握。","options":["doubt","deny","assert","question"],"sentence":"The witness chose to ______ that she had seen the suspect leaving the building at midnight. Multiple security cameras confirmed her account with video evidence.","translation":"證人聲稱她看到嫌疑人在午夜時離開大樓。多台監控攝像機用視頻證據確認了她的說法。","word":"assert"}},"assertion":{"createdAt":1781613113012,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"assertion 是主張或聲明，通常是對某事的堅定陳述","options":["question","assertion","invitation","suggestion"],"sentence":"The politician made a bold ______ that he would solve the economic crisis within one year. However, he provided no concrete evidence or detailed plan to support his claim.","translation":"這位政治家大膽聲稱他將在一年內解決經濟危機。然而，他沒有提供具體證據或詳細計劃來支持他的主張。","word":"assertion"}},"assess":{"createdAt":1782651710254,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"assess 意為評價或評定某人或某事物的質量、能力或價值。","options":["ignore","assess","record","announce"],"sentence":"The teacher will ______ each student's performance based on their test scores, class participation, and completed assignments. A comprehensive evaluation will determine their final grade.","translation":"教師將根據學生的考試成績、課堂參與度和完成的作業來評價每個學生的表現。全面的評估將決定他們的最終成績。","word":"assess"}},"assessment":{"createdAt":1786357407254,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"assessment 是名詞，表示「評估、評定」，指對某人的能力、進度或表現進行系統的評價。","options":["promotion","assessment","celebration","invitation"],"sentence":"The teacher conducted a comprehensive ______ of each student's progress at the end of the semester. The evaluation included written tests, oral presentations, and class participation to determine final grades.","translation":"老師在學期末對每位學生的進度進行了全面評估。評定包括筆試、口頭報告和課堂參與，以確定最終成績。","word":"assessment"}},"asset":{"createdAt":1783740110389,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"asset 是指有價值的資產或優勢，可以是物質財產或個人才能，能為人帶來好處或增加價值。","options":["liability","asset","burden","obstacle"],"sentence":"Her ability to speak five languages is a valuable ______ in the competitive job market. Employers specifically seek candidates with this rare skill because it gives them an advantage in international business.","translation":"她能說五種語言的能力在競爭激烈的就業市場中是一項寶貴的資產。雇主特別尋找具有這種稀有技能的候選人，因為它在國際業務中給了他們優勢。","word":"asset"}},"assign":{"createdAt":1782265478231,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"assign 意指把工作或任務分配給特定的人，具有分配和指定的含義。","options":["assign","ignore","suggest","avoid"],"sentence":"The teacher will ______ different research topics to each student in the class. This ensures that every student gets a unique project tailored to their interests.","translation":"老師將為班上的每位學生分配不同的研究主題。這確保每位學生都能獲得符合自己興趣的獨特專案。","word":"assign"}},"assignment":{"createdAt":1783403425349,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"assignment 指老師或上司安排給某人的具體工作或任務，特別是在學校或工作環境中分配的作業。","options":["assignment","punishment","privilege","promotion"],"sentence":"The teacher gave each student a challenging ______ to complete before Friday. Students were required to submit their written work by the deadline to receive a grade.","translation":"老師給每個學生安排了一項具有挑戰性的作業，要求在星期五前完成。學生必須在截止日期前提交他們的書面作業才能獲得成績。","word":"assignment"}},"assist":{"createdAt":1781672973738,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"assist是動詞，表示「協助；幫助」，指為他人的工作或活動提供支持或幫助。","options":["ignore","assist","distract","obstruct"],"sentence":"The nurse will ______ the surgeon during the complicated operation tomorrow. Her expertise and quick hands will be essential to ensure the procedure goes smoothly.","translation":"護士明天將在複雜的手術中協助外科醫生。她的專業知識和靈巧的雙手對於確保手術順利進行至關重要。","word":"assist"}},"assistance":{"createdAt":1781581336211,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"assistance指的是提供給他人的幫助或支持。","options":["directions","assistance","information","advice"],"sentence":"The elderly woman asked for ______ in carrying her heavy shopping bags to the parking lot. A kind stranger immediately offered to help her with the difficult task.","translation":"這位老婦人請求幫助將她沉重的購物袋提到停車場。一位善良的陌生人立即主動幫助她完成這項困難的任務。","word":"assistance"}},"assistant":{"createdAt":1783482744730,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"assistant 指的是助理或輔助人員，負責在他人的指導下完成支持性和行政性工作。","options":["director","assistant","consultant","supervisor"],"sentence":"The manager hired a new ______ to help with scheduling and administrative tasks. She will report directly to the manager and support the entire team's workflow.","translation":"經理聘請了一位新的助理來幫助安排日程和處理行政工作。她將直接向經理報告，並支持整個團隊的工作流程。","word":"assistant"}},"associate":{"createdAt":1783573046431,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"associate作為動詞表示把某事物與另一事物聯繫或聯想在一起，通常指心理上的關聯。","options":["ignore","forget","associate","replace"],"sentence":"Many people ______ the smell of fresh cookies with childhood memories and comfort. This connection between scent and emotion is deeply rooted in our brains.","translation":"許多人將新鮮餅乾的氣味與童年回憶和舒適感聯想在一起。氣味與情感之間的這種連結深深根植於我們的大腦中。","word":"associate"}},"association":{"createdAt":1781779647127,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"association表示由志同道合的人組成的組織或協會","options":["company","association","family","school"],"sentence":"She joined a professional ______ to network with others in her field. The organization held monthly meetings and provided valuable resources.","translation":"她加入了一個專業協會與同行交流。該組織每月舉辦會議並提供寶貴資源。","word":"association"}},"assume":{"createdAt":1781613113016,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"assume 表示假定或假設，不經過驗證就認為某事是真實的","options":["know","assume","ask","ignore"],"sentence":"Don't ______ that everyone likes the same kind of music as you do. People have different tastes and preferences that are valid.","translation":"不要假定每個人都喜歡和你一樣的音樂類型。人們有不同的有效口味和偏好。","word":"assume"}},"assumption":{"createdAt":1781613113013,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"assumption 是假定或臆測，指未經驗證而接受的想法","options":["fact","assumption","observation","knowledge"],"sentence":"He made an incorrect ______ about her intentions without asking for clarification first. Later he discovered his guess was completely wrong.","translation":"他在沒有先尋求澄清的情況下對她的意圖做出了不正確的假定。後來他發現他的猜測完全錯了。","word":"assumption"}},"assurance":{"createdAt":1781613113031,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"assurance 是保證、確認或向某人保證某事的言語","options":["question","assurance","doubt","denial"],"sentence":"She gave him her ______ that she would keep his secret safe. His trust in her promise helped him feel more confident.","translation":"她向他保證她會保護他的秘密。他對她承諾的信任幫助他更有信心。","word":"assurance"}},"assure":{"createdAt":1781613113024,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"assure 表示向某人保證或確認某事是真實的","options":["frighten","assure","confuse","deceive"],"sentence":"The doctor tried to ______ his worried patient that the surgery would be successful. His confident words and experience helped calm her fears.","translation":"醫生試圖向他擔心的患者保證手術會成功。他自信的言語和經驗幫助平復了她的恐懼。","word":"assure"}},"assured":{"createdAt":1781527602353,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"assured 表示對某事充滿信心和把握，通常用來描述一個人感到安心和確定的心理狀態。","options":["nervous","assured","confused","annoyed"],"sentence":"The captain felt ______ that the ship would safely reach its destination despite the storm. His confidence came from decades of experience navigating treacherous waters.","translation":"儘管暴風雨來襲，船長感到有把握船隻會安全抵達目的地。他的信心源自於數十年駕馭危險水域的經驗。","word":"assured"}},"asthma":{"createdAt":1781613113012,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"asthma 是一種慢性呼吸道疾病，會導致呼吸困難","options":["allergy","asthma","injury","fatigue"],"sentence":"His ______ made it difficult for him to participate in sports activities. The respiratory condition required him to use an inhaler during exercise.","translation":"他的氣喘使他難以參加體育活動。這種呼吸系統疾病要求他在運動時使用吸入器。","word":"asthma"}},"astonish":{"createdAt":1784179946370,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"astonish 是動詞，表示使某人感到極其驚訝或震驚，通常帶有意外和難以置信的感受。","options":["bore","astonish","confuse","entertain"],"sentence":"The magician's incredible trick did ______ the entire audience. Everyone sat in stunned silence, unable to believe what they had just witnessed.","translation":"魔術師不可思議的把戲使整個觀眾感到驚訝。每個人都坐在震驚的沉默中，無法相信他們剛才所看到的。","word":"astonish"}},"astonished":{"createdAt":1781429945499,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"astonished 表示非常驚訝或震驚，通常是面對出乎意料的事情時的強烈反應。","options":["bored","astonished","disappointed","confused"],"sentence":"We were ______ when our quiet neighbor suddenly announced she was a professional rock climber. Her incredible feats and achievements left us completely stunned and speechless.","translation":"當我們安靜的鄰居突然宣布她是專業攀岩者時，我們驚訝不已。她不可思議的壯舉和成就讓我們完全震驚，說不出話來。","word":"astonished"}},"astonishment":{"createdAt":1783685293800,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"astonishment意思是「驚訝、震驚」，指突然感到極度意外或驚奇的情感狀態。","options":["confusion","boredom","astonishment","amusement"],"sentence":"She stared in ______ as the magician made the elephant disappear from the stage. Her mouth dropped open in complete shock and disbelief.","translation":"當魔術師讓大象從舞台上消失時，她驚訝地瞪著眼睛。她的嘴巴張開，完全處於震驚和不相信的狀態。","word":"astonishment"}},"astray":{"createdAt":1783385703387,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"astray 是副詞，表示走錯路、迷失方向或誤入歧途的狀態，常用於比喻道德或人生方向上的偏離。","options":["forward","astray","upward","backward"],"sentence":"The young student went ______ during his teenage years and made poor choices. His parents eventually helped him find his way back to the right path through counseling and support.","translation":"這位年輕學生在青少年時期迷失方向，做出了不好的選擇。他的父母最終通過諮詢和支持幫助他回到正確的軌道。","word":"astray"}},"astronaut":{"createdAt":1781581336202,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"astronaut指的是經過訓練進行太空飛行和探索的人。","options":["pilot","astronaut","engineer","scientist"],"sentence":"The ______ underwent years of rigorous training before being selected for the space mission. His dedication and scientific expertise made him an ideal candidate to explore the moon.","translation":"這位太空人在被選中執行太空任務之前接受了多年嚴格的訓練。他的奉獻精神和科學專業知識使他成為探索月球的理想人選。","word":"astronaut"}},"astronomy":{"createdAt":1781499075057,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"天文學是研究宇宙中天體的科學，包括恆星、行星和星系。","options":["geology","botany","astronomy","meteorology"],"sentence":"Dr. Patel spent her career studying ______ and discovering new planets and stars. Her telescope revealed distant galaxies that had never been observed by humans before.","translation":"帕特爾博士用她的職業生涯研究天文學，發現了新的行星和恆星。她的望遠鏡揭示了人類以前從未觀測過的遙遠星系。","word":"astronomy"}},"at_a_loss":{"createdAt":1786357407254,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"at a loss 表示「困惑、不知所措」，形容某人感到困頓和無法應對局面。","options":["confident","at a loss","interested","relieved"],"sentence":"When the interviewer asked an unexpected technical question, Mark was completely ______ and couldn't formulate an answer. He stammered nervously and admitted he had no idea how to respond to the challenge.","translation":"當面試官問了一個出乎意料的技術問題時，馬克完全不知所措，無法組織出答案。他緊張地結巴，並承認他不知道如何應對這個挑戰。","word":"at a loss"}},"at_random":{"createdAt":1782361629315,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"at random 短語表示「隨意地」或「隨機地」，指沒有特定計畫或規律的選擇方式。","options":["carefully","at random","alphabetically","strategically"],"sentence":"The teacher selected five students ______ from the class roster to present their essays on stage. The names were chosen without any specific criteria or predetermined pattern.","translation":"老師從班級名單中隨意選擇了五名學生在舞台上呈現他們的論文。這些名字的選擇沒有任何特定的標準或預定的模式。","word":"at random"}},"athlete":{"createdAt":1781566460884,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"athlete是指經過訓練、參加體育競賽的人，與每日訓練和優秀表現相符。","options":["coach","athlete","spectator","judge"],"sentence":"The Olympic ______ trained six hours daily to prepare for the competition. His dedication to practice and fitness made him one of the country's top performers.","translation":"奧運運動員每天訓練六小時以準備比賽。他對練習和健身的投入使他成為國家頂級表現者之一。","word":"athlete"}},"athletic":{"createdAt":1781566460882,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"athletic形容與運動相關或具有運動員特質的身體和能力。","options":["artistic","academic","athletic","artistic"],"sentence":"Sarah has an ______ build with strong muscles developed from years of training. She excels in competitive sports due to her physical conditioning.","translation":"莎拉擁有一身運動員的體格，肌肉在多年訓練中得到發展。由於她的體能狀況，她在競技運動中表現卓越。","word":"athletic"}},"athletics":{"createdAt":1782007196630,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"「田徑運動；體育競技」指各種體育活動和運動項目的總稱，包括競速、跳躍和投擲等。","options":["academics","arts","athletics","music"],"sentence":"The school invested heavily in ______ by building new tracks, gyms, and sports facilities. The track team, basketball team, and volleyball team all benefited from these improvements.","translation":"學校通過建造新跑道、體育館和運動設施，投入大量資金支持田徑運動和體育競技。田徑隊、籃球隊和排球隊都從這些改善中受益。","word":"athletics"}},"atmosphere":{"createdAt":1781484415214,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"atmosphere意指一個地方或情境的整體氛圍和感覺，由多種元素組成。","options":["menu","price","atmosphere","noise"],"sentence":"The restaurant had such a romantic ______ that every couple felt in love. The soft lighting, gentle music, and intimate seating created the perfect mood.","translation":"餐廳有著如此浪漫的氣氛，使每一對情侶都感到相愛。柔和的燈光、溫柔的音樂和親密的座位安排營造了完美的氛圍。","word":"atmosphere"}},"atom":{"createdAt":1783391421679,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"atom（名詞）指「原子」，是物質的基本組成單位，由質子、中子和電子構成。","options":["molecule","crystal","atom","element"],"sentence":"Scientists use powerful microscopes to study the structure of a single ______ in detail. This smallest unit of matter contains protons, neutrons, and electrons.","translation":"科學家使用強大的顯微鏡來詳細研究單個原子的結構。這個最小的物質單位包含質子、中子和電子。","word":"atom"}},"atomic":{"createdAt":1783326301093,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"atomic 意指與原子或原子能有關的；在此句中特指利用原子核能量的武器。","options":["chemical","atomic","conventional","thermal"],"sentence":"The ______ bomb was developed during World War II and changed the course of history. Scientists harnessed the energy released from splitting the nucleus of uranium atoms.","translation":"______ 炸彈在第二次世界大戰期間被開發出來，改變了歷史的進程。科學家們利用了從分裂鈾原子核釋放出來的能量。","word":"atomic"}},"attach":{"createdAt":1782467634129,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"attach 表示將某物固定或連接到另一物上，或在電子郵件中附加文件。","options":["attack","tick","attach","alike"],"sentence":"Please ______ this document to your email before sending it. I need to make sure the file is included with your message so the recipient can download it.","translation":"請在寄送前將此文件附加到你的電子郵件。我需要確保該文件包含在你的訊息中，這樣收件人才能下載它。","word":"attach"}},"attached":{"createdAt":1786357407248,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"attached 在這裡表示「感情上依附的、喜歡的」，形容與某人或某物之間有強烈的感情聯繫。","options":["detached","attached","confused","anxious"],"sentence":"She felt deeply ______ to her childhood home and visited it whenever possible. The emotional bond she maintained with that place was unbreakable despite living far away.","translation":"她對童年時的家感到深深依附，儘管住得很遠，她仍儘可能經常拜訪。她與那個地方維持的感情紐帶是牢不可破的。","word":"attached"}},"attachment":{"createdAt":1781395428240,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"attachment 在電子郵件中指附加的文件或文檔，需要單獨下載或打開。","options":["signature","attachment","header","footer"],"sentence":"The email included an important ______ that contained the contract details. You need to download this file to review all the terms and conditions.","translation":"這封電子郵件包含了一個重要的附件，其中包含合約詳情。您需要下載此文件以查看所有條款和條件。","word":"attachment"}},"attack":{"createdAt":1782467634134,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"attack 表示以武力或暴力對某人或某處發動進攻。","options":["alike","attach","attack","tick"],"sentence":"The enemy forces will ______ the city at dawn tomorrow. The military has prepared all defenses in anticipation of this hostile assault.","translation":"敵軍將在明天黎明時發動對這座城市的攻擊。軍隊已準備好所有防禦設施以應對此次敵對攻擊。","word":"attack"}},"attain":{"createdAt":1781272410989,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"attain表示通過努力達到、獲得或實現某個目標或位置。","options":["abandon","forget","attain","ignore"],"sentence":"She worked hard for ten years to ______ her dream of becoming a doctor. Her determination and perseverance finally paid off when she completed her medical degree.","translation":"她努力了十年才達成了成為醫生的夢想。當她完成醫學學位時，她的決心和毅力終於得到了回報。","word":"attain"}},"attempt":{"createdAt":1781336858154,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"attempt 作為動詞或名詞，表示試圖做某事或進行某項嘗試，即使可能不會成功。","options":["completion","escape","attempt","decision"],"sentence":"The mountaineers made a final ______ to reach the peak before winter storms arrived. Despite their efforts, severe weather forced them to turn back just 200 meters from the summit.","translation":"登山者在冬季風暴到來之前做了最後一次試圖到達山峰的嘗試。儘管他們做出了努力，嚴酷的天氣迫使他們在距離頂峰僅200米的地方折返。","word":"attempt"}},"attend":{"createdAt":1782980445619,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"attend 在此句中表示「出席、參加」，指前往並參與某個活動或事件。","options":["host","organize","attend","cancel"],"sentence":"Will you ______ the wedding ceremony next Saturday afternoon? The bride and groom would be delighted to see you there.","translation":"你下週六下午會參加婚禮嗎？新娘和新郎會很高興在那裡見到你。","word":"attend"}},"attendant":{"createdAt":1783845443803,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"attendant指在飛機、火車等交通工具上為乘客服務的工作人員，符合「帶來枕頭和毛毯」的服務角色。","options":["pilot","attendant","manager","passenger"],"sentence":"The flight ______ brought me a pillow and a blanket during the long international flight. She was very professional and responded quickly to all passenger requests.","translation":"在這次漫長的國際航班中，空服員給我帶來了枕頭和毛毯。她非常專業，對所有乘客的要求反應迅速。","word":"attendant"}},"attention":{"createdAt":1782980445590,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"attention 在此句中表示「注意、專注」，指集中思想去聽或看某事物。","options":["silence","attention","time","space"],"sentence":"The teacher demanded ______ from all students during the important announcement. Everyone had to stop talking and focus completely.","translation":"老師在重要公告期間要求所有學生集中注意力。每個人都必須停止說話並完全專注。","word":"attention"}},"attentive":{"createdAt":1781414438954,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"attentive表示留心、注意周圍事物或對他人體貼關懷的態度","options":["careless","rude","attentive","sleepy"],"sentence":"The nurse was ______ to her patient's needs throughout the night. She responded immediately whenever he called for help or showed discomfort.","translation":"護士整夜都注意著她患者的需求。每當他呼救或表現出不適時，她立即做出反應。","word":"attentive"}},"attitude":{"createdAt":1784818310062,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"attitude 是指一個人對某事物的心理立場或態度，影響他們的行為和與他人的互動。","options":["skill","attitude","knowledge","experience"],"sentence":"His negative ______ toward the project made it difficult for the team to stay motivated. When he refused to cooperate and constantly complained, everyone's morale dropped significantly.","translation":"他對這個專案的消極態度使得團隊很難保持動力。當他拒絕合作並不斷抱怨時，每個人的士氣都明顯下降。","word":"attitude"}},"attorney":{"createdAt":1787049198611,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"attorney指的是執業律師或法律代理人，能在法庭上代表當事人進行訴訟。","options":["judge","attorney","witness","defendant"],"sentence":"The company hired an ______ to represent them in the lawsuit. She specializes in corporate law and has over twenty years of experience defending businesses.","translation":"公司聘請了一名律師代表他們出庭。她專門從事公司法，擁有二十多年為企業辯護的經驗。","word":"attorney"}},"attract":{"createdAt":1781850287960,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"attract 意指使某人或某物被吸引或對其產生興趣。","options":["repel","confuse","attract","disturb"],"sentence":"The bright neon lights and loud music will ______ many young people to the new nightclub downtown. The grand opening party is expected to draw hundreds of visitors on its first night.","translation":"明亮的霓虹燈和響亮的音樂將吸引許多年輕人前往市中心的新夜店。盛大的開幕派對預計在首晚會吸引數百名訪客。","word":"attract"}},"attraction":{"createdAt":1783516475400,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"attraction在此指能夠吸引人們注意或興趣的事物或地點，特別是旅遊景點。","options":["disadvantage","attraction","reputation","location"],"sentence":"The ______ of the amusement park draws millions of visitors every summer. Families come from across the region to experience the roller coasters and games.","translation":"遊樂園的吸引力每個夏季都吸引數百萬遊客。家庭從該地區各地前來體驗過山車和遊戲。","word":"attraction"}},"attractive":{"createdAt":1781779647062,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"attractive表示有吸引力的、引人注意的或令人愉悅的","options":["repulsive","attractive","confusing","boring"],"sentence":"The new advertising campaign was very ______. The company saw a significant increase in customer interest after launching it.","translation":"新廣告活動非常有吸引力。推出後，公司看到顧客興趣大幅增加。","word":"attractive"}},"attractiveness":{"createdAt":1783385703381,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"attractiveness 指的是一個人或事物具有的吸引他人的特質或力量，包括外貌、氣質等多方面因素。","options":["intelligence","attractiveness","confidence","elegance"],"sentence":"The model's ______ and charm made her stand out on the runway. Photographers praised not just her physical beauty, but her overall appeal and magnetism that captivated every audience.","translation":"那位模特的吸引力和魅力使她在跑道上脫穎而出。攝影師們稱讚的不僅是她的外表美麗，還有她那整體的吸引力和磁性，讓每個觀眾都著迷。","word":"attractiveness"}},"attribute":{"createdAt":1782361629310,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"attribute 動詞用法表示「把某事歸因於」或「歸咎於」，說明事情發生的原因。","options":["celebrate","attribute","deny","prevent"],"sentence":"Scientists ______ the recent crop failure to a prolonged drought that affected the entire region. Without sufficient rainfall, the plants simply could not survive the harsh conditions.","translation":"科學家把最近的農作物歉收歸因於影響整個地區的長期乾旱。沒有足夠的降雨，植物無法在惡劣的條件下存活。","word":"attribute"}},"auction":{"createdAt":1781499075055,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"拍賣是一種銷售方式，透過競價決定商品的最終買家和價格。","options":["exhibition","auction","appraisal","collection"],"sentence":"The art gallery held an ______ where wealthy collectors bid on rare paintings. The highest bidder won each item, paying thousands of dollars for their acquisitions.","translation":"藝術館舉辦了一場拍賣會，富有的收藏家競標稀有繪畫。出價最高的買家贏得了每件物品，為他們的收購支付了數千美元。","word":"auction"}},"audience":{"createdAt":1781581336197,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"audience指的是來看表演或聽演講的觀眾或聽眾。","options":["troupe","audience","orchestra","cast"],"sentence":"The comedian performed for a large ______ of over five hundred people at the theatre. Their enthusiastic laughter and applause showed their appreciation for his humor.","translation":"這位喜劇演員在劇院為超過五百人的大觀眾表演。他們熱情的笑聲和掌聲表明了他們對他幽默的欣賞。","word":"audience"}},"audio":{"createdAt":1783683369589,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"audio 是形容詞，表示「與聲音相關的」或「錄音的」，用來修飾與音訊和聲音相關的設備或內容。","options":["visual","audio","digital","mechanical"],"sentence":"The ______ equipment in the conference room needs to be upgraded to support better sound quality. The speakers, microphones, and recording devices all need replacement.","translation":"會議室的音訊設備需要升級以支持更好的音質。揚聲器、麥克風和錄音設備都需要更換。","word":"audio"}},"audit":{"createdAt":1781860901468,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"audit表示審計或查帳，是對財務記錄的正式檢查和驗證","options":["presentation","audit","advertisement","celebration"],"sentence":"The company hired a professional firm to conduct a financial ______ of their accounts. The auditors examined all transactions and records from the past three years.","translation":"公司聘請了一家專業公司對其帳目進行財務審計。審計員檢查了過去三年的所有交易和記錄。","word":"audit"}},"auditorium":{"createdAt":1782982841053,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"auditorium 意為劇院或禮堂等的觀眾席，指供觀眾或聽眾坐著觀看表演或聆聽講座的大型室內場所。","options":["gymnasium","auditorium","cafeteria","classroom"],"sentence":"The school held the graduation ceremony in the ______ which could seat over one thousand people. Families and friends packed the venue to watch their graduates receive their diplomas.","translation":"學校在可容納一千多人的禮堂舉行了畢業典禮。家人和朋友們擠滿了場地，看著畢業生領取文憑。","word":"auditorium"}},"authentic":{"createdAt":1781274836867,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"authentic形容詞表示真實的、可信的、非假冒的，特別是指已被證實或經過驗證的真品。","options":["fake","damaged","authentic","modern"],"sentence":"The museum displayed an ______ painting that was created by the famous artist in the 18th century. Experts had verified its genuineness through detailed analysis and historical documentation.","translation":"博物館展示了一幅由18世紀著名藝術家創作的真跡。專家透過詳細分析和歷史文獻驗證了其真實性。","word":"authentic"}},"author":{"createdAt":1782094693731,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"作者是指創作或撰寫文學、科學或其他作品的人。","options":["publisher","author","illustrator","translator"],"sentence":"The ______ of the mystery novel spent five years researching and writing the book. Her creative storytelling and detailed world-building impressed critics worldwide.","translation":"那部懸疑小說的作者花了五年時間研究和寫作這本書。她的創意故事講述和詳細的世界構建給全球評論家留下了深刻印象。","word":"author"}},"authority":{"createdAt":1783327146628,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"authority 指的是具有權力和決策能力的當局或機構，在此指市政府部門。","options":["building","authority","schedule","document"],"sentence":"The local ______ has announced new regulations for environmental protection. The mayor and city council members represent the government body responsible for enforcing these laws.","translation":"當地當局已宣布了新的環境保護法規。市長和市議會成員代表負責執行這些法律的政府機構。","word":"authority"}},"authorize":{"createdAt":1781779647066,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"authorize表示給予官方許可或權限進行某項行動","options":["deny","authorize","investigate","delay"],"sentence":"The manager must ______ any purchase over $5,000. Without her signature of approval, the transaction cannot proceed.","translation":"經理必須批准任何超過5000美元的採購。沒有她的簽名批准，交易無法進行。","word":"authorize"}},"autobiography":{"createdAt":1781581336207,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"autobiography指的是由某人自己撰寫的關於其生活的敘述。","options":["biography","autobiography","memoir","journal"],"sentence":"The famous actor published his ______ last year, sharing personal stories from his childhood and career. Readers were fascinated by his intimate account of becoming a Hollywood star.","translation":"這位著名演員去年出版了他的自傳，分享了他童年和職業生涯的個人故事。讀者對他成為好萊塢明星的親身描述著迷。","word":"autobiography"}},"autograph":{"createdAt":1783261324150,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"autograph 指著名人士的親筆簽名，通常具有收藏價值，是以簽署人本人的筆跡寫下的名字。","options":["portrait","autograph","certificate","diploma"],"sentence":"The famous actor signed her ______ on a photograph for the excited fan. The fan carefully framed the handwritten signature as a treasured memento.","translation":"這位著名演員在一張照片上簽署了她的______給興奮的粉絲。粉絲小心地將這個親筆簽名裱起來作為珍貴的紀念品。","word":"autograph"}},"automatic":{"createdAt":1781581336200,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"automatic表示無需人工干預而自行運作的機器或系統。","options":["sliding","automatic","glass","heavy"],"sentence":"The ______ doors at the mall entrance open and close without any manual effort. Customers simply walk toward the sensor and the system responds instantly.","translation":"購物中心入口的自動門無需任何人工操作就能打開和關閉。顧客只需朝感應器走去，系統就會立即做出反應。","word":"automatic"}},"automatically":{"createdAt":1781581336214,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"automatically是副詞，表示機器或系統自行運作而無需人工干預。","options":["manually","automatically","gradually","eventually"],"sentence":"When you enter the supermarket, the lights turn on ______ without anyone flipping a switch. This motion-sensor technology activates whenever a customer approaches the doors.","translation":"當你進入超市時，燈會自動打開，無需任何人打開開關。每當顧客靠近門時，這種動作傳感器技術就會啟動。","word":"automatically"}},"automobile":{"createdAt":1783327146629,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"automobile 是指四輪的汽車，可以在陸地上行駛，這裡指的是電動車。","options":["airplane","bicycle","automobile","boat"],"sentence":"My father just purchased a new ______ with advanced safety features. The vehicle has an electric engine and can travel 300 miles on a single charge.","translation":"我父親剛購買了一輛具有先進安全功能的新汽車。該車配備電動引擎，單次充電可行駛300英里。","word":"automobile"}},"automotive":{"createdAt":1784106663185,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"automotive是形容詞，意為「與汽車相關的」，用來描述與汽車製造、設計或工業相關的事物。","options":["culinary","automotive","maritime","agricultural"],"sentence":"The company specializes in ______ engineering and produces high-quality car parts. Their latest project involves designing advanced engine systems for electric vehicles.","translation":"該公司專門從事汽車工程，生產高品質的汽車零件。他們最新的項目涉及為電動車設計先進的引擎系統。","word":"automotive"}},"autonomy":{"createdAt":1781665727110,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"autonomy 指自治權或自我管理的能力，強調獨立決定自身事務的權力。","options":["wealth","autonomy","technology","education"],"sentence":"The newly independent nation fought hard to achieve political ______ from foreign powers. They established their own government, laws, and military without external interference.","translation":"這個新獨立的國家為了從外國勢力中獲得政治自治而奮力抗爭。他們建立了自己的政府、法律和軍隊，不受外部干涉。","word":"autonomy"}},"auxiliary":{"createdAt":1785140695727,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"auxiliary 表示輔助的、幫助的或附屬的，用來描述次要但重要的支持角色。","options":["primary","auxiliary","senior","chief"],"sentence":"The hospital hired several ______ staff members to support the main medical team. These workers assisted with patient care but were not licensed physicians or surgeons.","translation":"醫院聘請了幾名輔助人員來支持主要醫療團隊。這些工作人員協助患者護理，但不是執業醫生或外科醫生。","word":"auxiliary"}},"availability":{"createdAt":1781257238302,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"availability指某物是否可得、可獲取或能被使用的狀況。","options":["price","availability","quality","location"],"sentence":"The ______ of concert tickets determined whether fans could attend the show. Since only 100 seats remained and 500 people wanted to buy them, most disappointed fans went home empty-handed.","translation":"演唱會門票的可得性決定了粉絲是否能參加演出。由於只有100個座位剩餘，而500人想購票，大多數失望的粉絲空手而歸。","word":"availability"}},"available":{"createdAt":1782981571687,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"available 表示「可得到的、可用的」，指某物可以被取得或使用，在這裡指房間可以被預訂和使用。","options":["expensive","available","comfortable","large"],"sentence":"The hotel has several rooms ______ for guests this weekend. I need to book one immediately because they are being reserved very quickly.","translation":"飯店這個週末有幾間房間可供客人使用。我需要立即預訂一間，因為它們正在被快速預留。","word":"available"}},"avenge":{"createdAt":1787118100432,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"avenge 指的是為受害者報復或復仇，通過懲罰對方來尋求正義。","options":["celebrate","avenge","forget","question"],"sentence":"The warrior vowed to ______ his fallen brother by defeating the enemy general in combat. He spent years training to become strong enough for this revenge mission.","translation":"這名戰士發誓通過在戰鬥中擊敗敵方將軍來為他陣亡的兄弟報仇。他花了多年時間訓練以變得足夠強大來完成這項復仇任務。","word":"avenge"}},"avenue":{"createdAt":1781485266374,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"avenue除了指街道外，還可以比喻為達成目標的途徑或方法。","options":["dead end","obstacle","avenue","barrier"],"sentence":"The company explored a new ______ to expand their market reach and increase profits. This strategic direction proved successful and brought them valuable new business opportunities.","translation":"公司探索了一條新的途徑來擴大他們的市場覆蓋範圍並增加利潤。這個戰略方向證明是成功的，為他們帶來了寶貴的新商機。","word":"avenue"}},"average":{"createdAt":1781311983487,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"average 表示多個數值的平均值或典型的、中等的水平。","options":["presidential","evolution","average","expressive"],"sentence":"The ______ temperature for this region in July is around 28 degrees Celsius. This figure represents the typical weather conditions most people experience during that summer month.","translation":"這個地區七月的平均溫度約為攝氏28度。這個數字代表了大多數人在那個夏月經歷的典型天氣狀況。","word":"average"}},"avert":{"createdAt":1781595752125,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"avert 作為動詞，表示防止或避免某件不好的事情發生。","options":["cause","create","avert","encourage"],"sentence":"She tried to ______ the accident by slamming on the brakes quickly. Her quick reaction prevented the collision that could have been tragic.","translation":"她通過快速踩剎車試圖防止事故發生。她的快速反應阻止了可能是悲劇性的碰撞。","word":"avert"}},"aviation":{"createdAt":1781272410995,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"aviation指的是航空學、航空工業或飛行術，涉及飛機、飛行和空中運輸的各個方面。","options":["agriculture","architecture","aviation","archaeology"],"sentence":"My brother studied ______ in college and now works as a pilot for an international airline. His degree included courses in aircraft design, aerodynamics, and flight operations.","translation":"我的哥哥在大學裡學習航空學，現在在一家國際航空公司當飛行員。他的學位包括飛機設計、空氣動力學和飛行操作的課程。","word":"aviation"}},"awake":{"createdAt":1781595752119,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"awake 是形容詞，表示清醒的、沒有睡著的狀態。","options":["sleeping","tired","awake","restless"],"sentence":"Even though it was very early in the morning, the baby was fully ______ and alert. The infant had already opened his eyes and was looking around the room.","translation":"儘管天很早，嬰兒已經完全清醒並警覺。嬰兒已經睜開眼睛，四處張望房間。","word":"awake"}},"awaken":{"createdAt":1783323381797,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"awaken 作為動詞可以表示「意識到」或「使人覺醒」，指的是從無知或漠不關心的狀態中清醒過來。","options":["sleep","awaken","escape","deny"],"sentence":"The shocking news helped him ______ to the reality of his situation and the need for immediate change. He realized he could no longer ignore the problems that had been affecting his life for so long.","translation":"這個令人震驚的消息幫助他意識到自己所處處境的現實以及立即改變的必要性。他意識到自己再也不能忽視長期以來一直影響他生活的問題。","word":"awaken"}},"award":{"createdAt":1781256547739,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Award作為動詞表示正式授予或頒發獎品、獎金或榮譽給某人。","options":["withdraw","award","deny","delay"],"sentence":"The university will ______ scholarships to the top ten students based on their academic achievements. The recipients will be announced at the graduation ceremony next month.","translation":"大學將根據學生的學術成就將獎學金頒發給前十名學生。獲獎者將在下個月的畢業典禮上宣佈。","word":"award"}},"aware":{"createdAt":1781256547738,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Aware表示知道、意識到或認識到某事物的存在或事實。","options":["ignorant","aware","uncertain","careless"],"sentence":"She was ______ of the dangers associated with traveling alone in unfamiliar places. Therefore, she always informed her family of her location and carried safety devices with her.","translation":"她知道獨自在陌生地方旅行的危險。因此，她總是將她的位置告知家人，並隨身攜帶安全裝置。","word":"aware"}},"awareness":{"createdAt":1781499075060,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"意識指人們對某個問題或現象的認識和理解程度。","options":["ignorance","denial","awareness","indifference"],"sentence":"The environmental ______ campaign educated people about the dangers of plastic pollution. After seeing the documentary, viewers became concerned about protecting marine ecosystems.","translation":"環保意識運動教育人們了解塑膠污染的危害。看完紀錄片後，觀眾開始關注保護海洋生態系統。","word":"awareness"}},"awe":{"createdAt":1781672973717,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"awe是名詞，表示「敬畏；畏怯」，指對宏偉或令人印象深刻事物的深刻敬畏感。","options":["anger","awe","anxiety","annoyance"],"sentence":"The tourists stood in ______ as they gazed at the ancient pyramid for the first time. The massive stone structure inspired respect and wonder in everyone who saw it.","translation":"遊客們第一次凝視古老金字塔時站著充滿敬畏。巨大的石頭結構激發了每個看到它的人的尊重和驚歎。","word":"awe"}},"awed":{"createdAt":1783005778376,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"awed 意為「感到敬畏」或「被深深打動」，指對某件令人印象深刻的事物感到尊敬和驚嘆。","options":["bored","annoyed","awed","confused"],"sentence":"The tourists were ______ by the magnificent Taj Mahal when they finally stood before it. The building's beauty and architectural perfection left them speechless and deeply moved.","translation":"遊客們被宏偉的泰姬陵震撼了，當他們最終站在它面前時。這座建築的美麗和建築完美性使他們無言以對，深深感動。","word":"awed"}},"awesome":{"createdAt":1781256485495,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"awesome表示令人驚嘆的、非常棒的或令人印象深刻的","options":["boring","terrible","awesome","confusing"],"sentence":"The concert was absolutely ______ and the crowd was amazed by the stunning performance. Everyone left the venue feeling impressed and energized.","translation":"這場音樂會棒極了，觀眾對這場精彩的表演嘆為觀止。每個人都帶著欽佩和充滿活力的感覺離開了場地。","word":"awesome"}},"awful":{"createdAt":1781256485492,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"awful表示非常糟糕的、令人不快的或令人厭惡的","options":["delicious","fresh","awful","creative"],"sentence":"The food at the restaurant was absolutely ______ and we could barely eat it. Our entire dining experience was a complete disappointment.","translation":"餐廳的食物糟透了，我們幾乎吃不下去。我們整個用餐體驗都非常令人失望。","word":"awful"}},"awkward":{"createdAt":1783066793848,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"awkward 是形容詞，表示令人感到不適、尷尬或不自在的情況。","options":["comfortable","peaceful","awkward","pleasant"],"sentence":"There was an ______ silence in the room after he made that inappropriate comment. Everyone felt uncomfortable and didn't know what to say next.","translation":"在他說出那個不恰當的評論後，房間裡陷入了尷尬的沉默。每個人都感到不適，不知道接下來該說什麼。","word":"awkward"}},"babysit":{"createdAt":1781664419995,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"babysit是指臨時照顧別人的孩子，包括日常護理和監督。","options":["visit","babysit","teach","coach"],"sentence":"My older sister agreed to ______ my two younger brothers this weekend. She'll prepare their meals, help with homework, and put them to bed.","translation":"我的姐姐同意這個週末照顧我的兩個弟弟。她會為他們準備飯菜、幫助他們做功課，並讓他們上床睡覺。","word":"babysit"}},"babysitter":{"createdAt":1781664419993,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"babysitter是指臨時受僱照顧別人孩子的人，通常在父母外出時工作。","options":["teacher","babysitter","nurse","coach"],"sentence":"We hired a ______ to watch our children while we went out for dinner. She arrived at 6 PM and stayed until midnight.","translation":"我們雇了一位保母在我們外出吃飯時照看我們的孩子。她在下午6點到達，一直待到午夜。","word":"babysitter"}},"bachelor":{"createdAt":1783262131290,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bachelor在學位方面指學士學位，是大學本科課程完成後授予的學位。","options":["master's","bachelor","doctoral","professional"],"sentence":"After completing his university studies, he received his ______ degree in Engineering. He was now qualified to pursue advanced studies or enter the professional workforce.","translation":"完成大學學業後，他獲得了工程學學士學位。他現在有資格攻讀高級課程或進入專業工作隊伍。","word":"bachelor"}},"backyard":{"createdAt":1781792910177,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"backyard是指房屋後面的私人戶外空間，通常用於休閒和娛樂活動。","options":["park","backyard","playground","garden"],"sentence":"The children played soccer in the ______ behind their house. It was surrounded by a fence and had grass and a swing set.","translation":"孩子們在他們家後面的後院裡踢足球。它被柵欄包圍，有草地和秋千。","word":"backyard"}},"bacteria":{"createdAt":1781935654227,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bacteria 是名詞，表示「細菌」，指肉眼看不見的微小單細胞生物，有些對人體有害。","options":["viruses","bacteria","cells","nutrients"],"sentence":"The laboratory technician examined the sample under a microscope to identify the ______ that caused the infection. The results showed harmful microorganisms present in the patient's blood.","translation":"實驗室技術員在顯微鏡下檢查樣本以識別導致感染的細菌。結果顯示患者血液中存在有害的微生物。","word":"bacteria"}},"bait":{"createdAt":1781836375365,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bait是指放在釣鉤或陷阱上用來吸引魚或動物的餌食。","options":["lure","bait","trap","net"],"sentence":"The fisherman used worms as ______ to catch trout in the river. He placed them on the hook before casting his line into the water.","translation":"漁夫用蟲子作為餌來捕捉河裡的鱒魚。他在投竿前把它們放在鉤子上。","word":"bait"}},"baiting":{"createdAt":1781598671083,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"baiting 作名詞表示誘餌或用餌誘捕的行為，指在釣鉤上放置食物以吸引魚或其他動物","options":["decoration","baiting","shelter","camouflage"],"sentence":"The fisherman used live worms as ______ to catch more fish in the river. He cast his line repeatedly with fresh bait to attract the largest species.","translation":"漁夫用活蟲作誘餌在河裡捕更多魚。他反覆用新鮮的餌料投線以吸引最大的物種。","word":"baiting"}},"balance":{"createdAt":1782959289684,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"balance 在此作為名詞，表示銀行帳戶中的餘額或總金額。","options":["interest","balance","deposit","statement"],"sentence":"I need to check my bank ______ to see how much money I have left. The teller showed me that after my recent deposit, the total amount in my account increased significantly.","translation":"我需要檢查我的銀行餘額，看看我還剩多少錢。櫃員告訴我，在我最近存款後，我帳戶裡的總金額大幅增加。","word":"balance"}},"bald":{"createdAt":1782959282094,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bald是形容詞，表示沒有頭髮或禿頭；在這句話中強調他頭上完全沒有頭髮。","options":["hairy","bald","smooth","wrinkled"],"sentence":"The old man's ______ head reflected the sunlight brightly. He had lost all his hair many years ago due to a medical condition.","translation":"那位老先生禿頭的頭在陽光下閃閃發亮。多年前，他因為一種醫學疾病而失去了所有頭髮。","word":"bald"}},"ballot":{"createdAt":1781499075058,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"不記名投票是選民表達其政治選擇的方式，通常以秘密方式進行。","options":["petition","proposal","ballot","contract"],"sentence":"Citizens cast their ______ to elect the next president of the country. Each voter received a paper form where they marked their choice in complete secrecy.","translation":"公民投票以選舉該國的下一任總統。每位選民都收到了一份紙質表格，在完全保密的情況下標記他們的選擇。","word":"ballot"}},"ban":{"createdAt":1782408103441,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ban 作為名詞表示官方的禁止令或禁止措施，禁止某項活動或產品的使用。","options":["promotion","ban","guide","survey"],"sentence":"The government issued a ______ on plastic bags to reduce environmental pollution. All stores were required to stop distributing single-use plastic bags by the end of the month.","translation":"政府發布了禁止使用塑膠袋的禁令以減少環境污染。所有商店必須在月底前停止發放一次性塑膠袋。","word":"ban"}},"banana":{"createdAt":1784899764061,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"banana是一種黃色的香蕉水果，彎曲形狀，富含營養，是常見的早餐水果。","options":["apple","orange","banana","grape"],"sentence":"She peeled the yellow ______ and ate it for breakfast. This tropical fruit is rich in potassium and provides quick energy.","translation":"她剝開黃色的香蕉，作為早餐吃掉它。這種熱帶水果富含鉀，提供快速能量。","word":"banana"}},"band":{"createdAt":1781792910172,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"band是指一群演奏音樂的人組成的樂隊或樂團，通常規模比管弦樂團小。","options":["solo","band","orchestra","conductor"],"sentence":"The music students formed a ______ to perform at the school concert. They played guitars, drums, and keyboards together as a group.","translation":"音樂學生組成一個樂隊在學校音樂會上表演。他們一起演奏吉他、鼓和鍵盤。","word":"band"}},"bandage":{"createdAt":1781598671068,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bandage 作名詞表示繃帶，是用於覆蓋和保護傷口的醫療用品","options":["cast","bandage","injection","prescription"],"sentence":"After the nurse applied a clean ______ to the wound, she instructed the patient to keep it dry for three days. The patient followed her advice carefully to ensure proper healing.","translation":"護士在傷口上貼了乾淨的繃帶後，指示患者三天內保持乾燥。患者仔細遵循她的建議以確保適當癒合。","word":"bandage"}},"bandwagon":{"createdAt":1781883441462,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"bandwagon 指某種流行的潮流或時尚，人們盲目跟風參與其中","options":["crisis","movement","bandwagon","debate"],"sentence":"Many companies jumped on the sustainability ______ to attract environmentally conscious consumers. Their sudden interest in eco-friendly practices seemed driven more by profit than genuine commitment.","translation":"許多公司跟風做可持續發展的潮流來吸引有環保意識的消費者。他們對環保做法的突然興趣似乎更多是出於利潤而非真正的承諾。","word":"bandwagon"}},"bankrupt":{"createdAt":1781664420007,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bankrupt形容詞表示破產或完全沒有金錢的，通常指無法償還債務。","options":["profitable","bankrupt","successful","expanding"],"sentence":"After years of poor business decisions, the company declared itself ______ and shut down operations. Creditors would receive only a small fraction of what they were owed.","translation":"在多年的糟糕商業決策後，該公司宣布破產並停止運營。債權人只會收到他們應得金額的一小部分。","word":"bankrupt"}},"bankruptcy":{"createdAt":1785140695727,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"bankruptcy 是指企業或個人的資不抵債狀態，無法償還債務，導致法律上的破產。","options":["bankruptcy","expansion","merger","profit"],"sentence":"The failing company declared ______ after losing millions of dollars in bad investments. All of its assets were liquidated to pay back creditors as much as possible.","translation":"這家衰落的公司在一筆不良投資中損失數百萬美元後宣布破產。其所有資產被清算以盡可能多地償還債權人。","word":"bankruptcy"}},"banner":{"createdAt":1781598671080,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"banner 作名詞表示橫幅或橫布條，是掛起來進行宣傳或示威的大型布料","options":["sign","banner","poster","flag"],"sentence":"The activist group displayed a large ______ across the city hall building to protest government policies. The bold lettering was visible from several blocks away.","translation":"激進分子團體在市政廳大樓上展示了一條大橫幅以抗議政府政策。粗體字可以從幾個街區外看到。","word":"banner"}},"banquet":{"createdAt":1781336858151,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"banquet 是指一場正式的、豪華的宴會，通常為特殊場合舉辦，有多道菜餚和許多賓客。","options":["fight","breakfast","banquet","interview"],"sentence":"The ______ lasted for three hours with multiple courses and fine wines. The president's speech at the end congratulated all the distinguished guests for their contributions.","translation":"這場宴會持續了三個小時，包括多道菜餚和美酒。總統在結束時的演講祝賀了所有尊貴賓客的貢獻。","word":"banquet"}},"barbarian":{"createdAt":1782959314428,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"barbarian 指的是被認為沒有文明教養或未開化的人，特別是來自不同文化背景的人。","options":["scholar","barbarian","warrior","merchant"],"sentence":"The ancient Romans considered any foreigner who didn't speak Latin or follow their customs to be a ______. These people were viewed as uncivilized and lacking in education or refinement.","translation":"古羅馬人認為任何不說拉丁語或不遵循他們習俗的外國人都是野蠻人。這些人被認為是未開化的，缺乏教育或修養的人。","word":"barbarian"}},"bare":{"createdAt":1783301575275,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bare 意為裸露的、空蕩蕩的，用來形容沒有覆蓋物或裝飾的表面。","options":["decorated","bare","furnished","covered"],"sentence":"The old wooden floor was completely ______ after they removed all the carpeting. The children could see nothing but the raw planks of wood beneath their feet.","translation":"移除所有地毯後，那條老舊木質地板完全裸露。孩子們只能看到腳下原始的木板。","word":"bare"}},"barely":{"createdAt":1781860901466,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"barely是副詞，表示幾乎不、勉強地，強調剛好達到標準或幾近失敗","options":["clearly","barely","comfortably","easily"],"sentence":"The student ______ passed the exam with a score of 51 out of 100. He needed at least 50 points to graduate, so he made it by the smallest margin.","translation":"這名學生勉強以100分中的51分通過考試。他需要至少50分才能畢業，所以他以最小的差距成功了。","word":"barely"}},"bargain":{"createdAt":1781664420003,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bargain表示便宜的交易或划算的購買，以低於正常價格獲得商品。","options":["loss","bargain","expense","waste"],"sentence":"She found a great ______ at the thrift store—a designer handbag for only five dollars. It was in perfect condition and normally would have cost hundreds.","translation":"她在舊貨店找到了一個很好的便宜貨—一個名牌手提包只要五塊錢。它的狀況完美，通常要花費數百元。","word":"bargain"}},"bargaining":{"createdAt":1783301575280,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"bargaining 意為談判或討價還價的過程，指買賣雙方為了達成更有利的交易條件而進行的協商。","options":["agreement","silence","bargaining","conversation"],"sentence":"The customer and the shopkeeper engaged in intense ______ over the price of the antique vase. They went back and forth for twenty minutes, each trying to get a better deal.","translation":"顧客和店主為古董花瓶的價格進行了激烈的討價還價。他們來回爭論了二十分鐘，每個人都想獲得更好的交易。","word":"bargaining"}},"bark":{"createdAt":1782980445596,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"bark 在此句中表示「吠叫聲」，指狗發出的尖銳、響亮的聲音。","options":["collar","tail","bark","fur"],"sentence":"The dog's loud ______ woke up the entire neighborhood at midnight. The sound was aggressive and repeated continuously.","translation":"狗在午夜的大聲吠叫聲吵醒了整個社區。這聲音是咄咄逼人且不斷重複的。","word":"bark"}},"barn":{"createdAt":1781664419992,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"barn是指用來儲存農作物和農具的建築物，通常位於農場上。","options":["house","barn","market","garage"],"sentence":"The farmer stored hay and grain in the old ______ on his property. The structure had large wooden doors and was painted red.","translation":"農民在他的田產上的舊穀倉裡儲存乾草和穀物。這座建築有大木門，被漆成紅色。","word":"barn"}},"barrel":{"createdAt":1781425024015,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"barrel是指大型木製或金屬容器，用來儲存液體或其他物品，通常比瓶子大得多。","options":["bottle","barrel","tank","cask"],"sentence":"The old wooden ______ in the cellar contained vintage wine that had been aging for decades. We carefully rolled it across the stone floor without spilling a single drop of its precious liquid.","translation":"地窖裡的舊木桶裡裝著已陳年數十年的葡萄酒。我們小心地在石地板上滾動它，沒有灑出一滴珍貴的液體。","word":"barrel"}},"barren":{"createdAt":1781664419997,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"barren形容詞表示不毛之地或無法生長植物的地方，引申為貧瘠的。","options":["fertile","barren","green","lush"],"sentence":"The ______ desert stretched for hundreds of miles with no vegetation visible anywhere. Explorers struggled to find water or any signs of life.","translation":"貧瘠的沙漠綿延數百英里，看不到任何植物。探險家們努力尋找水或任何生命的跡象。","word":"barren"}},"barrier":{"createdAt":1781704395610,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"barrier表示「障礙」或「阻礙」，指阻止進展或溝通的事物或情況","options":["adoption","tension","barrier","threshold"],"sentence":"Language differences created a significant ______ between the two international teams trying to collaborate. They eventually hired a professional translator to bridge the communication gap.","translation":"語言差異在試圖合作的兩個國際團隊之間造成了顯著的障礙。他們最終聘請了專業翻譯來橋接溝通差距。","word":"barrier"}},"base":{"createdAt":1781664419998,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"base可指軍事基地或根據地，是進行活動的中心地點。","options":["camp","base","tent","fort"],"sentence":"The team built their military ______ in the valley for strategic advantage. From this location, soldiers could easily defend against enemy attacks from all directions.","translation":"該隊在山谷裡建立了軍事基地以獲得戰略優勢。從這個位置，士兵們可以輕易地防禦來自各個方向的敵人攻擊。","word":"base"}},"basic":{"createdAt":1782980445619,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"basic 在此句中表示「基礎的、基本的」，指最簡單和最重要的基礎知識。","options":["advanced","complex","basic","difficult"],"sentence":"Learning ______ math skills is essential before advancing to algebra. You must master addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division.","translation":"在進進階到代數之前，學習基礎數學技能是必要的。你必須掌握加減乘除。","word":"basic"}},"basically":{"createdAt":1781664420006,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"basically是副詞，表示根本上或基本上，用於簡化復雜的信息。","options":["Confusingly","Basically","Mysteriously","Ironically"],"sentence":"______, the project requires three main steps: planning, execution, and review. The other details can be worked out as we progress.","translation":"基本上，這個項目需要三個主要步驟：規劃、執行和審查。其他細節可以在進展過程中逐步解決。","word":"basically"}},"basin":{"createdAt":1781595752118,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"basin 是指用來盛水的盆或碗，通常用於洗漱等日常活動。","options":["bucket","basin","cup","pitcher"],"sentence":"She filled the ______ with water to wash her hands. The ceramic bowl held about two liters of liquid and had a wide opening.","translation":"她用水填滿水盆來洗手。陶製的碗可以容納約兩升液體，開口很寬。","word":"basin"}},"basis":{"createdAt":1781860901467,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"basis表示基礎或基準，指某事物賴以建立或存在的根本","options":["destruction","basis","weakness","conflict"],"sentence":"The ______ of their friendship was built on mutual trust and shared interests. They bonded over their love of reading and hiking.","translation":"他們友誼的基礎建立在相互信任和共同興趣之上。他們因對閱讀和登山的熱愛而結合。","word":"basis"}},"batter":{"createdAt":1781835517797,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"batter 意為接連猛打或反覆擊打，通常用於描述暴力或激烈的打擊行為。","options":["encourage","batter","welcome","support"],"sentence":"The boxer continued to ______ his opponent with powerful punches throughout the match. Each strike was delivered with tremendous force and intensity.","translation":"這位拳擊手在整場比賽中繼續用強大的拳擊猛打對手。每一次打擊都充滿了巨大的力量和強度。","word":"batter"}},"battered":{"createdAt":1781664420001,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"battered形容詞表示被打傷或飽受摧殘，看起來受到了長期的損壞。","options":["new","battered","clean","modern"],"sentence":"The old ______ suitcase had been through dozens of trips around the world. Its corners were dented, its handle was worn, and the locks barely functioned.","translation":"那只舊的飽受摧殘的手提箱經歷過數十次世界各地的旅行。它的角被撞凹了，把手磨損了，鎖幾乎無法正常工作。","word":"battered"}},"battle":{"createdAt":1781664420000,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"battle是戰役或戰鬥，指武裝衝突或爭鬥。","options":["discussion","battle","meeting","celebration"],"sentence":"The two armies fought in a fierce ______ that lasted from dawn until dusk. Hundreds of soldiers were wounded or killed in the conflict.","translation":"兩支軍隊在一場從黎明到黃昏的激烈戰役中交戰。數百名士兵在衝突中受傷或陣亡。","word":"battle"}},"bay":{"createdAt":1781883441462,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"bay 是指被陸地部分包圍的大片水域，通常是海岸邊的開放區域","options":["ocean","river","bay","strait"],"sentence":"The pirates hid their ship in a sheltered ______ surrounded by tall cliffs. The protected inlet kept their vessel safe from storms and enemy detection.","translation":"海盜把船隻藏在被高聳懸崖包圍的海灣裡。受保護的海灣入口使他們的船隻免受風暴和敵人偵測的危害。","word":"bay"}},"bead":{"createdAt":1781664420006,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bead是珠子，通常用於製作珠寶或裝飾品。","options":["stone","bead","coin","button"],"sentence":"She threaded tiny ______ onto a string to create a beautiful necklace. Each ______ was a different color, arranged in a perfect pattern.","translation":"她把小珠子穿在繩子上製作漂亮的項鍊。每顆珠子都是不同的顏色，排列成完美的圖案。","word":"bead"}},"beam":{"createdAt":1781359980248,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"beam作為名詞指光線、光束或光柱；特指一條直線的、集中的光線或粒子流。","options":["shadow","beam","reflection","filter"],"sentence":"A ______ of sunlight streamed through the window and illuminated the entire room. The golden light created a beautiful pattern on the wooden floor.","translation":"一束陽光透過窗戶射進來，照亮了整個房間。金色的光線在木地板上創造了美麗的圖案。","word":"beam"}},"bear":{"createdAt":1781582619550,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"bear 在此意為承受或忍受（困難、責任或負擔），表示承載和承受的能力。","options":["avoid","ignore","bear","refuse"],"sentence":"The mother had to ______ the heavy responsibility of raising her children alone after her husband passed away. She worked multiple jobs to provide food, shelter, and education for her family.","translation":"母親在丈夫去世後必須獨自承受撫養孩子的沉重責任。她做多份工作以為家人提供食物、住所和教育。","word":"bear"}},"bearing":{"createdAt":1781257238305,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bearing指人的舉止、風度或姿態，反映了一個人的行為表現和氣質。","options":["weight","bearing","costume","voice"],"sentence":"The elderly gentleman's dignified ______ impressed everyone in the room. His posture was straight, his movements were graceful, and he spoke with confidence and respect.","translation":"這位年邁紳士的高尚舉止給房間裡的每個人都留下了深刻印象。他的姿態筆直，動作優雅，說話時充滿信心和尊重。","word":"bearing"}},"beat":{"createdAt":1782980445618,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"beat 在此句中表示「打敗、贏過」，指在競賽中超過對手或獲勝。","options":["join","support","beat","watch"],"sentence":"Our team managed to ______ the defending champions in the final match. It was an unexpected victory that surprised everyone.","translation":"我們的球隊在決賽中設法擊敗了衛冕冠軍。這是一場出乎意料的勝利，讓每個人都感到驚訝。","word":"beat"}},"beaten":{"createdAt":1782959314429,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"beaten 是 beat 的過去分詞，表示在競爭或比賽中被擊敗或輸掉。","options":["tired","beaten","injured","confused"],"sentence":"The sports team felt devastated after being ______ by their rivals in the championship game. Despite their best efforts and strong preparation, they ultimately lost by twenty points.","translation":"運動隊在錦標賽中被對手打敗後感到沮喪。儘管他們盡力準備充分，但最終還是以二十分的差距輸掉了比賽。","word":"beaten"}},"beetle":{"createdAt":1781664419997,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"beetle是甲蟲，一種有硬殼翅膀的昆蟲。","options":["butterfly","beetle","bee","ant"],"sentence":"A large black ______ crawled across the garden path near the flowers. The insect had a hard shell and six legs like all members of its species.","translation":"一隻大黑甲蟲爬過花園小徑旁邊。這種昆蟲有硬殼和六條腿，就像它同類的所有成員一樣。","word":"beetle"}},"beforehand":{"createdAt":1782959282103,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"beforehand是副詞，表示事先或預先進行某事；在這句話中指在會議開始前提早做好準備工作。","options":["later","beforehand","yesterday","suddenly"],"sentence":"We need to prepare all the materials ______ so that everything is ready for the meeting. The presentation starts in one hour, so we have no time to gather things at the last minute.","translation":"我們需要事先準備好所有的材料，以便會議時一切就緒。簡報在一小時後開始，所以我們沒有時間在最後一刻才收集東西。","word":"beforehand"}},"beggar":{"createdAt":1781664420004,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"beggar是乞丐，指向他人乞討或要求施捨的人。","options":["merchant","beggar","musician","vendor"],"sentence":"A poor ______ sat on the street corner asking passersby for spare change. He had been homeless for several years.","translation":"一個窮乞丐坐在街角向行人乞討零錢。他已經無家可歸好幾年了。","word":"beggar"}},"behalf":{"createdAt":1781601735989,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"「behalf」表示代表某人或為了某人的利益，通常與「on behalf of」搭配使用，表示代表他人採取行動。","options":["behalf","authority","behalf","expense"],"sentence":"The lawyer spoke on ______ of his client during the court hearing. He presented arguments and evidence to defend the defendant's interests.","translation":"律師在法庭聽證會上代表他的委託人發言。他提出了論點和證據來為被告的利益辯護。","word":"behalf"}},"behave":{"createdAt":1782265478232,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"behave 指某人的行為舉止或表現方式，特別是在社交情境或特定規則下的表現。","options":["perform","discover","behave","enjoy"],"sentence":"The young children must ______ properly during the formal ceremony at the palace. They have been given strict instructions to sit quietly and follow all the etiquette rules.","translation":"年幼的孩子在宮殿的正式典禮中必須表現得得體。他們已獲得嚴格指示要安靜坐著並遵循所有禮儀規則。","word":"behave"}},"behavior":{"createdAt":1781792910185,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"behavior是指一個人的行為舉止和所有外顯的動作表現，包括言語和身體行為。","options":["appearance","behavior","schedule","homework"],"sentence":"The teacher was concerned about the student's ______ in class. He was constantly disrupting lessons, talking back to authority, and not following rules.","translation":"老師對這名學生在課堂上的行為感到擔憂。他不斷打擾上課、頂嘴和不遵守規則。","word":"behavior"}},"behavioral":{"createdAt":1781664420003,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"behavioral形容詞指與行為或舉止相關的，通常用於心理學或教育領域。","options":["physical","behavioral","nutritional","financial"],"sentence":"The psychologist studied ______ patterns in children to understand how they learn and develop. She observed their interactions during play sessions.","translation":"心理學家研究兒童的行為模式以了解他們如何學習和發展。她在遊戲過程中觀察了他們的互動。","word":"behavioral"}},"belong":{"createdAt":1781664420003,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"belong動詞表示歸屬於或屬於某人，表達所有權或歸屬關係。","options":["fit","belong","matter","appear"],"sentence":"This book doesn't ______ to me; it must ______ to someone else in the library. I'll return it to the lost and found.","translation":"這本書不屬於我；它一定屬於圖書館裡的其他人。我會把它交給失物招領處。","word":"belong"}},"belongings":{"createdAt":1781664420002,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"belongings是名詞複數，指某人擁有的個人物品或財產。","options":["furniture","belongings","decorations","equipment"],"sentence":"When she moved to a new apartment, she packed all her ______ into cardboard boxes. Her clothes, books, and personal items filled the entire truck.","translation":"當她搬到新公寓時，她把所有的物品裝進紙箱。她的衣服、書籍和個人物品裝滿了整輛卡車。","word":"belongings"}},"beloved":{"createdAt":1781664420005,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"beloved形容詞表示深受喜愛的或心愛的，通常用於形容受人尊敬的人。","options":["disliked","beloved","new","absent"],"sentence":"The ______ teacher retired after forty years of service to the school. Students gathered to celebrate her career and express their gratitude.","translation":"這位深受喜愛的教師在為學校服務四十年後退休。學生們聚在一起慶祝她的事業並表達感謝。","word":"beloved"}},"bend":{"createdAt":1781841148118,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bend 動詞意思是使彎曲、彎腰，指改變直線形狀或向下傾身的動作。","options":["straighten","bend","lift","stretch"],"sentence":"The acrobat had to ______ her body into impossible positions during the circus performance. She twisted and contorted herself so extremely that her head nearly touched her knees.","translation":"雜技演員必須在馬戲團表演中將身體彎曲成不可能的姿勢。她扭轉自己的身體到極端，使得她的頭幾乎接觸到膝蓋。","word":"bend"}},"beneath":{"createdAt":1781336858149,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"beneath 是介詞，表示在某物的下方或下面，通常帶有被覆蓋或隱藏的含義。","options":["above","beside","beneath","within"],"sentence":"The ancient ruins lay ______ the surface of the desert sand. Archaeologists used special equipment to excavate the buried structures from deep underground.","translation":"古代遺跡位於沙漠沙子表面的下方。考古學家使用特殊設備從地下深處挖掘埋藏的結構。","word":"beneath"}},"beneficial":{"createdAt":1783304704920,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"beneficial 是形容詞，表示「有益的、有幫助的」，用來描述對某人或某事產生積極影響或好處的事物。","options":["harmful","beneficial","neutral","irrelevant"],"sentence":"Regular exercise is ______ for your physical and mental health. Studies show that people who exercise consistently have lower stress levels and better overall wellness.","translation":"定期運動對你的身體和心理健康是有益的。研究表明，經常運動的人的壓力水平較低，整體健康狀況更好。","word":"beneficial"}},"benefit":{"createdAt":1781437435166,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"benefit 作為動詞表示有益於或對某人有好處；作為名詞表示利益或優勢。","options":["harm","benefit","confuse","ignore"],"sentence":"Regular exercise can greatly ______ your physical and mental health over time. Studies show that people who exercise consistently enjoy lower stress levels and better energy.","translation":"定期運動可以大大有益於你隨著時間推移的身體和心理健康。研究表明，經常運動的人享受更低的壓力水平和更好的能量。","word":"benefit"}},"beside":{"createdAt":1781672973721,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"beside作為前置詞表示「在…旁邊；在…附近」，指兩人或兩物相鄰的空間位置。","options":["beyond","beside","between","below"],"sentence":"She sat ______ her grandmother on the park bench, holding her hand gently. They enjoyed the peaceful moment together, listening to the birds sing.","translation":"她坐在她祖母身邊的公園長凳上，輕輕握著她的手。他們一起享受寧靜的時刻，聆聽鳥兒唱歌。","word":"beside"}},"besides":{"createdAt":1781672973719,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"besides作為前置詞表示「除…之外；再加上」，用來列舉額外的事項。","options":["Despite","Besides","Between","Behind"],"sentence":"______ studying mathematics, she also excels in literature and history. Her well-rounded education made her one of the most accomplished students in her class.","translation":"除了學習數學，她在文學和歷史方面也表現出色。她全面的教育使她成為班級中最優秀的學生之一。","word":"besides"}},"besiege":{"createdAt":1781417610416,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"besiege可以指用大量的事物圍困或騷擾某人，使其受到困擾。","options":["praise","ignore","besiege","motivate"],"sentence":"Complaints from customers continued to ______ the company's management every single day. The overwhelming volume of grievances made it impossible for executives to focus on other business matters.","translation":"顧客的投訴每天都在不斷地煩擾公司的管理層。大量的抱怨使主管們無法專注於其他業務事項。","word":"besiege"}},"betray":{"createdAt":1781709854486,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"betray（背叛）指對國家或他人不忠，與selling secrets to the enemy（向敵人出售秘密）和treacherous actions（叛國行為）的語境直接相關。","options":["betray","protect","defend","support"],"sentence":"The spy agreed to ______ his country by selling classified military secrets to the enemy. His treacherous actions resulted in the capture of innocent soldiers and the loss of strategic advantage.","translation":"間諜通過向敵人出售機密軍事情報同意背叛他的國家。他的叛國行為導致無辜士兵被俘虜，戰略優勢喪失。","word":"betray"}},"betrayal":{"createdAt":1781613113009,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"betrayal 表示背叛、違背信任或出賣某人的行為","options":["loyalty","betrayal","support","honesty"],"sentence":"His ______ of his best friend was the most painful decision he ever made. Finding out that he had revealed confidential secrets to their enemies broke the friendship forever.","translation":"他對最好朋友的背叛是他做過最痛苦的決定。發現他向敵人透露了機密秘密永遠破壞了這段友誼。","word":"betrayal"}},"beware":{"createdAt":1781792910182,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"beware是動詞，意思是「當心」或「提防」，用來警告他人注意危險。","options":["welcome","beware","enjoy","admire"],"sentence":"The sign read \"______ of the dog\" at the entrance to the property. The owner wanted visitors to know that a dangerous animal lived there.","translation":"入口處的標誌寫著「當心狗」。房主想讓訪客知道這裡住著一隻危險的動物。","word":"beware"}},"bewilder":{"createdAt":1784212160304,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bewilder指的是使某人感到困惑、迷茫或不知所措，通常因為信息複雜或情況令人困擾。","options":["guide","bewilder","motivate","encourage"],"sentence":"The complex instructions seemed to ______ the new employees on their first day of work. They stood confused in the training room, unable to understand what they were supposed to do next.","translation":"複雜的指示似乎在新員工的第一天工作時使他們感到困惑。他們站在訓練室裡感到困惑，無法理解他們接下來應該做什麼。","word":"bewilder"}},"beyond":{"createdAt":1781362281656,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"beyond表示在...更遠處或超越某個限度。","options":["within","beyond","beside","along"],"sentence":"The mountain range extends far ______ what we can see from this valley. The peaks continue for hundreds of kilometers into the distance.","translation":"山脈延伸到我們從這個山谷看不到的地方。這些山峰繼續向遠處延伸數百公里。","word":"beyond"}},"bias":{"createdAt":1781672973733,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bias是名詞，表示「成見；偏見」，指對人或事物的不公正或不理性的傾向。","options":["fairness","bias","kindness","patience"],"sentence":"The judge's ______ towards the wealthy defendant was evident in his lenient verdict. Critics argued that justice should be fair to everyone regardless of their economic status.","translation":"法官對富有被告的偏見在他寬恕的判決中顯而易見。評論者辯稱司法應該對每個人都公平，無論其經濟地位如何。","word":"bias"}},"biased":{"createdAt":1781613113016,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"biased 形容有成見、偏見或不公正的態度","options":["fair","biased","careful","reasonable"],"sentence":"The judge was criticized for making a ______ decision that favored the wealthy defendant. His prejudice against poor people clearly influenced his verdict.","translation":"法官因做出有利於富有被告的成見決定而受到批評。他對窮人的偏見明顯影響了他的判決。","word":"biased"}},"bilateral":{"createdAt":1781484539655,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"bilateral 表示涉及或由兩方面組成，強調雙方的平等合作和相互同意，常用於國際協議和關係。","options":["unilateral","trilateral","bilateral","multilateral"],"sentence":"The two countries signed a ______ trade agreement to benefit both nations equally. Neither country had power over the other in this mutual arrangement.","translation":"兩個國家簽署了一項雙邊貿易協議，使兩個國家都受益平等。在這個互利的安排中，任何一個國家都沒有優勢。","word":"bilateral"}},"bin":{"createdAt":1781613113025,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"bin 是垃圾桶或容器，用於存放廢棄物品","options":["drawer","shelf","bin","cup"],"sentence":"He threw the empty soda can into the ______ after finishing his drink. The recycling receptacle was conveniently located near the park bench.","translation":"他喝完飲料後將空罐扔進了垃圾桶。回收容器方便地位於公園長椅附近。","word":"bin"}},"bind":{"createdAt":1781779647043,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bind表示用繩子或其他物品捆綁或束縛某物","options":["separate","bind","open","paint"],"sentence":"We need to ______ these boxes together with rope. The delivery company requires all packages to be secured for transport.","translation":"我們需要用繩子將這些盒子綁在一起。快遞公司要求所有包裹在運輸時必須固定好。","word":"bind"}},"biodegradable":{"createdAt":1781437528473,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"biodegradable 表示能被微生物分解並回歸自然環境，通常用來描述環保的材料。","options":["durable","biodegradable","flexible","waterproof"],"sentence":"These ______ plastic bags will break down naturally within a few months. Unlike regular plastics that take hundreds of years to decompose, this material was specifically designed to return to the earth quickly.","translation":"這些可生物分解的塑膠袋將在幾個月內自然分解。與需要數百年才能分解的普通塑膠不同，這種材料是專門設計來快速回歸自然的。","word":"biodegradable"}},"biography":{"createdAt":1781613113008,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"biography 是傳記，記述某人真實的人生故事和經歷","options":["novel","article","biography","diary"],"sentence":"The author spent five years writing a detailed ______ of the famous musician. The book covered every major event in his life from childhood until his death.","translation":"作者花了五年時間寫一部關於著名音樂家的詳細傳記。這本書涵蓋了他從童年到去世的每一個重要事件。","word":"biography"}},"biology":{"createdAt":1781664419994,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"biology是研究生命和生物體的科學學科。","options":["chemistry","biology","physics","geology"],"sentence":"Sarah chose to study ______ in university because she was fascinated by living organisms. She spent hours in the laboratory examining cells under microscopes.","translation":"莎拉選擇在大學裡研究生物學，因為她對生物體很著迷。她花了數小時在實驗室裡用顯微鏡檢查細胞。","word":"biology"}},"biscuit":{"createdAt":1781257238303,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"biscuit指一種烘焙的、通常是酥脆的麵粉製食品，可以甜也可以鹹。","options":["sandwich","biscuit","soup","salad"],"sentence":"For breakfast, Tom enjoyed a warm ______ with butter and jam. He ate the crispy, golden-brown pastry in just two bites.","translation":"早餐時，湯姆享用了一塊塗有黃油和果醬的溫暖餅乾。他兩口就吃完了這個酥脆的金黃色烘焙食品。","word":"biscuit"}},"bitter":{"createdAt":1781792910184,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bitter在這裡表示因失望或不公平待遇而產生的持久怨恨和極為不滿的情感。","options":["happy","bitter","neutral","indifferent"],"sentence":"She felt ______ about losing the promotion to her colleague. She couldn't forget the disappointment and harbored negative feelings for months.","translation":"她對失去升職機會給了同事而感到怨恨。她無法忘記失望，並在幾個月內心懷不滿。","word":"bitter"}},"bizarre":{"createdAt":1783141117691,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"bizarre 是形容詞，表示「怪誕的、罕見的、異乎尋常的」，用來描述令人驚訝或不尋常的事物。","options":["boring","beautiful","bizarre","balanced"],"sentence":"The artist's ______ sculptures made headlines at the modern art exhibition. Visitors were shocked by the unusual shapes and unexpected materials, which looked nothing like anything they had ever seen before.","translation":"這位藝術家的怪誕雕塑在現代藝術展覽上成為頭條新聞。參觀者被不尋常的形狀和意想不到的材料所震驚，看起來完全不像他們以前見過的任何東西。","word":"bizarre"}},"blackmail":{"createdAt":1783516186773,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blackmail 是指用威脅或揭露隱私的方式強制他人給予金錢或好處的犯罪行為。","options":["negotiate","blackmail","persuade","communicate"],"sentence":"The criminal tried to ______ the politician by threatening to release damaging photos. The extortion scheme involved demanding money in exchange for silence.","translation":"那名罪犯試圖透過威脅要公開損害名譽的照片來敲詐該政治人物。這項勒索計劃涉及要求金錢以換取沉默。","word":"blackmail"}},"blackout":{"createdAt":1781664420004,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blackout是指大範圍停電或電力中斷的情況。","options":["sunrise","blackout","celebration","parade"],"sentence":"The entire city experienced a ______ when the power plant malfunctioned. All the streets went dark and traffic lights stopped working.","translation":"當發電廠故障時，整個城市經歷了停電。所有街道都陷入黑暗，紅綠燈停止工作。","word":"blackout"}},"blade":{"createdAt":1781484415207,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blade是指刀具或工具的切割部分，通常是鋒利的扁平部分。","options":["handle","blade","blade","tip"],"sentence":"He carefully sharpened the ______ of his knife before cutting the vegetables. The razor-sharp edge made slicing through the tomatoes effortless.","translation":"他在切蔬菜前仔細磨尖了他的刀片。鋒利的邊緣使切番茄變得毫不費力。","word":"blade"}},"blame":{"createdAt":1782959314430,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blame 作為動詞，表示將責任或過錯歸於某人或某事，通常用於負面情況。","options":["praise","blame","focus","report"],"sentence":"The manager decided to ______ the project failure on poor communication among team members. However, she acknowledged that she should have monitored the situation more carefully.","translation":"經理決定將項目失敗歸咎於團隊成員之間溝通不良。然而，她承認自己應該更仔細地監控情況。","word":"blame"}},"blank":{"createdAt":1783141117693,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blank 作為形容詞，表示「空白的」，指沒有填寫或寫入任何內容的空間。","options":["filled","blank","printed","colored"],"sentence":"The form had several ______ spaces where applicants needed to write their personal information. Please fill in your name, address, and contact details in each empty area provided.","translation":"該表單有幾個空白位置，申請者需要在那裡填寫個人信息。請在所提供的每個空白區域填寫您的姓名、地址和聯繫方式。","word":"blank"}},"blanket":{"createdAt":1781613113010,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blanket 作為名詞指毛毯或毯子，用來保暖","options":["pillow","blanket","curtain","rug"],"sentence":"She wrapped herself in a warm ______ to stay cozy on the cold winter night. The thick woolen cover was perfect for keeping her comfortable while she slept.","translation":"她用溫暖的毛毯包裹自己，在寒冷的冬夜保持舒適。厚重的羊毛覆蓋物非常適合讓她睡覺時舒服。","word":"blanket"}},"blare":{"createdAt":1781425024016,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blare是指發出刺耳、刺鼻、令人不快的大聲音，通常用來描述喇叭或警報等聲音。","options":["whisper","blare","hum","beep"],"sentence":"The car horns began to ______ loudly as traffic backed up on the highway during rush hour. The deafening noise was so piercing and harsh that everyone covered their ears in discomfort.","translation":"車子喇叭在尖峰時段高速公路交通堵塞時開始發出刺耳的聲音。這震耳欲聾的噪音如此刺耳刺鼻，以至於每個人都摀住耳朵感到不舒服。","word":"blare"}},"blast":{"createdAt":1782646755359,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blast 作為動詞，指的是用爆炸物進行的破壞或爆破行動。","options":["demolish","blast","destroy","remove"],"sentence":"The construction team used explosives to ______ the old tunnel through the mountain. The controlled detonation was necessary to clear the way for the new railway.","translation":"施工隊使用炸藥來爆破山中的舊隧道。這次受控的引爆對於為新鐵路開路是必要的。","word":"blast"}},"blasted":{"createdAt":1782959314430,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blasted 表示被爆炸或爆破所摧毀，或用作感嘆詞表示惱怒、詛咒，這裡指被砲火炸毀的。","options":["old","blasted","abandoned","damaged"],"sentence":"The ______ building stood as a tragic reminder of the war that had devastated the city. Its walls were full of holes and rubble scattered across the surrounding area.","translation":"被炸毀的建築物是戰爭蹂躪城市的悲劇提醒。它的牆壁滿是洞孔，碎石散落在周圍地區。","word":"blasted"}},"blaze":{"createdAt":1781746848181,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blaze 表示「烈火」或「熊熊燃燒」，描述強烈而明亮的火焰現象。","options":["breeze","blaze","drizzle","shadow"],"sentence":"The forest fire created a massive ______ that could be seen from miles away. The intense heat and bright flames illuminated the entire night sky.","translation":"森林火災造成了一場大火，從幾英里外都能看到。強烈的熱度和明亮的火焰照亮了整個夜空。","word":"blaze"}},"blazing":{"createdAt":1781840667143,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blazing用來形容極其炎熱、明亮或強烈的事物，特別是光線或火焰的強度。","options":["cold","blazing","distant","pale"],"sentence":"The ______ sun beat down on the desert, making it almost impossible to see. The temperature reached 50 degrees Celsius that day.","translation":"烈日驕陽照射在沙漠上，使得幾乎無法看清。那天氣溫達到攝氏50度。","word":"blazing"}},"bleach":{"createdAt":1781429945500,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bleach 作為動詞表示使褪色或使色彩變淡，通常由於陽光或化學物質的作用。","options":["strengthen","bleach","protect","darken"],"sentence":"The strong sunlight will ______ the colors of your curtains if you leave them in the window for too long. After just a few months, the vibrant red fabric had faded to a pale pink.","translation":"如果你長時間把窗簾放在窗邊，強烈的陽光會使它褪色。僅僅幾個月後，鮮豔的紅色布料就褪成了淡粉紅色。","word":"bleach"}},"bleached":{"createdAt":1782959314431,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bleached 表示被漂白或褪色，通常因為暴露在陽光、化學物質或其他物質下，顏色變淡或消褪。","options":["painted","bleached","reinforced","treated"],"sentence":"The old wooden fence had become ______ from years of exposure to intense sunlight and harsh weather. Its original dark brown color had completely faded to a pale, washed-out appearance.","translation":"這座老木籬笆經過多年的烈日和惡劣天氣暴露後，已經漂白褪色。它原來深棕色已完全褪成蒼白、洗淡的外觀。","word":"bleached"}},"bleak":{"createdAt":1786357407252,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"bleak 表示「荒涼的、陰冷的、黯淡的」，用來形容令人沮喪且缺乏溫暖或希望的環境或景象。","options":["vibrant","fertile","bleak","peaceful"],"sentence":"The landscape became increasingly ______ as winter approached and all vegetation died away. Snow and barren hills stretched endlessly across the horizon without a single tree or sign of life.","translation":"隨著冬天臨近且所有植被都枯死了，景觀變得越來越荒涼。白雪和光禿的丘陵無止盡地延伸開去，沒有一棵樹或任何生命的跡象。","word":"bleak"}},"bleed":{"createdAt":1781672973729,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bleed是動詞，表示「流血；出血」，指血液從身體傷口流出。","options":["heal","bleed","itch","fade"],"sentence":"After the accident, the wound began to ______ heavily and wouldn't stop. He rushed to the hospital to get medical attention immediately.","translation":"事故發生後，傷口開始大量流血，停不下來。他立即衝往醫院尋求醫療救助。","word":"bleed"}},"blend":{"createdAt":1781272410984,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blend是指將不同的物質或成分混合在一起，使其成為一個整體。","options":["separate","blend","bake","measure"],"sentence":"The chef will ______ the flour, eggs, and milk to create the cake batter. After stirring for several minutes, all ingredients become a smooth, uniform mixture.","translation":"廚師將麵粉、雞蛋和牛奶混合在一起製作蛋糕麵糊。攪拌幾分鐘後，所有材料變成光滑均勻的混合物。","word":"blend"}},"blended":{"createdAt":1781664419999,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blended是blend的過去式或形容詞，表示混合或混在一起。","options":["sliced","blended","heated","froze"],"sentence":"She ______ the fruit smoothie until it was completely smooth and creamy. The mixture of strawberries, bananas, and yogurt combined perfectly.","translation":"她混合果汁冰沙，直到它完全光滑和奶油狀。草莓、香蕉和酸奶的混合物完美結合。","word":"blended"}},"bless":{"createdAt":1781274836867,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"bless作為動詞表示祝福或祈求神聖力量保佑某人或某物，通常在宗教或正式場合使用。","options":["curse","name","bless","baptize"],"sentence":"The priest came to ______ the newborn baby during the religious ceremony. He made the sign of the cross and spoke sacred words to invoke divine protection.","translation":"牧師在宗教儀式中來祝福新生兒。他畫了十字聖號並說出神聖的話語來祈求神聖的保護。","word":"bless"}},"blessed":{"createdAt":1781613113005,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blessed 表示感到被祝福、蒙受幸運和恩惠的狀態","options":["cursed","blessed","tired","confused"],"sentence":"She felt truly ______ when she held her newborn baby for the first time. The joy and gratitude she experienced made her realize how fortunate her life had become.","translation":"當她第一次抱著新生嬰兒時，她感到真正的蒙福。她所經歷的喜悅和感恩讓她意識到她的人生變得多麼幸運。","word":"blessed"}},"blessing":{"createdAt":1781613113014,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blessing 是祝福或天賜的福氣，表示值得感恩的好事","options":["curse","blessing","burden","problem"],"sentence":"She considered her good health to be a true ______ in her life. She thanked God every day for this precious gift.","translation":"她認為自己的健康是人生中真正的祝福。她每天都為這份寶貴的禮物感謝上帝。","word":"blessing"}},"blink":{"createdAt":1781779647050,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blink在此表示漠視或逃避困難，引申自眨眼的習慣動作","options":["laugh","blink","smile","wave"],"sentence":"She refused to ______ at the difficult challenge ahead. Her determination showed that she was ready to face anything.","translation":"她對前面的困難挑戰毫不退縮。她的決心表明她已準備好面對任何事情。","word":"blink"}},"bloody":{"createdAt":1781664419996,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bloody形容詞表示涉及流血或暴力的，通常用來描述殘忍或激烈的事件。","options":["peaceful","bloody","brief","distant"],"sentence":"The ______ battle lasted three days and resulted in heavy casualties on both sides. Soldiers had to retreat and regroup after the intense fighting.","translation":"血腥的戰役持續了三天，雙方都遭受了重大傷亡。士兵們在激烈的戰鬥後不得不撤退並重新集結。","word":"bloody"}},"bloom":{"createdAt":1781792910183,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bloom是指花卉開放和綻放，表示植物生長期間的一個自然過程。","options":["wilt","bloom","fall","rot"],"sentence":"The cherry tree will ______ in early spring with beautiful pink flowers. The flowers will appear on all the branches within a few weeks.","translation":"櫻花樹將在早春開花，綻放美麗的粉紅色花朵。花朵將在幾週內出現在所有樹枝上。","word":"bloom"}},"blooming":{"createdAt":1781613113011,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blooming 形容繁盛、興旺、充滿活力的狀態","options":["dead","blooming","withered","empty"],"sentence":"The ______ garden was filled with colorful flowers and thriving plants everywhere. Every corner showed signs of vibrant growth and prosperity.","translation":"興旺的花園到處都是五顏六色的花朵和生長茂盛的植物。每個角落都顯示出生機勃勃的增長和繁榮。","word":"blooming"}},"blossom":{"createdAt":1783227361325,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"blossom 作名詞指花朵或花叢，特別是指樹木上同時開放的許多花朵，也引申為繁榮興旺的狀態。","options":["blossom","shade","growth","silence"],"sentence":"In spring, the cherry trees in the park burst into ______ with delicate pink petals covering the ground. The entire neighborhood smelled of sweetness as thousands of flowers opened at once.","translation":"春天時，公園裡的櫻花樹綻放出繁花，細緻的粉紅花瓣覆蓋了地面。整個社區充滿了甜香，因為數千朵花同時盛開。","word":"blossom"}},"blow":{"createdAt":1783505313972,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blow作名詞表示「猛擊」或「打擊」，指用力量施加的物理打擊。","options":["wind","blow","breath","push"],"sentence":"The boxer delivered a powerful ______ to his opponent's jaw. The referee counted the seconds as the fighter struggled to recover from the impact.","translation":"拳擊手向對手的下巴打了一記有力的一擊。裁判數著秒數，看著這名戰士試圖從撞擊中恢復過來。","word":"blow"}},"blown":{"createdAt":1783669066147,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blown 是 blow 的過去分詞，表示被風吹動或吹倒的狀態，通常用來描述風力造成的被動動作。","options":["broken","blown","bent","twisted"],"sentence":"The tree's branches were ______ down by the strong wind during the storm. The damage was so severe that several limbs snapped completely off.","translation":"暴風雨中強風把樹枝______吹倒了。破壞非常嚴重，幾根樹枝完全斷裂了。","word":"blown"}},"blunt":{"createdAt":1781672973728,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blunt是形容詞，表示「鈍的，不鋒利的」，指工具或物體的邊緣不尖銳。","options":["sharp","blunt","serrated","pointed"],"sentence":"The knife had become ______ after years of use without sharpening. I couldn't cut the bread properly no matter how hard I pressed down.","translation":"這把刀經過多年使用而沒有磨利後已經變鈍了。無論我多用力按下，我都無法正確地切麵包。","word":"blunt"}},"blurred":{"createdAt":1781564440927,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blurred 作形容詞表示模糊的、不清楚的，指邊界或細節不分明。","options":["sharp","blurred","bright","focused"],"sentence":"The photograph came out ______ because the camera moved during the shot. The image was so unclear that we couldn't identify the subject properly.","translation":"照片出來時模糊不清，因為拍攝時相機移動了。影像非常不清楚，我們無法正確識別主體。","word":"blurred"}},"blush":{"createdAt":1781864339054,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"blush表示因羞愧、害羞或尷尬而臉部發紅。","options":["smile","blush","frown","nod"],"sentence":"When the teacher asked her a difficult question in front of the whole class, she began to ______. Her face turned bright red because she was embarrassed about not knowing the answer.","translation":"當老師在全班面前問她一個困難的問題時，她開始臉紅。她的臉變得通紅，因為她對不知道答案感到尷尬。","word":"blush"}},"board":{"createdAt":1781256485490,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"board在此指的是公司的董事會，由董事組成的管理機構","options":["schedule","board","office","meeting"],"sentence":"The company's ______ met to discuss the quarterly financial results. The directors and executives reviewed all major decisions made during the past three months.","translation":"公司的董事會召開會議討論季度財務成果。董事和高管們審查了過去三個月做出的所有重大決定。","word":"board"}},"boast":{"createdAt":1783579649605,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"boast 是動詞，意為自吹自擂或誇耀，用來描述某人吹噓自己的成就或優點。","options":["whisper","boast","question","complain"],"sentence":"He couldn't help but ______ about winning the championship trophy. His teammates were tired of hearing him constantly talk about his achievements.","translation":"他忍不住為贏得冠軍獎杯而自吹自擂。他的隊友們厭倦了聽他不斷談論自己的成就。","word":"boast"}},"boil":{"createdAt":1781779647054,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"boil表示液體加熱達到沸點，產生氣泡並蒸發","options":["freeze","boil","cool","evaporate"],"sentence":"The water will ______ in about five minutes. Once it reaches 100 degrees Celsius, you can add the pasta.","translation":"水將在約五分鐘後煮沸。一旦達到攝氏100度，你就可以加入意粉。","word":"boil"}},"bold":{"createdAt":1781414884514,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"bold在排版中指字體粗的、粗體的，透過增加字體粗細來使文字更加醒目。","options":["itchy","bright","bold","soft"],"sentence":"The designer made the title ______ so it would stand out on the page. She increased the font weight to make sure readers would notice it immediately.","translation":"設計師把標題設成粗體，這樣它就會在頁面上突出來。她增加了字體的粗細，確保讀者會立即注意到它。","word":"bold"}},"bomb":{"createdAt":1781672973731,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bomb是名詞，表示「炸彈」，也可作動詞表示「轟炸；砲轟」。","options":["gift","bomb","letter","package"],"sentence":"The military launched a ______ at the enemy's ammunition depot to destroy their supplies. The explosion was so powerful that it was heard from miles away.","translation":"軍隊向敵人的彈藥庫投擲炸彈，以摧毀他們的補給品。爆炸威力之大，距離幾英里外都能聽到。","word":"bomb"}},"bond":{"createdAt":1781613113026,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"bond 表示連結、聯繫或人之間的深厚關係","options":["distance","conflict","bond","competition"],"sentence":"The strong ______ between the two sisters was evident in how they supported each other. They shared everything and were always there for one another.","translation":"兩個姐妹之間的強大紐帶從她們互相支持的方式中顯而易見。她們分享一切，總是彼此幫助。","word":"bond"}},"bonds":{"createdAt":1781664419994,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bonds在金融語境中指債券，是政府或公司發行的借貸工具。","options":["stocks","bonds","coins","medals"],"sentence":"The government issued ______ as a way to raise money from investors. These financial instruments promised to pay interest over a fixed period.","translation":"政府發行債券作為從投資者籌集資金的方式。這些金融工具承諾在固定期限內支付利息。","word":"bonds"}},"bone":{"createdAt":1783243988717,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"bone是骨頭，X光檢查是用來診斷骨頭斷裂的標準醫療程序","options":["bone","muscle","tendon","ligament"],"sentence":"The athlete fractured a ______ in his leg during the competition. The doctor ordered an X-ray to assess the severity of the injury.","translation":"運動員在比賽中腿部的______ 斷裂了。醫生下令進行X光檢查以評估傷害的嚴重程度。","word":"bone"}},"bonus":{"createdAt":1781443653208,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bonus指的是除了基本薪資之外的額外獎勵金或紅利，通常是作為表現優異的獎勵。","options":["penalty","bonus","deduction","fine"],"sentence":"The company gave each employee a generous ______ for exceeding sales targets this quarter. The extra payment was distributed in addition to their regular monthly salaries.","translation":"公司因員工這季超額完成銷售目標而給予每位員工慷慨的獎金。這筆額外款項是在他們定期月薪之外另行發放的。","word":"bonus"}},"bony":{"createdAt":1781672973723,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bony是形容詞，表示「瘦削的；皮包骨頭的」，形容身體消瘦或身上骨頭明顯。","options":["robust","bony","muscular","plump"],"sentence":"The old man had a ______ frame, as if he hadn't eaten well in years. His thin, angular appearance showed the effects of poverty and malnutrition.","translation":"這位老人體型瘦削，好像多年沒吃過好東西。他瘦弱而棱角分明的外表顯示了貧困和營養不良的影響。","word":"bony"}},"booklet":{"createdAt":1781598671172,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"booklet 作名詞表示小冊子，是一份較小的印刷出版物，通常包含關於特定主題的信息","options":["newspaper","booklet","poster","billboard"],"sentence":"The museum distributed a ______ to visitors containing information about the historical exhibits. The small publication included maps, descriptions, and interesting facts about each gallery.","translation":"博物館向遊客分發了一本小冊子，其中包含有關歷史展覽的信息。這份小出版物包括地圖、描述和有關每個畫廊的有趣事實。","word":"booklet"}},"boom":{"createdAt":1781613113014,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"boom 作為名詞表示經濟繁榮或快速發展時期","options":["recession","boom","depression","decline"],"sentence":"The economy experienced a rapid ______ during the late 1990s. Businesses expanded, unemployment fell, and consumer spending reached record levels.","translation":"經濟在1990年代後期經歷了快速繁榮。企業擴張，失業率下降，消費者支出達到創紀錄水平。","word":"boom"}},"boost":{"createdAt":1781883441463,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"boost 意指提升、增加或促進某事物的增長或改善","options":["reduce","maintain","boost","predict"],"sentence":"The new advertising campaign helped ______ the company's sales by thirty percent. The increased brand visibility significantly improved their quarterly revenue.","translation":"新的廣告活動幫助該公司的銷售額提升了百分之三十。增加的品牌知名度顯著改善了他們的季度收入。","word":"boost"}},"border":{"createdAt":1781613113028,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"border 是邊界或國家之間的分界線","options":["ocean","border","river","road"],"sentence":"The two countries share a long ______ that has been disputed for centuries. Soldiers guard the line that separates their territories.","translation":"這兩個國家共享一條長期有爭議的邊界。士兵守衛著將其領土分開的邊界線。","word":"border"}},"bore":{"createdAt":1782959289686,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bore 作為動詞，表示使某人感到厭倦或乏味。","options":["entertain","bore","inspire","confuse"],"sentence":"The long lecture began to ______ the students in the classroom. By the third hour, many were falling asleep because the speaker had no interesting examples or engaging stories.","translation":"冗長的講座開始使教室裡的學生感到厭倦。到了第三個小時，許多人開始打瞌睡，因為演講者沒有有趣的例子或引人入勝的故事。","word":"bore"}},"bosom":{"createdAt":1781613113027,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"bosom 指前胸、乳房或胸懷，常用於表示親密或溫暖的懷抱","options":["shoulder","lap","bosom","side"],"sentence":"She hugged her child close to her ______ and whispered reassuring words. The intimate embrace conveyed her deep maternal love.","translation":"她把孩子緊緊抱在胸懷，低聲說著安慰的話。這個親密的擁抱傳達了她深深的母愛。","word":"bosom"}},"boss":{"createdAt":1784899764063,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"boss是指在工作場所管理和領導他人的人，掌握著決定權和權威。","options":["intern","boss","customer","competitor"],"sentence":"The ______ called a meeting to discuss the quarterly sales report. His employees respect his leadership and clear vision for the company.","translation":"老闆召集一次會議討論季度銷售報告。他的員工尊重他的領導力和對公司的清晰願景。","word":"boss"}},"bother":{"createdAt":1781746848178,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bother 表示「打擾」或「煩惱」，在此句中表示不要干擾或騷擾某人的工作。","options":["help","bother","encourage","assist"],"sentence":"Don't ______ me while I'm working on this important project. I need complete silence and concentration to finish it on time.","translation":"當我在做這個重要專案時，不要打擾我。我需要完全的安靜和專注來按時完成。","word":"bother"}},"boulevard":{"createdAt":1782959289688,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"boulevard 作為名詞，表示寬闊的城市大道或街道，通常有行道樹和商業設施。","options":["alley","boulevard","parking lot","sidewalk"],"sentence":"The city's main ______ was lined with tall trees and expensive shops on both sides. It was the widest street in town, stretching for several kilometers through the downtown area.","translation":"這座城市的主要大道兩側排列著高大的樹木和昂貴的商店。這是城鎮裡最寬的街道，綿延數公里穿過市中心地區。","word":"boulevard"}},"bounce":{"createdAt":1781564440915,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bounce 作名詞表示彈力、彈性，指物體反彈的能力或動作。","options":["softness","bounce","weight","color"],"sentence":"The basketball had a good ______ when it hit the floor. We could hear it spring back up repeatedly with energy.","translation":"籃球掉到地上時有很好的彈跳。我們可以聽到它反覆有力地彈起來。","word":"bounce"}},"bound":{"createdAt":1781613113015,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bound 形容即將前往某地或肯定會發生的狀態","options":["staying","bound","thinking","worried"],"sentence":"With her suitcase packed and tickets in hand, she was ______ for Paris tomorrow morning. The excitement of her upcoming trip kept her awake all night.","translation":"她的行李已收拾好，機票已在手，她明早即將前往巴黎。即將到來的旅行的興奮使她整夜未眠。","word":"bound"}},"boundary":{"createdAt":1781779647057,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"boundary表示分界線或範圍的邊界，用於劃分不同的區域","options":["bridge","boundary","connection","wall"],"sentence":"The ______ between the two countries was established by the treaty. It runs through the river and is marked with official border posts.","translation":"兩國之間的分界線是由條約確立的。它穿過河流並標有官方邊界哨所。","word":"boundary"}},"bow":{"createdAt":1781767999773,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"bow 在這裡指的是弓樂器（如小提琴弓），用來在弦樂器上拉奏音樂。","options":["arrow","gesture","bow","knot"],"sentence":"The musician picked up her ______ and prepared to play the violin concerto. She drew it smoothly across the strings to create beautiful melodies.","translation":"音樂家拿起她的弓，準備演奏小提琴協奏曲。她光滑地用它在琴弦上拉動，創造出美妙的旋律。","word":"bow"}},"boxing":{"createdAt":1781613050059,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"boxing是指拳擊運動，通常涉及兩個人戴著手套在拳擊台上互相對打，或者個人在訓練時練習打拳技巧。","options":["swimming","boxing","dancing","cooking"],"sentence":"My brother trains in ______ three times a week at the local gym. He wears protective gloves and a headgear while practicing punching combinations with his coach.","translation":"我的哥哥每週在當地健身房訓練拳擊三次。他在與教練練習打拳組合時穿著保護手套和頭盔。","word":"boxing"}},"boycott":{"createdAt":1781883441457,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"boycott 意指拒絕購買或參與某事物，作為抗議或反對的方式","options":["promote","boycott","advertise","merge"],"sentence":"Environmental activists decided to ______ companies that use excessive plastic packaging. They organized a campaign encouraging consumers to stop purchasing their products entirely.","translation":"環保運動人士決定抵制使用過量塑膠包裝的公司。他們組織了一項運動，鼓勵消費者完全停止購買這些產品。","word":"boycott"}},"bozzin":{"createdAt":1784899523212,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bozzin是船舶上的水手長或領班水手，負責監督其他水手的工作並維持船上秩序。","options":["captain","bozzin","navigator","cook"],"sentence":"The ship's ______ barked orders at the deck crew, ensuring every rope was tied correctly and every sailor knew their duties. As the senior officer responsible for all sailors, he maintained strict discipline aboard the vessel.","translation":"船舶的水手長向甲板船員吼出命令，確保每根繩索都綁緊了，每個水手都知道自己的職責。作為負責所有水手的資深人員，他在船上維持嚴格的紀律。","word":"bozzin"}},"brag":{"createdAt":1781672973725,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"brag是動詞，表示「吹牛」，指自誇或誇大自己的成就和擁有物。","options":["hide","brag","whisper","complain"],"sentence":"He couldn't help but ______ about his new sports car to all his friends. Everyone at the party grew tired of hearing him boast about its expensive features.","translation":"他忍不住向所有朋友吹牛他的新跑車。派對上的每個人都厭倦了聽他吹噓它昂貴的功能。","word":"brag"}},"braid":{"createdAt":1783579649606,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"braid 是名詞，指編成的辮子或裝飾性的編織物，通常由多股頭髮或線條交叉編織而成。","options":["braid","ribbon","knot","curl"],"sentence":"She spent an hour weaving her long hair into an intricate ______. The resulting hairstyle featured multiple strands intertwined together in a decorative pattern.","translation":"她花了一個小時將她的長髮編成一個複雜的辮子。最終的髮型由多股纏繞在一起形成的裝飾圖案組成。","word":"braid"}},"braided":{"createdAt":1781709890953,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"braided是形容詞，表示用編織或辮的技術將多股物質交叉組合在一起的樣式。","options":["hazard","braided","engagement","hesitation"],"sentence":"The woman wore her long hair in a ______ style for the formal wedding ceremony. The intricate pattern of interwoven strands created an elegant and sophisticated look.","translation":"那位女性在正式的婚禮典禮上用編織的風格梳理她的長髮。交織絞合的複雜圖案呈現出優雅而精緻的外觀。","word":"braided"}},"brake":{"createdAt":1781664420002,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"brake是煞車系統，用於減速或停止車輛。","options":["engine","brake","wheel","seat"],"sentence":"The car's ______ failed while driving down the steep mountain road. The driver had to shift into a lower gear to slow down safely.","translation":"汽車在陡峭的山路上行駛時煞車失效。駕駛員不得不降擋來安全減速。","word":"brake"}},"branch":{"createdAt":1781779647124,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"branch在此指分公司或分支機構，而非樹的分枝","options":["leaf","root","branch","fruit"],"sentence":"The new ______ of our company will open in Tokyo next month. It will serve as our regional headquarters for Asia.","translation":"我們公司的新分店將於下個月在東京開業。它將成為我們在亞洲的區域總部。","word":"branch"}},"brand":{"createdAt":1781449095514,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"brand作為動詞意為打烙印或標記，用來在物品上留下特定的標識以區分品牌。","options":["hide","brand","erase","lose"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ all their products with a new logo. This mark would help customers immediately recognize their goods in stores.","translation":"該公司決定用新標誌為他們所有的產品打上烙印。這個標記會幫助顧客在商店裡立即辨別他們的商品。","word":"brand"}},"brand_new":{"createdAt":1781613113018,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"brand-new 形容全新的、未使用過的東西","options":["old","used","brand-new","damaged"],"sentence":"He proudly showed off his ______ car that he had just purchased from the dealership. The vehicle still had that fresh smell and hadn't a single scratch on it.","translation":"他驕傲地展示了他剛從經銷商那裡購買的嶄新汽車。這輛車仍然有新車的氣味，沒有任何劃痕。","word":"brand-new"}},"breadth":{"createdAt":1781484539655,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"breadth 表示橫向的寬度或距離，指事物從左到右的測量，而非上下或前後的距離。","options":["height","depth","breadth","length"],"sentence":"The ______ of the river is impressive, stretching nearly half a mile from one bank to the other. This wide expanse makes it difficult to cross.","translation":"河流的寬度令人印象深刻，從一岸延伸到另一岸幾乎有半英里。這種寬闊的範圍使其難以穿越。","word":"breadth"}},"break":{"createdAt":1781613113015,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"break 作為名詞表示中場休息或工作中間的休息時間","options":["lesson","break","assembly","dismissal"],"sentence":"During the morning ______, students left the classroom to rest and eat snacks. The twenty-minute interval gave everyone time to relax before the next lesson.","translation":"在上午的休息時間，學生離開教室去休息和吃零食。二十分鐘的間隔給了每個人在下一堂課前放鬆的時間。","word":"break"}},"breakdown":{"createdAt":1782461900357,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"breakdown是指機械、系統或設備突然停止工作或發生故障的情況。","options":["success","schedule","breakdown","improvement"],"sentence":"The factory production line experienced a sudden ______ that forced them to stop all operations for repairs. The mechanical failure lasted several hours before technicians could restore the equipment to working condition.","translation":"工廠的生產線突然發生故障，迫使他們停止所有操作進行修理。這個機械故障持續了幾個小時，直到技術人員能夠恢復設備的工作狀態。","word":"breakdown"}},"breakthrough":{"createdAt":1782959289686,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"breakthrough 作為名詞，表示重要的發現或進展，通常涉及成功或進步。","options":["setback","development","breakthrough","complication"],"sentence":"The medical team announced a major ______ in cancer treatment last week. Their new drug has shown remarkable results in clinical trials and is expected to save millions of lives.","translation":"醫療團隊上週宣布了癌症治療的一項重大突破。他們的新藥在臨床試驗中顯示出卓越的效果，預計將拯救數百萬人的生命。","word":"breakthrough"}},"breast":{"createdAt":1781275226787,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"此處breast作動詞表示「挺胸面對；勇敢地迎向」","options":["breast","dump","fume","include"],"sentence":"The soldier decided to ______ the enemy and charge forward despite the danger. His courage inspired all those fighting beside him.","translation":"那位士兵決定挺胸面對敵人並向前衝鋒，儘管危險重重。他的勇氣激勵了所有與他並肩作戰的人。","word":"breast"}},"breasts":{"createdAt":1781693275431,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"乳房在烹飪語境中指禽類（如雞或鴨）胸部的肉，是常見的食材。","options":["wings","breasts","legs","thighs"],"sentence":"The roasted chicken's ______ were tender and juicy, making them the most popular part of the dish. The chef seasoned them perfectly with herbs and garlic butter.","translation":"烤雞的乳房肉嫩多汁，是這道菜中最受歡迎的部分。廚師用香草和大蒜黃油完美地調味。","word":"breasts"}},"breath":{"createdAt":1781672973740,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"breath是名詞，表示「呼吸」，指吸入和呼出空氣的過程或吸入的空氣。","options":["water","breath","food","rest"],"sentence":"After running the marathon, he gasped for ______ and sat down to recover. His lungs burned as he tried to slow down his rapid breathing.","translation":"馬拉松比賽後，他喘著氣坐下來恢復。當他試圖放慢呼吸速度時，他的肺部燃燒著疼痛。","word":"breath"}},"breathe":{"createdAt":1781832549168,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"breathe 是指吸入和呼出空氣的生理動作，在冥想和放鬆練習中特別重要。","options":["think","breathe","move","speak"],"sentence":"The yoga instructor reminded everyone to ______ slowly and deeply during the meditation session. By focusing on each inhale and exhale, the participants felt more relaxed and centered.","translation":"瑜伽教練提醒每個人在冥想課程中要緩慢而深深地呼吸。通過關注每次吸氣和呼氣，參與者感到更加放鬆和平靜。","word":"breathe"}},"breathless":{"createdAt":1781566460883,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"breathless表示屏息的、因驚奇或興奮而屏住呼吸的狀態，與觀眾期待精彩時刻的心理狀態相符。","options":["noisy","breathless","chatty","loud"],"sentence":"The ______ audience sat in complete silence as the magician revealed his final illusion. Everyone had been holding their breath in anticipation of the stunning finale.","translation":"屏息的觀眾在完全寂靜中坐著，當魔術師揭示他的最後幻象時。每個人都屏住呼吸期待著這個驚人的結局。","word":"breathless"}},"breathtaking":{"createdAt":1781850287962,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"breathtaking 形容某事物極其壯觀或美麗，令人驚嘆、屏息。","options":["ordinary","distant","breathtaking","familiar"],"sentence":"The view from the top of the mountain was absolutely ______, leaving all the hikers speechless. They stood in stunned silence for several minutes, overwhelmed by the beauty of the landscape stretching for miles below them.","translation":"從山頂看到的景色絕對令人屏息，讓所有登山者都無言以對。他們以驚嘆的沉默站立了幾分鐘，被延伸到他們下方數英里的風景之美所打動。","word":"breathtaking"}},"breed":{"createdAt":1781566460882,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"breed作為名詞表示特定的品種或類型，通常用於描述經過人工培育的動物或植物。","options":["harvest","breed","crop","farm"],"sentence":"The laboratory was studying a new ______ of disease-resistant corn plants. Scientists had spent years developing this specific variety through selective cultivation.","translation":"實驗室正在研究一種新的抗病玉米品種。科學家花費多年時間通過選擇性培育開發這個特定品種。","word":"breed"}},"breeze":{"createdAt":1783179143813,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「breeze」指的是輕柔、溫和的微風，與強風（如gale或hurricane）完全不同。","options":["storm","breeze","gale","hurricane"],"sentence":"On that hot summer day, a gentle ______ swept across the garden, providing relief from the intense heat. The wind was so light and effortless that it barely rustled the leaves.","translation":"在那個炎熱的夏日，一陣輕柔的微風掃過花園，從酷熱中帶來了舒緩。風是如此輕微而毫不費力，幾乎沒有吹動樹葉。","word":"breeze"}},"bribe":{"createdAt":1781883441461,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"bribe 是指為了獲得不正當利益或特殊待遇而提供的非法金錢或禮物","options":["donation","payment","bribe","fee"],"sentence":"The corrupt official was arrested for accepting a ______ from a wealthy businessman. He had agreed to approve an illegal construction project in exchange for cash.","translation":"這名貪污官員因接受一位富有商人的賄賂而被逮捕。他曾同意批准一個非法建築項目以換取現金。","word":"bribe"}},"bridge":{"createdAt":1781672973746,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bridge作為名詞表示「橋；橋樑」，作為動詞表示「把…連結起來；使渡過」，指連接分離的事物或跨越障礙。","options":["divides","bridge","blocks","closes"],"sentence":"The new highway ______ connects the two separated communities that were isolated from each other for decades. Residents can now travel between the towns in just ten minutes.","translation":"新高速公路大橋連接了兩個被隔離了數十年的分離社區。居民現在可以在十分鐘內在兩個城鎮之間旅行。","word":"bridge"}},"brief":{"createdAt":1781613113017,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"brief 形容簡短、簡潔或短暫的","options":["lengthy","brief","complicated","confusing"],"sentence":"The speaker gave a ______ presentation that lasted only ten minutes. Despite its short duration, it covered all the essential points effectively.","translation":"演講者進行了簡短的演講，只持續了十分鐘。儘管時間很短，但它有效地涵蓋了所有要點。","word":"brief"}},"briefcase":{"createdAt":1782959289689,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"briefcase 作為名詞，表示用來攜帶文件和商務物品的公事包。","options":["suitcase","backpack","briefcase","envelope"],"sentence":"The businessman carried his ______ as he rushed to the important meeting downtown. Inside were all the contracts and documents he needed to sign the major deal.","translation":"那位商人匆匆趕往市中心參加重要會議時提著他的公事包。裡面裝著他簽署這項重大交易所需的所有合約和文件。","word":"briefcase"}},"briefly":{"createdAt":1781779647028,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"briefly表示簡短地、簡潔地說話或行動，與詳細解釋相反","options":["in detail","briefly","repeatedly","loudly"],"sentence":"The manager explained the project ______ during the meeting. She spoke for only three minutes and covered just the main points.","translation":"經理在會議中簡短地解釋了這個項目。她只講了三分鐘，只涵蓋了要點。","word":"briefly"}},"bright":{"createdAt":1782959314430,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bright 除了表示光線充足外，也可以形容人很聰明、有才智，能夠快速理解和解決問題。","options":["quiet","bright","tall","friendly"],"sentence":"The ______ student solved the difficult math problem in just a few minutes. Her teachers were impressed by her intelligence and quick thinking ability.","translation":"聰明的學生在幾分鐘內就解決了這個困難的數學問題。她的老師對她的聰慧和快速思考能力印象深刻。","word":"bright"}},"brilliant":{"createdAt":1781672973727,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"brilliant是形容詞，表示「光輝的；相當聰明的」，形容非常聰慧或才華橫溢的人。","options":["confused","brilliant","ordinary","slow"],"sentence":"Her ______ mind allowed her to solve complex mathematical problems in seconds. The professors were amazed by her exceptional intellectual ability and quick thinking.","translation":"她聰慧的頭腦使她能在幾秒鐘內解決複雜的數學問題。教授們對她傑出的智力能力和敏捷思維感到驚歎。","word":"brilliant"}},"brink":{"createdAt":1781664420007,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"brink表示邊緣或即將發生某事的臨界點，通常帶有危險或緊急的含義。","options":["center","brink","peak","foundation"],"sentence":"The company stood on the ______ of bankruptcy after losing major clients. Management needed to make drastic changes to survive.","translation":"在失去主要客戶後，該公司瀕臨破產邊緣。管理層需要做出激烈改變才能生存。","word":"brink"}},"broad":{"createdAt":1781595752121,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"broad 形容範圍或視野寬廣，可以涵蓋大的區域。","options":["narrow","limited","broad","blocked"],"sentence":"The ______ view from the mountain top allowed us to see for miles in every direction. We could observe the entire valley, distant forests, and the coastline all at once.","translation":"從山頂的寬廣景色使我們能夠朝各個方向看到數英里遠的地方。我們可以一次看到整個山谷、遙遠的森林和海岸線。","word":"broad"}},"broadcast":{"createdAt":1787049756212,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"broadcast是指透過電視、廣播等媒體向大眾播放節目或信息。","options":["postpone","broadcast","record","cancel"],"sentence":"The television station will ______ the live sporting event this Saturday evening. Millions of viewers across the country will be able to watch it at the same time.","translation":"電視台將在本週六晚上廣播這場現場體育賽事。全國數百萬觀眾將能夠同時觀看。","word":"broadcast"}},"broaden":{"createdAt":1781613113022,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"broaden 表示使變寬或擴展視野和知識","options":["narrow","broaden","ignore","forget"],"sentence":"Traveling to different countries helped ______ her perspective on life. Experiencing diverse cultures taught her to appreciate people's differences.","translation":"到不同國家旅遊幫助她拓寬了對生活的觀點。經歷多元文化教會她欣賞人們的差異。","word":"broaden"}},"broadly":{"createdAt":1781664419996,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"broadly是副詞，表示大體上或籠統地談論某事，不涉及細節。","options":["specifically","broadly","quietly","angrily"],"sentence":"When asked about his political views, he spoke ______ without getting into specific details. He preferred to discuss the general principles rather than individual policies.","translation":"當被問及他的政治觀點時，他泛泛地談論，沒有涉及具體細節。他更願意討論一般原則而不是具體政策。","word":"broadly"}},"brochure":{"createdAt":1781792910154,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"brochure是指印刷的宣傳小冊子，通常用來介紹產品、服務或旅遊景點的資訊。","options":["ticket","brochure","map","passport"],"sentence":"The travel agency handed me a colorful ______ about vacation packages. It contained detailed information about hotels, flights, and activities printed on folded paper.","translation":"旅行社遞給我一份關於度假套餐的彩色小冊子。它包含印在折疊紙張上關於飯店、航班和活動的詳細信息。","word":"brochure"}},"broil":{"createdAt":1781883441461,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"broil 意指用直接的上方熱源進行烹飪，通常是在烤箱中","options":["steam","boil","broil","poach"],"sentence":"The chef decided to ______ the salmon instead of frying it in a pan. The intense direct heat from above would give the fish a perfect golden crust.","translation":"廚師決定烤制鮭魚，而不是用平底鍋煎炒。來自上方的強烈直接熱量會給魚一個完美的金黃色外殼。","word":"broil"}},"broke":{"createdAt":1781664419995,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"broke是break的過去式，表示破裂或損壞某物。","options":["fixed","broke","cleaned","moved"],"sentence":"He ______ the vase when he knocked it off the table by accident. Now he's afraid to tell his mother what happened.","translation":"當他不小心把花瓶從桌子上碰掉時，他把它打破了。現在他害怕告訴媽媽發生了什麼事。","word":"broke"}},"brontosaurus":{"createdAt":1783243389246,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"雷龍是一種已滅絕的蜥腳類恐龍，以其超長的頸部和巨大的身體而聞名。","options":["triceratops","brontosaurus","tyrannosaurus","stegosaurus"],"sentence":"The massive ______ was a long-necked dinosaur that roamed Earth millions of years ago before going extinct. Fossil records show this four-legged herbivore could reach lengths of over 70 feet and weigh as much as ten elephants combined.","translation":"雷龍是一種長頸恐龍，在數百萬年前滅絕之前在地球上漫遊。化石記錄顯示這種四足草食性動物的長度可以超過70英尺，體重相當於十隻大象的總和。","word":"brontosaurus"}},"bronze":{"createdAt":1781429945500,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"bronze 作為名詞表示銅或青銅，在奧運會中特指代表第三名的銅牌。","options":["gold","silver","bronze","platinum"],"sentence":"The athlete won a ______ medal at the Olympic Games for her outstanding performance in the swimming competition. Coming in third place was still a remarkable achievement after four years of training.","translation":"這位運動員在奧運會上獲得了銅牌，以表彰她在游泳比賽中的出色表現。在四年的訓練後，獲得第三名仍然是一項非凡的成就。","word":"bronze"}},"brook":{"createdAt":1781425096277,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"brook 是名詞，指小溪或小河，通常指流量不大、流速較緩的天然水流，常見於鄉村或山區。","options":["path","brook","cliff","cave"],"sentence":"The hikers followed a narrow ______ through the forest to find fresh water during their journey. The gentle sound of flowing water and the cool air surrounding the small watercourse guided them to a perfect resting spot.","translation":"登山者沿著穿過森林的狹窄小溪前進，以便在旅程中找到淡水。流動的溫和水聲和圍繞著小水道的清涼空氣引導他們找到了完美的休息地點。","word":"brook"}},"brotherhood":{"createdAt":1782096279660,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"brotherhood指同志之間因共同經歷或目標而產生的深厚情感連結和相互忠誠。","options":["competition","brotherhood","hierarchy","confusion"],"sentence":"The soldiers developed a strong sense of ______ through their shared experiences in battle. They promised to support and protect each other for the rest of their lives.","translation":"士兵們透過在戰鬥中的共同經歷培養了深厚的手足情誼。他們承諾在餘生中相互支持和保護。","word":"brotherhood"}},"browse":{"createdAt":1781664420000,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"browse表示隨意翻閱或瀏覽，不一定有明確的尋找目標。","options":["search","browse","rush","skip"],"sentence":"She spent an hour at the bookstore to ______ through the new releases section. She picked up several titles that caught her attention and seemed promising.","translation":"她在書店裡花了一小時瀏覽新發行的書籍。她拿起了幾本引起她注意和看起來很有希望的書。","word":"browse"}},"bruise":{"createdAt":1781613113023,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"bruise 是碰傷或瘀傷，皮膚受鈍力撞擊後的損傷","options":["scar","wound","bruise","fracture"],"sentence":"The ______ on her arm was a dark purple color from where she had fallen. The mark would probably fade within a week.","translation":"她手臂上的瘀傷呈深紫色，是她跌倒時留下的。這個印記可能會在一周內消褪。","word":"bruise"}},"brush":{"createdAt":1781613113007,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"brush 作為名詞指的是刷子，用於清潔或繪畫的工具","options":["cloth","broom","brush","sponge"],"sentence":"He used a ______ to clean the paint off the wooden floor. The stiff bristles were perfect for scrubbing away the dried paint spots.","translation":"他用一把刷子清潔木地板上的油漆。堅硬的毛髮非常適合擦掉乾燥的油漆點。","word":"brush"}},"brutal":{"createdAt":1781850287960,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"brutal 形容某事物極其殘忍、兇狠或缺乏人情，通常引起道德譴責。","options":["strategic","clever","brutal","effective"],"sentence":"The enemy soldiers displayed ______ tactics during the occupation, showing no mercy to civilians. International observers documented countless war crimes and atrocities committed against innocent populations.","translation":"敵軍在佔領期間採取殘忍的戰術，對平民毫不留情。國際觀察員記錄了對無辜民眾實施的無數戰爭罪行和暴行。","word":"brutal"}},"bucket":{"createdAt":1781515270345,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"bucket 作名詞，指有把手的桶子，用來盛裝或運輸液體或物品。","options":["prospect","curious","bucket","investment"],"sentence":"The farmer carried a heavy ______ of fresh water from the well to his garden. He poured the contents slowly over the thirsty vegetables to help them grow.","translation":"農民從水井裡提著一桶新鮮水來到他的花園。他慢慢地將水倒在口渴的蔬菜上，幫助它們生長。","word":"bucket"}},"buckle":{"createdAt":1781272410990,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"buckle作為動詞表示用扣環或搭扣將某物固定或扣上，特別是在安全帶、皮帶等情況下。","options":["unbuckle","break","buckle","unfasten"],"sentence":"Please ______ your seatbelt before the airplane takes off for safety. The flight attendant reminds all passengers to fasten their restraints properly.","translation":"飛機起飛前，請扣好你的安全帶以保証安全。空服員提醒所有乘客正確地繫好他們的約束帶。","word":"buckle"}},"buddha":{"createdAt":1781503378959,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Buddha 是佛教的創始人和中心人物，被認為是悟道的聖人。","options":["Jesus","Buddha","Muhammad","Krishna"],"sentence":"______ taught his followers the path to enlightenment and inner peace. The religious figure founded Buddhism and is revered by millions of people worldwide.","translation":"佛陀教導他的追隨者通往開悟和內心平和的道路。這位宗教人物創立了佛教，受到全世界數百萬人的尊敬。","word":"buddha"}},"buddhism":{"createdAt":1781664420005,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"buddhism是佛教，一種源於亞洲的宗教和哲學體系。","options":["Islam","buddhism","Christianity","Judaism"],"sentence":"She converted to ______ after spending a year studying in Thailand. The teachings about suffering and enlightenment resonated deeply with her.","translation":"在泰國學習一年後，她改信了佛教。關於苦難和開悟的教義與她產生了深刻共鳴。","word":"buddhism"}},"budget":{"createdAt":1783923850857,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"budget 作形容詞表示「低廉的」或「價格便宜的」，通常用來形容成本較低的商品或服務。","options":["premium","budget","international","luxury"],"sentence":"Our family is trying to save money this year, so we are looking for a ______ airline that offers cheap ticket prices. We found one that charges half the price of premium carriers while still maintaining basic safety standards.","translation":"我們家庭今年試圖節省金錢，所以我們正在尋找一家提供便宜機票價格的低廉航空公司。我們找到了一家票價是高端航空公司一半的航空公司，同時仍然保持基本安全標準。","word":"budget"}},"bulge":{"createdAt":1781256547739,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Bulge表示膨脹、凸起或向外推起，通常是因為內部裝有太多東西。","options":["shrink","bulge","flatten","divide"],"sentence":"The backpack began to ______ as the student packed more and more books inside. By the time she zipped it closed, the fabric was stretched to its limits.","translation":"當學生在背包裡裝入越來越多的書籍時，背包開始膨脹。當她拉上拉鍊時，布料已經延伸到極限。","word":"bulge"}},"bulging":{"createdAt":1781883441463,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"bulging 形容物體鼓起、膨脹或突出，因為內部充滿了東西","options":["light","empty","organized","bulging"],"sentence":"The student's backpack was so ______ with books that the zippers could barely close. It appeared ready to burst open at any moment.","translation":"學生的背包裡裝了太多書籍，鼓得拉鍊都幾乎關不上。看起來隨時都準備裂開。","word":"bulging"}},"bulk":{"createdAt":1783327146629,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"bulk 表示物品的巨大體積或大量，特別強調佔據的空間大。","options":["weight","shape","bulk","color"],"sentence":"The shipping company charged extra fees because of the ______ of the cargo. The enormous volume of boxes took up most of the warehouse space.","translation":"由於貨物數量龐大，運輸公司收取了額外費用。巨大的箱子堆積佔據了倉庫的大部分空間。","word":"bulk"}},"bulky":{"createdAt":1782959314429,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bulky 形容物體體積大且佔據很多空間，強調的是大小和占地面積，而不是重量。","options":["heavy","bulky","expensive","modern"],"sentence":"The new refrigerator was so ______ that it barely fit through the kitchen doorway. We had to remove the door frame and call extra people to help move it inside.","translation":"新冰箱龐大得幾乎無法通過廚房門口。我們必須拆下門框，並叫額外的人幫忙搬進去。","word":"bulky"}},"bulletin":{"createdAt":1781256547738,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Bulletin是指電視或電臺突然插播的新聞快報或機構發佈的簡報和公告。","options":["advertisement","bulletin","documentary","commercial"],"sentence":"The emergency ______ interrupted the regular television program to announce the severe weather warning. Viewers learned that a powerful storm was approaching their region within the next few hours.","translation":"緊急新聞快報中斷了常規電視節目，宣布了嚴重天氣警告。觀眾得知一場強大的風暴將在接下來的幾小時內逼近他們的地區。","word":"bulletin"}},"bully":{"createdAt":1781664420001,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bully是名詞，指欺凌弱小的人或經常欺負他人的人。","options":["teacher","bully","friend","helper"],"sentence":"The school's biggest ______ constantly picked on smaller students and demanded their lunch money. Teachers finally intervened after many complaints from parents.","translation":"學校裡最大的欺凌者經常欺負較小的學生，並要求他們的午餐錢。在家長多次投訴後，教師終於進行了干預。","word":"bully"}},"bump":{"createdAt":1781362281667,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bump表示碰撞或撞擊，通常帶有一定的力度並可能導致疼痛。","options":["touch","bump","pass","lean"],"sentence":"She ______ her head on the low doorway as she entered the room. A painful impact left a small bruise on her forehead.","translation":"當她進入房間時，她的頭碰到了低門框。一次痛苦的碰撞在她的額頭上留下了一個小瘀傷。","word":"bump"}},"bumpy":{"createdAt":1781424137075,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"bumpy 形容詞意為「顛簸的」，用來描述不平穩或充滿顛簸的旅程或表面。","options":["smooth","pleasant","bumpy","peaceful"],"sentence":"The flight was very ______ and made many passengers feel uncomfortable. The airplane encountered severe turbulence while crossing over the mountain range.","translation":"這班飛機非常顛簸，使許多乘客感到不適。飛機在越過山脈時遭遇了嚴重的亂流。","word":"bumpy"}},"bun":{"createdAt":1782106346910,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bun（圓髮髻）是一種把頭髮捲成圓形盤在頭上的髮型。","options":["ponytail","bun","braid","knot"],"sentence":"She pulled her long hair up into a ______ at the back of her head for the formal dinner. This traditional hairstyle kept her hair neatly in place throughout the evening.","translation":"她為了參加正式晚宴，把長髮盤成圓髮髻。這種傳統髮型整個晚上都保持整潔。","word":"bun"}},"bundle":{"createdAt":1781933311795,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bundle（束；捆）指多個物品打包在一起銷售，而individual（個別的）、fragment（碎片）和sector（部門）都無法描述多個物品的組合套裝。","options":["individual","bundle","fragment","sector"],"sentence":"The store offered a special ______ deal that included a laptop, keyboard, mouse, and monitor all packaged together. Customers who bought the set saved forty percent compared to purchasing items separately.","translation":"商店提供了一個特殊的捆綁優惠，包括筆記型電腦、鍵盤、滑鼠和顯示器全部打包在一起。購買該套裝的消費者與單獨購買物品相比節省了百分之四十。","word":"bundle"}},"burden":{"createdAt":1782550057075,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"burden是名詞，表示困難、沉重的責任或不愉快的負擔，讓人感到受壓。","options":["gift","opportunity","burden","investment"],"sentence":"The heavy medical bills became a significant ______ on the family's finances after his illness. They struggled to pay for both treatment and daily expenses each month.","translation":"在他生病後，高額的醫療費用成為了家庭財務上的沉重負擔。他們每個月都很難支付治療費用和日常開支。","word":"burden"}},"bureau":{"createdAt":1781362281654,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bureau是指政府部門或辦公機構，如局、處、署等。","options":["office","bureau","store","factory"],"sentence":"She works at the environmental protection ______ handling pollution cases. The government agency is responsible for enforcing environmental regulations across the region.","translation":"她在環保局工作，處理污染案件。這個政府機構負責在該地區執行環境法規。","word":"bureau"}},"bureaucracy":{"createdAt":1781515329267,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bureaucracy 名詞，意思是官僚主義，指繁瑣的行政程序和過度的層級管理。","options":["efficiency","bureaucracy","progress","innovation"],"sentence":"The excessive ______ slowed down the approval process for new business licenses. Applicants had to submit documents to multiple departments and wait for weeks before receiving a decision.","translation":"過度的官僚主義減緩了新營業執照的審批過程。申請人必須向多個部門提交文件，並在獲得決定前等待數週。","word":"bureaucracy"}},"bureaucrat":{"createdAt":1783776543750,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bureaucrat是指在政府部門或大型機構中遵循規章制度、依照程序辦事的官僚人員，通常與繁瑣的官僚程序和僵化的決策過程相關聯。","options":["entrepreneur","bureaucrat","diplomat","scholar"],"sentence":"The ______ spent hours filling out forms and following rigid procedures instead of making quick decisions. He worked in a large government agency where red tape and inflexible rules governed every action.","translation":"那位官僚花了數小時填寫表格並遵循嚴格的程序，而不是做出快速決定。他在一個大型政府機構工作，其中繁文縟節和不靈活的規則控制著每一項行動。","word":"bureaucrat"}},"burglar":{"createdAt":1782228595872,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"burglar 是指進行入室盜竊的人，必須涉及非法進入他人住所並竊取物品的犯罪行為。","options":["shopkeeper","burglar","police officer","neighbor"],"sentence":"The police caught the ______ red-handed as he was climbing out of the window with stolen jewelry. The security camera footage clearly showed him breaking into the house at midnight.","translation":"警察當場抓住了那個竊賊，他正從窗戶爬出來偷走的珠寶。安全攝像頭的錄像清楚地顯示他在午夜闖入房子。","word":"burglar"}},"burial":{"createdAt":1781665727109,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"burial 指埋葬死者的儀式或行為，通常是文化和宗教習俗的一部分。","options":["celebration","burial","exhibition","documentation"],"sentence":"The ancient civilization practiced ______ of their kings in underground tombs filled with treasures. Archaeologists discovered the tomb intact after 3,000 years.","translation":"這個古老的文明將他們的國王埋葬在充滿珍寶的地下墓室中。考古學家在3000年後發現了完整無損的墓室。","word":"burial"}},"burrow":{"createdAt":1782401868821,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"burrow 表示動物挖掘的洞穴或地下隧道系統。","options":["nest","burrow","den","cave"],"sentence":"The rabbit dug a deep ______ underground to hide from predators and raise its young. The tunnel system was safe and well-hidden.","translation":"兔子在地下挖了一個深洞來躲避掠食者並養育幼兔。這個隧道系統既安全又隱蔽。","word":"burrow"}},"burst":{"createdAt":1783151252596,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"burst表示由於壓力或充脹而突然破裂或爆炸","options":["deflate","burst","stretch","expand"],"sentence":"The balloon will ______ if you keep inflating it with more air. The rubber can only stretch so far before it ruptures suddenly.","translation":"如果你繼續給氣球充氣，它會爆炸。橡膠在突然破裂前只能拉伸這麼遠。","word":"burst"}},"bury":{"createdAt":1782303071295,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"bury 意為埋藏或埋葬，可用於埋葬死者或將物品埋入土壤中","options":["conference","contact","bury","doctrine"],"sentence":"The family decided to ______ their beloved dog in the backyard. They held a small ceremony to honor his memory in a grave beneath the old oak tree.","translation":"這個家庭決定在後院埋葬他們親愛的狗。他們舉行了一個小儀式來紀念他在老橡樹下墓地中的記憶。","word":"bury"}},"butcher":{"createdAt":1781417610418,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"butcher是指屠夫或肉商，販賣肉類食品的商人。","options":["tailor","butcher","gardener","carpenter"],"sentence":"The local ______ offered the finest quality meat in the neighborhood for over forty years. His shop was known for its fresh cuts and expert knowledge of different animal parts.","translation":"這位當地肉商在鄰近地區提供最優質的肉類已超過四十年。他的店以新鮮的肉品切割和對不同動物部位的專業知識而聞名。","word":"butcher"}},"by":{"createdAt":1781595752116,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"by 在此表示被動語態中的施事者，表示由誰製作或創作。","options":["against","by","for","from"],"sentence":"The famous painting was created ______ a renowned artist in the 17th century. The masterpiece was produced through the skillful hands of Leonardo da Vinci.","translation":"這幅著名繪畫是由一位十七世紀的著名藝術家創作的。這件傑作是通過李奧納多‧達文西的巧妙手藝創作的。","word":"by"}},"bypass":{"createdAt":1783923850852,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"bypass 作動詞表示「繞過」或「迴避」，在此指透過另外的路線來避開某處。","options":["widen","bypass","repair","monitor"],"sentence":"The construction crew decided to ______ the main road by building a temporary detour around the congestion. This alternative route allowed traffic to flow smoothly without entering the heavily congested downtown area.","translation":"建築隊決定透過在擁堵地區周圍建造臨時迂迴路線來繞過主幹道。這條替代路線允許交通暢通無阻，而不必進入擁堵的市中心地區。","word":"bypass"}},"cabinet":{"createdAt":1781343050499,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"cabinet 在此指政府內閣，由內閣部長組成，負責政策制定和領導各部門。","options":["furniture","kitchen","cabinet","room"],"sentence":"The President's ______ consists of important ministers who advise on major policy decisions. These officials head various government departments.","translation":"總統的內閣由重要的部長組成，他們就重大政策決定提供建議。這些官員領導著各個政府部門。","word":"cabinet"}},"cafeteria":{"createdAt":1783923893538,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"cafeteria 是指提供自助餐飲食的食堂或餐廳，通常在學校或辦公場所。","options":["cape","carton","cafeteria","cartoon"],"sentence":"The school ______ serves lunch to hundreds of students every day. Students line up with their trays to select from various hot and cold dishes.","translation":"學校的自助餐館每天為數百名學生供應午餐。學生排隊拿著托盤從各種熱食和冷食中選擇。","word":"cafeteria"}},"calcium":{"createdAt":1781799990466,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"calcium是化學元素鈣，是人體骨骼和牙齒的主要成分，通常存在於乳製品和綠葉蔬菜中。","options":["iron","calcium","zinc","sodium"],"sentence":"The doctor recommended that the elderly patient increase her intake of ______ through dairy products. This mineral is essential for maintaining strong bones and preventing fractures.","translation":"醫生建議年長患者透過乳製品增加她的鈣攝入量。這種礦物質對維持骨骼強度和預防骨折至關重要。","word":"calcium"}},"calculate":{"createdAt":1781624534711,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"calculate 意為「計算、估算」，表示通過數學運算確定數量或結果。","options":["guess","calculate","ignore","assume"],"sentence":"The engineer needed to ______ the exact amount of materials required for the construction project before ordering supplies. Any mistake in the numbers would result in cost overruns.","translation":"工程師在訂購物資前需要計算施工項目所需的確切材料數量。數字上的任何錯誤都會導致成本超支。","word":"calculate"}},"calculated":{"createdAt":1781479123533,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"calculated 表示經過深思熟慮、有意圖地策劃的，不是即興的。","options":["spontaneous","calculated","confused","nervous"],"sentence":"Her ______ response to the criticism showed that she had carefully considered every word before speaking. She deliberately chose phrases that would minimize conflict while addressing the concerns raised.","translation":"她對批評的精心策劃的回應顯示她在說話前已經仔細考慮了每一個詞。她刻意選擇能夠最小化衝突同時解決所提出問題的措辭。","word":"calculated"}},"calculation":{"createdAt":1783346573160,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"calculation 意為計算或演算，指通過數學方法得出的結果。","options":["emotion","calculation","prediction","assumption"],"sentence":"The engineer's careful ______ of the bridge's load capacity prevented a structural disaster. She spent weeks reviewing her numbers to ensure every measurement was precise.","translation":"工程師對橋樑承重量的仔細計算防止了結構災難。她花費數週時間審查她的數字，以確保每項測量都是精確的。","word":"calculation"}},"calculator":{"createdAt":1781598671107,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"calculator 作名詞表示計算機或計算器，是用來執行數學運算的電子或機械設備","options":["compass","calculator","ruler","pencil"],"sentence":"The student used a ______ to solve the complex mathematical equations quickly. Without this device, the calculations would have taken much longer to complete.","translation":"學生用計算機快速解決複雜的數學方程。沒有這個設備，計算需要花費更長的時間才能完成。","word":"calculator"}},"calendar":{"createdAt":1783151252596,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"calendar是用來記錄日期和時間的工具，通常以年月日的形式組織","options":["planner","calendar","schedule","timetable"],"sentence":"I marked the important dates on my wall ______ so I wouldn't forget any appointments. The grid shows all twelve months with days and weeks laid out.","translation":"我在牆上的日曆上標記了重要日期，這樣我就不會忘記任何約會。網格顯示了所有十二個月，其中列出了天數和週數。","word":"calendar"}},"calligraphy":{"createdAt":1782638002575,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"書法是一種傳統藝術形式，使用毛筆精心書寫或繪製字符，強調筆畫的美感和技巧。","options":["painting","calligraphy","sculpture","photography"],"sentence":"The artist spent years perfecting her ______ skills, learning to paint beautiful characters with a brush. Her work was displayed in museums across Asia, where visitors admired the intricate brushstrokes and artistic expression.","translation":"這位藝術家花費多年時間完善她的書法技巧，學習用毛筆繪製美麗的文字。她的作品在亞洲各地的博物館展出，參觀者們欣賞其複雜的筆畫和藝術表現。","word":"calligraphy"}},"calm":{"createdAt":1782094693730,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"使鎮定是指讓某人或某物變得平靜和安詳。","options":["excite","calm","agitate","disturb"],"sentence":"The mother tried to ______ her crying baby by singing a soft lullaby. Within minutes, the child stopped crying and fell asleep peacefully.","translation":"母親試圖通過唱輕柔的搖籃曲來安撫她哭鬧的嬰兒。幾分鐘內，孩子停止了哭泣並安靜地入睡。","word":"calm"}},"calorie":{"createdAt":1783923893540,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"calorie 是熱量或能量的測量單位，在物理學和營養學中廣泛應用。","options":["cartoon","cafeteria","cape","calorie"],"sentence":"A single ______ is the amount of energy needed to raise the temperature of one gram of water by one degree Celsius. This scientific unit is essential for understanding nutrition and metabolism.","translation":"一個卡路里是將一克水的溫度提高攝氏一度所需的能量量。這個科學單位對於理解營養和新陳代謝至關重要。","word":"calorie"}},"cameo":{"createdAt":1782533789135,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cameo 名詞意思是客串演出，指著名演員在電影或電視劇中的短暫而有意義的出現。","options":["leading","cameo","supporting","dual"],"sentence":"The famous actor made a brief ______ appearance in the final scene of the superhero film. Though he only appeared for one minute, audiences recognized him instantly.","translation":"這位著名演員在超級英雄電影的最後一幕中進行了簡短的客串演出。雖然他只出現了一分鐘，觀眾仍然立即認出了他。","word":"cameo"}},"camouflage":{"createdAt":1782305067260,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"camouflage是指用顏色、圖案或物體遮掩或隱藏某物，使其難以被發現。","options":["weapon","camouflage","uniform","shelter"],"sentence":"The soldier used ______ to hide from enemy soldiers in the forest. The green and brown patterns on his uniform helped him blend perfectly with the trees and bushes around him.","translation":"士兵用偽裝在森林中躲避敵軍。他制服上的綠色和棕色圖案幫助他完美地融入周圍的樹木和灌木叢中。","word":"camouflage"}},"campaign":{"createdAt":1783419789617,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"campaign 指的是一系列有計劃且協調的活動，為了達到特定的目標，特別是在行銷或政治領域。","options":["strategy","campaign","promotion","project"],"sentence":"The company launched a major marketing ______ to promote their new product. They spent millions of dollars on advertising across television, social media, and billboards for three months.","translation":"該公司發起了一項大規模的行銷活動來推廣他們的新產品。他們在三個月內花費數百萬美元在電視、社群媒體和看板上進行廣告。","word":"campaign"}},"campus":{"createdAt":1781709984195,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"campus 特指大學或學校的全部校地和設施，包括建築物、宿舍和活動區域。","options":["building","campus","grounds","area"],"sentence":"The university's ______ is located in the heart of the city with beautiful gardens and modern buildings. Students can walk from their dormitories to the library in just ten minutes.","translation":"這所大學的校園位於城市中心，擁有美麗的花園和現代建築。學生可以在十分鐘內從宿舍走到圖書館。","word":"campus"}},"canal":{"createdAt":1783305898351,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"canal 是指人工開挖的水道或渠道，用於運輸水或船隻，常見於農業灌溉和城市運輸。","options":["reservoir","canal","pipeline","aqueduct"],"sentence":"The city built a ______ to transport water from the river to the distant farmland. This artificial waterway stretches for several miles and provides irrigation for crops.","translation":"這座城市修建了一條運河，將河水運送到遠處的農田。這條人工水道綿延數英里，為莊稼提供灌溉。","word":"canal"}},"cancel":{"createdAt":1781824444629,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"cancel 動詞表示取消或廢除已計劃的事件、預約或計畫。","options":["delay","confirm","cancel","accelerate"],"sentence":"Due to severe weather warnings, the airline had to ______ all flights scheduled for tomorrow. Passengers were offered full refunds or the option to rebook on future dates.","translation":"由於嚴重的天氣警告，航空公司必須取消所有計劃在明天進行的航班。乘客被提供全額退款或在未來日期改簽的選項。","word":"cancel"}},"cancer":{"createdAt":1781926371000,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"cancer 在這裡引申意思是迅速蔓延的弊病或惡習，比喻社會中不斷擴散的不良現象。","options":["strength","tradition","cancer","benefit"],"sentence":"Corruption has become a ______ in the local government, spreading through various departments. Officials have been arrested and convicted for accepting bribes and embezzling public funds.","translation":"腐敗已成為地方政府的惡習，蔓延到各個部門。官員因接受賄賂和挪用公款而被逮捕和定罪。","word":"cancer"}},"candidate":{"createdAt":1782982841049,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"candidate 意為候選人或應徵者，指參與競選或申請職位的人。","options":["spectator","candidate","journalist","volunteer"],"sentence":"The ______ for the mayor's position gave an impressive speech at the town hall meeting. He outlined his plans to improve education, infrastructure, and public safety if elected.","translation":"市長職位的候選人在城鎮大廳會議上發表了令人印象深刻的演講。他概述了若當選將改善教育、基礎設施和公共安全的計劃。","word":"candidate"}},"cane":{"createdAt":1784301551069,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cane 是一種單手拄著走路的長杆，通常用來幫助行走或作為裝飾配件，與 crutch（腋下拐杖）或 walker（助行器）不同。","options":["crutch","cane","walker","wheelchair"],"sentence":"The elderly man used a wooden ______ to help him walk down the steep street safely. The handle was smoothly carved and the shaft was polished to a fine shine.","translation":"這位老人用木製的手杖幫助他安全地走下陡峭的街道。手柄被光滑地雕刻，杖身被拋光得光亮閃閃。","word":"cane"}},"cannon":{"createdAt":1783489104908,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"大砲是一種大型火炮，通過爆炸火藥推動炮彈，在古代和近代戰爭中被廣泛用於防禦和進攻。","options":["musket","cannon","crossbow","sword"],"sentence":"The old fortress was equipped with several iron ______ aimed at the harbor. These weapons had defended the city from naval attacks for centuries.","translation":"這座古老的堡壘配備了幾門瞄準港口的鐵炮。這些武器已經為城市防禦海上攻擊數百年。","word":"cannon"}},"canvas":{"createdAt":1784193653313,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"canvas 是專指用於繪畫的帆布或油畫布，能夠承受各種繪畫顏料，是專業畫家的標準用材。","options":["canvas","paper","plastic","metal"],"sentence":"The artist stretched the ______ across the wooden frame before beginning to paint. She used a high-quality material that would hold acrylic paint without tearing.","translation":"藝術家在開始繪畫前把帆布拉伸到木質框架上。她使用了高品質的材料，可以承受丙烯顏料而不會撕裂。","word":"canvas"}},"canyon":{"createdAt":1781343050501,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"canyon 是指由河流侵蝕而成的深谷或峽谷，具有陡峭的岩壁。","options":["mountain","forest","canyon","desert"],"sentence":"Tourists flock to the famous ______ in Arizona to hike along its steep walls and river. The massive geological formation took millions of years to form.","translation":"遊客蜂擁到亞利桑那州著名的峽谷，沿著陡峭的岩壁和河流徒步旅行。這個龐大的地質構造花了數百萬年才形成。","word":"canyon"}},"capability":{"createdAt":1781850347301,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"能力是指某人或某物完成任務、執行功能或達到目標的力量或潛能。","options":["weakness","capability","limitation","cost"],"sentence":"The new software demonstrated impressive ______ by processing thousands of data points in just seconds. The company's engineers were amazed at how efficiently it could handle complex calculations.","translation":"新軟體通過在短短幾秒內處理數千個資料點來展示令人印象深刻的能力。公司的工程師對它處理複雜計算的效率感到驚訝。","word":"capability"}},"capable":{"createdAt":1781693304924,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"capable 表示有能力、有資格或足以勝任某項任務或職位。","options":["incapable","unworthy","capable","hesitant"],"sentence":"Maria proved herself ______ of leading the entire department after successfully completing three major projects. Her manager decided to promote her to director.","translation":"瑪麗亞通過成功完成三個重大項目後，證明了自己有能力領導整個部門。她的經理決定將她晉升為主任。","word":"capable"}},"capacity":{"createdAt":1781798927523,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"capacity 在此語境中表示容納能力或容量，即某物體或場所能容納的最大數量。","options":["design","capacity","quality","style"],"sentence":"The concert hall has a seating ______ of 5,000 people. When the venue reached full occupancy last night, no additional tickets could be sold.","translation":"音樂廳的座位容量為5,000人。當場地昨晚滿座時，無法再銷售任何額外的票券。","word":"capacity"}},"cape":{"createdAt":1783923893538,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"cape 是指披在肩膀上的無袖外衣或斗篷，常見於超級英雄或正式服裝中。","options":["carton","calorie","cape","cafeteria"],"sentence":"The superhero wore a flowing red ______ that billowed behind him as he flew through the city. This garment was an iconic part of his costume that made him instantly recognizable.","translation":"超級英雄穿著一件飄動的紅色斗篷，當他在城市中飛行時斗篷在身後飄揚。這件衣服是他服裝的標誌性部分，讓他一眼就能被認出。","word":"cape"}},"capital":{"createdAt":1781835517794,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"capital 在此作名詞使用，意為一個國家或地區的首都，是政治和經濟中心。","options":["province","capital","village","border"],"sentence":"The ______ of France is Paris, a beautiful city known for its museums and monuments. It is the most important city in the country where the government is located.","translation":"法國的首都是巴黎，一座以博物館和紀念碑聞名的美麗城市。它是國家中政府所在的最重要的城市。","word":"capital"}},"capitalism":{"createdAt":1781256485491,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"capitalism是一種經濟制度，強調私有財產權和市場競爭","options":["socialism","feudalism","capitalism","monarchy"],"sentence":"The country's economy is based on ______, where private individuals and businesses own the means of production. Citizens are free to buy, sell, and compete in the marketplace without heavy government control.","translation":"這個國家的經濟以資本主義為基礎，由私人和企業擁有生產資料。公民可以自由地在市場上買賣和競爭，不受政府過度控制。","word":"capitalism"}},"capitalist":{"createdAt":1781484415140,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"資本家是指相信資本主義經濟制度、進行商業投資以獲取利潤的人。","options":["socialist","capitalist","artist","scientist"],"sentence":"The wealthy ______ invested heavily in new factories and technologies. He believed that private ownership and profit-seeking were the best ways to grow the economy.","translation":"這位富有的資本家在新工廠和技術上投入了大量資金。他相信私人所有制和追求利潤是發展經濟的最佳方式。","word":"capitalist"}},"capsule":{"createdAt":1782094627219,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"capsule 在此指「太空艙」，是一個密閉的小型容器，用來保護乘員和貨物在太空中的安全。","options":["capsule","module","rocket","shuttle"],"sentence":"The astronauts climbed into the space ______ for their mission to the International Space Station. The protective vessel would shield them from extreme temperatures and radiation during launch.","translation":"太空人爬進太空艙進行前往國際太空站的任務。這個保護性容器在發射過程中會保護他們免受極端溫度和輻射的傷害。","word":"capsule"}},"captain":{"createdAt":1781787229332,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"captain 作為名詞指的是球隊、船舶或飛機的領導者，具有決策權和權威。","options":["referee","captain","coach","spectator"],"sentence":"The team's ______ made the final decision about which players would start the match. He had earned the respect of all his teammates through years of dedication.","translation":"隊長做出了關於哪些球員將首發出場的最終決定。他通過多年的奉獻獲得了所有隊友的尊重。","word":"captain"}},"caption":{"createdAt":1781580511754,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"caption 是圖片下方的說明文字，用來補充圖像內容","options":["border","caption","headline","layout"],"sentence":"The newspaper printed a ______ beneath the photograph to explain what was happening. Without this text, readers wouldn't understand the context of the image.","translation":"報紙在照片下方印了一個說明文字來解釋發生了什麼。沒有這個文本，讀者就不會理解圖像的背景。","word":"caption"}},"captioned":{"createdAt":1781799990462,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"captioned是指帶有字幕或標題的，特別用於描述視頻、照片或文件附加了文字說明的狀態。","options":["translated","captioned","dubbed","animated"],"sentence":"The ______ video included text overlays at the bottom of the screen. This feature was especially helpful for viewers watching in noisy environments.","translation":"那支附字幕的影片在螢幕底部包含了文字覆蓋層。這個功能對在嘈雜環境中觀看的觀眾特別有幫助。","word":"captioned"}},"captivate":{"createdAt":1781256547737,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Captivate表示強烈吸引某人的注意力和興趣，使其深深著迷。","options":["bore","captivate","educate","frighten"],"sentence":"The magician's extraordinary performance managed to ______ the entire audience for two hours. From the opening trick to the final illusion, every moment held their complete attention and wonder.","translation":"魔術師的非凡表演設法使整個觀眾著迷了兩個小時。從開場戲法到最後的幻象，每一刻都吸引了他們的完全注意力和驚嘆。","word":"captivate"}},"captivated":{"createdAt":1789355206436,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"captivated 是過去分詞形容詞，意思是被深深吸引或迷住，通常用來描述某人對某事物產生強烈的注意力和興趣。","options":["bored","captivated","confused","exhausted"],"sentence":"The audience was completely ______ by the magician's incredible illusions and stunning performance. Everyone sat motionless in their seats, unable to look away or think about anything else.","translation":"觀眾被魔術師不可思議的幻術和令人驚嘆的表演完全吸引住了。每個人都靜靜地坐在座位上，無法移開視線或想到其他任何事情。","word":"captivated"}},"captivating":{"createdAt":1783840979878,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"captivating 是形容詞，表示某事物能夠吸引人的注意力或令人感到著迷，使人無法將目光移開。","options":["boring","captivating","lengthy","educational"],"sentence":"The documentary was so ______ that the audience sat in complete silence for two hours. The filmmaker's use of rare footage and compelling storytelling kept everyone's attention from beginning to end.","translation":"這部紀錄片是如此令人著迷，以至於觀眾完全安靜地坐了兩個小時。電影製作者使用稀有鏡頭和引人入勝的敘事手法從始至終吸引了每個人的注意力。","word":"captivating"}},"captive":{"createdAt":1782921669882,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"captive是名詞，指被關押或被囚禁的人，強調失去自由和被拘禁的狀態。","options":["prisoner","captive","visitor","witness"],"sentence":"The ______ was held in the fortress for three years without any chance of escape. The guards made sure he could not leave the compound under any circumstances.","translation":"那個俘虜在堡壘裡被關押了三年，沒有任何逃脫的機會。守衛確保他在任何情況下都無法離開該區域。","word":"captive"}},"captivity":{"createdAt":1781429945496,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"captivity 表示被監禁或囚禁的狀態，通常用來描述動物或人被關起來失去自由的情況。","options":["freedom","captivity","training","migration"],"sentence":"The lion spent twenty years in ______ before finally being released to a wildlife sanctuary. After decades of confinement in a cage, the animal could barely remember how to hunt in the wild.","translation":"這隻獅子在被釋放到野生動物保護區之前，花了二十年被關在籠子裡。經過數十年的囚禁，這隻動物幾乎記不得如何在野外捕獵了。","word":"captivity"}},"capture":{"createdAt":1781709984194,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"capture 在攝影語境中表示拍攝或記錄影像，捕捉某個特定時刻。","options":["record","capture","draw","catch"],"sentence":"The photographer managed to ______ a stunning image of the eagle in flight. The award-winning shot was printed on the cover of National Geographic magazine.","translation":"攝影師成功拍攝到一張老鷹飛行中的絕美影像。這張獲獎照片被印在《國家地理》雜誌的封面上。","word":"capture"}},"carbohydrate":{"createdAt":1783243171150,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"carbohydrate是碳水化合物，是主要能量營養素，包括糖類、澱粉等，是身體快速能量的主要來源。","options":["protein","carbohydrate","mineral","vitamin"],"sentence":"Bread, pasta, and rice are all rich sources of ______ that provide energy for the body. Athletes often consume these foods before competitions to fuel their performance.","translation":"麵包、義大利麵和米飯都是提供身體能量的豐富碳水化合物來源。運動員經常在比賽前食用這些食物來為他們的表現提供燃料。","word":"carbohydrate"}},"carbon":{"createdAt":1781850347303,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"碳是一種化學元素，是有機物的基礎，存在於所有生命體中。","options":["nitrogen","oxygen","hydrogen","carbon"],"sentence":"The scientist measured the amount of ______ dioxide in the atmosphere to track climate change. This chemical compound consists of one carbon atom and two oxygen atoms.","translation":"科學家測量了大氣中的二氧化碳含量以追蹤氣候變化。這種化合物由一個碳原子和兩個氧原子組成。","word":"carbon"}},"cardinal":{"createdAt":1782170870876,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"cardinal作為形容詞表示極重要的、基本的或主要的，通常用於描述最核心的原則或目標。","options":["minor","flexible","cardinal","temporary"],"sentence":"One ______ principle in environmental conservation is protecting biodiversity at all costs. Scientists agree that this goal must be the foundation of all conservation policies.","translation":"環境保護的一個極重要原則是不惜一切代價保護生物多樣性。科學家們同意這一目標必須是所有保護政策的基礎。","word":"cardinal"}},"career":{"createdAt":1784220867711,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"career（職業；生涯歷程）指的是一個人在工作中經歷的長期發展過程，包括各種職位、經驗和成就。","options":["hobby","career","schedule","vacation"],"sentence":"She spent over thirty years building a successful ______ in finance. After her retirement, she reflected on all the promotions, challenges, and achievements that defined her professional journey.","translation":"她在金融領域花了三十多年建立成功的職業生涯。退休後，她反思了定義她職業道路的所有晉升、挑戰和成就。","word":"career"}},"carefree":{"createdAt":1782106217860,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"carefree作為形容詞表示「無憂無慮的、輕鬆的」，形容沒有困擾或擔心的狀態。","options":["anxious","carefree","burdened","stressed"],"sentence":"During summer vacation, the children felt ______ as they played in the park without any homework or responsibilities. Their laughter and joy reflected their complete lack of worry.","translation":"暑假期間，孩子們在公園裡玩耍時感到無憂無慮，因為沒有功課或責任。他們的笑聲和快樂反映了他們完全沒有煩惱。","word":"carefree"}},"careless":{"createdAt":1781850347302,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"粗心是形容詞，指缺乏注意力、不謹慎或沒有仔細考慮。","options":["intentional","clever","careless","strategic"],"sentence":"His ______ mistake on the exam cost him ten points that he could have easily avoided. He simply did not review his answers before submitting the paper.","translation":"他在考試上的粗心錯誤讓他失去了十分，這是他本來可以輕易避免的。他根本沒有在提交試卷前檢查他的答案。","word":"careless"}},"carelessness":{"createdAt":1783947021214,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"carelessness 是名詞，意為粗心或不小心，指缺乏應有的注意力和謹慎態度而導致的疏忽。","options":["intelligence","courage","carelessness","experience"],"sentence":"The accident on the highway was caused by the driver's ______, as he was texting while driving. His lack of attention and disregard for safety rules endangered the lives of everyone on the road.","translation":"高速公路上的事故是由於駕駛員的粗心造成的，因為他在開車時發送短信。他對安全規則的漠視和不注意危及了道路上所有人的生命。","word":"carelessness"}},"caretaker":{"createdAt":1782920661029,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"caretaker是指照顧者或看護人，負責照顧他人的健康和福祉","options":["assistant","caretaker","housekeeper","helper"],"sentence":"The elderly woman hired a ______ to help her with daily activities and household tasks. This compassionate person visited her home every day to provide necessary care.","translation":"這位老婦人聘請了一位照顧者來幫助她進行日常活動和家務。這位富有同情心的人每天都來她家提供必要的照顧。","word":"caretaker"}},"carnival":{"createdAt":1781485266374,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"carnival指的是充滿歡樂、娛樂和狂歡氣氛的節日或嘉年華會。","options":["funeral","conference","carnival","meeting"],"sentence":"The city hosted a week-long ______ with colorful parades, live music, and festive celebrations. Thousands of visitors came to enjoy the vibrant atmosphere and traditional festivities.","translation":"這座城市舉辦了為期一週的嘉年華，有彩色遊行、現場音樂和節日慶祝活動。數千名遊客來享受充滿活力的氛圍和傳統慶祝活動。","word":"carnival"}},"carnivore":{"createdAt":1783572769865,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"carnivore 是指專門以肉類為食的動物，與雜食性或草食性動物區別開來。","options":["omnivore","carnivore","scavenger","predator"],"sentence":"A lion is a ______ that hunts other animals for food. Unlike herbivores that eat only plants, this animal has sharp teeth and claws specifically adapted for catching and eating meat.","translation":"獅子是一種以狩獵其他動物為食的食肉動物。與只吃植物的草食動物不同，這種動物具有專門為捕捉和食用肉類而進化的尖銳牙齒和爪子。","word":"carnivore"}},"carpenter":{"createdAt":1781362281665,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"carpenter指的是從事木工工作的工人，製造或修理木製結構和物品。","options":["plumber","carpenter","electrician","mason"],"sentence":"The ______ carefully measured and cut the wood for the new deck. His skilled hands shaped each piece into the perfect size and fit.","translation":"木匠仔細測量並為新甲板切割木材。他熟練的手將每一塊木料塑造成完美的尺寸和配合。","word":"carpenter"}},"carriage":{"createdAt":1781256485494,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"carriage是指四輪馬車或火車車廂，用於運載乘客","options":["airplane","bicycle","carriage","submarine"],"sentence":"The luxurious ______ was pulled by four white horses through the royal procession. Passengers sat in the decorated wooden compartment as crowds watched the ceremonial parade.","translation":"這輛豪華的四輪馬車由四匹白馬拉著通過皇家遊行隊伍。乘客坐在裝飾華麗的木製車廂內，眾人觀看了這場儀式性遊行。","word":"carriage"}},"carry":{"createdAt":1781850347301,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"運送或攜帶是指用手、肩膀或其他方式將某物從一個地方移動到另一個地方。","options":["drag","throw","carry","drop"],"sentence":"The strong porter could ______ four heavy suitcases up the stairs without any help. His muscular arms made lifting the luggage look effortless.","translation":"這位強壯的行李員能夠毫無幫助地將四個沉重的行李箱運上樓梯。他結實的手臂使提著行李看起來毫不費力。","word":"carry"}},"carton":{"createdAt":1783923893539,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"carton 是指用硬紙板或塑膠製成的盒子，用於包裝和運輸商品。","options":["cafeteria","cartoon","carton","calorie"],"sentence":"The bakery packed the pastries in a sturdy ______ to protect them during delivery. The box was printed with the company's logo and contact information.","translation":"麵包店將糕點裝在堅固的紙盒中以在運送過程中保護它們。這個盒子上印著公司的標誌和聯繫資訊。","word":"carton"}},"cartoon":{"createdAt":1783923893539,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"cartoon 是指動畫片或卡通片，通常為兒童或成人設計的視覺娛樂節目。","options":["calorie","cape","cartoon","cafeteria"],"sentence":"The children watched their favorite ______ on television every Saturday morning. The animated series featured colorful characters and humorous adventures that kept them entertained.","translation":"孩子們每個星期六早上都在電視上看他們最喜歡的卡通片。這部動畫系列以彩色角色和幽默的冒險故事讓他們開心。","word":"cartoon"}},"carve":{"createdAt":1784169916848,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"雕刻是指用工具在堅硬的材料如石頭或木頭上切割以創作圖案或形狀。","options":["paint","carve","mold","cast"],"sentence":"The artist used a chisel to ______ an intricate design into the marble block. Each detailed pattern required hours of careful work on the stone surface.","translation":"藝術家用鑿子在大理石塊上雕刻了一個複雜的設計。每個細緻的圖案都需要在石頭表面花費數小時的仔細工作。","word":"carve"}},"cashier":{"createdAt":1781850347302,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"收銀員是在商店、銀行或餐館等地負責收錢、計算費用和處理付款的人員。","options":["manager","customer","cashier","clerk"],"sentence":"The ______ at the supermarket scanned all the groceries and told me the total came to forty-five dollars. I handed over my credit card to complete the transaction.","translation":"超市的收銀員掃描了所有雜貨並告訴我總額是四十五美元。我遞上我的信用卡來完成交易。","word":"cashier"}},"casino":{"createdAt":1781693265624,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"賭場是一個提供賭博遊戲和娛樂的商業場所。","options":["museum","casino","library","hospital"],"sentence":"Many tourists visit the ______ to try their luck at games of chance. The establishment is famous for its slot machines, poker tables, and roulette wheels.","translation":"許多遊客到賭場碰碰運氣玩機率遊戲。該場所以老虎機、撲克牌桌和輪盤遊戲而聞名。","word":"casino"}},"cassette":{"createdAt":1781256485493,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cassette是指盒式錄音帶或錄影帶，通常用於儲存音樂或視頻","options":["mirror","cassette","book","lamp"],"sentence":"She found an old ______ in her mother's attic from the 1980s. The magnetic tape inside contained recordings of family conversations from decades ago.","translation":"她在母親的閣樓裡發現了一個來自1980年代的舊盒式錄音帶。裡面的磁帶包含了幾十年前的家庭對話錄音。","word":"cassette"}},"cast":{"createdAt":1781776694538,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cast 作為名詞，意思是電影、戲劇或節目中的所有演員。","options":["script","cast","budget","location"],"sentence":"The ______ of the new film includes several award-winning actors. The director carefully selected each performer to bring the story to life on screen.","translation":"這部新電影的演員陣容包括多位獲獎的演員。導演仔細挑選了每位演員來在銀幕上呈現這個故事。","word":"cast"}},"castle":{"createdAt":1781951900951,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"castle特指貴族或王室居住的帶有防禦功能的大型建築，通常有護城河和塔樓。","options":["mansion","castle","fortress","tower"],"sentence":"The medieval ______ stood majestically on the hilltop with its tall stone walls and multiple towers. Visitors could see the defensive moat surrounding the entire structure.","translation":"中世紀的城堡以其高聳的石牆和多座塔樓雄偉地矗立在山頂。遊客可以看到環繞整個建築的防禦性護城河。","word":"castle"}},"casual":{"createdAt":1783159261866,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"casual（隨便的；漫不經心的）表示不認真或沒有充分考慮的行為或態度。","options":["serious","formal","casual","prepared"],"sentence":"He made a ______ remark about the meeting without giving it much thought. His comment was so offhand and careless that it upset his colleagues.","translation":"他對會議做了一個隨便的評論，沒有經過深思。他的評論是如此漫不經心和不負責任，以至於惹惱了他的同事。","word":"casual"}},"casualty":{"createdAt":1782953855198,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"casualty 在醫療語境中指醫院的急診室，用於處理緊急傷患和創傷情況","options":["reception","casualty","pharmacy","cafeteria"],"sentence":"The hospital's ______ was overwhelmed after the major train accident yesterday. The staff worked through the night treating injured passengers and coordinating emergency responses.","translation":"昨天重大火車事故後，醫院的急診室不堪重負。工作人員整夜工作，治療傷亡乘客並協調應急反應。","word":"casualty"}},"catalogue":{"createdAt":1782040742474,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"catalogue 名詞意為「目錄、清單」，指系統地列出商品、書籍或其他物品的完整清單。","options":["catalogue","rumor","theory","debate"],"sentence":"The library published a comprehensive ______ listing all ten thousand books in its collection. Visitors could use this detailed index to locate any specific title they needed.","translation":"圖書館出版了一份全面的目錄，列出了其收藏中的所有一萬本書。訪客可以使用這份詳細的索引來定位他們需要的任何特定書籍。","word":"catalogue"}},"catastrophe":{"createdAt":1782982841050,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"catastrophe 意為大災難或重大災禍，指造成嚴重破壞和大量傷亡的災害事件。","options":["event","catastrophe","celebration","discovery"],"sentence":"The tsunami of 2004 was a devastating ______ that killed hundreds of thousands of people across multiple countries. The disaster destroyed entire coastal communities and changed the lives of millions of survivors.","translation":"2004年的海嘯是一場毀滅性的大災難，造成數十萬人在多個國家喪生。這場災害摧毀了整個沿海社區，改變了數百萬倖存者的生活。","word":"catastrophe"}},"catch":{"createdAt":1783505313973,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"catch作動詞表示「接住」，指成功地用手或其他方式截住移動中的物體。","options":["throw","catch","hit","run"],"sentence":"The baseball player jumped high in the air to ______ the fly ball. Without his quick reflexes, the ball would have landed in the outfield.","translation":"棒球運動員跳起來去接那個飛球。如果沒有他敏捷的反應，球就會落在外野。","word":"catch"}},"category":{"createdAt":1781566185161,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"category指將事物按共同特徵分組的方式，用來分類和組織不同的項目。","options":["color","price","category","author"],"sentence":"The books in the library are organized by ______ to help readers find what they need. Fiction, non-fiction, biography, and science are examples of how the collection is arranged.","translation":"圖書館裡的書籍按種類組織，以幫助讀者找到他們需要的書。小說、非虛構、傳記和科學是收藏如何分類的例子。","word":"category"}},"cater":{"createdAt":1783141117687,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cater 作為動詞，意為「備辦食物」或「迎合要求」，常用於指提供食物服務或滿足特定需求。","options":["ignore","cater","decorate","schedule"],"sentence":"The restaurant will ______ the wedding reception with a three-course meal. They have prepared a menu specifically designed to suit all dietary preferences of the 200 guests.","translation":"這家餐廳將為婚禮招待會備辦三道菜的餐點。他們準備了一份菜單，特別設計來滿足200位賓客的所有飲食偏好。","word":"cater"}},"caterpillar":{"createdAt":1783502229639,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"caterpillar 是昆蟲的幼蟲形態，特別是蝴蝶或蛾的幼蟲，有著細長的身體和多條腿。","options":["butterfly","beetle","caterpillar","ant"],"sentence":"The green ______ crawled slowly along the leaf, munching on the plant material. In a few weeks, it would spin a cocoon and transform into a beautiful butterfly.","translation":"綠色的毛蟲沿著葉子緩慢爬行，啃食植物材料。幾週後，它會結繭並變身為美麗的蝴蝶。","word":"caterpillar"}},"cathedral":{"createdAt":1781598671066,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cathedral 作名詞表示大教堂或總教堂，通常是一座重要的宗教建築","options":["mansion","cathedral","warehouse","restaurant"],"sentence":"The magnificent ______ in the city center attracts thousands of tourists every year. Its Gothic architecture and stained glass windows are masterpieces from the medieval period.","translation":"市中心宏偉的大教堂每年吸引數千名遊客。其哥德式建築和彩色玻璃窗是中世紀的傑作。","word":"cathedral"}},"cattle":{"createdAt":1782094693728,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"牛是指大型的哺乳動物，通常被飼養用於產奶和肉類。","options":["sheep","cattle","horses","pigs"],"sentence":"The farmer herded his ______ across the pasture to fresh grazing land. The herd of bovine animals needed to move to find better grass.","translation":"農夫將他的牛群趕過牧場到新的放牧地。這群牛科動物需要移動以尋找更好的草地。","word":"cattle"}},"caught":{"createdAt":1781345746906,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"caught 是 catch 的過去式，在此指「染上」疾病，表示受感染。","options":["threw","caught","threw away","dropped"],"sentence":"The child ______ a terrible cold while playing outside in the rain. Within two days, he developed a fever and had to stay home from school.","translation":"孩子在雨中外面玩耍時染上了嚴重的感冒。兩天內，他發燒了，不得不待在家裡不去上學。","word":"caught"}},"causal":{"createdAt":1781842254311,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"causal 指涉及因果關係的，表示一件事物直接導致另一件事物發生的關係。","options":["random","causal","theoretical","emotional"],"sentence":"The researcher studied the ______ relationship between smoking and lung disease in her medical paper. She carefully examined how smoking directly caused changes in patients' lung tissue over time.","translation":"研究者在她的醫學論文中研究了吸菸和肺病之間的因果關係。她仔細檢查了吸菸如何隨著時間推移直接導致患者肺組織變化。","word":"causal"}},"cause":{"createdAt":1783151252601,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cause指的是導致某事發生的原因或起因","options":["result","cause","effect","outcome"],"sentence":"The heavy rainfall was the main ______ of the flooding in the valley last week. Without the excessive water from the storm, the disaster would not have occurred.","translation":"上週山谷洪水的主要原因是暴雨。沒有風暴帶來的過量水分，災難就不會發生。","word":"cause"}},"causing":{"createdAt":1787726211122,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"causing是現在進行式，表示「正在引起或導致」某事發生，常與負面結果搭配使用。","options":["preventing","causing","observing","celebrating"],"sentence":"The heavy rainfall is ______ flooding in several neighborhoods. Local authorities have declared a state of emergency due to the water damage.","translation":"大雨正在引起幾個社區的洪災。由於水災，當地當局已宣布進入緊急狀態。","word":"causing"}},"caution":{"createdAt":1783262026080,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"caution 作為名詞表示「小心、謹慎」，用來描述在危險情況下應有的態度和行為。","options":["speed","caution","confidence","patience"],"sentence":"The warning sign urged ______ when crossing the icy bridge. The safety inspector emphasized that drivers needed to slow down and remain vigilant to avoid accidents.","translation":"警告標誌在過冰橋時敦促小心。安全檢查員強調駕駛員需要減速並保持警惕以避免事故。","word":"caution"}},"cautionary":{"createdAt":1787118100433,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cautionary 是形容詞，表示警告性的或作為警戒的，目的是讓人吸取教訓。","options":["celebratory","cautionary","entertaining","educational"],"sentence":"The film served as a ______ tale about the dangers of reckless driving. Many high schools showed it to students to discourage them from unsafe behavior behind the wheel.","translation":"這部電影是一個關於魯莽駕駛危險的警告故事。許多高中向學生放映它以勸阻他們不要在駕駛時進行不安全行為。","word":"cautionary"}},"cautious":{"createdAt":1785462866776,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cautious 意為謹慎的、小心的，描述某人在面對潛在危險或風險時採取小心謹慎的態度或行動。","options":["reckless","cautious","cheerful","confident"],"sentence":"The driver remained ______ on the icy road, reducing speed and avoiding sudden movements. She knew that one careless mistake could cause a serious accident.","translation":"駕駛者在結冰的道路上保持謹慎，降低速度並避免突然移動。她知道一個粗心的錯誤可能會導致嚴重的事故。","word":"cautious"}},"cave":{"createdAt":1783502229634,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cave 是指天然形成的地下或山體中的空洞，通常由石灰岩或其他岩石侵蝕而成。","options":["tunnel","cave","building","valley"],"sentence":"The explorers discovered a massive ______ hidden deep within the mountainside during their expedition. Inside, they found ancient rock formations and evidence that prehistoric humans had once lived there.","translation":"探險家們在探險中發現了隱藏在山腰深處的大山洞。裡面他們發現了古老的岩層和史前人類曾經居住過的證據。","word":"cave"}},"cavity":{"createdAt":1782303071297,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cavity 在牙科中指蛀牙，也可泛指物體表面或內部的空隙或凹陷","options":["conference","cavity","compass","distant"],"sentence":"The dentist found a ______ in the patient's back tooth during the examination. The decay had formed a small hole that required immediate filling.","translation":"牙醫在檢查中發現患者後牙有一個蛀牙。蛀蝕形成了一個需要立即填充的小洞。","word":"cavity"}},"cease":{"createdAt":1784193653312,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cease 意為停止或結束，在此句子中表示工廠將停止生產，與「最終關閉日期」的上下文相符。","options":["continue","cease","expand","restart"],"sentence":"The factory will ______ production of this model next month. The company has already announced the final shutdown date to all employees.","translation":"工廠下個月將停止生產這個型號。公司已經向所有員工宣布了最終關閉日期。","word":"cease"}},"ceiling":{"createdAt":1781274836863,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ceiling在此context表示上限或最高限制，特別是指款項或價格不能超越的界限。","options":["foundation","ceiling","floor","wall"],"sentence":"The government announced a price ______ to prevent inflation from getting worse. No business was allowed to charge more than the maximum amount established by law.","translation":"政府宣布了價格上限以防止通貨膨脹惡化。法律規定沒有企業被允許收取超過最高金額。","word":"ceiling"}},"celebrate":{"createdAt":1782461900356,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"celebrate是指以歡樂、興奮的方式來紀念或歡慶一個重要的成就或事件。","options":["mourn","acknowledge","celebrate","remember"],"sentence":"The whole team gathered to ______ their victory after winning the championship game. They cheered, hugged, and danced together to mark this special achievement.","translation":"整個團隊聚在一起慶祝他們贏得冠軍賽後的勝利。他們歡呼、擁抱，一起跳舞來紀念這個特殊的成就。","word":"celebrate"}},"celebrated":{"createdAt":1781693295125,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"celebrated 是形容詞，表示著名的或備受尊敬的，用來描述有成就的人物。","options":["unknown","celebrated","fictional","ordinary"],"sentence":"The ______ author gave a lecture at our school last week, and hundreds of students attended. Her bestselling novels have been translated into 40 languages and won multiple international awards.","translation":"這位著名作家上周在我們學校舉辦了一場講座，數百名學生參加了。她的暢銷小說已被翻譯成40種語言，並贏得了多項國際獎項。","word":"celebrated"}},"celebration":{"createdAt":1783572181134,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"celebration 是名詞，意思是慶祝或慶典活動，通常涉及聚集、音樂、娛樂等歡樂的形式。","options":["punishment","celebration","argument","confusion"],"sentence":"The town organized a grand ______ to mark the anniversary of its founding. The event featured parades, fireworks, and thousands of residents gathering in the streets to honor the historic occasion.","translation":"這個城鎮組織了一場盛大的慶典來紀念它的建城週年紀念日。活動包括遊行、煙火，以及數千名居民聚集在街道上來榮耀這個歷史時刻。","word":"celebration"}},"celebrity":{"createdAt":1782646755360,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"celebrity 指的是因為才能或成就而獲得廣泛知名度和名望的著名人物。","options":["star","celebrity","performer","winner"],"sentence":"The young singer became an instant ______ after winning the national talent competition. Fans followed her everywhere, and she could no longer walk down the street without being recognized.","translation":"這位年輕歌手在贏得全國人才競賽後立即成為名人。粉絲到處跟著她，她再也不能在街上走而不被認出。","word":"celebrity"}},"cell":{"createdAt":1783151252594,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"cell是指構成所有生物體的最基本的生命單位","options":["tissue","organ","cell","organism"],"sentence":"The biologist examined a human ______ under the microscope to study its structure. The smallest unit of life contains a nucleus and cytoplasm.","translation":"生物學家在顯微鏡下檢查了一個人類細胞以研究其結構。生命的最小單位包含核和細胞質。","word":"cell"}},"cellular":{"createdAt":1784540090493,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cellular 是形容詞，意指與細胞有關的或由細胞組成的，用來描述涉及細胞層面的結構或過程。","options":["molecular","cellular","skeletal","organic"],"sentence":"The ______ structure of the organism allows it to function at the microscopic level. Scientists use powerful microscopes to observe the individual cells that make up this tiny framework.","translation":"這個生物體的細胞結構使其能在微觀水平上發揮功能。科學家使用強大的顯微鏡來觀察組成這個微小框架的各個細胞。","word":"cellular"}},"celsius":{"createdAt":1784193653318,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"celsius 是攝氏溫度刻度的名稱，世界上大多數國家採用此溫度測量單位，與華氏度相對。","options":["fahrenheit","kelvin","celsius","rankine"],"sentence":"The thermometer showed a temperature of 25 ______, which is a pleasant spring day. This scale is commonly used in most countries around the world, unlike the Fahrenheit scale used in the United States.","translation":"溫度計顯示溫度為攝氏25度，這是一個舒適的春日。這個溫度刻度在世界上大多數國家使用，不同於美國使用的華氏刻度。","word":"celsius"}},"cement":{"createdAt":1782292175216,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cement 作為名詞表示水泥或粘合劑，用於建築和粘合物體，是本題的正確答案。","options":["momentum","cement","motive","occupied"],"sentence":"The construction workers used ______ to bind the bricks together and create a strong foundation. Without this adhesive material, the building structure would not hold up against harsh weather conditions.","translation":"建築工人使用水泥將磚塊粘合在一起，並建造堅固的地基。沒有這種粘合材料，建築結構就無法抵禦惡劣的天氣條件。","word":"cement"}},"cemetery":{"createdAt":1781425093251,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cemetery 是名詞，指公墓或墓地，是埋葬死者的地方。","options":["museum","cemetery","hospital","library"],"sentence":"The old ______ on the hill is surrounded by tall oak trees and contains graves dating back two centuries. Every November, families visit this sacred burial ground to remember their deceased relatives.","translation":"山上的老墓地被高大的橡樹包圍，裡面有可追溯到兩百年前的墓穴。每年11月，家庭都會到這個神聖的埋葬地悼念他們已故的親人。","word":"cemetery"}},"censorship":{"createdAt":1787118100436,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"censorship 指的是對信息、出版物或言論的審查和控制，防止人們接觸某些內容。","options":["transparency","censorship","freedom","literacy"],"sentence":"The government's strict ______ policies prevented citizens from accessing independent news sources online. Many journalists were arrested for reporting information the regime deemed forbidden.","translation":"政府嚴格的言論審查政策阻止公民在線訪問獨立新聞來源。許多記者因報導該政權認為禁止的信息而被逮捕。","word":"censorship"}},"census":{"createdAt":1781481311493,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"census指的是官方進行的人口普查或人口統計調查。","options":["lawsuit","census","election","forecast"],"sentence":"The government conducted a comprehensive ______ to count the population and gather demographic information. Every household received an official questionnaire asking about age, occupation, and family size.","translation":"政府進行了一次全面的人口普查，以統計人口並收集人口統計信息。每個家庭都收到了一份官方問卷，詢問年齡、職業和家庭人數。","word":"census"}},"century":{"createdAt":1783151252600,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"century指的是一百年的時間跨度","options":["decade","century","millennium","era"],"sentence":"The ancient Roman civilization flourished over two thousand years ago, lasting for more than a ______. This period of history spanned from approximately 27 BC to 476 AD.","translation":"古羅馬文明在兩千多年前繁榮昌盛，持續了超過一個世紀。這段歷史時期從大約西元前27年跨越到西元476年。","word":"century"}},"ceremony":{"createdAt":1781696018690,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ceremony 意為典禮、禮儀，指正式、莊重的公開活動，通常遵循特定的傳統或規則。","options":["party","ceremony","celebration","feast"],"sentence":"The wedding ______ took place in a beautiful cathedral with hundreds of guests in attendance. The couple exchanged vows and rings according to traditional religious practices.","translation":"婚禮典禮在一座美麗的大教堂舉行，有數百位賓客出席。新人根據傳統宗教習俗交換了誓言和戒指。","word":"ceremony"}},"certain":{"createdAt":1782007262076,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"certain 表示確定、肯定的狀態，由於老師親自驗證了，所以她對此事很確定。","options":["uncertain","hopeful","certain","curious"],"sentence":"The teacher was ______ that all students had completed their homework before the exam. She had checked the submission list herself to verify this.","translation":"老師確定所有學生在考試前都完成了他們的功課。她親自檢查了提交名單來驗證這一點。","word":"certain"}},"certainly":{"createdAt":1782016805982,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"certainly 是副詞，表示無疑地、肯定地或確信地的態度。","options":["doubtfully","certainly","possibly","vaguely"],"sentence":"The professor ______ knows the answer to your question about quantum physics. He has published over fifty peer-reviewed papers on the subject.","translation":"教授無疑地知道你關於量子物理的問題的答案。他已經在這個主題上發表了五十多篇同行評審的論文。","word":"certainly"}},"certificate":{"createdAt":1782408103445,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"certificate 是一份正式的書面證明，表示某人完成了某項課程、考試或達到了某項資格。","options":["diploma","certificate","badge","award"],"sentence":"After completing the online course, each student received a ______ that confirmed they had successfully mastered all the required material. The document could be uploaded to professional networking websites.","translation":"完成線上課程後，每位學生都獲得了一份證明他們已成功掌握所有必要材料的證書。該文件可以上傳到專業社交網站。","word":"certificate"}},"certification":{"createdAt":1781336858147,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"certification 是正式的證明文件，表示某人已達到特定的標準或完成了特定的要求。","options":["complaint","certification","rejection","rumor"],"sentence":"She earned a ______ from the university after completing the professional development program. The document proved that she had successfully passed all required examinations and met every standard.","translation":"她在完成專業發展課程後從大學獲得了證明書。這份文件證明她已成功通過所有必修考試並達到了每項標準。","word":"certification"}},"certified":{"createdAt":1782228357818,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"certified 表示已正式認可或確認某人具備特定的資格或能力。","options":["fake","stolen","certified","temporary"],"sentence":"The construction worker showed his ______ credentials to prove he had completed the safety training course. His official certificate confirmed he had passed all required examinations.","translation":"建築工人出示了他的認證證書以證明他完成了安全培訓課程。他的官方證書確認他通過了所有必需的考試。","word":"certified"}},"certify":{"createdAt":1784540090497,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"certify 是動詞，意指正式證明或證實某事的真實性或正確性，通常涉及官方認可或書面證明。","options":["ignore","certify","purchase","manufacture"],"sentence":"The government agency will ______ that all products meet safety standards before they are sold to consumers. Official documents stamped with the agency's seal serve as proof of this verification.","translation":"政府機構將證明所有產品在銷售給消費者之前都符合安全標準。蓋有該機構印章的官方文件可作為此驗證的證明。","word":"certify"}},"chain":{"createdAt":1783151252595,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"chain指的是由相互連接的環節組成的金屬首飾或鏈條","options":["rope","chain","string","thread"],"sentence":"The jewelry store displayed a beautiful gold ______ in the window. The links were interlocked together to form a necklace.","translation":"珠寶店在櫥窗裡展示了一條美麗的金色鏈子。這些環節相互連接形成了項鍊。","word":"chain"}},"chairperson":{"createdAt":1783502229570,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"chairperson 是指被選舉或任命領導組織或委員會的人，具有主持和管理的職責。","options":["member","chairperson","secretary","audience"],"sentence":"The ______ of the committee announced the new policy at the meeting. She had been elected by all the members to lead the organization for the next two years.","translation":"委員會的主席在會議上宣佈了新政策。她被所有成員選舉為領導該組織兩年。","word":"chairperson"}},"challenge":{"createdAt":1781837419092,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Challenge作為動詞表示向某人發起挑戰，邀請他們參加競賽或對抗。","options":["ignore","challenge","congratulate","assist"],"sentence":"The young athlete ______ the world record holder to a competition. She was confident she could defeat him in the upcoming championship match.","translation":"年輕運動員向世界紀錄保持者發起挑戰。她相信自己能在即將舉行的錦標賽中擊敗他。","word":"challenge"}},"chamber":{"createdAt":1781566185160,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"chamber在官方場合中指用於特定官方用途的房間，例如議會廳或法院。","options":["chamber","garden","kitchen","stable"],"sentence":"The parliament members gathered in the ______ for their weekly meeting. The ornate hall featured marble columns and a high ceiling where important legislation was debated and voted upon.","translation":"國會議員們在那間議院集合進行每週的會議。這個裝飾華麗的大廳有大理石柱和高高的天花板，重要的立法在這裡被辯論和表決。","word":"chamber"}},"champagne":{"createdAt":1783488481391,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"香檳酒是一種來自法國香檳地區的起泡葡萄酒，通常在慶祝活動中飲用。","options":["vodka","champagne","whiskey","beer"],"sentence":"The couple celebrated their wedding with a bottle of ______ from the Champagne region of France. The sparkling wine is known for its bubbles and is traditionally served at special occasions.","translation":"這對夫婦用來自法國香檳地區的香檳酒慶祝他們的婚禮。這種起泡酒以其氣泡聞名，傳統上在特殊場合享用。","word":"champagne"}},"champion":{"createdAt":1781580511761,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"champion 指在比賽或競爭中獲勝的人，即冠軍","options":["spectator","referee","champion","participant"],"sentence":"The ______ of the tennis tournament raised the trophy above her head in celebration. She had defeated every opponent throughout the entire competition.","translation":"網球賽事的冠軍將獎杯舉過頭頂慶祝。她在整個比賽中擊敗了每一個對手。","word":"champion"}},"championship":{"createdAt":1781425737125,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"championship 指冠軍賽或冠軍頭銜，指最高等級的競賽或獲得的最高榮譽。","options":["playoff","championship","friendly","practice"],"sentence":"The basketball team won the ______ title after defeating every opponent in the tournament. They are now recognized as the best team in the entire league this season.","translation":"籃球隊在擊敗錦標賽中的每個對手後贏得了冠軍頭銜。他們現在被認為是本賽季整個聯賽中最好的隊伍。","word":"championship"}},"channel":{"createdAt":1783151252589,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"channel在此指的是電視頻道或播放節目的媒介","options":["station","channel","program","network"],"sentence":"I was watching a documentary on the nature ______ when I saw a fascinating program about wildlife. The show was broadcast on BBC One, which is a well-known television station.","translation":"我在看自然頻道上的紀錄片時，看到了一個關於野生動物的迷人節目。該節目在BBC One播放，這是一個著名的電視臺。","word":"channel"}},"chant":{"createdAt":1781256547738,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Chant表示以節奏或重複的方式大聲說出或吟唱某些詞語或短語。","options":["whisper","chant","write","forget"],"sentence":"The crowd began to ______ the team's name repeatedly during the championship game. The rhythmic repetition of \"Go Tigers!\" echoed throughout the entire stadium.","translation":"在冠軍賽期間，群眾開始反覆吟唱球隊的名字。「加油老虎隊！」的有節奏重複聲音迴盪在整個體育場。","word":"chant"}},"chaos":{"createdAt":1781837419088,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Chaos指的是完全的混亂和無序狀態，系統無法正常運作。","options":["peace","chaos","calm","order"],"sentence":"After the earthquake, the city descended into complete ______ with no electricity or clean water. The destruction and disorder made it nearly impossible for emergency services to operate effectively.","translation":"地震後，城市陷入完全混亂，沒有電力或清潔水。破壞和無序使緊急服務幾乎無法有效運作。","word":"chaos"}},"chaotic":{"createdAt":1781839703142,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"chaotic形容完全混亂無序的狀態，與找不到檔案、會議取消、不知道任務的情況完全相符。","options":["organized","peaceful","chaotic","productive"],"sentence":"The office became ______ during the system migration. Staff members couldn't find files, meetings were cancelled, and nobody knew their assignments.","translation":"在系統遷移期間，辦公室變得一片混亂。員工找不到檔案，會議被取消，沒有人知道自己的任務。","word":"chaotic"}},"chapel":{"createdAt":1781424574162,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"chapel 是指一個小型的禮拜堂或祈禱場所，通常規模較教堂小。","options":["stadium","chapel","warehouse","museum"],"sentence":"The bride and groom exchanged vows in a small ______ on the hillside. The intimate stone building had room for only fifty guests and beautiful stained-glass windows.","translation":"新娘和新郎在山坡上的一個小禮拜堂交換誓言。這座親密的石製建築只能容納五十位賓客，並有美麗的彩色玻璃窗。","word":"chapel"}},"character":{"createdAt":1781784910910,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"character 在文學中指人物的性格特徵或品質；第二句明確提到「誠實和善良這些特徵」，與第一句中性格的演變相對應。","options":["plot","character","setting","dialogue"],"sentence":"The protagonist's ______ evolved throughout the story as he learned from his mistakes. By the end of the novel, his honesty and kindness had become his defining traits.","translation":"主角的性格在整個故事中不斷演變，因為他從錯誤中學習。到小說結尾，他的誠實和善良成為了他的決定性特徵。","word":"character"}},"characteristic":{"createdAt":1783685028741,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"characteristic是形容詞，表示特有的或具有典型特徵的，用來描述某物獨特且易於辨認的品質。","options":["rare","characteristic","unusual","hidden"],"sentence":"The ______ feature of this bird species is its distinctive long tail feathers. You can identify this bird from a distance simply by observing this particular trait.","translation":"這種鳥類物種的特徵特性是其獨特的長尾羽。您可以僅通過觀察這個特殊特徵就能從遠處識別出這種鳥。","word":"characteristic"}},"characterize":{"createdAt":1785242752233,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"characterize 意為「描繪；描述……的特性」，指透過詳細描述來刻劃人物或事物的特徵、性質或本質。","options":["ignore","characterize","summarize","criticize"],"sentence":"Critics often ______ the protagonist as a tragic hero struggling against impossible odds. The novel explicitly describes his internal conflicts and moral dilemmas throughout every chapter.","translation":"評論家經常將主角描繪為與不可能的困境抗爭的悲劇英雄。這部小說在每一章中明確描述了他的內心衝突和道德困境。","word":"characterize"}},"charge":{"createdAt":1782475351764,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"charge作為動詞表示「收費」，指的是要求顧客支付金錢以換取服務或商品。","options":["ask","charge","request","suggest"],"sentence":"The restaurant will ______ you extra for adding sauce to your dish. The manager explained that this additional fee applies to all customized requests.","translation":"餐廳會因為你額外加醬汁而向你收費。經理解釋說，這筆額外費用適用於所有客製化要求。","word":"charge"}},"charitable":{"createdAt":1781693254766,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"charitable形容出於善心或慈悲的行為，特別是涉及對他人的幫助和捐贈。","options":["competitive","charitable","commercial","criminal"],"sentence":"His ______ donations to homeless shelters and food banks made a real difference in the community. Every year, he contributed thousands of dollars to help those in need.","translation":"他對無家者收容所和食物銀行的慈善捐款對社區產生了真實的影響。他每年都貢獻數千美元來幫助需要幫助的人。","word":"charitable"}},"charity":{"createdAt":1783323381797,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"charity 指的是慈善機構或慈善組織，致力於幫助需要幫助的人，通常通過募集和分配資金。","options":["business","school","charity","restaurant"],"sentence":"The local ______ organized a fundraising event to collect donations for families in need. The money raised would help provide food, shelter, and medical care to those experiencing poverty.","translation":"當地慈善機構組織了一場籌款活動，為有需要的家庭募集捐款。籌集的資金將幫助向經歷貧困的人提供食物、住所和醫療保健。","word":"charity"}},"charm":{"createdAt":1781256547737,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Charm作為動詞表示以某種吸引人的方式使某人感到愉悅或著迷。","options":["repel","charm","confuse","annoy"],"sentence":"Her warm smile and genuine kindness seemed to ______ everyone she met. People found themselves drawn to her presence and eager to spend time with her.","translation":"她溫暖的微笑和真摯的善良似乎使她遇見的每個人都著迷。人們發現自己被她的存在所吸引，渴望與她相處。","word":"charm"}},"charmed":{"createdAt":1781738105690,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"charmed 意為被迷住或深深吸引，通常表示對某事物的積極和愉快的反應。","options":["bored","charmed","confused","exhausted"],"sentence":"The children were completely ______ by the magician's incredible illusions during the performance. They sat in wonder, watching him make coins disappear and reappear from thin air.","translation":"孩子們在表演中完全被魔術師不可思議的幻覺所吸引。他們坐在那裡驚歎，看著他讓硬幣憑空消失又重新出現。","word":"charmed"}},"chart":{"createdAt":1783151252601,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"chart是用數據和視覺形式呈現信息的圖表或圖形","options":["report","document","chart","list"],"sentence":"The business analyst created a detailed ______ showing the company's quarterly sales figures. The graph displayed increasing profits over each three-month period.","translation":"商業分析師製作了一份詳細的圖表，顯示公司的季度銷售數據。該圖表顯示了每個三個月期間利潤的增加。","word":"chart"}},"chastity":{"createdAt":1783005778375,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"chastity 意為「貞潔」或「節操」，指在性道德上的純潔和自制。","options":["boldness","flexibility","chastity","ambition"],"sentence":"In the historical novel, the young woman's ______ was considered her most valued virtue by her family. She was praised for maintaining her moral purity and refusing advances from unsuitable suitors.","translation":"在這部歷史小說中，年輕女性的貞潔被她的家人視為最寶貴的品德。她因保持道德純潔和拒絕不合適求婚者的示好而受到讚揚。","word":"chastity"}},"chatter":{"createdAt":1781564440926,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"chatter 作動詞表示喋喋不休、嘮叨，指說話多、談話不停。","options":["listen","chatter","whisper","sing"],"sentence":"The students began to ______ loudly during the break period. Their constant talking and conversation filled the entire classroom.","translation":"學生們在休息時間開始喋喋不休地談話。他們不斷的談話和交談充滿了整個教室。","word":"chatter"}},"checkup":{"createdAt":1781783820686,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"checkup是指定期的健康檢查或體檢，用來評估身體的整體狀況，通常包括各種檢查和測試。","options":["operation","checkup","prescription","treatment"],"sentence":"I have a doctor's ______ scheduled for next Tuesday morning. The appointment includes blood tests, a physical examination, and a discussion about my overall health status.","translation":"我預約了下週二上午的醫生體檢。此次預約包括驗血、身體檢查和關於我整體健康狀況的討論。","word":"checkup"}},"cheerful":{"createdAt":1783159261866,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"cheerful（快樂的；令人愉快的）形容人的心情或態度是開朗和樂觀的。","options":["cheerful","tired","confused","angry"],"sentence":"Despite the rainy weather, Maria maintained a ______ attitude throughout the day. Her smiling face and positive energy brightened everyone's mood around her.","translation":"儘管下雨，瑪麗亞整天都保持著快樂的態度。她的笑容和積極的能量使周圍每個人的心情都變得愉快。","word":"cheerful"}},"cheerfully":{"createdAt":1783900102689,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cheerfully是副詞，表示以歡樂、愉快的方式做某事，用來形容某人的行動或態度充滿快樂和正面情緒。","options":["angrily","cheerfully","quietly","nervously"],"sentence":"She greeted her guests ______ at the door with a warm smile. Her positive attitude and genuine happiness made everyone feel welcome immediately.","translation":"她在門口歡樂地迎接客人，臉上帶著溫暖的微笑。她積極的態度和真摯的快樂讓每個人都立刻感到受歡迎。","word":"cheerfully"}},"chef":{"createdAt":1781343050502,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"chef 指專業廚師或廚師長，負責菜肴的設計、準備和烹飪。","options":["waiter","accountant","chef","manager"],"sentence":"The renowned ______ at the five-star restaurant creates innovative dishes every night. His culinary training and creativity have earned him multiple awards.","translation":"這家五星級餐廳著名的廚師每晚都創作創新菜肴。他的烹飪培訓和創意為他贏得了多個獎項。","word":"chef"}},"chemical":{"createdAt":1781499075056,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"化學反應涉及物質分子或原子的重新排列，產生新的物質。","options":["physical","biological","chemical","electrical"],"sentence":"The ______ reaction between the two liquids produced heat and changed their color. Scientists used beakers and safety goggles to conduct this transformation in the laboratory.","translation":"兩種液體之間的化學反應產生了熱量並改變了它們的顏色。科學家在實驗室使用燒杯和安全護目鏡進行了這種轉化。","word":"chemical"}},"chemicals":{"createdAt":1781425737125,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"chemicals 指化學物質或化學品，與工廠排放的有毒物質和製造過程相關。","options":["chemicals","plants","fish","rocks"],"sentence":"The factory released toxic ______ into the river, causing environmental damage downstream. Scientists tested the water and identified dangerous substances used in manufacturing processes.","translation":"工廠向河中排放有毒化學物質，造成下游環保損害。科學家測試了水質並識別出製造過程中使用的危險物質。","word":"chemicals"}},"chemist":{"createdAt":1781842000007,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"化學家是研究物質成分、性質和化學反應的科學家。","options":["physicist","chemist","biologist","geologist"],"sentence":"The ______ worked in the laboratory conducting experiments on chemical reactions. She had spent years studying the composition and properties of matter to understand how substances interact.","translation":"這位______在實驗室工作，進行化學反應實驗。她花了多年時間研究物質的成分和性質，以了解物質如何相互作用。","word":"chemist"}},"chemistry":{"createdAt":1781850287961,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"chemistry 指研究物質的組成、結構和變化的自然科學。","options":["history","physics","chemistry","biology"],"sentence":"She excelled in ______ class and scored the highest marks in all her exams. Her passion for understanding the properties of elements and compounds led her to pursue a degree in pharmaceutical research.","translation":"她在化學課上表現出色，在所有考試中都獲得最高分。她對了解元素和化合物性質的熱情促使她追求藥學研究的學位。","word":"chemistry"}},"cherish":{"createdAt":1784818310052,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cherish 是指珍視、寶貴或懷念某些有意義的人、事或時刻，通常涉及深層的情感聯繫。","options":["forget","cherish","ignore","dismiss"],"sentence":"She will always ______ the memories of her grandmother's cooking and wisdom. These precious moments from childhood mean more to her than any material possession ever could.","translation":"她將永遠珍惜祖母烹飪和智慧的回憶。童年時期這些寶貴時刻對她的意義遠超任何物質財富。","word":"cherish"}},"chest":{"createdAt":1783403425349,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"chest 作為名詞，指的是一種大型的木製或金屬製的盒子或櫃子，通常用來存放和保護貴重物品。","options":["chest","envelope","document","shelf"],"sentence":"She opened the old wooden ______ in the attic and discovered letters from her grandmother. Inside were also photographs and jewelry that had been carefully preserved for decades.","translation":"她打開閣樓裡的舊木櫃，發現了祖母的信件。裡面還有已經保存了幾十年的照片和珠寶。","word":"chest"}},"chew":{"createdAt":1782477421077,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"chew 表示用牙齒反覆咬和研磨食物或其他物質，通常為了品嚐或分解食物。","options":["swallow","chew","fetch","dig"],"sentence":"The dog will ______ on the bone for hours, extracting every bit of flavor and nutrition from it. This natural behavior keeps the animal satisfied and entertained.","translation":"狗會咀嚼骨頭好幾個小時，從中提取每一點味道和營養。這種自然行為讓動物感到滿足和娛樂。","word":"chew"}},"chic":{"createdAt":1787049198629,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"chic指時髦的、優雅高尚的風格，常用來形容衣著、設計或整體外觀非常符合潮流。","options":["plain","outdated","chic","casual"],"sentence":"Her ______ black dress and elegant accessories made her the most stylish person at the party. Fashion magazines often feature her as an example of modern sophistication.","translation":"她時髦的黑色連衣裙和優雅的配飾使她成為派對上最時尚的人。時尚雜誌經常以她作為現代品味的典範。","word":"chic"}},"chief":{"createdAt":1781515372606,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"chief用來表示最高層級或最主要的職位和人物","options":["launch","domestic","chief","fulfillment"],"sentence":"The ______ executive officer announced a new strategic direction for the company. As the highest-ranking official in the organization, he had the final authority on all major decisions.","translation":"首席執行官宣佈了公司的新戰略方向。作為組織中最高級別的官員，他對所有重大決策擁有最終的權威。","word":"chief"}},"childhood":{"createdAt":1781651775063,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"childhood 指人生中從出生到青少年期的早期階段。","options":["discussion","frustrate","justify","childhood"],"sentence":"My grandfather often reminisced about his ______ spent in a small village. He described playing in the fields and attending school with fond memories from his early years.","translation":"我的祖父經常回憶起他在小村莊度過的童年時期。他描述了在田野裡玩耍和上學的美好回憶，這些都來自他的早年。","word":"childhood"}},"childish":{"createdAt":1781565657685,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"childish 意指像小孩子一樣不成熟或幼稚的行為，通常用來批評成年人不理性的舉動。","options":["mature","childish","professional","responsible"],"sentence":"His ______ behavior of throwing tantrums when he didn't get his way annoyed everyone at the meeting. The forty-year-old executive needed to learn how to handle disappointment with maturity.","translation":"他在沒有得到他想要的東西時發脾氣的幼稚行為令會議上的每個人都感到厭煩。這位四十歲的執行官需要學會以成熟的方式處理失望。","word":"childish"}},"childlike":{"createdAt":1783255660825,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"childlike 意為「天真的、純真的」，帶有正面含義，指像孩子一樣的純潔和好奇心。","options":["immature","childlike","naive","foolish"],"sentence":"Despite his fifty years of age, Mark maintained a ______ sense of wonder about the world. He still asked innocent questions and believed in magic and fairy tales.","translation":"儘管馬克已經五十歲，他仍然保持著天真的好奇心看待世界。他仍然問天真的問題，相信魔法和童話故事。","word":"childlike"}},"chill":{"createdAt":1781323901188,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"chill意為「使變冷」或「使冷卻」，在此指降低飲料的溫度。","options":["heat","warm","chill","ferment"],"sentence":"Please ______ the champagne in the freezer before the guests arrive. We need the bottles to be ice-cold for the celebration tonight.","translation":"請在客人到達前在冰箱裡冷卻香檳。我們需要這些瓶子冰冷以供今晚的慶祝活動。","word":"chill"}},"chilly":{"createdAt":1782980805886,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"chilly 作形容詞，表示天氣、環境或感受有點冷、涼颼颼的。","options":["warm","hot","chilly","humid"],"sentence":"The morning air felt quite ______ when she stepped outside without a sweater. The temperature had dropped below 10 degrees Celsius overnight.","translation":"當她不穿毛衣走出去時，早晨的空氣感覺相當寒冷。夜間氣溫下降到了攝氏10度以下。","word":"chilly"}},"chimpanzee":{"createdAt":1784169916826,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"黑猩猩是一種高等靈長類動物，與人類有最接近的遺傳關係。","options":["gorilla","chimpanzee","orangutan","baboon"],"sentence":"The ______ at the zoo swung from branch to branch with incredible agility. Scientists study this primate's behavior because it shares about 98% of its DNA with humans.","translation":"動物園裡的黑猩猩以難以置信的敏捷性在樹枝間擺盪。科學家研究這種靈長類動物的行為，因為牠與人類的DNA有約98%相似。","word":"chimpanzee"}},"chip":{"createdAt":1781837419096,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Chip作為名詞指的是從物體上脫落的小碎片或缺口，通常是由於碰撞造成的。","options":["stain","chip","crack","dent"],"sentence":"When he dropped the ceramic plate, a small ______ broke off the edge. The damaged dish was no longer perfect but still usable for everyday meals.","translation":"當他掉落陶瓷盤子時，邊緣的一小片碎屑脫落。受損的盤子不再完美，但仍然可以用於日常用餐。","word":"chip"}},"chipped":{"createdAt":1781779647047,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"chipped表示邊緣或角落破損或有小缺口","options":["perfect","shiny","chipped","smooth"],"sentence":"The antique vase had a ______ rim. Despite the damage from years of use, it was still valuable.","translation":"古董花瓶的邊緣有缺口。儘管經過多年使用而受損，它仍然很有價值。","word":"chipped"}},"chirp":{"createdAt":1781414884519,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"chirp指小鳥或昆蟲發出的尖聲尖氣的叫聲，通常是短促而重複的。","options":["roar","chirp","whisper","thunder"],"sentence":"Every morning, the small birds would ______ outside my window to greet the sunrise. Their high-pitched sounds created a cheerful melody that woke me up naturally.","translation":"每個早晨，小鳥都會在我的窗外嘰嘰喳喳地叫來迎接日出。他們尖銳的聲音創造了一首歡樂的旋律，自然地喚醒了我。","word":"chirp"}},"chloroplast":{"createdAt":1783243171148,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"chloroplast是植物細胞中進行光合作用的細胞器，含有葉綠素，是植物能進行光合作用的關鍵結構。","options":["mitochondrion","ribosome","chloroplast","nucleus"],"sentence":"The ______ is the cellular organelle responsible for photosynthesis in plant cells. Without this structure containing chlorophyll, plants could not convert sunlight into energy.","translation":"葉綠體是植物細胞中負責光合作用的細胞器。沒有這個包含葉綠素的結構，植物無法將陽光轉化為能量。","word":"chloroplast"}},"choir":{"createdAt":1781429945498,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"choir 是指一群唱歌的人組成的合唱團或唱詩班，通常在教堂或音樂會中表演。","options":["audience","orchestra","choir","band"],"sentence":"The ______ sang beautifully at the Christmas concert last night. Over fifty singers, dressed in matching robes, harmonized together on stage.","translation":"合唱團昨晚在聖誕節音樂會上唱得很美。五十多名歌手穿著相配的長袍，在舞台上齊聲和諧唱歌。","word":"choir"}},"choke":{"createdAt":1781428458259,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"choke表示呼吸困難或因為疲勞而無法正常呼吸。","options":["contain","confidence","choke","normal"],"sentence":"The runner began to ______ during the final lap of the marathon. He struggled to breathe heavily while gasping for air as exhaustion overtook him.","translation":"跑步者在馬拉松的最後一圈開始窒息。當疲勞襲來時，他掙扎著沉重地呼吸，喘著氣。","word":"choke"}},"cholesterol":{"createdAt":1781425737124,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cholesterol 是一種血液中的脂肪物質，高膽固醇會對健康造成危害，需要通過飲食控制。","options":["iron","cholesterol","sodium","protein"],"sentence":"The doctor warned him that his ______ level was dangerously high after reviewing his recent blood test results. He must change his diet immediately to reduce the fatty substance in his bloodstream.","translation":"醫生在審查他最近的血液檢查結果後警告他膽固醇水平危險地高。他必須立即改變飲食以減少血液中的脂肪物質。","word":"cholesterol"}},"chord":{"createdAt":1781837419086,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"和弦是指多個音符同時發音而形成的音樂元素，與單獨的旋律不同。","options":["melody","chord","rhythm","tempo"],"sentence":"The pianist played a beautiful ______ that resonated through the concert hall. The harmony of multiple notes played simultaneously created a rich, musical sound.","translation":"鋼琴家彈奏了一個在音樂廳裡產生共鳴的美妙和弦。多個音符同時演奏的協調創造了豐富的音樂聲音。","word":"chord"}},"chore":{"createdAt":1782408103439,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"chore 指日常必須完成的、通常比較乏味的家務或工作。","options":["privilege","chore","hobby","celebration"],"sentence":"Taking out the garbage was the worst ______ that the teenager had to do every week. His parents made him complete this task without complaining, no matter how unpleasant.","translation":"倒垃圾是這位青少年每週必須做的最糟糕的雜務。他的父母讓他完成這項任務，無論多麼不愉快都不能抱怨。","word":"chore"}},"chorus":{"createdAt":1781839703143,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"chorus作動詞表示許多人同時說出相同的話，與thousands of voices united in unison（數千個聲音一致）完美對應。","options":["whisper","silence","chorus","ignore"],"sentence":"The audience began to ______ the main character's name as the finale approached. Thousands of voices united in unison, creating a powerful moment.","translation":"當終幕臨近時，觀眾開始齊聲喊著主角的名字。數千個聲音一致發出，創造了一個強大的時刻。","word":"chorus"}},"chronic":{"createdAt":1782040742474,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"chronic 形容詞意為「慢性的、長期的、習慣性的」，用於描述持久的疾病或問題。","options":["acute","temporary","chronic","occasional"],"sentence":"His ______ back pain required ongoing treatment and management for many years. The doctor explained that this long-term condition would likely persist throughout his life.","translation":"他的慢性背痛多年來需要持續治療和管理。醫生解釋說這種長期病症可能會在他的一生中持續存在。","word":"chronic"}},"chronological":{"createdAt":1781257238299,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"chronological指按照時間先後順序排列的，適合用來描述事件的時間順序。","options":["random","chronological","alphabetical","thematic"],"sentence":"The history textbook presents events in ______ order. Students can easily understand how one event led to the next by following the timeline from 1900 to 2020.","translation":"歷史教科書按時間順序呈現事件。學生可以通過遵循從1900年到2020年的時間線，輕鬆理解一個事件如何導致下一個事件。","word":"chronological"}},"chubby":{"createdAt":1781927792736,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"chubby用來形容人體態豐滿圓潤，通常帶有溫暖親切的含義，特別常用於描述嬰幼兒。","options":["thin","muscular","chubby","tall"],"sentence":"The ______ toddler had rosy cheeks and dimpled hands that made everyone want to pinch them. His round face and soft features were signs of good health and proper nutrition.","translation":"圓胖的幼兒有著紅潤的臉頰和酒窩小手，讓每個人都想捏一下。他圓圓的臉和柔軟的五官是健康和營養良好的象徵。","word":"chubby"}},"chunk":{"createdAt":1782018712119,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「chunk」指粗厚或不規則的大塊固體物質，通常用於描述食物或其他物品被分成的大部分。","options":["grain","chunk","slice","crumb"],"sentence":"He took a large ______ of bread from the table and ate it quickly. The piece was so big that it barely fit in his mouth.","translation":"他從桌子上拿了一大塊麵包並迅速吃掉。這塊麵包大到幾乎放不進他的嘴裡。","word":"chunk"}},"cigar":{"createdAt":1783389402200,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"雪茄是一種捲製的煙草製品，通常比香菸更粗、更長，以其豐富的風味而聞名。","options":["cigarette","cigar","pipe","tobacco"],"sentence":"My grandfather enjoys smoking a ______ after dinner every evening. He prefers the Cuban brands because of their rich flavor and smooth texture.","translation":"我的祖父喜歡在每晚晚餐後吸雪茄。他偏愛古巴品牌，因為它們具有濃郁的風味和順暢的質感。","word":"cigar"}},"cigarette":{"createdAt":1781343050492,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cigarette 是指紙煙，通常指香煙製品，醫生警告的就是吸煙對肺部的傷害。","options":["alcohol","cigarette","coffee","candy"],"sentence":"He quit smoking ______ last year because of health concerns. His doctor warned him that each stick he smoked was damaging his lungs.","translation":"他去年戒掉了香煙，因為擔心健康。他的醫生警告他說，他抽的每一根都在傷害他的肺。","word":"cigarette"}},"circle":{"createdAt":1783389116634,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"circle是指一個幾何圖形，由圓心周圍等距離的點組成的封閉曲線，沒有直線邊或角。","options":["square","circle","triangle","rectangle"],"sentence":"She drew a perfect ______ around the center point on the paper. The shape had no corners and every point on its edge was exactly the same distance from the middle.","translation":"她在紙上的中心點周圍畫了一個完美的圓圈。這個形狀沒有角，邊緣上的每一點到中間的距離都完全相同。","word":"circle"}},"circuit":{"createdAt":1782646755359,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"circuit 在這裡指的是法官或官員按固定路線進行的正式巡迴，涵蓋多個地點。","options":["route","circuit","schedule","pathway"],"sentence":"The judge travels on the ______ to hear cases in five different counties. She visits each courthouse once every three months in a set rotation.","translation":"法官在巡迴中旅行，在五個不同的縣聽取案件。她按照既定的輪轉方式每三個月訪問一次每個法院。","word":"circuit"}},"circular":{"createdAt":1781708461103,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"circular在這裡作為名詞，意指公司發送的印刷通知或傳單。","options":["linear","circular","rectangular","triangular"],"sentence":"The company sent out a ______ announcing the new office hours to all employees. Everyone received the printed notice in their mailbox yesterday.","translation":"公司發出一份通知，向所有員工宣佈新的辦公時間。昨天每個人的郵箱裡都收到了印刷的通知。","word":"circular"}},"circulars":{"createdAt":1781850287960,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"circulars 指大量印製並廣泛分發的廣告傳單或通函。","options":["posters","circulars","invoices","certificates"],"sentence":"The marketing department printed thousands of ______ to advertise the upcoming sale. These promotional materials were delivered to every mailbox in the neighborhood within one week.","translation":"行銷部門印製了數千份廣告傳單來宣傳即將舉行的促銷活動。這些宣傳材料在一週內被送到整個社區的每個信箱。","word":"circulars"}},"circulate":{"createdAt":1783330993543,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"circulate（循環）表示物質或信息在系統內流動或傳播，血液在血管中循環是最常見的用法。","options":["stagnate","circulate","freeze","evaporate"],"sentence":"Blood needs to ______ throughout the body to deliver oxygen to all cells. Without proper pumping from the heart, this vital process cannot function.","translation":"血液需要在整個身體內循環，以將氧氣輸送到所有細胞。沒有心臟的正確泵動，這個至關重要的過程就無法進行。","word":"circulate"}},"circulation":{"createdAt":1782094693732,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"發行量是指一份報紙、雜誌或其他出版物被發行或售出的份數。","options":["quality","circulation","reputation","location"],"sentence":"The newspaper's ______ increased dramatically after winning a major journalism award. More readers subscribed and bought copies from newsstands every day.","translation":"該報紙在贏得主要新聞獎後，發行量大幅增加。更多讀者訂閱並每天從報刊亭購買副本。","word":"circulation"}},"circumstance":{"createdAt":1781950727564,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"circumstance 指情況或環境因素，通常影響事件的發生或決定。","options":["weather","circumstance","season","color"],"sentence":"Under normal ______, I would never miss a family gathering. However, due to an emergency at work, I had to cancel my attendance.","translation":"在正常情況下，我永遠不會錯過家庭聚會。然而，由於工作上的緊急情況，我不得不取消參加。","word":"circumstance"}},"citation":{"createdAt":1781428458258,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"citation在此指正式的獎狀或榮譽證書，用來表彰個人的成就。","options":["choke","citation","crisis","lecture"],"sentence":"The student received a ______ from the university for her outstanding academic achievements. This award was presented during the graduation ceremony in front of all the faculty and graduates.","translation":"該學生因其傑出的學業成就獲得了大學的獎狀。這個獎項在畢業典禮上在全體教職員和畢業生面前頒發。","word":"citation"}},"cite":{"createdAt":1782651710251,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cite 意為引用或標明出處，以承認原作者的貢獻和想法。","options":["ignore","cite","summarize","paraphrase"],"sentence":"The professor asked students to ______ at least three sources in their research papers. Failure to give credit to original authors would constitute plagiarism.","translation":"教授要求學生在研究論文中至少引用三個來源。不給原作者標記來源將構成抄襲。","word":"cite"}},"citizen":{"createdAt":1781709984196,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"citizen 特指具有國籍和合法身分的人，享有特定國家的公民權利和義務。","options":["resident","citizen","person","inhabitant"],"sentence":"Every ______ of the country has the right to vote in national elections. Those who were born here or completed the naturalization process can participate in the democratic process.","translation":"這個國家的每位公民都有權在國家選舉中投票。那些在這裡出生或完成歸化程序的人可以參與民主進程。","word":"citizen"}},"citizenship":{"createdAt":1781424137077,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"citizenship 名詞意為「公民身分」，指一個人在某個國家的法律地位和權利。","options":["employment","citizenship","education","housing"],"sentence":"He finally obtained ______ after living in the country for ten years. The government approved his application and issued him an official passport.","translation":"他在該國居住十年後終於獲得了公民身分。政府核准了他的申請並頒發給他正式護照。","word":"citizenship"}},"civic":{"createdAt":1782552499023,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"civic 是形容詞，表示與城市、市政或市民相關的事務，特別是涉及公共事務和社區福利的內容。","options":["social","civic","cultural","public"],"sentence":"The mayor encouraged all residents to participate in the annual ______ center fundraiser. This event brings together volunteers from across the city to support local community programs.","translation":"市長鼓勵所有居民參加年度社區中心募款活動。這項活動聚集了來自全市的志願者支持當地社區計畫。","word":"civic"}},"civil":{"createdAt":1781272410990,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"civil作為形容詞指的是民事的、市民的，特別是在法律方面指不涉及刑事犯罪的民間糾紛。","options":["military","criminal","civil","martial"],"sentence":"The ______ court handles disputes between two private citizens about property rights. This type of case is different from criminal cases, which involve breaking the law.","translation":"民事法庭處理兩個私人公民之間關於財產權的爭議。這類案件與涉及違反法律的刑事案件不同。","word":"civil"}},"civilization":{"createdAt":1781332009067,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"civilization 指的是具有特定文化、制度和社會結構的人類社會","options":["animals","civilization","weather","mountains"],"sentence":"Ancient Egypt was one of the most advanced ______ in human history. This society developed writing, architecture, and complex government systems thousands of years ago.","translation":"古埃及是人類歷史上最先進的文明之一。這個社會在幾千年前就發展出了文字、建築和複雜的政府體系。","word":"civilization"}},"civilize":{"createdAt":1781850287958,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"civilize 意指透過文化、教育和社會制度的改進來提升一個社會的文明程度。","options":["educate","civilize","explore","colonize"],"sentence":"The missionaries worked to ______ the indigenous people by introducing education and modern institutions. Over centuries, this process transformed their society from nomadic tribes into settled communities with written language and formal government.","translation":"傳教士透過引進教育和現代機構的方式努力使土著人民開化。經過幾個世紀，這個過程將他們的社會從遊牧部落轉變為擁有書寫語言和正式政府的定居社區。","word":"civilize"}},"civilized":{"createdAt":1781332009080,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"civilized 是形容詞，表示文明的、開化的，用於形容有教養和禮貌的行為","options":["barbaric","civilized","chaotic","hostile"],"sentence":"The discussion remained calm and ______ despite the disagreement between the parties. Both sides presented their arguments respectfully without resorting to insults or aggression.","translation":"儘管雙方之間有分歧，討論仍然保持冷靜和文明。雙方都尊重地陳述了他們的論點，沒有訴諸辱罵或侵略。","word":"civilized"}},"claim":{"createdAt":1781838276305,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"claim作為名詞表示根據權利提出的要求或索賠。","options":["proponent","ordeal","claim","volume"],"sentence":"The insurance company rejected his ______ for damages after the car accident. He had submitted all the necessary documentation, but they denied his request for compensation.","translation":"保險公司拒絕了他在車禍後提出的損害賠償要求。他已提交了所有必要文件，但他們拒絕了他的索賠要求。","word":"claim"}},"clan":{"createdAt":1783760354086,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"clan 意為「氏族、部落」，指由共同祖先或血緣關係聯繫的家族或部落群體。","options":["clan","team","company","audience"],"sentence":"The ______ gathered once a year for a family reunion to celebrate their shared ancestry and traditions. Over 300 members of various branches came from different countries to participate in the event.","translation":"氏族每年聚集一次舉辦家族聚會，以慶祝他們共同的祖先和傳統。來自不同國家的300多名成員參加了這次活動。","word":"clan"}},"clap":{"createdAt":1781323901186,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"clap意為「鼓掌」或「拍手」，用來表達對表演者的欣賞和認可。","options":["boo","clap","whistle","shout"],"sentence":"When the performance ended, the entire audience stood up to ______ enthusiastically. The thunderous applause lasted for several minutes as a sign of appreciation.","translation":"當表演結束時，整個觀眾都站起來熱烈鼓掌。雷鳴般的掌聲持續了幾分鐘，表示讚賞。","word":"clap"}},"clarify":{"createdAt":1781337343697,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"clarify意為澄清、闡明或使事情變得清楚明白。","options":["obscure","clarify","ignore","complicate"],"sentence":"The spokesperson held a press conference to ______ the confusing statements made by the government earlier. The journalist's persistent questions forced him to provide specific and detailed explanations.","translation":"發言人舉行新聞發布會澄清政府早前做出的令人困惑的聲明。記者持續的提問迫使他提供具體和詳細的解釋。","word":"clarify"}},"clarity":{"createdAt":1781951900950,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"clarity指清楚明瞭的品質，使人能夠容易理解，與「每個人都明白」的結果相符。","options":["confusion","complexity","clarity","intelligence"],"sentence":"The teacher appreciated the student's ______ when she explained her ideas in simple, direct language. Everyone in the class immediately understood what she meant.","translation":"老師讚賞學生用簡潔直接的語言解釋她的想法時的清晰易懂。班上的每個人都立即明白了她的意思。","word":"clarity"}},"clash":{"createdAt":1781425737122,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"clash 作動詞時指發生衝突、碰撞或對抗，與軍隊之間的戰鬥相符。","options":["dance","clash","negotiate","rest"],"sentence":"The two opposing armies will ______ at dawn tomorrow on the battlefield. The collision between their forces will determine the outcome of the entire war.","translation":"兩支對立的軍隊明天黎明時將在戰場上發生衝突。他們軍隊之間的碰撞將決定整場戰爭的結果。","word":"clash"}},"clasp":{"createdAt":1781799990470,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"clasp是指用手臂或手緊緊握住或抱住某人或某物，表示緊密而用力的握住或擁抱。","options":["release","clasp","wave","guide"],"sentence":"The frightened child began to ______ her mother's hand tightly as they walked through the dark hallway. Her grip was so strong that it took considerable effort to gently loosen her fingers.","translation":"當這個受驚的孩子走過黑暗的走廊時，開始緊緊抓住媽媽的手。她的握力如此之強，需要相當的力氣才能溫和地鬆開她的手指。","word":"clasp"}},"classic":{"createdAt":1783918301432,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"classic作為形容詞表示「古典的；經典的」，用來形容具有長期影響力和藝術價值的文學、藝術或音樂作品。","options":["modern","classic","contemporary","trendy"],"sentence":"Many students study ______ literature in high school, such as Shakespeare's works. These texts have remained influential and widely taught for centuries because of their enduring artistic and cultural significance.","translation":"許多學生在高中時期研究古典文學，例如莎士比亞的作品。這些文本由於其持久的藝術和文化意義，幾個世紀以來一直保持影響力並被廣泛教授。","word":"classic"}},"classical":{"createdAt":1781832549169,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"classical 用來形容符合古典風格的音樂、藝術或文學作品，通常指歐洲傳統的古典時期。","options":["modern","classical","experimental","pop"],"sentence":"The orchestra performed several ______ pieces at the concert, including symphonies by Beethoven and Mozart. The audience appreciated the elegance and complexity of these timeless compositions from the 18th and 19th centuries.","translation":"交響樂團在音樂會上演奏了幾首古典樂曲，包括貝多芬和莫札特的交響曲。觀眾欣賞了這些來自18和19世紀的永恆作品的優雅和複雜性。","word":"classical"}},"classics":{"createdAt":1783346424319,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"classics是指那些經過時間考驗、具有永久價值和影響力的文學或藝術作品，通常在教育中被反覆研習。","options":["novels","classics","books","stories"],"sentence":"Many students study ______ like Shakespeare and Jane Austen in their literature classes. These timeless works have been taught in schools for centuries and continue to influence modern writers.","translation":"許多學生在文學課上研讀莎士比亞和簡·奧斯汀等經典著作。這些永恆的作品已在學校教授了數個世紀，並繼續影響現代作家。","word":"classics"}},"classification":{"createdAt":1781478568768,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"classification 指將事物按照特定標準進行分類或分級的過程。","options":["decoration","classification","description","illustration"],"sentence":"The library's ______ system organizes books by subject, author, and genre. Students found it much easier to locate materials using this organized method.","translation":"圖書館的分類系統按主題、作者和類型組織書籍。學生們發現使用這種有組織的方法更容易找到資料。","word":"classification"}},"classify":{"createdAt":1782228357817,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"classify 表示根據特定的標準或特徵將事物分組或分類。","options":["count","donate","classify","display"],"sentence":"The librarian will ______ all the new books into different genres and sections. She organized them by fiction, biography, history, and science to make browsing easier.","translation":"圖書館員將把所有新書分類成不同的類型和部分。她按小說、傳記、歷史和科學進行整理，以便瀏覽。","word":"classify"}},"clause":{"createdAt":1781799990468,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"clause是指法律文件或合約中的特定條款或條文，用來規定特定的權利或義務。","options":["chapter","clause","section","agreement"],"sentence":"The employment contract contained a non-compete ______ that prevented employees from working for rival companies. This specific provision was designed to protect the company's trade secrets for five years.","translation":"這份就業合約包含了一項禁業競爭條款，禁止員工為競爭公司工作。這項具體條款旨在保護該公司的商業機密五年。","word":"clause"}},"claw":{"createdAt":1783908094823,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"claw 指動物的爪子或腳爪，特別是指貓、狗等動物趾端的彎曲指甲，或螃蟹等動物的螯。","options":["paw","claw","talon","nail"],"sentence":"The cat extended its sharp ______ to scratch the furniture. With five curved nails on each paw, the feline could easily tear through fabric.","translation":"貓伸出它尖銳的爪子去抓傢俱。貓科動物每隻爪子上有五個彎曲的指甲，可以輕易撕裂織物。","word":"claw"}},"client":{"createdAt":1781343050500,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"client 指律師、顧問等服務提供者的客戶或委託人，他們需要專業服務。","options":["employees","competitors","client","strangers"],"sentence":"The law firm has many satisfied ______ who return for legal advice year after year. These individuals and companies trust the firm with their most sensitive matters.","translation":"這家律師事務所有許多滿意的客戶，他們多年來一直回來尋求法律建議。這些個人和公司信任該公司處理他們最敏感的事務。","word":"client"}},"cliff":{"createdAt":1782894607724,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cliff指的是陡峭的懸崖或峭壁，通常是地形突然下降且無法安全攀登的地方。","options":["mountain","cliff","hill","slope"],"sentence":"The hiker stood nervously at the edge of the tall ______ overlooking the ocean below. One wrong step could send him tumbling hundreds of meters down the rocky face.","translation":"登山者緊張地站在高聳懸崖的邊緣，俯瞰下方的大海。一步踏錯就可能讓他從陡峭的岩壁上滾落數百米。","word":"cliff"}},"climax":{"createdAt":1784019103269,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"climax 指故事或事件發展到最緊張、最激動人心的頂點或高潮時刻。","options":["beginning","climax","setting","dialogue"],"sentence":"The ______ of the movie occurs when the hero finally defeats the villain. Everything the audience has been waiting for throughout the film happens at this peak moment.","translation":"電影的高潮出現在英雄最終打敗反派的時候。觀眾在整部電影中一直期待的一切都在這個頂點時刻發生。","word":"climax"}},"cling":{"createdAt":1781425737126,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cling 表示黏著、依附或緊緊抓住，與孩子緊握母親的手和尋求安全感相符。","options":["release","cling","push","ignore"],"sentence":"The frightened child will ______ to her mother's hand tightly as they walk through the crowded market. She refuses to let go because she feels safe and protected only when holding onto her.","translation":"驚嚇的孩子走過擁擠的市場時會緊緊抓住她母親的手。她拒絕放開，因為只有緊握著母親時才感到安全和受保護。","word":"cling"}},"clinic":{"createdAt":1781837048333,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"clinic是指提供基本醫療服務的診所或小型醫療設施，通常不如醫院規模大。","options":["gymnasium","clinic","library","restaurant"],"sentence":"My grandmother visits the ______ every week to get her blood pressure checked. The facility is located right next to the hospital, making it convenient for basic medical consultations and routine check-ups.","translation":"我的祖母每週都去診所檢查血壓。這個設施位於醫院旁邊，方便進行基本的醫療諮詢和定期檢查。","word":"clinic"}},"clinical":{"createdAt":1781667024991,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"clinical指與患者直接相關的醫療實踐，而非單純的理論或實驗室研究。","options":["theoretical","laboratory","clinical","experimental"],"sentence":"The ______ trial tested the new drug on human patients rather than in a laboratory. Researchers observed real-world effects and side effects to ensure safety and efficacy.","translation":"臨床試驗在人類患者身上而不是在實驗室測試了新藥。研究人員觀察了真實世界的效果和副作用，以確保安全性和有效性。","word":"clinical"}},"clip":{"createdAt":1783323381798,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"clip 作為名詞指的是用來夾住或別住東西的小型金屬或塑膠裝置。","options":["sticker","clip","ribbon","rubber band"],"sentence":"She used a metal ______ to hold the stack of papers together on her desk. The fastener kept all the documents secure and prevented them from scattering when she moved the pile.","translation":"她用金屬夾子把辦公桌上的一疊紙張固定在一起。這個夾具使所有文件保持安全，防止她移動這堆紙張時散落。","word":"clip"}},"clockwise":{"createdAt":1781693271587,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"clockwise指的是順時針方向，與鐘錶指針運動方向相同，counterclockwise則是相反方向。","options":["counterclockwise","clockwise","leftward","backward"],"sentence":"The instructor told everyone to rotate their bodies in a ______ direction during the exercise class. The students spun from left to right, moving in the same direction as watch hands.","translation":"教練在運動課上告訴所有人按順時針方向旋轉他們的身體。學生們從左向右旋轉，按照手錶指針相同的方向移動。","word":"clockwise"}},"clone":{"createdAt":1786059734995,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"clone 作為名詞表示一個完全相同的複製品或酷似的東西，通常指外觀和功能幾乎無法區分的複製物。","options":["invention","clone","upgrade","prototype"],"sentence":"The new smartphone looks like an exact ______ of the famous brand model. Every detail, from the curved edges to the camera placement, is identical to the original design.","translation":"這款新智慧型手機看起來完全是那個著名品牌型號的複製品。從曲線邊緣到相機位置，每一個細節都與原始設計完全相同。","word":"clone"}},"closure":{"createdAt":1781274482554,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"closure在心理上指達到解脫或寬慰的狀態，通常涉及接納和放下過去。","options":["excitement","anger","closure","confusion"],"sentence":"After years of therapy, she finally found ______ regarding her painful childhood memories. The peace and acceptance she gained allowed her to move forward with her life.","translation":"經過多年的治療，她終於對痛苦的童年記憶獲得了寬慰。她獲得的平靜和接納使她能夠繼續前進。","word":"closure"}},"clothing":{"createdAt":1783151252599,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"clothing指的是人們穿在身上的衣服和服裝","options":["blankets","clothing","fabric","materials"],"sentence":"The homeless shelter provided warm winter ______ to all those in need. Coats, sweaters, and blankets were distributed to help people survive the cold season.","translation":"無家可歸者收容所為所有有需要的人提供了溫暖的冬季衣服。大衣、毛衣和毛毯被分發給幫助人們度過寒冷季節。","word":"clothing"}},"clue":{"createdAt":1781362281667,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"clue表示線索或提示，幫助找到答案或解決問題。","options":["witness","clue","suspect","weapon"],"sentence":"The detective found an important ______ at the crime scene. This piece of evidence helped solve the mysterious case.","translation":"偵探在犯罪現場發現了重要的線索。這條證據幫助破解了神秘案件。","word":"clue"}},"clumsy":{"createdAt":1782646076502,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"clumsy是形容詞，表示動作不靈活、笨拙，經常弄壞東西或容易跌倒。","options":["elegant","clumsy","graceful","skilled"],"sentence":"The ______ waiter dropped three plates during the dinner service. His lack of coordination and poor balance made it clear he was not suited for this job.","translation":"那位笨拙的侍者在晚餐服務中摔碎了三個盤子。他缺乏協調性和平衡感，顯然不適合做這份工作。","word":"clumsy"}},"clung":{"createdAt":1785166231753,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"clung 是 cling 的過去式，意為「緊抓；緊緊依附」，表示用力抓住或靠近某物或某人。","options":["released","pushed","clung","waved"],"sentence":"When the frightened child saw the stranger, she ______ to her mother's arm. The mother had to reassure her daughter that everything was safe and secure.","translation":"當受驚的孩子看到陌生人時，她緊緊抓住母親的手臂。母親不得不向女兒保證一切都是安全的。","word":"clung"}},"cluster":{"createdAt":1781257238301,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cluster指緊密聚集在一起的一群或一簇東西，特別是指物理上相連的物體。","options":["single","cluster","line","row"],"sentence":"A ______ of grapes hung from the vineyard vine. The farmer carefully harvested the tightly-grouped bunches together because they were all attached at the same point.","translation":"一串葡萄從葡萄園的藤蔓上掛下來。農民小心地將這些緊密分組的葡萄束一起收穫，因為它們都附著在同一個地方。","word":"cluster"}},"clutter":{"createdAt":1781274482560,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"clutter指亂堆或塞滿東西，導致空間變得雜亂無序。","options":["organize","clutter","clean","decorate"],"sentence":"She decided to ______ her living room with too many decorations and furniture. The space became so cramped and disorganized that guests could barely move around.","translation":"她決定用太多裝飾品和家具堆滿客廳。這個空間變得如此擁擠和混亂，以至於客人幾乎無法走動。","word":"clutter"}},"cluttered":{"createdAt":1784004063900,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"cluttered 是形容詞，表示「亂堆在」或「塞滿」，描述空間因為太多雜亂物品而顯得混亂和擁擠。","options":["empty","organized","cluttered","decorated"],"sentence":"Sarah's bedroom was so ______ with old boxes, clothes, and forgotten items that she could barely find her bed. She decided it was time to organize and donate most of what she no longer needed.","translation":"莎拉的臥室裡堆滿了舊箱子、衣服和被遺忘的物品，她幾乎找不到自己的床。她決定是時候整理並捐出大部分她不再需要的東西。","word":"cluttered"}},"coach":{"createdAt":1781272410986,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"coach指的是教練，專門指導和訓練運動員或學生提高他們的技能和表現。","options":["referee","coach","athlete","spectator"],"sentence":"The basketball ______ teaches his players new strategies and techniques every week. Without his guidance and training sessions, the team would not have won the championship.","translation":"籃球教練每週教導他的球員新的戰術和技巧。沒有他的指導和訓練課程，這支隊伍就不會贏得冠軍。","word":"coach"}},"coal":{"createdAt":1784960721533,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"coal是一種黑色的固體化石燃料，主要在礦井中開採，常用於發電和工業加熱。","options":["oil","coal","gas","wood"],"sentence":"The power plant burned ______ to generate electricity for the city. This black fossil fuel is extracted from mines deep underground.","translation":"發電廠燃燒____來為城市發電。這種黑色的化石燃料是從地下深處的礦井中開採出來的。","word":"coal"}},"coalition":{"createdAt":1781927792734,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"coalition指的是為了達成共同目標而由多個團體或政治力量所組成的臨時聯合體。","options":["coalition","competition","rebellion","faction"],"sentence":"The opposition parties formed a ______ to challenge the ruling government in the election. Three separate organizations united their resources and political strategies to compete against the incumbent party.","translation":"反對黨組成一個聯盟來在選舉中挑戰執政政府。三個獨立的組織聯合他們的資源和政治戰略來與現任政黨競爭。","word":"coalition"}},"coarse":{"createdAt":1781449095508,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"coarse意為粗糙的、不光滑的，用來描述物體表面或材質的質感。","options":["smooth","coarse","soft","silky"],"sentence":"The sandpaper's ______ texture made it ideal for removing paint. Its rough surface was much harsher than fine-grit paper.","translation":"砂紙的粗糙紋理使其適合用於去除油漆。它的表面比細顆粒紙粗糙得多。","word":"coarse"}},"coast":{"createdAt":1781443653218,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"coast指的是陸地與海洋相接的邊界，即海岸線或濱海地帶。","options":["mountain","coast","desert","forest"],"sentence":"The small fishing village was located on a rocky ______ where waves crashed against ancient stone cliffs. Tourists visited every summer to enjoy the scenic beauty of the shoreline.","translation":"這個小漁村位於海岸上，那裡海浪拍打著古老的石崖。遊客每年夏天都來享受海岸線的優美景色。","word":"coast"}},"coastal":{"createdAt":1781274482553,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"coastal指靠近海岸或與海岸相關的地方，通常有沙灘和海洋活動。","options":["mountain","coastal","desert","forest"],"sentence":"The ______ town attracted thousands of tourists every summer. Visitors enjoyed swimming in the ocean and walking along sandy beaches.","translation":"那個海邊小鎮每年夏天吸引數千名遊客。遊客享受在海洋中游泳和沿著沙灘散步。","word":"coastal"}},"coastline":{"createdAt":1783900102693,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"coastline是名詞，指海岸與陸地相交的邊界線，是地理術語，用來描述陸地和海洋之間的邊界。","options":["skyline","coastline","borderline","timeline"],"sentence":"The photographer traveled along the dramatic ______ to capture stunning views of cliffs and beaches. The scenic route stretched for hundreds of miles where the land met the sea.","translation":"攝影師沿著壯觀的海岸線旅行，捕捉懸崖和海灘的驚人景色。這條風景優美的路線在陸地與海洋相交的地方延伸數百英里。","word":"coastline"}},"cocaine":{"createdAt":1784169916853,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"古柯鹼是一種從古柯葉提取的強力成癮性中樞神經興奮劑毒品。","options":["heroin","cocaine","marijuana","methamphetamine"],"sentence":"The police officer discovered a shipment of illegal ______ hidden in the cargo containers. This dangerous and addictive drug was destined for distribution across the city.","translation":"警察發現了藏在貨櫃裡的非法古柯鹼貨物。這種危險且令人上癮的毒品原本要在城市各地販售。","word":"cocaine"}},"code":{"createdAt":1784979404218,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"code 作為名詞可表示編碼或代碼，尤其是指用程式語言編寫的指令集合。","options":["rule","code","signal","message"],"sentence":"The software developer wrote a ______ to fix the bug in the application. The program needed specific instructions written in a programming language to function properly.","translation":"軟體開發人員寫了一個代碼來修復應用程式中的錯誤。該程式需要用程式語言編寫的特定指令才能正常運作。","word":"code"}},"coexist":{"createdAt":1784691878996,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"coexist 表示兩個或多個事物能夠一起存在而不衝突，在這裡指不同宗教能和平共處。","options":["conflict","coexist","separate","compete"],"sentence":"Different religions can ______ peacefully in a diverse society. The key is mutual respect and understanding between communities that have different beliefs.","translation":"不同的宗教可以在多元社會中和平共存。關鍵是相互尊重和對信仰不同的社群的理解。","word":"coexist"}},"coffin":{"createdAt":1783832368938,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"coffin 是用來盛放和埋葬已故者的棺木或靈柩，通常用於葬禮。","options":["reinforce","coffin","lounge","insurance"],"sentence":"The funeral director carefully placed the deceased in a wooden ______ before the ceremony began. The mahogany box would be lowered into the ground during the burial service.","translation":"殯儀館主任在儀式開始前小心地將已故者放入一個木製棺材。這個紅木棺材將在埋葬儀式中被放入地下。","word":"coffin"}},"cognition":{"createdAt":1781837419087,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"認知是指人類的思維、記憶、理解等心智過程。","options":["emotion","cognition","behavior","growth"],"sentence":"The study examined how ______ develops in young children over time. Researchers measured their ability to think, remember, and understand the world around them.","translation":"這項研究檢視了幼兒認知能力如何隨時間發展。研究人員衡量了他們思考、記憶和理解周圍世界的能力。","word":"cognition"}},"cognitive":{"createdAt":1781664082521,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cognitive 指與認知、思考和感知有關的，涉及心理過程和精神活動。","options":["physical","cognitive","emotional","social"],"sentence":"Children develop ______ abilities as they grow, improving their memory and problem-solving skills. These mental processes help them understand and process information better.","translation":"兒童隨著成長發展認知能力，改善他們的記憶力和解決問題的能力。這些心理過程幫助他們更好地理解和處理信息。","word":"cognitive"}},"coherence":{"createdAt":1784004063899,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"coherence 表示「連貫性」或「一致性」，指文本或論點中各部分之間的邏輯連接和清晰關係。","options":["creativity","coherence","length","formality"],"sentence":"The report lacked ______ because the author jumped between different topics without clear transitions or logical connections. Readers found it difficult to follow the main argument from beginning to end.","translation":"這份報告缺乏連貫性，因為作者在不同的主題之間跳躍，沒有清晰的過渡或邏輯連接。讀者發現從開始到結束很難理解主要論點。","word":"coherence"}},"coherent":{"createdAt":1781965320892,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"coherent 表示論述或想法的連貫性和邏輯性，各部分有機地連接在一起。","options":["confusing","scattered","coherent","contradictory"],"sentence":"The professor's explanation was so ______ that students could easily follow the logical flow from beginning to end. Each point connected naturally to the next one.","translation":"教授的解釋非常連貫，學生可以輕鬆從開始到結束跟隨邏輯流程。每個要點都自然地連接到下一個。","word":"coherent"}},"coincide":{"createdAt":1783433977359,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"coincide 表示兩件或多件事情在時間上同時發生或重疊。","options":["conflict","coincide","separate","postpone"],"sentence":"The two events will ______ on the same day next month. My birthday party and the company annual meeting happen to fall on June 15th.","translation":"這兩個事件下個月會在同一天發生。我的生日派對和公司年會恰好都在六月十五日舉行。","word":"coincide"}},"coincidence":{"createdAt":1782562471175,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"coincidence指兩個或多個事件同時發生或不期而遇的巧合現象，無計畫性地同時出現的事件。","options":["fate","coincidence","miracle","blessing"],"sentence":"Meeting my old friend at the grocery store felt like a ______ since we hadn't seen each other in ten years. Neither of us had planned to be there at the same time, and we both happened to shop on the same day.","translation":"在雜貨店遇見我的老朋友感覺像是一個巧合，因為我們十年沒見面了。我們誰都沒有計畫在同一時間去那裡，我們碰巧在同一天購物。","word":"coincidence"}},"collaboration":{"createdAt":1781417610415,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"collaboration是指多個人或團體為了共同目標而一起合作、協力工作。","options":["competition","collaboration","isolation","conflict"],"sentence":"The successful project was the result of ______ between the three departments. Without teamwork and shared goals, the departments would have failed to achieve their objectives.","translation":"這個成功的專案是三個部門之間協作的結果。沒有團隊合作和共同目標，這些部門將無法實現他們的目標。","word":"collaboration"}},"collapse":{"createdAt":1781843396460,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"collapse作為名詞，表示結構或系統的突然失敗或倒塌，在此指建築物物理性的倒下。","options":["construction","collapse","expansion","development"],"sentence":"The building's sudden ______ shocked the entire neighborhood. Rescue teams rushed to the site after the structure fell to the ground.","translation":"該建築物的突然倒塌震驚了整個社區。結構倒地後，救援隊立即趕往現場。","word":"collapse"}},"collar":{"createdAt":1784260423580,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"collar 是名詞，指衣服的衣領或動物脖子上戴的項圈，可以直接繞在頸部。","options":["leash","collar","muzzle","harness"],"sentence":"The dog wore a leather ______ around its neck with a small metal tag attached. The veterinarian checked that it was not too tight by sliding a finger underneath to ensure proper fit.","translation":"這隻狗的脖子上戴著一條皮製的項圈，上面附著一個小金屬標籤。獸醫通過在下面滑動手指來檢查它是否太緊，以確保合適的貼合度。","word":"collar"}},"colleague":{"createdAt":1781783820679,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"colleague指的是在同一家公司或機構中與你一起工作的人，通常是平級的工作夥伴。","options":["friend","colleague","manager","client"],"sentence":"I need to discuss this project with my ______ before the meeting. We both work in the same department and have collaborated on several tasks together.","translation":"我需要在會議前與我的同事討論這個項目。我們都在同一部門工作，並且一起合作過幾項任務。","word":"colleague"}},"collect":{"createdAt":1781274836866,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"collect作為動詞表示把分散的東西聚集在一起或收集，通常指有系統地聚集多個物品。","options":["distribute","lose","collect","grade"],"sentence":"The teacher asked all students to ______ their homework assignments before the end of class. She walked around the room and gathered papers from each desk one by one.","translation":"老師要求所有學生在下課前交出他們的作業。她在教室裡走動，逐張地從每張課桌上收集論文。","word":"collect"}},"collection":{"createdAt":1783063660621,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"collection 指的是被收集在一起的物品的總體，通常是有價值或特別意義的東西。","options":["gift","collection","memory","purchase"],"sentence":"Maria has a large ______ of vintage stamps that she has gathered over twenty years. She proudly displays each piece in special albums organized by country and era.","translation":"瑪麗亞有一個龐大的古董郵票收藏，她花了二十年才集齊。她自豪地在特製相冊中展示每一件，按國家和時代組織。","word":"collection"}},"collective":{"createdAt":1782651710246,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"collective 表示由全體成員共同做出的決定，而不是個人的或私人的決定。","options":["individual","collective","personal","private"],"sentence":"The team made a ______ decision to change their strategy. All members voted together and agreed unanimously on this new direction.","translation":"團隊做出了一個集體決定來改變他們的策略。所有成員一起投票，對這個新方向達成一致同意。","word":"collective"}},"collector":{"createdAt":1782651710250,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"collector 指的是蒐集和保留特定物品的人，而不是買賣或交易這些物品的人。","options":["trader","collector","merchant","dealer"],"sentence":"My grandfather is a passionate ______ who has been gathering rare stamps for over fifty years. His entire house is filled with albums organized by country and year.","translation":"我的祖父是一位熱情的收藏家，他已經收集罕見郵票超過五十年。他的整個房子裡都是按國家和年份整理的集郵冊。","word":"collector"}},"collide":{"createdAt":1781799990469,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"collide是指兩個物體以強力相撞或互相碰撞，也可引申為觀點、意見等相牴觸。","options":["approach","collide","pass","follow"],"sentence":"The two vehicles began to ______ at the intersection when neither driver noticed the red traffic light. The impact was severe enough to trigger both airbag systems.","translation":"當兩名駕駛都沒有注意到紅燈時，這兩輛車在十字路口開始相撞。撞擊劇烈到足以觸發兩個安全氣囊系統。","word":"collide"}},"collision":{"createdAt":1782006648202,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"collision 指的是兩個物體或車輛之間的碰撞事件，通常造成損害。","options":["journey","collision","adventure","competition"],"sentence":"The two cars were involved in a serious ______ on the highway. The impact was so severe that both vehicles were completely destroyed.","translation":"兩輛汽車在高速公路上發生了一場嚴重的碰撞。撞擊是如此猛烈，以至於兩輛車都完全毀壞了。","word":"collision"}},"colloquial":{"createdAt":1781799990468,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"colloquial是指非正式的、日常的、口語的語言風格，通常用於日常交流而不是正式場合。","options":["poetic","colloquial","technical","archaic"],"sentence":"The author's writing style became increasingly ______ as the novel progressed. Rather than using formal academic language, the characters spoke in everyday phrases and slang that readers could easily understand.","translation":"隨著小說的進展，作者的寫作風格變得越來越口語化。她沒有使用正式的學術語言，而是讓角色用讀者容易理解的日常短語和俚語交談。","word":"colloquial"}},"colonial":{"createdAt":1781836375370,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"colonial形容詞表示與殖民地有關的，特別是指歐洲殖民統治時期。","options":["modern","colonial","revolutionary","contemporary"],"sentence":"The museum displayed artifacts from the ______ period of American history. These items included furniture and tools used when the country was under British rule.","translation":"博物館展出了美國歷史上殖民地時期的工藝品。這些物品包括該國受英國統治時期使用的家具和工具。","word":"colonial"}},"colonies":{"createdAt":1782200614312,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"colonies 作為名詞表示「一群（動物或生物）」，特別是指蜜蜂、螞蟻等社會性昆蟲聚集在一起生活的群體。","options":["armies","colonies","families","teams"],"sentence":"The ______ of ants work together to build intricate tunnels and gather food for survival. Scientists have observed how these insects communicate and cooperate as a single organized community.","translation":"螞蟻群落一起合作建造複雜的隧道並收集食物以求生存。科學家觀察到這些昆蟲如何相互溝通並作為一個有組織的共同體進行合作。","word":"colonies"}},"colonist":{"createdAt":1785501206652,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"colonist 指的是移居到新領土建立殖民地的人，特別是為了建立永久定居點和開發該地區的移民。","options":["explorer","colonist","merchant","sailor"],"sentence":"The ______ sailed across the Atlantic Ocean to establish a new settlement in North America. These early settlers built farms and towns on land that had been inhabited by Native Americans for thousands of years.","translation":"這個殖民者乘船橫越大西洋，在北美洲建立新的定居點。這些早期的移民在已經被美洲原住民居住數千年的土地上建造農場和城鎮。","word":"colonist"}},"colony":{"createdAt":1781345237580,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"colony指受主權國家統治的領土或殖民地，特別是在海外建立的定居點。","options":["empire","colony","nation","kingdom"],"sentence":"The British ______ in North America included Virginia, Massachusetts, and Georgia. These settlements were established along the eastern coast during the 17th and 18th centuries.","translation":"北美的英國殖民地包括維吉尼亞州、麻薩諸塞州和喬治亞州。這些定居點是在17和18世紀沿著東海岸建立的。","word":"colony"}},"column":{"createdAt":1781424157175,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"column 在報紙或雜誌中指定期發表的專欄或評論文章。","options":["headline","column","article","advertisement"],"sentence":"The newspaper's advice ______ was written by a psychologist who answered readers' personal questions every week. Thousands of people followed this section closely to get professional guidance.","translation":"報紙的建議專欄由一位心理學家撰寫，每週回答讀者的個人問題。成千上萬的人密切關注這個欄目以獲取專業指導。","word":"column"}},"columnist":{"createdAt":1781257238300,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"columnist是指定期為報紙或雜誌撰寫專欄文章的人。","options":["editor","columnist","printer","photographer"],"sentence":"Sarah works as a ______ for the newspaper, writing articles about current events. Every Monday, her opinion piece appears on page five of the publication.","translation":"莎拉在報紙上擔任專欄作家，撰寫關於時事的文章。每週一，她的評論文章都會出現在該出版物的第五頁。","word":"columnist"}},"combat":{"createdAt":1783760354084,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"combat 意為「與...戰鬥、鬥爭、對抗」，指積極努力解決或克服某個問題。","options":["combat","celebrate","ignore","monitor"],"sentence":"The government launched a new program to ______ the rising obesity rates among children. They invested in schools to improve nutrition and expand physical education programs.","translation":"政府啟動了一項新計畫來對抗兒童肥胖率上升的問題。他們投資學校以改善營養並擴展體育教育課程。","word":"combat"}},"combination":{"createdAt":1781402539337,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"combination 指多個元素或數字的特定排列方式，合在一起產生特定的結果。","options":["lock","combination","password","key"],"sentence":"The safe requires a ______ of numbers to open. You must enter them in the correct sequence, starting with 7-15-23.","translation":"這個保險箱需要一個號碼組合才能打開。你必須按正確的順序輸入它們，從7-15-23開始。","word":"combination"}},"combine":{"createdAt":1781776694540,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"combine 是動詞，意思是將兩個或多個事物混合或聯合在一起。","options":["separate","combine","freeze","measure"],"sentence":"The recipe asks you to ______ the flour and sugar in a large bowl. Mix these two dry ingredients together thoroughly before adding the wet ingredients.","translation":"食譜要求你在大碗裡把麵粉和糖混合在一起。在加入濕性材料之前，徹底混合這兩種乾性材料。","word":"combine"}},"combined":{"createdAt":1784103984084,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"combined 表示「結合的、合併的」，描述多個事物或力量被聯合在一起以產生更大的效果。","options":["separate","combined","individual","divided"],"sentence":"The ______ efforts of both teams resulted in a successful project completion. When the two groups worked together and merged their resources, they achieved the goal much faster than either could have alone.","translation":"兩支隊伍的______ 努力導致了項目的成功完成。當兩個小組合作並整合他們的資源時，他們比任何一個小組單獨工作都能更快地達成目標。","word":"combined"}},"comedian":{"createdAt":1781485266373,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"comedian指的是以表演幽默、講笑話和逗樂觀眾為職業的演員。","options":["musician","dancer","comedian","singer"],"sentence":"The ______ took the stage and immediately made the audience roar with laughter. His timing and witty jokes kept everyone entertained for the entire hour-long performance.","translation":"這位喜劇演員走上舞台，立即讓觀眾爆笑。他的時機把握和機智的笑話讓每個人在整個一小時的表演中都開懷大笑。","word":"comedian"}},"comedy":{"createdAt":1783839725051,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"comedy 是名詞，指以逗樂觀眾為目的的戲劇或電影，通常包含幽默、笑話和有趣的情節。","options":["tragedy","drama","comedy","documentary"],"sentence":"She went to the theater to watch a hilarious ______ that had the audience laughing from beginning to end. The actors performed silly jokes and funny scenes that kept everyone entertained.","translation":"她去劇院觀看了一部爆笑的喜劇，讓觀眾從頭到尾都在笑。演員們表演了愚蠢的笑話和有趣的場景，讓每個人都很開心。","word":"comedy"}},"comet":{"createdAt":1784019103289,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"comet 指由冰、岩石和塵埃組成的天體，當接近太陽時會展現出明亮的尾部，周期性地經過地球附近。","options":["planet","meteor","comet","satellite"],"sentence":"The ancient astronomer pointed his telescope at the ______ streaking across the night sky. This icy object with a glowing tail only appears once every hundred years.","translation":"古代天文學家用望遠鏡指向橫跨夜空的彗星。這個帶著發光尾巴的冰質天體只有每一百年才出現一次。","word":"comet"}},"comfort":{"createdAt":1781428458250,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"comfort在這裡表示安慰或支持，用來幫助某人度過難過的情緒。","options":["lecture","comfort","citation","crisis"],"sentence":"After losing the competition, Sarah needed some ______ from her parents. They hugged her and told her that she had done her best, which made her feel much better.","translation":"在輸掉比賽後，莎拉需要父母的安慰。他們擁抱她，並告訴她她已經盡力了，這讓她感到好多了。","word":"comfort"}},"comforting":{"createdAt":1781832549167,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"comforting 用來形容能夠給予安慰、消除憂慮或不安的事物或言語。","options":["harsh","comforting","confusing","insulting"],"sentence":"After losing the competition, Sarah found the coach's words very ______, which helped ease her disappointment. She realized that his emphasis on her improvement rather than the loss was exactly what she needed to hear.","translation":"在輸掉比賽後，莎拉發現教練的話非常令人欣慰，這幫助她緩解了失望的心情。她意識到他強調的是她的進步而不是失敗，這正是她需要聽到的。","word":"comforting"}},"comic":{"createdAt":1781582251995,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"comic 是形容詞，表示有趣的、好笑的、能引人發笑的特質。","options":["tragic","serious","comic","dramatic"],"sentence":"The ______ performance made the entire audience burst into laughter throughout the show. The comedian's timing and physical humor were absolutely perfect.","translation":"那場滑稽的表演讓整個觀眾在演出期間始終笑聲不斷。那位喜劇演員的時機和肢體幽默表現得完美無瑕。","word":"comic"}},"comics":{"createdAt":1781837601402,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"comics 是漫畫的統稱，指以連續圖畫和對白框組成的視覺敘事作品，通常包含故事情節和人物對話。","options":["novels","comics","magazines","newspapers"],"sentence":"My brother spent his pocket money on action-packed ______ from the bookstore last weekend. The colorful illustrated stories with speech bubbles were his favorite type of reading material.","translation":"我哥哥上週末用零花錢在書店裡買了充滿動作的漫畫。帶有對白框和彩色插圖的故事是他最喜歡的閱讀材料。","word":"comics"}},"command":{"createdAt":1782084127075,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"command 作為名詞表示正式的命令或指令，要求被執行，通常由具有權威的人發出。","options":["request","question","command","suggestion"],"sentence":"The general issued a ______ to his troops to advance toward the enemy position immediately. All soldiers obeyed without question and began their tactical movement.","translation":"將軍向他的部隊發出了命令，立即向敵人陣地推進。所有士兵都毫無疑問地服從並開始了他們的戰術行動。","word":"command"}},"commander":{"createdAt":1782477421077,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"commander 指的是擁有權威和指揮能力的領導者或軍事長官，負責做出重要決策。","options":["sailor","commander","engineer","cabin boy"],"sentence":"The ______ of the naval fleet made the strategic decision to change course immediately. All ships followed orders from the senior military officer in charge.","translation":"海軍艦隊的指揮官立即做出改變航向的戰略決定。所有船隻都遵循負責的高級軍官的命令。","word":"commander"}},"commence":{"createdAt":1781425093249,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"commence 是正式的動詞，表示某事物的開始或著手進行。","options":["finish","commence","postpone","conclude"],"sentence":"The new semester will ______ on Monday morning with a special assembly for all students. The principal has already scheduled the opening speech to begin at 8:30 AM sharp.","translation":"新學期將於週一早上開始，並為所有學生舉辦特別集會。校長已經安排開幕致詞在上午8:30準時開始。","word":"commence"}},"commencement":{"createdAt":1783900102694,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"commencement是名詞，既表示開始，也特指大學或學校的畢業典禮，象徵學生人生新階段的開始。","options":["conclusion","intermission","commencement","announcement"],"sentence":"The university held its annual ______ ceremony to celebrate the graduation of thousands of students. The event marked the official beginning of their professional careers.","translation":"大學舉辦了年度畢業典禮，以慶祝數千名學生的畢業。這次活動標誌著他們職業生涯的正式開始。","word":"commencement"}},"commend":{"createdAt":1782084127072,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"commend 作為動詞表示讚許、表揚或表示贊同某人的行為或成就。","options":["criticize","punish","commend","ignore"],"sentence":"The principal decided to ______ the student for his outstanding academic achievements and volunteer work. She presented him with a certificate of excellence in front of the entire school.","translation":"校長決定表揚這名學生因其傑出的學業成就和志願服務。她在全校面前給他頒發了優秀證書。","word":"commend"}},"comment":{"createdAt":1781667024997,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"comment是指對某事的看法或評論，通常提供建設性的意見或觀察。","options":["grade","comment","score","mark"],"sentence":"The teacher made a helpful ______ on Maria's essay about her writing style and grammar. Maria used the feedback to revise and improve her work for the final draft.","translation":"老師在瑪麗亞的關於寫作風格和語法的論文上做了一條有幫助的評論。瑪麗亞利用這些反饋來修改和改進她的最終稿。","word":"comment"}},"commentary":{"createdAt":1781485266372,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"commentary指的是對事件或表演的評論和評述，通常由專家或評論員提供。","options":["silence","quiet","commentary","voice"],"sentence":"The sports ______ provided insightful analysis throughout the entire basketball game. His remarks explained the team's strategy and predicted their next moves with remarkable accuracy.","translation":"這位運動評論員在整場籃球比賽中提供了深刻的分析。他的評論解釋了球隊的策略並以驚人的準確性預測了他們的下一步行動。","word":"commentary"}},"commentator":{"createdAt":1781274482558,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"commentator指在廣播或電視上進行實況評論和分析的人，通常提供專業見解。","options":["player","coach","commentator","fan"],"sentence":"The sports ______ provided live analysis of the football match. His expert insights and real-time observations helped viewers understand the strategy and tactics being used.","translation":"體育評論員對足球比賽進行現場分析。他的專業見解和實時評論幫助觀眾理解所使用的戰略和戰術。","word":"commentator"}},"commerce":{"createdAt":1781343050502,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"commerce 指商業貿易和商業活動，涉及商品的買賣和交換。","options":["agriculture","art","commerce","sports"],"sentence":"International ______ between countries has grown significantly due to improved transportation. Businesses now export and import goods across continents daily.","translation":"由於運輸改善，國家間的貿易顯著增長。企業現在每天都在跨洲出口和進口商品。","word":"commerce"}},"commercial":{"createdAt":1784301551070,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"commercial 是指為了銷售或賺取利潤而進行的商業性活動，強調經濟目的和市場導向。","options":["private","educational","commercial","experimental"],"sentence":"The company decided to launch a ______ campaign to promote their new smartphone across television, radio, and social media platforms. They invested millions of dollars to reach as many potential customers as possible.","translation":"該公司決定發起一場商業宣傳活動，通過電視、廣播和社交媒體平台推廣他們的新智慧型手機。他們投資了數百萬美元來吸引盡可能多的潛在客戶。","word":"commercial"}},"commercialize":{"createdAt":1782006648203,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"commercialize 指的是將產品或服務轉變為商業性的活動，以賺取利潤。","options":["publicize","donate","commercialize","simplify"],"sentence":"The startup decided to ______ their popular social media app by introducing premium features and advertisements. Within months, they generated millions of dollars in revenue from these business strategies.","translation":"這家新創公司決定通過引入高級功能和廣告來將其受歡迎的社交媒體應用商業化。幾個月內，他們從這些商業策略中產生了數百萬美元的收入。","word":"commercialize"}},"commercially":{"createdAt":1781493458243,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"commercially 副詞表示以商業目的或商業方式進行，指產品進入市場進行銷售","options":["privately","secretly","commercially","slowly"],"sentence":"The small startup decided to produce and sell its new invention ______ to reach a wider market. Within months, their products were available in stores across the country.","translation":"這家小型新創公司決定以商業方式生產和銷售其新發明，以達到更廣泛的市場。數個月內，他們的產品在全國各地的商店都可購買。","word":"commercially"}},"commission":{"createdAt":1784260423575,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"commission 作為動詞表示「委託…做」或「安排…做」，通常涉及支付費用或傭金給承包人完成特定工作。","options":["dismiss","commission","promote","abandon"],"sentence":"The art gallery decided to ______ a famous sculptor to create a large bronze statue for the city plaza. The sculptor would receive a percentage of the sales price as payment for completing this custom work.","translation":"藝術館決定委託一位著名雕塑家為城市廣場創作一座大型青銅雕像。雕塑家將獲得銷售價格的一定百分比作為完成這項定製工作的報酬。","word":"commission"}},"commit":{"createdAt":1782533789098,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"commit 動詞意思是承諾或保證，指對某事或某人做出正式的或長期的責任承諾。","options":["decline","commit","postpone","delegate"],"sentence":"The defendant refused to ______ to the investment plan until his lawyers reviewed all the legal documents. He wanted complete assurance before binding himself financially.","translation":"被告人拒絕在律師審查所有法律文件之前承諾投資計畫。他想要完全的保證才能在經濟上約束自己。","word":"commit"}},"commitment":{"createdAt":1781664082528,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"commitment 表示承諾、保證或致力於某事，指決心去做某事並為之負責。","options":["doubt","commitment","hesitation","confusion"],"sentence":"Her strong ______ to environmental protection led her to dedicate her career to conservation work. She volunteers regularly and advocates for sustainable practices in her community.","translation":"她對環境保護的堅定承諾使她將職業奉獻給了保護工作。她定期志願服務並在社區中倡導可持續實踐。","word":"commitment"}},"committed":{"createdAt":1783346573168,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"committed 意為承諾的或致力於的，表示某人全力投入或堅定地承諾某一事業。","options":["indifferent","uncommitted","committed","reluctant"],"sentence":"The ______ activists spent ten years fighting against environmental pollution in their city. Their dedication never wavered, even when facing powerful opposition from industrial corporations.","translation":"這些致力於環保的積極分子花了十年時間與城市中的環境污染作鬥爭。即使面對來自工業公司的強大反對，他們的決心也從未動搖。","word":"committed"}},"committee":{"createdAt":1781840659327,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"committee 是指為特定目的組成的正式組織機構，成員共同工作以做出決策。","options":["student","committee","audience","crowd"],"sentence":"The ______ met for three hours to discuss the new policy proposals. The fifteen members reviewed documents and voted on the recommendations together.","translation":"委員會開會三小時討論新的政策提案。這十五位成員一起審查文件並對建議進行投票。","word":"committee"}},"commodity":{"createdAt":1785451790339,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"commodity 特指可在市場上買賣的標準化商品，通常具有經濟價值並可大量交易。","options":["resource","commodity","product","material"],"sentence":"Oil has become the most valuable ______ in global trade over the past century. Nations compete fiercely to control and export this essential resource for energy and manufacturing.","translation":"在過去一個世紀裡，石油已成為全球貿易中最有價值的商品。各國激烈競爭以控制並出口這種能源和製造業的必需資源。","word":"commodity"}},"common":{"createdAt":1781794866339,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"common表示普通的、常見的，用來形容廣為人知的事物或現象。","options":["rare","common","secret","disputed"],"sentence":"It is ______ knowledge that water boils at 100 degrees Celsius. Most people learn this basic scientific fact in elementary school.","translation":"水在攝氏100度沸騰是______ 知識。大多數人在小學時就學習了這個基本科學事實。","word":"common"}},"commonly":{"createdAt":1783505303426,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"commonly表示通常地或一般地，用來表達某事經常或普遍發生","options":["rarely","never","commonly","occasionally"],"sentence":"English words are ______ used in business presentations around the world. Many international companies require their employees to speak English fluently.","translation":"英文單詞在世界各地的商業演講中通常被使用。許多國際公司要求員工流利地說英文。","word":"commonly"}},"commonplace":{"createdAt":1785211028863,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"commonplace 是形容詞，表示某事物非常普遍、平凡或司空見慣，已經不足為奇。","options":["remarkable","commonplace","dangerous","unpredictable"],"sentence":"Traffic jams during rush hour have become so ______ that commuters no longer find them surprising. In fact, city planners now expect congestion as a normal part of urban life.","translation":"尖峰時段的交通堵塞已變得如此司空見慣，以至於通勤者不再感到驚訝。事實上，城市規劃者現在將擁堵視為城市生活的正常部分。","word":"commonplace"}},"commonwealth":{"createdAt":1781343050503,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"commonwealth 指由多個國家或地區組成的政治聯合體，成員國之間有共同的政治和經濟聯繫。","options":["kingdom","empire","commonwealth","republic"],"sentence":"Australia is a ______ with a parliamentary system that includes Britain's monarch as head of state. Its member nations cooperate on various political and economic issues.","translation":"澳大利亞是一個國家聯合體，採用議會制，英國君主為國家元首。其成員國在各種政治和經濟問題上合作。","word":"commonwealth"}},"communicate":{"createdAt":1781429945498,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"communicate 是指進行溝通或傳達信息，強調雙向的交流和理解。","options":["argue","communicate","ignore","punish"],"sentence":"Parents should ______ regularly with their children about their feelings and concerns. Without open dialogue, misunderstandings between family members often grow worse.","translation":"父母應該定期與孩子溝通他們的感受和顧慮。如果沒有開放的對話，家庭成員之間的誤會往往會惡化。","word":"communicate"}},"communication":{"createdAt":1781693484715,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"communication 是指人與人之間的資訊交換和訊息傳遞，是相互理解的過程。","options":["cooperation","communication","competition","compensation"],"sentence":"Effective ______ between parents and teachers helps students succeed in school. Without regular conversations and updates, misunderstandings can easily occur.","translation":"父母和老師之間有效的溝通有助於學生在學校取得成功。沒有定期的對話和訊息更新，很容易產生誤解。","word":"communication"}},"communicative":{"createdAt":1781343050498,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"communicative 指樂於交流、健談的，與經常發言和分享想法的行為相符。","options":["shy","quiet","communicative","reserved"],"sentence":"Sarah is very ______ in meetings and always shares her ideas freely. She speaks up constantly and encourages others to participate in discussions.","translation":"莎拉在會議中很健談，總是自由地分享她的想法。她經常發言，並鼓勵他人參與討論。","word":"communicative"}},"communism":{"createdAt":1781343050497,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"communism 是一種政治和經濟制度，馬克思和列寧都是共產主義的倡導者。","options":["democracy","capitalism","communism","monarchy"],"sentence":"The Soviet Union was founded on the principles of ______ and collective ownership. Marx and Lenin were key figures in promoting this ideology.","translation":"蘇聯是建立在共產主義和集體所有制的原則基礎上的。馬克思和列寧是推行這一意識形態的關鍵人物。","word":"communism"}},"communist":{"createdAt":1781395428236,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"communist 作為形容詞或名詞，指與共產主義或共產黨相關的人或思想體系。","options":["democratic","communist","capitalist","monarchist"],"sentence":"During the Cold War, many countries feared the spread of ______ ideology from the Soviet Union. The government implemented policies specifically to prevent this political system from gaining influence.","translation":"冷戰期間，許多國家害怕蘇聯共產主義意識形態的傳播。政府實施了具體政策來阻止這一政治制度的影響力增長。","word":"communist"}},"community":{"createdAt":1782312212031,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"community指的是一個地區的人群或社會群體，他們因地理位置或共同利益而聚集在一起。","options":["library","community","government","school"],"sentence":"The local ______ organized a charity event to help families in need. The residents of the neighborhood worked together to support their neighbors and strengthen their bonds.","translation":"當地的社區組織了一場慈善活動來幫助有需要的家庭。鄰里居民齊心協力支持他們的鄰居並加強彼此的聯繫。","word":"community"}},"commute":{"createdAt":1782461900352,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"commute是指往返於家和工作地點的日常行程，特別強調這是定期重複的通勤活動。","options":["relax","commute","travel","depart"],"sentence":"Every morning, Sarah takes the train to ______ from her suburban home to her office downtown. The 45-minute journey is part of her daily routine, and she uses the time to read or listen to podcasts.","translation":"莎拉每天早上搭火車從郊區的家通勤到市中心的辦公室。這段45分鐘的旅程是她日常生活的一部分，她用這段時間閱讀或聽播客。","word":"commute"}},"commuter":{"createdAt":1781332009082,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"commuter 是名詞，指的是定期往返於家庭和工作場所之間的人","options":["tourist","commuter","driver","pedestrian"],"sentence":"The ______ took the same train every morning to get to work in the city. He had been following this routine for over five years.","translation":"這位通勤者每天早上都乘坐同一列火車去城市工作。他已經遵循這一慣例超過五年。","word":"commuter"}},"compact":{"createdAt":1781583174627,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"compact意指體積小、結構緊密，設計得能節省空間但功能完整","options":["spacious","sturdy","compact","elegant"],"sentence":"This ______ car is perfect for city driving since it fits easily into small parking spaces. Its small size allows drivers to navigate through narrow streets without difficulty.","translation":"這輛____汽車非常適合城市駕駛，因為它可以輕鬆停進小停車位。它的小尺寸使駕駛員能夠輕鬆地在狹窄的街道上行駛。","word":"compact"}},"companion":{"createdAt":1781667024995,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"companion是指一起進行活動並分享經歷的同伴或夥伴，強調陪伴和友誼的關係。","options":["guide","companion","stranger","tourist"],"sentence":"During her solo journey across Europe, Sarah found a travel ______ who shared her interests and made the experience more enjoyable. They explored cities together and became lifelong friends.","translation":"在獨自橫跨歐洲的旅程中，莎拉找到了一位分享她興趣的旅遊同伴，使經歷更加愉快。他們一起探索了城市，成為了終身朋友。","word":"companion"}},"company":{"createdAt":1781359980249,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"company作為名詞有陪伴、同伴的意思；指與他人在一起的伴隨或相處的狀態。","options":["absence","rivalry","company","service"],"sentence":"She enjoyed the ______ of her grandmother during the long winter evenings. They spent hours together playing cards and sharing stories from the past.","translation":"她喜歡在漫長的冬夜陪伴祖母。他們花了好幾個小時一起打牌和分享過去的故事。","word":"company"}},"comparable":{"createdAt":1781481072319,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"comparable 表示「可比的、類似的、相當的」，用於比較兩個事物時具有相似的特點或價值。","options":["superior","inferior","comparable","complex"],"sentence":"The performance of the new smartphone is ______ to the leading brand on the market. Both devices offer similar processing speeds, camera quality, and battery life at nearly identical price points.","translation":"這部新智慧手機的性能與市場上的領先品牌相當。兩部設備提供相似的處理速度、攝影品質和電池壽命，價格幾乎相同。","word":"comparable"}},"comparative":{"createdAt":1781849622417,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"比較的是指涉及將兩個或多個事物進行對比以找出相似或差異的，它強調相對關係而非絕對事實。","options":["absolute","comparative","theoretical","historical"],"sentence":"The ______ study examined how different countries handle healthcare systems. By analyzing multiple nations side by side, researchers could identify strengths and weaknesses in each approach.","translation":"這項比較研究檢查了不同國家如何處理醫療保健系統。通過並排分析多個國家，研究人員可以確定每種方法的優缺點。","word":"comparative"}},"comparatively":{"createdAt":1783841521609,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"comparatively 用來表示透過比較兩個事物而得出的相對性結論，強調需要與其他事物對照才能判斷程度的高低。","options":["absolutely","comparatively","surprisingly","extremely"],"sentence":"The cost of living in rural areas is ______ lower than in major cities. When you examine the actual numbers, you'll see that small towns have significantly reduced expenses for housing, food, and transportation.","translation":"鄉村地區的生活成本相對來說比大城市低。當你查看實際數字時，你會看到小鎮的住房、食物和交通費用明顯降低。","word":"comparatively"}},"compare":{"createdAt":1784614290058,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"compare是動詞，意為仔細檢查兩個或多個事物的相似和不同之處，以便理解它們之間的關係或找出差異。","options":["ignore","enhance","compare","memorize"],"sentence":"It's useful to ______ the prices of different brands before making a purchase decision. By examining the cost and quality of each product side by side, you can find the best value for your money.","translation":"在做出購買決定前，比較不同品牌的價格是很有用的。通過並排檢查每個產品的成本和質量，你可以找到最划算的選擇。","word":"compare"}},"comparison":{"createdAt":1785631026744,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"comparison是指把兩個或多個事物放在一起進行對照檢查，以了解它們的異同之處。","options":["contrast","comparison","similarity","distinction"],"sentence":"The ______ between the two products showed that Brand A was more durable than Brand B. When you place the items side by side and examine their features, you can see the clear differences in quality.","translation":"兩種產品之間的對照顯示A品牌比B品牌更耐用。當你把這些物品並排放置並檢查它們的特性時，你可以看到品質上的明顯差異。","word":"comparison"}},"compass":{"createdAt":1782303071296,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"compass 是一種導航工具，利用磁力指示方向，常用於旅行和探險","options":["doctrine","compass","eclipse","immigration"],"sentence":"The explorer relied on a ______ to navigate through the dense forest. The magnetic device helped him determine his direction when the sun was blocked by clouds.","translation":"這位探險家依靠羅盤在茂密的森林中航行。當太陽被烏雲遮擋時，這個磁性設備幫助他確定方向。","word":"compass"}},"compassion":{"createdAt":1782651710255,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"compassion 指對他人苦難的深切同情和關心，願意幫助和安慰他人。","options":["indifference","compassion","efficiency","authority"],"sentence":"The nurse showed great ______ toward her suffering patients, treating each one with gentleness and understanding. She listened to their worries and never rushed their care.","translation":"護士對她受苦的患者表現出極大的同情，以溫柔和理解對待每一個人。她傾聽他們的擔憂，從不匆忙對待他們的護理。","word":"compassion"}},"compassionate":{"createdAt":1781332009072,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"compassionate 意為有同情心的、富有同情的，表示對他人的痛苦和困難有深刻的同情","options":["cruel","compassionate","impatient","rude"],"sentence":"The ______ doctor spent extra time with each patient, listening to their concerns. She genuinely cared about their well-being and treated everyone with kindness and respect.","translation":"有同情心的醫生為每位患者花費了額外的時間，聆聽他們的關切。她真心關心他們的福祉，用善良和尊重對待每個人。","word":"compassionate"}},"compatible":{"createdAt":1781665727104,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"compatible 表示兩人或兩事物協調一致、投緣，適合一起共處或配合。","options":["anxious","compatible","hostile","uncertain"],"sentence":"Sarah and Mike have a ______ relationship because they share similar values and enjoy spending time together. Their families were thrilled when they announced their engagement last month.","translation":"莎拉和麥克的關係是相容的，因為他們有相似的價值觀，喜歡花時間在一起。當他們上月宣布訂婚時，他們的家人都欣喜若狂。","word":"compatible"}},"compel":{"createdAt":1781402154554,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"compel表示強迫或迫使某人做某事，在這裡指法律強制公司採取特定行動。","options":["compel","suspect","lottery","hijack"],"sentence":"The new law will ______ all companies to reduce their plastic waste by 30%. Failure to comply with this regulation will result in substantial fines and penalties.","translation":"新法律將強迫所有公司將塑料廢物減少30%。不遵守此規定將導致巨額罰款和處罰。","word":"compel"}},"compelling":{"createdAt":1785451790340,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"compelling 表示能強烈吸引注意力或令人信服的，具有說服力和引人注目的特質。","options":["detailed","compelling","honest","clear"],"sentence":"The witness provided a ______ account of what happened that night, describing specific details that convinced the entire jury. Her clear and persuasive testimony left no doubt about her credibility.","translation":"證人提供了一份令人信服的那晚發生事情的說法，描述了說服整個陪審團的具體細節。她清晰而有說服力的證詞對她的可信度毫無疑問。","word":"compelling"}},"compensate":{"createdAt":1781427134897,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"compensate表示給予金錢或其他報酬來補償或償還某人。","options":["promote","compensate","terminate","schedule"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ employees for the overtime work they completed last month. Management approved a special bonus payment to reward their extra effort.","translation":"公司決定為員工上個月完成的加班工作進行補償。管理層批准了一筆特別獎金來獎勵他們的額外努力。","word":"compensate"}},"compensation":{"createdAt":1784280685541,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"compensation 是指為了補償損失或傷害而支付的金錢或其他形式的賠償。","options":["promotion","compensation","evaluation","discipline"],"sentence":"The injured worker received ______ from the company for the workplace accident. The payment was intended to cover medical bills and lost wages during recovery.","translation":"受傷的工人因工作場所事故從公司獲得了補償金。這筆款項旨在支付康復期間的醫療費用和失業工資。","word":"compensation"}},"compete":{"createdAt":1781884659834,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"compete 意指在比賽或競爭中參與，與奧運會和獎牌競逐的語境相符。","options":["train","compete","celebrate","prepare"],"sentence":"Many athletes ______ in the Olympic Games every four years to earn medals and recognition. Only the most dedicated and skilled performers make it to the international stage.","translation":"許多運動員每四年在奧運會上競爭以獲得獎牌和認可。只有最敬業和最有技能的表演者才能進入國際舞台。","word":"compete"}},"competence":{"createdAt":1781332009079,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"competence 是名詞，表示能力或勝任能力，指做好某事所需的技能","options":["incompetence","competence","weakness","inexperience"],"sentence":"The manager demonstrated her ______ by successfully leading the complex project to completion. Her team members trusted her judgment and relied on her expertise.","translation":"經理通過成功領導複雜項目完成來展示她的能力。她的團隊成員信任她的判斷並依賴她的專業知識。","word":"competence"}},"competent":{"createdAt":1781272410987,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"competent表示具有能力、勝任的、能幹的，用來形容一個人在某方面具有足夠的技能和知識。","options":["lazy","incompetent","competent","dishonest"],"sentence":"The software developer proved to be ______ at solving complex programming problems. His manager decided to promote him because of his excellent skills and reliability.","translation":"這位軟體開發人員證明了他在解決複雜程式設計問題方面很能幹。他的經理因為他的優秀技能和可靠性而決定提拔他。","word":"competent"}},"competition":{"createdAt":1781425093251,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"competition 是名詞，表示比賽或競賽，通常涉及參與者之間的對抗或比較。","options":["cooperation","celebration","competition","cooperation"],"sentence":"The regional singing ______ attracted over 500 talented performers from different schools. Winners were announced after three days of intense judging and elimination rounds.","translation":"地區歌唱比賽吸引了來自不同學校的500多位才華橫溢的表演者。經過三天激烈的評判和淘汰賽後，宣佈了獲勝者。","word":"competition"}},"competitive":{"createdAt":1782619889129,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"competitive 指的是充滿競爭性的、強調與他人或其他團隊競爭的特點或環境。","options":["collaborative","peaceful","competitive","static"],"sentence":"The ______ nature of the sports industry drives athletes to train harder and improve constantly. Teams invest millions in talent recruitment because winning requires constant effort against rivals.","translation":"體育產業的______ 特性驅使運動員更加努力訓練並不斷改進。球隊投入數百萬招募人才，因為勝利需要與對手進行持續的努力競爭。","word":"competitive"}},"competitor":{"createdAt":1782620345618,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"competitor 指的是在業務或市場上與你競爭、試圖超越你的對手或競爭對手。","options":["ally","competitor","supplier","employee"],"sentence":"Our company faces a strong ______ in the smartphone market. This rival company has invested billions in research and development to outpace us.","translation":"我們的公司在智慧型手機市場上面臨一位強勁的競爭者。這家對手公司已投入數十億美元用於研究開發以超越我們。","word":"competitor"}},"compile":{"createdAt":1784110946853,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"compile 意為蒐集、彙編，指將多個資料或文件組織整合成一個完整的作品或集合。","options":["distribute","compile","summarize","publish"],"sentence":"The editor worked for months to ______ all the research papers into a single comprehensive volume. She organized the articles by topic and added cross-references between related studies.","translation":"編輯花了幾個月時間將所有研究論文彙編成一本綜合著作。她按主題組織文章並在相關研究之間添加交叉參考。","word":"compile"}},"complaint":{"createdAt":1782408103445,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"complaint 表示對某事不滿或不悅而提出的申訴、抱怨或正式投訴。","options":["compliment","complaint","conversation","review"],"sentence":"The customer filed a ______ with the restaurant manager about the cold food and rude service. The manager apologized and offered to remake the meal at no charge.","translation":"顧客向餐廳經理提出了關於食物冷和服務不禮貌的申訴。經理道歉了並主動免費重新製作這頓飯。","word":"complaint"}},"complement":{"createdAt":1782379142280,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"complement作為動詞表示補充或使完善，指的是通過添加某物來增強或完成整體效果。","options":["complement","ruin","match","serve"],"sentence":"The red wine will ______ the rich flavors of the steak dinner perfectly. Without this beverage choice, the meal would lack the sophistication and balance it needs.","translation":"紅葡萄酒將完美地補足牛排晚餐的濃郁風味。沒有這種飲料選擇，這頓飯將缺少它所需的精緻度和平衡。","word":"complement"}},"complementary":{"createdAt":1781274482564,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"complementary指能夠補充、完善或相互配合的事物，共同創造更完整的整體。","options":["opposite","identical","complementary","competing"],"sentence":"The two artists created ______ pieces that worked beautifully together in the exhibition. When displayed side by side, they enhanced and completed each other's visual narrative.","translation":"這兩位藝術家創作了在展覽中配合得很好的互補作品。當它們並排展示時，它們互相強化並完成彼此的視覺敘事。","word":"complementary"}},"complete":{"createdAt":1781532967170,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"complete 表示完整的、完成的，與「所有部分都已完成」的描述相符。","options":["partial","complete","ongoing","delayed"],"sentence":"The construction project is now ______ and ready for the grand opening ceremony. All the walls, floors, and decorations have been finished.","translation":"建築項目現在______(完整)，準備舉行盛大的開幕式。所有的牆壁、地板和裝飾都已完成。","word":"complete"}},"completely":{"createdAt":1783685028740,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"completely是副詞，表示完全地或徹底地，用來強調某事物的全部或整體狀態。","options":["partially","slightly","completely","somewhat"],"sentence":"The old building was ______ destroyed by the earthquake that struck the city. Nothing remained standing; the structure had been reduced to rubble.","translation":"這座古老的建築物被襲擊該城市的地震完全摧毀了。沒有任何東西保持站立；該結構已被化為廢墟。","word":"completely"}},"completion":{"createdAt":1781696018691,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"completion 意為完成，指事物達到終點、全部完成或達到預定目標的狀態。","options":["commencement","initiation","completion","halt"],"sentence":"The construction project was finally near ______ after two years of hard work and planning. The grand opening ceremony was scheduled for next month.","translation":"經過兩年的辛苦工作和規劃，這個建築項目終於接近完成。盛大開幕典禮定於下個月舉行。","word":"completion"}},"complex":{"createdAt":1782644423625,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"complex是形容詞，意為複雜的，用來形容需要花費大量時間和努力才能理解的事物。","options":["simple","complex","clear","obvious"],"sentence":"The ______ mathematical problem required several hours of careful analysis and multiple steps to solve. Even experienced mathematicians struggled with its intricate nature.","translation":"這個複雜的數學問題需要幾個小時的仔細分析和多個步驟才能解決。即使是經驗豐富的數學家也為其複雜的特性而苦惱。","word":"complex"}},"complexion":{"createdAt":1781323901186,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"complexion意為「膚色」，在此指人皮膚的顏色和質地。","options":["personality","complexion","attitude","expression"],"sentence":"She has a naturally beautiful ______ that glows even without makeup. The healthy pink and tan tones in her skin are inherited from her Mediterranean ancestry.","translation":"她天生擁有美麗的膚色，即使不化妝也閃閃發光。她皮膚上健康的粉紅色和棕褐色調是從她的地中海血統遺傳而來的。","word":"complexion"}},"complexity":{"createdAt":1782352245067,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"complexity指的是事物的複雜程度或難度。","options":["simplicity","ease","complexity","clarity"],"sentence":"The ______ of the mathematical problem made it difficult for most students to solve. Even advanced learners struggled with the multiple layers of calculations required.","translation":"這道數學問題的複雜性使大多數學生難以解決。即使是高級學習者也在所需的多層次計算中苦惱。","word":"complexity"}},"compliance":{"createdAt":1781274482560,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"compliance指遵守規則、法律或要求的行為，表示順從和配合。","options":["violation","resistance","compliance","defiance"],"sentence":"The company's strict ______ with environmental regulations impressed the government inspectors. They followed every rule and submitted all required documentation on time.","translation":"公司嚴格遵守環境法規給政府檢查員留下深刻印象。他們遵循每項規則並按時提交所有必需的文件。","word":"compliance"}},"complicated":{"createdAt":1781850287961,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"complicated 指某事物結構複雜、難以理解或難以處理。","options":["detailed","lengthy","complicated","boring"],"sentence":"The assembly instructions for the furniture were far too ______ for most people to follow without assistance. Even the engineers at the company admitted that simplifying the steps would require a complete redesign.","translation":"傢俱的組裝說明對大多數人來說太過複雜，沒有幫助根本無法遵循。公司的工程師甚至承認簡化步驟需要完全重新設計。","word":"complicated"}},"complication":{"createdAt":1781836375375,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"complication是複雜情況或併發症，指使情況變得更困難的意外問題。","options":["difficulty","complication","issue","problem"],"sentence":"The surgery went smoothly without any ______ or unexpected problems. The patient recovered quickly and was discharged within two weeks.","translation":"手術進行順利，沒有任何併發症或意外問題。患者恢復快速，兩週內出院。","word":"complication"}},"compliment":{"createdAt":1781425093250,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"compliment 是名詞，表示對他人的讚美、恭維或褒獎。","options":["criticism","complaint","compliment","insult"],"sentence":"Sarah received a lovely ______ from her teacher about her excellent artwork in class. The teacher told her that her painting demonstrated remarkable creativity and skillful technique.","translation":"莎拉因她在課堂上的優秀藝術作品收到老師的讚美。老師告訴她，她的畫作展示了傑出的創意和高超的技巧。","word":"compliment"}},"complimentary":{"createdAt":1783332861017,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「complimentary」形容詞表示「免費贈送的、無需付款的」。","options":["expensive","complimentary","required","optional"],"sentence":"The hotel provided ______ breakfast to all guests during their stay. No additional charge was added to their bill for this service.","translation":"旅館為所有客人在住宿期間提供免費早餐。此服務沒有向他們的賬單中增加任何額外費用。","word":"complimentary"}},"comply":{"createdAt":1781332009078,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"comply 意為順從或遵守，表示按照規則或要求行動","options":["ignore","comply","break","violate"],"sentence":"All employees must ______ with the company's safety regulations without exception. The workplace has strict rules that everyone is required to follow.","translation":"所有員工都必須順從公司的安全規定，毫無例外。工作場所有所有人都必須遵守的嚴格規則。","word":"comply"}},"component":{"createdAt":1782706784000,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"component指的是組成某個整體的個別部分或元素。","options":["material","component","machine","system"],"sentence":"Each ______ of the car's engine must be precisely manufactured to exact specifications. Without even one single part, the entire engine would fail to function properly.","translation":"汽車引擎的每個成份都必須按照精確的規格製造。如果少了哪怕一個零件，整個引擎就會無法正常運作。","word":"component"}},"compose":{"createdAt":1783499198618,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"compose 作為動詞表示創作或作曲，特別是指創作音樂作品的過程。","options":["perform","conduct","compose","record"],"sentence":"The famous musician took three years to ______ his greatest symphony. The masterpiece was eventually performed by orchestras around the world.","translation":"這位著名音樂家花了三年時間創作他最偉大的交響曲。這部傑作最終在世界各地的樂團中演奏。","word":"compose"}},"composed":{"createdAt":1781437220557,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"「Composed」形容詞表示一個人保持冷靜、鎮定，不受情緒干擾。","options":["panicked","anxious","composed","distressed"],"sentence":"Even during the chaotic emergency, the doctor remained ______ and made decisions with a steady hand. His calm demeanor helped reassure frightened patients in the waiting room.","translation":"即使在混亂的緊急情況下，醫生仍保持鎮定並以穩定的手做出決定。他的平靜表現幫助安撫了候診室裡受驚的患者。","word":"composed"}},"composer":{"createdAt":1784982601056,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"作曲家是指專門創作音樂作品的藝術家，而不僅僅是演奏或指揮音樂的人。","options":["musician","composer","conductor","performer"],"sentence":"Ludwig van Beethoven was a famous ______ who created some of the world's most beloved symphonies. He spent decades writing classical music that continues to inspire musicians and audiences around the globe.","translation":"路德維希·范·貝多芬是一位著名的作曲家，他創作了世界上一些最受歡迎的交響樂。他花費數十年時間創作古典音樂，繼續激勵著世界各地的音樂家和觀眾。","word":"composer"}},"composite":{"createdAt":1785941615614,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"composite 是形容詞或名詞，表示由多種成分或元素組成的東西，或者這樣的混合物本身。","options":["transparent","composite","flexible","fragile"],"sentence":"The engineer designed a ______ material that combined plastic and glass fibers. This blend of multiple substances gave it superior strength while keeping the overall weight low.","translation":"工程師設計了一種由塑膠和玻璃纖維組成的複合材料。這種多種物質的混合物既提高了強度，又保持了整體重量輕。","word":"composite"}},"composition":{"createdAt":1782056686165,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"composition 指事物所由各部分或成分組成的方式，強調組成物質的各種元素。","options":["structure","composition","history","weight"],"sentence":"The scientist analyzed the ______ of the meteorite to determine its origin. The laboratory found it contained iron, nickel, and several rare elements.","translation":"科學家分析了隕石的成分以確定其來源。實驗室發現它含有鐵、鎳和幾種稀有元素。","word":"composition"}},"compound":{"createdAt":1781515329270,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"compound 名詞，意思是化合物、複合物，指由兩種或多種物質結合而成的物質。","options":["tool","compound","method","theory"],"sentence":"The pharmaceutical company developed a new ______ to treat the disease more effectively. Scientists combined multiple chemical elements to create this innovative medication with fewer side effects.","translation":"製藥公司開發了一種新的化合物，可以更有效地治療該疾病。科學家結合多種化學元素創造了這種副作用更少的創新藥物。","word":"compound"}},"comprehend":{"createdAt":1782982841039,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"comprehend 意為充分了解或理解，強調對事物的深入理解，而不僅是表面知識。","options":["memorize","comprehend","ignore","discuss"],"sentence":"The physics student struggled to ______ the complex theory of relativity. Even after three hours of studying the textbook and attending extra tutoring sessions, the concepts remained unclear to her.","translation":"那位物理學生努力想要充分了解相對論的複雜理論。即使在學習課本三小時並參加額外輔導課程後，這些概念對她來說仍然不清楚。","word":"comprehend"}},"comprehension":{"createdAt":1781842419967,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"comprehension指對某事物的理解或領悟能力；在這裡強調學生能夠掌握和應用所學知識。","options":["participation","comprehension","presentation","appreciation"],"sentence":"The student's ______ of the complex physics concept was impressive after just one lesson. She could explain every detail and solve problems without any confusion.","translation":"這位學生在一堂課後對複雜物理概念的理解令人印象深刻。她能夠解釋每一個細節，並毫無困惑地解決問題。","word":"comprehension"}},"comprehensive":{"createdAt":1784341917027,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"comprehensive 意為廣泛的、總括的，指涵蓋所有或大部分內容，不遺漏重要部分的全面性。","options":["detailed","comprehensive","strict","boring"],"sentence":"The teacher provided a ______ review of all the material that would appear on the final exam. Students appreciated how it covered every chapter, every key concept, and every important detail they needed to study.","translation":"老師提供了一份涵蓋所有將在期末考試中出現的材料的全面複習。學生很感謝它涵蓋了每一章、每一個關鍵概念和他們需要學習的每一個重要細節。","word":"comprehensive"}},"compress":{"createdAt":1781838276304,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"compress作為動詞表示將某物壓縮或減小體積，以便傳輸或儲存。","options":["ordeal","compress","toll","claim"],"sentence":"You need to ______ the data files before sending them over email. The attachment size is currently too large to fit within the system's upload limit.","translation":"在通過電子郵件發送前，你需要壓縮數據文件。附件大小目前太大，超過了系統的上傳限制。","word":"compress"}},"comprise":{"createdAt":1784350994465,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"comprise 是「組成；構成」的意思，表示整體由多個部分組成。","options":["includes","comprise","contains","holds"],"sentence":"The United Nations ______ 193 member states that work together on international issues. Each nation contributes its own perspective and resources to the organization.","translation":"聯合國由193個成員國組成，這些國家一起處理國際問題。每個國家都為該組織貢獻自己的觀點和資源。","word":"comprise"}},"compromise":{"createdAt":1781343050504,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"compromise 指雙方各退一步、互相讓步達成的協議，通常各方都需要放棄部分要求。","options":["victory","defeat","compromise","agreement"],"sentence":"After hours of negotiation, both parties reached a ______ that satisfied neither side completely. Each side had to give up some of their original demands to reach an agreement.","translation":"經過數小時的談判，雙方達成了妥協，都不完全滿意。雙方都不得不放棄他們最初的一些要求才能達成協議。","word":"compromise"}},"compulsory":{"createdAt":1781935654219,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"compulsory 意為強制性的、義務性的，表示必須執行的要求。","options":["optional","compulsory","temporary","beneficial"],"sentence":"Attendance at the safety training session is ______ for all new employees. Those who fail to attend will face disciplinary action.","translation":"所有新員工必須參加安全培訓課程。不參加的人將面臨紀律處分。","word":"compulsory"}},"compute":{"createdAt":1781332009078,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"compute 意為用機器或計算方法來計算或算出","options":["estimate","compute","guess","ignore"],"sentence":"The accountant used specialized software to ______ the company's annual financial statements. The calculations were complex and required precision to ensure accuracy.","translation":"會計師使用專門的軟件計算公司的年度財務報表。這些計算很複雜，需要精確確保準確性。","word":"compute"}},"computerize":{"createdAt":1783836292878,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"computerize 是指將傳統的手工系統或紙質記錄轉換為使用電腦處理和管理的過程。","options":["organize","computerize","archive","digitize"],"sentence":"The hospital decided to ______ all its patient records last year to improve efficiency. Now doctors can access medical histories instantly from any computer terminal in the building.","translation":"這家醫院去年決定將所有患者記錄電腦化以提高效率。現在醫生可以從建築物內任何電腦終端立即訪問病歷。","word":"computerize"}},"computerized":{"createdAt":1783656026738,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"computerized 指的是採用電腦和電子系統處理的，強調從手工作業轉變為電腦作業的過程。","options":["automated","computerized","efficient","modern"],"sentence":"The bank's ______ system allows customers to access their accounts 24/7 without visiting a physical branch. The entire process from login to transaction is now handled by machines and software.","translation":"銀行的電腦化系統允許客戶24小時不間斷地訪問他們的帳戶，無需親自去物理分行。整個從登錄到交易的過程現在由機器和軟體處理。","word":"computerized"}},"conceal":{"createdAt":1783305922608,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"conceal 意為隱藏或掩蓋，指故意隱瞞或隱藏某物使其不被看見。","options":["reveal","conceal","display","broadcast"],"sentence":"The suspect tried to ______ the evidence by hiding it in the basement. The police discovered it anyway because they had a detailed search warrant.","translation":"嫌疑人試圖把證據藏在地下室裡。警察還是發現了，因為他們有詳細的搜查令。","word":"conceal"}},"concede":{"createdAt":1781860901465,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"concede表示讓步、認輸或承認，通常用於承認對方的勝利或正確性","options":["deny","concede","celebrate","ignore"],"sentence":"After losing the chess tournament, the champion had to ______ that his opponent played better. He acknowledged his defeat with grace and respect.","translation":"在輸掉國際象棋錦標賽後，冠軍不得不承認他的對手表現更好。他優雅而尊重地認可了自己的失敗。","word":"concede"}},"conceive":{"createdAt":1781323901178,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"conceive意為「構思」或「想像」，在此指科學家想出並發展了一個新的治療方案。","options":["abandon","conceive","dismiss","reject"],"sentence":"The scientist was able to ______ a revolutionary new treatment for the disease. After years of research and collaboration, her team finally brought this groundbreaking idea to life.","translation":"科學家能夠構思一種革命性的疾病新療法。經過多年的研究和合作，她的團隊終於將這個突破性的想法付諸實現。","word":"conceive"}},"concentrate":{"createdAt":1781332009077,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"concentrate 意為集中或集結，通常用於指集中注意力或將心力聚集在一件事上","options":["relax","concentrate","quit","sleep"],"sentence":"The student needed to ______ on her studies to improve her grades. With fewer distractions and dedicated study time, her academic performance improved significantly.","translation":"學生需要集中精力學習以提高成績。減少干擾和投入專門的學習時間後，她的學習成績明顯改善。","word":"concentrate"}},"concentration":{"createdAt":1784169916851,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"專心是指將全部注意力集中在某件事上，排除干擾的能力。","options":["distraction","relaxation","concentration","confusion"],"sentence":"The student maintained complete ______ during the exam despite the noise in the hallway. Her focused mental effort allowed her to answer all the difficult questions correctly.","translation":"儘管走廊裡有噪音，學生在考試期間保持了完全的專心。她集中的心智努力使她能夠正確回答所有難題。","word":"concentration"}},"concept":{"createdAt":1781965320889,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"concept 是指一個抽象的想法或觀念，常指理論上的概念而非具體事物。","options":["democracy","concept","government","principle"],"sentence":"The ______ of democracy is based on the idea that people should have a say in government. This abstract principle has been discussed by philosophers for thousands of years.","translation":"民主的概念是基於人民應該在政府事務中有發言權的想法。這個抽象的原則已經被哲學家討論了數千年。","word":"concept"}},"conception":{"createdAt":1783255652195,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"conception表示「概念、構想」，指最初的想法或創意的形成階段。","options":["execution","completion","conception","rejection"],"sentence":"The artist's original ______ for the sculpture was inspired by nature and ancient mythology. She spent months developing this initial idea before beginning to sculpt.","translation":"藝術家對雕塑的最初構想是受到自然和古代神話的啟發。在開始雕刻之前，她花了幾個月來發展這個初步想法。","word":"conception"}},"concern":{"createdAt":1781481311489,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"concern作動詞表示涉及、關係到某事或對某事表示關切和擔憂。","options":["celebrate","ignore","concern","document"],"sentence":"The environmental report will ______ the effects of climate change on coastal cities. Scientists are particularly worried about rising sea levels threatening millions of residents worldwide.","translation":"這份環境報告將涉及氣候變化對沿海城市的影響。科學家們特別擔心海平面上升會威脅全球數百萬居民。","word":"concern"}},"concerned":{"createdAt":1783255652194,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"concerned表示「擔憂的、關心的」，用來描述對某事感到焦慮或在意的情感狀態。","options":["happy","concerned","excited","bored"],"sentence":"The environmental group was ______ about the factory's pollution. They submitted a formal complaint to the government agency because they feared damage to the local water supply.","translation":"環保組織擔憂工廠的污染。他們向政府機構提交了正式投訴，因為他們害怕對當地水供應造成損害。","word":"concerned"}},"concerning":{"createdAt":1783407518032,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"concerning 作為介詞表示「關於」或「涉及」，用來表示話題或主題所涉及的內容。","options":["despite","concerning","beyond","following"],"sentence":"The manager called a meeting ______ the recent drop in sales figures. The discussion focused specifically on the factors that caused revenue to decline in the past quarter.","translation":"經理召開了一次關於最近銷售額下降的會議。討論特別集中在導致過去一個季度收入下降的因素上。","word":"concerning"}},"concession":{"createdAt":1782638002581,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"讓步是指在談判或爭論中主動放棄某些要求或立場，以達成協議或和解。","options":["demand","concession","requirement","standard"],"sentence":"After weeks of negotiation, the company made a major ______ by lowering the price by 20 percent. This compromise showed they were willing to meet their customers halfway rather than maintain their original demands.","translation":"經過數週的談判，該公司做出了重大讓步，將價格降低了20%。這個妥協表明他們願意與客戶達成折中方案，而不是堅持原始要求。","word":"concession"}},"concise":{"createdAt":1784284220462,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"concise 是指表達簡潔、簡明，用最少的詞語表達最多的意思，沒有多餘的部分。","options":["verbose","concise","lengthy","complicated"],"sentence":"The professor asked the students to write a ______ summary of the entire novel in just one paragraph. Because of this strict word limit, every sentence had to be carefully chosen and no unnecessary details were allowed.","translation":"教授要求學生用簡短的一個段落寫出整部小說的____摘要。由於這個嚴格的字數限制，每個句子都必須精心選擇，不允許有任何不必要的細節。","word":"concise"}},"conclude":{"createdAt":1781837419090,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Conclude表示根據證據或討論的基礎上做出最終的結論或判斷。","options":["begin","conclude","ignore","dispute"],"sentence":"After analyzing all the evidence, the detective ______ that the butler was responsible for the crime. His investigation revealed a clear pattern of guilt and motive.","translation":"在分析了所有證據後，偵探得出結論，女僕應該對犯罪負責。他的調查揭示了明確的內疚和動機模式。","word":"conclude"}},"conclusion":{"createdAt":1781842000007,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"結論是根據證據或事實得出的最終判斷或決定。","options":["beginning","question","conclusion","mystery"],"sentence":"After reviewing all the evidence, the detective reached a ______ about the case. The final summary showed that the suspect was innocent, which brought the investigation to an end.","translation":"在檢查了所有證據後，偵探得出了關於該案件的______。最終總結表明嫌疑人是無辜的，這結束了調查。","word":"conclusion"}},"concrete":{"createdAt":1782094693728,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"具體的是指可以看到、摸到或明確定義的東西，而非抽象或模糊的。","options":["abstract","concrete","theoretical","imaginary"],"sentence":"The judge required ______ evidence before making a decision on the case. The lawyer presented documents, photographs, and witness statements as tangible proof.","translation":"法官在對案件做出決定前要求具體的證據。律師提交了文件、照片和證人陳述作為有形的證明。","word":"concrete"}},"condemn":{"createdAt":1783741381743,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"condemn在法律語境中意為判刑或定罪，指法官對被告進行法律裁決。","options":["absolve","praise","condemn","acquit"],"sentence":"The judge will ______ the defendant if the evidence proves guilt beyond a reasonable doubt. The court has already scheduled the sentencing hearing for next month.","translation":"如果證據證明被告有罪且無合理懷疑，法官將判決被告有罪。法院已經安排了下月的判決聽證會。","word":"condemn"}},"condense":{"createdAt":1783661880055,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"condense 作為動詞表示壓縮或濃縮，與第二句中「從20頁縮減到5頁」和「刪除細節」的意思一致。","options":["expand","extend","condense","elaborate"],"sentence":"The professor asked students to ______ their 20-page essays into a 5-page summary. They had to remove unnecessary details and keep only the most important points.","translation":"教授要求學生將他們的20頁論文濃縮為5頁摘要。他們必須刪除不必要的細節，只保留最重要的要點。","word":"condense"}},"condensed":{"createdAt":1785243810728,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"condensed 表示「濃縮的、簡潔的」，指將較長或較複雜的內容濃縮成較短的形式。","options":["expanded","condensed","illustrated","translated"],"sentence":"The author provided a ______ version of the lengthy novel that could be read in just one hour. The abridged summary included only the most critical plot points and main characters.","translation":"作者提供了這部冗長小說的濃縮版本，可以在一小時內讀完。這份簡化摘要只包含了最關鍵的情節點和主要角色。","word":"condensed"}},"condition":{"createdAt":1782982841046,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"condition 作為名詞意為條件或要求，指必須滿足的特定要求或情況。","options":["location","condition","salary","benefit"],"sentence":"The job offer came with one important ______ that the candidate must relocate to the company's headquarters within three months. Without meeting this requirement, the position would not be available.","translation":"這份工作機會附帶一個重要條件，即候選人必須在三個月內遷往公司總部。如果不滿足這項要求，職位將不可用。","word":"condition"}},"conditional":{"createdAt":1781836375374,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"conditional形容詞表示有條件的，取決於某些事情是否發生或被滿足。","options":["dependent","conditional","flexible","uncertain"],"sentence":"His offer to help was ______ on receiving payment for his services. He would only assist if the agreed-upon fee was provided first.","translation":"他提供幫助的提議是有條件的，需要獲得服務報酬。他只有在首先提供協定費用的情況下才會協助。","word":"conditional"}},"conduct":{"createdAt":1781437528475,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"conduct 在音樂中表示指揮樂隊或管弦樂團，指揮者用手勢控制樂隊的演奏。","options":["attend","conduct","arrange","compose"],"sentence":"The orchestra leader will ______ the symphony with great passion and precision. Using careful hand gestures, he will guide all the musicians to play in perfect harmony.","translation":"樂隊指揮將以極大的熱情和精確度指揮交響樂。他將用仔細的手勢引導所有音樂家完美地協調演奏。","word":"conduct"}},"conductor":{"createdAt":1782016805984,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"conductor 是名詞，在音樂語境中表示指揮樂隊或交響樂團的人。","options":["soloist","conductor","composer","audience"],"sentence":"The ______ stood on the podium and raised his baton to begin the symphony. The orchestra members watched his movements carefully to stay synchronized.","translation":"樂隊指揮站在指揮台上舉起指揮棒開始演奏交響曲。樂團成員仔細觀察他的動作以保持同步。","word":"conductor"}},"confederation":{"createdAt":1784293496188,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"confederation是指多個國家、州或團體為了共同目標而組成的聯盟或同盟組織。","options":["rivalry","confederation","treaty","border"],"sentence":"The thirteen colonies formed a ______ to unite their efforts against British rule and create a stronger political union. This alliance established the foundation for the creation of a new independent nation.","translation":"十三個殖民地組成了一個同盟，團結力量對抗英國統治並建立更強大的政治聯盟。這個聯合為創建新的獨立國家奠定了基礎。","word":"confederation"}},"conference":{"createdAt":1782303071295,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"conference 指正式的會議或討論會，通常涉及多人或多個組織的代表進行討論","options":["compass","cavity","conference","eclipse"],"sentence":"The international ______ brought together leaders from fifty nations. They spent three days discussing trade agreements in a convention center.","translation":"國際會議匯聚了來自五十個國家的領導人。他們在會議中心花了三天時間討論貿易協議。","word":"conference"}},"confess":{"createdAt":1781274482556,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"confess指坦白承認錯誤或犯罪，通常涉及詳細說明事實。","options":["deny","confess","ignore","question"],"sentence":"The suspect decided to ______ his guilt to the police officer. He admitted to committing the crime and provided a detailed account of what happened.","translation":"嫌疑人決定向警官承認他的罪行。他承認犯了罪並提供了發生情況的詳細說明。","word":"confess"}},"confession":{"createdAt":1781272410988,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"confession指的是主動坦白或供認自己的錯誤、罪行等，通常是向當局或他人承認自己做了什麼。","options":["denial","promise","confession","complaint"],"sentence":"The suspect made a ______ to the police, admitting that he had stolen the diamond. His testimony was the key evidence that solved the case.","translation":"嫌疑人向警察坦白承認了他偷了鑽石。他的證詞是破案的關鍵證據。","word":"confession"}},"confidence":{"createdAt":1781428458260,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"confidence指對自己能力和成功的信心和相信。","options":["crisis","confidence","citation","superstitious"],"sentence":"The young athlete walked onto the stage with great ______ to perform her gymnastics routine. Her coach had trained her well, and she believed in her abilities completely.","translation":"年輕的運動員以極大的自信走上舞台表演她的體操項目。她的教練訓練得很好，她完全相信自己的能力。","word":"confidence"}},"confident":{"createdAt":1781565657698,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"confident 形容詞表示有信心和自信，相信自己能夠成功完成某事。","options":["nervous","confident","confused","exhausted"],"sentence":"The athlete felt ______ before the championship game because of her rigorous training and consistent victories. She had prepared thoroughly and knew her abilities matched the competition.","translation":"運動員在錦標賽前感到自信，因為她的嚴格訓練和持續的勝利。她已經充分準備，知道她的能力與競爭相匹配。","word":"confident"}},"confidential":{"createdAt":1781337343695,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"confidential意為機密的、秘密的，用於形容需要保護的敏感資訊。","options":["public","famous","confidential","broken"],"sentence":"The company kept the new product design ______ to prevent competitors from stealing the idea. Only the executive team had access to the blueprints and specifications.","translation":"公司將新產品設計保密，以防止競爭對手竊取想法。只有執行團隊能夠獲得藍圖和規格說明書。","word":"confidential"}},"confine":{"createdAt":1784341917028,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"confine 意為限制，指將某人或某物限制在特定的範圍或地點內，使其不能超出該範圍。","options":["gather","confine","organize","assign"],"sentence":"The new safety regulations ______ workers to designated areas of the construction site for their protection. This restriction was necessary because the other zones contained active machinery and dangerous materials.","translation":"新的安全法規將工人限制在建築工地的指定區域內以保護他們。這項限制是必要的，因為其他區域含有正在運行的機械和危險材料。","word":"confine"}},"confirm":{"createdAt":1781850347300,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"確認是指驗證或證實某事是否真實、準確或有效，通常需要進一步的證據或行動。","options":["cancel","confirm","deny","change"],"sentence":"The airline sent an email to ______ my flight reservation for next Tuesday. I needed to click the link to verify that I would indeed be traveling on that date.","translation":"航空公司發送電子郵件來確認我下週二的航班預訂。我需要點擊鏈接來驗證我確實會在那個日期出行。","word":"confirm"}},"confirmation":{"createdAt":1782094693733,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"確認是指正式同意或驗證某事已經被接受或安排。","options":["rejection","confirmation","denial","cancellation"],"sentence":"I waited for ______ from the hotel about my reservation before booking my flight. The manager sent me an email with the booking details and room number.","translation":"在預訂機票前，我等待飯店關於我預訂的確認。經理給我發送了一封包含預訂詳情和房間號碼的電子郵件。","word":"confirmation"}},"conflict":{"createdAt":1781926371000,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"conflict 作為動詞意思是衝突、爭執，指不同的觀點或利益發生激烈的對立。","options":["cooperate","negotiate","conflict","unite"],"sentence":"The two nations began to ______ over territory disputes along their shared border. Diplomatic negotiations failed, and military tensions escalated to the point of armed confrontation.","translation":"兩個國家開始因為共享邊界沿線的領土爭端而發生衝突。外交談判失敗，軍事緊張局勢升級到武裝對抗的程度。","word":"conflict"}},"conform":{"createdAt":1782646755361,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"conform 指的是按照既定的規則、標準或期望而行動或調整行為。","options":["follow","conform","obey","accept"],"sentence":"All students must ______ to the school's uniform policy without exception. Any deviation from the dress code will result in immediate disciplinary action.","translation":"所有學生必須符合學校的制服政策，毫無例外。任何偏離著裝規範的行為都將導致立即的紀律處分。","word":"conform"}},"confront":{"createdAt":1782651710252,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"confront 表示直接面對或遭遇困難和危險的情況。","options":["avoid","confront","anticipate","overlook"],"sentence":"The explorer had to ______ many dangerous obstacles during her expedition through the Amazon rainforest. Floods, wild animals, and disease were constant threats she encountered.","translation":"這位探險家在亞馬遜雨林的遠征中不得不面臨許多危險的障礙。洪水、野生動物和疾病都是她遇到的持續威脅。","word":"confront"}},"confrontation":{"createdAt":1785133004685,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"confrontation指的是兩方之間的直接對抗或面臨，通常帶有衝突或敵對的性質，與溫和的討論或協商不同。","options":["discussion","confrontation","debate","negotiation"],"sentence":"The heated ______ between the two political leaders dominated the news cycle for weeks. Both sides refused to back down, and the tension escalated as they faced each other directly.","translation":"兩位政治領袖之間的激烈對抗在新聞中佔據了好幾週的頭條。雙方都拒絕退縮，當他們直接面對時，緊張局勢不斷升級。","word":"confrontation"}},"confuse":{"createdAt":1783346573167,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"confuse 意為使困惑或使混淆，表示使某人感到不確定或無法理解。","options":["clarify","confuse","organize","simplify"],"sentence":"The unclear instructions will ______ most students about which assignment to submit first. The teacher should rewrite the directions using simple language to prevent misunderstanding.","translation":"不清楚的指示將使大多數學生對要先提交哪項作業感到困惑。老師應該用簡單的語言重寫指示以防止誤解。","word":"confuse"}},"confused":{"createdAt":1782381714739,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"confused 表示感到困惑、不理解或不清楚，通常在接收到難以理解的資訊或說明時使用。","options":["excited","confused","bored","frustrated"],"sentence":"I felt ______ when the teacher explained the complex math problem too quickly. After she slowed down and used simple examples, everything finally made sense to me.","translation":"當老師快速解釋複雜的數學問題時，我感到困惑。在她放慢速度並使用簡單的例子後，一切對我來說終於清楚了。","word":"confused"}},"confusing":{"createdAt":1781332009081,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"confusing 是形容詞，表示使人困惑的、令人感到不明白的","options":["clear","confusing","simple","helpful"],"sentence":"The instruction manual was quite ______ with unclear diagrams and poorly written explanations. Customers had difficulty assembling the product and complained about the lack of clarity.","translation":"說明書非常令人困惑，圖表不清楚，解釋寫得很差。客戶在組裝產品時遇到困難，並抱怨缺乏清晰性。","word":"confusing"}},"confusion":{"createdAt":1781661288519,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"confusion 是指無序、混亂或困惑的狀態，常用來形容混亂的環境或思想上的困惑","options":["clarity","confusion","silence","attention"],"sentence":"The ______ in the classroom was so bad that the teacher had to stop the lesson. Students were talking over each other, papers were scattered everywhere, and nobody knew what was happening.","translation":"教室裡的混亂非常嚴重，老師不得不停止上課。學生們互相說話，紙張散落一地，沒有人知道發生了什麼。","word":"confusion"}},"congratulate":{"createdAt":1781484415233,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"congratulate是指向某人表示祝賀和讚美，因為他們取得了成就或好運。","options":["criticize","congratulate","challenge","ignore"],"sentence":"Everyone came to ______ her on winning the scholarship to Harvard University. They gave her flowers, hugs, and warm wishes for her future success.","translation":"每個人都來祝賀她獲得了哈佛大學的獎學金。他們給了她鮮花、擁抱和對她未來成功的美好祝願。","word":"congratulate"}},"congress":{"createdAt":1783760354085,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"congress 意為「國會、立法機關」，特別指擁有立法權力的政府機構。","options":["congress","court","office","media"],"sentence":"The new law was debated extensively in ______ before it was finally approved by both houses. The legislators spent weeks discussing its potential impact on healthcare and taxation.","translation":"在新法案最終被兩院批准之前，它在國會中進行了廣泛的辯論。立法者花了數週時間討論它對醫療保健和稅收的潛在影響。","word":"congress"}},"congressman":{"createdAt":1781848330184,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"congressman是指在國家立法機構或議會中任職的成員或代表。","options":["judge","congressman","teacher","mayor"],"sentence":"The ______ voted in favor of the new education bill during the parliamentary session. His position in the legislative body allowed him to influence important national policies.","translation":"這位國會議員在議會會議中投票贊成新的教育法案。他在立法機構中的職位使他能夠影響重要的國家政策。","word":"congressman"}},"connect":{"createdAt":1784110946854,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"connect 意為聯繫、連接，用來描述將兩個或多個地點、事物或概念結合或連結在一起。","options":["separate","connect","distance","isolate"],"sentence":"The new highway will ______ the two major cities that are currently separated by rural farmland. This infrastructure project will reduce travel time between them from four hours to just ninety minutes.","translation":"這條新高速公路將連接目前被農村農田分隔的兩個主要城市。這個基礎設施項目將把它們之間的旅行時間從四小時減少到九十分鐘。","word":"connect"}},"connection":{"createdAt":1781582619550,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"connection 指兩個或更多事物之間的關係或聯繫，顯示它們如何相關或相互影響。","options":["separation","barrier","connection","conflict"],"sentence":"There is a strong ______ between regular exercise and good health. Scientific studies have consistently shown that people who exercise frequently have fewer health problems.","translation":"規律運動和良好健康之間有著密切的聯繫。科學研究一致表明經常運動的人健康問題較少。","word":"connection"}},"conquer":{"createdAt":1782575719153,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"conquer意為「征服、佔領、擊敗」，指通過軍事力量或堅決的努力取得對某個地區、對手或困難的控制或勝利。","options":["explore","conquer","visit","discover"],"sentence":"Alexander the Great managed to ______ most of the known world in his lifetime. Through military campaigns, he defeated every army that opposed his expansion across three continents.","translation":"亞歷山大大帝在其一生中成功征服了大部分已知世界。通過軍事行動，他擊敗了每一支反對他在三大洲擴張的軍隊。","word":"conquer"}},"conquest":{"createdAt":1785240153912,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"conquest在此指的是克服或戰勝困難、恐懼或挑戰，表示透過努力取得對某事物的控制或勝利。","options":["understanding","conquest","discussion","knowledge"],"sentence":"Her ______ of her fear of public speaking was a major personal achievement. Through years of practice and determination, she transformed from someone who avoided presentations into a confident speaker.","translation":"她克服了對公開演講的恐懼，這是一個重大的個人成就。通過多年的練習和決心，她從一個迴避演講的人變成了一個自信的演講者。","word":"conquest"}},"conscience":{"createdAt":1782094693729,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"良心是指一個人對道德和倫理的內在感受，驅使人做正確的事。","options":["mind","conscience","heart","brain"],"sentence":"His ______ troubled him after he realized he had cheated on the exam. He felt guilty and decided to confess to the teacher the next day.","translation":"他意識到自己在考試中作弊後，良心讓他感到不安。他感到內疚，決定第二天向老師坦白。","word":"conscience"}},"conscientious":{"createdAt":1784341917027,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"conscientious 意為認真的、盡責的，形容一個人工作態度誠實、認真，並且非常負責任和細心。","options":["hardworking","conscientious","friendly","talented"],"sentence":"Maria is a ______ employee who always completes her work on time and takes pride in every project. Her supervisor has never had to correct her mistakes because she pays close attention to every detail.","translation":"瑪麗亞是一位認真盡責的員工，總是按時完成工作，並對每個項目引以為傲。她的主管從未需要糾正她的錯誤，因為她對每個細節都特別留意。","word":"conscientious"}},"conscious":{"createdAt":1782361629314,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"conscious 形容詞表示「有意識的」、「清醒的」或「自覺的」，指一個人能夠感知和認識周圍環境。","options":["sleeping","conscious","dreaming","sedated"],"sentence":"The patient remained ______ throughout the surgical procedure and could respond to the surgeon's questions. The anesthesiologist carefully monitored her vital signs to ensure she stayed awake.","translation":"患者在整個手術過程中保持清醒，能夠回應外科醫生的問題。麻醉師仔細監測她的生命體徵以確保她保持清醒。","word":"conscious"}},"consciously":{"createdAt":1785110904569,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"consciously表示有意識地、自覺地，用於表達某個行為是否是出於主觀意願的，與後句說明這是無意中發生的現象形成對比","options":["consciously","frequently","quietly","reluctantly"],"sentence":"She did not ______ choose to hurt his feelings; it was simply an accidental remark. However, she immediately apologized once she realized the impact of her words.","translation":"她沒有有意識地選擇傷害他的感受；那只是一個無意的評論。然而，一旦她意識到她的言語的影響，她立即道歉了。","word":"consciously"}},"consciousness":{"createdAt":1783255892321,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"consciousness 是名詞，指清醒狀態或對周圍環境的認知和意識，特別是指從無意識或昏迷中恢復。","options":["popularity","consciousness","confidence","productivity"],"sentence":"After the accident, the patient regained ______ in the hospital and could recognize family members. The doctors were relieved to see that his awareness and cognitive functions had fully returned.","translation":"事故後，患者在醫院裡恢復了______，並能認出家庭成員。醫生們很欣慰地看到他的意識和認知功能已完全恢復。","word":"consciousness"}},"consecutive":{"createdAt":1781842000007,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"連續的意思是一個接一個地發生，沒有間斷或中斷。","options":["different","consecutive","recent","important"],"sentence":"The team won ______ games without losing a single match. Their winning streak lasted exactly five weeks with no breaks or interruptions.","translation":"該隊贏了______場比賽，沒有輸過一場。他們的連勝紀錄持續了整整五週，沒有任何中斷。","word":"consecutive"}},"consensus":{"createdAt":1781746848184,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"consensus 表示「共識」或「一致同意」，指所有相關人士達成的普遍協議。","options":["conflict","consensus","postponement","confusion"],"sentence":"After three hours of debate, the board finally reached a ______ on the new budget proposal. All twelve members voted in favor of the decision.","translation":"經過三小時的辯論，董事會最終就新的預算提案達成了共識。全部十二名成員都投票贊成該決定。","word":"consensus"}},"consent":{"createdAt":1781965320891,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"consent 是指同意或許可，通常用於正式或法律情況中需要獲得同意。","options":["consent","payment","insurance","diagnosis"],"sentence":"The doctor cannot perform surgery without the patient's ______ in writing. This legal requirement protects patients' rights and ensures they understand the procedure.","translation":"醫生未經患者的書面同意不能進行手術。這項法律要求保護患者的權利並確保他們理解該程序。","word":"consent"}},"consequence":{"createdAt":1781746685513,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"consequence指的是結果、後果，表示某個行為或事件引起的結果或影響。","options":["consequence","tolerance","stadium","miracle"],"sentence":"Driving recklessly can have serious ______ for your safety and the safety of others. You may face accidents, injuries, or legal penalties as a result of your actions.","translation":"魯莽駕駛可能對你和他人的安全造成嚴重的後果。你的行為可能導致事故、傷害或法律處罰。","word":"consequence"}},"consequent":{"createdAt":1781758494837,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"consequent 形容作為結果而產生的、隨後發生的事物，與第二句中列舉的洪水造成的損害相符。","options":["preceding","consequent","unrelated","accidental"],"sentence":"The heavy rainfall caused flooding, and the ______ damage to the town's infrastructure was severe. Because of the flood, roads, bridges, and buildings all suffered major destruction.","translation":"大雨導致洪水，隨之而來的對城鎮基礎設施的破壞非常嚴重。由於洪水，道路、橋樑和建築物都遭受了重大破壞。","word":"consequent"}},"consequently":{"createdAt":1781332009074,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"consequently 是副詞，表示結果或因此，用於說明某事是另一事件的結果","options":["however","consequently","although","meanwhile"],"sentence":"The storm caused severe damage to the power lines; ______, thousands of people lost electricity. The outage lasted for three days until repairs were completed.","translation":"暴風雨對電力線造成了嚴重損壞；因而，數千人失去了電力。停電持續了三天，直到維修完成。","word":"consequently"}},"conservation":{"createdAt":1782401868821,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"conservation 表示保護、保存或保育自然資源和野生動物。","options":["destruction","conservation","exploitation","extinction"],"sentence":"The ______ of endangered species requires coordinated efforts from governments, scientists, and environmental organizations worldwide. Without protection, many species would become extinct.","translation":"瀕危物種的保育需要全球政府、科學家和環保組織的協調努力。沒有保護，許多物種將會滅絕。","word":"conservation"}},"conservative":{"createdAt":1782401868810,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"conservative 表示傾向於保持現狀和傳統，反對激進變革。","options":["progressive","conservative","moderate","liberal"],"sentence":"The ______ political party opposed most new social reforms and preferred to maintain traditional values. They resisted any significant changes to existing policies.","translation":"這個保守派政治黨反對大多數新的社會改革，並且傾向於維持傳統價值觀。他們抵制對現有政策的任何重大改變。","word":"conservative"}},"conserve":{"createdAt":1782401868814,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"conserve 表示保存、保護或節約資源。","options":["waste","conserve","pollute","distribute"],"sentence":"During the drought, the government asked residents to ______ water by taking shorter showers and fixing leaky faucets. Every drop was precious.","translation":"在乾旱期間，政府要求居民通過洗短浴和修理漏水水龍頭來保存水。每一滴都很珍貴。","word":"conserve"}},"consider":{"createdAt":1782477376588,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"consider是指認真思考或評估某事物，通常涉及分析不同的方面才能做出決定。","options":["rejected","consider","refused","ignored"],"sentence":"I ______ this job offer carefully before making a final decision. After weighing all the pros and cons, I decided to accept it.","translation":"在做最終決定之前，我仔細考慮這份工作邀請。權衡利弊後，我決定接受它。","word":"consider"}},"considerable":{"createdAt":1783305922610,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"considerable 意為相當大的或可觀的，用來形容數量、程度或重要性都很大。","options":["tiny","negligible","considerable","minimal"],"sentence":"The company made a ______ profit this quarter, exceeding all previous records. The executives were thrilled by the amount of money they earned.","translation":"這家公司本季度獲得了相當大的利潤，超過了之前所有的記錄。主管對賺取的金額感到高興。","word":"considerable"}},"considerably":{"createdAt":1781824444628,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"considerably 是副詞，表示很大程度上、相當多地或值得注意地改變了某事物。","options":["slightly","considerably","potentially","eventually"],"sentence":"The new highway route has ______ reduced commute times for daily travelers. Traffic that once took forty-five minutes now only requires thirty minutes to navigate.","translation":"新的高速公路路線大幅縮短了日常通勤者的通勤時間。曾經需要四十五分鐘的交通現在只需三十分鐘即可通行。","word":"considerably"}},"considerate":{"createdAt":1781337343698,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"considerate意為體貼的、周到的或關心他人感受的。","options":["rude","selfish","considerate","lazy"],"sentence":"James is a very ______ friend who always remembers everyone's birthdays and asks about their problems. He shows genuine concern for others' feelings and well-being in every interaction.","translation":"詹姆斯是一位非常體貼的朋友，他總是記得每個人的生日並關心他們的問題。他在每次互動中都表現出對他人感受和福祉的真誠關心。","word":"considerate"}},"consideration":{"createdAt":1785545921252,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「consideration」在這裡表示「深思熟慮的考慮」，指認真思考和權衡各種因素的過程。","options":["attention","consideration","patience","caution"],"sentence":"The manager gave careful ______ to each employee's request before making a decision. She spent hours thinking about their needs and concerns.","translation":"經理在做決定前仔細考慮了每位員工的要求。她花了幾個小時思考他們的需求和顧慮。","word":"consideration"}},"considering":{"createdAt":1784599004461,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「considering」作為前置詞，意思是「考慮到」或「就而論」，用來引入某個因素或情況，說明為什麼某事是真實或合理的。","options":["despite","considering","whereas","unless"],"sentence":"______ her excellent qualifications and experience, she is the best candidate for the position. She has worked in this field for over ten years and has consistently received top performance reviews from her supervisors.","translation":"考慮到她出色的資格和經驗，她是這個職位的最佳候選人。她在這個領域工作了十多年，並且一直從主管那裡獲得最高的績效評價。","word":"considering"}},"consist":{"createdAt":1783346573161,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"consist 意為組成或構成，表示由某些部分或成員組合而成。","options":["consist","contain","compete","consist of"],"sentence":"The new Olympic team will ______ of athletes from fifteen different nations. Each country sent its three most talented competitors to represent them.","translation":"新奧運代表隊將由來自十五個不同國家的運動員組成。每個國家派遣了三名最才華橫溢的競賽者代表他們。","word":"consist"}},"consistent":{"createdAt":1783346573162,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"consistent 意為一致的或始終如一的，表示行為或結果保持穩定和相同。","options":["inconsistent","random","consistent","variable"],"sentence":"Maria's ______ performance throughout the entire season earned her the MVP award. She scored between 25 and 28 points in every single game without exception.","translation":"瑪麗亞在整個賽季中始終如一的表現為她贏得了MVP獎。她在每場比賽中都得分在25到28分之間，毫無例外。","word":"consistent"}},"consolation":{"createdAt":1783346573165,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"consolation 意為安慰或慰藉，指在失望或困難時給予的精神上的寬慰。","options":["celebration","consolation","compensation","reward"],"sentence":"Although he lost the championship, winning the ______ prize was some ______ for his months of hard training. The second-place trophy reminded him that his effort had not gone unrecognized.","translation":"雖然他沒有贏得冠軍，但贏得亞軍獎項對他數月的艱苦訓練是某種安慰。第二名獎盃提醒他他的努力並未被忽視。","word":"consolation"}},"console":{"createdAt":1781775363749,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"console 作為動詞表示慰問或慰藉某人，當某人遭遇不幸時提供心理上的支持。","options":["scold","console","advise","ignore"],"sentence":"She tried to ______ her friend who had just lost her job. She listened carefully to his worries and offered kind words to ease his pain.","translation":"她試圖______剛剛失業的朋友。她仔細傾聽他的擔憂，並提供親切的話語來緩解他的痛苦。","word":"console"}},"consonant":{"createdAt":1781965320885,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"consonant 指的是需要氣流受阻才能發音的字母，與母音(vowel)相對。","options":["vowel","consonant","syllable","phoneme"],"sentence":"The letter 'b' is a ______ that requires you to close your lips to pronounce it. In English, there are twenty-one of these letters, as opposed to only five vowels.","translation":"字母'b'是一個子音，發音時需要閉上嘴唇。在英文中，有二十一個這樣的字母，相對於只有五個母音。","word":"consonant"}},"conspicuous":{"createdAt":1785559261402,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"conspicuous 意指某物顯眼或引人注目，容易被看見或注意到，通常是因為它與周圍環境不同或特別突出。","options":["hidden","conspicuous","common","ordinary"],"sentence":"The bright red car was ______ among all the grey and black vehicles in the parking lot. Everyone who walked by immediately noticed it because of its striking color and unusual appearance.","translation":"那輛鮮紅色的車在停車場裡所有灰色和黑色的車輛中顯眼無比。每個經過的人都因為它醒目的顏色和不尋常的外觀而立即注意到它。","word":"conspicuous"}},"conspiracy":{"createdAt":1781799990470,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"conspiracy是指多個人秘密策劃做某件非法或有害的事情，通常涉及背叛或欺騙。","options":["rumor","conspiracy","scandal","investigation"],"sentence":"The detective uncovered a ______ involving high-ranking government officials who had secretly planned to manipulate the election results. Evidence showed they had been meeting in private for months to coordinate their illegal activities.","translation":"這名偵探揭露了一項由高階政府官員參與的陰謀，他們曾秘密計劃操縱選舉結果。證據顯示他們已經私下開會好幾個月來協調他們的非法活動。","word":"conspiracy"}},"conspire":{"createdAt":1781837419087,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Conspire表示為了達到不正當目的而進行秘密的同謀或策劃。","options":["cooperate","conspire","communicate","collaborate"],"sentence":"The two executives ______ to steal company secrets and sell them to competitors. They secretly planned their scheme without anyone noticing their communications.","translation":"這兩位主管密謀竊取公司機密並將其出售給競爭對手。他們秘密策劃了他們的計畫，沒有人注意到他們的溝通。","word":"conspire"}},"constant":{"createdAt":1783661880056,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"constant 是形容詞，表示經常發生的或連續不斷的，與第二句中「整天都不停止」完全相符。","options":["occasional","rare","constant","intermittent"],"sentence":"The ______ noise from the construction site made it impossible to concentrate on work. The drilling and hammering never seemed to stop throughout the day.","translation":"建築工地持續不斷的噪音使得無法專心工作。鑽孔和敲打聲整天都不停止。","word":"constant"}},"constantly":{"createdAt":1786856246203,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"constantly 是副詞，表示「不斷地、持續不斷地、經常地」，用來描述某個動作或狀態頻繁發生或持續進行。","options":["occasionally","constantly","rarely","never"],"sentence":"She ______ checks her phone for messages from her friends. Her phone has become such an inseparable part of her daily routine that she looks at it every few minutes without fail.","translation":"她不斷地查看手機是否有朋友的訊息。她的手機已經成為日常生活中不可分割的一部分，她每隔幾分鐘就會毫無例外地看一次。","word":"constantly"}},"constitute":{"createdAt":1781779647125,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"constitute表示組成或構成某個整體的成分或部分","options":["destroy","constitute","separate","undermine"],"sentence":"These five elements ______ the foundation of a successful business. Together, they form the essential framework that all operations depend upon.","translation":"這五個要素構成了一個成功企業的基礎。它們共同形成了所有業務所依賴的基本框架。","word":"constitute"}},"constitution":{"createdAt":1781424356419,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"constitution指的是一個國家或組織的根本法律文件，規定了其政治體系和基本原則。","options":["budget","constitution","treaty","regulation"],"sentence":"The country's ______ serves as the supreme law that outlines the structure of government and protects individual rights. All legislation must comply with the principles established in this foundational document.","translation":"該國的憲法是闡述政府結構和保護個人權利的最高法律。所有立法都必須符合這份基礎文件中所確立的原則。","word":"constitution"}},"constitutional":{"createdAt":1781779647127,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"constitutional表示符合或遵守憲法規定的","options":["modern","constitutional","popular","fair"],"sentence":"The court ruled that the new law was not ______ . The judges determined it violated several provisions in the founding document.","translation":"法院裁定這項新法律不符合憲法。法官判定它違反了憲法文件中的幾項條款。","word":"constitutional"}},"constraint":{"createdAt":1782006215683,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"「constraint」是名詞，表示「限制」或「束縛」，指阻止或減少某事物可能性的因素。","options":["opportunity","advantage","constraint","resource"],"sentence":"The project faced a serious budget ______ that limited what could be accomplished. Without additional funding, the team could only complete half of the originally planned features.","translation":"該項目面臨嚴重的預算限制，限制了可以完成的工作。沒有額外資金，團隊只能完成原計劃功能的一半。","word":"constraint"}},"construct":{"createdAt":1784725206764,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"construct 是及物動詞，表示「建造、構造、創立」，常用於描述建築物、結構或組織的創建過程。","options":["destroy","construct","analyze","investigate"],"sentence":"The company plans to ______ a new shopping mall in the downtown area. The architects have already completed the blueprints and the foundation work will begin next month.","translation":"公司計畫在市中心地區建造一個新的購物中心。建築師已經完成了藍圖，基礎工程將於下個月開始。","word":"construct"}},"construction":{"createdAt":1783774320514,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"construction 指的是建築過程或建築物本身，涉及地基、梁等結構性工作。","options":["kit","construction","squad","assembly"],"sentence":"The city announced a major ______ project that will take three years to complete. Workers have already started laying the foundation and installing steel beams for the new downtown office complex.","translation":"城市宣布了一項需要三年才能完成的主要建築項目。工人已經開始為新的市中心辦公綜合體鋪設地基並安裝鋼梁。","word":"construction"}},"constructive":{"createdAt":1781779647130,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"constructive表示有益的、建設性的或旨在改進的","options":["destructive","constructive","negative","harsh"],"sentence":"The manager provided ______ feedback to help the team improve. She pointed out specific areas for growth and offered practical suggestions.","translation":"經理提供了建設性反饋來幫助團隊改進。她指出了特定的改進領域並提供了實用建議。","word":"constructive"}},"consult":{"createdAt":1781961466404,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"consult 表示向某人請教或與某人商議，通常是為了獲得專業意見或建議。","options":["ignore","consult","announce","delay"],"sentence":"Before making a decision about the business merger, the CEO decided to ______ with the company's legal team. The lawyers provided expert advice that directly influenced the final contract terms.","translation":"在決定公司合併之前，首席執行官決定與公司的法律團隊商議。律師提供的專業建議直接影響了最終的合同條款。","word":"consult"}},"consultant":{"createdAt":1781779647128,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"consultant表示被聘請提供專業建議和指導的人","options":["employee","consultant","intern","competitor"],"sentence":"The company hired a marketing ______ to improve their brand strategy. This expert spent two weeks analyzing their current approach and proposing solutions.","translation":"公司聘請了營銷顧問來改進品牌戰略。這位專家花了兩週時間分析他們目前的方法並提出解決方案。","word":"consultant"}},"consultation":{"createdAt":1783323381796,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"consultation 指的是與專家或權威人士進行的正式會議或商議，目的是尋求意見或建議。","options":["vacation","consultation","interview","presentation"],"sentence":"Before making a major decision about her health, Maria requested a ______ with her doctor. The appointment was scheduled for next week so they could discuss her symptoms and treatment options in detail.","translation":"在做出關於她健康的重大決定之前，瑪麗亞要求與醫生進行諮詢。預約定在下週，以便他們可以詳細討論她的症狀和治療方案。","word":"consultation"}},"consume":{"createdAt":1781478568769,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"consume 表示使用、消耗或吃掉某樣東西。","options":["produce","consume","store","recycle"],"sentence":"The factory ______ thousands of tons of raw materials each month to produce textiles. The production demands required constant supply chain management.","translation":"工廠每月消耗數千噸原材料來生產紡織品。生產需求需要持續的供應鏈管理。","word":"consume"}},"consumer":{"createdAt":1785406734822,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"consumer 是指購買和使用商品或服務的人，與 producer（生產者）、retailer（零售商）和 advertiser（廣告商）的角色完全不同。","options":["producer","consumer","retailer","advertiser"],"sentence":"A ______ is someone who buys and uses products or services in the marketplace. Companies spend millions of dollars studying how their ______ behave when making purchasing decisions.","translation":"消費者是在市場上購買和使用產品或服務的人。公司花費數百萬美元研究他們的消費者在做出購買決定時的行為方式。","word":"consumer"}},"consumption":{"createdAt":1781926371000,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"consumption 意思是消費、消耗，指人們使用或食用商品和資源的數量。","options":["conservation","production","consumption","rationing"],"sentence":"The world's ______ of fossil fuels has increased dramatically over the past century. This growing demand has led to climate change and environmental degradation that affects the entire planet.","translation":"世界在過去一個世紀裡對化石燃料的消費大幅增加。這種不斷增長的需求導致了影響整個星球的氣候變化和環境退化。","word":"consumption"}},"contact":{"createdAt":1782303071297,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"contact 作為名詞表示接觸或聯繫，指人與人之間的溝通或相互往來","options":["bury","startling","contact","cavity"],"sentence":"The two organizations agreed to maintain regular ______ throughout the partnership. They scheduled monthly meetings to ensure smooth communication and collaboration.","translation":"這兩個組織同意在整個夥伴關係期間保持定期的聯繫。他們安排了每月一次的會議以確保順暢的溝通和合作。","word":"contact"}},"contagious":{"createdAt":1784451184441,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"contagious 表示「傳染的」或「易傳播的」，指疾病或思想能夠快速從一個人傳播到另一個人。","options":["rare","mild","contagious","dormant"],"sentence":"The flu virus is highly ______, spreading rapidly through the office within days. Everyone who came into contact with the infected employee had to quarantine.","translation":"流感病毒具有高度傳染性，在幾天內迅速蔓延到整個辦公室。所有與受感染員工接觸的人都必須隔離。","word":"contagious"}},"contain":{"createdAt":1781428458256,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"contain表示包含或包括某些內容或元素。","options":["contain","choke","lecture","superstitious"],"sentence":"The contract ______ several important clauses that protect both parties involved. Each section was carefully reviewed by lawyers before signing.","translation":"合約包含了幾項保護雙方的重要條款。簽署前每一部分都由律師仔細審查。","word":"contain"}},"container":{"createdAt":1783852040583,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"container是指用來裝東西的容器，通常有蓋子，可以裝液體或固體物質。","options":["spoon","container","freezer","recipe"],"sentence":"She poured the leftover soup into a plastic ______ before putting it in the refrigerator. The sealed lid kept the food fresh for several days.","translation":"她在將湯放入冰箱之前把剩下的湯倒入塑膠容器中。密閉的蓋子讓食物保持新鮮好幾天。","word":"container"}},"contaminate":{"createdAt":1782646755360,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"contaminate 指的是用有害或不潔的物質使某物變得不純淨或危險。","options":["pollute","contaminate","affect","damage"],"sentence":"The factory's chemical spill threatened to ______ the groundwater supply for the entire region. Local authorities immediately began testing wells to assess the extent of the pollution.","translation":"工廠的化學品洩漏威脅要汙染整個地區的地下水供應。當地當局立即開始測試水井以評估汙染的程度。","word":"contaminate"}},"contaminated":{"createdAt":1781566460883,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"contaminated表示被有害物質或細菌汙染的狀態，與水中有害細菌和政府警告措施相符。","options":["pure","clean","contaminated","treated"],"sentence":"The water supply was declared ______ after tests revealed harmful bacteria. The government issued a boil-water advisory to protect residents from illness.","translation":"經測試發現有害細菌後，供水被宣佈受汙染。政府發佈了煮沸飲用水警告以保護居民免受疾病。","word":"contaminated"}},"contamination":{"createdAt":1781531595650,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"contamination 是指使物質受到有害物質或污染的過程，特別是指危害健康的物質混入。","options":["shortage","contamination","treatment","distribution"],"sentence":"The water ______ made the entire supply unsafe for drinking. Scientists found harmful bacteria and chemicals that had seeped into the reservoir.","translation":"水的汙染使整個供水都不安全飲用。科學家們發現有害細菌和化學物質滲入了水庫。","word":"contamination"}},"contemplate":{"createdAt":1783391421681,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"contemplate（動詞）指「深思、沉思、仔細思考」，表示花時間認真思考某個問題。","options":["ignore","contemplate","dismiss","forget"],"sentence":"She sat alone by the window to ______ the meaning of life and her future decisions. After deep reflection for hours, she finally understood what she truly wanted.","translation":"她獨自坐在窗邊思考生命的意義和她的未來決定。經過數小時的深思熟慮後，她終於明白了她真正想要的是什麼。","word":"contemplate"}},"contemplation":{"createdAt":1781362281660,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"contemplation表示深思或沉思，指認真思考某事的過程。","options":["action","contemplation","movement","celebration"],"sentence":"After hours of ______, she finally made a decision about her career change. She had carefully thought through all the options and consequences.","translation":"經過數小時的沉思，她終於做出了關於職業改變的決定。她已經仔細考慮了所有的選項和後果。","word":"contemplation"}},"contemporary":{"createdAt":1783262026083,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"contemporary 作為名詞或形容詞表示「同時代的、當代的、同時代的人」，指在同一時期存在或生活的人或事物。","options":["ancestor","contemporary","successor","descendant"],"sentence":"Shakespeare was a ______ of Marlowe, and both playwrights dominated the London theater scene during the 1590s. These two great writers influenced each other through their works during the same period.","translation":"莎士比亞是馬洛的同時代人，兩位劇作家在1590年代統治了倫敦戲劇舞台。這兩位偉大的作家在同一時期通過他們的作品相互影響。","word":"contemporary"}},"contempt":{"createdAt":1781917052439,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"contempt表示強烈的蔑視或鄙視，通常針對被認為不值得尊重或道德低劣的人或行為。","options":["sympathy","respect","contempt","interest"],"sentence":"The judge showed ______ for the defendant's repeated lies and refusal to tell the truth. She sentenced him harshly and refused to make eye contact during the entire proceeding.","translation":"法官對被告人的反覆謊言和拒絕說出真相表示輕蔑。她判處他嚴厲的刑罰，並在整個訴訟過程中拒絕與他有眼神接觸。","word":"contempt"}},"contend":{"createdAt":1781779647129,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"contend表示競爭或爭奪某物","options":["watch","contend","ignore","abandon"],"sentence":"Three teams will ______ for the championship trophy. Only the strongest and most skilled team will emerge as the winner.","translation":"三支隊伍將為冠軍獎杯而競爭。只有最強大和最有技能的隊伍才能成為贏家。","word":"contend"}},"content":{"createdAt":1784002728423,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"content（滿意的；知足的）表示對現況感到滿足和快樂，不再有過多的慾望或不滿。","options":["anxious","angry","content","confused"],"sentence":"After years of struggling to find happiness, Maria finally felt ______ with her simple life in the countryside. She no longer yearned for wealth or fame, and appreciated everything she already had.","translation":"經過多年的努力尋求幸福，瑪麗亞終於對自己在鄉村的簡樸生活感到滿意。她不再渴望財富或名聲，而是感激她已經擁有的一切。","word":"content"}},"contention":{"createdAt":1784548725378,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"contention指爭論、紛爭或相互衝突的論點，用來描述雙方之間的持久性意見分歧和爭執。","options":["agreement","contention","harmony","friendship"],"sentence":"The ______ between the two scientists about climate change has lasted for years. Their opposing views on data interpretation have created an ongoing debate in academic journals.","translation":"兩位科學家關於氣候變化的爭論已經持續多年。他們在資料解釋上的對立觀點在學術期刊中引發了持續的辯論。","word":"contention"}},"contentment":{"createdAt":1781698273261,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"contentment 是名詞，表示「滿足感」或「知足」的狀態，指對現況感到滿意和心滿意足。","options":["frustration","ambition","contentment","anxiety"],"sentence":"After retiring from her successful career, Sarah found ______ in spending time with her grandchildren. She no longer felt the need to chase promotions or earn more money.","translation":"從成功的職業生涯退休後，莎拉在花時間與孫子孫女相處中找到了滿足感。她不再感到需要追求升職或賺取更多金錢。","word":"contentment"}},"contents":{"createdAt":1781425024017,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"contents是指容器或出版物裡面所裝的東西或所包含的內容，是複數名詞。","options":["container","contents","structure","label"],"sentence":"The ______ of the antique chest revealed letters, photographs, and jewelry from the 1920s. We consulted the museum's catalog to understand the historical significance of each item inside.","translation":"古董箱子裡面的東西揭示了1920年代的信件、照片和珠寶。我們查閱了博物館的目錄來瞭解裡面每件物品的歷史意義。","word":"contents"}},"contest":{"createdAt":1781836375370,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"contest是競賽或競爭，指參加者為了贏得獎勵或證明能力而進行的正式比賽。","options":["match","contest","game","challenge"],"sentence":"The students eagerly participated in the spelling ______ held at their school. The winner would receive a trophy and advance to the regional competition.","translation":"學生們熱情參加在他們學校舉辦的拼字比賽。獲勝者將獲得獎杯並晉級地區競賽。","word":"contest"}},"contestant":{"createdAt":1781667024998,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"contestant是指參加比賽或競爭的人，強調在特定競技活動中的參與身份。","options":["judge","chef","contestant","winner"],"sentence":"The final ______ on the cooking show prepared a three-course meal in just thirty minutes. Only the top three chefs made it to this stage of the competition.","translation":"烹飪節目的最後參賽選手在三十分鐘內準備了三道菜。只有排名前三的廚師才能進入競賽的這個階段。","word":"contestant"}},"context":{"createdAt":1784006934533,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「context」表示理解某事物所需的背景環境或情況，幫助我們正確詮釋意義。","options":["background","context","setting","environment"],"sentence":"To understand the author's message, you need to read the passage within its historical ______. The book was written during World War II, which explains why the characters constantly discuss themes of survival and loss.","translation":"要理解作者的訊息，你需要在其歷史背景的脈絡中閱讀這篇文章。這本書是在第二次世界大戰期間寫成的，這解釋了為什麼角色們不斷討論生存和喪失的主題。","word":"context"}},"continent":{"createdAt":1783556774442,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"continent指的是由許多國家組成的大陸或洲，是地球上最大的陸地區塊。","options":["country","continent","island","region"],"sentence":"Africa is the second-largest ______ in the world. It is surrounded by the Atlantic Ocean and Indian Ocean on all sides.","translation":"非洲是世界上第二大的洲。它被大西洋和印度洋包圍。","word":"continent"}},"continental":{"createdAt":1786088071925,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"continental 形容詞意為「大陸的；洲的」，用來描述位於大陸或主要陸地上的地區或事物。","options":["coastal","continental","domestic","regional"],"sentence":"The ______ United States refers to the 48 states located on the North American mainland. This term excludes Alaska and Hawaii, which are separated from the rest of the country by water.","translation":"「大陸美國」指的是位於北美洲主陸地上的48個州。這個術語排除了阿拉斯加州和夏威夷州，因為它們被水域與其他州隔開。","word":"continental"}},"continual":{"createdAt":1784820300725,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"continual 表示某事物不斷重複發生但有間隔中斷，不是完全連續不中斷的。","options":["constant","continual","permanent","endless"],"sentence":"The construction company worked on the building project with ______ interruptions for maintenance and repairs. They would work for two weeks, then stop for a week, and this cycle repeated throughout the year.","translation":"建築公司在建築項目上進行工作，期間有間隔的中斷進行維護和修繕。他們會工作兩週，然後停工一週，這個週期在整年內重複進行。","word":"continual"}},"continue":{"createdAt":1783845383677,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"continue 表示保持或延續正在進行的動作或狀態，不中斷。","options":["pause","continue","abandon","postpone"],"sentence":"The construction project will ______ through the winter months despite the harsh weather. The workers have been instructed to keep building and not stop for seasonal breaks.","translation":"儘管天氣惡劣，建設項目將在冬季繼續進行。工人被指示繼續施工，不要因季節性休息而停止。","word":"continue"}},"continuity":{"createdAt":1781507137210,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"continuity 指的是故事或敘述的連貫性和持續性，當出現不一致時，就表示連貫性被破壞了。","options":["dialogue","continuity","budget","location"],"sentence":"The film's ______ was broken when the director changed halfway through production. The audience noticed jarring inconsistencies in the plot and character development because of this abrupt transition.","translation":"這部電影的連貫性在製作中途導演更換時被打破了。由於這個突然的轉變，觀眾注意到劇情和角色發展中令人不適的不一致之處。","word":"continuity"}},"continuous":{"createdAt":1781775276768,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"continuous表示不間斷、連續進行，符合全年無休24小時運作的描述。","options":["occasional","continuous","weekly","monthly"],"sentence":"The factory operates on a ______ basis without any breaks. The production line runs 24 hours a day, seven days a week throughout the year.","translation":"該工廠以連續的方式運營，沒有任何停工。生產線一年四季每天運行24小時，每週運行7天。","word":"continuous"}},"continuously":{"createdAt":1781452134701,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"continuously副詞表示不間斷地、持續不斷地進行某個動作或狀態。","options":["intermittently","sporadically","continuously","occasionally"],"sentence":"The factory machines ran ______ for three days without stopping. Production managers monitored them constantly to ensure there were no breaks in the manufacturing process.","translation":"工廠機器連續運轉了三天而沒有停止。生產經理不斷監控它們，以確保製造過程中沒有中斷。","word":"continuously"}},"contract":{"createdAt":1783318346297,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"contract 作為動詞表示「收縮」，指物體體積或尺寸減小，常見於描述溫度變化對物質的影響。","options":["expand","contract","fracture","corrode"],"sentence":"When the temperature drops significantly, metal tends to ______ and become smaller. This physical property is why bridges have expansion joints to prevent damage during winter.","translation":"當溫度大幅下降時，金屬往往會收縮並變小。這種物理性質就是為什麼橋樑要有伸縮縫以防止冬季損害的原因。","word":"contract"}},"contractor":{"createdAt":1782920661027,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"contractor是指承包方或承辦商，通常是簽署合同來完成特定工程或服務的人","options":["worker","contractor","supervisor","engineer"],"sentence":"The construction company hired an experienced ______ to oversee the building project. This professional was responsible for managing workers and ensuring the work met quality standards.","translation":"建築公司聘請一位經驗豐富的承包商來監督建築項目。這位專業人士負責管理工人並確保工作符合品質標準。","word":"contractor"}},"contradict":{"createdAt":1782475559554,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"contradict表示反駁或與某事相矛盾，指兩個陳述或事實相互對立","options":["support","contradict","confirm","reinforce"],"sentence":"The witness's second statement seemed to ______ what he said in court earlier. The lawyer pointed out these inconsistencies to challenge his credibility.","translation":"證人的第二份陳述似乎與他在法庭上早前所說的相矛盾。律師指出這些不一致之處以質疑他的可信度。","word":"contradict"}},"contradiction":{"createdAt":1784630495580,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"contradiction 是指兩個相互對立或相反的陳述、主張或事實之間的直接衝突。","options":["mistake","contradiction","confusion","inconsistency"],"sentence":"The witness's statement contained a clear ______ when she claimed she was at home all evening, yet security footage showed her entering the building at 8 PM. This inconsistency became the key evidence in the investigation.","translation":"目擊者的陳述中存在明顯的矛盾，她聲稱整個晚上都在家，但安全監控錄像顯示她在晚上8點進入了大樓。這個矛盾之處成為調查中的關鍵證據。","word":"contradiction"}},"contradictory":{"createdAt":1784531912961,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"contradictory描述兩個或多個陳述、事實或想法相互對立或不一致，互相否定","options":["clear","contradictory","detailed","honest"],"sentence":"The witness gave ______ statements to the police about what happened that night. First he said he was at home, then he admitted he was actually at the crime scene.","translation":"證人向警察提供了關於那晚發生的事情相互矛盾的陳述。首先他說他在家裡，然後他承認他實際上在犯罪現場。","word":"contradictory"}},"contraption":{"createdAt":1788028661420,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"contraption 是「奇怪的裝置或複雜的機械」的意思，通常指結構複雜但用途不明的東西。","options":["painting","contraption","letter","building"],"sentence":"The inventor proudly showed everyone his latest ______, a strange mechanical device with gears and pulleys. Nobody could figure out what it was supposed to do.","translation":"發明家自豪地向大家展示他最新的奇怪裝置，一台有齒輪和滑輪的複雜機械。沒人能弄清楚它應該做什麼。","word":"contraption"}},"contrary":{"createdAt":1783329157090,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"contrary 作為名詞時，表示「相反的事物」或「相反」，常用於短語 \"the contrary\" 來指相反的情況或相反的事實。","options":["theory","contrary","hypothesis","evidence"],"sentence":"Most people assumed the experiment would fail, but the results proved the ______ to be true. The data demonstrated the exact opposite of what everyone had predicted.","translation":"大多數人認為實驗會失敗，但結果證明了相反的事實是真的。數據證明了與每個人預測完全相反的結果。","word":"contrary"}},"contrast":{"createdAt":1781746848184,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"contrast 表示「對比」或「對照」，指兩個事物之間的明顯差異。","options":["harmony","similarity","contrast","connection"],"sentence":"The ______ between the wealthy downtown area and the poor suburbs is striking and obvious. The difference in infrastructure, buildings, and resources is immediately noticeable.","translation":"繁華市中心和貧困郊區之間的對比非常鮮明。基礎設施、建築物和資源的差異一目了然。","word":"contrast"}},"contribute":{"createdAt":1781693295123,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"contribute 表示提供或貢獻，在此指員工在會議中提出建議。","options":["contribute","ignore","steal","delay"],"sentence":"All employees are expected to ______ their ideas during team meetings. The manager values input from every staff member and uses their suggestions to improve company processes.","translation":"所有員工都應在團隊會議中貢獻他們的想法。經理重視每位員工的意見，並利用他們的建議來改進公司流程。","word":"contribute"}},"contribution":{"createdAt":1781479123530,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"contribution 指的是對某事物的貢獻或捐獻，通常指物質或金錢上的幫助。","options":["complaint","contribution","permission","instruction"],"sentence":"The charity appreciated every ______ made by donors during the fundraising campaign. Without the generous donations from local businesses, the organization would not have been able to build the new community center.","translation":"慈善機構感謝在募款活動中捐獻者的每一筆捐獻。如果沒有當地企業的慷慨捐贈，該組織就不會能夠建造新的社區中心。","word":"contribution"}},"control":{"createdAt":1783823805986,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"control 名詞表示對某事物的管理、監督和掌控，以維持秩序和規範。","options":["assistance","control","support","permission"],"sentence":"The manager maintained strict ______ over the warehouse to prevent theft and ensure efficiency. Every employee's movements were monitored, and all inventory was carefully tracked and accounted for.","translation":"經理對倉庫保持嚴格的控制，以防止盜竊並確保效率。每名員工的動向都受到監控，所有庫存都被仔細追蹤和核算。","word":"control"}},"controversial":{"createdAt":1781275226789,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"此處controversial作形容詞表示「有爭議的；引起爭議的」","options":["controversial","breast","digestion","abroad"],"sentence":"The politician's ______ speech sparked heated debates in newspapers and social media. People on both sides couldn't agree on whether his statements were right or wrong.","translation":"這位政治家的有爭議的演講在報紙和社群媒體上引發了激烈辯論。雙方的人都對他的言論是否正確無法達成共識。","word":"controversial"}},"controversially":{"createdAt":1784648623660,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"controversially 表示「引起爭議地、有爭議地」，用於描述引發不同意見或爭論的行為方式。","options":["quietly","controversially","accidentally","temporarily"],"sentence":"The film director ______ cast an unknown actor in the lead role instead of hiring a famous star. This decision sparked heated debates among critics and audiences alike.","translation":"這位電影導演有爭議地選擇了一位無名演員來飾演主角，而不是聘請著名明星。這個決定引發了評論家和觀眾之間的激烈辯論。","word":"controversially"}},"controversy":{"createdAt":1783433708046,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"controversy 是指引起爭議或爭論的事件或話題，通常涉及不同觀點的衝突和公開辯論。","options":["agreement","controversy","celebration","promotion"],"sentence":"The new policy sparked a heated ______ among the board members, with some strongly supporting it and others fiercely opposing it. The disagreement became so intense that the local news covered the debate for weeks.","translation":"新政策在董事會成員之間引發了激烈的爭議，有些人強烈支持，而其他人則激烈反對。這場分歧變得如此激烈，以至於當地新聞報導了數週的辯論。","word":"controversy"}},"convene":{"createdAt":1783389402201,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"召集是指召集人員聚集在一起舉行會議或集會，表示會議的開始或召集的動作。","options":["disperse","convene","postpone","adjourn"],"sentence":"The board of directors will ______ next Monday to discuss the quarterly financial reports. All members have been notified and are expected to attend the meeting.","translation":"董事會將在下週一召集開會討論季度財務報告。所有成員都已被通知，預期將參加會議。","word":"convene"}},"convention":{"createdAt":1781414884518,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"convention在這裡指大型會議或集會，是業界人士聚集交流的正式活動。","options":["convention","schedule","performance","dream"],"sentence":"The annual film ______ attracted thousands of directors and producers from around the world. Attendees gathered to discuss new trends and network with industry professionals.","translation":"年度電影大會吸引了來自世界各地的數千名導演和製作人。與會者聚集在一起討論新趨勢並與行業專業人士建立聯繫。","word":"convention"}},"conventional":{"createdAt":1781484415208,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"conventional意指遵循傳統習俗和標準方法，不追求創新或特別的做法。","options":["revolutionary","unconventional","conventional","progressive"],"sentence":"Her ______ approach to teaching followed the traditional textbook methods used for decades. She rarely experimented with new or innovative techniques in her classroom.","translation":"她教學的傳統方法遵循了幾十年來使用的傳統教科書方法。她很少在課堂上嘗試新穎或創新的技巧。","word":"conventional"}},"converse":{"createdAt":1783557858061,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"converse作為形容詞表示相反的、對立的，用來描述兩個事物在性質或方向上完全相反。","options":["opposite","converse","similar","example"],"sentence":"The ______ of hot is cold, and they represent opposite ends of the temperature spectrum. These two extremes cannot coexist in the same state.","translation":"熱的相反是冷，它們代表溫度範圍的相反兩端。這兩個極端不能在同一狀態下共存。","word":"converse"}},"conversion":{"createdAt":1781274482562,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"conversion指將某物從一種形式或用途轉變為另一種形式或用途。","options":["destruction","construction","conversion","collection"],"sentence":"The old warehouse underwent a dramatic ______ into a modern art gallery. The transformation took two years to complete and created a stunning cultural venue for the community.","translation":"舊倉庫經歷了戲劇性的轉變，變成了現代美術館。這次改造花了兩年才完成，為社區創造了一個令人驚嘆的文化場所。","word":"conversion"}},"convert":{"createdAt":1784883376205,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"convert表示使某人改變信仰、思想或立場，特別是指宗教信仰的改變；在這個句子中指的是使村民從原有信仰改為基督教。","options":["maintain","convert","distribute","preserve"],"sentence":"The missionary worked hard to ______ the local people to Christianity. After years of education and spiritual guidance, many villagers accepted the new faith and were baptized into the church.","translation":"傳教士努力工作以使當地人民皈依基督教。經過多年的教育和精神指導，許多村民接受了新信仰並受洗加入教會。","word":"convert"}},"convey":{"createdAt":1781779647126,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"convey表示傳達、表達或傳輸信息、感受或意思","options":["hide","convey","ignore","change"],"sentence":"The artist tried to ______ emotion through her paintings. Viewers could feel the sadness and hope expressed in every brushstroke.","translation":"藝術家試圖通過她的繪畫傳達情感。觀眾可以感受到每筆筆觸中表達的悲傷和希望。","word":"convey"}},"convict":{"createdAt":1783005778371,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"convict 意為「宣判…有罪」或「證明…有罪」，指法庭的正式判決某人犯了罪。","options":["acquit","pardon","convict","release"],"sentence":"The jury voted unanimously to ______ the defendant based on overwhelming physical evidence presented during the trial. The judge sentenced him to ten years in prison.","translation":"陪審團根據審判期間提交的壓倒性物證一致投票裁定被告有罪。法官判處他十年監禁。","word":"convict"}},"conviction":{"createdAt":1781693281410,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"conviction（定罪）是法律術語，指法院宣判某人有罪或對其的正式判決。","options":["friendship","conviction","conversation","confusion"],"sentence":"After years of investigating the cold case, the detective finally secured a ______ against the suspect. The jury deliberated for only three hours before returning a guilty verdict.","translation":"經過多年調查這起陳年舊案後，偵探終於對嫌疑人獲得了定罪。陪審團只經過三小時的審議就回報了有罪判決。","word":"conviction"}},"convince":{"createdAt":1781850347304,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"說服或使相信是指通過提供證據或論點使某人相信某事或採取某項行動。","options":["confuse","trick","convince","remind"],"sentence":"The detective presented compelling evidence to ______ the jury that the defendant was guilty. The eyewitness testimony and physical proof left no doubt in their minds.","translation":"偵探提供了令人信服的證據來說服陪審團被告有罪。證人的證詞和物理證據讓他們心中沒有疑問。","word":"convince"}},"convinced":{"createdAt":1785325590629,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"convinced 是形容詞，表示被說服或確信某事是真實的，通常與介詞 of 或 that 搭配使用。","options":["confused","convinced","amused","concerned"],"sentence":"After hearing the evidence presented in court, the jury was ______ of the defendant's guilt. The lawyer's closing argument had systematically addressed every doubt they had raised.","translation":"在聽到法庭上提出的證據後，陪審團被說服了被告有罪。律師的結案陳詞系統地解決了他們提出的每一個疑慮。","word":"convinced"}},"convincing":{"createdAt":1784486409661,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"convincing表示有說服力的、令人信服的，通常用來形容表現、論點或證據能夠說動他人。","options":["convincing","boring","lengthy","tragic"],"sentence":"Although the actor delivered a ______ performance, the audience still found the plot of the movie unconvincing and unrealistic. His acting skills were excellent, but the story itself had too many logical flaws.","translation":"儘管這位演員呈現了有說服力的表演，觀眾仍然發現電影的情節不令人信服且不現實。他的演技十分出色，但故事本身有太多邏輯漏洞。","word":"convincing"}},"cooperate":{"createdAt":1781746685503,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"cooperate指的是合作、協作，表示兩個或多個人或組織為了共同的目的一起工作。","options":["terminate","sober","cooperate","rubbish"],"sentence":"The two companies decided to ______ on the new research project. They combined their resources and expertise to achieve a common goal.","translation":"這兩家公司決定在新研究項目上合作。他們結合資源和專業知識來達成共同目標。","word":"cooperate"}},"cooperation":{"createdAt":1784968599764,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cooperation指的是兩個或多個人或團體為了達成共同目標而一起工作的行為，強調的是團隊合作的精神。","options":["competition","cooperation","conflict","separation"],"sentence":"The two companies decided to work together through ______ to achieve their shared business goals. Without this ______, they would never have been able to complete such a massive project on time.","translation":"這兩家公司決定透過合作來實現他們的共同商業目標。沒有這種合作，他們永遠無法按時完成如此龐大的專案。","word":"cooperation"}},"cooperative":{"createdAt":1783332861020,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「cooperative」形容詞表示「合作的、協力的」，指人們願意共同努力達成共同目標。","options":["competitive","cooperative","hostile","lazy"],"sentence":"The team worked in a ______ manner to complete the project on schedule. Everyone contributed their skills and helped each other without complaints.","translation":"團隊以合作的方式按時完成了該項目。每個人都貢獻了他們的技能，並互相幫助，沒有怨言。","word":"cooperative"}},"coordinate":{"createdAt":1782638002583,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"協調是指組織和整合不同的人員或部門，使他們朝著同一目標有效地合作和配合。","options":["supervise","coordinate","evaluate","promote"],"sentence":"The event manager needed to ______ all the different departments to ensure the conference ran smoothly. She communicated with marketing, logistics, and finance teams to align their efforts toward a common goal.","translation":"活動經理需要協調所有不同的部門，以確保會議順利進行。她與市場行銷、後勤和財務團隊溝通，使他們的努力與共同目標保持一致。","word":"coordinate"}},"cope":{"createdAt":1782094627219,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"cope 是動詞，意為「對付、處理」，表示在困難的情況下採取行動來應對和解決問題。","options":["ignore","abandon","cope","celebrate"],"sentence":"After losing her job, Maria had to ______ with unexpected financial difficulties and uncertainty. She found a part-time position within two weeks and managed her expenses carefully.","translation":"失去工作後，瑪麗亞不得不應對突如其來的財務困難和不確定性。她在兩週內找到了一份兼職工作，並仔細管理開支。","word":"cope"}},"copper":{"createdAt":1784691879000,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"copper 是一種紅棕色的金屬元素，具有良好的導電和導熱性能，在古代被廣泛用於製造各種物品。","options":["copper","gold","iron","silver"],"sentence":"The ancient Egyptians used ______ to create tools, jewelry, and religious artifacts thousands of years ago. This reddish-brown metal was highly valued because it could be easily shaped and conducted heat effectively.","translation":"古埃及人用銅製造工具、珠寶和宗教器物已有數千年的歷史。這種紅棕色的金屬很受重視，因為它易於加工且導熱性強。","word":"copper"}},"copyright":{"createdAt":1784980232923,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"copyright是指對文學、藝術或音樂作品的法律保護，賦予創作者控制其作品使用和發行的權利。","options":["patent","copyright","trademark","license"],"sentence":"The author registered the ______ for her novel to protect it from unauthorized copying. This legal right ensures that only she can decide how her work is published and distributed.","translation":"作者為她的小說註冊了著作權以保護它免遭未經授權的複製。這項法律權利確保只有她可以決定她的作品如何出版和發行。","word":"copyright"}},"coral":{"createdAt":1781837419094,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"Coral是海洋中由微小生物構成的生物礁石，色彩豐富，為海洋生物提供棲息地。","options":["seaweed","sand","coral","rocks"],"sentence":"The scuba diver marveled at the vibrant ______ formations beneath the ocean surface. These colorful structures were home to thousands of fish and marine creatures.","translation":"潛水員對海洋表面下充滿活力的珊瑚構造感到驚嘆。這些色彩繽紛的結構是數千條魚和海洋生物的家園。","word":"coral"}},"cordial":{"createdAt":1787757574263,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cordial 意為「熱情友善的、溫暖親切的」，用來形容溫暖、親切和友好的態度或關係。","options":["hostile","cordial","cold","distant"],"sentence":"Although the two neighbours had disagreed for years, they greeted each other with a ______ smile and warm handshake. Their conversation was friendly and sincere, showing genuine respect.","translation":"儘管兩位鄰居多年來有分歧，他們互相問候時帶著熱情友善的微笑和溫暖的握手。他們的談話友好而真誠，表現出真正的尊重。","word":"cordial"}},"core":{"createdAt":1781696018693,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"core 意為核心、最重要的，指組織或系統最基本、最關鍵的價值和原則。","options":["temporary","surface","core","optional"],"sentence":"The ______ values of our organization include honesty, integrity, and respect for all people. These principles guide every decision we make.","translation":"我們組織的核心價值包括誠實、正直和尊重所有人。這些原則指導我們做出的每一個決定。","word":"core"}},"cornerstone":{"createdAt":1785240153911,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cornerstone是指最重要的基礎或關鍵要素，是支撐整個結構的最核心部分。","options":["foundation","cornerstone","tradition","policy"],"sentence":"The principle of free speech is the ______ of democratic societies. Without this fundamental value, all other rights and freedoms would lack proper support.","translation":"言論自由是民主社會的基石。沒有這個根本價值，所有其他權利和自由都會缺乏適當的支持。","word":"cornerstone"}},"coronation":{"createdAt":1782007262076,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"coronation 是指國王或王后的正式加冕儀式，通常包含莊嚴的傳統禮儀和官方宣布。","options":["celebration","coronation","parade","meeting"],"sentence":"The ______ of the new queen lasted for three hours and included traditional ceremonies passed down through generations. Millions of people watched the live broadcast as she was officially crowned as the nation's monarch.","translation":"新王后的加冕典禮持續了三個小時，包括了世代相傳的傳統儀式。數百萬人觀看了直播，見證她被正式加冕為國家的君主。","word":"coronation"}},"corporate":{"createdAt":1782395163855,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"corporate 是形容詞，表示與公司、企業或團體有關，通常用來描述公司層級的事務和決策。","options":["company","corporate","business","organizational"],"sentence":"The ______ offices were located on the top floor of the skyscraper downtown. All department heads from different branches gathered there for quarterly meetings.","translation":"公司的辦公室位於市中心摩天大樓的最高樓層。來自不同分支的所有部門主管都在那裡召開季度會議。","word":"corporate"}},"corporation":{"createdAt":1782094693727,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"大公司是指規模龐大、擁有眾多員工和資產的商業組織。","options":["person","corporation","individual","family"],"sentence":"The ______ announced a major merger that would combine two of the largest tech companies. The combined entity would now employ over 50,000 people worldwide.","translation":"那家大公司宣布了一項重大合併案，將結合兩家最大的科技公司。合併後的實體現在將在全球僱用超過5萬人。","word":"corporation"}},"corpse":{"createdAt":1781775598766,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"corpse是名詞，指死亡的人體，特別是在法醫或正式的語境中使用，強調已經失去生命的身體。","options":["witness","victim","corpse","suspect"],"sentence":"The detective examined the ______ at the crime scene to determine the time of death. The body had been lying there for several hours before being discovered by the neighbors.","translation":"偵探在犯罪現場檢查屍體以確定死亡時間。屍體在被鄰居發現之前已經躺在那裡好幾個小時了。","word":"corpse"}},"correlate":{"createdAt":1781843207977,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"此字表示找出兩個事物之間的關係或聯繫，通常用於統計或科學分析中。","options":["separate","correlate","ignore","dispute"],"sentence":"Scientists attempt to ______ the rise in global temperatures with increased carbon emissions. Their research clearly demonstrates that these two factors move together in a measurable and predictable way.","translation":"科學家試圖將全球溫度上升與碳排放增加相互聯繫。他們的研究清楚地證明了這兩個因素以可測量和可預測的方式一起變化。","word":"correlate"}},"correlated":{"createdAt":1782006620282,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"correlated表示「相互關聯的」，指兩個變數之間存在統計關係，與第二句中患者吸菸與患病率之間的明顯關聯相符。","options":["independent","correlated","documented","theoretical"],"sentence":"The study found that smoking and lung disease were ______ variables in the patient population. When researchers analyzed the data, they discovered that patients who smoked had significantly higher rates of developing this condition.","translation":"該研究發現吸菸和肺病在患者群體中是相關聯的變數。當研究人員分析數據時，他們發現吸菸的患者患上這種疾病的比率明顯更高。","word":"correlated"}},"correlation":{"createdAt":1781843207979,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"此名詞表示兩個變數或事物之間的相互關係或依存關係。","options":["contradiction","separation","correlation","confusion"],"sentence":"There is a strong ______ between regular exercise and improved mental health. When people exercise more frequently, they consistently report feeling happier and less stressed.","translation":"定期運動與改善心理健康之間存在很強的相互關係。當人們更頻繁地運動時，他們一致報告感到更快樂和壓力減少。","word":"correlation"}},"correspond":{"createdAt":1781693538702,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"correspond 表示相符合、相一致或相當於，也可以指通過寫信進行交流。","options":["contradict","correspond","differ","oppose"],"sentence":"The two letters ______ with each other perfectly in terms of content and date. Both were written on the same day by the same author.","translation":"這兩封信在內容和日期方面完全相符。兩封信都是由同一位作者在同一天寫的。","word":"correspond"}},"correspondence":{"createdAt":1781693304924,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"correspondence 表示兩件事物之間的相符或相似，強調它們在本質上或細節上的一致性。","options":["contradiction","difference","correspondence","confusion"],"sentence":"The detective noticed a striking ______ between the suspect's alibi and the witness statement. Both accounts matched perfectly in every detail.","translation":"偵探發現嫌疑人的不在場證明和證人陳述之間存在令人驚訝的相似之處。兩份陳述在每個細節上都完全相符。","word":"correspondence"}},"correspondent":{"createdAt":1782007196630,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「通訊記者」是指被派駐到特定地點報導新聞的記者，負責現場採集和傳送新聞。","options":["editor","correspondent","photographer","broadcaster"],"sentence":"The news organization sent a ______ to cover the international summit and report directly from the conference. She filed daily updates from the press room, interviewing world leaders and analyzing negotiations.","translation":"新聞機構派遣一名通訊記者去報導國際峰會並直接從會議現場報導。她在新聞室提交每日更新，採訪世界領導人並分析談判情況。","word":"correspondent"}},"corridor":{"createdAt":1781503378964,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"corridor 指的是在建築物內連接不同房間或區域的長走廊或通道。","options":["staircase","room","corridor","window"],"sentence":"The students walked through the long ______ to reach their next classroom. The hallway was lined with lockers and bulletin boards on both sides.","translation":"學生們走過長長的走廊到達他們的下一個教室。走廊兩側排列著儲物櫃和公告板。","word":"corridor"}},"corroborate":{"createdAt":1787757574255,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"corroborate 意為「证實、確認」，用來表示多個證據或來源支持並证實某個主張或理論。","options":["contradict","corroborate","obscure","question"],"sentence":"The witness's testimony will ______ the detective's theory about the crime. Multiple independent sources have confirmed the same facts, leaving no doubt about what happened.","translation":"證人的證詞將証實偵探對犯罪的理論。多個獨立來源已確認了相同的事實，對於發生的事情毫無疑問。","word":"corroborate"}},"corrupt":{"createdAt":1782007196631,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"「貪汙；腐敗」作為動詞表示通過非法手段如接受賄賂而損害廉正，或作為形容詞指已經喪失誠正品質的人或制度。","options":["influenced","motivated","corrupt","inspired"],"sentence":"The scandal revealed that several government officials had been ______ by accepting bribes from wealthy developers. Investigators discovered secret bank accounts and illegal payments that exposed their wrongdoing.","translation":"醜聞揭露了幾名政府官員通過接受富有開發商的賄賂而進行貪汙。調查人員發現了秘密銀行帳戶和非法付款，暴露了他們的不當行為。","word":"corrupt"}},"corruption":{"createdAt":1781619188929,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"corruption 指貪汙和不誠實行為，特別是官員的違法牟利行為。","options":["efficiency","corruption","organization","transparency"],"sentence":"The government launched an investigation into widespread ______ within the customs department. Several officials were arrested for accepting bribes and embezzling public funds.","translation":"政府對海關部門內的廣泛貪汙進行了調查。幾位官員因收受賄賂和挪用公款而被逮捕。","word":"corruption"}},"cortex":{"createdAt":1783489104905,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"大腦皮層是大腦最外層的灰質結構，負責處理感覺資訊、執行運動控制以及進行複雜的認知活動。","options":["cerebellum","cortex","brain stem","hippocampus"],"sentence":"The ______ of the brain is responsible for higher cognitive functions such as thinking, memory, and decision-making. This outer layer contains billions of neurons.","translation":"大腦的皮質負責思考、記憶和決策等更高級的認知功能。這個外層包含數十億個神經元。","word":"cortex"}},"cosmetic":{"createdAt":1782982841048,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cosmetic 意為化妝品，指用於改善或美化外表的化學製品。","options":["fabric","cosmetic","furniture","utensil"],"sentence":"She purchased a new ______ to enhance her appearance before the wedding ceremony. The foundation, blush, and lipstick she bought would help her look her best on the special day.","translation":"她在婚禮前購買了新的化妝品來增強自己的外表。她買的粉底、腮紅和口紅將幫助她在這個特殊日子裡看起來最好。","word":"cosmetic"}},"cosmic":{"createdAt":1786807132285,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cosmic 用來形容與宇宙相關的規模宏大或視野廣闊的事物，特別是涉及星星、行星或整個宇宙的事情。","options":["tiny","cosmic","ancient","terrestrial"],"sentence":"The telescope revealed a ______ perspective that showed how small Earth truly is in the universe. Ancient astronomers gazed at the stars and pondered the vastness of space itself.","translation":"這台望遠鏡揭示了一個宇宙的視角，顯示地球在宇宙中是多麼渺小。古代天文學家凝視星星，思考太空本身的浩瀚無邊。","word":"cosmic"}},"cost":{"createdAt":1783516555626,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"cost 作為動詞時，表示某物的價格或購買某物需要花費多少錢。","options":["cost","spend","charge","demand"],"sentence":"The new laptop will ______ you around three thousand dollars if you buy it today. The store is currently offering a special promotion, so the price is lower than usual.","translation":"如果你今天買這台新筆記型電腦，它將花費你大約三千美元。這家店目前正在進行特別促銷，所以價格比平時低。","word":"cost"}},"cost_effective":{"createdAt":1781667024994,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"cost-effective指在花費最少金錢的情況下達到最佳結果，是提高經濟效益的做法。","options":["expensive","wasteful","inefficient","cost-effective"],"sentence":"The company switched to a ______ manufacturing method that produced the same quality at half the price. Investors were impressed by the ability to maintain profit margins while reducing expenses.","translation":"公司改用了一種物有所值的製造方法，以一半的價格生產出相同品質的產品。投資者對在保持利潤率的同時降低成本的能力印象深刻。","word":"cost-effective"}},"costly":{"createdAt":1781582424691,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"costly表示昂貴的或代價高的，與hundreds of thousands of dollars相符，quick、simple和temporary都無法與金錢花費相關聯。","options":["quick","simple","costly","temporary"],"sentence":"The repairs to the old mansion turned out to be quite ______ for the owners. They had to spend hundreds of thousands of dollars to restore it.","translation":"對這座老宅的修繕對業主來說成本相當高昂。他們必須花費數十萬美元來修復它。","word":"costly"}},"costume":{"createdAt":1781332009070,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"costume 指的是為舞台表演或角色扮演設計的戲服或服裝","options":["weapon","costume","script","microphone"],"sentence":"The actress wore an elaborate ______ for the historical drama production. The wardrobe department spent weeks creating the period-appropriate clothing and accessories.","translation":"女演員為這部歷史劇製作穿著了精美的戲服。服裝部門花了數周時間創作符合時代的衣服和配飾。","word":"costume"}},"cottage":{"createdAt":1781484415209,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"cottage是指鄉村或鄉間的小房子，通常很小、簡樸但溫馨舒適。","options":["mansion","skyscraper","cottage","apartment"],"sentence":"They bought a small ______ in the countryside where they could enjoy peace and quiet. The humble dwelling had only three rooms and was surrounded by beautiful gardens.","translation":"他們在鄉村買了一所小房子，可以享受寧靜和安詳。這所簡樸的住宅只有三個房間，被美麗的花園包圍。","word":"cottage"}},"council":{"createdAt":1782408103442,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"council 指由政府或社區成員組成的正式會議機構或評議會，負責做出決定。","options":["committee","council","jury","club"],"sentence":"The local ______ met to discuss the proposal for building a new community center in the neighborhood. The five council members voted unanimously to approve the project.","translation":"地方評議會召開會議討論在社區建設新社區中心的提案。五名評議會成員一致投票批准該項目。","word":"council"}},"counsel":{"createdAt":1781256444516,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"counsel作動詞表示提供建議或勸告，通常由有經驗的人對他人提出專業意見。","options":["inspect","counsel","criticize","assign"],"sentence":"The career advisor will ______ students on which university programs best match their interests. She has helped hundreds of graduates find fulfilling career paths over her twenty years of experience.","translation":"職業顧問將就哪些大學課程最符合學生的興趣向他們提出建議。在她二十年的職業生涯中，她已幫助數百名畢業生找到了令人滿意的職業道路。","word":"counsel"}},"counselling":{"createdAt":1783159261865,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"counselling（建議；勸告）是指專業人士提供的指導和忠告，幫助人們解決問題。","options":["entertainment","counselling","exercise","medication"],"sentence":"After the accident, Sarah sought professional ______ to help her cope with the trauma. The therapist's guidance and advice were essential in her recovery process.","translation":"在事故發生後，莎拉尋求專業的心理諮詢來幫助她應對創傷。治療師的指導和建議對她的恢復過程至關重要。","word":"counselling"}},"counselor":{"createdAt":1781837419089,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Counselor是提供專業建議和指導的人，特別是在教育和個人發展領域。","options":["teacher","counselor","administrator","principal"],"sentence":"The school ______ helped students make better decisions about their academic future. Her expertise in guidance and career planning made her invaluable to the student body.","translation":"學校輔導員幫助學生對他們的學術未來做出更好的決定。她在指導和職業規劃方面的專業知識使她對學生群體無價。","word":"counselor"}},"count":{"createdAt":1781677018333,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"count在此作動詞，表示「重要」或「有價值」，常用於「count toward」短語中，意思是對某事有貢獻或影響。","options":["matter","count","install","stem"],"sentence":"The CEO said that employee satisfaction will ______ toward the company's success. She emphasized that this metric is crucial for evaluating overall performance.","translation":"執行長說員工滿意度將計算/重要於公司的成功。她強調這個指標對評估整體績效至關重要。","word":"count"}},"countable":{"createdAt":1781839703146,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"countable指可以被數的、可用數字修飾的，與can be pluralized and take numbers（可以複數化和用數字修飾）直接相符。","options":["invisible","countable","abstract","invisible"],"sentence":"In grammar, nouns are divided into ______ and uncountable categories. Words like 'apple' and 'chair' can be pluralized and take numbers before them.","translation":"在語法中，名詞分為可數名詞和不可數名詞兩類。像'apple'和'chair'這樣的詞可以複數化，並且可以在其前面加上數字。","word":"countable"}},"counter":{"createdAt":1781485266371,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"在餐飲環境中，counter指的是料理檯或服務檯，用來放置食物和與顧客互動。","options":["argument","objection","counter","dispute"],"sentence":"The customer placed her order at the ______ while the chef prepared the meal behind it. She watched through the glass display case as they assembled her sandwich on the stainless steel surface.","translation":"顧客在櫃台下單，廚師在後面準備餐點。她透過玻璃展示櫃看著他們在不鏽鋼操作檯上組合她的三明治。","word":"counter"}},"counterpart":{"createdAt":1787135117491,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"counterpart指在另一個地方或組織中擁有相同或相似職位的人，這裡指另一個國家的總統。","options":["counterpart","ambassador","journalist","translator"],"sentence":"The American President met with his ______ from France to discuss international trade agreements. Both leaders represented their nations at the diplomatic summit.","translation":"美國總統與他在法國的對應人物會面，討論國際貿易協議。兩位領導人在外交峰會上代表各自的國家。","word":"counterpart"}},"countless":{"createdAt":1781738105696,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"countless 意為無法計數的、數量極其龐大的，表示某物的數量非常多。","options":["several","countless","few","minimal"],"sentence":"The astronomer discovered ______ stars in the night sky using her telescope. So many celestial bodies were visible that it became impossible to count them all individually.","translation":"這位天文學家用她的望遠鏡在夜空中發現了無數的星星。如此多的天體是可見的，以至於不可能單獨數清楚它們。","word":"countless"}},"coupon":{"createdAt":1784454684889,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"優待券是一張紙質或數位憑證，消費者可以在購物時出示以獲得折扣或特定優惠。","options":["receipt","coupon","invoice","refund"],"sentence":"I found a ______ in the newspaper that gives me 20% off groceries this week. I can cut it out and bring it to the store to get the discount.","translation":"我在報紙上找到一張優待券，可以讓我這週買雜貨打八折。我可以剪下來帶到商店領取折扣。","word":"coupon"}},"courage":{"createdAt":1781582251994,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"courage 是名詞，表示在面對危險或困難時的勇氣和無所畏懼的精神。","options":["fear","courage","confusion","hesitation"],"sentence":"The firefighter showed great ______ when running into the burning building to save the family. His bravery was recognized by the entire community the next day.","translation":"那位消防員衝進燃燒的建築物救家人時展現了極大的勇氣。他的英勇行為在隔天被整個社區認可。","word":"courage"}},"courageous":{"createdAt":1782009797688,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"courageous 形容詞，表示具有勇氣、敢於面對困難或危險的品質；在這句話中強調消防員不畏危險的英勇精神。","options":["timid","courageous","lazy","confused"],"sentence":"The firefighter made a ______ decision to run into the burning building to save the trapped family. His bravery in the face of extreme danger earned him a medal of honor from the city.","translation":"消防員做出了一個勇敢的決定，衝進燃燒的建築物中救出被困的家人。他在面對極端危險時的英勇行為為他贏得了城市的榮譽勳章。","word":"courageous"}},"course":{"createdAt":1781424356416,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"course在此指的是在教育機構中系統地教授的一系列課程或科目。","options":["meal","direction","course","river"],"sentence":"She enrolled in a biology ______ at the university to fulfill her science requirement. The semester-long program covered topics such as cellular structure, genetics, and evolution.","translation":"她在大學註冊了一門生物課程以滿足她的理科要求。這個為期一學期的課程涵蓋了細胞結構、遺傳學和進化等主題。","word":"course"}},"court":{"createdAt":1781837419095,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Court在體育中指的是專門用於特定運動（如籃球、網球）的場地。","options":["field","court","stadium","gym"],"sentence":"The basketball players practiced on the ______ every afternoon before the big game. The wooden floor and hoops were professionally maintained for competition.","translation":"籃球運動員在大賽前每天下午在籃球場練習。木質地板和籃圈經過專業維護以備比賽。","word":"court"}},"courteous":{"createdAt":1782982841049,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"courteous 意為有禮貌的、彬彬有禮的，形容人具有禮貌和尊重他人的態度。","options":["rude","courteous","distant","indifferent"],"sentence":"The hotel receptionist was ______ to every guest who entered the lobby. She always greeted visitors with a warm smile, addressed them respectfully, and helped them with genuine kindness.","translation":"飯店接待員對進入大堂的每位客人都彬彬有禮。她總是用溫暖的微笑迎接訪客，尊重地稱呼他們，並用真誠的善意幫助他們。","word":"courteous"}},"courtesy":{"createdAt":1784169916844,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"禮節是指以尊重和殷勤的方式對待他人的行為舉止。","options":["efficiency","courtesy","punctuality","patience"],"sentence":"The flight attendant showed ______ by helping the elderly passenger with her luggage. Her polite and considerate behavior impressed everyone on the plane.","translation":"空服員透過幫助年長乘客拿行李展現了禮節。她有禮貌且體貼的行為給飛機上的每個人留下深刻印象。","word":"courtesy"}},"cover":{"createdAt":1783505313974,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cover作動詞表示「報導」，指記者或媒體對新聞事件進行新聞報導。","options":["ignore","cover","avoid","skip"],"sentence":"The journalist will ______ the major political event happening downtown tomorrow. News outlets across the city are sending reporters to interview candidates and document the proceedings.","translation":"記者將報導明天在市中心發生的重大政治事件。全市的新聞機構都派記者去採訪候選人並記錄會議。","word":"cover"}},"coverage":{"createdAt":1781693271586,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"coverage在新聞語境中指的是對事件的報導範圍和深度，包括採訪、分析和現場報告。","options":["ignorance","coverage","silence","absence"],"sentence":"The news station provided extensive ______ of the presidential election with multiple reporters at different locations. They interviewed candidates, showed live voting footage, and analyzed poll results throughout the day.","translation":"新聞電台對總統選舉進行了廣泛的報導，多名記者駐守在不同地點。他們採訪了候選人，播放了投票的現場畫面，並全天分析了民調結果。","word":"coverage"}},"coward":{"createdAt":1781693304926,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"coward 指缺乏勇氣、容易害怕且不敢面對困難或危險的人。","options":["hero","leader","coward","defender"],"sentence":"The soldier was branded a ______ after he abandoned his comrades during the battle. His refusal to fight demonstrated a complete lack of courage.","translation":"這位士兵在戰鬥中拋棄同志後被烙上了懦夫的標籤。他拒絕作戰表明他完全缺乏勇氣。","word":"coward"}},"cowardice":{"createdAt":1785220540773,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cowardice 是名詞，指缺乏勇氣或害怕面對危險的品質，通常用來描述令人不齒的行為。","options":["bravery","cowardice","strength","intelligence"],"sentence":"The soldier's ______ prevented him from standing up to the enemy during the battle. His commanding officer was deeply disappointed by his shameful retreat when he had the chance to be brave.","translation":"那個士兵的膽小阻止了他在戰鬥中對抗敵人。他的指揮官對他有機會表現勇敢卻羞恥地撤退感到極度失望。","word":"cowardice"}},"cowardly":{"createdAt":1782648229314,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"cowardly 是形容詞，表示缺乏勇氣、膽怯或害怕面對危險或困難的特性。","options":["cowardly","heroic","determined","aggressive"],"sentence":"His ______ behavior during the confrontation shocked everyone who knew him as a brave person. Instead of standing up for what was right, he ran away and refused to face the challenge.","translation":"他在對峙中表現出怯懦的行為，讓所有認識他是勇敢人士的人感到震驚。他沒有為正義挺身而出，反而逃跑並拒絕面對挑戰。","word":"cowardly"}},"cozy":{"createdAt":1783598428082,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cozy 形容一個地方或環境溫馨、舒適、令人感到安逸和放鬆","options":["crowded","cozy","formal","bare"],"sentence":"After a long day at work, Sarah settled into her ______ armchair with a warm blanket and hot tea. The soft lighting and comfortable surroundings made her feel completely relaxed.","translation":"經過一整天的工作後，莎拉坐進她溫馨的扶手椅，蓋著溫暖的毯子喝熱茶。柔和的燈光和舒適的環境讓她感到完全放鬆。","word":"cozy"}},"crack":{"createdAt":1781625891346,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"crack可表示身心因壓力過大而疲憊或崩潰","options":["laugh","crack","relax","improve"],"sentence":"After working on the project for three weeks without rest, she began to ______. Her friends noticed she was irritable and emotionally exhausted.","translation":"連續三週不休息地進行這個項目後，她開始身心疲憊。她的朋友注意到她易怒且情緒上很疲憊。","word":"crack"}},"crackdown":{"createdAt":1783598428073,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"crackdown 指的是政府或當局對非法活動的嚴厲懲罰和制止行動","options":["celebration","crackdown","investigation","promotion"],"sentence":"The government announced a strict ______ on illegal street racing after multiple accidents. Police will increase patrols and impose heavy fines on violators starting next week.","translation":"政府在多起事故後宣佈對非法街頭賽車進行嚴厲的制裁。警察將從下週開始增加巡邏次數並對違規者處以罰款。","word":"crackdown"}},"cracked":{"createdAt":1781619188927,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cracked 指表面出現裂紋或破裂，表示結構受損。","options":["solid","cracked","reinforced","stable"],"sentence":"After the earthquake, the ______ foundation posed a serious safety hazard to the building. Engineers recommended immediate reinforcement before further damage occurred.","translation":"地震後，破裂的地基對建築物造成了嚴重的安全隱患。工程師建議在進一步損壞前立即加固。","word":"cracked"}},"cracker":{"createdAt":1781532967167,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cracker 指爆竹、鞭炮，與「巨大噪音、閃光和響聲」的描述相符。","options":["candy","cracker","toy","balloon"],"sentence":"The children lit a ______ outside on New Year's Eve and enjoyed the loud noise and sparkles. It made a tremendous bang that startled the neighbors.","translation":"在除夕夜，孩子們在外面點燃了______(爆竹)，享受著巨大的噪音和閃光。它發出了一聲震天動地的巨響，嚇到了鄰居。","word":"cracker"}},"cradle":{"createdAt":1781831347630,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cradle 作名詞表示搖籃或發源地，引申指某事物的起源或誕生地。","options":["graveyard","cradle","monument","barrier"],"sentence":"Ancient Mesopotamia is often called the ______ of Western civilization where the earliest cities and writing systems emerged. Historians trace the origins of modern society back to this fertile region between the Tigris and Euphrates rivers.","translation":"古美索不達米亞經常被稱為西方文明的搖籃，最早的城市和文字系統在這裡出現。歷史學家將現代社會的起源追溯到這個位於底格里斯河和幼發拉底河之間的肥沃地帶。","word":"cradle"}},"cram":{"createdAt":1783598428077,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cram 表示用力將東西塞進或擠進一個空間內，通常指空間有限的情況","options":["organize","cram","display","arrange"],"sentence":"The students tried to ______ all their textbooks and notes into their small backpacks before the field trip. They squeezed everything in so tightly that the zippers barely closed.","translation":"學生們在實地考察前試圖把所有的課本和筆記擠進他們的小背包。他們把所有東西壓得很緊，拉鍊幾乎關不上。","word":"cram"}},"crash":{"createdAt":1787490844909,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"crash 在此表示電腦系統突然停止運作或當機，通常伴隨系統故障。","options":["freeze","crash","pause","lag"],"sentence":"The old computer would ______ every time I tried to open multiple programs. When I finally took it to the repair shop, the technician said the hard drive had completely failed.","translation":"每當我試圖開啟多個程式時，這台舊電腦就會當機。當我最後把它送到維修店時，技術人員說硬碟已經完全故障了。","word":"crash"}},"crater":{"createdAt":1783656026744,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"crater 指的是由撞擊或火山活動形成的圓形或近圓形的坑洞，通常邊緣很深。","options":["valley","crater","canyon","pit"],"sentence":"The meteor impact created a massive ______ in the desert that was visible from space. Scientists measured the depression and found it to be over 200 meters deep.","translation":"隕石撞擊在沙漠中造成了一個巨大的火山口狀坑洞，從太空都能看見。科學家測量了這個凹陷，發現它深度超過200米。","word":"crater"}},"crawler":{"createdAt":1784691888482,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"crawler 指的是靠爬行移動的動物或嬰兒，通常用來描述還不會走路的幼兒或昆蟲等爬行動物。","options":["runner","crawler","walker","jumper"],"sentence":"The baby was still a ______ and could only move around on her hands and knees. She had not yet learned to stand up and walk on two legs.","translation":"嬰兒還是一個爬行動物，只能用雙手和膝蓋在地上移動。她還沒有學會用兩條腿站起來走路。","word":"crawler"}},"crayon":{"createdAt":1784899764063,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"crayon是一種蠟製的繪畫工具，顏色鮮豔，特別適合兒童使用。","options":["pencil","crayon","marker","pen"],"sentence":"The toddler grabbed a red ______ and started drawing on the paper. This wax stick is perfect for young children learning to color.","translation":"幼兒抓起一支紅色蠟筆，開始在紙上畫畫。這種蠟筆非常適合學習著色的幼兒。","word":"crayon"}},"craze":{"createdAt":1784125558069,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"craze指的是突然流行但短暫存在的時尚或熱潮，強調其轉瞬即逝的特性，與長期的愛好或業務不同。","options":["hobby","craze","collection","business"],"sentence":"The latest ______ among teenagers is collecting vintage sneakers and trading them online. This temporary fashion trend has already started to fade as young people move on to other interests.","translation":"青少年中最新的時尚風行是收集和在網上交易復古運動鞋。這個短暫的流行趨勢已經開始消退，因為年輕人轉向了其他興趣。","word":"craze"}},"create":{"createdAt":1785731966823,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"create 意為「創造」或「製造」，指從無到有地產生或發明某樣新的東西。","options":["destroy","copy","create","display"],"sentence":"The artist decided to ______ a new painting using bold colors and abstract shapes. She spent three months developing this unique artwork from scratch.","translation":"藝術家決定用大膽的色彩和抽象形狀創作一幅新畫作。她花了三個月從零開始開發這件獨特的藝術作品。","word":"create"}},"creation":{"createdAt":1781268630487,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"creation指的是創造或創作，是指某人製作或創作的東西。","options":["destruction","creation","collection","exhibition"],"sentence":"The artist was very proud of her latest ______ which took her six months to complete. The sculpture was a masterpiece of modern art.","translation":"藝術家為她耗時六個月完成的最新作品感到非常自豪。這件雕塑是現代藝術的傑作。","word":"creation"}},"creative":{"createdAt":1781268630476,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"creative指的是具有創造力或創意的，能夠想出新的、原創的想法或解決方案。","options":["logical","practical","creative","analytical"],"sentence":"Sarah has a very ______ mind that allows her to solve problems in unique ways. She often finds novel solutions that others would never think of.","translation":"莎拉有一個非常有創造力的頭腦，使她能夠以獨特的方式解決問題。她經常找到其他人永遠不會想到的新穎解決方案。","word":"creative"}},"creativity":{"createdAt":1782786424041,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"creativity名詞表示產生新想法、創新思維和原創設計的能力。","options":["obedience","creativity","punctuality","efficiency"],"sentence":"The company values ______ in its design team and encourages employees to think outside the box. Workers are given freedom to experiment with new ideas and innovative approaches.","translation":"這家公司重視其設計團隊的創造力，並鼓勵員工跳出框框思考。員工被賦予自由來嘗試新想法和創新方法。","word":"creativity"}},"creator":{"createdAt":1783836292874,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"creator 是指發明或創立某樣東西的人，通常指公司或創意作品的創辦人或原始設計者。","options":["designer","creator","investor","employee"],"sentence":"Steve Jobs was the ______ of Apple Computer, founding the company in his parents' garage. He envisioned personal computers for everyday people and built a company that revolutionized technology.","translation":"史蒂夫·喬布斯是蘋果電腦的創造者，在他父母的車庫裡創辦了這家公司。他設想為普通人提供個人電腦，並建立了一家革新科技的公司。","word":"creator"}},"creature":{"createdAt":1783159261867,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"creature（生物）指任何有生命的動物或生物，包括已知和未知的物種。","options":["mineral","tool","creature","idea"],"sentence":"The scientist discovered a rare ______ living deep in the ocean that had never been documented before. This unknown living being had unique features that fascinated researchers worldwide.","translation":"科學家發現了一種罕見的生物深藏在海洋中，這以前從未被記錄過。這個未知的生命體具有令研究人員著迷的獨特特徵。","word":"creature"}},"credibility":{"createdAt":1784246008296,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"credibility指的是「可信性」或「可靠性」，特別強調他人對某人誠實性和真實性的信任程度。","options":["honesty","credibility","reputation","character"],"sentence":"The politician's ______ has been damaged after multiple false statements were exposed by fact-checkers. Once people lose trust in a leader, it becomes extremely difficult to restore public confidence.","translation":"這位政治家在事實查證機構揭露多項虛假聲明後，可信性受損。一旦人們對領導人失去信任，就極難恢復公眾信心。","word":"credibility"}},"credible":{"createdAt":1783955448022,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"credible 表示值得相信和信任的，通常用來形容證人、報告或消息來源等是否可靠。","options":["emotional","credible","lengthy","famous"],"sentence":"The witness's testimony was ______ because she had documented evidence and years of professional experience. The judge accepted her account without hesitation.","translation":"那位證人的證詞是可信的，因為她有文件證據和多年的專業經驗。法官毫不猶豫地接受了她的說法。","word":"credible"}},"credit":{"createdAt":1781837419089,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Credit作為名詞表示延期支付的購買方式，允許買家稍後付款。","options":["cash","credit","debit","check"],"sentence":"The store allowed customers to purchase items on ______ if they had an established account. Consumers could pay for their purchases at a later date.","translation":"如果客戶有既定帳戶，商店允許他們以賒帳方式購買商品。消費者可以在日後支付他們的購買費用。","word":"credit"}},"creditable":{"createdAt":1782555727235,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"creditable 形容值得讚揚和認可的行為或成就，表示可信任和可敬佩的品質。","options":["terrible","average","creditable","ordinary"],"sentence":"The student's performance on the difficult exam was quite ______, earning her praise from her teachers. Her high score reflected months of dedicated study and hard work.","translation":"這位學生在困難的考試中的表現相當可稱譽，贏得了老師的表揚。她的高分反映了數月的專心研究和辛苦工作。","word":"creditable"}},"creep":{"createdAt":1781427134902,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"creep指為了避免被發現而緩慢、悄悄地移動。","options":["dash","creep","sprint","stroll"],"sentence":"The burglar began to ______ through the dark hallway of the museum at midnight. He moved silently and carefully to avoid triggering any security alarms.","translation":"竊賊開始在午夜時悄悄潛行穿過博物館的黑暗走廊。他靜靜地小心移動以避免觸發任何安全警報。","word":"creep"}},"crept":{"createdAt":1786065087768,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"crept 是 creep 的過去式，表示以緩慢、謹慎、無聲的方式悄悄移動。","options":["ran","crept","jumped","danced"],"sentence":"The burglar ______ silently through the darkened hallway toward the safe. He moved so quietly that no one heard even a single footstep or sound.","translation":"竊賊悄悄地沿著黑暗的走廊向保險箱移動。他移動得非常無聲，沒有人聽到任何腳步聲或聲音。","word":"crept"}},"crescendo":{"createdAt":1784899523214,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"crescendo是音樂術語，指音量或強度逐漸增強的過程，在樂曲中營造出力度上升的效果。","options":["diminuendo","crescendo","staccato","tempo"],"sentence":"The orchestra built toward a dramatic ______ in the final movement of the symphony. The music grew louder and more intense until it reached its peak at the very end.","translation":"管弦樂隊在交響曲的最後樂章中漸漸達到了戲劇性的漸強。音樂逐漸變得越來越響亮和激烈，直到在最後達到高峰。","word":"crescendo"}},"crevice":{"createdAt":1784440086182,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"crevice是指岩石或牆壁上的狹窄裂縫或空隙，通常很深但很窄。","options":["plateau","crevice","corridor","chamber"],"sentence":"The tiny lizard squeezed its body into a ______ in the rock wall to hide from predators. The opening was so narrow that only the smallest creatures could fit through it.","translation":"那隻小蜥蜴把身體擠進岩石牆上的裂縫裡躲避掠食者。這個開口非常狹窄，只有最小的生物才能通過。","word":"crevice"}},"crew":{"createdAt":1781667024996,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"crew指執行特定任務的全體工作人員，特別是在船、飛機或製片等領域。","options":["cast","audience","crew","management"],"sentence":"The film production ______ included directors, cameramen, and sound technicians working together on set. Each member played a crucial role in creating the movie.","translation":"電影製作全體人員包括導演、攝影師和音效技師在片場一起工作。每個成員在電影製作中都發揮了關鍵作用。","word":"crew"}},"crime":{"createdAt":1783403425349,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"crime 指違反法律的犯罪行為或罪行，是對社會造成傷害的非法活動。","options":["crime","accident","misunderstanding","celebration"],"sentence":"The detective was determined to solve the serious ______ that had shocked the entire community. Evidence collected at the scene would be crucial in identifying and prosecuting the perpetrator.","translation":"偵探決心要破解那起震驚整個社區的嚴重犯罪。在現場收集的證據對於識別和起訴肇事者至關重要。","word":"crime"}},"criminal":{"createdAt":1784543009907,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"criminal是名詞，指的是犯罪的人；在這句話中，只有criminal能夠與「被判監禁」的情境相符。","options":["witness","criminal","judge","lawyer"],"sentence":"The police arrested the ______ who had stolen jewelry from three stores. He was sentenced to five years in prison after being found guilty in court.","translation":"警察逮捕了從三家商店竊取珠寶的罪犯。他在法庭被判有罪後被判處五年監禁。","word":"criminal"}},"cripple":{"createdAt":1782294199524,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cripple作動詞表示使某人殘廢或嚴重削弱其能力。","options":["strengthen","cripple","improve","enhance"],"sentence":"The severe injury threatened to ______ the athlete's ability to compete professionally. Doctors warned that permanent damage to his leg muscles could end his career.","translation":"嚴重傷害威脅要使這位運動員無法職業競賽。醫生警告說他腿部肌肉的永久性損傷可能會結束他的職業生涯。","word":"cripple"}},"crippled":{"createdAt":1781417610421,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"crippled是指身體殘廢或受傷，導致行動困難或喪失某些功能。","options":["wealthy","intelligent","crippled","tall"],"sentence":"The ______ knight struggled to walk up the stone staircase despite his determination. His leg injury from the battle prevented him from moving quickly or without pain.","translation":"這位殘廢的騎士儘管決心十足，仍然難以上石階。他在戰鬥中的腿部傷害阻止了他快速移動或無痛移動。","word":"crippled"}},"crippling":{"createdAt":1784899764062,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"crippling表示跛行或困難地行走，通常是由於腿部受傷或殘疾。","options":["running","crippling","dancing","sprinting"],"sentence":"The old man was ______ down the street after his injury. His damaged leg made every step painful and slow.","translation":"這位老人在受傷後跛腳走在街道上。他受傷的腿使每一步都很痛苦和緩慢。","word":"crippling"}},"crisis":{"createdAt":1781428458256,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"crisis指突然發生的困難或危險局面，需要迅速採取行動解決。","options":["confidence","normal","crisis","comfort"],"sentence":"The company faced a serious ______ when their main product was discovered to be defective. Management had to act immediately to recall all units and restore customer trust.","translation":"當該公司的主要產品被發現有缺陷時，公司面臨了嚴重的危機。管理層必須立即採取行動召回所有產品並恢復客戶信任。","word":"crisis"}},"crisp":{"createdAt":1782125686370,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"crisp（脆的）用來形容食物或物體容易碎裂、咬下時發出聲音且質地堅硬的特性。","options":["soft","crisp","sweet","juicy"],"sentence":"She bit into the ______ apple and heard a satisfying cracking sound. The fresh produce had been stored in the refrigerator to maintain its firm texture and brittleness.","translation":"她咬著那個脆的蘋果，聽到令人滿意的裂開聲。新鮮農產品被存放在冰箱裡以保持其堅硬的質地和易碎的特性。","word":"crisp"}},"crispy":{"createdAt":1786266828088,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"crispy 是形容詞，用來描述食物表面堅硬、易碎、有咔嚓聲的質地，通常透過烹飪使食物變得這樣。","options":["tender","crispy","moist","smooth"],"sentence":"I love eating ______ bacon for breakfast because it makes a satisfying crunching sound. The texture should be hard and brittle, breaking easily between your teeth rather than being soft or chewy.","translation":"我喜歡早餐吃酥脆的培根，因為它發出令人滿意的咔嚓聲。質地應該是硬且易碎的，在牙齒間容易折斷，而不是柔軟或有嚼勁的。","word":"crispy"}},"criteria":{"createdAt":1781738105695,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"criteria 是用來評判或衡量事物的標準或準則，通常以複數形式出現。","options":["opinions","criteria","rumors","guesses"],"sentence":"The hiring committee established clear ______ for evaluating all job applicants fairly and objectively. They would assess candidates based on education, experience, and communication skills.","translation":"招聘委員會制定了明確的標準，以便公平和客觀地評估所有求職者。他們將根據教育背景、工作經驗和溝通技能來評估候選人。","word":"criteria"}},"criterion":{"createdAt":1782294199520,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"criterion是單數形式，用來表示單一的評判標準或條件。","options":["criteria","criterion","criteria","critiques"],"sentence":"The teacher established a clear ______ for evaluating student essays. Students needed to meet at least three specific standards to achieve a passing grade.","translation":"老師為評估學生論文確立了明確的準則。學生需要達到至少三項具體標準才能及格。","word":"criterion"}},"critic":{"createdAt":1782746247865,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"critic 是指專業評論家，特別是對藝術、文學或表演進行批評和評價的人。","options":["fan","critic","actor","producer"],"sentence":"The famous film ______ gave the new movie a scathing review in the newspaper. His detailed analysis pointed out every flaw and weakness in the director's storytelling and cinematography.","translation":"這位著名的電影評論家在報紙上對這部新電影進行了尖銳的評論。他的詳細分析指出了導演敘事和攝影中的每一個缺陷和弱點。","word":"critic"}},"critical":{"createdAt":1782746247865,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"critical 作為形容詞可以表示情況危急或處於緊要關頭，需要立即關注和行動。","options":["minor","stable","critical","improving"],"sentence":"The patient's condition became ______ after the surgery, and doctors had to monitor him constantly in the intensive care unit. Every small change in his vital signs could affect his survival.","translation":"手術後患者的狀況變得危急，醫生不得不在重症監護室持續監測他。他的生命體徵的每一個微小變化都可能影響他的存活。","word":"critical"}},"criticism":{"createdAt":1781738105681,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"criticism 指的是對某人或某事物的負面評論或評判，通常涉及指出缺點或問題。","options":["praise","criticism","promotion","admiration"],"sentence":"The artist received harsh ______ about her new painting from several art reviewers. Despite their negative comments, she felt the feedback was constructive and helped her improve her technique.","translation":"這位藝術家因為她的新畫作從幾位藝術評論家那裡收到了嚴厲的批評。儘管他們的評論是負面的，但她認為這些反饋是建設性的，幫助她改進了技巧。","word":"criticism"}},"criticize":{"createdAt":1781283344040,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"criticize意為指出缺點或不足之處；當與「指出具體錯誤」和「提供改進建議」搭配時，表示進行建設性的評論。","options":["praise","criticize","ignore","summarize"],"sentence":"The teacher decided to ______ the student's essay for its numerous grammatical errors. She pointed out specific mistakes and offered constructive suggestions for improvement.","translation":"老師決定批評學生的論文因為它有許多文法錯誤。她指出具體的錯誤並提供改進建議。","word":"criticize"}},"crooked":{"createdAt":1789363793856,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"crooked 可形容物體彎曲，但在這裡指人不誠實、腐敗或從事非法活動。","options":["popular","crooked","distinguished","retired"],"sentence":"The ______ politician was finally arrested for embezzling public funds. Investigators uncovered evidence that he had been stealing money from taxpayers for years.","translation":"這位不誠實的政治人物因挪用公款而最終被捕。調查人員發現證據表明他多年來一直從納稅人那裡偷錢。","word":"crooked"}},"crop":{"createdAt":1781831848725,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"crop 作為名詞表示「作物」或「收成」，指的是農業種植並收穫的產物。","options":["harvest","crop","season","weather"],"sentence":"The farmers harvested their ______ of wheat this autumn. They sold the entire yield at the market for a good price.","translation":"農民在今年秋天收穫了他們的作物。他們以優好的價格在市場上銷售了整個產量。","word":"crop"}},"crowd":{"createdAt":1781274836864,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"crowd作為名詞表示聚集在一起的大量人群，通常表現出擁擠和混亂的狀態。","options":["crowd","line","team","parade"],"sentence":"A large ______ gathered outside the concert venue before the gates opened. Thousands of excited fans pushed and shoved to get the best positions for the show.","translation":"在演唱會場地大門打開前，一大群人聚集在外面。數千名興奮的粉絲互相推擠以獲得最佳位置看演出。","word":"crowd"}},"crowded":{"createdAt":1783661880049,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"crowded 是形容詞，表示地方裡有很多人，擁擠不堪。","options":["empty","spacious","crowded","quiet"],"sentence":"The subway during rush hour was extremely ______ with commuters. It was nearly impossible to move without bumping into someone.","translation":"高峰時間的地鐵擠滿了通勤者。幾乎不可能不碰到其他人就移動。","word":"crowded"}},"crucial":{"createdAt":1782646076507,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"crucial是形容詞，表示某事物極為重要、決定性的，對結果產生重大影響。","options":["minor","trivial","crucial","optional"],"sentence":"Getting enough sleep before the exam is ______ for your success. Without proper rest, your brain cannot function at its best during the test.","translation":"考試前充足的睡眠對你的成功至關重要。沒有充分的休息，你的大腦在考試時無法發揮最佳功能。","word":"crucial"}},"crude":{"createdAt":1783265475220,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"crude 表示未經加工、簡陋或粗製的狀態，常用來描述初期階段或未經修飾的作品，與精細或精緻的最終成果形成對比。","options":["refined","crude","elegant","sophisticated"],"sentence":"The artist's ______ sketch was just a quick outline on paper. However, after weeks of detailed work, he transformed it into a polished masterpiece with fine lines and careful shading.","translation":"這位藝術家的粗糙草圖只是紙上的快速輪廓。然而，經過數週的詳細工作，他將其轉變為一件精美的傑作，擁有精細的線條和仔細的陰影。","word":"crude"}},"cruel":{"createdAt":1781961506840,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cruel表示殘酷、無情，用於描述令人痛苦或傷害他人的行為和態度。","options":["kind","cruel","forgiving","gentle"],"sentence":"The villain in the movie was ______ to the innocent villagers, showing no mercy whatsoever. He tortured them and enjoyed their suffering, demonstrating the darkest aspects of human nature.","translation":"電影中的反派對無辜村民很______，毫無憐憫之心。他折磨他們並享受他們的痛苦，展現了人性最黑暗的一面。","word":"cruel"}},"cruelty":{"createdAt":1785761117550,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cruelty 意指故意傷害他人的行為或態度，表示缺乏同情心和殘忍的對待。","options":["kindness","cruelty","wisdom","fairness"],"sentence":"The dictator was known for his ______ toward anyone who opposed him. His regime imprisoned innocent people without trial and tortured prisoners, showing no mercy whatsoever.","translation":"這位獨裁者以對任何反對他的人施加______而聞名。他的政權監禁無辜者，不經審判就折磨囚犯，毫無憐憫之心。","word":"cruelty"}},"cruise":{"createdAt":1781268630483,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cruise指的是乘船遊覽，通常是一次休閒的海上旅行，船會停靠多個港口。","options":["flight","cruise","safari","expedition"],"sentence":"They booked a Caribbean ______ for their honeymoon. The ship would stop at five different tropical islands over two weeks.","translation":"他們為蜜月預訂了一次加勒比海遊輪之旅。這艘船將在兩周內停靠五個不同的熱帶島嶼。","word":"cruise"}},"crumble":{"createdAt":1783598428080,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"crumble 表示逐漸碎裂、崩潰或衰退，通常用於物理的破碎或比喻的衰落","options":["strengthen","expand","crumble","restore"],"sentence":"Without proper maintenance, the ancient fortress began to ______ into dust after centuries of neglect. Stone by stone, the walls weakened until the entire structure was nearly unrecognizable.","translation":"由於缺乏適當的維護，這座古老的堡壘在數個世紀的忽視後開始碎裂成灰塵。一塊塊石頭脫落，牆壁逐漸削弱，直到整個結構幾乎無法辨認。","word":"crumble"}},"crunchy":{"createdAt":1781484415225,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"crunchy意指食物發出嘎吱嘎吱聲且質地脆硬，通常表示食物新鮮美味。","options":["soft","smooth","crunchy","sticky"],"sentence":"The ______ texture of the fresh apple made a satisfying sound when she bit into it. Each chew produced a pleasant crackling noise that indicated its freshness and crispness.","translation":"新鮮蘋果的脆爽質地在她咬下去時發出令人滿足的聲音。每次咀嚼都產生令人愉快的嘎吱聲，表明它的新鮮和脆爽。","word":"crunchy"}},"crush":{"createdAt":1781693293269,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"crush 作名詞表示「迷戀的人」或「暗戀」，指對某人的浪漫感情。","options":["plant","philosopher","crush","executive"],"sentence":"Sarah has had a ______ on her classmate for months. She blushes whenever she sees him in the hallway.","translation":"莎拉暗戀她的同學已經好幾個月了。每當她在走廊裡看到他時，她就會臉紅。","word":"crush"}},"crushing":{"createdAt":1781693269016,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"crushing 作為形容詞表示非常嚴重的、毀滅性的、難以承受的，通常用於描述負面的影響或結果。","options":["minor","negligible","crushing","slight"],"sentence":"The company faced ______ losses after the market crash last month. The financial impact was so severe that hundreds of employees had to be laid off within weeks.","translation":"上個月市場崩潰後，該公司遭受了極其嚴重的損失。財務影響非常嚴重，以至於數百名員工必須在幾週內被裁員。","word":"crushing"}},"crystal":{"createdAt":1781256444507,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"crystal在此指手錶或鐘錶的玻璃蓋，既透明又具有保護作用。","options":["leather","crystal","metal","fabric"],"sentence":"The antique pocket watch had a protective ______ covering its face. Without this transparent shield, the delicate hands inside would be exposed to dust and damage.","translation":"古董懷錶的錶面有一層保護性的水晶玻璃。沒有這層透明的保護罩，裡面的精緻指針會暴露在灰塵和損害中。","word":"crystal"}},"cub":{"createdAt":1781951900951,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cub特指獅子、熊等野生動物的幼仔，是對小型肉食動物的專門術語。","options":["offspring","cub","pup","infant"],"sentence":"The mother bear protected her ______ fiercely from any danger that approached their den. The young animal stayed close to its parent during their first months of life.","translation":"母熊兇悍地保護她的幼崽免受任何接近洞穴的危險。這隻年輕的動物在生命的前幾個月都緊跟在父母身邊。","word":"cub"}},"cuddly":{"createdAt":1785252384393,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cuddly（令人想擁抱的；可愛親切的）形容某物看起來溫暖、柔軟且令人想要擁抱。","options":["fragile","cuddly","expensive","rare"],"sentence":"The stuffed animal was so ______ that children wanted to hug it immediately. Its soft fur, round shape, and gentle expression made it irresistibly warm and approachable.","translation":"那隻填充玩具是如此令人想擁抱，以至於孩子們立刻就想擁抱它。它柔軟的毛皮、圓潤的形狀和溫和的表情使它極具親切感和吸引力。","word":"cuddly"}},"cuisine":{"createdAt":1781362281726,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cuisine指的是烹飪或烹調風格，特別是某個地區或國家的特色菜餚。","options":["music","cuisine","art","fashion"],"sentence":"The restaurant specializes in Thai ______ with authentic recipes. The chefs use traditional cooking methods and genuine ingredients from Thailand.","translation":"這家餐廳專門提供泰國烹飪，採用正宗食譜。廚師使用傳統的烹飪方法和來自泰國的真正食材。","word":"cuisine"}},"culinary":{"createdAt":1781850347302,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"烹飪是形容詞，用來描述與烹飪、食品準備或廚房相關的事物。","options":["musical","artistic","culinary","athletic"],"sentence":"Her ______ skills were so exceptional that she won three Michelin stars for her restaurant. Food critics praised her innovative techniques and exquisite flavor combinations.","translation":"她的烹飪技能非常出色，她的餐廳獲得了三顆米其林星。美食評論家稱讚她的創新技巧和精緻的味道組合。","word":"culinary"}},"cultivate":{"createdAt":1782303283390,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cultivate 意為耕種或培養，在這裡指的是透過勞動來準備和管理土地以生產農作物。","options":["abandon","cultivate","destroy","ignore"],"sentence":"The farmer worked hard to ______ the land and grow healthy crops. After years of careful preparation and planting, the fields became fertile and productive.","translation":"農民努力耕種土地並種植健康的莊稼。經過多年的精心準備和播種，田地變得肥沃而富有成效。","word":"cultivate"}},"cultivated":{"createdAt":1781479123533,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"cultivated 指的是有教養、精緻優雅的，通過學習和經驗培養出來的品質。","options":["rude","wild","cultivated","lazy"],"sentence":"The ______ gentleman displayed excellent manners and refined taste in art and literature. His years of travel and education had shaped him into a person of sophistication and cultural appreciation.","translation":"這位有教養的紳士展現了在藝術和文學方面的優雅品味和精良舉止。他多年的旅行和教育經歷使他成為一個老練而具有文化修養的人。","word":"cultivated"}},"cultivation":{"createdAt":1783421881852,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cultivation 意為「培養；栽培」，指通過教育、訓練或照顧來發展或提高某種品質、技能或習慣。","options":["destruction","cultivation","observation","celebration"],"sentence":"The ______ of artistic skills requires years of dedicated practice and training. Many famous musicians began their ______ during childhood under expert guidance.","translation":"藝術技能的培養需要多年的專注練習和訓練。許多著名音樂家在童年時期就在專家的指導下開始了他們的培養。","word":"cultivation"}},"cumulate":{"createdAt":1781532967169,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cumulate 表示積聚、收集，與「每年增長」的描述相符。","options":["discard","cumulate","donate","trade"],"sentence":"Over the years, the collector continued to ______ rare stamps from around the world. His dedication meant his collection grew larger every single year.","translation":"多年來，收藏家繼續______(積聚)來自世界各地的稀有郵票。他的執著意味著他的收藏每年都在增長。","word":"cumulate"}},"cumulative":{"createdAt":1784770014778,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"cumulative 表示逐漸積累和增長的性質，強調多個小事物或影響加在一起產生的總體效果","options":["temporary","isolated","cumulative","random"],"sentence":"The ______ effect of small daily habits can lead to significant personal transformation over time. After six months of consistent exercise, the results became undeniable.","translation":"小的日常習慣的累積效應可以隨著時間導致顯著的個人轉變。經過六個月的持續運動後，結果變得無可否認。","word":"cumulative"}},"cunning":{"createdAt":1789747025028,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cunning 形容詞表示聰慧且狡猾，善於用巧妙的方法欺騙他人或達成目的。","options":["brave","cunning","hungry","tired"],"sentence":"The ______ fox tricked the farmer by pretending to be injured. The animal's clever strategy and deceptive behavior showed it was intelligent and sly.","translation":"這隻狡猾的狐狸透過假裝受傷來欺騙農夫。這隻動物的聰慧策略和欺騙行為顯示它既聰明又狡詐。","word":"cunning"}},"curative":{"createdAt":1782022372243,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"curative 意為「有療效的、能治療的」，用來形容能夠治癒或緩解疾病的方法或物質。","options":["harmful","curative","experimental","expensive"],"sentence":"The doctor prescribed a ______ treatment that would help heal the patient's chronic illness. After three months of following the regimen, the patient's symptoms disappeared completely.","translation":"醫生開了一種具有療效的治療方法來幫助患者治癒慢性病。經過三個月的治療後，患者的症狀完全消失了。","word":"curative"}},"curator":{"createdAt":1787049756211,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"curator是博物館或美術館的管理者和策展人，負責選擇、管理和展示藝術品。","options":["curator","janitor","visitor","architect"],"sentence":"The museum's ______ carefully selected and arranged all the artwork for the new exhibition. She spent months researching each piece to ensure historical accuracy.","translation":"博物館的館長/策展人為新展覽精心挑選和安排了所有藝術品。她花了幾個月研究每件作品以確保歷史的準確性。","word":"curator"}},"curb":{"createdAt":1782529318037,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"curb 意為控制或限制，用於表達對某事物的約束或抑制。","options":["encourage","curb","promote","subsidize"],"sentence":"The government implemented new tax policies to ______ excessive spending by wealthy corporations. These regulations were designed to control financial irresponsibility and encourage fiscal responsibility.","translation":"政府實施了新的稅收政策來控制富裕公司的過度支出。這些規定旨在控制財務不負責任行為並鼓勵財政責任。","word":"curb"}},"cure":{"createdAt":1785798467266,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cure作為名詞指的是治癒疾病或解決問題的方法或療程，強調能夠完全解決或治療的對策。","options":["solution","cure","prevention","symptom"],"sentence":"Scientists have finally discovered a ______ for the rare disease that has plagued millions of patients worldwide. The new treatment has already saved countless lives in clinical trials.","translation":"科學家終於發現了治癒這種在全世界影響數百萬患者的罕見疾病的方法。這種新的治療方式已經在臨床試驗中拯救了無數生命。","word":"cure"}},"curfew":{"createdAt":1781364476360,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Curfew是指政府為了維持秩序或安全而規定的在特定時間後禁止人們外出的法令。","options":["holiday","curfew","festival","meeting"],"sentence":"During the emergency, the government imposed a strict ______ that required all residents to stay indoors after 8 PM. Police patrolled the streets to ensure compliance with this mandatory time restriction.","translation":"在緊急狀況期間，政府實施了嚴格的宵禁，要求所有居民必須在晚上8點後待在室內。警察在街上巡邏，以確保遵守這項強制性的時間限制。","word":"curfew"}},"curiosity":{"createdAt":1783839719159,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"curiosity 指的是對事物感到興趣並想深入了解的心理狀態，常常驅使人們探索和學習。","options":["indifference","curiosity","anxiety","boredom"],"sentence":"Her ______ about how the ancient ruins were built led her to spend years researching archaeological records. She had always been fascinated by mysteries and questions about the past.","translation":"她對古代遺蹟如何建造的______促使她花費多年研究考古記錄。她一直對謎團和關於過去的問題著迷。","word":"curiosity"}},"curious":{"createdAt":1781515270344,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"curious 作形容詞，表示對某事物充滿好奇心或渴望瞭解的態度。","options":["bucket","investment","curious","prospect"],"sentence":"The young child was ______ about how the old clock worked on the mantelpiece. She asked her grandmother endless questions and wanted to take it apart to see the gears inside.","translation":"年幼的孩子對壁爐上的舊鐘如何運作感到好奇。她不斷地問祖母問題，想拆開它來看裡面的齒輪。","word":"curious"}},"currency":{"createdAt":1781860901465,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"currency指一個國家或地區使用的貨幣，是經濟交易的媒介","options":["language","culture","currency","custom"],"sentence":"When traveling to Japan, you need to exchange your dollars for the local ______. The yen is the official monetary unit used throughout the country.","translation":"前往日本旅遊時，你需要將美元兌換成當地貨幣。日圓是該國官方使用的貨幣單位。","word":"currency"}},"current":{"createdAt":1783870466423,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"current 作為形容詞表示「當前的」或「現在的」，指正在發生或存在於此刻的事物。","options":["historical","future","current","ancient"],"sentence":"The ______ economic crisis has affected employment rates across multiple industries. Government officials are implementing new policies to address the challenges that exist right now.","translation":"當前的經濟危機已影響到多個行業的就業率。政府官員正在實施新政策以應對目前存在的挑戰。","word":"current"}},"currently":{"createdAt":1783671496287,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"currently是副詞，表示現在或當前的時間，與過去和將來相對。","options":["previously","currently","eventually","rarely"],"sentence":"She is ______ working on a difficult project that requires all her attention. By next month, she will move on to a different assignment.","translation":"她目前正在從事一個需要她全神貫注的困難項目。到下個月，她將轉向不同的任務。","word":"currently"}},"curricular":{"createdAt":1785728010202,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"curricular 是形容詞，表示與學校正式課程或教學計畫相關的事物，通常指必修的、官方認可的課程內容。","options":["extracurricular","curricular","recreational","voluntary"],"sentence":"The school's ______ activities include mathematics, science, and history courses. These subjects are part of the official program that all students must complete to graduate.","translation":"學校的課程活動包括數學、科學和歷史課程。這些科目是所有學生必須完成才能畢業的正式課程的一部分。","word":"curricular"}},"curriculum":{"createdAt":1785720849897,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"curriculum指的是學校或教育機構為學生設計的全部課程和教學內容的總體計畫。","options":["schedule","curriculum","building","textbook"],"sentence":"The school's ______ includes mathematics, science, and literature courses. The principal spent weeks designing the ______ to ensure students develop both academic and practical skills.","translation":"學校的課程包括數學、科學和文學課程。校長花了幾週時間設計課程，以確保學生發展學術和實踐技能。","word":"curriculum"}},"curse":{"createdAt":1782982841047,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"curse 意為詛咒或咒罵，表示用言語表達惡意的祝願或惡毒的話語。","options":["bless","curse","praise","greet"],"sentence":"When the old witch saw the villain, she began to ______ him with angry words and supernatural wishes for his downfall. The villagers believed her dark words would bring misfortune upon him forever.","translation":"當老巫婆看到惡棍時，她開始用憤怒的話語詛咒他，並祈求他遭遇不幸。村民們相信她的黑暗言語會永遠給他帶來厄運。","word":"curse"}},"curve":{"createdAt":1782550057073,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"curve是名詞，表示不是直線的彎曲路線或弧線形狀。","options":["line","curve","obstacle","intersection"],"sentence":"The racetrack designer drew a sharp ______ in the road to slow down speeding cars. Drivers had to reduce their speed before entering this section or risk losing control.","translation":"賽道設計師在道路上畫了一個急轉彎來減緩超速汽車的速度。駕駛員在進入這一段時必須減速，否則有失控的風險。","word":"curve"}},"cushion":{"createdAt":1781653278522,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"cushion是名詞，表示墊子、座墊或靠墊，用於提供舒適和支撐，常放在家具上以增加舒適度。","options":["bracket","cushion","frame","shelf"],"sentence":"She placed a soft ______ on the hard wooden chair to make sitting more comfortable. After adding this padding, she could sit for hours without experiencing back pain.","translation":"她在堅硬的木製椅子上放了一個柔軟的______，使坐著更舒服。加上這個墊子後，她可以坐幾個小時而不會感到背部疼痛。","word":"cushion"}},"custody":{"createdAt":1781709854484,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"custody（監護）指法律上對兒童的照管和監護權，與court award（法院判決）和responsible for daily care（負責日常照顧）的語境相符。","options":["custody","dismissal","liberty","estate"],"sentence":"After the divorce, the mother was awarded ______ of both children by the court. She became responsible for their daily care, education, and well-being.","translation":"離婚後，母親被法院判予兩個孩子的監護權。她成為負責他們日常照顧、教育和福祉的人。","word":"custody"}},"custom":{"createdAt":1781336858149,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"custom 指的是在特定文化或社會中代代相傳的習慣或傳統做法。","options":["law","accident","custom","mistake"],"sentence":"In Japan, it is a ______ to remove your shoes before entering someone's home. This tradition has been practiced for centuries and is still widely respected today.","translation":"在日本，進入他人家中前脫掉鞋子是一個習俗。這個傳統已經被實踐了幾個世紀，今天仍然得到廣泛尊重。","word":"custom"}},"customary":{"createdAt":1784176210337,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"customary表示合乎習俗的、按照慣例的，是一種被廣泛接受和遵循的傳統做法。","options":["unusual","dangerous","customary","illegal"],"sentence":"It is ______ in Japan to remove your shoes before entering a home. This traditional practice has been followed there for centuries.","translation":"在日本，進入家裡前脫掉鞋子是習俗。這個傳統習慣在那裡已經遵循了幾個世紀。","word":"customary"}},"customer":{"createdAt":1781848934153,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"customer指購買商品或服務的人","options":["employee","customer","competitor","supplier"],"sentence":"The store manager apologized sincerely to the upset ______ about the billing error. She promised to refund the overcharge immediately.","translation":"商店經理為計費錯誤向不滿的顧客真摯地道歉。她承諾立即退款。","word":"customer"}},"customize":{"createdAt":1784711302809,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"customize表示根據個人或特定需求修改或調整產品、服務或系統的過程。","options":["manufacture","customize","standardize","distribute"],"sentence":"Many companies allow customers to ______ their products according to personal preferences and needs. You can choose colors, sizes, and features to create exactly what you want.","translation":"許多公司允許客戶根據個人偏好和需求來客製化他們的產品。你可以選擇顏色、尺寸和功能來創造你想要的東西。","word":"customize"}},"customized":{"createdAt":1783756901737,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"customized 是指根據個人或特定需求量身訂製或設計的，強調產品是按照客戶的特殊要求而製造或調整的。","options":["standard","customized","portable","expensive"],"sentence":"Sarah ordered a ______ laptop with specific software and hardware configurations that matched her professional needs. The manufacturer built the computer exactly according to her personal specifications rather than selling her a standard model off the shelf.","translation":"莎拉訂購了一台根據她的專業需求量身打造的客製化筆記型電腦，配備特定的軟體和硬體配置。製造商完全按照她的個人規格製造這台電腦，而不是賣給她現成的標準款式。","word":"customized"}},"customs":{"createdAt":1781848934150,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"customs指邊境檢查站，也指一個國家的關稅部門","options":["hotels","customs","restaurants","hospitals"],"sentence":"When traveling internationally, you must pass through ______ to declare any goods you're bringing into the country. The officers will inspect your luggage carefully.","translation":"在國際旅行時，你必須通過海關申報任何你帶入該國的物品。海關官員將仔細檢查你的行李。","word":"customs"}},"cycle":{"createdAt":1783330993549,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"cycle（循環）指一個按順序重複進行的一系列事件或過程，水循環是地球上最重要的自然循環之一。","options":["cycle","moment","theory","event"],"sentence":"The water ______ begins when the sun evaporates water from oceans and lakes. This process repeats continuously as clouds form, rain falls, and water returns to its source.","translation":"水循環始於太陽從海洋和湖泊蒸發水分。這個過程不斷重複，因為雲形成、雨落下，水回到其來源。","word":"cycle"}},"cynical":{"createdAt":1784045870603,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"cynical表示對他人的真誠和善意持懷疑態度，認為人們都是自私的，常見於多次失望後。","options":["optimistic","naive","cynical","enthusiastic"],"sentence":"Sarah has become increasingly ______ about politics after years of broken campaign promises. She now believes that all politicians only care about money and power, not about helping ordinary people.","translation":"多年來政治承諾被一次次打破後，莎拉對政治變得越來越憤世嫉俗。她現在相信所有政治家都只關心金錢和權力，而不在乎幫助普通民眾。","word":"cynical"}},"cytokinin":{"createdAt":1783243696862,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"細胞分裂素是一種植物激素，主要功能是促進細胞分裂、延緩衰老，常用於植物組織培養中。","options":["gibberellin","cytokinin","auxin","abscisic acid"],"sentence":"Plant biologists use ______ to stimulate cell division and growth in tissue culture. This hormone is particularly effective at promoting the development of shoots and delaying leaf senescence.","translation":"植物生物學家使用細胞分裂素來刺激組織培養中的細胞分裂和生長。這種激素在促進芽的發育和延遲葉片衰老方面特別有效。","word":"cytokinin"}},"cytoplasm":{"createdAt":1783489104901,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"細胞質是位於細胞核周圍的半流動物質，填充於細胞膜與核膜之間，是進行代謝作用的主要場所。","options":["nucleus","cytoplasm","membrane","chloroplast"],"sentence":"The ______ is the gel-like substance inside the cell that surrounds the nucleus. Organelles like mitochondria and ribosomes float within this material.","translation":"細胞質是細胞內圍繞細胞核的膠狀物質。粒線體和核糖體等細胞器浮在這種物質中。","word":"cytoplasm"}},"daily":{"createdAt":1781837419087,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"Daily指的是每天發生或進行的事物，日報就是每天出版一次的報紙。","options":["weekly","monthly","daily","annual"],"sentence":"I read the ______ newspaper every morning before going to work. The publication is released fresh each new day with updated news.","translation":"我每天早上上班前都會閱讀日報。這份出版物每天新鮮發行，提供最新新聞。","word":"daily"}},"dairy":{"createdAt":1783388637632,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dairy作為形容詞，表示「與奶牛或乳製品相關的」，常用於描述乳製品場所或與牛奶生產相關的業務。","options":["grain","dairy","fruit","vegetable"],"sentence":"The farmers at the local ______ farm produce milk and cheese for the entire region. They own over 200 cows that are milked every morning.","translation":"當地的奶牛場農民為整個地區生產牛奶和奶酪。他們擁有200多頭牛，每天早上都被擠奶。","word":"dairy"}},"damp":{"createdAt":1782304661033,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"damp作為形容詞表示有濕氣、潮濕的，通常不是完全浸濕但含有水分或濕度。","options":["dry","damp","freezing","stuffy"],"sentence":"The basement felt ______ and cold during the rainy season. We had to use a dehumidifier to reduce the moisture in the air.","translation":"雨季時地下室感覺潮濕而寒冷。我們不得不使用除濕機來降低空氣中的濕度。","word":"damp"}},"dampen":{"createdAt":1781696018693,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dampen 意為使潮濕或減弱、抑制，指降低或削弱某種情感、熱情或動力。","options":["enhance","dampen","increase","inspire"],"sentence":"The unexpected criticism did not ______ his enthusiasm for the project at all. He remained fully committed to completing his vision.","translation":"這意外的批評絲毫沒有削弱他對這個項目的熱情。他仍然完全致力於完成他的願景。","word":"dampen"}},"data":{"createdAt":1786338332960,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"data是指具體收集的事實、數字或信息，常用於科學研究和統計分析中。","options":["opinion","data","theory","hypothesis"],"sentence":"The researcher collected ______ from hundreds of survey responses to analyze consumer behavior. The statistics department processed this information using advanced computational methods.","translation":"研究人員從數百份調查回應中收集了數據以分析消費者行為。統計部門使用先進的計算方法處理這些資訊。","word":"data"}},"dawn":{"createdAt":1783395908756,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"dawn 可作動詞，表示天亮、破曉，描述太陽升起和白天開始的過程。","options":["set","fade","dawn","disappear"],"sentence":"As the sun began to ______, the birds started singing and the world awoke from darkness. This magical moment marked the beginning of a new day.","translation":"當太陽開始破曉時，鳥類開始唱歌，世界從黑暗中甦醒。這個神奇的時刻標誌著新的一天的開始。","word":"dawn"}},"dazzle":{"createdAt":1781275226789,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"此處dazzle作動詞表示「使感到刺眼；使目眩」","options":["dump","breast","dazzle","stroke"],"sentence":"The fireworks display continued to ______ the audience with brilliant colors and unexpected explosions. Their eyes were overwhelmed by the stunning brightness of each burst.","translation":"煙火表演繼續以炫目的色彩和意想不到的爆炸使觀眾眼花繚亂。每一次爆發的驚人亮度都讓他們的眼睛感到刺眼。","word":"dazzle"}},"deadly":{"createdAt":1788788231276,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"deadly 是形容詞，意思是「致命的」或「致死的」，用來形容能夠導致死亡的事物或情況。","options":["colorful","deadly","shy","expensive"],"sentence":"The snake venom is considered ______ to humans if left untreated. Medical professionals must administer antitoxin immediately to prevent fatalities.","translation":"如果不治療，這種蛇毒對人類是致命的。醫療專業人員必須立即注射解毒血清以防止死亡。","word":"deadly"}},"deafen":{"createdAt":1782294199524,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"deafen作動詞表示使某人失聰或聽力受損，通常指因極大聲響造成的傷害。","options":["deafen","silence","mute","quiet"],"sentence":"The explosion was so loud it threatened to ______ anyone standing nearby. The sound was measured at over 190 decibels, causing permanent hearing loss to several workers.","translation":"爆炸聲音非常大，威脅到附近任何人的聽力。聲音測量超過190分貝，導致幾名工人永久性失聽。","word":"deafen"}},"deal":{"createdAt":1781395310166,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"deal 作為動詞表示應付、處理某種情況或問題。","options":["ignore","avoid","deal","celebrate"],"sentence":"The manager had to ______ with three customer complaints before lunch. She handled each issue professionally and resolved them all within an hour.","translation":"經理必須在午餐前應付三個客戶投訴。她專業地處理了每個問題並在一小時內全部解決。","word":"deal"}},"dealer":{"createdAt":1785451790337,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dealer 在卡牌遊戲中特指負責發牌的人，也可泛指經銷或買賣商品的商人。","options":["manager","dealer","organizer","attendant"],"sentence":"The ______ shuffled the cards carefully before distributing them to each player at the table. In this poker game, he was responsible for managing the deck and ensuring fair play.","translation":"發牌者在將牌分配給桌上每位玩家之前仔細洗牌。在這場撲克遊戲中，他負責管理牌堆並確保公平遊戲。","word":"dealer"}},"debate":{"createdAt":1783397877977,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"debate（辯論會）指的是正式的討論活動，其中對立的雙方為了說服他人而互相提出論點和反駁，通常涉及政治、學術或公共議題。","options":["speech","debate","lecture","conversation"],"sentence":"The two candidates engaged in a heated ______ about economic policy during the election campaign. Each side presented arguments and counter-arguments to convince the audience of their position.","translation":"兩位候選人在選舉活動中就經濟政策進行了激烈的辯論會。雙方都提出了論點和反駁來說服觀眾支持他們的立場。","word":"debate"}},"debris":{"createdAt":1781598671164,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"debris 作名詞表示碎片或殘骸，指破壞或損毀後留下的廢棄物質","options":["furniture","debris","belongings","supplies"],"sentence":"The tornado left scattered ______ across the entire neighborhood after its destructive path. Residents spent weeks cleaning up the remains of destroyed buildings.","translation":"龍捲風在其破壞路徑後在整個社區留下散落的碎片。居民花了數週時間清理被摧毀建築物的殘骸。","word":"debris"}},"debt":{"createdAt":1781598671104,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"debt 作名詞表示債務，指某人或某個組織必須償還的金錢","options":["assets","debt","income","revenue"],"sentence":"After the loan was fully repaid, the company was finally free from financial ______. Management celebrated the achievement of becoming a debt-free organization.","translation":"貸款全額償還後，該公司終於擺脫了財務債務。管理層慶祝了成為無債務組織的成就。","word":"debt"}},"debut":{"createdAt":1781850347304,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"首演是指一個人或作品首次公開出現或展示，通常指演員或藝術家的第一次正式表演。","options":["retirement","performance","debut","appearance"],"sentence":"The young actress made her ______ in a small independent film last year. She has since appeared in three major Hollywood productions and received critical acclaim.","translation":"這位年輕女演員去年在一部小型獨立電影中首演。她此後出現在三部好萊塢主要影片中，並獲得了評論家的讚譽。","word":"debut"}},"decade":{"createdAt":1783063953960,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"decade表示「十年」，是指連續的10年時間。","options":["month","year","decade","century"],"sentence":"She has been working at the same company for more than one ______ without taking a single vacation day. Her 15-year employment record speaks volumes about her dedication.","translation":"她在同一家公司工作超過一個十年，沒有休過一天假。她15年的工作記錄充分說明了她的敬業精神。","word":"decade"}},"decay":{"createdAt":1781848934148,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"decay指事物逐漸腐爛、腐朽或衰敗的過程","options":["strengthen","decay","whiten","grow"],"sentence":"If you don't brush your teeth regularly, they will begin to ______. Poor dental hygiene leads to cavities and serious infections.","translation":"如果你不定期刷牙，牙齒就會開始腐爛。糟糕的牙齒衛生會導致蛀牙和嚴重感染。","word":"decay"}},"deceit":{"createdAt":1781283344055,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"deceit意為欺騙、詐欺；與「虛假宣傳」和「調查揭露真相」搭配，表示故意誤導他人的行為。","options":["honesty","deceit","compliance","transparency"],"sentence":"The company was involved in ______ when it falsely advertised that its products were environmentally friendly. Investigations revealed that the manufacturing process actually produced significant pollution.","translation":"該公司因虛假宣傳其產品環保而涉及欺騙。調查顯示製造過程實際上產生了大量污染。","word":"deceit"}},"deceive":{"createdAt":1781849847400,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"deceive表示欺騙或哄騙，與「說謊」和「失去信譽」的線索相符。","options":["inform","deceive","educate","encourage"],"sentence":"The salesman tried to ______ his customers about the product's quality. He was caught lying and lost all credibility.","translation":"銷售員試圖欺騙顧客關於產品的品質。他被發現說謊並失去了所有信譽。","word":"deceive"}},"decency":{"createdAt":1781850347301,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"得體或端莊是指符合社會道德規範、表現得當、行為高尚的品質。","options":["intelligence","strength","decency","humor"],"sentence":"The politician showed a lack of ______ when he publicly mocked his opponent's personal struggles. Such behavior violated basic standards of respect and dignity in public discourse.","translation":"當政治家公開嘲笑他對手的個人困難時，他展現出缺乏得體。這種行為違反了公開辯論中基本的尊重和尊嚴標準。","word":"decency"}},"decent":{"createdAt":1781959842986,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"decent 表示令人滿意、像樣的，用來形容達到可接受標準的事物，不一定是奢華或最好的。","options":["luxurious","decent","spacious","modern"],"sentence":"Although the hotel room was small, it was ______ and comfortable for our stay. We were satisfied with the clean sheets, working air conditioning, and friendly staff.","translation":"雖然飯店房間很小，但它很體面舒適，適合我們住宿。我們對乾淨的床單、正常運作的冷氣和友善的員工感到滿意。","word":"decent"}},"declaration":{"createdAt":1781959842990,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"declaration 指正式的、公開的宣佈或聲明，通常來自權威人士或政府機構，具有重要的法律或政治意義。","options":["suggestion","declaration","rumor","question"],"sentence":"The president made an official ______ announcing the new environmental policy to the nation. All major news outlets broadcast the formal announcement on television and radio.","translation":"總統發表了一份正式聲明，向全國宣佈新的環境政策。所有主要新聞媒體都在電視和廣播上播放了這項正式公告。","word":"declaration"}},"declare":{"createdAt":1781624534655,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"declare 意為「宣稱、宣佈、聲明」，表示正式公開地說出或宣告某事。","options":["hide","declare","delay","question"],"sentence":"The president will ______ the results of the election during a live television broadcast tomorrow. Citizens are waiting to hear the official announcement from the government.","translation":"總統將在明天的電視直播中宣佈選舉結果。公民們正在等待聽政府的正式宣告。","word":"declare"}},"decline":{"createdAt":1781598671099,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"decline 作名詞表示衰退或下降，指某事物數量或質量的減少","options":["growth","decline","stability","boom"],"sentence":"The company experienced a sharp ______ in sales after losing its largest client. Revenue dropped by 40% within just six months.","translation":"失去最大客戶後，該公司的銷售額經歷了急劇下降。收入在短短六個月內下降了40%。","word":"decline"}},"decorate":{"createdAt":1781395310168,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"decorate 表示為空間或物品進行美化或點綴以使其更加吸引人。","options":["demolish","decorate","abandon","damage"],"sentence":"The team decided to ______ the office for the holiday party with colorful balloons and lights. By evening, the plain gray walls had been transformed into a festive wonderland.","translation":"團隊決定用彩色氣球和燈光為假日派對裝飾辦公室。到了晚上，樸素的灰色牆壁已經變成了一個節日樂園。","word":"decorate"}},"decorative":{"createdAt":1781832478020,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"decorative 意為「裝飾性的」，用來形容主要目的是為了美觀和裝飾而非實用的東西。","options":["functional","decorative","expensive","ancient"],"sentence":"The vase serves a ______ purpose in the living room rather than a practical one. It's purely for beauty and has no function other than to enhance the appearance of the space.","translation":"這個花瓶在客廳裡的作用是裝飾性的，而不是實用的。它純粹是為了美觀，除了增強空間外觀外，沒有其他功能。","word":"decorative"}},"decorum":{"createdAt":1783516186778,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"decorum 是指適當的行為、得體的舉止和正式場合應遵守的禮儀標準。","options":["chaos","disorder","decorum","informality"],"sentence":"The ambassador maintained strict ______ during the formal state dinner, following all protocols of etiquette. Every gesture and word was carefully chosen to show respect.","translation":"那位大使在正式國宴期間保持了嚴格的禮儀，遵循所有禮節協議。每個手勢和話語都經過精心選擇以表示尊重。","word":"decorum"}},"decrease":{"createdAt":1781362281654,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"decrease表示減少或降低，通常用於數量、程度或強度的下降。","options":["increase","decrease","stabilize","fluctuate"],"sentence":"The company's profits will ______ if they don't reduce operational costs. The financial reports show fewer sales this quarter compared to last year.","translation":"如果公司不降低運營成本，利潤將會減少。財務報告顯示本季度的銷售額少於去年。","word":"decrease"}},"dedicate":{"createdAt":1783255075628,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"dedicate意思是把某物或某人的時間、才能或生命完全用於某個目的或事業。","options":["dedicate","abandon","ignore","postpone"],"sentence":"The athlete decided to ______ her entire career to helping young people achieve their dreams. She spent countless hours training and mentoring the next generation of competitors.","translation":"這位運動員決定將她的整個職業生涯獻給幫助年輕人實現夢想。她花了無數小時訓練和指導下一代競爭者。","word":"dedicate"}},"dedicated":{"createdAt":1782529318034,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dedicated 意為專注的或獻身的，用於形容對某事物全心投入的人。","options":["casual","dedicated","experienced","qualified"],"sentence":"The ______ teacher stayed after school every day to help struggling students improve their grades. Her commitment to education was evident in the remarkable progress her pupils made.","translation":"這位專注的老師每天放學後留下來幫助成績不理想的學生改進。她對教育的承諾在學生取得的進步中顯而易見。","word":"dedicated"}},"dedication":{"createdAt":1783609370263,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dedication 指的是對某件事的全心投入和長期承諾，這裡用來形容運動員對訓練的執著態度和堅持不懈的努力。","options":["laziness","dedication","confusion","hesitation"],"sentence":"The athlete's ______ to training every single day for ten years is what made her an Olympic champion. Her coach admired how she never missed a session, even when injured or exhausted.","translation":"這位運動員十年來每天訓練的奉獻精神使她成為奧運冠軍。她的教練欽佩她從不缺席訓練課程，即使在受傷或疲憊時也堅持不懈。","word":"dedication"}},"deduct":{"createdAt":1781848934154,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"deduct指從總數中減去或扣除某個部分","options":["add","deduct","multiply","divide"],"sentence":"The accountant will ______ all business expenses from your gross income before calculating taxes. This reduces the amount of taxes you owe.","translation":"會計將在計算稅款前從你的總收入中扣除所有業務開支。這減少了你所欠的稅款金額。","word":"deduct"}},"deduction":{"createdAt":1783516186779,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"deduction 是指從一般原理或已知事實推導出具體結論的邏輯推理方法。","options":["guessing","assumption","deduction","rumor"],"sentence":"Using ______, the detective concluded that the suspect was guilty based on three pieces of evidence. He started with specific facts and arrived at a logical conclusion.","translation":"利用演繹法，偵探根據三項證據推論該嫌疑人有罪。他從具體的事實開始，得出了邏輯結論。","word":"deduction"}},"deem":{"createdAt":1783068673118,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"deem 表示「認為；以為；視作」，用來表達對某事的判斷或看法。","options":["ignore","deem","reject","delay"],"sentence":"The committee will ______ the proposal acceptable based on the new evidence presented. After reviewing all the data, the members agreed unanimously that the standards had been met.","translation":"委員會將根據提交的新證據認為該提案是可以接受的。在審查了所有數據後，委員們一致同意已經達到了標準。","word":"deem"}},"default":{"createdAt":1784625437081,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"default 是指未能履行債務義務或按時支付款項的行為，構成違約。","options":["pay","default","settle","repay"],"sentence":"When the borrower failed to ______ on the loan payments for six months, the bank initiated legal proceedings. The contract clearly stated that missed payments would result in serious consequences.","translation":"當借款人六個月未能______貸款時，銀行啟動了法律程序。合同明確規定未支付款項將導致嚴重後果。","word":"default"}},"defeat":{"createdAt":1781425122880,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"defeat 意為失敗或被擊敗，與失分多和排名最後的資訊相符。","options":["victory","defeat","discount","exhibition"],"sentence":"The team suffered a terrible ______ in the championship game. They lost by thirty points and finished in last place.","translation":"球隊在錦標賽中遭受了慘敗。他們被領先三十分，最終排名墊底。","word":"defeat"}},"defect":{"createdAt":1781395310155,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"defect 指物品或系統中的問題或不完美之處，這裡用於描述需要修復的故障。","options":["strength","defect","feature","benefit"],"sentence":"The manufacturer discovered a ______ in the product that could affect safety. Engineers immediately recalled all units to fix this flaw before it reached consumers.","translation":"製造商發現產品中的缺陷可能會影響安全。工程師立即召回所有單位，在缺陷到達消費者之前進行修復。","word":"defect"}},"defective":{"createdAt":1786371595869,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"defective 是形容詞，表示某物有缺陷、不完美或無法正常運作，通常用來描述有問題或需要維修的產品。","options":["expensive","defective","popular","vintage"],"sentence":"The manufacturer had to recall all ______ units because they failed safety inspections. The company discovered that faulty wiring in every single product posed a serious fire hazard.","translation":"製造商必須召回所有有缺陷的單位，因為它們未通過安全檢驗。公司發現每件產品中的故障電線構成了嚴重的火災隱患。","word":"defective"}},"defend":{"createdAt":1782648229316,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"defend 作為動詞意指為某人或某事進行辯護、提供保護或支持，尤其在法律或衝突的背景下。","options":["attack","ignore","defend","abandon"],"sentence":"The lawyer worked tirelessly to ______ her client against the serious accusations in court. She presented compelling evidence and witnesses to prove his innocence.","translation":"律師不遺餘力地為她的當事人辯護，對抗法庭上的嚴重指控。她提出有力的證據和證人來證明他的清白。","word":"defend"}},"defendant":{"createdAt":1781693254767,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"defendant是法律術語，指被指控或起訴的人，在訴訟中被告方。","options":["plaintiff","witness","defendant","judge"],"sentence":"The ______ stood in court to hear the jury's verdict after months of trial. The person accused of the crime listened carefully as the judge announced the decision.","translation":"經過數月的審判後，被告站在法庭上聽取陪審團的判決。被控犯罪的人認真地聆聽法官宣布的決定。","word":"defendant"}},"defense":{"createdAt":1784770014786,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"defense 在此指的是防禦結構或手段，用於保護某物或某人免受攻擊或傷害","options":["weapon","offense","defense","supply"],"sentence":"The fortress's stone walls served as the primary ______ against enemy attacks. The soldiers stationed there could hold out for weeks against any siege.","translation":"堡壘的石牆是抵禦敵人攻擊的主要防禦物。駐守在那裡的士兵可以抵禦任何圍困持續數周。","word":"defense"}},"defensive":{"createdAt":1781449588283,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"defensive作為形容詞表示「防禦的、防守的」，用於描述保護或阻止攻擊的行為和策略。","options":["improve","signify","defensive","regulate"],"sentence":"The soccer team adopted a ______ strategy to protect their goal from the opponent's attacks. The coach instructed the players to focus on blocking shots and preventing dangerous advances into their penalty area.","translation":"足球隊採取了防禦性策略來保護他們的球門免受對手的攻擊。教練指示球員專注於擋球和防止對手危險地推進到他們的禁區。","word":"defensive"}},"defiance":{"createdAt":1784770014765,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"defiance 指的是對權威或規則的明確違抗和對立，特別是當某人堅定地拒絕服從時","options":["compliance","defiance","agreement","submission"],"sentence":"The activist's ______ of the unjust law inspired thousands to join the movement. She refused to back down even when threatened with arrest.","translation":"這位活動人士對不公正法律的違抗激勵了數千人加入運動。即使受到逮捕的威脅，她也拒絕退縮。","word":"defiance"}},"deficiency":{"createdAt":1783693741502,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"deficiency表示某種物質或能力的不足或缺乏，通常用於描述營養、資源或技能的短缺。","options":["abundance","deficiency","surplus","excess"],"sentence":"The patient's ______ in vitamin D led to weak bones and fatigue. Blood tests revealed that his body was not producing enough of this essential nutrient.","translation":"患者體內維生素D的缺乏導致骨骼虛弱和疲勞。血液檢查顯示他的身體沒有產生足夠的這種必需營養素。","word":"deficiency"}},"deficient":{"createdAt":1781693270386,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"deficient表示「不足的、缺乏的」，用來描述某物數量或質量不夠或有缺陷的情況。","options":["abundant","deficient","excessive","balanced"],"sentence":"The patient's diet was ______ in vitamin C, which led to serious health complications. Blood tests confirmed that his nutrient levels were critically low.","translation":"患者的飲食缺乏維生素C，導致了嚴重的健康問題。血液檢查證實他的營養水平嚴重不足。","word":"deficient"}},"deficit":{"createdAt":1782016805984,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"deficit 是名詞，表示支出大於收入的差額，即赤字或虧損。","options":["surplus","deficit","balance","profit"],"sentence":"The country faced a massive budget ______ as government spending far exceeded tax revenues. Without significant policy changes, the national debt would continue to grow rapidly.","translation":"由於政府支出遠超稅收收入，該國面臨巨大的預算赤字。如果沒有重大政策改變，國債將繼續迅速增長。","word":"deficit"}},"define":{"createdAt":1781395310172,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"define 表示給予清晰的定義或詳細說明某個詞語、概念或事物的確切含義。","options":["erase","define","illustrate","memorize"],"sentence":"The teacher asked students to ______ the term 'photosynthesis' in their own words during the exam. Each student had to provide a clear explanation of what the process means and how it works.","translation":"老師要求學生在考試中用自己的話定義「光合作用」這一術語。每個學生都必須清楚地解釋該過程的含義及其工作方式。","word":"define"}},"defined":{"createdAt":1783505313974,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"defined作形容詞表示「明確的」或「確定的」，指邊界或內容清楚而不模糊。","options":["vague","defined","suggested","flexible"],"sentence":"The contract had ______ terms that left no room for misunderstanding. Every detail was written out explicitly, so both parties knew exactly what they agreed to.","translation":"合約有明確的條款，沒有任何誤解的空間。每個細節都明確寫出來了，所以雙方都清楚他們同意了什麼。","word":"defined"}},"definite":{"createdAt":1782627743501,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"definite（絕對的；明確的）表示某事是確定的、明確的，沒有模糊或改變的空間，具有肯定的、不可更改的特性。","options":["uncertain","vague","definite","flexible"],"sentence":"The company has made a ______ decision about the new project launch date. The announcement clearly states that production will begin on March 15th with no possibility of postponement.","translation":"公司已經對新項目的啟動日期做出了絕對的決定。公告清楚地說明生產將在3月15日開始，沒有任何延期的可能。","word":"definite"}},"definitely":{"createdAt":1781283344047,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"definitely意為確實地、肯定地；與「已經註冊和預訂」的事實搭配，表示非常確定的態度。","options":["might","definitely","probably","possibly"],"sentence":"I will ______ attend the conference next month without any doubt. I have already registered and booked my hotel room.","translation":"我絕對會參加下個月的會議，毫無疑問。我已經註冊並預訂了酒店房間。","word":"definitely"}},"definition":{"createdAt":1783760526713,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"definition指對詞語或概念的準確說明和界定，用來解釋詞彙的確切含義。","options":["illustration","definition","example","story"],"sentence":"The dictionary provided a clear ______ of the obscure word that nobody in the classroom understood. After reading the explanation, all students finally grasped the exact meaning and could use it correctly.","translation":"字典為班上沒有人理解的晦澀單詞提供了清晰的定義。讀完解釋後，所有學生終於掌握了確切的意思，並能正確使用它。","word":"definition"}},"definitive":{"createdAt":1784770014782,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"definitive 指的是最終的、決定性的判斷或決定，一旦做出就不能改變或質疑","options":["preliminary","definitive","tentative","uncertain"],"sentence":"The court's ______ ruling ended all further appeals and established the legal precedent. This decision was final and could not be challenged or reversed.","translation":"法院的決定性裁定終止了所有進一步的上訴並建立了法律先例。這項決定是最終的，不能被質疑或推翻。","word":"definitive"}},"defy":{"createdAt":1783685293799,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"defy意思是「對抗、違抗、反抗」，表示公開反對或拒絕遵守某個權威或規則。","options":["support","defy","ignore","question"],"sentence":"The young activist decided to ______ the government's unjust law by refusing to comply. She was willing to face legal consequences for standing up for what she believed in.","translation":"這位年輕的倡導人士決定違抗政府的不公正法律，拒絕遵守。她願意因為堅持自己的信念而承擔法律後果。","word":"defy"}},"degree":{"createdAt":1781395310169,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"degree 表示溫度、程度或強度的度量單位，這裡指溫度的測量值。","options":["color","sound","degree","texture"],"sentence":"The heat in the desert reached an extreme ______ of 50 degrees Celsius during the afternoon. Residents stayed indoors to avoid the dangerous temperature.","translation":"沙漠中的高溫在下午達到了極端的50攝氏度。居民們呆在室內以避免危險的溫度。","word":"degree"}},"delay":{"createdAt":1783760526715,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"delay指延遲或延後，可作為動詞表示使事物推遲，或作為名詞表示延誤的時間。","options":["speed","progress","delay","acceleration"],"sentence":"The construction project faced a significant ______ due to unexpected weather conditions last week. The builders had to pause work for several days, which pushed the completion date back by two weeks.","translation":"由於上週意外的天氣狀況，建築項目面臨重大延誤。建築工人必須停止工作數天，這將竣工日期推遲了兩週。","word":"delay"}},"delegate":{"createdAt":1783005778358,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"delegate 意為「委派」或「授權」，指將任務或責任分配給他人代為執行或代表。","options":["avoid","delegate","postpone","reject"],"sentence":"The company will ______ the project management responsibilities to a senior team member. This person will represent the organization at the conference and make decisions on its behalf.","translation":"公司將把專案管理責任委派給一名資深團隊成員。這個人將代表組織參加會議並代表組織做出決定。","word":"delegate"}},"delegation":{"createdAt":1783005778363,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"delegation 意為「代表團」或「委任」，指被派遣去代表某個組織或國家的一群人。","options":["rumor","delegation","schedule","document"],"sentence":"A ______ from five countries arrived at the conference to discuss trade agreements. Each member was carefully selected by their government to represent their nation's interests.","translation":"一個由五個國家組成的代表團抵達會議以討論貿易協議。每個成員都被其政府精心挑選來代表其國家的利益。","word":"delegation"}},"deliberate":{"createdAt":1782646755360,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"deliberate 作為形容詞，表示經過深思熟慮、經過認真考慮做出的決定。","options":["rash","deliberate","sudden","quick"],"sentence":"The CEO made a ______ decision to close three underperforming branches. She had carefully reviewed financial reports for months before announcing the plan.","translation":"執行長做出了一個深思熟慮的決定，關閉三個績效不佳的分公司。在宣佈計劃之前，她已經仔細審查了數月的財務報表。","word":"deliberate"}},"deliberately":{"createdAt":1781507137218,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"deliberately 表示故意地、刻意地做某件事，強調行為是有計劃和意識的，而不是無意的。","options":["accidentally","reluctantly","deliberately","gradually"],"sentence":"She ______ knocked over the vase to test if her brother was telling the truth about the accident. Her actions proved that he had lied about how the original vase broke.","translation":"她故意打翻花瓶來測試她的哥哥是否在說關於意外的真話。她的行為證明他對原來的花瓶如何打破撒了謊。","word":"deliberately"}},"delicate":{"createdAt":1781425024018,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"delicate表示易碎的、脆弱的、精美的，需要謹慎對待，稍不注意就會受損。","options":["sturdy","delicate","heavy","modern"],"sentence":"The antique porcelain vase was extremely ______ and required special handling to prevent damage. One small drop or careless movement could cause it to shatter into a thousand pieces.","translation":"這個古董瓷花瓶極其脆弱，需要特殊處理以防止損壞。一次輕微的跌落或粗心的動作可能會使它破成一千片。","word":"delicate"}},"delight":{"createdAt":1783068339381,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"delight 名詞表示愉快、高興或喜悅的情感","options":["sadness","delight","confusion","anger"],"sentence":"The children received the news of an extra holiday with great ______. Their joy and excitement were evident in their smiling faces and celebratory cheers.","translation":"孩子們得知額外放假的消息時感到非常高興。他們的喜悅和興奮從微笑的臉龐和歡呼中顯而易見。","word":"delight"}},"delighted":{"createdAt":1784106663186,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"delighted是形容詞，意為「高興的、愉快的」，表示對某事感到極大的喜悅和滿足。","options":["bored","exhausted","delighted","confused"],"sentence":"Sarah was absolutely ______ when she received the surprise birthday party from her friends. She couldn't stop smiling and thanking everyone for the thoughtful celebration.","translation":"當莎拉從朋友們那裡收到驚喜生日派對時，她感到非常高興。她不停地微笑並感謝每個人的體貼慶祝。","word":"delighted"}},"delightful":{"createdAt":1785885349565,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"delightful 表示「令人愉快的、可喜的」，用來形容讓人感到高興和滿足的經歷或事物。","options":["exhausting","boring","delightful","expensive"],"sentence":"The vacation to the beach was ______ for the whole family. Everyone smiled, laughed, and said they had never had such a wonderful time together.","translation":"全家去海灘的假期令人愉快。每個人都微笑、大笑，都說他們從未有過這麼美好的時光。","word":"delightful"}},"deliver":{"createdAt":1781598671087,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"deliver 作動詞表示發表或遞送，在這裡指正式地發表演講或講話","options":["write","deliver","publish","record"],"sentence":"The president will ______ the inaugural address at the ceremony tomorrow morning. The speech is expected to outline his vision for the nation over the next four years.","translation":"總統明天上午將在儀式上發表就職演說。該演講預計將闡述他對未來四年國家的願景。","word":"deliver"}},"delivery":{"createdAt":1782002325570,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"delivery 在醫療語境中指的是分娩的過程，即嬰兒從子宮出生的過程。","options":["delivery","distribution","presentation","transmission"],"sentence":"The ______ of the newborn baby was successful, and both mother and child were in excellent health. The doctor completed the procedure in the hospital's maternity ward without any complications.","translation":"嬰兒的分娩很順利，母親和孩子都健康狀況良好。醫生在醫院的產科病房順利完成了手術，沒有任何併發症。","word":"delivery"}},"demand":{"createdAt":1783667392058,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"demand 作為動詞，表示以強硬或權威的方式要求某物，通常帶有強制性。","options":["suggest","demand","propose","recommend"],"sentence":"The employer will ______ higher productivity from all employees starting next month. Workers who fail to meet these new standards will face consequences.","translation":"雇主從下個月開始將要求所有員工提高生產力。未能達到這些新標準的工人將面臨後果。","word":"demand"}},"demanding":{"createdAt":1781598671169,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"demanding 作形容詞表示苛求的或過分要求的，指對他人有很高期望且難以滿足","options":["lenient","demanding","flexible","understanding"],"sentence":"The manager had a reputation for being very ______ with his team members. He expected perfection in every project and rarely accepted work that didn't meet his extremely high standards.","translation":"這位經理以對團隊成員過分要求而聞名。他期望每個項目都完美無缺，很少接受不符合他極高標準的工作。","word":"demanding"}},"dementia":{"createdAt":1781624534654,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dementia 意為「老年癡呆、癡呆症」，是一種影響記憶、思考和行為能力的神經系統疾病。","options":["arthritis","dementia","insomnia","allergy"],"sentence":"The elderly man was diagnosed with ______ after forgetting his family members' names and losing the ability to care for himself. His doctor explained that the disease affects memory and cognitive function.","translation":"這位老人在忘記家人的名字並喪失自理能力後被診斷患有老年癡呆。他的醫生解釋該疾病會影響記憶和認知功能。","word":"dementia"}},"democracy":{"createdAt":1781624534705,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"democracy 意為「民主政治、民主制度」，是指由人民統治的政治制度。","options":["tyranny","monarchy","democracy","dictatorship"],"sentence":"The citizens celebrated the establishment of ______ in their nation after years of living under military rule. They could finally vote freely and express their opinions without fear.","translation":"在多年生活在軍事統治下後，公民們慶祝了國家民主制度的建立。他們終於可以自由投票和表達意見而不用擔心。","word":"democracy"}},"democrat":{"createdAt":1781624534705,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"democrat 意為「民主主義者、民主派」，指擁護民主制度並為其效力的人。","options":["authoritarian","oligarch","democrat","monarch"],"sentence":"As a committed ______, he has spent his entire career fighting for equal rights and freedom of speech. His speeches always emphasize the importance of citizen participation in government.","translation":"作為一名致力於民主主義的人士，他花費了整個職業生涯爭取平等權利和言論自由。他的演講總是強調公民參與政府的重要性。","word":"democrat"}},"democratic":{"createdAt":1781624534657,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"democratic 意為「民主的」，指以人民主權和多數統治為基礎的政治制度。","options":["authoritarian","dictatorial","democratic","totalitarian"],"sentence":"The country adopted a ______ system where all citizens have the right to vote and participate in government. Every person's voice matters equally in the decision-making process.","translation":"該國採用了民主制度，所有公民都有權投票和參與政府事務。每個人在決策過程中的聲音都同等重要。","word":"democratic"}},"demonstrate":{"createdAt":1781283344054,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"demonstrate意為示範、展示；與「培訓會」和「員工看到實際操作」搭配，表示向他人展示如何使用或操作某物。","options":["criticize","demonstrate","estimate","document"],"sentence":"The engineer will ______ how the new software system works during the company training session tomorrow. All employees will have the opportunity to see the features in action and ask questions.","translation":"工程師將在明天的公司培訓會上示範新軟體系統的工作方式。所有員工將有機會看到實際操作並提出問題。","word":"demonstrate"}},"denial":{"createdAt":1781624534707,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"denial 意為「否認、否定」，指拒絕承認或接受某事實。","options":["admission","denial","agreement","confession"],"sentence":"The suspect's ______ of the crime became less convincing as more evidence was presented in court. The eyewitness testimony contradicted his claims completely.","translation":"隨著法庭上提出更多證據，被告對犯罪的否認變得越來越不可信。目擊者的證詞與他的說法完全相反。","word":"denial"}},"dense":{"createdAt":1781624534653,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dense 意為「密集的、稠密的」，用來形容物質或事物緊密排列或高度濃縮。","options":["sparse","dense","colorful","ancient"],"sentence":"The ______ forest was so thick that sunlight barely reached the ground. The hikers had to use flashlights during the middle of the day.","translation":"這片密集的森林非常濃厚，陽光幾乎無法到達地面。登山者不得不在白天中午使用手電筒。","word":"dense"}},"densely":{"createdAt":1788959648580,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"densely 是副詞，意為「密集地」，題目中第二句提到「建築物密集相鄰」和「街道擁擠」強調了高密度的特徵。","options":["sparsely","densely","evenly","randomly"],"sentence":"The city's population was distributed ______ throughout the downtown area, with skyscrapers and residential buildings packed closely together. Streets were crowded with people from morning until late evening.","translation":"這座城市的人口在市中心地區密集分佈，摩天大樓和住宅樓密集相鄰。街道從早到晚都擁擠著人群。","word":"densely"}},"density":{"createdAt":1781624534711,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"density 意為「密度」，指單位面積或體積內物質或人口的濃度。","options":["scarcity","rarity","density","emptiness"],"sentence":"The ______ of the population in the city center is much higher than in the suburban areas. Over ten thousand people live in just one square kilometer downtown.","translation":"市中心的人口密度遠高於郊區。市中心每平方公里就住著超過一萬人。","word":"density"}},"deny":{"createdAt":1781332009068,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"deny 意為否認或拒絕承認某事，尤其是在面對指控時","options":["admit","deny","ignore","celebrate"],"sentence":"The suspect continued to ______ all accusations of theft during the interrogation. However, security cameras had recorded him taking the items from the store.","translation":"嫌疑人在審訊中繼續否認所有的盜竊指控。然而，安全攝像頭錄下了他從商店拿走這些物品的過程。","word":"deny"}},"depart":{"createdAt":1784362633989,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"depart表示離開或出發的意思，在這個句子中指飛機即將起飛離開機場","options":["arrive","depart","land","return"],"sentence":"The flight will ______ from the airport at 10 AM tomorrow morning. All passengers have already boarded and the crew is preparing for takeoff.","translation":"明天早上飛機將在上午10點從機場出發。所有乘客都已登機，機組人員正在準備起飛。","word":"depart"}},"department":{"createdAt":1784723959944,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"department 指公司或組織內的專門部門或科系，負責特定的功能或業務範疇。","options":["building","company","department","office"],"sentence":"Sarah works in the Marketing ______ of a large technology company. She manages social media campaigns and advertising strategies for the entire organization.","translation":"莎拉在一家大型科技公司的行銷部門工作。她管理整個組織的社群媒體行銷活動和廣告策略。","word":"department"}},"departure":{"createdAt":1782522524124,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"departure 是指離開或出發的意思，在此指火車離開車站開始旅程的時間。","options":["arrival","departure","schedule","platform"],"sentence":"The train's ______ was delayed by two hours due to mechanical problems. Passengers had to wait in the station before they could finally leave for their destination.","translation":"由於機械問題，火車的出發被延遲了兩小時。乘客必須在車站等候，才能最終前往目的地。","word":"departure"}},"depend":{"createdAt":1781624534654,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"depend 意為「依靠、依賴」，表示需要他人或其他事物的幫助或支持才能完成某事。","options":["ignore","depend","refuse","prevent"],"sentence":"Small businesses often ______ on loans from the bank to start their operations. Without financial support, most entrepreneurs cannot afford to open their stores.","translation":"小型企業通常依靠銀行貸款來啟動業務。沒有財務支持，大多數企業家無法負擔開設商店的費用。","word":"depend"}},"dependable":{"createdAt":1781624534641,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dependable 意為「可信賴的、可依靠的」，用來形容值得信任、行為可預測的人或事物。","options":["lazy","dependable","confused","arrogant"],"sentence":"You can trust John because he is a ______ employee who always completes his work on time. When the company faced a crisis last month, he was the first person management called.","translation":"你可以相信約翰，因為他是一位可信任的員工，總是按時完成工作。上個月公司面臨危機時，他是管理層首先召喚的人。","word":"dependable"}},"dependence":{"createdAt":1781624534707,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"dependence 意為「依靠、依賴」，指對某物或某人的需要或信賴的狀態。","options":["independence","freedom","dependence","health"],"sentence":"The patient's ______ on medication became so severe that he could not function without taking multiple pills every day. The doctor warned him about the dangers of prolonged reliance.","translation":"患者對藥物的依賴變得如此嚴重，他每天不吃多種藥片就無法正常生活。醫生警告他長期依賴的危害。","word":"dependence"}},"dependent":{"createdAt":1781624534706,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dependent 意為「依賴的、依靠的」，形容某人需要他人的支持或幫助才能生存或生活。","options":["independent","dependent","responsible","capable"],"sentence":"Young children are naturally ______ on their parents for food, shelter, and emotional support. As they grow older, they gradually learn to become more independent.","translation":"幼小的孩子自然上依賴父母提供食物、住所和情感支持。隨著年齡增長，他們逐漸學會變得更加獨立。","word":"dependent"}},"depict":{"createdAt":1781451343289,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"描繪是指通過藝術、文字或其他方式生動地表現或展示某物，使其清晰可見。","options":["ignore","depict","conceal","erase"],"sentence":"The artist used bold colors and dramatic brushstrokes to ______ the emotions of grief and loss in her painting. Viewers immediately recognized the sadness and despair expressed through the artwork.","translation":"藝術家用大膽的色彩和戲劇性的筆觸在她的畫作中描繪悲傷和失去的情感。觀眾立即認出通過藝術品表達的悲傷和絕望。","word":"depict"}},"deplete":{"createdAt":1781395310167,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"deplete 表示大量減少或耗盡資源，使其變得稀少。","options":["increase","replenish","deplete","multiply"],"sentence":"Excessive fishing has begun to ______ the ocean's fish populations at an alarming rate. Scientists warn that if this continues, many species may disappear entirely within decades.","translation":"過度捕撈已開始以驚人的速度耗盡海洋的魚類資源。科學家警告，如果這種情況繼續下去，許多物種可能在幾十年內完全消失。","word":"deplete"}},"deploy":{"createdAt":1781624534656,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"deploy 意為「部署、展開、有效運用」，表示策略性地安排或利用某事物達到特定目標。","options":["abandon","deploy","criticize","ignore"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ its new marketing strategy across all social media platforms. This comprehensive approach helped them reach more customers than ever before.","translation":"該公司決定在所有社交媒體平台上部署其新的行銷策略。這種全面的方法幫助他們達到了前所未有的客戶數量。","word":"deploy"}},"deport":{"createdAt":1784773941951,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"deport 是指將某人強制驅逐出一個國家或地區，通常是由政府當局執行的正式行動。","options":["welcome","deport","promote","interview"],"sentence":"The government decided to ______ the illegal immigrant back to his home country. The official paperwork for his removal was processed within two weeks.","translation":"政府決定將非法移民驅逐出境回到他的祖國。他的遣返官方文件在兩週內處理完成。","word":"deport"}},"deportation":{"createdAt":1784773941959,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"deportation 是指政府當局強制將非公民或非法移民驅逐出境的法律程序和行為。","options":["promotion","deportation","vacation","celebration"],"sentence":"The immigrant faced ______ after overstaying his visa for three years. Legal proceedings were initiated by immigration authorities to remove him from the country.","translation":"該移民因居留簽證超期三年而面臨驅逐出境。移民當局啟動了法律程序將他從該國移除。","word":"deportation"}},"deposit":{"createdAt":1781395310163,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"deposit 作為名詞表示存入銀行的錢款或作為動詞表示將錢存入銀行。","options":["withdrawal","deposit","loan","mortgage"],"sentence":"She made a ______ at the bank to save money for her future. The teller accepted her $500 payment and credited it to her savings account.","translation":"她在銀行進行存款以為未來儲蓄。出納員接受了她的500美元付款並將其計入她的儲蓄賬戶。","word":"deposit"}},"depress":{"createdAt":1782009504013,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"使沮喪或壓低是指使某人的情緒、士氣或經濟狀況變差，造成消極或負面的心理或經濟影響。","options":["excite","energize","depress","inspire"],"sentence":"The gloomy weather and endless rain began to ______ everyone's mood in the office. By Friday, the entire team seemed lethargic and unmotivated to complete their projects.","translation":"陰沉的天氣和持續的雨開始______辦公室裡每個人的情緒。到了星期五，整個團隊似乎都沒有精力，也沒有動力完成他們的項目。","word":"depress"}},"depressed":{"createdAt":1782001211011,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"depressed 是形容詞，表示感到沮喪、悲傷或情緒低落的狀態。","options":["excited","depressed","motivated","confident"],"sentence":"After failing the exam, he felt ______ and didn't want to socialize with his friends. His mood improved only when he started preparing a study plan with his parents.","translation":"考試不及格後，他感到沮喪，不想和朋友交往。只有當他開始和父母制定學習計畫時，他的情緒才改善。","word":"depressed"}},"depressing":{"createdAt":1781967668681,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"depressing 指壓抑的或令人沮喪的，用來描述使人心情低落的事物或情況。","options":["bad","depressing","cold","wet"],"sentence":"The ______ weather made everyone feel gloomy and unmotivated throughout the day. The gray skies and constant drizzle seemed to drain all energy from the city.","translation":"整天壓抑的天氣使每個人都感到沮喪和沒有動力。灰色的天空和持續的細雨似乎耗盡了這座城市的所有活力。","word":"depressing"}},"depression":{"createdAt":1781283344048,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"depression意為心理沮喪或精神疾病（憂鬱症）；與「處方藥物」和「心理治療」搭配，表示需要醫療介入的精神狀況。","options":["anxiety","depression","stress","tiredness"],"sentence":"Sarah has been suffering from ______ for over a year and finds it difficult to enjoy activities she once loved. Her therapist has prescribed medication and recommended regular counseling sessions.","translation":"莎拉一年多來一直遭受抑鬱症的困擾，發現很難享受她曾經喜愛的活動。她的治療師開了藥物處方並建議定期諮詢。","word":"depression"}},"deprive":{"createdAt":1784596920830,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"deprive 意為「剝奪；奪走」，通常與 of 搭配，表示強行奪取他人本有的東西或權利。","options":["provide","deprive","describe","improve"],"sentence":"The harsh government policies would ______ citizens of their basic freedoms and rights. Without access to education, healthcare, or fair wages, families lost everything they needed to survive.","translation":"嚴苛的政府政策將剝奪公民的基本自由和權利。沒有教育、醫療或公平工資的途徑，家庭失去了生存所需的一切。","word":"deprive"}},"deprived":{"createdAt":1781624534647,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"deprived 意為「被剝奪的、缺乏的」，表示某人或某地區缺少基本的或必要的東西。","options":["proud","deprived","surprised","concerned"],"sentence":"Many children in that region are ______ of proper education and nutrition. The government's failure to invest in schools has left them far behind their peers in developed areas.","translation":"該地區的許多兒童缺乏適當的教育和營養。政府未能投資學校，導致他們遠遠落後於發達地區的同齡人。","word":"deprived"}},"deputy":{"createdAt":1782646755358,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"deputy 指的是正式的副職或代理人，具有官方權力和職責，特別是在市長等高級職位中作為代理。","options":["secretary","deputy","advisor","assistant"],"sentence":"When the mayor was ill, his ______ took over all administrative duties. The assistant had been trained for years to handle this exact responsibility.","translation":"當市長生病時，他的副手接管了所有行政職務。這位助理多年來一直在為處理這項確切的責任做準備。","word":"deputy"}},"derive":{"createdAt":1781362281655,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"derive表示源自或得自某處，指事物的起源或來源。","options":["create","derive","invent","form"],"sentence":"The word 'democracy' is ______ from Greek words meaning 'people' and 'rule'. Scholars trace its origins back to ancient Greece.","translation":"'民主'這個詞源自希臘語，意思是'人民'和'統治'。學者將其起源追溯到古希臘。","word":"derive"}},"derived":{"createdAt":1782084127073,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"derived 作為形容詞或過去分詞表示來源於或由某事物產生，通常用來説明詞彙、概念或物品的起源。","options":["forgotten","recent","derived","simple"],"sentence":"The word 'bicycle' is ______ from two Greek roots meaning 'two' and 'wheel'. Linguists can trace its origins back to ancient languages.","translation":"單詞「bicycle」衍生自兩個希臘語根，分別表示「兩個」和「輪子」。語言學家可以將其起源追溯到古代語言。","word":"derived"}},"descend":{"createdAt":1785120508393,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"descend是指從高處向低處移動或走下來，與climb（上升）的方向相反。","options":["climb","descend","hike","explore"],"sentence":"The mountain climbers began to ______ the steep slope as the sun set in the evening. They carefully made their way down the trail to reach the base camp before dark.","translation":"當太陽在傍晚落下時，登山者開始下降陡峭的山坡。他們小心地沿著小徑走下來，在天黑前到達大本營。","word":"descend"}},"descent":{"createdAt":1781698273256,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"descent 是名詞，表示「下降」或「下落」的動作，特別是指高度或位置的降低。","options":["ascent","descent","turbulence","takeoff"],"sentence":"The plane's ______ toward the runway was smooth and controlled. The pilots gradually lowered the altitude over several minutes until we touched down safely.","translation":"飛機向跑道的下降是平穩和受控的。飛行員在幾分鐘內逐漸降低高度，直到我們安全著陸。","word":"descent"}},"describe":{"createdAt":1782001211007,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"describe 意思是用言語或文字詳細說明或描繪某物的特徵。","options":["ignore","describe","identify","forget"],"sentence":"The witness was asked to ______ the appearance of the man who stole her purse. She provided detailed information about his height, clothing, and distinctive tattoo on his arm.","translation":"證人被要求描述偷她錢包的男人的外貌。她提供了關於他的身高、衣著和手臂上明顯刺青的詳細資訊。","word":"describe"}},"description":{"createdAt":1781967668676,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"description 指詳細的描述或刻畫，用來說明事物的特徵和外觀。","options":["identification","report","description","announcement"],"sentence":"The ______ of the missing dog was broadcast on all local news channels. The announcer mentioned its brown spots, white collar, and distinctive bark.","translation":"失蹤狗的描寫在所有當地新聞頻道上播放。播報員提到了它的棕色斑點、白色項圈和獨特的吠聲。","word":"description"}},"descriptive":{"createdAt":1783262026081,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"descriptive 作為形容詞表示「描寫的、描述性的」，指用詳細的描述來說明或刻畫某事物。","options":["brief","descriptive","vague","minimal"],"sentence":"The author wrote a ______ passage about the sunset, using vivid language to paint the scene. Readers could clearly visualize the orange and purple hues reflecting across the ocean waves.","translation":"作者寫了一段描寫性的日落段落，使用生動的語言來描繪場景。讀者可以清楚地想像橘色和紫色的色調映照在海浪上。","word":"descriptive"}},"desert":{"createdAt":1783945686782,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"desert 作為名詞表示乾旱少雨的沙漠地區，特別是指撒哈拉這樣的大型沙漠。","options":["ocean","forest","desert","valley"],"sentence":"The Sahara is one of the largest ______ in the world, covering vast areas of northern Africa. Temperatures there can exceed 50 degrees Celsius during the day.","translation":"撒哈拉是世界上最大的沙漠之一，覆蓋了非洲北部的廣大地區。那裡白天的溫度可以超過50攝氏度。","word":"desert"}},"deserted":{"createdAt":1783346573166,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"deserted 意為荒涼的或無人住的，描述一個地方因為人煙稀少而顯得空蕩蕩。","options":["crowded","populated","deserted","bustling"],"sentence":"The once-thriving beach town had become ______ after the hurricane destroyed most of the buildings. Not a single person was visible on the streets for miles around.","translation":"這個曾經繁華的海灘城鎮在颶風摧毀大部分建築後變得荒涼。方圓數英里的街道上沒有看到一個人。","word":"deserted"}},"deserve":{"createdAt":1781431278558,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"deserve表示因為某些品質或行為而應該得到某物或應該受到某種待遇。","options":["deserve","require","avoid","expect"],"sentence":"After working so hard on the project for three months, she truly ______ a promotion. Her manager recognized her dedication and effort by giving her the leadership role she earned.","translation":"在這個項目上努力工作三個月後，她真的應該獲得晉升。她的經理通過給予她贏得的領導職位來認可她的奉獻和努力。","word":"deserve"}},"desirable":{"createdAt":1781283344051,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"desirable意為渴望獲得的、令人想要的；與「願意支付更高房租」搭配，表示高度受歡迎和珍視的特性。","options":["rare","desirable","problematic","unavailable"],"sentence":"Living near public transportation is a ______ feature for many urban professionals. Those who commute daily are willing to pay higher rent for this convenience.","translation":"住在公共交通附近對許多都市專業人士來說是一個渴望獲得的特點。每天通勤的人願意為這種便利支付更高的房租。","word":"desirable"}},"desire":{"createdAt":1782001211008,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"desire 可作名詞或動詞，表示強烈的渴望或慾望。","options":["fear","desire","regret","doubt"],"sentence":"She had a strong ______ to travel around the world and experience different cultures. This dream had motivated her to save money and plan her journey for many years.","translation":"她強烈渴望環遊世界並體驗不同的文化。這個夢想促使她多年來一直在存錢和計畫旅程。","word":"desire"}},"despair":{"createdAt":1782408103435,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"despair 表示失望和絕望的情感狀態，指失去希望和信心。","options":["hope","despair","confusion","excitement"],"sentence":"After losing the championship game in the final seconds, the athlete sank into ______ and considered quitting the sport entirely. His coach had to remind him that one loss does not define an entire career.","translation":"在最後幾秒輸掉冠軍賽後，運動員陷入絕望，考慮徹底放棄這項運動。他的教練必須提醒他，一次失敗並不能定義整個職業生涯。","word":"despair"}},"desperate":{"createdAt":1781583174626,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"desperate意指極度絕望或急切，通常伴隨著無奈和被迫做出極端決定的情況","options":["curious","desperate","uncertain","thoughtful"],"sentence":"After losing his job, Tom felt ______ about his financial situation. He hadn't slept in days and was considering taking any work available, no matter how unsuitable.","translation":"失去工作後，湯姆對自己的財務狀況感到____。他已經好幾天沒有睡眠，正在考慮接受任何工作，無論多麼不適合。","word":"desperate"}},"desperation":{"createdAt":1781967668677,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"desperation 指絕望和孤注一擲的心態，用於描述被迫採取極端行動的情況。","options":["anger","desperation","determination","exhaustion"],"sentence":"In ______, the trapped miners dug through the rubble with their bare hands. This extreme situation forced them to take dangerous risks they would never normally attempt.","translation":"在拚命之下，被困的礦工用赤手空拳挖掘廢墟。這種極端情況迫使他們冒他們通常不會嘗試的危險。","word":"desperation"}},"despise":{"createdAt":1781967668679,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"despise 指強烈鄙視或看不起，表示極度的不尊重。","options":["distrust","despise","avoid","dislike"],"sentence":"He ______ people who lie and cheat others for personal gain. His strong moral principles made him look down upon such dishonest behavior.","translation":"他鄙視那些為了個人利益而欺騙他人的人。他堅強的道德原則使他看不起這種不誠實的行為。","word":"despise"}},"despite":{"createdAt":1781850347304,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"儘管是前置詞，表示雖然有某種困難或不利條件，但某事仍然發生。","options":["Because of","Unlike","Since","Despite"],"sentence":"______ the heavy rain and strong winds, the outdoor concert continued as scheduled. The audience stayed in their seats with umbrellas and enjoyed the entire performance.","translation":"儘管下著大雨和刮著強風，戶外音樂會仍按計劃繼續進行。觀眾帶著雨傘坐在座位上，享受了整場表演。","word":"despite"}},"destination":{"createdAt":1782001211010,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"destination 意思是旅程的終點或目標地點。","options":["journey","destination","vehicle","route"],"sentence":"After driving for eight hours, we finally arrived at our ______ and checked into the hotel. The mountain resort was even more beautiful than the travel guide had promised.","translation":"開了八小時的車後，我們終於抵達了目的地並入住飯店。這個山區度假村比旅遊指南承諾的還要美麗。","word":"destination"}},"destine":{"createdAt":1784548725382,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"destine表示命定或注定，指某事物已被預定或命運安排好，通常帶有必然性的含義。","options":["destine","prevent","discourage","allow"],"sentence":"Many believed that this young athlete was ______ to become an Olympic champion. Her exceptional talent and unwavering determination from childhood made this outcome seem inevitable.","translation":"許多人認為這位年輕運動員注定會成為奧運冠軍。她從小就展現的非凡天賦和堅定決心使這個結果似乎是必然的。","word":"destine"}},"destined":{"createdAt":1781967668680,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"destined 指特定目的或命中註定，用來說明預定的方向或終點。","options":["headed","destined","sailing","traveling"],"sentence":"The ship was ______ for North America when it suddenly encountered a terrible storm. The voyage had been planned months in advance with a specific arrival date.","translation":"這艘船前往北美時突然遭遇了可怕的風暴。這次航程已經提前幾個月計劃，有具體的到達日期。","word":"destined"}},"destiny":{"createdAt":1781693281408,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"destiny（命運）指的是被認為是預先決定或注定的未來事件，經常與宿命論的概念相關聯。","options":["choice","destiny","accident","reward"],"sentence":"Many people believe that their ______ is predetermined by fate. However, modern psychology suggests that our choices and actions shape our future more than any cosmic force.","translation":"許多人相信他們的命運是由命運預先決定的。然而，現代心理學表明我們的選擇和行動比任何宇宙力量更能塑造我們的未來。","word":"destiny"}},"destroy":{"createdAt":1782001211011,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"destroy 意思是完全破壞或毀壞某物。","options":["build","destroy","repair","renovate"],"sentence":"The hurricane ______ many buildings and roads in the coastal town last month. Reconstruction efforts are still ongoing to restore the damaged infrastructure and homes.","translation":"上月颶風摧毀了沿海城鎮的許多建築物和道路。重建工作仍在進行中，以恢復受損的基礎設施和房屋。","word":"destroy"}},"destruction":{"createdAt":1781345564013,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"destruction 是指大規模的破壞或毀滅，常用來描述戰爭、自然災害或重大災難造成的損害。","options":["creation","destruction","construction","production"],"sentence":"The hurricane caused massive ______ to the coastal city. Buildings were flattened, roads were torn apart, and thousands of people lost their homes.","translation":"颶風對沿海城市造成了大規模的毀滅。建築物被夷為平地，道路被摧毀，數千人失去了家園。","word":"destruction"}},"destructive":{"createdAt":1785423269710,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"destructive 是形容詞，意思是有破壞性的或有害的，用來描述造成嚴重損害或傷害的事物或行為。","options":["helpful","destructive","beautiful","creative"],"sentence":"The hurricane's ______ impact left thousands of homes in ruins and entire communities devastated. The local government declared it a natural disaster that would take years to recover from.","translation":"颶風的破壞性影響使數千棟房屋毀於一旦，整個社區被摧毀。當地政府宣布這是一場自然災害，需要多年才能恢復。","word":"destructive"}},"detach":{"createdAt":1781967668672,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"detach 意指將某物分離或拆開，通常用於分離連接的物體。","options":["disconnect","detach","remove","extract"],"sentence":"You need to ______ the USB cable from the computer before moving it. The technician carefully separated the connector without damaging the port.","translation":"你需要從電腦上拆掉USB電纜才能移動它。技術人員小心地分離連接器而不損壞接口。","word":"detach"}},"detail":{"createdAt":1781429810250,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"detail是指事物的細微部分或具體的項目，強調精確和全面的信息。","options":["symbol","detail","objection","square"],"sentence":"The artist paid careful attention to every ______ in the painting, from the texture of the fabric to the expression in the eyes. Without these small elements, the work would lack its remarkable realism.","translation":"藝術家對繪畫中的每個細節都仔細關注，從布料的質地到眼睛的表情。沒有這些小元素，這件作品將缺乏其出色的現實感。","word":"detail"}},"detain":{"createdAt":1782001211002,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"detain 意思是暫時拘留或扣留某人，通常是出於調查或程序需要。","options":["release","detain","interview","arrest"],"sentence":"The police had to ______ the suspect for questioning about the robbery. They kept him at the station for several hours before releasing him without charges.","translation":"警察必須將嫌疑人留下來接受關於搶劫案的詢問。他們將他關在警察局幾個小時後才釋放他，沒有提出控罪。","word":"detain"}},"detect":{"createdAt":1781395310165,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"detect 表示發現、察覺到原本未被發現的事物，通常指通過工具或感官識別。","options":["ignore","detect","welcome","announce"],"sentence":"The security system failed to ______ the intruder until he was already inside the building. The alarm should have alerted guards the moment someone attempted to enter.","translation":"安全系統未能在入侵者進入建築物時發現他。警報應該在有人試圖進入的那一刻提醒警衛。","word":"detect"}},"detective":{"createdAt":1781274482547,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"detective指從事調查犯罪案件的執法人員，必須蒐集證據並破案。","options":["actor","detective","reporter","teacher"],"sentence":"The ______ spent months investigating the mysterious disappearance. She gathered evidence, interviewed witnesses, and finally solved the case.","translation":"那位偵探花了數月時間調查神秘失蹤案。她蒐集證據、詢問證人，最終破案了。","word":"detective"}},"detention":{"createdAt":1783698190757,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"detention是指被扣留或被迫在某個地方停留作為懲罰，通常用於學校環境中的處分。","options":["promotion","detention","graduation","suspension"],"sentence":"The student received ______ after school for breaking the classroom rules. The principal explained that he would have to stay in the office for two hours as punishment.","translation":"那個學生因為違反課堂規則而被罰在學校放學後留堂。校長解釋說他必須在辦公室呆兩個小時作為懲罰。","word":"detention"}},"detergent":{"createdAt":1782001211009,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"detergent 是一種清潔劑，通常用於洗衣或清潔家居。","options":["soap","detergent","perfume","shampoo"],"sentence":"I need to buy some ______ to wash these dirty clothes stained with mud. The product aisle in the supermarket has many brands available for different types of fabrics.","translation":"我需要買一些洗衣液來洗這些沾有泥土的髒衣服。超市的日用品走廊有很多適合不同布料的品牌。","word":"detergent"}},"deterioration":{"createdAt":1786416115761,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"deterioration指事物品質、狀況或價值逐漸衰退或惡化的過程，通常帶有負面含義。","options":["deterioration","celebration","preparation","acceleration"],"sentence":"The ______ of the old building's foundation became impossible to ignore when cracks appeared in the walls. Engineers warned that without immediate repairs, the structural damage would spread rapidly.","translation":"當牆上出現裂縫時，這座舊建築地基的惡化變得無法忽視。工程師警告說，如果不立即修復，結構性破壞會迅速蔓延。","word":"deterioration"}},"determination":{"createdAt":1781626081097,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"determination 表示為了達成目標而堅持不懈的意志力和決心，常用於描述面對困難時不放棄的精神。","options":["confusion","determination","laziness","uncertainty"],"sentence":"She showed great ______ in pursuing her dream despite countless failures. Her unwavering commitment never wavered, even when others doubted her abilities.","translation":"儘管失敗無數次，她在追求夢想時展現了很大的堅定決心。她堅定不移的承諾從未動搖，即使其他人懷疑她的能力。","word":"determination"}},"determine":{"createdAt":1782001211013,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"determine 意思是做出決定或確定某事的結果。","options":["ignore","determine","suggest","wonder"],"sentence":"The jury had to ______ whether the defendant was guilty or innocent based on the evidence presented. Their verdict would significantly impact the future of the accused person.","translation":"陪審團必須根據呈交的證據確定被告是有罪還是無罪。他們的判決將對被告人的未來產生重大影響。","word":"determine"}},"determined":{"createdAt":1782009504013,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"下定決心的意思是有堅強的意志和決心去達成某個目標，不會輕易放棄或改變主意。","options":["hesitant","uncertain","determined","confused"],"sentence":"He was ______ to finish his degree despite working full-time and raising three children. His unwavering commitment to his goal inspired everyone around him to pursue their own dreams.","translation":"儘管要全職工作並撫養三個孩子，他仍下定決心完成學位。他堅定不移的承諾激勵了他周圍的每個人去追求自己的夢想。","word":"determined"}},"devastate":{"createdAt":1781967668681,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"devastate 指造成大規模破壞或蹂躪，表示極其嚴重的損害。","options":["damage","devastate","affect","impact"],"sentence":"The powerful hurricane will ______ the coastal regions if it makes landfall. The destructive winds and storm surge could destroy entire communities and cause massive damage.","translation":"如果強颶風登陸，它將摧毀沿海地區。破壞性的風和風暴潮可能會摧毀整個社區並造成巨大破壞。","word":"devastate"}},"devastated":{"createdAt":1781842419968,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"devastated形容極度悲傷、沮喪或遭受嚴重打擊的狀態；通常表示情感上的深度創傷而非輕微失望。","options":["disappointed","devastated","frustrated","annoyed"],"sentence":"She felt completely ______ when she learned that her beloved pet had passed away. The loss was so profound that she couldn't stop crying for days.","translation":"當她得知她心愛的寵物去世時，她感到完全摧毀。這個損失是如此深刻，以至於她好幾天都停不下來哭泣。","word":"devastated"}},"develop":{"createdAt":1781395310168,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"develop 表示逐步創造、改進或使某事物成長並達到成熟的狀態。","options":["destroy","abandon","develop","ignore"],"sentence":"The startup spent two years to ______ a revolutionary new smartphone application. The finished product received excellent reviews from technology critics and millions of downloads.","translation":"該初創公司花費兩年時間開發了一種革命性的新智慧手機應用程式。完成的產品獲得了科技評論家的好評和數百萬次下載。","word":"develop"}},"developing":{"createdAt":1781967668680,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"developing 指開發中的或發展中的，用於描述正在進步但尚未完全發達的國家或地區。","options":["poor","developing","struggling","emerging"],"sentence":"Many ______ countries are working hard to improve their infrastructure and education systems. These nations are gradually building modern facilities to support economic growth.","translation":"許多開發中的國家正在努力改善他們的基礎設施和教育系統。這些國家正在逐漸建設現代設施以支持經濟增長。","word":"developing"}},"development":{"createdAt":1782001211014,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"development 意思是逐步增進或改進的過程，通常指進步或成長。","options":["decline","development","regression","stagnation"],"sentence":"The ______ of artificial intelligence has changed how we live and work in recent years. Companies are investing billions of dollars into research and new technologies in this rapidly growing field.","translation":"人工智能的發展在近年來改變了我們的生活和工作方式。公司正在向這個快速增長領域的研究和新技術投入數十億美元。","word":"development"}},"device":{"createdAt":1783228210816,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"device 指的是具體的物理工具或機械裝置，尤其是在第二句提到的可穿戴設備，這是一個實際的硬體工具。","options":["method","device","technique","strategy"],"sentence":"She used a ______ to monitor her daily steps and heart rate throughout the day. The small wearable gadget synced automatically with her smartphone to track her fitness progress.","translation":"她用一個裝置全天監測她的日常步數和心率。這個小型可穿戴設備會自動與她的智慧手機同步，以追蹤她的健身進度。","word":"device"}},"devise":{"createdAt":1781424363982,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"devise 表示通過計畫和思考來創造或設計某個方案或方法，強調創意和設計的過程。","options":["execute","discover","devise","demand"],"sentence":"The engineers had to ______ a new plan to solve the bridge construction problem that appeared last week. After brainstorming for hours, they finally created a solution that satisfied all the safety requirements.","translation":"工程師們必須想出一個新計畫來解決上週出現的橋樑建築問題。經過數小時的腦力激盪後，他們終於創造出滿足所有安全要求的解決方案。","word":"devise"}},"devote":{"createdAt":1781484415228,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"devote意指將時間、精力或生命全力投入於某項事業或目標，表示真摯的承諾。","options":["waste","spend","devote","lose"],"sentence":"She decided to ______ her life to helping disadvantaged children in her community. For the next twenty years, she worked tirelessly at the local orphanage without expecting any reward.","translation":"她決定將她的人生奉獻給幫助社區中的弱勢兒童。在接下來的二十年裡，她在當地孤兒院不知疲倦地工作，沒有期待任何回報。","word":"devote"}},"devoted":{"createdAt":1782001211010,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"devoted 是形容詞，意思是全心投入或獻身於某事或某人。","options":["lazy","devoted","careless","hostile"],"sentence":"She was a ______ teacher who stayed late every day to help struggling students with their homework. Her commitment to her students' success never wavered despite the long hours and low salary.","translation":"她是一位獻身教育的老師，每天都待到很晚幫助學習困難的學生做功課。儘管工作時間長且薪酬低，她對學生成功的承諾從未動搖。","word":"devoted"}},"devotion":{"createdAt":1781967668678,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"devotion 指對某事或某人的深愛和奉獻，表示全身心投入。","options":["commitment","devotion","passion","interest"],"sentence":"Her ______ to charitable work has earned her numerous awards and recognition. For over thirty years, she has selflessly dedicated every moment to helping the poor.","translation":"她對慈善工作的奉獻獲得了許多獎項和認可。三十多年來，她一直無私地奉獻每一刻來幫助窮人。","word":"devotion"}},"devour":{"createdAt":1784173464330,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"devour 指貪婪地吞食或被完全摧毀消耗，可用於食物、火焰或抽象概念。","options":["damage","devour","inspect","protect"],"sentence":"The flames began to ______ the wooden structures of the old barn. Within minutes, the entire building was consumed by the rapidly spreading fire.","translation":"火焰開始吞噬這座舊穀倉的木製結構。幾分鐘內，整座建築被迅速蔓延的火焰吞沒。","word":"devour"}},"diabetes":{"createdAt":1781967668682,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"diabetes 指糖尿病，一種影響血糖調節的代謝疾病，需要長期管理和治療。","options":["obesity","diabetes","hypertension","arthritis"],"sentence":"His uncle was diagnosed with ______ last year and has since changed his diet significantly. The doctor prescribed daily insulin injections to manage his blood sugar levels.","translation":"他的叔叔去年被診斷出患有糖尿病，從此改變了他的飲食習慣。醫生開了每日胰島素注射來控制他的血糖水平。","word":"diabetes"}},"diagnose":{"createdAt":1781283344046,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"diagnose意為確定或識別疾病；後面提到「檢查結果後確定」，表示通過檢驗得出診斷結論。","options":["cure","diagnose","prevent","treat"],"sentence":"The doctor ran several tests to ______ the patient's mysterious illness. After examining the blood work and imaging results, she determined it was a thyroid disorder.","translation":"醫生進行了幾項檢查來診斷患者神秘的疾病。檢查血液檢驗和影像檢查結果後，她確定這是甲狀腺疾病。","word":"diagnose"}},"diagnosis":{"createdAt":1782352245069,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"diagnosis指的是醫生通過檢查確定患者患有的疾病或病況。","options":["prognosis","prediction","diagnosis","assumption"],"sentence":"After running several tests, the doctor gave the patient a ______ of Type 2 diabetes. The patient now knows what condition is causing her symptoms.","translation":"進行了多項測試後，醫生給患者做出了第二型糖尿病的診斷。患者現在知道導致其症狀的疾病是什麼。","word":"diagnosis"}},"diagram":{"createdAt":1787411857560,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"diagram 是指用線條和符號繪製的圖表或圖解，用來解釋或說明概念、過程或物體的結構。","options":["equation","narrative","diagram","schedule"],"sentence":"The science teacher drew a ______ on the whiteboard to show how the water cycle works. The labeled illustration with arrows clearly displayed the movement of water through evaporation, condensation, and precipitation.","translation":"科學老師在白板上畫了一個圖表來說明水循環如何運作。這個帶有標籤的插圖用箭頭清楚地展示了水通過蒸發、凝結和降水的移動過程。","word":"diagram"}},"dictate":{"createdAt":1781841742845,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dictate 作動詞表示「命令、規定」，指以權威方式強制執行特定的要求或決定。","options":["suggest","dictate","encourage","permit"],"sentence":"The strict teacher would ______ every detail of how students should complete their assignments. Students had no freedom to choose their own approach.","translation":"這位嚴格的教師會決定學生如何完成作業的每一個細節。學生沒有自由選擇自己方法的權利。","word":"dictate"}},"dictation":{"createdAt":1781967668676,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dictation 指口述或朗讀讓他人筆錄的做法，通常用於語言學習。","options":["lecture","dictation","presentation","speech"],"sentence":"During the English class, the teacher conducted a ______ exercise where students wrote down everything they heard. The students listened carefully and transcribed every word without seeing the text.","translation":"在英文課上，老師進行了一項口述練習，學生們寫下他們聽到的一切。學生們仔細聆聽並抄錄每個字而不看文本。","word":"dictation"}},"dictator":{"createdAt":1784451184442,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dictator 表示「獨斷專行者」或「專權者」，指獨自掌握全部權力且不允許民主或異議的統治者。","options":["judge","dictator","diplomat","delegate"],"sentence":"The ______ refused to allow any opposition parties or free elections in the country. Citizens lived in constant fear of persecution for speaking against the regime.","translation":"獨斷專行者拒絕允許該國存在任何反對黨或自由選舉。公民因言論反對政權而生活在持續的迫害恐懼中。","word":"dictator"}},"dictatorship":{"createdAt":1782001211012,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dictatorship 意思是由獨裁者統治的政體，特點是權力集中和個人自由受限。","options":["democracy","dictatorship","monarchy","republic"],"sentence":"The country lived under a brutal ______ for over thirty years before finally transitioning to democracy. Citizens suffered from severe restrictions on free speech and human rights during this dark period.","translation":"這個國家在獨裁統治下生活了三十多年，最後才過渡到民主制度。在這個黑暗時期，公民遭受了言論自由和人權的嚴重限制。","word":"dictatorship"}},"diesel":{"createdAt":1782009504007,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"柴油是一種石油產品，常用於卡車、公車和發電機等重型機械，燃油效率高且動力強勁。","options":["electric","diesel","hybrid","petrol"],"sentence":"The truck runs on ______ fuel, which is more efficient than gasoline for heavy vehicles. Many long-haul drivers prefer this type of engine because it provides better fuel economy and torque.","translation":"這輛卡車使用______燃料，對於重型車輛來說比汽油更有效率。許多長途司機更喜歡這種引擎，因為它提供更好的燃油經濟性和扭矩。","word":"diesel"}},"differ":{"createdAt":1788959648580,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"differ 意為「相異、不同於」，題目中第二句具體說明兩項研究採用「不同的方法論」強調了它們的差異性。","options":["agree","differ","support","combine"],"sentence":"The two research studies ______ significantly in their methodology and conclusions about climate change. One used statistical analysis while the other relied on observational data collected over decades.","translation":"這兩項研究在其關於氣候變化的方法論和結論上有重大差異。一項使用統計分析，而另一項依賴於數十年收集的觀測數據。","word":"differ"}},"differentiate":{"createdAt":1788959648577,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"differentiate 意為「區分、辨別」，題目中第二句說明需要「仔細觀察以便正確分類」，這正是區分相似物種所需的步驟。","options":["combine","differentiate","ignore","memorize"],"sentence":"It is important to ______ between similar plant species when conducting botanical research. Without careful observation of their leaf structure and flower patterns, scientists cannot classify them correctly.","translation":"在進行植物學研究時，重要的是區分不同的植物物種。如果沒有仔細觀察它們的葉片結構和花卉圖案，科學家無法正確分類。","word":"differentiate"}},"difficult":{"createdAt":1782001211014,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"difficult 是形容詞，表示某事很難做或很難理解。","options":["easy","difficult","simple","clear"],"sentence":"The ______ math problem required multiple steps and advanced knowledge to solve correctly. Even the top students in the class spent over an hour working through all the calculations.","translation":"這道困難的數學題需要多個步驟和進階知識才能正確求解。即使是班上的頂尖學生也花了一個多小時來完成所有計算。","word":"difficult"}},"digest":{"createdAt":1781696018689,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"digest 可作動詞表示消化或理解，指對信息進行深入思考和吸收的過程。","options":["memorize","ignore","digest","skim"],"sentence":"It took the student several weeks to ______ all the complex information from the economics textbook. Only after repeated reading and reflection could she truly understand the key concepts.","translation":"這位學生花了幾週時間才消化經濟學教科書中的所有複雜資訊。只有經過反覆閱讀和思考，她才能真正理解關鍵概念。","word":"digest"}},"digestion":{"createdAt":1781275226788,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"此處digestion指「消化」的過程，特別是食物在胃中的處理","options":["feast","stroke","digestion","dazzle"],"sentence":"After eating a large meal, his ______ was slow and uncomfortable. He felt bloated for hours because his stomach needed more time to process the food.","translation":"吃完一頓大餐後，他的消化很慢且不舒服。他感到腹脹持續數小時，因為他的胃需要更多時間來消化食物。","word":"digestion"}},"dignity":{"createdAt":1781886743286,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Dignity 指的是一個人內在的威嚴和尊嚴，代表自尊心和被尊重的應有權利。","options":["attitude","dignity","character","pride"],"sentence":"The elderly man maintained his ______ despite his difficult circumstances and health challenges. He refused to accept pity from others and insisted on living with respect and self-worth.","translation":"這位老人儘管處境困難和健康挑戰，仍保持著尊嚴。他拒絕接受他人的同情，堅持以尊重和自我價值來生活。","word":"dignity"}},"dike":{"createdAt":1785487324259,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dike是指用來防止水流或洪水的堤壩或防堤結構。","options":["bridge","dike","tunnel","fence"],"sentence":"The government built a massive ______ along the river to prevent flooding during storms. This earthen barrier successfully protected the town from the rushing water.","translation":"政府在河流沿岸建造了一道巨大的堤壩來防止暴雨期間的洪水。這道土堤成功地保護了該鎮免受急流侵襲。","word":"dike"}},"dilemma":{"createdAt":1781515329271,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dilemma 名詞，意思是困境、進退兩難，指必須在兩個或多個不理想的選擇中做出決定的困難處境。","options":["opportunity","dilemma","coincidence","agreement"],"sentence":"She faced a difficult ______ when both job offers required her to relocate to different cities. She had to choose between career advancement and staying close to her family.","translation":"當兩份工作都要求她搬遷到不同城市時，她面臨了一個困難的困境。她必須在職業發展和與家人親近之間做出選擇。","word":"dilemma"}},"diligent":{"createdAt":1781503378962,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"diligent 表示認真、刻苦、細致和持之以恆地從事工作或學習。","options":["lazy","careless","diligent","absent-minded"],"sentence":"The ______ student studied every evening without fail. She completed all her assignments on time and achieved the highest grades in the class.","translation":"這位勤奮的學生每晚都毫不間斷地學習。她按時完成所有作業，並取得班級中最高的成績。","word":"diligent"}},"dim":{"createdAt":1781886743284,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Dim 表示光線暗淡、不夠亮，通常是有意降低照明強度以達到特定效果。","options":["bright","dim","warm","soft"],"sentence":"The ______ light in the restaurant created a romantic atmosphere for couples dining together. The bulbs were deliberately turned down to make the space feel intimate and cozy.","translation":"餐廳裡昏暗的光線為一起用餐的情侶營造了浪漫的氛圍。燈泡被意圖調低亮度，使空間感到親密和舒適。","word":"dim"}},"dimension":{"createdAt":1781794866351,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dimension指尺寸、規模或面積，用來描述物體或空間的測量數據。","options":["colors","dimension","materials","purposes"],"sentence":"The architect had to consider multiple ______ when designing the new building. The length, width, and height all needed to fit within the constraints of the available land.","translation":"建築師在設計新建築時必須考慮多個______。長度、寬度和高度都需要符合可用土地的限制。","word":"dimension"}},"diminish":{"createdAt":1781886743286,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"Diminish 作為動詞，表示逐漸減小或減弱，強調一個漸進的過程而非突然消失。","options":["increase","disappear","diminish","echo"],"sentence":"The sound of the ambulance began to ______ as it drove further away from our location. Within minutes, we could barely hear the siren anymore because it was so far in the distance.","translation":"當救護車駛離我們的位置時，警笛聲開始減弱。幾分鐘內，我們幾乎聽不到警笛了，因為它距離太遠了。","word":"diminish"}},"dimly":{"createdAt":1781758494832,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dimly 用來形容光線微弱或模糊不清，與第二句中「光線非常微弱」相符。","options":["brightly","dimly","loudly","quickly"],"sentence":"The old lamp on the desk shone ______, casting shadows across the room. I could barely read the words on the page because the light was so faint.","translation":"桌子上的舊燈光線昏暗，在房間裡投下陰影。因為光線非常微弱，我幾乎無法讀清頁面上的文字。","word":"dimly"}},"dimple":{"createdAt":1781698273262,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"dimple 是名詞，表示「酒窩」，是皮膚上的小凹陷，通常在笑時變得更明顯。","options":["wrinkle","freckle","dimple","scar"],"sentence":"The baby's sweet smile revealed a tiny ______ on each cheek. These adorable facial features appeared whenever she laughed or grinned.","translation":"嬰兒甜蜜的笑容在每隻臉頰上露出一個小酒窩。每當她笑或咧嘴時，這些可愛的面部特徵就會出現。","word":"dimple"}},"dip":{"createdAt":1781311922070,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dip 表示短暫地將某物浸入液體中，通常是為了檢查或品嚐。","options":["drop","dip","throw","push"],"sentence":"Before eating the hot soup, I decided to ______ my spoon into it to test the temperature. The liquid was too hot, so I waited a few more minutes before starting my meal.","translation":"在吃熱湯之前，我決定把湯匙浸入其中來測試溫度。液體太熱了，所以我等了幾分鐘才開始用餐。","word":"dip"}},"diploma":{"createdAt":1781886743283,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Diploma 是指由教育機構頒發的學位證書，證明學生完成了課程並達到畢業要求。","options":["certificate","diploma","transcript","license"],"sentence":"After four years of studying engineering, Sarah finally received her ______ at graduation. The document certified that she had completed all required coursework and earned her degree.","translation":"在學習工程學四年後，莎拉終於在畢業典禮上獲得了文憑。這份文件證明她已完成所有必修課程並獲得了學位。","word":"diploma"}},"diplomacy":{"createdAt":1781886743285,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Diplomacy 指的是通過談判和協商解決國際事務的藝術和實踐，強調和平和妥協的方式。","options":["strategy","diplomacy","negotiation","protocol"],"sentence":"The two countries resolved their trade dispute through careful ______ rather than military conflict. Government representatives spent months negotiating and making compromises to reach a peaceful agreement.","translation":"兩國通過謹慎的外交而非軍事衝突來解決他們的貿易爭端。政府代表花費數月進行談判和妥協以達成和平協議。","word":"diplomacy"}},"diplomat":{"createdAt":1783491939258,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"diplomat 指從事外交工作、代表國家進行國際談判和關係協調的官員。","options":["soldier","diplomat","merchant","journalist"],"sentence":"The skilled ______ negotiated a peace treaty between the two warring nations for three months. His experience in international relations and his ability to mediate conflicts made him invaluable to both governments.","translation":"這位熟練的外交官在三個月內談判達成了兩個交戰國之間的和平條約。他在國際關係方面的經驗和調解衝突的能力對兩個政府都無比寶貴。","word":"diplomat"}},"diplomatic":{"createdAt":1781886743285,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Diplomatic 是形容詞，用來形容與外交相關的事物，特別是指外交官員和外交事務。","options":["corporate","diplomatic","political","governmental"],"sentence":"The ______ corps at the United Nations includes ambassadors and officials from nearly every country. These representatives work to maintain international relations and resolve disputes between nations.","translation":"聯合國的外交使團包括來自幾乎每個國家的大使和官員。這些代表致力於維護國際關係和解決國家之間的爭端。","word":"diplomatic"}},"direct":{"createdAt":1781564440933,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"direct 作動詞表示管理、指揮，指領導或控制他人的工作和方向。","options":["follow","direct","ignore","abandon"],"sentence":"The manager will ______ the project team to ensure it meets all deadlines and objectives. She will make important decisions and give clear instructions to all members.","translation":"經理將管理項目團隊以確保它達到所有截止日期和目標。她將做出重要決定並向所有成員發出明確指示。","word":"direct"}},"direction":{"createdAt":1781967668675,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"direction 指方向或指導，用來幫助人們知道往哪裡去或該如何做。","options":["location","distance","direction","route"],"sentence":"The GPS provided clear ______ for navigating through the unfamiliar city. Without these step-by-step instructions, we would have been completely lost.","translation":"GPS為在陌生城市中導航提供了明確的指導。沒有這些逐步指示，我們會完全迷路。","word":"direction"}},"directive":{"createdAt":1781967668681,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"directive 指正式的指令或命令，用於下達必須執行的具體要求。","options":["suggestion","directive","memo","notice"],"sentence":"The CEO issued a ______ requiring all employees to attend the mandatory safety training. The formal order outlined specific procedures that everyone must follow immediately.","translation":"首席執行官發布了一項指令，要求所有員工參加強制安全培訓。這個正式命令列出了每個人必須立即遵循的具體程序。","word":"directive"}},"directory":{"createdAt":1781967668677,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"directory 指名錄或簿冊，用來查找特定人物或機構的信息。","options":["database","directory","catalog","index"],"sentence":"I consulted the phone ______ to find the contact information for the local hospital. The book contained alphabetically organized names and phone numbers for thousands of businesses.","translation":"我查閱了電話簿找到當地醫院的聯絡資訊。這本書包含了數千個企業按字母順序組織的名字和電話號碼。","word":"directory"}},"disability":{"createdAt":1782009504012,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"殘疾或殘障是指身體或心智功能的受損，可能影響日常活動，但不代表一個人的能力或價值。","options":["advantage","disability","talent","skill"],"sentence":"She has a hearing ______ that requires her to use a special microphone during meetings. Despite this physical challenge, she has become one of the most successful engineers in her company.","translation":"她有聽力______，在開會時需要使用特殊麥克風。儘管有這個身體上的挑戰，她已成為公司最成功的工程師之一。","word":"disability"}},"disable":{"createdAt":1781848330183,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"disable表示使人喪失能力或行動能力，通常指因傷病或其他原因導致功能受損。","options":["discourage","disable","disappoint","dislike"],"sentence":"The accident was severe enough to ______ him from ever playing professional sports again. The injury left him physically unable to perform at the level he once did.","translation":"這場意外嚴重到使他無法再參加職業體育比賽。這次受傷使他身體上無法以他曾經的水準表現。","word":"disable"}},"disabled":{"createdAt":1781967668679,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"disabled 指使某人失去能力或傷殘，通常指身體或功能上的損害。","options":["injured","disabled","weakened","affected"],"sentence":"The accident ______ him permanently, leaving him unable to walk without assistance. Despite his physical limitations, he maintains a positive attitude and continues his studies.","translation":"這場事故使他永久傷殘，使他無法在沒有協助的情況下行走。儘管身體有限制，他保持積極態度並繼續他的學習。","word":"disabled"}},"disagree":{"createdAt":1781967668679,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"disagree 指意見或看法不一致，用於描述不同的立場或觀點。","options":["discuss","disagree","debate","differ"],"sentence":"My brother and I often ______ about which movie to watch on weekends. This time, he wanted to see an action film while I preferred a romantic comedy.","translation":"我和我的哥哥經常在週末看哪部電影的問題上意見不合。這次他想看動作片，而我更喜歡浪漫喜劇。","word":"disagree"}},"disagreement":{"createdAt":1781967668678,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"disagreement 指意見不合或看法分歧，用於描述兩方持不同立場的情況。","options":["confusion","disagreement","misunderstanding","difficulty"],"sentence":"The board members expressed strong ______ over the new budget proposal. Some wanted to increase spending while others insisted on cutting costs significantly.","translation":"董事會成員對新預算提案表達了強烈的意見不合。有些人想增加支出，而其他人堅持要大幅削減成本。","word":"disagreement"}},"disappear":{"createdAt":1781715397122,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"disappear 意為「消失、不見」，強調事物完全不在視野中或不存在的狀態。","options":["reappear","disappear","escape","hide"],"sentence":"The magician made the rabbit ______ from the locked box in front of thousands of amazed spectators. When the audience opened the box after the trick was over, there was nothing inside.","translation":"魔術師在數千名驚訝的觀眾面前讓兔子從上鎖的盒子裡消失。當魔術結束後觀眾打開盒子時，裡面什麼都沒有。","word":"disappear"}},"disappearance":{"createdAt":1781429810254,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"disappearance是指某人或某物突然消失或不見蹤影的狀態。","options":["temperature","disappearance","detail","firecracker"],"sentence":"The ______ of the ship in the ocean remains a mystery to this day, with no wreckage or survivors ever found. Investigators have spent decades trying to understand what happened.","translation":"這艘船在海洋中的消失至今仍然是一個謎，沒有發現任何殘骸或倖存者。調查人員已經花費了數十年試圖理解發生了什麼。","word":"disappearance"}},"disappoint":{"createdAt":1782009504014,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"使失望是指未能滿足某人的期望或希望，造成他人感到沮喪或受挫折。","options":["delight","satisfy","disappoint","impress"],"sentence":"The restaurant's poor service and cold food would ______ even the most patient customer. We had looked forward to celebrating our anniversary there for weeks, but we left feeling upset and regretful.","translation":"餐廳的服務不周和冷食物會______甚至最有耐心的顧客。我們期盼了幾周要在那裡慶祝周年紀念，但我們失望和後悔地離開了。","word":"disappoint"}},"disappointed":{"createdAt":1781693538704,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"disappointed 表示感到失望、沮喪或對某事未能如預期而感到難受。","options":["thrilled","relieved","disappointed","excited"],"sentence":"The team was ______ after losing the championship game in the final seconds. They had trained for months and believed they could win.","translation":"球隊在最後幾秒鐘輸掉冠軍賽後感到失望。他們訓練了好幾個月，相信他們能贏。","word":"disappointed"}},"disappointment":{"createdAt":1781967668681,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"disappointment 指失望或掃興，用於描述期望未能實現時的負面情緒。","options":["sadness","disappointment","sorrow","regret"],"sentence":"She felt great ______ when her favorite team lost the championship game in overtime. The bitter result after such a hard-fought season left her heartbroken.","translation":"當她最喜歡的隊伍在加時賽中輸掉了冠軍賽時，她感到極大的失望。經過如此艱苦的賽季後，這個苦澀的結果使她心碎。","word":"disappointment"}},"disapprove":{"createdAt":1781835517793,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"disapprove 意為反對或不贊成某事，通常表示對他人行為的負面態度。","options":["approve","disapprove","ignore","understand"],"sentence":"The parents strongly ______ of their son's decision to quit university. They expressed their objection at the family dinner last night.","translation":"這對父母強烈反對他們兒子退學的決定。他們在昨晚的家庭晚餐上表達了他們的反對意見。","word":"disapprove"}},"disaster":{"createdAt":1781451343288,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"災難是指突發的不幸事件，通常造成重大破壞、傷害或損失，需要緊急救援。","options":["blessing","disaster","festival","opportunity"],"sentence":"The hurricane was a terrible ______ that destroyed thousands of homes and displaced many families. The government declared a state of emergency and sent relief supplies to the affected region.","translation":"颶風是一場可怕的災難，摧毀了數千棟房屋並使許多家庭流離失所。政府宣布進入緊急狀態，並向受災地區派遣了救援物資。","word":"disaster"}},"disastrous":{"createdAt":1782009504011,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"災難性的意思是非常糟糕、造成嚴重負面後果的，通常用來形容計畫、事件或決定的失敗結果。","options":["successful","disastrous","neutral","profitable"],"sentence":"The company's marketing campaign was ______ and caused significant financial losses. The CEO apologized publicly after the strategy failed to reach any of its intended goals.","translation":"該公司的行銷活動是______性的，造成了重大的財務損失。該執行長在策略未能達成任何既定目標後公開道歉。","word":"disastrous"}},"discard":{"createdAt":1781835517791,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"discard 意為拋棄或丟掉某物，通常是因為它不再有用或不需要了。","options":["collect","discard","organize","display"],"sentence":"After the game ended, the player decided to ______ all the broken cards from his collection. He threw them into the trash bin because they were no longer usable.","translation":"遊戲結束後，這位玩家決定拋棄他收藏中所有破損的卡片。他把它們扔進垃圾桶，因為它們已經無法使用了。","word":"discard"}},"discharge":{"createdAt":1781798927511,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"discharge 在醫療語境中表示允許病人離開醫院或出院。","options":["admit","discharge","transfer","examine"],"sentence":"The hospital decided to ______ the patient after a successful surgery. The doctor signed the paperwork stating he was fully recovered and no longer needed medical care.","translation":"醫院決定在成功手術後將病人出院。醫生簽署了文件，說明他已完全康復，不再需要醫療照護。","word":"discharge"}},"disciple":{"createdAt":1783255147947,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"disciple 是指跟隨並學習某位導師或宗教領袖教導的學生或信徒，通常表示一種深層的承諾和忠誠。","options":["critic","enemy","disciple","stranger"],"sentence":"Jesus had twelve ______ who followed him and learned his teachings throughout his ministry. These devoted followers spread his message to different parts of the world after his death.","translation":"耶穌有十二位門徒跟隨他，在他的傳教期間學習他的教導。這些忠誠的追隨者在他死後將他的信息傳播到世界各地。","word":"disciple"}},"disciplinary":{"createdAt":1783227361319,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"disciplinary 意指與紀律或懲罰相關的，用來描述針對不當行為的規範或處罰行動。","options":["academic","disciplinary","recreational","financial"],"sentence":"The teacher implemented ______ measures after the students violated the school's conduct code. The principal decided to suspend three students for their serious misconduct.","translation":"老師在學生違反學校行為守則後實施了紀律措施。校長決定因他們的嚴重違規行為而停學三名學生。","word":"disciplinary"}},"discipline":{"createdAt":1783491939254,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"discipline 指系統性的規則和懲罰制度，用來維持秩序和規範行為。","options":["reward","discipline","entertainment","freedom"],"sentence":"The school implemented strict ______ to reduce student misconduct and ensure safety. Teachers recorded every infraction and issued warnings or penalties based on school rules.","translation":"學校實施嚴格的紀律以減少學生不當行為並確保安全。教師記錄每一項違規並根據學校規則發出警告或懲罰。","word":"discipline"}},"disclose":{"createdAt":1783491939255,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"disclose 意為揭露或透露之前隱藏的信息，通常指被迫或官方地公開秘密。","options":["conceal","disclose","fabricate","protect"],"sentence":"The company refused to ______ the names of its major investors to the public. However, when faced with legal pressure, officials were forced to reveal all confidential information.","translation":"該公司拒絕向公眾揭露其主要投資者的姓名。然而，面對法律壓力，官員們被迫披露所有機密資訊。","word":"disclose"}},"disclosure":{"createdAt":1782292020650,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"disclosure指將隱藏、保密的信息公開或揭露，強調打破沉默和公開真相的行為。","options":["concealment","storage","disclosure","rejection"],"sentence":"The government's ______ of classified documents shocked the public. The investigation revealed information that had been kept secret for over twenty years.","translation":"政府揭露機密文件震驚了公眾。調查揭示了保密超過二十年的資訊。","word":"disclosure"}},"discomfort":{"createdAt":1782084127071,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"discomfort 表示身體或心理上的不適感，可作為名詞表示不舒適的狀態。","options":["joy","discomfort","excitement","relief"],"sentence":"The long flight caused him significant ______ as he sat in a cramped seat for eight hours. By the time he landed, his back was aching and his neck was stiff.","translation":"長途飛行讓他在狹窄的座位上坐了八小時，造成了很大的不適。當他著陸時，他的背部疼痛，脖子僵硬。","word":"discomfort"}},"discount":{"createdAt":1781425122880,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"discount 指價格上的減少或優惠，與節省金錢和購物這個脈絡相符。","options":["tournament","exhibition","discount","fiber"],"sentence":"The store is offering a special ______ on all winter clothing this week. Customers can save up to forty percent on their purchases.","translation":"這家店本週對所有冬季服裝提供特別折扣。顧客最多可以節省百分之四十的購物費用。","word":"discount"}},"discourage":{"createdAt":1785813063297,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"discourage意思是使某人感到沮喪或失去信心，通常用於描述消極的影響使人放棄目標或努力。","options":["inspire","discourage","itch","motivate"],"sentence":"The repeated failures began to ______ him from pursuing his dream of becoming an artist. However, he eventually realized that setbacks were just part of the learning process and decided to continue anyway.","translation":"重複的失敗開始使他洩氣，不再追求成為藝術家的夢想。然而，他最終意識到挫折只是學習過程的一部分，並決定繼續下去。","word":"discourage"}},"discouraged":{"createdAt":1784005171686,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"discouraged 意思是感到沮喪或失去勇氣，通常在經歷失敗或挫折後產生，導致人們失去信心或動力。","options":["excited","discouraged","confused","angry"],"sentence":"After failing the exam three times, Maria felt ______ and considered giving up on her studies. Her parents tried to motivate her by reminding her of her past successes, but she had lost all confidence.","translation":"在三次考試失敗後，瑪麗亞感到沮喪，並考慮放棄學業。她的父母試圖提醒她過去的成功來激勵她，但她已經完全失去了信心。","word":"discouraged"}},"discouragement":{"createdAt":1784440086183,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"discouragement是指因失敗或挫折而產生的沮喪感和失去信心的狀態。","options":["determination","discouragement","enthusiasm","motivation"],"sentence":"After failing the exam three times, Maria felt a wave of ______ wash over her and began to question her abilities. However, her teacher's encouraging words helped her regain confidence and try again.","translation":"考試三次失敗後，瑪麗亞感到一陣沮喪襲來，開始質疑自己的能力。然而，她老師的鼓勵話語幫助她重新獲得信心並再試一次。","word":"discouragement"}},"discourse":{"createdAt":1783179143817,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「discourse」指的是雙向或多向的對話與交流，強調參與者之間的互動和交換意見，而非單向的表述。","options":["silence","discourse","monologue","whisper"],"sentence":"The professor engaged in a lengthy ______ with her students about the themes in modern literature. The exchange of ideas lasted over an hour and covered multiple philosophical perspectives.","translation":"教授與她的學生就現代文學的主題進行了長時間的對話。這次思想交流持續了一個多小時，涵蓋了多個哲學觀點。","word":"discourse"}},"discover":{"createdAt":1785600431190,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"discover 是指找到或偵測到之前不為人知的東西，在這裡指科學家透過搜索找到新的物種。","options":["invent","discover","create","imagine"],"sentence":"Scientists hope to ______ new species in the Amazon rainforest. The expedition team has been searching for unknown organisms that have never been documented by researchers before.","translation":"科學家希望在亞馬遜雨林中發現新物種。探險隊一直在尋找從未被研究人員記錄過的未知生物。","word":"discover"}},"discovery":{"createdAt":1781693295124,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"discovery 表示發現新的東西或知識，在此指科學上的新發現。","options":["loss","mistake","discovery","opinion"],"sentence":"The scientist's groundbreaking ______ of a new element changed the field of chemistry forever. Her research team published their findings in the most prestigious scientific journals worldwide.","translation":"這位科學家對新元素的突破性發現永遠改變了化學領域。她的研究團隊在世界上最著名的科學期刊上發表了他們的發現。","word":"discovery"}},"discreet":{"createdAt":1781425024017,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"discreet表示謹慎的、小心的、周密的，強調一個人能夠保守秘密且行為得當。","options":["loud","discreet","talkative","careless"],"sentence":"Maria was a ______ woman who never gossiped about her colleagues' personal lives. She kept all confidences to herself and carefully avoided spreading rumors around the office.","translation":"瑪麗亞是一個謹慎的女人，從不談論她同事的私人生活。她對所有秘密保密，小心避免在辦公室裡散播謠言。","word":"discreet"}},"discriminate":{"createdAt":1781746848182,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"discriminate 在此意為「辨別」或「區別」，表示分辨不同事物之間的差異。","options":["ignore","discriminate","combine","unite"],"sentence":"It's important to ______ between healthy competition and unfair business practices. The key difference lies in whether all competitors have equal opportunities.","translation":"區分健康競爭和不公平的商業行為是很重要的。關鍵區別在於所有競爭者是否都有平等的機會。","word":"discriminate"}},"discrimination":{"createdAt":1781256444519,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"discrimination在此指辨別力或區分能力，用於做出精明和公正的判斷。","options":["bias","discrimination","preference","favoritism"],"sentence":"The selection committee showed excellent ______ in choosing the scholarship winner by carefully evaluating each applicant's academic achievements and personal qualities. Their thoughtful assessment ensured the most deserving student received the award.","translation":"評選委員會在選擇獎學金得主時表現出卓越的辨別力，仔細評估了每位申請人的學術成就和個人素質。他們深思熟慮的評估確保了最值得的學生獲得了獎項。","word":"discrimination"}},"discuss":{"createdAt":1782140283164,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"discuss是動詞，表示就某個主題進行討論、商談或辯論。","options":["ignore","reject","discuss","postpone"],"sentence":"The board members gathered in the conference room to ______ the new business proposal. After two hours of debate, they reached a unanimous agreement.","translation":"董事會成員聚集在會議室討論新的商業提案。經過兩小時的辯論，他們達成了一致同意。","word":"discuss"}},"discussion":{"createdAt":1781651775062,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"discussion 指人們聚在一起交流意見、商談或討論某個主題的過程。","options":["childhood","alternative","discussion","frustrate"],"sentence":"The board held a lengthy ______ about the company's future direction. After hours of exchanging opinions and debating different viewpoints, they finally reached a decision.","translation":"董事會針對公司的未來方向進行了漫長的討論。經過數小時的意見交換和不同觀點的辯論後，他們最終做出了決定。","word":"discussion"}},"disease":{"createdAt":1783946029661,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"disease 是名詞，指影響身體健康的病症或疾病，可以是多種類型的健康問題。","options":["virus","disease","symptom","medicine"],"sentence":"The ______ spread rapidly through the population last winter, affecting thousands of people. Doctors worked hard to develop treatments for this serious infection.","translation":"這種疾病去年冬天在人群中迅速傳播，影響了數千人。醫生努力為這種嚴重感染開發治療方法。","word":"disease"}},"disguise":{"createdAt":1781424363981,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"disguise 指的是為了隱瞞真實身份而穿著或改變外貌的行為或物品，重點在於欺騙他人。","options":["costume","disguise","uniform","decoration"],"sentence":"The spy wore a clever ______ to hide his true identity at the embassy party. Nobody recognized him because he looked completely different with the fake beard and glasses.","translation":"那位間諜穿著巧妙的偽裝來隱瞞他在大使館派對上的真實身份。沒有人認出他，因為他戴著假鬍子和眼鏡看起來完全不同。","word":"disguise"}},"disgust":{"createdAt":1781961466408,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"disgust 表示對某事物感到嫌惡、厭惡或反感，通常導致負面的反應或行動。","options":["curiosity","concern","disgust","surprise"],"sentence":"The health inspector felt a strong sense of ______ when she discovered the unsanitary conditions in the restaurant's kitchen. She immediately closed the establishment and filed a formal complaint with the health department.","translation":"衛生檢查員在發現餐廳廚房的不衛生狀況時感到強烈的厭惡。她立即關閉了該餐廳並向衛生部門提交了正式投訴。","word":"disgust"}},"disgusted":{"createdAt":1782140283161,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"disgusted是形容詞，表示感到厭惡、反感或不適，通常是對令人不快的事物的情緒反應。","options":["happy","interested","disgusted","curious"],"sentence":"He felt ______ when he saw the filthy conditions of the abandoned house. The sight of mold and rats made him feel sick to his stomach.","translation":"當他看到廢棄房屋的骯髒環境時，他感到厭惡。黴菌和老鼠的景象讓他感到噁心。","word":"disgusted"}},"disgusting":{"createdAt":1782140283162,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"disgusting是形容詞，用來描述令人感到厭惡或反感的事物或現象。","options":["delicious","fresh","disgusting","appetizing"],"sentence":"The food left in the refrigerator was absolutely ______ and smelled terrible. We had to throw it away immediately without even tasting it.","translation":"冰箱裡放置的食物絕對令人噁心，聞起來很臭。我們必須立即將其丟掉，甚至沒有嚐一口。","word":"disgusting"}},"dismantle":{"createdAt":1782140283164,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"dismantle是動詞，表示逐步拆卸或拆解某物，通常是將其分解成各個零件。","options":["assemble","build","dismantle","install"],"sentence":"The construction crew had to ______ the old scaffold piece by piece. Each component was carefully removed and stored for future use.","translation":"建築工人必須一件一件地拆解舊的腳手架。每個零件都被小心地移除並儲存以供未來使用。","word":"dismantle"}},"dismay":{"createdAt":1781661288531,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dismay 是指感到失望、沮喪或灰心喪志的情感反應，通常是對於不好消息的負面情感","options":["delight","dismay","surprise","confusion"],"sentence":"To her great ______, Sarah discovered that her flight had been cancelled. She felt devastated and helpless as she stared at the airport departure board showing only red cancellation notices.","translation":"令莎拉極其沮喪的是，她發現她的航班被取消了。當她看著機場出發看板上全是紅色的取消通知時，她感到絕望和無助。","word":"dismay"}},"dismiss":{"createdAt":1782140283166,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"dismiss是動詞，表示解散、遣散或讓某人離開，也可表示開除或不予考慮。","options":["gather","assemble","dismiss","retain"],"sentence":"The principal had to ______ the entire school early due to a severe weather warning. All students were sent home by noon.","translation":"由於嚴重的天氣警報，校長必須提前解散整所學校。所有學生都在中午前被送回家。","word":"dismiss"}},"disorder":{"createdAt":1782140283163,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"disorder表示混亂、雜亂無章或無序的狀態，與秩序相反。","options":["silence","order","disorder","control"],"sentence":"The classroom fell into complete ______ when the teacher left the room. Desks were overturned, papers scattered everywhere, and students were shouting loudly.","translation":"當老師離開教室時，教室陷入了完全的混亂。課桌被翻倒，紙張散落一地，學生大聲喧嘩。","word":"disorder"}},"dispensable":{"createdAt":1781784283026,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"dispensable是形容詞，表示可有可無的、非必需的；句子中強調這些項目可以被移除而不會影響工作效率。","options":["irreplaceable","invaluable","dispensable","critical"],"sentence":"The manager decided that several items in the budget were ______ and could be cut without affecting productivity. Only the essential equipment and personnel would be retained in the restructuring.","translation":"經理決定預算中的幾項是______ 的，可以刪除而不會影響生產力。重組中只會保留必要的設備和人員。","word":"dispensable"}},"dispense":{"createdAt":1782140283165,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"dispense是動詞，表示分發、配給或提供某物，特別是在官方或有組織的方式下。","options":["hide","store","dispense","destroy"],"sentence":"The pharmacist will ______ your medication in the proper dosage. Please take one pill every morning with food.","translation":"藥劑師將按照適當的劑量為您分發藥物。請每天早上隨著食物服用一粒。","word":"dispense"}},"displace":{"createdAt":1782533789132,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"displace 動詞意思是取代或替換，指用新的東西或方法替代原有的。","options":["enhance","displace","improve","support"],"sentence":"The new technology will ______ traditional manufacturing methods in the industry. Within five years, automated systems are expected to take over most production processes.","translation":"新技術將取代業界的傳統製造方法。預計五年內自動化系統將接管大多數生產流程。","word":"displace"}},"displacement":{"createdAt":1782533789136,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"displacement 名詞意思是流離失所或被迫遷移，指人們被迫離開家園和社區。","options":["immigration","displacement","migration","relocation"],"sentence":"The war caused massive ______ of refugees who fled their homes to escape violence. Humanitarian organizations provided emergency aid to millions of people forced to leave their communities.","translation":"戰爭造成了大規模的難民流離失所，他們逃離家園以躲避暴力。人道主義組織為被迫離開社區的數百萬人提供了緊急援助。","word":"displacement"}},"display":{"createdAt":1781449095514,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"display意為展示或展覽，用來表示將某物公開展示或呈現給觀眾。","options":["hide","display","store","discard"],"sentence":"The museum will ______ the ancient artifacts in the new exhibition hall. Visitors will be able to see these historical treasures up close.","translation":"博物館將在新的展覽廳展示這些古代文物。遊客將能夠近距離看到這些歷史寶藏。","word":"display"}},"disposable":{"createdAt":1781283344049,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"disposable意為可拋棄的、用完即丟的；與「減少洗碗時間」和「環境廢棄物問題」搭配，表示一次性使用的產品。","options":["ceramic","disposable","glass","metal"],"sentence":"The restaurant switched to ______ cups to reduce the time spent washing dishes after service. However, this decision raised concerns about environmental waste.","translation":"餐廳改用用完即丟的杯子來減少服務後洗碗的時間。然而，這個決定引起了對環境廢棄物的擔憂。","word":"disposable"}},"disposables":{"createdAt":1781403377827,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"disposables 指的是可以拋棄或一次性使用的物品，通常用於描述餐具、包裝等日常消費品。","options":["permanent dishes","disposables","decorations","supplies"],"sentence":"The restaurant switched to ______ to reduce their environmental impact. They now use paper plates and plastic utensils that can be thrown away after each meal.","translation":"這家餐廳改用一次性用品來減少環境影響。他們現在使用紙盤和塑膠餐具，這些在每頓飯後都可以丟棄。","word":"disposables"}},"disposal":{"createdAt":1781283344053,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"disposal意為處置、處理；與「環保法規」和「安全移除」搭配，表示按照規定處理有害物質的過程。","options":["storage","disposal","production","inventory"],"sentence":"The hazardous waste requires proper ______ according to environmental regulations and safety standards. The company hired a specialized firm to handle the removal process safely.","translation":"根據環保法規和安全標準，危險廢棄物需要妥善處理。公司聘請了一家專業公司來安全地處理移除過程。","word":"disposal"}},"dispose":{"createdAt":1782092862161,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dispose of是一個片語，意思是丟棄或處理掉某物，特別是在不再需要時以適當的方式處理。","options":["organize","dispose","arrange","position"],"sentence":"The company needs to ______ of the old equipment properly. According to environmental regulations, they must send it to a certified recycling facility.","translation":"公司需要妥善處理舊設備。根據環保法規，他們必須將其送到經認證的回收設施。","word":"dispose"}},"disposition":{"createdAt":1787049198633,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"disposition指一個人的性格或脾氣，也可指傾向或安排事物的方式。","options":["illness","schedule","disposition","appearance"],"sentence":"Sarah has a cheerful and optimistic ______ that makes everyone around her happy. No matter what challenges arise, she maintains a positive attitude.","translation":"莎拉有著樂觀積極的性情，使她周圍的人都感到快樂。無論遇到什麼挑戰，她都保持積極的態度。","word":"disposition"}},"disputable":{"createdAt":1781425024016,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"disputable表示有爭議的、可以被質疑或辯論的，即不是所有人都同意的觀點。","options":["proven","disputable","obvious","certain"],"sentence":"The claim that climate change is entirely human-caused remains highly ______ among scientists. Some experts agree with it, while others present compelling counterarguments based on their research.","translation":"氣候變化完全由人類造成的說法在科學家中仍然有很大的爭議。有些專家同意，而其他人則根據他們的研究提出了令人信服的反駁。","word":"disputable"}},"dispute":{"createdAt":1781839703152,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"dispute指爭論或爭執，與disagreed over border territories and refused to negotiate（對邊界領土存在分歧並拒絕談判）完全相符。","options":["alliance","friendship","dispute","cooperation"],"sentence":"The ______ between the two neighbouring countries lasted for decades. They disagreed over border territories and refused to negotiate for years.","translation":"這兩個鄰國之間的爭執持續了數十年。他們在邊界領土上存在分歧，多年來拒絕談判。","word":"dispute"}},"disrupt":{"createdAt":1782529318029,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"disrupt 意為打斷或中斷，用於表達某事物對正常運作的干擾。","options":["enhance","schedule","disrupt","relocate"],"sentence":"The construction work outside will ______ the afternoon classes at the school. The principal has decided to move lessons to the gymnasium to avoid the loud noise.","translation":"學校外的建築工作將中斷下午的課程。校長決定將課程移到體育館以避免噪音。","word":"disrupt"}},"dissent":{"createdAt":1782529318018,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dissent 意為不同意或異議，用於表達與官方立場或主流觀點的反對意見。","options":["support","dissent","confusion","curiosity"],"sentence":"The manager expressed strong ______ with the new company policy during the meeting. Several employees nodded in agreement, showing they shared his opposition to the proposed changes.","translation":"經理在會議上對新公司政策表示強烈異議。幾位員工點頭同意，表明他們也反對擬議的變更。","word":"dissent"}},"dissolve":{"createdAt":1781738724026,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dissolve指的是固體物質在液體中融化並均勻混合，最終消失成為溶液的一部分。","options":["harden","dissolve","evaporate","crystallize"],"sentence":"When I added the sugar cube to my hot tea, it began to ______ instantly. Within seconds, the solid white cube had completely turned into liquid and mixed throughout the beverage.","translation":"當我把方糖加入熱茶時，它立即開始溶解。在幾秒鐘內，白色的固體方糖已經完全變成液體並混入飲料中。","word":"dissolve"}},"distance":{"createdAt":1783850528602,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"distance在這裡表示人與人之間的疏遠或冷淡的關係，不是指物理上的空間距離。","options":["closeness","distance","agreement","friendship"],"sentence":"After their argument, there seemed to be a growing ______ between the two friends. They stopped calling each other and avoided sitting together at lunch.","translation":"在他們吵架後，兩個朋友之間似乎出現了越來越大的冷淡。他們停止互相通話，也避免在午餐時坐在一起。","word":"distance"}},"distant":{"createdAt":1782303071298,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"distant 既可表示空間上的遠，也可表示態度或關係上的冷淡、疏遠","options":["cavity","eclipse","immigration","distant"],"sentence":"The two old friends seemed ______ when they reunited after twenty years. There was an awkwardness between them that made their conversation feel cold and uncomfortable.","translation":"這兩個老朋友在二十年後重聚時顯得冷淡。他們之間的尷尬使得他們的談話感到冷漠和不舒適。","word":"distant"}},"distinct":{"createdAt":1781272410979,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"distinct表示清楚可見的、易於辨別的，用來形容事物之間明顯的區別。","options":["similar","distinct","expensive","ancient"],"sentence":"The two paintings have ______ styles that make them easy to tell apart. Even a child can recognize the differences between them immediately.","translation":"這兩幅畫有明顯不同的風格，使人們很容易區分它們。即使是小孩也能立即認出它們之間的差異。","word":"distinct"}},"distinction":{"createdAt":1782401868800,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"distinction 表示兩個事物之間的差別或不同之處。","options":["similarity","distinction","connection","relationship"],"sentence":"There is a clear ______ between the two cooking styles. One uses fresh ingredients while the other relies on frozen products.","translation":"兩種烹飪風格之間有明確的區別。一種使用新鮮食材，而另一種依賴冷凍產品。","word":"distinction"}},"distinctive":{"createdAt":1781619188937,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"distinctive 指獨特的、有辨識度的、與眾不同的特徵或特色。","options":["common","distinctive","ordinary","standard"],"sentence":"The brand's ______ logo was instantly recognizable to customers all over the world. No other company used the same design or color combination.","translation":"該品牌的獨特標誌在世界各地的客戶都能立即識別。沒有其他公司使用相同的設計或色彩組合。","word":"distinctive"}},"distinctly":{"createdAt":1782092862166,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"distinctly是副詞，表示清楚地、明確地或清晰易辨地感知或聽到某事物。","options":["faintly","distinctly","softly","vaguely"],"sentence":"I ______ heard someone calling my name in the crowded marketplace. The voice was clear and unmistakable despite the surrounding noise.","translation":"在擁擠的市場裡，我清楚地聽到有人在叫我的名字。儘管周圍很吵雜，這個聲音還是很清晰和明確的。","word":"distinctly"}},"distinguish":{"createdAt":1782920661028,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"distinguish表示區別或辨別，用來將兩個或多個不同的事物區分開來","options":["separate","distinguish","divide","differ"],"sentence":"It is important to ______ between fact and opinion when reading news articles. A careful reader should be able to separate verified information from personal interpretations.","translation":"閱讀新聞文章時重要的是區別事實和觀點。小心的讀者應該能夠將經過驗證的資訊與個人解釋分開。","word":"distinguish"}},"distinguished":{"createdAt":1781443653221,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"distinguished形容詞指的是傑出、著名或受人尊敬的，通常用來形容在某個領域有重大成就的人。","options":["mediocre","ordinary","distinguished","unknown"],"sentence":"Professor Chen was a ______ scholar who had published over one hundred research papers in prestigious journals. Her groundbreaking work in quantum physics earned her international recognition and numerous awards.","translation":"陳教授是一位卓越的學者，在著名期刊上發表了超過一百篇研究論文。她在量子物理學上的開創性工作為她贏得了國際認可和眾多獎項。","word":"distinguished"}},"distort":{"createdAt":1782401868822,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"distort 表示扭曲、歪曲或曲解事實和信息。","options":["clarify","distort","explain","organize"],"sentence":"The dishonest politician tried to ______ the facts during his speech to mislead the voters. He presented false information as truth.","translation":"這位不誠實的政治人物試圖在他的演講中歪曲事實以誤導選民。他將虛假信息當作真理呈現。","word":"distort"}},"distract":{"createdAt":1783841734519,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"distract 意指使某人無法集中注意力或轉移其注意力，通常用來描述外部因素或干擾造成的分心狀態。","options":["encourage","distract","confuse","motivate"],"sentence":"The loud noise outside began to ______ the students during their exam. The teacher had to close the windows to help them focus on their test questions.","translation":"外面的巨大聲音開始在考試中分散學生的注意力。老師必須關上窗戶來幫助他們專注於考題。","word":"distract"}},"distraction":{"createdAt":1782920661034,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"distraction是指分心或心煩意亂，指使人無法專注於重要事務的事物","options":["distraction","problem","issue","annoyance"],"sentence":"Loud noises from the construction site next door created a ______ that prevented students from concentrating on their exams. The school had to move the test to a quieter location.","translation":"隔壁施工現場的噪音造成了心煩意亂，導致學生無法集中精力參加考試。學校不得不將考試改到較安靜的地點進行。","word":"distraction"}},"distress":{"createdAt":1781849847408,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"distress表示憂慮、痛苦或受難，與「擔憂和沮喪」的線索相符。","options":["joy","distress","delight","excitement"],"sentence":"The news about the accident caused great ______ to the family members. They were extremely worried and upset for weeks afterward.","translation":"關於這場事故的消息給家庭成員造成了極大的痛苦。他們在隨後的幾周內極度擔憂和沮喪。","word":"distress"}},"distressed":{"createdAt":1781499075060,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"焦慮不安表示一個人因為擔心或害怕而感到痛苦和不安。","options":["calm","content","distressed","relieved"],"sentence":"The mother looked ______ when she couldn't find her young son at the amusement park. Security guards immediately helped search the crowd and reunite them within minutes.","translation":"當這位母親在遊樂園找不到她的小兒子時，她看起來焦慮不安。保安人員立即幫助搜尋人群，並在幾分鐘內將他們重新團聚。","word":"distressed"}},"distribute":{"createdAt":1782920661023,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"distribute意為分發或分配，強調將東西有系統地分配給多個人或地方","options":["provide","distribute","supply","give"],"sentence":"The charity organization decided to ______ food and clothing to families affected by the disaster. Volunteers worked all day to ensure every household received equal portions.","translation":"慈善機構決定向受災家庭分發食物和衣服。志願者整天工作以確保每個家庭都獲得相等的份額。","word":"distribute"}},"distribution":{"createdAt":1781499075058,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"分發指將物品或物資按照計畫分配給多個人或地點。","options":["collection","distribution","storage","purchase"],"sentence":"The charity organized the ______ of food and blankets to homeless people throughout the city. Volunteers worked for weeks to ensure everyone in need received assistance.","translation":"慈善機構組織了向全市無家可歸者分發食物和毛毯。志願者花了幾週的時間確保每個需要幫助的人都得到協助。","word":"distribution"}},"district":{"createdAt":1782920661018,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"district是指行政區或轄區，特別是在城市或地方政府管轄的範圍內","options":["region","district","neighborhood","zone"],"sentence":"The mayor announced new policies for the downtown ______ to improve local businesses. The city council voted to allocate funds specifically to that administrative area.","translation":"市長為市中心區宣佈了新政策以改善當地商業。市議會投票決定向該行政區撥款。","word":"district"}},"disturb":{"createdAt":1781283344049,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"disturb意為妨礙或打擾；與「保持音量低」和「輕輕移動」搭配，表示避免任何可能影響睡眠的動作。","options":["comfort","disturb","feed","bathe"],"sentence":"Please do not ______ the sleeping baby as she needs rest to recover from her fever. Keep the volume low and move quietly around the house.","translation":"請不要打擾睡著的寶寶，因為她需要休息來從發燒中恢復。保持音量低並在屋子裡輕輕移動。","word":"disturb"}},"disturbance":{"createdAt":1781362281723,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"disturbance表示打擾或干擾，指破壞安寧或正常秩序的行為。","options":["joy","disturbance","pleasure","comfort"],"sentence":"The loud noise from the construction site caused ______ to the neighbors. Residents complained about the constant interruption to their peace.","translation":"建築工地的噪音對鄰居造成了打擾。居民抱怨他們的寧靜受到了持續的干擾。","word":"disturbance"}},"disturbed":{"createdAt":1782920661026,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"disturbed表示受到打擾、心煩意亂或在精神上感到不安","options":["upset","disturbed","confused","tired"],"sentence":"Maria felt ______ after reading the negative comments about her artwork online. She couldn't sleep that night because the criticism had upset her emotionally.","translation":"瑪麗亞在網上讀到有關她的藝術作品的負面評論後感到心煩意亂。那晚的批評使她在情感上不安，她無法入睡。","word":"disturbed"}},"disturbing":{"createdAt":1782920661032,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"disturbing是形容詞，表示令人不安或令人困擾的，引起心理上的不舒適","options":["disturbing","shocking","sad","troubling"],"sentence":"The documentary presented ______ footage of environmental destruction in the Amazon rainforest. Viewers found the images of deforestation deeply upsetting.","translation":"紀錄片呈現了亞馬遜雨林環境破壞的令人不安的鏡頭。觀眾發現森林砍伐的景象令人深感不安。","word":"disturbing"}},"diverse":{"createdAt":1781449095510,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"diverse意為多樣的、多變化的，用來形容具有多種差異或種類的事物。","options":["homogeneous","diverse","uniform","identical"],"sentence":"The city has a ______ population with people from many different countries and cultures. This multicultural environment enriches the community in many ways.","translation":"這座城市擁有來自許多不同國家和文化的多樣化人口。這個多元文化環境在許多方面豐富了社區。","word":"diverse"}},"diversify":{"createdAt":1781417610417,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"diversify是指使事物變得多樣化或涉足多個不同的領域以降低風險。","options":["consolidate","simplify","diversify","reduce"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ its product line by entering new markets. Instead of relying solely on electronics, they began producing clothing, furniture, and household goods.","translation":"公司決定通過進入新市場來使其產品線多樣化。他們不再只依賴電子產品，而是開始生產衣服、家具和家用商品。","word":"diversify"}},"diversion":{"createdAt":1781840030396,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"diversion 是名詞，表示繞行路線；在此句中特指因主路關閉而改變的臨時路線。","options":["shortcut","diversion","highway","intersection"],"sentence":"The main road was closed for construction, so the traffic was redirected on a ______ that took drivers through the countryside. This temporary route added thirty minutes to everyone's commute.","translation":"主要道路因施工而關閉，所以交通被重新定向到一條繞行路線，該路線引導駕駛人穿過鄉村。這條臨時路線為每個人的通勤增加了三十分鐘。","word":"diversion"}},"diversity":{"createdAt":1781479123533,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"diversity 指的是差異、多樣性，強調不同群體和觀點的存在和價值。","options":["uniformity","efficiency","diversity","stability"],"sentence":"The company's commitment to ______ meant hiring people from various ethnic backgrounds, religions, and cultures. The leadership believed that having employees with different perspectives would lead to better innovation and problem-solving.","translation":"公司對多樣性的承諾意味著聘請來自不同種族、宗教和文化背景的員工。領導層相信擁有具有不同觀點的員工會導致更好的創新和解決問題的能力。","word":"diversity"}},"divert":{"createdAt":1782921669884,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"divert是動詞，意為使改變方向或轉向，在這裡指將車輛流量引導到不同的路線。","options":["accelerate","divert","maintain","increase"],"sentence":"The construction on the highway forced authorities to ______ traffic to an alternate route. Drivers had to take a detour that added thirty minutes to their commute.","translation":"高速公路上的施工迫使當局將交通改道至替代路線。駕駛人必須繞行，增加了三十分鐘的通勤時間。","word":"divert"}},"divide":{"createdAt":1781362281729,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"divide表示分開或分裂，指因為不同的意見或利益而導致分離或衝突。","options":["unite","divide","strengthen","develop"],"sentence":"The controversial issue will ______ the community into different groups. Citizens have strong opposing opinions about the proposed development project.","translation":"這個有爭議的問題將使社區分成不同的團體。市民對提議的發展項目有著強烈的相反意見。","word":"divide"}},"dividend":{"createdAt":1782491138499,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dividend 表示根據股票所有權或投資分配給股東或投資者的利潤或紅利。","options":["rivalry","dividend","nightmare","reclaim"],"sentence":"As a shareholder in the company, she received a ______ check every quarter based on the company's profits. The more successful the business became, the larger the financial reward she earned.","translation":"作為公司的股東，她每季度根據公司的利潤收到一筆股息支票。業務變得越成功，她獲得的經濟回報就越大。","word":"dividend"}},"divine":{"createdAt":1781437435165,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"divine 可以表示極好的、美妙的、令人驚嘆的，用來形容非常優美或完美的事物。","options":["ordinary","divine","dark","cloudy"],"sentence":"The sunset was absolutely ______, with golden light spreading across the entire sky. Everyone stopped to admire its breathtaking and magnificent beauty.","translation":"日落絕對是美妙的，金色的光線遍佈整個天空。每個人都停下來欣賞它令人驚嘆的華麗美景。","word":"divine"}},"divinity":{"createdAt":1782921669884,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"divinity是名詞，指神性或神聖的性質，代表超越凡人的神聖和至高無上的品質。","options":["humanity","mortality","divinity","weakness"],"sentence":"Many ancient religions attributed ______ to their gods, believing them to be superior beings with supernatural powers. This sacred quality distinguished them from ordinary mortals.","translation":"許多古代宗教將神性賦予他們的神靈，相信他們是具有超自然力量的超級存在。這種神聖的品質使他們與普通人類區別開來。","word":"divinity"}},"division":{"createdAt":1783005778371,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"division 意為「部門」或「分開」，指組織內的一個獨立運作的部分或單位。","options":["building","director","division","location"],"sentence":"The company was organized into several departments, with the marketing ______ handling all advertising campaigns and brand development. Each department had its own budget and management team.","translation":"公司被分為幾個部門，其中行銷部門處理所有廣告活動和品牌開發。每個部門都有自己的預算和管理團隊。","word":"division"}},"divorce":{"createdAt":1782140283161,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"divorce是動詞，表示終止婚姻關係，在法律上解除夫妻關係。","options":["reconcile","remarry","divorce","reunite"],"sentence":"After twenty years of marriage, they decided to ______ and go their separate ways. The lawyers finalized their separation papers last month.","translation":"經過二十年的婚姻，他們決定離婚並各走各的路。律師上月完成了他們的分居文件。","word":"divorce"}},"doctrine":{"createdAt":1782303071298,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"doctrine 指某一宗教、政治或學派的基本信條、教義或學說","options":["startling","cavity","doctrine","compass"],"sentence":"The religious group strictly adhered to the ______ taught by their founder. These core beliefs and principles guided every aspect of their daily lives.","translation":"這個宗教團體嚴格遵循其創始人教導的教義。這些核心信念和原則指導了他們日常生活的各個方面。","word":"doctrine"}},"document":{"createdAt":1782611916174,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"document 名詞表示公文、文件，指正式的書面材料，用於記錄信息或證明事實。","options":["photograph","document","letter","contract"],"sentence":"She needed to submit an official ______ to prove her citizenship before she could apply for the passport. The government office required a birth certificate or similar proof of identity.","translation":"她需要提交一份官方文件來證明她的國籍，才能申請護照。政府辦公室要求提供出生證明或類似的身份證明。","word":"document"}},"documentary":{"createdAt":1784340530556,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"documentary 作為形容詞表示與文件、記錄或真實歷史證據相關，強調其真實性和記錄價值。","options":["fictional","documentary","artistic","imaginary"],"sentence":"The museum displayed a ______ collection of letters and photographs from the Civil War era. These original materials provided authentic evidence of how people lived during that historical period.","translation":"博物館展出了一份內戰時期的文件記錄收藏，包括信件和照片。這些原始材料提供了人們在那個歷史時期如何生活的真實證據。","word":"documentary"}},"domain":{"createdAt":1782352245071,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"domain指的是某個特定的領域、範圍或專業領地。","options":["enemy","barrier","domain","obstacle"],"sentence":"Physics is a ______ of science that studies matter and energy in the universe. Experts in this field conduct experiments to understand natural phenomena.","translation":"物理學是科學的一個領域，研究宇宙中的物質和能量。這個領域的專家進行實驗以理解自然現象。","word":"domain"}},"domestic":{"createdAt":1781515372607,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"domestic指國內的或本國的市場和事物","options":["persuasive","launch","domestic","force"],"sentence":"The ______ market in China has experienced significant growth over the past decade. Consumers within the country are increasingly purchasing locally-made products rather than imports.","translation":"過去十年來，中國的國內市場經歷了顯著增長。該國消費者越來越多地購買本地製造的產品，而不是進口商品。","word":"domestic"}},"domesticate":{"createdAt":1783491939256,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"domesticate 指將野生動物通過人類的選擇和訓練轉化為可被控制和飼養的家畜的過程。","options":["hunt","domesticate","observe","study"],"sentence":"Early humans began to ______ wild wolves thousands of years ago by selectively breeding the tamest individuals. Over many generations, these animals evolved into the modern dog breeds we know today.","translation":"早期人類在數千年前開始通過選擇性繁殖最溫馴的個體來馴養野狼。經過許多代，這些動物進化成了我們今天所知的現代狗品種。","word":"domesticate"}},"domesticated":{"createdAt":1783491939256,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"domesticated 是形容詞，用來描述已被人類馴養並習慣生活在人類控制下的動物。","options":["wild","domesticated","migratory","extinct"],"sentence":"Unlike wild horses that roam freely across grasslands, ______ horses have been trained by humans to accept riders and follow commands. These animals depend on humans for food and shelter.","translation":"與自由漫遊草地的野馬不同，馴養的馬已經被人類訓練接受騎手並服從命令。這些動物依靠人類提供食物和住所。","word":"domesticated"}},"dominance":{"createdAt":1783068339373,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dominance 名詞表示支配、統治或優越地位","options":["cooperation","dominance","friendship","trade"],"sentence":"The ______ of the larger empire over smaller kingdoms lasted for centuries. Their military superiority allowed them to control the entire region.","translation":"較大帝國對較小王國的統治持續了幾個世紀。他們的軍事優勢使他們能夠控制整個地區。","word":"dominance"}},"dominant":{"createdAt":1782611916163,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dominant 形容詞表示佔優勢的、支配的，指某物具有強大的控制力或影響力。","options":["recessive","dominant","rare","extinct"],"sentence":"The ______ species in the ecosystem controlled most of the resources and shaped the environment for all other organisms. Without this species' influence, the entire food chain would collapse.","translation":"該生態系中的主導物種控制了大部分資源，並為所有其他生物塑造了環境。沒有這個物種的影響，整個食物鏈將會崩潰。","word":"dominant"}},"dominantly":{"createdAt":1783491939250,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dominantly 用來形容某種特徵或性狀以優勢或主導的方式呈現，特別是在遺傳學中指顯性性狀的表現。","options":["recessive","dominantly","subtly","rarely"],"sentence":"The red flower color appeared ______ in the garden, overshadowing all other hues. Most plants inherited this trait from their parent because it was a dominant genetic expression.","translation":"紅色花朵在花園裡顯性遺傳地出現，壓倒了所有其他色調。大多數植物從親代繼承了這個特徵，因為它是顯性遺傳表現。","word":"dominantly"}},"dominate":{"createdAt":1782575719146,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dominate意為「統治、控制」，形容一方在競爭中擁有絕對優勢，完全掌控局面。","options":["participate","dominate","observe","support"],"sentence":"The strongest team will ______ the entire league this season. Their superior players and coaching staff ensure they control every game they play.","translation":"最強的隊伍這個賽季將統治整個聯賽。他們優秀的球員和教練組確保他們控制他們參加的每一場比賽。","word":"dominate"}},"domination":{"createdAt":1785110224412,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"domination 表示對他人或領土的支配、統治或控制，通常帶有權力和影響力的含義。","options":["liberation","domination","cooperation","negotiation"],"sentence":"The empire's ______ over the neighboring territories lasted for nearly two centuries. The ruler maintained control through military strength and strategic alliances that no other power could challenge.","translation":"帝國對鄰近領土的統治持續了將近兩個世紀。統治者通過軍事力量和其他任何勢力都無法挑戰的戰略聯盟來維持控制。","word":"domination"}},"donate":{"createdAt":1782555727232,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"donate 表示無償地將金錢或物品給予慈善機構或需要幫助的人，強調的是出於善意的無償贈予。","options":["spend","donate","invest","lend"],"sentence":"The wealthy businessman decided to ______ one million dollars to the local children's hospital. His generous contribution will help fund new medical equipment and research programs.","translation":"這位富有的商人決定向當地兒童醫院捐獻一百萬美元。他的慷慨貢獻將幫助資助新的醫療設備和研究項目。","word":"donate"}},"donation":{"createdAt":1786092977277,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"donation是指自願贈送給慈善機構或公益事業的金錢或物品，不期望獲得任何回報。","options":["contribution","donation","payment","investment"],"sentence":"The charity received a generous ______ from a local businessman to support their education program. The organization used the money to build a new school library for underprivileged children.","translation":"慈善機構從當地一位商人那裡收到了一筆慷慨的捐獻來支持他們的教育計畫。該組織用這筆錢為貧困兒童建造了一個新的學校圖書館。","word":"donation"}},"donor":{"createdAt":1783243350912,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"donor 意為捐贈者、贈送人，特別是指自願捐贈金錢、器官或其他資源給慈善機構或醫療機構的人。","options":["investor","donor","vendor","creditor"],"sentence":"The hospital recognized a generous ______ who had contributed one million dollars to their research fund. The donation was used to purchase advanced medical equipment.","translation":"醫院表彰了一位慷慨的捐贈者，他向他們的研究基金貢獻了一百萬美元。這筆捐款被用來購買先進的醫療設備。","word":"donor"}},"doom":{"createdAt":1781709984197,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"doom 名詞表示必然的毀滅或死亡，通常暗示無法避免的不幸結局。","options":["danger","doom","risk","peril"],"sentence":"The captain sensed ______ as the ship encountered the massive storm at sea. Dark clouds and towering waves suggested that the vessel might not survive the night.","translation":"當船在海上遇到巨大風暴時，船長感到厄運即將來臨。烏雲和高聳的浪潮表明這艘船可能無法度過這個夜晚。","word":"doom"}},"doomed":{"createdAt":1783870466414,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"doomed 表示某事物必然失敗或遭遇不幸的命運，常用於描述已無法改變的負面結果。","options":["blessed","doomed","restored","strengthened"],"sentence":"The old castle was ______ to collapse within the next decade. Structural engineers confirmed that its foundation had irreparable damage and no repairs could save it.","translation":"這座古老的城堡注定在未來十年內倒塌。結構工程師證實其地基無法修復，任何維修都無法拯救它。","word":"doomed"}},"dormitory":{"createdAt":1787049756210,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dormitory是指學生宿舍，專門為學生提供住宿的建築物。","options":["classroom","dormitory","library","cafeteria"],"sentence":"Many university students live in a ______ on campus. The building has multiple rooms where students share bathrooms and common areas.","translation":"許多大學生住在校園裡的宿舍。這棟建築有多個房間，學生們共享浴室和公共區域。","word":"dormitory"}},"doubt":{"createdAt":1782094693733,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"懷疑是指對某事的真實性或正確性感到不確定。","options":["verify","doubt","confirm","support"],"sentence":"The detective began to ______ the witness's alibi when inconsistencies appeared in their story. Further investigation revealed the witness had fabricated several key details.","translation":"當證人的故事出現不一致時，偵探開始懷疑證人的不在場證明。進一步的調查顯示證人編造了幾個關鍵細節。","word":"doubt"}},"doubtful":{"createdAt":1781653278520,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"doubtful是形容詞，表示可疑的或靠不住的，用於描述對某人或某事的信任或可靠性產生懷疑的狀態。","options":["confident","certain","doubtful","assured"],"sentence":"The manager felt ______ about hiring the candidate who had never worked in the industry before. The applicant's lack of relevant experience and contradictory references made the decision risky.","translation":"經理對聘用這位從未在該行業工作過的候選人感到______。申請人缺乏相關經驗和相互矛盾的推薦信使這個決定很危險。","word":"doubtful"}},"doubtless":{"createdAt":1783421881859,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"doubtless 為副詞，意為「無疑地；肯定地」，表示某事是確定或明確的，不存在懷疑。","options":["questionably","doubtless","possibly","rarely"],"sentence":"The athlete's outstanding performance will ______ secure her a place on the national team. Her record-breaking times and consistent medals leave no room for uncertainty.","translation":"這位運動員的傑出表現無疑將使她獲得國家隊的一席之地。她打破紀錄的成績和一致的獎牌毫無疑問地證明了這一點。","word":"doubtless"}},"downfall":{"createdAt":1783516186776,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"downfall 是指一個人或組織從成功或權力走向失敗、衰退或毀滅的過程。","options":["promotion","achievement","downfall","advancement"],"sentence":"The once-powerful executive's ______ began when investigators discovered financial fraud in his company. He lost his position, wealth, and freedom within months.","translation":"這位曾權勢顯赫的高管的衰落始於調查人員發現他公司的財務欺詐時。他在幾個月內失去了職位、財富和自由。","word":"downfall"}},"draft":{"createdAt":1781951900949,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"draft是初步或粗略的版本，通常需要進一步修改，而非最終成品。","options":["manuscript","draft","outline","summary"],"sentence":"The author wrote a rough ______ of her novel before submitting it to the publisher. She made many corrections and revisions before producing the final version.","translation":"作者在將小說提交給出版商之前先寫了一個粗略的草稿。在製作最終版本之前，她進行了許多修正和修改。","word":"draft"}},"drain":{"createdAt":1783613053038,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"drain 作為動詞表示「把液體排出或排空」，通常用於描述移除容器或系統中的液體。","options":["fill","drain","clean","inspect"],"sentence":"The plumber needs to ______ the water from the swimming pool before winter arrives. He will use a pump to remove all the liquid so it doesn't freeze and damage the pipes.","translation":"水管工需要在冬天到來前把游泳池的水排空。他會用幫浦把所有液體都移除，這樣就不會結冰並損壞管子。","word":"drain"}},"dramatic":{"createdAt":1782408103440,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dramatic 表示變化突然、明顯且令人印象深刻，具有戲劇化的效果。","options":["gradual","dramatic","minimal","predictable"],"sentence":"The ______ change in the company's profits surprised all the investors at the annual meeting. The quarterly earnings had suddenly jumped from a loss of two million dollars to a profit of five million.","translation":"公司利潤的戲劇性變化令年度會議上的所有投資者感到驚訝。季度收益突然從虧損兩百萬美元跳升至利潤五百萬。","word":"dramatic"}},"dramatically":{"createdAt":1782620345619,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"dramatically 用來形容變化發生得非常快速、劇烈或引人注目，強調改變的程度極其顯著。","options":["slowly","gradually","dramatically","slightly"],"sentence":"The stock price fell ______ after the company announced its bankruptcy. The value dropped by 95% in just a single trading day.","translation":"公司宣布破產後，股票價格急劇下跌。價值在一個交易日內下降了95%。","word":"dramatically"}},"drastic":{"createdAt":1781794866352,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"drastic指激烈的、猛烈的，用於形容急劇、極端或影響深遠的變化或行動。","options":["minor","gradual","drastic","theoretical"],"sentence":"The company made ______ changes to its operations after losing most of its customers. They completely restructured their management, eliminated entire departments, and relocated their headquarters overseas.","translation":"公司在失去大部分客戶後對其運營進行了______ 改變。他們完全重組了管理層、裁減了整個部門，並將總部遷往海外。","word":"drastic"}},"drastically":{"createdAt":1785339147829,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"drastically表示以激烈、徹底或極端的方式發生，強調變化的程度很大。","options":["slightly","drastically","gradually","marginally"],"sentence":"The company's profits ______ decreased after the major scandal was exposed in the media. Revenue dropped by more than fifty percent within just three months.","translation":"在重大醜聞被媒體曝光後，公司的利潤急劇下降。收入在短短三個月內下降了超過百分之五十。","word":"drastically"}},"draught":{"createdAt":1781581925129,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"draught 作為名詞表示初步的草圖或草稿，通常用於建築、工程或設計領域。","options":["proposal","draught","contract","blueprint"],"sentence":"The architect showed us a ______ of the new building design before construction began. We could see the preliminary sketches with measurements and structural details marked on paper.","translation":"在施工開始前，建築師向我們展示了新建築設計的草圖。我們可以看到紙上標有測量值和結構細節的初步草圖。","word":"draught"}},"drawback":{"createdAt":1782921669883,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"drawback是名詞，指缺點或不利之處，與advantage（優點）相反。","options":["advantage","benefit","drawback","strength"],"sentence":"While the new smartphone has excellent features, its main ______ is the short battery life. Users complained that the device only lasted five hours on a single charge.","translation":"雖然新智慧型手機具有出色的功能，但其主要缺點是電池續航時間短。用戶抱怨該設備單次充電只能使用五小時。","word":"drawback"}},"dread":{"createdAt":1783598428083,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dread 表示對某件事感到極度的恐懼、擔心或厭惡，通常指對未來的壞事感到害怕","options":["celebrate","dread","anticipate","welcome"],"sentence":"Many students ______ the final examination because they worry about failing and disappointing their parents. The anxiety keeps them awake at night for weeks beforehand.","translation":"許多學生害怕期末考試，因為他們擔心不及格和令父母失望。這種焦慮使他們在前幾週每晚都無法入睡。","word":"dread"}},"dreadfully":{"createdAt":1788028661424,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"dreadfully 是副詞，意思是「可怕地或極度地」，用來加強形容詞的程度。","options":["slightly","moderately","dreadfully","pleasantly"],"sentence":"The weather was ______ cold on the morning of the expedition, with temperatures dropping below freezing. The climbers had to wear multiple layers and insulated gear to survive.","translation":"探險早上的天氣極度寒冷，溫度降到冰點以下。登山者必須穿多層衣服和保暖裝備才能活下來。","word":"dreadfully"}},"dresser":{"createdAt":1783613053039,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dresser 作為名詞表示「講究穿著者」，指非常注重衣著打扮和搭配的人。","options":["designer","dresser","tailor","model"],"sentence":"My sister is a fashion ______ who always coordinates her outfits perfectly and never leaves home without looking impeccable. She spends hours selecting the right clothes and accessories for every occasion.","translation":"我妹妹是個講究穿著者，她總是完美地搭配服裝，從不邋遢地出門。她花費數小時為每個場合選擇合適的衣服和配飾。","word":"dresser"}},"dressing":{"createdAt":1781850347304,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"佐料或調料是指添加到食物中以增強風味的液體或半液體混合物。","options":["sauce","dressing","syrup","seasoning"],"sentence":"She poured the creamy ______ over her salad to add flavor and moisture. The vinaigrette combined olive oil, lemon juice, and herbs in the perfect balance.","translation":"她將奶油佐料倒在沙拉上以增加風味和濕潤度。這種油醋汁將橄欖油、檸檬汁和草本植物完美地結合在一起。","word":"dressing"}},"dressy":{"createdAt":1781848330184,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dressy形容穿著得體、講究、正式的，適合在特殊場合或正式場合穿著。","options":["casual","dressy","sporty","plain"],"sentence":"She wore a ______ outfit to the formal evening gala. Her elegant gown and fancy accessories showed she had taken great care with her appearance for this important occasion.","translation":"她穿著精緻講究的服裝出席正式晚宴。她優雅的禮服和華麗的配飾表明她為這個重要場合精心打扮。","word":"dressy"}},"drift":{"createdAt":1781836375377,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"drift表示漂流或漂動，指在水或空氣中被自然力量緩慢移動。","options":["sail","drift","float","move"],"sentence":"The damaged boat began to ______ helplessly across the ocean without power. The currents carried it further away from the shipping lanes.","translation":"受損的船開始在沒有動力的情況下無助地漂過海洋。洋流把它帶得離航道越來越遠。","word":"drift"}},"drill":{"createdAt":1783261324149,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"drill 作為動詞表示用工具鑽洞或鑽孔，通常搭配電動工具來完成穿透性的打孔工作。","options":["hammer","drill","saw","wrench"],"sentence":"The construction worker used a power ______ to make holes in the concrete wall. He needed to install metal anchors deep into the foundation.","translation":"建築工人用電動______在混凝土牆上打洞。他需要將金屬錨栓深深安裝到地基中。","word":"drill"}},"droplet":{"createdAt":1782265565188,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"droplet 指非常小的液體滴，通常用於描述水或其他液體的微小粒子。","options":["river","droplet","ocean","wave"],"sentence":"A tiny ______ of water fell from the leaking pipe onto the kitchen floor. Scientists used a microscope to examine this microscopic particle of moisture.","translation":"一滴微小的水從漏水的管道滴落到廚房地板上。科學家用顯微鏡檢查了這個微觀的濕氣粒子。","word":"droplet"}},"drought":{"createdAt":1782303283391,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"drought 指長期缺乏降雨導致的乾旱狀況，對農業和水資源造成嚴重影響。","options":["flood","storm","drought","frost"],"sentence":"The severe ______ lasted for three years and devastated the region's agriculture. Without rainfall, farmers could not irrigate their fields and many crops failed completely.","translation":"嚴重的旱災持續了三年，摧毀了該地區的農業。沒有降雨，農民無法灌溉他們的田地，許多莊稼完全歉收。","word":"drought"}},"drown":{"createdAt":1781345564015,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"drown 表示在水中溺水身亡或被水淹沒，通常描述危險或致命的水上事故。","options":["float","drown","swim","paddle"],"sentence":"The man began to ______ in the deep ocean as the waves pulled him under. Lifeguards immediately dove in and rescued him before it was too late.","translation":"當海浪把他拖入水下時，這名男子開始在深海中溺水。救生員立即跳入水中，在為時已晚之前救了他。","word":"drown"}},"drowsy":{"createdAt":1781310338174,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"drowsy 表示困倦、昏昏欲睡的狀態，通常是因為疲勞或缺乏睡眠。","options":["alert","drowsy","energetic","anxious"],"sentence":"After working the night shift, the security guard felt increasingly ______ as morning approached. He struggled to keep his eyes open and had difficulty concentrating on his duties.","translation":"在上完夜班後，隨著早晨的臨近，保安感到越來越昏昏欲睡。他很難睜開眼睛，在執行職務時難以集中注意力。","word":"drowsy"}},"drunk":{"createdAt":1781362281651,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"drunk是drink的過去分詞，表示已經喝下去，也可作形容詞表示醉酒的狀態。","options":["eaten","drunk","spent","bought"],"sentence":"He had ______ too much wine at the party and could barely stand. His stumbling walk and slurred speech made it clear he was intoxicated.","translation":"他在派對上喝了太多葡萄酒，幾乎站不住。他踉蹌的步態和含糊的言語清楚地表明他醉了。","word":"drunk"}},"dual":{"createdAt":1781619188932,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dual 指具有兩個部分或兩重性質的，表示同時具有兩個目的或功能。","options":["single","dual","multiple","triple"],"sentence":"The ______ purpose of the conference was to discuss policy changes and network with industry leaders. Attendees would gain both educational content and valuable professional connections.","translation":"這次會議的雙重目的是討論政策變化並與行業領袖建立聯繫。與會者將獲得教育內容和寶貴的專業人脈。","word":"dual"}},"dubious":{"createdAt":1781359980245,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dubious指令人懷疑、可疑或值得懷疑的；表示對某事的真實性或可信度持懷疑態度。","options":["reliable","dubious","popular","expensive"],"sentence":"The ______ claim that the product could cure all diseases within days raised serious concerns among health officials. Independent testing found no scientific support for these extraordinary promises.","translation":"該產品能在幾天內治癒所有疾病的可疑說法引起了衛生官員的嚴重關注。獨立測試發現這些非凡承諾沒有科學支持。","word":"dubious"}},"due":{"createdAt":1782134503213,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"due 作形容詞，表示應支付、到期或應履行的義務，常與金錢或截止日期相關。","options":["returned","due","suggested","planned"],"sentence":"The payment for this invoice is ______ on March 15th, and we must settle it before that date. The finance department has already sent several reminders about this deadline.","translation":"這張發票的付款應在3月15日到期，我們必須在該日期前結清。財務部已經發送了幾次有關這個截止日期的提醒。","word":"due"}},"dull":{"createdAt":1781595752114,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"dull 形容某事物缺乏趣味或令人感到無聊。","options":["interesting","exciting","dull","educational"],"sentence":"The lecture was so ______ that half the students fell asleep. The professor spoke in a monotone voice without any enthusiasm or engaging examples.","translation":"講座是如此乏味，以至於一半的學生睡著了。教授用單調的聲音講話，沒有任何熱情或引人入勝的例子。","word":"dull"}},"dumbbell":{"createdAt":1785331076817,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"啞鈴是一種健身器材，由短槓和兩端的加重圓盤組成，通常用於單手舉重訓練。","options":["barbell","dumbbell","kettlebell","resistance band"],"sentence":"I lifted a heavy ______ at the gym to strengthen my arm muscles. This piece of equipment consists of a short bar with weighted discs attached to each end.","translation":"我在健身房舉起一個沉重的啞鈴來加強我的手臂肌肉。這種設備由一根短槓桿組成，兩端各連接著加重的圓盤。","word":"dumbbell"}},"dumber":{"createdAt":1785920719147,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dumber在這裡用來形容人變得更加沉默寡言或不愛說話，而不是指智力低下，與withdrawn和quiet的語境相符。","options":["smarter","dumber","louder","angrier"],"sentence":"After the accident, he seemed ______ than before, barely speaking a word to anyone. The doctors explained that the trauma had made him withdrawn and unusually quiet.","translation":"在事故後，他看起來比以前更沉默寡言，幾乎不和任何人說話。醫生解釋說創傷使他變得孤僻且異常安靜。","word":"dumber"}},"dump":{"createdAt":1781275226790,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"此處dump作動詞表示「傾倒；丟棄」，指將廢棄物放在特定地點","options":["stroke","dazzle","dump","feast"],"sentence":"The construction company had to ______ tons of waste material at the designated site. The environmental regulations required them to dispose of it properly and legally.","translation":"建築公司必須在指定地點傾倒數噸的廢料。環保法規要求他們合法地妥善處理它。","word":"dump"}},"dung":{"createdAt":1788028661415,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dung 是「動物的排泄物或糞便」的意思，農民用它作為天然肥料。","options":["seeds","dung","rocks","tools"],"sentence":"The farmer spread animal ______ across the field to fertilize the soil. This organic matter would help the crops grow more abundantly next season.","translation":"農民在田地裡撒動物糞便來施肥土壤。這種有機物質將幫助莊稼在下個季節生長得更豐富。","word":"dung"}},"duplication":{"createdAt":1788028661417,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"duplication 是「複製或重複」的意思，指的是相同的工作被做了兩次。","options":["duplication","approval","celebration","presentation"],"sentence":"The company realized that the ______ of efforts between two departments was wasteful and inefficient. They decided to merge the teams to eliminate the redundant work.","translation":"公司意識到兩個部門之間的工作重複是浪費和低效的。他們決定合併團隊以消除冗餘的工作。","word":"duplication"}},"durable":{"createdAt":1783392139527,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"durable 是形容詞，表示能夠經久耐用、抗久的特性。","options":["comfortable","fashionable","durable","lightweight"],"sentence":"These ______ hiking boots have lasted me over five years of heavy use on mountain trails. I've tested them in countless challenging environments and they still perform excellently.","translation":"這些耐久的登山靴經歷我五年多在山路上的重度使用仍然沒有壞。我在無數具有挑戰性的環境中測試過它們，它們的表現仍然非常出色。","word":"durable"}},"duration":{"createdAt":1781746685498,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"duration指的是持續時間、時間長度，用來表示某事物從開始到結束所花費的時間。","options":["duration","medal","section","entertain"],"sentence":"The film's ______ was two hours and thirty minutes. Audiences had to remain seated throughout the entire showing without interruption.","translation":"這部電影的持續時間是兩小時三十分鐘。觀眾必須始終坐著觀看，不能中途中斷。","word":"duration"}},"dusk":{"createdAt":1781965320893,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"dusk 指的是日落時刻，介於白天和夜間之間的時段。","options":["midnight","noon","dawn","dusk"],"sentence":"The park is closed at ______, just after the sun has set below the horizon. Visitors must leave before darkness falls completely.","translation":"公園在黃昏時關閉，就在太陽落到地平線以下之後。訪客必須在天色完全變黑前離開。","word":"dusk"}},"duty":{"createdAt":1781836375372,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"duty表示責任或義務，通常指由職位或地位要求的重要責任。","options":["job","duty","work","task"],"sentence":"As a police officer, protecting the community is her primary ______. She takes this ______ seriously and works diligently every day.","translation":"作為警察，保護社區是她的主要責任。她認真對待這項責任，每天都勤奮工作。","word":"duty"}},"dwarf":{"createdAt":1784961147241,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dwarf 是指身材特別矮小的人或魔法生物，在童話故事中常見的角色設定。","options":["giant","dwarf","wizard","merchant"],"sentence":"In the fairy tale, Snow White lived with seven ______ who were very kind to her. Each of these small magical creatures had their own personality and helped her escape from the evil queen.","translation":"在童話故事中，白雪公主與七個對她非常友善的小矮人住在一起。這些小小的魔法生物每個都有自己獨特的個性，幫助她逃離了邪惡的皇后。","word":"dwarf"}},"dwell":{"createdAt":1782902371511,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dwell 表示在某個地方居住或長期生活，強調的是定居和長期居留。","options":["visit","dwell","travel","explore"],"sentence":"Many families ______ in the countryside where there is fresh air and peaceful surroundings. They have lived there for generations and consider it their permanent home.","translation":"許多家庭居住在有新鮮空氣和寧靜環境的鄉村。他們已經在那裡生活了好幾代，並將其視為永久住所。","word":"dwell"}},"dweller":{"createdAt":1786438599013,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dweller是指長期居住在某個地方的人，通常表示該地是其固定的住所，而不是臨時訪問或短暫停留的人。","options":["visitor","dweller","explorer","hunter"],"sentence":"The cave ______ lived in complete isolation from the modern world. The archaeologists discovered ancient tools and pottery scattered throughout the cavern where this prehistoric inhabitant once survived.","translation":"洞穴居民在與現代世界完全隔絕的地方生活。考古學家在這位史前居民曾經生存過的洞穴中發現了古代工具和陶器散落各地。","word":"dweller"}},"dynamic":{"createdAt":1783685293801,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"dynamic意思是「有活力的、動態的」，形容充滿能量、不斷變化或充滿活力的特性。","options":["static","rigid","dynamic","conservative"],"sentence":"The new CEO brought a ______ approach to the company that energized the entire workforce. Everyone noticed an immediate increase in productivity and innovation.","translation":"新任執行長為公司帶來了充滿活力的管理方式，激勵了整個員工隊伍。每個人都注意到生產力和創新立即增加。","word":"dynamic"}},"dynamite":{"createdAt":1783391419401,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dynamite是一種強力炸藥，用於爆破和摧毀，特別是在建築和採礦中。","options":["hammer","dynamite","pickaxe","torch"],"sentence":"The construction workers used ______ to blast through the rock formation. The explosion was so powerful that it shattered boulders into manageable pieces.","translation":"建築工人用炸藥炸穿岩層。爆炸非常強大，把巨石碎成可處理的碎片。","word":"dynamite"}},"dynasty":{"createdAt":1781484415235,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"dynasty是指由同一家族統治的政治權力時期，代表某個皇室的統治年代。","options":["country","dynasty","revolution","century"],"sentence":"The Ming ______ ruled China for nearly three hundred years and produced magnificent architecture. This period saw the construction of the Forbidden City and the Great Wall expansions.","translation":"明朝統治中國近三百年，並產生了宏偉的建築。這個時期見證了紫禁城和長城擴建的建造。","word":"dynasty"}},"eager":{"createdAt":1781582939255,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"eager 形容對某事充滿熱情和期待的心理狀態，與積極主動和提前準備的行為相符。","options":["tired","eager","confused","absent"],"sentence":"The ______ students raised their hands immediately when the teacher asked who wanted to volunteer for the science fair. They had been looking forward to this opportunity for weeks and had already started preparing their projects at home.","translation":"當老師問誰想參加科學展覽時，那些熱切的學生立即舉起手。他們已經期待這個機會好幾週，並已在家開始準備他們的項目。","word":"eager"}},"earnest":{"createdAt":1781484415154,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"earnest意指認真、誠摯和熱心，表現出真正的決心和承諾。","options":["lazy","earnest","careless","reluctant"],"sentence":"She made an ______ effort to improve her grades before the final exam. Her determination was so genuine that she studied every single day without missing once.","translation":"她在期末考試前做出了誠摯的努力來改進她的成績。她的決心是如此真誠，以至於她每天都堅持學習，沒有缺過一次。","word":"earnest"}},"earnestly":{"createdAt":1783955448027,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"earnestly 是副詞，表示認真、熱心和誠摯的態度，用來修飾動詞以強調說話者的真摯程度。","options":["briefly","earnestly","reluctantly","humorously"],"sentence":"She spoke ______ about her commitment to environmental protection at the conference. Her passionate tone and detailed proposals showed this was not a casual remark.","translation":"她在會議上誠摯地談論她對環境保護的承諾。她熱情的語調和詳細的提案表明這不是隨便說說的。","word":"earnestly"}},"earworm":{"createdAt":1782094693725,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"洗腦神曲是指一首容易記住且會不斷在腦中重複的歌曲。","options":["memory","earworm","lyric","rhythm"],"sentence":"That catchy pop song became an ______ that I couldn't stop humming all day. No matter what I did, the melody kept repeating in my head involuntarily.","translation":"那首朗朗上口的流行歌曲成了一首洗腦神曲，我整天都無法停止哼唱。無論我做什麼，那旋律都不由自主地在我腦中重複。","word":"earworm"}},"eccentric":{"createdAt":1783955448028,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"eccentric 形容人的行為、穿著或思想方式古怪、異乎尋常，偏離常規。","options":["conservative","expensive","eccentric","practical"],"sentence":"The artist was known for his ______ fashion sense and unconventional lifestyle. He wore mismatched clothes and lived in an abandoned warehouse by choice.","translation":"這位藝術家因其古怪的時尚品味和非傳統的生活方式而聞名。他穿著不搭配的衣服，選擇住在廢棄的倉庫裡。","word":"eccentric"}},"echo":{"createdAt":1783243389246,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"迴聲是聲波從物體表面反射回來的現象，是一個延遲且重複的聲音。","options":["whisper","vibration","echo","shadow"],"sentence":"When you shout in a canyon, the sound bounces off the rock walls and returns to you as a ______. This repeated sound arrives seconds after the original noise, creating a distinctive effect that proves sound reflects off solid surfaces.","translation":"當你在峽谷中喊叫時，聲音從岩石牆壁反彈回來，以迴聲的形式回到你耳邊。這個重複的聲音在原始噪音之後的幾秒鐘到達，證明聲音會從堅硬表面反射。","word":"echo"}},"eclipse":{"createdAt":1782303071297,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"eclipse 指日食或月食，是指一個天體遮擋另一個天體光線的天文現象","options":["immigration","eclipse","contact","doctrine"],"sentence":"During the total solar ______, the moon passed directly in front of the sun. The sky darkened in the middle of the day as the celestial bodies aligned perfectly.","translation":"在日全食期間，月球直接經過太陽前面。當天體完美排列時，天空在白天中間變暗。","word":"eclipse"}},"ecological":{"createdAt":1783324813341,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ecological 是指與生態系統、生物及其環境之間的關係相關的，或是與環保和自然保護有關的。","options":["economic","ecological","educational","electrical"],"sentence":"The government implemented new ______ policies to protect endangered species and their natural environments. These regulations focus specifically on maintaining biodiversity and reducing human impact on ecosystems.","translation":"政府實施了新的生態政策以保護瀕危物種及其自然環境。這些法規特別關注維護生物多樣性和減少人類對生態系統的影響。","word":"ecological"}},"ecology":{"createdAt":1781625891345,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"ecology是研究生物與其環境和其他生物之間相互關係的學科","options":["architecture","psychology","ecology","astronomy"],"sentence":"The university offers a specialized degree program in ______. Students study how organisms interact with their environment and each other.","translation":"這所大學提供生態學專業學位課程。學生們研究生物如何與它們的環境和彼此互動。","word":"ecology"}},"economic":{"createdAt":1784601855844,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"economic 是指與經濟相關的事物，特別是涉及金錢、成本和財務穩定性的政策或措施。","options":["political","social","economic","cultural"],"sentence":"The government implemented ______ policies to help citizens save money during the recession. These measures focused on reducing costs and improving financial stability for ordinary people.","translation":"政府實施經濟政策來幫助公民在經濟衰退期間省錢。這些措施重點是降低成本並改善普通人的財務穩定性。","word":"economic"}},"economical":{"createdAt":1781425737124,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"economical 形容詞指節儉的、節約的或成本效益高的，與低燃油和維護成本相關。","options":["expensive","economical","luxurious","heavy"],"sentence":"She bought an ______ car model that uses less fuel and costs less to maintain. The vehicle's low operating expenses make it perfect for her tight monthly budget.","translation":"她購買了一輛節能車型，耗油量少，維護成本也較低。這輛車的低運營費用非常適合她緊張的月度預算。","word":"economical"}},"economics":{"createdAt":1781425737125,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"economics 是經濟學，研究市場、商業、供應和需求等經濟現象的學科。","options":["art","biology","economics","literature"],"sentence":"She decided to major in ______ to understand how markets and businesses operate globally. Her university professors teach theories about supply, demand, and international trade systems.","translation":"她決定主修經濟學以理解市場和企業如何在全球運營。她的大學教授教授關於供應、需求和國際貿易系統的理論。","word":"economics"}},"economy":{"createdAt":1781564440925,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"economy 表示經濟，指一個國家或地區的生產、貿易和財政活動的整體系統。","options":["culture","economy","geography","military"],"sentence":"The country's ______ has been growing steadily over the past decade. The increased production and trade have brought prosperity to many citizens.","translation":"該國的經濟在過去十年裡穩步增長。生產和貿易的增加為許多公民帶來了繁榮。","word":"economy"}},"ecosystem":{"createdAt":1783955448029,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ecosystem 指生物與其周圍環境（包括其他生物）形成的相互依存的整體系統。","options":["population","ecosystem","landscape","climate"],"sentence":"The destruction of the forest threatens the entire ______ that depends on these trees for survival. Birds, insects, plants, and soil organisms are all interconnected within this balanced network.","translation":"森林的破壞威脅了依靠這些樹木生存的整個生態系統。鳥類、昆蟲、植物和土壤生物都在這個平衡的網絡中相互連接。","word":"ecosystem"}},"edge":{"createdAt":1781434900585,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"edge在此表示「優勢」，指相對於他人的有利位置或條件。","options":["boundary","edge","corner","margin"],"sentence":"The company gained a competitive ______ over its rivals by developing innovative technology. This advantage allowed them to capture more market share than their competitors.","translation":"該公司通過開發創新技術獲得了相對於競爭對手的競爭優勢。這種優勢使他們能夠比競爭對手獲得更多的市場份額。","word":"edge"}},"edible":{"createdAt":1783491939257,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"edible 形容詞指某物可以安全食用，不會造成傷害或中毒。","options":["toxic","edible","decorative","rare"],"sentence":"Many mushrooms in the forest are poisonous, but some varieties are ______ and prized by chefs. Local foragers know exactly which species are safe to harvest and cook.","translation":"森林裡許多蘑菇都有毒，但有些品種是可食用的，深受廚師們的青睞。當地採集者確切知道哪些物種可以安全採收和烹飪。","word":"edible"}},"edition":{"createdAt":1784439867438,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"版本是指某部作品的特定印刷或發行形式，不同的版本可能在內容、設計或其他方面有所不同。","options":["manuscript","edition","translation","collection"],"sentence":"The publisher released a new ______ of the classic novel with updated cover art and bonus chapters. This particular version was different from all the previous printings that had been sold over the decades.","translation":"出版社發行了這部經典小說的新版本，配有更新的封面藝術和額外章節。這個特定版本與幾十年來銷售的所有先前印刷版本不同。","word":"edition"}},"editor":{"createdAt":1784979404227,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"editor 指的是編輯或校訂者，負責審閱、修改和改進文稿或內容。","options":["publisher","writer","editor","designer"],"sentence":"The magazine hired a new ______ to review and improve all the articles before publication. This person had extensive experience in checking grammar, style, and ensuring the content met quality standards.","translation":"雜誌社聘請了一位新的編輯來審查和改進所有文章後發表。這個人在檢查語法、文體和確保內容符合品質標準方面有豐富的經驗。","word":"editor"}},"editorial":{"createdAt":1783955448032,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"editorial 既可作名詞指社論或評論文章，也可作形容詞指與編輯或發表觀點相關的內容。","options":["sports","weather","editorial","classified"],"sentence":"The newspaper's ______ page featured the editor's personal opinion on the recent government policy. Readers relied on this section to understand the publication's stance on current events.","translation":"報紙的社論頁面刊登了編輯對最近政府政策的個人看法。讀者依靠這一欄來了解該報紙對當前事件的立場。","word":"editorial"}},"editorials":{"createdAt":1781746685502,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"editorials指的是社論、編者按語，是報刊雜誌中編輯或評論員發表的評論文章。","options":["medal","editorials","moisture","obedience"],"sentence":"The newspaper published several ______ about the new government policy. The writers expressed their professional opinions and analysis on the controversial legislation.","translation":"報紙發表了幾篇關於新政府政策的社論。撰稿人表達了對這項有爭議立法的專業意見和分析。","word":"editorials"}},"effective":{"createdAt":1781661288528,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"effective 是指能達到預期效果的、有效的，用來形容某件事物是否成功地實現了目標","options":["efficient","popular","effective","expensive"],"sentence":"The new marketing campaign was not ______ at reaching younger audiences. Despite spending months on it, the company saw no increase in sales from that demographic.","translation":"新的行銷活動在接觸年輕觀眾方面並不有效。儘管花了幾個月的時間，該公司在這個年齡段的銷售額沒有增加。","word":"effective"}},"effects":{"createdAt":1782200614310,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"effects 作為名詞表示「效果；影響」，特別是指某個行動或物質所產生的結果或後果。","options":["benefits","purposes","effects","reasons"],"sentence":"The medicine has several negative ______ on the patient's health. Doctors noticed that it caused dizziness, nausea, and loss of appetite within hours of taking it.","translation":"這種藥物對患者的健康有幾個負面影響。醫生注意到患者在服用後數小時內出現頭暈、噁心和食慾不振的現象。","word":"effects"}},"efficiency":{"createdAt":1781841148116,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"efficiency 名詞意思是效率、功效，指以最少的時間、能量或資源完成任務的能力。","options":["cost","efficiency","quality","safety"],"sentence":"The factory improved its production ______ by introducing automated machinery and streamlined workflows. Workers completed the same amount of work in half the time with fewer resources.","translation":"工廠通過引入自動化機械和簡化的工作流程提高了生產效率。工人用更少的資源在一半的時間內完成了相同數量的工作。","word":"efficiency"}},"efficient":{"createdAt":1783566294628,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"efficient表示高效率的或能力強的，形容能以最少的時間和資源完成工作的人或方法。","options":["friendly","efficient","popular","experienced"],"sentence":"The new manager proved to be very ______ in organizing the office workflow. Within one month, productivity had increased by forty percent due to her systematic approach.","translation":"新經理在組織辦公室工作流程方面證明自己非常有效率。由於她的系統方法，在一個月內生產力提高了百分之四十。","word":"efficient"}},"effort":{"createdAt":1783678307405,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"effort 指為了達到某個目標而付出的勞動或能量，在此句中強調通過努力和決心才能成功完成任務。","options":["luck","effort","time","mistake"],"sentence":"She made a great ______ to finish her project on time. Despite working late into the night and sacrificing her weekend, her hard work and determination paid off.","translation":"她為了按時完成項目付出了很大的努力。儘管她工作到深夜並犧牲了周末時間，但她的辛勤工作和決心最終得到了回報。","word":"effort"}},"effortlessly":{"createdAt":1782187611207,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"effortlessly 表示做某事不需要費力或不費勁，輕輕鬆鬆地完成。","options":["nervously","carefully","effortlessly","slowly"],"sentence":"The professional pianist performed the difficult composition ______, making it seem incredibly simple. The audience was amazed because she didn't appear to struggle with even the most technical passages.","translation":"這位專業鋼琴家毫不費力地演奏了這首困難的作品，使它看起來簡單得難以置信。觀眾很驚訝，因為她即使在最技術性的段落也似乎沒有感到困難。","word":"effortlessly"}},"ego":{"createdAt":1784212160298,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ego指的是自我評價、自我中心或自負的態度，特別是指對自己的過度重視和易受傷害的自尊心。","options":["humility","ego","confidence","talent"],"sentence":"His ______ was so fragile that he couldn't accept even constructive criticism from his team. When someone pointed out a minor mistake in his work, he became defensive and angry for days.","translation":"他的自尊心非常脆弱，以至於他無法接受團隊中的任何建設性批評。當有人指出他工作中的一個小錯誤時，他會變得防守心態強且生氣好幾天。","word":"ego"}},"elaborate":{"createdAt":1783955448030,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"elaborate 作為動詞表示精心製作或詳細說明，通常意味著在原有基礎上增加細節和複雜性。","options":["simplify","elaborate","repeat","abbreviate"],"sentence":"The chef decided to ______ on the simple recipe by adding five additional ingredients and three cooking techniques. The result was a complex dish that took three hours to prepare.","translation":"廚師決定通過添加五種額外的食材和三種烹飪技術來精心製作這個簡單食譜。結果是一道複雜的菜餚，花了三個小時才準備好。","word":"elaborate"}},"elastic":{"createdAt":1781427134900,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"elastic在此指具有靈活性和適應性，能夠根據情況進行調整。","options":["strict","elastic","permanent","mandatory"],"sentence":"The company's work schedule is quite ______, allowing employees to adjust their hours based on personal needs. Workers can come in early or stay late depending on their family commitments.","translation":"公司的工作時間表相當靈活，允許員工根據個人需求調整他們的工作時間。員工可以根據家庭承諾提早上班或延遲下班。","word":"elastic"}},"elbow":{"createdAt":1783255660824,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"elbow 是名詞，指的是手臂與前臂之間的關節部位。","options":["shoulder","elbow","wrist","knee"],"sentence":"When she fell off the skateboard, she scraped her ______ badly on the concrete. The doctor examined the joint where her arm bends and applied bandages to the wound.","translation":"她從滑板上摔下來時，手肘在混凝土上嚴重擦傷。醫生檢查了她手臂彎曲的關節，並在傷口上貼上繃帶。","word":"elbow"}},"elect":{"createdAt":1785600431191,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"elect 是指通過投票選舉官員或領導人的行為，在這裡特指公民透過選票選出總統。","options":["appoint","hire","elect","nominate"],"sentence":"The citizens will ______ a new president in the upcoming national election. Millions of voters will cast their ballots to choose who will lead the country for the next four years.","translation":"公民將在即將舉行的全國選舉中選舉新總統。數百萬選民將投票決定誰將在未來四年領導國家。","word":"elect"}},"election":{"createdAt":1783243598913,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"election 是指人民通過投票選出代表或領導人的正式過程和事件。","options":["survey","election","debate","campaign"],"sentence":"The presidential ______ will take place next November when voters go to the polls. Citizens will cast their ballots to choose the next leader of the country.","translation":"總統選舉將在明年十一月舉行，屆時選民將前往投票站。公民將投票選擇國家的下一位領導人。","word":"election"}},"electric":{"createdAt":1783584143069,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"electric是形容詞，表示由電力驅動或與電力相關的，通常用於描述使用電力運作的裝置或系統。","options":["magnetic","electric","thermal","chemical"],"sentence":"The city installed new ______ lights throughout the downtown area to replace the old gas lamps. These modern lights use power from a grid and can be switched on and off instantly.","translation":"該市在市中心安裝了新的電動燈，以取代舊的煤氣燈。這些現代燈使用來自電網的電力，可以瞬間開關。","word":"electric"}},"electrician":{"createdAt":1781598671096,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"electrician 作名詞表示電工或電氣技師，是專門從事電氣維修和安裝的技術人員","options":["plumber","electrician","carpenter","painter"],"sentence":"The ______ quickly diagnosed the electrical problem in the building and fixed the wiring. The power was restored within two hours of his arrival.","translation":"電工迅速診斷了建築物中的電氣問題並修復了佈線。他到達後兩小時內電力已恢復。","word":"electrician"}},"electricity":{"createdAt":1782202115969,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"electricity 指電力或電流，在這個句子中用來描述驅動街燈和家庭照明的能源。","options":["water","electricity","fuel","gas"],"sentence":"The storm knocked out the ______ supply to the entire neighborhood. Without power, the streetlights went dark and families had to use candles for illumination.","translation":"暴風雨中斷了整個社區的電力供應。沒有電力，街燈熄滅了，家庭不得不用蠟燭來照明。","word":"electricity"}},"electronic":{"createdAt":1783609867010,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"electronic是形容詞，表示由電力驅動或涉及電力的設備或系統","options":["mechanical","electronic","wooden","plastic"],"sentence":"The ______ device requires batteries to operate. My smartphone, laptop, and tablet all need power sources to function.","translation":"這個電子設備需要電池才能運作。我的智慧型手機、筆記型電腦和平板電腦都需要電源才能運作。","word":"electronic"}},"electronics":{"createdAt":1782477421076,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"electronics 是指涉及電氣設備、電路和電子元件的學科和技術領域。","options":["sports","mechanics","electronics","gardening"],"sentence":"My son is fascinated by ______ and spends hours building circuits and experimenting with microchips. He dreams of becoming an engineer who designs computer components.","translation":"我的兒子對電子學著迷，花幾小時組裝電路和實驗微芯片。他夢想成為設計電腦零件的工程師。","word":"electronics"}},"elegance":{"createdAt":1784648623659,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"elegance 指「優雅、高雅、精緻」，用於形容設計、外表或風格中的精美品質。","options":["chaos","elegance","neglect","simplicity"],"sentence":"The ballroom was decorated with ______ and refinement. Every chandelier, curtain, and piece of furniture reflected a sophisticated and graceful aesthetic.","translation":"宴會廳以優雅和精緻來裝飾。每盞吊燈、窗簾和家具都反映了精緻而優美的美感。","word":"elegance"}},"elegant":{"createdAt":1783476327929,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"elegant 是形容詞，意為優雅的、高雅的、精美的，通常用來形容設計、風格或舉止富有品味和美感。","options":["harsh","elegant","chaotic","simple"],"sentence":"The ballroom was decorated in a ______ style with crystal chandeliers and marble columns. The refined aesthetics and sophisticated design impressed all the guests who attended the gala.","translation":"舞廳以優雅的風格裝飾，配有水晶吊燈和大理石柱子。精緻的美學和精妙的設計給參加慶典的所有嘉賓留下了深刻印象。","word":"elegant"}},"element":{"createdAt":1781583174626,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"element是指組成某物的基本成分或要素，對整體具有重要作用","options":["enemy","audience","element","problem"],"sentence":"Humor is an essential ______ of a good comedy film. Without it, the movie would fail to entertain audiences or make them laugh.","translation":"幽默是優秀喜劇電影的必要____。沒有它，這部電影將無法娛樂觀眾或使他們發笑。","word":"element"}},"elementary":{"createdAt":1783859537008,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"elementary 表示初級的、基礎的，用來形容最簡單和最基本的教育或知識級別。","options":["advanced","elementary","theoretical","professional"],"sentence":"Children begin learning ______ mathematics in their first years of school. The concepts include basic addition, subtraction, and simple number recognition.","translation":"兒童在上學的第一年就開始學習______數學。這些概念包括基本的加法、減法和簡單的數字認識。","word":"elementary"}},"elevate":{"createdAt":1785243810729,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"elevate 表示「舉起、抬起、提升」，在此引申為將某物或某人提升到更高的地位或水準。","options":["lower","maintain","elevate","abandon"],"sentence":"The new CEO's innovative strategies will ______ the company to a higher level of success. Her bold decisions have already transformed the organization into an industry leader.","translation":"新任執行長的創新策略將會把公司提升到更高的成功水平。她大膽的決策已經將組織轉變為業界領導者。","word":"elevate"}},"elevator":{"createdAt":1783305898350,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"elevator 是指在建築物內垂直運輸人員或貨物的機械裝置，通常安裝在樓層之間。","options":["staircase","escalator","elevator","corridor"],"sentence":"The office building has a broken ______ on the third floor. Workers must now climb the stairs because the machine that moves people up and down between floors is not working.","translation":"辦公大樓三樓的電梯壞了。由於那台在樓層之間上下運送人員的機器無法工作，員工們現在必須爬樓梯。","word":"elevator"}},"eligible":{"createdAt":1781621431914,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"eligible 表示符合某些要求或條件，有資格參與或獲得某物。在此句中，強調申請人必須滿足特定的學歷要求才能有資格申請。","options":["qualified","eligible","interested","prepared"],"sentence":"To apply for this scholarship, you must be ______ to compete with other university students. Since you haven't finished high school yet, you cannot submit your application this year.","translation":"要申請這項獎學金，你必須有資格與其他大學生競爭。由於你還沒有完成高中學業，你今年無法提交申請。","word":"eligible"}},"eligibly":{"createdAt":1782016805977,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"eligibly 是副詞，表示以符合資格或合適的方式進行某事。","options":["ineligibly","eligibly","reluctantly","temporarily"],"sentence":"She met all the requirements and could ______ apply for the scholarship program. The selection committee confirmed that her academic record and test scores satisfied every criterion.","translation":"她滿足了所有要求，可以合適地申請獎學金計畫。選拔委員會確認她的學術記錄和考試成績滿足了每一項標準。","word":"eligibly"}},"eliminate":{"createdAt":1782092862166,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"eliminate意思是完全移除或排除某人或某物，使其不再是整體的一部分。","options":["suspend","eliminate","promote","transfer"],"sentence":"The coach decided to ______ three players from the team roster due to poor performance. These athletes will no longer participate in training sessions or games.","translation":"教練決定因表現不佳而將三名球員從球隊名單中除名。這些運動員將不再參加訓練或比賽。","word":"eliminate"}},"elite":{"createdAt":1783346573164,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"elite 意為精英或掌權人物，指在某一領域最優秀、最有影響力的人群。","options":["ordinary","common","elite","average"],"sentence":"The ______ members of the club enjoy exclusive access to private facilities and events. These distinguished individuals represent the top 5% of wealth and influence in the city.","translation":"俱樂部的精英成員享有對私人設施和活動的獨家進入權。這些傑出人士代表了城市財富和影響力的前5%。","word":"elite"}},"eloquent":{"createdAt":1784376501501,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"eloquent 形容詞表示某人能用語言流暢、有說服力地表達思想，往往能打動聽眾的情感和理智。","options":["loud","eloquent","quick","tall"],"sentence":"The ______ speaker captivated the entire audience with his powerful delivery and persuasive arguments. His ability to use language effectively made even the skeptics reconsider their positions.","translation":"那位雄辯的演講者用他有力的表達和有說服力的論點吸引了整個觀眾。他有效使用語言的能力甚至讓懷疑者重新考慮他們的立場。","word":"eloquent"}},"embark":{"createdAt":1781434900596,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"embark指開始一次旅程或冒險，特別是通常涉及上船。","options":["abandon","embark","return","delay"],"sentence":"The explorers prepared to ______ on their dangerous expedition to the Arctic. They boarded their ship with supplies for a two-year journey.","translation":"探險家們準備開始他們危險的北極遠征。他們帶著兩年旅程的物資登上了他們的船。","word":"embark"}},"embarrassed":{"createdAt":1783423026254,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"embarrassed 表示因為在他人面前出現失誤或尷尬情況而感到羞愧和不安，與 proud、confident、relieved（驕傲、自信、輕鬆）相反，句子描述了典型的尷尬身體反應。","options":["proud","confident","embarrassed","relieved"],"sentence":"The performer felt ______ when she forgot her lines during the live broadcast. Her face turned red and she had difficulty making eye contact with the audience for the rest of the show.","translation":"表演者在直播中忘詞時感到尷尬。她的臉變紅了，在演出的其餘時間裡她很難與觀眾有眼神接觸。","word":"embarrassed"}},"embrace":{"createdAt":1782016805983,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"embrace 是動詞，表示接受、擁抱或熱情地採納某事物或某種想法。","options":["reject","avoid","embrace","question"],"sentence":"The university decided to ______ the new digital learning platform for all its courses. Faculty members across all departments have integrated the technology into their classrooms.","translation":"該大學決定在所有課程中採納新的數位學習平台。各個部門的教職員工已將該技術整合到他們的課堂中。","word":"embrace"}},"emerge":{"createdAt":1781437013467,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"emerge 意為浮現或出現，通常用於某人或某事物逐漸變得知名或受到關注的情況。","options":["disappear","emerge","decline","retreat"],"sentence":"After years of obscurity, the talented musician finally began to ______ on the international stage. Critics praised her performances at major concert halls across Europe and America.","translation":"經過多年的默默無聞後，這位才華橫溢的音樂家終於開始在國際舞台上浮現。歐洲和美洲主要音樂廳的評論家都稱讚了她的表演。","word":"emerge"}},"emergency":{"createdAt":1781693265625,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"緊急情況指需要迅速處理和應對的意外事件或危機。","options":["birthday","emergency","vacation","training"],"sentence":"During the fire alarm, staff immediately activated the ______ response plan. The procedure included evacuation routes and assembly points for all employees.","translation":"火警警報期間，員工立即啟動緊急應變計畫。該程序包括所有員工的疏散路線和集合點。","word":"emergency"}},"emerging":{"createdAt":1789747025033,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"emerging 動詞表示顯現、浮現或新興，用來形容正在出現或發展中的新事物、趨勢或經濟體。","options":["established","declining","emerging","traditional"],"sentence":"Many ______ tech companies in Southeast Asia are attracting investors from around the world. These young industries are still developing but showing great promise and rapid growth.","translation":"許多新興的科技公司在東南亞吸引了來自世界各地的投資者。這些年輕的產業仍在發展中，但展現出巨大的潛力和快速的成長。","word":"emerging"}},"emigrant":{"createdAt":1784190145226,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"emigrant 是指離開自己的原住地或祖國前往他地定居的人，強調的是「離開」的動作。","options":["immigrant","emigrant","traveler","refugee"],"sentence":"The ______ left his homeland to seek better opportunities in a new country. He packed his belongings and boarded a ship heading westward across the Atlantic Ocean.","translation":"那位移民離開了自己的祖國，尋求在新國家中更好的機會。他收拾行李，登上了一艘前往大西洋彼岸的船。","word":"emigrant"}},"emigrate":{"createdAt":1784701140000,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"emigrate 表示從自己的祖國移出去到另一個國家定居，強調的是離開本國的動作。","options":["immigrate","emigrate","migrate","navigate"],"sentence":"Many families decided to ______ from their homeland in search of better opportunities abroad. They packed their belongings and boarded a ship heading to North America.","translation":"許多家庭決定從故鄉移民到國外尋求更好的機會。他們收拾行李，登上了前往北美的船隻。","word":"emigrate"}},"emigration":{"createdAt":1781507137217,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"emigration 指的是人民從自己的國家移出或遷往他國，強調離開祖國的行為。","options":["immigration","emigration","celebration","exploration"],"sentence":"The country experienced massive ______ during the economic crisis of the 1980s. Millions of citizens left their homeland to seek better opportunities abroad.","translation":"這個國家在1980年代的經濟危機期間經歷了大規模的移居。數百萬公民離開他們的祖國去尋求海外的更好機會。","word":"emigration"}},"emission":{"createdAt":1783346573163,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"emission 意為排放或散發，特別指物質從源頭釋放到環境中的過程。","options":["absorption","emission","production","consumption"],"sentence":"The factory's carbon dioxide ______ has decreased by 40% since installing new filters. The government monitored the air quality daily to track the reduction in pollutants.","translation":"該工廠自從安裝新過濾器以來，二氧化碳排放已減少了40%。政府每天監測空氣品質以追蹤污染物的減少。","word":"emission"}},"emotion":{"createdAt":1781424356418,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"emotion指的是人所經歷的強烈而主觀的感受或心理反應，如喜悅、悲傷或憤怒。","options":["schedule","emotion","decision","expense"],"sentence":"She struggled to control her ______ when she received the news of her promotion. Tears of joy streamed down her face as she felt overwhelming happiness and gratitude.","translation":"當她收到晉升的消息時，她努力控制自己的情感。當她感到莫大的喜悅和感激時，淚水從她的臉上流下。","word":"emotion"}},"emotional":{"createdAt":1781566055841,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"emotional 用來形容受到強烈感受或情感影響的狀態，通常伴隨著對事物的情感反應。","options":["logical","emotional","physical","practical"],"sentence":"After hearing the sad news, she became very ______ and couldn't stop crying. Her reaction showed how deeply the loss had affected her feelings.","translation":"聽到悲傷的消息後，她變得非常情緒化，無法停止哭泣。她的反應表明這個損失對她的感受有多深遠的影響。","word":"emotional"}},"empathy":{"createdAt":1781693538703,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"empathy 指的是能夠理解和感受他人的情感和處境的能力。","options":["ignorance","empathy","criticism","skepticism"],"sentence":"The counselor showed great ______ when listening to the patient's difficult life story. She understood their pain and offered genuine support rather than judgment.","translation":"諮詢師在聽患者困難的人生故事時表現出了極大的同理心。她理解他們的痛苦，並提供真誠的支持而不是批評。","word":"empathy"}},"emperor":{"createdAt":1781566185159,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"emperor指的是一個國家或帝國的最高統治者，擁有絕對的權力和權威。","options":["servant","emperor","merchant","scholar"],"sentence":"The ______ ruled over a vast empire for fifty years. He made all the major political decisions and was considered the supreme leader of the entire nation.","translation":"那位皇帝統治了一個遼闊的帝國五十年。他做出了所有重大的政治決定，被認為是整個國家的最高統治者。","word":"emperor"}},"emphasis":{"createdAt":1781832478022,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"emphasis 意為「強調」或「著重」，用來表示對某事特別重視和突出強調。","options":["doubt","emphasis","criticism","confusion"],"sentence":"The teacher placed strong ______ on the importance of studying for the final exam. She repeated several times that this test would determine our final grade.","translation":"老師強調了期末考試的重要性。她多次重複說這次考試將決定我們的最終成績。","word":"emphasis"}},"emphasize":{"createdAt":1783843483369,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"emphasize表示「強調」或「著重」，指特別強烈地表達或突出某事物的重要性，使其受到特別關注。","options":["teach","emphasize","mention","explain"],"sentence":"The teacher continued to ______ the importance of reading comprehension during every class. She repeatedly highlighted this skill because many students struggled with understanding complex texts.","translation":"老師在每堂課中都持續強調閱讀理解的重要性。她反復突出這項技能是因為許多學生都難以理解複雜的文本。","word":"emphasize"}},"empire":{"createdAt":1783946375009,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"empire指的是由一個皇帝或統治者統治的龐大領土和人民的集合，通常跨越多個地區和民族。","options":["kingdom","empire","colony","nation"],"sentence":"The Roman ______ once controlled vast territories across Europe, Africa, and Asia. At its height, it stretched from Britain to Mesopotamia and included millions of subjects under a single ruler.","translation":"羅馬帝國曾經控制了歐洲、非洲和亞洲的廣大領土。在其鼎盛時期，它從英國延伸到美索不達米亞，並包含在單一統治者下的數百萬臣民。","word":"empire"}},"empire_states_in_mind":{"createdAt":1784899523214,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Empire States in mind指以紐約州為中心、認為該州應該主導全國的心態，體現了一種區域優越感。","options":["regional pride","Empire States in mind","geographical awareness","state loyalty"],"sentence":"The politician's ______ was evident in his speeches, where he constantly promoted New York's interests above all other regions. He believed that the state should be the cultural and economic center of the entire nation.","translation":"那位政治家的帝國心態在他的演講中顯而易見，他不斷地將紐約州的利益置於所有其他地區之上。他相信該州應該是整個國家的文化和經濟中心。","word":"Empire States in mind"}},"empirical":{"createdAt":1781359980239,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"empirical指基於實驗觀察和實際數據而非理論的；強調通過親身經驗或實驗驗證的方式獲得的知識。","options":["theoretical","empirical","hypothetical","abstract"],"sentence":"The scientist's ______ evidence was based on carefully controlled experiments and measurements. She collected data over five years rather than relying on theories or assumptions.","translation":"科學家的經驗證據是基於仔細控制的實驗和測量。她用了五年時間蒐集資料，而不是依賴理論或假設。","word":"empirical"}},"enchant":{"createdAt":1783243171146,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"enchant表示用魔法或神奇的方式使某人著迷、被深深吸引，在這裡強調的是魔幻的吸引力而非單純的娛樂。","options":["confuse","enchant","educate","entertain"],"sentence":"The magician's performance seemed to ______ the entire audience with illusions and tricks. Everyone sat mesmerized as rabbits appeared from empty hats.","translation":"魔術師的表演似乎用幻術和戲法吸引了整個觀眾。當兔子從空帽子裡出現時，每個人都坐著被迷住了。","word":"enchant"}},"enclose":{"createdAt":1785995979827,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"enclose 表示將某物放在裡面或隨附某物，特別是在郵件或包裹中附上文件或物品。","options":["ignore","enclose","delay","remove"],"sentence":"Please ______ your resume with your application form when you submit it. I have already prepared all the necessary documents to send along with your letter.","translation":"提交申請時，請隨附你的履歷表。我已經準備好所有必要的文件隨信寄出。","word":"enclose"}},"enclosed":{"createdAt":1783068339361,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"enclosed 形容詞表示被圍住的、密閉的或附上的","options":["open","enclosed","torn","blank"],"sentence":"The letter came in an ______ envelope that was sealed shut. Inside the sealed package was a confidential document meant only for the recipient.","translation":"信件裝在密封的信封裡。在密封的包裝內是一份只供收件人的機密文件。","word":"enclosed"}},"encounter":{"createdAt":1784173464335,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"encounter 指意外或突然地遇到某人或某事，通常涉及某種相遇或對面。","options":["avoid","encounter","search","befriend"],"sentence":"During her hiking trip, Sarah unexpectedly began to ______ several wild animals on the mountain trail. She had to remain calm and back away slowly from each dangerous situation.","translation":"在她的登山旅行中，莎拉在山路上意外地遇到了幾隻野生動物。她必須保持冷靜，並從每一個危險情況中緩慢退後。","word":"encounter"}},"encourage":{"createdAt":1783685028742,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"encourage是動詞，表示鼓勵或給予信心，用來描述激勵某人採取行動或增強他們的信心和動力。","options":["discourage","threaten","encourage","criticize"],"sentence":"The coach's words of praise continued to ______ the athletes to perform at their best. With such positive reinforcement, the team felt motivated to train harder and achieve greater success.","translation":"教練的讚美之詞持續鼓勵運動員發揮最佳表現。有了這樣的正面強化，球隊感到有動力更努力地訓練並取得更大的成功。","word":"encourage"}},"encouragement":{"createdAt":1784614290057,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"encouragement是名詞，指的是給予他人勇氣、信心或動力去做某事的言語或行為，通常帶有正面和支持的含義。","options":["criticism","encouragement","distraction","punishment"],"sentence":"The coach's ______ helped the athlete overcome self-doubt and push through the difficult training. Without this positive reinforcement and support from someone she trusted, she might have given up.","translation":"教練的鼓勵幫助運動員克服自我懷疑，並堅持艱苦的訓練。如果沒有來自她信任的人的這種積極強化和支持，她可能已經放棄了。","word":"encouragement"}},"encroachment":{"createdAt":1783255652195,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"encroachment表示「侵入、侵占」，指未經授權或逐漸地進入或佔據他人的領地或權利。","options":["encroachment","protection","expansion","improvement"],"sentence":"The ______ of suburban development into the forest has been ongoing for years. Wildlife habitats are shrinking as new houses and roads are built deeper into protected areas.","translation":"郊區開發對森林的侵占已經持續多年。隨著新房屋和道路建進受保護區域的深處，野生動物棲息地在萎縮。","word":"encroachment"}},"encyclopedia":{"createdAt":1786871362529,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"encyclopedia是一部包含許多主題的綜合參考書，按字母或主題分類排列，提供關於各種知識領域的信息。","options":["novel","encyclopedia","newspaper","dictionary"],"sentence":"Maria consulted a comprehensive ______ to learn about ancient civilizations for her history project. She needed a single reference book that contained articles on thousands of topics arranged alphabetically.","translation":"瑪麗亞查閱了一本全面的百科全書來了解古代文明以完成她的歷史項目。她需要一本包含數千篇按字母順序排列的文章的單一參考書。","word":"encyclopedia"}},"end_up_with":{"createdAt":1782361629313,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"end up with 短語表示「最終擁有」或「最後得到」，指經過一系列事件或談判後最終獲得的結果。","options":["started with","ended up with","rejected","ignored"],"sentence":"After negotiating with the car dealer for two hours, he ______ a significantly discounted price on the luxury vehicle. The salesman finally agreed to reduce the original asking price by 15 percent.","translation":"在與汽車經銷商談判兩小時後，他最終以大幅折扣的價格買到了這輛豪華車。銷售員最終同意將原始要價降低了15％。","word":"end up with"}},"endanger":{"createdAt":1781798927527,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"endanger 表示使某人或某物處於危險或風險中，可能造成傷害或損失。","options":["protect","endanger","educate","celebrate"],"sentence":"Reckless driving on the highway can ______ the lives of innocent passengers and pedestrians. Statistics show that speeding and ignoring traffic signals cause thousands of accidents annually.","translation":"在高速公路上魯莽駕駛會危及無辜乘客和行人的生命。統計數據顯示，超速和無視交通信號每年導致數千起事故。","word":"endanger"}},"endangered":{"createdAt":1781961517452,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"endangered 表示物種面臨滅絕的危險，強調物種已經進入危急狀態。","options":["rare","endangered","protected","threatened"],"sentence":"The giant panda was once considered an ______ species on the brink of extinction. Thanks to conservation efforts, its population has gradually increased over the past decade.","translation":"大熊貓曾經被認為是瀕臨滅絕的物種。由於保護措施，其數量在過去十年裡逐漸增加。","word":"endangered"}},"endeavor":{"createdAt":1781884659834,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"endeavor 表示為達成目標而持續努力和嘗試，與二十年的堅持不懈相呼應。","options":["struggle","endeavor","hesitate","retreat"],"sentence":"Despite facing countless obstacles, the scientist continued to ______ toward finding a cure for the disease. Her persistent determination finally led to a breakthrough after twenty years.","translation":"儘管面臨無數障礙，這位科學家繼續努力尋找這種疾病的治療方法。她的堅持決心在二十年後終於取得了突破。","word":"endeavor"}},"endorse":{"createdAt":1781621431920,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"endorse 意為公開支持、贊同或認可某個人、產品或想法，通常涉及將個人信譽借予該對象以增加其可信度。","options":["promote","endorse","produce","purchase"],"sentence":"The famous athlete decided to ______ the new sports drink by appearing in its advertisements. His signature and public approval helped boost sales significantly because many fans trust his opinion.","translation":"這位著名運動員決定透過在廣告中現身來贊同這款新運動飲料。他的簽名和公開認可幫助銷售額大幅增長，因為許多粉絲信任他的意見。","word":"endorse"}},"endorsement":{"createdAt":1782018712117,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"「endorsement」指對某人或某事的公開支持、贊同或認可，常用於商業和政治領域。","options":["criticism","ignorance","endorsement","rejection"],"sentence":"The celebrity's ______ of the new product helped boost its sales significantly. Without her public approval and backing, the campaign would have failed.","translation":"名人對這個新產品的贊同幫助大幅提升了銷售量。如果沒有她的公開認可和支持，這個活動就會失敗。","word":"endorsement"}},"endowment":{"createdAt":1784979555337,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"endowment（捐贈；資助）在此指大額的金錢捐獻，用於長期支持教育機構，與第二句中「generous gift of millions of dollars」描述的永久性資助相符。","options":["scholarship","endowment","tuition","expense"],"sentence":"The university received a substantial ______ from a wealthy donor to support scholarships for underprivileged students. This generous gift of millions of dollars will provide financial aid for generations to come.","translation":"該大學收到了一位富有捐贈者的大筆捐贈，用以支持貧困學生的獎學金。這份數百萬美元的慷慨禮物將在未來幾代人中提供財政援助。","word":"endowment"}},"endurance":{"createdAt":1782550983734,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"endurance 指的是在長時間或困難條件下堅持下去的能力，特別是指身體或精神上的忍耐力","options":["speed","endurance","flexibility","strength"],"sentence":"Marathon runners must develop exceptional physical ______ to complete the 42-kilometer race. They train for months to build the stamina needed to keep running despite exhaustion.","translation":"馬拉松運動員必須培養非凡的耐力來完成42公里的比賽。他們訓練數月以建立即使在疲勞時也能持續跑步所需的體力。","word":"endurance"}},"endure":{"createdAt":1783499198619,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"endure 作為動詞表示忍耐或承受困難的情況，強調在艱苦條件下堅持下去。","options":["enjoy","escape","endure","avoid"],"sentence":"The marathon runners had to ______ extreme heat and fatigue during the race. Many participants pushed through the pain for hours to cross the finish line.","translation":"馬拉松選手們在比賽中必須忍受極端的炎熱和疲勞。許多參賽者堅持數小時克服疼痛以衝過終點線。","word":"endure"}},"enforcement":{"createdAt":1782529318039,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"enforcement 意為執行或強制執行，用於表達對法律或規定的實施。","options":["creation","enforcement","suggestion","discussion"],"sentence":"Strict ______ of traffic laws has reduced the number of accidents in the city. Police patrols and speed cameras work together to ensure drivers comply with road regulations.","translation":"嚴格執行交通法規減少了城市中的交通事故數量。警察巡邏和測速攝像頭共同努力確保駕駛員遵守道路規定。","word":"enforcement"}},"engage":{"createdAt":1781709890957,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"engage作為動詞表示參與、從事或投入某項活動，通常暗示積極主動的參與。","options":["engage","hazard","hesitation","obsession"],"sentence":"The two competitors decided to ______ in a friendly debate about the best strategies for sustainable development. After hours of discussing different perspectives, both sides gained valuable insights from each other.","translation":"這兩位競爭者決定參與一場關於永續發展最佳策略的友誼辯論。在經過數小時討論不同觀點後，雙方都從彼此身上獲得了寶貴的見解。","word":"engage"}},"engaged":{"createdAt":1781485266371,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"engaged在此表示「正在從事某事」或「忙於」，表示某人目前正被某項活動佔據。","options":["married","disengaged","engaged","betrothed"],"sentence":"She was ______ in an intense phone conversation when I arrived at her office. She held up one finger to signal she would be free in just a few minutes.","translation":"我到達她辦公室時，她正忙於一通激烈的電話交談。她舉起一根手指示意幾分鐘後就能空出時間。","word":"engaged"}},"engagement":{"createdAt":1783330993548,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"engagement（訂婚）在此語境中指兩個人結婚前的正式承諾，通常伴隨求婚戒指和婚禮計畫。","options":["betrayal","rejection","engagement","dismissal"],"sentence":"After dating for three years, he proposed and she accepted his ______. They announced their wedding date to family and friends immediately.","translation":"交往三年後，他向她求婚，她接受了他的訂婚提議。他們立即向家人和朋友宣布了他們的婚禮日期。","word":"engagement"}},"engaging":{"createdAt":1783516186775,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"engaging 是指有吸引力、迷人或能夠引起他人興趣的特質。","options":["boring","dull","engaging","monotonous"],"sentence":"The speaker's ______ presentation kept the audience on the edge of their seats for two hours. Everyone was so captivated that no one even checked their phones.","translation":"那位演講者迷人的演講使觀眾兩小時都坐立不安。每個人都被深深吸引，以至於沒有人查看手機。","word":"engaging"}},"engine":{"createdAt":1783986695046,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"engine 是指汽車或機器的動力來源裝置，負責產生動力使車輛或機器能夠運轉。","options":["wheel","engine","battery","dashboard"],"sentence":"The car's ______ stopped working, so the mechanic had to repair it. Without this mechanical component, the vehicle cannot run at all.","translation":"汽車的引擎停止運作，所以機械師必須修理它。沒有這個機械零件，車輛根本無法運行。","word":"engine"}},"engineer":{"createdAt":1781598671072,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"engineer 作名詞表示工程師，是設計和建造結構或機械的專業人士","options":["architect","engineer","contractor","inspector"],"sentence":"The senior ______ designed a revolutionary bridge that could withstand earthquakes. Her innovative structural solutions have been adopted by engineering firms worldwide.","translation":"這位資深工程師設計了一座能抵抗地震的革命性橋樑。她的創新結構解決方案已被世界各地的工程公司採用。","word":"engineer"}},"enhance":{"createdAt":1781583174626,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"enhance是指改進或增強某物的品質、價值或效果，使其變得更好","options":["reduce","enhance","maintain","spoil"],"sentence":"Adding fresh herbs will ______ the flavor of your soup significantly. The taste will become more complex and delicious compared to the original recipe.","translation":"添加新鮮香草將大幅____您湯的風味。與原始食譜相比，味道會變得更加複雜和美味。","word":"enhance"}},"enlighten":{"createdAt":1781323901187,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"enlighten意為「啟迪」或「開導」，表示通過提供信息和知識來消除他人的誤解。","options":["confuse","mislead","enlighten","deceive"],"sentence":"The teacher's lecture helped ______ students about the true causes of climate change. By presenting scientific evidence and data, she cleared up many misconceptions they had held.","translation":"老師的講座幫助開導學生了解氣候變化的真正原因。通過呈現科學證據和數據，她消除了他們持有的許多誤解。","word":"enlighten"}},"enormous":{"createdAt":1783426292405,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"enormous形容詞表示非常大或龐大，超過通常的程度，常用於描述規模、數量或程度很大的事物。","options":["tiny","small","enormous","minor"],"sentence":"The construction company faced an ______ challenge when building the new skyscraper in the downtown area. The project required three years of work and involved thousands of workers.","translation":"建築公司在市中心建造新摩天大樓時面臨巨大的挑戰。該項目需要三年的工作，涉及數千名工人。","word":"enormous"}},"enormously":{"createdAt":1781564440926,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"enormously 作副詞表示巨大地、極大地，用來修飾動詞或形容詞以強調程度。","options":["slightly","enormously","modestly","gradually"],"sentence":"The technology industry has grown ______ in the last twenty years. The sector now employs millions of people and generates trillions of dollars in revenue worldwide.","translation":"技術產業在過去二十年裡巨幅增長。該部門現在僱用了數百萬人，在全球創造了數万億美元的收入。","word":"enormously"}},"enrich":{"createdAt":1784004063898,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"enrich 作為動詞表示「使豐富」或「使充實」，指透過增加知識或體驗來改善和提升。","options":["burden","enrich","confuse","limit"],"sentence":"Reading classic literature can ______ your mind and expand your understanding of human nature. Many educators believe that such books provide insight and perspective that mass media cannot offer.","translation":"閱讀經典文學可以豐富你的心靈，擴展你對人類本性的理解。許多教育工作者相信這些書籍提供的見解和視角是大眾媒體無法提供的。","word":"enrich"}},"enroll":{"createdAt":1783130376321,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"enroll 意為登記或報名入學，學生在開始課程前必須先完成登記手續。","options":["graduate","enroll","teach","dismiss"],"sentence":"Students must ______ in the university before the deadline to secure their place in the program. The registration office requires all applicants to complete this formal admission process by August 31st.","translation":"學生必須在截止日期前在大學註冊以確保他們在課程中的名額。註冊辦公室要求所有申請者在8月31日前完成這個正式的入學程序。","word":"enroll"}},"enrollment":{"createdAt":1781427134891,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"enrollment是指註冊入學的人數或過程，與申請新學生直接相關。","options":["graduation","enrollment","tuition","curriculum"],"sentence":"The university's ______ numbers increased by 30% this year. The admissions office had to hire additional staff to process all the new student applications.","translation":"這所大學的登記人數今年增加了30%。招生辦公室不得不雇用額外的工作人員來處理所有新學生的申請。","word":"enrollment"}},"ensure":{"createdAt":1781362281665,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ensure表示擔保或確保某事肯定會發生，強調保證和確定性。","options":["ignore","ensure","question","dispute"],"sentence":"The safety inspectors will ______ that the building meets all building codes. They conduct thorough checks before issuing approval certificates.","translation":"安全檢查員將確保建築物符合所有建築法規。他們在頒發批准證書前進行徹底檢查。","word":"ensure"}},"enterprise":{"createdAt":1784818655892,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"enterprise 是指商業性的企業或公司組織，特別是指創業型的商業活動。","options":["hobby","enterprise","school","family"],"sentence":"The startup ______ began with just three employees working from a small office. Within five years, it grew into a major company with operations across multiple countries.","translation":"這家初創企業開始時只有三名員工在一間小辦公室工作。五年內，它發展成為在多個國家運營的大公司。","word":"enterprise"}},"entertain":{"createdAt":1781746685505,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"entertain指的是招待、款待、使歡樂，表示提供娛樂活動或使他人感到愉快。","options":["obedience","entertain","affirm","terminate"],"sentence":"The host worked hard to ______ the guests throughout the evening. Everyone enjoyed the music, jokes, and delicious food that kept them smiling and laughing.","translation":"主人整晚努力招待客人。每個人都享受音樂、笑話和美食，這些讓他們一直微笑和歡笑。","word":"entertain"}},"entertaining":{"createdAt":1783558795714,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"entertaining 形容詞表示娛樂性的、有趣的、令人愉快的，用來形容能夠提供娛樂和樂趣的事物。","options":["boring","entertaining","confusing","sad"],"sentence":"The comedy show was so ______ that the audience laughed throughout the entire performance. Everyone left the theater in a great mood.","translation":"那場喜劇表演非常娛樂性十足，觀眾在整個演出過程中都在笑。每個人都以愉快的心情離開了劇院。","word":"entertaining"}},"entertainment":{"createdAt":1782395163853,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"entertainment 是名詞，指為取悅觀眾或使其消遣而提供的表演或活動。","options":["recreation","entertainment","amusement","hobby"],"sentence":"The hotel's ______ program includes live music, comedy shows, and dancing every evening. Guests love spending their nights enjoying these activities in the grand ballroom.","translation":"飯店的娛樂節目每晚都包括現場音樂、喜劇表演和舞蹈。客人喜歡在大宴會廳享受這些活動來度過晚上。","word":"entertainment"}},"enthusiasm":{"createdAt":1781274836862,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"enthusiasm表示對某事的熱心和熱忱，特別是指積極且充滿能量的態度。","options":["laziness","enthusiasm","confusion","criticism"],"sentence":"The team played with great ______ throughout the entire championship match. Their energy and positive attitude inspired everyone in the stadium to cheer loudly.","translation":"這支隊伍在整個錦標賽比賽中以極大的熱心參賽。他們的能量和積極態度激勵了體育館裡的每個人大聲歡呼。","word":"enthusiasm"}},"enthusiastic":{"createdAt":1783402916389,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"enthusiastic 形容對某事充滿熱情、熱心和積極的態度。","options":["boring","reluctant","enthusiastic","neutral"],"sentence":"Sarah gave an ______ presentation about marine conservation at the science conference. Her passionate speech and engaging slides inspired many audience members to support ocean protection.","translation":"莎拉在科學會議上熱烈地介紹了海洋保護。她充滿激情的演講和引人入勝的幻燈片激勵了許多觀眾支持海洋保護。","word":"enthusiastic"}},"entire":{"createdAt":1784616241154,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"entire（完全的；全部的）表示全部、完整的時間或事物，在這裡指一整天的時間沒有中斷。","options":["partial","entire","brief","early"],"sentence":"She spent the ______ day working on her project without taking any breaks. From morning until night, she devoted every single moment to completing it.","translation":"她用整整一天的時間在做她的專案而沒有休息。從早上到晚上，她把每一個時刻都用於完成它。","word":"entire"}},"entitle":{"createdAt":1781841505535,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"entitle 表示給予權利或使某人符合資格，通常與官方許可或資格相關。","options":["wonder","entitle","pollute","legendary"],"sentence":"Having a valid passport should ______ you to enter most countries without requiring additional documentation. The government issues these documents specifically to grant citizens this right.","translation":"擁有有效的護照應該使你有權進入大多數國家而無需額外文件。政府發放這些文件的目的就是為了賦予公民這項權利。","word":"entitle"}},"entity":{"createdAt":1781598671075,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"entity 作名詞表示實體或獨立存在的單位，在法律和商業中指作為一個整體而存在的組織","options":["person","entity","relationship","concept"],"sentence":"The corporation is a legal ______ that can own property and sign contracts independently. It operates as a separate organization distinct from its individual shareholders and owners.","translation":"該公司是一個獨立擁有財產和簽署合同的法律實體。它作為一個獨立組織運營，與其個別股東和所有者不同。","word":"entity"}},"entrance":{"createdAt":1781582619548,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"entrance 在此指建築物或場所的開口或門道，遊客進入時使用的通道。","options":["exit","entrance","corridor","window"],"sentence":"The museum's grand ______ was decorated with marble columns and statues. Visitors had to pass through this ornate doorway to get inside the building.","translation":"博物館宏偉的入口裝飾著大理石柱子和雕像。訪客必須通過這扇華麗的門道才能進入建築物內部。","word":"entrance"}},"entrepreneur":{"createdAt":1785111901211,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"entrepreneur 指的是創業者或企業家，是那些自己創辦並經營商業企業的人，通常要承擔風險和責任。","options":["employee","entrepreneur","manager","investor"],"sentence":"An ______ is someone who starts and runs their own business venture. She left her corporate job to become an ______, launching a tech startup that now employs fifty people.","translation":"企業家是開創並經營自己事業的人。她離開了公司職位成為一名企業家，創辦了一家現在擁有五十名員工的科技新創公司。","word":"entrepreneur"}},"entry":{"createdAt":1781693538701,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"entry 指的是進入某個領域、行業或地點的過程，通常表示開始或加入。","options":["exit","entry","departure","rejection"],"sentence":"Her ______ into the music industry came after years of hard work and auditions. She finally signed her first record deal last month.","translation":"她進入音樂產業是在多年的努力和試鏡後才實現的。她終於在上個月簽署了第一份唱片合約。","word":"entry"}},"envious":{"createdAt":1784531912959,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"envious表示對他人擁有的東西或成就感到嫉妒和羨慕的情感","options":["happy","proud","envious","confused"],"sentence":"She felt ______ watching her friend win the award she had worked so hard for. The jealousy was so intense that she could barely congratulate her friend sincerely.","translation":"看著朋友贏得她辛苦爭取的獎項，她感到嫉妒。這種妒忌是如此強烈，以至於她幾乎無法真誠地祝賀朋友。","word":"envious"}},"envision":{"createdAt":1783759309662,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"envision 意為「想像或預見」，通常指在頭腦中形成一個清晰的心理圖像或願景。","options":["ignore","envision","construct","criticize"],"sentence":"The architect began to ______ a revolutionary design for the new museum that would incorporate sustainable materials and cutting-edge technology. The detailed blueprints she created demonstrated exactly what the finished building would look like in twenty years.","translation":"建築師開始想像一個革命性的博物館設計，將可持續材料和尖端技術結合在一起。她創建的詳細藍圖展示了完成後的建築在二十年內會是什麼樣子。","word":"envision"}},"envy":{"createdAt":1781503378971,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"envy 表示對他人擁有或成就的羨慕和嫉妒，渴望擁有相同的事物。","options":["pride","joy","envy","happiness"],"sentence":"She felt a sense of ______ watching her friend receive the award she had hoped for. The jealous feeling grew stronger as she realized her friend's success surpassed her own achievements.","translation":"看著她的朋友獲得她一直希望的獎項，她感到一種忌妒。當她意識到朋友的成功超過她自己的成就時，這種嫉妒的感覺變得更強烈。","word":"envy"}},"enzyme":{"createdAt":1783395908757,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"enzyme 是酵素，指由生物體產生的蛋白質，能夠催化生化反應。","options":["hormone","enzyme","vitamin","mineral"],"sentence":"The ______ in the human digestive system breaks down food into smaller molecules that the body can absorb. Without these biological catalysts, digestion would be impossible.","translation":"人類消化系統中的酵素將食物分解成身體可以吸收的更小分子。沒有這些生物催化劑，消化將不可能進行。","word":"enzyme"}},"epidemic":{"createdAt":1781256485489,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"epidemic指的是在特定地區或時期內迅速傳播的疾病或流行性疾病","options":["celebration","epidemic","mystery","scandal"],"sentence":"The ______ spread rapidly through the city, affecting thousands of residents. Health officials declared a state of emergency because the infectious disease was out of control.","translation":"這場傳染病迅速蔓延到整個城市，影響了數千名居民。衛生官員宣布進入緊急狀態，因為這種傳染性疾病已失控。","word":"epidemic"}},"episode":{"createdAt":1781860901468,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"episode表示連續劇的一集或插曲，指連續故事中的單個部分","options":["character","episode","location","genre"],"sentence":"The final ______ of the TV series aired last night and left viewers wanting more. Fans were thrilled by the cliffhanger ending and are hoping for a second season.","translation":"這部電視劇的最後一集昨晚播出，令觀眾期待更多內容。粉絲們對懸念結局感到興奮，希望能有第二季。","word":"episode"}},"equal":{"createdAt":1784043446116,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"equal 作為形容詞表示「相等的；平等的」，用來描述兩個或多個事物在程度、數量或地位上的相同性","options":["superior","equal","limited","excessive"],"sentence":"In a fair competition, all participants should have ______ opportunities to succeed. The rules must ensure that no one gets an unfair advantage over the others.","translation":"在公平的競賽中，所有參與者應該有相等的機會成功。規則必須確保沒有人比其他人獲得不公平的優勢。","word":"equal"}},"equality":{"createdAt":1782374070901,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"equality 表示「相等；均等」，指所有人擁有相同的權利、機會或待遇。","options":["harmony","efficiency","equality","popularity"],"sentence":"The new law was designed to promote ______ between men and women in the workplace. Both genders now receive equal pay for the same job.","translation":"新法律旨在促進職場中男性和女性之間的平等。現在兩性在同一份工作中獲得相同的薪酬。","word":"equality"}},"equalize":{"createdAt":1781493458233,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"equalize 意為使相等或平衡，在這裡指讓兩支隊伍的上場時間相同","options":["increase","equalize","reduce","analyze"],"sentence":"The coach decided to ______ the playing time between the two teams' forwards. This adjustment ensured that both sides had the same number of minutes on the court.","translation":"教練決定平等分配兩隊前鋒的上場時間。這項調整確保雙方在場上有相同的分鐘數。","word":"equalize"}},"equals":{"createdAt":1784071822264,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"equals 作動詞表示「等於、相等」，用來表示兩個數值或量相同或具有相同的價值。","options":["surpasses","equals","resembles","approaches"],"sentence":"In mathematics, two plus two ______ four. This fundamental arithmetic fact is one of the first equations students learn in elementary school.","translation":"在數學中，二加二等於四。這個基本的算術事實是學生在小學學到的第一批等式之一。","word":"equals"}},"equate":{"createdAt":1783390227931,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"equate 指的是將兩件事物視為相等或具有相同的價值、地位或意義。","options":["equate","confuse","compare","separate"],"sentence":"Some people mistakenly ______ wealth with happiness and success in life. However, numerous studies have shown that financial abundance does not automatically lead to personal fulfillment or well-being.","translation":"有些人錯誤地將財富同等看待為幸福和人生成功。然而，許多研究表明，經濟富裕並不一定會自動導致個人的滿足感或福祉。","word":"equate"}},"equation":{"createdAt":1783260805486,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"equation是指包含未知數和等號的數學式子，學生需要求解它以找到變數的值。","options":["theory","equation","problem","concept"],"sentence":"The student solved the ______ by isolating the variable on one side. Mathematics class requires understanding how to manipulate algebraic expressions to find unknown values.","translation":"學生通過將變數隔離在一邊來求解方程式。數學課程需要理解如何操縱代數表達式來找到未知值。","word":"equation"}},"equidistant":{"createdAt":1788665721367,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"equidistant表示距離相等或等距的，用來描述兩個或多個物體之間的距離完全相同。","options":["distant","equidistant","isolated","adjacent"],"sentence":"The three towns are ______ from each other, forming a perfect triangle. Since each pair of towns is exactly 50 kilometers apart, no town is closer to any other than the third one.","translation":"這三個城鎮彼此距離相等，形成一個完美的三角形。由於每對城鎮之間的距離恰好都是50公里，所以沒有一個城鎮比其他城鎮更靠近第三個城鎮。","word":"equidistant"}},"equip":{"createdAt":1781709984197,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"equip 動詞表示配備或裝備某物以使其完備，通常用於配備工具或設備。","options":["furnish","equip","provide","supply"],"sentence":"The school decided to ______ all classrooms with new computers and projectors. The principal announced that the upgrade would be completed by the start of the academic year.","translation":"學校決定用新電腦和投影儀裝備所有教室。校長宣佈升級將在學年開始前完成。","word":"equip"}},"equipment":{"createdAt":1782016805983,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"equipment 是名詞，表示執行特定任務所需的物質工具和裝置的集合。","options":["knowledge","equipment","courage","experience"],"sentence":"The mountaineering team spent weeks preparing their ______ before attempting to summit the peak. Ropes, harnesses, oxygen tanks, and specialized clothing were all carefully checked and packed.","translation":"登山隊在嘗試登頂前花了數週時間準備他們的裝備。繩索、安全帶、氧氣罐和專業服裝都被仔細檢查和打包。","word":"equipment"}},"equity":{"createdAt":1783228002798,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"equity 在此指的是房產所有人實際擁有的部分價值，即房產總值減去所欠貸款的差額。","options":["wealth","equity","profit","interest"],"sentence":"After making a down payment on the house, the family began to build ______ as they paid off their mortgage each month. Over ten years, their ownership stake in the property increased significantly.","translation":"在支付房屋首付款後，這家人開始在每月償還抵押貸款時逐步積累房產淨值。十年間，他們在房產中的所有權權益大幅增加。","word":"equity"}},"equivalent":{"createdAt":1781402539338,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"equivalent 表示在價值、意義或功能上相等或相當，雖然形式可能不同。","options":["superior","equivalent","inferior","identical"],"sentence":"A passing grade of 60% is ______ to a D mark on the letter scale. Both represent the minimum acceptable performance level.","translation":"60%的及格分數相當於字母等級中的D分。兩者都代表最低可接受的表現水平。","word":"equivalent"}},"equivocate":{"createdAt":1789363793858,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"equivocate 意指用模稜兩可或含混的言語迴避問題，故意不給出清楚的答案。","options":["clarify","equivocate","confess","explain"],"sentence":"When asked directly about the scandal, the executive refused to answer clearly and instead chose to ______ with vague and evasive responses. His intentional ambiguity frustrated reporters trying to get the truth.","translation":"當被直接問及醜聞時，這位高管拒絕明確回答，反而選擇含糊其辭，給出模稜兩可和迴避的答覆。他的故意模糊讓試圖得到真相的記者感到沮喪。","word":"equivocate"}},"era":{"createdAt":1783421881858,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"era 意為「時代；歷史時期」，特指某一特定的歷史時間段或具有獨特特徵的年代。","options":["era","theory","region","method"],"sentence":"The Victorian ______ was known for its strict social customs and industrial advancement. This ______ lasted approximately from 1837 to 1901 and shaped modern society significantly.","translation":"維多利亞時代以其嚴格的社會習俗和工業進步而聞名。這個時代大約從1837年持續到1901年，對現代社會產生了重大影響。","word":"era"}},"erase":{"createdAt":1782094693726,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"抹去是指用工具或布料移除或清除某物的痕跡。","options":["draw","erase","write","mark"],"sentence":"She tried to ______ the mistake from the whiteboard with a cloth. The pencil marks completely disappeared after she wiped the surface.","translation":"她試圖用布料從白板上抹去那個錯誤。擦拭表面後，鉛筆痕跡完全消失了。","word":"erase"}},"erect":{"createdAt":1783947021213,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"erect 是及物動詞，意為豎立或建造，指將東西立起來或構建起來。","options":["demolish","erect","paint","inspect"],"sentence":"The construction workers began to ______ the steel framework of the new building on Monday morning. By the end of the week, the tall structure was standing straight and ready for the next phase of construction.","translation":"建築工人在星期一早上開始豎立新建築的鋼製框架。到週末，高聳的結構已經直立，準備進入下一個建造階段。","word":"erect"}},"errand":{"createdAt":1781434900598,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"errand指需要執行的短途任務或差事，通常是代表他人進行。","options":["party","errand","conversation","class"],"sentence":"She ran several ______ for her elderly mother, including picking up groceries and paying bills. The tasks were essential to help her mother manage daily responsibilities.","translation":"她為年邁的母親跑了幾次差事，包括購買雜貨和支付賬單。這些任務對幫助她母親處理日常事務至關重要。","word":"errand"}},"erupt":{"createdAt":1784625437079,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"erupt 意指火山或其他事物突然爆發或噴出，通常伴隨著劇烈的物質噴射。","options":["rumble","erupt","shake","tremble"],"sentence":"The volcano began to ______ without any warning from the geological monitoring station. Lava, ash, and rock shot high into the sky within minutes of the first tremor.","translation":"火山在地質監測站沒有任何警告的情況下開始______。第一次震動後數分鐘內，熔岩、火山灰和岩石高射入天空。","word":"erupt"}},"eruption":{"createdAt":1786416115761,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"eruption指火山或溫泉等的突然、猛烈的爆發或噴發，也可引申為情緒或事件的突然爆發。","options":["eruption","corruption","disruption","absorption"],"sentence":"The volcanic ______ sent ash clouds miles into the sky and forced thousands of residents to evacuate. Seismologists had detected warning signs for weeks before the mountain finally exploded.","translation":"火山的爆發將火山灰雲送入數英里的天空，迫使數千居民撤離。地震學家在這座山最終爆發前數週就發現了警告信號。","word":"eruption"}},"escalated":{"createdAt":1784045870594,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"escalated表示情況變得更加嚴重或激烈，在這個句子中指衝突從輕微升級為嚴重。","options":["diminished","escalated","postponed","clarified"],"sentence":"The minor disagreement between the two neighbors quickly ______ into a serious conflict. By the time the police arrived, they were shouting insults at each other from their front yards.","translation":"兩個鄰居之間的小分歧迅速升級成了嚴重的衝突。當警察到達時，他們已經在各自的前院互相謾罵了。","word":"escalated"}},"escalator":{"createdAt":1784355209446,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"escalator是指一種自動運行的樓梯，可以自動載人上下樓，具有連續移動的特性。","options":["elevator","escalator","corridor","escalator"],"sentence":"I took the ______ up to the third floor of the shopping mall instead of using the stairs. The mechanical moving steps made my journey quick and effortless.","translation":"我乘坐電扶梯上到購物商城的三樓，而不是走樓梯。這些機械移動的台階讓我的旅程快速又輕鬆。","word":"escalator"}},"escapade":{"createdAt":1787306201443,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"escapade 是名詞，指一次激動人心的冒險活動或逃脫，通常帶有冒險性或略顯調皮的意味。","options":["study","lecture","escapade","routine"],"sentence":"The teenagers' wild ______ involved sneaking out of their houses at midnight to explore the abandoned warehouse. Their parents were shocked to discover the extent of this reckless adventure.","translation":"這些青少年的瘋狂冒險活動涉及在午夜時偷偷溜出家門去探索廢棄的倉庫。他們的父母對發現這場魯莽冒險的程度感到震驚。","word":"escapade"}},"escape":{"createdAt":1781332009068,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"escape 意為逃跑或逃脫某個地方或情況","options":["enter","escape","sleep","work"],"sentence":"The prisoners planned to ______ from the maximum-security facility by tunneling under the fence. They successfully fled and were not recaptured for several months.","translation":"囚犯計畫通過在圍欄下挖隧道來逃跑。他們成功逃脫，並在幾個月內沒有被重新逮捕。","word":"escape"}},"eschew":{"createdAt":1783293763164,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"eschew 意思是「迴避、避開或放棄」，在這句話中指的是主動避免或不選擇某種食物。","options":["promote","eschew","study","prepare"],"sentence":"The health expert advised people to ______ processed foods and choose whole grains instead. Her recommendation was based on years of research showing the negative effects of artificial additives.","translation":"健康專家建議人們避開加工食品，改為選擇全穀物。她的建議是基於多年的研究，該研究顯示了人工添加劑的負面影響。","word":"eschew"}},"escort":{"createdAt":1783293763170,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"escort 作動詞意思是「護衛、護送或押送」，指陪同某人並保護其安全。","options":["greet","interview","escort","photograph"],"sentence":"The security team was assigned to ______ the famous actor through the crowded airport. They formed a protective barrier around him to ensure his safe passage.","translation":"安全小組被指派護送這位著名演員通過擁擠的機場。他們在他周圍形成了保護屏障，以確保他的安全通行。","word":"escort"}},"essence":{"createdAt":1783293802145,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"essence作為名詞表示「本質、精華」，指的是事物最重要、最基本的特性或成分。","options":["essence","summary","ending","review"],"sentence":"The ______ of a good novel is not just an interesting plot, but the deep characters and meaningful themes that resonate with readers. Without these core elements, even a fast-paced story feels hollow.","translation":"一部好小說的本質不只是有趣的情節，而是深層的角色和有意義的主題能引起讀者共鳴。沒有這些核心要素，即使情節快速發展的故事也感覺空洞無物。","word":"essence"}},"essential":{"createdAt":1781746685505,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"essential指的是本質的、必要的、不可缺少的，用來形容某樣事物對於達到某個目標是必不可少的。","options":["essential","duration","editorials","sober"],"sentence":"Good nutrition is ______ for children's healthy development. Without proper food intake, their bodies cannot grow strong and their minds cannot develop properly.","translation":"良好的營養對兒童的健康發展是必要的。沒有適當的食物攝入，他們的身體無法強健，心智也無法正常發展。","word":"essential"}},"establish":{"createdAt":1782106217859,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"establish作為動詞表示「建立、創辦」，指創建一個新的機構、公司或制度。","options":["explore","establish","dissolve","relocate"],"sentence":"The entrepreneur decided to ______ a new technology company in Silicon Valley last year. Today, her startup has grown to employ over fifty talented professionals.","translation":"這位企業家去年決定在矽谷建立一家新的科技公司。今天，她的新創公司已經成長到僱用超過五十位才華洋溢的專業人士。","word":"establish"}},"estate":{"createdAt":1781849847402,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"estate表示大片土地和建築組成的財產或莊園，與「包括豪宅和數百英畝」的線索相符。","options":["apartment","estate","cottage","hotel"],"sentence":"The wealthy family inherited a large ______ that included a mansion and hundreds of acres. The property had been in the family for generations.","translation":"這個富有的家族繼承了一個包括豪宅和數百英畝土地的大莊園。該房產已經在家族中傳了許多代。","word":"estate"}},"esteem":{"createdAt":1781831848728,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"esteem 作為名詞表示「尊敬」或「敬重」，指對某人或某事的高度評價和認可。","options":["criticism","esteem","attention","interest"],"sentence":"The professor earned great ______ among her students for her innovative teaching methods. Everyone respected her dedication to making complex topics easy to understand.","translation":"這位教授因其創新的教學方法在學生中獲得了高度的尊敬。每個人都欽佩她致力於使複雜主題容易理解的精神。","word":"esteem"}},"estimate":{"createdAt":1781331945989,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"estimate 指根據可用信息進行合理的估計或預算，通常涉及計算或評價。","options":["ignore","guess","estimate","remember"],"sentence":"The contractor asked me to ______ how much money I would need for home renovations. Based on the materials, labor costs, and the scope of work described, he predicted the project would cost around thirty thousand dollars.","translation":"承包商要求我估計進行房屋翻新需要多少錢。根據所述的材料、勞動力成本和工作範圍，他預測該項目將花費大約三萬美元。","word":"estimate"}},"estimation":{"createdAt":1781849847409,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"estimation表示估計或評價，與「詳細分析、涵蓋費用」的線索相符。","options":["guess","estimation","whim","mood"],"sentence":"According to the expert's ______, the project will cost approximately fifty thousand dollars. The detailed analysis covered all potential expenses.","translation":"根據專家的評估，這個項目將花費大約五萬美元。詳細的分析涵蓋了所有潛在費用。","word":"estimation"}},"eta":{"createdAt":1781228443753,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"Eta是希臘字母表中的第七個字母，在物理學中常用來代表效率、黏度等物理量。","options":["zeta","theta","eta","iota"],"sentence":"The seventh letter of the Greek alphabet is ______. Students learning about efficiency and viscosity in physics class regularly encounter this symbol in their textbooks.","translation":"希臘字母表中的第七個字母是______。學生在物理課堂上學習效率和黏度時，經常在教科書中遇到這個符號。","word":"eta"}},"eternal":{"createdAt":1785160871330,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"eternal 表示「永久的；永恆的」，指持續無限期、永遠不會結束的事物。","options":["eternal","external","eventual","essential"],"sentence":"The couple exchanged ______ vows on their wedding day, promising to love each other forever. They believed their commitment would never fade or change throughout their entire lives.","translation":"這對新人在婚禮上交換了永恆的誓言，承諾永遠彼此相愛。他們相信他們的承諾在整個人生中永遠不會消退或改變。","word":"eternal"}},"eternity":{"createdAt":1781515634901,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「eternity」表示無限長的時間或似乎永遠不會結束的很長一段時間。","options":["a moment","eternity","seconds","minutes"],"sentence":"Waiting for the exam results felt like ______. Time seemed to move incredibly slowly those two weeks.","translation":"等待考試成績的過程感覺像是永恆。那兩週時間似乎過得極其緩慢。","word":"eternity"}},"ethical":{"createdAt":1781256444518,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ethical指符合道德和倫理原則的，強調正直和誠實的行為標準。","options":["strict","ethical","marketing","financial"],"sentence":"The company's ______ standards require all employees to report conflicts of interest immediately. This policy ensures that business decisions are made with integrity and transparency.","translation":"公司的道德標準要求所有員工立即報告利益衝突。該政策確保業務決策以誠信和透明度進行。","word":"ethical"}},"ethics":{"createdAt":1781933311794,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"ethics（倫理；道德）涉及道德原則和公平對待，而logistics（物流）、mechanics（機械）和acoustics（聲學）都與道德標準和公平性無關。","options":["logistics","mechanics","ethics","acoustics"],"sentence":"The company's ______ committee reviewed all business practices to ensure no employees were treated unfairly. The group examined whether decisions followed moral principles and legal standards.","translation":"該公司的倫理委員會審查了所有業務實踐，以確保沒有員工受到不公平對待。該小組檢視了決策是否遵循道德原則和法律標準。","word":"ethics"}},"ethnic":{"createdAt":1784104245997,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ethnic 是形容詞，用來形容與特定民族、種族或文化相關的事物，這裡指的是不同民族的傳統。","options":["modern","ethnic","religious","political"],"sentence":"The museum has a special exhibition showcasing ______ traditions from around the world. The display includes traditional clothing, music, and artifacts from various cultural groups and nations.","translation":"博物館有一個特別展覽展示來自世界各地的______傳統。展覽包括來自各種文化群體和民族的傳統服裝、音樂和文物。","word":"ethnic"}},"ethylene":{"createdAt":1783243389245,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"乙烯是一種植物激素，以氣體形式存在，可以促進果實成熟和衰老過程。","options":["glucose","ethylene","chlorophyll","nitrogen"],"sentence":"The ripening hormone ______ is a simple hydrocarbon gas produced naturally by fruits. Banana farmers often use this colorless gas to artificially accelerate the yellowing process in storage facilities.","translation":"催熟激素乙烯是一種由水果自然產生的簡單烴類氣體。香蕉農民經常在儲藏設施中使用這種無色氣體來人為加速發黃過程。","word":"ethylene"}},"evacuate":{"createdAt":1783293763170,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"evacuate 意思是「撤離或疏散」，指在緊急或危險情況下迅速離開某個地點。","options":["evacuate","assemble","reinforce","decorate"],"sentence":"When the fire alarm sounded, all employees were instructed to ______ the building immediately. The authorities wanted everyone out within five minutes.","translation":"當火警警報響起時，所有員工被指示立即撤離建築物。當局希望所有人在五分鐘內離開。","word":"evacuate"}},"evaluate":{"createdAt":1782200614306,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"evaluate 表示「評價；估價」，在這個句子中指老師根據具體數據來判斷學生的表現優劣。","options":["ignore","evaluate","celebrate","memorize"],"sentence":"The teacher will ______ each student's performance based on their exam scores and class participation. She has already graded the tests and recorded all the marks in her spreadsheet.","translation":"老師將根據學生的考試成績和課堂參與情況來評估每位學生的表現。她已經批閱了考試，並在電子表格中記錄了所有分數。","word":"evaluate"}},"evaluation":{"createdAt":1783402916387,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"evaluation 是對某人或某物的價值、能力或質量進行的仔細評估和分析。","options":["celebration","evaluation","dismissal","promotion"],"sentence":"The manager conducted a detailed ______ of each employee's performance during the annual review meeting. She examined their strengths, weaknesses, and overall contributions to the company.","translation":"經理在年度審查會議中對每位員工的表現進行了詳細的評價。她檢查了他們的優勢、劣勢以及對公司的整體貢獻。","word":"evaluation"}},"evangelion":{"createdAt":1783243696864,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"福音是指基督教中關於耶穌基督拯救人類的好消息，通常帶有希望和救贖的含義。","options":["condemnation","judgment","evangelion","prophecy"],"sentence":"The preacher's message of ______ brought hope and inspiration to the troubled congregation. His sermon conveyed the joyful news of salvation and redemption to all who listened.","translation":"傳教士的福音信息為陷入困境的教眾帶來了希望和靈感。他的佈道向所有聽眾傳達了救贖和拯救的喜訊。","word":"evangelion"}},"even":{"createdAt":1783293802144,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"even作為形容詞表示「平的、平坦的」，用來描述表面沒有高低不平的特點。","options":["rough","even","curved","textured"],"sentence":"The carpenter sanded the wooden surface until it was completely ______ and smooth. Without any bumps or ridges, the table was now safe for children to play on.","translation":"木工師傅把木製表面打磨到完全平坦光滑。沒有任何凹凸或脊線，這張桌子現在對孩子們玩耍是安全的。","word":"even"}},"evenly":{"createdAt":1782807020089,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"evenly 是副詞，表示「均勻地」或「平均地」分配，強調分布的一致性和平衡。","options":["fairly","evenly","equally","justly"],"sentence":"The teacher distributed the candies ______ among all the students so that each child received the same amount. Every student got exactly ten pieces without any unfairness.","translation":"老師在所有學生中均勻地分配糖果，使每個孩子都獲得相同的數量。每個學生都得到正好十顆，沒有任何不公平。","word":"evenly"}},"eventual":{"createdAt":1781849847408,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"eventual表示最終的或最後才發生的，與「經過多年、需要耐心」的線索相符。","options":["immediate","eventual","unexpected","impossible"],"sentence":"The ______ success of the company came after many years of hard work and dedication. It took patience before the business became profitable.","translation":"公司的最終成功是在經過許多年的辛勤工作和奉獻之後才實現的。在業務開始盈利之前需要耐心等待。","word":"eventual"}},"eventually":{"createdAt":1781849847410,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"eventually表示最終或最後，與「經過二十年才發現」的線索相符。","options":["never","eventually","rarely","hardly"],"sentence":"She tried many different careers before she ______ found her true passion in teaching. It took her twenty years to discover what she loved.","translation":"在她最終在教學中找到真正的熱情之前，她嘗試了許多不同的職業。她花了二十年才發現自己喜歡的工作。","word":"eventually"}},"evidence":{"createdAt":1783401059689,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「evidence」是指法律或科學中的證據或證詞，用來證明某事的真實性或支持某個論點。","options":["argument","evidence","theory","opinion"],"sentence":"The detective presented strong ______ in court to prove the suspect was guilty. The witness testimony and DNA test results were crucial pieces of proof that convinced the judge.","translation":"那位偵探在法庭上提出強有力的證據來證明嫌疑人有罪。證人證詞和DNA測試結果是說服法官的關鍵證明。","word":"evidence"}},"evident":{"createdAt":1781624534708,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"evident 意為「明顯的、顯然的」，指容易看出或理解的事物。","options":["hidden","uncertain","evident","questionable"],"sentence":"It is ______ from her facial expression that she is unhappy with the decision made by the committee. She frowned and left the meeting without speaking to anyone.","translation":"從她的面部表情可以明顯看出，她對委員會做出的決定不滿意。她皺著眉頭離開了會議，沒有和任何人說話。","word":"evident"}},"evidently":{"createdAt":1781624534650,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"evidently 意為「顯然地、明顯地」，用於表達某事很清楚或容易看出。","options":["secretly","evidently","fortunately","theoretically"],"sentence":"The student ______ did not understand the mathematics concept during the lesson. He raised his hand multiple times to ask the same question in different ways.","translation":"該學生顯然在課堂上沒有理解數學概念。他多次舉手用不同方式提出同樣的問題。","word":"evidently"}},"evil":{"createdAt":1781345564015,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"evil 是形容詞，表示道德上邪惡、不道德或傷害他人的，常用來描述令人厭惡的人或行為。","options":["kind","generous","evil","peaceful"],"sentence":"The ______ dictator ruled his country with fear and violence for thirty years. His regime was responsible for torturing and murdering countless innocent citizens.","translation":"這位邪惡的獨裁者用恐懼和暴力統治他的國家三十年。他的政權對無數無辜公民進行了刑求和謀殺。","word":"evil"}},"evoke":{"createdAt":1781598671069,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"evoke 作動詞表示引起或喚起，通常指引起特定的情感、記憶或反應","options":["suppress","evoke","ignore","delay"],"sentence":"The old photograph managed to ______ strong emotions in my heart. Seeing it instantly transported me back to my childhood memories with vivid clarity.","translation":"這張舊照片設法在我心中引起強烈的情感。看到它讓我立刻回到童年回憶中，清晰生動。","word":"evoke"}},"evoluation":{"createdAt":1782476385143,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"evoluation 是名詞，指生物隨著時間推移而逐漸發生的變化和進化過程（evolution 的拼寫變體）。","options":["extinction","mutation","evoluation","reproduction"],"sentence":"Darwin's theory of ______ explains how species change and adapt over millions of years. His groundbreaking research fundamentally transformed our understanding of how life develops on Earth.","translation":"達爾文的進化論解釋了物種如何在數百萬年間變化和適應。他的開創性研究從根本上改變了我們對生命如何在地球上發展的理解。","word":"evoluation"}},"evolution":{"createdAt":1781840030398,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"evolution 是名詞，表示演化、進化；與「化石記錄」、「遺傳證據」和「數百萬年」的科學背景相符。","options":["creation","extinction","evolution","revolution"],"sentence":"Scientists study the ______ of species by examining fossil records and genetic evidence from different time periods. This process of change took millions of years to produce the diverse life forms we see today.","translation":"科學家通過檢查不同時期的化石記錄和遺傳證據來研究物種的進化。這個變化過程花了數百萬年才產生了我們今天看到的多樣生命形式。","word":"evolution"}},"evolve":{"createdAt":1783293802146,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"evolve作為動詞表示「演變、發展、成長」，指生物或事物經過長期變化而逐漸完善或改進。","options":["disappear","evolve","multiply","mutate"],"sentence":"Over millions of years, simple organisms began to ______ into more complex forms of life. This process of gradual change shaped all the species we see on Earth today.","translation":"在數百萬年的時間裡，簡單的生物開始演變成更複雜的生命形式。這種逐步改變的過程塑造了我們今天在地球上看到的所有物種。","word":"evolve"}},"exaggerate":{"createdAt":1782522524125,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"exaggerate 是指誇張或使過度放大，在此指不應該將問題的嚴重程度說得比實際更嚴重。","options":["minimize","ignore","exaggerate","explain"],"sentence":"Don't ______ the severity of the problem when you talk to your parents about it. Just tell them the truth, and they will understand your situation much better.","translation":"當你和父母談論這個問題時，不要誇大其嚴重性。只要告訴他們真相，他們會更好地理解你的情況。","word":"exaggerate"}},"exaggeration":{"createdAt":1784340530551,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"exaggeration 是指對事實的誇大或過度渲染，使事物看起來比實際情況更極端或更重要。","options":["truth","exaggeration","accuracy","fact"],"sentence":"His claim that he caught a fish the size of a car was clearly an ______ meant to impress his friends. When we saw the actual photo, the fish was only about a foot long.","translation":"他聲稱自己抓到一條汽車大小的魚，這顯然是誇張，目的是為了給朋友留下深刻印象。當我們看到實際的照片時，那條魚只有大約一英尺長。","word":"exaggeration"}},"examination":{"createdAt":1783476327935,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"examination 是名詞，意為檢查或考試，在醫學語境中指醫生對患者進行的系統檢查以評估健康狀況。","options":["examination","conversation","presentation","demonstration"],"sentence":"The doctor performed a thorough ______ of the patient, checking vital signs and asking about symptoms. This comprehensive assessment helped determine the correct diagnosis and treatment plan.","translation":"醫生對患者進行了徹底的檢查，查看生命跡象並詢問症狀。這種全面的評估幫助確定了正確的診斷和治療計劃。","word":"examination"}},"examine":{"createdAt":1782642451988,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"examine 意思是仔細檢查或審查某物，醫生需要詳細研究X光片才能診斷問題。","options":["ignore","examine","purchase","display"],"sentence":"The doctor will ______ the patient's X-rays carefully. The radiologist needs to study every detail to identify any fractures or abnormalities.","translation":"醫生將仔細檢查病人的X光片。放射科醫生需要研究每一個細節來識別任何骨折或異常。","word":"examine"}},"examinee":{"createdAt":1783262131289,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"examinee是指參加考試的人，即考生，與參加考試的行為直接相關。","options":["teacher","examinee","director","proctor"],"sentence":"The ______ nervously waited outside the examination room for their turn to enter. Hundreds of students from different schools had registered to participate in this nationwide test.","translation":"考生緊張地在考試室外等待輪到他們進去。來自不同學校的數百名學生已登記參加此次全國考試。","word":"examinee"}},"examiner":{"createdAt":1784450704021,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"examiner 是指主持考試、批改試卷的主考官，特別強調進行和評分考試的職責，區別於一般教師或檢查員。","options":["teacher","examiner","judge","inspector"],"sentence":"The ______ carefully reviewed each student's test paper and made detailed comments on their answers. This official who conducts and grades the exam must be impartial and experienced in evaluating academic performance.","translation":"主考官仔細審閱了每位學生的試卷，並在他們的答案上做了詳細的評論。這位進行和評分考試的官員必須公正且具備評估學術表現的經驗。","word":"examiner"}},"exceed":{"createdAt":1782022372249,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"exceed 意為「超過、超越」，表示某事物的程度或數量比預期或比較對象更大或更多。","options":["decline","match","exceed","approach"],"sentence":"The company's profit this quarter will ______ all previous records and expectations set by investors. The financial analysts had predicted a modest growth, but the actual results surpassed their most optimistic forecasts by a significant margin.","translation":"公司本季度的利潤將超越所有先前的記錄和投資者的預期。財務分析師曾預測增長幅度較為溫和，但實際結果遠超他們最樂觀的預測。","word":"exceed"}},"except":{"createdAt":1781425122880,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"except 是介詞，表示排除或不包括某人或某物，與湯姆因病缺席但其他人都在的脈絡相符。","options":["including","except","during","throughout"],"sentence":"Everyone attended the meeting ______ for Tom, who was sick that day. All other team members were present and participated.","translation":"除了生病的湯姆以外，所有人都參加了會議。所有其他團隊成員都出席並參與了會議。","word":"except"}},"exception":{"createdAt":1783609040254,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"exception 表示「例外；不符合一般規則的人或事物」，在這裡指那個不能參加的學生是不同於其他人的特殊情況。","options":["rule","exception","requirement","permission"],"sentence":"Most students attended the field trip, but there was one ______ who had to stay behind. This student had a family emergency that prevented him from going with the rest of the class.","translation":"大多數學生參加了實地考察，但有一個例外的學生必須留下來。這個學生有家庭緊急情況，使他無法和班上其他人一起去。","word":"exception"}},"exceptional":{"createdAt":1784614286368,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"exceptional 意為「優秀的；罕見的」，用來描述非常出眾或不同尋常的事物或表現。","options":["ordinary","exceptional","common","typical"],"sentence":"Her performance in the competition was ______, earning her the gold medal and international recognition. The judges had never seen such remarkable talent from someone so young.","translation":"她在比賽中的表現是優秀的，為她贏得了金牌和國際認可。評委從未見過如此年輕的人擁有如此傑出的才能。","word":"exceptional"}},"excerpt":{"createdAt":1781332009071,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"excerpt 指的是從書籍、文章或演講中摘取的一部分內容","options":["preface","excerpt","epilogue","outline"],"sentence":"The teacher showed the class an ______ from the novel to illustrate the author's writing style. The passage was only a few pages long but demonstrated the key themes of the book.","translation":"老師向班級展示了小說中的摘錄以說明作者的寫作風格。這段文章只有幾頁，但展示了該書的關鍵主題。","word":"excerpt"}},"excess":{"createdAt":1781598671068,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"excess 作名詞表示過量或超過，指超過必要或合理的數量","options":["essential","excess","required","annual"],"sentence":"The company must reduce its ______ spending to improve profitability this quarter. The accountant identified millions of dollars wasted on unnecessary purchases and luxury expenses.","translation":"公司必須減少過度支出以改善本季度的利潤率。會計師發現數百萬美元浪費在不必要的購買和奢侈開支上。","word":"excess"}},"excessive":{"createdAt":1781798927522,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"excessive 形容某事超過正常或合理的程度，表示過度或極度的。","options":["minimal","excessive","moderate","reasonable"],"sentence":"The teacher complained about the student's ______ use of social media during class. He spent more than five hours per day texting and scrolling instead of paying attention.","translation":"老師抱怨學生在課堂上過度使用社群媒體。他每天花超過五個小時發短信和滑動屏幕，而不是專注聽課。","word":"excessive"}},"exchange":{"createdAt":1781738105693,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"exchange 意為互相交換或調換，指的是兩個或以上的人之間相互給予東西。","options":["ignore","exchange","collect","record"],"sentence":"The two students decided to ______ phone numbers so they could stay in touch after graduation. They wrote down their contact information and handed each other their details.","translation":"兩位學生決定交換電話號碼，以便畢業後能保持聯繫。他們寫下了聯繫信息並互相交給了對方的詳細信息。","word":"exchange"}},"exclaim":{"createdAt":1783293763171,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"exclaim 意思是「呼喊或叫喊」，指用興奮、驚訝或強烈的情感大聲說話。","options":["whisper","exclaim","mumble","hesitate"],"sentence":"The child began to ______ with joy when she saw the surprise birthday cake on the table. Her loud cry of excitement caught everyone's attention.","translation":"當這個孩子看到桌子上的驚喜生日蛋糕時，她開始興高采烈地叫喊。她興奮的大聲喊叫引起了所有人的注意。","word":"exclaim"}},"exclude":{"createdAt":1784176210344,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"exclude是指將某人或某物排斥、不包括或開除在外，不允許其參與。","options":["promote","exclude","invite","celebrate"],"sentence":"The club voted to ______ the member who violated the rules. He was no longer allowed to participate in any future activities.","translation":"俱樂部投票決定開除違反規則的成員。他不再被允許參加任何未來的活動。","word":"exclude"}},"exclusion":{"createdAt":1785282866962,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"exclusion 是指將某人或某個群體刻意排除在外的行為或狀態，與包容或參與相反。","options":["inclusion","exclusion","participation","acceptance"],"sentence":"The ______ of certain groups from the club's membership caused considerable controversy and debate among the community. Many people protested against this discriminatory practice and demanded equal access for everyone.","translation":"俱樂部將某些群體排斥在會員資格之外，引發了社區內的相當爭議和辯論。許多人抗議這種歧視性做法，並要求所有人都能平等獲得使用權。","word":"exclusion"}},"exclusive":{"createdAt":1781362281664,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"exclusive表示排外的或獨家的，只限於特定的人或團體。","options":["public","exclusive","open","general"],"sentence":"This ______ club membership is only available to wealthy individuals. Regular people cannot join regardless of their interest in membership.","translation":"這個排外俱樂部會員只對富人開放。無論普通人多麼有興趣，他們都無法加入。","word":"exclusive"}},"exclusively":{"createdAt":1784648623661,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"exclusively 指「專門地、獨佔地、唯一地」，表示僅限於特定群體或用途。","options":["partially","randomly","exclusively","occasionally"],"sentence":"This luxury resort caters ______ to high-end clients with substantial budgets. The membership is limited to only the wealthiest individuals and celebrities.","translation":"這家豪華度假村專門為擁有充足預算的高端客戶服務。會員身份僅限於最富有的個人和名人。","word":"exclusively"}},"excretion":{"createdAt":1784301551065,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"excretion 指身體排出廢物和有害物質的過程，是維持生命活動的重要生理功能。","options":["absorption","excretion","digestion","circulation"],"sentence":"The ______ of waste materials is an essential bodily function that removes harmful substances through urine and sweat. This process occurs continuously throughout the day to maintain the body's health and chemical balance.","translation":"廢物的排泄是一個重要的身體機能，通過尿液和汗液排除有害物質。這個過程全天持續進行，以維持身體的健康和化學平衡。","word":"excretion"}},"excuse":{"createdAt":1784011912777,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"excuse作為動詞表示「原諒」或「饒恕」，用來請求他人原諒自己的過失或遲到等情況。","options":["blame","excuse","ignore","scold"],"sentence":"Please ______ me for being late to the meeting. I had a car accident on the highway, which was completely unavoidable.","translation":"請原諒我開會遲到。我在高速公路上發生了車禍，這是完全無法避免的。","word":"excuse"}},"execute":{"createdAt":1781424356416,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"execute指的是按照計劃或指令來完成某個任務或行動。","options":["ignore","execute","modify","cancel"],"sentence":"The architect asked the construction team to ______ the building plans exactly as designed. Every detail from the blueprints needed to be implemented precisely to ensure structural integrity.","translation":"建築師要求建築隊完全按照設計來執行建築計劃。藍圖中的每一個細節都需要精確實施，以確保結構完整性。","word":"execute"}},"execution":{"createdAt":1783395908755,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"execution 表示執行、實行，指將計劃或命令付諸行動的過程。","options":["planning","discussion","execution","design"],"sentence":"The ______ of the new marketing strategy began immediately after the board's approval. The team worked diligently to carry out every aspect of the plan according to schedule.","translation":"新行銷策略的執行在董事會批准後立即開始。團隊勤奮地按計劃執行了該計畫的每個方面。","word":"execution"}},"executive":{"createdAt":1781693293272,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"executive 是形容詞，意思是「行政上的」或「執行的」，用於形容管理層的決定或權力。","options":["ruthless","executive","crush","priceless"],"sentence":"The company's ______ decision to cut costs affected all departments immediately. The board of directors approved the new budget and operational changes during their monthly meeting.","translation":"公司的行政決定立即影響了所有部門的成本削減。董事會在月度會議期間批准了新預算和運營變化。","word":"executive"}},"exempt":{"createdAt":1782308772649,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"exempt作為動詞意為豁免或免除，用來表示某人被免除責任或義務。","options":["punished","exempt","enrolled","confused"],"sentence":"Students who maintain a perfect attendance record will be ______ from taking the final exam. The school announced this policy to reward those who never miss class throughout the entire semester.","translation":"維持完美出勤紀錄的學生將被豁免參加期末考試。學校宣佈這項政策是為了獎勵整個學期從未缺課的學生。","word":"exempt"}},"exert":{"createdAt":1781323901188,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"exert意為「運用」或「施加」，在此指使用權力或影響力來達成目標。","options":["lose","exert","ignore","abandon"],"sentence":"The manager decided to ______ her influence over the board members to approve the new project. Through her persuasion and political connections, she successfully pushed the proposal forward.","translation":"經理決定運用她對董事會成員的影響力來批准新項目。通過她的勸說和政治關係，她成功推動了該提案。","word":"exert"}},"exhaust":{"createdAt":1783685028742,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"exhaust是動詞，表示使人筋疲力盡或耗盡資源，用來描述能量、耐力或其他資源的完全消耗。","options":["energize","exhaust","motivate","strengthen"],"sentence":"The long hike through the mountains began to ______ the young climbers by midday. Their energy was completely drained, and several members requested to rest before continuing further.","translation":"到了中午，這條穿過山區的長途徒步旅行開始使年輕登山者筋疲力盡。他們的精力完全耗盡，幾名隊員要求在繼續前進之前休息。","word":"exhaust"}},"exhausted":{"createdAt":1781499075056,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"筋疲力盡表示一個人因為用力或工作而完全失去了體力和精力。","options":["excited","refreshed","exhausted","motivated"],"sentence":"After running a marathon, the athlete felt completely ______ and could barely stand. He had used up all his energy reserves during the grueling 26-mile race.","translation":"跑完馬拉松後，運動員感到筋疲力盡，幾乎無法站立。他在這場艱苦的26英里比賽中耗盡了所有的能量。","word":"exhausted"}},"exhibit":{"createdAt":1781775276771,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"exhibit意為展示或展覽，指將作品公開展示給公眾觀看。","options":["hide","steal","exhibit","destroy"],"sentence":"The museum will ______ rare paintings from the Renaissance period next month. Visitors will be able to see masterpieces that have been kept in private collections for centuries.","translation":"博物館下個月將展示文藝復興時期的罕見繪畫。遊客們將能夠看到數百年來一直保存在私人收藏中的傑作。","word":"exhibit"}},"exhibition":{"createdAt":1781425122881,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"exhibition 指展覽會或展覽品，與美術館、藝術作品和展出這個脈絡相符。","options":["tournament","exhibition","discount","defeat"],"sentence":"The museum held a special ______ featuring paintings by famous impressionist artists. Visitors came from around the world to see the masterpieces on display.","translation":"博物館舉辦了一場特別展覽，展出著名印象派畫家的作品。來自世界各地的遊客前來欣賞展出的傑作。","word":"exhibition"}},"exhibitor":{"createdAt":1781738105692,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"exhibitor 指的是展示或展覽商品、作品或物品的人，特別是在展覽會或展示會上。","options":["visitor","exhibitor","curator","artist"],"sentence":"The art gallery hired a professional ______ to arrange all the paintings and sculptures for the upcoming exhibition. This person had years of experience in displaying artwork to attract visitors.","translation":"美術館聘請了一位專業展示者來為即將舉辦的展覽安排所有的繪畫和雕塑。這個人有多年展示藝術作品以吸引遊客的經驗。","word":"exhibitor"}},"exhilarate":{"createdAt":1782009797690,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"exhilarate 動詞，表示使某人感到興高采烈、愉快或充滿活力；第二句的「大笑」和「心臟狂跳」強調了這種高興和興奮的情感狀態。","options":["bore","depress","exhilarate","tire"],"sentence":"The roller coaster ride will ______ everyone on the track with its thrilling twists and turns. Passengers walked off with huge smiles, their hearts pounding from the adrenaline rush.","translation":"雲霄飛車將以其令人刺激的轉彎和翻滾使軌道上的每個人都感到興高采烈。乘客下車時面帶大笑，他們的心臟因腎上腺素激增而狂跳。","word":"exhilarate"}},"exile":{"createdAt":1785160871331,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"exile 指「流放；放逐」，表示將某人強制驅逐出其祖國或原住地。","options":["exile","excuse","exercise","execute"],"sentence":"After losing the civil war, the deposed king was sentenced to ______ and forced to leave his homeland immediately. He spent the rest of his life in a foreign country, never allowed to return.","translation":"在內戰失敗後，被推翻的國王被判處流放，並被迫立即離開他的家鄉。他在異國他鄉度過了餘生，永不被允許回國。","word":"exile"}},"exist":{"createdAt":1786333150834,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"exist 表示「存在；生存」，指某物或某人具有實際的存在狀態，無論是過去、現在或未來。","options":["survive","exist","appear","matter"],"sentence":"Many people believe that unicorns do not ______ in the real world. However, fossils prove that dinosaurs definitely ______ millions of years ago.","translation":"許多人相信獨角獸在現實世界中不存在。然而，化石證明恐龍確實在數百萬年前存在過。","word":"exist"}},"existence":{"createdAt":1784078619498,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"existence表示「存在」或「生存」，指某物客觀存在的事實或狀態。","options":["possibility","existence","theory","discovery"],"sentence":"The ______ of life on other planets has fascinated scientists for decades. They continue to search for evidence that living organisms exist beyond Earth.","translation":"其他星球上生命的存在已經讓科學家們著迷了數十年。他們繼續尋找地球以外存在生物的證據。","word":"existence"}},"exotic":{"createdAt":1781598671101,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"exotic 作形容詞表示異國的或異國情調的，指來自遠方或不同文化的東西","options":["ordinary","exotic","basic","simple"],"sentence":"The restaurant serves ______ dishes from Southeast Asia that attract food enthusiasts. Diners enjoy flavors and spices that are rarely found in typical Western cuisine.","translation":"該餐廳提供來自東南亞的異國菜肴，吸引美食愛好者。食客喜歡在典型西方美食中很少見到的風味和香料。","word":"exotic"}},"expand":{"createdAt":1781664082522,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"expand 表示擴大、擴展或增加某事物的規模和範圍。","options":["contract","expand","collapse","pause"],"sentence":"The company plans to ______ its business into three new markets next year. They will open additional offices and hire more employees to support this growth.","translation":"該公司計畫明年將其業務擴展到三個新市場。他們將開設更多辦公室並聘請更多員工來支持這一增長。","word":"expand"}},"expansion":{"createdAt":1781839703137,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"expansion指事業或範圍的擴大延伸，與opening branches（開設分店）這個具體例子相符。","options":["contraction","expansion","stability","decline"],"sentence":"The company's ______ into new markets has created hundreds of jobs. They opened ten additional branches in Southeast Asia last quarter alone.","translation":"該公司向新市場的擴展創造了數百個工作機會。他們在上個季度僅在東南亞就開設了十家分支機構。","word":"expansion"}},"expect":{"createdAt":1783505313976,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"expect作動詞表示「期待」或「預料」，指認為某事很可能或必然發生。","options":["doubt","expect","deny","fear"],"sentence":"The coach ______ his team to win the championship this year. Based on their rigorous training and strong performance record, they are confident in their abilities.","translation":"教練期待他的球隊今年贏得冠軍。基於他們嚴格的訓練和強大的表現記錄，他們對自己的能力很有信心。","word":"expect"}},"expectation":{"createdAt":1781619188925,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"expectation 指對未來事件的期望或預期，反映對結果的盼望。","options":["anxiety","expectation","fear","doubt"],"sentence":"Her ______ for the job interview were extremely high after years of preparation. However, she performed poorly and didn't receive an offer.","translation":"經過多年準備，她對這次工作面試的期望極高。然而，她表現不佳，沒有收到錄用通知。","word":"expectation"}},"expedition":{"createdAt":1781619188923,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"expedition 指有目的的遠征或探險活動，通常涉及科研或探索目標。","options":["vacation","expedition","migration","journey"],"sentence":"The research team planned a challenging ______ to the Arctic to study climate change. They spent eighteen months preparing equipment and training before departing.","translation":"研究團隊計劃進行一次艱辛的北極探險，以研究氣候變化。他們在出發前花了十八個月準備設備和培訓。","word":"expedition"}},"expenditure":{"createdAt":1783946382149,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"expenditure 指的是支出或花費，特別是指組織或個人花費的金錢總額。","options":["income","expenditure","investment","profit"],"sentence":"The company's annual ______ on research and development has increased significantly. They spent millions of dollars this year alone to fund new projects and innovations.","translation":"公司年度在研究開發上的______ 大幅增加。他們今年單獨花費了數百萬美元來資助新項目和創新。","word":"expenditure"}},"expense":{"createdAt":1781961517451,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"expense 特指金錢上的支出或費用，通常用在經濟成本的語境中。","options":["burden","expense","effort","problem"],"sentence":"The family decided to cut down on their vacation ______ by staying at a budget hotel. They needed to reduce their overall spending due to limited financial resources.","translation":"這個家庭決定通過住在經濟旅館來減少他們的度假費用。由於財務資源有限，他們需要減少總體支出。","word":"expense"}},"expension":{"createdAt":1782659817811,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"expension 表示某物的膨脹或擴張，在此指人口增長導致的城市規模和需求的增加。","options":["reduction","expension","stability","decline"],"sentence":"The rapid ______ of the city's population has strained the local infrastructure. New schools, hospitals, and transportation systems are needed to accommodate the thousands of new residents moving in each month.","translation":"城市人口的快速膨脹使當地基礎設施承受壓力。需要建設新的學校、醫院和運輸系統來容納每月遷入的數千名新居民。","word":"expension"}},"expensive":{"createdAt":1781424137078,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"expensive 形容詞意為「昂貴的」，用來描述價格很高、花費很大的物品或服務。","options":["cheap","affordable","expensive","reasonable"],"sentence":"This restaurant is quite ______ and only wealthy customers can afford to eat here regularly. A single meal at this establishment costs more than a hundred dollars.","translation":"這家餐廳相當昂貴，只有富有的顧客才能經常在這裡用餐。這家店的一頓飯要花一百多美元。","word":"expensive"}},"experiment":{"createdAt":1782902371510,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"experiment 表示科學方法中進行的實驗或試驗，用來驗證假設。","options":["theory","experiment","conclusion","observation"],"sentence":"The scientist conducted an ______ to test the new hypothesis. The results were recorded carefully in the laboratory notebook after months of systematic testing.","translation":"這位科學家進行了一項實驗來測試新的假設。在幾個月的系統性測試後，結果被仔細地記錄在實驗室筆記本中。","word":"experiment"}},"expert":{"createdAt":1781715051242,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"expert 作為名詞表示「專家」或「熟練者」，指在某個領域具有深厚知識和高超技能的人。","options":["beginner","expert","student","observer"],"sentence":"Dr. Chen is an ______ in cardiac surgery who has performed thousands of complex operations. She was invited to lead the medical team because of her decades of specialized knowledge and proven skill in this field.","translation":"陳醫生是心臟手術的專家，已經進行過數千次複雜手術。由於她在這個領域擁有數十年的專業知識和經驗豐富的技能，她被邀請領導醫療團隊。","word":"expert"}},"expertise":{"createdAt":1781414438960,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"expertise指在特定領域中獲得的深厚知識、技能和專業能力","options":["luck","expertise","interest","theory"],"sentence":"The company hired a consultant with ______ in digital marketing strategy. His twenty years of experience and proven track record made him the perfect choice for leading the campaign.","translation":"公司聘請了一位擁有數位行銷策略專長的顧問。他二十年的經驗和成熟的業績使他成為領導這項活動的完美人選。","word":"expertise"}},"expiration":{"createdAt":1783293763169,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"expiration 意思是「屆滿、截止或終止」，特指產品失效或不再可用的日期。","options":["expiration","delivery","distribution","production"],"sentence":"The milk carton displayed an ______ date of June 15th, 2024. After that date, the product would no longer be safe to consume.","translation":"牛奶盒上顯示截止日期為2024年6月15日。在該日期之後，該產品將不再安全食用。","word":"expiration"}},"expire":{"createdAt":1784645461855,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"expire 意為「期滿、結束、失效」，通常用於描述證件、合約或有效期限到達終點時的狀態。","options":["improve","expire","extend","update"],"sentence":"My driver's license will ______ next month, so I need to renew it before then. The government won't allow me to drive legally once that date arrives.","translation":"我的駕駛執照將在下個月期滿，所以我需要在那之前更新它。一旦那個日期到達，政府就不會允許我合法駕駛。","word":"expire"}},"explain":{"createdAt":1783516555626,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"explain 是動詞，表示用清晰、詳細的方式使別人理解某事物。","options":["explore","explain","express","expand"],"sentence":"The teacher asked me to ______ the difficult concept to my classmates. After I finished describing the steps in detail, everyone finally understood the problem.","translation":"老師叫我向同學們解釋這個困難的概念。在我詳細描述完步驟後，每個人都終於明白了這個問題。","word":"explain"}},"explanation":{"createdAt":1783310403309,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"explanation是名詞，指對某事的原因、理由或含義的詳細說明或闡述。","options":["excuse","explanation","apology","complaint"],"sentence":"The teacher asked the student to provide an ______ for arriving late to class. The student clarified that there was heavy traffic on the road that morning.","translation":"老師要求學生提供遲到的解釋。學生澄清那天早上路上交通擁堵。","word":"explanation"}},"explicit":{"createdAt":1781581925131,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"explicit 表示詳盡的、明確的、毫不含糊的，指信息清楚直接，不需要推測。","options":["implicit","explicit","vague","ambiguous"],"sentence":"The teacher gave ______ instructions on how to complete the assignment. Students did not need to guess; every step was clearly written with specific examples.","translation":"老師給了關於如何完成作業的明確指示。學生不需要猜測；每個步驟都用具體的例子明確寫出。","word":"explicit"}},"explode":{"createdAt":1781693538700,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"explode 表示突然猛烈地爆發或炸開，常伴隨巨大的聲音和光線。","options":["whisper","explode","melt","float"],"sentence":"The fireworks will ______ into the night sky at midnight. We can already hear the loud bangs and see the colorful lights bursting above us.","translation":"煙火將在午夜時分爆炸進入夜空。我們已經能聽到巨大的爆炸聲，看到五顏六色的光線在我們上方炸裂。","word":"explode"}},"exploit":{"createdAt":1781425737122,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"exploit 作名詞時指傑出的功績或英勇的行為，與戰爭中的英雄表現相符。","options":["defeat","exploit","retreat","loss"],"sentence":"The soldier's brave ______ during the battle earned him a medal of honor. His heroic actions saved many lives and inspired his entire regiment.","translation":"這位士兵在戰鬥中的英勇功績為他贏得了榮譽勳章。他的英雄行為拯救了許多生命，激勵了整個團隊。","word":"exploit"}},"exploration":{"createdAt":1788163851359,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"exploration 是指對某個地區或事物的仔細勘查和探索，通常涉及發現新的東西或獲得新的知識。","options":["celebration","exploration","documentation","interpretation"],"sentence":"The team's ______ of the Amazon rainforest revealed many undiscovered plant species. Their systematic investigation into unmapped territories lasted over two years.","translation":"該團隊對亞馬遜雨林的探索揭示了許多未被發現的植物物種。他們對未開發領土的系統性調查持續了兩年多。","word":"exploration"}},"explore":{"createdAt":1781332009069,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"explore 意為探測或探險，通常用於對未知地區的調查和研究","options":["avoid","explore","close","ignore"],"sentence":"The research team decided to ______ the newly discovered cave system in the mountains. They spent weeks mapping out all the tunnels and studying the geological formations inside.","translation":"研究小組決定探測山區新發現的洞穴系統。他們花了數周時間繪製所有隧道並研究內部的地質構造。","word":"explore"}},"explosion":{"createdAt":1783476327934,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"explosion 是名詞，意為爆炸，指由化學反應或壓力突然釋放引起的劇烈破壞。","options":["whisper","murmur","explosion","silence"],"sentence":"The ______ at the warehouse could be heard from miles away, shaking buildings and triggering alarms across the city. The blast caused severe damage to the surrounding structures and injured several workers.","translation":"倉庫的爆炸可以從數英里外聽到，震撼了建築物並在全市觸發了警報。爆炸對周圍建築物造成了嚴重破壞，並使幾名工人受傷。","word":"explosion"}},"export":{"createdAt":1784341313976,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"export 作為動詞表示「輸出」或「出口」商品到其他國家，與 import（進口）相反。","options":["import","export","distribute","manufacture"],"sentence":"Many countries ______ agricultural products to international markets every year. China is one of the world's largest exporters of electronics and textiles to other nations.","translation":"許多國家每年向國際市場______農產品。中國是世界上向其他國家出口電子產品和紡織品的最大出口商之一。","word":"export"}},"expose":{"createdAt":1781598671164,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"expose 作動詞表示使暴露或揭露，指揭示隱藏或秘密的事實","options":["conceal","expose","ignore","protect"],"sentence":"Journalists worked to ______ the corruption scandal within the government agency. Their investigation revealed illegal activities hidden from the public for years.","translation":"記者致力於揭露政府機構內的腐敗醜聞。他們的調查揭示了多年來向公眾隱瞞的非法活動。","word":"expose"}},"exposure":{"createdAt":1781839703152,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"exposure指暴露在某物中，與prolonged sun exposure causing skin damage and UV radiation warnings（長時間暴曬導致皮膚損傷和紫外線警告）直接對應。","options":["shelter","protection","exposure","coverage"],"sentence":"Prolonged ______ to the sun without sunscreen can cause severe skin damage. The dermatologist warned her about the risks of UV radiation.","translation":"在沒有防曬霜的情況下長時間暴曬會造成嚴重的皮膚損傷。皮膚科醫生警告她紫外線輻射的危險。","word":"exposure"}},"express":{"createdAt":1782305067261,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"express是指用言語、行為或藝術形式表達或傳達想法、感情或意見。","options":["show","explain","express","deliver"],"sentence":"She wanted to ______ her feelings about the unfair decision to the principal. She scheduled a meeting to clearly communicate her concerns and disappointment about what happened.","translation":"她想向校長表達她對不公平決定的感受。她安排了一次會議，以清楚地傳達她對所發生事情的關切和失望。","word":"express"}},"expression":{"createdAt":1783908094818,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"expression 指臉部或眼睛所表現出來的表情，能夠反映一個人的情感或心態。","options":["gesture","expression","movement","posture"],"sentence":"The actor's ______ on his face showed deep sadness during the emotional scene. His furrowed brow and downturned mouth made it clear he was portraying a character in grief.","translation":"演員在情感場景中臉上的表情表現出深深的悲傷。他皺起的眉毛和向下的嘴角清楚地表明他在扮演一個悲傷的角色。","word":"expression"}},"expressive":{"createdAt":1781311983486,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"expressive 表示能夠表達感情或想法的，富有表現力和感染力的。","options":["average","offshore","expressive","evolution"],"sentence":"The dancer's ______ movements captivated the entire audience during the performance. Her body language conveyed deep emotion and artistic intention without speaking a single word.","translation":"舞者在表演中富有表現力的動作迷住了整個觀眾。她的肢體語言在沒有說一句話的情況下傳達了深層的情感和藝術意圖。","word":"expressive"}},"exquisite":{"createdAt":1787049198635,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"exquisite形容精緻、優雅、精美的事物，通常指做工精良或設計高雅。","options":["cheap","broken","exquisite","simple"],"sentence":"The jeweler crafted an ______ necklace with tiny diamonds and delicate gold filigree work. It was so beautifully made that it belonged in a museum.","translation":"珠寶商用細小鑽石和精巧的黃金絲工藝製作了一條精緻的項鍊。它製作得如此精美，應該放在博物館裡。","word":"exquisite"}},"extend":{"createdAt":1782646761054,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"extend 表示延長或延伸時間、期限、範圍等，使其變得更長或更遠。","options":["shorten","extend","negotiate","terminate"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ its contract with the supplier for another two years. This means the agreement will continue longer than originally planned.","translation":"公司決定將與供應商的合約延長兩年。這表示該協議將比原計畫繼續更長的時間。","word":"extend"}},"extended":{"createdAt":1786193938985,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"extended 表示「延長的；延伸的」，在此指保修期從標準的兩年延長到五年，覆蓋時間更長更廣泛。","options":["brief","extended","standard","basic"],"sentence":"The company decided to offer an ______ warranty that covers five years instead of the standard two years. This longer protection period gives customers much more peace of mind about their purchase.","translation":"該公司決定提供延長的保修期，涵蓋五年而不是標準的兩年。這個更長的保護期讓客戶對他們的購買更加放心。","word":"extended"}},"extension":{"createdAt":1781709984193,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"extension 在這裡指的是延長期限或時間長度，特別是在借用物品時的期限延長。","options":["renewal","extension","delay","postponement"],"sentence":"I need to request an ______ on my library book because I haven't finished reading it yet. The librarian said I can add two more weeks to the due date.","translation":"我需要申請延長我的圖書館借書期限，因為我還沒讀完。圖書館員說我可以在到期日期上再加兩週。","word":"extension"}},"extensive":{"createdAt":1781693591740,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"extensive 是形容詞，表示「廣闊的」、「大面積的」或「覆蓋範圍廣的」，強調規模大且涵蓋範圍廣。","options":["minimal","brief","extensive","focused"],"sentence":"The professor conducted ______ research across multiple countries and collected data from thousands of participants. His study covered urban areas, rural communities, and everything in between over five years.","translation":"教授在多個國家進行了廣泛的研究，並從數千名參與者收集了數據。他的研究涵蓋了城市地區、農村社區以及介於兩者之間的所有地方，歷時五年。","word":"extensive"}},"extent":{"createdAt":1782408103430,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"extent 表示某事物的廣度、範圍或程度，在這裡指颶風損害的規模和範圍。","options":["duration","extent","location","intensity"],"sentence":"The ______ of the damage from the hurricane was much worse than anyone had predicted. Engineers surveyed the region carefully to measure how far the destruction had spread.","translation":"颶風造成的損害程度遠比任何人預測的都要嚴重。工程師仔細調查該地區以測量破壞蔓延的距離。","word":"extent"}},"exterior":{"createdAt":1782552499022,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"exterior 指事物的外面或外表，與需要從外部粉刷牆壁和屋頂的動作相符。","options":["interior","exterior","structure","framework"],"sentence":"The ______ of the old building was painted bright blue last summer. Workers had to use special scaffolding to reach the high walls and roof.","translation":"這棟老建築的外表去年夏天被粉刷成亮藍色。工人們必須使用特殊的鷹架才能到達高牆和屋頂。","word":"exterior"}},"external":{"createdAt":1784106475791,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"external 是指來自外部、外界的或來自組織外的東西，與內部或組織內部的事物相對。","options":["internal","external","temporary","financial"],"sentence":"The company decided to hire an ______ consultant to review their business strategy objectively. This independent expert came from outside the organization and had no personal stake in the company's existing operations.","translation":"公司決定聘請外部顧問來客觀審查其業務戰略。這位獨立專家來自組織外部，對公司的現有運營沒有個人利益。","word":"external"}},"extinct":{"createdAt":1781598671067,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"extinct 作形容詞表示絕種的或消失的，指物種或現象完全不復存在","options":["endangered","extinct","migrating","thriving"],"sentence":"The dodo bird is now ______ and can only be seen in museums and historical records. This species disappeared forever in the 17th century due to human hunting.","translation":"渡渡鳥現在已經絕種，只能在博物館和歷史記錄中看到。這個物種在17世紀因人類獵殺而永遠消失。","word":"extinct"}},"extract":{"createdAt":1785134562398,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"extract 在這裡意為「拔出」或「取出」，特別是指移除或提取某物，通常涉及一定的力量或技巧。","options":["insert","extract","polish","examine"],"sentence":"The dentist had to ______ the patient's damaged tooth during the procedure. She used specialized instruments to carefully remove it from the socket without causing additional pain.","translation":"牙醫不得不在手術過程中拔出患者受損的牙齒。她使用專門的工具小心地將其從齒槽中移出，而不會造成額外的疼痛。","word":"extract"}},"extracurricular":{"createdAt":1784016923078,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"extracurricular 意為課外的、業餘的，指在正規課程之外進行的學習或活動。","options":["mandatory","extracurricular","failed","fundamental"],"sentence":"She joined several ______ activities at school, including the debate club and the drama society. These programs happen outside of regular classroom hours.","translation":"她在學校參加了幾項課外活動，包括辯論俱樂部和戲劇社。這些項目在常規課堂時間之外進行。","word":"extracurricular"}},"extraordinary":{"createdAt":1781693269016,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"extraordinary 意思是非凡的、特別的、超出尋常的，形容極其出眾或令人驚嘆的事物。","options":["ordinary","extraordinary","mediocre","average"],"sentence":"The young athlete displayed ______ talent during the championship match, impressing all the coaches in attendance. Her performance was so exceptional that professional teams immediately began scouting her for recruitment.","translation":"這位年輕運動員在錦標賽中展現了非凡的才能，給所有出席的教練留下了深刻印象。她的表現非常傑出，以至於職業隊伍立即開始尋求簽約她。","word":"extraordinary"}},"extreme":{"createdAt":1783488481396,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"極端用來形容達到最大程度或最高程度的情況，通常指超出普通範圍的事物。","options":["mild","moderate","extreme","pleasant"],"sentence":"The mountaineer faced ______ weather conditions during the climb, including temperatures below -40°C. These conditions were so severe that they posed serious dangers to survival.","translation":"登山者在攀登過程中面臨極端的天氣條件，包括低於零下40度的溫度。這些條件極其嚴苛，對生存構成了嚴重威脅。","word":"extreme"}},"extremely":{"createdAt":1783946375012,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"extremely是副詞，表示達到很高的程度或強度，用來修飾形容詞或其他副詞，表示「極端地」或「非常地」。","options":["moderately","slightly","extremely","somewhat"],"sentence":"The weather forecast warned that the storm would be ______ dangerous, and residents were urged to stay indoors. The meteorologist emphasized that winds could exceed 150 kilometers per hour and cause severe damage.","translation":"天氣預報警告風暴將極端危險，居民被敦促留在室內。氣象學家強調風速可能超過每小時150公里並造成嚴重損害。","word":"extremely"}},"eyesore":{"createdAt":1783228210814,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"eyesore 指的是看上去令人不快或難看的東西，通常讓人感到厭煩或反感，在這句話中特別強調了建築物的醜陋外觀。","options":["landmark","eyesore","structure","monument"],"sentence":"That abandoned building is a real ______ in our otherwise beautiful neighborhood. The city council has finally decided to demolish it because residents complained about its ugly appearance for years.","translation":"那座廢棄的建築物是我們否則美麗的鄰里中真正的眼中釘。市議會終於決定拆除它，因為居民多年來一直抱怨它醜陋的外觀。","word":"eyesore"}},"fable":{"createdAt":1781703691073,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"fable 作為名詞指寓言故事，通常涉及動物角色並傳達道德或教訓。","options":["novel","essay","fable","poem"],"sentence":"Aesop's most famous ______ tells the story of a tortoise and a hare racing to prove that slow and steady progress wins the competition. This timeless tale teaches children the moral lesson that persistence and determination are more valuable than natural talent.","translation":"伊索最著名的寓言講述了烏龜和兔子比賽的故事，用來證明穩定持久的進展能贏得比賽。這個永恆的故事教導孩子們一個道德教訓，即堅持和決心比天賦更有價值。","word":"fable"}},"fabric":{"createdAt":1781485266373,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"fabric指的是通過編織或紡織製成的織物和織品，用於製作衣服和其他物品。","options":["metal","plastic","fabric","leather"],"sentence":"She selected a soft cotton ______ for her summer dress project at the textile shop. The material felt smooth and breathable, perfect for hot weather clothing.","translation":"她在紡織品店為她的夏季連衣裙項目選擇了柔軟的棉織物。這種材料感覺光滑透氣，非常適合炎熱天氣的服裝。","word":"fabric"}},"fabulous":{"createdAt":1781780789949,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fabulous 是形容詞，意為極好的、令人難以置信的，通常用來讚美某事物非常出色或令人印象深刻。","options":["boring","fabulous","confusing","ordinary"],"sentence":"The performance was absolutely ______ and left the entire audience speechless. Everyone gave it a standing ovation and praised it as one of the best shows they had ever seen.","translation":"那場表演絕對是極好的，讓整個觀眾都驚呆了。每個人都起立鼓掌，並稱讚它是他們看過最好的演出之一。","word":"fabulous"}},"facade":{"createdAt":1785339147822,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"facade指建築物的正面或對外展示的表面，也引申為掩蓋真實情況的虛偽外表。","options":["entrance","facade","wall","structure"],"sentence":"The old building had an ornate ______ decorated with classical columns and intricate carvings. However, the interior was completely empty and abandoned behind this beautiful exterior.","translation":"那棟老建築有一個華麗的正面，裝飾著古典柱子和複雜的雕刻。然而，在這個美麗的外觀後面，內部完全是空的和廢棄的。","word":"facade"}},"facilitate":{"createdAt":1781703691070,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"facilitate 作為動詞表示使某事變得容易或便利，促進事情的進行。","options":["complicate","facilitate","ignore","prevent"],"sentence":"Online learning platforms ______ communication between teachers and students across different time zones. Without these digital tools, remote education would be much more challenging and inefficient.","translation":"線上學習平台促進了不同時區的老師和學生之間的溝通。沒有這些數位工具，遠距教育會變得更加困難和低效。","word":"facilitate"}},"facility":{"createdAt":1781417610422,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"facility是指為特定目的而建造的設備、機構或場所，通常配備必要的工具和資源。","options":["library","dormitory","facility","cafeteria"],"sentence":"The university invested millions of dollars in building a state-of-the-art research ______ for its chemistry department. Scientists now had access to the latest equipment and technology needed for advanced experiments.","translation":"大學投入數百萬美元為化學系建造最先進的研究設施。科學家們現在可以使用進行先進實驗所需的最新設備和技術。","word":"facility"}},"factor":{"createdAt":1784187965388,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"factor 指的是影響結果的各種要素或因素，可以是定量或定性的要素。","options":["reason","element","factor","cause"],"sentence":"Weather is an important ______ in determining crop yield for farmers. The amount of rainfall, temperature, and sunlight all influence how much food can be harvested each season.","translation":"天氣是決定農民作物產量的重要因素。降雨量、溫度和陽光都會影響每個季節能收穫多少糧食。","word":"factor"}},"faculties":{"createdAt":1783946382151,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"faculties 在此指的是大學中的各個學院或院系，每個faculty 通常包含相關的學科和部門。","options":["buildings","faculties","libraries","dormitories"],"sentence":"The university appointed new deans to oversee each of its academic ______ including engineering, medicine, and arts. These leadership positions were responsible for managing multiple departments and research centers within their respective schools.","translation":"大學任命新的院長來監督其每個學術______ ，包括工程學、醫學和藝術。這些領導職位負責管理其各自學院內的多個部門和研究中心。","word":"faculties"}},"faculty":{"createdAt":1781843487264,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"faculty 指的是學校或大學的全體教職員，包括教師和其他工作人員，是集體名詞。","options":["students","faculty","alumni","trustees"],"sentence":"The ______ at this university includes professors, lecturers, and administrative staff. The dean called a meeting with all 200 members to discuss the new curriculum policy.","translation":"這所大學的教職員包括教授、講師和行政人員。院長召集所有200名成員開會討論新的課程政策。","word":"faculty"}},"fade":{"createdAt":1784346428226,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fade 表示逐漸消失或褪去，特別是指顏色、光亮或聲音等逐漸變弱或消退。","options":["sharpen","fade","brighten","enlarge"],"sentence":"The old photograph will slowly ______ as it sits in direct sunlight for months. By next year, the colors will become so pale that you can barely recognize the faces in the picture.","translation":"這張舊照片在陽光直射下放置數月後會逐漸褪色。到了明年，顏色會變得非常淡，你幾乎無法認出照片中的人臉。","word":"fade"}},"fahrenheit":{"createdAt":1781784283025,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"Fahrenheit是名詞，指華氏溫標；美國主要使用華氏溫度來測量和報告天氣溫度，而不是攝氏溫度。","options":["Celsius","Kelvin","Fahrenheit","Rankine"],"sentence":"The weather report showed the temperature was 68 degrees ______. This is the temperature scale commonly used in the United States and a few other countries.","translation":"天氣預報顯示溫度是68度______。這是在美國和少數其他國家常用的溫度計量表。","word":"fahrenheit"}},"fail":{"createdAt":1783516555627,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"fail 作為動詞時，表示未能達到及格標準或未能成功完成某事。","options":["pass","miss","fail","skip"],"sentence":"If I ______ this final exam, I will not be able to graduate this year. My teacher warned me that I need at least a 60% score to pass the course.","translation":"如果我這次期末考不及格，我就無法在今年畢業。我的老師警告我，我需要至少60分才能通過這門課程。","word":"fail"}},"failure":{"createdAt":1784346605540,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"failure 表示失敗或疏忽，在這個句子中指公司未能完成任務的失敗。","options":["success","failure","attempt","delay"],"sentence":"The company's ______ to meet the deadline resulted in losing a major contract. The project manager's oversight and lack of planning were the primary reasons for this outcome.","translation":"公司未能按時完成期限導致失去了一份重大合約。專案經理的疏忽和缺乏規劃是導致這一結果的主要原因。","word":"failure"}},"faint":{"createdAt":1782921344555,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"faint 作為形容詞表示頭暈或虛弱的狀態，常伴隨視線模糊、頭昏眼花等症狀。","options":["angry","curious","faint","excited"],"sentence":"When Tom heard the terrible news, he began to feel ______ and his vision became blurry. He nearly lost consciousness and had to sit down immediately.","translation":"當湯姆聽到可怕的消息時，他開始感到頭暈，視線變得模糊。他幾乎失去意識，必須立即坐下。","word":"faint"}},"fairly":{"createdAt":1783823805984,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fairly 是副詞，表示相當地、一定程度地、還可以，介於『非常』和『不』之間的程度。","options":["extremely","fairly","terribly","not"],"sentence":"The movie was ______ entertaining, though it had some slow moments in the middle. Most viewers gave it a rating of six or seven out of ten, neither loving nor hating it.","translation":"這部電影相當有趣，雖然中間有一些緩慢的時刻。大多數觀眾給它打了六到七分（滿分十分），既不熱愛也不討厭。","word":"fairly"}},"faith":{"createdAt":1783558199864,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"faith（信任；信念）是指對某人或某事的堅定相信和信心，常用於表達忠誠與信念。","options":["doubt","faith","fear","envy"],"sentence":"She had complete ______ in her friend's honesty and never doubted his word. Even when others questioned him, she remained loyal and trusted him completely.","translation":"她對朋友的誠實有完全的信任，從不懷疑他的話。即使別人質疑他，她仍然忠實並完全相信他。","word":"faith"}},"faithful":{"createdAt":1781564440928,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"faithful 作形容詞表示忠實的、守信的，指保持忠誠、可靠和真實。","options":["aggressive","faithful","lazy","unfriendly"],"sentence":"The dog was a ______ companion who followed his owner everywhere. Throughout the years, the animal never abandoned or betrayed its owner's trust.","translation":"這隻狗是忠實的伴侶，到處跟著主人。多年來，這隻動物從未拋棄或背叛主人的信任。","word":"faithful"}},"faithfully":{"createdAt":1781696018689,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"faithfully 意為忠實地、忠誠地，形容以忠心、堅定和持久的方式對待某人或某事。","options":["reluctantly","faithfully","occasionally","carelessly"],"sentence":"The old dog ______ followed his master everywhere, never leaving his side for decades. Such unwavering devotion was truly remarkable.","translation":"老狗幾十年來忠實地跟隨主人到處走，從不離開主人身邊。這種堅定不移的忠誠確實令人印象深刻。","word":"faithfully"}},"fake":{"createdAt":1781780789962,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fake 在此作名詞，意為贗品或冒充者，表示非真實的、偽造的物品或假裝者。","options":["treasure","fake","discovery","relic"],"sentence":"The museum discovered that the ancient artifact was actually a ______ created by a clever forger. Testing revealed it was made only fifty years ago, not two thousand years ago.","translation":"博物館發現那件古代藝術品實際上是由一位聰明的偽造者創作的贗品。檢測表明它是五十年前製造的，而不是兩千年前。","word":"fake"}},"fall":{"createdAt":1787049756213,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fall是指從高處往下跌落或倒下。","options":["climb","fall","jump","slip"],"sentence":"Be careful on the ladder because you might ______ and hurt yourself. The ground is very hard if you lose your balance at that height.","translation":"小心梯子，因為你可能會跌倒並傷害自己。如果你在那個高度失去平衡，地面會非常硬。","word":"fall"}},"fame":{"createdAt":1781499075061,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"名聲指一個人因為成就或才能而廣為人知和受認可。","options":["obscurity","anonymity","fame","poverty"],"sentence":"The young musician achieved ______ after her debut album became a worldwide hit. Record labels wanted to sign her, and millions of fans followed her on social media.","translation":"這位年輕音樂家在她的首張專輯成為全球熱門後獲得了名聲。唱片公司想簽約她，數百萬粉絲在社交媒體上關注她。","word":"fame"}},"familiar":{"createdAt":1783575763871,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"familiar表示對某物有充分的認識、瞭解或經驗，感到熟悉。","options":["unfamiliar","confused","familiar","frustrated"],"sentence":"The tourist felt ______ with the customs of the local culture after spending three months living in the village. He had learned their traditions, language, and way of life through daily interaction.","translation":"這位遊客在村裡住了三個月後，對當地文化的習俗感到熟悉。他通過日常互動學習了他們的傳統、語言和生活方式。","word":"familiar"}},"familiarity":{"createdAt":1781499075057,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"熟悉指對某事物或某人有充分的認識或了解。","options":["confusion","unfamiliarity","familiarity","uncertainty"],"sentence":"Her ______ with the local customs made it easy for her to navigate the new city. Having lived there for five years, she knew all the best restaurants and neighborhoods.","translation":"她對當地習俗的熟悉使她很容易在這個新城市導航。在那裡生活了五年後，她知道所有最好的餐廳和社區。","word":"familiarity"}},"fanatic":{"createdAt":1781424574163,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fanatic 指對某事物有過度熱情或狂熱的人，有時帶有盲目追隨的含義。","options":["casual","fanatic","critic","player"],"sentence":"The sports ______ attended every single game, wore team jerseys, and collected memorabilia obsessively. His passion for the team bordered on an unhealthy obsession.","translation":"這位運動狂熱者參加了每一場比賽，穿著球隊球衣，並瘋狂地收集紀念品。他對球隊的熱情幾乎成為了不健康的執著。","word":"fanatic"}},"fancy":{"createdAt":1783575763867,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"fancy作為名詞表示對某物的愛好或特別的迷戀。","options":["dislike","confusion","fancy","talent"],"sentence":"She has a ______ for collecting vintage watches and has amassed over two hundred pieces. Her bedroom walls are decorated with glass cases displaying her prized collection.","translation":"她喜愛收集老式手錶，已經收集了超過兩百件。她的臥室牆壁上裝飾著玻璃櫃，展示她珍貴的收藏品。","word":"fancy"}},"fantastic":{"createdAt":1781332009065,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fantastic 意為極好的、非常令人滿意的，通常用來表達對某事物的高度讚美","options":["terrible","fantastic","boring","average"],"sentence":"The movie was absolutely ______ and exceeded all my expectations. Critics praised it as one of the best films of the year.","translation":"那部電影絕對是極好的，超越了我所有的期望。評論家稱讚它是今年最好的電影之一。","word":"fantastic"}},"fantasy":{"createdAt":1783671496285,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fantasy是名詞，指充滿想像和虛構元素的事物或故事，與現實相對。","options":["reality","fantasy","memory","history"],"sentence":"Many children enjoy reading stories about magic and adventure in their ______. However, these imaginative tales help them develop creativity and problem-solving skills.","translation":"許多孩子喜歡在他們的幻想中閱讀關於魔法和冒險的故事。然而，這些富有想像力的故事幫助他們發展創造力和解決問題的能力。","word":"fantasy"}},"fare":{"createdAt":1783323381795,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fare 指的是搭乘交通工具所需支付的價格或費用。","options":["destination","fare","schedule","direction"],"sentence":"I paid the bus ______ when I boarded the vehicle this morning. The driver gave me a receipt showing the exact amount I owed for my journey across town.","translation":"我今天早上上車時支付了公車費用。司機給了我一張收據，上面顯示了我跨越城鎮旅程所欠的確切金額。","word":"fare"}},"farmed":{"createdAt":1782920661028,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"farmed是指從事農業或耕種土地，包括種植作物和飼養動物","options":["owned","farmed","managed","worked"],"sentence":"His family ______ the land for generations, growing crops and raising livestock. The agricultural traditions had been passed down from his great-grandfather.","translation":"他的家族世世代代從事農業，種植農作物和飼養牲畜。農業傳統已從他曾祖父傳承下來。","word":"farmed"}},"farther":{"createdAt":1783419789622,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"farther 是副詞的比較級，用來表示距離上比較遠或更遠，用於比較兩個地點之間的距離。","options":["higher","farther","deeper","wider"],"sentence":"The hiking trail extended much ______ than the map had indicated. The group realized they would need several more hours to reach the final destination.","translation":"登山步道延伸的距離遠比地圖上標示的要遠。該小組意識到他們需要再花幾個小時才能到達最終目的地。","word":"farther"}},"fascinate":{"createdAt":1783575763866,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fascinate表示深深地吸引或迷住某人的興趣和注意力。","options":["ignored","fascinate","disappointed","confused"],"sentence":"The ancient ruins ______ archaeologists from around the world who came to study them. These mysterious structures held secrets that captivated everyone's attention.","translation":"古代遺跡迷住了來自世界各地研究它們的考古學家。這些神秘的結構隱藏著吸引每個人注意力的秘密。","word":"fascinate"}},"fascinated":{"createdAt":1782706784005,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fascinated表示被深深吸引或著迷，對某事物產生濃厚的興趣。","options":["bored","fascinated","confused","tired"],"sentence":"The young children were completely ______ by the magician's incredible illusions on stage. They couldn't take their eyes off him and kept asking questions about how the tricks were done.","translation":"年輕的孩子們完全被舞台上魔術師令人難以置信的幻覺吸引住了。他們目不轉睛地看著他，不斷詢問魔術是如何完成的。","word":"fascinated"}},"fascination":{"createdAt":1783584143070,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"fascination是名詞，表示對某事物的強烈興趣和著迷，通常伴隨主動探索和持續的投入。","options":["boredom","confusion","fascination","indifference"],"sentence":"Her ______ with ancient Egyptian history began when she was just a child visiting the museum. She spent hours reading books and watching documentaries about pharaohs and pyramids.","translation":"她對古埃及歷史的著迷始於她年幼時參觀博物館。她花了數小時閱讀書籍和觀看有關法老和金字塔的紀錄片。","word":"fascination"}},"fashion":{"createdAt":1783260805489,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fashion在這裡表示「流行款式」或「時尚」，指特定時期流行的衣著或設計風格。","options":["regulation","fashion","routine","tradition"],"sentence":"The designer created a new ______ that combined traditional and modern elements in an unexpected way. This unique style quickly became popular among trendy young people who appreciated its originality.","translation":"設計師創造了一種新的時尚風格，以意想不到的方式結合了傳統和現代元素。這種獨特的風格迅速在欣賞其原創性的時髦年輕人中流行起來。","word":"fashion"}},"fasten":{"createdAt":1783575763869,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fasten表示把某物繫緊或扣緊，使其牢固地固定。","options":["loosen","fasten","remove","adjust"],"sentence":"Before the airplane takes off, all passengers must ______ their seatbelts securely. Safety regulations require this step to be completed before the doors close.","translation":"飛機起飛前，所有乘客必須牢固地繫緊安全帶。安全法規要求在艙門關閉前完成此步驟。","word":"fasten"}},"fatal":{"createdAt":1781839703145,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"fatal指導致死亡的，與pronounced dead（被宣佈死亡）直接相關。","options":["minor","superficial","recoverable","fatal"],"sentence":"The accident proved to be ______ for the young driver. He was pronounced dead at the scene despite immediate medical intervention.","translation":"這場事故對年輕駕駛員來說是致命的。儘管立即進行了醫療干預，他仍在現場被宣佈死亡。","word":"fatal"}},"fateful":{"createdAt":1784079070387,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fateful是形容詞，表示某個事件具有重大的、決定性的影響，通常暗示命運的安排或深遠的後果。","options":["cheerful","fateful","brief","awkward"],"sentence":"That ______ meeting in 1969 changed the course of human history forever. When the two scientists shook hands for the first time, neither realized their collaboration would lead to the discovery that would revolutionize medicine.","translation":"那場1969年的命中註定的會面永遠改變了人類歷史的進程。當那兩位科學家第一次握手時，都沒有意識到他們的合作將導致革命性的醫學發現。","word":"fateful"}},"fatigue":{"createdAt":1783951417314,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fatigue是名詞，表示身體或精神上的疲憊和勞累，通常由於過度工作或活動而導致。","options":["enthusiasm","fatigue","motivation","confidence"],"sentence":"After working twelve hours without a break, the construction worker complained of extreme ______ and could barely keep his eyes open. His body felt so exhausted that he needed to rest immediately before continuing any physical labor.","translation":"在沒有休息的情況下工作了十二小時後，建築工人抱怨感到極度疲憊，幾乎睜不開眼睛。他的身體感到非常疲勞，必須在繼續進行任何體力勞動之前立即休息。","word":"fatigue"}},"fatigued":{"createdAt":1781696018682,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"fatigued 意為疲憊、勞累，形容身體或精神上的極度疲勞狀態。","options":["energized","refreshed","fatigued","motivated"],"sentence":"After working sixteen hours straight, the nurse felt completely ______ and could barely stand. She collapsed onto her bed immediately upon arriving home.","translation":"連續工作十六小時後，護士感到極其疲憊，幾乎站不住。她一到家就立刻倒在床上。","word":"fatigued"}},"faucet":{"createdAt":1781849511875,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"龍頭是一種裝置，用於控制水的流量，通常安裝在水管出口處。","options":["pipe","faucet","sink","drain"],"sentence":"Sarah twisted the ______ in the kitchen sink to get some water for cooking dinner. The handle controlled the flow of water from the pipe directly into her pot.","translation":"莎拉轉動廚房水槽上的龍頭以獲得烹飪晚餐所需的水。把手控制從管道直接流入她的鍋中的水流。","word":"faucet"}},"fault":{"createdAt":1784889153002,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fault 在這裡表示「責任」或「過錯」，用來表示誰應該為不良結果負責。","options":["success","fault","strength","advantage"],"sentence":"It was nobody's ______ that the project failed due to unexpected circumstances. The investigation clearly showed that external factors beyond anyone's control caused the problem.","translation":"沒有人應該為項目失敗而承擔責任，因為是無法預見的情況造成的。調查清楚地表明，超出任何人控制範圍的外部因素導致了這個問題。","word":"fault"}},"favor":{"createdAt":1781708652664,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"favor 指幫助或善意行為，通常需要某人花費時間或努力來為另一個人做事。","options":["question","favor","reminder","suggestion"],"sentence":"She asked her friend to do her a ______ by picking up her package at the post office. Her friend agreed without hesitation because they had helped each other many times in the past.","translation":"她請求朋友幫她去郵局取包裹。她的朋友毫不猶豫地同意了，因為他們過去曾多次互相幫助。","word":"favor"}},"favorable":{"createdAt":1781708652665,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"favorable 指贊同的、稱讚的或有利的，用來描述積極正面的評價或態度。","options":["negative","mixed","favorable","harsh"],"sentence":"The movie received ______ reviews from critics who praised its innovative storytelling and outstanding performances. Every major newspaper gave it four or five stars and recommended it highly to their readers.","translation":"這部電影獲得了評論家的好評，他們讚揚了它的創新敘事和傑出表演。每家主要報紙都給了它四顆或五顆星，並強烈推薦給讀者。","word":"favorable"}},"favorably":{"createdAt":1782475559554,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"favorably表示善意地、贊同地或積極地對待某事","options":["unfavorably","negatively","favorably","coldly"],"sentence":"The company responded ______ to our proposal for a partnership. They immediately scheduled a follow-up meeting and expressed genuine interest.","translation":"公司對我們的合作提案反應良好。他們立即安排了後續會議並表達了真正的興趣。","word":"favorably"}},"feasible":{"createdAt":1784037747283,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"feasible 意為「可行的、合理的」，用來形容一個計畫或想法在實際情況下是否能夠完成或實現。","options":["impossible","feasible","theoretical","expensive"],"sentence":"The project seemed ______ when the team had unlimited resources and expertise. However, after the budget was cut by half, many team members questioned whether it was still achievable.","translation":"當團隊擁有無限資源和專業知識時，該項目似乎是可行的。然而，在預算被削減一半後，許多團隊成員質疑它是否仍然可以實現。","word":"feasible"}},"feast":{"createdAt":1781275226788,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"此處feast指「盛宴；筵席」，指隆重而豐盛的聚餐活動","options":["digestion","feast","fume","abroad"],"sentence":"The royal ______ included dozens of dishes, entertainment, and guests from across the kingdom. Everyone celebrated and enjoyed the lavish spread of food and festivities.","translation":"皇家盛宴包括數十道菜餚、娛樂表演和來自整個王國的賓客。每個人都慶祝並享受了這場豐盛的食物和慶典。","word":"feast"}},"feature":{"createdAt":1781703691064,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"feature 作為名詞表示事物的特徵或特點，通常是值得注意或重要的屬性。","options":["defect","feature","price","brand"],"sentence":"The smartphone's most impressive ______ is its advanced camera system. This characteristic has become the main reason why customers choose this particular model over competitors.","translation":"這支智慧型手機最令人印象深刻的特徵是其先進的相機系統。這項優點已成為客戶選擇這款特定型號而不選擇競爭對手產品的主要原因。","word":"feature"}},"federal":{"createdAt":1784037747288,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"federal 意為「聯邦的」，指由多個州或地區組成的國家中央政府的權力和管轄範圍。","options":["state","federal","local","private"],"sentence":"The ______ government announced new policies that would apply to all fifty states. Each state premier had to comply with these nationwide regulations set by the central authority.","translation":"聯邦政府宣布了適用於全部五十個州的新政策。每個州長都必須遵守由中央權力機構制定的這些全國性法規。","word":"federal"}},"fee":{"createdAt":1781850347303,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"費用是指為獲得服務、進入場所或使用設施而必須支付的金錢。","options":["gift","reward","discount","fee"],"sentence":"The bank charged a monthly ______ of fifteen dollars for maintaining the account. Customers who kept a minimum balance could avoid paying this charge.","translation":"銀行為維護該帳戶每月收取十五美元的費用。保持最低餘額的客戶可以避免支付此費用。","word":"fee"}},"feedback":{"createdAt":1783243711389,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"feedback 是指對某人的工作或表現所提供的意見或評論，幫助他們了解自己的表現和如何改進。","options":["criticism","feedback","judgment","evaluation"],"sentence":"The teacher provided helpful ______ on my essay, pointing out both strengths and areas for improvement. After reading her comments, I understood exactly what I needed to fix for the next assignment.","translation":"老師在我的論文上提供了有幫助的回應，指出優點和需要改進的地方。讀完她的評論後，我確切知道下次作業需要修正什麼。","word":"feedback"}},"fellow":{"createdAt":1783403425349,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fellow 用作形容詞時，表示同事的、同伴的或具有相同地位的，指與說話者處於相同情況或位置的人。","options":["rival","fellow","superior","junior"],"sentence":"John and his ______ workers organized a surprise birthday party for their boss. They all contributed ideas and helped with the decorations in the office.","translation":"約翰和他的同事們為老闆組織了一場驚喜生日派對。他們都貢獻了想法，並幫助裝飾辦公室。","word":"fellow"}},"female":{"createdAt":1782200669359,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"female作為名詞或形容詞，用來指動物的雌性個體或女性，題目中透過「生育幼獅」的線索確定答案為雌性動物。","options":["male","female","young","wild"],"sentence":"The ______ lion is smaller and lighter than the male. Scientists observed her giving birth to cubs in the wildlife sanctuary.","translation":"母獅子比公獅子更小更輕。科學家在野生動物保護區觀察到她生下了幼獅。","word":"female"}},"feminine":{"createdAt":1781841148115,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"feminine 形容詞意思是女性的、女性特質的，用來描述具有女性特點或吸引女性的事物。","options":["masculine","feminine","neutral","bold"],"sentence":"The designer chose soft colors and delicate patterns to create a more ______ aesthetic for the spring collection. The boutique specifically targeted women who appreciated graceful and traditionally womanly design elements.","translation":"設計師選擇了柔和的顏色和精緻的圖案，為春季系列創造更女性化的美學風格。這家精品店特別針對欣賞優雅和傳統女性設計元素的女性。","word":"feminine"}},"fertile":{"createdAt":1781780789959,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"fertile 是形容詞，意為肥沃的、多產的，用於描述適合植物生長的土壤或具有生育能力的生物。","options":["rocky","frozen","fertile","sandy"],"sentence":"The farmer chose to plant his crops in the ______ soil near the river. The land produced an exceptionally abundant harvest year after year.","translation":"農民選擇在河邊肥沃的土壤中種植莊稼。這片土地年復一年地產出異常豐富的收穫。","word":"fertile"}},"fertility":{"createdAt":1781708652661,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fertility 指土壤的肥沃程度，能支持植物生長的能力。","options":["texture","fertility","depth","composition"],"sentence":"The ______ of the soil in this region is exceptional because of the yearly flooding from the river. Farmers here can harvest three crops annually without needing to add any synthetic fertilizers.","translation":"這個地區土壤的生育力是非常出色的，因為每年河流都會泛濫。這裡的農民每年可以收割三次莊稼，而不需要添加任何合成肥料。","word":"fertility"}},"fertilizer":{"createdAt":1781840030397,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fertilizer 是名詞，表示肥料；與「提高產量」和「改善土壤品質」的農業背景相符。","options":["pesticide","fertilizer","water","sunlight"],"sentence":"The farmer applied ______ to his fields to help the crops grow stronger and produce higher yields. The nutrients in this product significantly improved the soil quality.","translation":"農民在田地裡施用肥料以幫助農作物生長得更強壯並提高產量。這個產品中的營養物質大大改善了土壤品質。","word":"fertilizer"}},"fetch":{"createdAt":1781951900950,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fetch指去某個地方拿來某樣東西並帶回來，暗示著一個往返的動作。","options":["chase","fetch","throw","hide"],"sentence":"The dog wagged its tail excitedly when the boy asked it to ______ the ball from across the yard. The animal ran quickly and brought the toy back in its mouth.","translation":"當男孩要求狗去從院子對面拿回球時，狗興奮地搖著尾巴。那隻動物快速奔跑，用嘴叼回了玩具。","word":"fetch"}},"fianc":{"createdAt":1784346605541,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fiancé 指未婚夫，是指已經訂婚但尚未結婚的男性伴侶。","options":["brother","fiancé","colleague","friend"],"sentence":"Sarah is very excited because her ______ proposed to her last weekend with a diamond ring. They are now planning their wedding for next year.","translation":"莎拉非常興奮，因為她的未婚夫上週末用鑽戒向她求婚。他們現在正在計劃明年舉辦婚禮。","word":"fiancé"}},"fiber":{"createdAt":1781425122880,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"fiber 指構成物質的細長線狀物，與棉花植物和布料的特性相符。","options":["discount","tournament","fiber","defeat"],"sentence":"The new fabric is made from natural ______ that comes from cotton plants. This material is soft, breathable, and comfortable to wear.","translation":"這種新布料由來自棉花植物的天然纖維製成。這種材料柔軟、透氣，穿著舒適。","word":"fiber"}},"fiction":{"createdAt":1781424574161,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fiction 指虛構的敘述或故事，不是真實發生的事件。","options":["historical","fiction","scientific","political"],"sentence":"She enjoyed reading ______ novels that transported her to imaginary worlds. The stories she loved most were completely made up by the authors' creative minds.","translation":"她喜歡閱讀將她帶入想像世界的小說。她最喜歡的故事完全是由作者的創意想像所創作的。","word":"fiction"}},"fictional":{"createdAt":1781708652663,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fictional 指虛構的、想像出來的、不真實的，常用於描述小說或故事中的角色和情節。","options":["memorable","fictional","popular","mysterious"],"sentence":"Many readers were disappointed to learn that the ______ character they had grown to love would not appear in the author's next book. The author confirmed that this character existed only in her imagination and was never based on a real person.","translation":"許多讀者得知他們喜愛的虛構角色不會出現在這位作者的下一部書中而感到失望。作者確認這個角色只存在於她的想像中，從未以真實人物為基礎。","word":"fictional"}},"fidelity":{"createdAt":1783005778380,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"fidelity 意為「逼真度」或「忠誠」，指對原始內容的準確再現或對某人的忠誠。","options":["speed","volume","fidelity","duration"],"sentence":"The musician's recording maintained perfect ______ to the original composition, reproducing every note and nuance exactly as the composer intended. Audiophiles appreciated the authentic reproduction of the musical performance.","translation":"這位音樂家的錄音完美地保持了對原始作品的逼真度，準確再現了作曲家的意圖中的每一個音符和細節。音頻愛好者讚賞了音樂表演的真實再現。","word":"fidelity"}},"fierce":{"createdAt":1781776694537,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"fierce 是形容詞，意思是狂熱的、激烈的，通常用來形容強烈的情感或激烈的衝突。","options":["gentle","quiet","fierce","polite"],"sentence":"The ______ competition between the two companies has resulted in better products and lower prices. Customers benefit greatly from their intense rivalry in the market.","translation":"兩家公司之間的激烈競爭導致了更好的產品和更低的價格。顧客從他們在市場上的激烈競爭中受益匪淺。","word":"fierce"}},"figure":{"createdAt":1784011912779,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"figure作為名詞表示「人物」，指繪畫、雕塑或其他藝術作品中的人類形象或角色。","options":["landscape","figure","background","frame"],"sentence":"The ______ in the painting is wearing a red coat and standing near a window. The artist clearly intended this person to be the main focus of the entire composition.","translation":"畫中的人物穿著紅色外套，站在窗戶附近。藝術家顯然想讓這個人成為整個構圖的主要焦點。","word":"figure"}},"figures":{"createdAt":1784645448530,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"figures 在這裡指的是數字或統計數據，特別是在財務或商業背景下用來表示具體的數量。","options":["charts","graphs","figures","images"],"sentence":"The accountant spent all day analyzing the quarterly ______ to prepare the financial report. The numbers showed that the company's revenue had increased by 15 percent.","translation":"會計師花了一整天時間分析季度______ 來準備財務報告。這些數字顯示公司的收入增加了百分之十五。","word":"figures"}},"filter":{"createdAt":1783255075623,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"filter是一種能夠分離固體和液體的裝置，通過讓液體通過而阻擋雜質。","options":["container","filter","pump","bucket"],"sentence":"She used a ______ to remove impurities from the water before drinking it. The device trapped particles and contaminants while allowing clean liquid to pass through.","translation":"她用過濾器在飲用前從水中去除雜質。這個裝置捕捉顆粒和污染物，同時允許清潔液體通過。","word":"filter"}},"finance":{"createdAt":1781780789960,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"finance 是名詞，意為財務，指與金錢和資金相關的事務和管理。","options":["marketing","production","finance","human resources"],"sentence":"The company hired a new director to manage their ______ department. She was responsible for budgeting, accounting, and investment decisions.","translation":"公司聘請了一位新主任來管理他們的財務部門。她負責預算編製、會計和投資決策。","word":"finance"}},"financial":{"createdAt":1782202115973,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"financial 是形容詞，表示與金錢、預算或投資相關的事務，特別是在企業或組織的脈絡中。","options":["financial","medical","technical","legal"],"sentence":"The company's ______ department manages budgets and investments for the organization. The accountants there work with spreadsheets and bank statements every day.","translation":"公司的財務部門管理組織的預算和投資。那裡的會計每天都處理電子表格和銀行對帳單。","word":"financial"}},"financially":{"createdAt":1783068339363,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"financially 副詞表示在財務方面或金錢方面","options":["physically","mentally","financially","politically"],"sentence":"The company is not ______ stable enough to expand right now. Their accounting records show significant debt and limited cash reserves.","translation":"公司現在的財務狀況還不夠穩定，無法擴展。他們的會計記錄顯示債務龐大和現金儲備有限。","word":"financially"}},"finite":{"createdAt":1783068339358,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"finite 形容詞表示有限的、有限制的，與無限的相反","options":["infinite","finite","renewable","constant"],"sentence":"The Earth has only a ______ amount of fossil fuels available for use. Once we exhaust these resources, they cannot be replaced in our lifetime.","translation":"地球只有有限的化石燃料可供使用。一旦我們耗盡這些資源，在我們有生之年無法補充。","word":"finite"}},"firecracker":{"createdAt":1781429810251,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"firecracker是指在慶典或節日中點燃的小型爆炸裝置，會發出響亮的聲音。","options":["trustee","firecracker","swift","disappearance"],"sentence":"Children lit a ______ during the New Year celebration, and the sudden explosive sound made everyone jump with excitement. The tradition of setting off these noisemakers dates back centuries.","translation":"孩子們在新年慶祝中點燃了爆竹，突然的爆炸聲讓每個人都興奮地跳了起來。放置這些噪音製造者的傳統可以追溯到幾個世紀前。","word":"firecracker"}},"firm":{"createdAt":1785812406018,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"firm（堅定的）用來形容立場或決定時，表示堅定不移、不易改變，與執行長面對經濟困難仍然堅持的態度完全吻合。","options":["soft","flexible","firm","weak"],"sentence":"The CEO made a ______ decision to expand the company into new markets despite the economic uncertainty. The board of directors supported this unwavering commitment to growth.","translation":"執行長做出了堅定的決定，儘管經濟不確定，仍要將公司擴展到新市場。董事會支持了這種毫不動搖的成長承諾。","word":"firm"}},"firmly":{"createdAt":1784345268156,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"firmly 是指以堅定、不動搖的方式做某事；在這個句子中表示老師以沒有商量餘地的態度堅持她的規則。","options":["hesitantly","politely","firmly","reluctantly"],"sentence":"The teacher ______ refused to accept any late submissions for the assignment. She had clearly stated the deadline at the beginning of the semester and would not make exceptions.","translation":"老師堅定地拒絕接受任何逾期的作業提交。她在學期初就明確說明了截止日期，不會有任何例外。","word":"firmly"}},"fiscal":{"createdAt":1782084127074,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"fiscal 作為形容詞表示與政府或組織的金錢和財務事項相關，通常用於討論預算、稅收和國庫事務。","options":["environmental","military","fiscal","educational"],"sentence":"The government announced new ______ policies to address the budget deficit and economic challenges. The treasury department implemented stricter spending controls immediately.","translation":"政府宣布了新的財政政策以應對預算赤字和經濟挑戰。財政部立即實施了更嚴格的支出控制。","word":"fiscal"}},"flake":{"createdAt":1781268630465,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"flake指的是薄片或單個的小片，特別是指雪花或其他細小物質的單個單位。","options":["sheet","flake","layer","blanket"],"sentence":"A ______ of snow fell gently on the windowpane. Each individual crystal was visible before it melted into the glass.","translation":"一片雪花輕輕地落在窗戶玻璃上。每個單獨的冰晶在融化到玻璃中之前都是可見的。","word":"flake"}},"flame":{"createdAt":1784515339786,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"flame 是指燃燒產生的可見火光，具有明亮的光線和顏色，通常是橙色、黃色或紅色。","options":["smoke","flame","heat","wax"],"sentence":"The candle's bright ______ flickered gently in the dark room. The orange and yellow light danced across the walls as the fire burned steadily at the wick's tip.","translation":"蠟燭明亮的火焰在黑暗房間中輕輕搖曳。橙色和黃色的光線在牆上舞動，因為火在燭芯頂端穩定地燃燒。","word":"flame"}},"flammable":{"createdAt":1781832478021,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"flammable 意為「易燃的」或「可燃的」，用來描述容易著火的物質或材料。","options":["fragile","flammable","frozen","flexible"],"sentence":"The warehouse manager warned us that we must store all ______ materials in a separate, fireproof room. Gasoline, paint thinner, and other combustible substances require special handling and storage protocols.","translation":"倉庫經理警告我們必須將所有易燃物質存放在單獨的防火室中。汽油、油漆稀釋劑和其他易燃物質需要特殊的處理和儲存程序。","word":"flammable"}},"flash":{"createdAt":1783390227929,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"flash 作為名詞指的是短暫而耀眼的光亮或閃光，通常是一瞬間出現並消失。","options":["rumble","flash","gust","crack"],"sentence":"A sudden ______ of lightning illuminated the entire night sky during the storm. The brief burst of bright light lasted only a fraction of a second before darkness returned.","translation":"暴風雨期間，一道突然的閃光照亮了整個夜空。這短暫的亮光持續不到一秒鐘，隨後黑暗便重新籠罩。","word":"flash"}},"flat":{"createdAt":1781850347301,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"平坦是形容詞，表示表面光滑無凹凸，沒有高低起伏。","options":["curved","rounded","flat","sloped"],"sentence":"The carpenter carefully sanded the wooden surface until it was completely ______. The table now had no bumps, ridges, or uneven areas at all.","translation":"木匠仔細打磨木製表面，直到它完全平坦。這張桌子現在沒有任何凹凸、隆起或不平整的地方。","word":"flat"}},"flatter":{"createdAt":1781747309099,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"flatter 指用不誠實或過度的恭維來討好某人，目的是獲得利益或好感。","options":["inform","flatter","warn","assist"],"sentence":"He tried to ______ the boss by praising her appearance and complimenting her decisions at every meeting. Though insincere, these hollow words seemed to improve his chances for promotion.","translation":"他試圖通過讚美老闆的外表並在每次會議上恭維她的決定來諂媚她。雖然言不由衷，但這些虛偽的言語似乎改善了他晉升的機會。","word":"flatter"}},"flattered":{"createdAt":1783575763871,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"flattered表示因為得到讚美或奉承而感到高興、受寵若驚或被打動。","options":["offended","angry","flattered","embarrassed"],"sentence":"She felt ______ when her boss praised her presentation in front of the entire company. The unexpected compliment from someone she respected deeply moved her.","translation":"當她的老闆在整個公司面前讚美她的演講時，她感到受寵若驚。來自她所尊敬的人的意想不到的讚美深深打動了她。","word":"flattered"}},"flaw":{"createdAt":1784006934538,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"「flaw」指事物中存在的缺點或瑕疵，通常會影響其品質或完美度。","options":["flaw","crack","scratch","spot"],"sentence":"The diamond appeared perfect at first glance, but the jeweler discovered a small ______ inside the stone. This tiny imperfection reduced its value significantly on the market.","translation":"這顆鑽石乍看之下似乎完美無缺，但珠寶商在寶石內部發現了一個小缺陷。這個細微的瑕疵大大降低了它在市場上的價值。","word":"flaw"}},"fled":{"createdAt":1781780789956,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"fled 是 flee 的過去式，意為逃跑、逃離，表示某人迅速離開某個地方以躲避危險或追捕。","options":["entered","decorated","fled","repaired"],"sentence":"When the police arrived at the scene, the suspect immediately ______ the building. Officers searched the entire area but could not find him anywhere.","translation":"當警察到達現場時，嫌疑人立即逃離了大樓。警察搜查了整個地區，但找不到他。","word":"fled"}},"flee":{"createdAt":1783572181139,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"flee 是動詞，意思是逃離或快速離開某個危險的地方。","options":["flee","gather","work","sleep"],"sentence":"When the fire broke out in the building, residents had to ______ immediately to safety. Emergency sirens wailed as people rushed toward the exits and evacuated to the streets outside.","translation":"當建築物發生火災時，居民必須立即逃離到安全的地方。緊急警報聲鳴起，人們衝向出口並疏散到外面的街道。","word":"flee"}},"fleet":{"createdAt":1782352245063,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"fleet指的是一組船舶、飛機或車輛的集合，通常由同一個組織操控。","options":["single ship","dock","fleet","port"],"sentence":"The shipping company operates a large ______ of cargo ships across the world's oceans. These vessels work together to transport goods between continents.","translation":"這家航運公司在世界各大洋運營龐大的船隊。這些船舶共同運輸各大洲之間的貨物。","word":"fleet"}},"fleeting":{"createdAt":1781884659836,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fleeting 表示持續時間短、轉瞬即逝的，與只有幾週和快速消逝的描述完全吻合。","options":["eternal","fleeting","seasonal","fragrant"],"sentence":"The beauty of cherry blossoms is ______, lasting only a few weeks each spring before they fall to the ground. Tourists rush to see them because this magical season passes so quickly.","translation":"櫻花的美麗是短暫的，每個春天只持續幾週就會掉落到地面。遊客們匆忙前往觀看，因為這個神奇的季節轉瞬即逝。","word":"fleeting"}},"flexibility":{"createdAt":1784515366889,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"flexibility 意為「靈活性、機動性」，指在工作時間、地點或方法上的自主調整空間","options":["formality","flexibility","foundation","framework"],"sentence":"The new job contract offered great ______ in working hours and location. Employees could work from home three days a week or choose their own schedule.","translation":"新的工作合約在工作時間和地點上提供了很大的靈活性。員工可以每週在家工作三天或選擇自己的時間表。","word":"flexibility"}},"flexible":{"createdAt":1781839703145,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"flexible指有彈性、可調整的，與employees choosing different work options（員工可以選擇不同的工作方式）完全吻合。","options":["rigid","strict","flexible","mandatory"],"sentence":"Our company offers ______ working arrangements to employees. They can choose to work from home, the office, or a combination of both.","translation":"我們公司為員工提供靈活的工作安排。他們可以選擇在家工作、在辦公室工作或兩者結合。","word":"flexible"}},"flip":{"createdAt":1784350994458,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"flip 在這裡是「擲硬幣」的意思，表示將硬幣向空中拋起以決定結果。","options":["catch","flip","spin","throw"],"sentence":"The magician asked the audience member to ______ a coin to decide which card would be revealed. The coin spun through the air and landed on heads, determining the outcome of the trick.","translation":"魔術師要求觀眾成員擲硬幣來決定哪張牌會被揭露。硬幣在空中旋轉並落在正面，決定了魔術的結果。","word":"flip"}},"float":{"createdAt":1781696018687,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"float 意為漂浮，指物體輕輕地浮在液體或空氣中而不下沉。","options":["sink","drift","float","fall"],"sentence":"The balloon began to ______ upward into the sky after the children released it. It gradually disappeared among the clouds within minutes.","translation":"孩子們放開氣球後，它開始向空中漂浮。幾分鐘內它逐漸消失在雲層中。","word":"float"}},"floccinaucinihilipilification":{"createdAt":1782705207281,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"floccinaucinihilipilification是指認為某事物毫無價值或輕視，與評論家拒絕承認任何優點的態度相符。","options":["appreciation","floccinaucinihilipilification","analysis","encouragement"],"sentence":"The critic's ______ of the young artist's work was harsh and unwarranted. Despite praising the technical skill and originality evident in every brushstroke, the critic refused to acknowledge any merit whatsoever.","translation":"評論家對年輕藝術家作品的毫無價值評判是嚴厲且不公正的。儘管讚揚了每一筆筆觸中明顯的技術技巧和原創性，評論家仍然拒絕承認任何優點。","word":"floccinaucinihilipilification"}},"flock":{"createdAt":1782408103437,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"flock 作為動詞表示大量人群聚集或蜂擁而至，通常帶有急速和聚集的含義。","options":["scatter","flock","delay","organize"],"sentence":"When the famous musician announced a surprise concert, thousands of fans began to ______ to the stadium. Within hours, the venue was completely packed with eager supporters.","translation":"當這位著名音樂家宣布驚喜演唱會時，數千名粉絲開始蜂擁至體育館。幾小時內，場地就擠滿了熱情的支持者。","word":"flock"}},"flourish":{"createdAt":1783575763870,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"flourish表示興隆、茂盛、繁榮，達到成功和發展的狀態。","options":["decline","flourish","stagnate","struggle"],"sentence":"Under the new management, the business began to ______ and profits doubled within a year. The company expanded to new markets and hired more employees.","translation":"在新管理層的領導下，該業務開始繁榮，利潤在一年內翻倍。該公司擴展到新市場並僱用了更多員工。","word":"flourish"}},"flourishing":{"createdAt":1787135117493,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"flourishing意為繁榮、興盛、茂盛，用來描述事物蓬勃發展和生長旺盛的狀態。","options":["wilting","dying","flourishing","dormant"],"sentence":"The garden was ______ with colorful flowers and lush green plants in the spring. Every corner was filled with new growth and vibrant blooms.","translation":"春天時花園繁榮茂盛，到處都是色彩繽紛的花朵和青翠的植物。每個角落都充滿新的生長和充滿生機的花朵。","word":"flourishing"}},"fluid":{"createdAt":1783330993550,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"fluid（流體）是指在體內或身體某個部位的液態物質，例如關節液、血液或脊髓液，可以被抽取進行檢驗。","options":["tissue","bone","fluid","muscle"],"sentence":"The doctor analyzed the ______ extracted from the patient's knee joint to diagnose the injury. The laboratory results showed inflammation markers in this bodily substance.","translation":"醫生分析了從患者膝關節抽取的液體以診斷損傷。實驗室結果顯示這種身體物質中有發炎標誌。","word":"fluid"}},"flunk":{"createdAt":1781840030395,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"flunk 是動詞，表示不及格、當掉；與「不及格分數」和「父母失望」的情境相符。","options":["pass","flunk","teach","improve"],"sentence":"Tom studied very little and unfortunately decided to ______ his mathematics exam. His parents were disappointed when he received a failing grade.","translation":"湯姆學習很少，不幸地在數學考試中不及格。當他得到不及格分數時，他的父母很失望。","word":"flunk"}},"flush":{"createdAt":1782292205388,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"flush作為動詞表示臉部因為羞愧、興奮或熱而發紅，描述血液湧向臉部的生理反應。","options":["pale","flush","tremble","sweat"],"sentence":"After embarrassment, she began to ______ as everyone stared at her on stage. The redness spread across her cheeks and neck in response to the sudden attention.","translation":"尷尬之後，當大家都盯著她在舞台上時，她開始臉紅。紅色因應突然受到的注意而擴散到她的臉頰和脖子。","word":"flush"}},"flushed":{"createdAt":1783961993180,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"flushed 是指臉紅的狀態，通常由於害羞、尷尬、生氣或身體反應而導致。","options":["calm","proud","flushed","confident"],"sentence":"She looked ______ and embarrassed when her name was called in front of the entire class. Her cheeks had turned bright red from the sudden attention and public recognition.","translation":"當她的名字在全班面前被點名時，她看起來臉紅且很尷尬。她的臉頰因為突然的關注和公開表揚而變得通紅。","word":"flushed"}},"focal":{"createdAt":1783388637627,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"focal用作形容詞，表示「中心的、重要的」，指某物是最主要或最重要的焦點。","options":["peripheral","focal","secondary","minor"],"sentence":"The ______ point of the entire presentation was the company's new product launch. Without this central moment, the audience would have lost interest in the discussion.","translation":"整個演講的重點是公司的新產品發布。沒有這個中心時刻，觀眾會對討論失去興趣。","word":"focal"}},"foe":{"createdAt":1784173464333,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"foe 指敵人或對手，通常用於戰爭、衝突或競爭的背景中。","options":["ally","foe","witness","ambassador"],"sentence":"Throughout the war, the general faced his greatest military ______ across the northern border. The enemy commander proved to be a formidable opponent who challenged every strategic decision.","translation":"在整個戰爭中，將軍在北部邊界對面面對他最大的軍事敵人。敵軍司令被證明是一個強大的對手，挑戰了每個戰略決策。","word":"foe"}},"following":{"createdAt":1781564440934,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"following 作介詞表示在...之後、接著，指某事發生在另一事件之後。","options":["before","following","during","despite"],"sentence":"The team achieved great success in the competition, and ______ that victory, they received many sponsorship offers. The period right after their achievement brought them numerous opportunities.","translation":"團隊在比賽中取得了巨大成功，在那次勝利之後，他們收到了許多贊助邀請。他們成就之後的時期為他們帶來了許多機會。","word":"following"}},"fond":{"createdAt":1784515339793,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fond 表示對某人或某事有深厚的喜歡、寵愛或感情，通常用來描述溫暖而親密的關係。","options":["critical","fond","proud","tired"],"sentence":"My grandmother is very ______ of her grandchildren and always gives them gifts. She spends every weekend with them because she loves and treasures their company deeply.","translation":"我祖母非常疼愛她的孫子孫女，總是給他們禮物。她每個週末都和他們在一起，因為她深愛並珍視他們的陪伴。","word":"fond"}},"forage":{"createdAt":1785339147819,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"forage特指動物或人類尋找和採集食物的行為，通常指野生或自然環境中覓食。","options":["hunt","forage","search","dig"],"sentence":"The bear will ______ in the forest for berries and insects before winter arrives. Finding enough food to prepare for hibernation is essential for its survival.","translation":"熊在冬天到來前會在森林裡覓食漿果和昆蟲。找到足夠的食物為冬眠做準備對於牠的生存至關重要。","word":"forage"}},"forbid":{"createdAt":1783470930350,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"forbid是動詞，表示官方或權威性地禁止或不允許某事發生，違反會受到懲罰。","options":["forbid","encourage","allow","permit"],"sentence":"The school rules ______ students from bringing mobile phones to class. Students who violate this regulation will face serious disciplinary consequences.","translation":"學校規則禁止學生將手機帶到課堂。違反這項規定的學生將面臨嚴厲的紀律處分。","word":"forbid"}},"forbidden":{"createdAt":1782094693729,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"被禁止的是指不允許或違反規則的行為。","options":["allowed","forbidden","encouraged","recommended"],"sentence":"Swimming in that area is ______ due to dangerous currents and sharp rocks. The warning signs were posted to keep visitors safe from harm.","translation":"由於危險的水流和尖銳的岩石，在該區域游泳是被禁止的。警告標誌被張貼以保護遊客免受傷害。","word":"forbidden"}},"force":{"createdAt":1781515372606,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"force在這裡指武力或強制力量，用來控制或強迫他人","options":["fulfillment","chief","force","launch"],"sentence":"The government used ______ to disperse the protesters from the street. Police officers arrived with riot gear and physical restraint to control the crowd.","translation":"政府用武力將抗議者從街道上驅散。警察穿著防暴裝備到達現場，用身體約束力來控制人群。","word":"force"}},"forceful":{"createdAt":1783068339346,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"forceful 形容詞表示強有力的、有說服力的、堅強的或有效的","options":["weak","quiet","forceful","confused"],"sentence":"The speaker delivered a ______ argument that convinced the entire audience. Her powerful words and determined tone left no room for disagreement.","translation":"演講者提出了有說服力的論點，說服了整個觀眾。她有力的言詞和堅定的語氣不容許任何異議。","word":"forceful"}},"forge":{"createdAt":1781843396462,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"forge表示非法偽造或假冒，在此指製造虛假文件以欺騙他人的行為。","options":["create","design","forge","produce"],"sentence":"The criminal was arrested for attempting to ______ government documents. Investigators discovered fake passports and counterfeit certificates in his apartment.","translation":"那名罪犯因試圖偽造政府文件而被逮捕。調查人員在他的公寓裡發現了假護照和偽造證書。","word":"forge"}},"form":{"createdAt":1783068339356,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"form 作動詞表示形成或構成，描述某物從一種狀態或物質轉變為另一種","options":["evaporate","form","dissolve","melt"],"sentence":"When water freezes at zero degrees, it will ______ into solid ice. The transformation from liquid to solid state is complete.","translation":"當水在零度結凍時，它會轉變成固體冰。從液態到固態的轉變是完整的。","word":"form"}},"formal":{"createdAt":1782292020647,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"formal用來形容場合、衣著或行為需要符合禮儀和社交規範，通常指較為莊重和正式的場景。","options":["casual","formal","comfortable","trendy"],"sentence":"The company required all employees to wear ______ attire for the board meeting. This meant suits, ties, and professional dress codes were strictly enforced.","translation":"公司要求所有員工在董事會會議上穿著正式服裝。這意味著西裝、領帶和專業著裝規範被嚴格執行。","word":"formal"}},"formalize":{"createdAt":1784173464329,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"formalize 指使某事變得正式、官方或正規，通常通過官方程序或儀式。","options":["celebrate","formalize","announce","delay"],"sentence":"The couple decided to ______ their relationship by getting married in front of their families. They wanted to make their commitment official and legally recognized.","translation":"這對夫婦決定通過在家人面前結婚來使他們的關係正式化。他們想讓他們的承諾正式化並獲得法律認可。","word":"formalize"}},"formally":{"createdAt":1784355209447,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"formally是指以正式、莊重和官方的方式進行某事，通常涉及正式程序和儀式。","options":["casually","informally","formally","privately"],"sentence":"The president ______ announced the new trade agreement at the international conference. Representatives from both nations signed the official documents in front of the media.","translation":"總統在國際會議上正式宣布了新貿易協議。來自兩國的代表在媒體面前簽署了官方文件。","word":"formally"}},"format":{"createdAt":1784515366890,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"format 意為「格式、形式」，指事物的組織方式、結構或呈現方法","options":["fortune","format","feature","fiction"],"sentence":"The conference organizers changed the ______ of the presentation to make it more interactive. Instead of long speeches, they divided the session into shorter segments with audience participation.","translation":"會議組織者改變了演講的格式，使其更具互動性。他們將會議分成較短的環節，而不是冗長的演講，並加入觀眾參與。","word":"format"}},"formation":{"createdAt":1781449095515,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"formation意為形成或結構，用來描述事物是如何逐漸發展或組合成最終形態的過程。","options":["destruction","formation","melting","disappearance"],"sentence":"The ______ of the mountain range took millions of years of geological processes. The rocks were slowly shaped by tectonic forces over countless generations.","translation":"山脈的形成花費了數百萬年的地質過程。這些岩石通過數不清的代際中的構造力量慢慢塑造而成。","word":"formation"}},"former":{"createdAt":1782533789133,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"former 形容詞意思是較早的或以前的，用於描述曾經但不再是現在的狀態。","options":["current","former","future","elected"],"sentence":"The ______ president gave a speech about his accomplishments during his time in office. He had served the country twenty years before retiring from politics.","translation":"前任總統發表了一次關於他在任期間成就的演講。他在從政治中退休之前已經為國家服務了二十年。","word":"former"}},"formerly":{"createdAt":1781780789964,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"formerly 是副詞，意為從前、以前，用於描述過去的狀態或身份，與現在的情況相對比。","options":["currently","formerly","never","recently"],"sentence":"The building ______ served as a prison but was converted into a museum decades ago. Now it attracts thousands of visitors interested in learning about its history.","translation":"這棟建築以前曾用作監獄，但在幾十年前被改建成博物館。現在它吸引了數千名對其歷史感興趣的遊客。","word":"formerly"}},"formidable":{"createdAt":1784515366888,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"formidable 意為「可怕的、令人敬畏的」，用來形容令人印象深刻或難以對付的人或事物","options":["friendly","formidable","familiar","flexible"],"sentence":"The team faced a ______ opponent in the championship match. Their rivals had won the last five tournaments and possessed world-class athletes.","translation":"該隊在錦標賽中面臨一個可怕的對手。他們的對手贏得了過去五次錦標賽冠軍，並擁有世界級的運動員。","word":"formidable"}},"formula":{"createdAt":1781955529029,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"formula 在這裡指的是製作某物的標準步驟和規則，與科學或商業程序相關。","options":["recipe","formula","strategy","method"],"sentence":"The company uses a secret ______ for making their famous sauce. After years of research, they finally discovered the exact combination of ingredients and steps that creates the perfect taste.","translation":"該公司使用祕密公式來製作他們著名的醬汁。經過多年的研究，他們終於發現了製造完美味道的確切成分和步驟組合。","word":"formula"}},"formulate":{"createdAt":1783690592078,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"formulate 指的是經過仔細思考和規劃而制訂或構想出計畫、理論或政策，強調系統化和有目的的制訂過程。","options":["create","formulate","develop","design"],"sentence":"The research team spent six months working together to ______ a comprehensive strategy for reducing waste. Their detailed plan outlined specific goals and actionable steps to achieve them by next year.","translation":"研究團隊花了六個月的時間合作制訂一項全面的減少廢物策略。他們詳細的計劃列明了具體的目標和可行的步驟，以在明年前實現這些目標。","word":"formulate"}},"forsake":{"createdAt":1783346573165,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"forsake 意為離開、拋棄或遺棄，表示放棄對某人或某事的責任或忠誠。","options":["join","forsake","befriend","support"],"sentence":"He promised never to ______ his childhood best friend, no matter what happened. Years later, when she needed help most, he abandoned her without explanation.","translation":"他承諾無論發生什麼事都不會拋棄他的童年至交好友。多年後，當她最需要幫助時，他沒有任何解釋就拋棄了她。","word":"forsake"}},"forth":{"createdAt":1781581925132,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"forth 作為副詞表示向前出發、外出或離開某地，常用於「set forth」表示開始旅程。","options":["back","forth","ahead","away"],"sentence":"The explorer set ______ on a journey into the Amazon rainforest to discover new species. He packed his equipment and left the village at dawn, determined to venture deep into the jungle.","translation":"探險家出發進入亞馬遜雨林，尋求發現新物種。他打好行裝，在黎明時分離開村莊，決心深入叢林探險。","word":"forth"}},"forthcoming":{"createdAt":1785040529421,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"forthcoming 意為「即將發生的」或「即將到來的」，用來描述未來即將發生的事件或事物。","options":["past","forthcoming","distant","delayed"],"sentence":"The ______ movie release has generated a lot of buzz among fans. The studio announced that it will arrive in theaters next month.","translation":"即將上映的電影在粉絲之間引起了很大的關注。製片廠宣布它將在下個月登陸影院。","word":"forthcoming"}},"fortify":{"createdAt":1781693295123,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"fortify 意為加強或增強，在此指運動對免疫系統的強化作用。","options":["weaken","confuse","fortify","document"],"sentence":"Regular exercise can ______ your immune system and help you stay healthy. Studies show that people who exercise frequently get sick less often than sedentary individuals.","translation":"定期運動可以增強你的免疫系統並幫助你保持健康。研究顯示經常運動的人比久坐不動的人生病次數更少。","word":"fortify"}},"fortunate":{"createdAt":1781437528476,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fortunate 形容幸運的、僥倖的，指運氣好或經歷了好的結果。","options":["careless","fortunate","unfortunate","careful"],"sentence":"We felt very ______ to survive the car accident with only minor injuries. Many similar crashes result in serious harm, so we consider ourselves incredibly lucky to have walked away.","translation":"我們感到非常幸運在車禍中只受了輕傷。許多類似的撞車事故導致嚴重傷害，所以我們認為自己能夠安全脫離是不可思議的幸運。","word":"fortunate"}},"fortune":{"createdAt":1784519743236,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fortune 在此意指大量的金錢或財富，通常指一個人擁有的資產或財產。","options":["failure","fortune","mystery","conflict"],"sentence":"She inherited a large ______ from her wealthy grandmother. The inheritance of millions of dollars changed her life completely.","translation":"她從富有的祖母那裡繼承了一筆龐大的財富。繼承數百萬美元改變了她的人生。","word":"fortune"}},"forum":{"createdAt":1782377450341,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"forum 作為名詞表示「論壇」或「討論平台」，是進行公開討論和交換意見的場所。","options":["warehouse","calendar","forum","library"],"sentence":"The company created an online ______ where employees could share ideas and discuss important topics. This platform allowed thousands of staff members from different departments to participate in meaningful conversations.","translation":"公司創建了一個線上論壇，員工可以在其中分享想法並討論重要話題。這個平台允許來自不同部門的數千名員工參與有意義的對話。","word":"forum"}},"fossil":{"createdAt":1781311922073,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fossil 是指遠古生物的遺骨或遺跡經過地質作用保存在岩石中形成的。","options":["bone","fossil","skeleton","artifact"],"sentence":"The museum displayed a 200-million-year-old ______ of a prehistoric dinosaur in the main exhibition hall. Scientists carefully studied the preserved remains to learn about ancient life on Earth.","translation":"博物館在主展廳展示了一個2億年前的史前恐龍化石。科學家仔細研究了這些保存下來的遺骸，以了解地球上的古代生命。","word":"fossil"}},"foster":{"createdAt":1782352245061,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"foster意指培養、促進或發展某種能力、態度或感情。","options":["suppress","destroy","foster","ignore"],"sentence":"The teacher worked hard to ______ a love of reading in her young students. By encouraging them to read daily, she helped many children discover their passion for books.","translation":"老師努力在年輕學生中培養對閱讀的熱愛。通過鼓勵他們每天閱讀，她幫助許多孩子發現了他們對書籍的熱情。","word":"foster"}},"foul":{"createdAt":1784515366890,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"foul 在體育中意為「犯規」，指違反比賽規則的動作或行為","options":["fair","foul","formal","final"],"sentence":"The referee called a ______ play when the defender pushed the attacker to the ground. According to the rules, this type of contact is prohibited and results in a penalty.","translation":"當後衛將進攻手推到地上時，裁判判罰了一次犯規。根據規則，這種接觸是被禁止的，會導致罰款。","word":"foul"}},"found":{"createdAt":1783227888093,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"found 意為建立或創辦一個新的組織、公司或機構。","options":["discovered","found","worked","managed"],"sentence":"Steve Jobs and Steve Wozniak ______ Apple Computer in 1976. The two engineers started this company in a garage and eventually made it one of the world's most valuable corporations.","translation":"史蒂夫·喬布斯和史蒂夫·沃茲尼亞克在1976年建立了蘋果電腦公司。這兩位工程師在車庫裡創辦了這家公司，最終使其成為世界上最有價值的公司之一。","word":"found"}},"foundation":{"createdAt":1783575763865,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"foundation在此指一個進行慈善或社會工作的組織機構。","options":["foundation","building","school","community"],"sentence":"The charitable ______ was established to provide education for underprivileged children in rural areas. The organization has donated millions of dollars to build schools.","translation":"該慈善基金會成立是為了為農村地區貧困兒童提供教育。該組織已捐獻數百萬美元來建設學校。","word":"foundation"}},"founder":{"createdAt":1784450903138,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"founder是指創辦並建立公司或組織的人，通常是最初的創始者。","options":["employee","founder","investor","competitor"],"sentence":"Steve Jobs was the ______ of Apple Computer Company in 1976. He established the company in his parents' garage along with Steve Wozniak and Ronald Wayne.","translation":"史蒂夫·賈伯斯是蘋果電腦公司的創辦人，於1976年創立。他與史蒂夫·沃茲尼亞克和羅納德·韋恩一起在他父母的車庫裡創辦了這家公司。","word":"founder"}},"fountain":{"createdAt":1781708652663,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fountain 指噴出水的裝置或建築物，通常在公共場所用來裝飾和娛樂。","options":["statue","fountain","bridge","monument"],"sentence":"The ______ in the town square sprayed water high into the air, creating a beautiful display. Children ran around it laughing and trying to catch the droplets on hot summer days.","translation":"城鎮廣場上的噴泉將水噴向空中，創造出美麗的景象。在炎熱的夏日，孩子們在周圍跑動、歡笑，試圖接住水滴。","word":"fountain"}},"fowl":{"createdAt":1781532967166,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fowl 指家禽（雞、鴨等），與「生產雞蛋和肉類」和「鳥類」的描述相符。","options":["fish","fowl","cattle","sheep"],"sentence":"The farmer kept several ______ in the barnyard to produce eggs and meat. These birds were essential to his rural lifestyle.","translation":"農民在谷倉院子裡飼養了幾隻______(家禽)以生產雞蛋和肉類。這些鳥類對他的鄉村生活至關重要。","word":"fowl"}},"fraction":{"createdAt":1782006648204,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fraction 在這裡指的是極小的部分或比例，強調數量非常少。","options":["portion","fraction","majority","section"],"sentence":"Only a ______ of the student body attended the optional weekend workshop. Specifically, fewer than five percent of the enrolled students showed up.","translation":"只有一小部分學生參加了可選的週末工作坊。具體來說，少於百分之五的註冊學生出席了。","word":"fraction"}},"fracture":{"createdAt":1783575763870,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"fracture表示使某物破裂、斷裂或折斷。","options":["heal","unite","fracture","connect"],"sentence":"The impact of the earthquake was so powerful that it caused the ground to ______ in several places across the city. Geologists studied these deep cracks to understand the fault lines.","translation":"地震的衝擊力非常大，導致城市多個地方的地面斷裂。地質學家研究了這些深裂縫以了解斷層線。","word":"fracture"}},"fractured":{"createdAt":1783329157086,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fractured 是形容詞，表示骨頭或其他物體破裂或斷裂的狀態，這裡用來描述已經斷裂成多塊的骨頭。","options":["healed","fractured","strengthened","flexible"],"sentence":"The patient's ______ arm required immediate surgery and several months of physical therapy. The X-ray clearly showed the bone had broken into multiple pieces.","translation":"病人的斷裂手臂需要立即手術和數個月的物理治療。X光片清楚地顯示骨頭已經碎成了多塊。","word":"fractured"}},"fragile":{"createdAt":1781478568760,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fragile 用來形容容易破損或脆弱的東西，通常需要特別小心對待。","options":["durable","fragile","ornate","valuable"],"sentence":"The antique vase is extremely ______ and must be handled with great care. The slightest bump could cause it to shatter into pieces.","translation":"這個古董花瓶極其易碎，必須小心輕放。最輕微的碰撞都可能導致它破裂成碎片。","word":"fragile"}},"fragment":{"createdAt":1782006648203,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"fragment 指的是破碎後的小碎片或殘片，通常無法單獨成為完整的物體。","options":["fragment","theory","memory","document"],"sentence":"After the explosion, investigators carefully collected every ______ of evidence from the scene. Each piece of debris was catalogued and analyzed to reconstruct what happened.","translation":"爆炸後，調查人員仔細收集現場的每一個碎片證據。每一塊碎片都被編目和分析以重建發生的情況。","word":"fragment"}},"fragrance":{"createdAt":1781780789966,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fragrance 是名詞，意為香氣、芳香，指令人愉悅的氣味或香味。","options":["noise","fragrance","darkness","weight"],"sentence":"The beautiful rose garden filled the air with a delicate ______ that attracted butterflies and bees. Visitors could smell the sweet scent from across the park.","translation":"美麗的玫瑰園充滿了精緻的香氣，吸引了蝴蝶和蜜蜂。遊客可以從公園的另一端聞到甜蜜的氣味。","word":"fragrance"}},"fragrant":{"createdAt":1781708652660,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fragrant 指散發出宜人香氣的，與甜蜜的香氣相對應。","options":["colorful","fragrant","delicate","wilting"],"sentence":"The ______ flowers in the garden attracted many bees and butterflies. The sweet aroma was so strong that visitors could smell it from across the entire neighborhood.","translation":"花園裡的芬芳花朵吸引了許多蜜蜂和蝴蝶。這種甜蜜的香氣非常濃烈，訪客從整個鄰里的另一邊都能聞到它。","word":"fragrant"}},"frame":{"createdAt":1781708652666,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"frame 指建築物的框架或骨架，是支撐整個結構的主要構件。","options":["decoration","exterior","frame","roof"],"sentence":"The wooden ______ of the old house was damaged by termites and had to be completely replaced. Without the supporting beams and structural components, the walls could not stand properly.","translation":"老房子的木製框架被白蟻破壞，必須完全更換。沒有支撐梁和結構部件，牆壁無法正確站立。","word":"frame"}},"framework":{"createdAt":1783575763868,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"framework表示支撐或組織某事物的基本結構、體系或框架。","options":["framework","textbook","classroom","subject"],"sentence":"The ______ of the new curriculum was designed to help students develop critical thinking skills at every level. Teachers use this structure as a guide for lesson planning throughout the year.","translation":"新課程的框架旨在幫助學生在各個級別發展批判性思維能力。教師全年使用此結構作為課程規劃的指南。","word":"framework"}},"franchise":{"createdAt":1782642451991,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"franchise 是指特許經銷權，允許個人在支付費用後使用公司的品牌、系統和商業模式來經營事業。","options":["franchise","competition","donation","revolution"],"sentence":"McDonald's operates through a ______ model that allows individual entrepreneurs to open their own restaurants. Each owner pays a fee to use the brand name and business system established by the corporation.","translation":"麥當勞通過特許經銷權模式運營，允許個別企業家開設自己的餐廳。每個經營者都要支付費用以使用公司建立的品牌名稱和商業系統。","word":"franchise"}},"frantic":{"createdAt":1781850347302,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"發狂似的或情緒失控的是形容詞，表示極度焦急、緊張或狂亂的狀態。","options":["leisurely","careful","frantic","organized"],"sentence":"The mother's ______ search for her lost child lasted for hours through the crowded shopping mall. Her hands were shaking and her voice was trembling with panic.","translation":"母親在擁擠的購物中心發狂似地搜索她失散的孩子持續了好幾個小時。她的手在顫抖，她的聲音因恐慌而顫動。","word":"frantic"}},"frantically":{"createdAt":1782920661034,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"frantically表示狂亂地或慌張地，強調行動中的急促和失控感","options":["frantically","hurriedly","quickly","swiftly"],"sentence":"The fire alarm rang and people rushed ______ toward the emergency exits. The evacuation had to be orderly despite the urgency of the situation.","translation":"火災警報響起，人們狂亂地向緊急出口衝去。儘管情況緊迫，疏散必須有序進行。","word":"frantically"}},"fraud":{"createdAt":1782920661031,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"fraud是指欺騙或騙局，特別是通過不誠實或欺騙手段獲取金錢或利益","options":["fraud","crime","theft","misconduct"],"sentence":"The company's CEO was arrested for ______ after investigators discovered he had falsified financial records. The deception had cost investors millions of dollars.","translation":"公司首席執行官因欺騙罪被捕，調查人員發現他偽造了財務記錄。這次騙局使投資者損失了數百萬美元。","word":"fraud"}},"freak":{"createdAt":1784899523203,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"freak在這裡指狂熱者或極度沉迷某事物的怪人，強調過度的、令人驚訝的熱情程度。","options":["enthusiast","freak","expert","celebrity"],"sentence":"The social media ______ spent twelve hours a day posting videos and following every trend obsessively. His friends were amazed by his extreme dedication to online content.","translation":"那個社交媒體狂熱者每天花十二小時發布視頻並痴迷地追隨每一個潮流。他的朋友們對他在網路內容上的極端執著感到驚訝。","word":"freak"}},"freeway":{"createdAt":1781787229322,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"freeway 指的是沒有紅綠燈、高速的多車道道路，用於長距離運輸。","options":["bridge","freeway","parking lot","intersection"],"sentence":"During rush hour, traffic on the ______ moved slowly despite the lack of traffic lights. The highway's multiple lanes allowed cars to bypass city streets entirely.","translation":"在尖峰時段，儘管沒有紅綠燈，高速公路上的交通仍然緩慢移動。這條公路的多條車道讓汽車能夠完全繞過城市街道。","word":"freeway"}},"freeze":{"createdAt":1782305067262,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"freeze是指液體因溫度下降而變成固體的過程，特別是指水變成冰。","options":["melt","evaporation","freeze","condensation"],"sentence":"When the temperature drops below zero degrees Celsius, water will undergo a ______ and turn into solid ice. This happens because the cold causes the liquid molecules to stop moving and solidify into a crystalline structure.","translation":"當溫度降至零攝氏度以下時，水會經歷結冰，變成固體冰。這是因為寒冷導致液體分子停止運動並固化成晶體結構。","word":"freeze"}},"freight":{"createdAt":1781832478024,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"freight 意為「貨物」或「貨運」，通常指通過運輸方式（如卡車、火車、船舶）大量運送的商品。","options":["passengers","freight","equipment","luggage"],"sentence":"The truck was carrying heavy ______ across the country on a long-haul delivery. The cargo included machinery, textiles, and other goods destined for warehouses across the nation.","translation":"這輛卡車在長途運輸中跨越全國運送重貨。貨物包括機械、紡織品和其他運往全國各地倉庫的商品。","word":"freight"}},"frequency":{"createdAt":1783392139528,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"frequency 是名詞，表示某事物發生的次數或屢次發生的程度。","options":["intensity","duration","frequency","severity"],"sentence":"The ______ of her headaches had increased so much that she decided to see a doctor. She was experiencing them almost every other day now.","translation":"她頭痛的頻率增加了很多，所以她決定去看醫生。現在她幾乎每隔一天就會經歷一次。","word":"frequency"}},"frequent":{"createdAt":1782044436949,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"frequent是形容詞，表示經常重複發生或經常進行的事情，與「幾乎每晚」的描述相符。","options":["occasional","frequent","rare","single"],"sentence":"The tourist made ______ visits to the local restaurant during his stay in the city. He went there almost every evening to enjoy their signature dishes.","translation":"這名遊客在城市逗留期間經常光顧當地餐廳。他幾乎每晚都去那裡享用他們的招牌菜。","word":"frequent"}},"frequently":{"createdAt":1784193936074,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"frequently 是副詞，表示經常、頻繁地發生某事，用來描述高頻率的重複行為。","options":["rarely","frequently","occasionally","never"],"sentence":"She visits her grandmother ______ every weekend without fail. This habit has become a regular part of her weekly routine.","translation":"她每個週末都頻繁地拜訪她的祖母。這個習慣已經成為她每週例行公事的一部分。","word":"frequently"}},"friction":{"createdAt":1784191742098,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"friction指兩個物體表面相互摩擦產生的力，也可引申為人際關係中的矛盾或衝突。","options":["guide","friction","purchase","reveal"],"sentence":"The ______ between the two surfaces created heat as they rubbed together rapidly. Scientists measured the temperature increase caused by this physical interaction.","translation":"兩個表面之間的摩擦力在快速摩擦時產生熱量。科學家測量了這種物理相互作用造成的溫度上升。","word":"friction"}},"fright":{"createdAt":1781783820687,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"fright指的是突然的、令人感到害怕或驚嚇的感覺，通常是由於出乎意料的事件引起的。","options":["fright","joy","surprise","anger"],"sentence":"The sudden loud noise gave me quite a ______ while I was working alone in the office. It took me several minutes to calm down and realize it was just the printer malfunctioning.","translation":"當我獨自在辦公室工作時，突然的巨大噪音嚇了我一跳。我花了幾分鐘才平靜下來，意識到那只是印表機故障。","word":"fright"}},"frighten":{"createdAt":1782202115974,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"frighten 是動詞，表示使某人感到驚恐或害怕，這裡露營者的跳起和尖叫反應表明他們確實受到了驚嚇。","options":["amuse","frighten","confuse","bore"],"sentence":"The sudden loud noise in the dark forest did ______ the campers. Everyone jumped and screamed before realizing it was just a falling branch.","translation":"黑暗森林中突然的巨大聲響嚇到了露營者。在意識到那只是掉落的樹枝之前，每個人都跳起來尖叫。","word":"frighten"}},"frontier":{"createdAt":1783068339345,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"frontier 指的是國家、地區或已知領土的邊界或邊疆地帶","options":["capital","frontier","settlement","village"],"sentence":"The explorers ventured into the ______ to discover new lands. They crossed the border between two nations to reach unexplored territory.","translation":"探險家冒險進入邊境以發現新的土地。他們越過兩個國家之間的邊界以到達未被探索的領土。","word":"frontier"}},"froze":{"createdAt":1781532967165,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"froze 表示呆住、僵住，與「無法移動或尖叫」的描述相符。","options":["ran","froze","laughed","danced"],"sentence":"When the burglar suddenly appeared in the dark hallway, she ______ in absolute terror. She could not move or scream at that moment.","translation":"當竊賊突然出現在黑暗的走廊裡時，她因絕對恐懼而______(呆住)。她在那一刻無法移動或尖叫。","word":"froze"}},"frugal":{"createdAt":1781531595651,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"frugal 表示節約的、儉樸的，指在花費金錢時精打細算，不浪費。","options":["luxurious","lavish","frugal","extravagant"],"sentence":"Despite earning a high salary, he maintained a ______ lifestyle and avoided unnecessary spending. His modest apartment and secondhand furniture reflected his commitment to saving money.","translation":"儘管收入很高，他卻保持著節約的生活方式，避免不必要的開支。他樸素的公寓和二手傢具反映了他對存錢的承諾。","word":"frugal"}},"frustrate":{"createdAt":1781651775061,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"frustrate 意為讓人感到沮喪、挫折或被阻止達成目標。","options":["justify","discussion","frustrate","childhood"],"sentence":"The repeated delays began to ______ the entire team. Everyone felt angry and disappointed because their hard work seemed to be blocked at every turn.","translation":"反覆的延誤開始挫敗整個團隊。每個人都感到憤怒和失望，因為他們的辛苦工作似乎在每一步都被阻擾。","word":"frustrate"}},"frustrated":{"createdAt":1783575763860,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"frustrated表示因為無法達到目標或期望而感到沮喪、挫敗的情緒。","options":["excited","frustrated","confused","bored"],"sentence":"After failing the exam for the third time, Maria felt completely ______ and considered giving up. She had studied hard, but the results kept disappointing her.","translation":"瑪麗亞第三次考試不及格後，感到完全沮喪，並考慮放棄。她努力學習，但結果一直令她失望。","word":"frustrated"}},"frustration":{"createdAt":1781425024019,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"frustration是指因無法達成目標或反覆失敗而產生的挫敗感、沮喪感和煩悶情緒。","options":["joy","frustration","excitement","confidence"],"sentence":"After failing the exam for the third time, he felt overwhelming ______ and seriously questioned his abilities. His repeated disappointments had left him feeling defeated and uncertain about his future.","translation":"第三次考試不及格後，他感到壓倒性的挫敗感，並認真質疑自己的能力。他一次次的失望讓他感到沮喪和對未來的不確定。","word":"frustration"}},"fuel":{"createdAt":1781837601403,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fuel 作為動詞表示「激起」或「促進」，指提供能量或動力使某事物增長或加強。","options":["dampen","fuel","question","delay"],"sentence":"The environmental activist's passionate speech about climate change continued to ______ the students' determination to take action. Her inspiring words motivated them to organize a recycling campaign at school.","translation":"那位環保活動人士關於氣候變化的熱情演講繼續激起學生採取行動的決心。她鼓舞人心的話語激勵他們在學校組織回收活動。","word":"fuel"}},"fulfill":{"createdAt":1781425737121,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"fulfill 表示實現、完成或履行承諾和義務，與完成所有工作相符。","options":["fulfill","ignore","delay","avoid"],"sentence":"She promised to ______ all her responsibilities before leaving for vacation. Her supervisor confirmed that every project deadline and task requirement will be completed by Friday.","translation":"她承諾在休假前完成所有責任。她的主管確認每個專案截止日期和任務要求都會在星期五前完成。","word":"fulfill"}},"fulfillment":{"createdAt":1781515372607,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"fulfillment指實現自我或完成目標後所獲得的成就感和滿足感","options":["chief","launch","force","fulfillment"],"sentence":"She found great ______ in volunteering at the local shelter every weekend. The sense of purpose and satisfaction from helping others brought her genuine happiness.","translation":"她在每個週末在當地收容所做志工中找到了巨大的成就感。幫助他人帶來的目標感和滿足感給她帶來了真正的幸福。","word":"fulfillment"}},"fume":{"createdAt":1781275226788,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"此處fume作動詞表示「發怒；生悶氣」，通常指內心的不滿","options":["dazzle","include","fume","breast"],"sentence":"She began to ______ when she discovered her coworker had taken credit for her project. Her anger only grew as she realized the unfairness of the situation.","translation":"當她發現同事竊取她的項目成果時，她開始生悶氣。當她意識到這種不公平時，她的憤怒更加增長。","word":"fume"}},"function":{"createdAt":1783433420569,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"function 表示某物的目的或用途，在這裡指智能手機應該做什麼或它的作用是什麼。","options":["appearance","function","location","material"],"sentence":"The primary ______ of a smartphone is to make calls and send messages. Without understanding this basic purpose, users cannot appreciate all the other features the device offers.","translation":"智能手機的主要功能是打電話和發送信息。如果不理解這個基本目的，用戶就無法欣賞該設備提供的所有其他功能。","word":"function"}},"functional":{"createdAt":1781323901183,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"functional意為「正常工作的」或「實用的」，在此指電腦的所有功能都能正常運作。","options":["broken","obsolete","functional","decorative"],"sentence":"Although the old computer looks worn, it remains completely ______. Every program runs smoothly and all hardware components respond normally.","translation":"雖然這台舊電腦看起來磨損了，但它仍然完全正常工作。每個程序運行順暢，所有硬件組件都反應正常。","word":"functional"}},"fund":{"createdAt":1781449095509,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fund作為動詞意為提供資金或籌集經費，用來支持某個項目或計畫。","options":["close","fund","ignore","demolish"],"sentence":"The non-profit organization needed to ______ their new community center project. They launched a fundraising campaign to collect donations from local businesses.","translation":"非營利組織需要為他們的新社區中心項目提供資金。他們發起了募款活動以從本地企業籌集捐款。","word":"fund"}},"fundamental":{"createdAt":1781832478023,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"fundamental 意為「基礎的」或「根本的」，用來形容最基本、最重要、不可或缺的事物。","options":["advanced","optional","fundamental","temporary"],"sentence":"Learning to read and write is a ______ skill that all students must master. Without these basic abilities, it's nearly impossible to succeed in any other academic subject.","translation":"學習閱讀和寫作是所有學生必須掌握的基礎技能。沒有這些基本能力，在任何其他學術科目中都幾乎不可能成功。","word":"fundamental"}},"fundamentally":{"createdAt":1783516147977,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fundamentally 作為副詞表示「在根本上、本質上」，用來描述事物在最基本層面上的區別或特性。","options":["occasionally","fundamentally","gradually","temporarily"],"sentence":"The two companies operate ______ differently in their approach to customer service. While Company A prioritizes speed, Company B focuses on personalized relationships, showing that their business philosophies are at their core completely opposite.","translation":"這兩家公司在客戶服務的方法上根本性地不同。雖然 A 公司優先考慮速度，但 B 公司專注於個人化關係，說明它們的商業理念在本質上是完全相反的。","word":"fundamentally"}},"funds":{"createdAt":1782170870874,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"funds指的是資金或款項，通常用於支持或完成特定項目或計畫。","options":["volunteers","funds","equipment","permits"],"sentence":"The charity organization lacks sufficient ______ to build the new community center. Without donations from generous supporters, the project cannot proceed.","translation":"慈善機構缺乏足夠的資金來建造新的社區中心。沒有慷慨支持者的捐款，該項目無法進行。","word":"funds"}},"funeral":{"createdAt":1783575763869,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"funeral是指為了紀念逝者而舉行的喪葬儀式。","options":["wedding","celebration","funeral","parade"],"sentence":"The ______ was held at the cathedral with hundreds of mourners paying their respects to the deceased. The ceremony lasted two hours and included speeches celebrating his life.","translation":"葬禮在大教堂舉行，數百名悼念者向死者致敬。該儀式持續了兩小時，包括讚頌他人生的演講。","word":"funeral"}},"fur":{"createdAt":1783260805488,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"fur特指動物身上的毛皮，通常是厚密的保暖毛髮。","options":["skin","fur","wool","hair"],"sentence":"The rabbit's soft ______ kept it warm during the cold winter months. The thick coat covering its entire body provided excellent insulation against freezing temperatures.","translation":"兔子柔軟的毛皮在寒冷的冬季保持它溫暖。覆蓋其整個身體的厚外套提供了對冷凍溫度的極好絕緣。","word":"fur"}},"furious":{"createdAt":1782401868812,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"furious 表示極度憤怒或非常生氣的狀態。","options":["pleased","furious","curious","anxious"],"sentence":"The coach was ______ with his team after they lost the championship game. He yelled and slammed his clipboard on the bench.","translation":"在球隊輸掉冠軍賽後，教練對他們極度憤怒。他大聲喊叫並把他的夾板摔在凳子上。","word":"furious"}},"furiously":{"createdAt":1781626081101,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"furiously 作為副詞表示以激烈、狂暴或極具力量的方式進行某個動作，通常帶有強烈的情感或急迫感。","options":["lazily","slowly","furiously","calmly"],"sentence":"He worked ______ throughout the night to meet the deadline. His intense energy and rapid pace showed his desperation to finish the project before dawn.","translation":"他整晚狂怒地工作以趕上截止日期。他激烈的精力和快速的步伐顯示了他在天亮前完成項目的迫切性。","word":"furiously"}},"furniture":{"createdAt":1781886743284,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"Furniture 特指可移動的家居用品，如椅子、桌子、床等，用於室內陳設和日常生活。","options":["decorations","fixtures","furniture","appliances"],"sentence":"The living room needed new ______ after the old pieces became worn and broken. The family decided to buy a sofa, armchairs, and a coffee table to fill the space.","translation":"客廳需要新的家具，因為舊的家具已經破舊損壞。家人決定買沙發、扶手椅和咖啡桌來填滿這個空間。","word":"furniture"}},"further":{"createdAt":1783516147981,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"further 作為副詞表示「進一步、更遠地、在更大程度上」，用來指推進某事物的進展或深化。","options":["further","quickly","briefly","carefully"],"sentence":"The research team decided to investigate the issue ______ by conducting additional experiments. They wanted to extend their analysis beyond the initial findings and gain deeper insights into the phenomenon.","translation":"研究團隊決定通過進行額外實驗來進一步調查這個問題。他們想要將分析擴展到初步發現之外，並獲得對該現象更深入的理解。","word":"further"}},"furthermore":{"createdAt":1783575763868,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"furthermore是連接詞，用於補充說明，引出額外的理由或信息。","options":["however","furthermore","instead","previously"],"sentence":"The new policy will reduce costs and improve efficiency; ______, it will make the workplace safer for employees. These three benefits make the proposal worth implementing immediately.","translation":"新政策將降低成本並提高效率；此外，它將使工作場所對員工更加安全。這三個好處使該提案值得立即實施。","word":"furthermore"}},"futile":{"createdAt":1787118100428,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"futile 表示無效的、白費力氣的，因為無論如何嘗試都無法取得成功。","options":["successful","futile","profitable","creative"],"sentence":"The engineers' attempts to repair the broken machine proved ______ despite their best efforts. After three weeks and hundreds of thousands of dollars spent, they finally gave up.","translation":"工程師們修理壞機器的嘗試儘管盡了最大努力但還是徒勞的。三週後花費了數十萬美元，他們最終放棄了。","word":"futile"}},"gain":{"createdAt":1784215412205,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"gain作為動詞，表示增加或獲得某個量的增長，特別是在體重、數量或數值方面的增加。","options":["gain","develop","build","strengthen"],"sentence":"After months of hard training, the athlete was able to ______ several kilograms of muscle mass. The coach confirmed that the weight increase was exactly what they had planned for this phase of preparation.","translation":"經過幾個月的艱苦訓練，運動員能夠增加了幾公斤的肌肉質量。教練證實這個體重增加正是他們在這個準備階段所計劃的。","word":"gain"}},"galaxy":{"createdAt":1781850347302,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"星系是指由數十億顆恆星、行星、氣體和塵埃組成的龐大天體系統。","options":["planet","meteor","galaxy","nebula"],"sentence":"The ______ containing billions of stars stretched across the night sky in a magnificent spiral pattern. Astronomers estimated it was over 100,000 light-years in diameter.","translation":"包含數十億顆恆星的星系以壯麗的螺旋形式跨越夜空。天文學家估計其直徑超過十萬光年。","word":"galaxy"}},"gallery":{"createdAt":1781531595652,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gallery 是指展示藝術品的場所，特別是展示繪畫、雕塑等視覺藝術的地方。","options":["museum","gallery","theater","library"],"sentence":"The art ______ opened a new exhibition featuring paintings by contemporary artists. Visitors lined up outside to view the masterpieces displayed on the white walls.","translation":"畫廊開設了一場新展覽，展出當代藝術家的繪畫作品。遊客排隊進入以欣賞展示在白色牆壁上的傑作。","word":"gallery"}},"gambit":{"createdAt":1783402421329,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"開局是象棋中的一種策略性開場步驟，通常涉及犧牲一個棋子以換取更強的位置或攻擊機會。","options":["checkmate","gambit","stalemate","endgame"],"sentence":"The chess player opened with a bold ______, sacrificing a pawn to gain control of the center. This risky opening move was designed to create a strategic advantage early in the game.","translation":"國際象棋選手以大膽的開局開局，犧牲一個兵來控制棋盤中心。這個冒險的開局步驟旨在在遊戲早期獲得戰略優勢。","word":"gambit"}},"gang":{"createdAt":1781653278519,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gang是名詞，表示群伙或成群結隊的人，可以指任何聚集在一起的群體，無論是友善的或不友善的。","options":["single","gang","pair","duo"],"sentence":"A ______ of teenagers gathered at the park every evening to play basketball together. Their coach recognized them as a dedicated group of friends who helped each other improve.","translation":"一______青少年每天晚上聚集在公園裡一起打籃球。他們的教練認出他們是一群致力於互相幫助進步的朋友。","word":"gang"}},"gangster":{"createdAt":1784779066922,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gangster指幫派成員或黑手黨成員，通常與犯罪活動相關聯。","options":["doctor","gangster","teacher","engineer"],"sentence":"The police arrested the dangerous ______ who had been running an illegal operation in the city. He was involved in organized crime and had connections to several criminal syndicates.","translation":"警察逮捕了那個危險的幫派成員，他一直在城市中經營非法活動。他參與有組織的犯罪活動，並與多個犯罪集團有聯繫。","word":"gangster"}},"gap":{"createdAt":1782140283157,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gap指的是空間中的缺口、裂口或間隙，常用於描述兩物之間的空間距離。","options":["bridge","gap","wall","road"],"sentence":"There was a large ______ between the two buildings. The city decided to construct a bridge to span this empty space.","translation":"兩棟建築物之間有一個很大的缺口。這座城市決定建造一座橋來跨越這個空位。","word":"gap"}},"garment":{"createdAt":1781693275430,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"服裝是指穿在身上的衣服和衣著物品，包括各種類型的衣服如連衣裙、襯衫或外套等。","options":["accessory","fabric","garment","decoration"],"sentence":"She bought an elegant ______ at the boutique for the wedding ceremony. The silk dress was carefully tailored and cost over a thousand dollars.","translation":"她在精品店為婚禮購買了一件優雅的服裝。這件絲綢連衣裙經過精心裁製，花費超過一千元。","word":"garment"}},"gasoline":{"createdAt":1783557858058,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"gasoline是一種石油產品，用作內燃機的燃料，是大多數汽車和機動車輛的主要燃料。","options":["electricity","water","gasoline","air"],"sentence":"The car's engine runs on ______ and needs to be refueled every few hundred kilometers. Without this liquid fuel, the vehicle cannot start or operate.","translation":"汽車引擎以汽油運行，每行駛幾百公里就需要補充燃料。沒有這種液體燃料，車輛無法啟動或運行。","word":"gasoline"}},"gasp":{"createdAt":1784259020516,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gasp 是驚訝或震驚時的倒吸氣聲，通常是無意識的反應","options":["applause","gasp","cheer","laughter"],"sentence":"The audience let out a collective ______ when the magician made the car disappear on stage. Everyone inhaled sharply in surprise and shock.","translation":"當魔術師在舞台上讓汽車消失時，觀眾們集體倒吸了一口氣。每個人都驚訝和震驚地急速吸氣。","word":"gasp"}},"gather":{"createdAt":1781402539338,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gather 作動詞表示收集、聚集或整合來自不同來源的信息或物品。","options":["ignore","gather","create","lose"],"sentence":"The volunteers will ______ information about the problem from community members. They plan to conduct surveys and interviews over the next month.","translation":"志願者將從社區成員那裡收集關於該問題的信息。他們計畫在下個月進行調查和訪談。","word":"gather"}},"gathering":{"createdAt":1781848934149,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gathering指多人為了某個目的集合在一起的聚會或集會","options":["complaint","gathering","lawsuit","accident"],"sentence":"The family ______ was held at grandmother's house every summer. Cousins, aunts, and uncles came from all over to celebrate together.","translation":"家庭聚會每個夏天都在奶奶家舉行。表親、阿姨和叔叔從四面八方來慶祝。","word":"gathering"}},"gauge":{"createdAt":1784215412204,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gauge在這裡作為動詞，表示用測量儀器或工具來測量或計量某物的具體數值。","options":["measure","gauge","estimate","calculate"],"sentence":"The mechanic used a special tool to ______ the tire pressure and ensure it was at the correct level. Without this instrument, it would be impossible to measure the exact PSI accurately.","translation":"機械師用特殊工具來測量輪胎氣壓，確保其處於正確的水平。沒有這個儀器，就不可能準確測量確切的PSI。","word":"gauge"}},"gaze":{"createdAt":1781842254307,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gaze 表示長時間注視或凝視，通常帶有沉思或欣賞的情感，比 stare 更溫和，比 glance 的持續時間更長。","options":["ignore","gaze","glance","stare"],"sentence":"She couldn't help but ______ at the beautiful sunset over the ocean. Her eyes remained fixed on the horizon for nearly an hour without blinking.","translation":"她忍不住注視著海洋上美麗的日落。她的眼睛在將近一個小時內一直固定在地平線上，沒有眨眼。","word":"gaze"}},"gear":{"createdAt":1781581925133,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gear 作為名詞表示特定用途的裝備、工具或衣服，尤其是用於某項活動或工作的專門配件。","options":["supplies","gear","luggage","baggage"],"sentence":"The mountain climber packed all the necessary ______ including ropes, harnesses, and carabiners for the expedition. She carefully checked each piece of equipment to ensure safety during the ascent.","translation":"登山者為遠征打包了所有必要的裝備，包括繩索、安全帶和快速掛鉤。她仔細檢查了每件設備以確保登山時的安全。","word":"gear"}},"gender":{"createdAt":1781839950963,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"gender 指的是一個人的性別身份,通常包括男性、女性或其他性別認同。","options":["age","name","gender","education"],"sentence":"The survey asked each participant to indicate their ______ in the demographic section. The results showed that 55% of respondents identified as female and 45% as male.","translation":"調查要求每位參與者在人口統計部分註明他們的性別。結果顯示55%的受訪者認同女性身份,45%認同男性身份。","word":"gender"}},"general":{"createdAt":1781836375375,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"general作名詞表示陸軍最高軍銜之一，擁有指揮大規模軍事單位的權力。","options":["major","general","officer","commander"],"sentence":"The ______ led his troops into battle with great strategic skill and courage. His military rank and experience commanded respect from all his soldiers.","translation":"將軍以高超的戰略技巧和勇氣帶領他的部隊進入戰鬥。他的軍銜和經驗獲得了所有士兵的尊重。","word":"general"}},"generally":{"createdAt":1781515329269,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"generally 副詞，意思是通常、一般地，表示大多數情況或廣泛的趨勢。","options":["Rarely","Generally","Specifically","Occasionally"],"sentence":"______, people prefer to visit the beach during summer vacation rather than winter. Statistics show that beach tourism peaks in the warmest months of the year.","translation":"一般來說，人們在暑假期間更喜歡去海灘而不是冬天。統計數據顯示，海灘旅遊在一年中最溫暖的月份達到高峰。","word":"generally"}},"generate":{"createdAt":1782491138500,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"generate 表示產生、製造或創造某物，在這裡指通過轉換能源產生電力。","options":["generate","urinate","rivalry","modest"],"sentence":"The solar panels on the roof ______ enough electricity to power the entire house throughout the year. Engineers designed the system to capture maximum sunlight and convert it into usable energy.","translation":"屋頂上的太陽能電池板全年發電足以為整個房屋供電。工程師設計了該系統以捕獲最大的陽光並將其轉換為可用的能源。","word":"generate"}},"generation":{"createdAt":1781951900944,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"generation在這裡指的是同時代出生並經歷相似事件的人群，而不是指製造或創作的過程。","options":["production","generation","creation","invention"],"sentence":"The invention of the smartphone created a new ______ of technology users. Young people who grew up with mobile devices think very differently from their parents.","translation":"智慧型手機的發明創造了新一代的科技使用者。從小就接觸行動設備的年輕人的想法與他們的父母截然不同。","word":"generation"}},"generator":{"createdAt":1784779066928,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"generator是發電機或產生器，能夠產生電力或其他形式的能量。","options":["glacier","generator","compass","blanket"],"sentence":"When the power outage occurred, the hospital immediately turned on the emergency ______ to keep the lights on. This machine produced the electricity needed to continue operating critical medical equipment.","translation":"停電發生時，醫院立即啟動緊急發電機來保持燈亮著。這台機器產生了繼續運行關鍵醫療設備所需的電力。","word":"generator"}},"generosity":{"createdAt":1781709854482,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"generosity（慷慨）指無私地給予和幫助他人，與donate millions（捐獻數百萬）和willingness to help（幫助他人的意願）相呼應。","options":["stinginess","kindness","generosity","modesty"],"sentence":"The billionaire's ______ was evident when he donated millions to the children's hospital. His action showed genuine compassion and a willingness to help those in need.","translation":"這位億萬富翁的慷慨在他向兒童醫院捐獻數百萬美元時顯而易見。他的行動展現了真誠的同情心和幫助有需要的人的意願。","word":"generosity"}},"generous":{"createdAt":1784215231200,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"generous 表示願意大方地給予或分享，不吝嗇的態度，常用來形容在金錢、時間或幫助上的寬宏大量。","options":["stingy","generous","modest","careful"],"sentence":"The wealthy businessman was ______ with his donations to the charity. He gave away millions of dollars without expecting anything in return.","translation":"那位富有的商人向慈善機構捐獻時很慷慨。他毫不期待任何回報地捐出了數百萬美元。","word":"generous"}},"genius":{"createdAt":1781484415219,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"genius是指具有卓越才能和異常聰慧的人，在某個領域展現出非凡的成就。","options":["student","conductor","genius","critic"],"sentence":"Mozart was a musical ______ who composed his first symphony at the age of eight. His extraordinary talent and natural ability set him apart from ordinary musicians.","translation":"莫札特是一位音樂天才，在八歲時創作了他的第一部交響樂。他的非凡才能和天生的能力使他與普通音樂家不同。","word":"genius"}},"genre":{"createdAt":1783227469034,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"genre是指文學、音樂或藝術的類型或體裁，在這裡用來描述音樂的不同分類。","options":["instrument","genre","musician","rhythm"],"sentence":"My favorite ______ of music is jazz because I love improvisation and complex harmonies. This style emerged from African American communities in New Orleans during the early 20th century.","translation":"我最喜歡的音樂類型是爵士樂，因為我喜歡即興演奏和複雜的和聲。這種風格在20世紀初從紐奧良的非裔美國社區興起。","word":"genre"}},"genuine":{"createdAt":1784259020518,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"genuine 表示真正的、真實的、非偽造的物品或品質","options":["attractive","genuine","valuable","old"],"sentence":"The antique dealer assured me that the painting was ______ and not a forgery. She provided certificates of authenticity from three independent experts.","translation":"這位古董商確保我這幅畫是真正的，不是贗品。她提供了三位獨立專家的真品證書。","word":"genuine"}},"genuinely":{"createdAt":1783685293798,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"genuinely意思是「真正地、確實地」，用來強調某事是真實而不是虛假或表面的。","options":["falsely","genuinely","somewhat","partially"],"sentence":"She ______ cared about her friends' wellbeing, not just pretending to be kind. Her actions consistently showed she would sacrifice her own time and resources for them.","translation":"她真正關心她朋友的福祉，而不是假裝友善。她的行動始終表明她會為了朋友犧牲自己的時間和資源。","word":"genuinely"}},"geometric":{"createdAt":1785339147829,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"geometric指與幾何學相關的，或由簡單的形狀（如線條、圓形、三角形等）組成的。","options":["artistic","geometric","abstract","modern"],"sentence":"The artist created a stunning ______ pattern using only circles, triangles, and squares. The design was based purely on mathematical principles rather than natural forms.","translation":"藝術家只用圓形、三角形和正方形創作了一個令人驚嘆的幾何圖案。該設計完全基於數學原理，而不是自然形態。","word":"geometric"}},"germ":{"createdAt":1785559611188,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"germ 是指能夠引起疾病的微觀生物體，包括細菌、病毒等病原體。","options":["dust","germ","cell","virus"],"sentence":"A ______ is a microscopic organism that can cause disease in humans and animals. If you don't wash your hands after using the bathroom, you may spread bacteria and viruses to other people.","translation":"細菌是一種微觀生物，會對人類和動物造成疾病。如果你上完廁所後不洗手，你可能會把細菌和病毒傳播給其他人。","word":"germ"}},"gesture":{"createdAt":1782550057064,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gesture是名詞，表示用身體（通常是手臂或頭）做出來表達意思或情感的動作。","options":["complaint","gesture","strategy","mistake"],"sentence":"The old man made a ______ with his hand to invite his grandchildren to sit beside him. His warm expression and open palm showed his affection without speaking any words.","translation":"老人用手做了一個手勢邀請他的孫子坐在他身邊。他溫暖的表情和張開的手掌不用說話就表達了他的愛。","word":"gesture"}},"gibberellin":{"createdAt":1783243171149,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Gibberellin是一種植物激素，能促進植物細胞的伸長和生長，特別是莖和幼芽的發育。","options":["auxin","Gibberellin","cytokinin","ethylene"],"sentence":"Scientists applied ______ to the seedlings to promote rapid stem elongation and growth. The hormone worked effectively, and the plants grew significantly taller within weeks.","translation":"科學家將吉貝素應用於幼苗以促進莖迅速伸長和生長。這種激素有效發揮作用，植物在幾週內明顯變得更高。","word":"Gibberellin"}},"gibberish":{"createdAt":1784773494638,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gibberish 是指無法理解、毫無意義的言語或文字，通常指說話者表達不清或故意說些荒唐的話。","options":["eloquence","gibberish","wisdom","clarity"],"sentence":"When the drunk man started speaking ______, nobody could understand what he was trying to say. His words were completely incoherent and made no sense whatsoever.","translation":"當那個醉漢開始說胡言亂語時，沒有人能理解他想說什麼。他的話完全不連貫，毫無意義。","word":"gibberish"}},"gigantic":{"createdAt":1782575719153,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"gigantic意為「巨大的、龐大的」，形容某物的體積或規模非常大，遠超普通或預期的尺寸。","options":["tiny","crowded","gigantic","expensive"],"sentence":"The new shopping mall is absolutely ______ in size. It took three years to construct and covers an entire city block with hundreds of stores inside.","translation":"這家新購物中心的規模絕對是巨大的。它花了三年時間建造，佔地整個城市街區，內部有數百家商店。","word":"gigantic"}},"giggle":{"createdAt":1781331945988,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"giggle 指輕聲或斷斷續續地笑，通常是因為覺得有趣或感到害羞。","options":["giggle","cry","sleep","leave"],"sentence":"The children couldn't help but ______ when the clown made funny faces at them. Their laughter filled the entire room with joy and amusement.","translation":"當小丑對孩子們做鬼臉時，他們忍不住咯咯笑起來。他們的笑聲讓整個房間充滿了歡樂和娛樂。","word":"giggle"}},"glacier":{"createdAt":1784779066928,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"glacier是冰河或冰川，是由積累的冰雪形成的巨大冰塊，常見於高山和兩極。","options":["glacier","volcano","canyon","plateau"],"sentence":"The massive ______ at the top of the mountain was melting rapidly due to climate change. Scientists studied this enormous sheet of ice that had taken thousands of years to form.","translation":"山頂上的巨大冰河因氣候變化而迅速融化。科學家們研究了這個花費數千年形成的龐大冰塊。","word":"glacier"}},"glamor":{"createdAt":1781794866351,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"glamor指吸引力、魅力或誘惑力，特別是指華麗迷人但常帶有虛幻成分的外表。","options":["plainness","glamor","simplicity","ordinariness"],"sentence":"Hollywood movies often emphasize the ______ of celebrity life with red carpets and luxury cars. However, the reality behind the scenes is often quite different from what audiences see on screen.","translation":"好萊塢電影經常強調名人生活的______ ，包括紅地毯和豪車。然而，幕後的現實往往與觀眾在螢幕上看到的大不相同。","word":"glamor"}},"glamorous":{"createdAt":1781842254314,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"glamorous 表示迷人的、富有魅力的、光彩照人的，通常用來形容具有吸引力和優雅風度的人或事物。","options":["ordinary","glamorous","plain","timid"],"sentence":"The ______ movie star arrived at the red carpet event wearing a designer gown and sparkling diamonds. Photographers crowded around her, captivated by her stunning appearance and radiant charm.","translation":"這位迷人的電影明星穿著設計師禮服和閃閃發光的鑽石出現在紅毯活動上。攝影師聚集在她周圍，被她的驚人外表和光彩照人的魅力所吸引。","word":"glamorous"}},"glamour":{"createdAt":1782533789099,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"glamour 名詞意思是魅力或迷人的外表，通常指令人印象深刻的、令人嚮往的特質。","options":["wealth","glamour","talent","intelligence"],"sentence":"The movie star's ______ attracted photographers and fans wherever she went. Her elegant style and captivating presence made her one of Hollywood's most admired celebrities.","translation":"這位電影明星的魅力吸引了攝影師和粉絲無論她去哪裡。她優雅的風格和迷人的氣質使她成為好萊塢最受欽佩的名人之一。","word":"glamour"}},"glance":{"createdAt":1784259020511,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"glance 指短暫、快速的一瞥，常用於沒有時間仔細看的情況","options":["stare","glance","examination","review"],"sentence":"She took a quick ______ at the document before rushing to the meeting. She didn't have time to read it carefully, just a brief look.","translation":"她在衝往會議前快速地瞥了一眼文件。她沒有時間仔細閱讀，只是匆匆看了一眼。","word":"glance"}},"glare":{"createdAt":1783068339371,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"glare 動詞表示怒視、用憤怒的眼神盯著某人看","options":["smile","glare","nod","wink"],"sentence":"The angry customer began to ______ at the cashier when told the store was closed. His intense and hostile stare made everyone uncomfortable.","translation":"當被告知商店已關閉時，憤怒的顧客開始怒視收銀員。他強烈而敵對的凝視讓每個人都感到不舒服。","word":"glare"}},"glaring":{"createdAt":1783332861015,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「glaring」形容詞表示「明顯的、易於察覺的」，通常指令人眼花的、顯而易見的問題。","options":["subtle","glaring","hidden","minor"],"sentence":"There is a ______ error in the company's financial report that everyone should notice. The accountant mistakenly added an extra zero to the total revenue figure.","translation":"公司財務報告中有一個明顯的錯誤，每個人都應該注意到。會計師誤將多餘的一個零加到了總收入數字上。","word":"glaring"}},"gleam":{"createdAt":1783260805493,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gleam意為「發微光」或「閃爍」，指光線的柔和或閃閃發光的效果。","options":["fade","gleam","disappear","darken"],"sentence":"A bright light began to ______ from the diamond as it caught the sun's rays. The precious stone sparkled with an unmistakable radiance that lit up the entire display case.","translation":"當鑽石接住太陽光線時，一束明亮的光開始從中閃爍。這顆寶石以明確的光彩發出光芒，照亮了整個展示櫃。","word":"gleam"}},"glide":{"createdAt":1781417610414,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"glide是指光滑、流暢地滑動，通常帶有輕鬆優雅的感覺。","options":["jump","stumble","glide","sprint"],"sentence":"The ice skater began to ______ gracefully across the frozen pond. Her smooth movements required years of practice to master the technique of sliding without friction.","translation":"這位溜冰者開始在結冰的池塘上優雅地滑行。她流暢的動作需要多年的練習才能掌握無摩擦滑行的技巧。","word":"glide"}},"glimpse":{"createdAt":1781493458243,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"glimpse 名詞指短暫或不完整的看一眼，強調時間短暫和視野受限","options":["conversation","glimpse","interview","meeting"],"sentence":"I caught only a brief ______ of the celebrity as she rushed past the crowd. My view lasted just a few seconds before she disappeared around the corner.","translation":"當名人匆匆走過人群時，我只瞥見了她一眼。我的視線只持續了幾秒鐘，她就消失在街角了。","word":"glimpse"}},"glitter":{"createdAt":1784370440656,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"glitter 是指發出閃爍或閃耀的光，通常用來描述光線反射產生的閃亮效果。","options":["fade","glitter","disappear","settle"],"sentence":"The stars ______ brightly in the night sky above the mountain. Their shimmering light created a magical atmosphere that made the darkness sparkle.","translation":"星星在山脈上方的夜空中閃閃發光。它們的微光創造了一個神奇的氛圍，使黑暗閃爍發亮。","word":"glitter"}},"global":{"createdAt":1781784283023,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"global是形容詞，表示涉及世界各地的，與全球性相關的；在這個句子中強調公司在多個大陸的國際業務範圍。","options":["local","global","regional","domestic"],"sentence":"The company has expanded its operations to become a ______ enterprise with offices on every continent. Their influence now extends across North America, Europe, Asia, Africa, and Australia.","translation":"該公司已擴展業務成為一家______ 企業，在每個大陸都設有辦事處。他們的影響力現在延伸到北美、歐洲、亞洲、非洲和澳洲。","word":"global"}},"globe":{"createdAt":1784350994463,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"globe 是「地球儀；球體」的意思，可以旋轉來查看不同的地理位置。","options":["map","globe","poster","chart"],"sentence":"The geography teacher placed a ______ on the desk so students could see all the continents and oceans. Students could rotate it to locate different countries and understand Earth's geography better.","translation":"地理老師在桌子上放了一個球體，讓學生可以看到所有的大陸和海洋。學生可以旋轉它以找到不同的國家並更好地理解地球地理。","word":"globe"}},"gloom":{"createdAt":1783685293799,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"gloom意思是「陰暗、灰暗之處」，指缺乏光線或昏暗的環境狀況。","options":["brightness","clarity","gloom","sunlight"],"sentence":"The thick ______ settled over the forest as dark clouds blocked out the sun. The entire landscape became so dim that visibility was reduced to just a few metres.","translation":"當烏雲遮擋陽光時，濃厚的陰暗籠罩了森林。整個景觀變得如此昏暗，能見度只有幾米。","word":"gloom"}},"gloomy":{"createdAt":1783671496286,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gloomy是形容詞，用來描述昏暗、陰沉或令人沮喪的天氣和環境。","options":["bright","gloomy","warm","windy"],"sentence":"The weather has been very ______ this week, with dark clouds covering the sky. The meteorologist predicts that sunshine will finally return tomorrow.","translation":"這週的天氣一直非常憂鬱，烏雲覆蓋了天空。氣象學家預測明天陽光終於會回來。","word":"gloomy"}},"glorify":{"createdAt":1781449588288,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"glorify作為動詞表示「美化、讚頌、把…理想化」，指以過度正面或不準確的方式描繪某人或某事物。","options":["sensibly","signify","glorify","improve"],"sentence":"The documentary was criticized for attempting to ______ the actions of a controversial historical figure rather than presenting a balanced perspective. The filmmaker's portrayal emphasized heroic qualities while downplaying serious moral failings and harmful consequences.","translation":"這部紀錄片因試圖美化一位有爭議的歷史人物的行為而受到批評，而不是呈現平衡的觀點。電影製作人的描繪強調了英雄品質，同時淡化了嚴重的道德缺陷和有害後果。","word":"glorify"}},"glorious":{"createdAt":1781840030398,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"glorious 是形容詞，表示光榮的、壯麗的；與「令人驚嘆」和「壯麗的自然景觀」相呼應。","options":["dim","glorious","cloudy","ordinary"],"sentence":"The ______ sunset painted the sky in shades of orange, pink, and gold, creating a breathtaking view. Everyone stopped to admire the magnificent natural display that evening.","translation":"光榮燦爛的日落將天空染成橙色、粉紅色和金色，創造了令人驚嘆的景象。那天晚上每個人都停下來欣賞這壯麗的自然景觀。","word":"glorious"}},"glory":{"createdAt":1783419789623,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"glory 是名詞，指的是因偉大的成就或行為而獲得的高度榮譽、名聲和讚譽。","options":["victory","glory","wealth","power"],"sentence":"The ancient warriors fought for ______ and honor on the battlefield. Their names would be remembered for centuries, celebrated in songs and stories throughout the kingdom.","translation":"古代戰士在戰場上為榮譽而戰。他們的名字將被銘記數個世紀，在整個王國的歌曲和故事中被讚頌。","word":"glory"}},"glow":{"createdAt":1782491138499,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"glow 作為動詞表示發出溫暖或柔和的光線，通常帶有溫暖、舒適或充滿活力的含義。","options":["glow","subtract","mischievous","ownership"],"sentence":"The lantern began to ______ softly in the darkness, casting a warm, golden light across the room. Its gentle illumination filled everyone with a sense of comfort and peace.","translation":"燈籠開始在黑暗中柔和地發光，將溫暖的金色光線投射到房間各處。它溫和的光芒使每個人都感到舒適和平靜。","word":"glow"}},"glowing":{"createdAt":1782491138488,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"glowing 作為形容詞表示熱烈讚賞的、容光煥發的，用來描述極其正面和熱情的態度或評價。","options":["modest","investigation","glowing","territory"],"sentence":"The critic gave a ______ review of the new film, praising every aspect from the cinematography to the acting. She wrote that it was the best movie she had seen all year and recommended it enthusiastically to everyone.","translation":"評論家對這部新電影給出了熱烈的評論，讚揚了從攝影到表演的各個方面。她寫道這是她今年看過的最好的電影，並熱情地向每個人推薦了它。","word":"glowing"}},"glucose":{"createdAt":1783926511353,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"葡萄糖是一種單糖，是細胞進行有氧代謝和無氧代謝時的主要能量來源，被廣泛用於醫學和運動營養學中。","options":["protein","glucose","cholesterol","fiber"],"sentence":"When athletes need quick energy during intense exercise, their muscles rapidly consume ______ from the bloodstream. This simple sugar is the primary fuel source that cells use for immediate ATP production.","translation":"當運動員在劇烈運動中需要快速能量時，他們的肌肉會迅速消耗血液中的葡萄糖。這種簡單的糖類是細胞用於立即產生ATP的主要燃料來源。","word":"glucose"}},"goalkeeper":{"createdAt":1783346424326,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"goalkeeper是足球或曲棍球等運動中負責守護球門的球員，是隊伍中唯一被允許用手接球的位置。","options":["striker","goalkeeper","midfielder","defender"],"sentence":"The soccer team's ______ made three incredible saves during the second half of the match. This defensive player positioned himself directly in front of the net to block every shot.","translation":"足球隊的守門員在比賽下半場做出了三次不可思議的撲救。這位防守球員直接站在球門前阻擋每一次射門。","word":"goalkeeper"}},"goods":{"createdAt":1781693275430,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"商品是指用於買賣或交易的物品和貨物，特別是具有商業價值的物質產品。","options":["people","information","goods","animals"],"sentence":"The merchant transported ______ from China to Europe along the ancient Silk Road. These products included silk, spices, and porcelain that were highly valued in Western markets.","translation":"商人沿著古代絲綢之路將商品從中國運往歐洲。這些產品包括在西方市場中備受推崇的絲綢、香料和瓷器。","word":"goods"}},"goodwill":{"createdAt":1784370440652,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"goodwill 是指善意或親善，通常指企業或個人為建立良好關係而表現出的友好態度和好感。","options":["greed","goodwill","conflict","suspicion"],"sentence":"The company donated money to charity to build ______ with the community. This gesture of friendship and positive intentions helped improve their public image.","translation":"公司向慈善機構捐款，以便與社區建立善意。這種友善和積極意圖的舉動幫助改善了他們的公眾形象。","word":"goodwill"}},"gorgeous":{"createdAt":1783433817071,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gorgeous 是形容詞，表示極其漂亮、華麗和令人印象深刻的外觀，通常帶有讚美的語氣。","options":["tired","gorgeous","nervous","confused"],"sentence":"The bride looked absolutely ______ in her wedding dress decorated with pearls and crystals. Everyone at the ceremony couldn't stop admiring how stunning and radiant she appeared.","translation":"新娘穿著用珍珠和水晶裝飾的婚紗看起來絕對華麗。婚禮上的每個人都忍不住欣賞她看起來有多麼絢麗和容光煥發。","word":"gorgeous"}},"gorilla":{"createdAt":1786613223518,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gorilla 是指大猩猩，一種體型巨大的非洲靈長類動物，以強大的體力和聰慧著稱。","options":["chimpanzee","gorilla","elephant","lion"],"sentence":"The massive ______ beat its chest and roared loudly in the jungle. This large primate is native to Africa and is known for its incredible strength and intelligence.","translation":"那隻巨大的大猩猩在叢林中捶胸頓足並大聲咆哮。這種大型靈長類動物原產於非洲，以其驚人的力量和智力而聞名。","word":"gorilla"}},"gossip":{"createdAt":1781401591590,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gossip 作為動詞，意思是說別人的閒話或八卦，通常涉及傳播他人的祕密或私人信息。","options":["complain","gossip","whisper","celebrate"],"sentence":"The two friends love to ______ about their coworkers during lunch breaks. They share secrets and personal stories that they've heard from others around the office.","translation":"這兩個朋友喜歡在午餐時間說同事的閒話。他們分享從辦公室裡其他人那裡聽到的祕密和個人故事。","word":"gossip"}},"gourmet":{"createdAt":1783852021578,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gourmet 作形容詞，指高級的、優質的、供美食鑑賞家享用的食品或餐飲，強調食物的高品質和精緻程度。","options":["casual","gourmet","budget","standard"],"sentence":"The restaurant's new ______ menu features truffles, wagyu beef, and rare vintage wines that appeal to discerning diners. Only the finest ingredients sourced from around the world are used in each carefully prepared dish.","translation":"餐廳新推出的美食菜單以松露、和牛和稀有年份葡萄酒為特色，吸引挑剔的食客。每道精心準備的菜餚都只使用從世界各地採購的最優質食材。","word":"gourmet"}},"govern":{"createdAt":1784781060196,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"govern是指對一個國家、地區或組織進行治理和管理，包括制定政策和做出重要決策。","options":["ignore","govern","observe","defend"],"sentence":"The prime minister must ______ the country fairly and responsibly. She makes important decisions about laws, taxes, and public services that affect all citizens.","translation":"首相必須公正且負責任地治理這個國家。她制定關於法律、稅收和影響所有公民的公共服務的重要決定。","word":"govern"}},"government":{"createdAt":1784355956205,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"government是名詞，指的是負責制定和執行法律的政治機構或統治組織。","options":["citizens","government","weather","market"],"sentence":"The ______ passed a new law to protect the environment last month. The elected officials voted unanimously to reduce carbon emissions by 2030.","translation":"政府上個月通過了一項保護環境的新法律。被選出的官員一致投票決定在2030年前減少碳排放。","word":"government"}},"governmental":{"createdAt":1784092177149,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"governmental 是形容詞，表示與政府相關的或由政府部門管理的，常用於描述政府機構、政府決策或政府職能。","options":["educational","governmental","international","personal"],"sentence":"The new policy was approved by ______ officials at the national level. The decision came directly from the Ministry of Education and affected all public schools.","translation":"新政策得到了國家層級____官員的批准。該決定直接來自教育部，影響了所有公立學校。","word":"governmental"}},"gown":{"createdAt":1781484415211,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gown是指正式場合穿著的長禮服，通常用於重要活動如婚禮或宴會。","options":["jeans","gown","jacket","scarf"],"sentence":"The bride looked stunning in her white silk ______ as she walked down the aisle. The formal dress was elegantly designed with intricate lace details throughout.","translation":"新娘穿著白色絲綢禮服走下紅毯時看起來令人驚艷。這件正式的長衣優雅地設計，通篇都有複雜的蕾絲細節。","word":"gown"}},"grab":{"createdAt":1784535354788,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"grab 意指用手迅速而用力地抓住或搶取某物，通常帶有緊急或強行的含義。","options":["release","grab","place","arrange"],"sentence":"The child tried to ______ the toy from his sister's hands during playtime. He used force and speed to take it away before she could react.","translation":"那個小孩在玩耍時試圖從妹妹的手中抓取玩具。他用力量和速度搶走它，在她反應之前就奪走了。","word":"grab"}},"grace":{"createdAt":1781713470386,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"優美的風度是指行為舉止中所展現的優雅和精緻的品質。","options":["anger","grace","haste","confusion"],"sentence":"The ballet dancer moved across the stage with remarkable ______, captivating the entire audience. Her elegant movements and refined posture demonstrated years of professional training.","translation":"芭蕾舞者以非凡的優美姿態在舞台上移動，迷住了整個觀眾。她優雅的動作和精緻的姿態展現了多年的專業訓練。","word":"grace"}},"gradually":{"createdAt":1786113436890,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gradually 是副詞，表示緩慢地、逐步地發生某事，強調過程漸進而不是突然或迅速。","options":["suddenly","gradually","constantly","briefly"],"sentence":"The temperature ______ increased over the winter months. By spring, it had risen by 15 degrees Celsius, but the change was so slow that most people didn't notice it happening day by day.","translation":"冬季幾個月來氣溫逐步地上升。到了春天，氣溫上升了華氏15度，但變化非常緩慢，大多數人沒有注意到它一天天發生。","word":"gradually"}},"graduate":{"createdAt":1784683852170,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"graduate 作為動詞表示成功完成學業課程並獲得文憑或學位，標誌著教育階段的正式結束。","options":["enroll","graduate","transfer","tutor"],"sentence":"She will ______ from university next spring with a degree in engineering. After completing her final exams and submitting her thesis, she will officially receive her diploma.","translation":"她將在明年春天從大學畢業，獲得工程學學位。在完成最後的考試和提交論文後，她將正式獲得文憑。","word":"graduate"}},"graduation":{"createdAt":1784259020522,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"graduation 指完成學業並獲得學位的儀式和事件","options":["enrollment","graduation","registration","admission"],"sentence":"Her ______ from university was a proud moment for the entire family. Everyone gathered to celebrate her receiving her diploma.","translation":"她從大學畢業是整個家庭的驕傲時刻。每個人都聚集在一起慶祝她獲得文憑。","word":"graduation"}},"grain":{"createdAt":1781950727562,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"grain 指穀物或穀粒，如小麥、玉米、水稻等。","options":["metal","grain","fabric","equipment"],"sentence":"Farmers harvested tons of ______ from the fields this season. The wheat, barley, and corn were stored in silos for future use.","translation":"農民今年從田地中收穫了大量穀物。小麥、大麥和玉米被儲存在筒倉中供日後使用。","word":"grain"}},"grant":{"createdAt":1781345237575,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"grant作動詞表示「給予」或「授予」，通常用於正式或官方的贈與行為。","options":["deny","grant","refuse","withhold"],"sentence":"The government decided to ______ the organization a substantial amount of funding for their research project. The money was officially awarded in a formal ceremony last month.","translation":"政府決定向該組織授予大筆資金用於他們的研究項目。該筆款項在上個月的正式儀式上正式撥款。","word":"grant"}},"graph":{"createdAt":1781566055844,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"graph 是一種視覺化數據的工具，用坐標軸、曲線或其他圖形元素來表示數據之間的關係。","options":["report","graph","theory","conclusion"],"sentence":"The scientist presented a ______ showing the relationship between temperature and plant growth. The data points were plotted on both x and y axes to visualize the trend.","translation":"科學家展示了一張圖表，顯示溫度與植物生長之間的關係。數據點被繪製在 x 軸和 y 軸上以視覺化趨勢。","word":"graph"}},"graphic":{"createdAt":1783572181140,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"graphic 是形容詞，意思是生動的、形象的、逼真的，通常用來形容清楚、詳細且有衝擊力的描繪或圖像。","options":["subtle","vague","graphic","abstract"],"sentence":"The documentary included a ______ depiction of the historical battle that shocked many viewers. The realistic images and detailed descriptions left audiences visibly disturbed by what they witnessed on screen.","translation":"這部紀錄片包含了對歷史戰役的逼真描繪，震驚了許多觀眾。逼真的影像和詳細的描述讓觀眾對螢幕上看到的內容感到明顯不安。","word":"graphic"}},"grasp":{"createdAt":1781926370998,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"grasp 在這裡意思是理解、領悟，指通過努力和思考來掌握知識或概念。","options":["avoid","ignore","grasp","reject"],"sentence":"The student struggled to ______ the complex mathematical concept during the lecture. Only after reviewing the textbook three times did she finally understand it completely.","translation":"這名學生在講座中很難領悟這個複雜的數學概念。直到她複習了三次教科書後，她才最終完全理解了它。","word":"grasp"}},"grateful":{"createdAt":1782902185115,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"grateful 作形容詞表示「感激的」或「感謝的」，形容對他人幫助或恩惠的感受。","options":["annoyed","confused","grateful","indifferent"],"sentence":"He felt ______ for all the help his friends had given him during the difficult time. Without their support, he would never have recovered from his illness.","translation":"他對朋友在困難時期給予的所有幫助感到感激。沒有他們的支持，他永遠無法從疾病中康復。","word":"grateful"}},"gratifying":{"createdAt":1783598428083,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"gratifying 形容某事令人感到滿足、高興或成就感，使人感到欣慰和愉快","options":["disappointing","frustrating","gratifying","exhausting"],"sentence":"It was ______ for the volunteers to see the homeless children smile and enjoy the meals they had prepared. Knowing they made a real difference in people's lives filled their hearts with warmth.","translation":"看到無家可歸的孩子們微笑並享受他們準備的餐食，志願者們感到很滿足。知道他們在人們的生活中做出了真正的改變，使他們的心中充滿了溫暖。","word":"gratifying"}},"gratitude":{"createdAt":1781425024019,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gratitude是指感謝之心、感激之情，通常在受到幫助或善待後表達對他人的感謝。","options":["anger","gratitude","confusion","sorrow"],"sentence":"She expressed her ______ by baking homemade cookies for her neighbor who had helped her move. The thoughtful gesture showed how deeply she appreciated his kindness and support.","translation":"她通過為幫助她搬家的鄰居烘烤自製餅乾來表達她的感謝。這個貼心的舉動表明她對他的善良和支持的深深感激。","word":"gratitude"}},"grave":{"createdAt":1781693265627,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"墳墓是指埋葬死者的地點，通常在墓地中。","options":["school","grave","office","restaurant"],"sentence":"The elderly couple visited their late son's ______ every Sunday with fresh flowers. They spent time reflecting on cherished memories at the cemetery.","translation":"這對老夫婦每個星期天都會帶著鮮花去已故兒子的墳墓。他們在墓地花時間回憶珍貴的回憶。","word":"grave"}},"gravity":{"createdAt":1783262026085,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"gravity 作為名詞表示「嚴重性、莊嚴」，指事情的重要程度或所具有的嚴肅性質。","options":["humor","lightness","gravity","frivolity"],"sentence":"The principal spoke with ______ about the serious consequences of academic dishonesty in the school. Students understood that cheating on exams could result in expulsion.","translation":"校長以嚴肅的態度談論了學術不誠實在學校的嚴重後果。學生們明白在考試中作弊可能會被開除。","word":"gravity"}},"graze":{"createdAt":1781693271587,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"graze指的是牲畜在草地上邊走邊吃草，是一種典型的放牧行為，與奔跑或衝刺的動作完全不同。","options":["gallop","graze","sprint","charge"],"sentence":"The shepherd watched his sheep ______ peacefully in the meadow all afternoon. The animals slowly moved around eating grass from the field without any herding needed.","translation":"牧羊人整個下午都在觀看他的羊在草地上安靜地吃草。這些動物緩慢地四處走動，從田野裡吃草，不需要任何驅趕。","word":"graze"}},"grease":{"createdAt":1781515329265,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"grease 名詞，意思是油脂、油膩狀物，指機械或食物中的油性物質。","options":["dust","grease","water","rust"],"sentence":"The mechanic wiped away the excess ______ from the engine with an old cloth. The thick, oily substance had accumulated over months of regular use and needed cleaning.","translation":"機修工用一塊舊布擦去引擎上多餘的油脂。這種厚重的油膩物質經過數月的定期使用已經積累，需要清潔。","word":"grease"}},"greasy":{"createdAt":1781566460881,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"greasy形容充滿油脂或油膩的食物質感，與手指上留下殘留物和需要擦拭相符。","options":["dry","fresh","greasy","crispy"],"sentence":"The pizza was covered in a thick layer of ______ cheese that left residue on our fingers. We needed napkins to wipe off the oily coating.","translation":"披薩上覆蓋著一層厚厚的油膩起司，在我們的手指上留下了殘留物。我們需要餐巾紙來擦掉油膩的塗層。","word":"greasy"}},"greed":{"createdAt":1783737904101,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"greed 特指對金錢或物質財富的過度渴望和貪戀，具有負面含義。","options":["ambition","greed","negligence","arrogance"],"sentence":"The CEO's ______ led him to embezzle millions from the company for personal wealth. His insatiable desire for money ultimately destroyed his reputation and resulted in a lengthy prison sentence.","translation":"首席執行官的貪心導致他為了個人財富而挪用公司的數百萬美元。他對金錢的貪得無厭欲望最終摧毀了他的聲譽，並導致他被判長期監禁。","word":"greed"}},"greedy":{"createdAt":1783558795712,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"greedy 形容詞表示貪吃的、貪心的、貪婪的，指對食物或物質有過度的渴望。","options":["generous","greedy","tired","quiet"],"sentence":"The ______ child demanded more candy even though he had already eaten an entire box. His parents had to set strict limits on his sugar intake.","translation":"那個貪吃的孩子即使已經吃了整整一盒糖果，還是要求要更多。他的父母不得不對他的糖分攝入設置嚴格限制。","word":"greedy"}},"grief":{"createdAt":1783042345896,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"grief 是指因失去親愛的人或物而感到的深刻悲傷和痛苦。","options":["anger","confusion","grief","frustration"],"sentence":"After losing his beloved pet of fifteen years, the old man was consumed by ______ and struggled to find joy in daily activities. His family was deeply concerned about his emotional well-being during this difficult period.","translation":"失去了陪伴十五年的心愛寵物後，這位老人被悲傷吞沒，難以在日常活動中找到快樂。他的家人在這個困難時期對他的情感健康深感擔憂。","word":"grief"}},"grieve":{"createdAt":1781418481460,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"grieve作為動詞，表示因失去某人或某事而感到深深的悲傷和哀慟。","options":["celebrate","grieve","organize","appreciate"],"sentence":"The family continued to ______ over the loss of their beloved grandmother. They spent weeks mourning at home and attending memorial services.","translation":"這個家庭因失去親愛的祖母而繼續悲傷。他們花了數週在家中哀悼並參加追思會。","word":"grieve"}},"grind":{"createdAt":1782092862166,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"grind意思是用機器或工具將固體物質碾碎或磨成粉末或粗粒。","options":["roast","grind","blend","filter"],"sentence":"The coffee shop uses a machine to ______ fresh coffee beans every morning. The beans are crushed into fine powder to prepare for brewing.","translation":"咖啡館每天早上用機器磨新鮮咖啡豆。豆子被碾碎成細粉以便沖泡。","word":"grind"}},"grip":{"createdAt":1783946382151,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"grip 是動詞，意思是緊握或緊抓住某物，通常表示用力緊緊地握著以保持控制或支撐。","options":["release","grip","examine","tie"],"sentence":"The climber had to ______ the rope tightly as she descended the steep mountainside. Her hands were sweating, but she knew that loosening her hold even slightly could result in a dangerous fall.","translation":"當登山者從陡峭的山坡下降時，她必須______ 繩索。她的手在出汗，但她知道即使稍微鬆開她的把握也可能導致危險的跌落。","word":"grip"}},"groan":{"createdAt":1784245910036,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"groan 是指因痛苦或不適而發出的深沉呻吟聲或嘆息聲，通常帶有負面情緒。","options":["whisper","groan","smile","laugh"],"sentence":"The injured patient let out a painful ______ when the doctor examined his broken leg. The deep, anguished sound expressed his physical suffering and discomfort.","translation":"受傷的病人在醫生檢查他的斷腿時發出了痛苦的呻吟聲。那深沉、痛苦的聲音表達了他的身體痛楚和不適。","word":"groan"}},"groom":{"createdAt":1788028661419,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"groom 作為名詞是「新郎」的意思，指將要結婚的男性。","options":["groom","guest","priest","musician"],"sentence":"The ______ stood nervously at the altar waiting for his bride to arrive. He had spent hours with the barber to look perfect for this important day.","translation":"新郎緊張地站在祭壇等著新娘到達。他花了幾個小時去理髮店，為這個重要的日子看起來完美。","word":"groom"}},"gross":{"createdAt":1783260805487,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"gross表示未扣除費用或成本的總額，與net（淨額）相對。","options":["net","gross","average","potential"],"sentence":"The company's ______ revenue increased by 30% this year before any expenses were deducted. The accountant was careful to distinguish this total from the net profit after all costs.","translation":"公司今年的總收入在扣除任何費用前增加了30%。會計師小心地區分了這個總額和扣除所有成本後的淨利潤。","word":"gross"}},"ground":{"createdAt":1783561069058,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ground 作動詞時表示「擱淺」或「禁足」，這裡指飛機被迫停在地面無法起飛。","options":["sky","ground","lifted","soared"],"sentence":"The airplane had to make an emergency landing and was ______ on the runway for several hours. The pilot explained that mechanical problems prevented the aircraft from taking off again that day.","translation":"飛機必須緊急著陸，並在跑道上被擱淺了幾個小時。飛行員解釋說機械問題使飛機那天無法再次起飛。","word":"ground"}},"grounded":{"createdAt":1783262026083,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"grounded 作為形容詞表示「被禁足的」，指作為懲罰限制某人外出或進行某些活動的狀態。","options":["rewarded","grounded","promoted","encouraged"],"sentence":"The teenager was ______ for two weeks after breaking his parents' rules about curfew. He was not allowed to leave his home or contact his friends during this punishment period.","translation":"這位青少年因違反宵禁規則而被禁足兩週。在懲罰期間，他不被允許離開家或與朋友聯繫。","word":"grounded"}},"guarantee":{"createdAt":1781566460881,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"guarantee是一份正式的保證或擔保書，用來保護購買者的權益。","options":["receipt","guarantee","invoice","license"],"sentence":"The car manufacturer offers a five-year ______ on all engine parts. This written promise protects customers if any defects appear.","translation":"汽車製造商對所有引擎零件提供五年的保證。這份書面承諾在出現任何缺陷時保護客戶。","word":"guarantee"}},"guardian":{"createdAt":1782575719150,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"guardian意為「監護人、保護者」，指在法律上負責照顧和保護未成年人或無行為能力者的人。","options":["friend","guardian","teacher","colleague"],"sentence":"After her parents passed away, her uncle became her legal ______. He was responsible for making all important decisions about her education and welfare until she turned eighteen.","translation":"在她的父母去世後，她的叔叔成為她的法定監護人。在她滿十八歲之前，他負責做出所有關於她教育和福利的重要決定。","word":"guardian"}},"guidance":{"createdAt":1784779066927,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"guidance指引領、引導或建議，幫助人們做出正確的決定。","options":["punishment","guidance","textbook","entertainment"],"sentence":"The students received valuable ______ from their school counselor about choosing their future careers. Without her expert advice and direction, many would have been lost in making such important decisions.","translation":"學生們從學校輔導員那裡獲得了關於選擇未來職業的寶貴引導。沒有她的專業建議和指導，許多人在做出如此重要的決定時會感到迷茫。","word":"guidance"}},"guide":{"createdAt":1784191742096,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"guide指導遊、指南或帶領某人去某個地方的人，也可作動詞表示引導。","options":["purchase","reveal","guide","vessel"],"sentence":"The experienced ______ led tourists through the ancient temple, explaining its history. Everyone appreciated his detailed knowledge and clear directions about what to see next.","translation":"經驗豐富的導遊帶領遊客參觀古廟，解釋其歷史。每個人都欣賞他詳細的知識和清晰的指示，關於接下來要看什麼。","word":"guide"}},"guideline":{"createdAt":1782042740331,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"guideline 指的是幫助人們知道應該做什麼的正式建議或說明，通常由組織或權威機構制定。","options":["celebration","guideline","argument","rumor"],"sentence":"The company published a ______ for employees on how to conduct meetings professionally. This document was mandatory reading during onboarding to ensure everyone followed the same procedures.","translation":"公司發佈了一份員工如何專業地進行會議的指導方針。這份文件是入職培訓期間的必讀材料，以確保每個人都遵循相同的程序。","word":"guideline"}},"guilt":{"createdAt":1783609225840,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"guilt 指的是因為做了錯誤或不道德的事而產生的內疚感，通常伴隨著自責和後悔的心理狀態。","options":["shame","guilt","regret","worry"],"sentence":"She felt deep ______ after lying to her best friend. The weight of her wrongdoing made it impossible for her to sleep peacefully at night.","translation":"她因為對好友撒謊而感到深深的內疚。她所犯錯誤的沉重感使她無法安寧入睡。","word":"guilt"}},"guilty":{"createdAt":1784259020521,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"guilty 表示有罪的、內疚的，指因做了錯誤的事而感到自責","options":["innocent","happy","guilty","confused"],"sentence":"After stealing the cookies from the jar, the child looked ______ and confessed everything to her mother. Her face showed remorse and shame.","translation":"從罐子裡偷餅乾後，孩子看起來內疚不安，向母親坦白了一切。她的臉上表現出悔恨和羞愧。","word":"guilty"}},"gulf":{"createdAt":1783476327934,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"gulf 是名詞，意為深淵或鴻溝，比喻指思想、立場或地位之間的巨大差異。","options":["agreement","connection","gulf","similarity"],"sentence":"There is a wide ______ between the two political parties on economic policy. Their fundamentally different beliefs and values make compromise extremely difficult to achieve.","translation":"兩個政黨在經濟政策上存在著很大的鴻溝。他們在基本信念和價值觀上的根本差異使得妥協極其困難。","word":"gulf"}},"gymnasium":{"createdAt":1783391419405,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"gymnasium是一個裝有運動設備的室內設施，用於進行體育活動和訓練。","options":["cafeteria","library","gymnasium","auditorium"],"sentence":"After school, Maria went to the ______ to practice her volleyball skills with the team. The large indoor facility had multiple courts and modern equipment for all the athletes.","translation":"放學後，瑪麗亞去體育館和隊伍一起練習排球技能。這個寬敞的室內設施有多個場地和所有運動員的現代設備。","word":"gymnasium"}},"habit":{"createdAt":1783324813336,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"habit 是指人們經常重複進行的行為或慣例，通過長期實踐而形成，成為日常生活的自動部分。","options":["hobby","habit","interest","talent"],"sentence":"Exercising every morning has become a strong ______ for many people. Without this routine practice repeated daily over months, they feel something is missing from their day.","translation":"每天早上運動已經成為許多人的強烈習慣。如果沒有這個日復一日重複進行數個月的例行公事，他們會感到一天少了什麼。","word":"habit"}},"habitat":{"createdAt":1783419779304,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"habitat 指動植物生活和生長的地方，題目中指大熊貓生活的竹林環境。","options":["diet","habitat","predator","migration"],"sentence":"The giant panda's natural ______ is the bamboo forests of central China. Without protecting these forests, the species would lose its primary food source and shelter.","translation":"大熊貓的自然棲息地是中國中部的竹林。如果不保護這些森林，該物種將失去其主要食物來源和棲所。","word":"habitat"}},"habitual":{"createdAt":1781484415234,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"habitual意指習慣性的或通常的，表示經常重複發生的行為或傾向。","options":["occasional","rare","habitual","sudden"],"sentence":"His ______ tardiness had become a serious problem at work, and his boss finally gave him a warning. He arrived late to meetings almost every single day without fail.","translation":"他習慣性的遲到已經成為工作中的一個嚴重問題，他的老闆最終給了他一個警告。他幾乎每天都毫無例外地遲到開會。","word":"habitual"}},"halfway":{"createdAt":1785424294406,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"halfway（中途；一半的距離）表示在進行過程的中間或某段距離的一半處，在這句中指的是看電影進展到中間位置。","options":["entirely","halfway","quickly","slowly"],"sentence":"We were ______ through the movie when the power went out. We had watched about ninety minutes of the two-hour film before the electricity stopped.","translation":"當停電時，我們已經看到電影的中途。在停電之前，我們已經看了這部兩小時電影的約九十分鐘。","word":"halfway"}},"halt":{"createdAt":1784855445794,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"halt 意為「停止、中止」，指使某項活動或過程暫停或終止。","options":["continue","progress","halt","accelerate"],"sentence":"The construction project had to ______ due to unexpected structural problems discovered during inspection. Work would not resume until the issues were fully resolved.","translation":"由於檢查過程中發現的意外結構問題，建築項目必須停止。在問題完全解決之前，工作不會恢復。","word":"halt"}},"hamper":{"createdAt":1782170870875,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"hamper是動詞，意思是阻礙或妨礙某事的進行，通常表示造成困難或延遲。","options":["promote","enhance","hamper","celebrate"],"sentence":"Bad weather conditions could seriously ______ the outdoor concert scheduled for next Saturday. The organizers are already considering moving the event indoors if rain is forecasted.","translation":"惡劣的天氣條件可能會嚴重妨礙定於下週六舉辦的戶外音樂會。如果預測會下雨，組織者已經考慮將活動改到室內進行。","word":"hamper"}},"handcrafted":{"createdAt":1784259020517,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"handcrafted 指由手工藝人親手製作的工藝品，通常具有獨特性和高品質","options":["mass-produced","handcrafted","industrial","factory-made"],"sentence":"The jewelry store sold ______ rings that were made by skilled artisans one at a time. Each piece took weeks to complete and was unique.","translation":"這家珠寶店銷售由熟練工匠逐件手工製作的戒指。每件作品花費數週完成，且獨一無二。","word":"handcrafted"}},"handful":{"createdAt":1783499119089,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"handful 表示一把或一手所能握住的量，用來描述可以用手掌握住的小量物品","options":["bucket","handful","pile","bag"],"sentence":"She grabbed a ______ of popcorn from the bowl. The small amount fit perfectly in the palm of her hand.","translation":"她從碗裡抓了一把爆米花。這小量剛好放在她的手心裡。","word":"handful"}},"handicap":{"createdAt":1781451343287,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"障礙是指阻止或延遲進展的因素，表示一個人必須克服的困難或缺陷。","options":["advantage","achievement","handicap","skill"],"sentence":"His lack of formal education was a significant ______ in his career advancement. However, through determination and self-study, he managed to overcome this limitation and achieve success.","translation":"他缺乏正規教育是他職業發展中的一個重大障礙。然而，通過決心和自學，他設法克服了這一限制並取得了成功。","word":"handicap"}},"handicraft":{"createdAt":1784092177150,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"handicraft 是名詞，指手工藝或手工製作的藝術品，強調通過手工技巧而非機器製造的工藝品。","options":["machinery","handicraft","blueprint","factory"],"sentence":"She spent three months creating a beautiful ______ from hand-woven fabric and traditional embroidery. The piece was entirely made by hand without any machine assistance.","translation":"她花了三個月時間用手織布料和傳統刺繡創作了一件美麗的____。這件作品完全是手工製作的，沒有任何機器幫助。","word":"handicraft"}},"handle":{"createdAt":1785282834743,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"handle在這裡是名詞，表示名字或名稱，特別是指人使用的假名、昵稱或識別代稱，用來在系統或記錄中查找信息。","options":["weapon","handle","clue","motive"],"sentence":"The detective needed a ______ to identify the criminal in the database. When she entered the suspect's alias into the system, the record immediately appeared with all his known information.","translation":"偵探需要一個名字來在資料庫中識別罪犯。當她將嫌疑人的化名輸入系統時，該記錄立即出現，並顯示了他所有已知的信息。","word":"handle"}},"handle_s":{"createdAt":1784855445791,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"handle's 是 handle（把手、柄）的所有格形式，用來表示把手所屬的物體。","options":["lid's","handle's","bottom's","side's"],"sentence":"The pot's ______ was too hot to touch without protection. We had to use a cloth or oven mitt because the metal had been heating on the stove.","translation":"鍋子的把手太燙了，無法直接觸摸。我們必須用布或烤箱手套，因為金屬一直在爐子上加熱。","word":"handle's"}},"hang":{"createdAt":1783505303425,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"hang表示懸掛或垂下，指將物體固定在高處使其懸空","options":["fall","break","hang","sit"],"sentence":"The picture frame needs to ______ on the wall above the sofa. We'll use a strong nail and level to make sure it's perfectly straight.","translation":"這個相框需要掛在沙發上方的牆上。我們會用一根結實的釘子和水準儀來確保它完全筆直。","word":"hang"}},"harass":{"createdAt":1786432553904,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"harass 意思是持續地騷擾、煩擾或困擾某人，通常透過重複的不受歡迎的行動或言語。","options":["assist","harass","compliment","support"],"sentence":"The angry customer continued to ______ the store manager with repeated complaints and rude phone calls. The manager eventually reported the behavior to the police because it had become a pattern of unwanted, aggressive conduct.","translation":"那位憤怒的顧客持續用反覆的投訴和粗魯的電話來騷擾店經理。經理最終向警察報告了這種行為，因為它已經成為了一種不受歡迎的、具有攻擊性的行為模式。","word":"harass"}},"harassment":{"createdAt":1783760526712,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"harassment指對他人進行騷擾或煩擾，常見於職場或人際互動中，指不受歡迎的行為造成的困擾。","options":["celebration","harassment","promotion","training"],"sentence":"The employee filed a complaint about workplace ______ after experiencing repeated unwanted comments. The HR department took immediate action because such behavior violates company policy and makes the work environment hostile.","translation":"員工在經歷重複不受歡迎的評論後，對職場騷擾提出投訴。人力資源部採取了立即行動，因為這種行為違反了公司政策，並使工作環境變得充滿敵意。","word":"harassment"}},"harbor":{"createdAt":1783068339348,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"harbor 作名詞表示港口或避難所，是船隻停泊的安全地方","options":["ocean","harbor","reef","island"],"sentence":"The ship sailed safely into the ______ to escape the storm. The protected waters provided shelter and safety for the crew.","translation":"船隻安全地駛入港口以躲避風暴。受保護的水域為船員提供了庇護和安全。","word":"harbor"}},"hard":{"createdAt":1783419779305,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"hard 作為形容詞表示堅硬的、不易破損的，題目中描述岩石的物理特性很堅固。","options":["soft","heavy","hard","hot"],"sentence":"The rock was so ______ that the drill bit could not penetrate its surface. It took several days of continuous effort to make any progress cutting through it.","translation":"那塊岩石是如此堅硬，以至於鑽頭無法穿透其表面。花了好幾天的持續努力才能取得任何進展切穿它。","word":"hard"}},"harden":{"createdAt":1784553922297,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"harden 表示使某物變硬或變堅硬，在這裡指陶器在高溫下逐漸變得堅固。","options":["soften","harden","cool","dry"],"sentence":"The pottery needs to ______ in the kiln at high temperature for several hours. Once it reaches the proper hardness, it will be strong enough to hold liquids without breaking.","translation":"陶器需要在高溫窯中硬化數小時。一旦達到適當的硬度，它就會足夠堅硬，可以盛裝液體而不會破裂。","word":"harden"}},"hardly":{"createdAt":1783558795712,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hardly 副詞表示幾乎不、勉強才能，用來表達某事發生的程度很低。","options":["easily","hardly","probably","usually"],"sentence":"After working for twelve hours straight, Maria could ______ keep her eyes open. She fell asleep the moment her head touched the pillow.","translation":"連續工作了十二個小時後，瑪麗亞幾乎睜不開眼睛。她的頭剛一碰到枕頭就立刻睡著了。","word":"hardly"}},"hardship":{"createdAt":1784259020520,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hardship 指艱辛、困難的生活處境或遭遇的痛苦","options":["success","hardship","opportunity","blessing"],"sentence":"The family faced severe ______ when the factory closed and the father lost his job. They struggled to pay rent and buy food for months.","translation":"當工廠關閉父親失業時，這個家庭面臨了嚴重的困難。他們為期數月地掙扎著支付房租和購買食物。","word":"hardship"}},"harm":{"createdAt":1783661880050,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"harm 作為名詞表示傷害或損害，與第二句中的 damage 一致，描述吸菸的負面影響。","options":["benefit","harm","improvement","growth"],"sentence":"Smoking can cause significant ______ to your lungs and heart. Years of research have proven that tobacco products damage vital organs.","translation":"吸菸會對你的肺和心臟造成重大傷害。多年的研究已證明菸草製品會損害重要器官。","word":"harm"}},"harmful":{"createdAt":1781532967169,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"harmful 表示有害的，與「造成嚴重疾病」和「危險習慣」的描述相符。","options":["beneficial","harmful","neutral","helpful"],"sentence":"Smoking cigarettes is very ______ to your health and can cause serious diseases. Doctors strongly advise people to quit this dangerous habit.","translation":"吸煙對你的健康______(有害)，可能導致嚴重疾病。醫生強烈建議人們戒掉這個危險的習慣。","word":"harmful"}},"harmless":{"createdAt":1783566294556,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"harmless表示無害的或不會造成傷害的，是形容詞，用來描述沒有危險性的事物。","options":["dangerous","harmless","small","harmful"],"sentence":"The scientist assured us that the small spider we found was completely ______. It had no venom and could not bite humans under any circumstances.","translation":"科學家向我們保證，我們發現的小蜘蛛完全無害。它沒有毒液，在任何情況下都不能咬人。","word":"harmless"}},"harmonious":{"createdAt":1781437013476,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"harmonious 形容事物協調一致、和睦融洽的狀態，特別是指沒有衝突和爭執的關係。","options":["competitive","chaotic","harmonious","isolated"],"sentence":"The community garden created a ______ environment where neighbors from different backgrounds worked together peacefully. Volunteers from various ethnic groups collaborated on planting and harvesting without any conflicts.","translation":"社區花園創造了一個和諧的環境，來自不同背景的鄰居和平地一起工作。來自各個民族的志願者在種植和收穫過程中毫無衝突地合作。","word":"harmonious"}},"harmony":{"createdAt":1781667024984,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"harmony是指各部分協調一致的狀態，在音樂中指不同聲部的和諧配合。","options":["melody","harmony","rhythm","tempo"],"sentence":"The orchestra played in perfect ______ with each instrument blending beautifully. The conductor praised the musicians for their ability to work together without any conflicting sounds.","translation":"樂隊以完美的協調演奏，每件樂器都融合得很好。指揮讚揚了音樂家能夠一起工作而沒有任何不協調聲音的能力。","word":"harmony"}},"harness":{"createdAt":1783426292405,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"harness作為動詞表示控制並利用某種力量或資源，使其為人類目的服務。","options":["waste","harness","ignore","destroy"],"sentence":"The engineer worked to ______ the power of renewable energy sources for the city's electricity needs. By installing solar panels and wind turbines, they could effectively utilize these natural resources.","translation":"工程師致力於利用可再生能源的力量來滿足城市的電力需求。通過安裝太陽能電板和風力發電機，他們能有效地利用這些自然資源。","word":"harness"}},"harsh":{"createdAt":1781798927525,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"harsh 形容言詞或態度嚴厲、刺耳或令人不快，帶有冷酷的質感。","options":["gentle","harsh","silent","brief"],"sentence":"The teacher's ______ criticism of the student's essay was difficult to accept. She pointed out every spelling error, grammar mistake, and logical flaw in a cold, cutting manner.","translation":"老師對學生論文的尖銳批評很難接受。她以冷酷、尖刻的方式指出每一個拼寫錯誤、語法錯誤和邏輯缺陷。","word":"harsh"}},"harvest":{"createdAt":1781345746903,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"harvest 作名詞，指農作物的收穫或收成，通常是農業活動的成果。","options":["drought","harvest","planting","irrigation"],"sentence":"The farmers celebrated the end of summer with a bountiful ______. The fields yielded more crops than they had expected, ensuring food security for the entire region.","translation":"農民們用豐收來慶祝夏季的結束。田地產出的農作物比預期更多，確保了整個地區的糧食安全。","word":"harvest"}},"haste":{"createdAt":1781332009071,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"haste 意為匆忙或急促，通常導致粗心或錯誤","options":["care","haste","precision","planning"],"sentence":"In their ______, the workers made several mistakes on the construction site. If they had taken their time and worked more carefully, the errors could have been avoided.","translation":"在匆忙中，工人在建築工地上犯了幾個錯誤。如果他們花時間並更加小心地工作，這些錯誤是可以避免的。","word":"haste"}},"hasten":{"createdAt":1783661880052,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hasten 作為動詞表示催促或加快速度，與第二句中「時間快不夠了」和「快速準備」的語境相符。","options":["delay","hasten","skip","postpone"],"sentence":"The coach urged the athletes to ______ their training sessions before the competition. Time was running out, and they needed to prepare quickly.","translation":"教練敦促運動員在比賽前加快他們的訓練課程。時間快不夠了，他們需要快速準備。","word":"hasten"}},"hasty":{"createdAt":1784259020519,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hasty 指匆忙的、輕率的、沒有充分考慮的行為或決定","options":["bold","hasty","courageous","confident"],"sentence":"His ______ decision to quit his job without another offer lined up was a mistake. He should have thought it through more carefully.","translation":"他倉促決定辭職而沒有另外的工作機會是一個錯誤。他應該更仔細地思考。","word":"hasty"}},"hatch":{"createdAt":1781427134899,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"hatch在此指秘密策劃或準備一個計劃或陰謀。","options":["discover","analyze","hatch","report"],"sentence":"The spy agency spent months planning to ______ a secret operation against their rivals. By the time the plot was discovered, the operatives were already in position.","translation":"間諜機構花了數個月時間策劃一項針對敵手的秘密行動。當陰謀被發現時，特務已經就位了。","word":"hatch"}},"hatred":{"createdAt":1784355209445,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"hatred是指對某人或某事物的強烈厭惡和敵意，表示極端的負面情感。","options":["friendship","curiosity","hatred","indifference"],"sentence":"After years of conflict, the two nations developed a deep ______ for each other. This intense negative emotion had grown so strong that even peaceful negotiations seemed impossible.","translation":"經過多年的衝突後，這兩個國家對彼此產生了深深的仇恨。這種強烈的負面情感已經根深蒂固，甚至和平談判似乎都不可能了。","word":"hatred"}},"haunt":{"createdAt":1783670406867,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"haunt 表示某事物經常或反覆困擾、折磨某人，使其心理上無法擺脫。","options":["encourage","forget","haunt","inspire"],"sentence":"The memory of his failure in the competition continued to ______ him long after the event had ended. Years later, he still woke up at night thinking about the mistakes he had made.","translation":"比賽失敗的記憶在事件結束很久後仍然繼續困擾著他。多年後，他仍然會在夜裡醒來思考自己犯的錯誤。","word":"haunt"}},"hazard":{"createdAt":1781709890955,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"hazard指的是可能導致傷害、損失或危險的人物、情況或物質。","options":["implication","engagement","hazard","braided"],"sentence":"Working with heavy machinery without proper training presents a serious ______ to worker safety. The factory manager implemented strict protocols to minimize the risk of accidents and injuries.","translation":"在沒有適當訓練的情況下操作重型機械對工人的安全造成了嚴重的危害。工廠經理實施了嚴格的協議來最小化事故和傷害的風險。","word":"hazard"}},"hazardous":{"createdAt":1784785122864,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hazardous 是形容詞，意思是「危險的；有害的」，通常用來描述可能造成傷害、損害或風險的情況或物質。","options":["beneficial","hazardous","productive","straightforward"],"sentence":"Working with chemicals in the laboratory can be ______ if proper safety equipment is not used. The company requires all employees to wear protective gear and follow strict protocols to minimize the risk of injury or illness.","translation":"在實驗室中處理化學物質如果不使用適當的安全設備可能是危險的。公司要求所有員工穿戴防護裝備並遵循嚴格的協議以將受傷或生病的風險降至最低。","word":"hazardous"}},"headlong":{"createdAt":1787411857555,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"headlong 表示以不顧後果、衝動的方式行動，或者頭朝下地快速移動，通常帶有危險或魯莽的含義。","options":["carefully","headlong","slowly","gracefully"],"sentence":"The frightened horse ran ______ down the steep hill without stopping. Its reckless speed and complete lack of control made the situation extremely dangerous.","translation":"那隻受驚的馬沒有停止地魯莽地衝下陡峭的山坡。牠的不顧一切的速度和完全失控的狀態使情況變得極其危險。","word":"headlong"}},"headphone":{"createdAt":1782134503214,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"headphone 是名詞，指個人用來聽音樂或語音的耳機設備，通常只有使用者本人能聽到聲音。","options":["microphone","speaker","headphone","monitor"],"sentence":"I need to wear a ______ to listen to the music without disturbing others in the library. The device connects wirelessly to my smartphone via Bluetooth.","translation":"我需要戴著耳機在圖書館裡聽音樂，以免打擾他人。該設備通過藍牙無線連接到我的智慧型手機。","word":"headphone"}},"heal":{"createdAt":1785736945267,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"heal 是動詞，意思是治療或痊癒，用來描述身體傷口或疾病逐漸恢復的過程。","options":["hurt","heal","break","fade"],"sentence":"After the surgery, it will take several weeks for the wound to ______. The doctor prescribed antibiotics to prevent infection and speed up the recovery process.","translation":"手術後，傷口需要幾週的時間才能痊癒。醫生開了抗生素來預防感染並加快恢復過程。","word":"heal"}},"healthcare":{"createdAt":1781841505535,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"healthcare 是指醫療保健系統和服務，涵蓋了預防、治療和健康管理的各個方面。","options":["anthem","healthcare","wonder","legendary"],"sentence":"Many developed countries provide free ______ to all their citizens as a basic public service. The government funds hospitals, clinics, and medicines to ensure everyone can access medical treatment.","translation":"許多發達國家為所有公民提供免費的醫療保健作為基本公共服務。政府資助醫院、診所和藥物，以確保每個人都能獲得醫療治療。","word":"healthcare"}},"healthful":{"createdAt":1781693270387,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"healthful表示「有益健康的、促進健康的」，用來描述對身體有好處的飲食、習慣或生活方式。","options":["toxic","harmful","restrictive","healthful"],"sentence":"The nutritionist recommended a ______ diet full of vegetables, fruits, and whole grains. She emphasized that these foods would strengthen his immune system and boost his energy levels.","translation":"營養師推薦一種有益健康的飲食，充滿蔬菜、水果和全穀物。她強調這些食物會增強他的免疫系統並提升他的能量水平。","word":"healthful"}},"heartwarming":{"createdAt":1783613053038,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"heartwarming 是形容詞，表示「溫暖人心的」，用來描述能引發人們情感溫暖和積極情感反應的事物。","options":["heartwarming","confusing","entertaining","lengthy"],"sentence":"The story about the elderly couple reuniting after fifty years was truly ______. Many readers said they felt touched by the genuine love and devotion displayed between them.","translation":"關於老年夫妻分離五十年後重聚的故事確實溫暖人心。許多讀者說他們被他們之間展現的真摯愛意和忠誠所感動。","word":"heartwarming"}},"heaven":{"createdAt":1782373576500,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"heaven 指極樂或天國的狀態，用來形容達到理想、完美或極其幸福的境界","options":["struggle","heaven","confusion","regret"],"sentence":"After years of hard work, finally achieving her dream felt like ______. She had reached a state of perfect peace and ultimate contentment.","translation":"經過多年的辛苦工作，終於實現夢想感覺像天堂。她已經達到了完美的平靜和最終的滿足。","word":"heaven"}},"height":{"createdAt":1783747867969,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"height 是指垂直向上的距離或程度，用來測量物體從底部到頂部的垂直距離。","options":["width","height","length","depth"],"sentence":"The airplane reached a ______ of 10,000 meters above sea level. Passengers could see the clouds far below them as they climbed higher into the sky.","translation":"飛機達到海平面上方10,000米的高度。當乘客們爬升到更高的天空時，他們可以看到遠下方的雲層。","word":"height"}},"heighten":{"createdAt":1784016923078,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"heighten 意為增強、加強，指使某事物的程度、強度或效果變得更高或更大。","options":["reduce","heighten","ignore","conclude"],"sentence":"The dramatic music was designed to ______ the tension in the film. As the soundtrack grew louder and more intense, the audience felt increasingly nervous.","translation":"戲劇性的音樂旨在增強電影中的緊張氣氛。隨著配樂變得越來越響亮和激烈，觀眾感到越來越緊張。","word":"heighten"}},"heir":{"createdAt":1782883637401,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"heir特指法律上或血統上確定的繼承人，尤其是指將要繼承財產、地位或權力的人。","options":["relative","heir","prince","successor"],"sentence":"The king's oldest son is the ______ to the throne. When the monarch passes away, this person will inherit the crown and all royal responsibilities.","translation":"國王的長子是王位的繼承人。當君主去世時，這個人將繼承王冠和所有皇家責任。","word":"heir"}},"heist":{"createdAt":1782533789137,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"heist 名詞意思是搶劫或盜竊，特別指計畫周密的大規模盜竊行為。","options":["purchase","heist","auction","transaction"],"sentence":"The ______ of the valuable diamonds from the museum was the largest theft in the city's history. Thieves disabled the security system and escaped with over ten million dollars worth of jewels.","translation":"從博物館盜竊貴重鑽石的搶劫是該市歷史上最大的盜竊案。小偷禁用了安全系統並逃離了價值超過一千萬美元的珠寶。","word":"heist"}},"held":{"createdAt":1784259020517,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"held 是 hold 的過去式，表示舉行、進行某項活動或會議","options":["cancelled","held","postponed","delayed"],"sentence":"The company ______ its annual meeting in the grand ballroom last week. More than five hundred employees attended the event.","translation":"該公司上週在豪華宴會廳舉行了年度會議。超過五百名員工出席了該活動。","word":"held"}},"herb":{"createdAt":1784855445789,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"herb 指香草或藥草，通常用於烹飪或製作藥物的芳香植物。","options":["flower","herb","vegetable","fruit"],"sentence":"She picked fresh ______ from her garden to make herbal tea. Basil, mint, and thyme are common plants used for flavoring and medicinal purposes.","translation":"她從花園裡摘新鮮的香草製作草本茶。羅勒、薄荷和百里香是常用於調味和藥用的植物。","word":"herb"}},"herd":{"createdAt":1781836375379,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"herd是畜群，特別是指牛、羊或其他大型家畜的一群。","options":["pack","herd","flock","school"],"sentence":"The cowboys guided a large ______ of cattle across the prairie toward the market. Hundreds of animals moved together in a coordinated group.","translation":"牛仔們引導一大群牛穿過草原前往市場。數百隻動物協調地聚集在一起移動。","word":"herd"}},"heritage":{"createdAt":1782292205388,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"heritage指的是從前人或歷史中繼承下來的文化、傳統或物質財富，強調其歷史和代際傳承的意義。","options":["collection","heritage","museum","treasure"],"sentence":"The family's ______ includes priceless paintings and manuscripts passed down through generations. These items represent the artistic and cultural legacy that ancestors carefully preserved for their descendants.","translation":"這個家族的遺產包括世代相傳的無價繪畫和手稿。這些物品代表祖先為後代精心保存的藝術和文化遺產。","word":"heritage"}},"heroic":{"createdAt":1781848330188,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"heroic表示表現出英勇、勇敢或非凡勇氣的行為，或需要花費巨大努力的壯舉。","options":["cowardly","heroic","lazy","reckless"],"sentence":"The firefighter's ______ efforts to rescue the child from the burning building earned him widespread praise. Despite the extreme danger and personal risk, he refused to give up until everyone was safe.","translation":"消防員從燃燒的建築物中救出孩子的英勇努力獲得了廣泛讚揚。儘管面臨極端危險和個人風險，他拒絕放棄直到每個人都安全。","word":"heroic"}},"heroin":{"createdAt":1786014229148,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"海洛因是一種高度成癮的違法麻醉毒品，通常以粉末形式存在，被認為是最危險的毒品之一。","options":["marijuana","heroin","alcohol","caffeine"],"sentence":"The police arrested the drug dealer who was trafficking ______ across the border. The substance is one of the most addictive and dangerous illegal drugs in the world.","translation":"警察逮捕了走私海洛因過境的毒品販子。這種物質是世界上最具成癮性和危險性的非法毒品之一。","word":"heroin"}},"hesitate":{"createdAt":1784461445001,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hesitate（猶豫；遲疑）表示在做出決定或採取行動前出現的不確定或遲疑狀態。","options":["answer","hesitate","volunteer","decide"],"sentence":"When the teacher asked for volunteers, Maria began to ______ before slowly raising her hand. Her pause showed that she was uncertain about whether she should speak up in front of the whole class.","translation":"當老師要求志願者時，瑪麗亞開始猶豫，然後慢慢地舉起了手。她的停頓顯示她不確定自己是否應該在全班同學面前發言。","word":"hesitate"}},"hesitation":{"createdAt":1781709890954,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"hesitation指的是在做決定或採取行動前的遲疑或猶豫，表示缺乏確定性或信心。","options":["obsession","hazard","hesitation","implication"],"sentence":"Without any ______, he immediately accepted the job offer from the international company. His quick decision surprised everyone who expected him to take time to think about such a major career move.","translation":"他毫不猶豫地立即接受了那家國際公司的工作邀約。他的快速決定讓所有人感到驚訝，因為他們預期他會花時間考慮這樣的重大職業轉變。","word":"hesitation"}},"hid":{"createdAt":1782094693730,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"躲藏是指把自己隱藏起來，使他人看不見。","options":["ran","hid","walked","climbed"],"sentence":"The child ______ behind the tree during the game of hide-and-seek. She remained very still and quiet until the seeker finally found her.","translation":"孩子在捉迷藏遊戲中躲在樹後。她保持非常靜止和安靜，直到尋找者最終找到了她。","word":"hid"}},"hide":{"createdAt":1783841501541,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hide 表示隱藏或遮蔽某物，使其不被看見或發現，在這個句子中指將日記藏起來以防止他人發現。","options":["reveal","hide","display","share"],"sentence":"She decided to ______ her diary under the mattress so no one could find it. Her brother had a habit of reading her private thoughts, so she needed a secure place to keep her secrets safe from him.","translation":"她決定把日記藏在床墊下面，這樣沒有人能找到它。她的哥哥有閱讀她私人想法的習慣，所以她需要一個安全的地方來保護她的秘密不被他發現。","word":"hide"}},"hideaway":{"createdAt":1781709984200,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hideaway 名詞指隱秘的地方或逃避處，人們可以在那裡躲避世界、獨自享受時光。","options":["resort","hideaway","retreat","shelter"],"sentence":"The old cottage in the mountains served as a perfect ______ for the family seeking peace and solitude. They could escape from the busy city life and enjoy nature for weeks without interruption.","translation":"山裡的這棟老房子是尋求和平與寧靜的家庭的完美隱匿處。他們可以逃離繁忙的城市生活，享受數週的自然，不受打擾。","word":"hideaway"}},"hierarchy":{"createdAt":1781848330186,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hierarchy是組織系統中按權力、地位或重要性排列的等級結構。","options":["schedule","hierarchy","budget","conflict"],"sentence":"The company has a strict ______ that determines who reports to whom. The CEO sits at the top, followed by department heads, then managers, and finally regular employees at the bottom.","translation":"這家公司有嚴格的等級制度來決定誰向誰報告。首席執行官位居最高層，其次是部門主管、經理，最後是普通員工。","word":"hierarchy"}},"highlight":{"createdAt":1785131930569,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"highlight 作為動詞，意思是使某事物引起注意或強調其重要性，通常通過視覺上或言語上使其突出。","options":["ignore","highlight","describe","document"],"sentence":"The tour guide decided to ______ the most beautiful artwork in the museum by placing special lighting around it. Visitors were immediately drawn to that particular piece because it stood out from everything else on display.","translation":"導遊決定在博物館裡最美的藝術品周圍放置特殊照明來強調它。遊客立即被那件特別的作品吸引，因為它在展示的所有東西中脫穎而出。","word":"highlight"}},"hijack":{"createdAt":1781402154557,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hijack表示非法奪取和控制交通工具（如飛機、船隻）或貨物，通常涉及暴力或威脅。","options":["compel","hijack","possess","lottery"],"sentence":"Terrorists attempted to ______ the airplane and divert it to an undisclosed location. Fortunately, the pilot managed to alert authorities, and fighter jets intercepted the aircraft before it could change course.","translation":"恐怖分子試圖劫持飛機並將其轉向未公開的地點。幸運的是，飛行員成功警告了當局，戰鬥機在飛機改變路線前攔截了它。","word":"hijack"}},"hinder":{"createdAt":1784855445794,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"hinder 意為「妨礙、阻撓」，指阻止或延遲某事的進展或完成。","options":["assist","facilitate","hinder","support"],"sentence":"The heavy snow would ______ our travel plans if the roads became impassable. We might need to postpone our trip to the mountains.","translation":"如果道路變得無法通行，大雪會妨礙我們的旅行計劃。我們可能需要推遲前往山區的旅行。","word":"hinder"}},"hindrance":{"createdAt":1783944768439,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hindrance 是名詞，指妨礙或阻止進展的事物或情況。","options":["benefit","hindrance","advantage","support"],"sentence":"Lack of funding was a major ______ to the team's ability to complete the project on time. Without sufficient resources, they had to delay their work by several months.","translation":"缺乏資金是團隊按時完成項目的主要障礙。沒有充足的資源，他們不得不將工作延遲數個月。","word":"hindrance"}},"hippopotomonstrosesquippedaliophobia":{"createdAt":1783489104904,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"對長單詞的恐懼是一種心理恐懼症，患者害怕或焦慮於復雜、冗長的詞彙。","options":["curiosity","hippopotomonstrosesquippedaliophobia","enthusiasm","confidence"],"sentence":"His ______ made reading dictionaries and academic papers extremely challenging. Even attempting to pronounce lengthy medical terms would trigger his anxiety.","translation":"他對長單詞的恐懼使得閱讀字典和學術論文極其困難。甚至試著發音冗長的醫學術語都會引發他的焦慮。","word":"hippopotomonstrosesquippedaliophobia"}},"hitler":{"createdAt":1784899764066,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Hitler是指阿道夫·希特勒，納粹德國的領導人，20世紀最具破壞性的歷史人物之一。","options":["Churchill","Hitler","Stalin","Mussolini"],"sentence":"_______ was the dictator who led Nazi Germany during World War II. His regime was responsible for the Holocaust and millions of deaths.","translation":"希特勒是在第二次世界大戰期間領導納粹德國的獨裁者。他的政權對大屠殺和數百萬人死亡負責。","word":"Hitler"}},"hoarse":{"createdAt":1781693275429,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"嘶啞用來形容聲音沙啞、粗糙或沙沙的狀態，通常是由於過度使用或喉嚨不適引起的。","options":["loud","hoarse","clear","strong"],"sentence":"After shouting at the concert all night, the singer's voice became ______. She could barely whisper the next morning and had to cancel her interviews.","translation":"在演唱會上整晚尖叫後，歌手的嗓音變得嘶啞。她隔天早上幾乎無法低聲說話，不得不取消她的採訪。","word":"hoarse"}},"hoax":{"createdAt":1782637076483,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hoax 是騙局或惡作劇的意思，指故意欺騙或製造的虛假信息。","options":["investigation","hoax","documentary","report"],"sentence":"The news report about a meteor hitting the city was revealed to be a ______ when journalists discovered it was completely fabricated. The pranksters had created fake evidence to trick the public.","translation":"關於隕石撞擊城市的新聞報導被揭露為一場騙局，因為記者發現它完全是虛構的。惡作劇者創造了假證據來欺騙公眾。","word":"hoax"}},"hog":{"createdAt":1788028661425,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"hog 作為動詞是「獨佔或貪心地拿取」的意思，指一個人自私地占有所有東西。","options":["hog","share","prepare","display"],"sentence":"The greedy teenager would ______ all the snacks whenever guests came over, eating them before anyone else had a chance. His parents were embarrassed by his selfish behavior.","translation":"貪心的青少年每當有客人來時就獨佔所有零食，在其他人有機會吃之前就吃完了。他的父母為他自私的行為感到尷尬。","word":"hog"}},"hold":{"createdAt":1781515634900,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「hold」在這裡表示用手抓握或支撐某物，使其保持在原位。","options":["drop","hold","throw","catch"],"sentence":"Please ______ this box while I open the door. I need you to keep it steady with both hands until I return.","translation":"請你握住這個盒子，我去開門。我需要你用雙手保持它穩定直到我回來。","word":"hold"}},"holder":{"createdAt":1782187611208,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"holder 指的是持有或保有某物的人，特別是指保有某個位置、頭銜或所有權的人。","options":["winner","holder","player","coach"],"sentence":"The trophy ______ stood on the championship podium, proudly displaying the award he had won. He was announced as the current champion who held the title for the past three consecutive years.","translation":"獎盃持有者站在冠軍領獎台上，自豪地展示著他贏得的獎項。他被宣佈為過去三年連續保有該頭銜的現任冠軍。","word":"holder"}},"hollow":{"createdAt":1783566294548,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"hollow表示空心的或中間是空的洞穴，可用作名詞表示凹陷處或山谷。","options":["branch","hole","hollow","trunk"],"sentence":"The old tree had a large ______ in its trunk where birds built their nests. We could see straight through the empty space from one side to the other.","translation":"那棵老樹的樹幹上有一個很大的空洞，鳥兒在裡面築巢。我們可以從一邊看穿空心的地方到另一邊。","word":"hollow"}},"homogeneous":{"createdAt":1787118100429,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"homogeneous 指的是成分相同的、由相似元素組成的，與多樣性相反。","options":["diverse","homogeneous","international","colorful"],"sentence":"The classroom population was remarkably ______, with all students sharing the same ethnic background and socioeconomic status. This lack of diversity concerned the school administration.","translation":"這個教室的人口構成是非常同質的，所有學生都有相同的種族背景和社會經濟地位。這種缺乏多樣性的情況令學校管理部門感到擔憂。","word":"homogeneous"}},"honor":{"createdAt":1782637076487,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"honor 作為動詞時意為表示敬意、尊敬或使增光，表達對某人成就的尊重和認可。","options":["celebrate","honor","interview","remember"],"sentence":"The university decided to ______ the Nobel Prize winner with a special ceremony and honorary degree. This recognition celebrated his extraordinary scientific contributions.","translation":"大學決定用特別儀式和榮譽學位來尊崇這位諾貝爾獎得主。這項表彰慶祝了他非凡的科學貢獻。","word":"honor"}},"honorable":{"createdAt":1783516186778,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"honorable 是指具有高尚品德、正直、值得尊敬和信任的人或行為。","options":["cowardly","treacherous","honorable","selfish"],"sentence":"The ______ soldier refused to abandon his comrades even when ordered to retreat. His integrity and dedication to duty were beyond question.","translation":"那位品德高尚的士兵即使被命令撤退也拒絕放棄他的戰友。他的正直和對職責的奉獻是毋庸置疑的。","word":"honorable"}},"honorary":{"createdAt":1782637076491,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"honorary 是榮譽的、名譽的意思，指作為對某人成就或地位的表彰而授予的稱號或頭銜。","options":["advanced","honorary","temporary","provisional"],"sentence":"The university president presented the distinguished scientist with an ______ doctorate at the graduation ceremony. Although not a degree for academic study, it recognized his lifetime of scientific achievements.","translation":"大學校長在畢業典禮上為傑出科學家頒發了榮譽博士學位。雖然不是學位課程所得，但它認可了他一生的科學成就。","word":"honorary"}},"hook":{"createdAt":1783685028738,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hook是指彎曲的金屬工具，用於懸掛物品或捕捉魚類，具有鉤狀的形狀。","options":["net","hook","trap","bait"],"sentence":"The fisherman cast his line with a ______ at the end to catch the fish. The sharp metal curve was perfectly designed to pierce the fish's mouth and secure it.","translation":"漁夫投出帶著鉤的釣線來捕魚。這個尖銳的金屬彎曲物完美地設計用來刺穿魚的嘴巴並將其固定住。","word":"hook"}},"horizon":{"createdAt":1787135117494,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"horizon是指地平線，即天空和地面或海水相交的視覺邊界線，標誌著我們能看到的最遠距離。","options":["sky","water","horizon","cloud"],"sentence":"As the ship sailed further out to sea, the captain watched the sun sink below the ______. The boundary between the sky and ocean water continued to recede into the distance.","translation":"當船進一步駛入大海時，船長看著太陽沉入地平線。天空和海水之間的邊界線繼續延伸到遠方。","word":"horizon"}},"horizontal":{"createdAt":1784855445792,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"horizontal 意為「水平的」，指與地面平行或左右方向的線條或面。","options":["vertical","diagonal","horizontal","curved"],"sentence":"The artist drew a ______ line across the middle of the canvas. This line ran parallel to the ground and divided the painting into an upper and lower section.","translation":"藝術家在畫布中間畫了一條水平線。這條線與地面平行，將畫作分為上下兩部分。","word":"horizontal"}},"horizontally":{"createdAt":1782475871715,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"horizontally 表示「水平地」，指平行於地面或左右方向延伸的方式","options":["vertically","diagonally","horizontally","circularly"],"sentence":"The architect drew the line ______ across the blueprint from left to right. This direction is parallel to the ground level.","translation":"建築師在藍圖上從左到右水平地畫了一條線。這個方向與地面水平。","word":"horizontally"}},"hormone":{"createdAt":1784855445793,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hormone 指荷爾蒙或激素，是體內由腺體產生的化學物質，調節生理過程。","options":["vitamin","hormone","protein","enzyme"],"sentence":"The doctor explained that her mood swings were caused by fluctuations in ______ levels during her menstrual cycle. These chemical messengers regulate many bodily functions.","translation":"醫生解釋說，她的情緒波動是由於月經週期中激素水平波動引起的。這些化學信號傳遞物質調節許多身體功能。","word":"hormone"}},"horticulture":{"createdAt":1783005778369,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"horticulture 意為「園藝」或「果蔬花卉的栽培」，指專門研究種植蔬菜、水果和花卉的學科。","options":["astronomy","architecture","horticulture","engineering"],"sentence":"She studied ______ in college and now runs a successful organic farm that grows vegetables, fruits, and flowers. Her knowledge of soil composition and plant diseases helps her maximize crop yields.","translation":"她在大學學習園藝，現在經營一個成功的有機農場，種植蔬菜、水果和花卉。她對土壤成分和植物病害的知識幫助她最大化作物產量。","word":"horticulture"}},"hose":{"createdAt":1781484415236,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hose是指軟的管狀物，通常用於運輸流體如水，常見於花園澆水。","options":["ladder","hose","fence","gate"],"sentence":"He grabbed the garden ______ to water the flowers in the backyard. The flexible rubber tube made it easy to reach all the plants and beds.","translation":"他拿起花園水管來澆灌後院的花。這條柔軟的橡膠軟管使他可以輕鬆到達所有的植物和花床。","word":"hose"}},"hospitable":{"createdAt":1781849847404,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hospitable表示好客的或招待周到的，與「準備美食和舒適住宿」的線索相符。","options":["rude","hospitable","cold","unfriendly"],"sentence":"Our hosts were very ______ and made us feel welcome from the moment we arrived. They prepared delicious food and provided comfortable accommodations.","translation":"我們的主人非常好客，從我們到達的那一刻起就讓我們感到受歡迎。他們準備了美味的食物並提供了舒適的住宿。","word":"hospitable"}},"hospitably":{"createdAt":1783741381744,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"hospitably是副詞，表示以好客和周到的方式招待客人，體現出熱情和友善的待客態度。","options":["coldly","rudely","hospitably","reluctantly"],"sentence":"The host greeted all the guests ______ with warm smiles and refreshing beverages. The visitors felt immediately welcome and comfortable in the home.","translation":"主人以溫暖的笑容和清爽的飲料好客地招待了所有客人。訪客們立即感到在家中受歡迎和舒適。","word":"hospitably"}},"hospitality":{"createdAt":1781849511876,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"熱情好客是指以友善、慷慨和殷勤的態度對待客人。","options":["efficiency","location","hospitality","cleanliness"],"sentence":"The hotel's ______ made our stay absolutely wonderful and memorable. The staff offered us complimentary snacks, warm greetings, and went out of their way to help with all our requests.","translation":"飯店的熱情好客使我們的住宿絕對精彩而難忘。員工為我們提供免費點心、溫暖的問候，並竭盡全力幫助滿足我們所有的需求。","word":"hospitality"}},"hospitalize":{"createdAt":1784855445784,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hospitalize 意為「使住院」，指將患者送入醫院接受治療和護理。","options":["treat","hospitalize","examine","diagnose"],"sentence":"The patient's condition was so serious that the doctors decided to ______ him immediately. He needed round-the-clock medical care and monitoring that could only be provided in a hospital setting.","translation":"患者的病情非常嚴重，醫生決定立即將他住院。他需要只能在醫院環境中提供的全天候醫療護理和監測。","word":"hospitalize"}},"hostage":{"createdAt":1781581925134,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hostage 指被扣押以作為談判籌碼或保證的人，通常涉及要求賠償或其他條件的情況。","options":["prisoner","hostage","captive","suspect"],"sentence":"The criminal took a ______ to negotiate with the police for safe passage out of the city. The negotiator spoke carefully to ensure the innocent person's safety throughout the standoff.","translation":"犯罪分子抓了一個人質與警察談判，以便安全離開城市。談判代表小心謹慎地說話，以確保無辜者在整個對峙中的安全。","word":"hostage"}},"hostile":{"createdAt":1783612861545,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hostile 是形容詞，意思是懷有敵意的或充滿敵對態度的，通常用來描述不友善、對抗性或充滿衝突的態度或環境。","options":["friendly","hostile","neutral","peaceful"],"sentence":"The negotiations between the two countries became increasingly ______ as tensions rose over the disputed territory. Both sides refused to cooperate, made aggressive threats, and showed no willingness to compromise.","translation":"隨著對領土爭議的緊張局勢升級，兩國之間的談判變得越來越______(敵方的；充滿敵意的)。雙方都拒絕合作，做出了激進的威脅，並表現出沒有妥協的意願。","word":"hostile"}},"hostility":{"createdAt":1781965320891,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"hostility 指的是敵意和不友好的態度，通常伴隨著對抗和衝突。","options":["friendship","cooperation","hostility","alliance"],"sentence":"The ______ between the two neighboring countries has escalated into military tensions. Both sides refuse to negotiate and continue making aggressive threats.","translation":"兩個鄰近國家之間的敵意已經升級為軍事緊張局勢。雙方拒絕談判並繼續發出侵略性的威脅。","word":"hostility"}},"house":{"createdAt":1783255594155,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"house 作動詞表示「為…提供住處；收容」，指提供住所或居住空間給某人或某群體。","options":["educate","house","transport","employ"],"sentence":"The government built a new shelter to ______ homeless families during the winter months. The facility provides warm beds, meals, and support services to help people get back on their feet.","translation":"政府建造了一個新的收容所在冬季為無家可歸的家庭提供住處。該設施提供溫暖的床鋪、膳食和支持服務，幫助人們重新站起來。","word":"house"}},"household":{"createdAt":1783741381738,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"household是指與家庭或家務相關的，用於描述整個家庭共同的事務或開支，而不是個人或私人的。","options":["personal","household","individual","private"],"sentence":"The ______ budget includes expenses for groceries, utilities, and rent. Every family member contributes to managing these domestic finances together.","translation":"家庭預算包括食品雜貨、公用事業和租金的開支。每個家庭成員都參與管理這些家務財務。","word":"household"}},"housing":{"createdAt":1781332009082,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"housing 是名詞，指的是住房或住宅，通常用於指人們的居住場所","options":["education","housing","healthcare","transportation"],"sentence":"The government launched a new initiative to improve ______ for low-income families. The program provided subsidies and loans to help people purchase affordable homes.","translation":"政府啟動了一項新倡議來改善低收入家庭的住房。該計畫提供補助和貸款幫助人們購買負擔得起的房屋。","word":"housing"}},"hover":{"createdAt":1783256139029,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hover 指的是在空中停留或徘徊，保持相對靜止的狀態。","options":["land","hover","descend","depart"],"sentence":"The helicopter began to ______ above the accident scene as rescue workers prepared below. It remained suspended in the air, waiting for the signal to land.","translation":"直升機開始在事故現場上方盤旋，下方的救援人員正在準備。它懸停在空中，等待著陸信號。","word":"hover"}},"humanity":{"createdAt":1781484415236,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"humanity是指人性中的善良、同情和慈悲，代表對人類共同福祉的關心。","options":["selfishness","cruelty","humanity","ignorance"],"sentence":"Despite the tragedy, the rescue workers showed great ______ by risking their lives to save strangers. Their compassion and selflessness demonstrated the best qualities of humankind.","translation":"儘管發生了悲劇，救援工作人員通過冒著生命危險救陌生人來展現了偉大的人道精神。他們的同情心和無私展現了人類最好的品質。","word":"humanity"}},"humble":{"createdAt":1781693538704,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"humble 表示謙虛、謙卑或不自誇的品質，不傲慢也不自大。","options":["arrogant","proud","humble","boastful"],"sentence":"Despite winning three major awards, the actress remained ______ and never bragged about her accomplishments. She always credited her success to her dedicated team.","translation":"儘管贏得三個主要獎項，這位女演員仍然保持謙虛，從不吹噓她的成就。她總是將她的成功歸功於她敬業的團隊。","word":"humble"}},"humidity":{"createdAt":1783558199862,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"humidity（濕度）是指空氣中水蒸氣的含量程度，與頭髮變捲、衣服潮濕等現象直接相關。","options":["temperature","humidity","pressure","wind"],"sentence":"The ______ in the air was so high that my hair became frizzy and curly. The weather forecast warned that moisture levels would reach 90% by afternoon.","translation":"空氣中的濕度非常高，我的頭髮變得毛躁捲曲。天氣預報警告說下午時水分含量將達到90%。","word":"humidity"}},"humiliate":{"createdAt":1783946896987,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"humiliate表示「羞辱、使蒙羞」，指故意讓某人感到尷尬或失去尊嚴，特別是在他人面前。","options":["praise","humiliate","motivate","encourage"],"sentence":"The coach did not want to ______ his players in front of the opposing team. He chose to give them constructive feedback privately rather than making them feel ashamed publicly.","translation":"教練不想在對方球隊面前羞辱他的球員。他選擇私下給他們建設性的反饋，而不是讓他們在公開場合感到羞愧。","word":"humiliate"}},"humiliation":{"createdAt":1781434900590,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"humiliation指因失敗或被貶低而感到的羞辱和恥辱感。","options":["joy","humiliation","excitement","pride"],"sentence":"Losing the championship match in front of thousands of fans caused him great ______. He felt deeply ashamed and embarrassed by his poor performance.","translation":"在數千名球迷面前輸掉冠軍賽給他帶來了巨大的羞辱。他為自己糟糕的表現感到深深的羞愧和尷尬。","word":"humiliation"}},"humor":{"createdAt":1781345237583,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"humor指使人感到愉快或發笑的幽默感或幽默天賦。","options":["silence","humor","sadness","anger"],"sentence":"His natural ______ made him popular at parties and social gatherings. Everyone appreciated his funny jokes and witty observations about everyday life.","translation":"他天生的幽默感使他在派對和社交聚會上很受歡迎。每個人都欣賞他關於日常生活的有趣笑話和詼諧評論。","word":"humor"}},"humorous":{"createdAt":1781424356415,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"humorous用來形容能夠引起笑聲或娛樂的事物，特別是通過聰慧或幽默的方式。","options":["serious","humorous","aggressive","confusing"],"sentence":"The comedian's ______ jokes made the entire audience burst into laughter. His timing and clever wordplay demonstrated why he was considered one of the funniest performers of the year.","translation":"這位喜劇演員幽默有趣的笑話讓整個觀眾席爆發出笑聲。他的時機把握和聰慧的措辭充分說明了為什麼他被認為是該年最有趣的表演者之一。","word":"humorous"}},"hung":{"createdAt":1781849847410,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hung是hang的過去式，表示懸掛或吊起，與「掛在牆上、花時間調整位置」的線索相符。","options":["dropped","hung","broke","hid"],"sentence":"She ______ the painting carefully on the living room wall. It took her an hour to find the perfect spot and ensure it was level.","translation":"她小心地將這幅畫掛在客廳的牆上。她花了一個小時才找到完美的位置並確保它是水平的。","word":"hung"}},"hybrid":{"createdAt":1784106475789,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hybrid 是指由兩種或多種不同元素、特性或物質混合而成的東西，在此特指結合兩種動力系統的車輛。","options":["electric","hybrid","luxury","compact"],"sentence":"The car manufacturer introduced a new ______ vehicle that combined both electric and gasoline engines. This innovative design allowed drivers to switch between power sources depending on their driving conditions.","translation":"汽車製造商推出了一款新型混合動力車，同時結合了電動和汽油引擎。這種創新設計允許駕駛員根據駕駛條件在不同的動力來源之間切換。","word":"hybrid"}},"hydrate":{"createdAt":1783748418494,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"hydrate 是指為身體或物質補充水分的過程，通常用於描述在運動或乾燥環境後恢復體內的水份平衡。","options":["moisturize","refresh","hydrate","energize"],"sentence":"After the intense workout, the athletes needed to ______ their bodies by drinking plenty of water and electrolyte drinks. The coach emphasized that proper fluid intake was essential for recovery and performance.","translation":"在劇烈運動後，運動員需要通過喝大量的水和電解質飲料來補充水分。教練強調適當的液體攝入對於恢復和表現至關重要。","word":"hydrate"}},"hydrated":{"createdAt":1783661880056,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"hydrated 是形容詞，表示攝入足夠的水分或液體，與第二句中「喝大量的水」相呼應。","options":["dehydrated","thirsty","hydrated","exhausted"],"sentence":"Athletes need to stay ______ during intense training to maintain peak performance. Drinking plenty of water and electrolyte drinks is essential for their health.","translation":"運動員在劇烈訓練中需要保持水分充足以維持最佳表現。喝大量的水和電解質飲料對他們的健康至關重要。","word":"hydrated"}},"hydrogen":{"createdAt":1781849847402,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hydrogen是化學元素，與「最輕、最豐富」及「火箭燃料和製造水」的特性相符。","options":["Oxygen","Hydrogen","Carbon","Nitrogen"],"sentence":"______ is the lightest and most abundant element in the universe. Scientists use it as fuel in rockets and for creating water.","translation":"氫是宇宙中最輕和最豐富的元素。科學家將其用作火箭燃料和製造水。","word":"hydrogen"}},"hygiene":{"createdAt":1781832089958,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hygiene 指個人或公共衛生，包括清潔和預防疾病的習慣和實踐","options":["nutrition","hygiene","medication","exercise"],"sentence":"Good personal ______ is essential for preventing the spread of diseases. Washing hands regularly and keeping your surroundings clean are basic practices everyone should follow.","translation":"良好的個人衛生對於防止疾病傳播至關重要。定期洗手和保持周圍環境清潔是每個人都應該遵循的基本習慣。","word":"hygiene"}},"hypocrite":{"createdAt":1784855445793,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hypocrite 指偽善者，指那些言行不一、公開宣揚的道德與實際行為相反的人。","options":["hero","hypocrite","leader","friend"],"sentence":"Everyone considered him a ______ because he preached honesty while secretly stealing from his friends. His actions completely contradicted his stated values.","translation":"每個人都認為他是一個偽善者，因為他宣揚誠實，卻暗地裡從朋友那裡偷竊。他的行為與他所宣稱的價值觀完全相反。","word":"hypocrite"}},"hypotheses":{"createdAt":1784723959943,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hypotheses 是指在科學研究開始時提出的假說或假設，用來驗證是否正確。","options":["conclusions","hypotheses","theories","facts"],"sentence":"The researchers proposed several ______ to explain the experimental results. After collecting more data, they found evidence that supported only one of their initial predictions.","translation":"研究人員提出了幾個假設來解釋實驗結果。收集更多數據後，他們發現證據只支持他們最初預測中的一個。","word":"hypotheses"}},"hypothesis":{"createdAt":1782883637409,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"hypothesis是在進行科學實驗之前提出的暫時性假說，需要通過實驗驗證其正確性。","options":["theory","hypothesis","fact","conclusion"],"sentence":"The scientist proposed a ______ that excessive screen time affects children's sleep patterns. She designed an experiment to test this educated guess with careful data collection and analysis.","translation":"科學家提出了一個過度的螢幕時間會影響兒童睡眠模式的假設。她設計了一個實驗，通過仔細的數據收集和分析來測試這個有根據的猜測。","word":"hypothesis"}},"iceberg":{"createdAt":1784042974328,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"iceberg 名詞表示「冰山」，是指從冰川脫落漂浮在海洋中的大塊浮冰，大部分隱沒在水下。","options":["island","whale","iceberg","glacier"],"sentence":"The ship struck a massive ______ hidden beneath the dark waters of the Arctic Ocean. Only about one-tenth of its enormous bulk was visible above the surface.","translation":"這艘船撞上了一座隱藏在北冰洋黑暗水域下的巨大冰山。它龐大體積的大約十分之九沒有露出水面。","word":"iceberg"}},"icon":{"createdAt":1782042740335,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"icon 在電腦或手機中指代一個小圖片，用來代表一個程式、文件或功能，使用戶能快速識別和點擊。","options":["icon","calendar","keyboard","speaker"],"sentence":"She clicked on the ______ in the top-left corner of the screen to open the application. The small image with a mountain silhouette was immediately recognizable to all users.","translation":"她點擊了屏幕左上角的圖示來打開應用程序。那個帶有山脈輪廓的小圖像對所有用戶都是可立即識別的。","word":"icon"}},"ideal":{"createdAt":1781848934149,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"ideal指最完美或最令人滿意的狀態或情況","options":["terrible","rainy","ideal","cold"],"sentence":"The weather was ______ for the outdoor wedding ceremony. The temperature was perfect, and there wasn't a cloud in the sky.","translation":"天氣對於戶外婚禮非常理想。溫度完美，天空中沒有一絲雲彩。","word":"ideal"}},"identical":{"createdAt":1781424574160,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"identical 意為完全相同的，沒有任何區別。","options":["identical","different","expensive","damaged"],"sentence":"The two paintings were ______ in every way. Even the expert art appraiser could not tell them apart, as they had the same colors, brushstrokes, and dimensions.","translation":"這兩幅畫在各方面都完全相同。即使是專業的美術鑑定師也無法區分它們，因為它們有相同的色彩、筆觸和尺寸。","word":"identical"}},"identification":{"createdAt":1781841148118,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"identification 名詞意思是識別、辨認身份，指證明或驗證某人身份的過程或證件。","options":["payment","identification","reservation","luggage"],"sentence":"The airline required ______ from all passengers before allowing them to board the international flight. Each traveler had to present a valid passport or government-issued ID card at the check-in counter.","translation":"航空公司在允許所有乘客登上國際航班之前要求提供身份識別。每位旅客都必須在值機櫃台出示有效護照或政府簽發的身份證。","word":"identification"}},"identify":{"createdAt":1781840030395,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"identify 是動詞，表示辨認、鑑定；通過比較特徵來確認某人的身分正是此動詞的典型用法。","options":["ignore","identify","arrest","question"],"sentence":"The detective was able to ______ the suspect from the security camera footage. By comparing facial features and distinctive marks, she confirmed the criminal's identity.","translation":"偵探能夠從安全攝影機的錄像中辨認嫌疑人。通過比較面部特徵和獨特標記，她確認了罪犯的身分。","word":"identify"}},"identity":{"createdAt":1783558795713,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"identity 名詞表示身分、身份，指個人的名字、特徵或個人資訊。","options":["location","identity","weapon","motive"],"sentence":"The witness was unable to reveal the suspect's ______ due to security concerns. The police kept his name and personal information confidential.","translation":"由於安全考慮，證人無法透露嫌疑人的身分。警方對他的姓名和個人信息保密。","word":"identity"}},"ideology":{"createdAt":1782096279655,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ideology指的是一套有組織的信念體系和政治觀點，通常被推廣和教導給他人。","options":["strategy","ideology","appearance","location"],"sentence":"The political party's ______ emphasized equality and social justice for all citizens. Their leaders spent decades promoting these core beliefs through education and community programs.","translation":"這個政黨的思想體系強調所有公民的平等和社會正義。他們的領導人花了數十年時間透過教育和社區計畫來推廣這些核心信念。","word":"ideology"}},"idiom":{"createdAt":1781484415206,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"idiom是指一個短語或表達方式，其含義不能從組成詞語的字面意思推導出來。","options":["grammar","idiom","alphabet","accent"],"sentence":"The phrase 'raining cats and dogs' is a common English ______ that doesn't literally mean animals are falling from the sky. It simply means it's raining very heavily.","translation":"短語「下雨貓狗」是常見的英語習語，並不是字面上的意思動物從天上掉下來。它只是表示下雨非常猛烈。","word":"idiom"}},"idle":{"createdAt":1784355956206,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"idle是形容詞，表示閒散的、懶惰的、虛度光陰，指沒有從事有用或有生產力的活動。","options":["busy","successful","idle","constructive"],"sentence":"After graduating from university, Tom spent an ______ year doing nothing productive at home. He played video games all day instead of looking for a job or pursuing further education.","translation":"大學畢業後，湯姆在家虛度了一年光陰，沒有做任何有建設性的事情。他整天玩電子遊戲，而不是找工作或進行進一步的教育。","word":"idle"}},"idolize":{"createdAt":1787499142631,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"idolize 意為崇拜或把某人當作偶像對待，通常表示對某人深深的敬佩和尊敬。","options":["criticize","idolize","ignore","forget"],"sentence":"Many young fans ______ their favorite celebrities and follow everything they do. These admirers spend hours studying their idols' fashion, music, and lifestyle choices.","translation":"許多年輕粉絲崇拜他們最喜歡的名人，並跟隨他們所做的一切。這些仰慕者花費數小時研究他們偶像的時尚、音樂和生活方式。","word":"idolize"}},"ignorance":{"createdAt":1785240687668,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ignorance 意為對某事的無知或缺乏了解，在此指被告聲稱自己不知道某些事實的狀態。","options":["knowledge","ignorance","innocence","carelessness"],"sentence":"The defendant claimed ______ as a defense, arguing he did not know the document was forged. However, the judge ruled that lack of knowledge about the law is not a valid excuse.","translation":"被告以無知作為辯護理由，辯稱他不知道該文件是偽造的。然而，法官裁定不知道法律不是有效的藉口。","word":"ignorance"}},"ignorant":{"createdAt":1781849847405,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ignorant表示不知道的或無知的，與「從未學習過、知識缺陷」的線索相符。","options":["knowledgeable","ignorant","expert","informed"],"sentence":"She was ______ about the historical facts and had never studied the subject. Her lack of knowledge became obvious during the discussion.","translation":"她對歷史事實一無所知，從未學過這個科目。她的知識缺陷在討論中變得很明顯。","word":"ignorant"}},"ignore":{"createdAt":1781873027345,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ignore 表示故意不注意或不理會某人說的話或做的事。","options":["answer","ignore","repeat","hear"],"sentence":"When the teacher called on him, he decided to ______ her question and stare at his desk instead. His deliberate refusal to acknowledge what she said made it clear he was being disrespectful.","translation":"當老師點他回答時，他決定忽視她的問題，而是盯著自己的課桌。他刻意拒絕承認她說的話，清楚表明他在不尊重人。","word":"ignore"}},"illogical":{"createdAt":1783948760230,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"illogical指的是違反邏輯推理規則、不符合理性思維的，強調論證本身缺乏邏輯基礎。","options":["unconventional","illogical","unpopular","unscientific"],"sentence":"His argument that the sun revolves around the Earth was completely ______. No scientific evidence or rational reasoning could support such a claim in the modern age.","translation":"他認為太陽繞地球運轉的論證完全是不合邏輯的。沒有科學證據或理性推理能在現代支持這樣的主張。","word":"illogical"}},"illuminate":{"createdAt":1785160871329,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"illuminate 意為「照亮；闡明」，指透過解釋或說明使某事變得明白易懂。","options":["illuminate","interrupt","intimidate","irrigate"],"sentence":"The teacher used a diagram to ______ the complex scientific concept for her confused students. By showing concrete examples and visual aids, she made the abstract theory much clearer.","translation":"老師用圖表來闡明這個複雜的科學概念給困惑的學生。透過展示具體例子和視覺輔助工具，她使抽象理論變得更清楚。","word":"illuminate"}},"illusion":{"createdAt":1781849847409,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"illusion表示幻覺或錯覺，與「魔術、巧妙的把戲」的線索相符。","options":["reality","illusion","fact","truth"],"sentence":"The magician created a convincing ______ that made the audience believe the car had disappeared. Everyone was amazed by the clever trick.","translation":"魔術師創造了一個令人信服的幻覺，讓觀眾相信汽車消失了。每個人都對這個巧妙的把戲感到驚訝。","word":"illusion"}},"illustrate":{"createdAt":1784979555337,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"illustrate（舉例說明；畫插圖）在此指通過視覺圖示來解釋複雜的科學概念，與第二句中「drawing the step-by-step process」的行為相符。","options":["ignore","confuse","illustrate","simplify"],"sentence":"The professor used a detailed diagram to ______ the concept of photosynthesis. By drawing the step-by-step process on the whiteboard, she made the abstract concept much easier for students to understand.","translation":"教授用詳細的圖表來舉例說明光合作用的概念。通過在白板上繪製逐步過程，她使這個抽象概念對學生來說更容易理解。","word":"illustrate"}},"illustrated":{"createdAt":1782637076491,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"illustrated 是用插圖說明的、配有插圖的意思，指文本配合圖像以增強理解和視覺效果。","options":["printed","illustrated","published","written"],"sentence":"The children's book was beautifully ______ with colorful drawings on every page. The pictures helped young readers understand and enjoy the story more effectively.","translation":"這本兒童書用每一頁上的彩色圖畫精美地配插圖。這些圖片幫助年輕讀者更有效地理解和享受故事。","word":"illustrated"}},"illustration":{"createdAt":1783516475401,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"illustration指用來幫助解釋或裝飾文本的圖畫、繪圖或視覺圖像。","options":["photograph","illustration","chart","diagram"],"sentence":"The ______ in the children's book showed a colorful dragon flying over mountains. The picture on page fifteen perfectly depicted the scene described in the story.","translation":"兒童書中的插圖顯示了一條色彩斑斕的龍飛越山脈。第十五頁的圖片完美地描繪了故事中描述的場景。","word":"illustration"}},"illustrator":{"createdAt":1782022372248,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"illustrator 意為「插畫家」，指專門為書籍、雜誌等創作插圖的藝術工作者。","options":["publisher","illustrator","author","printer"],"sentence":"The children's book became a bestseller thanks to the talented ______ who created beautiful, colorful drawings for each page. Without these stunning visual artworks, the young readers would have found the story much less engaging.","translation":"這本兒童書籍成為暢銷書，多虧了才華橫溢的插畫家為每一頁創作了美麗多彩的插圖。如果沒有這些令人驚艷的視覺藝術作品，年輕讀者會發現故事的吸引力大大降低。","word":"illustrator"}},"image":{"createdAt":1782005726784,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"image 在此指某人或機構在公眾心目中的印象和看法，可以通過行動來改變和塑造。","options":["image","schedule","budget","strategy"],"sentence":"The politician worked hard to improve her public ______ before the election. She donated to charities and participated in community service to show voters her commitment to helping others.","translation":"這位政治家在選舉前努力改善她的公眾形象。她向慈善機構捐款並參與社區服務，向選民展示她幫助他人的承諾。","word":"image"}},"imaginary":{"createdAt":1782544253863,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"imaginary是形容詞，表示事物是虛構的、想像出來的，不存在於現實中。","options":["real","famous","imaginary","invisible"],"sentence":"The child created an ______ friend who would play with her every day. This friend existed only in her mind and was not a real person.","translation":"孩子創造了一位想像中的朋友，每天都和她一起玩。這位朋友只存在於她的腦海中，不是真實的人物。","word":"imaginary"}},"imagination":{"createdAt":1781849847411,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"imagination表示想像力，與「創造奇幻世界、魔法生物和冒險」的線索相符。","options":["logic","imagination","memory","reasoning"],"sentence":"The child's ______ was so vivid that he created entire fantasy worlds in his mind. His stories were filled with magical creatures and impossible adventures.","translation":"這個孩子的想像力非常生動，他在腦子裡創造了整個奇幻世界。他的故事充滿了魔法生物和不可能的冒險。","word":"imagination"}},"imagine":{"createdAt":1785711133009,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"imagine 意為「想像、猜想」，指在腦海中構想或創造出不一定存在或尚未發生的事物。","options":["remember","imagine","discover","organize"],"sentence":"I tried to ______ what my life would be like if I moved to another country. Without any concrete plans yet, I could only picture fictional scenarios in my mind.","translation":"我試著想像如果我搬到另一個國家，我的生活會是什麼樣子。沒有任何具體的計畫，我只能在腦海中構想虛構的情景。","word":"imagine"}},"imbibition":{"createdAt":1783489104909,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"吸收是指植物或種子吸收水分的過程，主要通過滲透作用，導致細胞體積增加和代謝活動恢復。","options":["dehydration","imbibition","evaporation","transpiration"],"sentence":"The dry seeds required ______ of water to germinate and grow. As they absorbed moisture, their cells expanded and life processes were activated.","translation":"乾燥的種子需要吸收水分才能發芽和生長。隨著它們吸收水分，細胞膨脹，生命過程被激活。","word":"imbibition"}},"imitate":{"createdAt":1781848934152,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"imitate指複製或仿效他人的行為、言語或動作","options":["ignore","imitate","avoid","criticize"],"sentence":"Young children tend to ______ the behavior of their parents and older siblings. This is a natural part of learning and development.","translation":"年幼的孩子往往會模仿父母和哥哥姐姐的行為。這是學習和發展的自然部分。","word":"imitate"}},"imitation":{"createdAt":1783516475407,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"imitation指對原物的複製或仿製，通常質量較低或不如真品。","options":["original","imitation","creation","masterpiece"],"sentence":"This designer handbag is just an ______ of the original, not an authentic product. The fake was made with cheaper materials and inferior craftsmanship.","translation":"這個設計師手袋只是原件的仿製品，不是正品。假貨是用更便宜的材料和較差的工藝製造的。","word":"imitation"}},"imitative":{"createdAt":1781434900592,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"imitative指模仿或複製他人的特點，通常暗示缺乏原創性。","options":["elaborate","imitative","minimalist","modern"],"sentence":"The new restaurant's ______ décor copied the style of famous Italian establishments without any original design. Art critics dismissed it as lacking authenticity and creativity.","translation":"這家新餐廳的模仿式裝飾抄襲了著名義大利餐廳的風格，沒有任何原創設計。藝術評論家認為它缺乏真實性和創意。","word":"imitative"}},"immediate":{"createdAt":1781437220556,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"「Immediate」形容詞表示直接的或立即發生的，沒有中間過程或延遲。","options":["distant","delayed","immediate","indirect"],"sentence":"The ______ cause of the accident was the driver's failure to brake in time. Within seconds of impact, emergency services arrived at the scene.","translation":"這起事故的直接原因是司機未能及時制動。撞擊後幾秒鐘內，緊急服務人員便趕到現場。","word":"immediate"}},"immediately":{"createdAt":1782544253859,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"immediately是副詞，表示某事馬上發生或立刻進行，沒有任何時間延遲。","options":["slowly","immediately","eventually","gradually"],"sentence":"When the fire alarm rang, all the students left the building ______. The evacuation had to happen right away without any delay.","translation":"當火警鈴聲響起時，所有學生立刻離開了建築物。疏散必須馬上進行，不能有任何延遲。","word":"immediately"}},"immense":{"createdAt":1782094693727,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"巨大的是指面積、數量或程度非常大的。","options":["small","immense","tiny","narrow"],"sentence":"The ______ rainforest stretches across multiple countries and contains millions of species. The sheer size of the Amazon is almost impossible to comprehend.","translation":"那片巨大的熱帶雨林跨越多個國家，包含數百萬物種。亞馬遜雨林的龐大規模幾乎無法理解。","word":"immense"}},"immigrant":{"createdAt":1784868215553,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"immigrant 特指移入他國定居的人，強調的是遷移和新的居住地；refugee 通常是被迫逃離，citizen 和 tourist 的身份定義不同。","options":["immigrant","citizen","refugee","tourist"],"sentence":"My grandmother was an ______ who arrived in this country with only a small suitcase. She came from Poland in 1952 seeking better economic opportunities.","translation":"我的祖母是一位移民，只帶著一個小行李箱來到這個國家。她於1952年從波蘭來到這裡，尋求更好的經濟機會。","word":"immigrant"}},"immigrate":{"createdAt":1783502229619,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"immigrate 指的是移居到另一個國家並以此為新家園，涉及永久性或長期的居住計劃。","options":["visit","immigrate","travel","explore"],"sentence":"Many people decided to ______ to Canada seeking better job opportunities and a higher standard of living. They obtained their visas and moved their families permanently to settle in North America.","translation":"許多人決定移入加拿大，尋求更好的工作機會和更高的生活水準。他們獲得了簽證，並將家人永久遷往北美定居。","word":"immigrate"}},"immigration":{"createdAt":1782303071294,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"immigration 指移入某個國家定居的行為和過程，通常涉及人口的跨境遷移","options":["eclipse","immigration","cavity","contact"],"sentence":"The government implemented new policies regarding ______ from other countries. These regulations affected thousands of people seeking to relocate and settle permanently.","translation":"政府實施了關於來自其他國家的移入的新政策。這些規定影響了數千名尋求永久遷居和定居的人。","word":"immigration"}},"imminent":{"createdAt":1781431278559,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"imminent指某事即將發生或臨近，通常用於描述快速逼近的事件。","options":["distant","imminent","unlikely","mild"],"sentence":"The weather forecast warns that a severe storm is ______ and residents should seek shelter immediately. Dark clouds are already gathering over the city, and rain is expected within the next hour.","translation":"天氣預報警告嚴重風暴即將來臨，居民應該立即尋求庇護。烏雲已經聚集在城市上空，預計雨水將在下一小時內開始。","word":"imminent"}},"immune":{"createdAt":1781840892410,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"immune表示對某種疾病或有害物質的免疫或抵抗力，無法被感染。","options":["vulnerable","resistant","immune","allergic"],"sentence":"After receiving the vaccine, the body developed antibodies that made her ______ to the virus. She could now be exposed to infected individuals without contracting the disease.","translation":"接種疫苗後，身體產生了使她對該病毒免疫的抗體。她現在可以接觸感染者而不會患病。","word":"immune"}},"immunity":{"createdAt":1783516475407,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"immunity指身體對疾病或感染的抵抗力，或指某人免受某項責任或處罰的豁免。","options":["vulnerability","immunity","weakness","susceptibility"],"sentence":"After receiving the vaccination, your body develops ______ to the disease. Your immune system can now recognize and fight off the virus if you're exposed to it.","translation":"接種疫苗後，您的身體對該疾病產生免疫力。如果您暴露於病毒中，您的免疫系統現在可以識別並對抗它。","word":"immunity"}},"impact":{"createdAt":1781345237581,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"impact作動詞表示對某事物產生重要的影響或衝擊效果。","options":["ignore","impact","observe","measure"],"sentence":"The new marketing campaign will ______ our sales figures significantly. We expect to see at least a 30% increase in revenue based on preliminary market analysis.","translation":"新的行銷活動將對我們的銷售數字產生重大影響。根據初步市場分析，我們預計收入至少會增加30%。","word":"impact"}},"impartial":{"createdAt":1787757574264,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"impartial 意為「公正的、不偏袒的」，用來形容沒有偏見、公平對待所有相關人士的態度或決定。","options":["biased","impartial","prejudiced","unfair"],"sentence":"The judge's decision was ______ and treated both parties fairly without favoring either side. She carefully examined all the evidence from each side before reaching her verdict.","translation":"法官的決定是公正的，公平對待雙方，不偏袒任何一方。她在做出裁決前仔細檢查了每一方的所有證據。","word":"impartial"}},"imperative":{"createdAt":1784986981431,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"imperative 形容某事極其重要且迫切需要執行，強調行動的必要性和緊急性。","options":["optional","imperative","theoretical","debatable"],"sentence":"It is ______ that we reduce plastic consumption immediately to protect our oceans. Scientists have warned that without urgent action now, marine ecosystems will suffer irreversible damage within the next decade.","translation":"立即減少塑膠消耗對保護我們的海洋至關重要。科學家警告，如果現在不採取緊急行動，海洋生態系統在未來十年內將遭受不可逆轉的損害。","word":"imperative"}},"imperial":{"createdAt":1783068673121,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"imperial 意為「帝國的；皇帝的」，用來形容與皇帝、皇族或帝國相關的事物。","options":["local","imperial","religious","military"],"sentence":"The museum displayed artifacts from the ancient ______ family, including crowns and royal robes. These priceless items once belonged to the emperor and his court.","translation":"博物館展出了來自古代帝國皇族的文物，包括皇冠和皇袍。這些無價的物品曾經屬於皇帝和他的朝代。","word":"imperial"}},"impermanence":{"createdAt":1785140695728,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"impermanence 指的是無常、短暫性，強調事物終將改變和消逝的特性。","options":["stability","impermanence","eternity","continuity"],"sentence":"Buddhist monks teach that ______ is a fundamental truth of existence. Everything in the universe eventually changes, decays, or disappears over time.","translation":"佛教僧侶教導無常是存在的基本真理。宇宙中的一切最終都會隨著時間推移而改變、衰退或消失。","word":"impermanence"}},"implement":{"createdAt":1785233957114,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"implement 是動詞，表示實施或貫徹計劃、政策或系統，使其實際生效。","options":["discuss","implement","abandon","propose"],"sentence":"The government decided to ______ a new education policy starting next year. The specific rules and procedures would be officially put into action across all schools.","translation":"政府決定從明年開始貫徹一項新的教育政策。具體的規則和程序將在所有學校正式付諸實施。","word":"implement"}},"implication":{"createdAt":1781709890956,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"implication指的是在沒有明確說明的情況下暗示或表達的意思，是隱含的含義。","options":["braided","implication","obsession","engagement"],"sentence":"The ______ of her statement was that the company had been dishonest with its investors. Although she never directly accused anyone, her carefully chosen words suggested serious misconduct had occurred.","translation":"她聲明的暗示是該公司對投資者不誠實。雖然她從未直接指責任何人，但她精心選擇的措詞表明發生了嚴重的不當行為。","word":"implication"}},"implicit":{"createdAt":1782106346909,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"implicit（含蓄的、不言明的）表示未直接說出但可以理解或推斷的意思。","options":["explicit","implicit","written","verbal"],"sentence":"The teacher's ______ approval of the students' plan was never stated directly in words. However, when she smiled and nodded during the presentation, everyone understood what she meant.","translation":"老師對學生計畫的含蓄認可從未用言語直接表達過。然而，當她在演講中微笑並點頭時，每個人都明白她的意思。","word":"implicit"}},"imply":{"createdAt":1783068673119,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"imply 意為「含有...的意思；暗指」，指間接地表達或暗示某種意思，而不是直接說出。","options":["state","imply","announce","explain"],"sentence":"The manager's silence seemed to ______ that she disagreed with the decision. When asked directly, she refused to comment, leaving everyone unsure of her actual position.","translation":"經理的沉默似乎暗示她不同意這個決定。當被直接詢問時，她拒絕評論，讓每個人都不確定她的實際立場。","word":"imply"}},"import":{"createdAt":1781841742836,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"import 作動詞表示「進口」，指將外國商品運入本國，與 export 相反。","options":["export","import","produce","consume"],"sentence":"Many countries ______ raw materials from Africa to use in manufacturing. These goods arrive by ship and truck at ports and distribution centers.","translation":"許多國家從非洲進口原材料用於製造業。這些商品通過船隻和卡車運抵港口和配送中心。","word":"import"}},"impose":{"createdAt":1781840659327,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"impose 表示強制實施或徵收，指通過權力強加某些要求或限制。","options":["suggest","impose","discuss","consider"],"sentence":"The government decided to ______ strict new regulations on all manufacturing plants. Companies now must follow these mandatory rules or face significant penalties.","translation":"政府決定在所有製造廠實施嚴格的新規定。公司現在必須遵守這些強制性規則，否則將面臨重罰。","word":"impose"}},"impoverish":{"createdAt":1783005778378,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"impoverish 意為「使貧困」或「使貧乏」，指使某人或某地變得貧窮或缺乏資源。","options":["enrich","strengthen","impoverish","develop"],"sentence":"The prolonged drought would ______ the agricultural communities that depended entirely on crop production for survival. Without rainfall, farmers faced complete financial ruin and starvation.","translation":"長期乾旱將使完全依賴農產品生產謀生的農業社區陷入貧困。沒有降雨，農民面臨完全的經濟崩潰和飢餓。","word":"impoverish"}},"impress":{"createdAt":1784683301272,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"impress是指給人留下深刻的、令人敬佩的印象，通常因為某人的才能、表現或品質令人欽佩。","options":["stagger","entertain","impress","rehearse"],"sentence":"Her exceptional violin performance managed to ______ the entire audience. The standing ovation and tears in people's eyes showed how deeply moved they were by her artistry.","translation":"她出色的小提琴表演成功地給全體觀眾留下了極深的印象。觀眾起立鼓掌和眼中的淚水表明他們被她的藝術深深打動了。","word":"impress"}},"impressed":{"createdAt":1783566294632,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"impressed表示印象深刻的或被深深打動的，形容對某人或某事感到欽佩或滿意的狀態。","options":["confused","impressed","surprised","disappointed"],"sentence":"The interviewer was very ______ with the candidate's knowledge and communication skills. She immediately offered him the job position on the spot.","translation":"面試官對候選人的知識和溝通技能留下了深刻印象。她立即當場給了他這份工作。","word":"impressed"}},"impression":{"createdAt":1783421881860,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"impression 意為「印象」，指某人或某事在他人心中引起的感受、看法或效果。","options":["impression","decision","suggestion","confusion"],"sentence":"The job candidate made an excellent ______ during the interview with her confident answers and professional demeanor. The hiring manager was so positively influenced that she was offered the position on the spot.","translation":"這位求職者在面試中以自信的回答和專業的舉止留下了深刻的印象。招聘經理受到如此積極的影響，她當場被錄用了。","word":"impression"}},"impressive":{"createdAt":1781849511876,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"令人印象深刻是指某事物給人留下深刻而良好的印象，令人欽佩。","options":["boring","loud","impressive","fast"],"sentence":"The young pianist's performance was truly ______ and moved many people to tears. Her technical skill, emotional depth, and perfect execution earned her a standing ovation from the entire audience.","translation":"這位年輕鋼琴家的表演確實令人印象深刻，使許多人感動得流淚。她的技術、情感深度和完美的表現贏得了全體觀眾的起立鼓掌。","word":"impressive"}},"imprison":{"createdAt":1783310579947,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"imprison 意為監禁或束縛，指將某人關押在監獄或受限制的地方。","options":["celebrate","imprison","liberate","educate"],"sentence":"The dictator used harsh laws to ______ anyone who dared to speak against the government. After twenty years in jail, the political prisoner was finally released from captivity.","translation":"獨裁者用嚴苛的法律來監禁任何敢於反對政府的人。經過二十年的監禁後，這位政治犯終於從囚禁中被釋放。","word":"imprison"}},"improve":{"createdAt":1781449588285,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"improve作為動詞表示「改善、增進、提高」，指使某事物變得更好或更優秀。","options":["improve","glorify","signify","just"],"sentence":"The student's test scores began to ______ after receiving tutoring and studying more consistently. Her progress was remarkable, jumping from a D grade to a B grade within just two months.","translation":"學生在接受輔導並更加持續地學習後，測試成績開始改善。她的進步是顯著的，在短短兩個月內從D級跳升到B級。","word":"improve"}},"improvement":{"createdAt":1782005726781,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"improvement 意指某事物變得更好或更優良的過程，通常伴隨正面的結果和進展。","options":["decline","improvement","confusion","tension"],"sentence":"The company made significant ______ to its products after listening to customer feedback. This change resulted in better sales and higher customer satisfaction scores.","translation":"該公司在聽取客戶反饋後對其產品進行了重大改善。這一變化導致銷售額更高和客戶滿意度評分提升。","word":"improvement"}},"impulse":{"createdAt":1781839703149,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"impulse指未經理性考慮的衝動，與bought without thinking and regretting（未經思考地購買並後悔）直接對應。","options":["planning","analysis","impulse","preparation"],"sentence":"Acting on ______ without thinking often leads to regrettable decisions. She bought expensive items she didn't need just because they were on sale.","translation":"在沒有思考的衝動下行動常常導致後悔的決定。她只是因為東西在打折就買了一些她不需要的昂貴物品。","word":"impulse"}},"impurity":{"createdAt":1786333483522,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"impurity 是指混合物中不純淨或不潔的物質成分，在此指水中的有害污染物。","options":["clarity","impurity","abundance","mixture"],"sentence":"The water sample contained an ______ that made it unsuitable for drinking. The laboratory identified the contaminant as a harmful chemical that had leaked from the nearby factory.","translation":"水樣本中含有一種雜質，使其不適合飲用。實驗室鑑定該污染物是來自附近工廠洩漏的有害化學物質。","word":"impurity"}},"incentive":{"createdAt":1781598671167,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"incentive 作名詞表示激勵或鼓勵，指促使某人採取特定行動的刺激物或獎勵","options":["penalty","incentive","restriction","burden"],"sentence":"The company offered a cash bonus as an ______ to increase employee productivity. Workers became more motivated to exceed their performance targets.","translation":"公司提供現金獎金作為激勵以提高員工生產力。工人變得更有動力超過他們的績效目標。","word":"incentive"}},"incident":{"createdAt":1785297837778,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"incident 指發生的事件或事故，特別是不尋常或值得注意的事情，可以是輕微的也可以是嚴重的。","options":["accident","incident","disaster","emergency"],"sentence":"The minor ______ at the airport caused a brief delay in departures. Security personnel quickly resolved the situation without any serious consequences.","translation":"機場發生了一起輕微的事件，導致出發延誤。安全人員迅速解決了這個情況，沒有造成嚴重後果。","word":"incident"}},"incidental":{"createdAt":1782476098663,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"incidental 形容詞是指附帶的、次要的或順便發生的事物，通常是非計畫性的額外開支。","options":["major","incidental","mandatory","essential"],"sentence":"The main cost of the trip was accommodation, but there were several ______ expenses we hadn't budgeted for. These extra costs included meals, transportation, and souvenirs that came up unexpectedly.","translation":"旅行的主要開支是住宿，但我們還有幾項附帶費用沒有預算。這些額外費用包括突然出現的餐食、交通和紀念品。","word":"incidental"}},"inclination":{"createdAt":1783039485899,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"inclination 指一個人對某事物的傾向或偏好，常用來描述自然而然的喜好或趨向。","options":["tendency","inclination","reluctance","aversion"],"sentence":"Sarah has a strong ______ toward pursuing a career in medicine. Her parents have supported this preference since she was young and always excelled in science classes.","translation":"莎拉對從事醫學職業有著強烈的傾向。她的父母從小就支持這個偏好，她在科學課上也一直表現優異。","word":"inclination"}},"incline":{"createdAt":1783516475403,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"incline指物體或地形向上或向下傾斜，或者指某人傾向於做某事。","options":["flatten","incline","straighten","widen"],"sentence":"The path began to ______ steeply as we climbed toward the mountain summit. The hikers had to lean forward to maintain their balance on the steep slope.","translation":"當我們向山頂攀登時，小徑開始陡峭傾斜。登山者不得不向前傾斜以在陡峭的斜坡上保持平衡。","word":"incline"}},"inclined":{"createdAt":1784711595412,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"inclined 在此處用作形容詞，表示某人「有傾向於」或「傾向於」做某事，通常表示一種心理或態度上的傾斜。","options":["hesitant","inclined","certain","confused"],"sentence":"After hearing the proposal, Maria seemed ______ to agree with the plan. Her nods and positive comments throughout the meeting made her position perfectly clear.","translation":"聽完提案後，瑪麗亞似乎傾向於同意這個計畫。她在整個會議中的點頭和正面評論使她的立場非常明確。","word":"inclined"}},"include":{"createdAt":1781275226790,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"此處include作動詞表示「包括；涵蓋」，指某物是整體的一部分","options":["fume","include","dazzle","dump"],"sentence":"The package deal will ______ airfare, hotel accommodations, and all meals. The price quote covers everything you need for your complete vacation.","translation":"這個套餐會包括機票、酒店住宿和所有餐飲。報價涵蓋了你完整假期所需的一切。","word":"include"}},"including":{"createdAt":1781362281657,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"including表示包括或包含某些東西作為整體的一部分。","options":["excluding","including","limiting","deducting"],"sentence":"The total cost of the trip is $500, ______ all meals and transportation. Accommodation, activities, and guides are part of this price.","translation":"旅行的總成本是500美元，包括所有的餐飲和交通。住宿、活動和導遊都包含在這個價格中。","word":"including"}},"inclusive":{"createdAt":1783516475402,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"inclusive指包括所有相關項目或費用，不排除任何部分的完整性。","options":["selective","exclusive","inclusive","limited"],"sentence":"The ______ pricing package covers all meals, accommodations, and activities during your stay. There are no hidden fees or additional charges to worry about.","translation":"全包定價套餐涵蓋您停留期間的所有餐飲、住宿和活動。沒有隱藏費用或額外費用需要擔心。","word":"inclusive"}},"income":{"createdAt":1783661880053,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"income 是名詞，表示收入或所得，與第二句中「賺錢」的概念一致，是支付開支的金錢來源。","options":["expenses","debt","income","bills"],"sentence":"Her monthly ______ from her new job allows her to pay all her bills comfortably. She earns enough money to cover rent, utilities, and food.","translation":"她從新工作中的月收入讓她能夠舒適地支付所有帳單。她的收入足以支付租金、公用事業和食物。","word":"income"}},"incoming":{"createdAt":1781935654224,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"incoming 是形容詞，表示「即將來臨的」或「正在到達的」，指飛機、訊息或人員即將抵達。","options":["departing","incoming","delayed","cancelled"],"sentence":"The ______ flight from Tokyo will arrive at Gate 12 in approximately thirty minutes. Please proceed to the arrival hall to greet your passengers.","translation":"從東京來的班機將在大約三十分鐘內抵達12號登機口。請前往到達大廳迎接您的乘客。","word":"incoming"}},"incorporate":{"createdAt":1781746848185,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"incorporate 表示「包含」或「將...包括在內」，指將某物納入或整合到整體中。","options":["remove","incorporate","separate","abandon"],"sentence":"The new software will ______ artificial intelligence features into its existing platform. Users will benefit from these technological advancements starting next month.","translation":"新軟體將人工智能功能集成到其現有平台中。用戶從下個月開始將從這些技術進步中受益。","word":"incorporate"}},"incorporates":{"createdAt":1781564440921,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"incorporates 表示納入、併入，指將某物包含或整合到整體中。","options":["removes","incorporates","ignores","rejects"],"sentence":"The new recipe ______ several traditional ingredients with modern cooking techniques. By mixing old and new methods, it creates a unique fusion dish.","translation":"新食譜將傳統食材與現代烹飪技術結合在一起。通過混合老舊和新的方法，它創造了獨特的融合菜餚。","word":"incorporates"}},"increase":{"createdAt":1783499198617,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"increase 作為動詞表示增加或擴大，在這裡用來描述公司擴大生產規模的行動。","options":["decrease","increase","maintain","suspend"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ its production capacity to meet growing demand. They invested millions of dollars in new machinery and hired additional workers to expand their output.","translation":"該公司決定增加其生產能力以滿足不斷增長的需求。他們投入數百萬美元購買新機器並雇用額外工人來擴大產出。","word":"increase"}},"incredible":{"createdAt":1782228595874,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"incredible 意為難以相信或驚人的，用來形容超乎尋常、令人驚嘆的事物或表現。","options":["boring","ordinary","incredible","typical"],"sentence":"The ______ performance by the young athlete left the entire audience speechless. He broke three world records in a single competition, something that had never happened before in Olympic history.","translation":"這位年輕運動員令人難以置信的表現讓整個觀眾都啞口無言。他在一場比賽中打破了三項世界紀錄，這在奧運歷史上從未發生過。","word":"incredible"}},"incur":{"createdAt":1781693304925,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"incur 表示因為某項行為或決定而招致或遭受（通常是負面的後果）。","options":["avoid","prevent","incur","deserve"],"sentence":"By arriving late to the meeting, the executive began to ______ the anger of the entire board. His tardiness had serious consequences for his standing in the company.","translation":"因為遲到開會，這位高管開始招致整個董事會的憤怒。他的遲到對他在公司的地位造成了嚴重後果。","word":"incur"}},"indecision":{"createdAt":1788918832583,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"indecision 是名詞，表示無法決定或猶豫不決的狀態，常常導致延遲和困擾。","options":["confidence","indecision","enthusiasm","clarity"],"sentence":"Her ______ about which job offer to accept lasted for three weeks. Finally, she realized that her constant wavering was causing her to miss the deadline for responding to both companies.","translation":"她對於應該接受哪份工作邀約的猶豫不決持續了三週。最後，她意識到她不斷的搖擺不定導致她錯過了回覆兩家公司的截止期限。","word":"indecision"}},"indeed":{"createdAt":1784078210969,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"indeed（確實）用於強調前面陳述的真實性或確認某事物確實如此，常用於加強語氣或表示同意。","options":["fortunately","indeed","possibly","arguably"],"sentence":"The experiment results were ______ surprising; in fact, they completely contradicted our initial hypothesis. The data showed a 95% success rate, which exceeded all our expectations.","translation":"實驗結果確實令人驚訝；事實上，它們完全推翻了我們最初的假設。數據顯示成功率達到95%，這超出了我們所有的預期。","word":"indeed"}},"indelible":{"createdAt":1783598428078,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"indelible 指的是無法消除、難以磨滅或永久的印記或影響","options":["temporary","indelible","minor","subtle"],"sentence":"The scandal left an ______ mark on the politician's reputation that haunted him for decades. No amount of apologizing or good deeds could ever fully erase the damage.","translation":"這起醜聞在這位政治家的聲譽上留下了難以消除的痕跡，多年來一直困擾著他。再多的道歉或善舉也無法完全抹去這種傷害。","word":"indelible"}},"independence":{"createdAt":1781624534658,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"independence 意為「獨立、自主」，指不依賴他人而能自立的狀態。","options":["dependence","independence","confusion","anxiety"],"sentence":"After living with her parents for twenty years, she finally achieved ______ by moving into her own apartment and supporting herself financially. She no longer needed their financial assistance.","translation":"在與父母生活了二十年後，她終於通過搬到自己的公寓並自給自足而獲得了獨立。她不再需要他們的經濟援助。","word":"independence"}},"independent":{"createdAt":1781564440934,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"independent 作形容詞表示獨立的，指不依賴他人、能自主做決定的。","options":["dependent","independent","uncertain","indecisive"],"sentence":"The young woman was ______ and made all her own decisions without relying on others. She had moved out of her parents' house and supported herself financially.","translation":"年輕女性是獨立的，自己做所有決定，不依賴他人。她已經搬出父母的房子並自己承擔財務支持。","word":"independent"}},"index":{"createdAt":1783516475403,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"index指一個按照組織（通常是字母順序）的列表，幫助人們快速找到特定的信息或頁碼。","options":["preface","index","appendix","glossary"],"sentence":"You can find all the topics discussed in this textbook by looking at the ______ at the back. It lists page numbers for every subject alphabetically.","translation":"您可以通過查看書背的索引來找到本教科書中討論的所有主題。它按字母順序列出每個主題的頁碼。","word":"index"}},"indicate":{"createdAt":1781257238303,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"indicate指顯示、表明或指出某事，常用於從徵兆推斷結論。","options":["prevent","indicate","delay","cancel"],"sentence":"The dark clouds ______ that a storm was coming soon. Within the next two hours, heavy rain and lightning would arrive in the area.","translation":"烏雲表明暴風雨即將來臨。在接下來的兩小時內，該地區將迎來暴雨和閃電。","word":"indicate"}},"indication":{"createdAt":1783783369675,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"indication（指示；暗示）是一種信號或徵兆，表明某事可能發生或某事的真實情況。","options":["indication","decoration","location","production"],"sentence":"The dark clouds were a clear ______ that a storm was coming soon. The meteorologist confirmed that rain would begin within the next hour.","translation":"烏雲是暴風雨即將到來的明確跡象。氣象學家證實雨將在接下來的一小時內開始。","word":"indication"}},"indicator":{"createdAt":1781860901470,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"indicator是名詞，表示指標或標誌，指用來衡量或表示某種情況的事物","options":["obstacle","indicator","weapon","reward"],"sentence":"Rising unemployment is often considered a key ______ of economic recession. Economists use this figure as a measurement to predict future market trends.","translation":"失業率上升通常被認為是經濟衰退的關鍵指標。經濟學家以此數據作為衡量標準來預測未來市場趨勢。","word":"indicator"}},"indifference":{"createdAt":1784016923076,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"indifference 意為漠不關心、無所謂的態度，指對某事缺乏興趣或關心。","options":["enthusiasm","indifference","anxiety","curiosity"],"sentence":"His ______ toward the environmental crisis shocked his colleagues. Despite the urgent warnings, he showed no concern or emotional response whatsoever.","translation":"他對環境危機的漠不關心令同事們震驚。儘管有緊迫的警告，他絲毫不表示關切或情感反應。","word":"indifference"}},"indifferent":{"createdAt":1781582424691,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"indifferent表示不關心或冷漠，與didn't investigate和didn't take action相符，interested、concerned和sympathetic都表示有關心或同情。","options":["interested","concerned","indifferent","sympathetic"],"sentence":"The manager seemed ______ to the complaints from the employees about working conditions. He didn't investigate or take any action whatsoever.","translation":"經理對員工關於工作條件的投訴似乎漠不關心。他既沒有調查也沒有採取任何行動。","word":"indifferent"}},"indigenous":{"createdAt":1782824834608,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"indigenous（土著的；本地的）用來形容原本就屬於某個地方、自然發展於該地的民族或物種。","options":["foreign","indigenous","modern","imported"],"sentence":"The ______ people of Australia have lived on the continent for over 65,000 years. Their culture and languages developed naturally in this land long before European contact.","translation":"澳洲的土著民族已經在這個大陸上生活了超過65,000年。他們的文化和語言在歐洲人接觸之前早就自然發展於這片土地上。","word":"indigenous"}},"indignant":{"createdAt":1783516475401,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"indignant表示因為受到不公平或不尊重的對待而感到憤怒和憤慨。","options":["grateful","amused","indignant","confused"],"sentence":"The customer became ______ when the restaurant served the wrong dish for the third time. She loudly complained to the manager about the repeated mistakes.","translation":"當餐廳第三次上錯菜時，顧客變得憤慨。她向經理大聲抱怨了反覆發生的錯誤。","word":"indignant"}},"indispensable":{"createdAt":1781884659829,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"indispensable 表示絕對必需、不能沒有的，強調某物對生存或功能至關重要。","options":["abundant","indispensable","precious","renewable"],"sentence":"Water is ______ for all living organisms to survive. Without it, no plant, animal, or human could exist on Earth.","translation":"水對所有生物生存是不可或缺的。沒有水，地球上沒有植物、動物或人類能夠存活。","word":"indispensable"}},"individual":{"createdAt":1781838276303,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"individual作為形容詞表示單獨的、個別的，強調每個人都是獨立的。","options":["nutritious","individual","compressed","standing"],"sentence":"Each ______ student must submit their own research project by Friday. The teacher will evaluate the work of every single person in the class separately.","translation":"每個學生必須在週五前提交自己的研究項目。老師將分別評估班級裡每個人的作品。","word":"individual"}},"individualism":{"createdAt":1787746599837,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"個人主義是強調個人自主、個人權利和個人成就優先於集體利益的哲學或態度。","options":["collectivism","individualism","conformity","traditionalism"],"sentence":"The artist's philosophy of ______ meant she prioritized her own creative vision over following popular trends. Her refusal to compromise her unique style, even when critics demanded conformity, demonstrated her unwavering commitment to this principle.","translation":"這位藝術家的個人主義哲學意味著她優先考慮自己的創意願景，而不是跟隨流行趨勢。她拒絕妥協自己獨特的風格，即使批評家要求一致性，也表現出她對這一原則的堅定承諾。","word":"individualism"}},"individually":{"createdAt":1782357080131,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"individually 表示逐個地、單獨地對待每一個人或事物，強調個別對待而非整體處理的方式。","options":["collectively","generally","individually","hastily"],"sentence":"The teacher assessed each student's progress ______ during the one-on-one meetings. She spent time with every single student to understand their unique strengths and weaknesses.","translation":"老師在一對一會議中個人地評估每位學生的進度。她花時間和每個學生單獨討論，以瞭解他們各自獨特的優點和缺點。","word":"individually"}},"induce":{"createdAt":1784796058841,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"induce作為動詞表示引誘或導致某事發生，在醫學背景下指藥物會導致或引發早產的情況。","options":["prevent","induce","delay","monitor"],"sentence":"The doctor warned that certain medications could ______ premature labor in pregnant women. She advised all expectant mothers to avoid these drugs unless absolutely necessary for their health.","translation":"醫生警告某些藥物可能會在孕婦中引誘早產。她建議所有準媽媽除非絕對必要以保護健康，否則應避免使用這些藥物。","word":"induce"}},"indulge":{"createdAt":1782352245072,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"indulge指的是允許自己享受快樂或滿足欲望，通常涉及過度或過分。","options":["deprive","limit","indulge","restrict"],"sentence":"The wealthy businessman tends to ______ himself with expensive watches and luxury cars. He spends a large portion of his income satisfying his expensive tastes.","translation":"這位富有的商人傾向於用昂貴的手錶和豪華汽車放縱自己。他花費大部分收入來滿足他昂貴的品味。","word":"indulge"}},"indulgence":{"createdAt":1782373576504,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"indulgence 指沉溺於某種習慣或行為，放縱自己對某事物的執著","options":["restraint","indulgence","exercise","learning"],"sentence":"His excessive ______ in video games caused him to neglect his studies. He spent fourteen hours daily gaming instead of attending classes.","translation":"他沉溺於電玩遊戲導致他忽視了學業。他每天花十四個小時玩遊戲，而不是去上課。","word":"indulgence"}},"industrial":{"createdAt":1783260805489,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"industrial意為「工業的」，用來描述與製造業或大規模生產相關的地區或活動。","options":["residential","agricultural","industrial","commercial"],"sentence":"The ______ zone near the city contained multiple factories and manufacturing plants. Heavy machinery and production facilities dominated the landscape in this area dedicated to manufacturing.","translation":"城市附近的工業區包含多個工廠和製造工廠。重型機械和生產設施主導了這個專門用於製造的地區的景觀。","word":"industrial"}},"industrialization":{"createdAt":1781581925128,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"industrialization 指的是工業發展和製造業的擴張，使社會從農業為主轉變為工業為主的過程。","options":["urbanization","industrialization","mechanization","globalization"],"sentence":"The ______ of the country transformed it from an agricultural society into a modern economic powerhouse. Factories replaced farms, and millions of workers moved to cities to operate machinery.","translation":"該國的工業化使其從農業社會轉變為現代經濟強國。工廠取代了農場，數百萬工人遷入城市操作機器。","word":"industrialization"}},"industrialize":{"createdAt":1781955529035,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"industrialize 指的是將一個地區或國家從農業經濟轉變為以工業製造為主的經濟。","options":["modernize","industrialize","urbanize","develop"],"sentence":"During the 19th century, many European countries began to ______ their economies rapidly. Factories replaced farmland, and millions of workers moved from rural villages to growing cities to work in manufacturing plants.","translation":"在19世紀，許多歐洲國家開始迅速使其經濟工業化。工廠取代了農田，數百萬工人從農村遷移到不斷發展的城市，在製造工廠工作。","word":"industrialize"}},"industrious":{"createdAt":1784438808443,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"industrious 意指勤勞、勤奮的，用來形容一個人努力工作、不怕辛勞的態度和特質。","options":["lazy","industrious","creative","friendly"],"sentence":"Sarah is very ______ and completes all her projects ahead of schedule. Her manager always praises her tireless work ethic and dedication to every task.","translation":"莎拉非常勤勞，總是提前完成所有的專案。她的經理總是稱讚她不知疲倦的工作精神和對每項任務的投入。","word":"industrious"}},"industry":{"createdAt":1781860901468,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"industry作名詞表示勤勉或勤奮，指認真努力地工作的品質","options":["laziness","industry","dishonesty","rudeness"],"sentence":"The ______ of the workers was evident in their dedication to completing the project on time. They worked long hours without complaint to meet the deadline.","translation":"工人的勤勉在他們致力於按時完成項目上顯而易見。他們不怨言地長時間工作以趕上截止日期。","word":"industry"}},"inevitable":{"createdAt":1783870466420,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"inevitable 意為不可避免的或必然發生的，表示無論採取什麼措施都無法防止某事發生。","options":["preventable","inevitable","temporary","avoidable"],"sentence":"Climate change and rising sea levels make coastal flooding ______ in many regions. Scientists have documented that these changes are occurring at such a rapid pace that nothing can prevent them.","translation":"氣候變化和海平面上升使許多地區的沿海洪災不可避免。科學家已證實這些變化發生速度如此之快，任何事物都無法阻止它們。","word":"inevitable"}},"inevitably":{"createdAt":1783388637631,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"inevitably是副詞，表示「不可避免地、必然地」，強調某事一定會發生且無法改變。","options":["possibly","inevitably","perhaps","occasionally"],"sentence":"If you continue to procrastinate on your studies, you will ______ fail the final exam. Every student who has ignored their coursework this semester has ended up getting poor results.","translation":"如果你繼續拖延學習，你將不可避免地在期末考試中不及格。每個在這學期忽視課程的學生最後都得到了差的成績。","word":"inevitably"}},"infamous":{"createdAt":1788779295375,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"infamous 是指因不好的原因而聞名遐邇，通常指因犯罪、邪惡或極其不當行為而臭名昭著。","options":["wealthy","infamous","intelligent","mysterious"],"sentence":"The serial killer became ______ for his brutal crimes that shocked the entire nation. News outlets worldwide covered his trial extensively because of his notoriously evil reputation.","translation":"這個連環殺手因他那令整個國家震驚的殘暴罪行而臭名昭著。由於他惡名遠播的聲譽，全球新聞媒體都廣泛報導了他的審判。","word":"infamous"}},"infancy":{"createdAt":1784818655893,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"infancy 比喻事物發展的早期階段，此時技術或組織還很年輕和不成熟。","options":["adulthood","infancy","decline","maturity"],"sentence":"The internet was still in its ______ during the 1990s when few people had access to computers. The technology had just begun to develop and was not yet widespread.","translation":"在1990年代，網際網路還處於嬰兒期，當時很少有人能夠上網。這項技術才剛開始發展，還沒有廣泛應用。","word":"infancy"}},"infant":{"createdAt":1781425024018,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"infant是指非常小的嬰幼兒，通常指出生後不久的新生兒，比toddler更小。","options":["child","infant","teenager","toddler"],"sentence":"The newborn ______ cried throughout the night, keeping the exhausted parents awake. The baby was only three days old and still adjusting to life outside the womb.","translation":"新生嬰兒整夜哭鬧，讓疲憊的父母徹夜未眠。這個寶寶才三天大，仍在適應子宮外的生活。","word":"infant"}},"infect":{"createdAt":1783434356330,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"infect 是動詞，意思是使患病或被疾病侵害，通常指病毒、細菌等傳播到身體組織中。","options":["heal","infect","cure","strengthen"],"sentence":"The virus began to ______ the cells in the patient's body within hours. Doctors warned that without immediate treatment, the disease would spread to vital organs.","translation":"病毒在數小時內開始感染患者體內的細胞。醫生警告說，如果不立即治療，疾病將蔓延到重要器官。","word":"infect"}},"infected":{"createdAt":1783579287228,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"infected 是形容詞，表示受到病菌或病毒的侵襲，導致疾病或傷口惡化的狀態。","options":["healed","infected","clean","minor"],"sentence":"The ______ wound required immediate medical attention to prevent serious complications. The doctor prescribed antibiotics because bacteria had entered the injury.","translation":"被感染的傷口需要立即就醫以防止嚴重併發症。醫生開了抗生素因為細菌已經進入傷口。","word":"infected"}},"infection":{"createdAt":1781693304923,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"infection 指由病原體引起的傳染病或感染狀態，通常需要用抗生素治療。","options":["injury","infection","inflammation","allergy"],"sentence":"The doctor warned that without proper treatment, the ______ could spread to other parts of the body. She prescribed antibiotics to kill the bacteria causing the illness.","translation":"醫生警告說，如果沒有適當的治療，感染可能會擴散到身體的其他部位。她開了抗生素來殺死引起疾病的細菌。","word":"infection"}},"infectious":{"createdAt":1783516475399,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"infectious在此指具有吸引力和感染力的品質，能夠影響他人的情緒和行為。","options":["contagious","infectious","spreading","communicable"],"sentence":"The band's ______ energy got the entire crowd dancing and singing along. Everyone at the concert was smiling and moving to the beat within minutes.","translation":"樂隊具有感染力的能量讓整個觀眾群跳舞唱歌。音樂會上的每個人在幾分鐘內都在微笑並隨著節奏搖擺。","word":"infectious"}},"infer":{"createdAt":1784454261441,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"infer 是指根據已知的事實或證據推斷出邏輯上的結論。","options":["ignore","construct","infer","observe"],"sentence":"From the student's perfect test scores and consistent participation, we can ______ that she is a dedicated learner. The evidence clearly supports this conclusion without her stating it explicitly.","translation":"從學生的完美測驗成績和持續參與來看，我們可以推斷她是一位勤奮的學習者。這些證據清楚地支持這個結論，而無需她明確說明。","word":"infer"}},"inferior":{"createdAt":1781515329264,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"inferior 形容詞，意思是次等的、劣於，用來描述質量或價值較低的事物。","options":["superior","inferior","comparable","equivalent"],"sentence":"The ______ quality of the counterfeit product became obvious when we opened the package. The materials felt cheap, and the craftsmanship was noticeably poor compared to the authentic version.","translation":"當我們打開包裝時，假冒產品的次等品質變得顯而易見。材料感覺廉價，與正品相比工藝明顯低劣。","word":"inferior"}},"inferiority":{"createdAt":1784648623658,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"inferiority 指「低劣、次等、自卑感」，尤其是指由於與他人比較而產生的心理感受。","options":["superiority","inferiority","neutrality","popularity"],"sentence":"The athlete struggled with feelings of ______ after losing to a stronger competitor. These self-doubts began to affect her confidence in future competitions.","translation":"在輸給更強的對手後，該運動員開始對自己產生自卑感。這些自我懷疑開始影響她在未來比賽中的信心。","word":"inferiority"}},"inferiors":{"createdAt":1781425122878,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"inferiors 指職位較低或地位低於自己的人，與經理尊重所有員工這個脈絡相符。","options":["supervisors","inferiors","colleagues","competitors"],"sentence":"The manager treated his ______ with respect and fairness. He believed that everyone in the company, regardless of rank, deserved to be valued.","translation":"經理尊重和公平對待他的下級。他相信公司裡的每個人，無論職位如何，都應該受到重視。","word":"inferiors"}},"infinite":{"createdAt":1781848330179,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"infinite表示無邊無際、無窮無盡的，沒有限制或邊界的狀態。","options":["finite","infinite","spherical","mysterious"],"sentence":"The universe is so vast and ______ that scientists believe it extends endlessly in all directions. No matter how far our telescopes look, we can never reach its edge or boundary.","translation":"宇宙是如此廣闊無限，科學家相信它向各個方向無盡地延伸。無論我們的望遠鏡看多遠，我們永遠無法到達它的邊緣或邊界。","word":"infinite"}},"inflict":{"createdAt":1781787229334,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"inflict 指造成傷害、痛苦或損失，通常用於不幸或負面的事件。","options":["prevent","inflict","repair","announce"],"sentence":"The natural disaster ______ severe damage on the coastal communities. Thousands of homes were destroyed, and many people lost everything.","translation":"自然災害對沿海社區造成了嚴重的損害。數千戶房屋被摧毀，許多人失去了一切。","word":"inflict"}},"influence":{"createdAt":1781715397126,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"influence 意為「影響、影響力」，指一個人或事物對他人行為、觀點或決定的推動作用。","options":["pressure","influence","authority","control"],"sentence":"The famous celebrity's ______ over her millions of followers was so powerful that her fashion choices instantly became global trends. When she wore a particular style, stores across the world sold out within days.","translation":"這位著名名人對她數百萬粉絲的影響力非常強大，以至於她的時尚選擇瞬間成為全球潮流。當她穿上特定款式時，世界各地的商店在幾天內就會售罄。","word":"influence"}},"influencer":{"createdAt":1784899764060,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"influencer是指在社交媒體上具有廣泛影響力，能夠影響他人購買決策和意見的人物。","options":["celebrity","influencer","athlete","politician"],"sentence":"The social media ______ has millions of followers who buy products she recommends. Her endorsements can make or break a brand's success in the market.","translation":"這位社交媒體網紅擁有數百萬粉絲，他們購買她推薦的產品。她的代言可以決定一個品牌在市場上的成敗。","word":"influencer"}},"influential":{"createdAt":1783656305272,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"influential意指對他人或事物有重大影響力和權勢，能夠改變他人的決定或事件的進展。","options":["wealthy","influential","generous","successful"],"sentence":"The ______ businessman donated millions to charity and shaped government policies. His decisions affected thousands of people across the country.","translation":"這位有影響力的商人捐贈了數百萬美元給慈善機構，並影響了政府政策。他的決定影響了全國數千人。","word":"influential"}},"inform":{"createdAt":1781693293270,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"inform 是動詞，意思是「通知」或「告知」某人某些資訊。","options":["inform","plant","crush","priceless"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ all employees about the upcoming restructuring. The announcement was made through an official email sent to everyone's inbox.","translation":"公司決定通知所有員工即將進行的重組。公告通過發送給每個人收件箱的正式電子郵件發送。","word":"inform"}},"information":{"createdAt":1782980805885,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"information 作名詞，指提供有用數據、知識或答案的詢問處或服務窗口。","options":["complaint","security","information","luggage"],"sentence":"The ______ desk at the airport helped travelers find their gates and check flight schedules. Visitors could stop by to ask questions about any travel arrangements they needed.","translation":"機場的資訊台幫助旅客找到登機口並查詢航班時間表。訪客可以停下來詢問有關他們需要的任何旅行安排的問題。","word":"information"}},"informative":{"createdAt":1783309289515,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"informative 形容詞表示提供知識、信息或教育價值，能夠傳達有用和有益的內容給接收者。","options":["entertaining","informative","lengthy","dramatic"],"sentence":"The documentary was extremely ______ and helped viewers understand the complex history of ancient civilizations. By the end of the film, audiences had learned numerous facts and gained valuable knowledge they did not possess before.","translation":"這部紀錄片極具知識性，幫助觀眾理解古代文明的複雜歷史。到電影結束時，觀眾已經學到了許多事實，獲得了他們之前沒有的寶貴知識。","word":"informative"}},"informed":{"createdAt":1781693538704,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"informed 表示基於充分信息、知識或事實做出的決定或判斷。","options":["random","hasty","informed","reckless"],"sentence":"She made an ______ decision about which university to attend after researching programs and speaking with current students. Her choice was based on solid facts and careful consideration.","translation":"在研究課程和與現有學生交談後，她對選擇哪所大學做出了有根據的決定。她的選擇基於確實的事實和仔細的考慮。","word":"informed"}},"infrastructure":{"createdAt":1783573046430,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"infrastructure指城市或國家的基本建設，如道路、橋樑、港口等物理設施和系統。","options":["culture","infrastructure","population","government"],"sentence":"The city invested millions of dollars in improving its ______, including roads, bridges, and water systems. Without these basic facilities and utilities, a modern city cannot function properly.","translation":"這座城市投資數百萬美元改善其基礎建設，包括道路、橋樑和供水系統。沒有這些基本設施和公用事業，現代城市無法正常運作。","word":"infrastructure"}},"ingenious":{"createdAt":1783598428079,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"ingenious 形容某個想法、設計或人非常聰慧、巧妙，充滿創意和足智多謀","options":["simple","common","ingenious","experimental"],"sentence":"The engineer designed an ______ solution to reduce water waste in the factory. Her clever system recycled 80% of the water and saved the company millions of dollars annually.","translation":"這位工程師設計了一個巧妙的解決方案來減少工廠的用水浪費。她聰慧的系統回收了80%的水，每年為公司節省了數百萬美元。","word":"ingenious"}},"ingredient":{"createdAt":1786083122683,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ingredient 是指組成某物的單個成分或因素，在烹飪中常指製作菜餚所需的各種材料。","options":["flavor","ingredient","recipe","mixture"],"sentence":"The secret ______ in this recipe is a special blend of spices from Asia. Without this key component, the dish would taste completely different.","translation":"這個食譜中的秘密成分是來自亞洲的特殊香料混合。沒有這個關鍵成分，這道菜的味道會完全不同。","word":"ingredient"}},"inhabit":{"createdAt":1783759708909,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"inhabit 表示在某個地方生活或居住，強調物種在該環境中長期居住而非短暫訪問。","options":["visit","inhabit","observe","destroy"],"sentence":"Many species of birds ______ the wetlands during migration season. These areas provide them with food, water, and shelter for several months each year.","translation":"許多鳥類物種在遷徙季節居住於濕地。這些地區為牠們提供食物、水和庇護所，持續數月。","word":"inhabit"}},"inhabitant":{"createdAt":1781715397125,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"inhabitant 意為「居民」，指長期居住在某個地方的人。","options":["visitor","inhabitant","tourist","refugee"],"sentence":"Every ______ of the small island village had to evacuate when the hurricane warning was issued by meteorological authorities. The entire population of approximately five hundred people sought shelter on the mainland.","translation":"當氣象部門發佈颶風警報時，小島村莊的每位居民都必須撤離。大約五百人的整個人口都前往大陸尋求庇護。","word":"inhabitant"}},"inhabited":{"createdAt":1783760354083,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"inhabited 意為「有人居住的、被居住的」，用來形容有人住在其中的地方。","options":["inhabited","ancient","dangerous","deserted"],"sentence":"The explorers discovered a remote island that appeared to be ______. However, they found footprints, cooking tools, and signs of recent activity scattered throughout the forest.","translation":"探險家們發現了一個看似遠離人跡的島嶼。然而，他們在森林裡發現了足跡、烹飪工具和最近活動的跡象。","word":"inhabited"}},"inherent":{"createdAt":1781425104310,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"inherent 表示內在的、固有的、天生就有的特性或品質。","options":["external","temporary","inherent","relative"],"sentence":"Honesty is an ______ quality of his character that he has possessed since childhood. No matter what circumstances he faced, he never compromised his principles.","translation":"誠實是他自幼就具有的性格中固有的品質。無論他面臨什麼情況，他都從未妥協過自己的原則。","word":"inherent"}},"inherit":{"createdAt":1783402916385,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"inherit 意為從已故的親人那裡獲得金錢、財產或地位，通常是透過遺囑或法律程序。","options":["donate","inherit","purchase","display"],"sentence":"When her grandfather passed away, Maria would ______ his valuable art collection and his house. The will clearly stated that she was the sole beneficiary of his entire estate.","translation":"當她的祖父去世時，瑪麗亞將會繼承他貴重的藝術品收藏和房子。遺囑明確規定她是他整個遺產的唯一受益人。","word":"inherit"}},"inheritance":{"createdAt":1785914396905,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"inheritance 是指從已逝的親人或前人那裡獲得的金錢、財產或權利，通常通過法律程序進行轉移。","options":["achievement","inheritance","reputation","contribution"],"sentence":"She received a substantial ______ from her grandmother's estate after the funeral. The lawyer explained that the house, investments, and jewelry were all part of what her family member had left behind.","translation":"她在葬禮後從祖母的遺產中獲得了一筆可觀的遺產。律師解釋說，房子、投資和珠寶都是她的家庭成員留下來的東西的一部分。","word":"inheritance"}},"initial":{"createdAt":1781437013481,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"initial 形容事物的開始階段或最初的狀態，之後可能會改變或發展。","options":["final","initial","revised","approved"],"sentence":"The company's ______ proposal outlined a budget of five million dollars for the expansion project. After stakeholder feedback, the plan evolved significantly over the following months.","translation":"公司最初的提案為擴展項目概述了五百萬美元的預算。在利益相關者的反饋後，該計劃在隨後的幾個月內發生了顯著變化。","word":"initial"}},"initially":{"createdAt":1781715397123,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"initially 意為「最初、開頭」，表示事件或行為發生的早期階段，與後來發生的改變形成對比。","options":["eventually","initially","gradually","suddenly"],"sentence":"The company ______ refused to accept the new business proposal from its competitors. However, after reviewing the terms more carefully, the board decided to reconsider their position.","translation":"該公司最初拒絕了來自競爭對手的新商業提案。不過在更仔細地審查條款後，董事會決定重新考慮他們的立場。","word":"initially"}},"initials":{"createdAt":1783389641947,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"initials是指名字的首字母，通常是名字和姓氏各取第一個字母組成的簡寫。","options":["signature","initials","autograph","mark"],"sentence":"Please sign the document with your ______ in the top right corner. Your signature should include the first letter of your first name and the first letter of your last name.","translation":"請在文件的右上角用你的名字首字母簽名。你的簽名應該包括你名字的第一個字母和你姓氏的第一個字母。","word":"initials"}},"initiate":{"createdAt":1783760526714,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"initiate指開始或主動發起某件事，表示採取首要行動開展某個計畫或過程。","options":["cancel","initiate","conclude","review"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ a new training program for all employees next month. Management announced that this project would begin with orientation sessions and would continue throughout the quarter.","translation":"公司決定下個月為所有員工啟動新的培訓計畫。管理層宣布該項目將從迎新會開始，並將在整個季度內繼續進行。","word":"initiate"}},"initiative":{"createdAt":1783402916387,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"initiative 指一項新的計畫、方案或措施，通常旨在解決問題或帶來改變。","options":["tradition","initiative","criticism","problem"],"sentence":"The new ______ to reduce plastic waste was launched by the environmental committee last month. Students now bring reusable containers to school, and the cafeteria has eliminated all single-use plastics.","translation":"減少塑膠廢物的新倡議由環境委員會上月啟動。學生現在帶著可重複使用的容器上學，而自助餐廳已經消除了所有一次性塑膠製品。","word":"initiative"}},"inject":{"createdAt":1784204756954,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"inject表示「注射」，指用針筒將液體推入身體內部的動作。","options":["prescribe","inject","consume","apply"],"sentence":"The doctor will ______ the vaccine directly into your bloodstream to help build immunity. The needle will enter your arm to deliver the medicine effectively.","translation":"醫生將把疫苗注射到你的血液中以幫助建立免疫力。針頭將進入你的手臂以有效地輸送藥物。","word":"inject"}},"injection":{"createdAt":1784625437080,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"injection 是指用針將液體藥物或物質注射進入身體的動作或過程。","options":["treatment","injection","therapy","procedure"],"sentence":"The patient received a ______ to relieve the pain in his shoulder joint. The doctor used a needle to administer the medication directly into the affected area.","translation":"患者接受了一次______以減輕肩關節的疼痛。醫生用針將藥物直接注射到患處。","word":"injection"}},"injure":{"createdAt":1781566185160,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"injure意思是造成身體上的傷害或損傷，通常指事故或暴力行為導致的傷害。","options":["help","injure","entertain","inspire"],"sentence":"The car accident did not ______ him seriously, thankfully. He was treated at the hospital for minor cuts and bruises, and was released within a few hours.","translation":"幸運的是，那場車禍沒有嚴重傷害他。他在醫院接受了輕微割傷和瘀傷的治療，幾小時內就被釋放了。","word":"injure"}},"injury":{"createdAt":1781798927524,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"injury 表示由於事故或暴力造成的身體傷害或損傷。","options":["victory","injury","experience","achievement"],"sentence":"The soccer player suffered a serious ______ during the match and had to be carried off the field. His leg was broken in two places and required surgery to heal.","translation":"足球運動員在比賽中遭受嚴重傷害，必須被抬出球場。他的腿在兩個地方骨折，需要手術才能癒合。","word":"injury"}},"injustice":{"createdAt":1782140283165,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"injustice指的是不公平、不正義或不公正對待，與正義相反。","options":["fairness","equity","injustice","lawfulness"],"sentence":"The protesters marched through the streets to voice their outrage against the ______ in the legal system. Many innocent people had been imprisoned without proper trials.","translation":"抗議者走上街頭表達他們對法律制度中不公平的憤怒。許多無辜的人被投入監獄而沒有得到適當的審判。","word":"injustice"}},"inning":{"createdAt":1782660244675,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"inning 在棒球中指一局或一回合，每支隊伍輪流進攻和防守。","options":["score","inning","pitch","strike"],"sentence":"In the baseball game, our team scored three runs during the fifth ______. The opposing team got their turn to bat after we finished our time on the field.","translation":"在棒球比賽中，我們隊在第五局得了三分。在我們結束在場上的時間後，對方隊獲得了他們的打擊機會。","word":"inning"}},"innocence":{"createdAt":1785728734898,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"innocence指的是一個人的清白或天真無邪的狀態，通常用來形容因經驗不足而對世界充滿純真信任的人。","options":["guilt","innocence","wisdom","maturity"],"sentence":"The young child's ______ was evident in her naive belief that everyone was inherently good. When she learned about crime and deception for the first time, she began to understand the harsh realities of the world.","translation":"那個小女孩天真無邪的本質在她天真地相信每個人本質上都是好人的信念中顯而易見。當她第一次了解到犯罪和欺騙時，她開始理解世界的殘酷現實。","word":"innocence"}},"innocent":{"createdAt":1783516475406,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"innocent指在法律或道德上沒有犯罪或做錯事，或指天真無邪。","options":["guilty","innocent","suspicious","uncertain"],"sentence":"The defendant claimed to be ______ of all charges brought against him in court. The jury found no evidence to support the prosecution's case.","translation":"被告聲稱他在法庭上對所有控告都是清白的。陪審團找不到任何證據支持控方的案件。","word":"innocent"}},"innocently":{"createdAt":1783516475400,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"innocently表示以天真無邪或清白的方式做某事，沒有惡意或隱藏意圖。","options":["cunningly","naively","innocently","deliberately"],"sentence":"The child ______ asked why the sky was blue, not realizing his question would lead to a lengthy scientific explanation. His genuine curiosity came from a place of pure naivety.","translation":"孩子天真地問為什麼天空是藍色的，沒有意識到他的問題會導致冗長的科學解釋。他真正的好奇心來自純粹的天真。","word":"innocently"}},"innovation":{"createdAt":1781933311788,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"innovation（創新）指的是新穎獨特的想法或產品，與tradition（傳統）、repetition（重複）和complication（複雜化）都不符合句意。","options":["tradition","innovation","repetition","complication"],"sentence":"The company's latest ______ in smartphone technology has attracted millions of customers worldwide. This breakthrough design was completely different from anything competitors had released before.","translation":"該公司在智慧型手機技術上的最新創新吸引了全球數百萬消費者。這項突破性的設計與競爭對手之前發佈的任何產品都完全不同。","word":"innovation"}},"innovative":{"createdAt":1783260805490,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"innovative意為「創新的」，指富有創意並引入新想法或方法的事物。","options":["traditional","conservative","innovative","familiar"],"sentence":"The company earned praise for its ______ approach to solving customer problems. They introduced completely new methods and technologies that no competitor had thought of before.","translation":"該公司因其創新的方式解決客戶問題而獲得讚揚。他們引入了沒有競爭對手之前想到的全新方法和技術。","word":"innovative"}},"innumerable":{"createdAt":1785834138217,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"innumerable 意指數量極多，多到無法計算或數清楚的程度，常用來形容龐大而無法準確計數的事物。","options":["innumerable","bright","distant","visible"],"sentence":"The night sky contains ______ stars that stretch across the universe. Astronomers have attempted to count them, but there are far too many to enumerate.","translation":"夜空中包含無數的星星延伸穿過宇宙。天文學家試圖計算它們，但數量太多無法逐一列舉。","word":"innumerable"}},"inquire":{"createdAt":1785160871324,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"inquire 表示「詢問；調查」，指主動尋求資訊或進行調查，符合偵探詢問證人的情境。","options":["ignore","inquire","imagine","improve"],"sentence":"The detective decided to ______ into the mysterious disappearance at the hotel. He visited each room and asked the staff detailed questions about what they had witnessed.","translation":"偵探決定調查飯店裡的神秘失蹤案件。他拜訪了每間房間，並向工作人員詢問他們目睹的情況。","word":"inquire"}},"inquiry":{"createdAt":1782084127075,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"inquiry 作為名詞表示提出的問題或正式的詢問，通常是為了獲取信息或進行調查。","options":["donation","complaint","inquiry","payment"],"sentence":"The university received an ______ from a prospective student asking about admission requirements and scholarship opportunities. The admissions office promptly provided detailed information about the application process.","translation":"大學收到了一位準學生的詢問，詢問入學要求和獎學金機會。招生辦公室迅速提供了有關申請程序的詳細信息。","word":"inquiry"}},"insane":{"createdAt":1782202151142,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"insane 在此表示極其愚蠢或荒唐，不僅危險而是明顯違反理性的行為。","options":["risky","insane","ambitious","unusual"],"sentence":"His plan to climb Mount Everest without any training or equipment seemed absolutely ______ to everyone around him. Even experienced mountaineers agreed that attempting such a feat would result in certain death.","translation":"他沒有任何訓練或裝備就攀登珠穆朗瑪峰的計畫在周圍人看來絕對是瘋狂的。即使是經驗豐富的登山者也同意，嘗試這樣的壯舉會導致確定的死亡。","word":"insane"}},"insert":{"createdAt":1783516475404,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"insert指將某物放入或推入另一個物體中的動作。","options":["remove","insert","extract","withdraw"],"sentence":"Please ______ your credit card into the slot at the bottom of the machine. The ATM will then ask you to enter your PIN number.","translation":"請將您的信用卡插入機器底部的插槽。ATM 隨後會要求您輸入您的PIN碼。","word":"insert"}},"insight":{"createdAt":1781927792735,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"insight是指對某件事物的深刻理解或敏銳的洞察力，通常需要思考和分析能力。","options":["luck","guess","insight","accident"],"sentence":"The detective's ______ about the crime scene helped solve the mysterious case within days. Her ability to understand subtle clues and connect seemingly unrelated evidence proved invaluable to the investigation.","translation":"偵探對犯罪現場的洞察力幫助在幾天內破解了神秘案件。她理解細微線索並連接看似無關證據的能力對調查至關重要。","word":"insight"}},"insist":{"createdAt":1781849847405,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"insist表示堅持或強調，與「不接受例外」的嚴格態度線索相符。","options":["suggest","insist","wonder","question"],"sentence":"The teacher continued to ______ that all students submit their assignments on time. She would not accept any late work without a valid excuse.","translation":"老師堅持所有學生必須按時提交作業。她不會接受任何遲交的作業，除非有正當理由。","word":"insist"}},"insistence":{"createdAt":1783685028733,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"insistence是指堅定不移地堅持某個立場或要求，表示強烈而執著的態度。","options":["flexibility","insistence","agreement","compromise"],"sentence":"The manager's ______ on meeting the deadline was firm and unwavering. No matter how many obstacles appeared, she refused to compromise or delay the project completion.","translation":"經理對於按期完成的堅持是堅定不搖的。無論出現多少障礙，她都拒絕妥協或延遲專案完成。","word":"insistence"}},"inspect":{"createdAt":1783516475404,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"inspect指仔細檢查或檢驗某物以評估其狀況或是否符合標準。","options":["install","inspect","repair","replace"],"sentence":"The safety officer will ______ all the electrical wiring in the new building before it opens. He needs to ensure everything meets the required safety standards.","translation":"安全官員將在新建築開放前檢查所有電氣布線。他需要確保一切都符合要求的安全標準。","word":"inspect"}},"inspection":{"createdAt":1781484415156,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"inspection是指官方或正式的檢查和檢驗過程，通常用於確保符合安全或品質標準。","options":["decoration","inspection","construction","election"],"sentence":"The building failed the safety ______ last week due to several code violations. The inspector documented all the problems that needed immediate repair.","translation":"這棟建築物上週安全檢驗不合格，因為存在多項規範違規。檢驗員記錄了所有需要立即修復的問題。","word":"inspection"}},"inspector":{"createdAt":1786003753911,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"inspector是指被授權檢查和評估事物是否符合標準或規定的官方人員。","options":["chef","inspector","manager","owner"],"sentence":"The health ______ visited the restaurant to check if it met food safety standards. She examined the kitchen, reviewed the storage conditions, and documented any violations she found.","translation":"衛生檢查員視察了這家餐廳，以檢查它是否符合食品安全標準。她檢查了廚房、查看了儲存條件，並記錄了她發現的任何違規行為。","word":"inspector"}},"inspiration":{"createdAt":1785813063298,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"inspiration指的是激勵或啟發某人的事物，或者突然產生的創意想法和靈感，常用於藝術、創意工作的語境中。","options":["discouragement","perspiration","inspiration","obligation"],"sentence":"The musician said that watching live performances was a great ______ for composing new pieces. Without attending these concerts, he would struggle to find fresh ideas for his work.","translation":"這位音樂家說，觀看現場演出是創作新曲目的重要靈感來源。如果沒有參加這些音樂會，他將很難為自己的工作找到新想法。","word":"inspiration"}},"inspirational":{"createdAt":1781935654224,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"inspirational 是形容詞，表示「鼓舞人心的」或「激勵人的」，指能夠激發他人勇氣或靈感的內容。","options":["boring","inspirational","controversial","lengthy"],"sentence":"Her ______ speech about overcoming adversity moved the entire audience to tears. Many people said it changed their perspective on life.","translation":"她關於克服逆境的鼓舞人心的演講讓整個觀眾感動得流淚。許多人說這改變了他們對生活的看法。","word":"inspirational"}},"inspire":{"createdAt":1782200614309,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"inspire 表示「賦予靈感；激勵鼓舞」，當人們被故事或言語深深打動時，就會受到激勵。","options":["bore","confuse","inspire","discourage"],"sentence":"The motivational speaker's powerful words will ______ young people to pursue their dreams. His personal story of overcoming poverty moved many audience members to tears and changed their perspective on life.","translation":"這位勵志演講者有力的言辭將激勵年輕人追逐他們的夢想。他克服貧困的個人故事令許多觀眾感動得流淚，改變了他們對人生的看法。","word":"inspire"}},"inspiring":{"createdAt":1786065087763,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"inspiring 是形容詞，表示能夠鼓舞人心、激發他人動力和熱情的。","options":["boring","inspiring","confusing","lengthy"],"sentence":"The coach gave an ______ speech that motivated the entire team to work harder. His words were so powerful that every player left the locker room feeling energized and determined to win.","translation":"教練發表了一場激勵人心的演講，激勵整支隊伍更加努力工作。他的話語非常有力，每位球員都帶著活力和決心離開更衣室，決心要贏得比賽。","word":"inspiring"}},"install":{"createdAt":1781677018338,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"install是動詞，表示「安裝」或「設置」，指將軟體、硬體或系統置於可使用的位置或狀態。","options":["remove","create","install","count"],"sentence":"The IT team will ______ the new software on all office computers next week. They have already scheduled the maintenance window to ensure minimal disruption.","translation":"IT團隊將在下週在所有辦公室電腦上安裝新軟體。他們已經安排了維護時間窗口以確保中斷最少。","word":"install"}},"installation":{"createdAt":1781693270388,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"installation指「安裝、設置」，表示將設備、機器或系統放在適當的位置並連接使其能夠使用的過程。","options":["removal","installation","design","inspection"],"sentence":"The ______ of the solar panels took three days to complete from start to finish. Workers carefully mounted each panel on the roof and connected them to the electrical system.","translation":"太陽能電池板的安裝花了三天時間完成。工人們仔細地在屋頂上安裝了每塊面板並將它們連接到電氣系統。","word":"installation"}},"instant":{"createdAt":1783262026084,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"instant 作為形容詞表示「立即的、速食的」，用來描述迅速製成或立刻發生的事物。","options":["slow","delayed","instant","cold"],"sentence":"The coffee maker produced an ______ hot beverage within seconds of pouring the water. The fast preparation time made it perfect for busy mornings when there was no time to brew fresh coffee.","translation":"倒入水後，咖啡機在幾秒內產生了速溶熱飲。快速的準備時間使其非常適合忙碌的早晨，當時沒有時間沖泡新鮮咖啡。","word":"instant"}},"instead":{"createdAt":1785424294408,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"instead（代替；而不是）表示用一種選擇來替換另一種選擇，在這句中表示用水果替代蛋糕作為甜點。","options":["instead","afterwards","before","during"],"sentence":"I didn't eat the chocolate cake for dessert; I had a bowl of fresh fruit ______ . The fruit was much lighter and healthier after such a heavy meal.","translation":"我沒有吃巧克力蛋糕作為甜點；我吃了一碗新鮮水果來代替。在如此豐盛的一餐之後，水果輕盈得多，也更健康。","word":"instead"}},"instinct":{"createdAt":1782612098201,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"instinct是指生物與生俱來的、無需學習的自然傾向或反應，通常用於描述基於本性而非理性思考的行為。","options":["emotion","instinct","habit","reflex"],"sentence":"When the baby saw the loud noise, she cried out of pure ______, without thinking about it. Her natural reaction was immediate and automatic, requiring no conscious thought or learning.","translation":"當嬰兒聽到巨大的聲音時，她純粹出於本能而哭泣，沒有經過思考。她的自然反應是立即而自動的，不需要任何有意識的思考或學習。","word":"instinct"}},"instinctive":{"createdAt":1782619889129,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"instinctive 指的是一種自然而然、無需思考就會做出的反應，是與生俱來的本能。","options":["learned","instinctive","delayed","hesitant"],"sentence":"When the child saw the hot stove, her ______ reaction was to pull her hand away immediately. She did not need to think about it or be taught what to do.","translation":"當孩子看到炙熱的爐子時，她的______ 反應是立即縮回手。她不需要思考或被教導該做什麼。","word":"instinctive"}},"instinctively":{"createdAt":1782408854741,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"instinctively 表示根據本能或直覺而做出的反應，不需要經過理性思考或學習過程。","options":["carefully","instinctively","reluctantly","gradually"],"sentence":"When the child saw the hot stove, she ______ pulled her hand away without thinking. Her action happened so quickly that she didn't have time to consciously decide what to do.","translation":"當孩子看到熱爐子時，她本能地瞬間縮回手臂，沒有經過思考。她的動作發生得如此迅速，以至於她沒有時間有意識地決定該怎麼做。","word":"instinctively"}},"institute":{"createdAt":1784020538400,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"institute作名詞時指研究機構、學院或研究所，是進行學術研究和教育的正式組織。","options":["institute","museum","library","hospital"],"sentence":"Professor Chen works at a research ______ that specializes in studying climate change and environmental protection. The organization was founded in 2015 and now employs over two hundred scientists.","translation":"陳教授在一個專門研究氣候變化和環境保護的研究所工作。該機構成立於2015年，現在僱用超過200位科學家。","word":"institute"}},"institution":{"createdAt":1783400753186,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"institution 指的是具有特定社會功能和組織結構的機構或組織，如學校、銀行或政府部門等。","options":["building","institution","location","company"],"sentence":"The university is a prestigious ______ dedicated to education and research. Many students apply to this organization every year because of its excellent academic reputation.","translation":"這所大學是一個致力於教育和研究的著名機構。許多學生每年申請這個組織，因為它有優秀的學術聲譽。","word":"institution"}},"instruct":{"createdAt":1786195387789,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"instruct 意思是「指示」或「通知」，指傳授知識或提供明確的指導和說明。","options":["confuse","instruct","entertain","ignore"],"sentence":"The teacher will ______ the students on how to use the new laboratory equipment. She will provide detailed step-by-step directions so everyone understands the proper procedures.","translation":"老師將指示學生如何使用新的實驗室設備。她將提供詳細的逐步說明，以便每個人都理解正確的程序。","word":"instruct"}},"instruction":{"createdAt":1783516475406,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"instruction指關於如何做某事的詳細指示或教學，通常以書面或口頭形式提供。","options":["story","instruction","novel","article"],"sentence":"The ______ manual clearly explains how to assemble the furniture step by step. Following these detailed guidelines should make the process straightforward.","translation":"說明手冊清楚地逐步解釋如何組裝家具。遵循這些詳細的指南應該會使該過程很簡單。","word":"instruction"}},"instructor":{"createdAt":1781479123534,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"instructor 指的是教練或講師，負責教授特定技能或知識的人。","options":["student","instructor","competitor","audience"],"sentence":"The fitness ______ demonstrated the proper technique for performing squats before the class began their workout. Students watched carefully as she showed them each step to ensure they exercised safely and effectively.","translation":"健身教練在課程開始前示範了進行深蹲的正確技巧。學生們仔細觀看她展示的每一個步驟，以確保他們能夠安全有效地運動。","word":"instructor"}},"instrument":{"createdAt":1781839950958,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"instrument 在這裡指的是樂器,特別是用於演奏音樂的工具。","options":["microphone","tool","instrument","document"],"sentence":"The musician tuned his ______ before the concert began. He carefully adjusted the strings on his violin to ensure perfect pitch.","translation":"音樂家在音樂會開始前調整了他的樂器。他仔細調整小提琴上的琴弦以確保完美音高。","word":"instrument"}},"instrumental":{"createdAt":1782522524123,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"instrumental 是指起作用的、有幫助的，表示某事物或某人在達成目標中扮演了關鍵角色。","options":["instrumental","theoretical","minimal","accidental"],"sentence":"His advice was ______ in helping me succeed in my business venture. Without his guidance and support, I would never have reached my goals.","translation":"他的建議在幫助我在商業冒險中成功方面起了重要作用。沒有他的指導和支持，我永遠不會達到我的目標。","word":"instrumental"}},"insufficient":{"createdAt":1783423026253,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"insufficient 表示數量或質量不足以達到要求的標準，與 abundant、sufficient、comprehensive（豐富、充分、全面的）相反，句子強調需要更多數據。","options":["abundant","sufficient","insufficient","comprehensive"],"sentence":"The committee decided to reject the proposal due to ______ evidence supporting its effectiveness. The research team needs to conduct additional studies and gather more data before resubmission.","translation":"委員會決定因為證據不足而拒絕該提案，以支持其有效性。研究團隊需要進行額外的研究並在重新提交前收集更多數據。","word":"insufficient"}},"insult":{"createdAt":1781849847410,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"insult表示侮辱或羞辱，與「粗魯評論、客人受傷」的線索相符。","options":["compliment","insult","praise","encourage"],"sentence":"His rude comment seemed to ______ the guest during the dinner party. She was visibly hurt and left the table early that evening.","translation":"他在晚宴中的粗魯評論似乎侮辱了這位客人。她顯然感到受傷並提早離開了餐桌。","word":"insult"}},"insurance":{"createdAt":1783832368941,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"insurance 是一種提供經濟保障的協議，當發生損失或意外事件時，保險公司會賠償相關費用。","options":["coffin","reinforce","lounge","insurance"],"sentence":"Before buying a new car, Sarah purchased comprehensive ______ to protect herself against accidents and theft. Her monthly premium was affordable, and the policy covered all major damages and medical expenses.","translation":"在購買新車之前，莎拉購買了綜合保險以保護自己免受事故和盜竊的損害。她的月保費很實惠，該保單涵蓋所有重大損害和醫療費用。","word":"insurance"}},"insure":{"createdAt":1783228002796,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"insure 是指通過支付保費與保險公司簽訂協議，以便在發生損失時獲得賠償。","options":["protect","insure","guarantee","secure"],"sentence":"Before traveling abroad, it is wise to ______ your luggage against loss or damage. The insurance company will reimburse you if your bags go missing during the flight.","translation":"出國旅行前，最好為行李投保以防丟失或損壞。如果你的行李在飛行途中遺失，保險公司會賠償你。","word":"insure"}},"insured":{"createdAt":1781849847411,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"insured表示已投保的或被保險人，與「可以提出索賠、獲得賠款」的線索相符。","options":["unprotected","insured","vulnerable","exposed"],"sentence":"The ______ homeowner filed a claim after the fire destroyed the house. The insurance company approved the reimbursement within two weeks.","translation":"被保險的房主在火災摧毀房子後提出了索賠。保險公司在兩周內批准了賠款。","word":"insured"}},"intact":{"createdAt":1781715397124,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intact 意為「完整無缺的、未被破壞的」，指事物保持原本的狀態，沒有受到損傷。","options":["damaged","intact","restored","preserved"],"sentence":"Despite the severe earthquake that shook the entire region, the ancient temple remained ______ and structurally sound. Engineers were amazed that not a single stone was out of place.","translation":"儘管嚴重的地震震撼了整個地區，但古老的寺廟保持完整無缺且結構完善。工程師們驚訝地發現沒有一塊石頭移位。","word":"intact"}},"intake":{"createdAt":1781935654225,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intake 是名詞，表示「吸入」或「攝入」，指身體吸收或消耗的食物、液體或物質的量。","options":["output","intake","exercise","medication"],"sentence":"The patient's daily salt ______ should not exceed two grams according to his doctor's orders. The physician warned him about the dangers of excessive sodium consumption.","translation":"根據醫生的指示，患者每日的鹽分攝取量不應超過兩克。醫生警告他過量攝入鈉的危害。","word":"intake"}},"integrate":{"createdAt":1783395908752,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"integrate 表示使結合、使融合，將不同的部分或人群結合在一起。","options":["separate","isolate","integrate","segregate"],"sentence":"The school decided to ______ students from different neighborhoods into the same classroom environment. By mixing students from diverse backgrounds, the administration hoped to promote understanding and unity.","translation":"學校決定將來自不同社區的學生融合到同一個教室環境中。透過混合來自不同背景的學生，學校管理部門希望促進相互理解和團結。","word":"integrate"}},"integration":{"createdAt":1784625437079,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"integration 是指將不同的部分、系統或群體結合或綜合成一個整體的過程。","options":["acquisition","integration","purchase","expansion"],"sentence":"The company's ______ of the new subsidiary took three years to complete successfully. All departments, systems, and employees were brought together into one unified organizational structure.","translation":"該公司新子公司的______花了三年時間才成功完成。所有部門、系統和員工都被整合到一個統一的組織結構中。","word":"integration"}},"integrity":{"createdAt":1782746247864,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"integrity 是指一個人的清廉、誠實和道德品質，特別是在面對誘惑時保持正直的能力。","options":["humor","intelligence","integrity","popularity"],"sentence":"The politician's ______ was questioned when investigators discovered he had taken bribes. Despite his public claims of honesty, his actions revealed corruption and dishonesty.","translation":"調查人員發現這位政治人物收受賄賂後，他的清廉受到質疑。儘管他公開聲稱誠實，但他的行為卻顯露了腐敗和不誠實。","word":"integrity"}},"intellect":{"createdAt":1784625437080,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intellect 專指人的智力或智能，特別是指進行理性思考、推理和理解的能力。","options":["talent","intellect","skill","wisdom"],"sentence":"Her remarkable ______ allowed her to solve complex mathematical problems that challenged most scholars. She possessed exceptional reasoning abilities and could grasp abstract concepts instantly.","translation":"她傑出的______使她能夠解決困擾大多數學者的複雜數學問題。她擁有超群的推理能力，能夠立即掌握抽象概念。","word":"intellect"}},"intellectual":{"createdAt":1783042345897,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"intellectual 指的是與思維、智力、推理和知識等腦力活動有關的特質或能力。","options":["physical","social","intellectual","artistic"],"sentence":"Her ______ abilities were recognized when she won first place in the national mathematics competition at age twelve. Her capacity for complex problem-solving and abstract reasoning far exceeded that of her peers.","translation":"當她在十二歲時在全國數學競賽中獲得第一名時，她的智力能力得到了認可。她進行複雜問題解決和抽象推理的能力遠超同齡人。","word":"intellectual"}},"intelligence":{"createdAt":1785118805535,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intelligence在此指「情報或資訊」，特別是指由政府或間諜機構蒐集的機密資訊，用於戰略決策。","options":["courage","intelligence","tradition","emotion"],"sentence":"The spy agency gathered critical ______ about the enemy's military movements. The classified information they collected helped government officials make informed decisions about national security.","translation":"間諜機構蒐集了關於敵軍軍事行動的關鍵情報。他們蒐集的機密資訊幫助政府官員就國家安全做出明智決定。","word":"intelligence"}},"intelligent":{"createdAt":1786284532216,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intelligent是形容詞，表示某人擁有聰慧的心智、聰明能幹的特質，能夠快速學習和理解困難的事物。","options":["lazy","intelligent","tall","friendly"],"sentence":"The ______ student solved the difficult math problem in just a few minutes. Her quick thinking and ability to understand complex concepts impressed everyone in the class.","translation":"那位聰明的學生只花了幾分鐘就解決了那個難題。她快速的思考能力和理解複雜概念的能力讓班上的每個人都印象深刻。","word":"intelligent"}},"intend":{"createdAt":1781849847402,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intend表示計畫或打算做某事，與「已經採取具體行動」的線索相符。","options":["forgot","intend","dreamed","assumed"],"sentence":"She ______ to finish her project by Friday. She has already scheduled time and gathered all necessary materials.","translation":"她計畫在星期五之前完成她的項目。她已經安排了時間並收集了所有必要的材料。","word":"intend"}},"intense":{"createdAt":1784293679180,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"intense 表示程度深、力量大、感受強烈，常用來形容極其費力或令人感到強烈的事物。","options":["moderate","gentle","intense","relaxing"],"sentence":"The athletes experienced an ______ workout that left them exhausted and sweating heavily. Their trainer pushed them to their physical limits with extreme difficulty.","translation":"運動員經歷了一次強烈的訓練，使他們筋疲力盡，大汗淋漓。他們的教練用極端的難度將他們推向了身體的極限。","word":"intense"}},"intensify":{"createdAt":1783945487821,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"intensify 表示「加強」或「增強」，指使某事物的程度或強度變得更大或更強。","options":["tend","resume","range","intensify"],"sentence":"The coach will ______ the team's training schedule before the championship match. The players will now train twice a day instead of once a day to improve their fitness.","translation":"教練將在錦標賽比賽前加強球隊的訓練日程。球員現在每天訓練兩次而不是一次，以提高他們的體能。","word":"intensify"}},"intensity":{"createdAt":1784347972143,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intensity 指某事物的強烈程度或劇烈程度，常用於描述自然現象、感情或物理量的強度水平。","options":["weather","intensity","speed","darkness"],"sentence":"The ______ of the storm increased dramatically as dark clouds gathered overhead. The wind grew so strong that trees were uprooted and power lines fell.","translation":"隨著烏雲聚集在頭頂，暴風雨的強烈程度急劇增加。風變得如此猛烈，以至於樹木被連根拔起，電線桿也倒塌了。","word":"intensity"}},"intensive":{"createdAt":1783823805982,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intensive 形容詞表示集中的、密集的、加強的，通常指投入大量時間和精力的活動。","options":["casual","intensive","occasional","relaxed"],"sentence":"The athlete underwent ______ training for six months to prepare for the Olympic Games. She trained eight hours every day, following a rigorous schedule that left her exhausted but determined.","translation":"這位運動員進行了六個月的密集訓練以準備奧運會。她每天訓練八小時，遵循嚴格的日程安排，這讓她感到筋疲力盡但決心堅定。","word":"intensive"}},"intent":{"createdAt":1782048417506,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intent 指某人行動背後的目的或意圖，通常用於描述做某事的動機或目標，尤其在法律或道德判斷的語境中。","options":["emotion","intent","location","timeline"],"sentence":"The detective questioned whether the suspect's ______ was to steal money or to seek revenge. The witness clearly saw him taking items from the safe, which proved his purpose was financial gain.","translation":"偵探質疑嫌疑人的意圖是竊取金錢還是尋求報復。證人清楚地看到他從保險箱裡拿走物品，這證明了他的目的是經濟利益。","word":"intent"}},"intention":{"createdAt":1783685293800,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intention意思是「目的、意圖」，指一個人做某事之前已經決定或計畫好的目標。","options":["result","intention","outcome","effect"],"sentence":"His ______ was to help the community rebuild after the disaster. However, he was criticized for what he actually did, which contradicted his stated purpose.","translation":"他的目的是幫助社區在災難後重建。然而，他因實際所為而受到批評，這與他聲稱的目的相矛盾。","word":"intention"}},"intentional":{"createdAt":1785936120022,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intentional 表示某事是有意為之或故意的，而不是意外或無心的。","options":["successful","intentional","surprising","illegal"],"sentence":"The coach didn't believe the foul was ______ because the player was simply trying to block the ball. The video review clearly showed the player had no desire to hurt the opponent.","translation":"教練不相信這個犯規是故意的，因為球員只是在試圖擋住球。錄影回放清楚地顯示球員沒有傷害對手的意圖。","word":"intentional"}},"interact":{"createdAt":1784982601057,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"互動是指相互之間進行持續的雙向交流和影響，不僅僅是出現或相遇。","options":["communicate","interact","appear","meet"],"sentence":"The two characters ______ with each other throughout the entire film, constantly arguing and resolving conflicts. Their dynamic relationship drives the main plot forward from beginning to end.","translation":"這兩個角色在整部電影中互相互動，不斷爭論和解決衝突。他們的動態關係從開始到結束推動了主要情節。","word":"interact"}},"interaction":{"createdAt":1781714871284,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"互動是指兩個或多個個體之間相互溝通、交流和影響的過程。","options":["silence","interaction","distance","confusion"],"sentence":"The ______ between the teacher and students was very positive and engaging during the class discussion. They exchanged ideas, asked questions, and listened to each other actively.","translation":"課堂討論期間，老師和學生之間的互動非常積極且引人入勝。他們交換想法、提問並積極傾聽彼此。","word":"interaction"}},"interactive":{"createdAt":1785994109580,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「interactive」是指需要雙向溝通或參與者積極參與的特性，特別是在展覽、教育或軟體中涉及使用者的主動互動。","options":["passive","interactive","static","decorative"],"sentence":"The museum's new exhibit is highly ______ , allowing visitors to touch the displays and participate in hands-on activities. The exhibit designers specifically created stations where guests can manipulate objects and receive immediate feedback from the technology.","translation":"這個博物館的新展覽是高度互動的，允許訪客觸摸展品並參與親身體驗的活動。展覽設計師特意創造了一些站點，讓訪客可以操縱物體並從科技中獲得即時反饋。","word":"interactive"}},"interfere":{"createdAt":1782018712119,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「interfere」表示某物妨礙或阻礙另一物的正常運作，或兩種事物之間產生不利的相互作用。","options":["enhance","interfere","improve","support"],"sentence":"The radio signal began to ______ with the television reception in the living room. Both devices stopped working properly at the same time.","translation":"無線電信號開始干擾客廳的電視接收。兩台設備同時無法正常工作。","word":"interfere"}},"interference":{"createdAt":1786017300854,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"interference意指妨礙或干涉，在此句中指信號被破壞或受阻，導致廣播品質變差的情況。","options":["cooperation","interference","assistance","harmony"],"sentence":"The radio signal suffered from ______ caused by nearby electrical equipment. The static became so severe that the broadcast was completely unlistenable.","translation":"無線電信號受到附近電器設備造成的干擾。靜電變得非常嚴重，使得廣播完全無法收聽。","word":"interference"}},"interior":{"createdAt":1782308456170,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Interior 指建築物或區域的內部，與外部相對，常用於描述室內裝飾和設計。","options":["exterior","interior","temporary","minimal"],"sentence":"The ______ design of the mansion featured marble columns and crystal chandeliers throughout every room. The architects paid special attention to decorating and furnishing the spaces inside the building.","translation":"這座豪宅的室內設計在每個房間都採用大理石柱子和水晶吊燈。建築師特別關注裝飾和布置建築物內部的空間。","word":"interior"}},"intermix":{"createdAt":1781564440925,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intermix 作動詞表示使混合、使混雜，指將不同的物質或元素混合在一起。","options":["separate","intermix","isolate","contrast"],"sentence":"The artist decided to ______ oil paint with watercolor in a single artwork. By blending these two different mediums together, she created a unique texture and effect.","translation":"藝術家決定在一件藝術作品中混合油畫和水彩。通過將這兩種不同的媒介混合在一起，她創造了獨特的質感和效果。","word":"intermix"}},"internal":{"createdAt":1784454261443,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"internal 是指在內部的、體內的，與外部相對。","options":["external","internal","minor","reported"],"sentence":"The patient complained of ______ bleeding in the abdomen after the car accident. The doctor ordered imaging tests to assess the damage inside the body.","translation":"車禍後，患者抱怨腹部有內部出血。醫生下令進行成像檢查以評估身體內部的損傷。","word":"internal"}},"interpret":{"createdAt":1781835517798,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"interpret 意為口譯或解說，即將一種語言轉換為另一種語言，或解釋某物的含義。","options":["question","interpret","record","memorize"],"sentence":"The translator was hired to ______ the foreign speaker's words for the audience. Without her help, nobody in the room would have understood what was being said.","translation":"翻譯被雇來為觀眾口譯外國演講者的言辭。沒有她的幫助，房間裡的任何人都不會理解所說的話。","word":"interpret"}},"interpretation":{"createdAt":1783760526715,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"interpretation指對事物或作品的理解和闡釋，反映出個人對其含義的解讀和分析。","options":["interpretation","creation","reproduction","copy"],"sentence":"The artist's ______ of the ancient painting was completely different from what art historians had previously believed. After examining historical documents, experts agreed that her unique perspective had revealed something important that had been overlooked.","translation":"藝術家對這幅古代繪畫的詮釋完全不同於藝術史學家之前的看法。在檢查歷史文件後，專家們同意她獨特的視角揭示了一些以前被忽視的重要東西。","word":"interpretation"}},"interpreter":{"createdAt":1786017950560,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"interpreter 是指專門進行口頭翻譯的人，能夠即時將一種語言轉換為另一種語言以便溝通。","options":["interpreter","accountant","consultant","architect"],"sentence":"The company hired a professional ______ to facilitate communication between the Japanese executives and the American investors. Without this skilled translator's assistance, the two groups would not have been able to understand each other's spoken words.","translation":"公司聘請了一位專業的口譯員來促進日本高管和美國投資者之間的溝通。沒有這位熟練翻譯員的協助，兩個小組就無法理解彼此的口頭言辭。","word":"interpreter"}},"interrupt":{"createdAt":1781832478020,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"interrupt 意為「插嘴」或「打斷」，用來表示在他人說話時突然插入自己的話語。","options":["listen","interrupt","understand","support"],"sentence":"Please don't ______ me while I'm speaking; I need to finish my thought. I was in the middle of explaining my proposal when you asked that question.","translation":"當我說話時，請不要打斷我；我需要把我的想法說完。我正在解釋我的提案時，你問了那個問題。","word":"interrupt"}},"interruption":{"createdAt":1786416115759,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"interruption指說話或行動被打斷或中斷，特別是在對話或會議中有人突然插話或阻礙進行。","options":["interruption","precision","expansion","celebration"],"sentence":"The meeting suffered from constant ______ as people kept checking their phones and talking out of turn. The manager finally asked everyone to silence their devices and wait for their turn to speak.","translation":"會議因為人們不斷查看手機和插話而受到不斷的打斷。經理最後要求所有人關閉手機並等待輪到自己發言。","word":"interruption"}},"intersection":{"createdAt":1783823805978,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intersection 是指兩條或多條道路相交的地點，特別是城市中的十字路口。","options":["destination","intersection","bridge","tunnel"],"sentence":"The car accident occurred at the busy ______ where two major highways crossed. Police officers arrived quickly to direct traffic and investigate the collision that happened right where the roads met.","translation":"車禍發生在兩條主幹道相交的繁忙十字路口。警察迅速趕到以指揮交通並調查發生在道路相交處的碰撞事故。","word":"intersection"}},"interval":{"createdAt":1783756887728,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"interval 表示兩個事物或地點之間的距離或空間間隔，在這個句子中指兩名跑步者之間的距離。","options":["duration","interval","schedule","routine"],"sentence":"The two runners maintained a steady ______ between them throughout the race. By the finish line, the faster runner had increased this distance to over fifty meters.","translation":"兩名跑步者在整個比賽中保持穩定的間隔。到了終點線，速度更快的跑步者已經將這段距離增加到五十多米。","word":"interval"}},"intervene":{"createdAt":1782575719151,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intervene意為「干預、調停」，指在衝突或問題中主動參與以改變其進展或結果。","options":["leave","intervene","ignore","delay"],"sentence":"The teacher had to ______ when the two students started arguing loudly in the classroom. Without her stepping in immediately, the situation would have escalated into a serious conflict.","translation":"當兩名學生在教室裡開始大聲爭論時，老師不得不干預。如果沒有她立即介入，局面會升級為嚴重的衝突。","word":"intervene"}},"intervention":{"createdAt":1782379142281,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intervention指的是插進或介入某件事情，特別是指採取行動去處理或解決一個問題。","options":["absence","intervention","observation","concern"],"sentence":"The teacher's ______ in the playground fight prevented the students from getting seriously injured. Her immediate action to separate the boys was necessary and timely.","translation":"老師在操場打架事件中的介入防止了學生們受到嚴重傷害。她立即採取行動分開男孩們是必要的和及時的。","word":"intervention"}},"interview":{"createdAt":1781767999779,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"interview 在這裡指的是正式的工作面試，通常由僱主進行以評估求職者的適合度。","options":["appointment","interview","meeting","discussion"],"sentence":"Sarah attended an ______ with the hiring manager at the tech company last Tuesday. The conversation lasted forty minutes and covered her professional experience and technical skills.","translation":"莎拉上週二參加了科技公司招聘經理的面試。談話持續了四十分鐘，涵蓋了她的專業經驗和技術技能。","word":"interview"}},"interviewer":{"createdAt":1781598671065,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"interviewer 作名詞表示面試官或進行面試的人，通常是代表公司進行招聘的人","options":["applicant","interviewer","receptionist","candidate"],"sentence":"The ______ asked me challenging questions about my previous work experience. After the meeting, she told me the hiring committee would contact me within a week.","translation":"面試官問我有關我以前工作經驗的具有挑戰性的問題。會議後，她告訴我招聘委員會將在一週內與我聯繫。","word":"interviewer"}},"intimacy":{"createdAt":1783759708909,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"intimacy 指人與人之間的親密關係和精神上的親近，包括信任、理解和深層的情感聯繫。","options":["distance","formality","intimacy","indifference"],"sentence":"The couple developed a deep sense of ______ through years of shared experiences and vulnerable conversations. Their closeness was built on mutual trust and understanding rather than physical affection alone.","translation":"這對夫婦通過多年的共同經歷和真誠對話建立了深厚的親密感。他們的親近是建立在相互信任和理解之上，而非僅僅是身體接觸。","word":"intimacy"}},"intimate":{"createdAt":1781566055843,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"intimate 表示關係親密、個人的，通常指那些涉及深層信任和情感共享的互動。","options":["casual","formal","intimate","distant"],"sentence":"The couple shared an ______ conversation over dinner, discussing their deepest fears and dreams. They had been together for fifteen years and could be completely vulnerable with each other.","translation":"這對情侶在晚餐時進行了一次親密的對話，討論了他們最深層的恐懼和夢想。他們在一起已經十五年了，彼此可以完全敞開心扉。","word":"intimate"}},"intimidate":{"createdAt":1784543009911,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intimidate是動詞，意思是威嚇或脅迫；與「威脅」和「紀律處分」的情境相符。","options":["encourage","intimidate","console","befriend"],"sentence":"The bully tried to ______ the smaller students by threatening them in the hallway. However, the students reported him to the principal and he faced disciplinary action.","translation":"這個霸凌者試圖在走廊裡威嚇較小的學生。然而，這些學生向校長舉報了他，他面臨紀律處分。","word":"intimidate"}},"intimidating":{"createdAt":1781955529033,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intimidating 形容人或事物令人感到害怕、畏懼或不自在的特質。","options":["friendly","intimidating","welcoming","approachable"],"sentence":"The new manager's ______ presence made the junior employees nervous during their first meeting. However, once they got to know him better, they realized he was actually quite friendly and supportive.","translation":"新經理令人生畏的氣場在第一次會議上使初級員工感到緊張。然而，一旦他們更好地了解他，他們意識到他實際上相當友好且樂於支持他人。","word":"intimidating"}},"intonation":{"createdAt":1782637076488,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intonation 是語調或聲調的意思，特別指說話時聲音的高低起伏變化。","options":["grammar","intonation","vocabulary","accent"],"sentence":"The language teacher corrected the student's ______ when he mispronounced the rising and falling patterns of English speech. The way sounds went up and down was crucial for proper English pronunciation.","translation":"語言教師糾正了學生對英語語調的錯誤，因為他發音時上升和下降的模式不正確。聲音的升降方式對於正確的英語發音至關重要。","word":"intonation"}},"intoxicate":{"createdAt":1782533789100,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intoxicate 動詞意思是使中毒或使喝醉，描述有害物質對身體造成的毒害影響。","options":["heal","intoxicate","nourish","strengthen"],"sentence":"The strong medication could ______ patients if taken in excessive doses without medical supervision. Doctors warned that overdosing would cause serious toxicity and altered mental states.","translation":"如果在沒有醫療監督的情況下過量服用，這種強效藥物可能會使患者中毒。醫生警告過量會造成嚴重毒性和精神狀態改變。","word":"intoxicate"}},"intricate":{"createdAt":1782292205387,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intricate用來形容精細複雜且難以理解的事物，特別是指設計或結構涉及許多相互關聯的部分。","options":["simple","intricate","modern","colorful"],"sentence":"The ______ design of the ancient temple took master craftsmen decades to complete. Every carved detail and interconnected pattern required extraordinary skill to understand and execute.","translation":"古代寺廟的錯綜複雜設計花費了工匠們數十年才完成。每一個雕刻細節和相互連接的圖案都需要非凡的技能才能理解和執行。","word":"intricate"}},"intrigue":{"createdAt":1783323381796,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intrigue 作為動詞表示使某人深感興趣或迷住，激起某人的好奇心。","options":["confuse","intrigue","bore","frighten"],"sentence":"The mysterious plot of the novel began to ______ her from the very first chapter. She found herself unable to put the book down because she wanted to discover what secrets the characters were hiding.","translation":"這部小說的神祕情節從第一章開始就讓她著迷。她發現自己無法放下這本書，因為她想發現角色隱藏著什麼祕密。","word":"intrigue"}},"introduce":{"createdAt":1783516475402,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"introduce指採用或推行新的事物、產品或服務，將其推向市場或引入某個環境。","options":["abandon","introduce","recall","discontinue"],"sentence":"The company plans to ______ a new line of eco-friendly products next quarter. This initiative will help them reach environmentally conscious consumers.","translation":"該公司計劃在下一季度推出一系列生態友好型產品。這一舉措將幫助他們吸引環保意識強的消費者。","word":"introduce"}},"intrude":{"createdAt":1784439867437,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"侵入是指未經邀請或未經許可進入某個地方，通常帶有違反他人隱私或領地的含義。","options":["visit","intrude","wander","explore"],"sentence":"The homeowner was angry when strangers began to ______ into his private property without permission. He immediately called the police because these uninvited people had crossed his fence and entered his house.","translation":"當陌生人未經允許開始侵入他的私人財產時，房主很生氣。他立即報警，因為這些不速之客翻過了他的柵欄並進入了他的房子。","word":"intrude"}},"intruder":{"createdAt":1781693271585,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"intruder指的是未經邀請或未經允許闖入的人，強調其非法或不受歡迎的特性。","options":["guest","intruder","visitor","friend"],"sentence":"The police arrested the ______ who had broken into the house while the family was sleeping. The homeowners were terrified to discover an unauthorized person had entered their home.","translation":"警察逮捕了在家人睡覺時闖入房屋的不速之客。屋主們驚恐地發現有未經授權的人進入了他們的家。","word":"intruder"}},"intuition":{"createdAt":1781714871277,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"直覺是指不依賴邏輯推理或證據而產生的內心感受或判斷。","options":["calculation","intuition","memory","theory"],"sentence":"Sarah had a strong ______ that something was wrong, even though there was no obvious evidence. Later, she discovered that her gut feeling had been correct all along.","translation":"莎拉有著強烈的直覺，認為有些事情不對勁，儘管沒有明顯的證據。後來，她發現她的第六感一直都是正確的。","word":"intuition"}},"invade":{"createdAt":1782659817803,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"invade 表示以武力或敵意進入他人的領土或空間，在此句中描述軍事入侵行為。","options":["explore","invade","visit","trade"],"sentence":"The enemy troops decided to ______ the neighboring country without warning. Military analysts predicted the offensive would begin with airstrikes followed by ground forces crossing the border.","translation":"敵軍決定毫無警告地入侵鄰國。軍事分析家預測進攻將以空襲開始，隨後是地面部隊越過邊界。","word":"invade"}},"invaluable":{"createdAt":1782040742474,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"invaluable 形容詞意為「無價的、極為寶貴的、非常有用的」，用於強調某物具有極高的價值。","options":["worthless","useless","invaluable","forgettable"],"sentence":"The advice from her mentor proved ______ as she navigated the challenges of her career. Without that guidance, she could never have achieved such remarkable success.","translation":"導師的建議在她應對職業挑戰時證明是無價的。沒有那份指導，她永遠無法取得如此顯著的成功。","word":"invaluable"}},"invariably":{"createdAt":1784011981600,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"invariably表示「不變地、總是、一定地」，指某事物在所有情況下都保持一致，沒有例外。","options":["rarely","invariably","sometimes","occasionally"],"sentence":"Whenever Sarah attends meetings, she ______ arrives fifteen minutes early. Her colleagues have never seen her be late, not even once in five years.","translation":"每當莎拉參加會議時，她總是提前十五分鐘到達。她的同事在五年內從未見過她遲到，甚至一次都沒有。","word":"invariably"}},"invasion":{"createdAt":1783489104904,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"入侵是指軍隊或敵對勢力未經許可進入他國領土，通常伴隨著武裝衝突。","options":["alliance","invasion","cooperation","trade"],"sentence":"The ______ of the enemy forces caught the nation unprepared for war. Soldiers marched across the border and occupied major cities within weeks.","translation":"敵軍的入侵讓國家毫無戰爭準備。士兵們越過邊界，在數週內佔領了主要城市。","word":"invasion"}},"invent":{"createdAt":1784011912778,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"invent表示「發明」或「創造」全新的東西，不同於改進或修改已存在的發明。","options":["discover","invent","create","build"],"sentence":"Thomas Edison did not ______ the light bulb, as many people mistakenly believe. He actually improved an existing design that was already developed by earlier inventors.","translation":"許多人誤以為湯瑪斯·愛迪生發明了燈泡，但他實際上並沒有。他其實只是改進了早期發明家已經開發的現有設計。","word":"invent"}},"invention":{"createdAt":1782374741816,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"invention指的是人通過創新和設計而創造出的新東西或新裝置，不同於discovery（發現已存在的東西）。","options":["discovery","invention","tradition","impression"],"sentence":"The ______ of the telephone by Alexander Graham Bell changed communication forever. This breakthrough creation was patented in 1876 and became one of the most important technological achievements in history.","translation":"亞歷山大·格拉罕·貝爾對電話的發明永遠改變了溝通方式。這項突破性的創造在1876年獲得專利，成為歷史上最重要的技術成就之一。","word":"invention"}},"inventory":{"createdAt":1782374070900,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"inventory 是指「物品清單；存貨」，指對倉庫或商店中所有物品的詳細記錄和數量統計。","options":["layout","receipt","inventory","decoration"],"sentence":"The store manager checked the ______ to see how many items were still in stock. After counting all the boxes and products on the shelves, she recorded the exact numbers in the system.","translation":"店經理檢查了存貨清單，看看還剩下多少商品。在點完貨架上的所有盒子和產品後，她在系統中記錄了確切數字。","word":"inventory"}},"invest":{"createdAt":1783419789622,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"invest 是動詞，表示將金錢或資源投入到某個項目或事業中，期望獲得未來的利益或回報。","options":["donate","invest","lend","spend"],"sentence":"The wealthy entrepreneur decided to ______ millions of dollars in the startup company. He believed the innovative technology would eventually generate substantial returns over the next five years.","translation":"這位富有的企業家決定在這家新創公司投資數百萬美元。他相信創新技術在未來五年內最終會產生可觀的回報。","word":"invest"}},"investigate":{"createdAt":1784011981602,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"investigate表示「調查、調查研究」，指對某事進行深入、系統的審視以發現事實和真相。","options":["ignore","investigate","report","document"],"sentence":"The police department decided to ______ the suspicious circumstances surrounding the missing person case. Detectives collected evidence, interviewed witnesses, and examined the scene thoroughly.","translation":"警察局決定調查失蹤人員案件周圍的可疑情況。偵探們收集證據、詢問證人，並徹底檢查了現場。","word":"investigate"}},"investigation":{"createdAt":1782491138498,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"investigation 表示為了找出真相而進行的系統性調查、審查或研究過程。","options":["investigation","urinate","generate","glowing"],"sentence":"The police department launched a thorough ______ into the robbery that occurred last Tuesday night. Detectives interviewed witnesses, examined evidence, and reviewed security camera footage to find the culprits.","translation":"警察局對上週二晚上發生的搶劫案進行了徹底的調查。偵探詢問了證人，檢查了證據，並查看了安全攝像機的錄像以找到犯人。","word":"investigation"}},"investigator":{"createdAt":1783256139030,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"investigator 指的是進行調查和研究以發現事實的人。","options":["prosecutor","investigator","judge","lawyer"],"sentence":"The experienced ______ spent months examining evidence at the crime scene before reaching conclusions. She carefully reviewed every detail, interviewed witnesses, and studied forensic reports.","translation":"這位經驗豐富的調查人員花費數月時間在犯罪現場檢查證據才得出結論。她仔細審查每一個細節、採訪證人並研究了法醫報告。","word":"investigator"}},"investigators":{"createdAt":1786111147343,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"investigators 是指從事調查工作的專業人員，特別是在警察或執法機構中負責蒐集證據和破案的人員。","options":["detectives","investigators","spectators","architects"],"sentence":"The police department sent several ______ to examine the crime scene for evidence. These professionals had years of experience in collecting clues and interviewing witnesses.","translation":"警察局派遣了幾名調查員到犯罪現場檢查證據。這些專業人士在收集線索和詢問目擊者方面擁有多年的經驗。","word":"investigators"}},"investment":{"createdAt":1781515270342,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"investment 作名詞，指為了獲利而投入的金錢、時間或資源。","options":["curious","bucket","investment","prospect"],"sentence":"Sarah decided her ______ in the new technology startup was the right decision. After three years, the company's profits tripled and her initial deposit of $10,000 grew to $50,000.","translation":"莎拉認為她對新科技新創公司的投資是正確的決定。三年後，該公司的利潤增加了三倍，她最初投入的一萬美元增長到五萬美元。","word":"investment"}},"involuntary":{"createdAt":1781860901469,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"involuntary是形容詞，表示非自願的或不由自主的，指無法控制的反應","options":["deliberate","planned","involuntary","intentional"],"sentence":"His ______ reaction to the loud noise was to cover his ears immediately. He did not consciously decide to do this; it happened automatically.","translation":"他對巨大噪音的不由自主反應是立即捂住耳朵。他沒有有意識地決定這樣做；這是自動發生的。","word":"involuntary"}},"involve":{"createdAt":1781624534704,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"involve 意為「牽涉、涉及、包含」，表示某事物作為必要部分或結果而包括在內。","options":["prevent","ignore","involve","cancel"],"sentence":"The project will ______ cooperation between different departments and several weeks of hard work. Success depends on everyone contributing their unique skills.","translation":"該項目將涉及不同部門之間的合作和數周的辛苦工作。成功取決於每個人貢獻他們獨特的技能。","word":"involve"}},"involvement":{"createdAt":1781709984197,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"involvement 名詞表示參與、投入或涉及某項活動的程度。","options":["attendance","involvement","presence","performance"],"sentence":"The teacher praised my ______ in the class discussion and group projects. She noted that I participated actively and contributed meaningful ideas every day.","translation":"老師讚揚了我在課堂討論和小組項目中的參與。她指出我每天都積極參與並貢獻有意義的想法。","word":"involvement"}},"ironic":{"createdAt":1786244771287,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「ironic」用來描述一種出乎意料或自相矛盾的局面，其中實際發生的事情與預期或表面上的情況相反。","options":["fortunate","ironic","obvious","unfortunate"],"sentence":"It was ______ that the safety inspector failed the building for fire code violations, considering he had ignored three previous warnings about the same issues. His careless oversight made his criticism of others seem hypocritical and contradictory.","translation":"諷刺的是，安全檢查員因消防規範違規而不通過該建築物，儘管他之前對相同問題已經忽視了三次警告。他的粗心疏忽使他對他人的批評顯得虛偽和自相矛盾。","word":"ironic"}},"irony":{"createdAt":1783516475400,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"irony指一種對比或矛盾的情況，其實際結果與預期或適當的結果相反，通常產生諷刺效果。","options":["coincidence","tragedy","irony","misfortune"],"sentence":"There is a certain ______ in the fact that the fire safety inspector's house caught on fire last week. The situation is darkly humorous given his profession.","translation":"消防安全檢查員的房子上週著火的事實中存在某種諷刺。鑑於他的職業，這種情況是黑色幽默的。","word":"irony"}},"irrelevant":{"createdAt":1782920661031,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"irrelevant表示不相關或無關，指某事物與討論或情況沒有直接關係","options":["irrelevant","unimportant","unnecessary","useless"],"sentence":"The judge ruled that the witness's personal opinions were ______ to the case. Only factual evidence about the defendant's actions would be considered in court.","translation":"法官裁定證人的個人意見與案件無關。只有關於被告行為的事實證據才會在法庭上被考慮。","word":"irrelevant"}},"irrigate":{"createdAt":1787049198630,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"irrigate指供應水分到田地或土壤以灌溉農作物，也可指用液體沖洗傷口。","options":["harvest","fertilize","irrigate","measure"],"sentence":"The farmer used a system of pipes and channels to ______ the dry fields during the hot summer. Without this water supply, the crops would wither and die.","translation":"農民在炎熱的夏季使用管道系統給乾旱的田地灌溉。沒有這個供水系統，莊稼會枯萎死亡。","word":"irrigate"}},"irritable":{"createdAt":1781693538703,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"irritable 形容易發脾氣、容易被激怒或心情不好的狀態。","options":["calm","peaceful","irritable","cheerful"],"sentence":"The patient became very ______ after not sleeping for three days. His doctor advised him to rest because fatigue was making him short-tempered and easily annoyed.","translation":"在三天沒有睡眠後，患者變得非常暴躁。他的醫生建議他休息，因為疲勞讓他脾氣暴躁，容易被激怒。","word":"irritable"}},"irritate":{"createdAt":1784108569958,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"irritate 意思是使某人感到惱怒或煩躁，也可以指皮膚發炎或受刺激。","options":["comfort","irritate","entertain","inspire"],"sentence":"The constant noise from the construction site will ______ many residents who live nearby. Some people may even develop skin problems from the dust and pollution.","translation":"來自建築工地的持續噪音將使許多住在附近的居民感到惱怒。有些人甚至可能因為灰塵和污染而出現皮膚問題。","word":"irritate"}},"irritated":{"createdAt":1786892992017,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"irritated 表示被激怒或惱怒的狀態，通常是因為某事令人不快或煩人而引起的負面情緒。","options":["delighted","irritated","confused","amused"],"sentence":"The customer became ______ when the waiter kept forgetting his order. His angry tone and sharp complaints made it clear he had reached the end of his patience.","translation":"當服務生一直忘記他的訂單時，顧客變得惱怒。他生氣的語氣和尖銳的抱怨清楚地表明他已經失去耐心。","word":"irritated"}},"isolate":{"createdAt":1781860901469,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"isolate是動詞，表示使孤立或隔離，指將某人或某物分開以防止接觸","options":["integrate","isolate","display","celebrate"],"sentence":"The hospital decided to ______ the infected patients from the general population. They were placed in a separate ward to prevent the disease from spreading to others.","translation":"醫院決定將受感染的患者與普通人群隔離。他們被安置在單獨的病房，以防止疾病傳播給他人。","word":"isolate"}},"isolated":{"createdAt":1781452134702,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"isolated形容詞表示某物遠離其他地方、孤立的或與外界隔絕的狀態。","options":["central","populated","isolated","connected"],"sentence":"The remote research station was ______ high in the mountains, far from any nearby towns or cities. Scientists working there could only communicate with the outside world through satellite phones.","translation":"遠程研究站位於高山之上，與任何附近的城鎮相隔離。在那裡工作的科學家只能通過衛星電話與外界溝通。","word":"isolated"}},"isolation":{"createdAt":1781840892403,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"isolation表示與他人分開或被隔開，用於防止疾病傳播的情況下最為合適。","options":["consultation","isolation","celebration","observation"],"sentence":"The patient was placed in ______ to prevent spreading the infectious disease to others. The hospital staff ensured he had no contact with any other patients or visitors.","translation":"患者被隔離以防止將傳染病傳播給他人。醫院工作人員確保他與其他患者或訪客沒有任何接觸。","word":"isolation"}},"issue":{"createdAt":1784246008294,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"issue在此指「期號」或「期刊」，特別是指雜誌或報紙的某一期出版物。","options":["problem","issue","conflict","dispute"],"sentence":"The magazine's latest ______ features an in-depth article on climate change. We're currently reading the March 2024 publication that just arrived at the newsstand yesterday.","translation":"這本雜誌的最新期號刊登了一篇關於氣候變化的深度文章。我們目前正在閱讀昨天剛到達報刊亭的2024年3月份出版物。","word":"issue"}},"itch":{"createdAt":1781515634901,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「itch」表示身體某個部位發癢或感到瘙癢的動作和感覺。","options":["burn","itch","swell","tingle"],"sentence":"My arm started to ______ after I got bitten by a mosquito. The sensation was so uncomfortable that I couldn't stop scratching.","translation":"被蚊子叮咬後，我的手臂開始發癢。這種感覺非常不舒服，我忍不住一直在抓。","word":"itch"}},"itchy":{"createdAt":1785813063298,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"itchy是形容詞，用來描述身體或皮膚產生癢癢的感覺，需要抓或搔才能緩解的不適感。","options":["itchy","warm","comfortable","soft"],"sentence":"Sarah's skin felt ______ after she wore the wool sweater for an hour. She immediately changed into a cotton shirt to stop the uncomfortable scratching sensation.","translation":"莎拉穿著羊毛毛衣一小時後，她的皮膚感到癢癢的。她立即換上棉質襯衫以停止不舒服的搔癢感。","word":"itchy"}},"item":{"createdAt":1781625891347,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"item指列表、清單或議程中的一個單獨的條目或項目","options":["person","item","building","animal"],"sentence":"Please review the third ______ on the agenda before the meeting begins. It concerns the budget allocation for next quarter.","translation":"請在會議開始前查看議程上的第三項。它涉及下一季度的預算分配。","word":"item"}},"ivory":{"createdAt":1781843487265,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"ivory 是名詞，指象牙這種材料，通常來自大象的象牙，也可指象牙白的顏色。","options":["ebony","marble","ivory","pearl"],"sentence":"The piano had ______ keys that had yellowed with age over the decades. Museum experts confirmed these keys were made from elephant tusks harvested in the 1800s.","translation":"這架鋼琴的象牙色琴鍵經過數十年已經泛黃。博物館專家確認這些琴鍵是用19世紀採集的象牙製成的。","word":"ivory"}},"ivy":{"createdAt":1781499075059,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"常春藤是一種攀爬植物，以其能夠沿著牆壁和其他表面生長而聞名。","options":["moss","ivy","grass","vines"],"sentence":"The old brick mansion was covered in wild ______ that had grown over decades. The climbing plant created a picturesque appearance as it wound around the walls and windows.","translation":"古老的磚砌大宅被數十年來生長的野生常春藤覆蓋。這種攀爬植物纏繞在牆壁和窗戶周圍，營造了一種如畫的外觀。","word":"ivy"}},"jade":{"createdAt":1782101581240,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"jade 作為名詞表示「玉、翡翠」，是一種珍貴的綠色寶石，在中國文化中具有重要意義。","options":["marble","emerald","jade","crystal"],"sentence":"The museum's most precious artifact is an ancient ______ sculpture worth millions of dollars. This green stone was carefully carved by master artisans from China over a thousand years ago.","translation":"博物館最珍貴的文物是一尊古代玉石雕像，價值數百萬美元。這塊綠色寶石是由中國古代大師工匠在一千多年前精心雕琢而成的。","word":"jade"}},"jail":{"createdAt":1783566294625,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"jail表示拘留所或監獄，是關押被定罪或等待審判的人的地方。","options":["court","jail","trial","judge"],"sentence":"The criminal was sentenced to five years in ______. He would spend his time locked behind bars in the prison facility downtown.","translation":"這名罪犯被判在監獄服刑五年。他將在市中心監獄設施的鐵欄後面度過時光。","word":"jail"}},"janitor":{"createdAt":1783309938750,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"janitor是指負責清潔和維護建築物衛生的工作人員，通常在學校、辦公室或其他公共場所工作。","options":["teacher","janitor","principal","electrician"],"sentence":"The ______ arrived early in the morning to clean the school building and empty all the trash cans. He used a mop and bucket to wash the hallway floors before students arrived.","translation":"管理員一大早就到達學校清潔建築物並清空所有垃圾桶。他用拖把和水桶在學生到達前清洗走廊地板。","word":"janitor"}},"jasmine":{"createdAt":1781948564907,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"茉莉是一種常見的觀賞花卉，以其濃郁的香氣和白色花瓣聞名，經常被用來製作香水和茶葉。","options":["rose","jasmine","tulip","daisy"],"sentence":"The garden was filled with the sweet fragrance of ______ flowers blooming in the warm evening. Sarah picked a delicate white blossom to wear in her hair, enjoying its distinctive floral perfume.","translation":"花園裡充滿了______花在溫暖的夜晚綻放的甜蜜香氣。莎拉摘了一朵精緻的白色花瓣戴在頭髮上，享受著它獨特的花香。","word":"jasmine"}},"jealous":{"createdAt":1781747309097,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"jealous 用來形容因害怕失去某人或某物的關注而產生的不安全感和猜疑。","options":["grateful","jealous","curious","confused"],"sentence":"She felt ______ when her best friend started spending more time with someone else. Her constant worry that she was being replaced revealed her insecure nature.","translation":"當她最好的朋友開始花更多時間與別人在一起時，她感到嫉妒。她不斷擔心自己被取代，這反映了她缺乏安全感的本性。","word":"jealous"}},"jingle":{"createdAt":1783389549634,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"jingle 是指發出清脆、高音的金屬聲響，通常帶有節奏感，常用來形容小金屬物體相互碰撞所發出的聲音。","options":["clatter","jingle","thud","scrape"],"sentence":"The keys in my pocket ______ as I walked down the street. The bright, metallic sound was rhythmic and musical, like small bells ringing together.","translation":"我口袋裡的鑰匙在我沿著街道走時發出叮噹聲。那明亮的金屬音是有節奏的，很像小鈴鐺一起敲響的聲音。","word":"jingle"}},"jockey":{"createdAt":1782292151503,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"jockey指的是在賽馬比賽中騎馬的人，需要多年的訓練和技術才能勝任。","options":["trainer","jockey","spectator","veterinarian"],"sentence":"The ______ skillfully guided the horse around the track during the race. He had trained for years to master the techniques needed for this competitive sport.","translation":"賽馬騎士熟練地在比賽中引導馬匹繞過賽道。他已經訓練多年以掌握這項競技運動所需的技術。","word":"jockey"}},"jointly":{"createdAt":1781848934151,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"jointly表示共同地或聯合地進行某項活動","options":["separately","jointly","slowly","privately"],"sentence":"The two companies decided to ______ develop a new technology. By pooling their resources and expertise, they could complete the project faster.","translation":"兩家公司決定聯合開發一項新技術。通過整合資源和專業知識，他們可以更快地完成項目。","word":"jointly"}},"jolly":{"createdAt":1781836375378,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"jolly形容詞表示興高采烈的、快活的或充滿歡樂的。","options":["stern","jolly","grumpy","serious"],"sentence":"Santa Claus is traditionally depicted as a ______ figure with a big smile and round belly. His cheerful demeanor brings joy to children everywhere.","translation":"聖誕老人傳統上被描繪成一個興高采烈的人物，帶著燦爛笑容和圓潤的肚子。他愉快的舉止給世界各地的兒童帶來歡樂。","word":"jolly"}},"journal":{"createdAt":1781950727565,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"journal 指期刊或定期出版的學術雜誌。","options":["novel","journal","newspaper","textbook"],"sentence":"She publishes her research in a prestigious ______ that reaches thousands of scientists worldwide. The academic publication has been in existence for over fifty years.","translation":"她在一份享有聲譽的期刊上發表研究，該期刊觸及全球數千名科學家。這份學術出版物已存在超過五十年。","word":"journal"}},"journalism":{"createdAt":1781713470387,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"新聞工作是指從事新聞採編、報導和傳播信息的行業和專業。","options":["agriculture","mathematics","journalism","medicine"],"sentence":"She studied ______ in university and now works as a reporter for a major newspaper. Her job involves investigating stories, conducting interviews, and writing articles for publication.","translation":"她在大學裡學習新聞工作，現在是一家主要報紙的記者。她的工作涉及調查故事、進行採訪和撰寫文章以供發表。","word":"journalism"}},"journalist":{"createdAt":1781452134700,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"journalist名詞指的是以撰寫和報導新聞為職業的專業人士。","options":["baker","journalist","architect","mechanic"],"sentence":"The ______ spent weeks investigating the corruption scandal and interviewing witnesses. Her research was published as a detailed news report in the morning newspaper.","translation":"這名新聞記者花了數週時間調查腐敗醜聞並採訪證人。她的研究以詳細新聞報導的形式發表在晨報上。","word":"journalist"}},"journey":{"createdAt":1781310338172,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"journey 是指一次旅行或旅程，通常涉及較長的距離和時間。","options":["destination","journey","vehicle","schedule"],"sentence":"Their ______ across three continents took nearly six months to complete. They visited dozens of cities and crossed multiple oceans during this extended expedition.","translation":"他們跨越三大洲的旅程耗時近六個月才完成。在這次漫長的遠征中，他們訪問了許多城市並跨越多個海洋。","word":"journey"}},"joyful":{"createdAt":1785055734523,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Joyful是形容詞，表示充滿快樂和愉悅的情感狀態，通常帶有明顯的幸福和興高采烈的特徵。","options":["sorrowful","joyful","confused","tired"],"sentence":"The children were ______ when they opened their birthday presents. Their laughter and bright smiles showed they were experiencing genuine happiness and delight.","translation":"當孩子們打開生日禮物時，他們感到愉悅。他們的笑聲和燦爛的笑容表明他們正在經歷真正的快樂和喜悅。","word":"joyful"}},"joyous":{"createdAt":1783661880052,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"joyous 是形容詞，表示充滿歡樂和喜悅的，與第二句中的 happiness 和 delight 相呼應。","options":["gloomy","somber","joyous","melancholy"],"sentence":"The ______ celebration filled the entire stadium with laughter and cheers. Everyone was overflowing with happiness and delight at the victory.","translation":"歡樂的慶祝活動使整個體育館充滿了笑聲和歡呼。每個人都因為勝利而滿溢著幸福和喜悅。","word":"joyous"}},"jubilant":{"createdAt":1787757574260,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"jubilant 意為「歡欣鼓舞的、欣喜若狂的」，用來形容極度快樂和興奮的狀態。","options":["anxious","jubilant","indifferent","disappointed"],"sentence":"The fans were absolutely ______ when their team won the championship. They cheered loudly, danced in the streets, and celebrated with pure joy and excitement.","translation":"當他們的球隊贏得冠軍時，球迷們絕對歡欣鼓舞。他們大聲歡呼，在街道上跳舞，並以純粹的喜悅和興奮慶祝。","word":"jubilant"}},"judge":{"createdAt":1781437220555,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"「Judge」作名詞指在法庭上主持訴訟、解釋法律並做出判決的司法官員。","options":["witness","lawyer","judge","defendant"],"sentence":"The ______ carefully reviewed all the evidence before making a final decision in the trial. His responsibility was to apply the law fairly and determine the verdict.","translation":"法官在審判中做出最終判決之前仔細審查了所有證據。他的責任是公正地適用法律並裁定判決。","word":"judge"}},"judgement":{"createdAt":1783468655107,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"judgement指的是根據證據、事實或理性分析而做出的決定或結論，需要經過深思熟慮。","options":["emotion","prejudice","judgement","rumor"],"sentence":"The lawyer presented compelling evidence to support her ______ that the defendant was innocent. After reviewing all the facts, the jury agreed with her logical and well-reasoned conclusion.","translation":"律師提出了有說服力的證據來支持她對被告無罪的判斷。在審查了所有事實後，陪審團同意她邏輯清晰、經過充分推理的結論。","word":"judgement"}},"judgment":{"createdAt":1784011981601,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"judgment表示「法官的判決、裁決」或「評判、判斷」，在法律語境中指法庭的最終決定。","options":["verdict","testimony","judgment","appeal"],"sentence":"The judge announced her ______ after carefully considering all the evidence presented during the trial. The defendant would either be found guilty or innocent based on her decision.","translation":"法官在仔細考慮了審判中提交的所有證據後宣布了她的判決。被告將根據她的決定被判有罪或無罪。","word":"judgment"}},"judicial":{"createdAt":1782056686167,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"judicial 指與法院、法官、審判和司法程序相關的事物。","options":["medical","judicial","educational","commercial"],"sentence":"The ______ system must ensure that all citizens receive a fair trial. The judge and jury work together to interpret laws and make binding legal decisions.","translation":"司法制度必須確保所有公民獲得公平的審判。法官和陪審團共同合作來解釋法律並做出具有約束力的法律決定。","word":"judicial"}},"junction":{"createdAt":1781836375370,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"junction是聯結點或樞紐，特別是在交通運輸中多條路線匯合的地方。","options":["station","junction","platform","depot"],"sentence":"The train ______ was crowded with passengers transferring between different rail lines. Multiple tracks converged at this central point in the station.","translation":"火車樞紐站擁擠著在不同鐵路線之間轉換的乘客。多條軌道在車站的這個中心點匯合。","word":"junction"}},"jungle":{"createdAt":1783228002797,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"jungle 特指熱帶地區植被濃密、野生動物眾多的叢林，通常比一般森林更加危險和難以通行。","options":["forest","jungle","woods","grove"],"sentence":"Explorers hacked their way through the dense ______ in search of the ancient temple. The thick vegetation and wild animals made navigation extremely difficult in this tropical wilderness.","translation":"探險家們在密集的叢林中開闢道路尋找古老的寺廟。茂密的植被和野生動物使得在這片熱帶荒野中的導航極其困難。","word":"jungle"}},"junior":{"createdAt":1785281602360,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"junior 作為名詞可以指大學生的年級身份，特別是指大三學生，表示比 senior（大四學生）年級較低。","options":["senior","junior","sophomore","freshman"],"sentence":"My older brother is a senior in college, while I am still a ______ at the same university. Since I have one more year to go before graduation, I am one year behind him in my studies.","translation":"我的哥哥在大學裡是大四學生，而我仍然是該大學的大三學生。由於我還要再花一年才能畢業，我在學業上比他晚一年。","word":"junior"}},"junk":{"createdAt":1781951900953,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"junk指沒有價值的廢棄物或垃圾，通常是人們想要丟棄的無用物品。","options":["treasures","junk","artifacts","antiques"],"sentence":"The old storage room was filled with ______ that had been accumulated over decades. The owner decided to throw out most of the useless items and start fresh.","translation":"老舊的儲藏室堆滿了數十年來積累的廢棄物。房主決定扔掉大部分無用的東西，重新開始。","word":"junk"}},"jury":{"createdAt":1782408103437,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"jury 指的是由普通公民組成的陪審團，負責在法庭上評議和判決案件。","options":["judge","jury","audience","council"],"sentence":"The ______ deliberated for three days before reaching a unanimous verdict in the criminal trial. The twelve members carefully reviewed all the evidence presented by both the prosecution and defense.","translation":"陪審團在刑事審判中經過三天的評議後達成了一致的裁決。這十二名成員仔細審查了控方和辯方提交的所有證據。","word":"jury"}},"just":{"createdAt":1781449588282,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"just作為形容詞時表示「公平的、正當的」，在法律或道德評判的背景下使用。","options":["defensive","just","trillion","sensibly"],"sentence":"The judge made a ______ decision that satisfied both parties in the lawsuit. Everyone agreed the ruling was fair and based on the facts presented in court.","translation":"法官做出了一個公平的判決，使訴訟雙方都感到滿意。每個人都同意這項裁定是公正的，並以法庭上呈現的事實為基礎。","word":"just"}},"justice":{"createdAt":1782140283163,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"justice指的是公平、正義或公正的法律判決，確保所有人都得到應得的對待。","options":["mercy","punishment","justice","revenge"],"sentence":"The court worked hard to ensure that ______ was served in this difficult case. The innocent person was finally acquitted and cleared of all charges.","translation":"法院努力確保在這個困難案件中得到公正對待。那位無辜的人最終被宣判無罪並清除所有指控。","word":"justice"}},"justification":{"createdAt":1781832089959,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"justification 指為某件事提供合理的解釋或辯護，用於證明某事的合理性","options":["punishment","justification","promotion","transfer"],"sentence":"The manager demanded a ______ for the employee's sudden absence from work. Without a valid reason, the employee faced disciplinary action.","translation":"經理要求員工對其突然缺勤工作給出理由。沒有充分的原因，該員工將面臨紀律處分。","word":"justification"}},"justify":{"createdAt":1781651775064,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"justify 表示為某事提供理由或證明其正當性和合理性。","options":["alternative","childhood","justify","frustrate"],"sentence":"The manager tried to ______ the controversial decision to all the employees. However, no matter what reasons were provided, most workers still disagreed with the choice.","translation":"經理試圖為這個有爭議的決定向所有員工辯護。然而，無論提供什麼理由，大多數工人仍然不同意這個選擇。","word":"justify"}},"juvenile":{"createdAt":1781950727560,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"juvenile 指青少年的或與年輕人相關的，也可指不成熟的行為。","options":["adult","corporate","juvenile","criminal"],"sentence":"The court handles ______ cases involving people under the age of eighteen. These young offenders receive different legal treatment than adults.","translation":"法院處理涉及十八歲以下的人的少年案件。這些年輕的違法者受到與成年人不同的法律待遇。","word":"juvenile"}},"keen":{"createdAt":1784979555336,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"keen（熱衷的；渴望的）在此表示莎拉對學習語言有強烈的興趣和願望，與第二句中提到的「intense passion」相呼應。","options":["reluctant","keen","bored","indifferent"],"sentence":"Sarah has always been ______ on learning new languages since childhood. Her parents noticed her intense passion and enrolled her in a specialized language program to support her natural curiosity.","translation":"莎拉從小就一直熱衷於學習新語言。她的父母注意到她強烈的熱情，並為她報名參加了專門的語言課程來支持她天生的求知欲。","word":"keen"}},"kidnap":{"createdAt":1781860901467,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"kidnap是動詞，表示非法綁架他人，通常為了勒索金錢或其他利益","options":["rescue","kidnap","interview","hire"],"sentence":"The criminals planned to ______ the wealthy businessman's son for ransom. The police launched an immediate investigation and arrested the suspects before they could execute their plot.","translation":"罪犯計畫綁架這位富有商人的兒子以勒索贖金。警方立即展開調查，並在他們執行計畫之前逮捕了嫌疑人。","word":"kidnap"}},"kidnapper":{"createdAt":1785120508392,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"kidnapper是指進行綁架犯罪的人，特別是指非法帶走他人（尤其是小孩）以勒索贖金或其他目的的犯人。","options":["criminal","kidnapper","thief","criminal"],"sentence":"The police finally arrested the ______ who had taken the child three weeks ago. Detectives had tracked him down using security camera footage from the neighborhood.","translation":"警察終於逮捕了三週前帶走孩子的綁架犯。偵探們利用鄰近地區的監視器錄影追蹤到他。","word":"kidnapper"}},"kidney":{"createdAt":1781362281726,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"kidney指的是腎臟，是人體的重要器官，負責過濾廢物和產生尿液。","options":["liver","kidney","heart","lung"],"sentence":"The patient underwent surgery to remove a damaged ______ from his body. The organ had stopped functioning properly due to disease.","translation":"患者進行了手術以移除他體內受損的腎臟。這個器官因疾病而停止了正常功能。","word":"kidney"}},"kin":{"createdAt":1781939439464,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"kin是名詞，指家屬或親戚，通常指血緣關係的家人成員。","options":["colleagues","kin","neighbors","competitors"],"sentence":"Sarah invited all her ______ to the family reunion, including cousins from three different states. The celebration brought together over fifty relatives who hadn't seen each other in years.","translation":"莎拉邀請所有親屬參加家庭聚會，包括來自三個不同州的表親。這次慶祝活動讓五十多位多年未見面的親戚聚集在一起。","word":"kin"}},"kindle":{"createdAt":1785337792090,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"kindle表示激起或點燃（通常指感情、興趣或想法），在這裡指激發某人的熱情和行動力。","options":["extinguish","kindle","ignore","suppress"],"sentence":"Reading that inspiring biography helped ______ her passion for environmental activism. She immediately started a community recycling program and convinced others to join her cause.","translation":"閱讀那部鼓舞人心的傳記幫助激起了她對環境保護的熱情。她立即啟動了一個社區回收計劃，並說服他人加入她的事業。","word":"kindle"}},"kit":{"createdAt":1783774320510,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"kit 指的是為了特定目的而配置的成套工具或配件集合。","options":["squad","kit","construction","uniform"],"sentence":"The photographer brought her complete camera ______ to the wedding, including lenses, tripod, and lighting equipment. She needed all these tools because the venue had unpredictable natural lighting.","translation":"攝影師帶著她完整的相機成套工具去婚禮現場，包括鏡頭、三腳架和照明設備。她需要所有這些工具，因為場地的自然光線變化不定。","word":"kit"}},"knock":{"createdAt":1781402539337,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"knock 是名詞，指敲打門或物體表面所發出的聲音或動作。","options":["ring","knock","whisper","footstep"],"sentence":"She heard a loud ______ on the door early in the morning. Three rapid raps startled her awake from her sleep.","translation":"她一大早聽到門上發出的大聲敲打聲。三下快速的敲打聲將她從睡眠中驚醒。","word":"knock"}},"knowledge":{"createdAt":1781362281668,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"knowledge指的是所掌握的信息、事實或技能，來自學習或經驗。","options":["opinion","knowledge","guess","belief"],"sentence":"Her extensive ______ of history made her an excellent teacher. Students appreciated how deeply she understood historical events and their significance.","translation":"她廣泛的歷史知識使她成為一位優秀的教師。學生欣賞她對歷史事件及其重要性的深刻理解。","word":"knowledge"}},"knowledgeable":{"createdAt":1784451009635,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"knowledgeable 是指擁有廣泛知識或在某一領域具有豐富知識的人，通常強調學識淵博和對主題的深入了解。","options":["strict","knowledgeable","popular","young"],"sentence":"Dr. Chen is a ______ professor who can answer questions about ancient history, literature, and philosophy. Her students respect her because she draws from decades of study and research across multiple disciplines.","translation":"陳教授是一位博識的教授，能回答關於古代歷史、文學和哲學的問題。她的學生尊敬她，因為她的知識來自數十年對多個學科的研究。","word":"knowledgeable"}},"lab":{"createdAt":1783579287227,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"lab 是 laboratory 的縮寫，指進行科學研究和實驗的專門設施或房間。","options":["office","classroom","lab","library"],"sentence":"The scientists conducted their research in the university ______ using specialized equipment and computers. The facility had high security to protect the sensitive experiments being performed there.","translation":"科學家在大學實驗室進行他們的研究，使用專門的設備和電腦。該設施有高度的安全措施來保護那裡進行的敏感實驗。","word":"lab"}},"label":{"createdAt":1781622232185,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"label 作為動詞表示在物品上貼標籤或標記信息。","options":["label","ship","paint","seal"],"sentence":"The factory workers must ______ each product with the manufacturing date and batch number. This information helps customers identify when the item was produced.","translation":"工廠工人必須在每個產品上貼上製造日期和批號標籤。此信息幫助客戶確定何時生產該物品。","word":"label"}},"labor":{"createdAt":1781832089957,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"labor 作為名詞指勞工或工人，特別是指從事體力工作的人力資源","options":["materials","labor","equipment","capital"],"sentence":"The company decided to hire more ______ to meet the increased production demands. These workers would be responsible for assembling the new product line.","translation":"公司決定聘僱更多的勞工來滿足增加的生產需求。這些工人將負責組裝新產品線。","word":"labor"}},"laboratory":{"createdAt":1781565657695,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"laboratory 名詞指進行科學實驗和研究的專門場所，配備各種科學儀器和設備。","options":["classroom","laboratory","office","warehouse"],"sentence":"The scientists conducted their chemical experiments in the ______ using specialized equipment. The facility had safety protocols and ventilation systems to protect researchers from hazardous substances.","translation":"科學家在實驗室中使用專門設備進行化學實驗。該設施有安全協議和通風系統，以保護研究人員免受有害物質的傷害。","word":"laboratory"}},"laborious":{"createdAt":1781746685546,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"laborious指的是費力的、辛苦的、繁重的，用來形容需要付出大量體力或腦力的工作。","options":["laborious","essential","stadium","tolerance"],"sentence":"The task of organizing the entire library was ______ and time-consuming. Workers spent weeks cataloging thousands of books and arranging them on shelves.","translation":"整理整個圖書館的工作是費力且耗時的。工作人員花了數週對數千本書進行編目並將其放在書架上。","word":"laborious"}},"lack":{"createdAt":1781402154553,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lack表示缺少或不足，在這裡指資金和員工的短缺導致了專案的失敗。","options":["possess","lack","compel","suspect"],"sentence":"The project failed due to a ______ of funding and experienced staff. Without sufficient resources and qualified personnel, the team could not complete the work on schedule.","translation":"這個專案因為缺少資金和有經驗的員工而失敗。沒有足夠的資源和合格的人員，團隊無法按時完成工作。","word":"lack"}},"ladder":{"createdAt":1783419789621,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ladder 在比喻意義上指的是職位或地位的進步階段，象徵著從低位晉升到高位的過程。","options":["hierarchy","ladder","structure","system"],"sentence":"She climbed the corporate ______ by working hard and earning promotions every few years. Starting as an entry-level employee, she eventually became a vice president of the company.","translation":"她通過努力工作和每幾年獲得晉升而爬上了公司的職位晉升階梯。作為初級員工開始，她最終成為公司的副總裁。","word":"ladder"}},"laid":{"createdAt":1783419789623,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"laid 是 lay 的過去式，表示放置或鋪設某物，特別是指將物體水平地放在表面上。","options":["built","laid","placed","set"],"sentence":"The construction workers ______ the foundation of the new building very carefully. The concrete had to be poured perfectly level to ensure the structure would be stable.","translation":"建築工人非常小心地鋪設了新建築的基礎。混凝土必須倒得完全水平，以確保結構穩定。","word":"laid"}},"lament":{"createdAt":1783851650434,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lament 是動詞，意為「為某事感到悲傷或遺憾，表達哀悼之情」，通常指面對失去或不幸事件時的深切悲傷。","options":["celebrate","lament","ignore","accept"],"sentence":"The elderly woman continued to ______ the loss of her longtime companion. She expressed her deep sorrow through tears and heartfelt words about memories they had shared together.","translation":"這位年長的女性繼續為失去她多年的伴侶而哀悼。她通過眼淚和發自內心的話語表達深深的悲傷，回憶他們一起共享的美好時光。","word":"lament"}},"landfill":{"createdAt":1782101579246,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"landfill 是指用於處理和掩埋固體廢棄物的場所，通常需要進行環境保護措施以防止污染。","options":["landfill","playground","swimming pool","library"],"sentence":"The city's waste management plan includes expanding the ______ to accommodate growing amounts of household trash. The facility is designed with protective layers to prevent groundwater contamination.","translation":"該市的廢物管理計畫包括擴大垃圾掩埋場，以容納不斷增加的生活垃圾。該設施設計有保護層，以防止地下水污染。","word":"landfill"}},"landlady":{"createdAt":1785994363439,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"landlady是指出租房產的女性房東或女地主，在這句話中強調的是女性身份的房東，而非男性房東或租客。","options":["landlord","tenant","landlady","neighbor"],"sentence":"My ______ came to collect the rent this morning and asked about the maintenance issues in the apartment. She is the woman who owns the building and manages all the rental properties on this street.","translation":"我的女房東今早來收租金，並詢問了公寓的維修問題。她是擁有這棟大樓並管理這條街上所有出租物業的女性。","word":"landlady"}},"landlord":{"createdAt":1781839950959,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"landlord 是指擁有並出租房產的人,對租住房屋的維護和修繕負有責任。","options":["landlord","tenant","contractor","neighbor"],"sentence":"The ______ refused to fix the broken heating system in the apartment. Since he owns the building, he has the legal responsibility to maintain all essential utilities.","translation":"房東拒絕修理公寓裡損壞的供暖系統。既然他擁有這棟建築,他在法律上有責任維護所有基本設施。","word":"landlord"}},"landmark":{"createdAt":1781564440928,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"landmark 表示地標，指著名的建築物或地點，用來識別或記住某個位置。","options":["restaurant","landmark","street","shop"],"sentence":"The Eiffel Tower is one of the most famous ______ in the world. Millions of tourists visit this iconic structure each year to admire its architectural significance.","translation":"埃菲爾鐵塔是世界上最著名的地標之一。每年數百萬遊客參觀這個標誌性結構來欣賞其建築意義。","word":"landmark"}},"landscape":{"createdAt":1781619188937,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"landscape 指自然的風景，特別是寬闊的戶外場景，常用於藝術和攝影中。","options":["portrait","landscape","architecture","still life"],"sentence":"The painter captured the beauty of the rural ______ in her oil paintings. Rolling hills, farmlands, and wildflower meadows filled each canvas.","translation":"畫家在她的油畫中捕捉了鄉村風景的美麗。層疊起伏的山丘、農地和野花草地填滿了每一幅畫布。","word":"landscape"}},"landslide":{"createdAt":1781777331350,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"landslide作為選舉用語，特指一方候選人或政黨以懸殊差距贏得選舉的情況","options":["landslide","majority","competition","campaign"],"sentence":"The candidate won the election by a ______, receiving more votes than all her opponents combined. Her overwhelming victory surprised no one, as polls had predicted her dominance for weeks.","translation":"這位候選人以大勝贏得了選舉，獲得的選票超過她所有對手的總和。她的壓倒性勝利沒有讓任何人感到驚訝，因為民調幾週來一直預測她會大勝。","word":"landslide"}},"lane":{"createdAt":1781424157172,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lane 在游泳中特指為每個選手劃分的單獨水道。","options":["pool","lane","course","field"],"sentence":"The swimmer dove into his assigned ______ and began racing against the other competitors. Each athlete had their own separate swimming path to prevent interference.","translation":"游泳者跳入他指定的泳道，開始與其他選手競賽。每位運動員都有自己獨立的游泳路線以防止干擾。","word":"lane"}},"largely":{"createdAt":1783419789619,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"largely 是副詞，表示主要地或在很大程度上，用來描述某事物占絕大部分或主要原因。","options":["partly","largely","slightly","rarely"],"sentence":"The success of the project was ______ due to the team's hard work and dedication. Without their efforts over the past year, the results would have been far less impressive.","translation":"該項目的成功在很大程度上是由於團隊的辛勤工作和奉獻精神。如果沒有他們在過去一年的努力，結果將遠不如現在令人印象深刻。","word":"largely"}},"lately":{"createdAt":1783255660823,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lately 意為「最近、近來」，指的是不久前至現在這段時間發生的事情。","options":["always","lately","often","rarely"],"sentence":"Maria has been feeling very stressed ______. She told her doctor that this anxiety only started three weeks ago when her new job began.","translation":"瑪麗亞最近一直感到非常有壓力。她告訴醫生，這種焦慮只是在三週前她開始新工作時才開始的。","word":"lately"}},"latest":{"createdAt":1782378744802,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"latest是形容詞，表示「最新的」或「最先進的」，指最近發佈或目前最先進的版本或型號。","options":["oldest","latest","broken","used"],"sentence":"She always buys the ______ smartphone model as soon as it comes out in the market. This year she purchased the newest phone with the most advanced features available.","translation":"她總是在最新的智慧型手機型號一上市就立即購買。今年她購買了擁有最先進功能的最新手機。","word":"latest"}},"latitude":{"createdAt":1786426989905,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"latitude（緯度）是地球上南北方向的位置坐標，赤道處的緯度為0度，向南北兩極遞增。","options":["longitude","altitude","latitude","direction"],"sentence":"The ship's captain used a GPS device to determine the ______ of their current position. Since they were sailing near the equator, the ______ reading was close to zero degrees.","translation":"船長使用GPS設備來確定他們當前位置的緯度。由於他們在赤道附近航行，緯度讀數接近零度。","word":"latitude"}},"latter":{"createdAt":1781619188921,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"latter 指兩者中的後者，與 former 相對，用來區分先後順序。","options":["former","latter","initial","previous"],"sentence":"Between the two proposals, I prefer the ______ one because it offers better long-term benefits. The second option includes more comprehensive coverage and lower costs.","translation":"在兩個提案中，我更喜歡後面的那個，因為它提供更好的長期利益。第二個選項包括更全面的覆蓋範圍和更低的成本。","word":"latter"}},"launch":{"createdAt":1781515372607,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"launch指正式推出或發起一個新的產品、計畫或活動","options":["fulfillment","launch","force","chief"],"sentence":"The company will ______ its new product line at the international trade show next month. Marketing teams are preparing promotional materials and coordinating with distributors to ensure a successful introduction.","translation":"該公司將在下個月的國際貿易展上推出其新產品線。市場營銷團隊正在準備宣傳材料並與經銷商協調，以確保成功推出。","word":"launch"}},"lavish":{"createdAt":1781955529034,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lavish 形容豪華、奢華或花費大量金錢的事物。","options":["simple","lavish","casual","modest"],"sentence":"The celebrity hosted a ______ party at her mansion with champagne, caviar, and live entertainment. Guests were impressed by the opulent decorations and the extravagant five-course meal served throughout the evening.","translation":"這位名人在她的宅邸裡舉辦了一場奢華派對，提供香檳、魚子醬和現場娛樂。嘉賓對華麗的裝飾和整個晚上提供的奢侈五道菜大餐印象深刻。","word":"lavish"}},"lawful":{"createdAt":1781484415236,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"lawful意指符合法律規定和法律許可的，是合法的和受到法律允許的。","options":["dangerous","common","lawful","popular"],"sentence":"The police officer explained that parking in that location was not ______ without a special permit. The city ordinance clearly prohibited it, and violators would receive fines.","translation":"警察解釋說，在沒有特殊許可證的情況下在該位置停車是不合法的。市法令明確禁止這樣做，違反者將被罰款。","word":"lawful"}},"lawsuit":{"createdAt":1782018712117,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「lawsuit」指在法院進行的法律訴訟或訴案，涉及兩方當事人的法律紛爭。","options":["contract","lawsuit","advertisement","treaty"],"sentence":"The company filed a ______ against its competitor for patent infringement last month. The case is now being heard in the federal court system.","translation":"該公司上個月因專利侵權對競爭對手提起訴訟。該案件現在在聯邦法院系統中進行審理。","word":"lawsuit"}},"lay":{"createdAt":1782475871714,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lay 表示「產卵」，是指母雞或其他動物產出蛋類的動作","options":["sit","lay","build","carry"],"sentence":"The hen will ______ eggs in the nesting box every morning. Farmers collect these eggs daily for sale.","translation":"母雞每天早上會在巢箱裡下蛋。農民每天收集這些蛋來販售。","word":"lay"}},"layer":{"createdAt":1785297837782,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"layer 指堆疊或並排放置的薄片或塊狀物，通常由多個相同的層組成，可用於描述蛋糕、地質、衣服等的不同堆疊部分。","options":["coating","level","layer","section"],"sentence":"The cake had three distinct ______ of chocolate, vanilla, and strawberry cream. Each ______ was precisely two centimeters thick and carefully stacked on top of the others.","translation":"這個蛋糕有三層不同的巧克力、香草和草莓奶油。每一層厚度精確地為兩公分，並小心地堆疊在彼此上面。","word":"layer"}},"layout":{"createdAt":1781886743280,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Layout 指的是物品或空間的具體排列方式，強調各個元素在空間中的相對位置。","options":["design","layout","structure","blueprint"],"sentence":"The architect presented the ______ of the new office building to the client. The plan showed where each wall, door, and window would be positioned on every floor.","translation":"建築師向客戶展示了新辦公大樓的佈局。該計畫顯示了每層樓上每面牆、門和窗戶的位置。","word":"layout"}},"lead":{"createdAt":1782006215682,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「lead」作為動詞表示「領導」或「帶領」，指引導他人朝某個方向或目標前進。","options":["follow","lead","join","watch"],"sentence":"The experienced coach will ______ the team to victory in the championship match. Players trust his strategic decisions because he has successfully guided many previous squads to win titles.","translation":"資深教練將在錦標賽中帶領球隊贏得勝利。球員信任他的戰略決策，因為他曾成功地指導許多前隊伍贏得冠軍。","word":"lead"}},"leader":{"createdAt":1782131663206,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"leader是指在一個群體、組織或國家中擁有權力和影響力，引導他人的人。","options":["member","leader","follower","supporter"],"sentence":"The ______ of the team made important decisions about the project direction. Everyone looked to this person for guidance and inspiration.","translation":"這支隊伍的領袖對專案的方向做出了重要決定。每個人都向這個人尋求指導和靈感。","word":"leader"}},"leadership":{"createdAt":1781256444516,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"leadership指領導的能力和品質，包括指揮、指導和激勵他人的能力。","options":["communication","leadership","intelligence","patience"],"sentence":"The new CEO demonstrated exceptional ______ by rallying the demoralized team and implementing a clear vision for recovery. Within six months, employee morale and productivity had significantly improved.","translation":"新執行長通過鼓舞士氣低落的團隊並實施明確的復甦願景，展現出卓越的領導能力。六個月內，員工士氣和生產力都顯著提高。","word":"leadership"}},"league":{"createdAt":1781622232188,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"league 指由多個運動隊或組織組成的聯合會或聯賽組織。","options":["league","team","tournament","club"],"sentence":"The basketball player signed a contract with the national ______ to compete against the best teams in the country. He will play fifty games throughout the regular season.","translation":"籃球運動員與國家聯賽簽訂合約，與國內最好的球隊競爭。他將在常規賽中進行五十場比賽。","word":"league"}},"leak":{"createdAt":1781693484714,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"leak 表示液體或氣體無意中從容器或管道中滲出或漏出，通常是緩慢且不受控制的。","options":["spray","leak","drip","pour"],"sentence":"The old pipe started to ______ water into the basement. We called a plumber immediately because we could see puddles forming on the floor.","translation":"舊管子開始向地下室漏水。我們立即叫了水管工，因為我們可以看到地板上形成了水坑。","word":"leak"}},"lean":{"createdAt":1784796058841,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lean作為動詞表示傾斜或倚靠，在這裡指樹幹因風暴而向一側傾斜的動作。","options":["straighten","lean","grow","bend"],"sentence":"The old oak tree began to ______ toward the river as the storm intensified. Its trunk bent at a dangerous angle, and we worried it might snap from the force of the wind.","translation":"老橡樹開始在暴風雨加劇時向河傾斜。它的樹幹危險地彎曲，我們擔心它可能會因風力而折斷。","word":"lean"}},"leap":{"createdAt":1781775598767,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"leap作為名詞表示「跳躍」，特別是指有力的、跨越較大距離的跳躍動作。","options":["stride","tumble","leap","crawl"],"sentence":"The athlete made an incredible ______ across the long-jump pit and broke the school record. His explosive jump was so powerful that he cleared the previous distance by several inches.","translation":"運動員在跳遠池上完成了一次令人難以置信的跳躍，打破了學校紀錄。他的爆發力十足的跳躍非常強有力，他清楚地超越了之前的距離好幾英寸。","word":"leap"}},"lease":{"createdAt":1782659817811,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lease 作為動詞表示根據租約租用或租借財產，通常涉及簽署協議和定期支付租金。","options":["purchase","lease","build","inherit"],"sentence":"The family decided to ______ an apartment in the city center for two years. They signed a contract with the landlord that outlined the monthly rent and the duration of their occupancy.","translation":"這家人決定租借市中心的一套公寓兩年。他們與房東簽署了一份合同，規定了月租金和占用期限。","word":"lease"}},"leather":{"createdAt":1782980805884,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"leather 作名詞，指由動物皮經過鞣製和加工而成的柔軟耐用的材料。","options":["wool","cotton","silk","leather"],"sentence":"She bought a new ______ jacket that felt incredibly soft and supple. The material was made from processed animal hides and cost quite a bit of money.","translation":"她買了一件新的皮革夾克，感覺非常柔軟。這種材料由經過加工的動物皮製成，花費了不少錢。","word":"leather"}},"lecture":{"createdAt":1781428458255,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"lecture在此指教授在課堂上進行的正式授課或演講。","options":["crisis","citation","lecture","choke"],"sentence":"The professor gave a two-hour ______ on quantum physics to the entire class. Students took notes throughout the presentation to understand the complex theories being taught.","translation":"教授為整個班級進行了一場兩小時的量子物理學講座。學生們在整個演講過程中做筆記，以理解所教授的複雜理論。","word":"lecture"}},"lecturer":{"createdAt":1781848934151,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lecturer指在大學或學院進行教學或演講的人","options":["student","lecturer","janitor","chef"],"sentence":"The visiting ______ from Oxford University gave a brilliant presentation on medieval history. The audience was captivated by her extensive knowledge and engaging delivery.","translation":"來自牛津大學的客座講師進行了關於中世紀歷史的精彩演講。觀眾被她淵博的知識和引人入勝的演講所吸引。","word":"lecturer"}},"led":{"createdAt":1786762819718,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"led 是 lead 的過去式，表示領導或引導某人前往某個地方。","options":["followed","led","confused","abandoned"],"sentence":"The experienced tour guide ______ our group through the ancient temple with great enthusiasm. His knowledge of history and confident directions made the experience unforgettable.","translation":"經驗豐富的導遊以極大的熱情引導我們的團隊穿過古老的寺廟。他的歷史知識和自信的指引使這次經驗難以忘懷。","word":"led"}},"leftover":{"createdAt":1781582939256,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"leftover 指用完飯後剩下的食物，與冷藏和重新加熱食用的敘述相符。","options":["recipe","leftover","ingredient","plate"],"sentence":"Sarah stored the ______ from yesterday's dinner in a container and placed it in the refrigerator for tomorrow's lunch. The roasted chicken and vegetables would still taste delicious when reheated.","translation":"莎拉把昨天晚餐的剩菜放進容器中，並將其放入冰箱以備明天的午餐。烤雞和蔬菜在加熱後仍然會很美味。","word":"leftover"}},"legacy":{"createdAt":1781481311491,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"legacy指的是前人留下的遺產、遺贈或深遠的影響。","options":["secret","legacy","hobby","schedule"],"sentence":"The philanthropist's ______ included millions of dollars donated to educational institutions. Her children continue her charitable work to preserve what she left behind for future generations.","translation":"這位慈善家的遺產包括捐獻給教育機構的數百萬美元。她的孩子們繼續她的慈善事業以保護她為後代留下的東西。","word":"legacy"}},"legal":{"createdAt":1783760354085,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"legal 意為「法律上的、合法的」，用來形容符合法律要求和規範的事物。","options":["written","legal","long","private"],"sentence":"The company ensured that all its contracts were ______ before signing them. An experienced attorney reviewed every document to confirm it complied with local laws and regulations.","translation":"公司在簽署所有合約前確保它們是合法的。一位經驗豐富的律師審查了每份文件以確認其符合當地法律和法規。","word":"legal"}},"legend":{"createdAt":1781484415216,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"legend是指世代相傳的故事或傳說，通常涉及超自然或歷史人物，真偽難以驗證。","options":["contract","invoice","legend","recipe"],"sentence":"According to an ancient ______, a magical dragon once guarded the village from invaders. Nobody could prove whether this story was true or merely a myth passed down through generations.","translation":"根據古老的傳說，一條神奇的龍曾經保護村莊免受入侵者的侵害。沒有人能證明這個故事是真實的還是世代相傳的神話。","word":"legend"}},"legendary":{"createdAt":1781841505536,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"legendary 形容詞表示某人或某事因其非凡成就而在歷史上或傳統中廣為人知，具有傳奇性質。","options":["legendary","wonder","pollution","entitle"],"sentence":"The ______ musician Bob Dylan won the Nobel Prize in Literature for his outstanding contributions to music and poetry. His songs have inspired generations of artists and continue to be studied in universities around the world.","translation":"傳奇音樂家鮑勃·迪倫因其在音樂和詩歌方面的傑出貢獻而獲得諾貝爾文學獎。他的歌曲激勵了幾代藝術家，並繼續在世界各地的大學中被研究。","word":"legendary"}},"legislate":{"createdAt":1781961517450,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"legislate 指的是正式制定或通過法律的行為，強調的是立法的法律程序。","options":["enforce","legislate","discuss","propose"],"sentence":"The government voted to ______ new environmental protection laws. This process required members of parliament to debate and pass the bill through official procedures.","translation":"政府投票表決要制定新的環境保護法律。這個過程需要議會成員辯論並通過官方程序使其生效。","word":"legislate"}},"legislation":{"createdAt":1781848934153,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"legislation指由政府制定和頒布的法律或法令","options":["treaty","legislation","movie","advertisement"],"sentence":"The new ______ on environmental protection requires companies to reduce their carbon emissions by 50% within five years. Parliament passed this law to combat climate change.","translation":"新的環境保護立法要求公司在五年內將碳排放減少50%。議會通過了這項法律來應對氣候變化。","word":"legislation"}},"legislative":{"createdAt":1781832089958,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"legislative 意為與制定法律相關的，特別是指立法機構或立法活動","options":["judicial","executive","legislative","administrative"],"sentence":"The parliament passed a new ______ proposal to address climate change. The bill was debated for months before being voted on by members of congress.","translation":"議會通過了一項新的立法提案來應對氣候變化。該法案在由國會議員投票表決前已討論了數月。","word":"legislative"}},"legislator":{"createdAt":1784016923077,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"legislator 意為立法者、立法委員，指被選舉或任命來制定和投票通過法律的人。","options":["journalist","legislator","architect","physician"],"sentence":"The ______ introduced a new bill to improve public transportation in the city. As an elected member of parliament, she had the power to propose and vote on laws.","translation":"這位立法委員提出了一項改善城市公共交通的新法案。作為議會的當選成員，她有權提議和表決法律。","word":"legislator"}},"legitimate":{"createdAt":1781836375371,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"legitimate形容詞表示合法的、正當的或法律允許的。","options":["questionable","legitimate","doubtful","suspicious"],"sentence":"The court ruled that his claim to the inheritance was ______ and fully supported by law. All proper documentation and legal procedures had been followed.","translation":"法院裁定他對遺產的索賠是合法的，並得到法律充分支持。所有適當的文件和法律程序都已遵循。","word":"legitimate"}},"legitimately":{"createdAt":1781710289366,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"legitimately 是副詞，表示「合法地、依法地」或「合理地、可接受地」，用於描述符合法律或規則的行為或主張。","options":["falsely","legitimately","questionably","dubiously"],"sentence":"The company can ______ claim that its products are environmentally friendly because it has obtained all necessary environmental certifications and passed rigorous government testing. The documentation proves their manufacturing processes meet all legal standards.","translation":"這家公司可以合法地聲稱其產品環保，因為它已獲得所有必要的環保認證並通過了嚴格的政府檢測。文件證明其製造過程符合所有法律標準。","word":"legitimately"}},"leisure":{"createdAt":1781842254310,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"leisure 作為形容詞表示空閒的、用於休閒的，指不受工作或責任束縛的時間。","options":["busy","leisure","stressful","urgent"],"sentence":"After working overtime for six months, Tom finally had some ______ time to relax and pursue his hobbies. He could now enjoy reading and painting without worrying about work deadlines.","translation":"在加班六個月後，湯姆終於有了一些閒暇時間來放鬆和追求他的愛好。他現在可以享受閱讀和繪畫，而不用擔心工作截止日期。","word":"leisure"}},"leisurely":{"createdAt":1785800870817,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"leisurely 是副詞，表示行動悠閒、放鬆、不匆忙的方式，強調以舒適悠閒的態度進行活動。","options":["quickly","leisurely","nervously","carelessly"],"sentence":"She walked through the park ______, enjoying every moment without rushing. The slow pace allowed her to notice the beautiful flowers and listen to the birds singing.","translation":"她悠閒地漫步公園，享受每一刻而不匆忙。緩慢的步伐讓她能夠注意到美麗的花朵並聆聽鳥兒的歌唱。","word":"leisurely"}},"length":{"createdAt":1783760526715,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"length指某物從一端到另一端的距離，特別用來量測物體的長度或時間的期間。","options":["width","depth","length","shape"],"sentence":"The swimming pool measures 50 meters in ______ and is used for Olympic competitions. Athletes must train extensively to swim this distance efficiently.","translation":"游泳池長度為50米，用於奧運會比賽。運動員必須進行廣泛培訓才能高效地游過這段距離。","word":"length"}},"lengthy":{"createdAt":1781926370994,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lengthy 意思是冗長的、漫長的，用來描述時間很長且往往令人厭倦的事物。","options":["brief","lengthy","productive","scheduled"],"sentence":"The meeting was so ______ that many employees fell asleep before it ended. It lasted for over five hours without a single break.","translation":"那場會議是如此冗長，以至於許多員工在它結束前就睡著了。它持續了五個多小時，沒有休息過。","word":"lengthy"}},"lesbian":{"createdAt":1785936120019,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"lesbian 是指性取向為女性且被其他女性所吸引的女性。","options":["lesbian","student","teacher","athlete"],"sentence":"Her girlfriend introduced her as a proud ______ at the community center. They had been together for five years and were planning to get married next spring.","translation":"她的女友在社區中心介紹她為一個驕傲的女同志。她們在一起已經五年了，計畫在明年春天結婚。","word":"lesbian"}},"lessen":{"createdAt":1785281230403,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lessen 意為「減少、降低、減輕」，在這個句子中表示藥物可以減輕疼痛的程度。","options":["increase","lessen","ignore","transfer"],"sentence":"The doctor prescribed medication to ______ the patient's pain and discomfort. After taking the medicine for a week, the patient reported feeling significantly better.","translation":"醫生開了藥物來減輕病人的疼痛和不適。在服用了一週的藥物後，病人報告說感到明顯好多了。","word":"lessen"}},"lest":{"createdAt":1783656026743,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lest 是連接詞，表示「以免」或「唯恐」，引出一個不希望發生的結果或情況。","options":["unless","lest","if","when"],"sentence":"She locked the doors carefully ______ anyone would break into her home while she was away. Security was her top concern when leaving the house unattended.","translation":"她小心地鎖上門，唯恐她不在家時有人會闖入。在離家時，安全是她最關心的問題。","word":"lest"}},"lethal":{"createdAt":1781626081102,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"lethal 作為形容詞表示能夠導致死亡或極其危險的，用於描述具有致命性質的物質或情況。","options":["harmless","beneficial","lethal","mild"],"sentence":"The poison was ______ enough to kill a person within minutes of ingestion. The medical team had no antidote available to reverse its fatal effects.","translation":"這種毒藥足以在攝入後幾分鐘內殺死一個人。醫療團隊沒有可用的解毒劑來逆轉其致命的影響。","word":"lethal"}},"lettuce":{"createdAt":1783243696864,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"萵苣是一種葉菜類蔬菜，葉片脆嫩，常用於製作沙拉，以低熱量和營養豐富而聞名。","options":["carrot","lettuce","tomato","cucumber"],"sentence":"Sarah prepared a fresh salad with ______ as the main ingredient for lunch. She chose the crisp, leafy green vegetable because it was low in calories and perfect for her diet.","translation":"莎拉準備了一份以萵苣為主要成分的新鮮沙拉作為午餐。她選擇這種脆嫩的綠色葉菜，因為它的熱量低，非常適合她的飲食。","word":"lettuce"}},"liability":{"createdAt":1781951900952,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"liability在法律和財務語境中指一個人或組織的法律責任和義務，需要承擔的負債。","options":["asset","liability","profit","expense"],"sentence":"The company's legal ______ increased significantly after the factory accident harmed several workers. They would have to pay compensation and face potential lawsuits.","translation":"工廠事故傷害了多名工人後，公司的法律責任大幅增加。他們必須支付賠償金並面臨潛在的訴訟。","word":"liability"}},"liable":{"createdAt":1783042345898,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"liable 指的是在法律上或道德上對某事應負責任，可能因此承受後果或罰款。","options":["fortunate","liable","grateful","capable"],"sentence":"The restaurant owner is ______ for any food poisoning incidents that occur due to improper food storage in his establishment. If customers become ill from contaminated meals, he could face serious legal consequences and lawsuits.","translation":"餐廳老闆對因其場所中食物儲存不當而造成的任何食物中毒事件負有責任。如果顧客因受污染的食物而生病，他可能面臨嚴重的法律後果和訴訟。","word":"liable"}},"liberal":{"createdAt":1784450229793,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"liberal 是形容詞，意為「心胸寬闊的」或「開放的」，形容某人對新想法、不同觀點和改革持開放態度。","options":["rigid","narrow","liberal","extreme"],"sentence":"She held ______ views on politics and was always willing to listen to different opinions. Her open-minded attitude made her respectful of diverse perspectives from all sides.","translation":"她在政治上抱持心胸寬闊的觀點，總是願意傾聽不同的意見。她開放的態度使她尊重來自各方的不同觀點。","word":"liberal"}},"liberally":{"createdAt":1784016923070,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"liberally 意為大方地、慷慨地，表示毫不吝嗇地給予或提供大量資源。","options":["carelessly","liberally","reluctantly","selectively"],"sentence":"The charity donated ______ to help families affected by the disaster. They gave millions of dollars without hesitation or concern for cost.","translation":"慈善機構慷慨地捐贈以幫助受災家庭。他們毫不猶豫地捐出數百萬美元，不顧成本。","word":"liberally"}},"liberate":{"createdAt":1784350994466,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"liberate 是「解放」的意思，表示將某人或某地從束縛、壓迫或統治中釋放出來。","options":["separate","liberate","divide","remove"],"sentence":"The revolutionary army fought to ______ the country from foreign occupation and colonial rule. Citizens celebrated in the streets when independence was finally achieved.","translation":"革命軍隊為了將國家從外國佔領和殖民統治中解放出來而戰鬥。當獨立最終實現時，公民在街道上慶祝。","word":"liberate"}},"liberated":{"createdAt":1785936120014,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"liberated 表示被解放或獲得自由，通常指從某種壓迫、束縛或控制中脫離出來。","options":["confused","liberated","exhausted","confused"],"sentence":"After years of oppression, the country finally felt ______ from colonial rule. The citizens celebrated their newfound independence and freedom to govern themselves.","translation":"經過多年的壓迫之後，這個國家終於感到從殖民統治中解放了出來。公民們慶祝他們新獲得的獨立和自治的自由。","word":"liberated"}},"liberation":{"createdAt":1785337792084,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"liberation表示從束縛、監禁或壓迫中的解放或釋放，在這裡特別指從集中營中獲得自由。","options":["motivation","liberation","construction","celebration"],"sentence":"The ______ of prisoners from the concentration camp was celebrated as a turning point in the war. Soldiers broke down the gates and freed thousands of captives who had suffered for years.","translation":"集中營囚犯的解放被慶祝為戰爭的轉折點。士兵推倒大門，釋放了數千名遭受多年折磨的俘虜。","word":"liberation"}},"liberty":{"createdAt":1782980805883,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"liberty 作名詞，特別強調自由和獨立的權利，尤其是在政治或社會背景下。","options":["independence","liberty","freedom","rights"],"sentence":"The American colonists fought hard for their ______ from British rule. This fundamental right allowed them to govern themselves and make their own decisions.","translation":"美洲殖民地的人民為了從英國統治中獲得自由而奮力抗爭。這項基本權利使他們能夠自我治理，做出自己的決定。","word":"liberty"}},"license":{"createdAt":1781836375369,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"license是許可證或執照，由官方機構頒發，允許某人從事某項活動。","options":["certificate","license","permit","diploma"],"sentence":"Before operating a taxi, the driver must obtain a ______ from the government. The document certifies that he has passed all required safety and knowledge tests.","translation":"在運營計程車前，駕駛員必須獲得政府頒發的執照。該文件証明他已通過所有必需的安全和知識測試。","word":"license"}},"lie":{"createdAt":1782522524127,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"lie 在此為名詞，表示不真實的陳述或謊言，指故意說出虛假的話來欺騙他人。","options":["secret","story","lie","reason"],"sentence":"He told a ______ about where he had been that night, but his friends eventually discovered the truth. His dishonesty damaged their trust in him.","translation":"他對那晚他去過的地方說了謊，但他的朋友最終發現了真相。他的不誠實損害了他們對他的信任。","word":"lie"}},"lieutenant":{"createdAt":1785119661241,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lieutenant是指中尉，一個軍銜，在海軍或陸軍中位於lower ranks和higher-ranking officers之間的位置。","options":["captain","lieutenant","sergeant","admiral"],"sentence":"The young ______ was promoted after demonstrating excellent leadership during the military operation. He now held the rank that comes after ensign in the naval hierarchy.","translation":"這位年輕的中尉在軍事行動中展現了出色的領導能力後被晉升。他現在擁有在海軍等級制度中位於少尉之後的軍銜。","word":"lieutenant"}},"lifeguard":{"createdAt":1781484415226,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lifeguard是指在游泳池、海灘等地專門負責監督和救助遇到危險的人的工作人員。","options":["teacher","lifeguard","coach","janitor"],"sentence":"The ______ jumped into the pool immediately when he noticed a child struggling in the deep end. His quick action and swimming skills saved the young swimmer's life.","translation":"當救生員注意到一個孩子在深水區掙扎時，他立即跳進了游泳池。他迅速的反應和游泳技能救了這位年輕游泳者的生命。","word":"lifeguard"}},"lifeline":{"createdAt":1783946375010,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"lifeline指的是救助或維持生命的關鍵事物或連接，在緊急情況下提供救援或支持。","options":["accessory","landmark","lifeline","shortcut"],"sentence":"When the hiker became lost in the mountains, the rope served as a ______ that connected him to safety. Without this vital connection, he would have had no way to reach the rescue team waiting at the summit.","translation":"當登山者在山區迷路時，繩子成為了連接他與安全的生命線。沒有這條重要的連接，他將沒有辦法到達在山頂等待的救援隊。","word":"lifeline"}},"lifelong":{"createdAt":1786060141979,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lifelong 是形容詞，表示持續整個人生或整輩子的，強調從開始到結束的長期承諾或經驗。","options":["temporary","lifelong","casual","occasional"],"sentence":"She made a ______ commitment to environmental conservation when she was just twenty years old. Even now, at eighty-five, she still dedicates every day to protecting forests and wildlife.","translation":"她在二十歲時就對環境保護做出了終身的承諾。即使現在已經八十五歲，她仍然每天致力於保護森林和野生動物。","word":"lifelong"}},"lift":{"createdAt":1782361629306,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lift 在這裡表示「舉起」或「提起」，指用機械力量將物體升高到更高的位置。","options":["lower","lift","push","carry"],"sentence":"The worker used a crane to ______ the heavy steel beam onto the building's framework. The machine's hydraulic system made it possible to raise objects weighing several tons.","translation":"工人用起重機把沉重的鋼樑舉起來放在建築物的框架上。這臺機器的液壓系統使得它能夠舉起重達數噸的物體。","word":"lift"}},"lighten":{"createdAt":1781840892408,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lighten表示變亮或變淡，用於描述顏色或光線逐漸變淡的過程。","options":["darken","lighten","freeze","thicken"],"sentence":"As the sun rose higher in the sky, the night sky began to ______ from dark blue to pale pink. The transition lasted about thirty minutes before dawn fully broke.","translation":"當太陽在天空升得更高時，夜空開始從深藍色變淡到淡粉紅色。這個過程持續了大約三十分鐘，直到天亮。","word":"lighten"}},"lightning":{"createdAt":1784794253714,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"lightning是指伴隨雷鳴的放電現象，表現為明亮的閃光，具有強大的電力，能夠造成物理損害。","options":["rain","thunder","lightning","wind"],"sentence":"During the thunderstorm, a bright flash of ______ illuminated the dark sky for a split second. The electrical discharge was so powerful that it struck a tree near the house, splitting it in half.","translation":"在雷暴期間，一道明亮的閃電在瞬間照亮了黑暗的天空。這道電放電非常強大，甚至擊中了房子附近的一棵樹，將其一分為二。","word":"lightning"}},"likelihood":{"createdAt":1784439491472,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"likelihood是名詞，表示某事發生的可能性或機率，常用於正式或學術語境中。","options":["possibility","likelihood","chance","probability"],"sentence":"The ______ of rain tomorrow is very high according to the weather forecast. Meteorologists predict a 90% chance, so you should definitely bring an umbrella.","translation":"根據天氣預報，明天下雨的可能性非常高。氣象學家預測有90%的機會，所以你一定要帶傘。","word":"likelihood"}},"likewise":{"createdAt":1782378744799,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"likewise是副詞，表示「同樣地」或「也一樣」，用來表達兩個人有相同的感受或經驗。","options":["differently","likewise","confused","disappointed"],"sentence":"Tom enjoyed the concert very much, and his sister felt ______ about the performance. Both of them left the venue smiling and discussing their favorite songs.","translation":"湯姆非常享受這場音樂會，他的妹妹對這場表演有著相同的感受。他們倆都帶著微笑離開會場，討論著他們最喜歡的歌曲。","word":"likewise"}},"limb":{"createdAt":1782401868817,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"limb 表示人體或動物的肢體，如手臂、腿部等。","options":["organ","limb","sense","emotion"],"sentence":"After the accident, the injured worker had to have his injured ______ amputated to prevent infection. He would need to adjust to life with a prosthetic.","translation":"事故後，受傷的工人不得不截肢以防止感染。他需要適應使用假肢的生活。","word":"limb"}},"limit":{"createdAt":1783042345895,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"limit 指的是對某事物的數量、程度或範圍設定的最高界線或約束。","options":["rule","limit","schedule","policy"],"sentence":"The school imposed a ______ on how many hours students could spend on their mobile phones each day. Students were not allowed to use their phones for more than three hours during weekdays.","translation":"學校對學生每天使用手機的時數施加了限制。學生在工作日間不得使用手機超過三小時。","word":"limit"}},"limitation":{"createdAt":1782902185114,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"limitation 作名詞表示「限制」或「局限」，指對某事物的約束或阻礙。","options":["success","limitation","advantage","opportunity"],"sentence":"The project faced a serious ______ when the budget was cut in half. Without sufficient funds, the team could not proceed with their original ambitious plans.","translation":"當預算被削減一半時，該項目面臨了一個嚴重的限制。沒有足夠的資金，團隊無法按照原計畫進行。","word":"limitation"}},"limp":{"createdAt":1783841864096,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"limp 作為動詞，表示因為受傷或身體問題而步履蹣跚、跛行走路。","options":["sprint","limp","crawl","jump"],"sentence":"After the soccer player injured his knee, he had to ______ off the field. The coach could see he was moving slowly and unsteadily on one leg.","translation":"在足球運動員膝蓋受傷後，他必須一瘸一拐地離開球場。教練可以看到他在一條腿上緩慢而不穩定地移動。","word":"limp"}},"linger":{"createdAt":1783346424326,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"linger意指在某個地方停留或逗留，通常暗示不急著離開或想多待一會兒。","options":["rush","linger","depart","scatter"],"sentence":"After the concert ended, many fans decided to ______ in the parking lot hoping to see the performers leave. Security eventually asked them to leave because they had been waiting there for over an hour.","translation":"音樂會結束後，許多粉絲決定在停車場逗留，希望看到表演者離開。由於他們已經在那裡等待了一個多小時，保安最終要求他們離開。","word":"linger"}},"lingering":{"createdAt":1784173464328,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lingering 形容事物持久地停留或逗留不去，不會立即消散或消失。","options":["fading","lingering","absent","welcome"],"sentence":"The ______ smell of coffee filled the kitchen long after breakfast had ended. Even hours later, the aroma refused to disappear completely from the room.","translation":"早餐結束後很久，咖啡的持久香氣仍然充滿廚房。即使在幾小時後，香氣仍然拒絕完全從房間消失。","word":"lingering"}},"lining":{"createdAt":1784890375921,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Lining 是指衣服或容器內部的布料層，用於保護或增加舒適度。","options":["pocket","lining","zipper","collar"],"sentence":"The jacket's ______ is made of soft silk for comfort. Without this inner fabric layer, the rough outer material would scratch your skin directly.","translation":"夾克的裡布是用柔軟的絲綢製成的，為了舒適。沒有這個內層布料，粗糙的外部材料會直接刮傷你的皮膚。","word":"lining"}},"liquid":{"createdAt":1783068339386,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"liquid 名詞表示液體或液狀物質，具有能流動但體積固定的特性","options":["gas","liquid","plasma","crystal"],"sentence":"Water is a ______ that flows freely and takes the shape of any container. Unlike solid ice, this substance has no fixed form.","translation":"水是可以自由流動並採納任何容器形狀的液體。與固體冰不同，這種物質沒有固定的形狀。","word":"liquid"}},"liquor":{"createdAt":1781798927520,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"liquor 特指含有酒精的飲料，尤其是烈酒，不包括咖啡或果汁。","options":["beverages","liquor","coffee","juice"],"sentence":"The store had a special promotion on ______ last weekend. Customers could buy whiskey, vodka, and rum at discounted prices.","translation":"上週末商店對烈酒進行特價促銷。顧客可以以折扣價購買威士忌、伏特加和朗姆酒。","word":"liquor"}},"literacy":{"createdAt":1783859537006,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"literacy 指的是識字和讀寫能力，特別是指人們能夠閱讀和寫作的技能。","options":["literacy","technology","infrastructure","employment"],"sentence":"The government launched a program to improve ______ in rural areas. Many children in those regions could not read or write before the initiative began.","translation":"政府推動了一項計畫來提高農村地區的______。在計畫開始前，那些地區的許多兒童無法讀寫。","word":"literacy"}},"literal":{"createdAt":1781840667146,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"literal指的是按照字面上的實際意義理解，而不是比喻或引申的意義。","options":["figurative","serious","literal","sarcastic"],"sentence":"Don't take his comment about being 'dead tired' in a ______ sense. He simply means he is very exhausted after working all day.","translation":"不要按照字面意思理解他說的「累死了」這句話。他只是在表示整天工作後感到非常疲憊。","word":"literal"}},"literally":{"createdAt":1781773623461,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"literally作為副詞表示「逐字地」或「實在地」，此處用於強調一個表達方式的字面意思，而非比喻意思。","options":["virtually","literally","practically","almost"],"sentence":"When he said the weather was so hot he could ______ fry an egg on the pavement, his friend laughed. Of course, the temperature wasn't actually high enough to cook food on the ground.","translation":"當他說天氣炎熱到他可以在人行道上煎雞蛋時，他的朋友笑了。當然，溫度實際上還不夠高到能在地上烹飪食物。","word":"literally"}},"literary":{"createdAt":1784011981600,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"literary表示「文學的」，指與文學、書籍和作家相關的事物或領域。","options":["scientific","musical","literary","political"],"sentence":"Professor Chen specializes in ______ criticism and analysis of classical works. She has published numerous academic papers on Shakespeare, Austen, and Dickens.","translation":"陳教授專門研究文學批評和古典著作分析。她已經發表了許多關於莎士比亞、奧斯汀和狄更斯的學術論文。","word":"literary"}},"literate":{"createdAt":1782476098663,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"literate 形容詞是指能夠閱讀和書寫的、有識字能力的，也可指具有一定文化水平和知識素養的。","options":["educated","skilled","literate","intelligent"],"sentence":"In developing countries, not everyone is ______ in their native language. Many children, especially in rural areas, never learn to read or write properly.","translation":"在開發中國家，並非每個人都識字。許多兒童，尤其是在農村地區，從未學會正確的閱讀和書寫。","word":"literate"}},"literature":{"createdAt":1781693254756,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"literature指的是文學作品的總稱，包括各種書籍、詩歌和戲劇創作。","options":["furniture","literature","music","cuisine"],"sentence":"She spent her summer reading classic ______ from authors like Jane Austen and Charles Dickens. Her bookshelf was filled with novels, poetry collections, and dramatic works.","translation":"她花了整個夏天閱讀珍·奧斯汀和查爾斯·狄更斯等作家的經典文學作品。她的書架上擺滿了小說、詩集和戲劇作品。","word":"literature"}},"livelihood":{"createdAt":1784911952482,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"livelihood 指的是維持生計的生活來源或方式，強調謀生的整體手段，而非單純的工作或薪資。","options":["income","livelihood","salary","occupation"],"sentence":"After the factory closed, many workers lost their primary ______ overnight. Without finding new employment quickly, these families struggled to pay for food and housing.","translation":"工廠關閉後，許多工人一夜之間失去了主要的______。如果不快速找到新工作，這些家庭將難以支付食物和住房費用。","word":"livelihood"}},"liver":{"createdAt":1786762819713,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"liver 是肝臟，是人體的重要內臟器官，負責過濾血液和產生膽汁。","options":["heart","liver","kidney","lung"],"sentence":"The ______ is a vital organ that filters blood and produces bile. Doctors often perform ultrasounds to check if this organ is healthy and functioning properly.","translation":"肝臟是一個重要器官，可以過濾血液並產生膽汁。醫生經常進行超聲波檢查，以確認這個器官是否健康且功能正常。","word":"liver"}},"livestock":{"createdAt":1783389549634,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"livestock 是指被飼養用於生產食物或其他商業用途的家畜，包括牛、羊、豬、雞等農場動物。","options":["crops","livestock","equipment","buildings"],"sentence":"The farmer raises ______ on his ranch to provide milk and meat for the market. He has cows, sheep, pigs, and chickens that he cares for daily.","translation":"農民在他的牧場飼養家畜以向市場提供牛奶和肉類。他每天照顧牛、羊、豬和雞。","word":"livestock"}},"living":{"createdAt":1786681187026,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"living 作形容詞表示「生活」或「活著的」，這裡指的是退休生活的方式和品質。","options":["dying","living","working","sleeping"],"sentence":"My grandparents have a comfortable ______ in their retirement home. They spend their days gardening, reading, and enjoying time with family members who visit regularly.","translation":"我的祖父母在退休家園裡過著舒適的生活。他們每天都花時間園藝、閱讀，並享受與定期來訪的家人相聚的時光。","word":"living"}},"loan":{"createdAt":1781848934138,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"loan指銀行或其他機構提供的借款，通常需要利息償還","options":["gift","loan","scholarship","inheritance"],"sentence":"He went to the bank to apply for a ______ to buy a house. The bank officer reviewed his income and credit score before approving the amount.","translation":"他去銀行申請貸款購買房子。銀行職員在批准金額前審查了他的收入和信用評分。","word":"loan"}},"lobby":{"createdAt":1782018712118,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"「lobby」在此指建築物的入口大廳或前廳，是公眾集合和會面的地方。","options":["rooftop","basement","lobby","kitchen"],"sentence":"Environmental groups gathered in the ______ of the parliament building to meet with legislators. They wanted to discuss their concerns about the new bill face-to-face.","translation":"環保團體在國會大廈的大廳聚集，以便與立法者會面。他們想面對面討論他們對新法案的關切。","word":"lobby"}},"local":{"createdAt":1783760192896,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"local 是指某個特定地區或社區的，與該地方及其居民息息相關，通常暗示親近和熟悉的特性。","options":["international","virtual","local","corporate"],"sentence":"The ______ farmers at the village market sell fresh produce that they grow in nearby fields. These community members have lived in this region for generations and know the land intimately.","translation":"村莊市場裡的______農民出售他們在附近田地裡種植的新鮮農產品。這些社區成員世世代代都住在這個地區，對這片土地非常熟悉。","word":"local"}},"locate":{"createdAt":1784191742098,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"locate指確定或發現某物的位置，也可表示座落於某個地點。","options":["reveal","vessel","locate","purchase"],"sentence":"The GPS system helped us ______ the nearest gas station on the highway. Within five minutes, we found it and filled up our tank.","translation":"全球定位系統幫助我們定位高速公路上最近的加油站。在五分鐘內，我們找到了它並加滿了油箱。","word":"locate"}},"located":{"createdAt":1784263185084,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"located 是形容詞，表示某物在某個特定的地點或位置上，常用來描述建築物、城市等地理位置。","options":["designed","located","constructed","operated"],"sentence":"The new office building is ______ in the downtown area near the train station. The address is 123 Main Street, which is exactly where the company wanted to establish its headquarters.","translation":"新的辦公樓座落於火車站附近的市中心地區。地址是主街123號，正好是公司想要建立總部的位置。","word":"located"}},"location":{"createdAt":1781839703151,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"location指場所或位置，與situated in the city centre near transportation（位於市中心靠近交通）直接相符。","options":["timing","design","location","budget"],"sentence":"The ______ of the new office has been carefully selected. It is situated in the city centre near public transportation and major business hubs.","translation":"新辦公室的位置已被仔細選擇。它位於市中心，靠近公共交通和主要商業樞紐。","word":"location"}},"locker":{"createdAt":1782791846897,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"locker 是指帶有鎖的個人儲物櫃，通常在運動場所、學校或工作場所使用，用來安全存放個人物品。","options":["drawer","locker","shelf","cabinet"],"sentence":"She stored her sports equipment in a ______ at the gym. The metal compartment with a combination lock kept her belongings secure during her workout.","translation":"她在健身房的衣物櫃裡存放運動器材。這個有密碼鎖的金屬隔間在她運動時保護她的物品安全。","word":"locker"}},"lodge":{"createdAt":1781961517452,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lodge 在這裡是動詞，表示某物被固定或卡入另一物體中。","options":["hide","lodge","settle","rest"],"sentence":"A small stone managed to ______ itself in the bicycle tire during the mountain ride. Despite the rider's efforts, it remained firmly stuck until they reached a repair shop.","translation":"一塊小石子在山地自行車騎行中卡在自行車輪胎裡。儘管騎手的努力，它一直牢牢卡著，直到他們到達修車店。","word":"lodge"}},"log":{"createdAt":1782475871717,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"log 表示「日誌；記錄」，指記錄某段時間內發生的事件或活動的官方文件","options":["map","log","letter","report"],"sentence":"The captain wrote detailed notes in the ship's ______ to record the weather conditions and distance traveled each day. This official document serves as a permanent record of the voyage.","translation":"船長在船的日誌中詳細記錄了天氣狀況和每天行駛的距離。這份官方文件是航程的永久記錄。","word":"log"}},"logic":{"createdAt":1783433817069,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"logic 是指推理和思維的清晰性，強調理性分析和合乎因果關係的論證過程。","options":["emotion","logic","creativity","humor"],"sentence":"The lawyer's argument relied on clear ______ and evidence. Without following a rational chain of reasoning, his case would have fallen apart in court.","translation":"律師的論點依賴清晰的邏輯和證據。如果沒有遵循理性的推理鏈條，他的案件在法庭上就會崩潰。","word":"logic"}},"logical":{"createdAt":1781773623459,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"logical作為形容詞表示「合邏輯的」或「合理的」，指思路清晰、符合邏輯規則的。","options":["rational","logical","reasonable","smart"],"sentence":"Her argument was very ______ and easy to follow from beginning to end. She presented facts in a clear order where each point led naturally to the next conclusion.","translation":"她的論點非常合邏輯，從頭到尾都很容易理解。她以清晰的順序呈現事實，其中每一點自然導向下一個結論。","word":"logical"}},"logically":{"createdAt":1786348154570,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"logically 意思是以合理、有理性的方式進行，用於描述有條不紊地分析或推理的方式。","options":["emotionally","logically","hastily","carelessly"],"sentence":"If you examine the evidence ______, you will see that the suspect was nowhere near the crime scene. The timeline of events, the witness statements, and the physical evidence all point to the same reasonable conclusion.","translation":"如果你合邏輯地檢查證據，你會看到嫌疑人根本不在犯罪現場。事件的時間順序、證人陳述和物理證據都指向同一個合理的結論。","word":"logically"}},"long":{"createdAt":1781841742844,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"long 作動詞表示「渴望、極想」，通常用於表達強烈而持久的願望。","options":["dread","long","fail","refuse"],"sentence":"After years of living abroad, she ______ to return to her hometown. The thought of seeing her family again filled her with deep yearning.","translation":"在國外生活多年後，她渴望回到家鄉。想到能再次見到家人讓她充滿深深的渴望。","word":"long"}},"longevity":{"createdAt":1782401868808,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"longevity 表示長壽或持續很長時間的特性。","options":["decline","longevity","collapse","weakness"],"sentence":"The ______ of the ancient civilization was remarkable, lasting over three thousand years. Historians were amazed by how long this society managed to survive and flourish.","translation":"這個古代文明的長壽是非凡的，持續了三千多年。歷史學家對這個社會設法存續和繁榮的時間之長感到驚訝。","word":"longevity"}},"longitude":{"createdAt":1784711302807,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"longitude是指測量地球上某一點東西方向位置的地理坐標，與緯度配合使用。","options":["altitude","longitude","direction","distance"],"sentence":"The ship's captain used both latitude and ______ to pinpoint their exact location on the map. These two coordinates work together to determine any position on Earth's surface.","translation":"船長同時使用緯度和經度來確定他們在地圖上的確切位置。這兩個坐標一起作用來確定地球表面上的任何位置。","word":"longitude"}},"loop":{"createdAt":1783927689736,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"loop 是指形成閉合圓形或環形的結構，在這裡指過山車軌道的圓形部分。","options":["tunnel","drop","loop","turn"],"sentence":"The roller coaster has an exciting ______ that turns riders upside down. As the coaster climbs the track, passengers experience a complete circular motion in the air.","translation":"過山車有一個令人興奮的迴圈，使乘客倒立。當過山車沿著軌道上升時，乘客在空中體驗完整的圓形運動。","word":"loop"}},"loose":{"createdAt":1784362126701,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"loose 在這裡表示「鬆動的」，指物體不夠緊或固定得不牢固，即將脫落或分離的狀態。","options":["tight","loose","broken","small"],"sentence":"The button on my shirt has become ______ and might fall off soon. I need to sew it back on tightly before it drops completely.","translation":"我襯衫上的鈕扣已經變得鬆動，可能很快就會掉下來。我需要在它完全脫落之前把它緊緊縫回去。","word":"loose"}},"loosely":{"createdAt":1781667024993,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"loosely表示不緊密、鬆散的狀態，與firmly或tightly的含義相反。","options":["firmly","tightly","securely","loosely"],"sentence":"The rope was tied ______ around the package, allowing it to shift slightly during transport. The delivery company had to retie it securely to prevent damage.","translation":"繩子鬆散地捆在包裹周圍，使其在運輸過程中可以輕微移動。快遞公司必須重新牢固地綁它以防止損壞。","word":"loosely"}},"loosen":{"createdAt":1781839703154,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"loosen指鬆開或放鬆，與gradually released the tension and let descend（逐漸釋放張力和讓下降）完全相符。","options":["tighten","secure","loosen","fasten"],"sentence":"She had to ______ her grip on the rope to let the climber descend safely. The guide gradually released the tension to control the pace.","translation":"她必須鬆開抓著繩子的力度，以讓登山者安全下降。嚮導逐漸釋放張力來控制速度。","word":"loosen"}},"lotion":{"createdAt":1781738105694,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lotion 是一種液態或乳狀的皮膚護理產品，用於滋潤和保護皮膚。","options":["powder","lotion","soap","shampoo"],"sentence":"After taking a hot bath, she applied a moisturizing ______ to her dry skin to keep it soft and hydrated. The creamy product spread smoothly over her arms and legs.","translation":"洗完熱水澡後，她在乾燥的皮膚上涂了保濕乳液以保持皮膚柔軟和滋潤。這種乳狀產品在她的手臂和腿上均勻塗開。","word":"lotion"}},"lottery":{"createdAt":1781402154554,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"lottery指一種靠運氣決定贏家的遊戲或抽籤活動，通常涉及購票和獲獎。","options":["hijack","compel","lottery","stance"],"sentence":"She won the ______ and received a prize of one million dollars. After years of buying tickets every week, her luck finally changed when she matched all the winning numbers.","translation":"她贏得了彩票，獲得了一百萬美元的獎金。在多年每週購買彩票後，她終於幸運地配對了所有中獎號碼。","word":"lottery"}},"lounge":{"createdAt":1783832368933,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lounge 指的是供人休息、等待或社交的舒適場所，如機場或飯店的等候室或居室。","options":["coffin","lounge","insurance","reinforce"],"sentence":"After our flight was delayed, we spent three hours in the airport ______ reading magazines and drinking coffee. The comfortable seating area had soft chairs, a television, and complimentary snacks available to all waiting passengers.","translation":"我們的班機延誤後，我們在機場休息廳裡花了三個小時閱讀雜誌和喝咖啡。舒適的座位區有軟椅、電視和免費提供給所有等候乘客的小食。","word":"lounge"}},"loyal":{"createdAt":1782637076490,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"loyal 是忠誠的意思，指對某人或某事的堅定忠實和不變的忠心。","options":["friendly","loyal","playful","gentle"],"sentence":"The dog remained ______ to his owner throughout his entire life, always staying by his side through good times and bad. This unwavering devotion demonstrated the special bond between them.","translation":"這條狗在整個生命中都忠於他的主人，總是在好壞時期都陪伴在他身邊。這種不動搖的忠誠展示了他們之間的特殊紐帶。","word":"loyal"}},"loyalty":{"createdAt":1785252384394,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"loyalty（忠誠；忠實）指對某人或某個組織的堅定承諾和信任，即使面對其他誘惑也不背棄。","options":["loyalty","ambition","experience","creativity"],"sentence":"The employee's ______ to the company was evident through twenty years of dedicated service. He turned down multiple job offers from competitors because he valued his commitment to his employer above all else.","translation":"該員工對公司的忠誠在二十年的獻身服務中顯而易見。他拒絕了多個來自競爭對手的工作機會，因為他將對雇主的承諾視為最重要的。","word":"loyalty"}},"lucid":{"createdAt":1788779295371,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lucid 是指頭腦清楚、思路清晰、易於理解的狀態，常用來形容人的思維或語言表達。","options":["confused","lucid","anxious","drowsy"],"sentence":"The patient's mind became ______ after the doctor adjusted his medication. He could now clearly remember recent events and explain his thoughts in perfect order.","translation":"醫生調整了病人的藥物後，他的頭腦變得清晰。他現在能夠清楚地記住最近發生的事情，並按完美的順序解釋他的想法。","word":"lucid"}},"lucrative":{"createdAt":1783947243481,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"lucrative形容詞表示某事能帶來大量利潤或金錢收益，即賺錢的、盈利的。","options":["lucrative","competitive","risky","obsolete"],"sentence":"Tech entrepreneurs often pursue ______ business opportunities in the software industry. These ventures can generate millions of dollars in revenue annually for successful companies.","translation":"科技企業家經常在軟體產業中尋求有利可圖的商業機會。這些企業每年能為成功的公司產生數百萬美元的收入。","word":"lucrative"}},"lullaby":{"createdAt":1785567783221,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lullaby 是一首特別為了哄嬰幼兒睡覺而創作的催眠曲，具有溫和、重複的音樂特徵。","options":["symphony","lullaby","ballad","hymn"],"sentence":"The mother sang a soft ______ to her baby to help him fall asleep. The gentle melody with repetitive, soothing words is a traditional song passed down through generations for bedtime.","translation":"母親唱著柔和的搖籃曲來幫助她的寶寶入睡。這首具有重複、舒緩歌詞的溫柔旋律是代代相傳的傳統睡前歌曲。","word":"lullaby"}},"lump":{"createdAt":1784173464335,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lump 指一個固體塊或團，通常是不規則形狀的物質聚集在一起。","options":["stream","lump","layer","dust"],"sentence":"The baker mixed the dry ingredients and noticed a ______ of unmixed flour in the batter. She stirred vigorously until the solid mass dissolved completely into the mixture.","translation":"烘焙師混合乾材料，注意到麵糊中有一團未混合的麵粉。她用力攪拌，直到固體塊完全溶解到混合物中。","word":"lump"}},"lunar":{"createdAt":1781848934149,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lunar指基於月亮週期的日曆系統","options":["solar","lunar","gregorian","julian"],"sentence":"The ______ calendar is used in many Asian countries to determine important festivals. The Mid-Autumn Festival, for example, is celebrated on the 15th day of the eighth month.","translation":"陰曆在許多亞洲國家用來確定重要節日。例如，中秋節在第八個月的第15天慶祝。","word":"lunar"}},"lunatic":{"createdAt":1782550057059,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lunatic用作形容詞表示瘋狂的、極其不理智的，描述極其危險和無謂的行為。","options":["careful","lunatic","experienced","cautious"],"sentence":"The ______ driver swerved across three lanes without signaling. Police later found he had been driving for 36 hours straight without sleep.","translation":"那個瘋狂的司機在沒有打信號燈的情況下跨過三條車道。警察後來發現他已經連續36小時不睡覺地開車。","word":"lunatic"}},"lung":{"createdAt":1782637076489,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lung 是肺的意思，是人體呼吸系統中的重要器官，用於吸收氧氣和排出二氧化碳。","options":["heart","lung","liver","kidney"],"sentence":"The doctor examined the patient's ______ with a stethoscope to check for any signs of pneumonia or infection. These organs are responsible for breathing and oxygen exchange.","translation":"醫生用聽診器檢查了患者的肺，檢查是否有肺炎或感染的跡象。這些器官負責呼吸和氧氣交換。","word":"lung"}},"lure":{"createdAt":1781836375374,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lure是誘惑或吸引，指能夠吸引某人去做某事的東西。","options":["trap","lure","trick","scheme"],"sentence":"The bright lights and exciting games of the casino served as a ______ for many gamblers. The appeal of winning big money kept drawing people back repeatedly.","translation":"賭場的明亮燈光和刺激遊戲對許多賭徒起著誘惑作用。贏大錢的吸引力不斷吸引人們反覆回來。","word":"lure"}},"lush":{"createdAt":1783391419404,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"lush形容植物繁茂、鬱鬱蔥蔥，通常指生長茂密且令人愉悅的自然景觀。","options":["barren","desert-like","lush","dry"],"sentence":"The tropical rainforest was incredibly ______, with thick vegetation covering every surface. The abundance of greenery and vibrant plant life made it one of the most beautiful places I had ever visited.","translation":"熱帶雨林令人難以置信地鬱鬱蔥蔥，濃密的植被覆蓋每一個表面。豐富的綠色植物和充滿活力的植物生命使其成為我去過的最美麗的地方之一。","word":"lush"}},"lust":{"createdAt":1784773941955,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lust 是指一種強烈而不可控制的慾望，通常暗示貪婪或過度的渴望。","options":["respect","lust","admiration","concern"],"sentence":"His ______ for power drove him to make unethical business decisions. He cared only about accumulating wealth and influence, regardless of the moral cost.","translation":"他對權力的慾望驅使他做出不道德的商業決定。他只關心積累財富和影響力，不顧道德代價。","word":"lust"}},"luxurious":{"createdAt":1782637076485,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"luxurious 是豪華的、奢侈的意思，用來描述高檔、精緻的物品或體驗。","options":["modest","luxurious","simple","basic"],"sentence":"The five-star hotel offered a ______ experience with marble bathrooms, silk bedding, and gold-plated fixtures. Every detail was designed to provide ultimate comfort and elegance.","translation":"五星級酒店提供了豪華的體驗，配備大理石浴室、絲綢床上用品和鍍金配件。每一個細節都被設計成提供最高的舒適和優雅。","word":"luxurious"}},"luxury":{"createdAt":1785033795935,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"luxury指高級且昂貴的舒適享受或物品，代表一種奢華的生活方式。","options":["business","luxury","educational","budget"],"sentence":"She treated herself to a ______ vacation in Switzerland after working hard for two years. The five-star resort featured private butlers, gourmet dining, and spa treatments that cost more than her monthly salary.","translation":"她在努力工作兩年後犒賞自己去瑞士度了一個奢侈假期。五星級度假村配備了私人管家、美食餐飲和水療護理，費用超過她的月薪。","word":"luxury"}},"lyric":{"createdAt":1786961304463,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"lyric 是指歌曲中的歌詞，即歌手應該唱出來的文字內容，而不是旋律或和聲。","options":["melody","lyric","rhythm","harmony"],"sentence":"The singer performed the song beautifully, but she forgot one ______ in the second verse. The sheet music clearly showed every word that should have been sung, and the audience noticed the missing line immediately.","translation":"歌手把這首歌唱得很好聽，但她在第二段忘記了一句______。樂譜上清楚地顯示了所有應該被唱出來的詞句，觀眾立即注意到了這缺失的一句。","word":"lyric"}},"mace":{"createdAt":1783402421330,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"重錘是一種中世紀武器，由金屬頭部和長柄組成，用於擊碎對手的盔甲和骨骼。","options":["sword","mace","bow","shield"],"sentence":"The medieval warrior wielded a heavy ______ with a spiked metal head mounted on a wooden handle. This brutal weapon was designed to crush armor and deliver devastating blows in close combat.","translation":"中世紀戰士揮舞著一把沉重的重錘，其尖刺金屬頭部安裝在木製手柄上。這種殘忍的武器旨在擊碎盔甲並在近距離戰鬥中造成毀滅性打擊。","word":"mace"}},"machinery":{"createdAt":1782637076484,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"machinery 是機械的意思，指工業生產中使用的大型機器和設備的總稱。","options":["tools","machinery","workers","materials"],"sentence":"The factory was filled with large ______ that produced automobiles day and night. The equipment required regular maintenance to function properly.","translation":"工廠裡裝滿了晝夜不停生產汽車的大型機械。這些設備需要定期維護才能正常運作。","word":"machinery"}},"made_one_s_name":{"createdAt":1782361629312,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"make one's name 短語表示「成名」或「建立名聲」，指通過傑出的成就而獲得廣泛認可。","options":["lost her job","made one's name","became unknown","retired"],"sentence":"The young director ______ with her groundbreaking documentary that premiered at the international film festival. Her innovative storytelling approach immediately caught the attention of major studios.","translation":"這位年輕導演通過她在國際電影節首映的開創性紀錄片成名。她創新的敘事方法立即引起了主要電影公司的關注。","word":"made one's name"}},"magnet":{"createdAt":1784011108114,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"magnet是具有磁性的物體，能夠吸引含鐵的物質並產生磁場","options":["battery","prism","magnet","lever"],"sentence":"A ______ can attract iron objects and create a magnetic field around it. Children often use these devices to pick up metal paperclips and nails from a table.","translation":"磁鐵能吸引鐵製物體並在其周圍產生磁場。孩子們經常用這些工具從桌子上吸起金屬迴紋針和釘子。","word":"magnet"}},"magnetic":{"createdAt":1781430348003,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"magnetic 是指具有磁力或與磁有關的，能夠吸引鐵和其他磁性物質。","options":["electric","gravitational","magnetic","thermal"],"sentence":"Iron filings instantly stick to a ______ field when placed near a strong magnet. This property allows the metal particles to be attracted and rearranged without any direct physical contact.","translation":"當鐵屑靠近強磁鐵時，它們會立即粘附到磁場上。這種特性使金屬粒子能夠被吸引和重新排列，而無需任何直接的物理接觸。","word":"magnetic"}},"magnificence":{"createdAt":1784173464327,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"magnificence 指豪華、壯麗、宏偉的特質，通常用來形容令人印象深刻的規模和奢華。","options":["simplicity","magnificence","popularity","efficiency"],"sentence":"The palace displayed extraordinary ______ with its golden ceilings and marble columns. Visitors from around the world came specifically to witness the grandeur and splendid beauty of this architectural masterpiece.","translation":"宮殿以其金色天花板和大理石柱展現了非凡的豪華壯麗。來自世界各地的遊客特地前來見證這座建築傑作的宏偉和華麗之美。","word":"magnificence"}},"magnificent":{"createdAt":1782476385142,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"magnificent 是形容詞，用來形容某物非常壯麗、壯觀、宏偉，給人留下深刻印象。","options":["small","magnificent","ancient","ordinary"],"sentence":"The ______ palace towered above the city with golden domes and intricate carvings. Visitors traveled from distant lands just to witness its breathtaking grandeur and architectural beauty.","translation":"那座壯麗的宮殿以其金色圓頂和複雜的雕刻高聳在城市上方。遊客們從遠方的土地來到這裡，只為了見證它令人驚豔的宏偉和建築美感。","word":"magnificent"}},"magnify":{"createdAt":1781430348003,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"magnify 是指使某物看起來更大，特別是通過光學儀器如放大鏡或顯微鏡來實現。","options":["reduce","magnify","observe","collect"],"sentence":"Scientists use a microscope to ______ tiny organisms so they can be studied in detail. Without this optical device, these microorganisms would be invisible to the human eye.","translation":"科學家使用顯微鏡來放大微小的生物體，以便進行詳細研究。沒有這種光學設備，這些微生物對人眼來說是不可見的。","word":"magnify"}},"mainland":{"createdAt":1781362281652,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mainland指的是一個國家或地區的主要陸地部分，不包括島嶼。","options":["coast","mainland","harbor","shore"],"sentence":"Many people from the island traveled to the ______ to find better job opportunities. The larger landmass offered more industries and economic growth than their home island.","translation":"許多來自島嶼的人前往大陸尋找更好的工作機會。這片更大的陸地比他們的島嶼提供了更多的產業和經濟增長。","word":"mainland"}},"mainstream":{"createdAt":1782786424039,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"mainstream形容詞表示被廣泛接受和認可的、屬於主流思想或風格的。","options":["mainstream","experimental","underground","obscure"],"sentence":"His artistic style was once considered rebellious, but it has now become ______. Major museums and collectors worldwide have embraced his work as part of accepted contemporary art.","translation":"他的藝術風格曾經被認為是反叛的，但現在已經成為主流。世界各地的主要美術館和收藏家已經將他的作品視為公認的當代藝術的一部分。","word":"mainstream"}},"maintain":{"createdAt":1782637076492,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"maintain 是保持、維持的意思，指通過持續的努力和照顧使某物保持良好狀態。","options":["design","maintain","expand","relocate"],"sentence":"The homeowner worked diligently to ______ the garden by watering the plants daily and removing weeds regularly. Without this consistent care, the garden would become overgrown and neglected.","translation":"房主努力維護花園，每天澆灌植物並定期除草。沒有這種持續的照顧，花園就會變得雜亂無章和被忽視。","word":"maintain"}},"maintenance":{"createdAt":1781443653219,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"maintenance指的是對設施或系統的定期保養、維護和修繕工作，以保持其正常狀態。","options":["destruction","abandonment","maintenance","demolition"],"sentence":"The apartment building required regular ______ to keep all systems functioning properly. The landlord hired contractors monthly to inspect pipes, repair electrical issues, and service the heating system.","translation":"這棟公寓需要定期維護以保持所有系統正常運作。房東每月雇用承包商檢查管道、修復電氣問題並維修供暖系統。","word":"maintenance"}},"majestic":{"createdAt":1783470852903,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"majestic是形容詞，形容物體具有莊嚴、雄偉、令人印象深刻的氣質，通常用於描述自然風景或宏大的事物。","options":["steep","distant","majestic","ancient"],"sentence":"The ______ mountains stood tall against the sunset, commanding respect and admiration. Their snow-capped peaks seemed to touch the sky with grandeur and power.","translation":"這些雄偉的山峰在日落時高聳挺立，令人敬畏和讚嘆。它們白雪皚皚的山頂似乎以莊嚴和力量觸及天空。","word":"majestic"}},"majesty":{"createdAt":1781425104309,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"majesty 指莊嚴、威嚴或崇高的品質，也用作皇帝或王后的敬稱。","options":["tragedy","majesty","modesty","obesity"],"sentence":"The ______ of the ancient palace left all the visitors speechless. Its grand architecture and royal decoration embodied centuries of power and authority.","translation":"古老宮殿的威嚴令所有訪客嘆為觀止。其宏偉的建築和皇家裝飾體現了數百年的權力和權威。","word":"majesty"}},"major":{"createdAt":1781430953386,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"major作為動詞表示「主修某科目」，在大學教育的語境中使用。","options":["minor","major","graduate","transfer"],"sentence":"She decided to ______ in Biology at university. Her parents were pleased because she chose a field with excellent career prospects.","translation":"她決定在大學主修生物學。她的父母很高興，因為她選擇了一個有很好職業前景的領域。","word":"major"}},"majority":{"createdAt":1781425104308,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"majority 表示大多數、佔多數的人或物，與 minority（少數）相對。","options":["majority","minority","faculty","severity"],"sentence":"The ______ of students in the class prefer online learning over traditional classrooms. Only a few students actually enjoy sitting at desks all day.","translation":"班上大多數學生比起傳統教室更喜歡在線學習。只有少數學生真正喜歡整天坐在課桌前。","word":"majority"}},"mammal":{"createdAt":1781430348005,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"mammal 是指一類溫血脊椎動物，特徵是能夠產奶來餵養後代。","options":["fish","reptile","mammal","amphibian"],"sentence":"A whale is a large ______ that lives in the ocean and breathes air through a blowhole. Despite living in water, it shares the characteristic of producing milk to feed its young.","translation":"鯨魚是一種生活在海洋中並通過噴孔呼吸空氣的大型哺乳動物。儘管生活在水中，它具有產奶來餵養幼崽的特徵。","word":"mammal"}},"manage":{"createdAt":1785406388603,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"manage 作為動詞表示「管理」，指負責監督、組織和控制一個部門或組織的運作。","options":["join","manage","audit","promote"],"sentence":"Sarah was promoted to ______ the entire marketing department last month. She now oversees hiring, budgeting, and strategic planning for her team.","translation":"莎拉上個月被晉升為管理整個行銷部門的負責人。她現在監督她團隊的招聘、預算和策略規劃。","word":"manage"}},"manageable":{"createdAt":1781950727559,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"manageable 表示易於處理、可控制或不難管理的事情。","options":["impossible","dangerous","manageable","temporary"],"sentence":"The project seemed ______ when we divided it into smaller tasks. Breaking it down into five stages made it much easier to complete.","translation":"當我們把項目分成更小的任務時，它似乎是可以處理的。把它分成五個階段使其更容易完成。","word":"manageable"}},"management":{"createdAt":1781951900953,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"management指有效地組織和控制人力、物資等資源以達成目標的過程。","options":["ignorance","management","awareness","discussion"],"sentence":"Good ______ of time and resources is essential for the success of any large project. The team leader carefully planned and organized every aspect of their work.","translation":"良好的時間和資源管理對任何大型項目的成功都至關重要。團隊領導仔細規劃和組織了工作的各個方面。","word":"management"}},"manager":{"createdAt":1785454917947,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"manager 指在組織或公司中負責監督和指導他人工作的人，通常具有決策權和管理責任。","options":["employee","manager","colleague","client"],"sentence":"The ______ of our department organized a meeting to discuss the quarterly budget. She has been leading this team for five years and reports directly to the director.","translation":"我們部門的經理組織了一次會議來討論季度預算。她領導這個團隊已經五年了，並直接向主管匯報。","word":"manager"}},"mandate":{"createdAt":1781425104310,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"mandate 表示授權、委任或人民通過選舉給予的權力和責任。","options":["mandate","debate","climate","project"],"sentence":"The government received a ______ from the people to implement new environmental policies. The election results clearly showed that voters supported these green initiatives.","translation":"政府收到人民的授權以實施新的環保政策。選舉結果清楚地表明投票者支持這些綠色倡議。","word":"mandate"}},"manifest":{"createdAt":1781860901464,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"manifest作動詞表示表現或顯現，指某種情感或特徵清楚地表露出來","options":["hide","conceal","manifest","suppress"],"sentence":"Her anger began to ______ through her facial expressions and body language. By the time she spoke, everyone could clearly see she was upset.","translation":"她的憤怒開始通過她的面部表情和肢體語言表現出來。當她說話時，每個人都清楚地看到她很不高興。","word":"manifest"}},"manifestation":{"createdAt":1781425104307,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"manifestation 指某種情感、品質或狀況的具體表現或外在顯示。","options":["concealment","manifestation","imagination","limitation"],"sentence":"The ______ of her anger was evident when she slammed the door. Her outburst showed us exactly how upset she truly felt.","translation":"她憤怒的表現在她砰地關上門時顯而易見。她的爆發讓我們看到她真正有多沮喪。","word":"manifestation"}},"manipulate":{"createdAt":1781430953388,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"manipulate表示「以不正當手段操縱或控制」，通常帶有欺騙或不誠實的含義。","options":["report","announce","manipulate","observe"],"sentence":"The corrupt politician tried to ______ the election results in his favor. He bribed election officials and tampered with voting machines to ensure his victory.","translation":"腐敗的政客試圖操縱選舉結果以對自己有利。他賄賂選舉官員並篡改投票機以確保自己的勝利。","word":"manipulate"}},"mankind":{"createdAt":1783947021214,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mankind 是名詞，意為人類或全體人民，指所有的人或人類作為一個整體。","options":["animals","mankind","nature","machines"],"sentence":"Throughout history, ______ has always searched for ways to improve living conditions and advance civilization. From ancient discoveries to modern technology, humans have continuously worked toward a better future.","translation":"在整個歷史上，人類一直在尋求改善生活條件和推進文明的方法。從古代發現到現代科技，人類不斷為更美好的未來而努力。","word":"mankind"}},"manner":{"createdAt":1783042345896,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"manner 指的是做事或舉止的方式、態度或風格，強調行為表現的方法。","options":["fashion","manner","style","method"],"sentence":"The chef prepared the dish in a very professional ______, ensuring every detail was perfect before serving it to the customers. His calm demeanor and precise techniques impressed everyone in the kitchen.","translation":"廚師以非常專業的方式準備這道菜，確保在上菜前每個細節都完美無缺。他的冷靜舉止和精確技術給廚房裡的每個人都留下了深刻印象。","word":"manner"}},"manners":{"createdAt":1781430953389,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"manners是名詞，表示「禮貌」或「舉止得體」，涉及社交行為和禮儀規範。","options":["languages","skills","manners","interests"],"sentence":"Good ______ are essential in business meetings and formal social gatherings. Children are taught to say \"please\" and \"thank you\" from an early age.","translation":"良好的禮儀在商務會議和正式社交聚會中是必不可少的。孩子們從小就被教導要說「請」和「謝謝」。","word":"manners"}},"mansion":{"createdAt":1781430953391,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"mansion是名詞，表示「大宅」或「豪宅」，指規模很大的宏偉私人住宅。","options":["apartment","cottage","mansion","studio"],"sentence":"The billionaire purchased a grand ______ overlooking the city skyline. The property featured 15 bedrooms, multiple swimming pools, and sprawling gardens on 10 acres.","translation":"這位億萬富翁購買了一座俯瞰城市天際線的豪宅。該房產有15間臥室、多個游泳池和跨越10英畝的寬敞花園。","word":"mansion"}},"manual":{"createdAt":1783759708910,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"manual 形容詞表示用手或手動進行的工作，與自動化或機械化的工作相對。","options":["efficient","manual","advanced","digital"],"sentence":"The factory recently upgraded from ______ labor to automated machinery for packaging products. Workers now monitor the machines rather than performing the repetitive tasks by hand.","translation":"這家工廠最近從手工勞動升級為自動化機械來包裝產品。工人現在監控機器，而不是用手執行重複的任務。","word":"manual"}},"manufacture":{"createdAt":1781840892405,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"manufacture意為製造或生產，與「自己生產」和「質量控制」的語境相符。","options":["distribute","manufacture","advertise","transport"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ its own products instead of outsourcing to other factories. This allowed them to maintain strict quality control over every item produced.","translation":"該公司決定自己製造產品，而不是外包給其他工廠。這讓他們能夠對每件生產的產品保持嚴格的質量控制。","word":"manufacture"}},"manufacturer":{"createdAt":1785239072554,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"manufacturer 是指「製造商；生產商」，專指從事生產或製造產品的企業或公司，通常擁有生產設施和技術。","options":["distributor","customer","manufacturer","competitor"],"sentence":"The car ______ announced a new electric vehicle model at the international auto show. The company has been producing automobiles for over fifty years and operates factories across multiple continents.","translation":"這家汽車製造商在國際車展上宣布推出新的電動車型。這家公司已經生產汽車超過五十年，並在多個大陸經營工廠。","word":"manufacturer"}},"manuscript":{"createdAt":1781775276767,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"manuscript指作者的原始文稿或手寫文件，在提交出版前通常會有修改和批註。","options":["publication","manuscript","blueprint","diploma"],"sentence":"The author submitted her ______ to the publisher for review. The handwritten pages were filled with notes and corrections from months of editing.","translation":"作者將她的手稿提交給出版商審查。這些手寫的頁面上充滿了數月編輯工作中的註釋和修改。","word":"manuscript"}},"maple":{"createdAt":1781430953388,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"maple是名詞，指「楓樹」，以其在秋季變色的美麗葉子而聞名。","options":["oak","pine","maple","birch"],"sentence":"The park is famous for its beautiful ______ trees in the fall. Every autumn, visitors come from all over to see the brilliant red and orange leaves.","translation":"這個公園因其在秋天時美麗的楓樹而聞名。每年秋天，遊客們從四面八方來欣賞絢爛的紅色和橙色葉子。","word":"maple"}},"mar":{"createdAt":1782475351771,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"mar意為「損壞、破壞、損傷」，指的是對某物的外觀或品質造成負面影響。","options":["enhance","improve","mar","polish"],"sentence":"The careless scratch will ______ the surface of the antique wooden table. The dealer said this imperfection significantly reduces its value in the market.","translation":"那道粗心的刮痕會損傷這張古董木桌的表面。經銷商說這個瑕疵大大降低了它的市場價值。","word":"mar"}},"margin":{"createdAt":1781424574162,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"margin 指頁面的邊緣或空白處，通常用於寫註記或評論。","options":["center","title","margin","conclusion"],"sentence":"The teacher wrote helpful comments in the ______ of the student's essay. The feedback was written in the empty white spaces beside the main text.","translation":"老師在學生論文的空白處寫下有用的評論。反饋寫在主要文本旁邊的空白處。","word":"margin"}},"marginal":{"createdAt":1781337343698,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"marginal意為微小的、少量的或邊緣的，用於形容數量很少或影響不大的情況。","options":["dramatic","excellent","marginal","spectacular"],"sentence":"The student's improvement in mathematics was only ______ despite attending tutoring sessions twice a week. His test scores increased by less than 3%, which was hardly significant.","translation":"儘管學生每週參加兩次補習課程，但他的數學成績提升只是微小的。他的測試成績只提高了不到3%，這幾乎不顯著。","word":"marginal"}},"marine":{"createdAt":1782401868811,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"marine 表示與海洋或航海相關的。","options":["forest","marine","desert","underground"],"sentence":"The research team studied ______ life forms in the deepest parts of the ocean. They discovered many unusual creatures that had never been documented before.","translation":"研究團隊在海洋最深處研究了海洋生命形式。他們發現了許多以前從未被記錄過的不尋常生物。","word":"marine"}},"marital":{"createdAt":1781425104309,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"marital 是形容詞，指與婚姻、夫妻關係相關的事物。","options":["musical","marital","martial","material"],"sentence":"The couple sought ______ counseling to improve their relationship. They wanted professional help to strengthen the bond between husband and wife.","translation":"這對夫婦尋求婚姻諮詢以改善他們的關係。他們希望獲得專業幫助來加強夫妻之間的紐帶。","word":"marital"}},"marker":{"createdAt":1781430348002,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"marker 是一種書寫工具，通常有粗筆尖和彩色墨水，用於在白板、海報等表面上做標記或寫字。","options":["pencil","marker","eraser","ruler"],"sentence":"The teacher used a red ______ to highlight the important dates on the whiteboard. Students could clearly see the bright marks because the ink was designed to be highly visible.","translation":"老師用紅色的記號筆在白板上標記重要的日期。學生們能清楚地看到這些明亮的標記，因為這種墨水的設計就是為了高度可見。","word":"marker"}},"martial":{"createdAt":1781430348004,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"martial 是指與軍事、戰爭或格鬥相關的，常見於 martial arts（武術）這個詞組。","options":["fine","performing","martial","visual"],"sentence":"The student enrolled in a ______ arts class to learn self-defense techniques and discipline. The instructor taught traditional combat methods passed down through generations of training.","translation":"這名學生報名參加了武術課程以學習自衛技巧和紀律。教練教授了代代相傳的傳統格鬥方法。","word":"martial"}},"marvel":{"createdAt":1781425104309,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"marvel 作名詞表示令人驚奇的事物或成就；也可作動詞表示感到驚奇。","options":["failure","marvel","marble","marvel"],"sentence":"The invention of electricity was a ______ of human engineering and creativity. Scientists marveled at how such a discovery could transform entire civilizations.","translation":"電的發明是人類工程和創意的奇跡。科學家們對這一發現如何能改變整個文明感到驚嘆。","word":"marvel"}},"marvelous":{"createdAt":1782410027826,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"marvelous指奇妙的、令人驚歎的；第二句的「令人驚歎」、「不可思議」和「起身歡呼」都表達了極端正面的驚喜，與marvelous的含義完全相符。","options":["ordinary","professional","marvelous","careful"],"sentence":"The acrobat's performance was absolutely ______, with breathtaking flips and jumps that amazed the entire audience. Everyone stood up and cheered at the incredible display of skill and courage.","translation":"特技演員的表演絕對令人驚嘆，有令人屏息的翻轉和跳躍，讓整個觀眾驚歎不已。每個人都為這項技能和勇氣的不可思議展示起身歡呼。","word":"marvelous"}},"masculine":{"createdAt":1781425104310,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"masculine 是形容詞，表示男性的、陽剛的或具有男性特徵的事物。","options":["feminine","masculine","electric","melodic"],"sentence":"He has a ______ voice that makes him sound like a radio announcer. His deep tone and bold delivery are distinctly male in character.","translation":"他有著男性化的嗓音，聽起來像廣播播音員。他深沉的音調和大膽的表達方式具有明顯的男性特徵。","word":"masculine"}},"mass":{"createdAt":1781430953390,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"mass作為名詞表示「大量」或「大眾」，通常指數量龐大的人或物。","options":["shortage","scarcity","mass","absence"],"sentence":"There was a ______ of people gathering at the concert venue before the show started. The crowd was so dense that security had difficulty controlling the flow of attendees.","translation":"演唱會開始前，有大量人群聚集在演唱會場地。人群如此密集，以至於安保部門難以控制參與者的流動。","word":"mass"}},"massage":{"createdAt":1781430953387,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"massage是名詞，表示「按摩」這種物理治療方法，通常涉及用手對身體進行操作。","options":["surgery","consultation","massage","injection"],"sentence":"After the intense workout, Tom went to get a ______ to relieve his sore muscles. The therapist spent an hour applying pressure and kneading his shoulders and back.","translation":"激烈運動後，湯姆去做按摩來緩解肌肉酸痛。治療師花了一個小時在他的肩膀和背部施加壓力和揉搓。","word":"massage"}},"massive":{"createdAt":1781430953387,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"massive表示「大規模的、巨大的」，用來形容規模或程度很大的事物。","options":["tiny","modest","massive","slight"],"sentence":"The company experienced a ______ drop in sales last quarter. The losses were so significant that they had to lay off thousands of employees.","translation":"該公司上季度經歷了大幅銷售下滑。虧損非常巨大，他們不得不裁員數千人。","word":"massive"}},"master":{"createdAt":1782902185110,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"master 作動詞表示「精通」或「掌握」，指通過學習和練習達到高度的技能水平。","options":["learn","master","attempt","understand"],"sentence":"After years of practice, she was finally able to ______ the difficult piano technique. Her teacher confirmed that she had reached the highest level of skill and could perform it flawlessly.","translation":"經過多年的練習，她終於能夠精通這項困難的鋼琴技巧。她的老師確認她已經達到了最高的技能水平，可以完美地演奏它。","word":"master"}},"masterpiece":{"createdAt":1781950727566,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"masterpiece 指一件傑作或最優秀的作品，通常在其領域內達到最高水準。","options":["failure","masterpiece","sketch","copy"],"sentence":"The painting is considered a ______ of Renaissance art. Art historians rank it among the greatest works ever created in human history.","translation":"這幅畫被認為是文藝復興藝術的傑作。藝術史學家將其列為人類歷史上曾創作過的最偉大作品之列。","word":"masterpiece"}},"mastery":{"createdAt":1782533789091,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mastery 意思是完全的控制和熟練，指通過長期努力達到的完美技能或專業水平。","options":["interest","mastery","familiarity","knowledge"],"sentence":"After fifteen years of daily practice, the musician finally achieved ______ of the violin. She could perform the most difficult concertos with perfect precision.","translation":"經過十五年的每日練習，這位音樂家終於精通了小提琴。她可以完美地演奏最困難的協奏曲。","word":"mastery"}},"match":{"createdAt":1781849847411,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"match表示比賽或競賽，與「網球、錦標賽、球員比賽」的線索相符。","options":["conversation","match","story","song"],"sentence":"The tennis ______ was the most exciting event of the championship tournament. The two players were equally skilled and fought intensely for every point.","translation":"這場網球比賽是錦標賽中最令人興奮的事件。這兩名球員技術相當，為每一分而激烈比賽。","word":"match"}},"material":{"createdAt":1781848934146,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"material作名詞指製作東西所需的布料、原料或材料","options":["information","material","price","design"],"sentence":"The seamstress selected a soft ______ for the wedding dress. The fabric felt smooth and luxurious between her fingers.","translation":"裁縫為婚紗選擇了柔軟的布料。這種織物摸起來光滑奢華。","word":"material"}},"matter":{"createdAt":1783505303422,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"matter在此表示重要或有關係，用來表達某事是否具有重要性或影響力","options":["exist","care","matter","happen"],"sentence":"It doesn't ______ whether you arrive early or late to the meeting. What's important is that you attend and contribute your ideas.","translation":"你是早到還是晚到會議並不要緊。重要的是你要參加並貢獻你的想法。","word":"matter"}},"mattress":{"createdAt":1782824834613,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mattress（床墊）是放在床架上、人睡眠時躺在上面的厚墊子，需要有適當的硬度來提供支撐和舒適感。","options":["pillow","mattress","blanket","frame"],"sentence":"Sarah bought a new ______ for her bed because the old one had become too soft and uncomfortable. She spent hours testing different options at the furniture store to find the perfect level of firmness.","translation":"莎拉為她的床買了一個新的床墊，因為舊的變得太軟且不舒服。她在家具店花了好幾個小時測試不同的選項，以找到完美的硬度等級。","word":"mattress"}},"mature":{"createdAt":1781311983484,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"mature 表示成熟的或已經充分發育的狀態，與年輕或未發育相對。","options":["presidential","timer","mature","average"],"sentence":"The ______ trees in the orchard produced more fruit than the younger saplings. These plants had developed strong root systems over several decades of growth.","translation":"果園裡成熟的樹木比年輕的樹苗產出更多水果。這些植物經過數十年的生長已經發展出強大的根系。","word":"mature"}},"maturity":{"createdAt":1783208024474,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"maturity 在金融語境中指債券或投資項目達到期滿日期，投資者可以收回本金和利息的時刻。","options":["growth","maturity","interest","profit"],"sentence":"The bond investment will reach ______ in 10 years, at which point you can withdraw your principal and earned interest. The financial advisor assured me that this was a safe way to save for long-term goals.","translation":"該債券投資將在10年後到期，屆時您可以提取本金和賺取的利息。財務顧問向我保證，這是為長期目標儲蓄的安全方式。","word":"maturity"}},"maximize":{"createdAt":1783419789624,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"maximize 是動詞，表示使某事物達到可能的最高水準或最大程度，追求最優結果。","options":["increase","maximize","optimize","enhance"],"sentence":"The farmer used advanced irrigation techniques to ______ crop yield from his fields. By controlling water distribution and nutrients precisely, he achieved record production levels this season.","translation":"農民使用先進的灌溉技術來最大化他田地的農作物產量。通過精確控制水分配和營養，他在本季度達到了創紀錄的產量水準。","word":"maximize"}},"maximum":{"createdAt":1781434900593,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"maximum表示能達到或允許的最高限度或最大數量。","options":["minimum","maximum","average","typical"],"sentence":"The swimming pool has a ______ capacity of 500 people for safety reasons. Authorities strictly enforce this limit to prevent overcrowding.","translation":"出於安全考慮，游泳池的最大容納人數為500人。當局嚴格執行此限制以防止過度擁擠。","word":"maximum"}},"mayor":{"createdAt":1782637076482,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mayor 是市長或鎮長的意思，是城市或城鎮的主要行政首長。","options":["governor","mayor","senator","judge"],"sentence":"The ______ of the city announced new policies at the town hall meeting. As the chief elected official, he had the authority to make decisions for the entire municipality.","translation":"市長在市政廳會議上公佈了新政策。作為城市的最高民選官員，他有權為整個市政當局做決定。","word":"mayor"}},"maze":{"createdAt":1784899764059,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"maze是一種設計複雜的迷宮結構，通常有許多相互連接的通道，容易令人困惑。","options":["garden","maze","park","forest"],"sentence":"The children got lost in the hedge ______ at the garden. They had to find their way through the winding paths to reach the exit.","translation":"孩子們在花園裡的樹籬迷宮中迷路了。他們必須通過蜿蜒的小徑找到出口。","word":"maze"}},"mean":{"createdAt":1781437220553,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"「Mean」作形容詞表示一個人不友善、吝嗇或缺乏同情心。","options":["generous","kind","mean","fair"],"sentence":"It was ______ of him to refuse sharing his lunch with the hungry child. He had plenty of food but chose to be stingy and unkind.","translation":"他拒絕與飢餓的孩子分享午餐是很卑鄙的。他有很多食物卻選擇吝嗇和不善待他人。","word":"mean"}},"meaningfully":{"createdAt":1783063660622,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"meaningfully 是副詞，表示以有意義、有實質內容的方式進行某事。","options":["loudly","briefly","meaningfully","quickly"],"sentence":"The two old friends spoke ______ about their lives and shared deep personal stories. Their conversation went far beyond small talk and revealed their true feelings.","translation":"這兩位老朋友有意義地談論了他們的生活並分享了深層的個人故事。他們的談話遠超過於閒聊，揭示了他們的真實感受。","word":"meaningfully"}},"meaningless":{"createdAt":1787297511846,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"meaningless 是形容詞，表示沒有意義、無價值或沒有目的的，通常用於描述失去重要性或實際用途的事物。","options":["pointless","meaningless","valuable","significant"],"sentence":"After the company was shut down, all of his years of work there suddenly felt ______. He realized that none of the projects he had completed would ever be used or have any real impact.","translation":"在公司關閉後，他多年的工作突然感到毫無意義。他意識到他完成的任何項目都不會被使用，也不會產生任何真實的影響。","word":"meaningless"}},"means":{"createdAt":1781622232187,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"means 在此語境中指財富或經濟能力，即做某事所需的金錢或資源。","options":["interest","means","courage","time"],"sentence":"Sarah doesn't have the financial ______ to travel abroad this year. She is saving money and working part-time to afford a vacation in the future.","translation":"薩拉今年沒有經濟手段出國旅遊。她正在存錢並兼職工作，以便將來能負擔起度假。","word":"means"}},"meantime":{"createdAt":1782786424042,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"meantime名詞表示在某個事件發生期間或兩個時間點之間的時段。","options":["aftermath","meantime","finale","conclusion"],"sentence":"The main course will take about thirty minutes to prepare, so in the ______ we can enjoy appetizers and wine. By the time dinner is ready, everyone will be seated and relaxed.","translation":"主菜需要大約三十分鐘來準備，所以在此期間我們可以享受開胃菜和葡萄酒。到晚餐準備好時，每個人都將就座並放鬆。","word":"meantime"}},"meanwhile":{"createdAt":1782410027828,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"meanwhile是副詞，表示同時、在此期間；第二句明確說明「同時」發生的兩件事，強調時間的並行性，這正是meanwhile的確切含義。","options":["afterwards","meanwhile","therefore","however"],"sentence":"While Sarah was studying for her exam in the library, ______ her brother was playing video games at home. Both children were occupied with different activities on the same afternoon.","translation":"莎拉在圖書館為考試複習時，同時她的哥哥在家玩電子遊戲。兩個孩子在同一個下午忙於不同的活動。","word":"meanwhile"}},"measurable":{"createdAt":1782550983730,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"measurable 意指能夠被量化或用數據評估的，可以通過具體指標來衡量","options":["abstract","measurable","theoretical","vague"],"sentence":"The company set ______ goals for the next quarter, with specific numbers and deadlines. We can track progress by comparing actual results to these targets.","translation":"公司為下一季度設立了可測量的目標，具有具體的數字和截止日期。我們可以通過將實際結果與這些目標進行比較來追蹤進度。","word":"measurable"}},"measure":{"createdAt":1782410027828,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"measure作為名詞，指措施、手段；雖然steps和efforts也可表示行動，但在此語境中「take measures」是固定搭配，特別指政府或機構採取的正式措施或政策。","options":["steps","measure","decisions","efforts"],"sentence":"The government took emergency ______ to prevent the spread of the disease during the pandemic. These actions included lockdowns, testing, and vaccination programs.","translation":"政府採取了應急措施來防止疫情期間疾病的傳播。這些措施包括封鎖、檢測和疫苗接種計畫。","word":"measure"}},"measureable":{"createdAt":1782659817808,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"measureable 指能夠被量化、計算或用數字表示的特性，強調可以用具體指標來評估。","options":["important","measureable","successful","valuable"],"sentence":"The company's success is highly ______ through sales figures and profit margins. Each quarter, they track these metrics to evaluate their business performance.","translation":"公司的成功可以通過銷售數字和利潤率進行衡量。每個季度，他們追蹤這些指標來評估業務績效。","word":"measureable"}},"measurement":{"createdAt":1782619889122,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"measurement 指的是通過測量工具所得到的精確數值或尺寸，特別是當涉及具體的數字和單位時。","options":["observation","measurement","prediction","description"],"sentence":"The engineer took careful ______ of the building to ensure it met safety standards. The data showed exact dimensions in meters and centimeters.","translation":"工程師仔細進行______ 以確保建築物符合安全標準。數據以米和厘米顯示了確切的尺寸。","word":"measurement"}},"mechanic":{"createdAt":1784911952481,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"mechanic 是指專門從事機械設備修理和維護工作的技工，特別是在汽車等機械上。","options":["engineer","technician","mechanic","worker"],"sentence":"When my car broke down, I took it to a skilled ______ to fix the engine. He spent three hours diagnosing the problem and replacing the faulty parts.","translation":"當我的車拋錨時，我把它送給一位熟練的______修理引擎。他花了三個小時診斷問題並更換故障零件。","word":"mechanic"}},"mechanical":{"createdAt":1781619188926,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mechanical 指由機械裝置組成的，通過物理機制而非電力運作。","options":["digital","mechanical","electronic","automatic"],"sentence":"The ______ clock required winding every morning to maintain accuracy. Unlike electronic devices, it relied entirely on springs and gears.","translation":"這台機械鐘每天早上需要上鏈以保持精確度。與電子設備不同，它完全依靠彈簧和齒輪。","word":"mechanical"}},"mechanism":{"createdAt":1783945367026,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"mechanism 意為「機械裝置、機械零件」，指構成機器或系統的各個部件及其協同工作的方式。","options":["appearance","melody","mechanism","decoration"],"sentence":"The clock's ______ consists of gears, springs, and levers working together. When you wind up the clock, all these components operate in perfect harmony to keep accurate time.","translation":"時鐘的機械裝置由齒輪、彈簧和槓桿組成，一起協同工作。當你上發條時，所有這些零件都完美地協調運作以保持準確的時間。","word":"mechanism"}},"medal":{"createdAt":1781746685515,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"medal指的是獎章、獎牌、勳章，是頒發給在比賽或活動中表現優異者的獎品。","options":["duration","medal","rubbish","entertain"],"sentence":"The champion swimmer received a gold ______ at the international competition. The award was hung around her neck as recognition of her extraordinary athletic achievement.","translation":"冠軍游泳選手在國際比賽中獲得金牌。這枚獎牌掛在她的脖子上，以表彰她非凡的運動成就。","word":"medal"}},"medalled":{"createdAt":1784797720534,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"medalled是形容詞，用來描述已經獲得或佩戴獎牌的人或物，特別是在體育競技中獲得勳章或獎牌的含義。","options":["talented","medalled","celebrated","decorated"],"sentence":"The ______ athlete stood proudly on the podium after winning three gold medals at the Olympics. She had trained for over a decade to achieve this honor of wearing multiple medals around her neck.","translation":"這位獲得獎牌的運動員在奧運會贏得三面金牌後，自豪地站在領獎台上。她經過十多年的訓練才達到這項佩戴多面獎牌的榮譽。","word":"medalled"}},"mediate":{"createdAt":1783670406862,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mediate 表示作為中介者在爭端雙方之間進行調停和協商，幫助他們達成協議。","options":["ignore","mediate","attack","observe"],"sentence":"The UN representative agreed to ______ between the two conflicting nations. Without a neutral third party to help them communicate and reach a compromise, the dispute would likely escalate further.","translation":"聯合國代表同意在兩個衝突的國家之間進行調停。沒有中立的第三方幫助他們溝通並達成妥協，這場爭端可能會進一步升級。","word":"mediate"}},"mediator":{"createdAt":1783556774447,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mediator是指在雙方爭端中進行調停和協調的中立人物，目的是幫助達成協議。","options":["advocate","mediator","observer","participant"],"sentence":"The ______ helped resolve the dispute between the two arguing parties. Without this neutral third person, the conflict would never have reached a peaceful settlement.","translation":"調停者幫助解決兩個爭論方之間的糾紛。沒有這個中立的第三方，衝突永遠不會達成和平解決。","word":"mediator"}},"medication":{"createdAt":1781425078612,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"藥物是指醫生處方的、藥劑師配置的物質，用於治療疾病或緩解症狀。","options":["exercise","medication","diet","therapy"],"sentence":"The doctor prescribed a strong ______ to help manage the patient's chronic pain. The pharmacist carefully prepared the prescription at the counter.","translation":"醫生開了一種強效的藥物來幫助患者控制慢性疼痛。藥劑師在櫃檯小心地配置了這個處方。","word":"medication"}},"medicinal":{"createdAt":1781836375367,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"medicinal形容詞表示與藥物或治療疾病相關的，具有醫療功效的。","options":["decorative","medicinal","culinary","poisonous"],"sentence":"The old herbalist showed us various plants with ______ properties stored in her shop. Many of these herbs had been used for centuries to treat illnesses.","translation":"老草藥商展示了她店裡存放的各種具有藥用特性的植物。許多這些草藥已被用於治療疾病數個世紀。","word":"medicinal"}},"medieval":{"createdAt":1781935654226,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"medieval 是形容詞，表示「中世紀的」，指西元5至15世紀之間的歐洲中古時代。","options":["modern","ancient","medieval","contemporary"],"sentence":"The ______ castle was built with thick stone walls and narrow windows for defensive purposes. Historians estimate it dates back to approximately the 12th century.","translation":"這座中世紀城堡建有厚重的石牆和狹窄的窗戶以供防禦之用。歷史學家估計它可以追溯到大約十二世紀。","word":"medieval"}},"meditate":{"createdAt":1787389822694,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"meditate 是指通過安靜思考和集中意念來深思熟慮或進行精神修養，常見於瑜伽和禪修等修行活動中。","options":["exercise","meditate","sleep","read"],"sentence":"Every morning, she likes to ______ for thirty minutes before starting her day. This quiet practice helps her reflect deeply on her life decisions and spiritual beliefs.","translation":"每天早上，她喜歡在開始一天前冥想三十分鐘。這個安靜的修行幫助她深入反思自己的人生決定和精神信念。","word":"meditate"}},"meditation":{"createdAt":1781777331357,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"meditation是名詞，表示沉思、冥想或深思熟慮的精神修行活動","options":["exercise","meditation","discussion","presentation"],"sentence":"She practiced ______ every morning for thirty minutes to calm her anxious mind. This quiet, introspective practice helped her find inner peace and clarity before facing the day's challenges.","translation":"她每天早上練習冥想三十分鐘來平復焦慮的心情。這種寧靜、內省的修行幫助她在面對一天的挑戰之前找到內心的平靜與清晰。","word":"meditation"}},"meds":{"createdAt":1784899764061,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"meds是medicine的縮寫，指用於治療或預防疾病的藥物或藥品。","options":["vitamins","meds","supplements","herbs"],"sentence":"The patient must take her ______ every morning to manage her diabetes. These prescription pills help regulate her blood sugar levels throughout the day.","translation":"患者每天早上必須服用她的藥物來控制她的糖尿病。這些處方藥丸幫助她全天調節血糖水平。","word":"meds"}},"medulla":{"createdAt":1783489104902,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"延髓（medulla oblongata）是腦幹的一部分，位於脊髓上方，負責調節呼吸、心跳和血壓等自動生理功能。","options":["cerebrum","medulla","thalamus","hypothalamus"],"sentence":"The ______ oblongata is the lowest part of the brain that controls vital functions like breathing and heart rate. Damage to this region can be fatal.","translation":"延髓是腦的最低部分，控制呼吸和心率等生命功能。該區域受損可能是致命的。","word":"medulla"}},"melancholic":{"createdAt":1783823805985,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"melancholic 是形容詞，表示憂鬱的、悲傷的、充滿憂愁的情感狀態。","options":["cheerful","melancholic","energetic","uplifting"],"sentence":"The composer's ______ symphony brought tears to the audience's eyes during the concert. The slow, sorrowful melodies expressed deep sadness and longing throughout the entire piece.","translation":"這位作曲家的憂鬱交響樂在音樂會上讓觀眾淚流滿面。緩慢、哀傷的旋律在整個樂曲中表達了深深的悲傷和渴望。","word":"melancholic"}},"melancholy":{"createdAt":1781777331349,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"melancholy是名詞，表示悲哀、憂鬱的情感狀態；也可作形容詞，描述悲傷的心境或事物","options":["joy","melancholy","excitement","confidence"],"sentence":"The poet's ______ was evident in every verse he wrote about lost love and forgotten dreams. His dark, sorrowful mood had persisted for months since his departure.","translation":"詩人在他寫的每一首關於失落的愛和被遺忘的夢想的詩句中都顯露出悲哀。他自從離開後，那種黑暗、悲傷的心情已經持續了好幾個月。","word":"melancholy"}},"melody":{"createdAt":1783927689724,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"melody 是指歌曲或音樂作品中能被哼唱的主旋律或曲調。","options":["rhythm","lyrics","melody","harmony"],"sentence":"The beautiful ______ of the song stayed in my head for days. I could hum the main tune even though I had only heard it once.","translation":"這首歌優美的旋律在我腦海裡停留了好幾天。雖然我只聽過一次，但我仍能哼出主要的曲調。","word":"melody"}},"membership":{"createdAt":1781311922068,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"membership 是指加入某個組織、俱樂部或機構的資格或身份，通常需要支付費用。","options":["ticket","license","membership","permit"],"sentence":"To access the gym facilities, you must purchase a ______ card first. The annual fee includes unlimited access to all equipment and fitness classes.","translation":"要使用健身房設施，你必須先購買會員資格卡。年費包括對所有設備和健身課程的無限制使用。","word":"membership"}},"memorable":{"createdAt":1784193936076,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"memorable 是形容詞，表示值得記住、難以忘懷的事物，指給人留下深刻印象的經歷或事件。","options":["boring","ordinary","memorable","uneventful"],"sentence":"The wedding was truly ______ for everyone who attended. Years later, guests still talk about the beautiful ceremony and unexpected surprise performance.","translation":"對所有出席的人來說，這場婚禮真的值得紀念。多年後，賓客們仍然談論著美麗的典禮和令人驚喜的表演。","word":"memorable"}},"memorial":{"createdAt":1784454684890,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"紀念的（memorial）用來描述專為紀念逝者或重要事件而設立的紀念碑或紀念品。","options":["decorative","memorial","historical","ancient"],"sentence":"The city built a ______ statue in the town square to honor the soldiers who died in the war. Visitors come here every year on the anniversary to pay their respects.","translation":"城市在鎮廣場建立了一座紀念雕像，以紀念在戰爭中犧牲的士兵。訪客每年週年紀念日都會來這裡致敬。","word":"memorial"}},"memorize":{"createdAt":1783390227930,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"memorize 指的是將資訊牢記於心中，以便稍後能夠準確地回憶和複述。","options":["memorize","understand","research","discuss"],"sentence":"Students need to ______ all the vocabulary words before the final examination next week. The teacher will test their ability to recall and write down every single term from the study list.","translation":"學生需要在下週的期末考試前背誦所有的詞彙單字。老師將測試他們回憶並寫下學習清單中每個術語的能力。","word":"memorize"}},"menace":{"createdAt":1787118100435,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"menace 作為名詞指的是危險的人或事物，或者構成威脅的存在。","options":["companion","menace","decoration","benefit"],"sentence":"The stray dog became a ______ to the neighborhood after it began attacking residents and destroying property. The animal control department eventually captured and removed it.","translation":"這隻流浪狗在開始攻擊居民和破壞財產後成為了社區的威脅。動物控制部門最終捕獲並移除了它。","word":"menace"}},"mend":{"createdAt":1785240687667,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mend 在此意為改正或修復關係，通過積極的行動使破裂的關係恢復良好。","options":["ignore","mend","break","damage"],"sentence":"Sarah decided to ______ her relationship with her estranged sister after years of silence. She reached out, apologized sincerely, and they began rebuilding their bond together.","translation":"莎拉決定修補她與疏遠的妹妹之間的關係，已經好多年沒有說話了。她主動聯繫，真誠道歉，他們開始一起重建彼此的感情。","word":"mend"}},"mental":{"createdAt":1783256139029,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mental 指的是與思想、智力或心理相關的。","options":["physical","mental","emotional","social"],"sentence":"Regular exercise provides significant ______ health benefits beyond just physical fitness. Studies show that it reduces anxiety, depression, and improves overall psychological well-being.","translation":"定期運動除了身體健身外還提供顯著的心理健康益處。研究表明它減少焦慮、抑鬱症，並改善整體心理健康。","word":"mental"}},"mentality":{"createdAt":1781746685492,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mentality指的是心態、思想方法，用來描述一個人的心理狀態和思維方式。","options":["rubbish","mentality","moisture","stadium"],"sentence":"The athlete's ______ before the competition was positive and confident. He spent hours visualizing success and believing he would win the gold medal.","translation":"比賽前運動員的心態是積極而自信的。他花了數小時進行心像訓練，相信自己會贏得金牌。","word":"mentality"}},"mention":{"createdAt":1781619188928,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mention 指簡短地談及或提到某事，通常不進行詳細討論。","options":["emphasis","mention","declaration","announcement"],"sentence":"In her speech, she made only a brief ______ of her personal struggles. She chose not to elaborate on the difficulties she had faced.","translation":"在她的演講中，她只是簡要提及了她個人的困境。她選擇不詳細說明她所面臨的困難。","word":"mention"}},"mentor":{"createdAt":1782477376585,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mentor是指有經驗的人指導和啟發另一個人的職業或個人發展，提供智慧和建議。","options":["colleague","mentor","supervisor","friend"],"sentence":"My ______ at work helped me develop my professional skills over the past two years. She provided guidance on difficult projects and introduced me to important industry contacts.","translation":"我工作中的導師在過去兩年幫助我發展專業技能。她在困難的項目上提供指導，並介紹我認識重要的業界人脈。","word":"mentor"}},"merchandise":{"createdAt":1783852040582,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"merchandise是指商品或貨物，特別是指為了銷售而準備的物品。","options":["customers","merchandise","displays","profits"],"sentence":"The store manager ordered new ______ to display on the shelves for the upcoming holiday season. The items included clothing, electronics, and household goods that customers could purchase.","translation":"店經理為即將到來的假日季節訂購了新的商品在架子上展示。這些物品包括衣服、電子產品和家用物品，供顧客購買。","word":"merchandise"}},"merchant":{"createdAt":1786426340612,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"merchant是指以買賣商品為職業並從中獲利的人，通常從製造商或其他商人那裡購進商品，然後轉售給消費者或其他商人。","options":["customer","merchant","farmer","scholar"],"sentence":"The silk ______ traveled along the ancient trade routes to sell his goods across Asia. He owned a large warehouse in the port city where he stored fabrics, spices, and other valuable commodities for resale.","translation":"這位絲綢商人沿著古老的貿易路線旅行，將他的商品銷售到整個亞洲。他在港口城市擁有一個大倉庫，在那裡存放布料、香料和其他有價值的商品以供轉售。","word":"merchant"}},"merciful":{"createdAt":1781848330189,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"merciful表示仁慈、寬宏大量、願意原諒或減輕他人痛苦的品質。","options":["strict","merciful","confused","angry"],"sentence":"The judge was ______ in her sentencing despite the defendant's serious crimes. She considered his difficult background and gave him a reduced punishment rather than the maximum penalty allowed by law.","translation":"儘管被告犯了嚴重罪行，法官在量刑時表現出慈悲。她考慮了他困難的背景，給了他減輕的懲罰而不是法律允許的最高刑罰。","word":"merciful"}},"merciless":{"createdAt":1783947021213,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"merciless 是形容詞，意為無情的、殘忍的，描述沒有同情心或憐憫的態度和行為。","options":["kind","fair","merciless","patient"],"sentence":"The tyrant ruled with a ______ hand, showing no compassion for those who opposed his regime. His brutal tactics and complete indifference to human suffering made him one of history's most feared leaders.","translation":"這位暴君以殘忍的手段統治，對反對其統治的人毫無同情心。他的殘暴策略和對人類苦難的完全漠視使他成為歷史上最令人畏懼的領導人之一。","word":"merciless"}},"mercy":{"createdAt":1785936120020,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"mercy 指的是對他人的慈悲心和寬恕，尤其是對那些本可受到懲罰的人。","options":["anger","justice","mercy","punishment"],"sentence":"The judge decided to show ______ to the first-time offender instead of imposing the maximum sentence. His compassionate decision reflected his belief in the possibility of redemption.","translation":"法官決定對初犯者表示慈悲，而不是判處最高刑罰。他富有同情心的決定反映了他對救贖可能性的信念。","word":"mercy"}},"merely":{"createdAt":1784011981598,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"merely表示「僅僅、不過」，用來強調某事物只是部分原因或次要原因，而非主要原因。","options":["entirely","merely","partially","mostly"],"sentence":"The company's success was ______ due to luck; their strategic planning and hard work were the real driving forces. Without careful management and innovation, no business can succeed for long.","translation":"公司的成功僅僅是因為運氣；他們的戰略規劃和辛勤工作才是真正的驅動力。沒有謹慎的管理和創新，沒有企業能長期成功。","word":"merely"}},"merge":{"createdAt":1781622232186,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"merge 意為使兩個或多個事物合併或融合成一個整體。","options":["separate","merge","relocate","decline"],"sentence":"The two smaller companies decided to ______ into one larger corporation to increase their market power. By combining their resources, they became a much stronger competitor.","translation":"這兩家較小的公司決定合併成一家大公司以增加市場力量。通過整合他們的資源，他們成為了一個更強大的競爭者。","word":"merge"}},"merit":{"createdAt":1782094627215,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"merit 表示「價值、優點或功績」，在這裡指的是學術上的成就和能力，這是決定獎學金的基準。","options":["wealth","merit","background","appearance"],"sentence":"The scholarship was awarded based on academic ______, not family connections. The selection committee carefully reviewed each candidate's grades, test scores, and achievements.","translation":"獎學金是根據學業價值而非家庭關係來頒發的。選拔委員會仔細審查了每位候選人的成績、考試分數和成就。","word":"merit"}},"message":{"createdAt":1782475351771,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"message指「消息、訊息」，在這裡特指通過手機發送的文字通訊。","options":["letter","message","signal","sound"],"sentence":"I received your ______ on my phone at 3 PM, but I was in a meeting so I couldn't respond immediately. The text said you wanted to meet tomorrow.","translation":"我在下午三點在手機上收到你的訊息，但我當時在開會所以無法立即回覆。那條文字說你想明天見面。","word":"message"}},"messenger":{"createdAt":1784624316006,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"messenger 名詞表示負責傳送信息或物品的人，通常是信差或使者。","options":["secretary","messenger","soldier","spy"],"sentence":"The ______ delivered the urgent letter to the ambassador at dawn. He had traveled through the night to ensure the important news arrived on time.","translation":"信差在黎明時分將緊急信件送達大使手中。他通宵趕路以確保重要消息及時送達。","word":"messenger"}},"messy":{"createdAt":1784899764061,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"messy表示混亂、邋遢、不整潔的狀態，物品雜亂無章。","options":["clean","organized","messy","tidy"],"sentence":"His bedroom was so ______ that you could barely see the floor. Clothes, books, and toys were scattered everywhere without any organization.","translation":"他的臥室非常混亂，你幾乎看不到地板。衣服、書籍和玩具散落在各處，沒有任何組織。","word":"messy"}},"metabolism":{"createdAt":1782401868818,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"metabolism 表示身體內的新陳代謝或代謝過程。","options":["disease","metabolism","injury","allergy"],"sentence":"Athletes with a fast ______ burn calories more quickly than average people. This helps them maintain lower body weight even while eating substantial meals.","translation":"新陳代謝快的運動員比普通人燃燒卡路里的速度更快。即使進食大量食物，這也幫助他們維持較低的體重。","word":"metabolism"}},"metal":{"createdAt":1784890375930,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"Metal 是指具有導電性、延展性和高強度的元素或合金，常用於工業和建築中。","options":["plastic","wood","metal","rubber"],"sentence":"The bridge is constructed from ______, which can withstand heavy loads and extreme weather. Steel and aluminum are examples of this strong, durable material.","translation":"這座橋是用金屬構建的，可以承受重負荷和極端天氣。鋼和鋁是這種堅固耐用材料的例子。","word":"metal"}},"metaphor":{"createdAt":1782352245065,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"metaphor是一種修辭手法，通過將一個事物比作另一個事物來傳達意思。","options":["fact","statistic","metaphor","definition"],"sentence":"The poet used a ______ to describe life as a journey with many twists and turns. This figure of speech helped readers understand the ups and downs of human experience.","translation":"詩人用隱喻將生活描述為充滿許多曲折的旅程。這種修辭方法幫助讀者理解人生經歷的起伏。","word":"metaphor"}},"meteorologist":{"createdAt":1785487324260,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"meteorologist是指專門研究氣象和大氣現象的科學家。","options":["carpenter","meteorologist","musician","chef"],"sentence":"The ______ studied weather patterns for decades before publishing her groundbreaking research. Her expertise in atmospheric science made her one of the most respected scientists in her field.","translation":"這位氣象學家在發表突破性研究之前研究了數十年的天氣模式。她對大氣科學的專業知識使她成為該領域最受尊敬的科學家之一。","word":"meteorologist"}},"method":{"createdAt":1781836375375,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"method是方法或方式，指完成任務或實現目標的特定步驟或程序。","options":["process","method","procedure","technique"],"sentence":"The teacher introduced a new ______ for solving complex mathematical problems. Students found this systematic approach much clearer than the traditional way.","translation":"老師介紹了一種解決複雜數學問題的新方法。學生們發現這種系統方法比傳統方式清晰得多。","word":"method"}},"metropolitan":{"createdAt":1785135819242,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"metropolitan 是形容詞，用來形容一個大城市及其周邊地區，強調城市的規模龐大及其都市特性。","options":["rural","metropolitan","industrial","coastal"],"sentence":"The ______ area includes the downtown business district and all the surrounding suburbs. The Census Bureau reported that over 20 million people live in this vast urban region centered around the major city.","translation":"該______ 地區包括市中心商業區及所有周邊郊區。人口普查局報告指出，有超過 2000 萬人居住在以主要城市為中心的這個廣大城市地區。","word":"metropolitan"}},"middle_lamella":{"createdAt":1783489104905,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"中膠層是位於相鄰植物細胞壁之間的膠質物質，主要成分是果膠，使植物細胞之間相互連接。","options":["cell membrane","middle lamella","cell wall","plasmodesma"],"sentence":"The ______ is the adhesive layer that binds adjacent plant cells together. It is composed primarily of pectin and acts as a cement between cell walls.","translation":"中膠層是將相鄰植物細胞粘合在一起的粘合層。它主要由果膠組成，作為細胞壁之間的粘合劑。","word":"middle lamella"}},"midst":{"createdAt":1781651261374,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"midst在此表示事物的中央或中間位置，通常用於描述某人或某物處於環境的核心區域。","options":["rod","treasury","midst","projection"],"sentence":"In the ______ of the crowded marketplace, she found her lost friend by calling his name loudly. They embraced each other surrounded by dozens of shoppers and vendors.","translation":"在擁擠市集的中間，她通過大聲呼喊他的名字找到了失散的朋友。他們被數十位購物者和小販包圍著相擁而抱。","word":"midst"}},"mighty":{"createdAt":1783228210816,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"mighty 表示極其強大和強悍，在這句話中指軍隊擁有無敵的軍事力量和規模，能夠征服其他勢力。","options":["small","weak","mighty","peaceful"],"sentence":"The ______ army marched across the continent, conquering every kingdom in their path. Their sheer size and military strength were unmatched by any rival force in the region.","translation":"強大的軍隊行軍穿過大陸，征服了他們路上的每個王國。他們龐大的規模和軍事力量在該地區無與倫比。","word":"mighty"}},"migrant":{"createdAt":1781582939254,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"migrant 指季節性移動工作或為了謀生而遷徙的人，與跨國工作和季節性返回的敘述相符。","options":["migrant","wealthy","elderly","local"],"sentence":"The ______ workers came from neighboring countries to find better employment opportunities during the harvest season. They would return to their home villages after the crops were collected each autumn.","translation":"移民工人來自鄰近國家，在收穫季節尋求更好的就業機會。他們在每年秋天收割完後會返回家鄉。","word":"migrant"}},"migrate":{"createdAt":1783612861543,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"migrate 是動詞，意思是遷移或移動到另一個地方，通常指動物季節性的移動或人口的遷移。","options":["stay","migrate","sing","build"],"sentence":"Every winter, thousands of birds ______ south to find warmer climates and more food sources. This annual journey covers thousands of miles and is essential for their survival during the cold months.","translation":"每年冬天，數千隻鳥類______(遷移)到南方尋找更溫暖的氣候和更多的食物來源。這次年度旅程涵蓋數千英里，對牠們在寒冷月份的生存至關重要。","word":"migrate"}},"migration":{"createdAt":1782083925070,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"migration是指動物或人群從一個地方移動到另一個地方的過程，通常涉及長距離的移動。","options":["hibernation","adaptation","migration","reproduction"],"sentence":"Every spring, the ______ of birds from south to north signals the arrival of warmer weather. Scientists track these animals moving thousands of kilometers to their breeding grounds.","translation":"每年春天，鳥類從南方到北方的遷移標誌著溫暖天氣的到來。科學家們追蹤這些動物移動數千公里到它們的繁殖地。","word":"migration"}},"migratory":{"createdAt":1784438746556,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"migratory 是形容詞，用來描述有定期遷移習性的動物或人群，特別是那些季節性地在不同地點之間往返的對象。","options":["stationary","migratory","nocturnal","endangered"],"sentence":"Many ______ bird species travel thousands of miles each year as they follow seasonal changes in temperature and food availability. These animals do not stay in one place permanently but instead move between different regions throughout the year.","translation":"許多遷徙的鳥類物種每年行進數千英里，因為它們會追蹤季節性的溫度和食物供應變化。這些動物不會永久停留在一個地方，而是全年在不同地區之間移動。","word":"migratory"}},"mild":{"createdAt":1784020538390,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mild表示輕微的或症狀不嚴重的，通常用來描述疾病、天氣或味道等程度較低的情況。","options":["severe","mild","chronic","fatal"],"sentence":"The doctor said my cold symptoms were ______ and would improve within a few days. Since I only had a slight cough and a small fever, I didn't need any strong medication.","translation":"醫生說我的感冒症狀很輕微，會在幾天內改善。既然我只有輕微咳嗽和低燒，就不需要任何強力藥物。","word":"mild"}},"milestone":{"createdAt":1781478568771,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"milestone 指人生或歷史上具有重要意義的重大事件或階段。","options":["obstacle","milestone","distraction","setback"],"sentence":"Graduating from university was a significant ______ in her life journey. This achievement opened doors to new career opportunities and personal growth.","translation":"從大學畢業是她人生旅程中的重要里程碑。這個成就為她打開了新的職業機會和個人成長的大門。","word":"milestone"}},"military":{"createdAt":1782550057063,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"military用作形容詞表示與軍隊或軍事有關的，通常用來修飾與國防、武器或軍隊相關的名詞。","options":["social","educational","military","healthcare"],"sentence":"The country increased its ______ budget by 15% to modernize its weapons systems. The government announced this spending plan during a press conference about national defense.","translation":"該國增加了15%的軍事預算以現代化其武器系統。政府在一場關於國防的新聞發佈會上宣佈了這項支出計劃。","word":"military"}},"millennia":{"createdAt":1782480892565,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"millennia 是 millennium 的複數形式，表示「千年」，指一千年的時間跨度。","options":["centuries","decades","millennia","moments"],"sentence":"Civilizations have risen and fallen over ______ of human history. Archaeological evidence shows continuous human development spanning thousands of years across multiple ancient periods.","translation":"在人類歷史的千年中，文明興衰交替。考古證據顯示了跨越數千年和多個古代時期的連續人類發展。","word":"millennia"}},"millennium":{"createdAt":1781927792735,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"millennium指的是一千年的時間跨度，特別常用來指代按照基督紀年計算的每個一千年周期。","options":["century","decade","millennium","year"],"sentence":"People around the world celebrated the arrival of the new ______ with grand fireworks and festivities. The year 2000 marked the transition from the second to the third period of one thousand years in the Common Era.","translation":"世界各地的人們用盛大的煙火和慶祝活動迎接新千年的到來。公元2000年標誌著從第二個千年過渡到第三個千年。","word":"millennium"}},"mimic":{"createdAt":1781507137215,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"mimic 表示模仿或學習某人的樣子、聲音或行為，特別強調複製的能力。","options":["ignore","understand","mimic","record"],"sentence":"The young parrot learned to ______ the sounds of its trainer perfectly. Within weeks, it could reproduce every word and tone exactly as it had heard them.","translation":"年輕的鸚鵡學會了完美地模仿它的訓練者的聲音。在幾週內，它能夠完全按照聽到的方式複製每個單詞和音調。","word":"mimic"}},"mineral":{"createdAt":1783426292399,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mineral是指天然無機物質，通常具有特定的化學成分和結晶結構，常見於地質學和採礦領域。","options":["organic","mineral","plant","animal"],"sentence":"The geologist discovered a rare ______ deposit containing valuable metals and crystals. She spent weeks analyzing the composition and properties of the inorganic substance.","translation":"地質學家發現了一個罕見的礦物礦床，含有貴金屬和晶體。她花了數週時間分析這種無機物質的組成和特性。","word":"mineral"}},"minerals":{"createdAt":1781848330187,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"minerals指天然存在的無機固體物質，是人體維持正常功能所需的營養元素。","options":["vitamins","minerals","proteins","fats"],"sentence":"The supplement contains essential ______ like calcium and iron that your body needs. These inorganic substances are crucial for maintaining healthy bones and producing red blood cells.","translation":"這種補充劑含有鈣和鐵等人體所需的必要礦物質。這些無機物質對於保持骨骼健康和生成紅血球至關重要。","word":"minerals"}},"mingle":{"createdAt":1785820983981,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mingle 表示人們聚集在一起、互相交往或相互混合，通常用於社交場合中不同群體的人互相接觸和交流。","options":["separate","mingle","organize","celebrate"],"sentence":"At the company party, employees were encouraged to ______ with colleagues from different departments. This interaction helped break down barriers and fostered better communication across the organization.","translation":"在公司派對上，員工被鼓勵與來自不同部門的同事相互混合交往。這種互動有助於打破障礙，促進整個組織間的溝通。","word":"mingle"}},"miniature":{"createdAt":1784648623662,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"miniature 表示「微型的、小型的、微小的」，用於形容物體的小尺寸或精緻的小型模型。","options":["enormous","miniature","realistic","broken"],"sentence":"The collector displayed a beautiful ______ train set on a shelf in his study. The intricate details and tiny tracks were crafted with remarkable precision by skilled artisans.","translation":"收藏家在他的書房架子上展示了一個美麗的微型火車組。複雜的細節和微小的軌道是由熟練的工匠以非凡的精確度製作的。","word":"miniature"}},"minimal":{"createdAt":1782037869754,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"minimal表示最少的、最低限度的，強調數量或程度很小。","options":["excessive","minimal","moderate","substantial"],"sentence":"The company spent only a ______ amount of money on marketing this quarter. They invested nearly all their budget into product development instead.","translation":"該公司在本季度的行銷上花費了最少的金額。他們幾乎將所有預算投入到產品開發中。","word":"minimal"}},"minimize":{"createdAt":1782475871716,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"minimize 表示「極小化；減少到最低程度」，指使某事物的量或程度變得盡可能小","options":["maximize","ignore","minimize","celebrate"],"sentence":"To ______ the impact of pollution, the company invested in renewable energy sources. They are actively reducing their carbon footprint.","translation":"為了最小化污染的影響，該公司投資了可再生能源。他們正在積極減少碳足跡。","word":"minimize"}},"minimum":{"createdAt":1781696018687,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"minimum 意為最低限度、極小值，指可接受或必需的最低標準。","options":["maximum","requirement","minimum","suggestion"],"sentence":"The company requires a ______ of five years of experience for this senior position. Candidates with less than that threshold will not be considered for the role.","translation":"公司要求這個高級職位至少需要五年的工作經驗。經驗少於此標準的候選人將不被考慮。","word":"minimum"}},"minister":{"createdAt":1781848330188,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"minister可指政府部長、外交使節或宗教牧師，是具有重要職位或使命的人。","options":["tourist","minister","student","merchant"],"sentence":"The ______ from the neighboring country arrived in the capital to negotiate a trade agreement. As the government's official representative, he held meetings with high-ranking officials.","translation":"來自鄰國的外交使節抵達首都談判貿易協議。作為政府的官方代表，他與高級官員舉行了會議。","word":"minister"}},"ministry":{"createdAt":1784104245998,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ministry 是名詞，指的是政府的部會或部門，專門管理特定領域的事務，這裡指的是教育部。","options":["academy","ministry","library","university"],"sentence":"The ______ of Education announced new policies for schools across the country. This government department, led by the Education Minister, oversees all public and private educational institutions.","translation":"______教育部宣佈了全國學校的新政策。這個由教育部長領導的政府部門監督所有公立和私立教育機構。","word":"ministry"}},"minor":{"createdAt":1783993252120,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"minor 作為形容詞表示較小的或次要的，程度不高","options":["severe","major","minor","total"],"sentence":"The accident caused only ______ damage to the car's bumper. The repair cost less than $200 and didn't affect the vehicle's safety.","translation":"這次意外只對車的保險桿造成輕微損傷。維修費用少於200美元，不影響車輛的安全性。","word":"minor"}},"minority":{"createdAt":1783558795714,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"minority 名詞表示少數、少數派，指在數量或比例上較少的群體。","options":["majority","minority","committee","division"],"sentence":"Although women made up a ______ in the company's management team, they held some of the most important positions. Out of twenty managers, only four were women.","translation":"儘管女性在公司管理團隊中佔少數，但她們擔任了一些最重要的職位。在二十位經理中，只有四位是女性。","word":"minority"}},"minors":{"createdAt":1785487324258,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"minors是指法律上的未成年人，即年齡未滿成年的人士。","options":["adults","seniors","minors","students"],"sentence":"The concert venue has a strict policy that ______ cannot purchase tickets to late-night shows. All attendees under the age of eighteen must leave the hall by 10 PM.","translation":"演唱會場地有嚴格的規定，未成年人不能購買深夜演出的門票。所有年齡在十八歲以下的參加者必須在晚上十點前離開大廳。","word":"minors"}},"miracle":{"createdAt":1781746685515,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"miracle指的是奇蹟，表示一件非常不可能但卻真實發生的事件，通常超越自然法則。","options":["miracle","obedience","editorials","laborious"],"sentence":"The patient's recovery from such a serious illness seemed like a ______. Doctors had given up hope, but the patient woke up one morning completely healed.","translation":"病人從如此嚴重的疾病中恢復似乎是個奇蹟。醫生已經放棄了希望，但病人在一個早晨醒來時完全康復了。","word":"miracle"}},"miraculous":{"createdAt":1785936166578,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"miraculous 意為奇蹟般的或超自然的，用來形容似乎不可能發生但卻真實發生的事件，特別是指與自然規律相悖的令人驚嘆的事物。","options":["gradual","miraculous","expected","documented"],"sentence":"The patient's ______ recovery from the terminal illness shocked all the doctors. Despite being given only weeks to live, he was completely healthy within a month.","translation":"患者從絕症中______ 的康復震驚了所有醫生。儘管醫生只給了他幾週的生命，但他在一個月內完全康復了。","word":"miraculous"}},"miraculously":{"createdAt":1782265478226,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"miraculously 用來形容出人意料且似乎不可能發生的事情，通常帶有正面或驚人的含義。","options":["unfortunately","miraculously","gradually","typically"],"sentence":"The lost hiker ______ survived three days in the wilderness without food or water. Doctors said it was impossible for anyone to endure such extreme conditions.","translation":"失蹤的登山者奇蹟般地在沒有食物和水的荒野中活了三天。醫生說不可能有人能在如此極端的環境中存活。","word":"miraculously"}},"miscellaneous":{"createdAt":1784602197509,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"miscellaneous 用來描述由許多不同種類或性質的東西組成的混雜集合，特別強調多樣性和缺乏統一性。","options":["organized","miscellaneous","expensive","fragile"],"sentence":"The thrift store had a ______ collection of items including old books, vintage toys, lamps, and kitchen utensils. The shop owner had gathered donations from many different sources, so nothing really matched or belonged to a single category.","translation":"舊貨店裡有各式各樣的收藏品，包括舊書、懷舊玩具、燈具和廚房用具。店主從許多不同的來源收集捐贈品，所以沒有任何東西真正配套或屬於同一類別。","word":"miscellaneous"}},"mischief":{"createdAt":1781484415230,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"mischief是指調皮搗亂或淘氣的行為，通常涉及惡作劇但不一定有害。","options":["studying","prayer","mischief","sleep"],"sentence":"The children got into ______ when they thought no adults were watching them. They hid their toys, broke a vase, and blamed each other for the chaos.","translation":"當孩子們以為沒有成人在看他們時，他們開始調皮搗亂。他們藏起玩具，打破了花瓶，互相指責造成的混亂。","word":"mischief"}},"mischievous":{"createdAt":1782491138498,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mischievous 表示喜歡惡作劇、調皮的，通常帶有一點點頑皮的特性，但通常不會造成真正的傷害。","options":["glowing","mischievous","modest","territory"],"sentence":"The ______ children hid their parents' car keys as a prank and refused to reveal the location. Everyone knew they were just being playful troublemakers, not truly trying to cause serious harm.","translation":"這些調皮的孩子們作為惡作劇隱藏了他們父母的車鑰匙，並拒絕透露位置。每個人都知道他們只是在調皮搗蛋，並非真正想造成嚴重傷害。","word":"mischievous"}},"misconception":{"createdAt":1783423026249,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"misconception 是指對某事物的錯誤或不正確的理解，與 fact、truth、reality（事實、真相）相反，句子強調的是人們對鯊魚的不準確認知。","options":["fact","misconception","truth","reality"],"sentence":"Many people have a ______ that all sharks are dangerous man-eaters. However, most shark species actually avoid humans and rarely attack unless provoked.","translation":"許多人對鯊魚都有誤解，認為所有鯊魚都是危險的食人兇手。然而，大多數鯊魚物種實際上會避開人類，除非被激怒否則很少發起攻擊。","word":"misconception"}},"miserable":{"createdAt":1782660146222,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"miserable用來形容深層的不幸和痛苦狀態，通常伴隨著情感上的困擾和絕望。","options":["tired","miserable","confused","anxious"],"sentence":"After losing his job, Tom felt absolutely ______ and couldn't find motivation for anything. His family worried about his mental health during this dark period.","translation":"失去工作後，湯姆感到極其不幸，對任何事都提不起勁。在這段黑暗時期，他的家人為他的心理健康感到擔憂。","word":"miserable"}},"misery":{"createdAt":1784019103287,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"misery 指深度的痛苦、不幸和悲慘的狀態，通常伴隨著極度的苦難。","options":["misery","curiosity","victory","prosperity"],"sentence":"The refugees suffered great ______ after losing their homes in the war. Their pain and suffering were evident in their faces and the desperate conditions they endured.","translation":"難民在戰爭中失去家園後經歷了巨大的不幸。他們的痛苦在他們的臉上和他們所忍受的絕望條件中顯而易見。","word":"misery"}},"missile":{"createdAt":1782228779947,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"missile特指導向飛彈，是從遠距離透過空中發射的精確導向武器，與其他選項相比最為準確。","options":["rocket","missile","bomb","cannon"],"sentence":"The military launched a ______ at the enemy's headquarters from across the border. The weapon traveled through the air at supersonic speed before hitting its target.","translation":"軍隊從邊界對岸向敵軍總部發射了一枚飛彈。這件武器以超音速飛行穿過空中，最後擊中目標。","word":"missile"}},"mission":{"createdAt":1781693303266,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mission 在此指「使命」或「外交任務」，特別是指重要的正式任務，通常涉及政治或商業目的。","options":["journey","mission","vacation","assignment"],"sentence":"The diplomat was sent on a special ______ to negotiate peace between the two countries. Her objective was to meet with government officials and establish a framework for future discussions.","translation":"這位外交官被派遣執行一項特殊的使命，以協商兩國之間的和平。她的目標是與政府官員會面並建立未來討論的框架。","word":"mission"}},"missionary":{"createdAt":1781601735996,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"「missionary」是指為了宗教目的而到異地傳教的人，通常從事宗教教育和社區服務工作。","options":["missionary","scholar","merchant","diplomat"],"sentence":"The ______ traveled to remote villages to spread Christian teachings and establish schools. Local communities welcomed him because he provided education and medical assistance to their children.","translation":"傳教士前往偏遠村莊傳播基督教教義並建立學校。當地社區歡迎他，因為他為他們的孩子提供教育和醫療援助。","word":"missionary"}},"mistake":{"createdAt":1782826126322,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mistake是名詞，表示在做某事時不小心或無意中造成的錯誤或過失，通常需要被糾正。","options":["success","mistake","achievement","improvement"],"sentence":"She made a ______ when she wrote the wrong date on the form. The teacher circled it in red pen and asked her to correct the error.","translation":"她在表格上寫錯日期時犯了一個錯誤。老師用紅筆圈出來，要求她改正這個過失。","word":"mistake"}},"mistook":{"createdAt":1781693591739,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mistook 是 mistake 的過去式，表示錯誤地認為某人或某物是另一個人或物體。","options":["recognized","mistook","understood","remembered"],"sentence":"I ______ my friend's twin sister for my friend when I saw her at the grocery store. Later, I realized my mistake when she introduced herself with a different name.","translation":"我在雜貨店看到我朋友的孿生妹妹時誤認為是我的朋友。後來當她自我介紹時用了不同的名字，我才意識到我的錯誤。","word":"mistook"}},"mitochondria":{"createdAt":1783489104907,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"粒線體是進行細胞呼吸的主要場所，通過有氧代謝產生ATP，為細胞提供能量用於各種生命活動。","options":["ribosomes","mitochondria","lysosomes","vacuoles"],"sentence":"The ______ are often called the powerhouse of the cell because they produce energy. These organelles convert glucose into ATP through aerobic respiration.","translation":"粒線體經常被稱為細胞的動力工廠，因為它們產生能量。這些細胞器通過有氧呼吸將葡萄糖轉化為ATP。","word":"mitochondria"}},"mix":{"createdAt":1781515329268,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mix 動詞，意思是混合、混和，指將不同的物質結合在一起。","options":["separate","mix","measure","sift"],"sentence":"The recipe instructed us to ______ the flour and sugar together in a large bowl. After combining the dry ingredients, we added the eggs and butter to create the batter.","translation":"食譜要求我們在一個大碗中將麵粉和糖混合在一起。將乾性材料混合後，我們加入雞蛋和黃油製作麵糊。","word":"mix"}},"mixed":{"createdAt":1788047064058,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mixed 表示由不同種類或性質的東西合併在一起的狀態，在這裡指食材的多樣性和異質性。","options":["pure","mixed","simple","identical"],"sentence":"The recipe called for a ______ group of ingredients including flour, eggs, and honey. Some were dry and some were wet, requiring careful combination before baking.","translation":"食譜要求一個混合的材料組合，包括麵粉、雞蛋和蜂蜜。有些是乾的，有些是濕的，烘烤前需要仔細混合。","word":"mixed"}},"mixture":{"createdAt":1786066009453,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mixture 是指由兩種或多種物質混合而成的東西，在烹飪中常用來描述多種材料組合在一起的結果。","options":["separation","mixture","solution","element"],"sentence":"The recipe calls for a ______ of flour, sugar, and butter combined together. Once you blend all the ingredients in the bowl, the ______ will be ready for baking.","translation":"這個食譜需要將麵粉、糖和奶油混合在一起。一旦你在碗裡把所有材料攪拌均勻，這個混合物就準備好可以烘烤了。","word":"mixture"}},"moan":{"createdAt":1784451009635,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"moan 是指發出痛苦、悲傷或不滿的低沉聲音，常用來表達身體疼痛或情感苦惱。","options":["laugh","moan","whisper","shout"],"sentence":"The injured patient began to ______ in pain after the surgery. The nurse rushed over when she heard the low, sorrowful sound coming from the hospital bed.","translation":"受傷的病患在手術後開始呻吟。護士聽到病床上傳來低沉、悲傷的聲音時衝了過去。","word":"moan"}},"mob":{"createdAt":1782228779948,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mob指的是無秩序、易激動的人群，通常帶有負面含義，強調其混亂和失控的特性。","options":["audience","mob","committee","audience"],"sentence":"An angry ______ gathered outside the courthouse, shouting and pushing each other without any clear organization. The crowd was so chaotic that police struggled to maintain control.","translation":"一群憤怒的烏合之眾聚集在法院外，無組織地喊叫和互相推擠。人群非常混亂，警察難以維持秩序。","word":"mob"}},"mobile":{"createdAt":1783946029661,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mobile 作為形容詞表示可以移動的、不固定在一個地方的，能夠輕鬆轉移或攜帶。","options":["remote","mobile","digital","flexible"],"sentence":"She bought a ______ office setup so she could work from different locations. She carried her laptop, phone, and desk accessories from the café to the park.","translation":"她購買了可移動的辦公室設置，以便她可以在不同的地點工作。她將筆記本電腦、手機和辦公桌配件從咖啡館帶到公園。","word":"mobile"}},"mobilize":{"createdAt":1782228779947,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mobilize表示將人力或資源組織動員起來，以快速有效的方式進行行動或應對緊急情況。","options":["allocate","mobilize","produce","purchase"],"sentence":"The government decided to ______ all available resources to respond to the natural disaster. They called upon volunteers, deployed emergency services, and organized relief supplies immediately.","translation":"政府決定動員所有可用資源來應對自然災害。他們立即召集志願者、部署應急服務並組織救援物資。","word":"mobilize"}},"mock":{"createdAt":1783260805492,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mock意為「嘲弄」或「愚弄」，指以不尊重或嘲笑的方式對待某人。","options":["support","mock","encourage","assist"],"sentence":"The bullies began to ______ the shy student by imitating his awkward movements and mannerisms. Their cruel behavior was meant to humiliate and ridicule him in front of his peers.","translation":"霸凌者開始通過模仿害羞學生的笨拙動作和舉止來嘲弄他。他們的殘忍行為意在在同齡人面前羞辱和嘲笑他。","word":"mock"}},"mockery":{"createdAt":1784711302809,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mockery指的是嘲笑或嘲弄某人或某事，通常帶有幽默或輕蔑的意圖。","options":["praise","mockery","description","support"],"sentence":"The comedian's performance was filled with ______ of political leaders and their controversial decisions. The audience laughed as he imitated their mannerisms and exaggerated their flaws.","translation":"這位喜劇演員的表演充滿了對政治領袖及其爭議決定的嘲笑。當他模仿他們的舉止並誇大他們的缺點時，觀眾們笑了。","word":"mockery"}},"mode":{"createdAt":1784908375548,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mode 是名詞，表示「方法、做法、方式」，指完成任務或進行活動的特定方式或模式。","options":["result","mode","threat","schedule"],"sentence":"The company switched to a remote work ______ during the pandemic. Employees logged into video conferences from home and communicated through email and messaging platforms instead of meeting in person.","translation":"公司在疫情期間改為遠距工作的方式。員工從家中登入視訊會議，透過電子郵件和訊息平台溝通，而不是親自見面。","word":"mode"}},"moderate":{"createdAt":1785110904566,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"moderate表示中庸的、適度的，是既不過多也不過少的程度，正好符合醫生建議的平衡運動量","options":["excessive","moderate","minimal","intense"],"sentence":"The doctor recommended a ______ amount of exercise each day. She advised that too much activity would be harmful, but complete rest would also be unhealthy.","translation":"醫生建議每天進行適度的運動。她建議過多的活動會有害，但完全休息也會不健康。","word":"moderate"}},"moderation":{"createdAt":1781836375368,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"moderation表示適度、溫和或不過分，強調適量而非完全禁止或過度。","options":["abundance","excess","moderation","restriction"],"sentence":"The nutritionist advised eating sweets in ______ rather than consuming large quantities daily. She emphasized that small amounts of treats could be part of a healthy lifestyle.","translation":"營養師建議適度食用甜食，而不是每天大量食用。她強調少量的零食可以成為健康生活方式的一部分。","word":"moderation"}},"modern":{"createdAt":1783243711390,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"modern 指的是當代的、最新的或符合當今時代特徵的事物，與過時或古老的事物相對。","options":["ancient","contemporary","modern","traditional"],"sentence":"The company decided to replace its old equipment with ______ technology to improve efficiency. The new machines use artificial intelligence and cloud computing, features that did not exist ten years ago.","translation":"公司決定用現代技術取代舊設備以提高效率。新機器使用人工智能和雲計算，這些是十年前不存在的功能。","word":"modern"}},"modernization":{"createdAt":1783255147946,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"modernization 是指將舊的、過時的事物更新為現代的、先進的過程，通常涉及技術進步和基礎設施改善。","options":["tradition","modernization","agriculture","preservation"],"sentence":"The country invested heavily in ______ to update its infrastructure and technology. The government's plan included building new railways, airports, and digital systems to compete with developed nations.","translation":"該國投入大量資金進行現代化以更新其基礎設施和技術。政府的計畫包括建設新的鐵路、機場和數位系統，以與發達國家競爭。","word":"modernization"}},"modernize":{"createdAt":1784454261436,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"modernize 是指使某物跟上時代潮流、採用最新技術和方法。","options":["abandon","modernize","simplify","document"],"sentence":"The factory decided to ______ its equipment and production methods. The company invested millions in new technology to keep up with current industry standards.","translation":"工廠決定使其設備和生產方法現代化。公司投入了數百萬美元購置新技術以跟上當前的行業標準。","word":"modernize"}},"modernized":{"createdAt":1785797658768,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"modernized 表示使某事物採用新的、現代的方式或技術進行更新，這裡指工廠透過新設備和數位系統進行了現代化改造。","options":["destroyed","modernized","abandoned","expanded"],"sentence":"The old factory was ______ with new equipment and digital systems. The production process now uses the latest technology instead of outdated machinery.","translation":"那間老工廠用新設備和數位系統進行了現代化改造。生產流程現在使用最新科技，而不是過時的機器。","word":"modernized"}},"modest":{"createdAt":1782491138480,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"modest 表示樸素、不浮誇或謙虛的態度，指一個人的生活方式或性格特徵不張揚、不奢侈。","options":["glowing","modest","mischievous","rival"],"sentence":"Despite earning millions, he maintained a ______ lifestyle and lived in a small apartment. His friends were amazed that someone so wealthy would choose such simple, unpretentious surroundings.","translation":"儘管賺了數百萬美元，他保持了樸素的生活方式，住在一個小公寓裡。他的朋友們驚訝於一個如此富有的人會選擇如此簡樸、不矯飾的環境。","word":"modest"}},"modesty":{"createdAt":1783468655099,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"modesty指的是一個人的謙遜、樸素或不誇耀自己的品質，與自我吹捧的態度相反。","options":["arrogance","modesty","confusion","pride"],"sentence":"Despite winning the competition, the champion spoke with such ______ that she barely mentioned her own achievements. She credited her success entirely to her team's hard work and her coach's guidance.","translation":"儘管贏得了比賽，這位冠軍卻以如此謙遜的態度講話，幾乎沒有提及她自己的成就。她將她的成功完全歸功於她的團隊的努力和教練的指導。","word":"modesty"}},"modify":{"createdAt":1786489685995,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"modify意為改變或更改某物的形式、性質或功能，使其變得不同，但仍保留基本結構。","options":["destroy","modify","ignore","preserve"],"sentence":"The architect decided to ______ the building's design to make it more energy-efficient. The changes included adding solar panels and improving the insulation system.","translation":"建築師決定修改建築物的設計，以提高能源效率。這些變更包括安裝太陽能板和改進隔熱系統。","word":"modify"}},"moist":{"createdAt":1781481311493,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"moist是形容詞，表示有水分、潮濕的狀態。","options":["frozen","moist","hard","burning"],"sentence":"The baker preferred to work with ______ dough to ensure the bread would have a soft texture. Adding just the right amount of water made the mixture perfect for kneading and rising.","translation":"麵包師喜歡用潮濕的麵團工作，以確保麵包具有柔軟的質地。添加適量的水使混合物非常適合揉捏和發酵。","word":"moist"}},"moisture":{"createdAt":1781746685508,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"moisture指的是濕氣、水份、潮濕，是指空氣或物質中含有的水分。","options":["moisture","medal","mentality","cooperate"],"sentence":"The ______ in the air during the rainy season can damage electronic equipment. The high humidity levels made everything feel damp and sticky.","translation":"雨季空氣中的濕氣會損害電子設備。高濕度使一切都感覺潮濕和粘膩。","word":"moisture"}},"moment":{"createdAt":1784190147983,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"moment意為極短的時間片段，通常指幾秒鐘或很短的一段時間，與「幾秒鐘」的語境相符。","options":["hour","moment","day","week"],"sentence":"Wait just a ______ while I finish this task. I'll be done in a few seconds, so please be patient.","translation":"等我一片刻，我來完成這項任務。我會在幾秒鐘內完成，所以請耐心等待。","word":"moment"}},"momentary":{"createdAt":1781835134545,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"momentary 表示持續時間很短，只持續一瞬間或很短的時間，與長期或持久相反。","options":["permanent","intense","momentary","sharp"],"sentence":"The pain I felt was ______ and disappeared within seconds. By the time I finished counting to ten, it was completely gone.","translation":"我感受到的疼痛是短暫的，在幾秒鐘內就消失了。當我數到十時，它已經完全消失了。","word":"momentary"}},"momentum":{"createdAt":1782292175217,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"momentum 表示動力、推動力或衝力，用來描述不斷增強的力量和勢頭。","options":["occupied","motive","momentum","cement"],"sentence":"The team built ______ throughout the season by winning consecutive games and improving their performance. By the playoff finals, their unstoppable force and energy made them strong contenders for the championship.","translation":"球隊在整個賽季中通過連勝和提高表現而積累了推動力。到了季後賽決賽，他們不可阻擋的力量和能量使他們成為冠軍的有力競爭者。","word":"momentum"}},"monarch":{"createdAt":1783130376322,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"monarch 指的是君主或國王皇帝，是王國中擁有最高權力並世襲王位的統治者。","options":["servant","merchant","monarch","peasant"],"sentence":"The ______ ruled the kingdom for over fifty years, making important decisions about laws and governance. She was the supreme leader and inherited her throne from her mother, the previous queen.","translation":"這位君主統治王國超過五十年，制定了關於法律和治理的重要決定。她是最高領導人，並從她的母親（前任皇后）那裡繼承了王位。","word":"monarch"}},"monarchy":{"createdAt":1785339147824,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"monarchy指由君主（如國王或皇帝）統治的政體，通常涉及世襲權力制度。","options":["democracy","monarchy","dictatorship","republic"],"sentence":"The country has been ruled by a ______ for over three hundred years, with power passing from one king to his eldest son. The royal family maintains tremendous influence over national affairs and governance.","translation":"這個國家已經由君主制統治了三百多年，權力從一位國王傳給他的長子。皇室對國家事務和治理保有巨大的影響力。","word":"monarchy"}},"monetary":{"createdAt":1784962580677,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"monetary 是形容詞，表示與金錢、金融或貨幣制度相關的事務，常用於描述金融政策或經濟措施。","options":["educational","environmental","monetary","cultural"],"sentence":"The central bank announced a new ______ policy to control inflation and stabilize the economy. The decision to adjust interest rates and money supply would have immediate effects on borrowing costs and investment.","translation":"中央銀行宣布了一項新的貨幣政策來控制通脹並穩定經濟。調整利率和貨幣供應量的決定將對借貸成本和投資產生直接影響。","word":"monetary"}},"monitor":{"createdAt":1783329157092,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"monitor 作為名詞時，指的是負責監督或核查某事的人，在這個句子中指的是在學校監督學生行為的監督員。","options":["teacher","monitor","principal","counselor"],"sentence":"The school hired a ______ to oversee student behavior in the hallways during lunch breaks. This person was responsible for ensuring students followed all safety rules and remained orderly.","translation":"學校聘請了一名監督員在午餐時間在走廊裡監督學生的行為。這個人負責確保學生遵守所有安全規則並保持秩序。","word":"monitor"}},"monitoring":{"createdAt":1784565759536,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"monitoring是指持續地觀察、檢查或追蹤某事物的行為，常用於安全或績效評估的情境中。","options":["celebrating","monitoring","abandoning","forgetting"],"sentence":"The company implemented a new ______ system to track employee productivity. The IT department installed software that records all computer activities throughout the workday.","translation":"公司實施了新的監控系統來追蹤員工的生產力。資訊科技部門安裝了在整個工作日記錄所有電腦活動的軟體。","word":"monitoring"}},"monitoringhis":{"createdAt":1787332768004,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"monitoringhis是一個非標準英文單詞，在此上下文中用於表示持續監控和追蹤系統活動的動作。","options":["recordkeeping","monitoringhis","surveillance","tracking"],"sentence":"The system was ______ all network activity throughout the day. The IT department needed to track every connection and log to ensure security compliance.","translation":"該系統整天都在______所有的網路活動。資訊部門需要追蹤每個連接和日誌以確保安全合規。","word":"monitoringhis"}},"monopoly":{"createdAt":1784450229792,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"monopoly 是名詞，意為「壟斷」或「獨佔」，指一家公司或個人完全控制某個市場或商品的供應。","options":["partnership","competition","monopoly","diversity"],"sentence":"The large tech company maintained a ______ in the smartphone market by controlling over 80% of sales. No other competitor could challenge their dominant position.","translation":"這家大型科技公司透過控制超過80%的銷售額在智慧型手機市場中保持壟斷地位。沒有其他競爭對手能夠挑戰他們的主導地位。","word":"monopoly"}},"monotony":{"createdAt":1783961993174,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"monotony 是指毫無變化、令人厭倦的重複，強調單調乏味的狀態。","options":["excitement","monotony","progress","success"],"sentence":"The ______ of her daily routine—waking up, going to work, and returning home—made her feel uninspired. She decided to travel abroad to escape this repetitive cycle and experience something completely different.","translation":"她日常作息的單調乏味——醒來、上班、回家——讓她感到沒有靈感。她決定出國旅遊，逃離這個重複的循環，體驗完全不同的東西。","word":"monotony"}},"monument":{"createdAt":1786352858591,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"monument 指的是為了紀念重要人物或歷史事件而建立的紀念性建築物或紀念碑，具有紀念和敬仰的目的。","options":["building","monument","structure","tower"],"sentence":"The Lincoln ______ in Washington, D.C. is one of the most visited tourist attractions in the United States. It was built to honor the 16th president and stands as a permanent tribute to his legacy.","translation":"位於華盛頓特區的林肯紀念碑是美國最受歡迎的旅遊景點之一。它是為了紀念第16任總統而建造的，是對他遺產的永久致敬。","word":"monument"}},"mood":{"createdAt":1785282866962,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mood 是指一個人內在的情感狀態或心情，通常可以透過態度和表情反映出來。","options":["behavior","mood","opinion","decision"],"sentence":"Sarah's ______ improved dramatically after she received good news about her job promotion. Her cheerful attitude and bright smile showed that she was now feeling very happy and optimistic.","translation":"莎拉收到關於工作晉升的好消息後，她的情緒大幅改善。她開朗的態度和燦爛的笑容表明她現在感到非常高興和樂觀。","word":"mood"}},"moody":{"createdAt":1783260805493,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"moody意為「心情多變的」或「喜怒無常的」，用來描述情緒經常起伏的人。","options":["cheerful","moody","stable","calm"],"sentence":"The ______ teenager's emotions seemed to change without warning or apparent reason. One moment he was happy, and the next moment he was withdrawn and sullen.","translation":"這個心情多變的青少年的情緒似乎在沒有警告或明顯原因的情況下改變。一刻他很開心，下一刻他又沉默寡言和悶悶不樂。","word":"moody"}},"moral":{"createdAt":1782410027827,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"moral用作形容詞，指道德上的、蘊含教訓的；第二句強調故事所傳達的人生教訓和價值觀，這正是moral lesson的核心特徵。","options":["entertaining","moral","educational","fictional"],"sentence":"The children's story has a clear ______ lesson: honesty is always the best policy. The main character learns that telling the truth brings peace of mind and trust from others.","translation":"這個兒童故事有一個清晰的道德教訓：誠實永遠是最好的政策。主角學到說實話能帶來心靈的平靜和他人的信任。","word":"moral"}},"morale":{"createdAt":1781696018684,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"morale 意為士氣、精神狀態，通常指群體或組織的團隊精神和信心程度。","options":["strength","morale","strategy","equipment"],"sentence":"The team's ______ dropped significantly after they lost the championship game. Coaches had to work hard to rebuild their confidence and enthusiasm for next season.","translation":"在失去冠軍賽後，球隊的士氣明顯下降。教練必須努力重建他們對下賽季的信心和熱情。","word":"morale"}},"morality":{"createdAt":1782554388864,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"morality 指的是道德標準和倫理原則，用來判斷行為的對錯。","options":["behavior","morality","intelligence","creativity"],"sentence":"The school's code of ______ requires students to be honest and respectful to others. Without clear principles about right and wrong, society would collapse into chaos.","translation":"學校的道德規範要求學生誠實和尊重他人。沒有明確的關於對錯的原則，社會將陷入混亂。","word":"morality"}},"morally":{"createdAt":1782044436950,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"morally是副詞，表示從道德或倫理角度來看，與「道德上是錯誤的」這個概念相符。","options":["legally","morally","practically","logically"],"sentence":"The judge ruled that the defendant's actions were ______ wrong, even though they were technically legal. The decision caused public outrage because people felt justice had not been served.","translation":"法官裁定被告的行為在道德上是錯誤的，儘管在法律上是合法的。這項裁決引起公眾憤怒，因為人們認為正義沒有得到伸張。","word":"morally"}},"moreover":{"createdAt":1783737904100,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"moreover 是一個轉折連接詞，用於添加另一個正面的支持論點，強化之前的觀點。","options":["besides","however","moreover","therefore"],"sentence":"The restaurant serves excellent food at reasonable prices; ______, it has a warm and welcoming atmosphere. These three factors combined make it the best dining experience in the city.","translation":"這家餐廳以合理的價格提供優秀的食物；而且，它還有溫暖和熱情的氛圍。這三個因素結合在一起使其成為城市中最好的餐飲體驗。","word":"moreover"}},"mortal":{"createdAt":1783841701034,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"mortal 表示「凡人的、必然死亡的」，指所有人類都有生命的終結。","options":["royal","immortal","mortal","legendary"],"sentence":"As a ______ being, the king knew he could not live forever no matter how powerful his kingdom became. Even the greatest rulers must eventually face death like all humans.","translation":"作為一個凡人，國王知道無論他的王國多麼強大，他也不能永遠活著。即使是最偉大的統治者也必須像所有人類一樣最終面對死亡。","word":"mortal"}},"mortality":{"createdAt":1783260805494,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mortality意為「死亡率」，指一定時期內一定人口中死亡人數所佔的比例。","options":["natality","mortality","fertility","morbidity"],"sentence":"The epidemiologist studied the ______ rate among different age groups to understand the pandemic's impact. The statistical data showed how many deaths occurred in each population segment over a specific period.","translation":"流行病學家研究了不同年齡組的死亡率，以了解疫情的影響。統計數據顯示在特定時期內每個人口群體中有多少人死亡。","word":"mortality"}},"mortgage":{"createdAt":1781481311488,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mortgage是指銀行向購房者提供的貸款，以及對房產的抵押擔保。","options":["investment","mortgage","insurance","scholarship"],"sentence":"After saving for ten years, Maria finally qualified for a ______ to purchase her first home. The bank approved her application because she had a stable job and a substantial down payment.","translation":"在存了十年的錢後，瑪麗亞終於獲得批准買她的第一間房子。銀行批准她的申請是因為她有穩定的工作和大筆的首付款。","word":"mortgage"}},"motion":{"createdAt":1781580511757,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"motion 表示物體的移動或運行狀態","options":["sound","color","motion","weight"],"sentence":"The pendulum continued its ______ back and forth for hours. Its regular swinging pattern was hypnotic to watch.","translation":"鐘擺持續其往復的運動好幾個小時。它有規律的擺動模式看起來很催眠。","word":"motion"}},"motionless":{"createdAt":1781481072317,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"motionless 表示完全靜止不動的狀態，沒有任何動作或移動。","options":["running","alert","motionless","graceful"],"sentence":"The deer stood ______ in the forest, barely visible among the trees. Not a muscle twitched as the hunter approached cautiously.","translation":"鹿在森林裡靜止不動地站著，在樹木中幾乎看不見。當獵人小心翼翼地靠近時，它連一塊肌肉都沒有動過。","word":"motionless"}},"motivate":{"createdAt":1784450229787,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"motivate 是動詞，意為「給予動機」或「激勵」，指的是鼓勵某人採取行動或達成目標。","options":["discourage","motivate","confuse","punish"],"sentence":"Good teachers try to ______ their students to work hard and achieve their goals. When students feel encouraged and inspired, they are more likely to put in extra effort.","translation":"好老師會試著激勵他們的學生努力工作並達成目標。當學生感到受到鼓勵和啟發時，他們更可能會付出額外的努力。","word":"motivate"}},"motivated":{"createdAt":1786625251617,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"motivated 意為「有動力的、受到激勵的」，表示一個人被激勵去採取行動或達成目標的狀態。","options":["tired","motivated","confused","bored"],"sentence":"The students felt ______ to study harder after receiving praise for their excellent test scores. Their newfound determination helped them achieve even better results in the following semester.","translation":"學生們在因優異的考試成績而受到表揚後感到了動力去更努力地學習。他們新獲得的決心幫助他們在接下來的學期取得了更好的成績。","word":"motivated"}},"motive":{"createdAt":1782292175218,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"motive 表示動機或目的，是驅使某人採取行動的原因或理由。","options":["momentum","occupied","cement","motive"],"sentence":"The detective investigated the suspect's ______ for committing the crime during the interrogation. After discovering that the person stood to gain a large inheritance, the police finally understood why they had committed such an act.","translation":"偵探在詢問期間調查了嫌疑人犯罪的動機。在發現這個人將獲得一大筆遺產後，警察終於明白他們為什麼要這樣做。","word":"motive"}},"motto":{"createdAt":1782378744800,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"motto是名詞，指的是座右銘或格言，是用來指引行動或表達人生原則的簡短語句。","options":["motto","location","budget","schedule"],"sentence":"The company's ______ has guided their employees for over twenty years in the workplace. The phrase 'Work hard, dream big' is displayed on every office wall.","translation":"這家公司的座右銘已經在二十多年來指引著他們的員工。短語「努力工作，夢想遠大」被展示在每面辦公室牆上。","word":"motto"}},"mound":{"createdAt":1785242681789,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"mound 指由土石堆積而成的小丘或土堆，經常用於考古發掘的背景","options":["mound","valley","crater","plain"],"sentence":"Archaeologists discovered an ancient ______ while excavating the field. Careful digging revealed pottery and tools buried beneath the earthen heap.","translation":"考古學家在挖掘田地時發現了一座古老的土丘。仔細挖掘在這個土堆下面發現了陶器和工具。","word":"mound"}},"mount":{"createdAt":1787554448282,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"mount 作動詞意為增加或增長，特別是指數量、強度或問題逐漸上升。","options":["decrease","stabilize","mount","disappear"],"sentence":"As the deadline approached, pressure and stress began to ______ among the team members. By the final week, everyone felt overwhelmed by the mounting workload.","translation":"隨著截止日期臨近，團隊成員之間的壓力和緊張開始增加。到最後一週，每個人都被不斷增加的工作量所淹沒。","word":"mount"}},"mourn":{"createdAt":1783260805492,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mourn意為「悲悼」或「哀慟」，表示為某人的去世或損失感到悲傷。","options":["celebrate","mourn","remember","honor"],"sentence":"The entire nation gathered to ______ the loss of the beloved leader who had passed away. The funeral service was attended by thousands of people expressing their deep sorrow.","translation":"整個國家聚集在一起哀悼所愛領導人去世的喪失。葬禮由數千人參加，他們表達了深深的悲傷。","word":"mourn"}},"mournful":{"createdAt":1783395908751,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"mournful 是形容詞，表示充滿悲傷、憂鬱或哀悼的情感。","options":["cheerful","energetic","mournful","upbeat"],"sentence":"The ______ melody played softly in the concert hall, bringing tears to many audience members' eyes. The composition conveyed deep sorrow and loss throughout every note.","translation":"那首憂傷的旋律在音樂廳裡輕輕播放，使許多觀眾淚流滿面。這首樂曲從每一個音符都傳達出深深的悲痛和失落感。","word":"mournful"}},"mow":{"createdAt":1784645448522,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mow 的意思是用機器或工具割草或穀類植物等，這句話中明確提到用機器切割草。","options":["water","mow","plant","fertilize"],"sentence":"Every Saturday morning, my father goes outside to ______ the lawn before it gets too tall. He uses a machine to cut the grass down to a manageable height.","translation":"每個星期六早上，我父親都會出去______ 草坪，以免它長得太高。他用機器把草割短到可以管理的高度。","word":"mow"}},"multiple":{"createdAt":1783476327936,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"multiple 是形容詞，意為多重的、多個的、多樣的，表示不止一個或多於一種。","options":["single","unique","multiple","isolated"],"sentence":"The accident resulted in ______ injuries to the passengers in the vehicle. Paramedics had to treat various wounds, fractures, and contusions affecting different parts of their bodies.","translation":"事故導致了車內乘客的多重傷害。救護人員必須治療影響身體不同部位的各種傷口、骨折和挫傷。","word":"multiple"}},"multiply":{"createdAt":1783476327937,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"multiply 是動詞，意為增加、繁殖或相乘，在生物學語境中表示生物數量的迅速增加。","options":["decrease","divide","multiply","stabilize"],"sentence":"The bacteria in the culture began to ______ rapidly under ideal laboratory conditions. Within 24 hours, the population had increased exponentially as each cell divided and reproduced.","translation":"在理想的實驗室條件下，培養皿中的細菌開始迅速繁殖。在24小時內，隨著每個細胞的分裂和繁殖，種群數量呈指數增長。","word":"multiply"}},"mundane":{"createdAt":1783870466421,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"mundane 描述某事物平凡無奇、日常普通，缺乏特殊性或令人興奮的特質。","options":["exciting","adventurous","mundane","extraordinary"],"sentence":"Though the job seemed ______ at first glance, it required careful attention to detail and problem-solving skills. Thousands of people performed these repetitive, unremarkable tasks every single day without recognition.","translation":"雖然這份工作乍一看似乎很平凡，但它需要仔細的注意力和解決問題的技能。每天有數千人執行這些重複、不起眼的任務而不被認可。","word":"mundane"}},"municipal":{"createdAt":1784106475789,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"municipal 是指與城市或市鎮的政府、管理或事務相關的，特別是指由市政府而非州政府或聯邦政府管理的事務。","options":["state","municipal","federal","provincial"],"sentence":"The ______ government announced new regulations for public transportation in the city. The mayor's office and city council worked together to implement these policies across all neighborhoods.","translation":"市政府宣布了城市公共交通的新規定。市長辦公室和市議會合作在所有社區實施這些政策。","word":"municipal"}},"murder":{"createdAt":1781951900952,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"murder指故意殺害他人的犯罪行為，強調是非法的、預謀的致命傷害。","options":["accident","suicide","murder","disappearance"],"sentence":"The detective was called to investigate a ______ that had occurred in the downtown hotel. The victim had been killed intentionally, and the police needed to find the culprit.","translation":"偵探被召來調查在市中心酒店發生的謀殺案。受害者是被故意殺害的，警察需要找到兇手。","word":"murder"}},"murderer":{"createdAt":1781758494836,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"murderer 指的是犯謀殺罪的兇手，與第二句中「犯下謀殺案的人」的描述相符。","options":["victim","witness","murderer","detective"],"sentence":"The detective finally identified the ______ after analyzing DNA evidence from the crime scene. The evidence proved that this person was the one who committed the homicide.","translation":"偵探在分析犯罪現場的DNA證據後，最終確認了兇手的身份。證據證明這個人就是犯下謀殺案的人。","word":"murderer"}},"murmur":{"createdAt":1784982319108,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"murmur 是動詞，表示用低沉而含糊的聲音碎碎念、輕聲說話，通常帶有不滿或不同意的意思。","options":["shout","murmur","laugh","whisper"],"sentence":"The student began to ______ complaints under her breath during the boring lecture. The teacher could barely hear the soft, continuous sounds coming from the back of the classroom.","translation":"在那個無聊的講座中，學生開始在她的呼吸下碎碎念抱怨。老師勉強能聽到來自教室後面微弱的、持續的聲音。","word":"murmur"}},"murmuring":{"createdAt":1781839703147,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"murmuring指低聲說話或低沈的聲音，與soft voices blended together（柔和的聲音融合）完美對應。","options":["silence","applause","murmuring","laughter"],"sentence":"The ______ of the audience grew louder as they waited for the concert to begin. Soft voices blended together into a gentle background hum.","translation":"當觀眾等待演唱會開始時，低聲說話聲變得更大聲。柔和的聲音融合在一起，形成了一個溫柔的背景嗡嗡聲。","word":"murmuring"}},"muscle":{"createdAt":1785800870820,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"muscle 是名詞，指身體中能夠收縮產生運動的組織，通過運動訓練能夠變得更大更強壯。","options":["bone","muscle","skin","fat"],"sentence":"The athlete developed strong ______ through years of consistent weight training. His arms and legs showed visible definition from the growth of his tissues.","translation":"這位運動員通過多年持續的舉重訓練發展出強壯的肌肉。他的手臂和腿部因為組織的增長而顯示出明顯的線條。","word":"muscle"}},"muscular":{"createdAt":1785454917953,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"muscular 形容詞表示具有發達的肌肉或肌肉強壯，通常用來描述身體經過鍛鍊而變得強健的外觀。","options":["tall","muscular","handsome","intelligent"],"sentence":"The athlete's ______ physique was the result of years of intense training at the gym. His well-defined arms and strong legs impressed everyone at the competition.","translation":"這位運動員發達的肌肉體格是多年在健身房進行高強度訓練的結果。他發達的手臂和強壯的腿部給比賽中的每個人都留下了深刻印象。","word":"muscular"}},"muse":{"createdAt":1786863230645,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"muse作為名詞表示深思、冥想或靈感的泉源，特別是在創意或藝術工作中的思考狀態。","options":["noise","muse","action","argument"],"sentence":"The artist sat quietly by the window, lost in ______ about her next masterpiece. She had been thinking deeply for hours, searching for creative inspiration to overcome her writer's block.","translation":"藝術家安靜地坐在窗邊，沉思著她的下一部傑作。她已經深思熟慮了好幾個小時，尋找創意靈感來克服她的創意困境。","word":"muse"}},"mustache":{"createdAt":1781403377828,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"mustache 特指長在上嘴唇上方的鬚髮，不包括下巴或兩側的鬍子。","options":["beard","eyebrows","mustache","sideburns"],"sentence":"The old gentleman carefully groomed his ______ every morning before going to work. He took great pride in the distinctive facial hair that grew above his upper lip.","translation":"這位老紳士每天早上上班前都會細心修剪他的八字鬚。他為長在上唇上方的這道獨特鬍子感到驕傲。","word":"mustache"}},"mute":{"createdAt":1783949553268,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mute 在音樂中是指一種弱音器，一種放在樂器上以減弱或改變音量的裝置。","options":["loud","mute","bright","sharp"],"sentence":"During the classical music performance, the violinist used a ______ to soften the sound of her instrument. The small wooden device was placed on the bridge to create a more delicate and subdued tone.","translation":"在古典音樂表演中，小提琴手用弱音器來軟化她樂器的聲音。這個小木製裝置被放在琴橋上，以創造更細膩和柔和的音質。","word":"mute"}},"mutual":{"createdAt":1782542941493,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mutual 是形容詞，表示兩方或多方之間相互的、彼此的，意指雙方都平等參與和受影響。","options":["temporary","mutual","one-sided","conditional"],"sentence":"The two countries signed a ______ agreement to work together on environmental issues. Both nations committed equally to the same goals and responsibilities outlined in the treaty.","translation":"兩國簽署了一項相互協議，共同應對環保問題。雙方都同樣致力於條約中規定的相同目標和責任。","word":"mutual"}},"mutually":{"createdAt":1782131663201,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mutually表示雙方或多方都以相同的方式或程度參與某事，強調相互的、共同的關係。","options":["separately","mutually","reluctantly","temporarily"],"sentence":"The two companies agreed to work together ______ for their benefit. Both sides signed a contract committing to share profits equally.","translation":"這兩家公司同意彼此一起工作以獲得他們的利益。雙方簽署了一份承諾平等分享利潤的合約。","word":"mutually"}},"mysterious":{"createdAt":1781582619549,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"mysterious 形容某事難以理解或無法解釋，充滿謎團和未知的特質。","options":["bright","cheerful","mysterious","ordinary"],"sentence":"The old castle had a ______ atmosphere that made visitors feel uneasy and curious. No one could explain the strange sounds heard at night or the peculiar markings on the walls.","translation":"這座古老的城堡有著神秘的氣氛，使訪客感到不安和好奇。沒有人能解釋夜間聽到的奇怪聲音或牆上的奇特標記。","word":"mysterious"}},"mysteriously":{"createdAt":1785904437503,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mysteriously是副詞，表示以神祕、難以解釋或隱祕的方式發生某事，修飾動詞以表達不尋常或令人困惑的行為。","options":["quickly","mysteriously","slowly","loudly"],"sentence":"The cat ______ disappeared from the locked room without leaving any trace. No one could explain how it escaped, and the situation remained completely unexplained.","translation":"貓神祕地從上鎖的房間裡消失了，沒有留下任何蹤跡。沒有人能解釋它是如何逃脫的，情況仍然完全無法解釋。","word":"mysteriously"}},"mystery":{"createdAt":1783063660624,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"mystery 指的是難以理解或解釋的神祕事物，其原因或答案未知。","options":["history","mystery","story","legend"],"sentence":"The disappearance of the ancient artifact remains a ______ that archaeologists have been unable to solve. No one knows who took it or where it went decades ago.","translation":"古代文物的失蹤仍然是考古學家無法解決的謎團。沒有人知道誰在幾十年前拿走了它或它去了哪裡。","word":"mystery"}},"myth":{"createdAt":1785820661000,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"myth 指的是古代流傳下來的、通常涉及神靈或超自然力量的傳統故事，而非基於歷史事實。","options":["fact","story","myth","legend"],"sentence":"The ancient ______ of Prometheus stealing fire from the gods has been retold for thousands of years across many cultures. Scholars have confirmed that this is not a historical event but rather a symbolic story created by ancient Greeks.","translation":"普羅米修斯從眾神那裡盜取火焰的古代神話已經在許多文化中被述說了數千年。學者們已經確認這不是歷史事件，而是由古代希臘人創作的象徵性故事。","word":"myth"}},"naive":{"createdAt":1781616876966,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"naive 形容詞表示「天真的、樸素的」，指缺乏經驗或判斷力，容易被欺騙。","options":["sophisticated","cynical","naive","skeptical"],"sentence":"The young girl was too ______ to understand the politician's deceptive promises. She believed everything she heard without questioning or analyzing the claims.","translation":"那個年輕女孩太天真，無法理解政治家欺騙性的承諾。她沒有質疑或分析這些主張就相信了一切。","word":"naive"}},"naked":{"createdAt":1781616876970,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"naked 形容詞除了表示「赤裸的」，還可引申為「未經掩飾的、毫無隱瞞的」。","options":["hidden","false","naked","complicated"],"sentence":"The ______ truth about the scandal was finally revealed to the public. All the facts were presented without any embellishment or cover-up.","translation":"關於醜聞的赤裸真相終於向公眾公開。所有事實都被呈現，沒有任何美化或隱瞞。","word":"naked"}},"narrate":{"createdAt":1781950727561,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"narrate 指講述故事或提供敘述，通常是通過語音解說。","options":["paint","ignore","narrate","compose"],"sentence":"The famous actor will ______ the documentary about Antarctic wildlife. His voice will guide viewers through each scene from start to finish.","translation":"這位著名演員將為關於南極野生動物的紀錄片敘述旁白。他的聲音將指導觀眾從頭到尾穿過每一場景。","word":"narrate"}},"narrative":{"createdAt":1781616876980,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"narrative 形容詞表示「敘事的、故事的」，指以講述故事或敘述事件為主要特徵的文學作品。","options":["descriptive","narrative","poetic","dramatic"],"sentence":"The author used a ______ technique to tell the story from the main character's perspective. The entire novel was structured as a sequential account of events.","translation":"作者使用敘事技巧從主要角色的角度講述故事。整部小說的結構是事件的順序帳述。","word":"narrative"}},"narrator":{"createdAt":1781616876983,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"narrator 名詞表示「敘述者、旁白者」，指在書籍、電影或紀錄片中講述故事或提供解說的人。","options":["actor","narrator","director","editor"],"sentence":"The ______ of the documentary spoke in a calm, authoritative voice that captivated the audience. His commentary guided viewers through the complex historical events.","translation":"紀錄片的旁白者用平靜而權威的聲音吸引了觀眾。他的評論引導觀眾了解複雜的歷史事件。","word":"narrator"}},"narrow":{"createdAt":1781616876985,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"narrow 形容詞表示「狹窄的、寬度小的」，指物理空間的寬度受限。","options":["wide","narrow","spacious","open"],"sentence":"The ______ alleyway between the buildings was so tight that two people could barely pass each other. We had to walk single file to navigate it.","translation":"建築物之間的狹窄小巷非常狹擠，兩個人幾乎無法相互通過。我們必須單排行走才能通過。","word":"narrow"}},"narrowly":{"createdAt":1781616876971,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"narrowly 副詞表示「勉強地、差一點」，指僅僅避免了不好的結果。","options":["widely","narrowly","slowly","carefully"],"sentence":"He ______ avoided the accident by swerving at the last second. His quick reflexes prevented a serious collision by mere inches.","translation":"他在最後一秒轉向，差一點就避免了事故。他敏捷的反應以極小的距離阻止了嚴重碰撞。","word":"narrowly"}},"nasty":{"createdAt":1784982319108,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"nasty 是形容詞，用來形容令人厭惡、不愉快或令人反感的事物，特別是在味道、氣味或品質方面。","options":["delicious","nasty","sweet","mild"],"sentence":"The food had a ______ taste that made everyone spit it out immediately. We discovered later that it had been left in the sun for three days and had started to rot.","translation":"那食物有著令人不快的味道，讓每個人都立刻吐了出來。我們後來發現它在陽光下放了三天，已經開始腐爛了。","word":"nasty"}},"nationalism":{"createdAt":1781616876985,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"nationalism 名詞表示「民族主義、國家主義」，指強調本國利益和民族優越性的政治思想。","options":["internationalism","pacifism","nationalism","liberalism"],"sentence":"The rise of ______ in the country led citizens to prioritize their own nation's interests above international cooperation. Political leaders appealed to patriotic sentiments.","translation":"該國民族主義的上升導致公民優先考慮本國利益而不是國際合作。政治領導人訴諸愛國情感。","word":"nationalism"}},"nationality":{"createdAt":1781484415231,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"nationality是指某人所屬的國家或公民身份，表示一個人的國籍。","options":["height","nationality","occupation","religion"],"sentence":"On the passport application, he had to indicate his ______ as Canadian. The form required him to state which country he was a citizen of.","translation":"在護照申請表上，他必須將國籍註明為加拿大人。該表格要求他說明他是哪個國家的公民。","word":"nationality"}},"native":{"createdAt":1781616876986,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"native 形容詞表示「本地的、本國的」，用於描述一個人生來就具備的語言或文化。","options":["foreign","native","amateur","student"],"sentence":"She is a ______ speaker of Mandarin Chinese, having grown up in Beijing. The language came naturally to her without any formal study.","translation":"她是普通話的母語使用者，在北京長大。該語言對她來說很自然，無需任何正式學習。","word":"native"}},"natural":{"createdAt":1781616919425,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"自然的是指未經人為改造或處理的，原本就存在的樣子。","options":["artificial","natural","obvious","difficult"],"sentence":"This river follows a ______ path through the valley without any human engineering. The water flows freely and has never been diverted by dams.","translation":"這條河流經山谷時遵循自然的路徑，沒有任何人工工程。水流自由流動，從未被大壩轉向。","word":"natural"}},"naturally":{"createdAt":1781616919428,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"自然地是指按照自然規律或天性發生，不需人為干預。","options":["artificially","slowly","naturally","gradually"],"sentence":"When the sun rises, the sky brightens ______ without any artificial light. This process happens automatically every morning.","translation":"當太陽升起時，天空不需任何人工光線自然地變亮。這個過程每天早上自動發生。","word":"naturally"}},"nature":{"createdAt":1781616876967,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"nature 名詞表示「自然、天性、本質」，指事物的基本特性或內在本質。","options":["color","history","nature","beauty"],"sentence":"The ______ of water is to flow downward due to gravity. Scientists study this fundamental property to understand how ecosystems function.","translation":"水的本性是由於重力而向下流動。科學家研究這個基本性質以了解生態系統如何運作。","word":"nature"}},"nausea":{"createdAt":1781424157176,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"nausea 指的是想吐或感到不適的感覺，通常伴隨胃部不適。","options":["dizziness","fatigue","nausea","headache"],"sentence":"The patient reported experiencing severe ______ after taking the new medication on an empty stomach. He felt so queasy that he had to lie down for an hour before he could function again.","translation":"患者報告說在空腹時服用新藥後經歷了嚴重的噁心感。他感到非常難受，必須躺下一小時才能重新活動。","word":"nausea"}},"nautical":{"createdAt":1789363793858,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"nautical 形容與航海、海上航行或海洋相關的事物。","options":["culinary","musical","nautical","astronomical"],"sentence":"The captain used ______ charts and compass readings to navigate the ship across the ocean. His knowledge of seafaring traditions and maritime law was essential for the voyage.","translation":"船長使用航海圖表和指南針讀數來引導船隻穿越大洋。他對航海傳統和海事法律的了解對航程至關重要。","word":"nautical"}},"naval":{"createdAt":1783005778367,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"naval 意為「海軍的」或「軍艦的」，指與海軍或海上軍事活動相關的形容詞。","options":["civilian","aerial","naval","commercial"],"sentence":"The ______ forces deployed their submarines and destroyers to patrol the international waters. These military vessels were equipped with advanced weapons and communication systems.","translation":"海軍部隊部署潛水艇和驅逐艦巡邏國際水域。這些軍艦配備了先進的武器和通訊系統。","word":"naval"}},"navigate":{"createdAt":1781443653217,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"navigate在這裡指的是駕駛或引導船隻通過特定路線，需要技術和知識。","options":["abandon","navigate","sink","float"],"sentence":"The captain had to carefully ______ the ship through the treacherous waters near the rocky reef. His expertise in reading nautical charts and handling the wheel was crucial to avoiding disaster.","translation":"船長必須小心翼翼地駕駛船隻通過岩礁附近的危險水域。他閱讀航海圖表和操控舵輪的專業知識對於避免災難至關重要。","word":"navigate"}},"navigation":{"createdAt":1781616876981,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"navigation 名詞表示「航海、飛行、領航」，指確定路線和方向的過程或技術。","options":["entertainment","communication","navigation","medication"],"sentence":"The ship's captain relied on advanced ______ systems to find the correct route across the ocean. GPS technology made the journey much safer than before.","translation":"船長依靠先進的導航系統在海洋中找到正確的路線。GPS技術使航程比以前安全得多。","word":"navigation"}},"navy":{"createdAt":1781616877019,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"navy 名詞表示「海軍」，指一個國家的軍事海上部隊，或深藍色（海軍藍）的顏色。","options":["army","navy","marines","coast"],"sentence":"He enlisted in the ______ after high school to serve his country at sea. His uniform displayed the insignia of the naval fleet.","translation":"他高中後參加了海軍以在海上為國服務。他的制服展示了海軍艦隊的徽章。","word":"navy"}},"nearsighted":{"createdAt":1781616876977,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"nearsighted 形容詞表示「近視的」，指無法清楚看到遠處物體的眼睛狀況。","options":["farsighted","nearsighted","blind","colorblind"],"sentence":"The ______ student had difficulty reading the information written on the classroom whiteboard. She needed glasses to see distant objects clearly.","translation":"這個近視的學生在閱讀課堂白板上的信息時遇到困難。她需要眼鏡才能清楚地看到遠處的物體。","word":"nearsighted"}},"neat":{"createdAt":1781256444518,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"neat指整潔、有序的狀態，描述一個人或地方井井有條、乾乾淨淨。","options":["colorful","cozy","neat","spacious"],"sentence":"Sarah's apartment is always ______, with every book organized on shelves and dishes promptly washed. Her friends are impressed by how she maintains such order despite her busy work schedule.","translation":"莎拉的公寓總是整潔有序的，每本書都整齊地放在書架上，盤子也立即洗淨。她的朋友對她在繁忙的工作日程中仍能保持如此秩序感到印象深刻。","word":"neat"}},"necessarily":{"createdAt":1781616876972,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"necessarily 副詞表示「必定地、必然地」，用於表達邏輯上的必然性。","options":["always","necessarily","quickly","slowly"],"sentence":"Success in business does not ______ come from working the longest hours. Some of the most successful entrepreneurs focus on efficiency and smart strategies instead.","translation":"商業上的成功不必定來自於工作時間最長。一些最成功的企業家反而專注於效率和聰明的策略。","word":"necessarily"}},"necessary":{"createdAt":1781616919428,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"必需的是指不可或缺、一定要有的、非做不可的。","options":["optional","necessary","harmful","expensive"],"sentence":"Regular exercise is ______ for maintaining good health and fitness. Without it, your body becomes weak and susceptible to diseases.","translation":"定期運動對於維持良好的健康和體能是必需的。沒有它，你的身體會變得虛弱並容易生病。","word":"necessary"}},"necessity":{"createdAt":1781616877017,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"necessity 名詞表示「必要、必需品」，指必不可少或無法避免的事物。","options":["luxury","luxury","necessity","distraction"],"sentence":"Sleep is a biological ______ that every human must fulfill. Without adequate rest, our bodies and minds cannot function properly.","translation":"睡眠是每個人都必須滿足的生理必要條件。沒有充分的休息，我們的身體和心智無法正常運作。","word":"necessity"}},"needy":{"createdAt":1781616876974,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"needy 形容詞表示「貧困的、缺乏生活必需品的」，指經濟困難的人。","options":["wealthy","needy","educated","established"],"sentence":"The charity organization provides food and shelter to ______ families in the community. These households struggle to afford basic necessities each month.","translation":"慈善機構為社區中貧困的家庭提供食物和住所。這些家庭每個月都難以負擔基本生活必需品。","word":"needy"}},"negative":{"createdAt":1782619889125,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"negative 表示不贊成、不同意或帶有批評性的態度，與肯定或正面的反應相反。","options":["neutral","positive","negative","constructive"],"sentence":"The student received a ______ response from the professor about his research proposal. The feedback included a list of reasons why the project would not be approved.","translation":"學生從教授那裡收到了關於他研究提案的______ 回應。反饋包括了為什麼該項目不會獲得批准的原因列表。","word":"negative"}},"neglect":{"createdAt":1781616919425,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"忽視是指故意或無意地不注意、不照顧某事物。","options":["care","neglect","renovation","inspection"],"sentence":"The abandoned house showed clear signs of ______ over many years. No one had maintained it or paid attention to its deteriorating condition.","translation":"這棟廢棄的房子多年來顯示出明顯的忽視跡象。沒有人維護它或關注其惡化的狀況。","word":"neglect"}},"negotiate":{"createdAt":1781484415237,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"negotiate是指通過對話和討論來達成協議或解決分歧，涉及妥協和相互讓步。","options":["celebrate","surrender","negotiate","flee"],"sentence":"The two nations had to ______ for months before reaching a peace agreement. Both sides made compromises and discussed their demands until they found common ground.","translation":"兩個國家必須談判數月才能達成和平協議。雙方做出妥協並討論他們的要求，直到找到共同點。","word":"negotiate"}},"negotiation":{"createdAt":1785898286594,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"negotiation 指的是雙方或多方之間的談判和交涉過程，目的是達成協議或共識。","options":["debate","celebration","negotiation","investigation"],"sentence":"The two countries entered into a lengthy ______ to reach an agreement on trade tariffs. After six months of discussing terms, compromises, and proposals, they finally signed a contract.","translation":"兩國進行了漫長的談判以達成貿易關稅協議。經過六個月討論條款、妥協和提案，他們最終簽署了合約。","word":"negotiation"}},"nerve":{"createdAt":1781616876977,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"nerve 名詞可表示「神經」，也可引申為「勇氣、膽量」，指敢於採取行動的勇氣。","options":["fear","doubt","nerve","weakness"],"sentence":"It took a lot of ______ for her to speak up against the unfair decision. Her courageous stand inspired others to voice their opinions.","translation":"她需要很大的勇氣才能對不公平的決定發聲。她勇敢的立場激勵了其他人表達意見。","word":"nerve"}},"nervous":{"createdAt":1781566185162,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"nervous形容人感到不安、緊張或擔憂的情感狀態，通常伴隨著生理上的反應。","options":["confident","relaxed","nervous","excited"],"sentence":"She felt ______ before her first job interview. Her hands trembled, her heart raced, and she could barely sleep the night before due to anxiety.","translation":"她在第一次工作面試前感到緊張。她的手發抖，心跳加速，由於焦慮她前一晚幾乎無法入睡。","word":"nervous"}},"netizen":{"createdAt":1783423026256,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"netizen 是指在網際網路上活動的使用者或網路使用者，特別是在社群媒體上有影響力的人，而 government official、newspaper、librarian（政府官員、報紙、圖書館員）不是特指網路使用者。","options":["government official","netizen","newspaper","librarian"],"sentence":"The social media campaign went viral after a popular ______ shared the video with their two million followers. This single action sparked a global conversation that lasted for weeks across multiple platforms.","translation":"這個社群媒體活動在一位受歡迎的網民與他們的二百萬粉絲分享該視頻後變得病毒式傳播。這個單一的行動引發了跨越多個平台持續數週的全球對話。","word":"netizen"}},"neuter":{"createdAt":1781431278560,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"neuter作為語法術語，指既不是陽性也不是陰性的詞性。","options":["positive","neuter","complex","active"],"sentence":"In grammar, the word 'it' is considered ______ because it doesn't indicate whether something is masculine or feminine. Unlike pronouns such as 'he' or 'she', it applies to objects without gender.","translation":"在語法中，單詞「it」被認為是中性的，因為它不表示某物是陽性還是陰性。與「he」或「she」等代詞不同，它適用於沒有性別的對象。","word":"neuter"}},"neutral":{"createdAt":1781616877017,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"neutral 形容詞表示「中立的、不偏袒的」，指不支持任何一方或不表示個人意見。","options":["biased","neutral","partisan","hostile"],"sentence":"The mediator remained ______ throughout the dispute to ensure a fair outcome. He did not favor either side and listened to both parties equally.","translation":"調解人在整個紛爭中保持中立以確保公平的結果。他沒有偏袒任何一方，並平等地傾聽雙方的意見。","word":"neutral"}},"nevertheless":{"createdAt":1783870466422,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"nevertheless 是連接詞，表示「儘管如此」或「然而」，用於引出與前句相反或相對的陳述。","options":["therefore","consequently","nevertheless","thus"],"sentence":"The weather forecast predicted heavy rain for the entire weekend; ______, the family decided to proceed with their outdoor picnic. They packed umbrellas and rain gear, determined not to let the forecast ruin their plans.","translation":"天氣預報預測整個週末都會下大雨；儘管如此，這個家庭決定繼續進行他們的戶外野餐。他們打包了傘和雨具，決心不讓天氣預報毀掉他們的計劃。","word":"nevertheless"}},"nightmare":{"createdAt":1782491138497,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"nightmare 表示一個令人害怕或不愉快的夢，通常會使人在睡眠中感到恐懼或驚恐。","options":["investigation","nightmare","mischievous","dividend"],"sentence":"She woke up in a cold sweat from a terrible ______ in which she was being chased by unknown shadows. Her heart was still racing, and it took her several minutes to realize it had only been a dream.","translation":"她在一個可怕的惡夢中冷汗驚醒，夢中她被未知的影子追趕。她的心臟仍在劇烈跳動，花了幾分鐘才意識到這只是一個夢。","word":"nightmare"}},"nobility":{"createdAt":1781268630489,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"nobility指的是高尚或崇高的品質，表示道德上的優越性和尊嚴。","options":["wealth","nobility","strength","intelligence"],"sentence":"The prince was admired for his ______ and generous spirit toward the poor. His kindness and selflessness set him apart from others.","translation":"王子因其對貧困者的高尚和慷慨精神而受到敬佩。他的善良和無私使他與眾不同。","word":"nobility"}},"noble":{"createdAt":1781616876961,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"noble 形容詞表示「高貴的、貴族的」，指具有高尚品質或來自貴族階級的人或事物。","options":["poor","noble","common","wealthy"],"sentence":"The ______ family ruled the kingdom with honor and grace. They were respected throughout the land for their dignified conduct and high moral standards.","translation":"那個貴族家族以榮譽和優雅統治王國。他們因為舉止莊重和高尚的道德標準而在全國受到尊敬。","word":"noble"}},"nominate":{"createdAt":1781616919427,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"提名是指正式推薦某人參選或擔任某個職位。","options":["elect","nominate","dismiss","interview"],"sentence":"The board will ______ three directors at the next annual meeting. The shareholders have the right to officially propose their preferred candidates.","translation":"董事會將在下次年會上提名三名董事。股東有權正式提議他們偏好的候選人。","word":"nominate"}},"nomination":{"createdAt":1781616919427,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"提名是指正式推薦或指定某人參與評選或擔任職位的行為。","options":["rejection","nomination","approval","interview"],"sentence":"The award committee announced the ______ of five candidates for the scholarship. Each person had been formally proposed by their school.","translation":"獎學金委員會宣布了五名候選人的提名。每個人都已被其學校正式提議。","word":"nomination"}},"nominator":{"createdAt":1781616877018,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"nominator 名詞表示「提名者」，指提出某人為候選人或為某人爭取職位或榮譽的人。","options":["recipient","nominator","judge","spectator"],"sentence":"The ______ submitted her name for the awards ceremony, believing she deserved recognition. Her contribution to the organization had been exceptional.","translation":"提名者為她提交了獲獎典禮的名字，認為她值得認可。她對組織的貢獻非常卓越。","word":"nominator"}},"nominee":{"createdAt":1781616919429,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"被提名者是指被正式推薦或指定參與評選的人。","options":["judge","nominee","winner","host"],"sentence":"The ______ for Best Actor will attend the awards ceremony next week. This person has been officially selected to compete for the prize.","translation":"最佳男演員的被提名者將在下週參加頒獎典禮。這個人已被正式選中參與比賽。","word":"nominee"}},"nonprofit":{"createdAt":1783227469036,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"nonprofit是指以慈善或服務目的運營而非以營利為目標的組織或機構，所有利潤都用於支持其使命。","options":["commercial","nonprofit","private","government"],"sentence":"The organization operates as a ______ institution dedicated to providing free education to underprivileged children. All donations and revenue are reinvested into their programs rather than distributed as profits to shareholders.","translation":"該組織作為一個非營利機構運營，致力於為弱勢兒童提供免費教育。所有捐款和收入都被重新投資到他們的計劃中，而不是作為利潤分配給股東。","word":"nonprofit"}},"nonsense":{"createdAt":1787049756212,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"nonsense是指荒唐、不合理或毫無意義的言論。","options":["wisdom","nonsense","evidence","truth"],"sentence":"The politician's speech was full of ______ that made no logical sense. Fact-checkers immediately debunked every claim he made.","translation":"這位政治家的演講充滿了毫無邏輯意義的胡言亂語。事實查證者立即駁斥了他所有的主張。","word":"nonsense"}},"norm":{"createdAt":1781256444513,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"norm指廣泛接受的規範或標準，是社會中普遍遵循的行為準則。","options":["greeting","norm","habit","tradition"],"sentence":"In many Western countries, shaking hands is considered a social ______ when meeting someone. However, in some Asian cultures, bowing or nodding is the expected standard instead.","translation":"在許多西方國家，握手被認為是見面時的社交規範。然而，在一些亞洲文化中，鞠躬或點頭是預期的標準。","word":"norm"}},"normal":{"createdAt":1781428458258,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"normal指符合預期或通常的狀態，不異常不特殊。","options":["superstitious","normal","crisis","confidence"],"sentence":"After three weeks of heavy rain, the weather finally returned to ______ conditions. The sun came out and temperatures were back to what we usually see in this season.","translation":"經過三週的暴雨後，天氣終於恢復到正常狀況。太陽出來了，溫度回到了本季通常的水平。","word":"normal"}},"nose":{"createdAt":1784899764062,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"nose是臉部用來呼吸和嗅覺的器官，位於兩眼之間。","options":["mouth","nose","ear","paw"],"sentence":"The dog's ______ twitched as it smelled the food cooking. This sensitive body part allows the animal to track scents from far away.","translation":"當聞到烹飪的食物氣味時，狗的鼻子抽動了。這個敏感的身體部位使動物能夠從遠處追蹤氣味。","word":"nose"}},"nostril":{"createdAt":1781616877018,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"nostril 名詞表示「鼻孔」，指鼻子的開口，通過它呼吸和聞氣味。","options":["ear","nostril","mouth","eye"],"sentence":"When she breathed in the spicy aroma, her ______ flared slightly in response. The scent traveled through her nasal passage.","translation":"當她吸入辛辣的香氣時，她的鼻孔略微擴張。氣味通過她的鼻腔。","word":"nostril"}},"notable":{"createdAt":1781616876984,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"notable 形容詞表示「顯著的、值得注意的」，指因為重要性或優秀品質而受到關注的人或事物。","options":["unknown","notable","amateur","inexperienced"],"sentence":"The conference featured ______ speakers from the field of environmental science. Their groundbreaking research and innovative ideas impressed the entire audience.","translation":"會議邀請了環境科學領域的杰出講者。他們的開創性研究和創新想法給全體觀眾留下了深刻印象。","word":"notable"}},"noted":{"createdAt":1781616876982,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"noted 形容詞表示「著名的、被注意到的」，指因為成就或特點而受到認可的人或事物。","options":["unknown","noted","unsuccessful","retired"],"sentence":"The ______ surgeon had performed thousands of successful operations in his career. His reputation for excellence attracted patients from around the world.","translation":"這位著名的外科醫生在他的職業生涯中進行了數千次成功的手術。他卓越的聲譽吸引了來自世界各地的患者。","word":"noted"}},"noticeable":{"createdAt":1781583174627,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"noticeable意指明顯的、容易看出的，通常指某物的改變或差異足夠大而引人注目","options":["invisible","questionable","noticeable","temporary"],"sentence":"There was a ______ improvement in Sarah's exam scores this semester. Her hard work and extra study sessions clearly paid off with results that jumped from 65% to 92%.","translation":"莎拉本學期的考試成績有____的進步。她的努力和額外學習課程顯然得到了回報，成績從65%跳升至92%。","word":"noticeable"}},"notify":{"createdAt":1781616919431,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"通知是指向某人傳達信息或告知某事的行為。","options":["ignore","notify","cancel","guarantee"],"sentence":"The airline will ______ all passengers about the flight delay immediately. A text message and email will be sent to confirm the change.","translation":"航空公司將立即通知所有乘客航班延誤。將發送文本消息和電子郵件以確認該變更。","word":"notify"}},"notion":{"createdAt":1781616919430,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"想法或概念是指心中產生的一種想像或信念。","options":["proof","notion","fact","law"],"sentence":"She had a strange ______ that talking to plants would make them grow faster. Her idea seemed illogical to most gardeners.","translation":"她有一個奇怪的想法，認為跟植物說話會讓它們長得更快。她的想法對大多數園丁來說似乎不合邏輯。","word":"notion"}},"notorious":{"createdAt":1786017950559,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"notorious 指因為負面的原因而廣為人知、臭名昭著，通常用於描述臭名遠揚的人物或事件。","options":["generous","notorious","mysterious","talented"],"sentence":"The drug lord became ______ for his violent crimes and international smuggling operations. Law enforcement agencies across multiple countries recognized his name immediately because of his widespread infamy.","translation":"這名毒梟因其暴力犯罪和國際走私活動而臭名昭著。多個國家的執法機構因為他廣為人知的惡名而立即認出他的名字。","word":"notorious"}},"nourish":{"createdAt":1781616876970,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"nourish 動詞表示「滋養、供養」，指通過食物或其他方式提供營養和支持。","options":["harm","nourish","weaken","injure"],"sentence":"A healthy diet can ______ your body and strengthen your immune system. Foods rich in vitamins and minerals are essential for maintaining wellness.","translation":"健康的飲食可以滋養你的身體並增強免疫系統。富含維生素和礦物質的食物對維持健康至關重要。","word":"nourish"}},"nourishing":{"createdAt":1781840030396,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"nourishing 是形容詞，表示滋養的、滋補的；與「幫助患者恢復」和「醫生推薦」的背景相配合。","options":["spoiled","nourishing","cold","spicy"],"sentence":"The ______ soup made with fresh vegetables and lean protein helped the patient recover quickly. The doctor recommended eating this type of meal every day for optimal health.","translation":"用新鮮蔬菜和瘦肉蛋白製成的滋養湯幫助患者迅速康復。醫生建議每天食用這類飲食以獲得最佳健康狀況。","word":"nourishing"}},"novel":{"createdAt":1781616919426,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"新穎的是指前所未有的、新鮮的、令人眼目一新的。","options":["traditional","complex","novel","popular"],"sentence":"The scientist presented a ______ approach to solving the climate crisis. Her innovative method had never been attempted before in the field.","translation":"這位科學家提出了解決氣候危機的新穎方法。她的創新方法在該領域以前從未被嘗試過。","word":"novel"}},"novelist":{"createdAt":1781616876973,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"novelist 名詞表示「小說家」，指專門創作小說的作家。","options":["musician","actress","novelist","chef"],"sentence":"The famous ______ spent ten years writing her award-winning novel. Her name appeared on bestseller lists for months after its publication.","translation":"這位著名小說家花了十年時間寫她獲獎的小說。出版後，她的名字在暢銷書排行榜上出現了幾個月。","word":"novelist"}},"novelty":{"createdAt":1781616919431,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"新穎或新奇是指事物初次出現時引起人們興趣和驚奇的特性。","options":["price","reliability","novelty","quality"],"sentence":"The ______ of the new smartphone wore off after a few months. Once people got used to it, they no longer found it exciting.","translation":"新智能手機的新穎性在幾個月後消退了。一旦人們習慣了它，他們就不再覺得它令人興奮。","word":"novelty"}},"novice":{"createdAt":1781616877016,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"novice 名詞表示「新手、初學者」，指剛開始學習或從事某項活動的人。","options":["champion","novice","expert","professional"],"sentence":"As a ______ in the sport, he made many mistakes during his first competition. More experienced athletes offered him advice and encouragement.","translation":"作為這項運動的初學者，他在第一次比賽中犯了許多錯誤。更有經驗的運動員向他提供了建議和鼓勵。","word":"novice"}},"nuclear":{"createdAt":1781616876976,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"nuclear 形容詞表示「核子的、原子核的」，常用來描述與核能相關的事物。","options":["solar","wind","nuclear","fossil"],"sentence":"The country invested billions in ______ energy to reduce carbon emissions. Scientists believe this power source is crucial for sustainable development.","translation":"該國投入數十億美元於核能，以減少碳排放。科學家認為這種電力來源對可持續發展至關重要。","word":"nuclear"}},"nucleus":{"createdAt":1781616919433,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"核是指原子中心的構成部分，或細胞中心含有遺傳信息的結構。","options":["shell","nucleus","electron","orbit"],"sentence":"The ______ of an atom contains protons and neutrons. Scientists use microscopes to study this tiny central structure.","translation":"原子的核由質子和中子組成。科學家使用顯微鏡研究這個微小的中心結構。","word":"nucleus"}},"nude":{"createdAt":1781616876984,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"nude 形容詞表示「裸體的、一絲不掛的」，在藝術語境中指沒有穿衣服的人體。","options":["clothed","dressed","nude","armored"],"sentence":"The artist painted the model in a ______ pose to capture the natural beauty of the human form. The classical sculpture in the museum displayed similar artistic expression.","translation":"藝術家以裸體姿勢繪製模特兒，以捕捉人類形態的自然美。博物館中的古典雕塑展現了相似的藝術表現。","word":"nude"}},"null":{"createdAt":1783489104906,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"null表示無效的、零值的或空的，在法律和計算機科學中常用來表示某物缺乏法律效力或不存在。","options":["binding","null","provisional","temporary"],"sentence":"The contract was declared ______ because one party had signed under duress. All terms and agreements were rendered invalid and unenforceable.","translation":"由於一方在脅迫下簽署，合同被宣佈無效。所有條款和協議均被宣佈無效且不可強制執行。","word":"null"}},"numb":{"createdAt":1781616876968,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"numb 形容詞表示「麻木的、沒感覺的」，指失去知覺或感覺遲鈍。","options":["warm","numb","painful","tense"],"sentence":"After the dentist injected anesthetic, his fingers felt completely ______. He could not feel the sensation of touch on his hand for several hours.","translation":"牙醫注射麻醉劑後，他的手指感到完全麻木。他好幾小時內無法感受到手上的觸覺。","word":"numb"}},"numerous":{"createdAt":1781616877016,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"numerous 形容詞表示「眾多的、許多的」，指數量很大的人或物。","options":["rare","numerous","occasional","minimal"],"sentence":"The city experienced ______ earthquakes throughout the year, causing concern among residents. Seismic activity was recorded almost every week.","translation":"該市全年經歷了許多地震，引起居民的擔憂。幾乎每週都錄製到地震活動。","word":"numerous"}},"nursery":{"createdAt":1781616876981,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"nursery 名詞表示「幼兒園、託兒所、育兒室」，指照顧和教育年幼孩子的地方。","options":["office","hospital","nursery","warehouse"],"sentence":"The ______ was decorated with colorful murals and soft toys for the infants. Parents left their babies there during working hours.","translation":"託兒所用彩色壁畫和軟玩具裝飾，供嬰兒使用。父母在工作時間將嬰兒留在那裡。","word":"nursery"}},"nurture":{"createdAt":1781616876969,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"nurture 名詞表示「養育、教養、培養」，指照顧和教導某人的過程。","options":["punishment","neglect","restriction","nurture"],"sentence":"Good parental ______ is essential for a child's development. Parents provide love, care, and education to help their children grow into healthy adults.","translation":"良好的父母養育對孩子的發展至關重要。父母提供愛、照顧和教育來幫助孩子成長為健康的成年人。","word":"nurture"}},"nutrient":{"createdAt":1781616919430,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"養分或營養物是指食物中對身體有益的化學物質，如維生素、礦物質等。","options":["ingredient","nutrient","poison","flavor"],"sentence":"Calcium is an essential ______ that strengthens bones and teeth. This mineral must be consumed regularly through dairy products or supplements.","translation":"鈣是一種必要的營養物質，可以強化骨骼和牙齒。這種礦物質必須通過乳製品或補充劑定期攝入。","word":"nutrient"}},"nutrition":{"createdAt":1781616919424,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"營養是指食物中對身體有益的物質，包括維生素、礦物質等養分。","options":["exercise","nutrition","entertainment","decoration"],"sentence":"A balanced diet provides essential ______ for growth and development. The vitamins, minerals, and proteins in food support our body's functions.","translation":"均衡的飲食為成長和發展提供必要的營養。食物中的維生素、礦物質和蛋白質支持我們身體的功能。","word":"nutrition"}},"nutritional":{"createdAt":1781564440930,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"nutritional 作形容詞表示營養的，指與營養價值或成分相關的。","options":["monetary","nutritional","visual","chemical"],"sentence":"The ______ value of this food is quite high with lots of vitamins and minerals. It provides essential nutrients that support good health and body development.","translation":"這種食物的營養價值相當高，含有大量的維生素和礦物質。它提供支持健康和身體發育的必要營養。","word":"nutritional"}},"nutritionist":{"createdAt":1781616876975,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"nutritionist 名詞表示「營養學家」，指研究和提供營養飲食建議的專家。","options":["trainer","nutritionist","doctor","chef"],"sentence":"The ______ advised her client to increase protein intake and reduce sugar consumption. Professional dietary guidance helped the patient achieve her weight loss goals.","translation":"營養學家建議她的客戶增加蛋白質攝入並減少糖分攝入。專業的飲食指導幫助患者實現了她的減肥目標。","word":"nutritionist"}},"nutritious":{"createdAt":1781838276304,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"nutritious作為形容詞表示食物富有營養、有益於健康。","options":["compressed","individual","nutritious","standing"],"sentence":"The doctor recommended eating more ______ foods to improve your health. She specifically suggested adding leafy greens, whole grains, and lean proteins to your daily diet.","translation":"醫生建議吃更多富有營養的食物來改善你的健康。她特別建議在你的日常飲食中增加葉菜、全穀物和瘦肉蛋白。","word":"nutritious"}},"oasis":{"createdAt":1784294243297,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"綠洲是沙漠中因有水源而形成的植被茂密的地方，提供了一個對旅行者來說至關重要的棲息地。","options":["mirage","oasis","canyon","plateau"],"sentence":"After days of crossing the hot desert, the travelers finally discovered a small ______ where they could find fresh water and shade. The lush vegetation and natural spring surrounded by sand dunes made it the perfect place to rest and refill their supplies.","translation":"在穿過炎熱的沙漠數天後，旅行者終於發現了一個小綠洲，在那裡他們可以找到淡水和樹蔭。被沙丘包圍的蒼翠植被和天然泉水使其成為休息和補充物資的完美地點。","word":"oasis"}},"oath":{"createdAt":1783905256085,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"oath 是在法律或宗教場合正式發誓或誓約的行為，通常涉及莊嚴的承諾和法律後果。","options":["promise","oath","statement","declaration"],"sentence":"The witness raised her hand and took a solemn ______ before testifying in court. She promised to tell the truth, the whole truth, and nothing but the truth.","translation":"證人舉起手，在法庭上進行了莊嚴的誓言。她承諾會說出真實、完整的事實，不隱瞞任何事情。","word":"oath"}},"obedience":{"createdAt":1781746685511,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"obedience指的是順從、服從，表示願意遵守規則或聽從他人的指示。","options":["rubbish","obedience","consequence","sober"],"sentence":"The dog trainer rewarded the puppy for its ______ when it followed commands. The animal consistently responded to every instruction without hesitation or resistance.","translation":"訓犬師獎勵小狗的順從，因為它遵循了命令。這隻動物始終迅速回應每個指令，沒有猶豫或抵抗。","word":"obedience"}},"obedient":{"createdAt":1784193612993,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"obedient意思是順從的、孝順的，形容一個人願意聽從並遵守他人的命令或指示。","options":["curious","playful","obedient","clever"],"sentence":"The young child was very ______ and always listened to his parents' instructions without complaining. His parents rarely had to repeat themselves because he followed their guidance immediately.","translation":"這個小孩非常順從，總是不抱怨地聽從父母的指示。他的父母很少需要重複自己的話，因為他立即遵循他們的指導。","word":"obedient"}},"obediently":{"createdAt":1783262131289,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"obediently表示順從地、恭順地執行命令或指示，沒有反抗或懷疑。","options":["reluctantly","obediently","defiantly","carelessly"],"sentence":"The dog followed the trainer's commands ______ during the competition. Every instruction was executed perfectly without any hesitation or resistance.","translation":"那隻狗在比賽期間順從地跟隨訓練員的命令。每項指令都完美執行，沒有任何猶豫或抵抗。","word":"obediently"}},"obey":{"createdAt":1781773623458,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"obey作為動詞表示「服從」或「順從」，強調對權威人物或規則的遵從行為。","options":["follow","obey","listen","respect"],"sentence":"The soldiers were trained to ______ their commanding officers without question. When the general gave an order, every soldier immediately followed it without hesitation.","translation":"士兵被訓練無條件地服從他們的指揮官。當將軍下達命令時，每個士兵都立即毫不遲疑地執行。","word":"obey"}},"object":{"createdAt":1781849847401,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"object作為名詞表示物體或實物，與「可以看到和欣賞設計」的線索相符。","options":["concept","object","idea","thought"],"sentence":"The ______ on the table was made of pure silver. Everyone admired its beautiful craftsmanship and intricate design.","translation":"桌子上的物體是用純銀製成的。每個人都讚美它美麗的工藝和複雜的設計。","word":"object"}},"objection":{"createdAt":1781429810264,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"objection是指對某事的不同意或反對意見，通常在討論或決策中表達。","options":["disappearance","firecracker","objection","rite"],"sentence":"Several committee members raised an ______ to the new proposal during the meeting. Despite their concerns about cost and feasibility, the vote proceeded as scheduled.","translation":"在會議期間，幾位委員會成員對新提案提出了反對。儘管他們對成本和可行性有顧慮，投票仍按計劃進行。","word":"objection"}},"objective":{"createdAt":1783476327933,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"objective 是形容詞，意為客觀的、不帶感情的，強調基於事實而非個人觀點或感受。","options":["objective","passionate","emotional","prejudiced"],"sentence":"The scientist approached the research with an ______ mindset, carefully collecting data without personal bias. Her commitment to factual evidence and impartial analysis earned her respect in the academic community.","translation":"這位科學家以客觀的態度進行研究，小心翼翼地收集數據而不帶個人偏見。她對事實證據和公正分析的承諾在學術界中贏得了尊重。","word":"objective"}},"obligation":{"createdAt":1784205349798,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"obligation 是指必須履行的責任或法律上的要求，特別是在有外在期望或法律約束的情況下。","options":["privilege","obligation","opportunity","encouragement"],"sentence":"As a student, you have an ______ to complete your assignments before the deadline. Your parents and teachers expect you to fulfill this responsibility without being reminded.","translation":"作為一名學生，你有義務在截止日期前完成你的作業。你的父母和老師期望你在沒有提醒的情況下履行這項責任。","word":"obligation"}},"obligatory":{"createdAt":1781738392787,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"「obligatory」表示必須做的、義務性的，與「mandatory」和「requires」等詞語的意思相符，指必須完成的要求。","options":["tedium","trophy","obligatory","offense"],"sentence":"Attending the mandatory safety training is ______ for all new employees. The company requires every person to complete it before starting work.","translation":"參加強制性安全培訓對所有新員工是義務的。公司要求每個人在開始工作前完成它。","word":"obligatory"}},"oblige":{"createdAt":1784451184439,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"oblige 表示「使感激」或「提供幫助」，強調通過友善的行為讓他人感到被關照或感激。","options":["ignore","oblige","restrict","charge"],"sentence":"The hotel staff always ______ guests by providing extra pillows and arranging late check-outs. Their willingness to help made the guests feel genuinely appreciated.","translation":"飯店員工總是通過提供額外枕頭和安排延遲退房來使客人感激。他們的幫助意願使客人感到真正被欣賞。","word":"oblige"}},"obliged":{"createdAt":1784711302803,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"obliged表示因為受到恩惠或道德責任而感到必須要做某事的感覺。","options":["grateful","obliged","surprised","reluctant"],"sentence":"I felt ______ to help my neighbor carry her groceries after she had helped me move last month. Her kindness created a debt of gratitude that I felt compelled to repay.","translation":"在她上個月幫助我搬家後，我感到有義務幫助我的鄰居提雜貨。她的善良製造了一種感恩的債務，我覺得有責任要回報。","word":"obliged"}},"obscene":{"createdAt":1787049198634,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"obscene形容下流的、淫穢的或令人厭惡的內容，通常涉及性或暴力的不當表達。","options":["poetic","elegant","obscene","subtle"],"sentence":"The film contained ______ language and explicit scenes that were unsuitable for children. The rating board gave it an adults-only classification.","translation":"這部電影包含淫穢的語言和不適合兒童觀看的露骨場景。評級委員會將其列為成人專看的分類。","word":"obscene"}},"obscure":{"createdAt":1788133134306,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"obscure 在此處作為形容詞，表示某人或某物鮮為人知、默默無聞，未受到廣泛認可或注意。","options":["famous","obscure","talented","prolific"],"sentence":"The ______ artist never achieved fame during her lifetime, despite creating beautiful paintings. Art historians only discovered her work decades after her death, recognizing her as a hidden genius.","translation":"這位無名的藝術家在有生之年從未成名，儘管她創作了美麗的繪畫。藝術史學家在她去世幾十年後才發現了她的作品，並認出她是一位隱藏的天才。","word":"obscure"}},"observance":{"createdAt":1783667392055,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"observance 意指遵守規則、法律或習慣的行為，強調按照規定行動。","options":["violation","observance","discussion","consideration"],"sentence":"The ______ of traffic laws is essential for road safety. Drivers must follow speed limits and stop signs every time they operate a vehicle.","translation":"遵守交通法規對道路安全至關重要。駕駛人每次操作車輛時都必須遵守速度限制和停止標誌。","word":"observance"}},"observant":{"createdAt":1781485266372,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"observant形容詞表示擁有敏銳的觀察力，能注意到細微的細節和變化。","options":["careless","inattentive","observant","negligent"],"sentence":"The ______ detective noticed tiny scratches on the lock that others had completely missed. His ability to spot small details made him invaluable in solving complex cases.","translation":"這位觀察敏銳的偵探注意到了其他人完全忽視的鎖上微小的刮痕。他發現細節的能力使他在解決複雜案件時無價之寶。","word":"observant"}},"observation":{"createdAt":1781709984194,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"observation 在科學語境中表示通過觀看和記錄來收集信息的過程。","options":["hypothesis","observation","theory","prediction"],"sentence":"Based on careful ______ of the experiment, the scientist noticed that temperature affected the reaction speed. She documented every detail she saw over three months.","translation":"根據對實驗的仔細觀察，科學家注意到溫度影響反應速度。她記錄了三個月內看到的每一個細節。","word":"observation"}},"observatory":{"createdAt":1785406508861,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"observatory 是指專門用來進行天文觀測和研究天體現象的建築物或機構。","options":["laboratory","observatory","museum","library"],"sentence":"The scientists built a new ______ on top of the mountain to study celestial bodies. The facility was equipped with powerful telescopes and instruments designed to track stars and planets in the night sky.","translation":"科學家在山頂上建造了一個新的天文臺來研究天體。該設施配備了強大的望遠鏡和儀器，用於追蹤夜空中的恆星和行星。","word":"observatory"}},"observe":{"createdAt":1781364476362,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"Observe意指仔細地注視或研究某事物，通常是為了收集信息或進行科學研究。","options":["ignore","celebrate","observe","criticize"],"sentence":"The scientist decided to ______ the behavior of the penguins in their natural habitat for several weeks. She took detailed notes on how they hunted, played, and interacted with each other throughout each day.","translation":"科學家決定在企鵝的自然棲息地觀察牠們的行為，為期數週。她詳細記錄了牠們如何捕獵、嬉戲以及每天彼此互動的方式。","word":"observe"}},"observer":{"createdAt":1781664082522,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"observer 是指觀察者或觀察家，指看著某事發生但不直接參與的人。","options":["participant","observer","conductor","inventor"],"sentence":"As a keen ______, the scientist carefully watched the experiment unfold without participating. Her detailed notes recorded every change that occurred during the procedure.","translation":"作為一名敏銳的觀察者，科學家仔細觀察實驗進行，但不參與其中。她詳細的筆記記錄了過程中發生的每一項變化。","word":"observer"}},"obsess":{"createdAt":1783759528319,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"obsess 表示「使縈繞、纏住、沉迷於」，指一個人被某個想法或事物持續佔據心思，無法擺脫。","options":["relax","celebrate","obsess","ignore"],"sentence":"She began to ______ over every detail of the wedding plan, thinking about it day and night. Her constant worry and preoccupation had started to affect her sleep and daily life.","translation":"她開始沉迷於婚禮計畫的每個細節，日夜不停地想著它。她持續的擔憂和執著已經開始影響她的睡眠和日常生活。","word":"obsess"}},"obsessed":{"createdAt":1781849847404,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"obsessed表示對某事物執著或沉迷，與「花費大量時間和金錢」的線索相符。","options":["indifferent","obsessed","bored","uninterested"],"sentence":"He became completely ______ with collecting vintage stamps. He spent all his free time and money searching for rare editions.","translation":"他完全沉迷於收集古董郵票。他花費所有的空閒時間和金錢尋找稀有版本。","word":"obsessed"}},"obsession":{"createdAt":1781709890952,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"obsession指的是對某事物強烈而持久的執著或著迷，常常影響一個人的日常生活和決定。","options":["hesitation","obsession","implication","hazard"],"sentence":"Her ______ with collecting vintage stamps has consumed most of her free time and money. She spends every weekend at antique markets searching for rare editions to add to her collection.","translation":"她對收集古董郵票的執念佔據了她大部分的空閒時間和金錢。她每個週末都在古董市場尋找罕見版本來加入她的收藏。","word":"obsession"}},"obsolete":{"createdAt":1789363793858,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"obsolete 形容已過時的、不再使用的或被新事物取代的事物。","options":["innovative","modern","obsolete","essential"],"sentence":"Many consider typewriters to be ______ technology in the age of computers and smartphones. Manufacturers have stopped producing them because few people want to use them anymore.","translation":"在電腦和智能手機的時代，許多人認為打字機是已過時的技術。製造商已停止生產它們，因為很少有人想使用它們。","word":"obsolete"}},"obstacle":{"createdAt":1782646561677,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"obstacle 表示阻礙進展或成功的困難或阻礙物，第二句說明資金不足阻止了團隊購買設備。","options":["solution","obstacle","opportunity","advantage"],"sentence":"The main ______ to completing the project on time was the lack of funding. Without sufficient resources, the team could not purchase the necessary equipment.","translation":"按時完成項目的主要障礙是缺乏資金。沒有充足的資源，團隊無法購買必要的設備。","word":"obstacle"}},"obstinate":{"createdAt":1782644423629,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"obstinate是形容詞，意為固執的、倔強的，形容一個人頑固地堅持自己的觀點而不願改變。","options":["flexible","obstinate","reasonable","agreeable"],"sentence":"The ______ old man refused to change his mind about moving to a new house despite everyone's persuasion. No amount of reasoning could convince him to reconsider his position.","translation":"儘管每個人都勸阻，這位固執的老人仍然拒絕改變關於搬到新房子的想法。沒有任何推理能夠說服他重新考慮他的立場。","word":"obstinate"}},"obstruct":{"createdAt":1787306201438,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"obstruct 是動詞，意思是阻礙或堵塞，通常用於描述某物阻擋或妨礙通道、視線或進展。","options":["clarify","obstruct","accelerate","illuminate"],"sentence":"The fallen tree began to ______ the narrow mountain road, making it impossible for vehicles to pass through. Emergency crews had to arrive quickly to remove the debris before traffic was completely blocked.","translation":"倒下的樹開始阻礙狹窄的山路，使車輛無法通行。緊急救援隊必須迅速趕到，在交通完全受阻前移除碎片。","word":"obstruct"}},"obtain":{"createdAt":1783468712841,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"獲得（obtain）意為通過努力或請求而得到某物，在這裡指成功獲得獎學金。","options":["lose","obtain","reject","ignore"],"sentence":"She worked hard to ______ a scholarship for university. After months of applications and interviews, she finally received the letter of acceptance.","translation":"她努力工作以獲得大學獎學金。經過數月的申請和面試，她終於收到了錄取通知書。","word":"obtain"}},"obvious":{"createdAt":1781345746904,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"obvious 作形容詞，表示明顯的、顯而易見的，無需解釋或證明。","options":["hidden","obvious","uncertain","debatable"],"sentence":"It was ______ to everyone that the experiment had failed from the start. The data clearly showed that none of the results matched the predicted outcomes.","translation":"每個人都很明顯地看出實驗從一開始就失敗了。數據清楚地表明，沒有任何結果與預測的結果相符。","word":"obvious"}},"obviously":{"createdAt":1781664082525,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"obviously 是副詞，表示明顯地、顯然地或易於看出的。","options":["subtly","obviously","possibly","hardly"],"sentence":"The student was ______ unprepared for the final exam, as evidenced by his poor performance. He had not studied any of the material and struggled with even the simplest questions.","translation":"這名學生顯然沒有為期末考試做準備，他的糟糕表現證明了這一點。他沒有學習任何材料，甚至在最簡單的問題上也遇到了困難。","word":"obviously"}},"occasion":{"createdAt":1781864339048,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"occasion用來表示特定的時間或事件，特別是重要或特殊的場合。","options":["event","occasion","moment","chance"],"sentence":"We should dress formally for this important ______. My cousin is getting married next Saturday, and we want to look our best.","translation":"我們應該在這個重要的場合穿著正式。我的表弟下個星期六要結婚了，我們想要看起來最好。","word":"occasion"}},"occasional":{"createdAt":1781951900950,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"occasional表示不經常發生或只在某些時候發生，與「每天」的習慣相對立。","options":["constant","occasional","regular","daily"],"sentence":"My grandfather drinks coffee only on ______ mornings, not every single day. He usually prefers tea with his breakfast.","translation":"我的祖父只在偶爾的早晨喝咖啡，而不是每天都喝。他通常喜歡用茶來搭配早餐。","word":"occasional"}},"occasionally":{"createdAt":1781402539334,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"occasionally 表示不經常發生，只是在某些特殊或不規則的時間發生某事。","options":["always","occasionally","never","frequently"],"sentence":"She ______ visits her grandmother on weekends. Most weeks she stays home, but perhaps once a month she makes the trip.","translation":"她偶爾在週末拜訪她的祖母。大多數週她待在家裡，但也許一個月一次她會進行這次旅行。","word":"occasionally"}},"occupation":{"createdAt":1782101579241,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"occupation 指的是一個人從事的職業或工作，通常是長期的職業活動，而非短期的興趣或休閒活動。","options":["hobby","occupation","location","vacation"],"sentence":"Her primary ______ is software engineering, which requires strong problem-solving skills. She has been working in this field for over ten years and has become an expert in her domain.","translation":"她的主要職業是軟體工程，需要強大的問題解決能力。她在這個領域工作了十多年，已成為該領域的專家。","word":"occupation"}},"occupied":{"createdAt":1782292175217,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"occupied 作為形容詞表示被佔用或被占據，也可表示忙碌的狀態。","options":["motive","cement","occupied","momentum"],"sentence":"The conference room was ______ by the marketing team during their important presentation. Since they were busy discussing the quarterly strategy, no one else could use the space that afternoon.","translation":"會議室被行銷團隊在他們重要的演講期間佔用了。由於他們忙著討論季度策略，那天下午沒有其他人可以使用這個空間。","word":"occupied"}},"occupy":{"createdAt":1783260805488,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"occupy在這裡表示「占領」，指用武力控制或佔據一個地方。","options":["abandon","occupy","survey","defend"],"sentence":"The military forces began to ______ the disputed territory after crossing the border. Local residents were required to evacuate from their homes as the new government took control.","translation":"軍隊越過邊界後開始占領有爭議的領土。當新政府接管時，當地居民被要求撤離他們的家園。","word":"occupy"}},"occur":{"createdAt":1781831848726,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"occur 是動詞，表示「發生」，通常用於描述事件或情況的發生。","options":["appears","happens","occur","exists"],"sentence":"An accident ______ on the highway yesterday evening. The police arrived within minutes to help the injured drivers.","translation":"昨晚在高速公路上發生了一場事故。警察在幾分鐘內趕到協助受傷的駕駛人。","word":"occur"}},"occurrence":{"createdAt":1781359980245,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"occurrence指某事發生、出現或遭遇的現象；強調事件或事物發生的頻率或次數。","options":["prediction","prevention","occurrence","documentation"],"sentence":"The ______ of earthquakes in this region has increased significantly over the past decade. Local authorities recorded more than twenty tremors last year alone.","translation":"這個地區地震的發生頻率在過去十年大幅增加。當地當局去年單獨記錄了二十多次震動。","word":"occurrence"}},"odd":{"createdAt":1781860901461,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"odd表示古怪的、異常的，用來形容不符合常理或出人意料的事物","options":["common","odd","expected","normal"],"sentence":"It was quite ______ that he arrived at the party wearing pajamas. Everyone else was dressed formally, making his choice seem very unusual.","translation":"他穿著睡衣來到派對是相當古怪的。每個人都穿著正式服裝，使他的選擇顯得非常不尋常。","word":"odd"}},"odor":{"createdAt":1781746848187,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"odor 表示「氣味」或「臭味」，指通過嗅覺感受到的氣體或香氣。","options":["sight","sound","odor","taste"],"sentence":"The ______ coming from the garbage bin was absolutely unbearable in the hot summer heat. The janitor quickly replaced the trash and cleaned the area thoroughly.","translation":"在炎熱的夏天，來自垃圾桶的臭味是完全無法忍受的。清潔工迅速更換了垃圾並徹底清潔了該區域。","word":"odor"}},"offend":{"createdAt":1782274431081,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"offend 表示傷害他人的感受或讓人生氣，在這個語境中與「傷害你的感受」的後文相符，其他選項都與傷害他人感受的含義相反。","options":["help","offend","encourage","support"],"sentence":"I didn't mean to ______ you with my comment about your presentation. I apologize sincerely, as I can see that my words have hurt your feelings.","translation":"我不是故意用關於你的演講的評論來冒犯你。我真誠地道歉，因為我看到我的話傷害了你的感受。","word":"offend"}},"offended":{"createdAt":1781434900591,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"offended表示感到不快、傷害或被冒犯的狀態。","options":["pleased","offended","amused","inspired"],"sentence":"She felt ______ by his rude comments about her appearance during the meeting. His words hurt her feelings and she refused to speak to him for days.","translation":"她對他在會議上關於她外貌的粗魯評論感到被冒犯。他的言語傷害了她的感情，她拒絕與他交談了好幾天。","word":"offended"}},"offense":{"createdAt":1781738392785,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「take offense」是常見的片語，表示對某人的言論或行為感到冒犯或被冒犯，符合被傷害和受侮辱的感受。","options":["trophy","offense","tedium","obligation"],"sentence":"Taking ______ to his comments, she decided to avoid him in the future. She felt deeply hurt and insulted by what he had said about her work.","translation":"她對他的評論感到冒犯，決定以後要避開他。她對他關於她工作的言論感到深深受傷和被侮辱。","word":"offense"}},"offensive":{"createdAt":1783409864842,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"offensive 是形容詞，意為冒犯的、令人不快的或有攻擊性的，用來形容言語、行為或態度對他人造成的負面影響。","options":["aggressive","defensive","offensive","expansive"],"sentence":"His remark about her appearance was quite ______ and hurt her feelings deeply. She was upset for days because she felt disrespected and insulted by his words.","translation":"他關於她外表的評論相當冒犯人，深深傷害了她的感受。她為此難過了好幾天，因為她覺得被他的言語不尊重和侮辱了。","word":"offensive"}},"offer":{"createdAt":1783993252107,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"offer 作為動詞表示主動給予或提議，公司主動提供免費培訓給員工","options":["receive","offer","demand","refuse"],"sentence":"The company will ______ free training to all new employees. This generous program is part of their commitment to professional development.","translation":"該公司將向所有新員工提供免費培訓。這個慷慨的計畫是他們對專業發展承諾的一部分。","word":"offer"}},"official":{"createdAt":1781507137219,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"official 指的是來自政府或權威機構的正式、具有權威性的，而不是非正式或個人的說法。","options":["unofficial","official","personal","private"],"sentence":"The ______ statement from the government was released at noon on Tuesday. All major news outlets reported the announcement as the authoritative word from the administration.","translation":"政府的官方聲明在星期二中午發布。所有主要新聞媒體都將這份公告報導為來自政府的權威聲明。","word":"official"}},"officially":{"createdAt":1781693281409,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"officially（正式地）意指以正式、官方或經過授權的方式進行某事，而非非正式或私下進行。","options":["quietly","officially","hypothetically","accidentally"],"sentence":"The company announced the new product line ______ during a press conference yesterday. All media outlets reported on the announcement, confirming it was a formal and authorized disclosure.","translation":"公司在昨天的記者會上正式宣佈了新產品線。所有媒體都報導了這項宣佈，確認這是一次正式和授權的披露。","word":"officially"}},"offshore":{"createdAt":1781311983483,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"offshore 指在海上或離岸的，通常用於描述水域中的設施或項目。","options":["offshore","mature","expressive","presidential"],"sentence":"The company decided to build its ______ wind farms to harness renewable energy. These installations are located several miles away from the coast in the ocean.","translation":"該公司決定建造離岸風電場以利用可再生能源。這些設施位於海岸線外數英里的大洋中。","word":"offshore"}},"offspring":{"createdAt":1781580511748,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"offspring 指動物或人類的幼崽或後代，這裡指獅子的幼崽","options":["enemies","offspring","territory","prey"],"sentence":"The lion and lioness watched their ______ playing in the savanna. The young cubs would soon learn to hunt from their parents.","translation":"獅子和母獅看著他們的後代在草原上玩耍。這些年幼的幼崽很快就會學會從父母那裡狩獵。","word":"offspring"}},"oligosaccharides":{"createdAt":1783402421328,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"寡糖是一種由少數幾個單醣分子連結而成的碳水化合物，通常含有3到10個單醣單位。","options":["polymers","oligosaccharides","monosaccharides","lipids"],"sentence":"The ______ molecules in honey contain between 3 and 10 glucose units linked together. These carbohydrates are larger than simple sugars but smaller than polysaccharides.","translation":"蜂蜜中的寡糖分子由3到10個葡萄糖單位連結而成。這些碳水化合物比簡單糖類大，但比多醣小。","word":"oligosaccharides"}},"olive":{"createdAt":1781424157177,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"olive 是一種小的綠色或黑色果實，來自橄欖樹，常用於烹飪和製油。","options":["grape","olive","lemon","pepper"],"sentence":"The chef added fresh ______ to the Mediterranean salad to give it an authentic Greek flavor. These small green fruits were picked from trees in the coastal region.","translation":"廚師向地中海沙拉中加入新鮮的橄欖，以賦予它真正的希臘風味。這些小綠色果實是從沿海地區的樹上採摘的。","word":"olive"}},"omit":{"createdAt":1783660470999,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"omit 指「省略」或「遺漏」，不包括某些內容。句子強調不能省略任何步驟，因為這可能造成危險，這正是 omit 的反面含義。","options":["complete","omit","repeat","simplify"],"sentence":"You should not ______ any steps when following this safety procedure. Missing even one instruction could lead to serious injuries.","translation":"遵循此安全程序時，您不應該略過任何步驟。即使只遺漏一項指示也可能導致嚴重傷害。","word":"omit"}},"operate":{"createdAt":1782529318031,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"operate 意為進行手術，當與病人或身體部位搭配時，表示進行外科手術。","options":["consult","examine","operate","observe"],"sentence":"The surgeon will ______ on the patient's knee tomorrow morning at 8 AM. The medical team has prepared the operating room and all necessary surgical instruments.","translation":"外科醫生明早8點將為病人進行膝蓋手術。醫療團隊已準備好手術室和所有必要的手術器械。","word":"operate"}},"operation":{"createdAt":1785893098104,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"operation 是名詞，意為運轉、經營或操作，指企業、機器或系統的實際運作過程。","options":["location","operation","investment","closure"],"sentence":"The factory's ______ runs smoothly with hundreds of workers managing the machinery and production lines. The management team oversees every aspect of the manufacturing process to ensure quality output.","translation":"工廠的運轉順利進行，數百名工人管理機械和生產線。管理團隊監督製造過程的每個方面以確保品質產出。","word":"operation"}},"operational":{"createdAt":1786612055536,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"operational 意指某物已經就緒並正在實際運作或運行中，可用於描述機器、設施或系統的實際運作狀態。","options":["theoretical","operational","financial","environmental"],"sentence":"The new manufacturing facility became ______ last month after months of construction and testing. The company can now produce 500 units per day from this fully functioning plant.","translation":"新的製造工廠在經過數月的建設和測試後，上個月開始投入運作。該公司現在可以從這個完全運作的工廠每天生產500個單位。","word":"operational"}},"operative":{"createdAt":1782096279661,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"operative指法律、規則或系統正式實施並產生效力，現在正在使用中。","options":["suggested","historic","operative","theoretical"],"sentence":"The new safety regulations became ______ on January 1st of this year. All employees must follow these rules starting from that official date.","translation":"新的安全規定從今年1月1日起生效。所有員工必須從該官方日期開始遵守這些規則。","word":"operative"}},"operator":{"createdAt":1784451184439,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"operator 表示「操作員」或「駕駛員」，指熟練操作機械或設備的專業人員。","options":["manager","operator","inspector","architect"],"sentence":"The ______ skillfully guided the large crane to lift the heavy steel beams. Years of training had made him confident in handling such dangerous machinery.","translation":"操作員熟練地引導大型起重機提起沉重的鋼樑。多年的培訓使他對操作這種危險機械充滿信心。","word":"operator"}},"opponent":{"createdAt":1782228595873,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"opponent 指在競爭、比賽或衝突中與某人對抗的人，通常是指運動比賽或競爭中的對手。","options":["teammate","coach","opponent","audience"],"sentence":"In the chess tournament, Maria faced her toughest ______ in the final round. Her rival had defeated every other player without losing a single match.","translation":"在國際象棋比賽中，瑪麗亞在決賽中遇到了她最強的對手。她的競爭者沒有輸掉一盤比賽就打敗了所有其他選手。","word":"opponent"}},"opportunity":{"createdAt":1782522524115,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"opportunity 是指有利的時機或有可能發生的事情，在句子中表示莎拉錯過的有利條件。","options":["challenge","opportunity","responsibility","destination"],"sentence":"Sarah missed a great ______ to study abroad because she was afraid to apply. The scholarship deadline has already passed, so she cannot take this chance again.","translation":"莎拉因為害怕申請而錯過了一個出國留學的大好機會。獎學金的申請截止日期已經過了，所以她不能再抓住這個機會。","word":"opportunity"}},"oppose":{"createdAt":1781843396460,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"oppose表示反對或抵抗某事，在此指公民對政策的強烈反對態度。","options":["support","approve","oppose","encourage"],"sentence":"Many citizens decided to ______ the government's new environmental policy. They organized protests and submitted formal objections to demonstrate their disagreement.","translation":"許多市民決定反對政府的新環保政策。他們組織抗議並提交正式異議以表達他們的反對。","word":"oppose"}},"opposite":{"createdAt":1785712424167,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"opposite 意為「相反的、對面的」，用來描述位置或方向上完全相對的兩邊。","options":["similar","opposite","adjacent","distant"],"sentence":"The ______ side of the street has a bakery, while our side has a bookstore. If you want to buy bread, you need to cross the road to the other direction.","translation":"街道的相反一側有一家麵包店，而我們這一側有一家書店。如果你想買麵包，你需要穿過馬路到另一個方向。","word":"opposite"}},"opposition":{"createdAt":1782042740336,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"opposition 表示對某事物的不贊成或反對態度，通常指來自不同群體或個人的異議。","options":["support","enthusiasm","opposition","agreement"],"sentence":"The new environmental policy faced strong ______ from several business leaders at the town hall meeting. Despite their concerns about increased costs, the council voted unanimously to approve the initiative.","translation":"新的環境政策在城鎮大會上遭到了幾位商業領袖的強烈反對。儘管他們對成本增加表示擔憂，委員會還是一致投票批准了這項計畫。","word":"opposition"}},"oppress":{"createdAt":1783179414640,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"oppress是動詞，指用威權或不公正的方式壓迫、壓制某人，使其受到不公正待遇。","options":["support","oppress","encourage","inspire"],"sentence":"The authoritarian regime continued to ______ dissidents and silence opposition voices. Citizens who spoke out against the government risked imprisonment and severe punishment.","translation":"這個威權政權繼續壓迫異議人士並封殺反對聲音。公開反對政府的公民面臨監禁和嚴厲懲罰的風險。","word":"oppress"}},"oppressed":{"createdAt":1786512186784,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"oppressed 形容詞表示被不公正地壓制、被剝削或受到不公平待遇的人或群體，題目中第二句提到被剝奪投票權和公平待遇，正是受壓迫的具體表現。","options":["celebrated","oppressed","sophisticated","developed"],"sentence":"The ______ communities fought for their basic human rights and freedom. They had been denied voting privileges, fair wages, and equal treatment under the law for generations.","translation":"受壓迫的社區爭取他們的基本人權和自由。他們已被剝奪投票權、公平薪酬和法律平等對待多個世代。","word":"oppressed"}},"oppression":{"createdAt":1785236060335,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"oppression指的是政治或社會上的壓迫和迫害，通常涉及不公正的權力濫用和對人民自由的限制。","options":["freedom","oppression","democracy","independence"],"sentence":"The people lived under harsh ______ imposed by the authoritarian regime. The government used violence and fear to control every aspect of their daily lives.","translation":"人民生活在專制政權施加的嚴厲壓迫之下。政府使用暴力和恐懼來控制他們日常生活的每個方面。","word":"oppression"}},"opt":{"createdAt":1784981439741,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"opt表示選擇或挑選，通常指優先選擇某個選項而非其他選項。","options":["refuse","opt","require","arrange"],"sentence":"Many employees ______ to work from home after the company introduced flexible policies. The decision to choose remote work over commuting to the office became increasingly popular among the staff.","translation":"許多員工在公司推行靈活政策後選擇居家工作。員工們決定選擇遠距工作而不是通勤到辦公室，這變得越來越受歡迎。","word":"opt"}},"optimism":{"createdAt":1781840030393,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"optimism 是名詞，表示樂觀、樂天的態度；在句子中與「相信事情會改善」和「積極展望」相呼應。","options":["pessimism","optimism","confusion","arrogance"],"sentence":"Despite the challenging circumstances, Sarah maintained her ______ and believed things would improve. Even when others gave up, her positive outlook never wavered.","translation":"儘管情況具有挑戰性，莎拉仍然保持樂觀態度，相信事情會改善。即使當其他人放棄時，她的積極展望從未動搖。","word":"optimism"}},"optimistic":{"createdAt":1782555727237,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"optimistic 表示對未來充滿希望和信心，相信事情會向好的方向發展。","options":["pessimistic","doubtful","optimistic","uncertain"],"sentence":"Despite facing many challenges in her business, Sarah remained ______ about the company's future growth. She believed that with proper planning and effort, success was absolutely within reach.","translation":"儘管在她的業務中面臨許多挑戰，莎拉對公司未來的增長仍然保持樂觀。她相信透過適當的計劃和努力，成功絕對是可以達到的。","word":"optimistic"}},"option":{"createdAt":1781693254764,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"option表示可供選擇的事物或選項，強調有多種可能性。","options":["obligation","option","complaint","reservation"],"sentence":"The restaurant offered customers multiple ______ for their main course. Diners could choose between chicken, fish, beef, or vegetarian pasta.","translation":"這家餐廳為顧客提供了多種主菜選擇。用餐者可以在雞肉、魚、牛肉或素食義大利麵之間選擇。","word":"option"}},"optional":{"createdAt":1782659817810,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"optional 表示某事物是可以自由選擇的，不是必須的或強制性的。","options":["mandatory","optional","recommended","essential"],"sentence":"Attending the company picnic on Saturday is completely ______. The management has made it clear that employees can choose whether or not to participate without any consequences.","translation":"參加週六的公司野餐完全是可選的。管理部門已明確表示員工可以選擇是否參加，不會有任何後果。","word":"optional"}},"oral":{"createdAt":1784293679179,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"oral 是指以言語或口頭方式進行的，通常不涉及書面或視覺形式。","options":["written","oral","visual","digital"],"sentence":"The student's ______ presentation was graded based on how clearly she spoke to the class. She did not submit any written essay or visual aids.","translation":"學生的口頭報告是根據她向全班講話的清晰程度來評分的。她沒有提交任何書面論文或視覺輔助工具。","word":"oral"}},"orbit":{"createdAt":1783823805986,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"orbit 名詞表示行星或衛星圍繞另一個天體運行的軌道路徑。","options":["eclipse","orbit","rotation","constellation"],"sentence":"The Earth travels in an ______ around the Sun, completing one full cycle every 365 days. This elliptical path keeps our planet at a consistent distance from the star, enabling life to flourish.","translation":"地球沿著太陽周圍的軌道運行，每365天完成一個完整的循環。這條橢圓路徑使我們的星球與恆星保持一致的距離，使生命得以繁衍生息。","word":"orbit"}},"orbital":{"createdAt":1783243171151,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"orbital是形容詞，表示與軌道相關的，用來描述天體在固定軌道上的運動和相關物理現象。","options":["rotational","orbital","atmospheric","gravitational"],"sentence":"The ______ mechanics of planets around the sun follows Kepler's laws of motion. Astronomers use these principles to predict the exact paths that celestial bodies will take.","translation":"行星圍繞太陽的軌道力學遵循克卜勒運動定律。天文學家使用這些原理來預測天體將採取的確切路徑。","word":"orbital"}},"ordeal":{"createdAt":1781838276307,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"ordeal指嚴峻的考驗或痛苦的經歷。","options":["volume","individual","ordeal","proponent"],"sentence":"After surviving the ______ of the natural disaster, the survivors received counselling and support. They had endured weeks of hardship and uncertainty before being rescued.","translation":"在經歷自然災害的磨難後，倖存者獲得了諮詢和支持。在被救出前，他們經歷了數週的艱辛和不確定性。","word":"ordeal"}},"order":{"createdAt":1783482972495,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"order 作為動詞表示「訂貨、點單」，特別用於在餐廳或商店中要求購買或提供特定商品。","options":["request","order","demand","ask"],"sentence":"The customer called the restaurant to ______ a pizza and pasta for delivery. The waiter confirmed the request and wrote down all the details for the kitchen.","translation":"客人打電話到餐廳訂購披薩和義大利麵外帶。服務生確認了請求並將所有細節寫下來供廚房使用。","word":"order"}},"ordered":{"createdAt":1781849847403,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ordered表示有序的或整齊的，與「整齊排列、容易找到東西」的線索相符。","options":["chaotic","ordered","messy","scattered"],"sentence":"His bedroom was very ______ with everything arranged neatly on shelves. You could easily find anything you needed without searching.","translation":"他的臥室非常整齊，每樣東西都整齊地排列在架子上。你可以輕鬆找到任何你需要的東西，無需搜尋。","word":"ordered"}},"orderly":{"createdAt":1783612594867,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"orderly在此表示醫院或軍隊中的護工或勤務員，主要工作是協助患者和維持環境整潔。","options":["doctor","orderly","surgeon","visitor"],"sentence":"The hospital ______ helped the patient get dressed and tidied up the room. His job was to ensure everything was organized and that patients received proper care.","translation":"醫院的護工幫助病人穿衣服並整理房間。他的工作是確保一切井然有序，並確保患者得到適當的照顧。","word":"orderly"}},"ordinary":{"createdAt":1784078619501,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"ordinary是形容詞，表示「普通的」或「正常的」，指沒有特別之處或不引人注意的事物。","options":["extraordinary","normal","ordinary","special"],"sentence":"What seemed like an ______ day at first turned into an unforgettable adventure. By evening, the children had discovered a hidden cave in the forest.","translation":"起初看似普通的一天最後變成了難忘的冒險。到了晚上，孩子們在森林裡發現了一個隱藏的洞穴。","word":"ordinary"}},"organ":{"createdAt":1783572474513,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"organ作為名詞可指「風琴」，是一種大型樂器，常見於教堂中，能發出深沉而莊嚴的音樂。","options":["guitar","organ","violin","flute"],"sentence":"The church hired a musician to play the magnificent ______ during Sunday service. The beautiful music filled the entire cathedral with its deep, resonant tones.","translation":"教堂聘請了一位音樂家在週日禮拜時演奏這架宏偉的風琴。優美的音樂用其深沉、共鳴的音調填滿了整個教堂。","word":"organ"}},"organic":{"createdAt":1783784234596,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"organic 形容詞表示不使用人工化學物質，特別是在農業中指自然的、環保的生產方式。","options":["industrial","chemical","organic","mechanical"],"sentence":"The farmer uses only ______ farming methods that avoid synthetic pesticides and fertilizers. His crops are certified by the government as being produced without any artificial chemicals.","translation":"這位農民只使用有機農業方法，避免使用合成農藥和肥料。他的農作物已被政府認證為不含任何人工化學物質生產的產品。","word":"organic"}},"organism":{"createdAt":1781693269015,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"organism 指的是活的生物體或生命體，可以是微生物、植物或動物。","options":["landscape","organism","monument","technology"],"sentence":"Scientists discovered a new ______ in the deep ocean that had never been documented before. The microscopic creature has unique characteristics that distinguish it from all previously known species.","translation":"科學家在深海中發現了一個以前從未被記錄過的新的生物體。這種微小的生物具有將其與所有已知物種區分開來的獨特特徵。","word":"organism"}},"organization":{"createdAt":1784078619502,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"organization是名詞，指「組織」或「團體」，通常指有結構、有明確目標和成員的集體。","options":["movement","organization","institution","company"],"sentence":"The charity ______ has helped thousands of families in need over the past decade. Its structured programs and dedicated volunteers work together to make a real difference.","translation":"這個慈善組織在過去十年中幫助了數千個有需要的家庭。它的結構化計畫和敬業的志願者共同努力產生真實的影響。","word":"organization"}},"organize":{"createdAt":1783228210816,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"organize 意思是計劃和協調各個細節，將事物安排得井然有序，這正是第二句中提到的任務分配、場地預訂和志願者協調的含義。","options":["attend","organize","celebrate","promote"],"sentence":"We need to ______ the charity event by next month to ensure everything runs smoothly. The team will assign tasks, book venues, and coordinate volunteers according to a detailed timeline.","translation":"我們需要在下個月前組織這場慈善活動，以確保一切順利進行。團隊將根據詳細的時間表分配任務、預訂場地並協調志願者。","word":"organize"}},"organized":{"createdAt":1781402539333,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"organized 表示有系統地安排或整理，使事物井然有序、便於使用或理解。","options":["chaotic","organized","temporary","empty"],"sentence":"The ______ office has a clear filing system and labeled drawers. Everything is easy to find because the manager spent weeks creating an efficient structure.","translation":"這個井井有條的辦公室有清晰的檔案系統和標有標籤的抽屜。一切都很容易找到，因為經理花了幾週時間創建一個高效的結構。","word":"organized"}},"organizer":{"createdAt":1784442392559,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"organizer 是指負責籌辦、組織和管理活動或事件的人，必須具備計劃能力和協調能力。","options":["attendee","organizer","sponsor","volunteer"],"sentence":"The ______ of the conference spent months planning every detail, from booking the venue to arranging speakers. Without their careful coordination and management, the event would never have come together so smoothly.","translation":"這場會議的籌辦者花了幾個月的時間規劃每一個細節，從預訂場地到安排演講者。如果沒有他們的仔細協調和管理，活動就不會進行得如此順利。","word":"organizer"}},"orient":{"createdAt":1785281602361,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"orient 作為動詞表示「定方位」或「指正向」，幫助人確定自己在空間中的位置和方向。","options":["confuse","orient","lose","abandon"],"sentence":"When we arrived at the unfamiliar city, our guide helped us ______ ourselves by pointing out the main landmarks and cardinal directions. Once we understood where north, south, east, and west were, we felt much more confident navigating the streets.","translation":"當我們來到陌生的城市時，我們的導遊指出主要地標和方向，幫助我們確定方位。一旦我們知道了北、南、東、西在哪裡，我們就對在街道上行走感到更有信心了。","word":"orient"}},"oriental":{"createdAt":1785228405498,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"oriental是形容詞，意指來自東方或亞洲地區，特別是東亞、南亞及東南亞地區的文化、藝術或地理特徵。","options":["Western","oriental","modern","contemporary"],"sentence":"The museum's new ______ art collection features intricate silk paintings and jade sculptures from ancient China. The curator specifically sourced these artifacts from countries east of Europe and the Middle East.","translation":"博物館的新東方藝術收藏展示了來自古代中國的複雜絲綢畫和玉器雕塑。策展人特別從歐洲和中東以東的國家採購這些工藝品。","word":"oriental"}},"orientation":{"createdAt":1785281726110,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"orientation 作名詞表示「新生訓練」或「適應期」，指為新人安排的介紹性課程或活動。","options":["promotion","orientation","evaluation","termination"],"sentence":"The new employees attended a one-day ______ program to learn about company policies and meet their colleagues. This introductory training session is mandatory for all staff members joining the organization.","translation":"新員工參加了一天的新生訓練課程，以了解公司政策並認識他們的同事。這項介紹性培訓課程對所有加入該組織的員工是強制性的。","word":"orientation"}},"origin":{"createdAt":1783993252112,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"origin 表示起源或由來，指某物開始或產生的地方和時間","options":["tradition","origin","recipe","popularity"],"sentence":"The ______ of the pizza recipe can be traced back to Naples, Italy in the 18th century. Food historians have documented this culinary history extensively.","translation":"披薩食譜的起源可以追溯到18世紀義大利那不勒斯。美食歷史學家已經廣泛記錄了這段烹飪歷史。","word":"origin"}},"original":{"createdAt":1785135254500,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"original（最初的；原著）指最初創作或製作的版本，是最早的、未經修改的。","options":["modern","original","recent","updated"],"sentence":"The museum displayed the ______ manuscript written by the author over two hundred years ago. This was the very first version the writer created with his own hand, not a copy or reproduction.","translation":"博物館展示了兩百多年前作者親筆寫下的原著手稿。這是作家親手創作的第一個版本，而不是副本或復製品。","word":"original"}},"originality":{"createdAt":1781424157168,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"originality 指的是創新和獨創的品質，與傳統或模仿相對。","options":["imitation","originality","technique","popularity"],"sentence":"The artist's work was praised for its ______, as no one had ever seen such a unique style before. The judges noted that every piece was completely different from traditional art movements.","translation":"這位藝術家的作品因其獨創性而受到讚揚，因為沒有人見過如此獨特的風格。評委們指出每件作品都與傳統藝術運動完全不同。","word":"originality"}},"originate":{"createdAt":1783944768439,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"originate 的意思是某事物開始、產生或源自於某處或某個時間。","options":["continue","originate","spread","develop"],"sentence":"The tradition to celebrate New Year's Eve with fireworks ______ in ancient China over 2,000 years ago. Historians have traced the custom back to this specific region and time period.","translation":"在除夕夜放煙火來慶祝的傳統始於2000多年前的中國古代。歷史學家已經將這個習俗追溯到這個特定的地區和時期。","word":"originate"}},"ornament":{"createdAt":1786108955730,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ornament 作為名詞表示用來裝飾的物品，可以是掛在樹上、擺在架子上的各種裝飾品。","options":["furniture","ornament","clothing","utensil"],"sentence":"She hung a beautiful silver ______ on the Christmas tree. The decorative piece sparkled under the lights and was made of metal.","translation":"她在聖誕樹上掛了一個美麗的銀色裝飾品。這件金屬製的裝飾物在燈光下閃閃發光。","word":"ornament"}},"orphan":{"createdAt":1781452134701,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"orphan名詞指因父母去世而失去親生父母照顧的兒童。","options":["teacher","immigrant","orphan","volunteer"],"sentence":"The young ______ was taken in by the charity organization after losing both parents. The social workers ensured he received proper education and emotional support at their residential facility.","translation":"失去雙親的小孤兒被慈善機構收留了。社工人員確保他在他們的居住設施中獲得適當的教育和情感支持。","word":"orphan"}},"orphanage":{"createdAt":1783005778380,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"orphanage 意為「孤兒院」，指收容和照顧失去父母的兒童的機構。","options":["hospital","orphanage","factory","prison"],"sentence":"The charity donated thousands of books and educational supplies to the local ______ to help the children receive better schooling. The staff was grateful for the support that would improve the orphans' futures.","translation":"慈善機構向當地孤兒院捐獻了數千冊書籍和教育用品，幫助孩子們獲得更好的教育。工作人員感謝這種將改善孤兒未來的支持。","word":"orphanage"}},"orthodox":{"createdAt":1781424356418,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"orthodox指的是遵循既定的傳統或廣泛接受的標準做法，而不是創新或激進的方法。","options":["radical","modern","orthodox","experimental"],"sentence":"His views on education were quite ______ and aligned with traditional teaching methods. He believed in standardized curricula and conventional approaches that had been used for decades.","translation":"他對教育的看法相當正統，與傳統教學方法相一致。他相信標準化課程和已使用數十年的常規方法。","word":"orthodox"}},"otherwise":{"createdAt":1783946896986,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"otherwise表示「否則、不然」，用來表達在特定條件不被滿足時會發生的相反結果或後果。","options":["similarly","otherwise","meanwhile","instead"],"sentence":"You must submit your assignment by Friday, ______ you will lose points. If you fail to meet this deadline, there will be consequences for your grade.","translation":"你必須在週五前提交作業，否則你將失去分數。如果你沒有按時完成，你的成績將受到懲罰。","word":"otherwise"}},"outbreak":{"createdAt":1784527506360,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"outbreak是指疾病、暴力事件或其他不良情況的突然發生或爆發，在此句中用來描述疾病在城市中突然大規模出現的情況。","options":["outbreak","discovery","rumor","decline"],"sentence":"The sudden ______ of the disease in the city forced hospitals to implement emergency protocols. Health officials traced the source to a contaminated water supply that affected thousands of residents.","translation":"該城市疾病的突然爆發迫使醫院實施應急協議。衛生官員追蹤到污染的水源是影響數千居民的原因。","word":"outbreak"}},"outcome":{"createdAt":1787589681575,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"outcome 是名詞，意為「結果」或「後果」，通常指事件或過程完成後產生的最終結果。","options":["process","outcome","strategy","campaign"],"sentence":"The ______ of the election surprised many political analysts who had predicted a different result. After months of campaigning and voting, the final results were announced on television.","translation":"選舉的結果讓許多政治分析家感到驚訝，他們曾預測會有不同的結果。經過數月的競選和投票後，最終結果在電視上宣布了。","word":"outcome"}},"outdated":{"createdAt":1787183305619,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"outdated 表示某物已經不再符合時代需求或已被更新的版本取代，通常用來形容技術、觀念或風格已經過時的東西。","options":["modern","outdated","advanced","current"],"sentence":"The software on my computer is ______, so I need to install the latest version to access new features. My IT department informed me that this program hasn't been updated since 2010.","translation":"我電腦上的軟體已經過時了，所以我需要安裝最新版本才能使用新功能。我的資訊部門通知我，這個程式自從2010年以來就沒有更新過。","word":"outdated"}},"outfit":{"createdAt":1781842254309,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"outfit 在此指一個組織化的團隊或集體，包括所有必要的人員和設備來完成特定的任務。","options":["outfit","building","schedule","strategy"],"sentence":"The rock band needed to purchase new stage equipment and hire additional musicians to complete their ______. The manager was responsible for assembling all the necessary members and gear for the upcoming world tour.","translation":"搖滾樂隊需要購買新的舞台設備並僱用額外的音樂家來完成他們的團隊。經理負責為即將進行的世界巡迴演唱會組合所有必要的成員和設備。","word":"outfit"}},"outgoing":{"createdAt":1786003580671,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"outgoing是形容詞，表示性格外向、好交際、喜歡與他人互動的特質。","options":["shy","outgoing","reserved","quiet"],"sentence":"Sarah has an ______ personality and loves meeting new people at parties. She was voted the most sociable student in her class because she constantly initiates conversations with strangers and organizes group activities.","translation":"莎拉有著____性格，喜歡在派對上認識新朋友。她因為經常主動與陌生人交談並組織團體活動，被選為班上最善於交際的學生。","word":"outgoing"}},"outing":{"createdAt":1781437435163,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"outing 指短途旅遊或遠足活動，通常是有組織的集體外出參觀。","options":["meeting","outing","lecture","interview"],"sentence":"The school organized a wonderful ______ to the botanical gardens for all students. We packed lunches and spent the entire day exploring the exotic plants and enjoying nature together.","translation":"學校為所有學生組織了一次美妙的短途旅遊到植物園。我們帶著午餐，花了整天時間探索異國植物並一起享受大自然。","word":"outing"}},"outlaw":{"createdAt":1784980745491,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"outlaw 作為名詞指被法律制裁或被社會排斥的逃犯或歹徒，通常指那些因犯罪而被通緝的人。","options":["merchant","outlaw","doctor","ambassador"],"sentence":"The sheriff tracked down the dangerous ______ who had robbed three banks in the territory. The government officially declared him a criminal and banned him from ever returning to civilization.","translation":"警長追捕了在該地區搶劫了三家銀行的危險歹徒。政府正式宣布他為罪犯，禁止他再返回文明世界。","word":"outlaw"}},"outlet":{"createdAt":1781665727111,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"outlet 在此指排放口或出口，用於讓液體、氣體或廢物流出或排出。","options":["entrance","container","outlet","barrier"],"sentence":"The factory installed a large water ______ to drain waste materials from production. The pipe extended directly into the river outside the facility.","translation":"工廠安裝了一個大型水排放孔來排放生產中的廢料。管道直接延伸到設施外的河裡。","word":"outlet"}},"outline":{"createdAt":1783609867013,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"outline是名詞，表示物體的外形輪廓或邊界線","options":["shadow","outline","distance","perspective"],"sentence":"The ______ of the mountain was clearly visible against the sunset sky. You could see the sharp edges and shapes where the peak met the orange horizon.","translation":"山的輪廓在日落的天空中清晰可見。你可以看到山峰與橙色地平線相接處的尖銳邊緣和形狀。","word":"outline"}},"outlive":{"createdAt":1782401868816,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"outlive 表示活得比另一個人更長或存活期更久。","options":["abandon","outlive","ignore","disappoint"],"sentence":"The actress managed to ______ most of her contemporaries in the film industry. She continued working well into her nineties while her peers retired decades earlier.","translation":"這位女演員設法比電影業中大多數同代人活得更久。當她的同齡人幾十年前退休時，她繼續工作到九十多歲。","word":"outlive"}},"outlook":{"createdAt":1784531912955,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"outlook用來表示對未來情況的看法或預期，在這裡指的是對公司財務前景的展望","options":["perspective","outlook","appearance","location"],"sentence":"The company's financial ______ has improved significantly after the new CEO took over. Analysts predict strong growth and increased profits over the next five years.","translation":"公司在新任執行長接管後，財務前景顯著改善。分析師預測未來五年將出現強勁增長和利潤增加。","word":"outlook"}},"outlying":{"createdAt":1789363793855,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"outlying 形容位於邊遠或外圍的地方，距離中心或主要區域較遠。","options":["central","bustling","outlying","industrial"],"sentence":"The ______ villages had no access to modern infrastructure or public services. These remote settlements were located far from the main city and its resources.","translation":"這些偏遠的村莊無法獲得現代基礎設施或公共服務。這些偏遠的定居點遠離主城市及其資源。","word":"outlying"}},"outnumber":{"createdAt":1783409864837,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"outnumber 是指在數量上超過或比多，特別強調一方的數量比另一方多，通常用於比較兩個群體的規模。","options":["surpass","outnumber","exceed","overwhelm"],"sentence":"The enemy forces ______ our troops by three to one. We were vastly outnumbered on the battlefield and had to retreat strategically.","translation":"敵方軍隊在數量上超過我們的部隊三比一。我們在戰場上人數遠遠不足，不得不進行戰略性撤退。","word":"outnumber"}},"outrage":{"createdAt":1786345900365,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"outrage 表示因不公正或令人厭惡的事情而引起的強烈憤怒和義憤","options":["sympathy","outrage","curiosity","confusion"],"sentence":"The ______ caused by the corrupt politician's scandal sparked massive protests across the country. Public anger reached unprecedented levels when evidence of embezzlement was revealed.","translation":"貪腐政客醜聞引起的憤慨激發了全國各地的大規模抗議。當挪用公款的證據被披露時，公眾的憤怒達到了前所未有的水平。","word":"outrage"}},"outrageous":{"createdAt":1782378744801,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"outrageous是形容詞，表示「令人憤怒的」或「駭人聽聞的」，用來形容令人感到憤怒、無禮或極度不合理的事物。","options":["affordable","reasonable","outrageous","modest"],"sentence":"The restaurant charged an ______ price of $500 for a single meal, which shocked all the customers. Many people complained that such an expensive fee was completely unreasonable and insulting.","translation":"這家餐廳對一頓飯收取了駭人聽聞的500美元價格，這讓所有客戶都感到震驚。許多人抱怨這樣昂貴的費用完全不合理且令人感到侮辱。","word":"outrageous"}},"outright":{"createdAt":1783841864097,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"outright 既可作副詞表示「徹底地、完全地」，也可作形容詞表示「完全的、直接的」，強調沒有保留或模糊之處。","options":["partial","outright","vague","hesitant"],"sentence":"When asked if he had stolen the money, the man gave an ______ denial. He did not hesitate or equivocate—his answer was immediate and complete.","translation":"當被問及他是否偷了錢時，那個男人給出了徹底的否認。他沒有猶豫或模稜兩可——他的回答是立刻而且完全的。","word":"outright"}},"outrun":{"createdAt":1786111147345,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"outrun 是指跑得比其他人或物體更快，或是在速度上超越對方，通常在競賽或追逐中使用。","options":["admire","outrun","encourage","meet"],"sentence":"The sprinter trained hard to ______ all his competitors in the final race. By the end, he had left everyone far behind and crossed the finish line minutes ahead of the second-place runner.","translation":"短跑運動員刻苦訓練，以便在最後的比賽中跑得比所有對手都快。最後，他把所有人都遠遠拋在身後，並比第二名的選手提前幾分鐘衝過終點線。","word":"outrun"}},"outset":{"createdAt":1783256139028,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"outset 指的是某事物的開端或開始階段。","options":["completion","outset","delay","expansion"],"sentence":"From the ______ of the project, the team knew it would be challenging and require extra resources. They had prepared a detailed plan on the very first day.","translation":"從項目一開始，團隊就知道這將很有挑戰性且需要額外資源。他們從第一天就準備了詳細的計劃。","word":"outset"}},"outskirts":{"createdAt":1783320724611,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"outskirts 是指城市或城鎮的邊緣地帶、郊外地區，通常位於市中心之外。","options":["downtown","outskirts","suburbs","neighborhood"],"sentence":"The new suburban development was built on the ______ of the city, far from the downtown area. Most residents there commute to their jobs in the city center every morning.","translation":"新的郊區開發項目建在城市的邊緣地帶，遠離市中心。大多數居民每天早上都要前往城市中心上班。","word":"outskirts"}},"outsource":{"createdAt":1789859724146,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"outsource 是指將公司的某項工作或業務委託給外部公司或供應商來完成，通常是為了降低成本或專注於核心業務。","options":["relocate","outsource","automate","delegate"],"sentence":"Many companies decide to ______ their customer service operations to specialized firms in other countries. This strategy allows them to reduce labor costs while maintaining service quality through experienced external providers.","translation":"許多公司決定將客戶服務業務外包給其他國家的專業公司。這種策略讓他們能夠降低勞動成本，同時通過有經驗的外部供應商維持服務品質。","word":"outsource"}},"outward":{"createdAt":1783262026081,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"outward 作為形容詞表示「外表的、外面的」，用來描述外表或對外呈現的樣子，與內在相對。","options":["inward","outward","awkward","backward"],"sentence":"Though she maintained a calm ______ appearance during the interview, her hands trembled nervously beneath the table. Her inner anxiety was completely hidden from the hiring manager's view.","translation":"雖然她在面試期間保持著平靜的外表，但她的雙手在桌子下面緊張地顫抖。她的內心焦慮完全隱藏在招聘經理的視線之外。","word":"outward"}},"outwards":{"createdAt":1781268630474,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"outwards表示向外或朝外的方向，與inwards（向內）相反。","options":["inwards","upwards","outwards","downwards"],"sentence":"The explosion sent debris ______ in all directions. The force pushed everything away from the center point.","translation":"爆炸將碎片向外發送到四面八方。這股力量將所有東西從中心點推開。","word":"outwards"}},"overall":{"createdAt":1782083925066,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"overall作為副詞，用於表達對某事物的總體或全面的評價，後面通常跟著對整體情況的判斷。","options":["specifically","overall","partially","briefly"],"sentence":"The project had some delays, but ______ it was completed on time. When we reviewed the final results and total timeline, we could confirm success.","translation":"這個項目有些延誤，但總體來說它按時完成了。當我們查看最終結果和總時間表時，我們可以確認成功。","word":"overall"}},"overcame":{"createdAt":1782200614311,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"overcame 是 overcome 的過去式，表示「克服；戰勝」，指成功地應對或解決困難。","options":["created","overcame","ignored","accepted"],"sentence":"Despite facing severe discrimination and poverty, Nelson Mandela ______ tremendous obstacles to become the president of South Africa. His determination and courage inspired millions around the globe.","translation":"儘管面臨嚴重的歧視和貧困，納爾遜·曼德拉克服了巨大的障礙，成為南非總統。他的決心和勇氣激勵了全球數百萬人。","word":"overcame"}},"overcoat":{"createdAt":1781484415218,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"overcoat是指穿在其他衣服外層的長厚外套，用於保暖和防寒。","options":["shirt","overcoat","shoes","hat"],"sentence":"He put on his heavy ______ before stepping outside into the freezing winter air. The thick wool garment protected him from the biting cold and strong winds.","translation":"在步入刺骨的冬季寒冷空氣之前，他穿上了厚重的大衣。這件厚羊毛衣保護他免受刺骨的寒冷和強風的侵襲。","word":"overcoat"}},"overcome":{"createdAt":1781926464745,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"overcome 表示成功地面對並克服困難或負面情感，通常需要努力和時間。","options":["express","overcome","ignore","announce"],"sentence":"She worked hard to ______ her fear of public speaking through practice and coaching. After months of dedication, she delivered a confident presentation to two hundred people.","translation":"她通過練習和指導努力克服了她對公開演講的恐懼。經過數月的奉獻，她自信地向二百人做了一次演講。","word":"overcome"}},"overflow":{"createdAt":1782408103446,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"overflow 表示液體超過容器的容量而溢出或流出。","options":["leak","overflow","drip","splash"],"sentence":"The bathtub experienced an ______ when the drain became clogged with hair and soap scum. Water spilled across the bathroom floor and damaged the wooden cabinet below.","translation":"當排水口被頭髮和肥皂垢堵塞時，浴缸發生了溢水。水灑在浴室地板上並損壞了下面的木製櫃子。","word":"overflow"}},"overhear":{"createdAt":1783470852902,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"overhear表示無意中、無心聽到別人的對話，強調意外性和非故意的聽聞。","options":["witness","understand","overhear","interrupt"],"sentence":"I didn't mean to ______ their private conversation in the hallway. I was walking past when I accidentally caught some of their words.","translation":"我無意中在走廊裡聽到了他們的私人談話。我經過時不小心聽到了他們的一些話語。","word":"overhear"}},"overheard":{"createdAt":1783698190759,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"overheard是指無意中聽到別人的對話，通常是無意識或未被邀請的狀況下聽到的。","options":["overheard","announced","whispered","debated"],"sentence":"Sarah ______ her friends talking about the surprise party while she was walking down the hallway. She pretended not to know anything when they asked her later.","translation":"莎拉在走廊裡行走時無意中聽到她的朋友們談論驚喜派對。當他們之後問她時，她假裝不知道任何事情。","word":"overheard"}},"overlap":{"createdAt":1784625437078,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"overlap 是指兩個物體或區域在部分地方相疊或重合，特別強調部分重疊而非完全融合。","options":["intersect","overlap","merge","combine"],"sentence":"The two circles ______ each other in the middle of the diagram. The shaded region represents the area where both circles share common space.","translation":"這兩個圓在圖表的中間彼此______。陰影區域代表兩個圓共用的公共空間。","word":"overlap"}},"overlook":{"createdAt":1783389780658,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"overlook 在此表示「俯瞰、眺望」，指從高處往下看景物，強調位置高度和視野開闊。","options":["ignore","overlook","dismiss","forget"],"sentence":"From the balcony of the hotel, guests can ______ the entire city skyline and the harbor below. The room was specifically chosen for its elevated position that provides this sweeping vista.","translation":"從飯店的陽台上，客人可以俯瞰整個城市天際線和下方的港口。這個房間之所以被特別選擇，是因為它的高地位置能提供這樣的廣闊景觀。","word":"overlook"}},"overrated":{"createdAt":1785487324262,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"overrated是形容詞，表示某事物被評價或評估得過高，實際價值不如其聲譽那麼高。","options":["underrated","famous","overrated","popular"],"sentence":"Many critics believe that this famous restaurant is ______ despite its popularity among tourists. The food quality and service do not justify the high prices customers are charged.","translation":"許多評論家認為儘管這家著名餐廳在遊客中很受歡迎，但它被高估了。食物品質和服務不足以為顧客支付的高價格辯護。","word":"overrated"}},"oversee":{"createdAt":1785898286593,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"oversee 意指監督或看管某項工作或活動，確保它按照計劃進行。","options":["participate","oversee","design","finance"],"sentence":"The project manager will ______ the construction of the new office building. She has already hired supervisors at each site to report directly to her on progress.","translation":"專案經理將監督新辦公大樓的建造。她已經在每個工地聘請主管直接向她報告進度。","word":"oversee"}},"overtake":{"createdAt":1781651261373,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"overtake在此表示趕上並超過他人，強調在比賽或競爭中達到領先地位。","options":["overtake","projection","physics","midst"],"sentence":"The runner's energy and speed began to ______ that of her competitors in the final lap. By crossing the finish line first, she had surpassed all the other athletes.","translation":"那位跑者在最後一圈的能量和速度開始超過她的競爭對手。她通過首先衝過終點線而超越了所有其他運動員。","word":"overtake"}},"overtaken":{"createdAt":1781580511760,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"overtaken 是 overtake 的過去分詞，表示被超越或被超車","options":["cheered","supported","photographed","overtaken"],"sentence":"The racing car was ______ by its rival on the final lap of the competition. The other vehicle had accelerated faster and passed it just before the finish line.","translation":"在比賽的最後一圈，這輛賽車被對手超越了。另一輛車加速更快，在終點線前剛好超過它。","word":"overtaken"}},"overthrew":{"createdAt":1783130197544,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"overthrew是overthrow的過去式，意思是用武力推翻或顛覆政府、統治者或制度。","options":["supported","overthrew","elected","appointed"],"sentence":"The revolutionary army ______ the corrupt government in a swift military coup. The dictator fled the country and was never seen again.","translation":"革命軍在一場迅速的軍事政變中推翻了腐敗政府。獨裁者逃離了這個國家，再也沒有出現過。","word":"overthrew"}},"overthrow":{"createdAt":1781443653220,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"overthrow指的是用武力推翻或打倒現有政權或統治者。","options":["support","strengthen","overthrow","elect"],"sentence":"The rebel forces planned to ______ the corrupt government through armed resistance. After months of fighting, they successfully took control of the capital and established a new regime.","translation":"叛軍計畫通過武裝抵抗來推翻腐敗的政府。經過數月的戰鬥後，他們成功控制了首都並建立了新政權。","word":"overthrow"}},"overturn":{"createdAt":1783685028737,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"overturn是指翻倒或使某物傾覆，通常用來描述船隻、車輛或其他物體因外力而翻轉的情況。","options":["stabilize","float","overturn","anchor"],"sentence":"The boat began to ______ in the rough sea when the massive wave struck it. The vessel capsized, and passengers had to swim for their lives.","translation":"當巨大的波浪襲擊這艘船時，它開始在洶湧的大海中翻覆。這艘船傾覆了，乘客們不得不游泳逃生。","word":"overturn"}},"overwhelm":{"createdAt":1784355956206,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"overwhelm是動詞，表示淹沒、壓倒，指被大量或強大的事物所淹沒，以至於無法應對。","options":["encourage","motivate","overwhelm","inspire"],"sentence":"The number of tasks on her to-do list would ______ most people, making them feel completely stressed. She had over fifty things to complete by the end of the week.","translation":"待辦事項清單上的任務數量會壓倒大多數人，使他們感到完全受壓。她在周末前要完成五十多件事。","word":"overwhelm"}},"owe":{"createdAt":1785143022571,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"owe 在此用法表示「將...歸功於」，意指某人或某事對自己的成功有貢獻，應該因此感謝他們。","options":["deserve","owe","earn","gain"],"sentence":"I ______ my success to my parents' support and guidance. Without their encouragement, I would never have achieved my goals.","translation":"我的成功應歸功於父母的支持和指導。沒有他們的鼓勵，我永遠不會取得成就。","word":"owe"}},"owing":{"createdAt":1782480892563,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"owing 作為介詞表示「歸功於」或「由於」，用來指出某件事的原因或責任來源。","options":["similar","owing","obvious","equal"],"sentence":"The team's success this season was ______ to the excellent coaching and hard work of the players. The coach's innovative strategy and the players' dedication made all the difference.","translation":"這支球隊本賽季的成功將歸功於出色的教練和球員的辛勤工作。教練的創新策略和球員的奉獻精神改變了一切。","word":"owing"}},"ownership":{"createdAt":1782491138490,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ownership 表示對某物的所有權或擁有權，通常涉及法律上的完全控制和所有權。","options":["dividend","ownership","nightmare","glow"],"sentence":"After years of hard work, she finally achieved her dream of ______ over a small business. The deed was signed and the keys were officially handed over to her last week.","translation":"經過多年的辛勤工作，她終於實現了擁有一家小企業的夢想。契約已簽署，鑰匙在上週正式交付給她。","word":"ownership"}},"oxidation":{"createdAt":1782475351770,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"oxidation是指「氧化作用」，特指物質與氧氣發生的化學反應過程。","options":["corrosion","oxidation","erosion","weathering"],"sentence":"The ______ of iron occurs when it is exposed to oxygen and moisture for extended periods. This chemical process is why metal bridges need regular protective coatings.","translation":"鐵在長期暴露於氧氣和濕度中時會發生氧化。這個化學過程就是為什麼金屬橋樑需要定期保護塗層的原因。","word":"oxidation"}},"oxygen":{"createdAt":1788141589572,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"oxygen是空氣中使動物能夠呼吸的氣體，它是維持生命的關鍵元素。","options":["nitrogen","oxygen","carbon dioxide","hydrogen"],"sentence":"Plants release ______ during photosynthesis, which is essential for most living organisms to breathe. Without this gas, animals would not be able to survive on Earth.","translation":"植物在光合作用過程中釋放______，這對大多數生物呼吸是必不可少的。沒有這種氣體，動物就無法在地球上生存。","word":"oxygen"}},"oyster":{"createdAt":1781840892408,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"oyster是牡蠣，一種貝類海鮮，需要打開貝殼才能食用。","options":["steak","salmon","oyster","lobster"],"sentence":"The luxury seafood restaurant served a delicious ______ appetizer topped with caviar and lemon juice. The chef carefully shucked each shell to reveal the tender meat inside.","translation":"這家高級海鮮餐廳供應美味的牡蠣前菜，上面裝飾著魚子醬和檸檬汁。廚師仔細地打開每個貝殼，露出裡面的軟肉。","word":"oyster"}},"ozone":{"createdAt":1787845362178,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"臭氧是一種由三個氧原子組成的氣體，存在於地球大氣的平流層，能吸收太陽的紫外線輻射，保護地球上的生命。","options":["nitrogen","ozone","carbon","helium"],"sentence":"The upper atmosphere contains a layer of ______ that protects Earth from harmful ultraviolet radiation. This gas is a form of oxygen with three atoms instead of two.","translation":"上層大氣中含有一層______，可以保護地球免受有害的紫外線輻射。這種氣體是由三個原子組成的氧氣形式。","word":"ozone"}},"pace":{"createdAt":1785110904569,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"pace表示步伐、步調或速度，指運動員在整個比賽中保持的持續速度，與後句描述穩定的速度表現相符","options":["pace","distance","victory","noise"],"sentence":"The runner maintained a steady ______ throughout the marathon race. He neither sprinted too fast at the beginning nor slowed down significantly near the end.","translation":"那名跑者在整個馬拉松比賽中保持了穩定的步調。他既沒有在開始時衝刺太快，也沒有在接近終點時明顯放慢速度。","word":"pace"}},"packet":{"createdAt":1781738105687,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"packet 指的是一個小的、輕便的包裝或容器，通常用於裝載小量的商品。","options":["barrel","packet","crate","container"],"sentence":"She bought a ______ of instant noodles from the convenience store for her lunch. The small container contained dried noodles, seasoning powder, and cooking instructions all in one unit.","translation":"她從便利店為午餐買了一小包速凍麵。這個小容器裡面包含了乾麵、調味粉和烹飪說明，全部在一個單位裡。","word":"packet"}},"palace":{"createdAt":1788737560825,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"palace特指帝王或統治者的官方住所，通常規模宏大華麗，代表王權和統治權力。","options":["mansion","castle","palace","fortress"],"sentence":"The royal family lived in a magnificent ______ with hundreds of rooms and golden decorations. Tourists from around the world came to admire the residence of the monarch.","translation":"皇家成員住在一座有數百個房間和黃金裝飾的宏偉宮殿中。來自世界各地的遊客前來欣賞這個君主的住所。","word":"palace"}},"panel":{"createdAt":1782533789136,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"panel 名詞意思是專家小組或評審團，指為了特定目的而聚集在一起的一群人。","options":["committee","panel","board","jury"],"sentence":"A ______ of experts reviewed the research proposal before approving the funding for the scientific study. The selection committee included five specialists from different medical fields.","translation":"一個專家小組在批准科學研究的資金之前審查了研究提案。評選委員會包括來自不同醫學領域的五位專家。","word":"panel"}},"panelled":{"createdAt":1781515329268,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"panelled 形容詞，意思是鑲嵌面板的、用木板裝飾的，指用板材覆蓋或裝飾的表面。","options":["painted","panelled","tiled","carpeted"],"sentence":"The mansion's dining room featured walls ______ with dark mahogany wood. The luxurious interior design gave the space an elegant and sophisticated appearance.","translation":"豪宅的餐廳的牆壁用深色桃花心木面板裝飾。奢華的室內設計賦予該空間優雅而精緻的外觀。","word":"panelled"}},"panic":{"createdAt":1781758494838,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"panic 指突然的恐懼和驚慌失措，與第二句中人們急忙逃難的行為相符。","options":["calm","joy","panic","boredom"],"sentence":"When the fire alarm suddenly went off, a wave of ______ swept through the crowded shopping mall. People ran frantically toward the exits, pushing and shoving in their desperate attempt to escape.","translation":"當火警警報突然響起時，驚恐蔓延整個擁擠的購物中心。人們瘋狂地跑向出口，推搡著試圖逃脫。","word":"panic"}},"paperback":{"createdAt":1781709984198,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"paperback 名詞指用紙質封面裝訂的書籍，通常比精裝本便宜且更輕便。","options":["hardbound","paperback","leather-bound","cloth-covered"],"sentence":"I bought a ______ version of the novel because it was less expensive than the hardcover edition. The soft cover made it easy to carry in my backpack while traveling.","translation":"我買了小說的平裝本，因為它比精裝版便宜。柔軟的封面使我在旅行時容易將其放入背包中。","word":"paperback"}},"parachute":{"createdAt":1781836375376,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"parachute是降落傘，一種用於從飛行中的飛機安全著陸的裝置。","options":["umbrella","parachute","balloon","net"],"sentence":"When the plane's engines failed, the pilot deployed his ______ and prepared to land safely. The device slowed his descent significantly as he drifted toward the ground.","translation":"當飛機引擎失效時，飛行員部署了降落傘並準備安全著陸。該裝置在他漂向地面時顯著減緩了他的下降。","word":"parachute"}},"paradise":{"createdAt":1782378744792,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"paradise是指天堂或天囿樂園，指一個完美、令人快樂的地方，與文句中所描述的美好環境相符。","options":["prison","paradise","challenge","burden"],"sentence":"After years of hard work, Sarah finally found her ______ on a small island with beautiful beaches and peaceful surroundings. She had dreamed of this perfect, idyllic place her entire life.","translation":"經過多年努力工作後，莎拉終於在一個有美麗海灘和寧靜環境的小島上找到了她的天堂。她一輩子都夢想著這個完美、理想的地方。","word":"paradise"}},"paradox":{"createdAt":1781449095516,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"paradox意為似是而非或自相矛盾，用來描述看似不合邏輯但可能含有真理的言論或情況。","options":["truth","paradox","fact","principle"],"sentence":"The statement that \"less is more\" is a famous ______ in philosophy. It seems contradictory at first, but it actually makes sense when you think deeply about it.","translation":"「少即是多」這句話是哲學中著名的悖論。乍看之下似乎自相矛盾，但當你深入思考時，它實際上是有道理的。","word":"paradox"}},"parallel":{"createdAt":1783005778377,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"parallel 意為「平行的」，指兩條線或面保持相同方向且距離恆定，永不相交。","options":["diverging","converging","parallel","perpendicular"],"sentence":"The two railroad tracks ran ______ to each other, maintaining exactly the same distance throughout their entire length. Engineers ensured they never intersected despite stretching across hundreds of kilometers.","translation":"兩條鐵軌彼此平行運行，在整個長度上保持完全相同的距離。工程師確保儘管延伸數百公里，它們也不會相交。","word":"parallel"}},"paralysis":{"createdAt":1782533789138,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"paralysis 名詞意思是癱瘓或麻痺，指身體某部分失去運動能力或感覺的狀態。","options":["weakness","paralysis","fatigue","numbness"],"sentence":"The patient suffered complete ______ of his lower limbs after the spinal cord injury. Doctors explained that the nerve damage prevented any movement or sensation below his waist.","translation":"患者在脊髓損傷後下肢完全癱瘓。醫生解釋說神經損傷導致腰部以下無法活動或感覺。","word":"paralysis"}},"paralyze":{"createdAt":1781693266949,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"paralyze表示使某人或某物失去行動能力或思考能力，引申為使人感到極度害怕或無能為力。","options":["energize","motivate","paralyze","encourage"],"sentence":"The accident seemed to ______ the entire community with fear. Everyone was too shocked and frightened to move or speak for several minutes.","translation":"這起事故似乎使整個社區都被恐懼所癱瘓。每個人都震驚和害怕得說不出話來，無法行動。","word":"paralyze"}},"paraphrase":{"createdAt":1787118100434,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"paraphrase 是指用自己的話重新表達他人的思想或文本，保持意思不變但用詞不同。","options":["memorize","paraphrase","recite","translate"],"sentence":"The student was asked to ______ the original poem in her own words for the assignment. She had to express the same meaning without copying the author's exact phrasing.","translation":"學生被要求用自己的話改述原詩以完成作業。她必須在不抄襲作者確切措辭的情況下表達相同的意思。","word":"paraphrase"}},"parliament":{"createdAt":1785463654216,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"parliament 指國家的議會或國會，是制定和批准法律的正式立法機構。","options":["the court","parliament","the university","the company"],"sentence":"The new law was debated extensively before it was approved by ______ last month. Members of both the House and the Senate voted on the legislation in the nation's legislative body.","translation":"這項新法律在上個月獲得議會批准之前經過了廣泛的辯論。眾議院和參議院的成員在國家立法機構中投票表決了該立法。","word":"parliament"}},"parole":{"createdAt":1784540125094,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"parole是指有條件的提前釋放囚犯，不同於完全自由，釋放人員仍需遵守特定條件。","options":["freedom","bail","parole","amnesty"],"sentence":"After serving ten years of his sentence, the prisoner was granted ______ and released from prison early. The condition allowed him to live in society again, but he had to report to his officer monthly and follow strict behavioral rules.","translation":"在服刑十年後，囚犯被獲准假釋並提前釋放出獄。這項條件允許他重新回到社會生活，但他必須每月向官員報到並遵守嚴格的行為規則。","word":"parole"}},"partial":{"createdAt":1782408854742,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"partial 作為形容詞表示偏袒或不公正，傾向於支持某一方而損害另一方的利益。","options":["honest","neutral","partial","thorough"],"sentence":"The judge was accused of being ______ in her decision because she favored one side over the other. Her ruling clearly did not treat both parties equally or fairly.","translation":"法官因為偏袒一方而被指責決定是有偏見的。她的裁決明顯地沒有平等或公平對待雙方。","word":"partial"}},"participant":{"createdAt":1783783369671,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"participant（參與者）指的是主動參與或分享某項活動的人，而不是被動地觀看或旁觀。","options":["observer","participant","sponsor","audience"],"sentence":"Each ______ in the debate competition received a certificate of participation. The organizers made sure to recognize everyone who took an active role in the event.","translation":"辯論比賽中的每位參與者都獲得了參賽證書。組織者確保認可了在活動中發揮積極作用的每一個人。","word":"participant"}},"participate":{"createdAt":1783839725049,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"participate 是動詞，表示主動加入或參與某項活動、事件或過程。","options":["participate","watch","organize","sponsor"],"sentence":"All students are encouraged to ______ in the school's sports day competition. Those who sign up will receive a free t-shirt and have the chance to win medals.","translation":"所有學生都被鼓勵在學校運動會比賽中參與。報名的學生將獲得免費t恤並有機會獲得獎牌。","word":"participate"}},"participation":{"createdAt":1781345746906,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"participation 作名詞，指參與或加入某項活動，強調主動的投入。","options":["absence","participation","observation","distraction"],"sentence":"Active ______ in classroom discussions has significantly improved students' academic performance. Teachers noticed that engaged students who regularly contributed their ideas achieved higher grades.","translation":"在課堂討論中的積極參與大大提高了學生的學習成績。教師們注意到積極參與並經常貢獻想法的學生成績更高。","word":"participation"}},"particle":{"createdAt":1786007511424,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"particle是指極小的物質碎片或顆粒，可以是固體、液體或氣體狀態，通常用來描述肉眼難以看見的微小單位。","options":["element","particle","substance","molecule"],"sentence":"A ______ of dust floated through the beam of sunlight in the room. The scientist studied this tiny piece of matter under a microscope to understand its atomic structure.","translation":"一粒塵埃在房間的陽光束中飄浮。科學家在顯微鏡下研究這個極小的物質碎片，以了解其原子結構。","word":"particle"}},"particular":{"createdAt":1781582251998,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"particular 是形容詞，表示獨特的、特殊的或與眾不同的特質。","options":["common","generic","particular","standard"],"sentence":"This restaurant has a ______ style of cooking that you won't find anywhere else in the city. The chef uses secret family recipes passed down through three generations.","translation":"這家餐廳有一種獨特的烹飪風格，在城市的其他地方找不到。主廚使用傳承三代的祕密家傳食譜。","word":"particular"}},"particularly":{"createdAt":1781693271588,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"particularly表示特別地、尤其地，用於強調某個事物在眾多選擇中特別受歡迎或重要。","options":["generally","particularly","rarely","never"],"sentence":"The restaurant serves many delicious dishes, but I enjoy their seafood ______ whenever I visit. The ocean-based meals are my favorite items on the entire menu.","translation":"這家餐廳提供許多美味佳餚，但我特別喜歡他們的海鮮。這些海鮮餐是整個菜單上我最喜歡的項目。","word":"particularly"}},"partly":{"createdAt":1788788231272,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"partly 是副詞，意思是「部分地」或「在某種程度上」，用來表示某事物只完成了一部分而非全部。","options":["entirely","partly","slowly","carefully"],"sentence":"The project was ______ completed due to budget constraints. However, the team managed to finish the most critical components before running out of funds.","translation":"由於預算限制，該專案只是部分地完成了。然而，該團隊在資金耗盡之前設法完成了最關鍵的組件。","word":"partly"}},"partnership":{"createdAt":1784532099868,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"partnership 指的是兩個或多個人或組織之間的合作關係，雙方共同工作並分享利益和責任。","options":["competition","partnership","hierarchy","monopoly"],"sentence":"The two companies formed a ______ to develop new technology together. Under this agreement, they would share profits, responsibilities, and decision-making equally.","translation":"兩家公司形成了一種夥伴關係來共同開發新技術。根據這項協議，他們將平等地分享利潤、責任和決策權。","word":"partnership"}},"pass_down":{"createdAt":1782361629311,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pass down 表示「傳承」或「代代相傳」，指將知識、技能或傳統從長輩傳給晚輩。","options":["throw away","pass down","forget","sell"],"sentence":"The family decided to ______ their grandmother's recipe for traditional mooncakes to the youngest generation. Each member of the family has carefully preserved these instructions for over a century.","translation":"這個家族決定把祖母的傳統月餅食譜傳承給最年輕的一代。家族的每一位成員都小心翼翼地保留了這些食譜超過一個世紀。","word":"pass down"}},"passage":{"createdAt":1783566294541,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"passage表示文章或文本中的一段內容，通常指書籍或文獻中的特定部分。","options":["book","passage","story","chapter"],"sentence":"The teacher asked us to write an essay about a ______ from our favorite novel. We had to analyze the three paragraphs she highlighted in the textbook.","translation":"老師要求我們寫一篇關於我們最喜歡的小說中的一段文章的文章。我們必須分析她在教科書中標記的三個段落。","word":"passage"}},"passenger":{"createdAt":1783690944506,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"passenger特指「乘客、旅客」，是搭乘交通工具（如飛機、火車、汽車等）的人的專用術語。","options":["traveler","person","passenger","customer"],"sentence":"Each ______ on the flight was asked to show their boarding pass and identification at the gate. The airline staff checked documents systematically before allowing people to board the aircraft.","translation":"飛行上的每位乘客都被要求在登機口出示登機證和身份證明。航空公司工作人員在允許人們登機前系統地檢查了證件。","word":"passenger"}},"passer":{"createdAt":1785244147966,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"passer指的是偶然經過某地的行人或路人，強調是臨時出現而非預先認識或固定角色的人。","options":["friend","passer","guard","vendor"],"sentence":"A ______ stopped to help when the elderly woman dropped her groceries on the street. This kind stranger, who was simply walking by at that moment, didn't hesitate to assist her.","translation":"當這位年長婦女在街上掉落雜貨時，一位過路人停下來幫助她。這位素不相識的人，恰好在那一刻經過，毫不猶豫地幫助了她。","word":"passer"}},"passer_by":{"createdAt":1781926371001,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"passer-by 意思是路人、過路人，指恰好經過某地點的人，通常與該地點沒有特定的關係。","options":["resident","passer-by","police officer","driver"],"sentence":"A ______ witnessed the car accident and immediately called the emergency services. The witness provided crucial information about what happened at the intersection.","translation":"一位路人目擊了這起車禍，並立即撥打了急救服務電話。這位證人提供了關於在十字路口發生的情況的關鍵信息。","word":"passer-by"}},"passion":{"createdAt":1786033221184,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"passion 指的是對某事物的強烈熱愛和內在驅動力，不僅僅是興趣或愛好，而是深層的情感投入和持久的動力。","options":["hobby","passion","talent","interest"],"sentence":"She pursued her ______ for painting with dedication, spending hours in her studio every day. Her friends admired how intensely she cared about this artistic pursuit, which drove all her creative decisions.","translation":"她以奉獻精神追求她對繪畫的熱情，每天在工作室裡花費數小時。她的朋友們欽佩她對這個藝術追求的熱烈程度，這推動了她所有的創意決定。","word":"passion"}},"passionate":{"createdAt":1787291156706,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"passionate意為熱情的或熱烈的，形容一個人或其行為充滿感情、熱忱和強烈的信念。","options":["boring","brief","passionate","technical"],"sentence":"She gave a ______ speech about climate change that moved many people in the audience to tears. Her intense delivery and sincere commitment to the cause inspired everyone to take action.","translation":"她發表了一場關於氣候變化的______演講，使許多觀眾感動得流淚。她強烈的表達方式和對這一事業的真摯承諾激勵了每個人採取行動。","word":"passionate"}},"passive":{"createdAt":1784546023701,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"passive 作為形容詞表示消極的、被動的，指一個人不主動採取行動或參與的態度和行為。","options":["negative","passive","cold","indifferent"],"sentence":"His ______ attitude toward the project frustrated his team members who wanted active participation. Instead of offering ideas and solutions, he simply listened without contributing anything.","translation":"他對這個項目的被動態度激怒了希望積極參與的團隊成員。他沒有提出想法和解決方案，只是被動地聽著，沒有貢獻任何東西。","word":"passive"}},"pastime":{"createdAt":1781311922067,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pastime 是指用來打發時間或消遣的活動，通常是為了娛樂和享受。","options":["job","pastime","habit","chore"],"sentence":"Reading novels is my favorite ______ during long train journeys. I find that spending time with a good book helps the hours pass quickly and keeps me entertained.","translation":"在長途火車旅行中，閱讀小說是我最喜愛的消遣。我發現花時間讀一本好書能幫助時間快速流逝並保持我的娛樂。","word":"pastime"}},"pastry":{"createdAt":1785728734900,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pastry指的是由麵粉、奶油和其他材料製成的油酥甜點或點心，通常具有分層且酥脆的質地。","options":["bread","pastry","soup","salad"],"sentence":"The baker carefully layered butter and dough to create a delicate ______ for the morning display case. The flaky, golden creations included croissants, éclairs, and Danish swirls that customers lined up to purchase.","translation":"麵包師傅仔細地將奶油和麵團分層，為早晨的展示櫃製作精緻的油酥糕點。這些酥脆的金黃色創意包括可頌麵包、閃電泡芙和丹麥捲，吸引顧客排隊購買。","word":"pastry"}},"patch":{"createdAt":1785339147825,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"patch指一個相對較小、有特殊特徵或外觀不同的地方，或用來修補洞孔的材料。","options":["section","patch","row","area"],"sentence":"The farmer noticed a small ______ of diseased plants in the middle of his wheat field. He quickly isolated and removed that area to prevent the infection from spreading to nearby crops.","translation":"農民在他的麥田中央發現了一小塊患病的植物。他迅速隔離並移除了那片區域，以防止感染蔓延到附近的莊稼。","word":"patch"}},"patent":{"createdAt":1781842656772,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"專利權是政府授予發明人在一定時期內對其發明享有的獨占權利，用以保護創新的技術或產品。","options":["license","patent","trademark","copyright"],"sentence":"The inventor filed a ______ to protect her new invention from being copied by competitors. The government granted her exclusive rights to manufacture and sell the product for twenty years.","translation":"這位發明家申請了專利權來保護她的新發明，防止競爭對手抄襲。政府授予她在二十年內製造和銷售該產品的獨家權利。","word":"patent"}},"path":{"createdAt":1781268630480,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"path指的是小徑或小路，通常是行人或動物行走的較窄的通道。","options":["road","path","highway","bridge"],"sentence":"The hikers followed a narrow ______ through the dense forest. The trail was clearly marked with white blazes on the trees.","translation":"登山者沿著一條狹窄的小徑穿過密林。這條小路在樹上用白色標記清晰地標記。","word":"path"}},"pathetic":{"createdAt":1781693254761,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pathetic形容令人感到失望或悲慘的情況，通常帶有負面評價。","options":["excellent","pathetic","energetic","athletic"],"sentence":"The team's performance in the championship game was absolutely ______, with players making careless mistakes throughout. They lost 0-10, failing to score a single point.","translation":"球隊在錦標賽中的表現絕對悲慘，球員們始終在犯粗心大意的錯誤。他們以0比10的比分落敗，未能得到一分。","word":"pathetic"}},"patience":{"createdAt":1783609867016,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"patience是名詞，表示能夠冷靜地承受延遲、困難或煩惱而不感到沮喪的品質","options":["speed","patience","talent","intelligence"],"sentence":"Learning a new language requires great ______ and consistent practice over months. You must remain calm and not expect immediate results.","translation":"學習一門新語言需要極大的耐心和數月的持續練習。你必須保持冷靜，不要期望立竿見影的結果。","word":"patience"}},"patient":{"createdAt":1784723959945,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"patient 作為形容詞表示有耐心的、能夠忍耐的特質，指一個人在困難情況下保持冷靜。","options":["experienced","patient","skilled","young"],"sentence":"The ______ doctor waited calmly as the emergency room filled with people needing immediate care. Despite the chaos and long hours, she never showed frustration or anger.","translation":"這位有耐心的醫生在急診室人滿為患時沉著地等待。儘管混亂和長時間工作，她從未表現出沮喪或憤怒。","word":"patient"}},"patriot":{"createdAt":1784078512099,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"patriot 指的是深愛自己國家並願意為國家利益而犧牲的人，不僅是軍人、領導人或將軍。","options":["soldier","patriot","leader","general"],"sentence":"George Washington was a ______ who fought for American independence. He dedicated his life to serving his country and inspiring others to do the same.","translation":"喬治·華盛頓是一位為美國獨立而戰的愛國者。他終身致力於服侍自己的國家，並激勵他人也這樣做。","word":"patriot"}},"patriotic":{"createdAt":1781437013477,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"patriotic 形容人對自己的國家忠誠和熱愛，願意為國家的利益而奉獻。","options":["patriotic","selfish","indifferent","cowardly"],"sentence":"The soldiers displayed their ______ spirit by volunteering to serve their country during the war. They were willing to sacrifice their safety to protect their nation's freedom and independence.","translation":"士兵們通過在戰爭期間自願為祖國服役來展現他們的愛國精神。他們願意犧牲自己的安全來保護國家的自由和獨立。","word":"patriotic"}},"patrol":{"createdAt":1781257238304,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"patrol指定期往返巡視某個區域，通常是為了維持秩序和安全。","options":["construct","patrol","decorate","abandon"],"sentence":"Police officers ______ the streets every night to maintain safety. The officers walked up and down each block checking for any signs of trouble or suspicious activity.","translation":"警察每晚巡邏街道以維護安全。警察沿著每個街區走上走下，檢查任何麻煩跡象或可疑活動。","word":"patrol"}},"patron":{"createdAt":1786024548446,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"patron 在此指資助或贊助文化機構的人，通常是有經濟實力並支持藝術、文化或慈善事業的人士。","options":["customer","patron","visitor","investor"],"sentence":"The wealthy ______ donated a large sum of money to the local art museum. His generous support allowed the museum to acquire several rare paintings for its permanent collection.","translation":"那位富有的贊助者向當地藝術博物館捐贈了一大筆金錢。他的慷慨支持使博物館能夠為其永久收藏購得幾幅罕見的畫作。","word":"patron"}},"pattern":{"createdAt":1785072842094,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pattern 指的是在某物表面上重複出現的設計、圖案或典型的排列方式。","options":["texture","pattern","material","color"],"sentence":"The fabric had a beautiful floral ______ that repeated every few inches. The designer carefully studied the geometric arrangement to create a consistent and visually pleasing design.","translation":"這塊布料有美麗的花卉圖案，每隔幾英寸重複出現。設計師仔細研究了這個幾何排列方式，以創造出一致且視覺上令人愉悅的設計。","word":"pattern"}},"pause":{"createdAt":1782980805883,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pause 在此作名詞使用，表示短暫的停頓或間斷，讓人能夠恢復精力。","options":["break","pause","delay","wait"],"sentence":"The teacher asked the students to take a ______ before continuing with the difficult exam. After five minutes of rest, they felt more focused and ready to proceed.","translation":"老師要求學生在繼續進行困難的考試前稍作暫停。休息五分鐘後，他們感到更加專注，準備好繼續前進。","word":"pause"}},"peak":{"createdAt":1782475871716,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"peak 表示「山頂；頂端」，指山或高地的最高處","options":["base","peak","slope","trail"],"sentence":"The mountain climbers finally reached the ______ after climbing for eight hours. From this highest point, they could see the entire valley below.","translation":"登山者經過八小時的攀登後，終於到達了山頂。從這個最高點，他們可以看到下面的整個山谷。","word":"peak"}},"pearl":{"createdAt":1783489104904,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"珍珠是由牡蠣或蚌類貝殼分泌的物質形成的圓形寶石，具有獨特的光澤和柔和的色澤。","options":["diamond","pearl","emerald","sapphire"],"sentence":"She wore a necklace made of white ______ that had been passed down through her family for generations. The lustrous gem gleamed softly in the candlelight.","translation":"她戴著一條由白珍珠製成的項鍊，這條項鍊已在她家族中代代相傳。這顆閃亮的寶石在燭光下柔和地閃閃發光。","word":"pearl"}},"peculiar":{"createdAt":1782979135454,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"peculiar 意思是獨特的、奇怪的，指某事物有不同尋常的特質或令人感到新奇和不熟悉。","options":["common","peculiar","pleasant","faint"],"sentence":"The old house had a ______ smell that no one could quite identify. Everyone who visited commented on how unusual and distinctive it was, unlike anything they had encountered before.","translation":"這座老房子有一種獨特的氣味，沒有人能夠完全辨認出來。每個來訪的人都評論說這種氣味是多麼不尋常和與眾不同，不像他們以前遇到過的任何東西。","word":"peculiar"}},"pedal":{"createdAt":1785904647076,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"踏板是指用腳踩踏的機械裝置，通常用來控制車輛或機器的操作。","options":["wheel","pedal","steering","mirror"],"sentence":"The driver pressed the ______ with her foot to slow down the car. She had to apply steady pressure to the brake mechanism to come to a safe stop.","translation":"駕駛員用腳踩下踏板來減慢汽車的速度。她必須對制動機制施加穩定的壓力才能安全停止。","word":"pedal"}},"pedestrian":{"createdAt":1781532967162,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pedestrian 指行人，與「過馬路」和「正在行走的人」的描述相符。","options":["driver","pedestrian","cyclist","passenger"],"sentence":"The ______ was crossing the street when the car suddenly turned the corner. The person walking had the right of way.","translation":"______(行人)正在過馬路時，汽車突然轉過街角。這個正在行走的人有優先通行權。","word":"pedestrian"}},"peek":{"createdAt":1782016805981,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"peek 是動詞，表示快速或秘密地看，通常是從隱蔽的地方窺視。","options":["peek","flee","ignore","skip"],"sentence":"The curious child tried to ______ behind the curtain to see what presents were hidden. His mother caught him with his eyes directed toward the gap in the fabric.","translation":"好奇的孩子試著偷看窗簾後面看看隱藏了什麼禮物。他的母親抓住他時，他的眼睛正指向布料的縫隙。","word":"peek"}},"peep":{"createdAt":1783068339370,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"peep 動詞表示窺視、偷看或透過小縫隙看","options":["glance","peep","observe","watch"],"sentence":"The child would ______ through the keyhole to see what was happening in the next room. She pressed her eye against the small opening without being noticed.","translation":"孩子會從鑰匙孔窺視，看看隔壁房間發生了什麼。她將眼睛貼著小開口而沒有被發現。","word":"peep"}},"peer":{"createdAt":1782377450337,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"peer 作為動詞表示「凝視」或「仔細看」，通常用於在困難的視覺條件下費力地看某物。","options":["ignore","peer","knock","wave"],"sentence":"She had to ______ through the foggy window to see if anyone was outside. The dim lighting made it difficult for her to see clearly, so she squinted hard.","translation":"她必須透過霧濛濛的窗戶凝視以查看外面是否有人。昏暗的光線使她難以看清楚，所以她用力眯著眼睛。","word":"peer"}},"pelt":{"createdAt":1781363994340,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"pelt作為名詞表示動物的皮毛，通常指去毛的獸皮，可用於製作衣物或毛皮製品。","options":["skin","arrow","voice","stone"],"sentence":"The hunter carefully removed the ______ from the animal to use as clothing. He stretched and dried the soft fur before trading it at the market.","translation":"獵人小心地從動物身上剝下獸皮來作為衣服。他在拿到市場交易之前先將柔軟的毛皮拉伸並晾乾。","word":"pelt"}},"penalty":{"createdAt":1781268630486,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"penalty指的是處罰或懲罰，特別是針對違規或犯罪行為的懲罰。","options":["reward","bonus","penalty","award"],"sentence":"The player received a ______ for fouling his opponent during the game. He was benched for the next five minutes as punishment.","translation":"球員因在比賽中犯規對手而受到處罰。作為懲罰，他被替換下場五分鐘。","word":"penalty"}},"pending":{"createdAt":1782477421076,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pending 表示某事物正在等待中或尚未決定的狀態，強調事情還沒有完成或確定。","options":["approved","pending","rejected","signed"],"sentence":"The contract is still ______ approval from both parties. The lawyers expect a final decision within the next two weeks.","translation":"合約仍然待定批准雙方同意。律師預期在未來兩週內會有最終決定。","word":"pending"}},"penetrate":{"createdAt":1783262026084,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"penetrate 作為動詞表示「看穿、洞察」，指深入理解或識破某事物的真實本質。","options":["ignore","penetrate","accept","overlook"],"sentence":"The detective was able to ______ the suspect's lies through careful questioning and analysis of the evidence. Her sharp investigative skills revealed the truth that had been hidden beneath false statements.","translation":"偵探通過仔細的訊問和證據分析能夠看穿嫌疑人的謊言。她敏銳的調查技能揭示了隱藏在虛假陳述下面的真相。","word":"penetrate"}},"penetrating":{"createdAt":1788918832587,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"penetrating 作為形容詞表示敏銳的、深刻的，通常用來形容能夠看穿本質的眼光、評論或問題。","options":["penetrating","vague","friendly","casual"],"sentence":"The detective's ______ questions about the suspect's alibi quickly revealed inconsistencies in his story. His sharp and thorough interrogation technique left no room for evasion.","translation":"偵探對於嫌疑人不在場證明的敏銳提問迅速揭露了他故事中的矛盾之處。他精闢而徹底的審問技巧不允許任何迴避。","word":"penetrating"}},"peninsula":{"createdAt":1781926370999,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"peninsula 意思是半島，指由水體三面包圍、只有一面與陸地相連的地理區域。","options":["island","peninsula","continent","plateau"],"sentence":"Florida is a large ______ that extends into the Atlantic Ocean and Gulf of Mexico. It is surrounded by water on three sides, which shapes its climate and economy.","translation":"佛羅里達是一個伸入大西洋和墨西哥灣的大半島。它在三面被水包圍，這形成了它的氣候和經濟。","word":"peninsula"}},"penniless":{"createdAt":1788028661418,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"penniless 意思是「一文不名或身無分文」，描述一個人沒有任何錢。","options":["wealthy","homeless","penniless","famous"],"sentence":"After losing his job and spending all his savings, Tom became ______. He had to ask friends for help because he couldn't afford even a meal.","translation":"失去工作並花光所有積蓄後，湯姆身無分文。他不得不向朋友求助，因為他連頓飯都吃不起。","word":"penniless"}},"pension":{"createdAt":1782352245070,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"pension指的是退休後由政府或前僱主提供的定期養老金或年金。","options":["salary","loan","pension","bonus"],"sentence":"After working for forty years, my grandfather finally receives a monthly ______ from his former company. This income helps him cover his living expenses in retirement.","translation":"在工作四十年後，我祖父終於從他的前公司領取月度養老金。這筆收入幫助他支付退休後的生活費用。","word":"pension"}},"per":{"createdAt":1781414884520,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"per是介詞，表示「每」或「每一」，常用於計算單位價格或比率。","options":["per","after","during","beyond"],"sentence":"The car rental company charges thirty dollars ______ day for this luxury vehicle. If you rent it for a week, the total cost would be two hundred and ten dollars.","translation":"租車公司對這輛豪華車每天收費三十美元。如果你租一週，總成本將是二百一十美元。","word":"per"}},"perceive":{"createdAt":1785242988951,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"perceive意思是通過感官或意識來發現、注意到或理解某事物，強調的是通過觀察或感知而獲得認識。","options":["ignore","perceive","forget","misunderstand"],"sentence":"Many people ______ the sudden change in temperature as a sign of approaching weather. The meteorologist confirmed that this perception accurately predicted the storm.","translation":"許多人察覺到溫度的突然變化是接近的天氣的信號。氣象學家證實了這種察覺準確預測了風暴。","word":"perceive"}},"perception":{"createdAt":1781268630485,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"perception指的是感知或認知，是指人對事物的理解和看法，可能與事實不符。","options":["action","perception","reaction","decision"],"sentence":"His ______ of the situation was completely different from reality. He believed the meeting was a disaster when it actually went very well.","translation":"他對局勢的感知與現實完全不同。他認為會議是一場災難，而實際上進行得非常順利。","word":"perception"}},"perceptual":{"createdAt":1784102962362,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"perceptual 是指與感官知覺或認知過程相關的，用來描述人透過感覺器官和大腦如何理解世界的方式。","options":["emotional","perceptual","technical","visual"],"sentence":"The artist's ______ experience of color differs from what the camera actually captures. She sees rich warm tones in the sunset, but the photograph shows cooler hues because her brain interprets light differently than the device's sensors.","translation":"這位藝術家對顏色的感知經驗與相機實際捕捉的不同。她在日落中看到豐富溫暖的色調，但照片卻顯示較冷的色調，因為她的大腦對光線的解釋方式與設備的傳感器不同。","word":"perceptual"}},"perch":{"createdAt":1784125382686,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"perch 強調在高處或邊緣位置停留，特別用來描述鳥類在高處棲息的動作。","options":["sit","perch","rest","land"],"sentence":"The bird decided to ______ on the highest branch of the old oak tree. From that elevated spot, it could see the entire forest below and spot any approaching predators.","translation":"那隻鳥決定在老橡樹最高的樹枝上棲息。從那個高處，牠可以看到下面整個森林，並發現任何接近的掠食者。","word":"perch"}},"perfectionist":{"createdAt":1781864339052,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"perfectionist指對自己或他人的工作要求極高，追求完美無缺的人。","options":["student","perfectionist","writer","scholar"],"sentence":"My sister is such a ______ that she rewrites her essays five times before submitting them. Even though her first draft is already excellent, she insists on finding every tiny flaw.","translation":"我的妹妹是個完美主義者，她在提交論文前要重寫五次。雖然她的初稿已經很優秀了，但她堅持要找到每一個小缺點。","word":"perfectionist"}},"perform":{"createdAt":1782096279665,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"perform指在觀眾面前進行表演、演出或呈現某項才藝或活動。","options":["disappear","perform","construct","calculate"],"sentence":"The orchestra was asked to ______ at the opening ceremony of the international sports festival. The musicians rehearsed for weeks to ensure their presentation was flawless.","translation":"管弦樂隊被邀請在國際運動節的開幕式上演出。音樂家們排練了數週以確保他們的表演完美無瑕。","word":"perform"}},"performance":{"createdAt":1782637076487,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"performance 是表演、表現或成就的意思，指在藝術或其他領域中的表現質量。","options":["costume","performance","script","stage"],"sentence":"The actor's ______ in the drama was outstanding and earned him critical acclaim from major newspapers. His skilled portrayal of the lead character moved audiences to tears.","translation":"演員在戲劇中的表演非常出色，為他贏得了主要報紙的評論好評。他對主角的精湛演繹感動了觀眾。","word":"performance"}},"performer":{"createdAt":1781832549170,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"performer 指在觀眾面前進行表演或展示技能的人，可以是舞者、雜技演員、音樂家等各種類型。","options":["musician","painter","performer","chef"],"sentence":"The talented ______ captivated the entire audience with her stunning acrobatic display on stage. Her years of training and practice were evident in every graceful movement she executed.","translation":"這位才華橫溢的表演者用她舞台上令人驚歎的特技表演吸引了整個觀眾。她多年的訓練和練習在她執行的每一個優雅動作中都很明顯。","word":"performer"}},"perfume":{"createdAt":1783482955479,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"perfume 是一種含有高濃度香精的液體化妝品，用來為身體增添香味，通常比其他香氛產品的香氣濃郁持久。","options":["cologne","perfume","deodorant","lotion"],"sentence":"She sprayed her favorite ______ on her wrists before leaving for the party. The sweet-smelling liquid made everyone around her notice the pleasant fragrance immediately.","translation":"她在參加派對前在手腕上噴了她最喜歡的香水。這種甜香的液體讓她周圍的人立刻注意到怡人的香氣。","word":"perfume"}},"perhaps":{"createdAt":1783505313975,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"perhaps作副詞表示「也許」或「或許」，用於表達不確定性和可能性。","options":["definitely","perhaps","certainly","obviously"],"sentence":"We should leave now, or ______ we could wait another hour to see if the weather improves. The forecast shows there is only a thirty percent chance of rain, so it is uncertain.","translation":"我們現在應該出發，或者也許我們可以再等一個小時看天氣是否改善。預報顯示只有百分之三十的下雨機率，所以情況不確定。","word":"perhaps"}},"peril":{"createdAt":1782037869758,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"peril是名詞，表示嚴重的危險或威脅，常用來描述可能造成傷害或死亡的情況。","options":["opportunity","peril","benefit","comfort"],"sentence":"Sailors face great ______ when navigating through the stormy waters near the rocky coast. Many ships have been wrecked in this treacherous area.","translation":"水手在靠近岩石海岸的風暴水域航行時面臨巨大的危險。許多船隻在這片危險的區域被摧毀。","word":"peril"}},"period":{"createdAt":1783332861023,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「period」名詞表示「一段時間、時期」，指具有特定起點和終點的時間段。","options":["moment","period","second","instant"],"sentence":"The company experienced significant growth during the five-year ______ from 2019 to 2024. Their revenue tripled and they expanded to three new countries.","translation":"公司在2019年至2024年五年期間經歷了顯著增長。他們的收入增加了三倍，並擴展到三個新國家。","word":"period"}},"periodic":{"createdAt":1782056686161,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"periodic 表示定期發生或有規律地重複發生，通常按固定的時間間隔進行。","options":["random","periodic","permanent","optional"],"sentence":"The magazine publishes a ______ newsletter every month to keep readers informed. The subscribers always receive their copies on the same date without fail.","translation":"這本雜誌每個月發布定期通訊來讓讀者保持信息靈通。訂閱者總是在同一日期收到他們的副本，從不間斷。","word":"periodic"}},"periodically":{"createdAt":1781693303267,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"periodically 表示「定期地」或「週期性地」，指按照固定的時間間隔反覆進行某項活動。","options":["occasionally","periodically","rarely","once"],"sentence":"The company checks its equipment ______ to ensure everything is functioning properly. These inspections happen every three months without fail.","translation":"公司定期檢查其設備以確保所有東西運作正常。這些檢查每三個月進行一次，風雨不改。","word":"periodically"}},"perish":{"createdAt":1781836375377,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"perish表示毀滅或死亡，特別是指生物因為缺乏必要條件而無法生存。","options":["evolve","perish","migrate","adapt"],"sentence":"Many animals will ______ if their natural habitats continue to be destroyed. Without forests or water sources, they cannot survive.","translation":"如果自然棲息地繼續被破壞，許多動物將會滅絕。沒有森林或水源，它們無法生存。","word":"perish"}},"permanence":{"createdAt":1785140695728,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"permanence 指的是永久性、持久性，表示事物能長期存在和保留的狀態。","options":["destruction","permanence","obscurity","rejection"],"sentence":"The artist hoped her sculptures would achieve ______ by being displayed in the museum's permanent collection. She wanted her work to endure for future generations to admire.","translation":"這位藝術家希望她的雕塑能透過在博物館永久收藏中展出而獲得永久性。她希望自己的作品能為未來世代所欣賞而永存。","word":"permanence"}},"permanent":{"createdAt":1781714871283,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"長久的是指持續很長時間，不會改變或結束的狀態。","options":["seasonal","permanent","brief","casual"],"sentence":"The company decided to hire him for a ______ position rather than a temporary contract. He would work there for many years without any expiration date.","translation":"公司決定為他提供一份長久的職位，而不是臨時合約。他將在那裡工作多年，沒有任何終止日期。","word":"permanent"}},"permanently":{"createdAt":1783332861020,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「permanently」副詞表示「永久地、永久性地」，指某事持久地、不可改變地進行。","options":["temporarily","permanently","hesitantly","gradually"],"sentence":"After the accident, the athlete decided to retire ______ from professional sports. He will never compete again and has closed that chapter of his life.","translation":"在事故發生後，運動員決定永久退出職業體育。他將永遠不再比賽，並已經結束了他人生的這一章。","word":"permanently"}},"permeate":{"createdAt":1787554448280,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"permeate 意為滲透或充滿，指某物在空間或物質中逐漸傳播或擴散開來。","options":["fade","permeate","concentrate","isolate"],"sentence":"The smell of fresh bread began to ______ throughout the entire bakery. Within minutes, even customers outside on the street could detect the delicious aroma.","translation":"新鮮麵包的香氣開始滲透整個麵包店。幾分鐘內，甚至街上的顧客也能聞到這種美味的香氣。","word":"permeate"}},"permissible":{"createdAt":1783255660822,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"permissible 意為「被許可的、允許的」，強調某事符合規則或政策允許的範圍。","options":["acceptable","permissible","possible","reasonable"],"sentence":"Students may submit assignments late only if it is ______ by their instructor. However, the policy clearly states that extensions beyond one week are strictly forbidden.","translation":"學生只有在導師許可的情況下才可以遲交作業。但是，政策明確規定超過一週的延期是嚴格禁止的。","word":"permissible"}},"permission":{"createdAt":1783566294628,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"permission表示準許或許可，是獲得他人同意做某事的權利或正式准許。","options":["advice","permission","help","time"],"sentence":"I asked my parents for ______ to go to the concert next weekend. They said yes and even offered to drive me there.","translation":"我請求父母允許我去參加下週末的音樂會。他們同意了，甚至提出要送我去。","word":"permission"}},"permit":{"createdAt":1784004063885,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"permit 作為動詞表示「允許」或「許可」，在這句話中搭配否定詞 will not，表示學校拒絕允許學生離開校園。","options":["prevent","permit","require","suggest"],"sentence":"The school will not ______ students to leave campus during lunch without written consent. The principal has made it clear that this rule applies to all students without exception.","translation":"學校不會允許學生在午餐時間未經書面同意離開校園。校長已明確表示此規則適用於所有學生，沒有例外。","word":"permit"}},"perseverance":{"createdAt":1781362281661,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"perseverance表示毅力和不屈不撓的精神，即堅持不懈的決心。","options":["laziness","perseverance","arrogance","confusion"],"sentence":"Her ______ through years of training eventually led to Olympic gold. She never gave up despite countless setbacks and failures.","translation":"她多年訓練中的毅力最終導致了奧運金牌。儘管遭遇無數挫折和失敗，她從未放棄。","word":"perseverance"}},"persevere":{"createdAt":1785252384393,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"persevere（堅持）意指在面對困難和障礙時仍然不放棄，持續努力向前。","options":["persevere","retreat","celebrate","experiment"],"sentence":"Even though the project faced many obstacles, the team decided to ______ until they reached their goal. They continued working hard despite failures and setbacks over the next two years.","translation":"儘管該專案面臨許多障礙，該團隊決定堅持下去直到達成目標。儘管在接下來的兩年裡經歷了失敗和挫折，他們仍繼續努力工作。","word":"persevere"}},"persevering":{"createdAt":1784438986220,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"persevering 表示持續不懈、堅持不放棄，即使遭遇困難和失敗也不放棄的態度和行為。","options":["lazy","persevering","confident","intelligent"],"sentence":"Despite facing many obstacles, she remained ______ in her efforts to complete her university degree. Even after failing her exams three times, she studied harder each time and eventually graduated with honors.","translation":"儘管面臨許多障礙，她在完成大學學位的努力中保持堅持。即使在三次考試不及格後，她每次都更加努力地學習，最終以優異成績畢業。","word":"persevering"}},"persist":{"createdAt":1781622232182,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"persist 意為堅持不懈地繼續做某事，儘管遇到困難或反對。","options":["abandon","persist","forget","doubt"],"sentence":"Despite facing rejection, she continued to ______ in her efforts to become a professional musician. Eventually, after years of dedication, she was accepted into a prestigious conservatory.","translation":"儘管面臨拒絕，她繼續堅持她成為專業音樂家的努力。最終，經過多年的奉獻，她被著名音樂學院錄取。","word":"persist"}},"persistence":{"createdAt":1782542941495,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"persistence 是名詞，指持續努力、堅持不懈、不放棄的品質，表現為在困難中繼續追求目標的決心。","options":["laziness","persistence","hesitation","distraction"],"sentence":"Her ______ in studying for the exam paid off when she finally earned an excellent score. Despite facing numerous setbacks and distractions, she never gave up on her goal.","translation":"她在考試中的堅持不懈終於得到了回報，當她最終獲得優異成績時。儘管面臨許多挫折和干擾，她從未放棄自己的目標。","word":"persistence"}},"persistent":{"createdAt":1785898016297,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"persistent 表示持續不斷、堅持不懈的態度，特別是在面對困難或障礙時仍然繼續進行。","options":["temporary","persistent","careless","fortunate"],"sentence":"Despite facing many rejections, Sarah's ______ effort to become an actress never wavered. She auditioned for roles continuously for ten years without giving up.","translation":"儘管面臨許多拒絕，莎拉堅持不懈的努力成為演員的決心從未動搖。她連續十年不放棄地參加角色試鏡。","word":"persistent"}},"persistently":{"createdAt":1786974103479,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"persistently 表示持續地、堅定不移地進行某動作，即使遇到困難或反對也不放棄，這正是「拒絕放棄並繼續嘗試」的含義。","options":["occasionally","persistently","quietly","loudly"],"sentence":"She ______ knocked on the door until someone finally answered. Even after being told to leave multiple times, she refused to give up and kept trying.","translation":"她堅持不懈地敲門，直到有人最後應門。即使被多次告知要離開，她仍然拒絕放棄並繼續嘗試。","word":"persistently"}},"personal":{"createdAt":1787899726587,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"personal 表示「個人的、私人的」，用來描述只屬於某個人或不想與他人分享的事物。","options":["social","personal","public","professional"],"sentence":"She kept her diary in a ______ safe hidden in her bedroom closet. No one else was allowed to read her private thoughts and feelings.","translation":"她把日記保存在臥室壁櫃裡的私人保險箱中。沒有人被允許閱讀她的私密思想和感受。","word":"personal"}},"personality":{"createdAt":1781431278559,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"personality指一個人的個性、人格特質和整體行為模式。","options":["appearance","personality","intelligence","schedule"],"sentence":"Her bright and cheerful ______ makes her popular with everyone at school. Classmates are drawn to her infectious enthusiasm and kind attitude toward others.","translation":"她明亮和愉快的個性使她在學校受歡迎。同學們被她具有感染力的熱情和對他人的善良態度所吸引。","word":"personality"}},"personnel":{"createdAt":1786023912369,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Personnel 指的是全體職員或人事部門，專門處理員工相關的行政事務和管理工作。","options":["equipment","personnel","budget","strategy"],"sentence":"The company's ______ department is responsible for hiring and managing employees. All staff members must report their work schedules to this department.","translation":"公司的人事部門負責招聘和管理員工。所有員工必須向這個部門報告他們的工作時間表。","word":"personnel"}},"perspective":{"createdAt":1785281850796,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"perspective在藝術中指的是透視法，是一種表現三維空間在二維平面上的技術手法。","options":["technique","perspective","angle","method"],"sentence":"From an artistic ______, the painter used vanishing point techniques to create depth on the canvas. This technical approach to drawing is called linear perspective in art.","translation":"從藝術的透視法來看，畫家使用消失點技巧在畫布上創造深度。這種繪畫的技術方法在藝術中稱為線性透視法。","word":"perspective"}},"persuade":{"createdAt":1784159638685,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"persuade 意為「說服某人相信或同意某事」，通常帶有成功改變他人想法的含義，但在這個句子中表示嘗試說服但未成功。","options":["convince","persuade","inform","remind"],"sentence":"The salesman tried to ______ me to buy the expensive car by showing me all its advanced features. However, I remained unconvinced because I had already decided to purchase a different model.","translation":"銷售員試圖透過展示昂貴汽車的所有先進功能來說服我購買它。然而，我仍然不為所動，因為我已經決定購買另一款車型。","word":"persuade"}},"persuasive":{"createdAt":1781515372605,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"persuasive用來形容具有說服力、能讓人改變想法或接受觀點的事物","options":["violent","persuasive","domestic","chief"],"sentence":"The ______ argument convinced many voters to change their minds about the policy. His speech included compelling evidence and logical reasoning that appealed to both emotions and facts.","translation":"那個有說服力的論點說服了許多選民改變對該政策的看法。他的演講包含了令人信服的證據和合理的推理，吸引了情感和事實兩方面的共鳴。","word":"persuasive"}},"pessimism":{"createdAt":1784293721080,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pessimism是指對未來的悲觀看法和負面態度，相信事情不會好轉或會失敗。","options":["optimism","pessimism","realism","pragmatism"],"sentence":"Her ______ about the future made her reluctant to pursue new opportunities. Despite evidence that the economy was recovering, she remained convinced that everything would eventually fail.","translation":"她對未來的悲觀態度使她不願追求新的機會。儘管有證據表明經濟正在復甦，她仍然確信一切最終都會失敗。","word":"pessimism"}},"pessimistic":{"createdAt":1783579287221,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pessimistic 是形容詞，表示對未來持消極或負面的看法，相信事情會往不好的方向發展。","options":["optimistic","pessimistic","realistic","philosophical"],"sentence":"Sarah has a very ______ outlook on life and always expects the worst to happen. Even when her friends try to encourage her, she remains convinced that things will turn out badly.","translation":"莎拉對人生的看法非常悲觀，總是預期最壞的結果會發生。即使她的朋友試圖鼓勵她，她仍然確信事情會變糟。","word":"pessimistic"}},"pest":{"createdAt":1781580511759,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"pest 是指危害農作物或造成麻煩的害蟲或討厭的東西","options":["blessing","helper","pest","friend"],"sentence":"The farmer discovered a ______ infestation in his crops that was destroying the harvest. He would need to use pesticide to eliminate these unwanted insects.","translation":"農民發現他的莊稼中有害蟲侵擾，正在毀壞收穫。他需要使用殺蟲劑來消滅這些不受歡迎的昆蟲。","word":"pest"}},"pesticide":{"createdAt":1783479823225,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pesticide 是名詞，特指用於殺死或驅除害蟲的化學物質或製劑。","options":["fertilizer","pesticide","herbicide","compost"],"sentence":"The farmer applied ______ to his crops to protect them from insects. Without this chemical treatment, the entire harvest would be destroyed by harmful bugs.","translation":"農民在他的作物上施用殺蟲劑以保護它們免受昆蟲侵害。沒有這種化學處理，整個收穫都會被有害的蟲子摧毀。","word":"pesticide"}},"petal":{"createdAt":1783243389245,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"花瓣是花朵最外層的彩色結構，是花的觀賞部分，可以吸引昆蟲前來傳粉。","options":["stem","petal","leaf","seed"],"sentence":"Each colorful ______ of the rose unfolds gracefully as the flower blooms. These delicate leaf-like structures surround the reproductive center and attract pollinators with their bright hues.","translation":"玫瑰花的每一片花瓣在花朵綻放時優雅地展開。這些嬌嫩的葉狀結構環繞在生殖中心周圍，以其鮮豔的色彩吸引傳粉者。","word":"petal"}},"petition":{"createdAt":1786612427675,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"petition 是名詞，指正式提交給當局的請願書或申訴狀，通常由多人簽署以表達集體要求。","options":["complaint","petition","proposal","request"],"sentence":"The residents submitted a ______ to the city council demanding better public transportation. The document contained thousands of signatures from community members who wanted their voices heard on this important issue.","translation":"居民向市議會提交了一份請願書，要求改善公共交通。這份文件包含了數千名社區成員的簽名，他們希望在這個重要議題上被聽到。","word":"petition"}},"petrify":{"createdAt":1789858442642,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"petrify 意為「使驚嚇得僵住」或「嚇得動不了」，通常表示因為極端的恐懼而失去行動能力。","options":["confuse","petrify","entertain","bore"],"sentence":"The horror movie scene would ______ most viewers with its sudden jump scare. When the killer appeared on screen, audiences gasped and froze in their seats, unable to move from sheer terror.","translation":"這個恐怖電影場景會讓大多數觀眾感到驚嚇。當殺手出現在螢幕上時，觀眾驚聲尖叫並在座位上僵住，因為純粹的恐懼而無法動彈。","word":"petrify"}},"petrol":{"createdAt":1784176328504,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"petrol 是名詞，指汽油或燃油，用於驅動汽車引擎和其他內燃機。","options":["water","electricity","petrol","food"],"sentence":"The old car consumed a lot of ______ during long road trips across the country. We had to stop at gas stations frequently because the engine was very inefficient.","translation":"這輛老車在長途公路旅行中消耗了大量汽油。我們必須經常停在加油站，因為引擎效率很低。","word":"petrol"}},"petroleum":{"createdAt":1786449307955,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"petroleum是指石油，一種從地下開採的化石燃料，可以精煉成各種能源產品。","options":["aluminum","petroleum","timber","uranium"],"sentence":"Many countries depend on ______ exports to generate revenue for their economies. This fossil fuel is refined into gasoline, diesel, and other products used worldwide.","translation":"許多國家依靠石油出口來為其經濟產生收入。這種化石燃料被精煉成汽油、柴油和全球使用的其他產品。","word":"petroleum"}},"petty":{"createdAt":1782352245062,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"petty形容事物瑣碎、微不足道或不重要，也可指人小氣或心胸狹窄。","options":["serious","urgent","petty","critical"],"sentence":"The employee complained about ______ issues like the temperature of the office coffee. Her manager dismissed these concerns as insignificant compared to major workplace problems.","translation":"員工抱怨辦公室咖啡溫度之類的瑣碎問題。她的經理認為這些問題相比主要的工作問題微不足道而將其駁回。","word":"petty"}},"pharmacist":{"createdAt":1786995012605,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pharmacist是指在醫院或藥房工作、具有藥學專業資格、負責配藥和用藥指導的專業人員。","options":["doctor","pharmacist","nurse","chemist"],"sentence":"My uncle is a ______ who works at the local hospital dispensing medications. He spent four years in pharmacy school learning how to prepare and distribute prescription drugs safely to patients.","translation":"我的叔叔是在當地醫院工作的藥劑師，負責配藥。他在藥學院花了四年時間學習如何安全地為患者準備和配發處方藥。","word":"pharmacist"}},"pharmacy":{"createdAt":1784980745492,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"pharmacy 是指銷售和配發藥物的商店或機構，由藥劑師負責管理，顧客可以在此獲取處方藥物。","options":["library","bakery","pharmacy","cinema"],"sentence":"She went to the ______ to pick up her prescription for antibiotics. The licensed pharmacist checked her ID and explained the dosage instructions carefully.","translation":"她去藥房取她的抗生素處方。持證藥劑師檢查了她的身分證並仔細解釋了用藥劑量。","word":"pharmacy"}},"phase":{"createdAt":1784110946857,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"phase 意為階段、時期，用來描述一個過程或發展中的特定時間段或部分。","options":["delay","phase","setback","conclusion"],"sentence":"The construction project is currently in the third ______ of development, with the foundation already completed and walls beginning to go up. The final stage, which includes finishing interior work, is scheduled for next year.","translation":"該建築項目目前處於開發的第三階段，地基已完成，牆壁開始豎立。最後一個階段包括完成內部工作，計劃於明年進行。","word":"phase"}},"phenomenon":{"createdAt":1781449588288,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"phenomenon作為名詞表示「現象、特殊的或不尋常的事件」，其複數形式為phenomena。","options":["improve","glorify","phenomenon","regulate"],"sentence":"The northern lights are a spectacular natural ______ that occurs when solar particles interact with Earth's atmosphere. Scientists have studied this occurrence extensively to understand the physics behind the stunning colored displays in the sky.","translation":"北極光是一種壯觀的自然現象，當太陽粒子與地球大氣相互作用時就會發生。科學家們已經廣泛研究了這種現象，以了解天空中令人驚嘆的彩色顯示背後的物理學原理。","word":"phenomenon"}},"philosopher":{"createdAt":1781693293272,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"philosopher 是名詞，意思是「哲學家」，指從事哲學研究和思考的人。","options":["crush","executive","philosopher","plant"],"sentence":"Socrates was a renowned Greek ______ who spent his life questioning conventional wisdom. His ideas about virtue and knowledge continue to influence Western thought.","translation":"蘇格拉底是著名的希臘哲學家，他用一生時間質疑傳統智慧。他關於美德和知識的思想持續影響西方思想。","word":"philosopher"}},"philosophical":{"createdAt":1781715397124,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"philosophical 意為「哲學的、哲學相關的」，涉及抽象的思辨和對根本性問題的探討。","options":["scientific","philosophical","historical","mathematical"],"sentence":"The professor engaged her students in a ______ discussion about the nature of consciousness and free will. The students debated abstract concepts rather than focusing on practical applications.","translation":"教授與學生進行了一場哲學性的討論，涉及意識和自由意志的本質。學生們辯論的是抽象概念而非實際應用。","word":"philosophical"}},"philosophy":{"createdAt":1781961517453,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"philosophy 指的是人對生活和價值的系統化思考和信念，而不僅是單一的意見或態度。","options":["strategy","philosophy","opinion","attitude"],"sentence":"His personal ______ emphasizes the importance of hard work and perseverance in achieving success. This belief system guides all his major life decisions and values.","translation":"他個人的人生觀強調勤奮工作和堅持不懈在成功中的重要性。這個信念體系指導他所有的重大人生決定和價值觀。","word":"philosophy"}},"photograph":{"createdAt":1782044436943,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"photograph是名詞，表示相機拍攝下來的影像或圖片，可以被裱框保存。","options":["memory","photograph","moment","view"],"sentence":"She took a beautiful ______ of the sunset from the mountain top. The image was so stunning that she decided to frame it and hang it on her bedroom wall.","translation":"她從山頂拍了一張美麗的照片。這張影像非常驚人，她決定把它裱框並掛在臥室牆上。","word":"photograph"}},"photographic":{"createdAt":1785111164618,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"photographic形容詞意為「攝影的、照相的」，用來形容與照片或攝影相關的事物或展覽。","options":["musical","photographic","literary","theatrical"],"sentence":"The museum displayed a ______ exhibition featuring images from the 1920s. Each picture was taken with an old camera and showed the precise details of that historical era.","translation":"博物館展出了一場1920年代的攝影展覽。每張照片都是用舊相機拍攝的，展現了那個歷史時代的精確細節。","word":"photographic"}},"photography":{"createdAt":1781310338175,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"photography 是指用相機捕捉和創作影像的藝術和技術。","options":["painting","poetry","photography","sculpture"],"sentence":"She decided to pursue a career in ______ after winning several awards for her landscape images. Her portfolio of stunning nature photographs has been featured in multiple international exhibitions.","translation":"在因風景照片獲得多個獎項後，她決定從事攝影事業。她令人驚嘆的自然照片作品集已在多個國際展覽中展出。","word":"photography"}},"phrase":{"createdAt":1782096279664,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"phrase指一組詞組成的表達方式或口號，通常具有特定的含義或容易記住。","options":["calculation","phrase","measurement","decoration"],"sentence":"The advertising company created a catchy ______ that appeared in all their television commercials. Consumers loved repeating this memorable expression whenever they saw the brand.","translation":"廣告公司創造了一個琅琅上口的短語，出現在他們所有的電視廣告中。消費者喜歡在看到該品牌時重複這句令人難忘的表達。","word":"phrase"}},"physical":{"createdAt":1787394567888,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"physical 意為與身體有關的，在醫療檢查的語境中，特別強調醫生需要直接接觸和檢查患者的身體部位。","options":["mental","physical","emotional","spiritual"],"sentence":"The doctor performed a ______ examination to check the patient's heart and lungs. She measured his blood pressure, listened to his breathing, and felt his abdomen during this hands-on assessment.","translation":"醫生進行了身體檢查來檢查患者的心臟和肺部。她在這次親身評估中測量了他的血壓，聽了他的呼吸，並觸診了他的腹部。","word":"physical"}},"physically":{"createdAt":1783092623182,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"physically 是副詞，表示身體上或從身體層面，與 mentally（心理上）或 emotionally（情感上）相對。","options":["mentally","temporarily","physically","emotionally"],"sentence":"Although Sarah was ______ unable to attend the conference due to her injury, she participated remotely by video call. Her mind was sharp and engaged the entire time.","translation":"雖然莎拉因為受傷在身體上無法參加會議，但她透過視訊通話遠端參與。她的思維清晰，全程都很投入。","word":"physically"}},"physician":{"createdAt":1781836375366,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"physician是內科醫生，主要治療內科疾病，而不是牙科、外科或心理治療。","options":["dentist","surgeon","physician","therapist"],"sentence":"When Sarah developed a persistent cough, she made an appointment with her ______. The doctor specialised in treating lung and heart conditions.","translation":"當莎拉出現持續咳嗽時，她預約了醫生。這位醫生專門治療肺部和心臟疾病。","word":"physician"}},"physicist":{"createdAt":1781884659833,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"physicist 是指研究物理學、物質和能量等現象的科學家，與相對論理論最相關。","options":["mathematician","physicist","chemist","astronomer"],"sentence":"Albert Einstein was a renowned ______ who revolutionized our understanding of gravity and motion. His theories of relativity changed the course of science forever.","translation":"愛因斯坦是一位著名的物理學家，他革新了我們對重力和運動的理解。他的相對論理論永遠改變了科學的進程。","word":"physicist"}},"physics":{"createdAt":1781651261375,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"physics是研究物質、能量和力的自然科學學科，涉及對物體運動和相互作用的研究。","options":["treasury","midst","rod","physics"],"sentence":"She excelled in her ______ class and won first place in the science competition. Her understanding of motion, force, and energy helped her solve complex problems about how objects move and interact.","translation":"她在物理課中表現出色，並在科學競賽中獲得第一名。她對運動、力和能量的理解幫助她解決了有關物體如何運動和相互作用的複雜問題。","word":"physics"}},"pickpocket":{"createdAt":1781532967167,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pickpocket 指扒手，與「在人群中巧妙地偷取」的描述相符。","options":["vendor","pickpocket","beggar","performer"],"sentence":"The ______ stole the man's wallet without him even noticing during the crowded festival. The thief had expertly removed it from his back pocket.","translation":"在擁擠的節日期間，______(扒手)在那個人沒有注意到的情況下偷了他的錢包。小偷巧妙地從他的後口袋裡取出了它。","word":"pickpocket"}},"pickup":{"createdAt":1783068339366,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pickup 名詞表示接某人或取某物的地點或時間","options":["delivery","pickup","drop-off","departure"],"sentence":"I need to arrange a ______ time at the airport to collect my brother. Please meet me at the departures area at 3 PM sharp.","translation":"我需要安排在機場接人的時間來接我的哥哥。請在下午3點準時在出發區與我碰面。","word":"pickup"}},"pier":{"createdAt":1786319891173,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pier是指從陸地延伸到水中的長堤或橋墩，用於停泊船隻和方便人們進出水上活動。","options":["bridge","pier","beach","dock"],"sentence":"The fishing boat was tied up at the wooden ______ that extended out into the harbor. Fishermen walked along this structure to board their vessels and cast their lines into the water.","translation":"漁船被綁在延伸到港灣中的木製長堤上。漁民沿著這個結構行走以登上他們的船隻，並將釣線投入水中。","word":"pier"}},"pilgrim":{"createdAt":1783262026082,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pilgrim 作為名詞表示「朝聖者、香客」，指為了宗教信仰而進行長途旅行的人。","options":["tourist","pilgrim","merchant","scholar"],"sentence":"The ______ traveled thousands of miles to visit the sacred temple in the mountains. His journey of spiritual devotion took him through difficult terrain and challenging weather.","translation":"朝聖者千里迢迢地前往山上的聖廟進行訪問。他的靈性虔誠之旅帶他穿過艱難的地形和惡劣的天氣。","word":"pilgrim"}},"pillar":{"createdAt":1782542941487,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pillar 是指垂直的建築支撐柱，通常是圓形或方形的柱體，用來承重和支撐建築物的上部結構。","options":["beam","pillar","wall","foundation"],"sentence":"The ancient temple was supported by a massive stone ______ that had stood for over a thousand years. Without this structural element holding up the roof, the entire building would collapse.","translation":"這座古老的寺廟由一根巨大的石頭柱子支撐，已經屹立了一千多年。如果沒有這個結構元素撐起屋頂，整座建築就會倒塌。","word":"pillar"}},"pilot":{"createdAt":1783609867016,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"pilot是名詞，表示操控飛機或其他交通工具的人員","options":["passenger","mechanic","pilot","instructor"],"sentence":"The experienced ______ skillfully landed the airplane despite the strong winds. His years of training prepared him for challenging weather conditions.","translation":"經驗豐富的飛行員儘管有強風仍然巧妙地降落了飛機。他多年的訓練使他為挑戰性的天氣狀況做好了準備。","word":"pilot"}},"pilotage":{"createdAt":1781507137217,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pilotage 指的是領航人員引導船隻通過困難或危險的水域的行為，特別是在狹窄或複雜的航道上。","options":["cargo","pilotage","insurance","maintenance"],"sentence":"The large cargo ship required ______ to safely navigate through the narrow strait. An experienced local guide boarded the vessel to direct it through the treacherous waters.","translation":"這艘大型貨船需要領航才能安全通過狹窄的海峽。一位經驗豐富的當地嚮導登上該船，引導它通過危險的水域。","word":"pilotage"}},"pioneer":{"createdAt":1781582278975,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pioneer指的是在某個領域中最早開創或開拓的人，特別是指那些進入未知領域並為後來者鋪路的人物。","options":["critic","pioneer","follower","investor"],"sentence":"Steve Jobs was a ______ in the technology industry, introducing revolutionary products that changed how people work and communicate. His innovations came decades before competitors caught up, making him a true first-mover.","translation":"史蒂夫·賈伯斯是科技產業的開拓者，推出了革命性的產品改變了人們的工作和溝通方式。他的創新比競爭對手早了幾十年，使他成為真正的先行者。","word":"pioneer"}},"pipeline":{"createdAt":1782637076485,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pipeline 是管道或管線的意思，用於運輸液體或氣體的管狀結構。","options":["truck","pipeline","railway","highway"],"sentence":"The oil company constructed a ______ across the country to transport crude oil from the refineries to the distribution centers. This underground infrastructure was essential for efficient delivery.","translation":"石油公司建造了一條跨越全國的管道，將原油從煉油廠運送到配送中心。這個地下基礎設施對於高效運輸至關重要。","word":"pipeline"}},"pirate":{"createdAt":1785242055830,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pirate 作為動詞表示盜版或非法複製受著作權保護的內容，例如軟體、音樂或電影。","options":["stolen","pirate","hacked","leaked"],"sentence":"The software company discovered that someone had ______ their latest video game and uploaded it to illegal download sites. They decided to take legal action against the criminals who had stolen their intellectual property.","translation":"該軟體公司發現有人盜版了他們最新的視頻遊戲，並將其上傳到非法下載網站。他們決定對竊取其知識產權的犯罪分子採取法律行動。","word":"pirate"}},"pistil":{"createdAt":1783402421330,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"雌蕊是花的雌性生殖器官，位於花的中心，授粉後發育成果實。","options":["stamen","petal","pistil","sepal"],"sentence":"The ______ at the center of the flower develops into the fruit after pollination occurs. This female reproductive structure contains the ovary where seeds are produced.","translation":"花中心的雌蕊在授粉後發育成果實。這個雌性生殖結構包含卵巢，其中產生種子。","word":"pistil"}},"pitch":{"createdAt":1788737560817,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pitch在音樂中指聲音的高低，由頻率決定，不同於音量、節奏或速度。","options":["volume","pitch","rhythm","tempo"],"sentence":"The singer adjusted the ______ of her voice to hit the high note. The musical note required a frequency much higher than her usual speaking range.","translation":"歌手調整了她聲音的音高來唱出高音。那個音符需要的頻率遠高於她平常說話的範圍。","word":"pitch"}},"pitiful":{"createdAt":1781873027350,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pitiful 形容某事物令人感到同情或憐憫，通常因為其情況很糟糕或令人遺憾。","options":["excellent","pitiful","normal","healthy"],"sentence":"The stray dog's ______ condition, with ribs showing through its matted fur, broke everyone's heart. Donations poured in immediately after the rescue shelter posted photos of the animal.","translation":"那隻流浪狗可憫的狀況——肋骨從糾結的毛髮中露出來，讓所有人心碎。救援庇護所發佈了這隻動物的照片後，捐款立即湧入。","word":"pitiful"}},"pity":{"createdAt":1781625891342,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"pity在此指令人感到遺憾或失望的事情","options":["joy","blessing","pity","privilege"],"sentence":"It's such a ______ that you can't attend the concert tonight. I know you've been looking forward to it for months.","translation":"你今晚無法參加音樂會真是太遺憾了。我知道你已經期待它好幾個月了。","word":"pity"}},"placement":{"createdAt":1783690592065,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"placement 指的是臨時或暫時的職位安排，特別是為了獲得經驗或填補短期需求而安排的職務。","options":["employment","placement","position","internship"],"sentence":"Sarah secured a three-month ______ at the marketing firm to gain work experience. The company hired her specifically for this temporary position while she was still a student.","translation":"莎拉在行銷公司獲得了為期三個月的臨時職位以獲得工作經驗。該公司特別在她還是學生時雇用她擔任這個臨時職位。","word":"placement"}},"plague":{"createdAt":1781598671058,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"plague 作名詞表示瘟疫或大災難，通常指造成大規模死亡或破壞的傳染病或災難","options":["blessing","plague","celebration","monument"],"sentence":"The ______ of locusts destroyed the entire harvest in the region. Medieval people believed that such disasters were divine punishments for their sins.","translation":"該地區的蝗蟲瘟疫摧毀了整個收成。中世紀的人們認為這樣的災難是上帝對他們罪惡的懲罰。","word":"plague"}},"plain":{"createdAt":1786497811163,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"plain作為形容詞表示樸素的、不加修飾的，指某物簡單、沒有裝飾或複雜的設計。","options":["fancy","plain","colorful","textured"],"sentence":"She wore a ______ white dress without any decorations or patterns. The simple design showed her preference for minimalist fashion rather than ornate styles.","translation":"她穿著一件樸素的白色連衣裙，沒有任何裝飾或圖案。簡單的設計顯示她喜歡極簡主義時尚，而不是華麗的風格。","word":"plain"}},"planet":{"createdAt":1781961517451,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"planet 指的是繞恆星公轉的大型天體，而不是恆星、小行星或彗星。","options":["star","planet","asteroid","comet"],"sentence":"Scientists discovered a new ______ orbiting a distant star system. This celestial body has the right atmospheric conditions to potentially support life.","translation":"科學家們發現了一顆圍繞遠方星系運行的新行星。這個天體具有可能支持生命的正確大氣條件。","word":"planet"}},"plant":{"createdAt":1781693293271,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"plant 作名詞可表示「工廠」或「製造設施」，與生產和工業活動相關。","options":["philosopher","ruthless","priceless","plant"],"sentence":"The manufacturing ______ in the industrial zone produces thousands of units daily. Workers operate heavy machinery on the factory floor around the clock.","translation":"工業區的製造工廠每天生產數千件產品。工人們在工廠樓層全天候操作重型機械。","word":"plant"}},"plantation":{"createdAt":1781840659328,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"plantation 是指大規模的農業莊園，專門種植某一種商業作物。","options":["city","plantation","forest","village"],"sentence":"The vast ______ stretched across hundreds of acres of fertile land in the Caribbean. Rows of sugarcane grew under the tropical sun, harvested by workers year-round.","translation":"這片遼闊的大農場在加勒比地區佔據了數百英畝的肥沃土地。排成一列的甘蔗在熱帶陽光下生長，全年由工人收割。","word":"plantation"}},"plastic":{"createdAt":1781926370999,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"plastic 作為形容詞意思是塑膠的，指由塑膠材料製成的物品，該材料難以分解。","options":["paper","glass","plastic","metal"],"sentence":"The ______ bag dissolved in the ocean, harming marine life and contributing to environmental pollution. Marine scientists found pieces of it in the stomachs of fish and sea turtles.","translation":"塑膠袋在海洋中溶解，傷害了海洋生物並造成環保污染。海洋科學家在魚類和海龜的胃裡發現了它的碎片。","word":"plastic"}},"platform":{"createdAt":1784188048586,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"platform 在這裡指的是用來站立演講或表演的舞臺或講臺，是一個實體的升高結構。","options":["audience","platform","podium","microphone"],"sentence":"The politician stood on the ______ to deliver her speech to the crowd. The microphone and spotlight were set up on this raised stage so everyone could see and hear her clearly.","translation":"那位政治家站在講臺上向群眾發表演講。麥克風和聚光燈都設置在這個升高的舞臺上，這樣每個人都能清楚地看到和聽到她的講話。","word":"platform"}},"plea":{"createdAt":1781359980244,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"plea是指向權威人士提出的懇求或請求；在法律語境中指被告就罪名所作的供述或認罪。","options":["objection","declaration","plea","verdict"],"sentence":"The defendant made a desperate ______ for mercy before the judge announced the sentence. His lawyer begged the court to consider his difficult family situation.","translation":"被告在法官宣佈判決前對法官提出了絕望的懇求。他的律師懇求法庭考慮他困難的家庭狀況。","word":"plea"}},"plead":{"createdAt":1784868215548,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"plead 是法律用語，表示在法庭上提出對指控的回應（認罪或不認罪），不同於一般的 confess（坦白）或 testify（作證）。","options":["deny","plead","testify","confess"],"sentence":"The defendant decided to ______ guilty in court. His lawyer advised him that this admission would likely result in a reduced sentence.","translation":"被告決定在法庭上認罪。他的律師告訴他，這項認罪陳述可能會導致刑期減少。","word":"plead"}},"pleasant":{"createdAt":1784355956204,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pleasant是形容詞，表示令人愉快的、令人滿意的，常用來形容令人高興或舒適的事物或環境。","options":["stormy","pleasant","freezing","humid"],"sentence":"The weather was so ______ that we decided to have a picnic outside. We enjoyed the warm sunshine and gentle breeze without any rain or storms.","translation":"天氣非常令人愉快，所以我們決定在外面野餐。我們享受溫暖的陽光和溫和的微風，沒有任何雨或風暴。","word":"pleasant"}},"please":{"createdAt":1784125382691,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"please 意為「使…感到高興或滿意」，用來表示讓某人感到愉快或開心的動作。","options":["satisfy","please","help","comfort"],"sentence":"Nothing could ______ the demanding customer, no matter how hard the staff tried to serve them. Even the finest meal and most attentive service failed to bring a smile to their face.","translation":"沒有什麼能使這位挑剔的顧客感到高興，無論員工多麼努力地服侍他們。即使是最美味的餐點和最周到的服務也無法讓他們的臉上浮現笑容。","word":"please"}},"pleased":{"createdAt":1783505313976,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pleased作形容詞表示「高興的」或「滿意的」，用於描述因為好的結果而感到滿足和快樂的狀態。","options":["angry","pleased","disappointed","confused"],"sentence":"The customer was very ______ with the excellent service at the restaurant. She left a generous tip and promised to recommend the place to all her friends.","translation":"顧客對餐廳的優質服務感到非常滿意。她留了很大方的小費，並答應要向所有朋友推薦這個地方。","word":"pleased"}},"pleasure":{"createdAt":1782644423621,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pleasure是名詞，意為愉快、快樂，在句子中指閱讀帶來的正面情感和滿足感。","options":["pain","pleasure","confusion","anger"],"sentence":"Reading a good book is a source of great ______ for many people. The happiness and satisfaction they feel while turning each page makes them forget all their worries.","translation":"閱讀一本好書對許多人來說是巨大快樂的來源。當他們翻動每一頁時感受到的幸福和滿足感使他們忘卻所有煩惱。","word":"pleasure"}},"pledge":{"createdAt":1783737904094,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pledge 是指正式的誓言或保證，通常是書面的或在公開場合做出的承諾。","options":["promise","pledge","statement","speech"],"sentence":"The candidate made a ______ to reduce taxes if elected. He signed the document in front of thousands of supporters to show his commitment.","translation":"該候選人做了一項誓言，如果當選將減少稅收。他在數千名支持者面前簽署了這份文件以表示他的承諾。","word":"pledge"}},"plentifully":{"createdAt":1785110904570,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"plentifully表示豐富地、充足地、大量地，用來形容產量或數量充分充裕的狀態，與後句提到的充足供應相符","options":["plentifully","rarely","scarcely","occasionally"],"sentence":"During the harvest season, fruits and vegetables grew ______ in the farmer's fields. The abundance was so great that he was able to supply the entire local market with surplus.","translation":"在豐收季節，水果和蔬菜在農民的田地裡豐富地生長。豐產程度足以讓他能夠向整個當地市場供應，甚至還有剩餘。","word":"plentifully"}},"plot":{"createdAt":1785885640891,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"plot在此指「秘密計劃」或「陰謀」，與conspiracy同義但為更正式的單詞，通常用於描述隱祕的計謀或計畫。","options":["scheme","conspiracy","plot","strategy"],"sentence":"The detective uncovered a secret ______ to overthrow the government. She discovered detailed plans and evidence that the conspirators had carefully hidden for months.","translation":"偵探發現了一個推翻政府的秘密陰謀。她發現了共謀者為了隱瞞長達數月而精心隱藏的詳細計畫和證據。","word":"plot"}},"plow":{"createdAt":1783262026082,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"plow 作為名詞表示「犁」，是農業工具，用於翻動和整理土壤以準備播種。","options":["harrow","plow","rake","hoe"],"sentence":"The farmer used a horse-drawn ______ to prepare his fields for planting spring crops. The deep furrows created by this tool would help break up the hard soil.","translation":"農民用馬拉的犁來準備春季作物種植的田地。這個工具創造的深犁溝將幫助打碎堅硬的土壤。","word":"plow"}},"plunge":{"createdAt":1782920661022,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"plunge表示驟然、急速地下降或移動，強調動作的突然性和幅度之大","options":["plunge","decrease","drop","fall"],"sentence":"The stock market prices ______ dramatically after the announcement of economic difficulties. Investors watched in horror as the value of their shares fell sharply within minutes.","translation":"經濟困難公佈後，股市價格驟然下跌。投資者驚恐地看著他們的股票價值在幾分鐘內急劇下跌。","word":"plunge"}},"pneumonia":{"createdAt":1781933311795,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pneumonia（肺炎）是影響肺部的呼吸道感染，而arthritis（關節炎）、diabetes（糖尿病）和amnesia（遺忘症）都是不同類型的疾病，不會影響肺部。","options":["arthritis","pneumonia","diabetes","amnesia"],"sentence":"The elderly patient was admitted to the hospital with a severe case of ______ that affected both lungs. The doctor prescribed antibiotics and oxygen therapy to help him recover from this respiratory infection.","translation":"這位年長患者因嚴重的肺炎入院治療，影響了兩個肺。醫生開了抗生素和氧氣療法來幫助他從這種呼吸道感染中恢復。","word":"pneumonia"}},"pneumonoultramicroscopicsilicovolcanoconiosis":{"createdAt":1783489104903,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"矽肺病是一種由長期吸入火山灰和矽塵引起的肺部疾病，通常發生在礦工等職業人群中。","options":["bronchitis","pneumonoultramicroscopicsilicovolcanoconiosis","asthma","tuberculosis"],"sentence":"The miners suffered from ______ after years of inhaling volcanic ash and silica particles. This occupational disease left them gasping for breath.","translation":"礦工在吸入火山灰和矽粒子多年後患上矽肺病。這種職業病使他們呼吸困難。","word":"pneumonoultramicroscopicsilicovolcanoconiosis"}},"poacher":{"createdAt":1782920661025,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"poacher是指偷獵者，專門非法狩獵受保護的野生動物以獲取利益","options":["hunter","poacher","criminal","thief"],"sentence":"A ______ was arrested for illegally hunting endangered animals in the national park. Wildlife officials said the man had been stealing rare species for months.","translation":"一名偷獵者因在國家公園非法獵捕瀕危動物而被捕。野生動物官員表示，該男子數月來一直在盜竊稀有物種。","word":"poacher"}},"podium":{"createdAt":1784899764064,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"podium是頒獎或演講時使用的講臺或領獎台，通常是一個隆起的平臺。","options":["bench","podium","chair","stage"],"sentence":"The Olympic athlete stood on the ______ to receive her gold medal. The audience applauded as she stood at the highest platform.","translation":"奧運運動員站在領獎臺上接受她的金牌。當她站在最高的平臺上時，觀眾們鼓掌。","word":"podium"}},"poetic":{"createdAt":1785281892646,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"poetic（有詩意的）形容具有詩人的特質或充滿想像力和藝術美感的事物，常用於描述語言、影像或表達方式。","options":["scientific","poetic","logical","mathematical"],"sentence":"The sunset painted the sky in a ______ way that inspired the artist to create her masterpiece. The imagery was so vivid and full of artistic beauty that it transcended ordinary description.","translation":"夕陽以一種富有詩意的方式為天空著色，激發了藝術家創作她的傑作。這個意象是如此生動且充滿藝術美感，超越了尋常的描述。","word":"poetic"}},"point":{"createdAt":1781580511758,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"point 在運動中指得分，代表比賽中計算的單位","options":["player","coach","point","strategy"],"sentence":"The team scored the winning ______ in the final seconds of the game. This single score gave them the victory they had worked so hard for.","translation":"球隊在比賽最後幾秒鐘獲得了獲勝的得分。這一分給了他們辛苦爭取的勝利。","word":"point"}},"pointed":{"createdAt":1783927689717,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pointed 表示言辭或批評尖銳、直接且明確指向問題所在，帶有強烈意圖的意思。","options":["blunt","pointed","vague","casual"],"sentence":"The teacher made a ______ comment about my essay during the meeting. She specifically criticized the weak thesis statement and unclear arguments.","translation":"老師在會議中對我的論文提出了尖銳的評論。她特別批評了薄弱的論點陳述和不清楚的論據。","word":"pointed"}},"poison":{"createdAt":1783947243481,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"poison是名詞，指有毒的物質，通常用於害人或殺人；也可作動詞表示用毒藥毒害某人。","options":["spice","poison","medicine","herb"],"sentence":"The detective discovered that the victim had ingested ______ hidden in the evening meal. The toxicology report confirmed the presence of a lethal substance that caused immediate organ failure.","translation":"偵探發現受害者在晚餐中攝入了隱藏其中的毒藥。毒理學報告證實了導致器官立即衰竭的致命物質的存在。","word":"poison"}},"poisoned":{"createdAt":1783419779300,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"poisoned 表示被毒害或受污染的狀態，這裡指水被有害物質污染了，導致不能安全飲用。","options":["cleaned","poisoned","filtered","tested"],"sentence":"The water supply was ______ by industrial chemicals, making it unsafe to drink. The government had to shut down the facility immediately and issue health warnings to all residents.","translation":"水供應被工業化學物質毒害，使其不安全飲用。政府必須立即關閉該設施，並向所有居民發布健康警告。","word":"poisoned"}},"poisonous":{"createdAt":1781336858138,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"poisonous 用來形容某物含有毒素，會對生命造成威脅或傷害。","options":["beautiful","poisonous","harmless","colorful"],"sentence":"The snake's venom is ______, so hikers must avoid contact with it. Even a small bite from this creature can cause death within hours.","translation":"這條蛇的毒液是有毒的，所以登山者必須避免與它接觸。即使被這種生物輕輕咬一口，也可能在幾小時內導致死亡。","word":"poisonous"}},"poke":{"createdAt":1783850642243,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"poke 表示用尖銳的物體輕輕地戳或刺某物，通常是用手指或尖端物品進行的動作。","options":["squeeze","poke","twist","wrap"],"sentence":"The child tried to ______ the balloon with a sharp stick to see what would happen. He carefully aimed at the surface, hoping to burst it with just one quick jab.","translation":"這個小孩試著用尖銳的棍子戳氣球，想看看會發生什麼。他小心地瞄準表面，希望只用一次快速的戳刺就能戳破它。","word":"poke"}},"polar":{"createdAt":1781693254771,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"polar形容詞指與地球南北極有關的地區，特別是非常寒冷和冰凍的地方。","options":["tropical","urban","polar","coastal"],"sentence":"Scientists conducted extensive research in the ______ regions to study climate change and its effects on ice. Teams traveled to the Arctic and Antarctic to collect data about melting glaciers.","translation":"科學家在極地地區進行了廣泛的研究，以研究氣候變遷及其對冰的影響。團隊前往北極和南極收集關於冰川融化的數據。","word":"polar"}},"pole":{"createdAt":1783208024473,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pole 是指豎立的柱子或桿子，用來支撐或固定其他物體，與「支撐電線」和「固定在地面」的描述完全吻合。","options":["wire","pole","cable","line"],"sentence":"The construction workers installed a tall metal ______ to support the electrical wires across the street. The ______ stood about 10 meters high and was firmly anchored to the ground.","translation":"建築工人安裝了一根高大的金屬柱子以支撐街道上的電線。這根柱子高約10公尺，並牢固地固定在地面上。","word":"pole"}},"policy":{"createdAt":1784355209446,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"policy是指由組織或政府制定的正式規則或策略，具有強制性和約束力。","options":["suggestion","preference","policy","request"],"sentence":"The company's new ______ requires all employees to arrive at the office by 9 AM sharp. This written rule applies to everyone in the organization without exception.","translation":"公司的新政策要求所有員工必須在上午9點準時到達辦公室。這項書面規則對組織中的每個人都無例外地適用。","word":"policy"}},"polish":{"createdAt":1784191742095,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"polish指擦亮、磨光或拋光某個物體表面，使其變得光滑有光澤。","options":["resistance","purchase","polish","locate"],"sentence":"The jeweler used a soft cloth to ______ the diamond ring until it sparkled. The shine became so bright that it reflected light beautifully in every direction.","translation":"珠寶商用柔軟的布料擦亮鑽石戒指，直到它閃閃發光。光澤變得非常耀眼，在各個方向上都能反射光線。","word":"polish"}},"polished":{"createdAt":1783848553718,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"「polished」作為形容詞時，表示「打磨光亮的」、「精緻的」或「老練的」，用來形容經過精心準備、完善和優雅的事物或表現。","options":["rough","casual","polished","simple"],"sentence":"The executive delivered a ______ presentation to the board of directors, with every slide perfectly designed and every word carefully chosen. Her confident delivery and flawless performance impressed all the stakeholders in the room.","translation":"這位主管向董事會呈現了一份精緻老練的演講，每張幻燈片設計完美，每個詞彙經過精心選擇。她充滿信心的表達和無懈可擊的表現令所有利益相關者印象深刻。","word":"polished"}},"political":{"createdAt":1784820300726,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"political 用來形容與政府、統治和權力相關的事務，特別是在公共政策和選舉的背景下。","options":["personal","political","social","economic"],"sentence":"The debate between the two candidates focused on ______ issues such as healthcare and education reform. These topics directly affect government policy and voter decisions in the election.","translation":"兩位候選人之間的辯論集中於政治議題，如醫療保健和教育改革。這些話題直接影響政府政策和選民在選舉中的決定。","word":"political"}},"politician":{"createdAt":1783660470985,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"politician 指的是從事政治活動、參與政府工作或競選公職的人，與 voter（投票者）、journalist（記者）、activist（活動人士）的身份不同。","options":["voter","politician","journalist","activist"],"sentence":"The ______ promised to improve healthcare during the election campaign. She had spent twenty years working in government before running for office.","translation":"這位政治家在選舉活動中承諾改善醫療保健。她在從政前已經在政府部門工作了二十年。","word":"politician"}},"politics":{"createdAt":1781841148117,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"politics 名詞意思是政治、政治活動，指與政府、權力和公共事務管理相關的活動和討論。","options":["sports","cooking","politics","music"],"sentence":"Many university students became passionate about ______ after attending debates about election campaigns and policy reforms. They spent hours discussing how government decisions affected society and joined student political organizations.","translation":"許多大學生在參加關於選舉活動和政策改革的辯論後對政治充滿熱情。他們花了幾個小時討論政府決策如何影響社會，並加入了學生政治組織。","word":"politics"}},"pollusion":{"createdAt":1784773941960,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"pollusion 指的是對環境的污染或汙穢，特別是由工業或人類活動造成的。","options":["protection","preservation","pollusion","conservation"],"sentence":"The factory's ______ of the river was so severe that fish could no longer survive in its waters. Environmental scientists warned that the contamination would take decades to reverse.","translation":"工廠對河流的污染非常嚴重，以至於魚類無法再在其水域中生存。環境科學家警告污染將需要數十年才能逆轉。","word":"pollusion"}},"pollutant":{"createdAt":1781603436398,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"pollutant是指污染環境、危害生態或人體健康的物質，通常來自工業排放或廢棄物。","options":["nutrient","resource","pollutant","product"],"sentence":"The factory's emissions released a dangerous ______ into the atmosphere that affected the air quality for miles around. Scientists identified the harmful substance as nitrogen dioxide, a chemical that damages human respiratory systems.","translation":"工廠的排放物向大氣中釋放了一種危險的污染物，影響了方圓數英里的空氣品質。科學家將這種有害物質確定為二氧化氮，這是一種會損害人體呼吸系統的化學物質。","word":"pollutant"}},"pollute":{"createdAt":1782312212035,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"pollute是指使環境或物質變得不潔淨或有害，造成污染。","options":["purify","protect","pollute","preserve"],"sentence":"The factory's emissions ______ the river, making it unsafe for drinking and fishing. Scientists found dangerous chemicals in the water samples from downstream areas.","translation":"工廠的排放物污染了河流，使其不適合飲用和捕魚。科學家在下游地區的水樣中發現了危險化學物質。","word":"pollute"}},"polluted":{"createdAt":1781832089958,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"polluted 表示被污染的，指環境、空氣、水等被有害物質汙染","options":["purified","polluted","clear","refreshing"],"sentence":"The river became increasingly ______ due to industrial waste dumping upstream. Fish and aquatic plants began to die as the water quality deteriorated significantly.","translation":"由於上游工業廢物傾倒，河流變得越來越污染。隨著水質明顯惡化，魚類和水生植物開始死亡。","word":"polluted"}},"pollution":{"createdAt":1781841505535,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"pollution 指的是環境中的污染物質或污染現象，會對生態和人類健康造成負面影響。","options":["entitle","healthcare","pollution","wonder"],"sentence":"The ______ in our city's air has reached dangerous levels this week due to factory emissions. Parents are keeping their children indoors because breathing the contaminated atmosphere poses serious health risks.","translation":"由於工廠排放，我們城市空氣中的污染本週已達到危險水平。父母們讓孩子待在室內，因為呼吸被污染的空氣會造成嚴重的健康風險。","word":"pollution"}},"ponder":{"createdAt":1781424157171,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"ponder 意為深思熟慮、仔細考慮某事，特別是指重大決定。","options":["ignore","dismiss","ponder","announce"],"sentence":"She sat quietly in the garden for hours to ______ the important decision about her future career. Finally, after deep reflection, she decided to pursue medicine.","translation":"她在花園裡靜靜地坐了幾個小時來沉思這個關於她未來職業的重要決定。經過深思熟慮後，她最終決定從醫。","word":"ponder"}},"popular":{"createdAt":1783658877745,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"popular（流行的；受歡迎的）用來形容某事物被許多人喜愛或廣泛接受，結合銷售數字最高的語境，只有popular最能完整表達這種廣泛受歡迎的狀態。","options":["expensive","popular","reliable","portable"],"sentence":"This new smartphone model is very ______ among teenagers. Sales figures show it's the best-selling phone in its price range this year.","translation":"這款新智慧型手機在青少年中非常流行。銷售數字顯示它是今年同價位最暢銷的手機。","word":"popular"}},"popularity":{"createdAt":1781693266948,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"popularity指某人或某物受歡迎的程度，即人氣、流行度。","options":["popularity","confidence","anxiety","confusion"],"sentence":"The singer's ______ grew dramatically after her hit single was released. Fans from all over the world were listening to her music and buying concert tickets.","translation":"這位歌手的人氣在她的熱門單曲發行後急劇增長。來自世界各地的粉絲都在聽她的音樂並購買演唱會門票。","word":"popularity"}},"popularize":{"createdAt":1783516186774,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"popularize 意指使某物變得廣為人知、被大眾接受或容易理解。","options":["obscure","eliminate","popularize","restrict"],"sentence":"Social media helped ______ the new diet trend among young people worldwide. Millions of users shared videos and recipes, making it accessible to the general public.","translation":"社交媒體幫助將新飲食趨勢在全球年輕人中普及開來。數百萬用戶分享影片和食譜，使其對大眾可得。","word":"popularize"}},"populate":{"createdAt":1784430835558,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"populate意為「使某地有人居住；構成某地的人口」，強調通過移民和定居使地區人口增加。","options":["discover","populate","explore","divide"],"sentence":"Many European settlers came to Australia in the 19th century to ______ the vast continent. Over time, cities and towns grew as more families arrived and established permanent communities across the land.","translation":"許多歐洲移民在19世紀來到澳洲以構成該大陸的人口。隨著時間推移，隨著更多家庭到達並在全國各地建立永久定居點，城市和城鎮逐漸發展。","word":"populate"}},"populated":{"createdAt":1781950727562,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"populated 指住有人口或居住著許多人的地方。","options":["decorated","populated","isolated","destroyed"],"sentence":"The downtown area is densely ______ with office buildings and shops. Thousands of people live and work there every single day.","translation":"市中心區域密集居住著辦公樓和商店。每天都有數千人在那裡生活和工作。","word":"populated"}},"population":{"createdAt":1782619889127,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"population 專指某地區或國家的居民總數，通常用具體的人數來表示。","options":["area","population","development","economy"],"sentence":"The ______ of Tokyo has grown significantly over the past fifty years. Census data indicates that over 37 million people now live in the metropolitan area.","translation":"東京的______ 在過去五十年中增長顯著。人口普查數據表明，現在有超過3700萬人居住在該大都市區。","word":"population"}},"populous":{"createdAt":1783243350911,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"populous 意為人口眾多的、人煙稠密的，用來形容某個地區或國家有大量居民。","options":["spacious","populous","isolated","developed"],"sentence":"China is one of the most ______ countries in the world. Its cities are filled with hundreds of millions of residents living in dense urban areas.","translation":"中國是世界上人口最眾多的國家之一。其城市裡有數億居民居住在密集的城市地區。","word":"populous"}},"porch":{"createdAt":1781481072318,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"porch 表示建築物入口處的走廊或門廊，通常在房屋外部供人休息和活動。","options":["basement","attic","porch","kitchen"],"sentence":"We sat on the ______ of the farmhouse, enjoying the cool evening breeze. The wooden chairs were arranged perfectly for viewing the sunset over the fields.","translation":"我們坐在農舍的走廊上，享受涼爽的傍晚微風。木製椅子完美地排列著，方便欣賞田野上的日落。","word":"porch"}},"port":{"createdAt":1783558795713,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"port 名詞表示港口、港市，是船隻停靠和貨物裝卸的地方。","options":["airport","port","station","market"],"sentence":"The cargo ship arrived at the busy ______ early in the morning to unload its containers. Hundreds of workers were ready to move the goods onto the dock.","translation":"貨輪在清晨抵達繁忙的港口卸下集裝箱。數百名工人準備好將貨物移到碼頭。","word":"port"}},"portable":{"createdAt":1785331076824,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"便於攜帶的是指能夠輕易地移動、轉移或隨身攜帶的特性。","options":["stationary","portable","heavy","fragile"],"sentence":"She bought a ______ speaker that she could easily take on her camping trip and beach vacation. The device weighs only 500 grams and fits perfectly into her backpack.","translation":"她買了一個便於攜帶的揚聲器，可以輕鬆帶上露營旅行和海灘度假。這個設備重量只有500克，完美地裝入她的背包。","word":"portable"}},"porter":{"createdAt":1782308456171,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Porter 指在火車站、機場等地幫助乘客搬運和運輸行李的工作人員。","options":["conductor","porter","passenger","vendor"],"sentence":"The ______ at the train station quickly grabbed our heavy suitcases and loaded them onto the cart. We tipped him generously because he helped us transport our baggage to the platform.","translation":"火車站的行李員迅速拿起我們沉重的行李箱，並將它們裝上手推車。我們慷慨地給了他小費，因為他幫助我們將行李運送到月台。","word":"porter"}},"portfolio":{"createdAt":1782092862164,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"portfolio在金融語境中指投資組合，是指某人或機構所持有的各種投資資產的集合。","options":["briefcase","portfolio","presentation","proposal"],"sentence":"The investment manager showed me her ______ containing stocks, bonds, and real estate holdings. This collection demonstrated her diverse approach to wealth management across multiple asset classes.","translation":"投資經理向我展示了她的投資組合，其中包含股票、債券和房地產持有。這個集合展示了她在多個資產類別的多元化財富管理方法。","word":"portfolio"}},"portion":{"createdAt":1783063660625,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"portion 指的是一份食物或某樣東西的一部分，通常是為一個人分配的量。","options":["plate","portion","flavor","texture"],"sentence":"The restaurant served a generous ______ of dessert on my plate. I could only eat half of it because it was much larger than usual.","translation":"餐廳在我的盤子裡盛了一大份甜點。我只能吃一半，因為它比平時大得多。","word":"portion"}},"portrait":{"createdAt":1781738105693,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"portrait 指的是對某人臉部或全身的繪畫、素描或攝影，通常用於表現一個人的樣子。","options":["landscape","portrait","sculpture","mural"],"sentence":"The famous painter spent three months creating a detailed ______ of the historical figure. The artwork captured not only his physical appearance but also the wisdom reflected in his eyes.","translation":"這位著名畫家花了三個月創作了這位歷史人物的詳細肖像畫。這件藝術作品不僅捕捉了他的外表，還反映了他眼中的智慧。","word":"portrait"}},"portray":{"createdAt":1782533789135,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"portray 動詞意思是描繪或描述，指通過藝術、文字或表演來表現某人或某事物。","options":["ignore","portray","criticize","distort"],"sentence":"The documentary film will ______ the struggles and victories of the ancient civilization. Through interviews and historical artifacts, it presents an accurate picture of their daily life.","translation":"紀錄片將描繪古代文明的奮鬥和勝利。通過訪談和歷史文物，它呈現了他們日常生活的準確圖景。","word":"portray"}},"pose":{"createdAt":1783332861011,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「pose」作動詞表示「造成、引起、提出」，常用來表示帶來困難或問題。","options":["solve","pose","ignore","prevent"],"sentence":"Climate change will ______ serious challenges to coastal communities in the future. Rising sea levels and extreme weather events are expected to cause significant damage.","translation":"氣候變化將來會對沿海社區造成嚴重的挑戰。海平面上升和極端天氣事件預計會造成重大損害。","word":"pose"}},"position":{"createdAt":1781345746903,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"position 作名詞，在此指職務或職位，表示在機構中的工作角色。","options":["location","position","movement","direction"],"sentence":"She was offered a senior management ______ at the international corporation. She accepted the job offer and will start work next month as the new director.","translation":"她獲得了國際公司高級管理職位的聘請。她接受了工作邀請，將於下個月作為新任總監開始工作。","word":"position"}},"positive":{"createdAt":1783612594862,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"positive在此表示樂觀、正面的態度，指向前看、尋求解決辦法的心態。","options":["negative","positive","neutral","doubtful"],"sentence":"She maintained a ______ attitude despite facing many challenges. Even when things went wrong, she refused to complain and focused on solutions instead.","translation":"儘管面臨許多挑戰，她保持著肯定的態度。即使事情出錯，她也拒絕抱怨，而是專注於解決方案。","word":"positive"}},"possess":{"createdAt":1781402154558,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"possess表示擁有或持有某物，在這裡指律師必須持有法律執業執照。","options":["possess","lack","compel","hijack"],"sentence":"To practice law in this country, a lawyer must ______ a valid license issued by the bar association. Without this credential, it is illegal to provide legal services to clients.","translation":"在這個國家執業律師必須擁有律師協會頒發的有效執照。沒有這個證書，向客戶提供法律服務是違法的。","word":"possess"}},"possession":{"createdAt":1782395163854,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"possession 是名詞，指某人所擁有的物品或財產，強調所有權和持有的狀態。","options":["belonging","possession","treasure","property"],"sentence":"After winning the lottery, she carefully locked away her newly acquired ______ in the bank vault. The valuable items, including jewelry and gold bars, needed maximum security protection.","translation":"中獎後，她小心地把新獲得的財產鎖在銀行保險箱裡。包括珠寶和金條在內的貴重物品需要最高度的安全保護。","word":"possession"}},"possible":{"createdAt":1782475559553,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"possible表示有可能實現或發生，指某事可能做到","options":["impossible","certain","possible","unlikely"],"sentence":"It is ______ that we could finish the project by Friday if we work overtime. The deadline is tight, but our team believes we can manage it.","translation":"如果我們加班，我們可能在星期五之前完成這個項目。截止日期很緊，但我們的團隊相信我們能夠做到。","word":"possible"}},"postpone":{"createdAt":1781950727567,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"postpone 指延遲或推遲某事件的日期或時間。","options":["expedite","postpone","announce","cancel"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ the product launch until next quarter. They needed more time to conduct thorough market research and testing.","translation":"公司決定將產品發佈推遲到下個季度。他們需要更多時間進行全面的市場研究和測試。","word":"postpone"}},"posture":{"createdAt":1783945015694,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"posture指身體的姿勢或姿態，特別是指站立或坐著時身體各部位的排列方式。","options":["breathing","posture","flexibility","concentration"],"sentence":"The yoga instructor corrected my ______ during the meditation exercise. She told me to sit up straighter and keep my shoulders relaxed.","translation":"瑜伽教練在冥想練習中糾正了我的姿勢。她告訴我要坐直，保持肩膀放鬆。","word":"posture"}},"pot":{"createdAt":1784818655890,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pot 是指有把手和蓋子的深型烹飪容器，特別用於加熱液體和煮食物。","options":["pan","pot","bowl","plate"],"sentence":"She heated water in a ______ on the stove to prepare for cooking dinner. The metal container had a handle and lid, making it perfect for boiling vegetables.","translation":"她在爐子上用罐子加熱水準備做晚餐。這個金屬容器有把手和蓋子，非常適合煮蔬菜。","word":"pot"}},"potent":{"createdAt":1781619188931,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"potent 指強大、有力或有效力的，特別是指藥物或物質的功效。","options":["weak","potent","mild","gentle"],"sentence":"The medicine proved to be a ______ treatment for the patient's condition. Just a small dose was enough to produce significant improvement within hours.","translation":"這種藥物被證明是治療患者病症的強有力的治療方法。僅僅一小劑量就足以在幾小時內產生顯著的改善。","word":"potent"}},"potential":{"createdAt":1782265565187,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"potential 指某人或某物未來可能達到的能力或成就的可能性。","options":["failure","potential","weakness","disability"],"sentence":"The young athlete showed great ______ in the competition. Coaches believe he could become a champion if he continues training hard over the next few years.","translation":"年輕運動員在比賽中展現了巨大的潛能。教練們相信如果他在接下來的幾年裡繼續努力訓練，他可能會成為冠軍。","word":"potential"}},"poultry":{"createdAt":1781950727559,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"poultry 指家禽，特別是為了食物而飼養的雞、鴨、鵝等家禽。","options":["vegetables","cattle","poultry","fish"],"sentence":"The farm raises ______ such as chickens and ducks for their eggs and meat. These birds are kept in dedicated enclosures on the property.","translation":"農場飼養家禽，如雞和鴨，以獲取它們的蛋和肉。這些鳥類在該地產上的專用圍欄中飼養。","word":"poultry"}},"pounce":{"createdAt":1786807132291,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pounce 是指動物迅速而猛烈地撲向或攻擊目標的動作，通常帶有突然性和力量感。","options":["wait","pounce","observe","descend"],"sentence":"The cat waited motionless on the fence, ready to ______ at the first sign of movement. When the bird landed on the grass below, the cat leaped down with incredible speed and force.","translation":"貓靜靜地蹲在籬笆上，準備在第一次看到動靜時撲向獵物。當鳥降落在下面的草地上時，貓以驚人的速度和力量跳了下去。","word":"pounce"}},"pound":{"createdAt":1788737560822,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Pound作動詞表示用力重複敲打或打擊，強調力度大和聲音響亮。","options":["knock","Pound","tap","ring"],"sentence":"He began to ______ on the door with his fist because no one answered the bell. His violent knocking echoed loudly throughout the entire house.","translation":"因為沒人應門鈴，他開始用拳頭猛烈敲打門。他暴力的敲門聲在整個房子裡迴盪。","word":"Pound"}},"pour":{"createdAt":1781564440920,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pour 作動詞表示倒、灌，指將液體從一個容器流向另一個容器。","options":["sip","pour","freeze","collect"],"sentence":"She decided to ______ the hot water into the teapot. The steam rose up as the boiling liquid flowed inside.","translation":"她決定把熱水倒入茶壺。滾燙的液體流入時蒸氣上升。","word":"pour"}},"poverty":{"createdAt":1781709854477,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"poverty（貧窮）指缺乏金錢或資源的狀態，與struggle to afford basic necessities（難以負擔基本必需品）形成因果關係。","options":["wealth","poverty","abundance","prosperity"],"sentence":"Many families in rural areas live in ______ and struggle to afford basic necessities. The government launched a program to provide food and shelter to those without sufficient income.","translation":"許多農村地區的家庭生活在貧窮中，難以負擔基本生活必需品。政府啟動了一項計劃，為收入不足的人提供食物和住所。","word":"poverty"}},"powder":{"createdAt":1783566294626,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"powder表示細粉末或化妝用粉，通常用刷子或海綿塗抹在皮膚上。","options":["makeup","powder","cream","lotion"],"sentence":"She applied ______ to her face before the important presentation. The makeup artist used a soft brush to blend the fine particles across her cheeks.","translation":"她在重要的演講前在臉上撲粉。化妝師用柔軟的刷子將細粒子混合在她的臉頰上。","word":"powder"}},"practical":{"createdAt":1783660470998,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"practical 意為「實際的」或「切實可行的」，強調基於現實、能夠真正應用的方法。與 theoretical（理論的）相對，句子明確指出他避免理論討論，注重實際成效。","options":["theoretical","practical","creative","aggressive"],"sentence":"His ______ approach to problem-solving has helped the company save thousands of dollars. Rather than theoretical discussions, he focuses on real-world solutions that actually work.","translation":"他解決問題的實際方法幫助公司節省了數千美元。他不是進行理論討論，而是專注於真正可行的實際解決方案。","word":"practical"}},"practice":{"createdAt":1783068339384,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"practice 名詞表示重複進行某項活動以改進或精通的過程","options":["performance","practice","concert","audition"],"sentence":"Regular ______ is essential for musicians who want to improve their skills. The pianist spent three hours each day playing scales and studying new compositions.","translation":"對於想要改進技能的音樂家來說，定期練習是必不可少的。鋼琴家每天花三小時彈奏音階和學習新作品。","word":"practice"}},"practitioner":{"createdAt":1781478568770,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"practitioner 指在某一專業領域中執業或從事該行業工作的人。","options":["student","patient","practitioner","researcher"],"sentence":"A skilled medical ______ must complete years of education and licensing before treating patients. Dr. Chen has been practicing medicine for over twenty years.","translation":"一名技術熟練的醫療從業人員必須在治療患者之前完成多年的教育和執業執照。陳醫生已經執業二十多年了。","word":"practitioner"}},"praise":{"createdAt":1783400753206,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"praise 是表示讚許、認可或欣賞的言詞或表達，通常用於肯定他人的成就或行為。","options":["criticism","praise","advice","punishment"],"sentence":"The teacher gave ______ to the student for her excellent presentation. The positive feedback motivated her to work even harder on future projects.","translation":"老師因為學生精彩的報告而對她表示讚美。這些正面的反饋激勵她在未來的項目上更加努力。","word":"praise"}},"pray":{"createdAt":1788737560824,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"Pray指向神聖的力量虔誠地祈求或祈禱，是一種宗教或靈性的行為。","options":["hope","wish","Pray","desire"],"sentence":"Every night before bed, she would ______ for her family's safety and health. This spiritual practice brought her comfort and peace during difficult times.","translation":"每晚睡前，她會為家人的安全和健康祈禱。這個靈性的修行在困難時期給了她安慰和平靜。","word":"Pray"}},"preach":{"createdAt":1785798467265,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"preach是指在宗教或道德方面向聽眾進行佈道或宣揚信息的動作，通常帶有宗教或道德勸告的意涵。","options":["teach","preach","speak","lecture"],"sentence":"Every Sunday, the pastor would ______ to his congregation about the importance of kindness and compassion. He spent hours preparing his sermon to inspire people spiritually.","translation":"每個星期天，牧師都會向他的會眾宣揚關於仁慈和同情的重要性。他花了幾小時準備他的佈道來激勵人們的精神。","word":"preach"}},"precaution":{"createdAt":1784795329364,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"precaution 意為「預防措施」，指為了防止某事發生或降低風險而事先採取的行動或準備。","options":["precaution","opportunity","shortcut","advantage"],"sentence":"The construction site manager took every ______ to ensure worker safety before beginning the project. Guards were posted, equipment was inspected, and all safety protocols were strictly enforced.","translation":"建築工地經理在開始施工前採取了一切預防措施以確保工人安全。設置了警衛、檢查了設備，並嚴格執行了所有安全規程。","word":"precaution"}},"precede":{"createdAt":1783852040585,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"precede是指在時間或順序上先發生或先出現在另一個事物之前。","options":["follow","precede","serve","delay"],"sentence":"In the formal dinner, the appetizers will ______ the main course by about thirty minutes. The guests will enjoy wine and conversation while waiting for the entrée.","translation":"在正式晚宴中，開胃菜將在主菜之前大約三十分鐘上桌。客人將在等待主菜時享受葡萄酒和交談。","word":"precede"}},"precedence":{"createdAt":1785510517947,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"precedence（居前、優先、地位高低）指的是在級別、重要性或順序上的優先權；在這個句子中，它表示執行長的決定因其職位而具有更高的優先權。","options":["preference","precedence","presence","patience"],"sentence":"In the corporate hierarchy, the CEO's decisions take ______ over those of junior managers. This order of importance is clearly established in the company's organizational structure.","translation":"在公司階級制度中，執行長的決定在地位上優先於初級經理人的決定。這種重要性的順序在公司的組織結構中是明確規定的。","word":"precedence"}},"precedent":{"createdAt":1783332861018,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「precedent」名詞表示「先例、慣例」，指過去的案例或決定用於指導未來的行動。","options":["complaint","precedent","rumor","theory"],"sentence":"This court decision has set a ______ for how similar cases should be handled in the future. Other judges will now reference this ruling when making their own decisions.","translation":"這個法院判決為將來如何處理類似案件設立了先例。其他法官在做出自己的決定時將現在參考這一判決。","word":"precedent"}},"precious":{"createdAt":1784624316000,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"precious 形容詞表示非常寶貴、珍貴或稀有，通常指價值高或對某人很重要的東西。","options":["common","precious","fragile","stolen"],"sentence":"The ______ diamond was kept in a vault because it was worth millions of dollars. The jeweler refused to let it out of his sight due to its rarity and high value.","translation":"這顆珍貴的鑽石被保存在金庫裡，因為它價值數百萬美元。珠寶商因為它的稀有性和高價值而拒絕讓它離開他的視線。","word":"precious"}},"precise":{"createdAt":1781746848186,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"precise 表示「精確的」或「準確的」，指數據或資訊非常準確和詳細。","options":["approximate","vague","precise","rough"],"sentence":"The engineer provided ______ measurements for the construction project. Every dimension was accurate to within one millimeter.","translation":"工程師為建築專案提供了精確的測量。每個尺寸都精確到毫米以內。","word":"precise"}},"precisely":{"createdAt":1781624534652,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"precisely 意為「精確地、確切地」，強調準確無誤的程度。","options":["vaguely","carefully","precisely","quickly"],"sentence":"The scientist measured the chemical compound ______ to ensure the experiment's accuracy. Even a difference of 0.001 grams could affect the final results.","translation":"科學家精確地測量了化學化合物以確保實驗的準確性。即使相差0.001克也會影響最終結果。","word":"precisely"}},"precision":{"createdAt":1782170870871,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"precision指的是準確性和精密度，在需要高度準確的工作中非常重要，例如外科手術。","options":["speed","precision","confidence","experience"],"sentence":"The surgeon performed the operation with remarkable ______, ensuring every cut was exact. Even a millimeter of error could have caused serious complications.","translation":"外科醫生以非凡的精確性進行手術，確保每一刀都恰到好處。即使偏差一毫米也可能造成嚴重併發症。","word":"precision"}},"predator":{"createdAt":1784540125091,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"predator是指以其他動物為食的掠食性動物，在這裡指的是狩獵斑馬的獅子。","options":["victim","predator","herbivore","scavenger"],"sentence":"The lion is a fierce ______ that hunts zebras on the African savanna. Ecologists study how this carnivorous animal maintains the balance of the ecosystem by controlling prey populations.","translation":"獅子是在非洲草原上獵捕斑馬的兇悍捕食性動物。生態學家研究這種肉食性動物如何通過控制獵物數量來維持生態系統的平衡。","word":"predator"}},"predecessor":{"createdAt":1781738105689,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"predecessor 指的是某人之前擔任過的職位上的人，或是先前存在的版本或事物。","options":["successor","predecessor","subordinate","colleague"],"sentence":"The new manager was eager to learn from her ______ about the company's operational procedures. Her previous supervisor had worked at the firm for fifteen years before retiring last month.","translation":"新經理渴望從她的前任那裡了解公司的運營程序。她的前一位主管在上月退休前在公司工作了十五年。","word":"predecessor"}},"predict":{"createdAt":1783208024473,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"predict 意為根據資訊或跡象提前說出將來會發生什麼事，與「風暴準時到達」一句中「如預報一樣」的結果相呼應。","options":["observe","predict","witness","prevent"],"sentence":"The weather forecaster was able to ______ that a major storm would hit the coast within 48 hours. The storm arrived exactly as forecasted, causing significant flooding in the region.","translation":"天氣預報員能夠預言一場大風暴將在48小時內襲擊海岸。風暴按預報準時到達，造成該地區嚴重洪水。","word":"predict"}},"predictable":{"createdAt":1788140972138,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"predictable 用來形容某件事能被預先知道或預料到，因為它遵循已知的模式或習慣。","options":["surprising","predictable","emotional","reasonable"],"sentence":"Her reaction was so ______ that everyone knew exactly what she would say next. We had seen her respond the same way to similar situations dozens of times before.","translation":"她的反應是如此可以預測，以至於每個人都知道她接下來會說什麼。我們已經看到她對類似的情況做出同樣的反應數十次了。","word":"predictable"}},"prediction":{"createdAt":1781401591593,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"prediction 是指基於現有信息對未來事件的預測或預言。","options":["observation","memory","prediction","description"],"sentence":"The weather forecaster made a ______ that it would rain heavily next Tuesday. Meteorologists use computer models and historical data to make such forecasts.","translation":"氣象預報員預測下週二會下大雨。氣象學家使用電腦模型和歷史數據來進行這樣的預測。","word":"prediction"}},"prefer":{"createdAt":1781437528476,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"prefer 表示較喜歡或寧願選擇某一個選項勝過另一個，常用來比較兩個事物的偏好。","options":["prefer","require","attend","schedule"],"sentence":"Most students ______ online classes over in-person lectures because they offer more flexibility. They can attend sessions at their own pace and rewatch difficult material as many times as needed.","translation":"大多數學生寧願選擇網上課程而不是面對面講座，因為它們提供了更多的靈活性。他們可以按照自己的進度參加課程，並根據需要多次重新觀看困難的內容。","word":"prefer"}},"preferable":{"createdAt":1783262131290,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"preferable表示更適合、更受歡迎或相比之下更令人喜歡的選擇。","options":["identical","equal","preferable","similar"],"sentence":"Living in the countryside is ______ to living in the noisy city for many people. The peaceful environment and fresh air are much more appealing than urban congestion.","translation":"對許多人來說，住在鄉村比住在喧鬧的城市更令人喜歡。寧靜的環境和新鮮空氣比城市的擁擠更具吸引力。","word":"preferable"}},"preferably":{"createdAt":1783260805487,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"preferably意為「更好地」或「最好」，表示一個更受歡迎的選項，但不是絕對必要的。","options":["absolutely","preferably","definitely","necessarily"],"sentence":"We should schedule the meeting ______ in the afternoon when everyone is available. However, if morning is the only option, we can adjust our plans.","translation":"我們最好在下午安排會議，那時每個人都有空。但是，如果早上是唯一的選擇，我們可以調整計劃。","word":"preferably"}},"preference":{"createdAt":1783332861019,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「preference」名詞表示「偏愛、偏好」，指對某事物的特別喜好或選擇傾向。","options":["schedule","preference","location","price"],"sentence":"The survey asks customers about their ______ regarding different coffee flavors. Some people prefer dark roast while others like lighter varieties.","translation":"調查詢問客戶對不同咖啡口味的偏愛。有些人喜歡深焙咖啡，而其他人喜歡較輕的品種。","word":"preference"}},"prehistoric":{"createdAt":1785038456734,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prehistoric 指的是文字記錄之前的時代，特別用於描述人類文明早期的時期，因此特別適合指代石器時代和化石等最古老的遺物。","options":["modern","prehistoric","ancient","primitive"],"sentence":"The museum's collection of ______ artifacts includes stone tools and fossils from over 10,000 years ago. These objects predate written history by thousands of years.","translation":"博物館的史前文物收藏包括超過一萬年前的石器和化石。這些物品的年代早於書面歷史數千年。","word":"prehistoric"}},"prejudice":{"createdAt":1782352245068,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"prejudice指的是對某人或某事物的不公正或不合理的成見和偏見。","options":["appreciation","fairness","prejudice","support"],"sentence":"The hiring manager's ______ against older workers prevented qualified candidates from getting the job. This unfair bias violated employment discrimination laws.","translation":"招聘經理對年長工作者的成見使合格候選人無法獲得工作。這種不公平的偏見違反了就業歧視法。","word":"prejudice"}},"prejudiced":{"createdAt":1781839703150,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"prejudiced指對他人有成見或偏見的，與comments showing bias about ethnicity（關於種族的帶有偏見的評論）完全相符。","options":["fair","impartial","prejudiced","objective"],"sentence":"The judge was deemed ______ and removed from the case. His comments about the defendant's ethnicity made his bias obvious to everyone.","translation":"該法官因為有偏見而被判定應該退出此案。他對被告種族的評論使他的偏見對每個人都顯而易見。","word":"prejudiced"}},"preliminary":{"createdAt":1781839703153,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"preliminary指初步的、未最終確定的，與更多comprehensive testing is needed to confirm（需要更多全面測試來確認）的語境完全相符。","options":["final","conclusive","preliminary","definitive"],"sentence":"The ______ results of the medical test suggest a potential issue. However, more comprehensive testing will be needed to confirm the diagnosis.","translation":"醫療測試的初步結果表明有潛在問題。但是需要更全面的測試來確認診斷。","word":"preliminary"}},"premature":{"createdAt":1781256444515,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"premature指過早或倉促的，暗示應該等待更多資訊才下決定。","options":["careful","premature","detailed","thorough"],"sentence":"The doctor advised against ______ conclusions about the patient's condition based on initial symptoms. More comprehensive tests would be needed before making any definitive diagnosis.","translation":"醫生建議不要根據初期症狀對患者的病情做出倉促的結論。需要進行更全面的測試才能做出明確診斷。","word":"premature"}},"premier":{"createdAt":1784011108102,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"premier是指政府的最高領導人，特別是在聯邦制國家中由議會選出的行政首長","options":["president","premier","minister","ambassador"],"sentence":"The ______ of Canada is responsible for leading the federal government. She was elected by Parliament and holds the highest executive position in the country.","translation":"加拿大的首相負責領導聯邦政府。她由國會選出，擁有全國最高的行政職位。","word":"premier"}},"premiere":{"createdAt":1781401361936,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"premiere指電影、戲劇等作品的首次公開展演或首映式，通常是一個重大的文化事件。","options":["sequel","premiere","release","screening"],"sentence":"The new Marvel movie had its ______ at the Cannes Film Festival last night. Thousands of fans gathered outside the theatre to see the actors walk the red carpet for the first public showing.","translation":"新的漫威電影昨晚在坎城影展舉行了首映。數千名粉絲聚集在劇院外，為第一場公開放映時看到演員走紅毯。","word":"premiere"}},"premise":{"createdAt":1784365643298,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"premise 是論證的基礎假定或前提條件，而後面的句子表明這個假定是錯誤的。","options":["conclusion","premise","evidence","fact"],"sentence":"The lawyer's argument was based on a faulty ______ that all witnesses tell the truth. However, the evidence clearly showed that several witnesses had lied under oath.","translation":"律師的論證基於所有證人都說實話的錯誤假定。然而，證據清楚地表明幾名證人在宣誓作證時說了謊。","word":"premise"}},"premium":{"createdAt":1784004063893,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"premium 作為名詞表示「附加費」或「加價」，指為了升級或更高級的產品而額外支付的費用。","options":["discount","charge","premium","refund"],"sentence":"If you want to upgrade to the deluxe coffee, there will be a small ______ added to your bill. Most customers find the extra cost worthwhile for the superior quality and larger size.","translation":"如果你想升級到豪華咖啡，你的賬單上將被加上一小筆附加費。大多數顧客認為額外的費用值得，因為品質更優越且份量更大。","word":"premium"}},"prescribe":{"createdAt":1781747309098,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prescribe 是醫學術語，特指醫生正式開藥方，患者可以在藥房領取該藥物。","options":["recommend","prescribe","discuss","suggest"],"sentence":"The doctor decided to ______ antibiotics for the patient's bacterial infection. After writing the medication on a form, the patient took it to the pharmacy to fill.","translation":"醫生決定為患者的細菌感染開抗生素。醫生在表格上寫下藥物後，患者拿著處方箋到藥房配藥。","word":"prescribe"}},"prescription":{"createdAt":1781401591591,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prescription 是指醫生開給患者的藥方或處方籤，用於在藥局購買特定藥物。","options":["diagnosis","prescription","symptom","treatment"],"sentence":"The doctor wrote a ______ for antibiotics after examining my throat infection. I took this document to the pharmacy to obtain my medication.","translation":"醫生檢查完我的喉嚨感染後，開了一張抗生素的處方籤。我拿著這份文件到藥局去拿藥。","word":"prescription"}},"presence":{"createdAt":1781837419086,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"Presence指的是一個人的存在所帶來的影響力和氣場，能夠吸引他人的注意。","options":["absence","voice","presence","smile"],"sentence":"Her calm ______ immediately put everyone at ease when she entered the room. The way she commanded attention without speaking demonstrated her powerful impact.","translation":"當她進入房間時，她的沉著讓所有人立即感到放心。她無需言語就能吸引注意力的方式展示了她強大的影響力。","word":"presence"}},"present":{"createdAt":1783332861016,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「present」形容詞表示「出席的、在場的」，用來描述人是否在場。","options":["absent","present","early","late"],"sentence":"All employees must be ______ for the mandatory company meeting next Monday. Attendance will be recorded to ensure full participation.","translation":"所有員工必須出席下週一的強制公司會議。將記錄出席情況以確保充分參與。","word":"present"}},"presentation":{"createdAt":1783042345898,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"presentation 指的是將信息、想法或產品以有組織且引人入勝的方式呈現給觀眾的演講或展示活動。","options":["proposal","presentation","document","report"],"sentence":"The marketing team spent two weeks preparing their ______ for the annual investor conference to showcase the company's new product line. They included colorful slides, live demonstrations, and a detailed sales forecast in front of a hundred potential partners.","translation":"行銷團隊花了兩週時間為年度投資者會議準備他們的演示，以展示公司的新產品線。他們在一百位潛在合作夥伴面前包括了彩色投影片、現場演示和詳細的銷售預測。","word":"presentation"}},"preservation":{"createdAt":1781951900949,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"preservation指維持某物的原有狀態並防止其損壞，強調的是保持而非修復或展示。","options":["destruction","restoration","preservation","exhibition"],"sentence":"The museum focuses on the ______ of ancient artifacts by keeping them in climate-controlled rooms. Without these careful protective measures, these priceless objects would crumble to dust.","translation":"博物館專注於在氣候控制的房間裡保存古代文物。如果沒有這些仔細的保護措施，這些無價之寶會化為塵埃。","word":"preservation"}},"preservative":{"createdAt":1781839950962,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"preservative 是指添加到食品中以防止腐敗並延長保存期的物質。","options":["flavoring","preservative","coloring","sweetener"],"sentence":"The food manufacturer added a ______ to extend the shelf life of the bread. Without this chemical substance, the product would spoil within just a few days.","translation":"食品製造商添加了防腐劑以延長麵包的保存期。沒有這種化學物質,產品幾天內就會變質。","word":"preservative"}},"preserve":{"createdAt":1781950727566,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"preserve 指保護或維持某物的原始狀態，防止其被破壞或消失。","options":["destroy","preserve","populate","relocate"],"sentence":"The government created a wildlife ______ to ______ the endangered species from extinction. The protected area ensures these animals can live safely without hunting interference.","translation":"政府設立了一個野生動物保護區來保護瀕危物種免於滅絕。受保護的區域確保這些動物可以安全生活，不受捕獵干擾。","word":"preserve"}},"preside":{"createdAt":1787719340189,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"preside是指主持或領導某個會議、活動或程序，通常由具有權力或權威的人來執行。","options":["attend","preside","witness","observe"],"sentence":"The judge will ______ over the court proceedings tomorrow morning. She has been selected to lead the trial because of her extensive legal experience and fair reputation.","translation":"法官明天早上將主持法庭訴訟程序。她因為豐富的法律經驗和公正的聲譽而被選中領導這場審判。","word":"preside"}},"presidency":{"createdAt":1784531912960,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"presidency指的是某人擔任總統的時期或任期，強調領導人物統治的時間跨度","options":["term","presidency","childhood","journey"],"sentence":"During his ______, the president implemented major reforms that changed the nation's direction. These changes took eight years to complete and had lasting effects on policy.","translation":"在他的總統任期內，總統實施了改變國家方向的重大改革。這些改革耗時八年才完成，對政策產生了持久影響。","word":"presidency"}},"president":{"createdAt":1781831347631,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"president 可以表示國家的總統，也可以表示大學、公司等組織的校長或總裁。","options":["janitor","president","groundskeeper","security guard"],"sentence":"The ______ of Harvard University announced new scholarship programs during the graduation ceremony. This leader oversees all academic and administrative operations across the institution's numerous colleges and schools.","translation":"哈佛大學的校長在畢業典禮上宣布了新的獎學金計畫。這位領導者監督該機構眾多學院和學校的所有學術和行政運作。","word":"president"}},"presidential":{"createdAt":1781311983485,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"presidential 指與總統或總統職位相關的，通常用來描述選舉或權力。","options":["expressive","presidential","offshore","syndrome"],"sentence":"The ______ election drew record numbers of voters to the polls across the nation. Citizens were eager to choose the next head of state and determine the direction of the country.","translation":"總統選舉在全國各地吸引了創紀錄人數的選民投票。公民渴望選擇下一任國家首腦並決定國家的方向。","word":"presidential"}},"press":{"createdAt":1781434900598,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"press指新聞媒體和出版界，特別是報紙、雜誌和新聞機構。","options":["judicial","press","religious","medical"],"sentence":"The ______ coverage of the scandal damaged the politician's reputation significantly. Newspapers and television networks reported extensively on the unfolding investigation.","translation":"新聞界對醜聞的報導大大損害了該政治家的聲譽。報紙和電視網絡廣泛報導了持續進行的調查。","word":"press"}},"pressure":{"createdAt":1781582251997,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"pressure 是名詞，表示來自外界環境、工作或期望所造成的心理或物理壓力。","options":["relief","freedom","pressure","excitement"],"sentence":"The student felt intense ______ as the exam date approached and deadlines piled up. Multiple assignments and upcoming tests created an overwhelming sense of stress.","translation":"隨著考試日期臨近和截止日期堆積，那位學生感受到強烈的壓力。多項作業和即將到來的考試造成了壓倒性的壓力感。","word":"pressure"}},"prestige":{"createdAt":1783058128609,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prestige 是指因成就、優秀或品質而獲得的名聲和尊敬，通常與聲譽和影響力密切相關。","options":["wealth","prestige","location","size"],"sentence":"The university has maintained its ______ for over a century through academic excellence and notable alumni. Many students from around the world apply to attend because of the institution's outstanding reputation and influence.","translation":"這所大學一個多世紀以來通過學術卓越和傑出校友維持了其名望。許多來自世界各地的學生申請入學是因為該機構的傑出聲譽和影響力。","word":"prestige"}},"prestigious":{"createdAt":1781565657691,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prestigious 形容詞表示享有高聲望和廣泛認可的地位，通常與教育機構、公司或組織相關。","options":["unknown","prestigious","affordable","recently-founded"],"sentence":"She earned her degree from a ______ university that is recognized worldwide for excellence. Employers actively seek graduates from this institution because of its outstanding reputation.","translation":"她從一所享有盛譽且在世界各地因卓越而聞名的大學獲得學位。雇主積極尋求該機構的畢業生，因為它有傑出的聲譽。","word":"prestigious"}},"presumably":{"createdAt":1787900221371,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"presumably 意為「據推測、想必」，用來表達基於某些理由而做出的推測或假設，而不是絕對肯定的事實。","options":["certainly","presumably","obviously","definitely"],"sentence":"The ancient artifact is ______ thousands of years old based on the carbon dating results. The laboratory report clearly confirms this age through scientific analysis.","translation":"根據碳定年測試結果，這件古代文物據推測有數千年的歷史。實驗室報告通過科學分析明確證實了這個年代。","word":"presumably"}},"presume":{"createdAt":1782475351769,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"presume意為「假定、推定」，表示基於某些理由而相信某事是真實的，但不確定。","options":["presume","confirm","know","observe"],"sentence":"I ______ that you have already read the email I sent yesterday morning. Since you haven't mentioned it yet, I wanted to check if you actually received it.","translation":"我假定你已經看過我昨天早上寄出的電子郵件。既然你還沒有提到它，我想檢查你是否真的收到了。","word":"presume"}},"pretend":{"createdAt":1782980805885,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"pretend 作動詞，表示故意裝作某種樣子或假裝某事是真實的。","options":["think","believe","pretend","imagine"],"sentence":"The child loved to ______ that she was a superhero fighting crime in the city. She would put on a cape and mask, then act out elaborate rescue scenarios with her toys.","translation":"這個孩子喜歡假裝自己是一個在城市中打擊犯罪的超級英雄。她會穿上斗篷和面罩，然後用玩具表演複雜的救援場景。","word":"pretend"}},"pretense":{"createdAt":1784173464329,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pretense 指虛假的聲稱或假裝，通常是為了隱藏真相或欺騙他人。","options":["honesty","pretense","confidence","interest"],"sentence":"He dropped his ______ and finally admitted that he had never actually read the famous novel. His friends were relieved to learn he was no longer hiding behind false claims.","translation":"他放下假裝，終於承認他從未真正閱讀過這部著名小說。他的朋友們很高興得知他不再躲在虛假聲稱後面。","word":"pretense"}},"pretentious":{"createdAt":1781582278976,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"pretentious形容試圖表現得比實際更高雅、更重要或更複雜的人或事物，通常帶有虛偽和自大的意味。","options":["affordable","traditional","pretentious","modest"],"sentence":"The restaurant's ______ menu featured dishes with unnecessarily complicated French names for simple preparations. Yet when the food arrived, diners were disappointed to discover it was ordinary cuisine presented with artificial flair.","translation":"這家餐廳自命不凡的菜單上，簡單的菜式被冠以複雜的法文名稱。然而當食物端上來時，食客失望地發現這只是用人為浮華包裝的平凡料理。","word":"pretentious"}},"prevail":{"createdAt":1781841742850,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prevail 作動詞表示「佔優勢、盛行」，指某種思想、趨勢或情況廣泛流行並占上風。","options":["diminish","prevail","disappear","weaken"],"sentence":"Despite the opposition from traditionalists, modern values ______ throughout the younger generation. New ideas about work-life balance became the cultural norm.","translation":"儘管傳統主義者的反對，現代價值觀在年輕一代中佔據上風。關於工作與生活平衡的新想法成為了文化規範。","word":"prevail"}},"prevent":{"createdAt":1783996545982,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"prevent 是指阻止某事發生或採取措施在問題出現之前加以制止，而不是在問題已經發生後才解決。","options":["cure","cause","prevent","treat"],"sentence":"Regular exercise and a healthy diet can ______ many serious diseases. By making these lifestyle choices now, you reduce your risk of developing heart disease or diabetes in the future.","translation":"定期運動和健康的飲食可以預防許多嚴重疾病。透過現在做出這些生活方式的選擇，你可以降低將來患心臟病或糖尿病的風險。","word":"prevent"}},"preventing":{"createdAt":1785424294408,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"preventing（阻止；預防）意思是採取措施來阻止某事發生或保護某人免受傷害，在這裡指的是減少犯罪事件的發生。","options":["encouraging","preventing","promoting","allowing"],"sentence":"The new security system is effective at ______ theft in our neighborhood. Since it was installed last month, there have been zero break-ins reported.","translation":"新的安全系統在阻止我們社區的盜竊方面很有效。自從上個月安裝以來，已經沒有報告任何入室盜竊事件。","word":"preventing"}},"preventive":{"createdAt":1782007196628,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「預防的」用來形容在問題發生前採取的行動或政策，強調預先防止而非事後補救。","options":["curative","preventive","reactive","expensive"],"sentence":"Taking ______ measures early can save you from serious health problems later. Doctors often recommend vaccines and regular exercise as ways to stop diseases before they start.","translation":"及早採取預防措施可以讓您免於日後嚴重的健康問題。醫生通常建議接種疫苗和定期運動是在疾病開始前阻止疾病的方式。","word":"preventive"}},"preview":{"createdAt":1782637076486,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"preview 是預覽或預映的意思，指在正式發佈或上映之前提前展示內容。","options":["review","preview","broadcast","screening"],"sentence":"The film studio offered a special ______ of the new movie to selected critics before its public release. Critics were invited to watch the film early and share their opinions.","translation":"電影製片廠在新電影公開上映前向精選的評論家提供了特別預映。評論家被邀請提前觀看電影並分享他們的意見。","word":"preview"}},"previous":{"createdAt":1781746848180,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"previous 表示「以前的」或「先前的」，指過去發生過的事情。","options":["current","previous","future","ideal"],"sentence":"In her ______ job, she worked as a software engineer for five years. Now she has transitioned to become a project manager.","translation":"在她以前的工作中，她做了五年的軟體工程師。現在她轉變成了專案經理。","word":"previous"}},"previously":{"createdAt":1786416115760,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"previously是副詞，表示在過去的某個時間點發生的事情，指時間上的先前或以前。","options":["currently","previously","rarely","instantly"],"sentence":"The restaurant's health inspection revealed serious violations that were ______ overlooked by the authorities. New management has since implemented strict cleaning protocols to address all past issues.","translation":"餐廳的衛生檢查發現了之前被當局忽視的嚴重違規。新管理層之後實施了嚴格的清潔規程來解決所有過去的問題。","word":"previously"}},"prey":{"createdAt":1781951900948,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prey指被捕食者捕獵的動物，在掠食者和被捕食者的關係中具體指被追捕的對象。","options":["enemy","prey","target","victim"],"sentence":"The eagle spotted a rabbit as its ______ and dove down from the sky to catch it. The smaller animal had no chance of escaping this powerful predator.","translation":"鷹發現一隻兔子是它的獵物，從空中俯衝而下去抓住它。這隻較小的動物無法逃脫這隻強大捕食者的追捕。","word":"prey"}},"priceless":{"createdAt":1781693293271,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"priceless 是形容詞，意思是「無價的」或「極為珍貴的」，無法用金錢衡量其價值。","options":["ruthless","priceless","executive","crush"],"sentence":"The ancient painting discovered in the museum vault is absolutely ______. Experts estimate its historical and artistic value to be beyond any monetary calculation.","translation":"在博物館金庫中發現的古代畫作絕對是無價的。專家認為其歷史和藝術價值超過任何金錢計算。","word":"priceless"}},"priest":{"createdAt":1782304661034,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"priest是名詞，指基督教或其他宗教中的神職人員，負責執行宗教儀式和禮拜。","options":["doctor","priest","teacher","judge"],"sentence":"The ______ performed the wedding ceremony in the church. He wore his white collar and blessed the couple with holy water.","translation":"牧師在教堂裡主持了婚禮。他穿著白領口，用聖水祝福這對新人。","word":"priest"}},"primal":{"createdAt":1784042974319,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"primal 形容詞表示「最初的、原始的、與生俱來的」，用來描述源於人類最早時期或本性中的事物。","options":["modern","primal","learned","complex"],"sentence":"The ______ fear of darkness is deeply rooted in human nature and has existed since our earliest ancestors. This instinct helped our forebears survive dangerous nights in the wilderness.","translation":"對黑暗的原始恐懼深深植根於人類本性中，自我們最早的祖先以來就存在了。這種本能幫助我們的祖先在荒野的危險夜晚中生存下來。","word":"primal"}},"primarily":{"createdAt":1784960721538,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"primarily是副詞，表示「首要地」或「主要地」，用來說明某事物的主要特點或大部分內容。","options":["rarely","primarily","occasionally","never"],"sentence":"The restaurant serves ______ Italian dishes, though they also offer French cuisine. Their menu features pasta, risotto, and traditional recipes from Rome and Milan.","translation":"這家餐廳主要提供義大利菜，雖然他們也提供法國菜。他們的菜單以來自羅馬和米蘭的義大利麵、燴飯和傳統食譜為主。","word":"primarily"}},"primary":{"createdAt":1782529318033,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"primary 意為最主要的或首要的，用於強調在多個原因或因素中最重要的一個。","options":["secondary","primary","initial","preliminary"],"sentence":"The ______ reason for the company's failure was poor financial management. Other factors like market competition were less significant in comparison.","translation":"公司失敗的首要原因是財務管理不善。相比之下，市場競爭等其他因素不太重要。","word":"primary"}},"prime":{"createdAt":1781496369387,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prime在此作動詞使用，表示「事先給某人提供情況，使有所準備」，強調提前告知和準備。","options":["dismiss","prime","ignore","confuse"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ its employees with detailed information before the major product launch. The briefing session ensured everyone understood their roles and responsibilities for the announcement.","translation":"公司決定在重大產品發佈前向員工提供詳細信息，做好準備。簡報會議確保每個人都了解自己在公佈會上的角色和責任。","word":"prime"}},"primitive":{"createdAt":1783208024471,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"primitive 形容早期、未開化或技術簡陋的人類或文明，與「簡單的石器」和「數百萬年前」的時間點相符。","options":["modern","advanced","primitive","civilized"],"sentence":"Archaeological findings suggest that ______ humans used simple stone tools for hunting thousands of years ago. These early tools have been carbon-dated to over 2 million years old.","translation":"考古發現表明，遠古人類在數千年前使用簡單的石器進行狩獵。這些早期工具的碳定年結果顯示超過200萬年前。","word":"primitive"}},"primitives":{"createdAt":1781926370999,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"primitives 意思是原始人、未開化的人，指人類早期的祖先或文化發展水平較低的人群。","options":["modernists","scholars","primitives","inventors"],"sentence":"The anthropologist studied ______ from ancient civilizations by examining their tools and artwork. These early people had developed surprisingly sophisticated techniques despite lacking modern technology.","translation":"人類學家通過檢查他們的工具和藝術作品來研究古代文明的原始人。儘管缺乏現代技術，這些早期的人已經發展出令人驚訝地複雜的技術。","word":"primitives"}},"principal":{"createdAt":1783305188029,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"principal 在此作為名詞，指的是學校的最高行政主管，擁有制定重要決策的權力。","options":["teacher","principal","student","parent"],"sentence":"The ______ of the school announced the new academic calendar at the assembly. He made the decision after consulting with the board of directors and the teaching staff.","translation":"學校的校長在集會上宣佈了新的學年日程。他在諮詢董事會和教職員工後做出了這個決定。","word":"principal"}},"principle":{"createdAt":1782106346908,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"principle（原則）指的是指導行為或決定的基本規則或信念。","options":["location","principle","equipment","schedule"],"sentence":"The company's ______ of treating all employees fairly has made it a great workplace. This core belief guides every hiring and promotion decision they make.","translation":"該公司對所有員工公平對待的原則使其成為一個偉大的工作場所。這一核心信念指導著他們做出的每一個招聘和晉升決定。","word":"principle"}},"prior":{"createdAt":1785587554574,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prior 作為形容詞，表示「較為優先的」或「在前面的」，指在時間或重要性上應該先處理的事物。","options":["later","prior","simple","urgent"],"sentence":"You must complete all ______ tasks before starting the new project. The work from last week has higher importance than anything you'll receive today.","translation":"你必須在開始新專案之前完成所有較為優先的任務。上週的工作比你今天將收到的任何東西都更重要。","word":"prior"}},"priority":{"createdAt":1783905256098,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"priority 是指被認為最重要、必須首先處理或關注的事項，強調了順序和緊急程度。","options":["concern","priority","objective","goal"],"sentence":"The hospital made patient safety its highest ______ during the pandemic. All resources and staff decisions were directed toward protecting vulnerable patients first.","translation":"在疫情期間，醫院將患者安全列為最高優先事項。所有資源和員工決定都指向首先保護易受傷害的患者。","word":"priority"}},"prison":{"createdAt":1785824979178,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prison是指關押犯人的地方，通常用於懲罰違反法律的人。","options":["hospital","prison","school","office"],"sentence":"The criminal was sentenced to spend ten years in ______. He was locked behind bars as punishment for his serious crimes.","translation":"這名罪犯被判在監獄服刑十年。他因為犯了嚴重罪行而被關在鐵欄後面。","word":"prison"}},"prisoner":{"createdAt":1783130197539,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prisoner指的是被監禁或被逮捕並在監獄中服刑的人。","options":["visitor","prisoner","judge","lawyer"],"sentence":"The ______ was kept in a locked cell and guarded by armed officers. He had been convicted of robbery and was serving a ten-year sentence.","translation":"那個犯人被關在上了鎖的牢房裡，由武裝警衛看守。他因搶劫罪被判有罪，正在服十年徒刑。","word":"prisoner"}},"privacy":{"createdAt":1783946029659,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"privacy 是指個人的隱私權或不受他人打擾的權利，特別是關於個人資訊和私人生活的保護。","options":["security","privacy","freedom","solitude"],"sentence":"She values her ______ and rarely shares personal information with strangers. She keeps her bedroom door locked and her diary hidden from everyone.","translation":"她重視她的隱私，很少與陌生人分享個人資訊。她把臥室門鎖上，並把日記藏起來，不讓任何人看到。","word":"privacy"}},"private":{"createdAt":1781479123532,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"private 指的是私人的、不對外公開的，與公眾無關的事務。","options":["public","casual","private","formal"],"sentence":"The CEO held a ______ meeting with the board of directors in a closed conference room. No journalists or employees were invited to attend this confidential discussion about the company's future strategy.","translation":"執行長在一間密閉的會議室裡與董事會進行私人會議。沒有記者或員工被邀請參加這次關於公司未來策略的機密討論。","word":"private"}},"privatize":{"createdAt":1783685293801,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"privatize意思是「使私有化」，指將原本由政府或公共機構控制的資產或服務轉移至私人企業。","options":["nationalize","regulate","privatize","subsidize"],"sentence":"The government decided to ______ the state-owned railway system by selling it to private investors. This shifted control of the transportation network from public hands to corporate ownership.","translation":"政府決定將國有鐵路系統私有化，將其出售給私人投資者。這將運輸網絡的控制權從公共部門轉移到企業所有權。","word":"privatize"}},"privilege":{"createdAt":1784982601058,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"特權是指由於特殊身份或地位而獲得的優先待遇或殊榮，而非簡單的機會或成就。","options":["opportunity","privilege","achievement","benefit"],"sentence":"Attending the exclusive dinner with the CEO was a great ______ for the young employee who had worked so hard. Only the top performers in the company were invited to this special event.","translation":"能夠與首席執行官參加專屬晚宴對於這位辛勤工作的年輕員工來說是一項殊榮。公司中只有表現最出色的員工被邀請參加這個特殊活動。","word":"privilege"}},"probably":{"createdAt":1784193946482,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"probably 是副詞，表示「很可能」或「或許」，用來描述有相當可能性但不確定的事情。","options":["definitely","probably","never","always"],"sentence":"She will ______ arrive at the meeting on time, though there is some traffic. The weather forecast shows a 70% chance of rain, so we are not completely certain about her arrival.","translation":"她很可能會準時到達會議，儘管有一些交通。天氣預報顯示下雨的機率為70%，所以我們對她的到達時間並不完全確定。","word":"probably"}},"probe":{"createdAt":1782902185116,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"probe 作動詞表示「盤問」、「追問」或「探究」，指進行深入的調查或詢問以尋求真相。","options":["probe","ignore","celebrate","accept"],"sentence":"The detective decided to ______ deeper into the suspect's background and alibis. She asked increasingly detailed questions about his whereabouts on the night of the crime.","translation":"偵探決定深入追問嫌疑人的背景和不在場證明。她對他在犯罪當晚的行蹤提出了越來越詳細的問題。","word":"probe"}},"procedure":{"createdAt":1781961506841,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"procedure指一系列有順序的步驟或規定步驟，通常用於正式的流程和手續。","options":["celebration","procedure","accident","decoration"],"sentence":"To apply for a passport, you must follow the government ______ carefully and complete each step in order. The official checklist outlines exactly which documents to submit first, then which agency to visit next.","translation":"申請護照時，你必須仔細遵循政府______，並依序完成每個步驟。官方檢查清單列出了確切要先提交哪些文件，然後再去哪個機構。","word":"procedure"}},"proceed":{"createdAt":1783068673123,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"proceed 表示「進行；繼續」，指開始或繼續進行某項活動或過程。","options":["cancel","proceed","schedule","postpone"],"sentence":"The surgeon will not ______ with the operation until all the test results are reviewed. Patient safety is the top priority before making any medical decisions.","translation":"外科醫生在審查所有測試結果之前不會進行手術。在做出任何醫療決定之前，患者安全是最高優先級。","word":"proceed"}},"proceeding":{"createdAt":1782101579245,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"proceeding 在此指採取的措施或行動，特別是為了應對某個問題或達成特定目標而進行的正式步驟。","options":["proceeding","decoration","celebration","conversation"],"sentence":"The company took immediate ______ to address the safety violations discovered at the factory. These actions included inspections, repairs, and staff retraining programs.","translation":"公司採取立即措施來處理工廠發現的安全違規問題。這些措施包括檢查、維修和員工再培訓計畫。","word":"proceeding"}},"process":{"createdAt":1782092862167,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"process指一系列有序的步驟或操作，用來達成特定的結果或進行生產和加工。","options":["department","process","system","facility"],"sentence":"The manufacturing ______ involves multiple stages from raw materials to finished products. Each step is carefully monitored to ensure quality and consistency.","translation":"製造過程涉及從原材料到成品的多個階段。每一步都受到仔細監控以確保品質和一致性。","word":"process"}},"procession":{"createdAt":1785242055826,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"procession 指的是一群人在正式或莊嚴的場合下有秩序地排成一列行進的隊伍。","options":["parade","procession","crowd","queue"],"sentence":"The wedding guests formed a long ______ as they walked slowly down the aisle toward the altar. The line of people moved in an orderly, ceremonial fashion, with each person following the one in front.","translation":"婚禮來賓排成長長的隊伍，緩慢地沿著走道向祭壇走去。這群人以有序、莊嚴的方式行進，每個人都跟著前面的人。","word":"procession"}},"proclaim":{"createdAt":1783946029662,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"proclaim 是動詞，表示正式、公開地宣佈或聲明某事，通常帶有官方或莊嚴的性質。","options":["whisper","proclaim","suggest","debate"],"sentence":"The king will ______ the new law in front of all the citizens tomorrow. He plans to announce it publicly from the palace steps to ensure everyone hears the important declaration.","translation":"國王明天將在所有公民面前宣佈新法律。他計劃從宮殿台階上公開宣佈，以確保每個人都聽到這份重要宣言。","word":"proclaim"}},"produce":{"createdAt":1783332861006,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「produce」作動詞表示「生產、製造」，特別是農業上種植和生長農產品的意思。","options":["consume","produce","transport","purchase"],"sentence":"The farm can ______ enough vegetables to feed the entire town. Last year they grew tomatoes, lettuce, and carrots in large quantities.","translation":"農場能夠生產足夠的蔬菜來餵養整個城鎮。去年他們大量種植了番茄、生菜和胡蘿蔔。","word":"produce"}},"product":{"createdAt":1787307336537,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"product 在此指公司製造或銷售的商品或成果；與 process（過程）、profit（利潤）、project（專案）不同，只有 product 符合「在市場推出的具體商品」的語境。","options":["process","product","profit","project"],"sentence":"The company launched a new ______ in the smartphone market last month. This innovative device combines cutting-edge technology with affordable pricing to attract budget-conscious consumers.","translation":"該公司上個月在智慧型手機市場推出了一款新產品。這款創新裝置結合了尖端技術和經濟實惠的價格，以吸引預算有限的消費者。","word":"product"}},"production":{"createdAt":1785120157988,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"production指的是製造或生產的過程和結果，在這裡指工廠製造的商品數量或產量增加了。","options":["consumption","production","distribution","destruction"],"sentence":"The factory increased its ______ by 40% this year. The workers manufactured more cars, electronics, and textiles than ever before.","translation":"這家工廠今年將其產量增加了40%。工人製造了比以往更多的汽車、電子產品和紡織品。","word":"production"}},"productive":{"createdAt":1781939439465,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"productive是形容詞，表示多產的、高效的、富有成果的，形容能夠產生大量成果或結果。","options":["idle","slow","productive","incomplete"],"sentence":"The research team had a very ______ year, publishing multiple studies and making significant discoveries. Their laboratory output exceeded all previous records and contributed greatly to the field.","translation":"研究團隊度過了非常多產的一年，發表了多項研究並取得了重大發現。他們實驗室的產出超過了所有以往的紀錄，對該領域的貢獻很大。","word":"productive"}},"productivity":{"createdAt":1782920661039,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"productivity是指生產力，即在特定時間內完成的工作量或生產的產品數量","options":["productivity","performance","work","effort"],"sentence":"The company invested in new technology to improve employee ______ and efficiency. After implementing the changes, output increased by 30 percent in three months.","translation":"公司投資新技術以提高員工的生產力和效率。實施改變後，產出在三個月內增加了30%。","word":"productivity"}},"profession":{"createdAt":1781840667145,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"profession指的是需要專業訓練和知識的職業或行業。","options":["hobby","skill","profession","passion"],"sentence":"After graduating from medical school, she entered the ______ of dentistry. She spent years training to specialize in oral health care.","translation":"從醫學院畢業後，她進入了牙科專業。她花了多年時間培訓以專精於口腔保健。","word":"profession"}},"professional":{"createdAt":1781582939254,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"professional 形容具有專業知識、技能和經驗的人或工作，與長期培訓和獲得業界認可的背景相符。","options":["amateur","young","professional","expensive"],"sentence":"The ______ photographer used high-end cameras and lighting equipment to capture the wedding photos. She had spent fifteen years studying her craft and had won multiple industry awards for her work.","translation":"這位專業攝影師使用高端相機和照明設備來拍攝婚禮照片。她花了十五年研究她的技藝，並因她的工作獲得了多個行業獎項。","word":"professional"}},"professor":{"createdAt":1784795529742,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「教授」是指在大學或高等教育機構中教授學科並進行研究的學術人員，通常擁有高級學位。","options":["student","professor","librarian","administrator"],"sentence":"My ______ holds a PhD in molecular biology and has published over fifty research papers. She teaches advanced biochemistry to graduate students at the university.","translation":"我的教授擁有分子生物學博士學位，已發表了五十多篇研究論文。她在大學教授高級生物化學課程給研究生。","word":"professor"}},"proficiency":{"createdAt":1782170870876,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"proficiency指的是在某個技能或語言上的精通和熟練程度，表示已達到較高的掌握水平。","options":["curiosity","proficiency","interest","awareness"],"sentence":"After five years of intensive training, Maria has achieved ______ in Mandarin Chinese. She can now read classical literature and participate in academic discussions without difficulty.","translation":"經過五年的集中訓練後，瑪麗亞已經精通漢語普通話。她現在可以閱讀古典文學並輕鬆參與學術討論。","word":"proficiency"}},"proficient":{"createdAt":1784293496186,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"proficient表示在某個領域內具有高度的技能和專業知識，能夠熟練地完成相關工作。","options":["interested","proficient","curious","anxious"],"sentence":"After years of training, she became ______ in three different languages and could translate documents with ease. Her fluency and accuracy impressed even the most demanding clients.","translation":"經過多年訓練後，她精通三種不同的語言，能夠輕鬆翻譯文件。她的流暢度和準確性令人印象深刻，甚至讓最挑剔的客戶也為之驚嘆。","word":"proficient"}},"profile":{"createdAt":1785983108178,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"profile在此指對某人的詳細介紹或簡歷，通常包含其背景資訊和職業成就。","options":["portrait","profile","summary","outline"],"sentence":"The company created a detailed ______ of each job candidate to help with the hiring decision. The document included their educational background, work experience, and professional achievements.","translation":"該公司為每位求職者創建了詳細的人物簡介，以幫助招聘決策。該文件包括他們的教育背景、工作經驗和專業成就。","word":"profile"}},"profit":{"createdAt":1783063953961,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"profit作動詞表示「獲利、獲得好處」，指從某事中得到益處或利益。","options":["harm","damage","profit","weaken"],"sentence":"The business consultant explained how improving efficiency could ______ the company's operations. Better workflows would save thousands of dollars annually and improve productivity.","translation":"商業顧問解釋了提高效率如何能有益於公司的運營。更好的工作流程將每年節省數千美元並提高生產力。","word":"profit"}},"profound":{"createdAt":1781794866353,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"profound指深遠的、深切的，用於形容思想、感受或影響具有深刻的意義和重要性。","options":["shallow","obvious","profound","trivial"],"sentence":"The philosopher's ______ insights into human nature changed how people understood themselves. His ideas continue to influence thinkers and scholars more than a century after his death.","translation":"這位哲學家對人性的______ 洞察改變了人們對自己的理解。他的想法在他去世一個多世紀後仍繼續影響思想家和學者。","word":"profound"}},"program":{"createdAt":1783505313977,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"program作名詞表示「電腦程式」或「編碼」，指一組為電腦執行特定任務的指令。","options":["schedule","program","document","design"],"sentence":"The software developer wrote a complex ______ to automate the data processing system. The code contains thousands of lines of instructions that tell the computer exactly what calculations to perform.","translation":"軟體開發人員編寫了一個複雜的程式來自動化數據處理系統。代碼包含數千行指令，告訴電腦要執行什麼計算。","word":"program"}},"progress":{"createdAt":1781848934154,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"progress指在某方面的改善或向前發展的過程","options":["decline","progress","failure","stagnation"],"sentence":"The student's ______ in mathematics has been remarkable this year. Her test scores have improved dramatically, and she now ranks at the top of her class.","translation":"這位學生今年在數學方面的進步非常顯著。她的考試成績大幅提高，現在在班級中排名靠前。","word":"progress"}},"progressive":{"createdAt":1781843396462,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"progressive表示不斷前進和逐步進行的，在此指組織的改變是循序漸進而非突然的。","options":["sudden","dramatic","progressive","radical"],"sentence":"The organization implemented ______ changes to modernize its operations. Each phase of the reform built upon the previous one, gradually transforming the company over five years.","translation":"該組織實施循序漸進的改革以使其業務現代化。改革的每個階段都建立在前一個基礎上，在五年內逐漸改變公司。","word":"progressive"}},"progressively":{"createdAt":1783946382150,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"progressively 是副詞，表示逐漸地、不斷前進地發生變化，強調過程中有規律的逐步進展。","options":["suddenly","temporarily","progressively","randomly"],"sentence":"The patient's condition improved ______ over the course of six months of treatment. Each week brought measurable advances, building steadily from one stage to the next.","translation":"患者的狀況在六個月的治療過程中______ 改善。每週都帶來可測量的進展，從一個階段穩步發展到下一個階段。","word":"progressively"}},"prohibit":{"createdAt":1785337792089,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prohibit意為禁止或不允許做某事，在這句話中表示法律明確禁止的行為。","options":["encourage","prohibit","permit","regulate"],"sentence":"The new law will ______ smoking in all public buildings starting next month. Violators will face significant fines, and signs will be posted everywhere to inform people of the restriction.","translation":"新法律將從下月開始禁止在所有公共建築內吸菸。違反者將面臨鉅額罰款，各處都將張貼標誌以通知民眾該限制。","word":"prohibit"}},"prohibition":{"createdAt":1781839950960,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"prohibition 指的是官方的禁止或禁令,具有法律效力。","options":["permission","suggestion","prohibition","advertisement"],"sentence":"The government enacted a ______ on smoking in public buildings. Violating this law could result in significant fines or penalties.","translation":"政府頒布了在公共建築物內禁止吸煙的禁令。違反這項法律可能導致罰款或處罰。","word":"prohibition"}},"project":{"createdAt":1782134503209,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"project 在此作名詞，指有明確目標和截止日期的計畫或方案，常用於工作或企業環境中。","options":["task","project","game","dream"],"sentence":"Our team is working on a new ______ to develop mobile applications for the company. The client expects us to deliver the final product by the end of next quarter.","translation":"我們的團隊正在進行一個新的項目，為公司開發行動應用程式。客戶期望我們在下一季度末交付最終產品。","word":"project"}},"projection":{"createdAt":1781651261360,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"projection在此表示基於分析而做出的預測或推測，常用於天氣、經濟等領域的未來預估。","options":["rod","projection","treasury","physics"],"sentence":"The weather forecast made a ______ that temperatures would drop significantly next week. The meteorologists based their prediction on months of collected data and climate patterns.","translation":"天氣預報做出了下週氣溫會大幅下降的推測。氣象學家根據數月收集的資料和氣候模式來做出這項預測。","word":"projection"}},"projector":{"createdAt":1781582251997,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"projector 是名詞，指的是能夠將影像投射到牆面或螢幕上的設備。","options":["speaker","projector","microphone","printer"],"sentence":"The teacher turned on the ______ to display the lesson slides on the classroom wall. The bright image was clearly visible to all students in the back row.","translation":"老師打開投影機將課程投影片顯示在教室牆上。明亮的影像對後排的所有學生都清晰可見。","word":"projector"}},"prolong":{"createdAt":1782373576504,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prolong 是延長時間或延伸某事物的時間跨度，使其變得更長","options":["shorten","prolong","cancel","summarize"],"sentence":"The negotiators decided to ______ the meeting for another two hours. They added extra agenda items and extended the session well into the evening.","translation":"談判代表決定將會議延長兩小時。他們增加了額外的議程項目，並將會議延伸到了晚上。","word":"prolong"}},"prominence":{"createdAt":1786416115755,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prominence表示一個人或事物的知名度或重要性，指在公眾視野中受到廣泛認可和關注的狀態。","options":["duration","prominence","confusion","tradition"],"sentence":"The actor gained ______ after starring in several blockbuster films. She was previously unknown, but now her face appears on magazine covers worldwide.","translation":"這位演員在出演幾部大片後獲得了知名度。她之前默默無聞，但現在她的臉出現在世界各地的雜誌封面上。","word":"prominence"}},"prominent":{"createdAt":1783759528318,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prominent 表示「著名的、重要的、知名的」，通常用來描述在其領域中備受認可和尊敬的人物或事物。","options":["unknown","prominent","shy","inactive"],"sentence":"The ______ business leader was invited to speak at the international conference. Her achievements in the industry have made her one of the most recognized figures in the world.","translation":"那位著名的商業領袖被邀請在國際會議上發言。她在業界的成就使她成為世界上最受認可的人物之一。","word":"prominent"}},"promise":{"createdAt":1785239072549,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"promise 作動詞表示「諾言；約定」，指的是對他人做出的鄭重承諾或誓言，通常涉及未來的行動或責任。","options":["threat","promise","complaint","question"],"sentence":"The athlete made a ______ to work harder and improve her performance. She signed a contract committing to train six days a week for the next two years.","translation":"這位運動員做出了一個承諾，要更加努力並改進她的表現。她簽署了一份合同，承諾在未來兩年內每週訓練六天。","word":"promise"}},"promising":{"createdAt":1781362281662,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"promising表示有前途的或大有可為的，預示著未來的成功。","options":["poor","promising","average","disappointing"],"sentence":"The young athlete showed ______ skills during the tournament. Coaches believe she has great potential to become a champion.","translation":"這位年輕運動員在比賽中表現出有前途的技能。教練認為她有成為冠軍的巨大潛力。","word":"promising"}},"promote":{"createdAt":1781775276773,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"promote指晉升或提拔員工到更高的職位，通常伴隨著更多責任和更高的報酬。","options":["demote","fire","promote","transfer"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ Sarah to manager after she demonstrated excellent leadership skills. She will now oversee the entire department and earn a higher salary.","translation":"公司決定提升莎拉為經理，因為她展示了出色的領導能力。她現在將監督整個部門並獲得更高的薪酬。","word":"promote"}},"promotion":{"createdAt":1783947021214,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"promotion 是名詞，意為升遷或晉級，指在工作中被提升到更高的職位或職級。","options":["demotion","vacation","promotion","transfer"],"sentence":"After five years of excellent work and dedication, Sarah finally received a ______ to senior manager. Her new position came with increased responsibilities and a significant salary increase.","translation":"經過五年的出色工作和奉獻，莎拉最終獲得了晉升為高級經理的機會。她的新職位帶來了更多責任和顯著的加薪。","word":"promotion"}},"prompt":{"createdAt":1783225337470,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prompt 作為動詞表示「引起、導致、激起」，也可形容詞表示「迅速的、敏捷的」；在此句中用作動詞，表示某事物導致或激起某人採取行動。","options":["delay","prompt","prevent","allow"],"sentence":"The sudden noise ______ him to turn around and investigate immediately. His quick reaction showed how alert and responsive he was to the unexpected sound.","translation":"突然的噪音促使他立即轉身調查。他快速的反應展示了他對意外聲音的警覺和敏捷反應。","word":"prompt"}},"prone":{"createdAt":1783851650423,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prone 表示「易於遭受或傾向於某事」，常與 to 搭配使用，形容人容易受到某種影響或疾病。","options":["resistant","prone","immune","protected"],"sentence":"People with weak immune systems are ______ to catching colds during winter. Medical research shows that certain genetic factors make individuals more susceptible to respiratory infections.","translation":"免疫系統較弱的人在冬天容易患感冒。醫學研究表明，某些遺傳因素會使個人更容易受到呼吸道感染。","word":"prone"}},"pronounce":{"createdAt":1781693304925,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pronounce 在此意為正式宣告或宣布某項決定、判決或結論。","options":["hear","pronounce","question","debate"],"sentence":"The judge will ______ the verdict after carefully reviewing all the evidence presented during the trial. The courtroom fell silent as everyone awaited her formal declaration.","translation":"法官在仔細審查審判期間提出的所有證據後，將宣告判決。法庭陷入沉寂，所有人都在等待她的正式宣告。","word":"pronounce"}},"pronounced":{"createdAt":1784950578944,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pronounced 作形容詞表示「明顯的、顯著的」，用來描述易於察覺的差異或特徵。","options":["subtle","pronounced","common","unclear"],"sentence":"The difference between the two candidates' policies is ______. The economist noted that one supports free markets while the other advocates for strict government regulation.","translation":"兩位候選人的政策差異很明顯。經濟學家指出，一位支持自由市場，而另一位則主張嚴格的政府監管。","word":"pronounced"}},"pronunciation":{"createdAt":1783470852898,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pronunciation是指說一個詞語時聲音的具體方式，強調正確的音位和音節。","options":["accent","pronunciation","dialect","articulation"],"sentence":"The teacher corrected my ______ of the French word during class. She showed me how to position my tongue and lips to produce the correct sounds.","translation":"老師在課堂上糾正了我對這個法文單字的發音。她向我展示了如何調整舌頭和嘴唇的位置以發出正確的聲音。","word":"pronunciation"}},"proof":{"createdAt":1784546023702,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"proof 是名詞，表示能夠驗證或確認某事真實性的證據或憑據，在法律和科學中特別常用。","options":["evidence","proof","documentation","verification"],"sentence":"The detective demanded ______ that the suspect was at the crime scene on that night. Without solid evidence like fingerprints or witness statements, the case could not proceed.","translation":"偵探要求證明嫌疑人在那晚在犯罪現場。沒有堅實的證據，比如指紋或證人陳述，案件無法進行。","word":"proof"}},"propaganda":{"createdAt":1784372634555,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"propaganda 是指為了推動特定觀點或政策而進行的系統性宣傳活動，通常帶有政治目的或偏見。","options":["entertainment","propaganda","education","documentation"],"sentence":"The government's ______ campaign convinced many citizens to support the new policy. The ministry carefully controlled all media messages to shape public opinion in their favor.","translation":"政府的宣傳運動說服了許多市民支持新政策。該部門仔細控制所有媒體訊息以便塑造有利於他們的輿論。","word":"propaganda"}},"propel":{"createdAt":1782883637409,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"propel是指用力推動或驅動某物向前運動，強調施加力量使其移動或進行。","options":["guide","propel","launch","accelerate"],"sentence":"The rocket engines ______ the spacecraft toward Mars at incredible speeds. Without this powerful thrust force pushing the vehicle forward, it could never reach such distant destinations.","translation":"火箭引擎以令人難以置信的速度推動宇宙飛船向火星前進。沒有這股強大的推動力，它永遠無法到達如此遙遠的目標。","word":"propel"}},"proper":{"createdAt":1781359980249,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"proper指適合、適當或恰當的；強調符合特定情境或標準的要求。","options":["casual","improper","proper","creative"],"sentence":"Using ______ grammar and correct spelling is essential when writing formal business letters. Your employer expects professional communication in all official correspondence.","translation":"寫正式商業信函時，使用適當的語法和正確的拼寫至關重要。你的雇主期望所有官方函件中的溝通都是專業的。","word":"proper"}},"properly":{"createdAt":1781414884517,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"properly表示適當地、恰當地、按照正確方式進行，強調符合要求和規範。","options":["quickly","properly","eagerly","loudly"],"sentence":"The student did not follow the instructions ______, so her essay format was completely incorrect. The teacher had to ask her to rewrite it according to the exact guidelines provided.","translation":"學生沒有適當地遵循說明，所以她的論文格式完全不正確。老師不得不要求她按照提供的確切指南重新撰寫。","word":"properly"}},"property":{"createdAt":1782187611207,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"property 指的是個人或組織所擁有的財產、房地產或物業，包括土地、建築物和其他有形資產。","options":["education","property","advice","reputation"],"sentence":"After inheriting his uncle's ______, he became a wealthy man overnight. The estate included multiple buildings, land, and valuable assets across three different cities.","translation":"在繼承了他叔叔的財產後，他一夜之間成為了富人。這座莊園包括多棟建築物、土地以及分佈在三個不同城市的寶貴資產。","word":"property"}},"prophet":{"createdAt":1782022372247,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"prophet 意為「預言家、先知」，指被認為具有預知未來或傳達神聖訊息能力的人物。","options":["prophet","historian","philosopher","merchant"],"sentence":"In ancient times, people believed a ______ could foresee future events through divine inspiration. The oracle at Delphi was one of the most famous figures consulted for predictions about what would happen in the coming years.","translation":"在古代，人們相信先知可以通過神聖的靈感預見未來事件。德爾菲的神殿祭司是人們最常諮詢的著名人物，用來預測未來幾年將發生的事情。","word":"prophet"}},"proponent":{"createdAt":1781838276307,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"proponent指某個想法或計劃的支持者或倡導者。","options":["ordeal","toll","proponent","volume"],"sentence":"Dr. Chen is a leading ______ of renewable energy in our country. She has spent the last twenty years advocating for solar and wind power initiatives.","translation":"陳博士是我們國家可再生能源的主要支持者。她過去二十年一直在倡導太陽能和風能項目。","word":"proponent"}},"proportion":{"createdAt":1784212160303,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"proportion指的是相對大小或數量之間的比例關係，在藝術和設計中用來描述各個部分之間的相對關係。","options":["color","proportion","size","texture"],"sentence":"The artist carefully studied the ______ of the human face to ensure that the eyes, nose, and mouth were correctly positioned. By measuring the distances between facial features, she achieved a realistic portrait that looked natural and balanced.","translation":"藝術家仔細研究了人臉的比例，以確保眼睛、鼻子和嘴巴的位置正確。通過測量面部特徵之間的距離，她完成了一幅看起來自然且平衡的寫實肖像。","word":"proportion"}},"proposal":{"createdAt":1783395908753,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"proposal 表示計劃、建議或提案，指向他人呈現的想法或計畫。","options":["complaint","report","proposal","complaint"],"sentence":"The manager presented a ______ to improve the company's efficiency by implementing new technology. The board voted on whether to accept this suggested plan at the meeting.","translation":"經理提出了一項計劃，通過實施新技術來提高公司的效率。董事會在會議上投票決定是否接受這項建議的方案。","word":"proposal"}},"propose":{"createdAt":1781693266948,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"propose在此表示向某人提出結婚的建議，即求婚；也可表示提議或建議。","options":["propose","postpone","promote","provide"],"sentence":"He decided to ______ marriage to his girlfriend on Valentine's Day. He had carefully planned the romantic dinner and prepared a diamond ring.","translation":"他決定在情人節向女友求婚。他仔細計畫了浪漫的晚餐並準備了一枚鑽石戒指。","word":"propose"}},"prose":{"createdAt":1783670406866,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"prose 指散文或平凡乏味的言論，與詩歌相對，通常以日常的文體表達，有時顯得乏味。","options":["verse","dialogue","prose","narrative"],"sentence":"Unlike the beautiful poetry in the anthology, much of the book's ______ felt dull and uninspiring. The editor acknowledged that several chapters lacked creativity and failed to engage readers emotionally.","translation":"與文集中優美的詩歌不同，這本書的大部分散文感覺乏味且缺乏靈感。編輯承認幾章缺乏創意，未能在情感上打動讀者。","word":"prose"}},"prosecute":{"createdAt":1781848934146,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prosecute指以法律手段對被告人進行起訴或檢舉的行為","options":["defend","prosecute","release","pardon"],"sentence":"The district attorney decided to ______ the suspect for armed robbery. The evidence collected at the crime scene was sufficient to bring charges.","translation":"地方檢察官決定起訴該嫌疑人武裝搶劫罪。在犯罪現場收集的證據足以提起訴訟。","word":"prosecute"}},"prosecution":{"createdAt":1782352245055,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prosecution指的是控方或檢察機構對被告人的起訴和訴訟行為。","options":["defense","prosecution","jury","verdict"],"sentence":"The ______ of the accused criminal took place in federal court last month. The lawyer presented evidence that proved the defendant's guilt beyond a reasonable doubt.","translation":"被指控的罪犯的起訴在上個月於聯邦法院進行。律師提供了證據證明被告有罪。","word":"prosecution"}},"prospect":{"createdAt":1781515270335,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prospect 在此作名詞，指探勘或勘探的地點，也可指有潛力開採的礦藏地點。","options":["investment","prospect","bucket","curious"],"sentence":"The geologist spent weeks exploring the remote area as a potential mineral ______. The company hired him specifically to search for deposits of copper and gold underground.","translation":"地質學家花了數週時間探勘一個潛在的礦物前景。該公司聘請他專門在地下尋找銅和金的礦床。","word":"prospect"}},"prospective":{"createdAt":1783516186776,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prospective 是指有可能發生或成為某物的人或事，特別是指潛在的客戶、學生或候選人。","options":["retired","prospective","current","graduated"],"sentence":"The university recruiter met with ______ students to discuss their academic interests and career goals. These young people were considering applying to the institution.","translation":"那位大學招生人員與有前途的學生見面，討論他們的學術興趣和職業目標。這些年輕人正在考慮申請該機構。","word":"prospective"}},"prospectus":{"createdAt":1787049198633,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prospectus是投資或入學機構發行的正式文件，概述機構的計劃、前景和相關細節。","options":["contract","prospectus","invoice","receipt"],"sentence":"Before investing in the new venture, she carefully read the ______ to understand the business plan. It outlined the company's goals, strategies, and financial projections for the next five years.","translation":"在投資新創企業之前，她仔細閱讀了簡章以了解商業計劃。它概述了公司未來五年的目標、策略和財務預測。","word":"prospectus"}},"prosper":{"createdAt":1783005778370,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"prosper 意為「興旺」或「繁榮」，指事業、個人或地區在經濟和發展上取得成功。","options":["decline","stagnate","prosper","relocate"],"sentence":"After implementing new marketing strategies, the small business began to ______ and expand rapidly. Within three years, they opened five new branches across the country.","translation":"在實施新的行銷策略後，這家小企業開始繁榮並迅速擴張。三年內，他們在全國各地開設了五家新分店。","word":"prosper"}},"prosperous":{"createdAt":1781515329259,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prosperous 形容詞，意思是昌盛的、興旺的，在這裡用來描述經濟發展良好的狀態。","options":["declining","prosperous","stagnant","fragile"],"sentence":"The ______ economy created countless job opportunities for workers. The country's GDP grew by 15% last year, attracting foreign investors from around the world.","translation":"繁榮的經濟為工人創造了無數的工作機會。該國的國內生產毛額去年增長了15%，吸引了來自世界各地的外商投資。","word":"prosperous"}},"protection":{"createdAt":1782646322966,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"protection 是指防止傷害或損害的行為或條件，在此上下文中指保險所提供的保障措施。","options":["insurance","protection","prevention","security"],"sentence":"The insurance policy provided financial ______ against unexpected accidents and disasters. Coverage included medical expenses, property damage, and liability claims to ensure complete security.","translation":"保險單提供了針對意外事故和災難的財務保護。保險涵蓋醫療費用、財產損害和責任索賠，以確保完整的安全性。","word":"protection"}},"protein":{"createdAt":1781332009083,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"protein 是名詞，指的是蛋白質，一種重要的營養物質，對肌肉和組織的構成至關重要","options":["carbohydrate","protein","fat","vitamin"],"sentence":"Athletes need to consume adequate ______ to support muscle growth and recovery. Foods like chicken, fish, and eggs are excellent sources of this essential nutrient.","translation":"運動員需要消耗足夠的蛋白質來支持肌肉生長和恢復。雞肉、魚和雞蛋等食物是這種必要營養素的極好來源。","word":"protein"}},"protest":{"createdAt":1782140283166,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"protest是名詞，表示對某事的正式或公開反對，通常是針對政策或不公正現象的抗議活動。","options":["celebration","parade","protest","festival"],"sentence":"Thousands of people attended the ______ outside the government building yesterday. They carried signs demanding action on climate change.","translation":"昨天數千人在政府大樓外參加了抗議活動。他們舉著標語牌要求採取氣候變化行動。","word":"protest"}},"prototype":{"createdAt":1782475351772,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prototype指「原型」，是指產品正式生產前製作的第一個試驗版本，用於測試和改進。","options":["replica","prototype","sketch","diagram"],"sentence":"The engineering team built a ______ of the new electric vehicle before beginning mass production. They needed to test all features and identify any problems in the design.","translation":"工程團隊在開始大規模生產之前製造了新電動車的原型。他們需要測試所有功能並識別設計中的任何問題。","word":"prototype"}},"protract":{"createdAt":1783556774449,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"protract意為延長或拖延，通常指將某事的持續時間無必要地延伸得更長。","options":["complete","protract","accelerate","simplify"],"sentence":"The construction project continued to ______ long beyond the originally scheduled deadline. Management's poor planning and lack of resources kept pushing the completion date further and further back.","translation":"施工項目遠超原定截止日期後繼續延長。管理層的規劃不周和資源不足使完成日期不斷推遲。","word":"protract"}},"prove":{"createdAt":1783944768432,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"prove 的意思是用證據或論據來證實或確認某事是真實的。","options":["disprove","prove","question","examine"],"sentence":"The scientist conducted experiments to ______ her theory about climate change. Her research findings were published in a peer-reviewed journal and convinced the academic community.","translation":"科學家進行實驗來證明她關於氣候變化的理論。她的研究成果發表在同行評審期刊上，並說服了學術界。","word":"prove"}},"proverb":{"createdAt":1784960721537,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"proverb是一句簡短的傳統說法，用來表達普遍的真理或智慧，通常在文化中代代相傳。","options":["novel","proverb","poem","letter"],"sentence":"My grandmother often quoted the ______ \"An apple a day keeps the doctor away.\" This traditional saying has been passed down through generations to teach wisdom.","translation":"我的祖母經常引用諺語「一天一蘋果，醫生遠離我。」這句傳統的說法代代相傳以傳授智慧。","word":"proverb"}},"provide":{"createdAt":1781777331353,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"provide是動詞，表示供應、提供某物給某人或某個地方","options":["withhold","provide","deny","refuse"],"sentence":"The restaurant agreed to ______ complimentary drinks for all guests at the wedding reception. The manager wanted to ensure every attendee felt welcome and well cared for throughout the evening.","translation":"餐廳同意為婚禮招待會的所有賓客提供免費飲料。經理想確保每位出席者在整個晚上都感到受歡迎且得到妥善照顧。","word":"provide"}},"provided":{"createdAt":1783848553717,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「provided」作為連接詞時，表示「假如」或「條件是」，用來陳述一個必要的條件。在此句中，它引入了獲得獎學金考慮資格的必要條件。","options":["although","provided","because","unless"],"sentence":"______ you submit your application before Friday, you will be considered for the scholarship. However, if you miss the deadline, your application will be rejected regardless of its quality.","translation":"假如你在星期五之前提交申請書，你將被考慮獲得獎學金。但是，如果你錯過截止日期，你的申請將被拒絕，無論其品質如何。","word":"provided"}},"province":{"createdAt":1781583174625,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"province是指國家內部的一個行政區域，通常由中央政府管轄，具有某種程度的自治權","options":["country","province","city","district"],"sentence":"The ______ of Ontario is one of the most populated regions in Canada. It has its own government and laws that differ from other parts of the country.","translation":"安大略____是加拿大人口最密集的地區之一。它擁有自己的政府和與該國其他地區不同的法律。","word":"province"}},"provincial":{"createdAt":1781831347625,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"provincial 形容詞表示首都或大城市以外的地方，通常帶有閉塞或不開放的含義。","options":["metropolitan","rural","provincial","cosmopolitan"],"sentence":"The ______ town had no major universities or cultural institutions like those found in the capital city. Most residents had never traveled beyond their own region and were unfamiliar with urban life.","translation":"這個外省的小鎮沒有像首都那樣的主要大學或文化機構。大多數居民從未離開過自己的地區，對城市生活不熟悉。","word":"provincial"}},"provision":{"createdAt":1781832508019,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"provision 表示「供應量；預備；食糧」，指為特定目的預先準備的物品或數量。","options":["denial","provision","prohibition","reduction"],"sentence":"The government made adequate ______ of food and water for the refugees. Trucks arrived daily at the camp delivering supplies that would last several weeks.","translation":"政府為難民做出了充足的食物和水的供應。卡車每天抵達營地運送可以維持數週的物資。","word":"provision"}},"provisional":{"createdAt":1783068673120,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"provisional 表示「暫時的；臨時的」，指在正式或最終版本出現前的過渡性措施。","options":["permanent","provisional","expired","invalid"],"sentence":"The government issued a ______ license to the company while waiting for final approval. The permit would become permanent only after all safety inspections were completed.","translation":"政府在等待最終批准期間向該公司簽發了臨時許可證。只有在完成所有安全檢查後，許可證才會變成永久性的。","word":"provisional"}},"provoke":{"createdAt":1785242988951,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"provoke意思是通過某些行為或言論來故意激怒他人或引起某種反應，常用於引發不利的情緒或衝突。","options":["calm","prevent","provoke","satisfy"],"sentence":"The politician's controversial speech was designed to ______ strong reactions from the opposition. His inflammatory remarks deliberately stirred up anger and sparked intense debates.","translation":"這位政治家的爭議性演講旨在激怒反對派的強烈反應。他的煽動性言論故意激起了憤怒並引發了激烈的辯論。","word":"provoke"}},"psychiatrist":{"createdAt":1787135117486,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"psychiatrist是指專門治療心理健康和精神障礙的醫生，能夠診斷和治療各種心理疾病。","options":["dentist","psychiatrist","pharmacist","nutritionist"],"sentence":"When Sarah struggled with severe anxiety and depression, her doctor referred her to a ______. The specialist helped her work through her emotional trauma and prescribed medication to manage her symptoms.","translation":"當莎拉為嚴重的焦慮和抑鬱症苦惱時，她的醫生將她轉介給一位精神科醫生。這位專家幫助她處理她的情緒創傷，並開藥物來控制她的症狀。","word":"psychiatrist"}},"psychiatry":{"createdAt":1783402916386,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"psychiatry 是醫學的一個分支，專門研究和治療精神疾病和心理障礙。","options":["cardiology","psychiatry","dentistry","dermatology"],"sentence":"Dr. Chen specializes in ______ and helps patients understand their mental health conditions. He completed years of medical training to diagnose and treat disorders like depression and anxiety.","translation":"陳醫生專門從事精神病學，幫助患者了解他們的心理健康狀況。他完成了多年的醫學培訓以診斷和治療抑鬱症和焦慮症等疾病。","word":"psychiatry"}},"psychic":{"createdAt":1781362281725,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"psychic表示通靈的、有特異功能的，指超自然或心靈上的能力。","options":["mathematical","psychic","musical","athletic"],"sentence":"She claimed to have ______ abilities that allowed her to read minds. She said she could communicate with spirits and see the future.","translation":"她聲稱擁有通靈能力，可以讀取他人的想法。她說她可以與靈魂溝通並看到未來。","word":"psychic"}},"psychological":{"createdAt":1782542941494,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"psychological 是形容詞，指與心理、心靈、思想和情感相關的事物，屬於心理學領域的研究範疇。","options":["physical","psychological","infectious","genetic"],"sentence":"The therapist specializes in treating ______ disorders such as anxiety and depression. These conditions affect a person's mental state and emotional well-being rather than physical health.","translation":"治療師專門治療心理障礙，如焦慮症和抑鬱症。這些疾病影響的是一個人的心理狀態和情感健康，而不是身體健康。","word":"psychological"}},"psychologist":{"createdAt":1782646561676,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"psychologist 是指受過專業培訓的心理健康專家，透過談話療法幫助患者解決心理問題。","options":["doctor","psychologist","teacher","coach"],"sentence":"Maria visited a ______ to discuss her anxiety and stress management strategies. The professional she saw had a PhD in clinical mental health and specialized in cognitive behavioral therapy.","translation":"瑪麗亞拜訪了一位心理學家來討論她的焦慮和壓力管理策略。她看到的專業人士擁有臨床心理健康博士學位，並專門從事認知行為療法。","word":"psychologist"}},"psychology":{"createdAt":1781532967164,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"psychology 是心理學，與「人如何思考」、「人類行為和情緒」的描述相符。","options":["biology","chemistry","psychology","physics"],"sentence":"She decided to study ______ in university because she was interested in how people think. Her focus was on understanding human behavior and emotions.","translation":"她決定在大學學習______(心理學)，因為她對人們如何思考感興趣。她的專注點是理解人類的行為和情緒。","word":"psychology"}},"psychopath":{"createdAt":1783243171151,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"psychopath是指具有反社會人格特徵的人，表現出缺乏同情心、道德感和悔意，同時具有操縱他人的傾向。","options":["patient","psychopath","victim","witness"],"sentence":"The criminal psychologist studied the ______ to understand his lack of empathy and manipulative behavior. The patient showed no remorse for his actions despite causing harm to many people.","translation":"犯罪心理學家研究這位精神病質者以了解他缺乏同情心和操縱性的行為。儘管對許多人造成傷害，患者卻表現出沒有悔意。","word":"psychopath"}},"psychotherapy":{"createdAt":1783661880053,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"psychotherapy 是名詞，表示心理治療或精神療法，與第二句中「治療師」和「處理情緒」的語境完全相符。","options":["medication","surgery","psychotherapy","exercise"],"sentence":"After the traumatic event, John decided to seek ______ to process his emotions. A licensed therapist helped him work through his anxiety and grief.","translation":"在創傷事件後，約翰決定尋求心理治療來處理他的情緒。一位有執照的治療師幫助他度過焦慮和悲傷。","word":"psychotherapy"}},"public":{"createdAt":1784193946483,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"public 是形容詞，表示「公眾的」或「公開的」，指對大眾開放、屬於全社會的人或物。","options":["private","secret","public","exclusive"],"sentence":"The ______ library in our town is open to everyone and free to use. Any citizen can borrow books, use the computers, and attend events there without paying any membership fees.","translation":"我們鎮上的公共圖書館對所有人開放，免費使用。任何公民都可以借閱書籍、使用電腦，以及參加那裡的活動，無需支付任何會費。","word":"public"}},"publication":{"createdAt":1781345237584,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"publication指書籍、文章或其他作品的出版或發行行為及其所發行的物品。","options":["reception","publication","rejection","discussion"],"sentence":"The ______ of the research paper was delayed due to peer review corrections. The journal finally released the study online and in print this morning.","translation":"由於同行評審修正，研究論文的出版被延遲了。期刊今早終於在線和印刷版上發布了這項研究。","word":"publication"}},"publicize":{"createdAt":1785761664996,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"publicize 是指向公眾宣傳或公開發佈某事，使大眾知道；在這句話中強調通過各種渠道讓人們了解新產品。","options":["conceal","publicize","postpone","regulate"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ its new product through social media campaigns and television advertisements. The marketing team worked hard to make sure everyone in the country knew about the launch.","translation":"公司決定通過社交媒體活動和電視廣告來公佈其新產品。行銷團隊努力確保全國每個人都知道這次推出。","word":"publicize"}},"publish":{"createdAt":1785040694796,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"publish 意為「出版；發行」，指將作品正式印刷並發行給公眾，使其可以在商業渠道中購買。","options":["write","publish","edit","promote"],"sentence":"The author worked on her manuscript for five years before deciding to ______ it with a major publisher. Her book finally appeared in bookstores and online retailers worldwide last month.","translation":"這位作者花了五年時間修改她的手稿，然後決定用一家大出版社來______它。她的書終於在上個月出現在世界各地的書店和網路零售商上。","word":"publish"}},"publisher":{"createdAt":1782646322965,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"publisher 是指發行書籍的公司或機構，負責出版和發行作品，而不是編寫或編輯內容的人。","options":["author","publisher","editor","printer"],"sentence":"The ______ decided to release the book in both hardcover and digital formats. The company that printed and distributed the novel to bookstores worldwide was responsible for all production decisions.","translation":"出版商決定以精裝和數位格式發行這本書。負責將小說印製並分配到全球書店的公司對所有生產決策負責。","word":"publisher"}},"pulse":{"createdAt":1782542941494,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pulse 是名詞，指由心臟跳動引起的血液脈搏，通常在手腕、頸部等地方可以感受到的有節奏的跳動。","options":["heartbeat","pulse","temperature","pressure"],"sentence":"The doctor checked the patient's ______ by placing two fingers on the wrist. The rhythmic beating indicated that the heart was pumping blood steadily through the body.","translation":"醫生通過將兩根手指放在手腕上來檢查患者的脈搏。有節奏的跳動表明心臟在穩定地將血液泵送通過全身。","word":"pulse"}},"pump":{"createdAt":1781359980247,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pump作為動詞有套問的意思；指通過反覆或持續的提問來從某人那裡獲取信息。","options":["extract","pump","document","broadcast"],"sentence":"The reporter tried to ______ information from the witness about what he had seen that night. Despite persistent questioning, the witness refused to reveal any details.","translation":"記者試圖從證人那裡套問他那晚看到的信息。儘管提出了持續的質詢，證人拒絕透露任何細節。","word":"pump"}},"pumps":{"createdAt":1781332009077,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pumps 是名詞，指的是無帶的高跟女鞋，通常用於正式場合","options":["boots","pumps","sandals","sneakers"],"sentence":"She wore elegant red ______ to the formal evening gala. The high-heeled shoes matched her dress perfectly and made her feel confident and stylish.","translation":"她穿著優雅的紅色高跟鞋參加了正式的晚宴。這雙高跟鞋與她的禮服完美搭配，讓她感到自信和時尚。","word":"pumps"}},"punch":{"createdAt":1782542941492,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"punch 作為名詞表示用拳頭的一擊或一拳，是拳擊和格鬥運動中的基本動作。","options":["kick","punch","shove","throw"],"sentence":"The boxer delivered a powerful ______ to his opponent's face during the third round. The impact was so forceful that it knocked the other fighter down on the canvas.","translation":"拳擊手在第三輪中向對手的臉部揮出了一記有力的一拳。打擊力度如此之大，以至於將另一位拳手擊倒在畫布上。","word":"punch"}},"punctual":{"createdAt":1786364372305,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"punctual 是形容詞，意思是「準時的、如期的」，用來形容一個人準確地按時到達或完成某事的習慣或特性。","options":["friendly","punctual","creative","confident"],"sentence":"My manager expects all team members to be ______ for morning meetings, arriving exactly at 9 AM. Yesterday, John arrived at 8:55 AM and received praise for his reliable timekeeping.","translation":"我的經理期望所有團隊成員在早晨會議上準時出席，恰好在上午9點到達。昨天，約翰在上午8點55分到達，因為他可靠的守時而受到稱讚。","word":"punctual"}},"pupils":{"createdAt":1787049756213,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pupils是指小學或學校的學生，特別是年幼的學生。","options":["colleagues","pupils","relatives","patients"],"sentence":"The teacher gave each of her ______ a worksheet to complete in class. She had thirty students in total, ranging from age six to seven years old.","translation":"老師給她的每個學生一份工作表在課堂上完成。她總共有三十名學生，年齡從六歲到七歲不等。","word":"pupils"}},"puppet":{"createdAt":1783609867015,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"puppet是名詞，表示由演員通過繩子或手部操控的木製或布製人形玩具","options":["doll","puppet","statue","figure"],"sentence":"The child's favorite toy was a wooden ______ with strings attached to its limbs. The puppeteer moved it around the stage for the afternoon show.","translation":"孩子最喜歡的玩具是一個四肢上附著繩子的木製木偶。木偶戲演員在下午的表演中用它在舞台上移動。","word":"puppet"}},"purchase":{"createdAt":1784191742097,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"purchase指購買商品或進行交易的行為，也可指所購買的商品本身。","options":["polish","resistance","purchase","guide"],"sentence":"She made a ______ at the grocery store and bought fresh vegetables for dinner. The receipt showed she spent exactly thirty dollars on her shopping trip.","translation":"她在雜貨店進行了購買，買了新鮮蔬菜做晚餐。收據顯示她在購物時花了整好三十元。","word":"purchase"}},"pure":{"createdAt":1785885349561,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pure 表示「純的、不摻雜的、完全沒有雜質」，這裡用來形容水質完全沒有污染物。","options":["dirty","pure","warm","deep"],"sentence":"The spring water in the mountains is ______ and safe to drink. Scientists tested it and found no chemicals, bacteria, or other contaminants in the water.","translation":"山裡的泉水是純淨的，可以安全飲用。科學家檢測了它，發現水中沒有化學物質、細菌或其他污染物。","word":"pure"}},"purest":{"createdAt":1788737560824,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"purest表示物質的純度達到最高級別，沒有任何雜質混合，是純淨的最高程度。","options":["cleanest","simplest","purest","freshest"],"sentence":"This water sample represents the ______ form of H₂O we could find in the laboratory. Scientists confirmed it contained absolutely no contaminants or dissolved minerals.","translation":"這個水樣本代表我們在實驗室裡能找到的最純淨的H₂O形式。科學家確認它完全不含污染物或溶解礦物。","word":"purest"}},"purify":{"createdAt":1782575719152,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"purify意為「使純淨、淨化」，指通過去除有害或不需要的物質來使某物變得清潔和純淨。","options":["distribute","purify","waste","filter"],"sentence":"The new water treatment plant will ______ the tap water to remove all harmful chemicals and bacteria. Citizens can now drink safely from their faucets without worrying about contamination.","translation":"新的水處理廠將淨化自來水以去除所有有害的化學物質和細菌。居民現在可以安全地從水龍頭飲用水，而不用擔心污染。","word":"purify"}},"purity":{"createdAt":1783671496288,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"purity是名詞，指某物不含雜質或污染物、純淨無污的狀態。","options":["temperature","purity","depth","color"],"sentence":"The water's ______ is essential for drinking and cooking in rural villages. Testing the water regularly ensures it is free from harmful bacteria and chemicals.","translation":"水的純淨度對農村地區的飲用和烹飪至關重要。定期檢測水質可確保它不含有害的細菌和化學物質。","word":"purity"}},"purpose":{"createdAt":1781693270387,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"purpose指「意圖、目的、目標」，表示做某事想要達到或實現的目標。","options":["obstacle","purpose","consequence","tradition"],"sentence":"The main ______ of the new community center is to provide affordable recreational activities for local residents. The facility offers sports classes, art workshops, and meeting spaces for all ages.","translation":"新社區中心的主要目的是為當地居民提供價格合理的娛樂活動。該設施為各年齡層提供運動課程、藝術工作坊和會議空間。","word":"purpose"}},"pursue":{"createdAt":1782637076483,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pursue 意為追捕、追趕或追求，在此指警察緊跟嫌疑人不讓其逃脫的行為。","options":["arrest","pursue","question","observe"],"sentence":"The police officer decided to ______ the suspect who had fled from the scene of the crime. The officer ran down the street, determined not to let the criminal escape.","translation":"警察決定追捕從犯罪現場逃跑的嫌疑人。警官跑過街道，決心不讓罪犯逃脫。","word":"pursue"}},"pursuit":{"createdAt":1781939898048,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"pursuit表示追趕或追求某個目標，這裡特別指動態的追捕行為。","options":["wandering","pursuit","rendering","hesitation"],"sentence":"The detective was in ______ of the suspect through the crowded streets. He finally caught up with him near the train station after a twenty-minute chase.","translation":"偵探在擁擠的街道上追趕嫌疑人。在二十分鐘的追捕後，他終於在火車站附近逮捕了他。","word":"pursuit"}},"pyramid":{"createdAt":1783488892615,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"pyramid是指一種有著四個三角形面相交於一點頂端的建築結構，最著名的例子是埃及的金字塔。","options":["monument","building","pyramid","structure"],"sentence":"The ancient Egyptians built a massive stone ______ as a tomb for the pharaoh. This iconic structure with four triangular sides meeting at a point still stands in Giza today.","translation":"古埃及人建造了一座巨大的石製金字塔作為法老的墓葬。這座具有標誌性的四個三角形邊在頂端相交的建築至今仍聳立在吉薩。","word":"pyramid"}},"quake":{"createdAt":1781950727565,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"quake 指震顫或顫抖，特別是指地震或由於恐懼而發抖。","options":["settle","quake","freeze","harden"],"sentence":"The ground began to ______ when the earthquake struck the city. Buildings shook violently and people ran out into the streets in panic.","translation":"當地震襲擊城市時，地面開始震動。建築物劇烈搖晃，人們驚慌失措地跑到街上。","word":"quake"}},"qualification":{"createdAt":1784546023696,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"qualification 指的是能夠勝任某項工作或職位所需的正式資格或證書，是招聘中的標準要求。","options":["education","qualification","experience","certificate"],"sentence":"You need a ______ in nursing to work as a registered nurse in most countries. The hospital's HR department requires proof of your degree and license before hiring.","translation":"在大多數國家，你需要護理資格才能成為註冊護士。醫院的人力資源部門在招聘前需要你的學位和執照證明。","word":"qualification"}},"qualified":{"createdAt":1781332009068,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"qualified 意為有資格的、勝任的，表示具備必要的技能或資格","options":["inexperienced","qualified","young","willing"],"sentence":"Only ______ professionals with years of training should perform this dangerous surgery. The hospital requires all surgeons to have medical degrees and board certification.","translation":"只有有資格的專業人士經過多年培訓才應執行這項危險的手術。該醫院要求所有外科醫生都要有醫學學位和委員會認證。","word":"qualified"}},"qualify":{"createdAt":1784624316005,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"qualify 動詞表示使某人具有資格或使其滿足特定要求和條件。","options":["retire","qualify","graduate","compete"],"sentence":"To ______ for the Olympic team, athletes must pass a rigorous selection process. Only those who meet the strict performance standards will be accepted into the program.","translation":"要符合進入奧運隊的資格，運動員必須通過嚴格的選拔過程。只有達到嚴格表現標準的人才會被接受進入該計畫。","word":"qualify"}},"quality":{"createdAt":1781425737119,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"quality 指事物的優秀程度或品質水平，與服務標準和訓練計畫的改善相關。","options":["quantity","quality","location","price"],"sentence":"The restaurant's ______ of service has improved significantly over the past year. The manager implemented strict training programs to ensure every customer interaction meets high standards.","translation":"這家餐廳的服務品質在過去一年中大幅改善。經理實施了嚴格的培訓計畫，以確保每次客戶互動都達到高標準。","word":"quality"}},"quantity":{"createdAt":1781933311793,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"quantity（數量）指可測量的物質多少，而quality（品質）、identity（身分）和facility（設施）都不能用「一半的量」來修飾。","options":["quality","quantity","identity","facility"],"sentence":"The baker reduced the ______ of sugar in the recipe to make the cookies less sweet. She used exactly half the amount that was originally specified.","translation":"麵包師傅減少了食譜中糖的數量，使餅乾不那麼甜。她使用的量正好是原本規定量的一半。","word":"quantity"}},"quarrel":{"createdAt":1781864339053,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"quarrel表示兩個人或多個人之間的口頭爭執或吵架，通常涉及不同意見。","options":["chat","quarrel","laugh","whisper"],"sentence":"The two friends began to ______ loudly in the cafeteria about who should pay for lunch. By the time they finished shouting, everyone in the room was staring at them.","translation":"這兩個朋友在自助餐廳大聲爭吵誰應該付午餐費。當他們停止尖叫時，房間裡的每個人都在看著他們。","word":"quarrel"}},"quarter":{"createdAt":1783505313977,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"quarter作名詞表示「四分之一」，指將某物分成四等份後的其中一份。","options":["half","quarter","third","part"],"sentence":"She ate three-______ of the pizza and saved the rest for tomorrow. There was only one slice left out of the original eight slices.","translation":"她吃了披薩的四分之三，其餘的留到明天。原本八片中只剩下一片。","word":"quarter"}},"queer":{"createdAt":1781794866350,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"queer是用來描述非異性戀或非順性別身份的現代術語，常用於LGBTQ+相關語境中。","options":["religious","queer","athletic","academic"],"sentence":"The ______ community has made significant progress in fighting for equal rights and recognition. Pride parades celebrate the diverse identities of LGBTQ+ individuals worldwide.","translation":"______ 社群在爭取平等權利和認可方面取得了重大進展。驕傲遊行慶祝全球LGBTQ+個體的多元身份。","word":"queer"}},"quest":{"createdAt":1785724173566,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"quest 意指為了實現某個目標而進行的持續性追求或探索，強調目標的重要性和追求的決心。","options":["journey","quest","adventure","expedition"],"sentence":"The knight embarked on a ______ to find the legendary treasure hidden in the mountains. His ______ lasted many years, during which he overcame countless obstacles and dangerous creatures.","translation":"那位騎士開始了一場追求，想要找到隱藏在山中的傳奇寶藏。他的追求持續了許多年，期間他克服了無數的障礙和危險的生物。","word":"quest"}},"questionnaire":{"createdAt":1781935654222,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"questionnaire 是一份包含多個問題的書面表格，用於收集受調查者的意見或信息。","options":["interview","feedback","questionnaire","survey form"],"sentence":"Please fill out this ______ with your feedback about our customer service. We need your written responses to all twenty questions.","translation":"請填寫此問卷以提供對我們客戶服務的反饋。我們需要您對所有二十個問題的書面回答。","word":"questionnaire"}},"quilt":{"createdAt":1781484415210,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"quilt是指用多層布料和填充物製成的厚重被子，通常是手工製作的。","options":["pillow","quilt","curtain","rug"],"sentence":"She snuggled under her warm ______ on the cold winter night. The handmade blanket had been stitched together from colorful fabric patches by her grandmother.","translation":"在寒冷的冬夜，她蜷縮在溫暖的棉被下。這條手工製作的被子是由她祖母用五顏六色的布料碎片縫製而成的。","word":"quilt"}},"quit":{"createdAt":1782660244674,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"quit 表示停止工作或離開職位，在這裡指瑪麗亞辭掉了她的工作。","options":["continue","quit","enjoy","improve"],"sentence":"After working at the company for five years, Maria decided to ______ her job and pursue a career in music. She submitted her resignation letter on Friday and will no longer be employed there starting next month.","translation":"瑪麗亞在公司工作五年後，決定辭職去追求音樂事業。她在星期五提交了辭職信，從下個月開始將不再在那裡工作。","word":"quit"}},"quiver":{"createdAt":1783390227929,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"quiver 作為動詞表示輕微而快速的顫抖或震動，通常由於寒冷、恐懼或興奮所引起。","options":["quiver","fly","straighten","whistle"],"sentence":"The arrow began to ______ slightly as the archer held it steady before releasing. His hands trembled with nervousness, causing the entire shaft to shake uncontrollably.","translation":"當弓箭手鬆開前穩穩地握著箭時，箭開始輕微顫抖。他的雙手因緊張而發抖，導致整根箭桿不由自主地搖晃。","word":"quiver"}},"quota":{"createdAt":1781848330185,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"quota指規定必須達到的數量、定額或限額，通常用於銷售或生產目標。","options":["complaint","quota","tradition","vacation"],"sentence":"Each sales team must meet the monthly ______ or face consequences. The company expects every representative to sell at least fifty units by the end of the month.","translation":"每個銷售團隊必須完成月度配額，否則將面臨後果。公司期望每位代表在月底前至少銷售五十個單位。","word":"quota"}},"quotation":{"createdAt":1787238219843,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"quotation 指直接引用他人的原文字句，強調的是逐字逐句的引用，而不是改述或摘要。","options":["summary","paraphrase","quotation","reference"],"sentence":"The student included a ______ from Shakespeare at the beginning of her essay. She carefully cited the exact words from the famous playwright to support her literary analysis.","translation":"學生在她的論文開頭引用了莎士比亞的引言。她仔細引用了這位著名劇作家的原文來支持她的文學分析。","word":"quotation"}},"quote":{"createdAt":1784962580676,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"quote 作動詞表示直接引用或援引某人的原始言論，並通常使用引號來標示，用以支持論點或傳達確切的意思。","options":["ignore","summarize","quote","paraphrase"],"sentence":"The journalist decided to ______ the famous philosopher's words to support her argument about ethics in modern society. She used quotation marks around the exact passage and cited the original source in her footnotes.","translation":"記者決定引用這位著名哲學家的話來支持她關於現代社會倫理的論點。她在確切的段落周圍使用引號，並在腳註中引用了原始出處。","word":"quote"}},"race":{"createdAt":1781580511756,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"race 在這裡指的是競速比賽，參與者要看誰能最先完成","options":["match","game","race","tournament"],"sentence":"The sprinter won the ______ by crossing the finish line first. All the other competitors had been running at full speed as well.","translation":"短跑運動員率先衝過終點線贏得了比賽。所有其他競爭對手也一直在全速奔跑。","word":"race"}},"racecar":{"createdAt":1784773941957,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"racecar 是指專門為競速運動設計和製造的高性能車輛。","options":["bicycle","truck","racecar","bus"],"sentence":"The ______ accelerated to 200 miles per hour on the straightaway at the Grand Prix. Its aerodynamic design and high-powered engine made it the fastest vehicle on the track.","translation":"這輛賽車在大獎賽的直道上加速至時速200英里。其空氣動力學設計和高性能引擎使其成為賽道上速度最快的車輛。","word":"racecar"}},"racial":{"createdAt":1782542941491,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"racial 是形容詞，指與種族、民族背景或民族血統相關的事物，常用於描述與種族相關的社會議題。","options":["social","racial","political","economic"],"sentence":"The new legislation aims to eliminate ______ discrimination in hiring practices across the country. The law specifically addresses unfair treatment based on ethnic background and ancestry.","translation":"新法律旨在消除全國招聘實踐中基於種族的歧視。該法律特別針對基於民族背景和祖先的不公平對待。","word":"racial"}},"racism":{"createdAt":1781935654226,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"racism 是名詞，表示「種族主義」或「種族歧視」，指基於種族差異而進行的不公正對待或歧視。","options":["diversity","racism","cooperation","integration"],"sentence":"The government launched a national campaign to combat ______ in schools and workplaces. Educational programs were designed to promote equality and respect for all ethnic groups.","translation":"政府發起了一項全國運動來對抗學校和工作場所中的種族歧視。教育計畫旨在促進所有種族的平等和尊重。","word":"racism"}},"racist":{"createdAt":1781418481459,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"racist作為名詞，指持有種族歧視觀點並根據種族差異對他人進行判斷或歧視的人。","options":["pacifist","racist","activist","realist"],"sentence":"The ______ made offensive statements based on people's ethnicity and skin color. His discriminatory views were condemned by the entire community.","translation":"那位種族主義者根據人們的種族和膚色發表了冒犯性言論。他的歧視性觀點被整個社區譴責。","word":"racist"}},"rack":{"createdAt":1788166170239,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rack 在這裡是名詞，指的是一個有多個橫桿或層架的架子，用來放置或懸掛物品，特別強調其結構中有多個水平層或桿子。","options":["shelf","rack","cabinet","closet"],"sentence":"She hung her winter coats on the wooden ______ in the hallway. The structure had multiple horizontal bars where she could organize all her outerwear by season.","translation":"她把冬季外套掛在走廊裡的木製架子上。這個結構有多個水平橫桿，她可以按季節整理她所有的外衣。","word":"rack"}},"radiate":{"createdAt":1783598428081,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"radiate 指的是發出或散發光、熱或某種感受，使其向外傳播","options":["hide","radiate","suppress","contain"],"sentence":"The bride seemed to ______ happiness as she walked down the aisle on her wedding day. Her smile was so bright and contagious that everyone in the room felt her joy.","translation":"新娘在婚禮當天走過走道時散發著幸福的光彩。她的微笑是如此明亮而具有感染力，以至於房間裡的每個人都感受到了她的喜悅。","word":"radiate"}},"radical":{"createdAt":1782352245065,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"radical形容某事物是根本性的、極端的或激進的，通常涉及深層次的變化。","options":["minor","tiny","radical","slight"],"sentence":"The company made a ______ change to its business model to survive in the modern market. They completely restructured their operations from the ground up.","translation":"公司對其商業模式進行了根本性改革以在現代市場中生存。他們從根本上徹底重組了運營。","word":"radical"}},"radioactive":{"createdAt":1783946382148,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"radioactive 是指具有放射性、能發出輻射的物質，通常需要特殊防護措施來安全處理。","options":["combustible","radioactive","fragile","synthetic"],"sentence":"The scientist warned that the ______ material in the laboratory must be stored in a lead-lined container. Without proper shielding, the substance would emit dangerous radiation that could harm everyone nearby.","translation":"科學家警告實驗室中的______ 物質必須存放在鉛襯容器中。沒有適當的屏蔽，該物質會發出危險的輻射，可能傷害附近的每個人。","word":"radioactive"}},"rage":{"createdAt":1784908375548,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"rage 是名詞，表示「憤怒、狂怒」或「肆虐」，形容自然災害或其他力量的猛烈、破壞性表現。","options":["beauty","silence","rage","mystery"],"sentence":"The hurricane swept through the coastal town with destructive ______. Buildings were flattened, trees were uprooted, and entire neighborhoods were devastated by the storm's violent force.","translation":"颶風以強大的怒火席捲沿海城鎮。建築物被夷為平地，樹木被連根拔起，整個社區都被風暴的暴力力量摧毀。","word":"rage"}},"raid":{"createdAt":1785941615619,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"raid 表示一次突然的、通常帶有敵對性質的襲擊或搜查行動，強調出其不意和速度。","options":["raid","inspection","tour","visit"],"sentence":"The police launched a ______ on the warehouse to search for stolen goods. Officers arrived without warning at dawn to catch the criminals off guard.","translation":"警察對倉庫進行了突襲以搜查贓物。警察在黎明時分毫無預警地到達，以打其不備。","word":"raid"}},"rail":{"createdAt":1783925286798,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rail 作為名詞，指的是鐵路交通的軌道，是列車行駛的基礎設施。","options":["road","rail","bridge","cable"],"sentence":"The passenger train travels on a steel ______ that stretches across the country. Workers must inspect the track regularly to ensure safety for all commuters.","translation":"客運列車沿著跨越全國的鋼製______行駛。工人必須定期檢查軌道，以確保所有通勤者的安全。","word":"rail"}},"railway":{"createdAt":1784899764057,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"railway指的是火車運輸系統及其相關的軌道基礎設施。","options":["highway","railway","pathway","waterway"],"sentence":"The new ______ connects the city center to the airport. Trains travel along these steel tracks to transport thousands of passengers daily.","translation":"新的鐵路將市中心與機場連接起來。火車沿著這些鋼軌行駛，每天運送數千名乘客。","word":"railway"}},"raise":{"createdAt":1782920661035,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"raise在此表示飼養或飼育動物，特別是為了生產或經濟目的","options":["raise","breed","keep","maintain"],"sentence":"The farmer decided to ______ sheep on his property to generate additional income. He built new barns and fences to accommodate the growing herd.","translation":"農民決定在他的土地上飼養羊以增加額外收入。他建造了新的穀倉和圍欄來容納日益增長的羊群。","word":"raise"}},"rally":{"createdAt":1781362281649,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rally是指集會或群眾大會，人們聚集在一起表達共同的立場或支持。","options":["debate","rally","interview","broadcast"],"sentence":"The political ______ attracted thousands of supporters from across the country. Citizens gathered in the square to show their support for the candidate.","translation":"這場政治集會吸引了來自全國各地的數千名支持者。市民聚集在廣場上表示對候選人的支持。","word":"rally"}},"ranch":{"createdAt":1785337792091,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ranch是指大牧場或大農場，特別是用於畜牧業的廣闊土地和農業經營設施。","options":["apartment","ranch","factory","hospital"],"sentence":"My grandfather owns a large ______ in Texas where he raises cattle and horses. The property spans thousands of acres and has been in the family for three generations.","translation":"我的祖父在德州擁有一個大牧場，他在那裡飼養牛隻和馬匹。該地產跨越數千英畝，已在家族中傳承三代。","word":"ranch"}},"random":{"createdAt":1784546023702,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"random 是形容詞，表示沒有計劃、沒有順序或模式的選擇，完全根據機會而定，強調不可預測性和公平性。","options":["arbitrary","random","unpredictable","casual"],"sentence":"The teacher selected students for the presentation using a ______ method to ensure fairness. She simply drew names from a hat without any pattern or preference.","translation":"老師使用隨意的方法選擇學生進行演講，以確保公平性。她只是從帽子裡抽籤，沒有任何模式或偏好。","word":"random"}},"randomly":{"createdAt":1784004626892,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"randomly 表示無計畫或無特定原因地進行某事，強調選擇時沒有預定的模式或目的，完全靠機會決定。","options":["carefully","randomly","deliberately","strategically"],"sentence":"The researcher selected participants ______ from the entire population to avoid bias. This method ensured that each person had an equal chance of being chosen for the study.","translation":"研究人員從整個人口中隨便地選擇參與者以避免偏見。這種方法確保每個人都有平等的機會被選中參加這項研究。","word":"randomly"}},"range":{"createdAt":1783945487819,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"range 在這裡表示「種類的分布」或「可選擇的各種選項」，指咖啡館提供的多種風味選擇。","options":["selection","range","tendency","intensity"],"sentence":"The coffee shop offers a wide ______ of flavors, from light roasts to dark roasts. Customers can choose from at least twenty different options available every day.","translation":"這家咖啡館提供多種風味，從淺焙到深焙。顧客每天可以從至少二十種不同的選項中選擇。","word":"range"}},"rap":{"createdAt":1784439867436,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"饒舌樂是一種流行音樂類型，特點是在節奏強烈的背景音樂上快速吟誦韻腳的歌詞。","options":["poetry","rap","speech","conversation"],"sentence":"The musician performed a high-energy ______ song that featured fast-paced rhymes and a strong beat. The audience loved the rhythmic vocal style with its emphasis on spoken lyrics over instrumental music.","translation":"那位音樂家表演了一首充滿活力的饒舌樂歌曲，以快速的韻腳和強烈的節拍為特色。觀眾喜歡這種節奏感強的演唱風格，強調在樂器音樂上講話的歌詞。","word":"rap"}},"rapid":{"createdAt":1781332009075,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rapid 是形容詞，表示速度快的、迅速的","options":["slow","rapid","steady","stable"],"sentence":"The ______ growth of the company allowed it to expand into three new markets within a year. Investors were impressed by how quickly the business was developing.","translation":"公司的迅速增長使其在一年內擴展到三個新市場。投資者對業務發展的速度印象深刻。","word":"rapid"}},"rapidly":{"createdAt":1781332009075,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rapidly 是副詞，表示非常快速地或迅速地發生","options":["slowly","rapidly","steadily","gradually"],"sentence":"The technology company's stock price increased ______ after announcing their new product. Within a month, the value had nearly doubled due to strong investor interest.","translation":"這家科技公司在宣佈新產品後股價迅速上升。在一個月內，由於投資者的強烈興趣，股票價值幾乎翻倍。","word":"rapidly"}},"rare":{"createdAt":1781708461109,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rare在此作為形容詞，表示物品珍貴且極少見的特性。","options":["common","rare","broken","modern"],"sentence":"This ______ antique vase is worth thousands of dollars at the auction. Only three identical pieces are known to exist in the entire world.","translation":"這件珍貴的古董花瓶在拍賣會上價值數千美元。全世界只有三件相同的藝術品存在。","word":"rare"}},"rarely":{"createdAt":1785976166794,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rarely 表示「幾乎不」或「罕有地」，用來描述一個動作發生的頻率非常低；在這個句子中，「只回去過三次」的事實證實了訪問的頻率極低。","options":["frequently","rarely","sometimes","usually"],"sentence":"She ______ visits her hometown because she lives far away and her work keeps her very busy. Since moving to the city ten years ago, she has only been back three times.","translation":"她很少回訪她的家鄉，因為她住得很遠，工作也很繁忙。自從十年前搬到城市後，她只回去過三次。","word":"rarely"}},"rarity":{"createdAt":1784016923079,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"rarity 意為稀有、罕見，指某物很少見或很難找到的質量或特徵。","options":["rarity","commodity","tradition","requirement"],"sentence":"Finding a well-preserved dinosaur fossil is a great ______ in paleontology. Such discoveries happen only once in many decades.","translation":"在古生物學中找到保存完好的恐龍化石是一件罕見的事情。這樣的發現只在數十年才會發生一次。","word":"rarity"}},"rash":{"createdAt":1781840892411,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rash指皮膚上出現的疹子或皮疹，通常由過敏或感染引起。","options":["fever","rash","cough","bruise"],"sentence":"The child broke out in a red ______ after eating shellfish at dinner last night. The allergic reaction caused itching and swelling that persisted for several hours.","translation":"孩子在昨晚晚餐吃貝類後出現紅色皮疹。這種過敏反應導致瘙癢和腫脹，持續了數小時。","word":"rash"}},"rate":{"createdAt":1784985112934,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rate 在此用法表示「速度」或「比率」，特別是用來描述經濟或統計數據隨時間變化的幅度。","options":["pace","rate","speed","tempo"],"sentence":"The ______ of inflation has increased significantly this year. Economists are concerned because prices are rising faster than they did last month.","translation":"今年通貨膨脹的速度大幅上升。經濟學家感到擔憂，因為物價上漲的速度比上個月更快。","word":"rate"}},"ratify":{"createdAt":1781332009069,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ratify 意為正式批准或簽署，使條約或協議具有法律效力","options":["reject","ratify","ignore","debate"],"sentence":"The government must ______ the international treaty before it becomes legally binding. Parliament voted to officially approve the agreement with a strong majority.","translation":"政府必須正式批准這項國際條約，使其具有法律約束力。議會以絕對多數投票正式批准了該協議。","word":"ratify"}},"ratio":{"createdAt":1781414438947,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ratio用來表示兩個量之間的相對關係或比較，通常用分數或冒號表示","options":["percentage","ratio","average","quantity"],"sentence":"The ______ of boys to girls in the class is 3:2. This mathematical proportion helps us understand the distribution of students by gender.","translation":"班級中男生與女生的比例是3:2。這個數學比例幫助我們了解學生按性別的分布。","word":"ratio"}},"ration":{"createdAt":1783948760226,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ration是指政府或機構在供應緊張時所分配的固定數量，強調官方控制和限量分配的特性。","options":["donation","ration","portion","surplus"],"sentence":"During the war, each family received a weekly ______ of bread and butter. The government strictly controlled the amount of food distributed to ensure supplies lasted through the entire conflict.","translation":"在戰爭期間，每個家庭每週獲得一份麵包和黃油的配給量。政府嚴格控制分配的食物數量，以確保供應品能維持整個衝突期間的使用。","word":"ration"}},"rational":{"createdAt":1783516186777,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"rational 是指基於理性、邏輯推理和事實而非情感或直覺的。","options":["impulsive","emotional","rational","spontaneous"],"sentence":"Making a ______ decision requires analyzing all available facts and avoiding emotional reactions. The scientist used logic and evidence rather than intuition.","translation":"做出理性的決定需要分析所有可用的事實並避免情緒反應。那位科學家使用邏輯和證據而非直覺。","word":"rational"}},"raw":{"createdAt":1781664082519,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"raw 表示食物未經烹飪、處於自然狀態或未經加工的。","options":["cooked","raw","frozen","canned"],"sentence":"She prefers to eat ______ vegetables in her salad rather than cooked ones. The fresh carrots and uncooked broccoli retain all their natural crunch.","translation":"她更喜歡在沙拉中吃生蔬菜而不是熟的。新鮮的胡蘿蔔和未煮過的花椰菜保留了所有天然的脆爽。","word":"raw"}},"reach":{"createdAt":1781664082516,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reach 作名詞時表示可以到達的範圍或距離，特別是指伸手能夠到的距離。","options":["distance","reach","height","length"],"sentence":"The top shelf is beyond my ______, and I cannot grab the books without using a ladder. My arm is simply too short to touch that height.","translation":"頂部的架子超出了我的夠得著的範圍，沒有梯子我無法拿到書籍。我的手臂太短了，無法觸及那個高度。","word":"reach"}},"react":{"createdAt":1784176328505,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"react 是動詞，表示對某事做出立即的反應或回應，通常是基於情感或本能的行為。","options":["ignore","celebrate","react","sleep"],"sentence":"When the teacher announced the surprise test, students began to ______ with groans and complaints. Their immediate response showed genuine disappointment about the unexpected assignment.","translation":"當老師宣布突襲考試時，學生們開始做出反應，發出呻吟聲和抱怨。他們的立即反應表明他們對這個突然的測驗感到真正的失望。","word":"react"}},"reaction":{"createdAt":1783656305276,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"reaction指人對某事或某人的直接反應或回應，通常是自然而然產生的。","options":["response","attitude","reaction","emotion"],"sentence":"The student's ______ to the surprise exam was immediate frustration and worry. He had not studied and was clearly caught unprepared.","translation":"學生對突然考試的反應是立即感到沮喪和擔憂。他沒有復習，顯然措手不及。","word":"reaction"}},"realism":{"createdAt":1785135254500,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"realism（現實主義；注重實際）是一種藝術風格或作風，強調準確地描繪現實世界，避免幻想或理想化。","options":["abstraction","surrealism","realism","impressionism"],"sentence":"The artist's approach to painting reflected her commitment to ______, capturing every detail and texture exactly as it appeared in nature. She refused to use fantasy or exaggeration in her work, focusing instead on what could actually be seen.","translation":"這位藝術家的繪畫方法反映了她對現實主義的承諾，精確地捕捉自然界中的每一個細節和質感。她拒絕在作品中使用幻想或誇大，而是專注於實際能看到的東西。","word":"realism"}},"realistic":{"createdAt":1781362281724,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"realistic表示符合實際的、實際上可能的，指根據現實情況制定的計畫或目標。","options":["impossible","realistic","extreme","vague"],"sentence":"He set ______ goals for his fitness journey instead of expecting immediate results. He understood that progress would take time and consistent effort.","translation":"他為自己的健身之旅設定了現實的目標，而不是期望立竿見影的結果。他明白進步需要時間和持續的努力。","word":"realistic"}},"reality":{"createdAt":1784431968392,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"reality（真實性）指客觀存在的真實情況和現實世界，與幻想、虛構或想像相對。","options":["dreams","hope","reality","fiction"],"sentence":"Many people watch fantasy movies to escape from ______, but eventually they must return to their everyday lives. The real world requires us to deal with responsibilities, work, and practical challenges.","translation":"許多人觀看奇幻電影以逃避______，但最終他們必須回到日常生活。真實世界要求我們應對責任、工作和實際挑戰。","word":"reality"}},"realization":{"createdAt":1781831848729,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"realization 作為名詞表示「領悟」或「認識」，指突然明白或理解某件事的過程。","options":["discovery","understanding","realization","decision"],"sentence":"His ______ that he had wasted years pursuing the wrong career path came too late. He finally understood his true passion when he was already in his fifties.","translation":"他領悟到自己浪費多年追求錯誤職業道路的時刻已經太晚了。當他已經五十多歲時，他才最終明白自己的真正熱情所在。","word":"realization"}},"realize":{"createdAt":1781332009078,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"realize 意為實現或達成，表示將想法或計畫變成現實","options":["abandon","realize","forget","ignore"],"sentence":"The entrepreneur didn't ______ his business dream until years of hard work and persistence. He eventually built a successful company that generated millions in revenue.","translation":"企業家在多年的辛勤工作和堅持後才實現了他的商業夢想。他最終建立了一家成功的公司，產生了數百萬的收入。","word":"realize"}},"realm":{"createdAt":1781362281658,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"realm指的是特定領域或範圍，如藝術、科學或政治等。","options":["country","realm","location","region"],"sentence":"In the ______ of sports, Michael Jordan is considered the greatest basketball player. His achievements set records that remain unmatched in his field.","translation":"在體育領域，邁克爾·喬丹被認為是最偉大的籃球運動員。他的成就創造了在他的領域中仍然無與倫比的紀錄。","word":"realm"}},"reap":{"createdAt":1783309289510,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reap 意指收割或收穫農作物，也可引申為獲得成果或利益，通常指經過努力後得到的回報。","options":["sow","reap","irrigate","plow"],"sentence":"Farmers work hard throughout the year so they can ______ a bountiful harvest in autumn. After months of planting seeds and nurturing the crops, they finally collect all the grain and vegetables they have grown.","translation":"農民全年辛勤工作，以便在秋天能夠收穫豐收。在數個月的播種和照料莊稼之後，他們最終收集了所有他們種植的穀物和蔬菜。","word":"reap"}},"rear":{"createdAt":1782304661028,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rear作為形容詞表示位置在後面或背部，在這裡指汽車的後部位置。","options":["front","rear","side","interior"],"sentence":"The ______ of the car was damaged in the accident. We had to take it to the mechanic to fix the bumper and trunk.","translation":"汽車的後部在事故中損壞了。我們不得不把它送到機械師那裡修理保險桿和行李箱。","word":"rear"}},"reasonable":{"createdAt":1781849622417,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"合理的是指符合常理、適當或公平的，通常用來描述價格、決定或主張是否明智且可接受。","options":["excessive","reasonable","suspicious","outrageous"],"sentence":"The price of thirty dollars for that shirt seems ______ to me. I checked several stores and found similar items in the same price range.","translation":"這件襯衫三十美元的價格對我來說似乎是合理的。我檢查了幾家商店，發現類似的商品價格範圍相同。","word":"reasonable"}},"reassure":{"createdAt":1781927792736,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reassure指的是通過安慰、保證或提供信息來消除某人的擔憂和恐懼。","options":["threaten","reassure","confuse","ignore"],"sentence":"The doctor tried to ______ the anxious patient about the upcoming surgery. She explained the procedure in detail and shared success statistics to calm his fears.","translation":"醫生試圖讓焦慮的患者對即將進行的手術放心。她詳細解釋了手術程序並分享成功統計數據來緩解他的恐懼。","word":"reassure"}},"rebel":{"createdAt":1783557858059,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rebel作為名詞表示反抗權威或政府的人，通常是領導或參與反抗運動的人。","options":["teacher","rebel","friend","merchant"],"sentence":"The ______ led an uprising against the oppressive government. His followers were willing to risk everything to overthrow the authoritarian regime.","translation":"反抗者領導了一場反對專制政府的起義。他的追隨者願意冒一切風險推翻獨裁統治。","word":"rebel"}},"rebellion":{"createdAt":1781798927523,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rebellion 指對權威的武裝反抗或起義，通常涉及暴力和有組織的抗爭活動。","options":["celebration","rebellion","petition","election"],"sentence":"The peasants launched a ______ against the tyrannical government in the 18th century. They organized armed uprisings, burned government buildings, and demanded political reform.","translation":"十八世紀農民對暴虐的政府發動了叛亂。他們組織了武裝起義，焚燒政府建築，並要求政治改革。","word":"rebellion"}},"rebuttal":{"createdAt":1789363793851,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rebuttal 是指對某人的論點或指控進行直接的駁斥或反駁，通常在法律或辯論的語境中使用。","options":["agreement","rebuttal","summary","postponement"],"sentence":"The lawyer presented a strong ______ against the prosecution's claims. Her arguments directly addressed and refuted each point made by the opposing counsel.","translation":"律師提出了強有力的駁斥來反駁控方的指控。她的論據直接針對並駁倒了對方律師提出的每一點。","word":"rebuttal"}},"recall":{"createdAt":1783760354085,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"recall 意為「回想起、回憶」，指從記憶中喚起或想起過去的事物。","options":["imagine","recall","recognize","understand"],"sentence":"The elderly man tried to ______ the names of his childhood friends, but most of the details had faded from his memory over the decades. He could only remember a few faces and one or two names.","translation":"這位年長的男子試圖回想起童年朋友的名字，但經過數十年，大部分細節已從他的記憶中淡去。他只能記得幾張臉和一兩個名字。","word":"recall"}},"recast":{"createdAt":1784173464322,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"recast 表示重新安排演員或重新製作，特別是在戲劇或電影中更換演員或改寫內容。","options":["dismiss","recast","review","preview"],"sentence":"The director decided to ______ the entire film with a new cast of actors. After the original stars withdrew from the project, she had no choice but to hire replacements for every major role.","translation":"導演決定用新的演員陣容重塑整部電影。在原始明星從該項目中撤出後，她別無選擇，只能為每個主要角色聘請替代者。","word":"recast"}},"receipt":{"createdAt":1783402416981,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"receipt是指購物或交易後收到的紙質或電子證明文件，用來證明已完成付款和購買。","options":["invoice","receipt","delivery","warranty"],"sentence":"I kept the ______ from my purchase at the store so I could return the item if needed. The cashier printed it out and handed it to me as proof of my transaction.","translation":"我保留了在商店購買商品的收據，以便在需要時可以退貨。收銀員打印出來並將其交給我作為交易證明。","word":"receipt"}},"receive":{"createdAt":1783499119085,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"receive 表示接收或得到某物，在這句話中指的是收到快遞員送來的包裹","options":["send","receive","open","expect"],"sentence":"I ______ a package from my friend yesterday. The delivery driver handed it to me at my front door.","translation":"我昨天收到了朋友寄來的一個包裹。快遞員在我的前門把它交給了我。","word":"receive"}},"receiver":{"createdAt":1784901026851,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"receiver在這裡指的是電話的受話器，是聽電話時拿在耳邊的部分。","options":["sender","receiver","transmitter","speaker"],"sentence":"When the telephone rang, she picked up the ______ and answered the call. The device in her hand allowed her to hear the person speaking on the other end of the line.","translation":"當電話鈴聲響起時，她拿起受話器接聽電話。她手中的這個裝置讓她能夠聽到通話另一端的人說話。","word":"receiver"}},"reception":{"createdAt":1784293587905,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reception在這裡指的是正式的接待會或招待會，用來歡迎和款待來訪的客人。","options":["departure","reception","inspection","transaction"],"sentence":"The hotel arranged a formal ______ to welcome all the conference guests. The event included refreshments, speeches, and networking opportunities at the entrance hall.","translation":"飯店安排了一場正式的接待會來歡迎所有會議來賓。該活動包括在入口大廳的茶點、演講和交流機會。","word":"reception"}},"receptionist":{"createdAt":1781693538701,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"receptionist 是在辦公室、飯店或診所前台工作的接待人員，負責招待訪客和進行初步接待。","options":["manager","receptionist","janitor","accountant"],"sentence":"The ______ greeted every visitor with a warm smile and helped them sign in. She had worked at the front desk for five years and knew all the regular clients by name.","translation":"接待員用溫暖的微笑迎接每位訪客，並幫助他們簽到。她在前台工作了五年，認識所有的常客。","word":"receptionist"}},"recess":{"createdAt":1781840659328,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"recess 在政治或學校環境中指休會或休假期間，暫停正常活動。","options":["session","recess","meeting","debate"],"sentence":"Parliament announced a two-week ______ starting next Monday for all members to return to their constituencies. During this break, legislators would campaign and address local concerns.","translation":"議會宣佈從下週一開始兩週的休會期，供所有成員返回各自的選區。在此休息期間，立法者可以進行競選並解決地方問題。","word":"recess"}},"recession":{"createdAt":1781311922068,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"recession 是指經濟的衰退期，特徵是商業活動減少、失業增加和收入下降。","options":["recession","growth","boom","expansion"],"sentence":"During the ______, many businesses closed and unemployment rates increased dramatically. The economic downturn lasted for two years before the country began to recover.","translation":"在經濟衰退期間，許多企業關閉，失業率大幅上升。這次經濟衰退持續了兩年才開始恢復。","word":"recession"}},"recharge":{"createdAt":1781933311792,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"recharge（充電；放鬆休息）在此指恢復精力，而accelerate（加速）、restructure（重組）和substitute（替代）都無法在此情境下表達休息和恢復的意思。","options":["accelerate","recharge","restructure","substitute"],"sentence":"After working for twelve hours straight, the exhausted employee decided to ______ by taking a week-long vacation. This break helped him regain his physical and mental strength.","translation":"連續工作十二小時後，疲憊的員工決定通過一週長的假期來放鬆休息。這個休息幫助他恢復了身體和心理的力量。","word":"recharge"}},"recipe":{"createdAt":1783690592076,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"recipe 特別指烹飪食物的配方和步驟，包括所需的材料和具體的烹飪方法。","options":["formula","recipe","method","instruction"],"sentence":"My grandmother followed her secret ______ for the chocolate cake that won first prize at the fair. The handwritten instructions had been passed down through three generations of our family.","translation":"我的祖母按照她秘密食譜製作的巧克力蛋糕在展覽會上獲得了一等獎。這份手寫的說明已經傳承了我們家族三代。","word":"recipe"}},"recipient":{"createdAt":1789648270598,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"recipient 是指接收或獲得某物（如禮物、獎項、幫助等）的人，在這個句子中特別指被授予獎學金的人。","options":["donor","recipient","judge","sponsor"],"sentence":"The ______ of the scholarship was thrilled to receive the award letter. She had worked hard all year, and now her dedication was being recognized by the selection committee.","translation":"獎學金的接受者收到獎狀信時非常高興。她整年都在努力工作，現在她的奉獻精神獲得了評審委員會的認可。","word":"recipient"}},"recite":{"createdAt":1781582424689,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"recite意為背誦或朗誦，特別是指從記憶中說出或背出文字，這裡與from memory和without notes的語境相符。","options":["write","recite","translate","analyze"],"sentence":"The student had to ______ the entire poem from memory during the exam. She listed every line perfectly without looking at her notes.","translation":"那名學生必須在考試中憑記憶背誦整首詩。她完美地列舉了每一行，沒有查看筆記。","word":"recite"}},"reckless":{"createdAt":1784426633467,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reckless 表示不顧後果、輕率且危險的行為，完全忽視風險和安全。","options":["careful","reckless","cautious","responsible"],"sentence":"The driver's ______ behavior on the highway endangered everyone in the car. He ignored all speed limits and traffic signs without any concern for safety.","translation":"駕駛員在高速公路上的輕率行為危及車內的每個人。他無視所有速度限制和交通標誌，毫不關心安全問題。","word":"reckless"}},"reckon":{"createdAt":1781836375376,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reckon表示認為或想，是一種相對非正式的表達方式，表達個人的看法或估計。","options":["calculate","reckon","determine","estimate"],"sentence":"Based on the weather forecast, I ______ that tomorrow will be sunny. The meteorologists predicted clear skies throughout the day.","translation":"根據天氣預報，我認為明天會是晴天。氣象學家預測全天天空晴朗。","word":"reckon"}},"reclaim":{"createdAt":1782491138492,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reclaim 表示收回所有權或開墾並恢復土地，將其從被破壞或廢棄的狀態恢復到可用的狀態。","options":["urinate","reclaim","subtract","rivalry"],"sentence":"The environmental organization worked to ______ the polluted wetlands and restore them to their natural state. By removing toxic chemicals and replanting native vegetation, they successfully transformed the abandoned swamp into a thriving ecosystem.","translation":"環保組織努力開墾受污染的濕地並將其恢復到自然狀態。通過清除有毒化學物質和重新種植本地植被，他們成功地將被遺棄的沼澤轉變為一個繁榮的生態系統。","word":"reclaim"}},"recognition":{"createdAt":1786346829174,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"recognition 指的是對某人的成就或能力的正式承認或辨識，通常帶有肯定和讚賞的意涵。","options":["criticism","recognition","confusion","distraction"],"sentence":"The athlete finally received ______ for her outstanding achievements after years of hard work. The award ceremony celebrated her accomplishments and acknowledged her as a champion in her sport.","translation":"這位運動員經過多年的努力工作後，終於獲得了對她傑出成就的承認。頒獎典禮表彰了她的成就，並認可她是該運動項目的冠軍。","word":"recognition"}},"recognize":{"createdAt":1781532967163,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"recognize 表示認出、辨認，與「改變很多後無法辨認但聽到名字後明白」的情境相符。","options":["forget","remember","recognize","ignore"],"sentence":"I could not ______ my old friend at the party because she had changed so much. After she told me her name, I finally understood who she was.","translation":"在派對上我無法______(認出)我的老朋友，因為她改變了很多。在她告訴我她的名字後，我終於明白她是誰了。","word":"recognize"}},"recommend":{"createdAt":1781332009082,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"recommend 意為推薦或建議，表示認為某事物很好而建議他人使用或欣賞","options":["criticize","recommend","discourage","warn"],"sentence":"The film critic highly ______ the new movie to all audiences who enjoy dramatic storytelling. She gave it five stars and called it a must-see film.","translation":"電影評論家高度推薦這部新電影給所有喜歡戲劇性故事講述的觀眾。她給了它五顆星，並稱其為必看電影。","word":"recommend"}},"recommendation":{"createdAt":1784173464332,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"recommendation 指基於個人經驗向他人提出的建議或推薦意見。","options":["criticism","recommendation","complaint","warning"],"sentence":"Based on my positive experience at the restaurant, I gave it a strong ______ to all my friends. I told them it was the best dining experience I had ever had.","translation":"根據我在這家餐廳的積極體驗，我向所有朋友強烈推薦它。我告訴他們這是我曾經有過的最好的用餐體驗。","word":"recommendation"}},"reconcile":{"createdAt":1783005778368,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reconcile 意為「調和」或「調解」，指解決分歧並恢復和諧關係。","options":["repeat","reconcile","ignore","worsen"],"sentence":"The mediator helped the divorced couple ______ their past grievances and establish a peaceful co-parenting arrangement. Both parents now communicate respectfully about their children's welfare.","translation":"調解人幫助這對離異夫婦調和過去的分歧並建立和平的共同養育安排。雙親現在尊重地就孩子的福祉進行溝通。","word":"reconcile"}},"reconciliation":{"createdAt":1783005778366,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"reconciliation 意為「和解」或「調和」，指解決衝突和恢復友好關係的過程。","options":["competition","distance","reconciliation","separation"],"sentence":"After years of bitter conflict, the two nations reached a ______ through diplomatic negotiations. Both sides agreed to settle their differences and rebuild their relationship.","translation":"經過多年的激烈衝突，兩個國家通過外交談判達成了和解。雙方同意解決分歧並重建彼此的關係。","word":"reconciliation"}},"recorder":{"createdAt":1784287004777,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"recorder在這裡指的是豎笛或直笛，是一種傳統的木管樂器，可以吹奏出音樂。","options":["camera","recorder","microphone","speaker"],"sentence":"The musician played a beautiful melody on her wooden ______. She had learned to play this traditional wind instrument in music class when she was only seven years old.","translation":"音樂家在她的木製______上演奏了優美的旋律。她在七歲時在音樂課上學會了演奏這種傳統木管樂器。","word":"recorder"}},"recover":{"createdAt":1781939439466,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"recover作動詞表示恢復、復原或重新獲得，通常指從疾病、受傷或困難中恢復過來。","options":["worsen","ignore","develop","recover"],"sentence":"After three weeks of rest and treatment, the athlete was finally able to ______ from the serious knee injury. His doctors confirmed he could return to training and resume his competitive schedule.","translation":"經過三週的休息和治療，運動員終於能夠從嚴重的膝蓋受傷中恢復。他的醫生確認他可以恢復訓練並恢復他的競賽日程。","word":"recover"}},"recovery":{"createdAt":1783434356331,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"recovery 是名詞，表示從疾病、傷害或困難中恢復到正常或健康的狀態。","options":["relapse","decline","recovery","regression"],"sentence":"After six weeks of physical therapy, the athlete's ______ from the injury was nearly complete. He was finally able to return to training at full intensity.","translation":"經過六週的物理治療後，這位運動員從受傷中的復原幾乎完全了。他終於能夠以全力強度回到訓練。","word":"recovery"}},"recreation":{"createdAt":1781564440919,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"recreation 表示娛樂、消遣，指為了享樂和放鬆而進行的活動。","options":["exercise","recreation","employment","duty"],"sentence":"Playing video games is my favorite form of ______. I enjoy this activity after work to relax and unwind.","translation":"玩電子遊戲是我最喜歡的娛樂方式。我喜歡在工作後進行這項活動來放鬆。","word":"recreation"}},"recreational":{"createdAt":1781481311491,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"recreational是指為了消遣、娛樂和休閒目的的活動。","options":["mandatory","recreational","professional","dangerous"],"sentence":"The park offers many ______ activities for families on weekends. Children can enjoy playgrounds, sports fields, and swimming pools designed purely for leisure and entertainment.","translation":"這個公園在週末為家庭提供許多消遣活動。兒童可以享受遊樂場、運動場和游泳池，這些都是為了消遣和娛樂而設計的。","word":"recreational"}},"recruit":{"createdAt":1782040742472,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"recruit 動詞意為「招募、徵募」，指招聘或吸收新成員加入組織或軍隊。","options":["dismiss","retire","recruit","promote"],"sentence":"The army decided to ______ young soldiers to strengthen its forces before the war began. They visited schools and universities to find the most promising candidates.","translation":"軍隊決定招募年輕士兵以在戰爭開始前加強其力量。他們訪問學校和大學以尋找最有前景的候選人。","word":"recruit"}},"redeem":{"createdAt":1787049198631,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"redeem指恢復名譽或信譽，或通過行為彌補過去的錯誤，也可指購回或兌換。","options":["ignore","abandon","redeem","punish"],"sentence":"After years of poor decisions, he worked hard to ______ himself through honest actions and genuine apologies. His family saw that he was truly committed to change.","translation":"在多年糟糕的決定之後，他通過誠實的行動和真誠的道歉來救贖自己。他的家人看到他真的致力於改變。","word":"redeem"}},"redefine":{"createdAt":1781767999780,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"redefine 意指從根本上改變某事物的定義或內涵，賦予它新的、更適切的意義。","options":["revise","redefine","remove","reconsider"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ its mission statement to reflect modern values and social responsibility. The new version emphasized sustainability and community engagement rather than profit alone.","translation":"公司決定重新定義其使命宣言，以反映現代價值觀和社會責任。新版本強調永續發展和社區參與，而不僅僅是利潤。","word":"redefine"}},"redistribute":{"createdAt":1786096032879,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"redistribute 意為「重新分配」，指將資源、金錢或利益從一個地方或群體轉移到另一個地方或群體，通常是為了實現更公平的分配。","options":["collect","redistribute","eliminate","preserve"],"sentence":"The government decided to ______ the tax revenue from wealthy regions to underdeveloped areas. This policy aimed to ensure that resources were fairly allocated across all communities.","translation":"政府決定將稅收收入從富裕地區重新分配到欠發達地區。這項政策旨在確保資源在所有社區中公平分配。","word":"redistribute"}},"reduce":{"createdAt":1783660471003,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reduce 意為「減少」或「縮減」數量或程度。句子提及投資和措施是為了達成減少排放的目標，而不是增加、監測或分配。","options":["increase","reduce","monitor","distribute"],"sentence":"The government plans to ______ carbon emissions by 50% over the next decade. They will invest in renewable energy and promote public transportation to achieve this target.","translation":"政府計劃在未來十年內將碳排放量減少百分之五十。他們將投資可再生能源並推廣公共交通以達成此目標。","word":"reduce"}},"reduction":{"createdAt":1781948564910,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"減少是指數量或規模的下降，從第二句提到的費用從1000萬美元降至600萬美元這個具體例子可以看出，這裡明確指的是數值的下降。","options":["increase","expansion","reduction","fluctuation"],"sentence":"The company announced a significant ______ in production costs through new technology. Expenses fell from $10 million to $6 million over the fiscal year.","translation":"公司宣佈透過新技術實現成本______。開支在財政年度內從1000萬美元降至600萬美元。","word":"reduction"}},"redundancy":{"createdAt":1784105049121,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"redundancy 在此指的是失業或被解僱的情況，特別是指因公司縮減而導致職位被消除或員工被裁減，這是英國英語中常用的表達方式。","options":["promotion","redundancy","efficiency","expansion"],"sentence":"The company announced a ______ program that would affect 500 employees across all departments. Workers received severance packages and retraining support as part of the layoff process.","translation":"該公司宣佈了一項將影響所有部門500名員工的裁員計畫。員工獲得了遣散費和再培訓支援作為裁員程序的一部分。","word":"redundancy"}},"reef":{"createdAt":1788908822836,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reef是指由珊瑚、岩石或沙子形成的淺水海底隆起地形，通常位於海面附近，是豐富的海洋生態系統的棲息地。","options":["valley","reef","plateau","canyon"],"sentence":"The coral ______ is home to thousands of colorful fish and other marine species. Divers were careful not to touch the delicate structure while exploring beneath the surface.","translation":"珊瑚礁是成千上萬種彩色魚類和其他海洋生物的家園。潛水員在探索海面下時小心不要觸摸這個脆弱的結構。","word":"reef"}},"refer":{"createdAt":1785721100023,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"refer 在此處意為「歸因於」，表示將某事物的原因追溯到某個特定因素，與句子中討論結果原因的語境相符。","options":["attribute","refer","mention","compare"],"sentence":"The scientist will ______ the unusual results to experimental error rather than a flaw in the hypothesis. The data clearly shows that the anomaly occurred due to contamination in the laboratory equipment.","translation":"科學家會將不尋常的結果歸因於實驗誤差，而不是假設的缺陷。數據明確表明異常是由於實驗室設備的污染造成的。","word":"refer"}},"referee":{"createdAt":1784438808444,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"referee 是指足球、籃球、摔角等運動比賽中負責判罰和執行比賽規則的官員。","options":["referee","spectator","coach","announcer"],"sentence":"The ______ blew the whistle and made a controversial call during the championship game. Both teams argued that he had made an unfair decision about whether the ball was in or out of bounds.","translation":"裁判吹響了哨子，在冠軍賽中做出了一個有爭議的判罰。兩支隊伍都爭辯說他對球是否在界內做出了不公正的判決。","word":"referee"}},"reference":{"createdAt":1784473552378,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reference作為名詞表示「參考」或「提及」，指在文本中引述或指向另一個來源的行為。","options":["tribute","reference","summary","interpretation"],"sentence":"The student included a ______ to Shakespeare's Hamlet in her essay about themes of revenge. She cited the exact page number from the book at the end of her paper.","translation":"學生在關於復仇主題的論文中包含了對莎士比亞《哈姆雷特》的參考。她在論文末尾引用了該書的確切頁碼。","word":"reference"}},"referendum":{"createdAt":1785240153910,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"referendum指的是全民公投，是一種直接民主形式，讓人民對特定議題進行投票表決。","options":["election","referendum","survey","debate"],"sentence":"The government decided to hold a ______ to let citizens vote on whether to join the trade agreement. The results would be binding, and every eligible voter could participate in this direct democratic process.","translation":"政府決定舉行全民公投，讓公民投票決定是否加入貿易協議。結果將具有約束力，每位合格選民都可以參與這個直接民主過程。","word":"referendum"}},"refill":{"createdAt":1782529318038,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"refill 意為重新填充或補充，用於表達將容器再次盛滿或補充物品。","options":["empty","refill","clean","replace"],"sentence":"I need to ______ my water bottle before the hiking trip begins. The spring nearby provides fresh water for travelers to replenish their supplies.","translation":"登山之旅開始前我需要重新填充我的水瓶。附近的泉水為旅客提供新鮮的水來補充他們的供應。","word":"refill"}},"refine":{"createdAt":1784786005753,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"refine 表示改善或使更完善，通過去除缺陷和增強質量來使某事物變得更好。","options":["complicate","refine","abandon","accelerate"],"sentence":"The engineer worked to ______ the manufacturing process by removing inefficiencies and improving quality. After months of testing and adjustment, the new method reduced waste by 40% and increased output significantly.","translation":"工程師致力於精進製造過程，消除低效率並提高品質。經過幾個月的測試和調整後，新方法將廢棄物減少了40%，並大幅提高了產量。","word":"refine"}},"refined":{"createdAt":1781933311794,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"refined（精煉的；優雅的）描述有禮貌、優雅的人，而crude（粗糙的）、boisterous（吵鬧的）和clumsy（笨拙的）都與精緻舉止和磨練言辭的描述相反。","options":["crude","boisterous","refined","clumsy"],"sentence":"The ______ gentleman always used proper etiquette and spoke with eloquent vocabulary at formal events. His sophisticated manners and polished speech impressed everyone in attendance.","translation":"那位優雅紳士在正式場合總是遵循適當的禮儀，並用雄辯的詞彙說話。他的精緻舉止和磨練過的言辭給在場的每個人留下了深刻印象。","word":"refined"}},"reflect":{"createdAt":1785732801435,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reflect在此表示「反射」，描述光線或影像從表面返回的物理現象。","options":["distort","reflect","magnify","absorb"],"sentence":"The mirror will ______ your image so you can see yourself clearly. When light bounces off the shiny surface, it bends back toward the source.","translation":"鏡子將反射你的影像，這樣你就能清楚地看到自己。當光線從閃亮的表面反彈時，它會向回源頭彎曲。","word":"reflect"}},"reflection":{"createdAt":1783261324152,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reflection 作為名詞表示某事物的真實體現或映照，反映了事物的本質特徵或實際狀況。","options":["requirement","reflection","prediction","amendment"],"sentence":"The report's findings were a clear ______ of the company's poor management practices. The data showed low employee satisfaction, high turnover rates, and declining profits.","translation":"這份報告的發現是該公司管理不善實踐的清晰______。數據顯示員工滿意度低、離職率高和利潤下降。","word":"reflection"}},"reflective":{"createdAt":1783255660824,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reflective 作為形容詞可表示「反光的、反射的」，指表面能夠反射光線的特性。","options":["smooth","reflective","painted","dark"],"sentence":"The artist painted the door with a ______ surface that shines brightly in the sunlight. The metallic finish bounces light back in all directions.","translation":"藝術家用反光表面為門上漆，在陽光下閃閃發亮。金屬質感向四面八方反射光線。","word":"reflective"}},"reform":{"createdAt":1786497666546,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reform 作為名詞表示「改革」或「改良」，指的是對系統或機構的重大改變或改進。","options":["tradition","reform","complaint","tourism"],"sentence":"The government announced a major ______ to improve the education system. The changes would affect curriculum, teacher training, and school funding across the country.","translation":"政府宣佈了一項重大改革以改善教育系統。這些變化將影響全國的課程、教師培訓和學校經費。","word":"reform"}},"refresh":{"createdAt":1782786424043,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"refresh動詞表示使某人或某物恢復活力、精力或精神。","options":["tire","refresh","depress","burden"],"sentence":"After a long day of work, a cool shower and cold drink will ______ both your body and mind. You will feel renewed and ready to tackle the evening ahead.","translation":"經過漫長的工作日之後，涼爽的淋浴和冷飲將使你的身體和心靈煥然一新。你將感到精神煥發，準備好迎接即將到來的夜晚。","word":"refresh"}},"refreshment":{"createdAt":1782002325566,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"refreshment 在這裡指的是會議或活動中提供的食物和飲料，用來讓人感到精神恢復和滿足。","options":["decoration","refreshment","transportation","equipment"],"sentence":"After the long meeting, the conference organizers provided ______ for all the attendees. The cookies and juice were especially appreciated by those who had skipped lunch.","translation":"長會議後，會議組織者為所有與會者提供了點心。特別是那些沒吃午餐的人都很喜歡餅乾和果汁。","word":"refreshment"}},"refuge":{"createdAt":1782084127075,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"refuge 作為名詞表示安全的庇護所或避難場所，提供保護和庇護免受危險或不適。","options":["entertainment","exercise","refuge","adventure"],"sentence":"During the storm, the family sought ______ in the basement of their house where they felt safe. The sturdy walls and concrete structure provided protection from the violent weather.","translation":"在暴風雨期間，這家人在他們房子的地下室尋求庇護所，在那裡他們感到安全。堅固的牆壁和混凝土結構提供了對惡劣天氣的保護。","word":"refuge"}},"refugee":{"createdAt":1781926464744,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"refugee 指因為戰爭、迫害或自然災害而逃離家園的人，必須是被迫離開的狀況。","options":["tourist","refugee","diplomat","merchant"],"sentence":"The organization provides shelter and food to ______ fleeing war zones. Many of these individuals have lost everything and are seeking safety across international borders.","translation":"該組織為逃離戰爭地帶的難民提供住所和食物。許多這些人已經失去了一切，正在尋求跨越國際邊界的安全。","word":"refugee"}},"refund":{"createdAt":1781437013473,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"refund 意為退款或退費，指商家將顧客已支付的金額返還給顧客。","options":["replacement","refund","discount","warranty"],"sentence":"The customer demanded a ______ after discovering the defective product had broken within a week. The company processed the request immediately and returned the full purchase price to her account.","translation":"顧客在發現有缺陷的產品在一週內損壞後要求退款。公司立即處理了該請求並將全部購買價格退回到她的帳戶。","word":"refund"}},"refundable":{"createdAt":1782529318026,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"refundable 意為可退款的，用於說明購買的商品或服務可以退錢給消費者。","options":["expensive","refundable","non-transferable","limited"],"sentence":"The airline ticket is ______, which means customers can get their money back if they cancel their flight. This policy provides peace of mind for travelers who might need to change their plans.","translation":"機票是可退款的，這意味著顧客如果取消航班可以取回他們的錢。這項政策為可能需要改變計劃的旅客提供了安心。","word":"refundable"}},"refusal":{"createdAt":1781332009076,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"refusal 是名詞，表示對要求或提議的拒絕或回絕","options":["agreement","refusal","acceptance","willingness"],"sentence":"The athlete's ______ to use performance-enhancing drugs earned him great respect from the sporting community. He consistently declined offers to cheat despite pressure from competitors.","translation":"運動員拒絕使用性能增強藥物的行為贏得了體育界的高度尊重。儘管競爭對手的施壓，他一直拒絕作弊的提議。","word":"refusal"}},"refuse":{"createdAt":1784204756956,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"refuse表示「拒絕」，指明確地表達不接受某個提議或要求。","options":["accept","consider","refuse","ignore"],"sentence":"She decided to ______ the job offer because the salary was too low and the commute was too long. Despite the company's persuasion, she firmly declined their proposal.","translation":"她決定拒絕這份工作機會，因為薪水太低，通勤時間也太長。儘管公司試圖說服她，但她堅定地拒絕了他們的提議。","word":"refuse"}},"refute":{"createdAt":1781332009066,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"refute 意為駁斥或反駁某人的說法，通常帶有提供相反證據的含義","options":["support","refute","ignore","accept"],"sentence":"The scientist was able to ______ the false claims with solid evidence. The data clearly demonstrated that the original hypothesis was incorrect.","translation":"科學家能夠用確鑿的證據駁斥那些虛假的主張。數據清楚地表明原來的假設是錯誤的。","word":"refute"}},"regain":{"createdAt":1784343574890,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"regain是指恢復或重新獲得之前失去的東西，在這裡指患者重新獲得了手臂的活動能力。","options":["lose","regain","avoid","damage"],"sentence":"After months of physical therapy, the patient was able to ______ full mobility in his injured arm. The doctor confirmed that his strength and range of motion had completely returned to normal.","translation":"經過數個月的物理治療後，患者能夠重新恢復受傷手臂的完全活動能力。醫生確認他的力量和活動範圍已經完全恢復到正常狀態。","word":"regain"}},"regard":{"createdAt":1781848934142,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"regard作動詞表示敬重、尊敬，或者表示看待、認為的意思","options":["ignore","regard","forget","question"],"sentence":"I ______ my former teacher with great respect and admiration. She was the one who inspired me to pursue a career in education.","translation":"我非常尊敬和欽佩我的前任老師。她是激勵我從事教育事業的人。","word":"regard"}},"regarding":{"createdAt":1783905256100,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"regarding 是一個介詞，表示「關於」或「就...而言」，用來引出某個特定的話題或討論對象。","options":["about","regarding","toward","against"],"sentence":"The manager wanted to discuss the budget cuts ______ the marketing department. She had several concerns about how the reduction would affect their upcoming campaign.","translation":"經理想討論關於行銷部門的預算削減。她對削減如何影響他們即將進行的活動有幾個擔憂。","word":"regarding"}},"regardless":{"createdAt":1781515329267,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"regardless 副詞，意思是不管、不顧，表示不受某事物影響或限制。","options":["because","regardless","instead","unless"],"sentence":"The athlete decided to compete in the tournament ______ of her recent injury. She was determined to participate and give her best effort despite the pain.","translation":"儘管最近受傷，運動員仍決定參加比賽。她決心參加並不顧疼痛而盡力表現。","word":"regardless"}},"regime":{"createdAt":1783949553269,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"regime 是指一個政府或政權體系，特別是指統治方式或治理組織的體制，在這個句子中指的是一個獨裁統治者或獨裁政府。","options":["regime","holiday","friendship","climate"],"sentence":"The authoritarian ______ imposed strict controls over citizens' daily lives and restricted freedom of speech. The government's policies affected everything from education to employment, making it clear how comprehensive their authority was.","translation":"專制政權對公民的日常生活施加嚴格控制，並限制言論自由。政府的政策影響從教育到就業的一切，清楚地表明他們的權力有多全面。","word":"regime"}},"region":{"createdAt":1781515329268,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"region 名詞，意思是地區、區域，指一個特定的地理範圍。","options":["city","region","building","street"],"sentence":"The ______ experiences heavy rainfall during the monsoon season every year. Residents in this area need to prepare for flooding and landslides during those months.","translation":"該地區每年在季風季節都會經歷大量降雨。該地區的居民需要在那段時間準備應對洪水和山崩。","word":"region"}},"regional":{"createdAt":1784110946854,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"regional 意為地區的、區域的，用來形容限於特定地理區域或行政區域的事物。","options":["global","regional","national","international"],"sentence":"The ______ manager oversees all operations in the Southeast, including stores in Florida, Georgia, and South Carolina. Her decisions only affect that specific geographic area, not the entire company.","translation":"該地區經理監督東南部的所有運營，包括佛羅里達州、喬治亞州和南卡羅來納州的門市。她的決定只影響該特定地理區域，不影響整個公司。","word":"regional"}},"register":{"createdAt":1785815645914,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"register在這裡指的是正式的紀錄簿或登記簿，用來記錄和追蹤重要資訊如出勤。","options":["notebook","register","schedule","textbook"],"sentence":"The teacher asked all students to sign the ______ on the first day of class. This official document would be used to track attendance throughout the entire semester.","translation":"老師在開學第一天要求所有學生在簽到簿上簽名。這份正式文件將用於追蹤整個學期的出勤記錄。","word":"register"}},"registration":{"createdAt":1781831347632,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"registration 名詞表示正式的登記或註冊程序，特別是在教育或行政機構中。","options":["graduation","registration","vacation","recreation"],"sentence":"Students must complete ______ before attending their first classes at the university. The process involves submitting documents, paying fees, and confirming enrollment in specific courses.","translation":"學生必須在參加大學第一堂課之前完成登記。該過程涉及提交文件、支付費用和確認特定課程的入學資格。","word":"registration"}},"regret":{"createdAt":1783262131287,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"regret表示對過去的決定或行為感到後悔、遺憾或失望的情感。","options":["joy","regret","excitement","confidence"],"sentence":"She felt deep ______ about not studying hard enough for the exam. Years later, she still wishes she could go back and change that decision.","translation":"她對沒有為考試而努力學習感到深深的遺憾。多年後，她仍然希望能夠回到過去並改變那個決定。","word":"regret"}},"regretful":{"createdAt":1781951900948,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"regretful表示為過去的行為感到後悔或遺憾，與願意改變未來行為的想法相符。","options":["happy","regretful","excited","proud"],"sentence":"After eating too much candy, the child felt ______ and wished she hadn't been so greedy. She promised her mother that she would be more careful with sweets next time.","translation":"吃了太多糖果後，孩子感到懊悔，希望自己沒有那麼貪心。她向媽媽承諾下次會更小心對待甜食。","word":"regretful"}},"regular":{"createdAt":1782106217858,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"regular作為形容詞表示「規律的、有規則的」，用來描述按照一定模式反覆發生的事情。","options":["random","regular","occasional","sporadic"],"sentence":"She goes to the gym on a ______ basis, exercising every Monday, Wednesday, and Friday. This consistent schedule helps her maintain good physical fitness.","translation":"她以規律的方式去健身房，每週一、三、五都會運動。這種一致的時間安排幫助她保持良好的身體健康。","word":"regular"}},"regulate":{"createdAt":1781449588284,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"regulate作為動詞表示「限制、控管、調節」，指通過規則或法律來管理某事物的程度或行為。","options":["glorify","regulate","phenomenon","trillion"],"sentence":"The government decided to ______ the amount of pollution that factories could release into the environment. New laws were implemented to set strict limits on emissions and require regular monitoring of industrial activities.","translation":"政府決定限制工廠可以向環境中排放的污染量。實施了新的法律來設定嚴格的排放限制並要求對工業活動進行定期監測。","word":"regulate"}},"regulation":{"createdAt":1781515329261,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"regulation 名詞，意思是規定、管理，指具有約束力的官方或正式規則。","options":["suggestion","regulation","recommendation","tradition"],"sentence":"The new ______ required all restaurants to display their health inspection scores. Restaurant owners had to follow these mandatory guidelines or face heavy fines.","translation":"新的規定要求所有餐廳公開展示其衛生檢查評分。餐廳老闆必須遵守這些強制性的指導方針，否則將面臨高額罰款。","word":"regulation"}},"rehabilitate":{"createdAt":1783748012843,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rehabilitate 是指幫助某人（特別是囚犯）恢復正常生活或改正行為，透過提供教育和訓練來改造他們。","options":["punish","rehabilitate","isolate","document"],"sentence":"The prison program aims to ______ inmates by teaching them job skills and counseling. After serving their sentences, participants have a much better chance of successfully reintegrating into society.","translation":"監獄計畫旨在透過教導工作技能和心理諮詢來使囚犯獲得改造。服刑後，參與者成功重新融入社會的機會會大得多。","word":"rehabilitate"}},"rehearsal":{"createdAt":1781434900594,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rehearsal指為準備正式表演而進行的練習或排練。","options":["vacation","rehearsal","composition","recording"],"sentence":"The orchestra spent three months in ______ before the concert performance. The conductor made the musicians repeat difficult passages over and over until they achieved perfection.","translation":"樂團在音樂會前進行了三個月的排練。指揮讓音樂家們一遍又一遍地重複困難段落，直到達到完美。","word":"rehearsal"}},"rehearse":{"createdAt":1786779367796,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rehearse意指為了準備演出或表演而反覆練習；在這個語境中特別指演員在正式演出前的預演或排練活動。","options":["perform","rehearse","memorize","announce"],"sentence":"The actors need to ______ their lines before the opening night performance. They have only three days left to practice and perfect every scene.","translation":"演員需要在首演之夜前排練他們的台詞。他們只有三天的時間來練習和完善每一場景。","word":"rehearse"}},"rehearsed":{"createdAt":1782308456171,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Rehearsed 指經過多次練習和排練的，已提前準備好的表演或談話。","options":["spontaneous","rehearsed","improvised","unrehearsed"],"sentence":"The ______ presentation went smoothly without any mistakes or awkward pauses during the meeting. The team had practiced the speech multiple times before standing in front of the executives.","translation":"經過彩排的演講在會議期間進行得很順利，沒有任何錯誤或尷尬的停頓。團隊在站在高管面前之前已經多次練習了這個演講。","word":"rehearsed"}},"reign":{"createdAt":1781481072317,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reign 表示「統治、當政」，指君主或統治者行使權力的時期。","options":["visit","reign","promotion","residence"],"sentence":"Queen Victoria's ______ lasted over 60 years and transformed the British Empire. During this entire period, she held absolute power and made all the major decisions for the nation.","translation":"維多利亞女王的統治持續了60多年，並改變了大英帝國。在整個時期中，她掌握絕對權力並為國家做出所有重大決定。","word":"reign"}},"reinforce":{"createdAt":1783832368939,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"reinforce 意思是加強或增強某物的力量、結構或能力，使其變得更牢固或有效。","options":["insurance","lounge","reinforce","coffin"],"sentence":"The construction team decided to ______ the damaged bridge with additional steel supports. Engineers calculated that these new structural elements would significantly increase the bridge's load-bearing capacity.","translation":"建築團隊決定用額外的鋼製支撐來加強受損的橋樑。工程師計算這些新的結構元件將大大增加橋樑的承載能力。","word":"reinforce"}},"reinforcement":{"createdAt":1785252384394,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"reinforcement（援軍；加強）指為了增強力量或支持而派遣的額外人員或資源。","options":["reinforcement","intelligence","weapons","communication"],"sentence":"The military general called for ______ to strengthen the weakened garrison at the border. Additional soldiers and supplies arrived within days to support the troops already in position.","translation":"軍事將軍要求增援以加強邊境駐軍的力量。額外的士兵和補給品在數天內到達，以支持已駐守的部隊。","word":"reinforcement"}},"reject":{"createdAt":1789118514859,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reject是指拒絕或否認某事物，通常因為不符合要求或不被接受。","options":["accept","reject","review","consider"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ the job applicant's resume because it lacked the required qualifications. The hiring manager explained that without a university degree, the candidate did not meet their mandatory employment criteria.","translation":"公司決定拒絕這位求職者的簡歷，因為它缺乏所需的資格。招聘經理解釋說，沒有大學學位，該候選人不符合他們的強制性就業標準。","word":"reject"}},"rejoice":{"createdAt":1784546023700,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rejoice 是一個較為正式的動詞，表示因重大的好事而感到極大的高興和欣喜，帶有莊重的情感。","options":["celebrate","rejoice","applaud","cheer"],"sentence":"The entire nation will ______ when the national team wins the championship. Their victory has been achieved after twenty years of hard work and dedication.","translation":"當國家隊贏得冠軍時，整個國家將深感欣喜。他們的勝利是在二十年的辛勤工作和奉獻之後才取得的。","word":"rejoice"}},"relate":{"createdAt":1781798927526,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"relate 在此語境中表示詳細敘述或描述某一事件或故事的經過。","options":["ignore","relate","conceal","distort"],"sentence":"The witness carefully ______ the events of the night to the police detectives. She described how the suspect entered the building through the back door at 10 PM.","translation":"證人仔細地向警察偵探敘述了那晚發生的事件。她描述了嫌疑人如何在晚上10點從後門進入建築物。","word":"relate"}},"relation":{"createdAt":1783993252119,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"relation 表示人或事物之間的關係或聯繫","options":["distance","conflict","relation","border"],"sentence":"The ______ between the two countries improved significantly after the peace treaty was signed. Diplomatic efforts strengthened their bond considerably.","translation":"和平條約簽署後，兩個國家之間的關係顯著改善。外交努力大大加強了他們的聯繫。","word":"relation"}},"relationship":{"createdAt":1781776694532,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"relationship 是名詞，意思是兩個或多個人之間的連結或互動狀態。","options":["distance","relationship","competition","confusion"],"sentence":"Their ______ has grown stronger over the past five years. They now trust each other completely and share all their personal thoughts and feelings.","translation":"他們的關係在過去五年裡變得更加牢固。他們現在完全互相信任，並分享彼此的所有個人想法和感受。","word":"relationship"}},"relative":{"createdAt":1782823456543,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"relative 在這裡是名詞，指的是有血緣關係的家庭成員。","options":["colleague","stranger","relative","neighbor"],"sentence":"My ______ from Australia came to visit us last summer. She is my mother's sister, and we had a wonderful time exploring the city together.","translation":"我來自澳洲的親戚去年夏天來拜訪我們。她是我媽媽的妹妹，我們一起探索城市，度過了美好的時光。","word":"relative"}},"relatively":{"createdAt":1782823456545,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"relatively 是副詞，表示相對地、比較地衡量兩件事物時的程度。","options":["extremely","relatively","definitely","apparently"],"sentence":"This task is ______ easy compared to the previous one we completed. The previous task required much more time and effort to finish successfully.","translation":"與我們之前完成的任務相比，這個任務相對容易。之前的任務需要花費更多時間和精力才能成功完成。","word":"relatively"}},"relatives":{"createdAt":1783505313975,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"relatives作名詞表示「親戚」或「家族成員」，指有血緣關係的人。","options":["friends","relatives","neighbors","colleagues"],"sentence":"She invited all her ______ to the family reunion this summer. Cousins, aunts, uncles, and grandparents will gather from different states for the celebration.","translation":"她邀請了她所有的親戚參加今年夏天的家族聚會。表兄妹、阿姨、叔叔和祖父母將從不同的州聚集一起慶祝。","word":"relatives"}},"relativity":{"createdAt":1781849622415,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"相對論是物理學中的基本理論，說明事物的性質往往取決於參考框架或觀察者的角度。","options":["absorption","relativity","density","momentum"],"sentence":"The concept of ______ in physics shows that time and space are not absolute. Einstein's theory demonstrates that measurements depend on the observer's frame of reference.","translation":"物理學中的相對論概念表明時間和空間不是絕對的。愛因斯坦的理論證明測量結果取決於觀察者的參考框架。","word":"relativity"}},"relay":{"createdAt":1784553922302,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"relay 表示轉發或播放內容，在這裡指電視信號被轉播到多個頻道供全國觀眾收看。","options":["create","relay","record","translate"],"sentence":"The news station will ______ the live coverage of the presidential debate to all affiliated channels across the country. Viewers in every region will be able to watch the same broadcast simultaneously.","translation":"新聞電臺將把總統辯論的現場轉播轉發給全國所有附屬頻道。每個地區的觀眾都能同時收看相同的廣播。","word":"relay"}},"release":{"createdAt":1787009720005,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"release在這裡作為名詞，表示電影或產品的「上映」或「發行」，指的是向公眾推出或發佈的行為。","options":["delay","release","production","cancellation"],"sentence":"The film studio announced the ______ of their new superhero movie next Friday. Fans have been waiting months for this blockbuster to become available in cinemas.","translation":"電影公司宣佈他們的新超級英雄電影將於下週五上映。粉絲們已經等了好幾個月，期待這部大片在電影院上映。","word":"release"}},"relentless":{"createdAt":1781481072315,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"relentless 表示持續不斷、堅持不懈的，通常帶有強烈的力量或嚴厲的意味，強調沒有停止或緩解。","options":["occasional","relentless","constructive","fair"],"sentence":"The ______ criticism from the media never gave the politician a moment of peace. Day after day, week after week, the attacks continued without any breaks or mercy.","translation":"媒體的持續嚴厲批評從未給這位政治家片刻的安寧。日復一日、周復一周，攻擊持續不斷，沒有任何中斷或寬恕。","word":"relentless"}},"relevant":{"createdAt":1784648623663,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"relevant 指「有關的、相關聯的、切題的」，用於描述與特定話題或情況相直接相關的信息或觀點。","options":["irrelevant","fictional","relevant","confusing"],"sentence":"The witness's testimony was highly ______ to the case. The information she provided directly addressed the key questions that the jury needed to answer.","translation":"證人的證詞與案件非常相關。她提供的信息直接解決了陪審團需要回答的關鍵問題。","word":"relevant"}},"relevantly":{"createdAt":1783482926747,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"relevantly 是副詞，表示「有關地、相關聯地」，用來描述陳述或討論與特定主題或問題有直接關聯的方式。","options":["irrelevantly","relevantly","eloquently","passionately"],"sentence":"The speaker discussed the topic ______, making sure each point connected directly to the main issue. Her comments addressed only what mattered to the debate, avoiding any unnecessary tangents.","translation":"演講者相關聯地討論了該主題，確保每一點都與主要問題直接相連。她的評論只涉及與辯論相關的內容，避免了任何不必要的離題。","word":"relevantly"}},"reliable":{"createdAt":1781775276770,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"reliable指值得信任、可依賴的，與按時完成工作、被同事信任的描述相符。","options":["lazy","dishonest","reliable","careless"],"sentence":"Maria is a ______ employee who always completes her work on time and with great accuracy. Her colleagues trust her to handle the most important projects.","translation":"瑪麗亞是一位可信賴的員工，她總是按時完成工作且精確度很高。她的同事信任她來處理最重要的項目。","word":"reliable"}},"reliance":{"createdAt":1784451184440,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reliance 表示「依賴」或「依靠」，指對某事物的強烈依存程度。","options":["production","reliance","export","investment"],"sentence":"Many developing countries have reduced their ______ on imported oil by investing in renewable energy. This shift has made them more economically independent.","translation":"許多發展中國家通過投資可再生能源減少了對進口石油的依賴。這一轉變使他們在經濟上更加獨立。","word":"reliance"}},"reliant":{"createdAt":1785711727397,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reliant 是形容詞，意思是「依賴的」，通常與介詞 on 搭配使用，表示對某人或某事物的依賴程度。","options":["independent","reliant","dominant","neutral"],"sentence":"Many developing nations are ______ on imports from wealthier countries for essential goods. Without these trade relationships, their economies would struggle significantly.","translation":"許多發展中國家依賴來自較富有國家的進口商品。沒有這些貿易關係，它們的經濟將面臨重大困難。","word":"reliant"}},"relic":{"createdAt":1781437013472,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"relic 指的是來自過去的遺物或遺跡，通常具有歷史價值，需要被保存和研究。","options":["relic","invention","document","theory"],"sentence":"The ancient ______ discovered in the archaeological dig provided valuable insights into the lost civilization. Experts carefully preserved the pottery fragments and stone tools for further study.","translation":"在考古挖掘中發現的古老遺跡為失落文明提供了寶貴的見解。專家們小心翼翼地保存了陶器碎片和石製工具以供進一步研究。","word":"relic"}},"relief":{"createdAt":1785885640892,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"relief在此指「痛苦或不適的減輕或解除」，強調症狀或困擾的實際減輕。","options":["comfort","peace","relief","joy"],"sentence":"After years of suffering from chronic pain, the patient finally felt ______ when the new medication began to work. The doctor explained that this treatment would help ease the symptoms significantly.","translation":"在多年的慢性疼痛折磨後，當新藥開始起效時，患者終於感到緩解。醫生解釋說這個治療將有助於顯著緩解症狀。","word":"relief"}},"relieve":{"createdAt":1784362633990,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"relieve表示減輕或緩解的意思，通常用於減輕痛苦、不適或焦慮","options":["increase","relieve","worsen","spread"],"sentence":"The cold compress will ______ the pain in my swollen ankle after the injury. Within minutes of applying it, I felt much better and more comfortable.","translation":"受傷後，冷敷墊會減輕我腫脹腳踝的疼痛。敷上幾分鐘後，我感到舒服得多了。","word":"relieve"}},"relieved":{"createdAt":1786431993231,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"relieved 表示消除了擔憂或負擔後感到舒適和寬慰，通常是在壞事變成沒那麼糟或問題解決後產生的情感。","options":["worried","relieved","confused","excited"],"sentence":"After hearing that her flight had been delayed rather than cancelled, Sarah felt ______ and could finally relax. The news meant she would still make it to her destination, just a few hours later than planned.","translation":"聽到她的班機只是延誤而不是取消後，莎拉感到寬慰，終於可以放鬆了。這個消息意味著她仍然能趕上目的地，只是比計畫晚了幾個小時。","word":"relieved"}},"religion":{"createdAt":1783419789618,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"religion 指的是一套信仰體系，涉及對神聖事物的崇敬和遵循特定的教義與儀式。","options":["culture","tradition","religion","philosophy"],"sentence":"Many people around the world practice different forms of ______ to guide their spiritual lives. Buddhism, Christianity, Islam, and Judaism are just a few examples of major faiths.","translation":"世界上許多人實踐不同形式的宗教信仰來指導他們的精神生活。佛教、基督教、伊斯蘭教和猶太教只是幾個主要信仰的例子。","word":"religion"}},"religious":{"createdAt":1784818655892,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"religious 形容虔誠信教、遵循宗教信仰和教義的人。","options":["athletic","artistic","religious","political"],"sentence":"He was a ______ person who attended church every Sunday and followed his faith strictly. His devotion to his beliefs guided every major decision he made in life.","translation":"他是一個虔誠的信教者，每個星期天都去教堂，並嚴格遵循他的信仰。他對信念的獻身指導著他人生中的每一個重大決定。","word":"religious"}},"relocation":{"createdAt":1787188635042,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"relocation 是指人員或機構從一個地點搬遷到另一個地點，涉及物理上的移動和改變位置。","options":["promotion","relocation","expansion","renovation"],"sentence":"The company announced a ______ of its headquarters to a new city next year. Many employees will need to move their families and find new homes in the relocated office area.","translation":"公司宣布明年將總部搬遷到一個新城市。許多員工將需要搬遷他們的家庭，並在新辦公室所在地區尋找新家。","word":"relocation"}},"reluctance":{"createdAt":1786059734994,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reluctance 表示不願意或不情願做某事，通常帶有猶豫或抗拒的情感。","options":["enthusiasm","reluctance","confidence","eagerness"],"sentence":"She accepted the job offer with obvious ______, even though it was a great opportunity. Her hesitant tone and forced smile made it clear she had serious doubts about taking the position.","translation":"她雖然接受了這份很好的工作機會，但明顯表現出了不情願。她遲疑的語氣和勉強的微笑清楚地表明她對接受這份工作有嚴重的疑慮。","word":"reluctance"}},"reluctant":{"createdAt":1783921619156,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reluctant 表示不願意或勉強同意做某事，通常帶有消極或反對的態度。","options":["eager","reluctant","curious","confident"],"sentence":"She was ______ to attend the meeting because she disagreed with the proposed changes. Even though her boss insisted, she made it clear that she did not want to go.","translation":"她不願意參加會議，因為她不同意提議的改變。儘管她的老闆堅持，她明確表示她不想去。","word":"reluctant"}},"reluctantly":{"createdAt":1783823805987,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reluctantly 是副詞，表示不願意地、勉強地、帶著消極情緒去做某事。","options":["eagerly","reluctantly","immediately","enthusiastically"],"sentence":"The student ______ agreed to join the group project even though she preferred working alone. She signed the agreement with a frown and expressed her reservations to the teacher before starting.","translation":"這名學生不願意地同意加入小組專案，儘管她更喜歡獨自工作。她皺著眉頭簽署了協議，並在開始前向老師表達了她的保留意見。","word":"reluctantly"}},"rely":{"createdAt":1784961185441,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rely是指依靠或信任某事物，強調對其他事物的必要性和信心；在此句中表示農民依靠雨水才能成功種植莊稼。","options":["depend","rely","trust","count"],"sentence":"Many farmers ______ on rain to water their crops during the growing season. Without this natural resource, their harvest would fail completely.","translation":"許多農民在生長季節依賴雨水來灌溉他們的莊稼。沒有這種自然資源，他們的收成就會完全失敗。","word":"rely"}},"remain":{"createdAt":1784692580418,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"remain 意為「保持」或「停留」，在這裡表示客人決定待在原地幫忙，與第二句中「留下來」的意思相符。","options":["leave","remain","depart","disappear"],"sentence":"After the party ended, only a few guests decided to ______ at the house to help clean up. The host was grateful that they stayed behind even though everyone else had already left.","translation":"派對結束後，只有少數幾位客人決定留在房子裡幫忙打掃。主人很感謝他們留下來，儘管其他人都已經離開了。","word":"remain"}},"remainder":{"createdAt":1784908375547,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"remainder 是名詞，表示「剩餘部分」或「其餘」，指在分出或使用後還剩下的東西。","options":["beginning","remainder","flavor","size"],"sentence":"She ate half of the pizza at lunch and saved the ______ for dinner. The uneaten portion stayed in the refrigerator until evening when she was hungry again.","translation":"她午餐時吃了一半的披薩，把剩下的部分留到晚餐吃。未吃完的部分在冰箱裡放了一下午，直到晚上她又餓了。","word":"remainder"}},"remains":{"createdAt":1782125686367,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"remains（遺跡；遺留物）指的是歷史上遺留下來的物質痕跡，特別是考古發掘中發現的古代物體或遺存。","options":["buildings","remains","artifacts","documents"],"sentence":"Archaeologists discovered ancient ______ buried beneath the city. They carefully excavated pottery fragments and skeletal structures that dated back over 2,000 years.","translation":"考古學家在城市下方發現了古代遺跡。他們仔細挖掘了可追溯至2000多年前的陶片和骨骼結構。","word":"remains"}},"remark":{"createdAt":1782610887951,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"remark是指意見或評論，特別是對某事所做的口頭或書面的觀察。","options":["question","remark","assignment","schedule"],"sentence":"The teacher made an interesting ______ about the student's essay. Her comment was so thoughtful that it changed how the student approached writing.","translation":"老師對學生的論文提出了一個有趣的評論。她的意見非常深思熟慮，改變了學生對寫作的看法。","word":"remark"}},"remarkable":{"createdAt":1786182323086,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"remarkable 意指某事物非凡、傑出或值得注意，通常用來形容令人印象深刻或超乎尋常的成就或特質。","options":["ordinary","remarkable","common","typical"],"sentence":"Her ______ achievements in mathematics have earned her recognition from universities around the world. She discovered a new theorem at the age of just sixteen, something few mathematicians accomplish in their entire careers.","translation":"她在數學方面的卓越成就贏得了世界各地大學的認可。她在十六歲時發現了一個新定理，這是少數數學家在整個職業生涯中才能完成的事情。","word":"remarkable"}},"remedy":{"createdAt":1784648623662,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"remedy 指「治療法、解決方法」，用於描述用來治療疾病或解決問題的方法。","options":["diagnosis","remedy","symptom","question"],"sentence":"The doctor prescribed a ______ for the patient's persistent cough. The medication worked effectively and cleared the symptoms within a few days.","translation":"醫生為患者的持續咳嗽開了藥物治療。這種藥物很有效，幾天內就清除了症狀。","word":"remedy"}},"remind":{"createdAt":1783660470994,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"remind 的意思是「提醒」或「使某人想起」，幫助人們記住他們可能忘記的事情。ask（問）、allow（允許）、force（強迫）都無法表達「提醒」的含義。","options":["ask","remind","allow","force"],"sentence":"Please ______ me to call my mother before I leave the office. I tend to forget important family matters when I'm busy with work.","translation":"請提醒我在離開辦公室前給我媽媽打電話。當我忙於工作時，我往往會忘記重要的家庭事務。","word":"remind"}},"reminder":{"createdAt":1781437435165,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reminder 是提醒物或提醒者，幫助人們記住需要完成的事情。","options":["decoration","reminder","achievement","complaint"],"sentence":"I set a phone alarm as a ______ to pay my monthly bills on time. Without this notification, I would likely forget the important deadline.","translation":"我設置了一個手機鬧鐘來提醒我按時支付月度帳單。沒有這個通知，我可能會忘記這個重要的截止日期。","word":"reminder"}},"reminiscent":{"createdAt":1785732801436,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reminiscent表示「使人想起…的；引起回憶的」，用來描述某物讓人想起過去的經歷或記憶。","options":["indicative","reminiscent","suggestive","symbolic"],"sentence":"The old photograph was ______ of her childhood summers at the beach house. Every detail—the faded colors, the vintage cars, the clothing styles—brought back vivid memories from decades past.","translation":"這張老照片使人想起她在海邊小屋度過的童年夏日。每一個細節—褪色的顏色、古董車、服裝風格—都喚起了數十年前的生動回憶。","word":"reminiscent"}},"remote":{"createdAt":1783609867014,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"remote是形容詞，表示地點距離遙遠、偏離人口集中區域","options":["busy","urban","central","remote"],"sentence":"The cabin was located in a ______ area far from any city or town. It took us three hours of driving through mountains to reach it.","translation":"小屋位於遠離任何城市或城鎮的偏遠地區。我們花了三個小時穿過山區才到達它。","word":"remote"}},"removable":{"createdAt":1785898485874,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"removable 是指可以被拆卸或取出的東西，強調物品能夠從原來的位置分離或拆下來。","options":["durable","removable","portable","replaceable"],"sentence":"The laptop has a ______ battery that you can easily take out and replace. I always carry a spare one when I travel for long periods.","translation":"這台筆記型電腦有一個可移除的電池，你可以輕鬆地取出並更換。我在長途旅行時總是帶著一個備用電池。","word":"removable"}},"removal":{"createdAt":1782529318044,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"removal 意為去除或移除，用於表達將某物從原位置拿掉或取出。","options":["cleaning","removal","whitening","adjustment"],"sentence":"The dentist recommended the ______ of two wisdom teeth to prevent future dental problems. The extraction procedure was scheduled for the following week.","translation":"牙醫建議拔除兩顆智齒以防止未來的牙齒問題。拔牙程序定在下週進行。","word":"removal"}},"remove":{"createdAt":1785732801434,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"remove表示「移除、拿掉」，在這裡指牙醫將患者的牙齒拔掉，是不可逆的動作。","options":["clean","remove","examine","fill"],"sentence":"The dentist had to ______ the patient's decayed tooth to prevent further infection. The extraction took only a few minutes and the patient felt immediate relief.","translation":"牙醫必須移除患者腐爛的牙齒以防止進一步的感染。拔牙只花了幾分鐘，患者立即感到舒適。","word":"remove"}},"render":{"createdAt":1783262026085,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"render 作為動詞表示「使成為、使變得」，指通過某種作用或影響使某物進入某種狀態。","options":["keep","render","maintain","consider"],"sentence":"The accident ______ the old bridge unsafe for traffic and it had to be closed immediately. Structural engineers determined that continued use would endanger the lives of drivers and pedestrians.","translation":"這次事故使老橋對交通不安全，必須立即關閉。結構工程師確定繼續使用將危及駕駛員和行人的生命。","word":"render"}},"renew":{"createdAt":1781709984195,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"renew 表示延長有效期或更新已過期的文件，使其重新有效。","options":["replace","renew","restore","revise"],"sentence":"I forgot to ______ my passport before my international trip next month. The government website allows citizens to complete the process online in just a few minutes.","translation":"我忘記在下個月的國際旅行前更新護照。政府網站允許公民在幾分鐘內在線完成這個過程。","word":"renew"}},"renewable":{"createdAt":1781693270388,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"renewable表示「可再生的、可恢復的」，指能夠自然地或通過人為方式補充和重新生成的資源。","options":["fossil","renewable","dangerous","outdated"],"sentence":"The government invested heavily in ______ energy sources like wind and solar power to reduce carbon emissions. These resources can be naturally replenished and will not deplete over time.","translation":"政府大力投資於風能和太陽能等可再生能源，以減少碳排放。這些資源可以自然補充，不會隨著時間而耗盡。","word":"renewable"}},"renewed":{"createdAt":1784485533682,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"renewed（更新的；延長的）用來描述一份重新簽署或重新開始的協議，表示某事物被恢復、更新或再次開始。","options":["broken","renewed","terminated","suspended"],"sentence":"After the contract expired, both parties signed a ______ agreement to continue their business relationship. The new deal included updated terms that reflected the changes in market conditions over the past year.","translation":"合約到期後，雙方簽署了一份更新的協議以繼續他們的商業關係。新協議包括反映過去一年市場條件變化的更新條款。","word":"renewed"}},"renovation":{"createdAt":1782920661026,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"renovation是指翻新或整修，特別是將舊建築或物品恢復到良好的狀態","options":["construction","renovation","development","modification"],"sentence":"The old building underwent major ______ to restore its historical features and modernize its systems. The project took two years to complete, transforming the structure inside and out.","translation":"這棟老建築進行了大規模翻新，以恢復其歷史特徵並使其系統現代化。該項目花費兩年才完成，從內到外改造了建築物。","word":"renovation"}},"renowned":{"createdAt":1781843396461,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"renowned表示享有高度名譽和廣泛認可的，通常用於描述才華出眾的人物。","options":["unknown","infamous","renowned","ordinary"],"sentence":"The ______ chef was invited to prepare the royal banquet. His restaurants had won multiple international awards and were featured in prestigious culinary magazines worldwide.","translation":"那位著名廚師被邀請為皇家宴會準備食物。他的餐廳贏得了多個國際獎項，並在世界各地享有盛譽的烹飪雜誌上刊登。","word":"renowned"}},"rental":{"createdAt":1782410027820,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rental用作形容詞，指可供出租的物業；這裡的語境強調租賃協議和每月租金，明確指出這是一間出租的公寓。","options":["purchase","rental","commercial","residential"],"sentence":"We found a beautiful ______ apartment near the city center for $1,200 per month. The landlord requires a six-month contract and a security deposit before we can move in.","translation":"我們在市中心附近找到了一間美麗的租賃公寓，每月租金為$1,200。房東要求我們簽署六個月的合約並支付押金才能入住。","word":"rental"}},"repair":{"createdAt":1781515329262,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"repair 名詞，意思是修理、修整，指恢復損壞物品的工作。","options":["inspection","repair","maintenance","upgrade"],"sentence":"The car required extensive ______ after the accident damaged its engine. The mechanic spent three weeks fixing all the broken components and replacing damaged parts.","translation":"事故後，汽車的引擎受損，需要進行大規模的修理。機修工花了三週時間修復所有破損的零件並更換受損的部件。","word":"repair"}},"repay":{"createdAt":1781693484716,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"repay 表示償還欠款或以實際行動回報他人的恩情和幫助。","options":["forget","deny","repay","ignore"],"sentence":"I borrowed money from my best friend last year, and now I want to ______ her kindness. She helped me when I needed it most, so I will always be grateful.","translation":"去年我向我最好的朋友借了錢，現在我想報答她的善意。她在我最需要時幫助了我，所以我將永遠感謝她。","word":"repay"}},"repeal":{"createdAt":1785339147827,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"repeal指正式廢除或撤銷法律、法規或規定的行為。","options":["enforce","repeal","revise","implement"],"sentence":"The government voted to ______ the unpopular tax law that had been in place for a decade. Citizens celebrated when the legislation was officially cancelled and removed from the books.","translation":"政府投票決定廢除已經實施十年的不受歡迎的稅收法律。當該法律被正式取消並從法律條文中移除時，公民們歡欣鼓舞。","word":"repeal"}},"repeat":{"createdAt":1784334613273,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"repeat 表示重複地說或做某事，通常是指說或做過一次之後再做一次相同的事情。","options":["ignore","repeat","translate","memorize"],"sentence":"The teacher asked the students to ______ the difficult sentence after her. She wanted them to say the exact same words one more time so they could practice the correct pronunciation.","translation":"老師要求學生跟著她重覆說那句難句子。她希望他們再說一次完全相同的字詞，以便練習正確的發音。","word":"repeat"}},"repel":{"createdAt":1783068339338,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"repel 意為排斥或拒絕，用來描述一種力量或影響將某物推開或驅逐","options":["attract","repel","absorb","suspend"],"sentence":"The strong magnetic field will ______ any metal objects that come too close. The negative charge pushes them away with tremendous force.","translation":"強磁場會拒絕任何靠近的金屬物體。負電荷以巨大的力量將它們推開。","word":"repel"}},"repent":{"createdAt":1785253731018,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"repent（悔改；後悔）表示對過去的錯誤感到真摯的悔意，並願意改正自己的過錯。","options":["celebrate","repent","ignore","escape"],"sentence":"The criminal decided to ______ for his wrongdoings and asked for forgiveness. He spent years in prison reflecting on his sins and genuinely regretting the harm he had caused.","translation":"這個罪犯決定為自己的過錯悔改並尋求寬恕。他在監獄裡花了數年時間反思自己的罪行，並真誠地後悔他造成的傷害。","word":"repent"}},"repentant":{"createdAt":1781653278521,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"repentant是形容詞，表示後悔的，用於描述對過去的錯誤或不當行為感到真正懊悔和遺憾的狀態。","options":["stubborn","repentant","proud","arrogant"],"sentence":"The ______ thief apologized sincerely to the store owner and returned all the stolen goods. His genuine remorse and promise to change his ways convinced everyone of his transformation.","translation":"這個______小偷真誠地向店主道歉並歸還了所有被盜的物品。他真正的悔恨和改過自新的承諾使每個人都相信他的轉變。","word":"repentant"}},"repetitive":{"createdAt":1784005171687,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"repetitive 意思是重複的或囉嗦的，指同樣的動作、言語或模式不斷地重複發生，令人感到乏味。","options":["challenging","creative","repetitive","prestigious"],"sentence":"The factory worker found his job very ______ and monotonous. He performed the same three tasks over and over again, eight hours a day, five days a week.","translation":"工廠工人發現他的工作非常重複和單調。他每天八小時、每週五天一遍遍地重複同樣的三項任務。","word":"repetitive"}},"replace":{"createdAt":1783660471001,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"replace 指「用新的東西取代舊的」。句子清楚表明系統無法修復，因此必須用新系統來替換它，而不是修理、清潔或升級。","options":["repair","replace","clean","upgrade"],"sentence":"The old air conditioning system is broken, so we need to ______ it with a new one. The technician says the current unit cannot be repaired anymore.","translation":"舊的空調系統壞了，所以我們需要用新的來取代它。技術人員說目前的設備已經無法修復了。","word":"replace"}},"replaceable":{"createdAt":1781843396461,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"replaceable表示可以被取代或替換的，強調該職位或物品並不是獨一無二的。","options":["irreplaceable","permanent","replaceable","unique"],"sentence":"The company emphasized that all customer service representatives are ______ by equally trained staff. This policy ensures continuous service even during employee turnover.","translation":"該公司強調所有客服代表都可以由同樣訓練有素的員工取代。這項政策確保即使員工流動也能持續提供服務。","word":"replaceable"}},"replacement":{"createdAt":1783927689735,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"replacement 是指用另一個相同或相似的東西來替換原來的損壞或磨損的東西。","options":["repair","upgrade","replacement","substitute"],"sentence":"After my old phone broke, I needed to find a ______ immediately. The store offered me a new model with the same features and warranty.","translation":"我的舊手機壞了後，我需要立即找到替換品。商店提供了一款具有相同功能和保修的新型號。","word":"replacement"}},"replenish":{"createdAt":1788028661411,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"replenish 意思是「補充或重新裝滿」，在這裡指的是旅客把空容器重新裝滿水。","options":["waste","replenish","observe","divide"],"sentence":"After the long journey through the desert, the travelers needed to ______ their water supply. They stopped at the oasis to fill their containers completely.","translation":"經過沙漠的長途旅行後，旅客們需要補充他們的水量供應。他們在綠洲停下來完全裝滿他們的容器。","word":"replenish"}},"reply":{"createdAt":1781776694539,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"reply 是名詞，意思是對某人說的話或寫的信的回應或答覆。","options":["question","complaint","reply","delivery"],"sentence":"I sent her an email three days ago, but I still haven't received a ______ from her. She has not written back or acknowledged my message in any way.","translation":"我三天前給她發了一封電子郵件，但我仍然沒有收到她的回覆。她沒有寫回信或以任何方式確認我的信息。","word":"reply"}},"reportedly":{"createdAt":1783423026253,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reportedly 用於表示根據某些報導或傳聞的陳述，需要確認來源和證據，而 certainly、obviously、definitely（肯定、顯然、明確地）則表示絕對確定的事實。","options":["certainly","reportedly","obviously","definitely"],"sentence":"The celebrity ______ spent three months filming in remote locations across South America. According to multiple news sources and interviews, the production faced numerous weather-related challenges.","translation":"據報導，這位名人花了三個月在南美洲的偏遠地點拍攝。根據多個新聞來源和採訪，製片面臨了許多天氣相關的挑戰。","word":"reportedly"}},"represent":{"createdAt":1781256547736,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Represent在此表示描寫或描繪，指藝術作品表現或呈現出某個場景或概念。","options":["ignore","represent","conceal","destroy"],"sentence":"The painting ______ a peaceful village at sunset with golden light spreading across the sky. Every detail in the artwork captures the artist's vision of rural tranquility.","translation":"這幅畫描寫了一個日落時刻的寧靜村莊，金色的光線灑滿天空。藝術品中的每一個細節都捕捉了藝術家對鄉村寧靜的想像。","word":"represent"}},"representation":{"createdAt":1781424356417,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"representation指的是以某種形式對現實事物或概念的展示或描繪。","options":["photograph","representation","contract","theory"],"sentence":"The artist created a beautiful ______ of the landscape through her oil painting. The canvas captured the essence of the mountains, valleys, and golden sunset in striking detail.","translation":"這位藝術家通過油畫創作了對風景的優美呈現。畫布以引人注目的細節捕捉了山脈、山谷和金色日落的精髓。","word":"representation"}},"representative":{"createdAt":1781848934139,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"representative指能夠代表某個類別或時代特徵的典型例子","options":["fake","representative","modern","abstract"],"sentence":"This painting is a ______ example of Renaissance art from the 15th century. Art historians often use it in textbooks to illustrate the period's characteristics.","translation":"這幅畫是15世紀文藝復興藝術的典型例子。藝術史學家經常在教科書中用它來說明該時期的特點。","word":"representative"}},"representatives":{"createdAt":1781836375378,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"representatives是代表，指被授權代表某個團體、機構或國家行動的人。","options":["ambassadors","representatives","delegates","envoys"],"sentence":"Each country sent ______ to the international conference to discuss climate change. These officials had the authority to negotiate agreements on behalf of their nations.","translation":"每個國家派遣代表參加國際會議討論氣候變化。這些官員有權代表他們的國家進行談判。","word":"representatives"}},"reproduce":{"createdAt":1781693265626,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"複製是指以相同或相似的方式製作或重新創作某物。","options":["sell","reproduce","destroy","analyze"],"sentence":"The art student was asked to ______ the famous painting using watercolors. The instructor wanted the class to practice the original artist's techniques and style.","translation":"美術學生被要求用水彩複製這幅著名畫作。講師希望全班練習原始藝術家的技巧和風格。","word":"reproduce"}},"reptile":{"createdAt":1782401868816,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reptile 表示爬行動物，如蛇、蜥蜴和烏龜等。","options":["mammal","reptile","bird","fish"],"sentence":"The snake is a cold-blooded ______ that relies on external heat sources to regulate its body temperature. Unlike mammals, it cannot produce its own warmth.","translation":"蛇是一種冷血爬行動物，依靠外部熱源來調節其體溫。與哺乳動物不同，它無法產生自己的熱量。","word":"reptile"}},"republic":{"createdAt":1785143022577,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"republic 是指由人民選舉的代表進行統治的國家形式，與君主制或帝國制不同。","options":["kingdom","empire","republic","colony"],"sentence":"France is a ______ with a president as the head of state, not a monarchy. Citizens have the right to vote for their leaders.","translation":"法國是一個共和國，由總統作為國家元首，而不是君主制。公民有權投票選擇他們的領導人。","word":"republic"}},"republican":{"createdAt":1781437220554,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"「Republican」形容詞表示支持共和政體制度和民主原則的人或政策。","options":["monarchist","communist","republican","anarchist"],"sentence":"The ______ candidate promised to reduce government spending and protect individual freedoms. He campaigned on principles of limited state power and free enterprise.","translation":"這位共和黨候選人承諾減少政府支出並保護個人自由。他在限制國家權力和自由企業的原則基礎上進行競選。","word":"republican"}},"repulsive":{"createdAt":1787049198623,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"repulsive形容令人厭惡或反感的事物，通常會引發負面的生理或情感反應。","options":["delicious","nutritious","repulsive","fresh"],"sentence":"The old, decaying food in the refrigerator was absolutely ______. I had to turn away and hold my nose when I opened the door.","translation":"冰箱裡腐爛的舊食物令人極其厭惡。我打開門時不得不轉身捂住鼻子。","word":"repulsive"}},"repurposed":{"createdAt":1782529318036,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"repurposed 意為重新利用或賦予新的用途，用於描述將原有物品改作他途的行為。","options":["demolished","repurposed","renovated","relocated"],"sentence":"The old warehouse was ______ into a trendy art gallery and event space. Community members appreciated how the abandoned building was transformed into a vibrant cultural venue.","translation":"舊倉庫被重新利用改造成了時尚藝術館和活動場所。社區成員讚賞這座廢棄建築被改造成充滿活力的文化場所。","word":"repurposed"}},"reputation":{"createdAt":1783516186775,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reputation 是指一個人、組織或事物在公眾心中的看法或評價。","options":["location","reputation","inventory","schedule"],"sentence":"The company's ______ suffered greatly after the scandal was exposed in the news. Years of building trust were destroyed in a single day.","translation":"該公司的名聲在醜聞被新聞揭露後大受損害。多年建立的信任在一天內被摧毀。","word":"reputation"}},"request":{"createdAt":1781832508021,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"request 表示「請求；要求」，指向他人提出希望對方做某事的願望。","options":["expense","request","accident","beginning"],"sentence":"At the ______ of the students, the teacher agreed to postpone the final exam by one week. The class had submitted a formal petition explaining their need for additional study time.","translation":"應學生的要求，老師同意將期末考試推遲一週。全班提交了一份正式請願書，解釋他們需要更多的複習時間。","word":"request"}},"require":{"createdAt":1781840892411,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"require表示強制性的要求或必須有的條件，比建議或推薦更具強制力。","options":["suggest","require","recommend","prefer"],"sentence":"Most universities ______ applicants to submit standardized test scores along with their essays and transcripts. Without these documents, admissions officers cannot complete their evaluation process.","translation":"大多數大學要求申請者提交標準化考試成績以及論文和成績單。沒有這些文件，招生官員無法完成評估過程。","word":"require"}},"required":{"createdAt":1781848934142,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"required指被需要或被強制要求必須完成的事項","options":["optional","required","forbidden","suggested"],"sentence":"All students must submit a ______ essay before the end of the semester. Without it, they cannot receive credit for the course.","translation":"所有學生必須在學期末前提交一份必需的論文。沒有它，他們無法獲得課程學分。","word":"required"}},"requirement":{"createdAt":1783346573163,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"requirement 意為需求或必需品，表示必須滿足的條件或必需的事物。","options":["suggestion","option","requirement","preference"],"sentence":"One ______ for admission to the graduate program is a minimum GPA of 3.5. All applicants must demonstrate this academic standard before they can be considered.","translation":"申請研究所的一項必需條件是最低GPA為3.5。所有申請者必須在被考慮之前展示這一學術標準。","word":"requirement"}},"rescue":{"createdAt":1784701140001,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rescue 作名詞表示救援行動，指從危險或困境中拯救某人或某物的過程。","options":["arrest","rescue","retreat","release"],"sentence":"The firefighters mounted a dramatic ______ operation when they discovered a family trapped in the burning building. Thanks to their quick thinking and bravery, all five members were safely pulled out alive.","translation":"當消防隊員發現一家人被困在燃燒的建築物中時，他們進行了一場戲劇性的救援行動。多虧他們的快速反應和勇氣，所有五名成員都被安全救出。","word":"rescue"}},"research":{"createdAt":1784825878240,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"research是指有系統的調查和實驗活動，目的是發現新的事實或知識，通常涉及數據收集、分析和學術發表。","options":["teaching","research","travel","discussion"],"sentence":"The scientist spent five years conducting ______ on a new vaccine. Her team published their findings in a peer-reviewed journal after collecting data and analyzing results.","translation":"這位科學家花了五年時間進行疫苗新藥的______。她的團隊在收集數據和分析結果後，在同行評審的期刊上發表了他們的發現。","word":"research"}},"researcher":{"createdAt":1785242988950,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"researcher指的是從事科學研究或學術調查的專業人士，通常會進行系統的數據收集並發表學術著作。","options":["teacher","researcher","journalist","student"],"sentence":"The ______ spent five years collecting data for her study. She published her findings in a prestigious academic journal after completing her investigation.","translation":"這位研究員花了五年時間為她的研究收集數據。在完成調查後，她在一份享有盛譽的學術期刊上發表了她的發現。","word":"researcher"}},"resemblance":{"createdAt":1786167460229,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"resemblance 是名詞，表示外貌或特徵的相似或相像之處，通常用來描述人或物體之間的相似程度。","options":["difference","resemblance","distance","preference"],"sentence":"There is a striking ______ between the two sisters, with identical facial features and the same eye color. People often mistake one for the other because of how much they look alike.","translation":"這兩姐妹之間有著顯著的相似之處，擁有相同的面部特徵和眼睛顏色。人們經常因為她們看起來非常相像而把一個誤認為另一個。","word":"resemblance"}},"resemble":{"createdAt":1781310338173,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"resemble 表示看起來相像或具有相似的特徵。","options":["ignore","resemble","criticize","change"],"sentence":"The teenage boy's facial features ______ those of his father quite remarkably. People often comment that they look like they could be twins despite their age difference.","translation":"這個青少年男孩的面部特徵與他父親的特徵非常相似。儘管年齡相差很大，人們經常評論他們看起來就像可能是雙胞胎。","word":"resemble"}},"resent":{"createdAt":1781622232189,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"resent 表示對某人或某事感到不滿、憎恨或感到受傷和冤枉。","options":["praise","resent","support","congratulate"],"sentence":"Tom began to ______ his coworker after she was promoted to a supervisory position. He felt that the promotion was unfair and that he deserved the opportunity more than she did.","translation":"在他的同事被提升為主管職位後，湯姆開始憎恨她。他認為這次晉升是不公平的，並且認為他比她更應該得到這個機會。","word":"resent"}},"reservation":{"createdAt":1782897696862,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reservation在這裡表示「預訂席位」，指提前在餐廳預留座位的行為。","options":["complaint","reservation","suggestion","conclusion"],"sentence":"I made a ______ at the restaurant for 7 PM tonight. The staff confirmed that they had set aside a table for four people under my name.","translation":"我在餐廳預訂了今晚7點的位置。員工確認他們已經用我的名字預留了一張四人桌。","word":"reservation"}},"reserve":{"createdAt":1784723233348,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reserve 在這裡作為動詞，意思是預先安排或保留某樣東西供日後使用。","options":["cancel","reserve","inspect","improve"],"sentence":"The hotel asked me to ______ a room for next month's conference. I called ahead to ensure they would hold it under my name until my arrival.","translation":"飯店要求我為下個月的會議預訂一間房間。我提前打電話以確保他們會以我的名義保留房間直到我到達。","word":"reserve"}},"reserved":{"createdAt":1781696018677,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reserved 意為拘謹、有保留的，指人在社交場合中不願過多表露自己的想法和感受。","options":["outgoing","reserved","enthusiastic","talkative"],"sentence":"The CEO maintained a ______ demeanor during the public interview, speaking only when necessary. Her colleagues noted that she rarely shared personal opinions at company gatherings.","translation":"這位執行長在公開採訪中保持著矜持的舉止，只在必要時才發言。她的同事們注意到她很少在公司聚會上分享個人觀點。","word":"reserved"}},"reservoir":{"createdAt":1781693266949,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"reservoir是一個蓄水或儲存液體的大型人工結構，通常用於供水或灌溉。","options":["reservoir","factory","hospital","library"],"sentence":"The city built a large ______ to store water during the rainy season. This facility supplies drinking water to over one million residents throughout the year.","translation":"該市修建了一個大型蓄水池來在雨季儲存水。這個設施全年為超過一百萬居民供應飲用水。","word":"reservoir"}},"reside":{"createdAt":1781622232190,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reside 意為居住或住在某個地方，通常指長期的居住。","options":["visit","reside","travel","explore"],"sentence":"The ambassador will ______ in the capital city for the duration of her diplomatic mission. She has been assigned to the country's main government district.","translation":"大使將在她的外交任務期間住在首都。她被派遣到該國的主要政府區域。","word":"reside"}},"residence":{"createdAt":1781582939253,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"residence 意指某人居住的地方或住房，在這裡與搬家和尋找房子的語境相符。","options":["job","residence","hobby","language"],"sentence":"After retiring, Mr. Chen decided to change his ______ from the bustling city to a quiet countryside village. He spent months searching for the perfect house with a garden and a peaceful view of the mountains.","translation":"退休後，陳先生決定將他的住所從熙攘的城市改至寧靜的鄉村。他花了數月尋找完美的房子，有花園和寧靜的山景。","word":"residence"}},"resident":{"createdAt":1783656305275,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"resident特指某地的居民或住戶，是指在某個地方居住的人。","options":["owner","visitor","resident","tenant"],"sentence":"Every ______ of the apartment building must follow the rules in the lease agreement. The property manager enforces these regulations for everyone who lives here.","translation":"公寓樓的每位居民都必須遵守租約中的規則。物業經理對所有住在這裡的人實施這些規定。","word":"resident"}},"residential":{"createdAt":1783390227930,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"residential 是形容詞，指的是用於住居或與住宅相關的地區或建築物。","options":["commercial","industrial","residential","agricultural"],"sentence":"The city council approved a plan to develop a new ______ area on the outskirts of town. The zoning ordinance specified that only single-family homes and apartment buildings would be permitted in this zone.","translation":"市議會批准了在城鎮邊緣開發新住宅區的計畫。分區條例規定該地區只允許建造單家庭住宅和公寓樓。","word":"residential"}},"residual":{"createdAt":1781832508018,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"residual 表示「剩餘的；殘留的」，指留下來或保留下來的部分。","options":["new","residual","imported","synthetic"],"sentence":"The factory was ordered to clean up ______ chemicals left in the storage tanks. Environmental inspectors found traces of toxic substances that had accumulated over decades.","translation":"工廠被要求清除儲存槽中留下的殘留化學物質。環境檢查員發現了數十年來累積的有毒物質痕跡。","word":"residual"}},"resign":{"createdAt":1783841864098,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"resign 作為動詞，表示正式從職位或工作中退出，即辭職。","options":["retire","resign","transfer","demote"],"sentence":"After twenty years of service, the director decided to ______ from his position. He announced his departure at the board meeting last week.","translation":"經過二十年的服務，主任決定從他的職位上辭職。他在上週的董事會會議上宣佈了他的離職。","word":"resign"}},"resignation":{"createdAt":1783841864097,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"resignation 作為名詞，專指從職位或工作中正式退出的行為或文件，即辭職。","options":["complaint","resignation","promotion","transfer"],"sentence":"The employee submitted her ______ after disagreeing with the company's new policies. Her letter indicated she was leaving her job effective immediately.","translation":"在與公司的新政策意見不合後，員工提交了她的辭職信。她的信件表明她將立即離開這份工作。","word":"resignation"}},"resigned":{"createdAt":1781926464746,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"resigned 表示接受不幸的狀況或放棄希望的態度，通常帶有無奈和放棄的情緒。","options":["excited","resigned","promoted","ambitious"],"sentence":"After losing the promotion, he felt ______ to his current position and accepted he would not advance further. He stopped applying for better jobs and simply focused on his daily tasks.","translation":"失去晉升機會後，他對現在的職位感到認命，接受了他不會進步的事實。他停止申請更好的工作，只是專注於日常工作。","word":"resigned"}},"resist":{"createdAt":1783945367025,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"resist 意為「抵抗、對抗」，表示能夠承受或對抗外部的力量、影響或條件而不被破壞。","options":["absorb","resist","transform","accelerate"],"sentence":"The rubber material can ______ extreme heat and pressure without breaking. Engineers chose this specific polymer because it must withstand the harsh conditions inside the engine.","translation":"橡膠材料可以抵抗極端高溫和壓力而不破裂。工程師選擇這種特定的聚合物是因為它必須承受引擎內部的惡劣條件。","word":"resist"}},"resistance":{"createdAt":1784191742095,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"resistance指抵抗、反對或反抗某事物，也可指物理中的電阻或阻力。","options":["friction","resistance","guide","purchase"],"sentence":"The team faced strong ______ from their opponents during the debate competition. However, they overcame all the objections and won first place.","translation":"球隊在辯論比賽中面臨對手的強烈反對。然而，他們克服了所有的反對意見並贏得了第一名。","word":"resistance"}},"resistant":{"createdAt":1783476327940,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"resistant 是形容詞，意為抵制的、抗的、具有抵抗力的，表示對某事物有不被影響或被改變的能力。","options":["sensitive","vulnerable","resistant","responsive"],"sentence":"The new antibiotic-______ bacteria posed a serious public health challenge for hospitals worldwide. These microorganisms could survive treatment that had previously been effective, making infections harder to cure.","translation":"新的抗生素耐藥菌對全球醫院構成了嚴重的公共衛生挑戰。這些微生物能夠存活在以前有效的治療中，使得感染更難以治癒。","word":"resistant"}},"resolution":{"createdAt":1781434900597,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"resolution指堅定的決心或計劃做某事的明確意圖。","options":["complaint","resolution","excuse","question"],"sentence":"She made a ______ to exercise every morning and eat healthier food starting January first. Her determination to change her lifestyle remained strong throughout the entire year.","translation":"她下定決心從一月一日開始每天早晨鍛煉並吃更健康的食物。她改變生活方式的決心在整個一年中保持堅定。","word":"resolution"}},"resolve":{"createdAt":1784700783428,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"resolve 作為名詞表示「決心、決定」，指的是經過深思熟慮後所做出的堅定決定或承諾。","options":["ignore","resolve","delay","forget"],"sentence":"After months of uncertainty, she finally made a ______ to pursue her dream of becoming a doctor. Her determination was so strong that nothing could stop her from achieving this goal.","translation":"經過幾個月的不確定，她終於下定決心追求成為醫生的夢想。她的決心是如此堅定，沒有任何事情能阻止她實現這個目標。","word":"resolve"}},"resolved":{"createdAt":1781424157174,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"resolved 作為形容詞表示堅定不移、下定決心的狀態。","options":["hesitant","uncertain","resolved","confused"],"sentence":"After months of self-doubt, Marcus felt ______ to finally start his own business venture. He had made a firm commitment and would not change his mind no matter what obstacles appeared.","translation":"經過幾個月的自我懷疑，馬庫斯感到下定決心終於開始自己的商業冒險。他已經做出堅定的承諾，無論出現什麼障礙都不會改變主意。","word":"resolved"}},"resort":{"createdAt":1781860901466,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"resort作名詞表示度假地或名勝，是供人休閒娛樂的地方","options":["fortress","resort","prison","factory"],"sentence":"The tropical ______ offered beautiful beaches, luxury hotels, and fine dining restaurants. Thousands of tourists visited this destination every year to relax and enjoy the amenities.","translation":"這個熱帶度假地提供美麗的海灘、豪華酒店和高級餐廳。每年有數千名遊客前往這個目的地放鬆和享受設施。","word":"resort"}},"resource":{"createdAt":1781926464745,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"resource 在商業語境中指公司可利用的資產、資金或財產，用於運營和發展。","options":["expense","resource","liability","debt"],"sentence":"The company carefully manages its financial ______ to ensure long-term stability. Their accountants track every dollar of capital and investment to prevent wasteful spending.","translation":"公司謹慎地管理其財務資源以確保長期穩定性。他們的會計師追蹤每一美元的資本和投資以防止浪費支出。","word":"resource"}},"respect":{"createdAt":1782646322967,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"respect 作動詞表示尊敬、敬重某人，既包含敬畏他們的品質，也包含問候和禮貌對待。","options":["greet","honor","respect","admire"],"sentence":"We must ______ our elders for their wisdom and experience gained over many years. When greeting them, we show courtesy and consideration for their contributions to society.","translation":"我們必須尊敬長者多年積累的智慧和經驗。向他們問候時，我們表示對他們對社會貢獻的禮貌和考慮。","word":"respect"}},"respectable":{"createdAt":1786634602863,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「respectable」意指值得尊敬的、受人尊重的，通常用來形容一個人的品格、職業或成就令人敬佩。","options":["notorious","respectable","reckless","trivial"],"sentence":"Although he came from a poor family, he built a ______ career as a doctor and earned the admiration of his community. People looked up to him because of his honesty, hard work, and dedication to helping others.","translation":"雖然他出身貧窮，但他建立了可敬的醫學生涯，贏得了社區的敬佩。人們因為他的誠實、勤奮和幫助他人的奉獻精神而尊敬他。","word":"respectable"}},"respectful":{"createdAt":1785143022579,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"respectful 表示表現出對他人的尊重和恭敬，通常指態度或行為中表現出的敬意。","options":["lazy","respectful","casual","hasty"],"sentence":"The student gave a ______ bow to the teacher before asking a question. This polite gesture showed that she valued and honored her educator.","translation":"學生在提問前向老師行了一個恭敬的鞠躬。這個禮貌的姿態表明她尊重她的教育工作者。","word":"respectful"}},"respecting":{"createdAt":1781622232188,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"respecting 作為介詞表示「關於」或「就...而言」，用於引入所討論的主題。","options":["Ignoring","Respecting","Questioning","Delaying"],"sentence":"______ the new company policy, all employees must submit their reports by Friday afternoon. Management has made this requirement clear to ensure proper workflow.","translation":"關於新的公司政策，所有員工必須在星期五下午前提交報告。管理層已經明確了這一要求，以確保適當的工作流程。","word":"respecting"}},"respective":{"createdAt":1783845383676,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"respective 表示分別屬於不同的人或事物，強調各自的、個別的關係。","options":["shared","respective","previous","temporary"],"sentence":"The three employees returned to their ______ offices after the meeting concluded. John went to the marketing department, Sarah to accounting, and Michael to research and development.","translation":"會議結束後，三名員工返回各自的辦公室。約翰去了行銷部門，莎拉去了會計部門，邁克爾去了研究開發部門。","word":"respective"}},"respond":{"createdAt":1782476098662,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"respond 是指對某件事或某人做出反應或回應，通常涉及言語或行動上的回答。","options":["listen","understand","respond","react"],"sentence":"When the teacher asked a question, the student did not ______ immediately. He waited several seconds before raising his hand to answer.","translation":"當老師問了一個問題時，學生沒有立即回應。他等了幾秒鐘才舉手回答。","word":"respond"}},"respondent":{"createdAt":1783685028739,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"respondent是指參與調查或研究並提供答案的人，也就是回答問卷或提供反饋的受試者。","options":["observer","respondent","interviewer","analyst"],"sentence":"Each ______ in the survey provided detailed answers to the questions about their shopping habits. The researchers collected responses from over 500 people across different age groups.","translation":"調查中的每位答覆者都詳細回答了有關其購物習慣的問題。研究人員從不同年齡組的500多人那裡收集了回答。","word":"respondent"}},"response":{"createdAt":1783745209275,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"response 指對問題、刺激或請求所做出的回答或反應，在這裡表示學生對老師提問的答覆。","options":["attention","response","silence","movement"],"sentence":"The teacher waited patiently for a ______ from the student after asking a difficult question. The student took several minutes to think carefully before giving an answer.","translation":"老師在問了一個難題後耐心等待學生的回答。學生花了幾分鐘仔細思考後才給出答案。","word":"response"}},"responsibility":{"createdAt":1784986981426,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"responsibility 指的是被賦予或承擔的職責和義務，在這裡表示莎拉作為管理者所承擔的責任。","options":["pleasure","responsibility","opportunity","criticism"],"sentence":"As the project manager, Sarah accepted full ______ for meeting the deadline. The team looked to her to make final decisions and ensure all tasks were completed on time.","translation":"作為專案經理，莎拉接受了完成截止日期的全部責任。團隊期待她做出最終決定並確保所有任務按時完成。","word":"responsibility"}},"responsible":{"createdAt":1782265478230,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"responsible 表示某人要為某事負責，具有承擔義務和後果的含義。","options":["capable","responsible","interested","grateful"],"sentence":"As the team leader, Maria is ______ for ensuring all deadlines are met. She takes full accountability when projects fail and always delivers quality work on time.","translation":"作為團隊領導，瑪麗亞負責確保所有截止日期都能達成。當專案失敗時，她承擔全部責任，並且始終按時交付優質成果。","word":"responsible"}},"responsive":{"createdAt":1784972485458,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"responsive 表示反應積極、敏捷、迅速回應他人需求的意思，強調對外界刺激或要求的快速和積極反應。","options":["ignorant","responsive","stubborn","passive"],"sentence":"The customer service team was very ______ to our complaints and resolved the issue within hours. Their quick action showed they were actively listening and genuinely cared about solving our problem.","translation":"客服團隊對我們的投訴反應積極，並在幾小時內解決了問題。他們的迅速行動表明他們在積極傾聽，並真心關注解決我們的問題。","word":"responsive"}},"restoration":{"createdAt":1781693295122,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"restoration 表示修復或恢復某物到原來的狀態，在這裡指藝術品的修復工作。","options":["destruction","restoration","removal","examination"],"sentence":"The old painting required careful ______ to bring back its original beauty. The art team spent months removing layers of dirt and repainting damaged sections.","translation":"這幅古老的畫作需要仔細的修復以恢復其原有的美麗。藝術團隊花費了數月時間去除汙垢層並重新繪製受損部分。","word":"restoration"}},"restore":{"createdAt":1783558795711,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"restore 表示修復或恢復某物到原來的狀態或功能。","options":["destroy","restore","examine","display"],"sentence":"The museum team worked carefully to ______ the ancient painting that had been damaged by water. After three months of cleaning and repair, the artwork looked as beautiful as it did centuries ago.","translation":"博物館團隊小心翼翼地修復那幅被水損壞的古代繪畫。經過三個月的清潔和修復，這件藝術品看起來和幾個世紀前一樣美麗。","word":"restore"}},"restrain":{"createdAt":1781777331351,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"restrain是動詞，意為阻止、制止或遏制某事物的發展或蔓延","options":["promote","distribute","restrain","encourage"],"sentence":"The government attempted to ______ the spread of misinformation during the crisis. Officials implemented strict regulations on media outlets to control what could be published.","translation":"政府試圖在危機期間阻止錯誤信息的傳播。官員們對媒體機構實施了嚴格的規定，以控制可以發表的內容。","word":"restrain"}},"restraint":{"createdAt":1783845383676,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"restraint 指控制自己的情感或行為，保持冷靜和理性的能力。","options":["aggression","restraint","enthusiasm","impatience"],"sentence":"The diplomat showed great ______ during the heated negotiation, remaining calm and composed. He refused to raise his voice or make emotional decisions despite the provocation.","translation":"在激烈的談判中，外交官表現出極大的克制，保持冷靜和沉著。儘管受到激怒，他拒絕提高聲音或做出情緒化的決定。","word":"restraint"}},"restrict":{"createdAt":1783063953960,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"restrict表示「限制、約束」，指有意地控制或減少某事的進行或使用。","options":["expand","promote","restrict","encourage"],"sentence":"The government decided to ______ access to certain websites for national security reasons. Only approved institutions and individuals can now visit these sites.","translation":"政府決定為了國家安全而限制對某些網站的訪問。現在只有獲批准的機構和個人可以訪問這些網站。","word":"restrict"}},"restricted":{"createdAt":1781310338165,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"restricted 表示受到限制或約束，只有符合條件的人才能進入或使用。","options":["welcomed","restricted","encouraged","advertised"],"sentence":"Access to the top floor of the building is ______ to authorized personnel only. Visitors without proper identification cannot enter that area under any circumstances.","translation":"建築物頂層的通道僅限授權人員進入。沒有適當身份證明的訪客在任何情況下都無法進入該區域。","word":"restricted"}},"restriction":{"createdAt":1783841864098,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"restriction 作為名詞，指對某項活動或行為的限制或約束，強調對自由或活動的控制。","options":["allowance","restriction","subsidy","exemption"],"sentence":"The government imposed a ______ on international travel during the pandemic. Citizens were not permitted to leave the country without special approval.","translation":"在疫情期間，政府對國際旅行實施了限制。公民未經特別批准不得離開該國。","word":"restriction"}},"result":{"createdAt":1783927689726,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"result 指的是某個行動、實驗或過程最後得出的結果或成果。","options":["process","result","method","equipment"],"sentence":"The ______ of the experiment was completely different from what we expected. The data showed that the hypothesis was incorrect.","translation":"實驗的結果完全不同於我們的預期。數據顯示假設是不正確的。","word":"result"}},"resume":{"createdAt":1783945487821,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"resume 表示「重新開始」或「恢復某項活動」，指在暫停後繼續進行的工作或活動。","options":["intensify","selection","resume","tend"],"sentence":"After the lunch break, the workers ______ their construction work on the building. The project was delayed but ultimately completed by the deadline.","translation":"午餐休息後，工人們重新開始在建築物上的施工工作。該項目雖然延遲了，但最終在截止日期前完成。","word":"resume"}},"retail":{"createdAt":1783468712840,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"零售（retail）是指直接向消費者銷售商品的商業活動，與只向企業銷售的批發相反。","options":["wholesale","retail","manufacturing","distribution"],"sentence":"The company decided to expand its ______ business by opening stores in shopping malls. They wanted to sell directly to individual customers rather than to other businesses.","translation":"該公司決定通過在購物中心開設門店來擴展其零售業務。他們想直接銷售給個人消費者，而不是其他企業。","word":"retail"}},"retailer":{"createdAt":1781715397125,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"retailer 意為「零售商」，指直接向消費者銷售商品的商家。","options":["manufacturer","retailer","supplier","wholesaler"],"sentence":"The local fashion ______ announced a massive sale to clear out last season's inventory from all their stores. Customers lined up before dawn to purchase discounted clothing at competitive prices.","translation":"當地服裝零售商宣佈進行大規模促銷，以清空所有門店的上季庫存。顧客在天亮前排隊，以競爭性的價格購買打折衣服。","word":"retailer"}},"retain":{"createdAt":1781777331357,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"retain是動詞，表示保留、保有或繼續擁有某人或某物","options":["dismiss","replace","retain","remove"],"sentence":"The school decided to ______ the same principal for another term due to his excellent leadership. Administrators believed his experience and vision were invaluable for the institution's continued growth.","translation":"由於這位校長的卓越領導力，學校決定保留他再任一個任期。管理人員認為他的經驗和遠景對機構的持續發展是無價的。","word":"retain"}},"retaliate":{"createdAt":1787118100422,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"retaliate 是指以同樣的方式來回應傷害或不公正的行為，即報復或以牙還牙。","options":["forgive","retaliate","celebrate","ignore"],"sentence":"After the rival team fouled him unfairly, the player decided to ______ by fouling them back during the next play. His coach immediately benched him for retaliatory behavior.","translation":"在對手隊不公平地犯規後，這名球員決定通過在下一次進攻時犯規來報復。他的教練立即因報復性行為將他換下場。","word":"retaliate"}},"retention":{"createdAt":1785898643637,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"retention 是指保有或維持某物的能力，在這裡指的是公司保有員工的能力，即員工留任率。","options":["promotion","retention","recruitment","suspension"],"sentence":"The company's employee ______ rate has improved significantly after implementing better workplace policies. Their investment in staff development has resulted in fewer people leaving their jobs.","translation":"公司的員工保有率在實施更好的工作場所政策後大幅提高。他們在員工發展方面的投資導致離職人數減少。","word":"retention"}},"retort":{"createdAt":1784794253714,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"retort是指以尖銳或機智的方式做出快速回應，特別是作為對批評或侮辱的反擊。","options":["whisper","retort","question","ignore"],"sentence":"When the critic insulted her work, she ______ with a sharp and witty comeback. Her quick-witted response left the entire audience impressed by her clever ability to respond in kind.","translation":"當評論家侮辱她的作品時，她用尖銳且機智的回應進行反駁。她快速而聰慧的回答讓全場觀眾對她以牙還牙的聰明才智印象深刻。","word":"retort"}},"retreat":{"createdAt":1783656026742,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"retreat 在軍事語境中表示後退或撤退，是有組織的向後移動而非逃跑。","options":["advance","surrender","retreat","escape"],"sentence":"After losing the battle, the general ordered his troops to ______ to a safer location. The soldiers packed up their equipment and moved backward away from enemy lines.","translation":"戰役失敗後，將軍命令他的部隊後退到更安全的地點。士兵們收拾裝備，向後移動，遠離敵軍防線。","word":"retreat"}},"retribution":{"createdAt":1787118100427,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"retribution 指的是對不當行為的懲罰或報應，是一種應有的後果。","options":["mercy","retribution","sympathy","promotion"],"sentence":"The ancient law of ______ demanded that wrongdoers face severe consequences for their crimes. The judge sentenced the criminal to twenty years in prison.","translation":"古老的報應法則要求不法分子為他們的罪行承擔嚴厲後果。法官判處該罪犯二十年監禁。","word":"retribution"}},"retrieve":{"createdAt":1783760354081,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"retrieve 意為「找回、恢復」，在這個句子中指的是尋回遺失的物品。","options":["lose","retrieve","bury","examine"],"sentence":"After losing his wedding ring at the beach, he hoped to ______ it before his wife found out. He hired a metal detector expert to search the sand the next morning.","translation":"他在海灘上丟失了結婚戒指後，希望能夠尋回它，然後才被妻子發現。隔天早上他僱用了一位金屬探測器專家來搜索沙灘。","word":"retrieve"}},"reunion":{"createdAt":1783092623183,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reunion 是名詞，特指久別重逢或重新聚集，強調的是曾經在一起後再次聚合的事件。","options":["celebration","reunion","gathering","meeting"],"sentence":"The family ______ was held at the old country house where everyone had gathered decades ago. Cousins who hadn't seen each other since childhood embraced with tears of joy.","translation":"家族重聚在數十年前大家聚集過的老鄉村房子裡舉辦。從小就沒有見過面的表親們擁抱在一起，淚流滿面地歡喜。","word":"reunion"}},"reveal":{"createdAt":1784191742097,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reveal指揭露、顯露或使某事物為人所知的行為。","options":["locate","reveal","friction","single"],"sentence":"The magician's final trick was designed to ______ the secret behind his illusion. When he showed how it was done, the audience was amazed at the cleverness.","translation":"魔術師的最後一個魔術旨在揭露他幻術背後的秘密。當他展示它是如何完成的時，觀眾對其巧妙感到驚訝。","word":"reveal"}},"revelation":{"createdAt":1785033795934,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"revelation指的是先前隱藏或未知的事實被揭露或暴露出來，通常會令人感到驚訝。","options":["revelation","document","rumor","suggestion"],"sentence":"The ______ that the CEO had been embezzling company funds shocked all the employees. The investigation's findings were presented in a detailed report that exposed years of financial crimes.","translation":"首席執行官一直在挪用公司資金的真相震驚了所有員工。調查的發現在一份詳細的報告中被公開，暴露了多年的財務犯罪。","word":"revelation"}},"revenge":{"createdAt":1783845383675,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"revenge 表示因受到傷害或冒犯而採取行動以報復或惲懲對方。","options":["forgiveness","revenge","collaboration","sympathy"],"sentence":"After losing the championship game, the team sought ______ by defeating their rivals in the rematch. They were determined to settle the score and prove they were the better team.","translation":"在失去冠軍賽後，球隊在複賽中擊敗對手以尋求報復。他們決心扳回一城，證明自己是更強的隊伍。","word":"revenge"}},"revenue":{"createdAt":1781926464745,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"revenue 指政府或企業通過各種來源（如稅收、銷售）獲得的收益或歲入。","options":["expense","profit","revenue","loss"],"sentence":"The government collected significant ______ from taxes this quarter. These funds will be allocated to education, healthcare, and infrastructure projects.","translation":"政府在本季度從稅收中徵集了可觀的稅收收入。這些資金將被分配給教育、醫療和基礎設施項目。","word":"revenue"}},"reverence":{"createdAt":1787554448276,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reverence 指對神聖或偉大事物的深刻尊敬和敬畏，通常表現在恭敬的行為和態度上。","options":["indifference","reverence","curiosity","skepticism"],"sentence":"The ancient temple was treated with ______ by all who entered its sacred halls. Visitors removed their shoes and spoke in whispers to show their deep respect and admiration.","translation":"古老的寺廟受到所有進入其神聖殿堂的人的尊敬。遊客脫掉鞋子，低聲說話，以表達他們深深的尊重和欽佩。","word":"reverence"}},"reverse":{"createdAt":1781581925130,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reverse 作為形容詞表示相反的一面或背面，指物體的另一側或相對的方向。","options":["opposite","reverse","inverse","backward"],"sentence":"The ______ side of the coin showed a different image than the front. When I flipped it over, I discovered an eagle engraved on the back.","translation":"硬幣的反面顯示的圖像與正面不同。當我翻轉它時，我發現背面刻著一隻鷹。","word":"reverse"}},"reversed":{"createdAt":1781362281725,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reversed表示相反的、反轉的，指改變方向或返回先前的狀態。","options":["confirmed","reversed","approved","maintained"],"sentence":"The ______ decision meant they had to go back to their original plan. The previous ruling was overturned and everything returned to how it was before.","translation":"相反的決定意味著他們必須回到最初的計畫。之前的裁決被推翻，一切都回到了之前的樣子。","word":"reversed"}},"review":{"createdAt":1787047083092,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"review（複習）在這裡指的是回顧和重新學習之前學過的知識，以加深理解和記憶。","options":["ignore","review","preview","summarize"],"sentence":"Before the final exam, Maria decided to ______ all the chapters she had studied last semester. She went through her notes and textbook systematically to refresh her memory of the material.","translation":"在期末考試前，瑪麗亞決定複習她上學期學過的所有章節。她系統地查閱了她的筆記和教科書，以重新喚起她對這些材料的記憶。","word":"review"}},"revise":{"createdAt":1787375045689,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"revise意為修正或校訂，指的是對已完成的作品進行檢查和改進，使其更加完善。","options":["ignore","revise","publish","memorize"],"sentence":"The student decided to ______ her essay after receiving feedback from her teacher. She made corrections to the grammar, reorganized several paragraphs, and improved the overall structure based on the comments.","translation":"學生在收到老師的回饋後決定修正她的論文。她根據評論改正了文法、重新組織了幾個段落，並改進了整體結構。","word":"revise"}},"revival":{"createdAt":1781693281411,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"revival（復興）指某事物的重新興起、恢復流行或重新激發人們的興趣。","options":["decline","revival","division","survival"],"sentence":"The 1990s saw a ______ of interest in vintage fashion among young people. Thrift stores reported a significant increase in customers searching for retro clothing styles from previous decades.","translation":"1990年代見證了年輕人對復古時尚興趣的復興。舊衣店報告了尋找前幾十年復古服裝風格的顧客大幅增加。","word":"revival"}},"revive":{"createdAt":1786346829175,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"revive 意思是使某物恢復活力、復原或重新流行，在此指公司從衰退狀態中恢復過來。","options":["destroy","abandon","revive","complicate"],"sentence":"The new management team worked hard to ______ the struggling company. Within months, sales increased dramatically and employees became motivated again as the business regained its competitive edge.","translation":"新的管理團隊努力使這家苦苦掙扎的公司重新振興。在幾個月內，隨著業務重新獲得競爭力，銷售額大幅增長，員工也變得積極主動。","word":"revive"}},"revolt":{"createdAt":1781824444628,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"revolt 動詞表示反抗權威或進行武裝起義，通常指大規模的抵抗運動。","options":["support","surrender","revolt","compromise"],"sentence":"The citizens began to ______ against the oppressive regime after decades of unfair treatment. They organized massive protests and demanded immediate political reforms throughout the country.","translation":"在數十年的不公平待遇後，市民開始反抗壓制性政權。他們組織了大規模抗議活動，並要求全國立即進行政治改革。","word":"revolt"}},"revolution":{"createdAt":1782550983734,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"revolution 在此處指重大的創新或改革，帶來深刻和快速的社會或技術變革","options":["evolution","revolution","invention","discovery"],"sentence":"The digital ______ transformed how people communicate, work, and access information worldwide. The internet fundamentally changed society in ways that were as significant as major historical upheavals.","translation":"數位革新改變了全球人民溝通、工作和獲取資訊的方式。網際網路以與重大歷史變革同樣重要的方式從根本上改變了社會。","word":"revolution"}},"revolutionary":{"createdAt":1782410027824,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"revolutionary指具有革命性的、帶來深刻變革的；第二句強調「完全改變」和「改變整個產業」，說明這項技術的影響是根本性的，而非單純的改進。","options":["modern","revolutionary","expensive","portable"],"sentence":"The smartphone was a ______ technology that completely transformed how people communicate and access information. It changed the entire industry and the way billions of people live their daily lives.","translation":"智慧型手機是一項革命性的技術，徹底改變了人們溝通和獲取資訊的方式。它改變了整個產業以及數十億人日常生活的方式。","word":"revolutionary"}},"revolve":{"createdAt":1784911952477,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"revolve 特別強調圍繞中心物體的軌道運動，而不是物體本身的自轉。","options":["rotate","revolve","spin","orbit"],"sentence":"The planets ______ around the sun in predictable orbits. This motion has been occurring for billions of years and governs the seasons and celestial mechanics.","translation":"行星繞著太陽____。這種運動已經持續了數十億年，並控制著季節和天體力學。","word":"revolve"}},"reward":{"createdAt":1784960721538,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"reward是名詞，表示因為做了某件好事或找到了什麼東西而獲得的獎賞、獎金或報酬。","options":["punishment","reward","complaint","request"],"sentence":"The company offered a generous ______ to anyone who could find the lost documents. After three days, an employee discovered them and received the promised cash prize.","translation":"公司為任何能找到丟失文件的人提供慷慨的獎賞。三天後，一名員工發現了文件並獲得了承諾的現金獎金。","word":"reward"}},"rhetoric":{"createdAt":1784876876659,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rhetoric 是指為了說服或影響他人而使用的言辭和說話技巧，通常帶有修辭性、煽動性或裝飾性的語言。","options":["logic","rhetoric","humor","modesty"],"sentence":"The politician's ______ was filled with emotional appeals and exaggeration rather than factual evidence. Critics argued that his flowery language was designed to manipulate voters' feelings instead of presenting substantive policy details.","translation":"那位政治人物的雄辯言辭充滿了情感訴求和誇大其詞，而非事實根據。批評者辯稱他華麗的語言是為了操縱選民的感受，而不是提出實質的政策細節。","word":"rhetoric"}},"rhinoceros":{"createdAt":1783402916390,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"rhinoceros 是一種大型的陸生哺乳動物，以其頭上的一個或多個角而聞名，常見於非洲和亞洲。","options":["elephant","giraffe","rhinoceros","hippopotamus"],"sentence":"The wildlife documentary featured footage of a massive ______ charging through the African savanna. This endangered animal, known for its distinctive horn, is one of the world's most impressive mammals.","translation":"野生動物紀錄片展示了一隻巨大的犀牛在非洲草原上奔跑的鏡頭。這種瀕危動物以其獨特的角而聞名，是世界上最令人印象深刻的哺乳動物之一。","word":"rhinoceros"}},"rhyme":{"createdAt":1784105435517,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"rhyme 作為動詞表示詞語的末尾發音相同或相似，形成押韻效果。","options":["rhyme","flow","dance","echo"],"sentence":"The poet carefully chose words that ______ with each other to create a musical quality in the verse. She paired \"cat\" with \"hat\" and \"moon\" with \"June\" to demonstrate how the ending sounds match perfectly.","translation":"詩人精心選擇彼此押韻的詞語來創造詩句中的音樂質感。她將「cat」與「hat」配對，將「moon」與「June」配對，以展示結尾聲音如何完美匹配。","word":"rhyme"}},"rhythm":{"createdAt":1783841864097,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rhythm 作為名詞，指音樂、詩歌、舞蹈等的節奏和節律，強調重複出現的有規律的模式。","options":["harmony","rhythm","melody","volume"],"sentence":"The dancer moved perfectly in ______ with the music. Every step, every turn, and every gesture synchronized precisely with the beat and tempo.","translation":"舞者的動作與音樂的節奏完美配合。每一步、每一轉身和每一個姿態都與節拍和速度精確同步。","word":"rhythm"}},"rib":{"createdAt":1781665727115,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rib 指人體胸腔的肋骨，是保護內臟器官的骨骼結構，共12對。","options":["shoulder","rib","ankle","finger"],"sentence":"The accident caused a severe fracture in his left ______, making it painful to breathe. The doctor recommended complete rest for six weeks to allow proper healing.","translation":"事故導致他左邊肋骨嚴重骨折，使呼吸變得痛苦。醫生建議完全休息六週以促進正確癒合。","word":"rib"}},"rid":{"createdAt":1783760526714,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"rid指使某人或某事物免除或擺脫不需要的東西或狀態，常用於表達消除負面的人或物。","options":["rid","remind","reward","retain"],"sentence":"Sarah wanted to ______ herself of the bad habit of checking her phone constantly throughout the day. She decided to leave her phone in another room during work hours so she could focus better.","translation":"莎拉想擺脫整天不斷查看手機的壞習慣。她決定在工作時間將手機留在另一個房間，這樣她可以更好地集中注意力。","word":"rid"}},"rides":{"createdAt":1787049756214,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rides是指遊樂園或嘉年華中供人乘坐娛樂的設施。","options":["games","rides","shows","foods"],"sentence":"The children enjoyed the thrilling ______ at the amusement park all afternoon. The roller coaster was the fastest and most exciting one available.","translation":"孩子們整個下午都在遊樂園裡享受刺激的遊樂設施。過山車是最快、最令人興奮的設施。","word":"rides"}},"ridicule":{"createdAt":1781449095506,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ridicule意為嘲笑或戲弄，指用嘲諷的方式對待或評論他人。","options":["praise","ridicule","ignore","help"],"sentence":"The bully would ______ his classmate's appearance every day at school. The victim felt humiliated and hurt by these constant mocking comments.","translation":"霸凌者每天在學校嘲笑他同學的外貌。受害者因為這些不斷的嘲笑評論感到羞辱和受傷。","word":"ridicule"}},"ridiculous":{"createdAt":1784701140003,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"ridiculous 形容詞表示非常荒唐、可笑或不值得認真對待的，充滿了愚蠢的特性。","options":["sensible","practical","ridiculous","reasonable"],"sentence":"The proposal to ban all bicycles from the city streets was absolutely ______ and sparked outrage among residents. The city council withdrew the suggestion after realizing how absurd and impractical it truly was.","translation":"禁止所有自行車在城市街道上行駛的提議完全荒唐，引發了居民的憤怒。市議會在意識到這個建議多麼荒謬和不切實際後，撤回了該提議。","word":"ridiculous"}},"rigid":{"createdAt":1782357080126,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rigid 用來形容規則或政策時，表示非常嚴格、不靈活、沒有迴旋餘地的特性。","options":["flexible","rigid","modern","casual"],"sentence":"The company has a ______ dress code that requires all employees to wear formal business attire every single day. Employees who tried to wear casual clothing on Fridays were immediately told it was not permitted.","translation":"這家公司有一套僵直嚴格的著裝規則，要求所有員工每天都必須穿著正式商務服裝。試圖在星期五穿著休閒服裝的員工被立即告知這是不被允許的。","word":"rigid"}},"rigorous":{"createdAt":1784570169577,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rigorous 指的是嚴格的、精確的、要求高的態度或標準，特別是在學術或科學領域中強調精確性和完整性。","options":["flexible","rigorous","lenient","casual"],"sentence":"The professor's ______ grading standards required students to submit perfectly formatted assignments with no errors. Her meticulous approach meant that even minor mistakes would result in significant point deductions.","translation":"這位教授的嚴格評分標準要求學生提交格式完美、沒有錯誤的作業。她一絲不苟的方法意味著即使是小錯誤也會導致大量扣分。","word":"rigorous"}},"rim":{"createdAt":1784961185443,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rim是指物體的外緣或邊沿，特別強調可以放置物品的邊界部分；在此句中指桌子的邊緣能夠放置眼鏡。","options":["edge","rim","border","side"],"sentence":"She carefully placed her glasses on the ______ of the table before diving into the pool. The edge was just wide enough to keep them from falling off.","translation":"她在跳進游泳池之前小心地把眼鏡放在桌子的邊緣。邊緣的寬度剛好足以防止它們掉下來。","word":"rim"}},"rinser":{"createdAt":1784301551070,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rinser 是一種沖洗的裝置或工具，用來用水沖洗物體以去除污垢、肥皂或其他物質。","options":["scrubber","rinser","drainer","sterilizer"],"sentence":"The restaurant installed a high-pressure ______ at each sink to quickly clean dishes after they were washed with soap. This device sprayed hot water forcefully to remove any remaining food particles and soap residue.","translation":"這家餐廳在每個水槽都安裝了一個高壓沖洗器，以便在用肥皂清洗後快速沖洗盤子。這個裝置用力噴射熱水來去除任何剩餘的食物顆粒和肥皂殘留物。","word":"rinser"}},"riot":{"createdAt":1781665727113,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"riot 指暴亂或騷亂，指多人參與的暴力事件，伴隨破壞和混亂。","options":["parade","discussion","riot","seminar"],"sentence":"The protest escalated into a full-scale ______ when tensions between demonstrators and police became violent. Fires were set, windows were broken, and hundreds of people were injured.","translation":"當示威者和警察之間的衝突變成暴力事件時，抗議升級為全面的暴亂。火災被點燃，窗戶被打破，數百人受傷。","word":"riot"}},"rip":{"createdAt":1781840892407,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rip表示撕裂或撕破，描述衣物被利物割破的情況。","options":["fold","rip","iron","wash"],"sentence":"He accidentally ______ his new shirt on the sharp nail sticking out from the wall. The damage was so severe that the garment was no longer wearable.","translation":"他不小心在牆上突出的尖釘上撕破了他的新襯衫。損傷非常嚴重，以至於衣服不再可穿。","word":"rip"}},"ripe":{"createdAt":1781362281663,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ripe表示水果已經成熟，可以食用或採摘。","options":["green","ripe","frozen","sour"],"sentence":"The ______ fruit fell from the tree and was ready to eat. It had developed a sweet aroma and deep yellow color.","translation":"成熟的水果從樹上掉下來，已經可以吃了。它已經散發出甜蜜的香氣並呈現深黃色。","word":"ripe"}},"ripple":{"createdAt":1783946375012,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"ripple指的是水面上由於擾動而產生的細小波浪或漣漪，通常呈現圓形擴散的模式。","options":["ripple","current","splash","tide"],"sentence":"She tossed a stone into the calm pond and watched a ______ spread across the water's surface. The small wave gradually expanded outward in circular rings until it faded away.","translation":"她把一塊石頭扔進平靜的池塘，看著涟漪在水面上擴散。小波浪逐漸向外擴展成圓形波紋，直到消退。","word":"ripple"}},"rise":{"createdAt":1781582424690,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"rise作為名詞表示上升或增加，與climbed higher and higher相符，fall(下降)、cycle(循環)和pattern(模式)都不符合。","options":["fall","cycle","rise","pattern"],"sentence":"The temperature showed a significant ______ over the past week. The thermometer climbed higher and higher each day.","translation":"過去一週內溫度出現了顯著的上升。溫度計每天都爬得越來越高。","word":"rise"}},"rising":{"createdAt":1781582251996,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"rising 是形容詞，表示在增加、上升或提高的趨勢。","options":["falling","stable","rising","freezing"],"sentence":"The ______ temperature in the city broke all previous records this summer. The thermometer continued to climb higher each day throughout July and August.","translation":"城市的上升溫度打破了今年夏天所有以前的記錄。整個七月和八月期間，溫度計每天都在持續上升。","word":"rising"}},"risk":{"createdAt":1785406388593,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"risk 作為動詞表示「冒著...的危險」，意思是願意面對可能的負面結果以換取潛在收益。","options":["avoid","risk","ignore","delay"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ investing in a new market despite economic uncertainty. They carefully analyzed potential losses before committing their resources.","translation":"儘管經濟不確定，該公司決定冒著投資新市場的風險。他們在承諾資源之前仔細分析了潛在損失。","word":"risk"}},"risky":{"createdAt":1781824444606,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"risky 形容詞表示某事物存在危險、損失或失敗的可能性，通常用於警告情境。","options":["safe","stable","risky","profitable"],"sentence":"Investing all your savings in a single startup is a ______ financial decision. Many experienced investors warn against putting money into unproven companies with uncertain futures.","translation":"將所有積蓄投資於單一初創公司是一個危險的財務決定。許多經驗豐富的投資者警告不要將資金投入於未經驗證且前景不確定的公司。","word":"risky"}},"rite":{"createdAt":1781429810243,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rite是指宗教或文化上的正式儀式或典禮，通常具有重要的象徵意義。","options":["detail","rite","firecracker","temperature"],"sentence":"The wedding ______ included exchanging vows and rings in front of family and friends. This sacred ceremony has been practiced in their culture for generations.","translation":"婚禮儀式包括在家人和朋友面前交換誓言和戒指。這個神聖的儀式在他們的文化中已經實踐了很多代。","word":"rite"}},"ritual":{"createdAt":1784868215556,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"ritual 表示經常重複進行的固定儀式或慣例；random（隨機）、surprise（驚喜）和 adventure（冒險）都不符合「固定重複」的特徵。","options":["ritual","random","surprise","adventure"],"sentence":"Every morning, Sarah follows the same ______ of meditation and exercise. This repeated routine has become such an essential part of her day that she feels incomplete without it.","translation":"每天早上，莎拉都遵循相同的冥想和運動儀式。這個重複的慣例已經成為她生活中不可或缺的一部分，沒有它她就感到不完整。","word":"ritual"}},"rival":{"createdAt":1782491138501,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rival 表示競爭或對抗中的對手，指在同一領域或事業中競爭或較勁的人。","options":["territory","rival","investigation","dividend"],"sentence":"The two tennis players were fierce competitors, and their ______ pushed each to perform at their absolute best. Every match between them was hotly contested and watched by thousands of fans.","translation":"這兩名網球運動員是激烈的競爭者，他們的對手推動彼此發揮最佳水平。他們之間的每一場比賽都是激烈的競爭，並被數千名粉絲觀看。","word":"rival"}},"rivalry":{"createdAt":1782491138502,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rivalry 表示兩個或多個人或組織之間的競爭或對抗關係，通常涉及相互較勁和競爭。","options":["nightmare","rivalry","glow","ownership"],"sentence":"The ______ between the two companies had lasted for decades as they competed fiercely for market dominance. Their constant battles for customers and profits drove both organizations to innovate constantly.","translation":"這兩家公司之間的相互較勁已經持續了幾十年，因為他們激烈地競爭市場主導地位。他們為爭奪客戶和利潤的持續戰鬥推動兩個組織不斷創新。","word":"rivalry"}},"roam":{"createdAt":1785339147810,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"roam表示在廣大地區內不受限制地漫遊或閒逛，強調無目的地四處行動的動作。","options":["gallop","roam","graze","wander"],"sentence":"The wild horses ______ freely across the vast grasslands without any fences or barriers. They wandered for miles every day in search of fresh vegetation.","translation":"野馬在遼闊的草原上自由地漫遊，沒有任何柵欄或障礙。牠們每天漫步數英里尋找新鮮的植被。","word":"roam"}},"rob":{"createdAt":1783063660622,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rob 是指用暴力或威脅來搶奪他人的財物或金錢。","options":["visit","rob","repair","inspect"],"sentence":"The criminals planned to ______ the bank during the night shift. Police arrested them before they could steal the money from the vault.","translation":"犯罪分子計劃在夜班期間搶劫銀行。警察在他們能夠從金庫盜竊金錢之前逮捕了他們。","word":"rob"}},"robbery":{"createdAt":1782401868812,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"robbery 表示武裝盜竊或搶劫行為。","options":["accident","robbery","disaster","incident"],"sentence":"The police officer investigated the ______ that occurred at the bank last night. The thieves stole over one million dollars in cash.","translation":"警察調查了昨晚在銀行發生的搶案。盜賊偷走了超過一百萬美元的現金。","word":"robbery"}},"robust":{"createdAt":1787564137110,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"robust 用來形容系統或結構既堅固耐用又能夠應對各種挑戰和壓力，在本句中指該系統即使面臨攻擊也能保持穩定運作。","options":["fragile","robust","complex","expensive"],"sentence":"The company built a ______ system that could handle millions of transactions per day without crashing. Even during the unexpected server attacks last month, the infrastructure remained stable and fully operational.","translation":"該公司建立了一個能夠每天處理數百萬筆交易而不會崩潰的堅固系統。即使在上個月出現意外的伺服器攻擊期間，該基礎設施仍然保持穩定並完全正常運作。","word":"robust"}},"rod":{"createdAt":1781651261365,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rod在此指釣竿或其他長的杆狀物體，是一根可以拿握的硬棒形工具。","options":["treasury","rod","overtake","midst"],"sentence":"The fishing guide handed me a ______ and pointed toward the river. I held the long wooden shaft firmly and prepared to cast my line into the water.","translation":"釣魚嚮導遞給我一根竿，指向河流。我緊緊握住這根長木軸，準備將釣線投入水中。","word":"rod"}},"roll":{"createdAt":1782550057064,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"roll用作動詞表示使某物翻滾或滾動，特別是圓形物體在表面上轉動移動。","options":["float","roll","swing","jump"],"sentence":"The child watched the ball ______ down the steep hill and disappear into the bushes. He chased after it as fast as he could, but it moved faster than he could run.","translation":"孩子看著球在陡峭的山坡上滾下去並消失在灌木叢中。他盡快追趕它，但它移動得比他能跑的速度更快。","word":"roll"}},"rot":{"createdAt":1783256139027,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rot 是指物質因為分解或腐蝕而逐漸毀壞。","options":["strengthen","rot","harden","preserve"],"sentence":"If the wooden beams are not treated, they will begin to ______ within a few years. Termites and moisture will cause severe structural damage to the house.","translation":"如果木樑沒有得到處理，它們會在幾年內開始腐爛。白蟻和潮濕會對房屋結構造成嚴重損害。","word":"rot"}},"rotate":{"createdAt":1782477421077,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"rotate 表示使某物或人按照一定順序交替變換位置或職責，形成循環系統。","options":["rotate","abandon","cancel","extend"],"sentence":"The employees ______ shifts on a weekly basis to ensure fair coverage across all time periods. This schedule means each worker experiences different working hours throughout the month.","translation":"員工按周輪流輪換班次以確保所有時段都有公平的人員配置。這個日程表意味著每位工人在整個月內會經歷不同的工作時間。","word":"rotate"}},"rotation":{"createdAt":1787902089826,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rotation指物體繞其自身軸線的旋轉運動，在這句話中指地球繞太陽運行一周的循環過程。","options":["orbit","rotation","revolution","spin"],"sentence":"The Earth completes one full ______ around the sun every 365 days. This yearly cycle determines the seasons and is essential for all life on our planet.","translation":"地球每365天圍繞太陽完成一次完整的旋轉。這個年度週期決定了季節，對地球上的所有生命都至關重要。","word":"rotation"}},"rotten":{"createdAt":1781625891336,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rotten表示食物或物品因腐朽、變質而不適合使用或食用","options":["fresh","rotten","sweet","firm"],"sentence":"The fruit had turned ______ and was covered in mold. We had to throw it away because it was no longer safe to eat.","translation":"水果已經腐爛並且長滿了黴菌。我們必須把它扔掉，因為它已經不安全食用了。","word":"rotten"}},"rough":{"createdAt":1784176210344,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rough在這裡表示大致的、粗略的，指的是不精確的初步估計或概括。","options":["precise","rough","final","certified"],"sentence":"The contractor gave a ______ estimate of $10,000 for the renovation project. The final cost would be determined after a detailed inspection.","translation":"承包商為翻新項目給出了約10,000美元的粗略估計。最終成本將在詳細檢查後確定。","word":"rough"}},"roughly":{"createdAt":1781848934137,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"roughly用來表示大概或大約，不是精確的數字","options":["exactly","roughly","legally","secretly"],"sentence":"The project will cost ______ $50,000 to complete. We might spend a bit more or less depending on unexpected expenses.","translation":"這個項目完成大約需要50,000美元。根據意外開支，我們可能花費更多或更少。","word":"roughly"}},"route":{"createdAt":1781431278557,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"route表示行進的路徑或途線，與destination（目的地）、vehicle（車輛）和schedule（時間表）不同。","options":["destination","route","vehicle","schedule"],"sentence":"The delivery driver took a different ______ to avoid traffic on the highway. He turned left at the intersection and followed the GPS directions through residential streets.","translation":"送貨司機採取了不同的路線以避免高速公路上的交通。他在十字路口向左轉，並按照GPS方向穿過住宅街道。","word":"route"}},"routine":{"createdAt":1782980805884,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"routine 作形容詞，表示按照既定模式或習慣進行的、常規的、例行公事的事物。","options":["unusual","special","routine","urgent"],"sentence":"The hospital staff performed ______ medical checkups on all new patients. These standard procedures were conducted the same way for every single person who arrived.","translation":"醫院工作人員對所有新患者進行例行的醫療檢查。這些標準程序對每一位到達的患者都以相同的方式進行。","word":"routine"}},"rover":{"createdAt":1783243171142,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rover在這裡是指專門用於探測星球表面的自動駕駛探測機器，特別是火星車，能夠在外星球進行科學任務。","options":["wanderer","rover","explorer","satellite"],"sentence":"The NASA ______ successfully landed on Mars and began collecting soil samples. Scientists monitored its movements across the red planet's surface for several years.","translation":"美國太空總署的火星車成功著陸火星並開始收集土壤樣本。科學家們在幾年內監測了它在紅色星球表面的移動。","word":"rover"}},"royal":{"createdAt":1781626081100,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"royal 作為形容詞表示與國王、皇帝或王室有關的，用於描述屬於或涉及統治階級的人物或事物。","options":["royal","common","ordinary","peasant"],"sentence":"The ______ family attended the grand ceremony in their ceremonial robes and jewels. Members of the palace, including the king and his immediate relatives, graced the event with their presence.","translation":"皇室成員穿著禮儀服飾和珠寶出席了盛大的典禮。宮殿成員，包括國王和他的直系親屬，出席了這項活動。","word":"royal"}},"royalty":{"createdAt":1782562471169,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"royalty指王室成員或皇族成員，特別是指擁有王權的人，在此句中準確描述英國王家的成員身份。","options":["nobility","royalty","aristocracy","dynasty"],"sentence":"The British ______ includes the King, Queen, and their immediate family members. Prince William and Prince George are part of this exclusive group that represents the monarchy.","translation":"英國王室包括國王、王后和他們的直系家庭成員。威廉王子和喬治王子是代表君主制的這個排他性團體的一部分。","word":"royalty"}},"rub":{"createdAt":1781661288532,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rub 是指用手或物體在表面上進行摩擦或按壓的動作","options":["ignore","rub","observe","measure"],"sentence":"The massage therapist began to ______ the client's sore shoulders with firm, circular motions. After thirty minutes of this soothing treatment, the patient's muscle tension finally started to release.","translation":"按摩治療師開始用有力的圓形動作摩擦客戶酸痛的肩膀。經過三十分鐘的舒緩治療後，患者的肌肉緊張終於開始釋放。","word":"rub"}},"rubbish":{"createdAt":1781746685497,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rubbish指的是垃圾、廢物，是日常生活中產生的不需要的物質。","options":["obedience","rubbish","miracle","tolerance"],"sentence":"The sanitation workers collected the ______ from every house on the street. They placed all the waste materials into the truck for disposal.","translation":"清潔工人從街上每棟房子收集垃圾。他們將所有廢棄物放入卡車中進行處理。","word":"rubbish"}},"rude":{"createdAt":1782265565180,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rude 意指沒有禮貌、粗暴或不尊重他人的行為或態度。","options":["polite","rude","quiet","confused"],"sentence":"The ______ customer shouted at the waiter without any politeness. His aggressive behavior and lack of respect made everyone uncomfortable in the restaurant.","translation":"那位粗魯的顧客對服務員大喊大叫，毫無禮貌。他的侵略性行為和缺乏尊重使餐廳裡的每個人都感到不舒服。","word":"rude"}},"rugged":{"createdAt":1786352662688,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rugged用來形容地形或地面粗糙、崎嶇不平，需要體力和勇氣才能通過的特性。","options":["smooth","rugged","gentle","flat"],"sentence":"The hiker chose a ______ path through the mountains that tested her strength and determination. The steep terrain with rocky outcrops and uneven ground required careful footing at every step.","translation":"登山者選擇了一條穿過山脈的崎嶇小徑來測試她的力量和決心。陡峭的地形、岩石露頭和不平的地面在每一步都需要謹慎踩踏。","word":"rugged"}},"ruin":{"createdAt":1782644423626,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"ruin是名詞，意為遺蹟或廢墟，指過去結構仍然存在但已經毀損的建築物。","options":["treasure","monument","ruin","fortress"],"sentence":"The old castle stood as a ______ overlooking the valley for centuries. Visitors could still see the remains of its once-grand stone walls and towers.","translation":"這座古老的城堡作為遺蹟俯瞰山谷已有數個世紀。遊客們仍然可以看到它曾經宏偉的石牆和塔樓的殘骸。","word":"ruin"}},"ruler":{"createdAt":1785904475013,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"ruler 有兩個常見意思：一是統治者或領導者，二是用來測量的尺；在這個題目中，第一句指統治者，第二句指測量工具，只有 ruler 這個詞能同時滿足兩個句子的含義。","options":["leader","monarch","ruler","king"],"sentence":"The ______ used a fair system of laws to govern the kingdom. The carpenter measured the wood with a measuring ______ to ensure precise dimensions.","translation":"統治者用公平的法律體系來統治王國。木匠用測量尺來測量木材以確保尺寸精確。","word":"ruler"}},"rumor":{"createdAt":1782200669360,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rumor指的是未經證實的說法或謠言，題目中「被證實為完全虛假」的線索明確指出答案是謠言而非事實或正式宣告。","options":["fact","rumor","announcement","decision"],"sentence":"A ______ spread through the office that the company would be closing next month. However, the CEO later issued a statement confirming that all reports were completely false and unfounded.","translation":"公司裡流傳著一個謠言，說公司將在下個月關閉。不過，執行長後來發表聲明，證實所有報導都完全是虛假和毫無根據的。","word":"rumor"}},"runaway":{"createdAt":1784818310063,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"runaway 可作名詞指逃亡者或逃脫者，通常指因各種原因而逃離的人。","options":["criminal","runaway","witness","suspect"],"sentence":"The police arrested the ______ who had fled the city three weeks earlier. Investigators confirmed that he had been living in an abandoned warehouse after escaping from custody.","translation":"警察逮捕了三週前逃離城市的逃亡者。調查人員證實他在越獄後一直住在一個廢棄倉庫裡。","word":"runaway"}},"rural":{"createdAt":1782637076477,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rural 意為鄉村的、農村的，用來描述遠離城市的農業地區。","options":["urban","rural","industrial","commercial"],"sentence":"The ______ area had very few buildings and was surrounded by farms and forests. Most of the people living there worked as farmers or in agriculture-related jobs.","translation":"那個鄉村地區建築物很少，周圍都是農場和森林。住在那裡的大多數人從事農業或與農業相關的工作。","word":"rural"}},"rush":{"createdAt":1781951900954,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rush表示倉促、急速地做某事，通常暗示不夠仔細或容易出錯，與「仔細做」相對立。","options":["complete","rush","finish","start"],"sentence":"Don't ______ through your homework; take your time to do it carefully and correctly. Hurrying often leads to silly mistakes that could have been avoided.","translation":"不要匆忙完成你的家庭作業；花時間仔細正確地做。急速完成往往會導致本可避免的愚蠢錯誤。","word":"rush"}},"rushed":{"createdAt":1785886850815,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rushed 表示匆忙、倉促進行的，通常帶有負面含義，指沒有充分準備或時間就倉促做出的行動。","options":["careful","rushed","deliberate","strategic"],"sentence":"The ______ decision to launch the product without proper testing turned out to be a major mistake. The company later admitted they should have taken more time to plan and review before moving forward.","translation":"那個倉促的決定在沒有經過適當測試就推出產品，結果證明是個重大錯誤。公司後來承認他們應該在推進之前花更多時間來計劃和審查。","word":"rushed"}},"rust":{"createdAt":1784962580670,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"rust 是指金屬表面因與空氣或水接觸而產生的氧化物，通常呈紅棕色，會逐漸破壞金屬的質量。","options":["dust","rust","mold","paint"],"sentence":"The old metal gate was covered in orange ______ after years of exposure to rain and moisture. The oxidation process had turned the iron into a flaky, reddish-brown substance that weakened the metal's structure.","translation":"老金屬大門在多年暴露於雨水和濕氣中後，被橙色的鐵鏽覆蓋。氧化過程已將鐵轉變為易碎的紅棕色物質，削弱了金屬的結構。","word":"rust"}},"ruthless":{"createdAt":1781693293272,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ruthless 是形容詞，意思是「無情的」、「冷酷的」或「殘忍的」，形容沒有同情心的人或行為。","options":["priceless","ruthless","executive","philosopher"],"sentence":"The dictator's ______ regime was responsible for countless human rights violations. Dissidents who opposed the government simply disappeared without a trace.","translation":"獨裁者的無情政權造成了無數的人權侵犯。反對政府的異議人士簡直是人間蒸發。","word":"ruthless"}},"sacred":{"createdAt":1784624699791,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sacred 意指神聖的、受尊敬的，通常用於描述宗教或精神上具有重要意義的事物或地方。","options":["common","sacred","old","valuable"],"sentence":"Many religions consider certain texts to be ______ and worthy of reverence. In some cultures, these holy writings are treated with such respect that only priests are allowed to handle them.","translation":"許多宗教認為某些文本是神聖的，值得尊敬。在某些文化中，這些聖潔的著作受到如此尊重，只有神職人員被允許接觸它們。","word":"sacred"}},"sacrifice":{"createdAt":1781360333384,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sacrifice 表示放棄或獻出某物以換取更重要的東西，常用於做出重大的犧牲。","options":["gain","preserve","sacrifice","enjoy"],"sentence":"The soldier was willing to ______ his life for his country. He knew that dying in battle was the ultimate price he might have to pay.","translation":"那位士兵願意為國家犧牲自己的生命。他知道在戰鬥中喪生是他可能要付出的最高代價。","word":"sacrifice"}},"sail":{"createdAt":1788959648579,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sail 作為名詞指帆，題目中第二句說「帆布捕捉風」明確描述了帆的功能和用途。","options":["anchor","sail","deck","mast"],"sentence":"The wind filled the ship's white ______ as it left the harbor early in the morning. The canvas caught the breeze and propelled the vessel forward across the open ocean.","translation":"當船在清晨離開港口時，風充滿了船隻的白色帆。帆布捕捉微風，將船隻推向廣闊的海洋。","word":"sail"}},"sailor":{"createdAt":1788959648578,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sailor 指的是水手或海員，題目中第二句強調「他的船員依賴他在海上的專業」體現了 sailor 在航海中的角色。","options":["captain","sailor","carpenter","chef"],"sentence":"The experienced ______ climbed the rigging to adjust the sails during the storm at sea. His crew depended on his expertise navigating the ship through rough waters.","translation":"這位經驗豐富的水手在海上風暴中爬上索具調整帆。他的船員依賴他在洶湧波浪中駕駛船隻的專業知識。","word":"sailor"}},"sake":{"createdAt":1781360333390,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sake 表示目的、緣故或理由，常用於短語「for the sake of」表示為了某人或某事的利益。","options":["criticism","sake","amusement","debate"],"sentence":"For the ______ of his family's happiness, Mr. Chen decided to relocate to a safer neighborhood. He believed that protecting his loved ones was worth any personal inconvenience.","translation":"為了家人的幸福，陳先生決定搬到一個更安全的社區。他相信保護親人值得任何個人的不便。","word":"sake"}},"salary":{"createdAt":1781360333388,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"salary 是指員工由僱主按期支付的固定報酬，通常是按月或按年計算。","options":["gift","loan","salary","bonus"],"sentence":"The company offered John a monthly ______ of $3,500 for his new position. He was satisfied with the financial package they provided.","translation":"公司為約翰的新職位提供了每月3,500美元的薪水。他對他們提供的財務待遇感到滿意。","word":"salary"}},"salmon":{"createdAt":1785119661242,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"salmon是指鮭魚，具有獨特的溯溪產卵行為，會在繁殖季節游回上游。","options":["dolphins","salmon","whales","sharks"],"sentence":"During spawning season, thousands of ______ swim upstream against the river current. This remarkable migration journey covers hundreds of miles as they return to their birthplace.","translation":"在產卵季節，數千條鮭魚逆流而上游動。這次非凡的遷徙旅程覆蓋數百英里，因為它們回到出生地。","word":"salmon"}},"salon":{"createdAt":1785824979183,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"salon是指舉辦文化或社交聚會的豪華會客室或沙龍，通常聚集知識分子和社會名流。","options":["salon","kitchen","bedroom","garage"],"sentence":"The wealthy nobleman hosted an intellectual gathering in his grand ______ on Friday evening. Distinguished artists, writers, and philosophers discussed philosophy and literature in that elegant reception room.","translation":"這位富有的貴族在週五晚上在他宏偉的會客室舉辦了一場知識分子聚會。傑出的藝術家、作家和哲學家在那個優雅的招待室裡討論哲學和文學。","word":"salon"}},"salute":{"createdAt":1781794866348,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"salute在軍事環境中指敬禮，是向上級或旗幟表示尊敬的正式舉動。","options":["ignore","salute","insult","embrace"],"sentence":"The soldiers would ______ their commanding officer every morning at dawn. This gesture of respect was a mandatory military tradition that demonstrated obedience and discipline.","translation":"士兵們每天黎明時都會______ 他們的指揮官。這種尊敬的舉動是強制性的軍事傳統，表達了服從和紀律。","word":"salute"}},"salvage":{"createdAt":1781362281657,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"salvage表示搶救或搶救可用的東西，特別是從損壞或危險的情況中。","options":["damage","salvage","abandon","destroy"],"sentence":"The divers worked to ______ valuable items from the sunken ship. They managed to recover precious artifacts and cargo from the ocean floor.","translation":"潛水員努力從沉沒的船隻中搶救貴重物品。他們成功地從海底恢復了珍貴的文物和貨物。","word":"salvage"}},"sandal":{"createdAt":1781360333386,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sandal 是一種開放式的鞋類，通常在溫暖的季節穿著，讓腳部能夠透氣。","options":["boot","sneaker","sandal","loafer"],"sentence":"On hot summer days, Tom prefers to wear a comfortable ______ instead of closed shoes. The open design allows his feet to breathe in the humid weather.","translation":"在炎熱的夏天，湯姆喜歡穿著舒適的涼鞋而不是封閉的鞋子。開放的設計使他的腳在潮濕的天氣中透氣。","word":"sandal"}},"sanitation":{"createdAt":1785893497483,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sanitation 是指下水道設施和衛生設備，用於管理污水和廢物，以保持公共衛生。","options":["education","sanitation","transportation","entertainment"],"sentence":"The city invested millions in improving ______ by building new sewage systems and treatment plants. Without proper waste management infrastructure, diseases spread quickly through communities.","translation":"該市投資數百萬改善下水道設施，通過建設新的污水系統和處理廠。沒有適當的廢物管理基礎設施，疾病會迅速在社區中傳播。","word":"sanitation"}},"satellite":{"createdAt":1781961466407,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"satellite 是指繞行星球運行的人造或天然天體，能夠從軌道上傳輸資料或進行觀測。","options":["satellite","telescope","rocket","drone"],"sentence":"The space agency launched a new ______ into orbit to improve weather forecasting across the region. This advanced equipment transmits data back to Earth every few minutes to monitor atmospheric conditions.","translation":"太空機構將一顆新的衛星發射到軌道上，以改進該地區的天氣預報。這套先進設備每隔幾分鐘就向地球傳輸資料以監測大氣狀況。","word":"satellite"}},"satisfaction":{"createdAt":1781360333385,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"satisfaction 是指對某事物感到滿足和高興的感受，通常來自達成目標或期望被滿足。","options":["confusion","frustration","satisfaction","exhaustion"],"sentence":"After completing her master's degree, Maria felt a sense of ______ with her academic achievements. She smiled knowing that all her hard work had finally paid off.","translation":"完成碩士學位後，瑪麗亞對自己的學術成就感到滿意。她微笑著，知道自己所有的辛苦最終得到了回報。","word":"satisfaction"}},"satisfactory":{"createdAt":1783661880051,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"satisfactory 是形容詞，表示令人滿意且充分，恰好符合第二句所述的「符合最低要求」。","options":["exceptional","poor","satisfactory","failing"],"sentence":"The student's test score was ______, earning a passing grade. Although not perfect, the result met the minimum requirements.","translation":"學生的測試分數是令人滿意的，獲得了及格分數。雖然不完美，但結果符合最低要求。","word":"satisfactory"}},"satisfied":{"createdAt":1784341313977,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"satisfied 是形容詞，表示「感到滿意的」或「滿足的」，通常搭配 with 使用，意指對某事物感到滿意。","options":["confused","satisfied","frustrated","angry"],"sentence":"The customer was not ______ with the quality of the product he received. He complained to the manager and demanded a full refund because the item did not meet his expectations.","translation":"那位顧客對他收到的產品品質不______。他向經理投訴並要求全額退款，因為該商品未符合他的期望。","word":"satisfied"}},"satisfy":{"createdAt":1781360333391,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"satisfy 表示使人感到滿足和滿意，通常指滿足期望或需求。","options":["disappoint","annoy","satisfy","frustrate"],"sentence":"The restaurant's excellent service and delicious food helped ______ every customer who visited that evening. Many guests left positive reviews praising their overall experience.","translation":"餐廳的優質服務和美味食物使那天晚上光臨的每位顧客都感到滿足。許多客人留下了肯定的評價，讚揚他們的整體體驗。","word":"satisfy"}},"sauce":{"createdAt":1783426292403,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sauce是一種調味醬或醬汁，通常是液體或糊狀的，用於給食物增添風味和質地。","options":["bread","sauce","meat","cheese"],"sentence":"The chef prepared a special ______ by blending tomatoes, garlic, and herbs together. The liquid condiment was then drizzled over the pasta to add flavor.","translation":"廚師通過混合番茄、大蒜和香草來準備一種特殊的醬汁。這種液體調味醬隨後淋在義大利麵上以增加風味。","word":"sauce"}},"savage":{"createdAt":1781775276772,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"savage形容凶猛、野蠻、未被馴化的動物或人，符合不加警告攻擊的兇悍行為。","options":["gentle","tame","savage","friendly"],"sentence":"The ______ tiger attacked the hunter without warning or hesitation. Its wild and ferocious behavior showed no signs of domestication.","translation":"那隻兇猛的老虎毫無警告地攻擊了獵人。它野蠻兇悍的行為表明沒有被馴化的跡象。","word":"savage"}},"scale":{"createdAt":1785712314609,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"scale在這裡表示「刻度」或「量尺」，用於按比例測量和繪製建築物的尺寸。","options":["ruler","scale","map","compass"],"sentence":"The architect used a ______ to measure the building's dimensions on the blueprint. Without this measurement tool, he would not be able to convert real-world sizes into the miniature proportions needed for the drawing.","translation":"建築師在藍圖上使用____來測量建築物的尺寸。沒有這個測量工具，他就無法將現實世界的大小轉換為繪圖所需的縮小比例。","word":"scale"}},"scan":{"createdAt":1783921619163,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"scan 表示迅速瀏覽或檢查某物，通常不是仔細詳細地閱讀整個內容。","options":["memorize","scan","translate","frame"],"sentence":"I need to ______ the document quickly to find the important information. I don't have time to read every word, so I'll just look over it rapidly.","translation":"我需要快速掃描這份文件以找到重要信息。我沒有時間逐字閱讀，所以我只會快速查看。","word":"scan"}},"scandal":{"createdAt":1782894607725,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"scandal指的是令人震驚和引發公眾譴責的不當行為或醜聞事件，通常涉及道德或法律問題。","options":["achievement","scandal","victory","promotion"],"sentence":"The politician's career ended after a major ______ was exposed by the newspapers. His reputation never recovered once the public learned about his dishonest behavior and illegal actions.","translation":"這位政治人物的職業生涯在一樁重大醜聞被報紙揭露後結束了。一旦公眾了解到他的不誠實行為和非法活動，他的聲譽就無法恢復。","word":"scandal"}},"scar":{"createdAt":1784535218996,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"scar是指傷口癒合後在皮膚上留下的永久痕跡或標記，通常指的是已經癒合但仍可看見的疤痕。","options":["wound","scar","bruise","cut"],"sentence":"The accident left a permanent ______ on his left arm that he can still see today. After years of healing, the mark has faded but remains visible as a thin line on his skin.","translation":"這場意外在他的左臂上留下了一道至今仍然可見的永久傷痕。經過多年的癒合，這道痕跡已經褪色但仍然作為皮膚上的細線可見。","word":"scar"}},"scarce":{"createdAt":1782265478232,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"scarce 表示某物稀有或難得，供應量不足以滿足需求。","options":["abundant","scarce","popular","dangerous"],"sentence":"Fresh water is ______ in the desert regions of North Africa. Local residents must travel miles to find clean drinking water sources.","translation":"在北非沙漠地區，淡水非常稀少。當地居民必須走很遠的距離才能找到清潔的飲用水源。","word":"scarce"}},"scarcely":{"createdAt":1784347972141,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"scarcely 意為「幾乎不」或「勉強」，用來表示某事剛發生或勉強發生，強調時間上的接近和動作的緊急性。","options":["hardly","scarcely","rarely","never"],"sentence":"She had ______ finished her homework when her mother called her for dinner. By the time she put down her pen, the meal was already on the table.","translation":"她幾乎還沒完成功課，她媽媽就叫她吃飯了。她才剛放下筆，飯菜就已經擺上桌了。","word":"scarcely"}},"scarcity":{"createdAt":1781626081098,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"scarcity 指某種資源或物品供應不足、難以獲得的狀態，與 abundance、plenty、surplus 等表示充足的詞相反。","options":["abundance","plenty","scarcity","surplus"],"sentence":"The ______ of fresh water in the desert region forced residents to travel miles for drinking supplies. Without adequate rainfall for years, the local population struggled with severe shortages.","translation":"沙漠地區缺乏淡水，迫使居民要走很遠的路才能獲得飲用水。由於多年沒有充足的降雨，當地人口面臨嚴重的短缺。","word":"scarcity"}},"scarf":{"createdAt":1783470930352,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"scarf作為動詞是非正式用法，表示快速貪心地吃東西，通常暗示吃得很急促且毫無節制。","options":["scarf","chewed","sipped","tasted"],"sentence":"He was so hungry after the marathon that he ______ down his entire meal in less than five minutes. His friends were amazed at how quickly he finished eating.","translation":"馬拉松後他餓極了，所以他狼吞虎嚥地吃完了整頓飯，用時不到五分鐘。他的朋友對他吃飯的速度感到驚訝。","word":"scarf"}},"scatter":{"createdAt":1783760526713,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"scatter指使物品向四面八方分散或散開，與收集或組織相反。","options":["scatter","organize","compress","gather"],"sentence":"The explosion caused debris to ______ across the entire street in all directions. Emergency responders had to carefully collect pieces from dozens of locations because the blast was so powerful.","translation":"爆炸導致碎片散開到整條街道的四面八方。緊急救援人員必須從數十個地點仔細收集碎片，因為爆炸力非常強大。","word":"scatter"}},"scattered":{"createdAt":1783557858052,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"scattered表示東西分散、四處散開的狀態，常用來形容雜亂無章地分布在各處的物品。","options":["organized","scattered","expensive","hidden"],"sentence":"The children's toys were ______ all over the living room floor. After the birthday party ended, we had to spend an hour picking them up from every corner.","translation":"孩子們的玩具散佈在整個客廳地板上。派對結束後，我們花了一個小時從每個角落撿起來。","word":"scattered"}},"scenario":{"createdAt":1781849622418,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"設想場景是指一種可能發生的情況或假想的狀態，通常用於規劃、預測或分析可能的結果。","options":["achievement","scenario","document","budget"],"sentence":"In a worst-case ______, the company would lose half its revenue next year. Management discussed this possibility during the financial planning meeting to prepare contingency strategies.","translation":"在最壞的設想下，公司明年可能會失去一半的收入。管理層在財務規劃會議上討論了這種可能性以準備應急策略。","word":"scenario"}},"scene":{"createdAt":1783612594866,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"scene在此表示電影或劇作中的一個視覺場景或場景片段，指特定位置拍攝的畫面。","options":["dialogue","scene","character","script"],"sentence":"The movie's opening ______ showed a beautiful sunset over the mountains. The cinematographer spent weeks filming in that exact location to capture the perfect landscape.","translation":"電影的開場場景展示了山脈上方美麗的日落。電影攝影師花了數週時間在那個確切位置拍攝，以捕捉完美的風景。","word":"scene"}},"scenery":{"createdAt":1784340894475,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"scenery 是指自然或人工環境中令人欣賞的景象或風景，通常用來描述美麗的視覺景觀。","options":["weather","scenery","transportation","building"],"sentence":"The mountain ______ was so beautiful that Sarah stopped her car to take photographs. She spent an hour capturing the views of the peaks, forests, and valleys around her.","translation":"山區的風景非常美麗，莎拉停下車來拍照。她花了一個小時捕捉周圍群山、森林和山谷的景色。","word":"scenery"}},"scenic":{"createdAt":1787051980322,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"scenic是形容詞，意為「風景優美的、景色宜人的」，用來描述具有美麗自然景觀或視覺吸引力的地點或路線。","options":["busy","scenic","dangerous","popular"],"sentence":"The tour bus took us along a ______ route through the mountains with breathtaking views at every turn. We stopped frequently to photograph the stunning landscapes and picturesque valleys that surrounded us.","translation":"旅遊巴士帶我們沿著山區的風景優美路線行駛，每個轉彎處都有令人驚嘆的景色。我們經常停下來拍攝令人驚艷的風景和環繞四周的如畫山谷。","word":"scenic"}},"scent":{"createdAt":1781693266946,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"scent是指某物散發出來的氣味或香氣，也可作動詞表示嗅聞到。","options":["texture","scent","color","size"],"sentence":"The ______ of fresh roses filled the entire garden. I could smell the sweet fragrance from across the yard.","translation":"新鮮玫瑰的香味充滿了整個花園。我可以從院子的另一端聞到這股甜蜜的香氣。","word":"scent"}},"schedule":{"createdAt":1781837601401,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"schedule 作為名詞表示「時間表」，指按照順序安排的時間計畫，通常詳細列出各個活動或事件的時間。","options":["calendar","schedule","syllabus","notebook"],"sentence":"The teacher posted the class ______ on the bulletin board so students would know when each lesson starts. All the time slots were filled in clearly for the entire semester.","translation":"老師將課程時間表貼在公告欄上，以便學生知道每堂課何時開始。整個學期的所有時間段都清楚地填入了。","word":"schedule"}},"scheme":{"createdAt":1782529318035,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"scheme 意為計畫或陰謀，通常帶有欺騙或不當企圖的含義。","options":["business","scheme","agreement","proposal"],"sentence":"The criminals developed an elaborate ______ to defraud elderly investors of their savings. Police arrested them before they could execute this carefully planned fraud operation.","translation":"犯罪分子制定了一個精心設計的計畫來詐騙老年投資者的儲蓄。警察在他們實施這項詐騙計畫前就逮捕了他們。","word":"scheme"}},"scholar":{"createdAt":1784204756956,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"scholar表示「學者」，指從事學術研究並具有深厚知識的人。","options":["student","journalist","scholar","artist"],"sentence":"The renowned ______ spent decades researching ancient civilizations and published over fifty academic papers. His expertise in archaeology earned him respect from universities around the world.","translation":"這位著名的學者花費了數十年研究古代文明，並發表了五十多篇學術論文。他在考古學方面的專業知識使他獲得了世界各地大學的尊重。","word":"scholar"}},"scholarship":{"createdAt":1785119661239,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"scholarship是指獎學金，通常基於學術成就或其他資格而頒發給學生，用於幫助支付教育費用。","options":["diploma","scholarship","tuition","degree"],"sentence":"Maria received a full ______ to attend the university without paying tuition. The award was granted based on her exceptional academic performance and test scores.","translation":"瑪麗亞獲得了全額獎學金，可以無需支付學費就讀大學。這個獎項是根據她優異的學術成績和考試分數而授予的。","word":"scholarship"}},"scoop":{"createdAt":1781360333389,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"scoop 表示用勺子或類似工具舀取或挖取物品的動作。","options":["pour","mix","scoop","spread"],"sentence":"Using a large wooden spoon, the chef began to ______ ice cream into bowls for the dessert course. The creamy vanilla melted slightly as it fell into each dish.","translation":"主廚用一把大木勺開始用舀的方式將冰淇淋放入碗中作為甜點。奶油狀的香草冰淇淋在掉入每個碗時略微融化。","word":"scoop"}},"scope":{"createdAt":1781848934145,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"scope指某項活動、研究或工作所涵蓋的範圍或限制","options":["cost","scope","success","criticism"],"sentence":"The ______ of this research project is limited to North American universities only. We cannot include data from European institutions due to time constraints.","translation":"這個研究項目的範圍僅限於北美大學。由於時間限制，我們無法納入來自歐洲機構的數據。","word":"scope"}},"score":{"createdAt":1781360333392,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"score 作為動詞表示在比賽中得分或獲得分數，是體育競技中的常用詞彙。","options":["lose","score","defend","catch"],"sentence":"The basketball player was thrilled to ______ thirty points in the championship game, leading his team to victory. The crowd cheered wildly as the final buzzer sounded.","translation":"籃球運動員在錦標賽比賽中得到三十分而感到高興，帶領他的隊伍贏得勝利。當最後的蜂鳴聲響起時，觀眾歡聲雷動。","word":"score"}},"scorn":{"createdAt":1786617863986,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"scorn是指深深的輕蔑和鄙視，特別是帶有拒絕或看不起對方的情感，與句中的contemptuous和dismissive相呼應。","options":["pity","scorn","indifference","curiosity"],"sentence":"The wealthy businessman showed ______ toward the homeless people on the street by refusing to make eye contact. His contemptuous attitude and dismissive behavior made it clear he viewed them as beneath him.","translation":"那位富有的商人對街上的無家可歸者表現出輕蔑，拒絕與他們有眼神接觸。他那充滿鄙視的態度和拒絕的行為明確表明他認為他們不如他。","word":"scorn"}},"scramble":{"createdAt":1781449095509,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"scramble意為急忙移動、攀爬或爭搶，通常帶有緊急或混亂的意味。","options":["walk","scramble","sit","wait"],"sentence":"When the fire alarm sounded, all the employees had to ______ out of the building quickly. Everyone rushed toward the emergency exits in panic.","translation":"當火災警報聲響起時，所有員工都必須快速爬出大樓。每個人都驚慌地衝向緊急出口。","word":"scramble"}},"scrambled":{"createdAt":1781661288530,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"scrambled 是指蛋類烹飪方法，將打散的蛋液在鍋中攪拌加熱，也可表示打亂或混亂","options":["fried","scrambled","boiled","poached"],"sentence":"The ______ eggs were served with toast and bacon for breakfast. The chef had mixed the raw eggs vigorously in the pan until they formed soft, fluffy curds.","translation":"炒蛋配吐司和培根作為早餐上桌。廚師在平底鍋中將生雞蛋用力攪拌，直到形成柔軟蓬鬆的凝塊。","word":"scrambled"}},"scrap":{"createdAt":1781955529034,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"scrap 作為動詞表示放棄、取消或廢除某個計畫、項目或想法。","options":["launch","scrap","revise","postpone"],"sentence":"After the budget cuts, the company decided to ______ the expansion project entirely. All the blueprints and preliminary designs were thrown away, and the initiative was completely abandoned.","translation":"在預算削減後，公司決定完全放棄擴展項目。所有的藍圖和初步設計都被丟棄，該計畫被徹底放棄。","word":"scrap"}},"scrape":{"createdAt":1782529318034,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"scrape 意為去除或刮掉，用於描述用銳利工具或粗糙表面去除某物。","options":["paint","scrape","sand","polish"],"sentence":"I need to ______ off the old paint from the door before applying a fresh coat. Using a putty knife, I carefully removed layers of peeling paint that had accumulated over many years.","translation":"我需要刮去門上的舊油漆，然後才能塗上新漆。我用油灰刀小心地去除了多年積累的剝落油漆層。","word":"scrape"}},"scratch":{"createdAt":1781939439461,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"scratch作動詞表示用爪子或尖銳物體在表面留下痕跡，動物常用爪子抓撓物體。","options":["paint","scratch","polish","measure"],"sentence":"The cat began to ______ at the furniture with its sharp claws. Within minutes, deep marks appeared on the wooden armchair where it had been digging in.","translation":"貓開始用銳利的爪子抓家具。幾分鐘內，木製扶手椅上出現了深深的痕跡，那是它挖掘留下的。","word":"scratch"}},"scream":{"createdAt":1785110904568,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"scream表示尖叫、大聲喊叫，指因害怕或情緒激動而發出的高聲叫喊，與後句提到的「大聲叫喊」相呼應","options":["whisper","laugh","scream","sing"],"sentence":"When the child saw the spider on the wall, she began to ______ at the top of her lungs. Everyone in the house heard her loud cry from across three rooms away.","translation":"當孩子看到牆上的蜘蛛時，她開始大聲尖叫。房子裡的每個人都從隔著三間房間的地方聽到了她的大聲叫喊。","word":"scream"}},"screen":{"createdAt":1785936166579,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"screen 作為動詞意為選拔、審查或檢查，特別是指對人員或物品進行安全檢查或評估，以確定是否符合特定標準。","options":["welcome","screen","register","interview"],"sentence":"The security guards will ______ all visitors at the airport entrance before allowing them inside. Everyone must pass through metal detectors and have their bags checked thoroughly.","translation":"保安人員將在機場入口處______ 所有訪客，然後才允許他們進入。每個人都必須通過金屬探測器，並徹底檢查他們的行李。","word":"screen"}},"screwdriver":{"createdAt":1786432445300,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"screwdriver 是一種用來旋轉螺釘的工具，由手柄和尖端組成，可用於組裝或拆卸帶有螺釘的物品。","options":["hammer","wrench","screwdriver","pliers"],"sentence":"The technician reached into his toolbox and grabbed a ______ to loosen the metal screws on the electronic device. Without this handheld tool with a handle and a flat or Phillips tip, he would not be able to disassemble the equipment.","translation":"技術人員伸手進入他的工具箱，拿起一把螺絲起子來鬆開電子設備上的金屬螺釘。沒有這個帶把手和平頭或十字頭的手持工具，他將無法拆卸該設備。","word":"screwdriver"}},"script":{"createdAt":1781531595648,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"script 是指電影、戲劇或電視節目的原稿或台詞，演員需要根據劇本表演。","options":["schedule","script","contract","proposal"],"sentence":"The actor received the ______ from the director just before filming began. The handwritten notes in the margins showed the director's personal instructions for each scene.","translation":"演員在開始拍攝前從導演那裡收到了原稿。邊際的手寫註釋顯示了導演對每個場景的個人指導。","word":"script"}},"scroll":{"createdAt":1781360333391,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"scroll 表示向上或向下移動來查看電子屏幕上的更多內容，或展開捲軸查看內容。","options":["jump","scroll","flip","skip"],"sentence":"As Sarah continued to ______ down her social media feed, she discovered an interesting article about ancient history. Hours passed as she kept moving through endless posts.","translation":"當莎拉繼續滾動瀏覽她的社交媒體動態時，她發現了一篇有趣的古代歷史文章。當她不斷翻閱無數的帖子時，幾個小時過去了。","word":"scroll"}},"scrutiny":{"createdAt":1784016923075,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"scrutiny 意為細看、仔細審查，指對某事物進行嚴格、詳細的檢查和評估。","options":["scrutiny","approval","distribution","modification"],"sentence":"The financial report underwent careful ______ before it was approved by the board. Every number, figure, and calculation was examined in detail.","translation":"財務報告在董事會批准前進行了仔細的審查。每個數字、數據和計算都被詳細檢查。","word":"scrutiny"}},"sculptor":{"createdAt":1781360333386,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sculptor 是指專門從事雕刻或塑造作品的藝術家，通常用石頭或其他材料創作。","options":["painter","musician","sculptor","architect"],"sentence":"The famous ______ spent decades carving marble and bronze into beautiful works of art. His studio was filled with chisels, hammers, and partially completed statues.","translation":"那位著名的雕塑家花費數十年將大理石和青銅雕刻成美麗的藝術作品。他的工作室裡擺滿了鑿子、錘子和未完成的雕像。","word":"sculptor"}},"sculpture":{"createdAt":1781832508020,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sculpture 表示「雕塑；雕刻」，指用石頭、木頭、金屬等材料製成的立體藝術作品。","options":["painting","sculpture","poem","symphony"],"sentence":"The museum's newest acquisition is a bronze ______ created by a renowned artist in the 19th century. Visitors can admire the intricate details of the carved figures from multiple angles in the main gallery.","translation":"博物館最新的收藏品是由一位著名藝術家在19世紀創作的青銅雕塑。遊客可以在主畫廊中從多個角度欣賞雕刻人物的複雜細節。","word":"sculpture"}},"seal":{"createdAt":1781926464746,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"seal 作為動詞表示用材料或方法將東西密封起來，防止漏水或空氣進入。","options":["open","crack","seal","expose"],"sentence":"The contractor will ______ the roof with waterproof material before winter arrives. This protective barrier will prevent rain and snow from leaking into the building.","translation":"承包商將在冬天到來之前用防水材料密封屋頂。這層保護屏障將防止雨和雪滲入建築物。","word":"seal"}},"season":{"createdAt":1781832478023,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"season 意為「季節」，用來指一年中特定的時間段，如春、夏、秋、冬。","options":["week","holiday","season","year"],"sentence":"Winter is my favorite ______ because I love the cold weather and snow. During these months, I enjoy skiing and building snowmen with my friends.","translation":"冬天是我最喜歡的季節，因為我喜歡寒冷的天氣和雪。在這些月份裡，我喜歡和朋友滑雪和堆雪人。","word":"season"}},"seasonal":{"createdAt":1784454723333,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"seasonal 形容詞表示與特定季節有關或只在某些季節發生，通常不是全年性的。","options":["permanent","seasonal","experienced","local"],"sentence":"Many ______ workers are hired during the summer months to help with the harvest. These employees are only needed for a few months each year, not permanently.","translation":"許多季節性工人在夏季被僱用來幫助收穫。這些員工每年只需要幾個月，而不是永久的。","word":"seasonal"}},"seasoned":{"createdAt":1782084127073,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"seasoned 作為形容詞表示經歷豐富、閱歷深厚或擁有長期經驗的，常用來描述在某個領域有深入知識的人。","options":["new","inexperienced","seasoned","unknown"],"sentence":"The chef was a ______ professional with over thirty years of experience in international cuisine. He had mastered cooking techniques from every continent.","translation":"這位廚師是一位經驗豐富的專業人士，在國際美食領域擁有三十多年的經驗。他已掌握了每個大陸的烹飪技術。","word":"seasoned"}},"seasoning":{"createdAt":1783423026254,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"seasoning 是指用來調味和增強食物風味的物質，如香料和調味料，而 vegetable、ingredient、meat（蔬菜、配料、肉類）雖然可能是食物的一部分但不是專指調味料。","options":["vegetable","seasoning","ingredient","meat"],"sentence":"The chef added a pinch of exotic ______ to the soup to enhance its complex flavors. The ingredients included black pepper, cumin, and coriander, which created an aromatic and balanced taste.","translation":"廚師在湯中加入了一點異國調味料來增強其複雜的風味。配料包括黑胡椒、孜然和香菜，創造出芳香平衡的味道。","word":"seasoning"}},"section":{"createdAt":1781746685504,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"section指的是部份、區域、地域，表示某個整體中分開的一部分或特定的地區。","options":["section","consequence","miracle","laborious"],"sentence":"The library's reference ______ contains all the important dictionaries and encyclopedias. Students can find maps and atlases in that particular area of the building.","translation":"圖書館的參考書區包含所有重要的字典和百科全書。學生可以在建築的那個特定區域找到地圖和地理誌。","word":"section"}},"sector":{"createdAt":1784451184440,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sector 表示「部門」或「行業」，指經濟或社會中的特定領域或行業部分。","options":["season","sector","section","sermon"],"sentence":"The technology ______ in our country has grown tremendously over the past decade. Companies in this field are now among the largest employers in the nation.","translation":"過去十年我們國家的科技行業增長巨大。該領域的公司現在是該國最大的僱主之一。","word":"sector"}},"secure":{"createdAt":1783005778366,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"secure 意為「安全的」或「有保障的」，形容一個地方或事物受到保護和防御。","options":["open","secure","damaged","narrow"],"sentence":"The building's ______ entrance featured multiple locked doors and surveillance cameras. Authorized personnel were required to use identification badges to gain access.","translation":"這棟建築的安全入口設有多個上鎖的門和監視攝像頭。授權人員需要使用身分證卡才能進入。","word":"secure"}},"security":{"createdAt":1784362329642,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"security（安全；防禦）是指保護人員、設施或資訊免受危險或威脅的措施和狀態。","options":["comfort","security","efficiency","convenience"],"sentence":"The airport installed advanced cameras and metal detectors to enhance ______ for all passengers. These measures are essential because protecting people from potential threats is the primary responsibility of any transportation facility.","translation":"機場安裝了先進的攝像機和金屬探測器來加強對所有乘客的______。這些措施是必不可少的，因為保護人們免受潛在威脅是任何運輸設施的首要責任。","word":"security"}},"seduce":{"createdAt":1786355607287,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"seduce 在此處表示用迷人或欺騙的方式引誘某人做某事，特別是做他們不應該做或不需要做的事情。","options":["convince","seduce","educate","inform"],"sentence":"The advertising campaign tried to ______ young people into buying expensive designer clothes they didn't need. The company used attractive models and promises of social status to manipulate their target audience.","translation":"這個廣告活動試圖誘惑年輕人購買他們不需要的昂貴設計師服裝。該公司使用有吸引力的模特和社會地位的承諾來操縱目標受眾。","word":"seduce"}},"seek":{"createdAt":1781839703148,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"seek意為尋求、尋找，與fled their homeland和need for shelter（逃離祖國和需要庇護）的語境完全相符。","options":["abandon","reject","seek","avoid"],"sentence":"Many refugees ______ shelter and safety in neighbouring countries. They fled their homeland due to ongoing conflict and persecution.","translation":"許多難民在鄰國尋求庇護和安全。他們因持續的衝突和迫害而逃離了祖國。","word":"seek"}},"seem":{"createdAt":1781832508016,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"seem 表示「似乎；仿佛」，用來描述表面上的印象或感覺，常用於帶有轉折的語境中。","options":["appear","seem","look","sound"],"sentence":"The old house might ______ abandoned, but the owner still lives there. Upon closer inspection, we discovered furniture inside and fresh food in the kitchen.","translation":"這棟老房子似乎被遺棄了，但業主仍然住在那裡。經過仔細檢查，我們發現裡面有傢俱和新鮮食物在廚房裡。","word":"seem"}},"seemingly":{"createdAt":1781746848185,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"seemingly 表示「表面上」或「看起來」，指事物在外表上的樣子，但實際可能不同。","options":["definitely","seemingly","certainly","obviously"],"sentence":"The project appeared ______ simple at first glance. However, when the team started working on it, they discovered numerous hidden complications.","translation":"這個項目乍一看似乎很簡單。不過，當團隊開始著手時，他們發現了許多隱藏的複雜性。","word":"seemingly"}},"segment":{"createdAt":1781950727560,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"segment 表示整體中的一個部分或分割的一部分。","options":["majority","segment","company","product"],"sentence":"The market research team analyzed a specific ______ of the customer population. They focused only on female consumers aged 25 to 40 for their study.","translation":"市場研究團隊分析了客戶群體的特定部分。他們的研究只針對年齡在25至40歲的女性消費者。","word":"segment"}},"segregate":{"createdAt":1785941615621,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"segregate 是動詞，表示將人或物分開或隔離，通常指按照某些特徵將群體分開。","options":["segregate","evaluate","motivate","celebrate"],"sentence":"The school decided to ______ students by ability level, placing advanced learners in one classroom and struggling students in another. This separation was based solely on test scores, regardless of other factors.","translation":"學校決定根據能力水平將學生分開，將進度快的學習者放在一間教室，困難的學生放在另一間。這種隔離完全基於測驗成績，不考慮其他因素。","word":"segregate"}},"seize":{"createdAt":1781787229330,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"seize 表示迅速而用力地抓住或奪取某物，通常帶有緊急或強制的含義。","options":["ignore","examine","seize","follow"],"sentence":"The police officer managed to ______ the suspect's weapon before anyone got hurt. The quick action prevented a potential tragedy at the store.","translation":"警察在任何人受傷前成功地奪取了嫌疑人的武器。這次迅速的行動防止了商店內可能發生的悲劇。","word":"seize"}},"seizure":{"createdAt":1788584795274,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"seizure 在此表示政府或司法機構依法強制奪取或沒收他人財產的行為。","options":["display","seizure","purchase","donation"],"sentence":"The sudden ______ of the company's assets by the government shocked the business community. The court order authorized the confiscation because the owner was suspected of money laundering.","translation":"政府對該公司資產的突然奪取震驚了商業界。法院命令授權沒收是因為業主被懷疑洗錢。","word":"seizure"}},"select":{"createdAt":1783993252123,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"select 作為動詞表示挑選或選擇，指從多個選項中選出","options":["reject","select","ignore","exclude"],"sentence":"The teacher will ______ five students from the class to represent the school at the competition. The chosen students will be announced at the assembly next week.","translation":"老師將從班級中挑選五名學生代表學校參加比賽。被選中的學生將在下週的集會上宣布。","word":"select"}},"selection":{"createdAt":1783945487820,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"selection 表示「被挑選或精心選擇的東西」，強調這些物品是經過仔細篩選的。","options":["intensity","range","selection","tendency"],"sentence":"The museum's ______ of ancient artifacts spans three thousand years of history. Each item in the collection was carefully chosen by expert curators.","translation":"博物館的古代文物收藏跨越三千年的歷史。收藏中的每件物品都是由專家策展人精心挑選的。","word":"selection"}},"selective":{"createdAt":1783850642244,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"selective 表示有嚴格的挑選標準，不是接受所有人，而是根據特定條件篩選。","options":["random","inclusive","selective","automatic"],"sentence":"The university uses a ______ admissions process that carefully evaluates each applicant's credentials. Only students with exceptional grades, test scores, and extracurricular activities are accepted.","translation":"這所大學採用有選擇性的招生流程，仔細評估每位申請者的資歷。只有成績優異、考試分數高和課外活動表現傑出的學生才會被錄取。","word":"selective"}},"semester":{"createdAt":1785424294402,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"semester（學期）是指大學或學校中一個較長的教學時間段，通常為半年，一個學年通常包含兩個學期。","options":["semester","decade","week","month"],"sentence":"My university divides the school year into two ______ periods. The first one runs from September to December, and the second one runs from January to May.","translation":"我的大學將學年分為兩個學期時期。第一個從九月至十二月，第二個從一月至五月。","word":"semester"}},"seminar":{"createdAt":1781950727561,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"seminar 指一種教育活動，通常涉及專家和參與者之間的討論和學習。","options":["movie","concert","seminar","party"],"sentence":"She attended a ______ on digital marketing strategies last week. The workshop included interactive discussions with industry experts for two hours.","translation":"她上週參加了一個關於數位行銷策略的研討會。該研討會包括與業內專家進行兩小時的互動討論。","word":"seminar"}},"senator":{"createdAt":1783256139030,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"senator 指的是在參議院或類似上議院中任職的政治人物。","options":["mayor","senator","governor","minister"],"sentence":"The newly elected ______ promised to represent her constituents faithfully in the legislative chamber. She would serve a six-year term in the national parliament.","translation":"這位新當選的參議員承諾將在立法院忠實代表她的選民。她將在國家議會任職六年。","word":"senator"}},"senior":{"createdAt":1781345746901,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"senior 用作形容詞，表示年資較久、地位較高的人，與 junior（資淺的）相對。","options":["junior","senior","lateral","external"],"sentence":"My ______ colleague has been working at the company for over twenty years. He mentors the newer employees and holds significant authority in our department.","translation":"我的前輩同事在公司工作已經超過二十年了。他指導新員工，在我們部門中擁有重要的權力。","word":"senior"}},"sensation":{"createdAt":1781848934136,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sensation指引起廣泛注意或引發強烈反應的事件或情況","options":["silence","sensation","disappointment","delay"],"sentence":"When the celebrity arrived at the event, their presence caused a great ______. Fans screamed and pushed forward, creating chaos everywhere.","translation":"當這位名人抵達活動時，他們的出現引起了巨大的轟動。粉絲尖叫著向前推擠，到處都是混亂。","word":"sensation"}},"sensational":{"createdAt":1783310579948,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sensational 意為轟動的或聳人聽聞的，指能引起廣泛關注但往往誇大或煽情的事物。","options":["boring","accurate","sensational","educational"],"sentence":"The newspaper published a ______ headline about the celebrity scandal to attract more readers. The exaggerated story turned out to be mostly false, but it sold thousands of copies.","translation":"報紙刊登了一則聳人聽聞的名人醜聞標題來吸引更多讀者。這個誇大其詞的故事後來被證實大多是假的，但它賣出了數千份。","word":"sensational"}},"sense":{"createdAt":1783993252118,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sense 作為名詞表示感覺或感受，指一種不由自主的直覺或認知","options":["thought","sense","idea","hope"],"sentence":"She had a strong ______ that something was wrong when her friend stopped calling her. Her intuition turned out to be correct.","translation":"當她的朋友停止給她打電話時，她強烈感到有些不對勁。她的直覺被證明是正確的。","word":"sense"}},"sensible":{"createdAt":1782292020652,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sensible形容做出明智、合理、符合常識的決定或選擇，顯示出良好的判斷力。","options":["reckless","illogical","sensible","wasteful"],"sentence":"It would be ______ to check the weather forecast before planning an outdoor wedding. Since rain was predicted for that weekend, moving the event indoors was the right decision.","translation":"在規劃戶外婚禮前檢查天氣預報會是明智的。由於那個週末預測有雨，將活動改到室內是正確的決定。","word":"sensible"}},"sensibly":{"createdAt":1781449588287,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"sensibly作為副詞表示「明智地、合理地」，指以理性、謹慎且明智的方式行動或思考。","options":["sensibly","trillion","glorify","defensive"],"sentence":"The financial advisor recommended that her clients invest their money ______ by diversifying their portfolio across different asset classes. This prudent approach helped protect their savings from excessive risk and volatility.","translation":"理財顧問建議她的客戶通過將投資組合分散到不同資產類別來明智地投資他們的金錢。這種謹慎的方法有助於保護他們的儲蓄免受過度風險和波動性。","word":"sensibly"}},"sensitive":{"createdAt":1783993252117,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sensitive 表示對某些事物敏感或在乎，容易受到影響或傷害","options":["proud","sensitive","confident","strong"],"sentence":"She is very ______ about comments regarding her appearance and achievements. Even mild criticism can hurt her feelings deeply.","translation":"她對關於她外表和成就的評論非常敏感。即使是輕微的批評也會深深傷害她的感受。","word":"sensitive"}},"sensitivity":{"createdAt":1781424574159,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sensitivity 在此指對他人感受的敏銳體察和善解人意的能力。","options":["ignorance","sensitivity","criticism","distance"],"sentence":"The therapist's ______ to her clients' emotional needs made her an excellent counselor. She always noticed when someone was upset and responded with compassion and understanding.","translation":"治療師對客戶情感需求的體貼使她成為一名優秀的顧問。她總是注意到有人不開心，並以同情和理解來回應。","word":"sensitivity"}},"sensor":{"createdAt":1782883637408,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sensor是一種能夠感知和測量物理量（如動作、溫度、光線等）並將其轉換為信號的電子裝置。","options":["camera","sensor","alarm","detector"],"sentence":"The security system relies on a motion ______ to detect any unauthorized entry. When movement is detected by this electronic device, an alarm is triggered automatically.","translation":"安全系統依賴於動作感應器來檢測任何未經授權的進入。當這個電子設備檢測到移動時，警報會自動觸發。","word":"sensor"}},"sensory":{"createdAt":1784176210340,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sensory是指與感覺或知覺相關的，涉及眼睛、耳朵、鼻子、舌頭和皮膚等感官。","options":["physical","sensory","mental","imaginary"],"sentence":"The taste, smell, and touch are all ______ experiences. These perceptions come directly from our five senses.","translation":"味覺、嗅覺和觸覺都是知覺體驗。這些感受直接來自我們的五感。","word":"sensory"}},"sentence":{"createdAt":1782807020081,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sentence 作為名詞可以表示法官宣布的「判決」，特別是在法律語境中指法院對被告人的懲罰決定。","options":["verdict","sentence","punishment","ruling"],"sentence":"The judge delivered a harsh ______ to the criminal in court. The verdict was read aloud, and the defendant was ordered to serve ten years in prison.","translation":"法官在法庭上對罪犯做出了嚴厲的判決。判決書被宣讀出來，被告被命令服刑十年。","word":"sentence"}},"sentiment":{"createdAt":1783391421682,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sentiment（名詞）指「觀點、意見、看法」或「情緒、感情」，代表某群人的集體看法或情感態度。","options":["law","sentiment","protest","government"],"sentence":"The public ______ about the new law was overwhelmingly negative and divided the community. Surveys showed that most citizens opposed the proposed changes.","translation":"公眾對新法律的觀點壓倒性地是負面的，並分裂了社群。調查顯示大多數公民反對所提議的改變。","word":"sentiment"}},"sentimental":{"createdAt":1785339147828,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sentimental指充滿情感、多愁善感或易於被情感所影響的狀態。","options":["logical","sentimental","objective","practical"],"sentence":"My grandmother became quite ______ when she looked through old photographs from her wedding day. She smiled softly while recalling the emotions and memories from fifty years ago.","translation":"當我的祖母翻看她婚禮當天的舊照片時，變得相當感傷。她輕輕微笑，回憶起五十年前的情感和回憶。","word":"sentimental"}},"sepal":{"createdAt":1783243696863,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"萼片是位於花朵最外層的綠色葉狀物，主要功能是在花未開放時保護花瓣。","options":["petal","stamen","sepal","pistil"],"sentence":"The green ______ forms the outer protective layer of the flower before it blooms. Each of these leaf-like structures protects the delicate petals inside during the flowering stage.","translation":"綠色的萼片形成了花朵盛開前的外層保護層。這些葉狀結構中的每一個都在開花階段保護內部的精緻花瓣。","word":"sepal"}},"separate":{"createdAt":1784616241155,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"separate（個別的；分開的）表示各自獨立的、不合併的，在這裡指每個學生獨立完成各自的專案。","options":["combined","shared","separate","collaborative"],"sentence":"The teacher asked each student to work on a ______ project instead of grouping together. This way, she could evaluate each person's individual effort and understanding.","translation":"老師要求每個學生做個別的專案而不是分組合作。這樣她就能評估每個人的個人努力和理解。","word":"separate"}},"separated":{"createdAt":1785885349566,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"separated 表示「分開的、個別的」，用來形容物體或人群之間有距離或間隔。","options":["separated","connected","round","small"],"sentence":"The students sat at ______ tables during the exam so they could not see each other's answers. This arrangement ensures that each student works independently without any possibility of cheating.","translation":"考試期間學生坐在分開的桌子上，這樣他們看不到彼此的答案。這種安排確保每個學生都獨立作答，沒有任何作弊的可能。","word":"separated"}},"separation":{"createdAt":1781773623454,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"separation作為名詞表示「分離」或「分開」，強調原本統一或相連的事物被分開的狀態。","options":["division","separation","boundary","border"],"sentence":"The ______ between the two countries lasted for decades until they finally reunited. Both sides had built walls and borders to keep their populations apart during this period.","translation":"兩國之間的分離持續了數十年，直到他們最終重新統一。在這一時期，雙方都建造了牆壁和邊界來讓他們的人口分開。","word":"separation"}},"sequence":{"createdAt":1783845383673,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"sequence 指事物按照特定的順序或次序排列，強調先後關係。","options":["sequence","quality","duration","intensity"],"sentence":"The film director carefully planned the ______ of scenes to tell the story effectively. The opening scene had to come before the climax, which had to come before the ending.","translation":"電影導演仔細規劃了場景的順序以有效地講述故事。開場景必須在高潮之前出現，高潮必須在結局之前出現。","word":"sequence"}},"sequent":{"createdAt":1782265565191,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sequent 指按照時間或邏輯順序相互連接和跟隨的事件或現象。","options":["random","sequent","independent","isolated"],"sentence":"The ______ events in the novel created a thrilling narrative that kept readers engaged. The author carefully structured each chapter so that one action directly caused the next to happen.","translation":"小說中連續發生的事件創造了一個激動人心的敘事，讓讀者保持參與。作者精心設計了每一章，使得一個行動直接導致下一個行動的發生。","word":"sequent"}},"serenade":{"createdAt":1784899523211,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"serenade是指在情人窗下唱的情歌或小夜曲，通常是浪漫的表達方式。","options":["concert","serenade","aria","symphony"],"sentence":"Under the moonlight, Marco stood beneath Isabella's window and sang a romantic ______ to express his undying love. The melodic song was a traditional Spanish love ballad performed with passion.","translation":"在月光下，馬可站在伊莎貝拉的窗戶下唱著浪漫的小夜曲來表達他永恆的愛。這首旋律優美的歌曲是一首充滿激情的傳統西班牙愛情民謠。","word":"serenade"}},"serene":{"createdAt":1783946029661,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"serene 是形容詞，表示安詳、寧靜和平和的狀態，沒有擾亂或焦慮。","options":["beautiful","serene","large","colorful"],"sentence":"The ______ garden was filled with soft sounds of flowing water and gentle breezes. No loud noises or rushing people disturbed the peaceful atmosphere there.","translation":"這個安詳的花園充滿了流水和輕微微風的柔和聲音。沒有任何大聲噪音或匆忙的人打擾這裡的平靜氛圍。","word":"serene"}},"serenity":{"createdAt":1781738105696,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"serenity 指的是一種寧靜、平和和安詳的狀態，通常帶來心靈的平靜。","options":["chaos","serenity","excitement","tension"],"sentence":"She found ______ in the quiet garden, surrounded by blooming flowers and gentle birdsong. The peaceful atmosphere helped her forget about all her work-related stress and worries.","translation":"她在寧靜的花園中找到了平靜，四周環繞著盛開的花朵和溫柔的鳥鳴。這種平和的氛圍幫助她忘記了所有與工作相關的壓力和煩惱。","word":"serenity"}},"sergeant":{"createdAt":1781493458240,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sergeant 是軍銜，指軍隊中的士官階級，擁有領導和下達命令的權限","options":["major","sergeant","doctor","teacher"],"sentence":"The ______ barked orders at the soldiers during the morning drill. He was a military officer with years of experience leading troops in the field.","translation":"這位軍士在早上訓練時對士兵們發出命令。他是一位有多年率領部隊作戰經驗的軍事長官。","word":"sergeant"}},"serial":{"createdAt":1781619188915,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"serial 指連續的、一連串的，通常用來描述重複發生的事件或行為。","options":["isolated","serial","random","accidental"],"sentence":"The ______ killer was arrested after committing crimes across multiple cities over several years. Investigators discovered a pattern of similar offenses spanning a decade.","translation":"連環殺手在多個城市犯下多起罪行多年後被逮捕。調查人員發現了跨越十年的一系列相似犯罪模式。","word":"serial"}},"series":{"createdAt":1787065356906,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"series 是指連續性的事物集合，特別是指按順序播放或發生的多個相關單位，如電視劇集。","options":["episode","series","broadcast","channel"],"sentence":"The television network decided to produce a new ______ consisting of ten episodes that will air weekly. Each episode will continue the story from the previous one, creating an ongoing narrative.","translation":"電視網決定製作一部由十集組成的新連續劇，將每週播出。每集都將延續前一集的故事，形成一個持續進行的敘事。","word":"series"}},"servant":{"createdAt":1783905256094,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"servant 特指在富有家庭中工作、為主人服侍的人，通常是低階職位，與現代的 employee 或 worker 有歷史區別。","options":["employee","servant","worker","assistant"],"sentence":"In the grand mansion, the ______ prepared breakfast for the family each morning. He worked in service to the household for over thirty years, following all their requests and managing household duties.","translation":"在這座宏偉的大宅中，僕人每天早上為家人準備早餐。他在這個家庭中服侍了三十多年，遵循他們的所有要求並管理家務。","word":"servant"}},"serve":{"createdAt":1781437220550,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「Serve」在此表示提供食物或飲料給客人，是餐飲業的常見用法。","options":["consume","serve","purchase","store"],"sentence":"The restaurant will ______ dinner at 6 PM every evening. The head chef personally prepares each dish to be presented to our guests.","translation":"這家餐廳每晚將在6點提供晚餐。主廚親自準備每一道菜肴呈獻給我們的客人。","word":"serve"}},"server":{"createdAt":1788088378112,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"server在餐飲業中指的是負責為顧客服務、點餐和上菜的員工。","options":["chef","server","host","manager"],"sentence":"The restaurant hired a new ______ to take orders and deliver food to the guests. He wore a black uniform and worked during the dinner shift every evening.","translation":"餐廳雇用了一名新的伺服員來點餐並將食物送給客人。他穿著黑色制服，每晚在晚餐時段工作。","word":"server"}},"service":{"createdAt":1782823456538,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"service 在這裡是名詞，指的是為顧客提供的各種設施和幫助。","options":["product","service","building","location"],"sentence":"The hotel offers excellent ______ to all its guests. The staff is always ready to help with room cleaning, food delivery, and any other requests.","translation":"這家飯店為所有客人提供優質的服侍。員工隨時準備幫助客人進行房間清潔、送餐和任何其他要求。","word":"service"}},"session":{"createdAt":1785132674979,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"session 在法律語境中指法庭的開庭或審理期間，是正式的司法程序。","options":["break","session","meeting","period"],"sentence":"The court will hold a ______ next Monday to hear the case. The judge announced that this ______ would last three days and all witnesses must be present.","translation":"法院將在下週一舉行一次開庭。法官宣布這次開庭將持續三天，所有證人必須出席。","word":"session"}},"setback":{"createdAt":1783208024467,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"setback 意為遭遇困難或問題而導致的延遲或失敗，與後文的「恢復」形成對比，表示之前發生了負面事件。","options":["progress","setback","advantage","breakthrough"],"sentence":"The company experienced a major ______ when their main factory caught fire. However, they managed to rebuild and recover within six months.","translation":"當主工廠發生火災時，該公司遭遇了一次重大挫折。然而，他們在六個月內成功重建並恢復了。","word":"setback"}},"settle":{"createdAt":1783470930351,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"settle在這裡是動詞，表示在某個地方定居或確定長期居住，通常帶有停止遷移的意思。","options":["travel","settle","explore","wander"],"sentence":"After years of living in different cities for work, the couple decided to ______ in a quiet town in the countryside. They bought a house and plan to stay there permanently.","translation":"經過多年為了工作在不同城市流動後，這對夫婦決定在鄉村的一個安靜小鎮安置下來。他們買了一棟房子，計劃永遠住在那裡。","word":"settle"}},"settlement":{"createdAt":1786546612154,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"settlement在法律語境中指庭外和解或協議，是指當事人雙方同意以某些條款結束訴訟的協定。","options":["agreement","settlement","dispute","contract"],"sentence":"After months of negotiation, the two companies reached a ______ to end their lawsuit. Both parties agreed to the terms and avoided going to trial.","translation":"經過數月的談判，兩家公司達成庭外和解以結束他們的訴訟。雙方同意了條款並避免了上法庭。","word":"settlement"}},"settler":{"createdAt":1788959648578,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"settler 指的是移民或殖民者，題目中第二句提到「建造永久社區的歐洲移民」明確指出了 settler 的身份特徵。","options":["settler","soldier","merchant","explorer"],"sentence":"The ______ built a log cabin on the newly acquired land during the colonial period. These pioneers were among the first European immigrants to establish permanent communities in the region.","translation":"這位移民在殖民時期的新開墾地上建造了一座木製小屋。這些先驅者是最早在該地區建立永久社區的歐洲移民之一。","word":"settler"}},"severe":{"createdAt":1783927689734,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"severe 形容詞表示嚴重的、嚴格的或強烈的程度，暗示情況非常不好或令人擔憂。","options":["mild","moderate","severe","light"],"sentence":"The weather forecast warned us about a ______ storm that would arrive tonight. The meteorologist predicted heavy rain, strong winds, and possible flooding in the region.","translation":"天氣預報警告我們今晚將有一場嚴重的風暴。氣象學家預測該地區將出現大雨、強風和可能的洪水。","word":"severe"}},"severity":{"createdAt":1783255660825,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"severity 意為「嚴格程度、嚴重程度」，指事物的程度或強度。","options":["duration","severity","type","location"],"sentence":"The ______ of the punishment depends on how serious the crime is. A minor theft would receive a lighter sentence than armed robbery.","translation":"懲罰的嚴格程度取決於犯罪有多嚴重。輕微竊盜會被判處比武裝搶劫更輕的刑罰。","word":"severity"}},"sexual":{"createdAt":1782106346911,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sexual（性的、涉及生殖的）與涉及兩個生物體共同繁殖有關。","options":["asexual","sexual","human","animal"],"sentence":"The documentary explored ______ reproduction in different animal species around the world. It explained how males and females come together to create offspring.","translation":"這部紀錄片探討了世界各地不同動物物種的有性生殖。它解釋了雌雄個體如何在一起產生後代。","word":"sexual"}},"shabby":{"createdAt":1781843487265,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"shabby 是形容詞，表示衣服或物品破爛、磨損、不整潔的樣子。","options":["expensive","pristine","shabby","fashionable"],"sentence":"His ______ coat had holes in the sleeves and a missing button. He could barely afford new clothes because he had lost his job six months ago.","translation":"他破舊的外套袖子上有洞，還缺了一個鈕扣。他因為六個月前失業，幾乎買不起新衣服。","word":"shabby"}},"shade":{"createdAt":1783760354084,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"shade 意為「陰影、陰暗、陰涼處」，指由於遮擋陽光而形成的涼爽區域。","options":["light","shelter","shade","breeze"],"sentence":"On the hot summer day, the children ran to sit under the ______ of the large oak tree. The temperature in that spot was at least 10 degrees cooler than in the direct sunlight.","translation":"在炎熱的夏日，孩子們跑到大橡樹的陰影下坐著。那個地方的溫度比直接在陽光下至少涼爽10度。","word":"shade"}},"shadow":{"createdAt":1784439491473,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"shadow是名詞，指由光線被物體遮擋後在地面或牆上形成的暗影或影子。","options":["darkness","shade","shadow","silhouette"],"sentence":"On a sunny day, the long ______ cast by the tall building stretched across the entire plaza. Without the building blocking the sun's rays, this dark shape would not have appeared on the ground.","translation":"在晴天，高樓投射的長長影子延伸到整個廣場。如果沒有建築物遮擋陽光，這個黑暗形狀就不會出現在地面上。","word":"shadow"}},"shallow":{"createdAt":1783228210815,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"shallow 在這裡表示缺乏深度或知識膚淺，無法理解複雜或深層的概念，與深入的、全面的理解相反。","options":["deep","broad","shallow","thorough"],"sentence":"Her ______ understanding of the topic was evident during the interview. She could only provide surface-level answers and couldn't engage with the deeper philosophical questions.","translation":"她對這個話題的膚淺理解在面試中很明顯。她只能提供表面層面的答案，無法應對更深層的哲學問題。","word":"shallow"}},"shame":{"createdAt":1783661880054,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"shame 是名詞，表示羞愧或羞辱的感受，與第二句中家人的失望和尷尬相呼應。","options":["pride","honor","shame","glory"],"sentence":"He felt a deep sense of ______ after his dishonest actions were discovered. His family was disappointed and embarrassed by his behavior.","translation":"在他的不誠實行為被發現後，他感到深深的羞愧。他的家人對他的行為感到失望和尷尬。","word":"shame"}},"shape":{"createdAt":1783841864099,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"shape 作為名詞，指物體的外形、輪廓或三維結構，用來描述事物的整體視覺形式。","options":["color","shape","texture","size"],"sentence":"The artist sculpted the clay into the ______ of a human figure. The proportions and silhouette were instantly recognizable to everyone who viewed it.","translation":"藝術家將黏土雕成了人類身體的形狀。比例和輪廓對於看到它的每個人都是立刻可以辨認的。","word":"shape"}},"shareholder":{"createdAt":1781424157173,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"shareholder 指的是擁有公司股票或股份的人，具有投票權和經濟利益。","options":["employee","shareholder","customer","director"],"sentence":"Each ______ of the company was invited to attend the annual meeting to vote on important business matters. The meeting included representatives from over 500 investors who owned pieces of the company.","translation":"公司的每位股東都被邀請參加年度會議以對重要的商業事項進行投票。會議包括來自超過500位擁有公司股份的投資者代表。","word":"shareholder"}},"sharp":{"createdAt":1781951900953,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sharp在這裡指刀刃銳利、鋒利，能夠進行精確切割而不會損傷食材。","options":["dull","sharp","heavy","old"],"sentence":"The chef used a ______ knife to slice the vegetables with precision and efficiency. The blade cut through the produce without any crushing or tearing.","translation":"廚師用一把鋒利的刀子精確而有效地切割蔬菜。刀片切過農產品時沒有任何壓碎或撕裂。","word":"sharp"}},"sharpen":{"createdAt":1782477376587,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sharpen是指使刀具或其他工具的邊緣變尖銳，或使思維和技能更敏銳。","options":["wash","sharpen","polish","clean"],"sentence":"I need to ______ my knife before cutting the vegetables for dinner. The blade has become dull after months of regular use.","translation":"我需要磨我的刀來切晚餐的蔬菜。刀片經過幾個月的定期使用後變得遲鈍了。","word":"sharpen"}},"sharply":{"createdAt":1782920661024,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sharply表示銳利地或急劇地，用來描述溫度、價格等的明顯而急速的變化","options":["suddenly","sharply","quickly","rapidly"],"sentence":"The temperature dropped ______ overnight, falling from 20°C to 5°C in just a few hours. Weather forecasters warned residents to prepare for the sudden cold change.","translation":"溫度在一夜之間急劇下降，在短短幾小時內從20°C跌至5°C。氣象預報員警告居民為突然的寒冷變化做好準備。","word":"sharply"}},"shatter":{"createdAt":1785712314610,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"shatter在這裡用作動詞，表示「摧毀」或「粉碎」，強調徹底而突然地破壞某人的希望或計劃。","options":["damage","break","shatter","weaken"],"sentence":"The news of his dismissal seemed to ______ all his hopes and dreams for the future. His entire career plan collapsed in an instant, leaving him devastated and uncertain about what comes next.","translation":"被解僱的消息似乎____了他對未來的所有希望和夢想。他整個職業計劃在瞬間瓦解，讓他感到絕望和不確定未來會發生什麼。","word":"shatter"}},"shattered":{"createdAt":1785972595781,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"shattered 既可以表示物理上的破碎（如玻璃或陶瓷器皿），也可以比喻性地表示希望、夢想或信心被完全摧毀或破壞。","options":["broken","shattered","cracked","fragmented"],"sentence":"The vase fell from the shelf and lay ______ on the floor, with pieces scattered everywhere. His dreams of becoming a professional athlete were also ______ when he suffered a serious injury.","translation":"花瓶從架子上掉下來，碎裂地躺在地板上，碎片四處散開。當他遭受嚴重傷害時，他成為職業運動員的夢想也被摧毀了。","word":"shattered"}},"shave":{"createdAt":1789747025032,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"shave 動詞表示用剃鬚刀或刮刀從皮膚上去除毛髮，通常指刮掉臉上的鬍子或身體上的毛髮。","options":["trim","wash","shave","comb"],"sentence":"Every morning, my grandfather uses a razor to ______ his thick beard. The process takes him about ten minutes to remove all the facial hair completely.","translation":"每天早上，我的祖父用剃鬚刀來刮去他厚實的鬍子。這個過程需要他大約十分鐘才能完全除去所有的臉部毛髮。","word":"shave"}},"shed":{"createdAt":1781665727114,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"shed 指動物自然地脫落或掉落毛髮、皮膚或其他物質的過程。","options":["stretched","shed","stored","painted"],"sentence":"The dog ______ its thick winter coat every spring when the weather became warmer. The groomer had to brush out pounds of fur during each appointment.","translation":"每年春天天氣變暖時，狗都會脫去厚重的冬毛。美容師在每次預約時都要梳掉幾磅的毛髮。","word":"shed"}},"sheer":{"createdAt":1781449095513,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sheer意為完全的、徹底的，用來強調某種品質或程度的絕對性或極端性。","options":["partial","sheer","slight","minimal"],"sentence":"The ______ determination of the athlete helped her win the championship despite her injuries. She never gave up, no matter how difficult the competition became.","translation":"這位運動員完全的決心幫助她在受傷的情況下贏得了冠軍。無論比賽變得多麼困難，她都從未放棄。","word":"sheer"}},"shelf":{"createdAt":1781311922069,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"shelf 是指附著在牆上或家具上的水平面，用來放置物品。","options":["counter","shelf","desk","cabinet"],"sentence":"The library organized all the books on a tall wooden ______ near the entrance. Visitors could easily see the new arrivals displayed on the second level of the structure.","translation":"圖書館在入口附近的高木製架子上組織所有書籍。訪客可以輕易看到在這個結構的第二層展示的新書。","word":"shelf"}},"shelter":{"createdAt":1781484415232,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"shelter是指提供保護和避難的地方，保護人們免受惡劣環境或危險。","options":["danger","shelter","challenge","opportunity"],"sentence":"The homeless people found ______ in the old warehouse during the harsh winter storm. The building provided them with protection from the freezing wind and heavy snow.","translation":"無家可歸的人在嚴寒的冬季暴風雪中在舊倉庫裡找到了避難所。這棟建築為他們提供了免受刺骨寒風和大雪的保護。","word":"shelter"}},"shelves":{"createdAt":1781532967168,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"shelves 指擱板、架子，與「在其上放置書籍」和「五個水平面」的描述相符。","options":["cabinets","shelves","drawers","closets"],"sentence":"She organized all her books neatly on the wooden ______ in the living room. The library furniture had five levels where different collections could be displayed.","translation":"她在客廳的木製______(架子)上整齊地整理了所有的書。這個圖書館家具有五個水平面可以展示不同的收藏。","word":"shelves"}},"sheriff":{"createdAt":1783841864098,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sheriff 作為名詞，指郡級執法的最高官員，通常負責縣或郡的治安工作。","options":["mayor","sheriff","judge","governor"],"sentence":"The local ______ was responsible for maintaining law and order in the county. He oversaw all police operations and answered directly to the state authorities.","translation":"當地郡保安官負責維持該郡的法律和秩序。他監督所有警察行動並直接向州當局負責。","word":"sheriff"}},"shield":{"createdAt":1782401868820,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"shield 表示防護用的盾牌，可以用來遮擋或保護。","options":["weapon","shield","armor","helmet"],"sentence":"The medieval soldier used his ______ to protect himself from his enemy's sword strikes. The metal barrier deflected most of the blows.","translation":"中世紀士兵用他的盾牌來保護自己免受敵人的劍擊。這個金屬屏障偏轉了大多數打擊。","word":"shield"}},"shift":{"createdAt":1781841742845,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"shift 作動詞表示「改變、轉移」，在此語境中指改變策略方向或優先順序。","options":["maintain","shift","ignore","reverse"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ its focus from product quantity to product quality. Management announced this strategic change at the quarterly board meeting.","translation":"該公司決定將重點從產品數量轉移到產品質量。管理層在季度董事會會議上宣佈了這一戰略改變。","word":"shift"}},"shiver":{"createdAt":1782706784006,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"shiver指因為寒冷、恐懼或其他原因而身體輕微顫抖或發抖。","options":["perspire","shiver","stretch","yawn"],"sentence":"When Sarah stepped outside into the freezing winter air, she began to ______ uncontrollably. Her body was reacting to the sudden drop in temperature by trembling.","translation":"當莎拉走到凍得刺骨的冬日戶外時，她開始不由自主地發抖。她的身體因為溫度突然下降而顫抖。","word":"shiver"}},"shortcoming":{"createdAt":1783784234595,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"shortcoming 是指人或事物的缺點或不足之處，特別是相對於預期或標準的不足。","options":["strength","shortcoming","achievement","quality"],"sentence":"Despite his talents, John's main ______ is his inability to work well with others. This weakness has prevented him from advancing to leadership positions in his company.","translation":"儘管約翰很有才華，但他的主要缺點是他無法與他人好好合作。這個弱點阻止了他在公司晉升到領導職位。","word":"shortcoming"}},"shortsighted":{"createdAt":1781926464746,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"shortsighted 形容缺乏遠見卓識，只關注眼前利益而忽視長期後果的人或政策。","options":["visionary","strategic","shortsighted","innovative"],"sentence":"The company's ______ business strategy focused only on next quarter's profits. As a result, they failed to invest in innovation and eventually lost market share to competitors.","translation":"該公司目光短淺的商業策略只關注下一季度的利潤。結果，他們未能投資於創新，最終將市場份額失給了競爭對手。","word":"shortsighted"}},"shove":{"createdAt":1782106198895,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"shove 表示粗暴地推動或推擠，通常帶有侵略性或不禮貌的含義，常用來描述用力推開他人的行為。","options":["whisper","shove","float","skip"],"sentence":"The angry customer tried to ______ his way through the crowded store to reach the complaint desk. He pushed other shoppers aside without apologizing, moving forcefully and rudely past everyone in his path.","translation":"那位憤怒的顧客試圖用力推擠自己通過擁擠的商店以到達投訴台。他毫無歉意地用力蠻橫地推開其他購物者，硬生生地從每個人身邊經過。","word":"shove"}},"showcase":{"createdAt":1781564440923,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"showcase 作動詞表示展示、展出，指為了凸顯優點而展示某物。","options":["hide","showcase","ignore","criticize"],"sentence":"The fashion show will ______ the designer's latest collection. The models will wear all the new outfits on the runway to highlight their beauty and craftsmanship.","translation":"時裝秀將展示設計師的最新系列。模特會在跑道上穿著所有新服裝，突出它們的美感和工藝。","word":"showcase"}},"shrill":{"createdAt":1781738724025,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"shrill用來形容令人不快的尖銳刺耳的聲音，特別是高音量的聲音會讓人感到不適。","options":["melodious","shrill","gentle","muted"],"sentence":"The ______ sound of the alarm clock pierced through the quiet bedroom at 6 AM. My ears rang painfully as the high-pitched noise continued blaring without stopping.","translation":"鬧鐘刺耳的聲音在早上六點刺穿了安靜的臥室。當這個高頻率的噪音持續不停地響起時，我的耳朵疼痛地嗡嗡作響。","word":"shrill"}},"shrink":{"createdAt":1781257238302,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"shrink指物體體積或尺寸變小，常用於描述織物經過洗滌或乾燥後的變化。","options":["expand","shrink","fade","stretch"],"sentence":"The wool sweater will ______ if you wash it in hot water. After one cycle in the dryer, it became two sizes smaller and no longer fit.","translation":"如果你用熱水洗羊毛毛衣，它會縮小。在烘乾機中轉一圈後，它縮小了兩個尺碼，不再合身。","word":"shrink"}},"shrub":{"createdAt":1781693270388,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"shrub指「灌木」，是一種比樹木矮小、有多個主幹的木本植物。","options":["tree","shrub","vine","flower"],"sentence":"The gardener planted a flowering ______ along the garden pathway to add color and texture. This woody plant was perfect for the space because it stayed relatively small and required minimal pruning.","translation":"園丁沿著花園小徑種植了一株開花灌木來增添顏色和質感。這種木本植物非常適合這個空間，因為它保持相對較小的尺寸且需要最少的修剪。","word":"shrub"}},"shuffle":{"createdAt":1783927689733,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"shuffle 是指混亂地移動或重新排列某物（尤其是紙牌），以改變其順序。","options":["stack","shuffle","deal","cut"],"sentence":"The magician asked me to ______ the deck of cards before he performed the trick. I mixed up the cards thoroughly by moving them around in the pile.","translation":"魔術師要求我在他表演魔術之前洗牌。我透過在牌堆中移動卡牌來徹底混淆它們。","word":"shuffle"}},"shutter":{"createdAt":1783845383674,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"shutter 是相機的快門，控制光線進入相機的時間，是拍照時必不可少的部件。","options":["lens","shutter","viewfinder","tripod"],"sentence":"The photographer pressed the camera ______ to capture the moment in a fraction of a second. The mechanical device opened and closed rapidly to let light onto the film.","translation":"攝影師按下相機的快門在瞬間捕捉到這個時刻。這個機械裝置迅速打開和關閉以讓光線進入膠片。","word":"shutter"}},"shuttle":{"createdAt":1781532967168,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"shuttle 指穿梭運行的交通工具，與「在兩地之間往返運送」和「定時服務」的描述相符。","options":["taxi","shuttle","ambulance","truck"],"sentence":"The airport ______ service provided free transportation between the terminal and the parking lot. Passengers could ride it every fifteen minutes without paying.","translation":"機場______(接駁車)服務在航站樓和停車場之間提供免費運輸。乘客可以每十五分鐘乘坐一次，無需付費。","word":"shuttle"}},"sibling":{"createdAt":1783841864099,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sibling 作為名詞，指兄弟姐妹，即共享相同父母的人。","options":["cousin","sibling","neighbor","classmate"],"sentence":"John and his ______ attended the same school and shared many classes together. They were born to the same parents and lived in the same household.","translation":"約翰和他的手足上同一所學校並一起上了許多課。他們由同一對父母所生並住在同一個家庭中。","word":"sibling"}},"sidewalk":{"createdAt":1784176210343,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sidewalk是指城市或城鎮中供行人行走的人行道，通常位於街道邊並與車道分開。","options":["highway","sidewalk","parking lot","runway"],"sentence":"Pedestrians walked safely on the ______ while traffic passed on the road. The paved path was separated from the street for foot traffic only.","translation":"行人在人行道上安全地行走，而交通在道路上通行。這條鋪砌的路徑與街道分開，只供行人使用。","word":"sidewalk"}},"sideways":{"createdAt":1781709984194,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sideways 是副詞，表示向一側或側向移動，身體與前進方向垂直。","options":["backward","sideways","forward","diagonally"],"sentence":"The crab moved ______ across the sandy beach toward the ocean. Its body was turned at a ninety-degree angle to its direction of travel.","translation":"螃蟹橫著身體沿著沙灘向海洋移動。它的身體與移動方向成九十度角。","word":"sideways"}},"siege":{"createdAt":1782308456169,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Siege 指圍攻或圍困，通常指軍隊包圍一座城堡或要塞，試圖迫使其投降。","options":["alliance","siege","celebration","negotiation"],"sentence":"The castle endured a three-month ______ as enemy forces surrounded and cut off all supply lines. The defenders inside were completely isolated until reinforcements finally arrived.","translation":"這座城堡經歷了三個月的圍攻，因為敵軍包圍並切斷了所有補給線。城內的防守者完全被隔離，直到援軍最終到達。","word":"siege"}},"sigh":{"createdAt":1781478568769,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sigh 表示因疲勞、失望或放鬆而發出的長呼氣聲。","options":["whisper","sigh","laugh","shout"],"sentence":"She began to ______ heavily as she reviewed the stack of unfinished work on her desk. Her exhausted expression revealed her frustration and fatigue.","translation":"當她看著桌上未完成的工作堆時，她開始重重地嘆氣。她疲憊的表情表露了她的沮喪和疲勞。","word":"sigh"}},"sign":{"createdAt":1785888350259,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sign 在這裡表示「招牌」，是指懸掛在店面上用於標識或宣傳的物體。","options":["signal","sign","gesture","mark"],"sentence":"The store owner hung a bright red ______ above the entrance to attract customers. The wooden board displayed the name of the business and was visible from across the street.","translation":"店主在入口上方掛了一個鮮紅色的招牌來吸引顧客。這塊木板展示了企業的名稱，從街道對面就能看到。","word":"sign"}},"signal":{"createdAt":1781362281666,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"signal表示發出信號或信號本身，用於傳達信息或指示。","options":["ignore","signal","watch","follow"],"sentence":"The coach ______ to the player to make a substitution. The specific hand gesture communicated the desired action from the sideline.","translation":"教練向球員發出信號進行替換。這個特定的手勢從場邊傳達了所需的行動。","word":"signal"}},"signature":{"createdAt":1783227888090,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"signature 是指親手簽寫的名字，用來授權或驗證文件的真實性。","options":["initial","signature","mark","stamp"],"sentence":"The contract requires your ______ on the bottom line. The lawyer asked me to write my full name by hand to authorize the agreement.","translation":"合同要求你在底線上簽字。律師要求我親手寫上全名以授權該協議。","word":"signature"}},"significance":{"createdAt":1784426633473,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"significance 指事物的重要程度、意義或價值，特別是在歷史或文化背景中。","options":["weight","significance","color","size"],"sentence":"The historical document held great ______ for the nation's understanding of its past. Scholars spent years studying it because it revealed crucial information about the founding era.","translation":"這份歷史文獻對國家理解其過去具有重大的重要性。學者花費多年研究它，因為它揭示了關於建國時代的關鍵信息。","word":"significance"}},"significant":{"createdAt":1783609867014,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"significant是形容詞，表示某事物具有重要性或重大意義","options":["minor","tiny","significant","questionable"],"sentence":"The research team made a ______ discovery about climate change. Their findings will influence environmental policies around the world.","translation":"研究團隊在氣候變化方面取得了重要發現。他們的發現將影響世界各地的環境政策。","word":"significant"}},"significantly":{"createdAt":1783063953958,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"significantly表示「顯著地、明顯地」，用來描述一個很大或重要的變化程度。","options":["slightly","significantly","minimally","barely"],"sentence":"The new policy has ______ changed how students approach their studies. Teachers report that engagement levels have risen by more than 40% this year.","translation":"新政策已經顯著地改變了學生對學習的態度。教師報告說今年的參與度提高了40%以上。","word":"significantly"}},"signify":{"createdAt":1781449588286,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"signify作為動詞表示「表示、意指、象徵」，指通過符號、標誌或動作來表達某種意思或信息。","options":["regulate","sensibly","signify","phenomenon"],"sentence":"The red traffic light does ______ that drivers must stop their vehicles immediately. This universal symbol is recognized worldwide as a clear instruction to halt before proceeding.","translation":"紅色交通燈表示駕駛員必須立即停止他們的車輛。這個普遍的符號在世界各地都被認識為清楚的停止指令。","word":"signify"}},"silent":{"createdAt":1781848934147,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"silent指完全沒有聲音或寂靜的狀態","options":["crowded","silent","chaotic","empty"],"sentence":"The library was completely ______ during exam week. Students studied intently without making any noise or distractions.","translation":"考試週期間圖書館完全寂靜無聲。學生們集中精力學習，沒有任何噪音或干擾。","word":"silent"}},"similar":{"createdAt":1781784910908,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"similar 表示有相同或共同特徵，但不一定完全相同；這裡用 however 轉折，強調儘管時代不同，兩幅畫在藝術風格上卻相似。","options":["different","similar","identical","opposite"],"sentence":"The two paintings are ______ in style and composition. However, one was created in the 19th century while the other was painted just last year.","translation":"這兩幅畫在風格和構圖上是相似的。然而，其中一幅創作於19世紀，另一幅則是去年才完成的。","word":"similar"}},"similarity":{"createdAt":1781401591593,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"similarity 是指兩個或多個事物之間的相同或相似的特徵。","options":["difference","similarity","contrast","distance"],"sentence":"There is a striking ______ between the two paintings, even though they were created by different artists. Both artworks feature the same color palette and landscape composition.","translation":"這兩幅畫之間有著令人驚訝的相似之處，儘管它們是由不同的藝術家創作的。兩件藝術作品都採用相同的調色板和風景構圖。","word":"similarity"}},"similarly":{"createdAt":1783859537002,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"similarly 表示以相同或相似的方式進行，用來描述兩個或多個事物採取相同或相似的做法。","options":["differently","similarly","quickly","carefully"],"sentence":"The two students approached the math problem ______. Both of them used the same step-by-step method to reach the correct answer.","translation":"這兩個學生用______的方式來解決數學問題。他們兩人都使用了相同的逐步方法來得到正確答案。","word":"similarly"}},"simmer":{"createdAt":1784818310065,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"simmer 是指用文火緩慢加熱，使液體保持在低沸點狀態，常用於烹飪中以融合風味。","options":["boil","roast","simmer","bake"],"sentence":"Let the sauce ______ on low heat for about twenty minutes before serving. You want the flavors to blend together gently without reaching a rolling boil.","translation":"將醬汁以低溫文火煨約二十分鐘後再上菜。你希望味道能溫和地融合在一起，而不是達到沸騰的程度。","word":"simmer"}},"simple":{"createdAt":1781709984196,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"simple 形容詞表示容易理解或做到的，不複雜、不繁瑣的。","options":["basic","simple","small","short"],"sentence":"The recipe is quite ______ and requires only five basic ingredients. Even children can follow the straightforward instructions without any difficulty.","translation":"這個食譜很簡單，只需要五種基本材料。甚至小孩都可以輕鬆按照直接的說明進行操作。","word":"simple"}},"simplicity":{"createdAt":1786346829176,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"simplicity 指簡單、簡易的特性，強調事物的基本和純樸的本質，避免過度複雜化。","options":["complexity","popularity","simplicity","fragility"],"sentence":"The designer believed in the ______ of clean lines and minimal decoration for modern furniture. Her philosophy was that removing unnecessary elements created more elegant and functional pieces.","translation":"設計師相信現代家具採用簡潔線條和最少裝飾的簡單性。她的哲學是去除不必要的元素能創造出更優雅和實用的作品。","word":"simplicity"}},"simplify":{"createdAt":1781693295125,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"simplify 表示使某事變得簡單或容易，在此指教授簡化複雜的數學內容。","options":["complicate","simplify","ignore","translate"],"sentence":"The professor decided to ______ the complex mathematical formula for beginner students. She broke it down into smaller steps and provided clear examples that made the concept easier to follow.","translation":"教授決定為初學者學生簡化複雜的數學公式。她將其分解成更小的步驟，並提供了清晰的範例以使概念更容易理解。","word":"simplify"}},"simply":{"createdAt":1782096279665,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"simply在此用作副詞，表示「完全地」或「絕對地」，強調某事的確定性或絕對性質。","options":["somewhat","partially","simply","rarely"],"sentence":"The task is ______ impossible to complete by tomorrow's deadline with our current resources. No amount of additional effort will allow us to finish in time.","translation":"用我們目前的資源，在明天截止日期前完成這項任務是絕對不可能的。沒有任何額外的努力會讓我們按時完成。","word":"simply"}},"simulate":{"createdAt":1787118100437,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"simulate 可以表示假裝或模擬某種狀態、感受或情況以製造出虛假的表象。","options":["verify","simulate","document","analyze"],"sentence":"The actor had to ______ emotions he did not genuinely feel in order to deliver a convincing performance. His ability to appear angry, sad, and heartbroken impressed the film critics.","translation":"為了提供令人信服的表演，演員必須假裝他實際上並未真正感受到的情感。他能夠表現出憤怒、悲傷和心碎的能力給電影評論家留下了深刻印象。","word":"simulate"}},"simultaneous":{"createdAt":1783845383672,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"simultaneous 表示兩件或多件事情在同一時間發生，完全沒有先後之分。","options":["sequential","simultaneous","delayed","separate"],"sentence":"The two events were ______ occurrences that happened at exactly the same time. Both the earthquake and the power outage struck the city in a single moment.","translation":"這兩個事件是同時發生的。地震和停電在同一時刻襲擊了這個城市。","word":"simultaneous"}},"sin":{"createdAt":1782410027827,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sin指罪惡、違反道德或宗教規範的行為；第二句提到「宗教」、「精神救贖」和「悔改」，這些詞彙專門用於宗教道德層面，明確指出所指為sin而非單純的mistake。","options":["mistake","sin","problem","habit"],"sentence":"In many religions, lying and stealing are considered serious ______ that separate humans from spiritual salvation. Priests often teach that repentance and forgiveness are the paths to redemption.","translation":"在許多宗教中，說謊和偷竊被視為嚴重的罪惡，使人類與精神救贖相隔絕。神父經常教導悔改和寬恕是救贖之路。","word":"sin"}},"sincere":{"createdAt":1783558795711,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sincere 形容詞表示真心誠意的、發自內心的、沒有虛偽的。","options":["fake","sincere","brief","public"],"sentence":"His ______ apology moved everyone in the room to tears. He spoke from his heart without any pretense or false words.","translation":"他真心誠意的道歉感動了房間裡的每個人流淚。他發自內心地說話，沒有任何虛偽或假話。","word":"sincere"}},"sincerity":{"createdAt":1783256139028,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sincerity 指的是真誠、誠心和發自內心的真實性。","options":["eloquence","sincerity","authority","popularity"],"sentence":"The politician's ______ was questioned by reporters who felt he was being deceptive. His contradictory statements over the past month proved his words lacked genuine honesty.","translation":"這位政治家的真誠性受到記者質疑，他們認為他在說謊。他過去一個月的矛盾言論證明了他的言辭缺乏真正的誠實。","word":"sincerity"}},"single":{"createdAt":1784191742094,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"single在此指未婚或單身狀態，也可表示單一的或獨自的。","options":["locate","single","polish","reveal"],"sentence":"She preferred to remain ______ rather than rush into a relationship. Her friends respected her decision to focus on her career for now.","translation":"她寧願保持單身，也不想匆匆進入一段感情。她的朋友們尊重她目前專注於事業的決定。","word":"single"}},"singular":{"createdAt":1781653278509,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"singular是形容詞，表示單數的，與複數形式相對，用來描述只代表一個人或物的語法形式。","options":["plural","singular","possessive","abstract"],"sentence":"The teacher asked the student to identify the ______ form of the noun 'children'. The correct answer was 'child', which refers to only one person.","translation":"老師要求學生識別名詞「children」的______形式。正確答案是「child」，它指的是只有一個人。","word":"singular"}},"sinner":{"createdAt":1784648623656,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sinner 指「罪人、犯罪者」，通常在宗教或道德語境中使用，指做了錯誤或邪惡事情的人。","options":["saint","scholar","sinner","martyr"],"sentence":"According to religious doctrine, a ______ is someone who has committed wrongdoing and seeks forgiveness. The priest offered confession as a path to redemption.","translation":"根據宗教教義，罪人是犯下不當行為並尋求寬恕的人。牧師提供懺悔作為救贖的途徑。","word":"sinner"}},"site":{"createdAt":1781848934145,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"site指建築或某項工程進行的地點或地理位置","options":["website","site","office","store"],"sentence":"The construction ______ is located just outside the city center. Workers have already begun drilling and preparing the land for the new shopping mall.","translation":"建築工地位於城市中心外。工人已經開始鑽孔並為新購物商場準備土地。","word":"site"}},"situate":{"createdAt":1785325590634,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"situate 是動詞，意為使位於、設置在某個地點，通常用被動語態 be situated 來表示某物所在的位置。","options":["situate","celebrate","regulate","dedicate"],"sentence":"The new office building will ______ our company headquarters in the heart of the business district. The architects chose this location specifically for its proximity to major clients and transportation hubs.","translation":"新辦公樓將把我們公司總部設置在商業區的中心。建築師特意選擇了這個地點，因為它靠近主要客戶和運輸樞紐。","word":"situate"}},"situated":{"createdAt":1781950727565,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"situated 表示坐落在或位於某個特定位置。","options":["built","situated","named","designed"],"sentence":"The hotel is ______ near the beach and within walking distance of downtown. Guests enjoy easy access to both nature and urban attractions.","translation":"這家酒店位於靠近海灘的地方，距離市中心步行距離內。客人可以輕鬆前往自然和城市景點。","word":"situated"}},"situation":{"createdAt":1784176210341,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"situation指的是一個特定的形勢、情況或位置，涉及某一時刻的具體狀況。","options":["building","situation","celebration","industry"],"sentence":"The political ______ in that country became increasingly tense last year. The tensions and circumstances deteriorated gradually.","translation":"去年那個國家的政治形勢變得越來越緊張。局勢和環境逐漸惡化。","word":"situation"}},"skeleton":{"createdAt":1781665727114,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"skeleton 指事物的基本框架或梗概，省略細節，只保留主要結構或要點。","options":["museum","skeleton","library","obstacle"],"sentence":"The project manager created a ______ of the business plan to present the main ideas clearly. It outlined only the essential steps and timelines without minor details.","translation":"項目經理為商業計劃製作了一個梗概，以清楚地呈現主要想法。它只概述了基本步驟和時間表，沒有細節。","word":"skeleton"}},"skeptical":{"createdAt":1781784910912,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"skeptical 表示持懷疑態度、不相信；第二句強調她傾向於質疑和不信任，與懷疑的態度完全吻合。","options":["excited","trusting","skeptical","optimistic"],"sentence":"She was ______ about the company's promises of guaranteed profits within a month. Her years of experience in finance had taught her to question unrealistic claims.","translation":"她對這家公司在一個月內保證獲利的承諾持懷疑態度。她多年的金融經驗教會她質疑不切實際的說法。","word":"skeptical"}},"skilled":{"createdAt":1784818655892,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"skilled 形容擁有高超技能和專業能力的人，能夠製作出高質量的作品。","options":["lazy","young","skilled","tired"],"sentence":"The ______ carpenter built custom furniture with remarkable precision and artistry. His years of training and experience allowed him to create masterpieces.","translation":"這位熟練的木匠以令人驚嘆的精確度和藝術性製作定製家具。他多年的培訓和經驗使他能夠創作傑作。","word":"skilled"}},"skim":{"createdAt":1782373576505,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"skim 指快速瀏覽或掃過文本，只了解大概內容而不深入閱讀","options":["memorize","analyze","skim","ignore"],"sentence":"Rather than reading every word carefully, he chose to ______ through the report. He quickly glanced at the headings and key points without absorbing all the details.","translation":"他選擇瀏覽報告，而不是仔細閱讀每個單詞。他快速瞥過標題和重點，但沒有吸收所有細節。","word":"skim"}},"skinny":{"createdAt":1782751548890,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"skinny 是指非常瘦的、皮包骨的，通常帶有負面或中立的含義，強調缺乏肌肉或體重不足。","options":["muscular","heavy","skinny","athletic"],"sentence":"The marathon runner was very ______, with barely any body fat visible under his tight athletic shirt. His coach monitored his diet carefully to ensure he maintained enough nutrition for his training.","translation":"馬拉松運動員非常____，他緊身運動衫下幾乎看不到任何身體脂肪。他的教練仔細監控他的飲食，以確保他為訓練保持足夠的營養。","word":"skinny"}},"skull":{"createdAt":1781414884516,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"skull指頭蓋骨或顱骨，是頭部骨骼結構的總稱，常在考古挖掘中被發現。","options":["skull","pottery","artifact","fossil"],"sentence":"The archaeologist carefully excavated the ancient ______ from the burial site. The bone structure revealed important information about the person who had lived thousands of years ago.","translation":"考古學家小心翼翼地從埋藏地點挖掘出古代頭蓋骨。骨骼結構揭示了數千年前生活的人的重要信息。","word":"skull"}},"slam":{"createdAt":1784713618158,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"slam 是指用力快速且猛烈地關閉或推動某物，通常會發出很大的聲音。","options":["open","slam","lock","paint"],"sentence":"The angry customer began to ______ the door as she left the store in frustration. The loud bang from the forceful impact echoed through the entire building and startled everyone inside.","translation":"憤怒的顧客在沮喪中離開店鋪時開始猛力關上門。強大衝擊發出的巨大聲響在整個建築物內迴盪，驚嚇了裡面的每個人。","word":"slam"}},"slap":{"createdAt":1782646561677,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"slap 是指用手掌快速打擊某人或某物的動作，通常帶有急促有力的特徵。","options":["punch","slap","hug","push"],"sentence":"In anger, he tried to ______ his opponent across the face during the heated argument. The referee immediately stopped the confrontation and ejected him from the match.","translation":"在憤怒中，他試圖在激烈的爭執中用手掌打他的對手的臉。裁判立即停止了對抗並將他逐出比賽。","word":"slap"}},"slash":{"createdAt":1783261169963,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"slash是動詞，意思是用刀或利器快速地劈砍或劃開某物。","options":["tie","slash","wrap","bind"],"sentence":"The swordsman used his blade to ______ through the dense vines blocking the path. With a single powerful stroke, he cut away the entire tangled mass in one motion.","translation":"劍士用他的刀刃劈砍穿過阻擋路徑的濃密藤蔓。一次有力的揮斬，他用一個動作就切掉了整個糾纏的一團。","word":"slash"}},"slaughter":{"createdAt":1782786424035,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"slaughter作為名詞，表示大規模殺害動物或人類，特別是在工業或暴力的環境中。","options":["breeding","slaughter","transportation","storage"],"sentence":"The factory faced criticism for the inhumane ______ of livestock. Animal rights groups documented the cruel conditions where thousands of animals were killed each day.","translation":"這家工廠因為牲畜的不人道屠宰而面臨批評。動物權利組織記錄了數千隻動物每天被殺害的殘忍環境。","word":"slaughter"}},"slave":{"createdAt":1784980232924,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"slave是指被迫從事勞動、沒有人身自由、被視為主人財產的人，是一種極端的被奴役狀態。","options":["servant","slave","worker","peasant"],"sentence":"In ancient Rome, a ______ was forced to work without pay or freedom for their master. This person had no rights and could be bought or sold like property.","translation":"在古羅馬，奴隸被迫為他們的主人免費工作，沒有自由。這個人沒有權利，可以像財產一樣被買賣。","word":"slave"}},"slavery":{"createdAt":1781693265625,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"蓄奴是指強迫他人成為奴隸並從事無償勞動的非人道制度。","options":["agriculture","slavery","democracy","trade"],"sentence":"The abolition of ______ in the 19th century marked a turning point in human rights. Millions of people were finally freed from forced labor and cruel treatment.","translation":"十九世紀廢除奴隸制度標誌著人權的轉折點。數百萬人終於從強制勞動和殘酷待遇中解放出來。","word":"slavery"}},"slay":{"createdAt":1781443653215,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"slay是指殺死或摧毀，在這個語境中用來描述龍對村莊造成的致命傷害。","options":["protect","slay","befriend","nurture"],"sentence":"The dragon was said to ______ entire villages in ancient legends. Warriors spent years searching for the beast that had caused such terrible destruction.","translation":"傳說中那條龍在古老的傳說裡曾殘殺過整個村莊。戰士們花了數年時間尋找造成如此可怕破壞的野獸。","word":"slay"}},"slender":{"createdAt":1784428748124,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"slender 是形容詞，意思是修長的、苗條的，通常用來讚美身材高挑優雅的人或物。","options":["thick","slender","muscular","broad"],"sentence":"The fashion model had a ______ figure that made her perfect for runway shows. Her delicate frame and thin waist were the result of years of careful diet and exercise.","translation":"那位時尚模特擁有修長的身材，非常適合參加時裝秀。她嬌弱的身材和纖細的腰部是多年來精心飲食和運動的結果。","word":"slender"}},"slew":{"createdAt":1784110946856,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"slew 是 slay 的過去式，意為殺死、屠殺，用來描述以暴力手段造成他人死亡的行為。","options":["hired","slew","welcomed","pardoned"],"sentence":"According to historical records, the tyrant ______ hundreds of innocent people during his brutal reign. The massacre remained one of the darkest chapters in the nation's history.","translation":"根據歷史記載，暴君在其殘暴統治期間殺死了數百名無辜者。這場大屠殺仍然是該國歷史上最黑暗的篇章之一。","word":"slew"}},"slice":{"createdAt":1786546612160,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"slice特指將食物用刀切成的薄片，通常用於描述麵包、肉類等食物被切開的較薄部分。","options":["portion","slice","piece","section"],"sentence":"She cut a ______ of bread from the loaf to make a sandwich. The piece was about an inch thick and perfect for toasting.","translation":"她從麵包片上切下一片來製作三明治。這片大約一英寸厚，非常適合烘烤。","word":"slice"}},"slight":{"createdAt":1783395908749,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"slight 表示輕微的、細微的，形容數量、程度或範圍很小。","options":["dramatic","complete","slight","significant"],"sentence":"The patient reported only a ______ improvement in his symptoms after taking the new medication. His doctor noted that the change was so minor it was barely noticeable.","translation":"患者報告說服用新藥物後症狀只有輕微改善。他的醫生指出這種變化非常微小，幾乎察覺不到。","word":"slight"}},"slightly":{"createdAt":1783685028739,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"slightly是副詞，表示輕微地或稍微地，用來描述細微的、不明顯的變化或程度。","options":["dramatically","significantly","slightly","considerably"],"sentence":"The temperature dropped ______ during the night, from 25 degrees to 24 degrees. The change was so minimal that most people didn't even notice it.","translation":"溫度在夜間輕微下降，從25度降到24度。這個變化非常微小，以至於大多數人甚至沒有注意到。","word":"slightly"}},"slim":{"createdAt":1781767999781,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"slim 作為形容詞表示身材苗條、纖瘦，通常帶有正面的健康含義。","options":["tall","slim","strong","muscular"],"sentence":"After six months of exercise and healthy eating, Marcus achieved his goal of having a ______ physique. His doctor noted that his improved fitness levels had significantly enhanced his overall health.","translation":"經過六個月的運動和健康飲食後，馬庫斯達到了擁有苗條身材的目標。他的醫生指出他改善的體能水平大大提升了他的整體健康。","word":"slim"}},"sling":{"createdAt":1783944768437,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sling 的意思是用快速的動作把東西扔或掛在身體上，通常指以傾斜的方式掛著。","options":["carry","sling","pack","lift"],"sentence":"He decided to ______ his backpack over his shoulder before heading to school. The bag hung comfortably on one side of his body as he walked.","translation":"他決定把背包掛在肩膀上才出發去學校。這個包舒適地掛在他身體的一側，當他走路時。","word":"sling"}},"slippery":{"createdAt":1783759528320,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"slippery 表示「滑的、容易滑動的」，用來描述一個表面光滑到不容易保持穩定或站立的狀態。","options":["rough","stable","slippery","dry"],"sentence":"The ______ surface of the icy road made driving extremely dangerous. The car skidded and lost traction as soon as it touched the wet pavement.","translation":"結冰的道路那個光滑的表面使駕駛變得極其危險。汽車一接觸到潮濕的路面就開始打滑並失去牽引力。","word":"slippery"}},"slogan":{"createdAt":1781770031230,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"口號是指為了宣傳或推廣目的而創作的簡潔、容易記住的短語或格言。","options":["billboard","slogan","jingle","mascot"],"sentence":"The company's marketing team created a memorable ______ to promote their new product. The phrase \"Just Do It\" became so iconic that customers immediately recognized the brand.","translation":"行銷團隊創造了一個容易記住的口號來推廣他們的新產品。「Just Do It」這句話變得如此標誌性，以至於顧客立即認出了這個品牌。","word":"slogan"}},"sloppy":{"createdAt":1781824444650,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sloppy 形容詞表示馬虎、不細心、不整潔或工作品質差。","options":["careful","precise","sloppy","organized"],"sentence":"The restaurant received a failing health inspection due to ______ food preparation and poor sanitation standards. The inspector found uncovered dishes, dirty utensils, and improper storage of raw ingredients.","translation":"該餐廳因食物準備馬虎和衛生標準差而收到健康檢查不合格。檢查員發現未蓋好的菜肴、骯髒的餐具和生食材料儲存不當。","word":"sloppy"}},"slot":{"createdAt":1784176210339,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"slot指的是一個狹窄的開口或槽口，特別是用來投幣或放入物品的。","options":["button","slot","drawer","screen"],"sentence":"You need to insert your coin into the ______ on the vending machine. The narrow opening is designed specifically for that purpose.","translation":"你需要把硬幣插入自動販賣機上的狹縫。這個狹窄的開口是專門為此設計的。","word":"slot"}},"slum":{"createdAt":1783256139026,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"slum 指的是貧困、過度擁擠且條件惡劣的城市居住區。","options":["suburb","slum","district","neighborhood"],"sentence":"The old factory district had become a dangerous ______ where poverty and crime were widespread. The investigator documented terrible living conditions in the overcrowded tenement buildings.","translation":"老工廠區已經變成了一個危險的貧民窟，貧困和犯罪現象普遍存在。調查人員記錄了擁擠租賃公寓中的可怕生活條件。","word":"slum"}},"slump":{"createdAt":1784531912963,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"slump表示突然急劇下降或衰退，通常用來描述價格、價值或業績的急劇下滑","options":["rise","slump","stabilize","accelerate"],"sentence":"The stock market began to ______ dramatically after the economic crisis was announced. Within weeks, investors had lost billions of dollars in portfolio value.","translation":"經濟危機宣布後，股票市場開始急劇下跌。在幾週內，投資者的投資組合價值損失了數十億美元。","word":"slump"}},"sly":{"createdAt":1784247900127,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sly 意為狡猾的或悄悄的，用來形容某人或某物以狡詐或隱秘的方式行動。","options":["loud","sly","friendly","tired"],"sentence":"The ______ fox crept through the forest without making a sound. He moved carefully and quietly, hoping no one would notice him sneaking past.","translation":"那隻狡猾的狐狸在森林裡悄悄地爬行，沒有發出任何聲音。牠小心翼翼且靜悄悄地移動，希望沒有人會注意到牠偷偷溜過。","word":"sly"}},"smash":{"createdAt":1787794132953,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"smash作為動詞表示用力打碎或摔碎某物，通常伴隨著破壞性的結果和聲音。","options":["smash","slide","bounce","roll"],"sentence":"The child accidentally dropped the ceramic plate and watched it ______ into pieces on the kitchen floor. The loud crash sound and scattered fragments made it clear the plate could never be repaired.","translation":"孩子不小心掉落了陶瓷盤子，眼看著它摔碎成碎片掉落在廚房地板上。巨大的碎裂聲和散落的碎片使得這個盤子永遠無法修復。","word":"smash"}},"smooth":{"createdAt":1783557858060,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"smooth是形容詞，表示表面沒有凹凸或粗糙之處，質地光滑平整。","options":["rough","broken","smooth","dull"],"sentence":"The marble countertop felt ______ to the touch with no rough edges or bumps. The craftsman had polished it perfectly until it gleamed.","translation":"大理石檯面摸起來光滑，沒有粗糙的邊緣或凸起。工匠已經完美地拋光了它，使其閃閃發光。","word":"smooth"}},"smother":{"createdAt":1781840892410,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"smother在此指撲滅或扼殺，常用於描述滅火或抑制發展的行為。","options":["ignite","spread","smother","report"],"sentence":"The firefighters worked quickly to ______ the flames using foam and water from their hoses. Within minutes, the dangerous fire was completely extinguished.","translation":"消防員迅速用泡沫和從水管中噴出的水來撲滅火焰。在幾分鐘內，危險的火災被完全撲滅了。","word":"smother"}},"smuggle":{"createdAt":1781531595643,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"smuggle 表示祕密地或非法地運輸違禁品，通常是為了逃避稅收或法律。","options":["declare","smuggle","examine","transport"],"sentence":"The criminal tried to ______ diamonds across the border without paying taxes. The customs officers at the checkpoint were specifically trained to catch people attempting illegal imports.","translation":"那名罪犯試圖在未繳稅的情況下將鑽石走私過邊境。海關檢查站的官員受過專門訓練，以抓捕試圖非法進口的人。","word":"smuggle"}},"snap":{"createdAt":1783945686780,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"snap 作為動詞表示用相機快速拍攝照片，強調拍攝的迅速和便利性。","options":["paint","snap","sketch","frame"],"sentence":"She used her phone to ______ a quick photo of the sunset. The image was captured instantly without any delay or special equipment.","translation":"她用手機快速拍攝夕陽的照片。這張影像是瞬間捕捉的，不需要任何延遲或特殊設備。","word":"snap"}},"snatch":{"createdAt":1785233827696,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"snatch 是指快速而突然地奪走或搶走某物，通常帶有暴力或急促的意味。","options":["donate","snatch","organize","display"],"sentence":"The thief tried to ______ the woman's purse right out of her hands. Before anyone could react, he had grabbed it and run away into the crowd.","translation":"小偷試圖從那名婦女的手中奪走她的錢包。在任何人反應過來之前，他已經搶走了，跑進人群中逃走了。","word":"snatch"}},"sneak":{"createdAt":1784781060187,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sneak是指以隱秘或偷偷摸摸的方式做某事，通常是為了避免被發現或注意到。","options":["walk","sneak","run","climb"],"sentence":"The thief tried to ______ into the museum without being noticed. The security cameras recorded him moving quietly through the shadows to avoid detection.","translation":"小偷試圖悄悄地潛入博物館而不被注意。安全攝像頭錄下了他在陰影中安靜地移動以躲避檢測的過程。","word":"sneak"}},"sneaker":{"createdAt":1786608812646,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sneaker 是指設計用於運動和休閒活動的輕便運動鞋，通常有橡膠底和柔軟的上部，適合跑步和日常穿著。","options":["boot","sneaker","loafer","heel"],"sentence":"I bought a new pair of ______ to wear during my morning jog. These rubber-soled shoes are perfect for running because they provide excellent cushioning and support.","translation":"我買了一雙新的運動鞋在早晨慢跑時穿。這些橡膠底的鞋子很適合跑步，因為它們提供了絕佳的緩衝和支撐。","word":"sneaker"}},"sneaky":{"createdAt":1783844498823,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sneaky 形容詞表示某人或某事偷偷摸摸、鬼鬼祟祟地行動，試圖避免被他人注意或發現。","options":["loud","sneaky","clumsy","friendly"],"sentence":"The ______ thief moved quietly through the dark hallway, careful not to make any noise. Security cameras later revealed he had deliberately avoided every single sensor and light.","translation":"那個鬼鬼祟祟的小偷在黑暗的走廊裡靜靜地移動，小心不發出任何聲音。安全攝像頭後來顯示他故意躲避了每一個傳感器和燈光。","word":"sneaky"}},"sneeze":{"createdAt":1784345268156,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sneeze 是指當鼻腔受到刺激時，身體自動發出的爆發性呼吸反應；通常伴隨著聲音和鼻腔分泌物。","options":["cough","laugh","sneeze","sigh"],"sentence":"When dust entered his nose, Tom let out a loud ______ that echoed through the room. His explosive reaction startled everyone nearby.","translation":"當灰塵進入他的鼻子時，湯姆發出了一聲在房間裡迴盪的響亮噴嚏。他突然的反應嚇到了附近的每個人。","word":"sneeze"}},"sniff":{"createdAt":1783092623174,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sniff 是指用鼻子吸氣來聞某樣東西，特別是用來尋找或偵測氣味。","options":["bark","sniff","dig","run"],"sentence":"The dog began to ______ the ground carefully, searching for any scent left by the other animals. Its sensitive nose picked up traces that were invisible to human eyes.","translation":"那隻狗開始小心地聞著地面，尋找其他動物留下的任何氣味。它敏感的鼻子能感知到人眼看不見的蹤跡。","word":"sniff"}},"snore":{"createdAt":1781961506842,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"snore指睡眠時鼻子發出的粗重呼吸聲，是一種無意識的睡眠現象。","options":["whisper","snore","laugh","sing"],"sentence":"My grandfather would ______ loudly every night, keeping everyone in the house awake. His wife finally bought him earplugs to help him breathe more easily while sleeping.","translation":"我的祖父每晚都會______很大聲，讓家裡所有人都睡不著。他的妻子最後為他買了耳塞，幫助他在睡眠時呼吸更順暢。","word":"snore"}},"snort":{"createdAt":1783260805491,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"snort意為「噴鼻息」，指動物通過鼻子發出的強有力聲音。","options":["whisper","snort","sing","breathe"],"sentence":"The horse began to ______ loudly through its nostrils when it sensed danger nearby. The animal's forceful breathing was a sign that it was about to bolt away from the threat.","translation":"當馬感覺到附近有危險時，開始通過鼻孔大聲噴鼻息。這隻動物有力的呼吸表明它即將逃離威脅。","word":"snort"}},"snuck":{"createdAt":1782134503214,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"snuck 是 sneak 的過去式，表示悄悄地、偷偷地移動，通常帶有隱祕或避免被發現的含義。","options":["jumped","snuck","ran","fell"],"sentence":"The cat ______ into the kitchen while everyone was sleeping to find food. Nobody heard any noise because it moved so quietly and carefully.","translation":"貓咪趁著所有人都睡著的時候偷偷溜進廚房尋找食物。沒有人聽到任何聲音，因為它移動得非常安靜和小心。","word":"snuck"}},"soak":{"createdAt":1781603436394,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"soak是指將物體長時間浸入液體中，使其吸收液體或變軟，通常需要一段時間。","options":["boil","soak","rinse","drain"],"sentence":"You should ______ the dried beans in water overnight before cooking them. This process will soften them and reduce the cooking time significantly.","translation":"你應該在烹飪前將乾豆子在水中浸泡一整夜。這個過程會軟化它們並大幅縮短烹飪時間。","word":"soak"}},"soar":{"createdAt":1781832089956,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"soar 表示急速上升或高飛，可用於描述信心、價格等迅速增長的情況","options":["decline","soar","stabilize","fluctuate"],"sentence":"After winning the championship, the team's confidence began to ______. The stock market also ______ by 15% following the positive economic report.","translation":"贏得冠軍後，球隊的信心開始翱翔。股市在正面經濟報告後也上漲了15%。","word":"soar"}},"sob":{"createdAt":1783748418494,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sob 特別指那種伴隨著抽泣聲和深呼吸的哭泣方式，通常表現出強烈的情感波動。","options":["weep","sob","sigh","moan"],"sentence":"The child began to ______ uncontrollably after hearing the sad news about her pet. She gasped between each cry, her whole body shaking with emotion.","translation":"聽到關於她寵物的悲傷消息後，孩子開始無法控制地啜泣。她在每次哭泣之間喘息，整個身體因情緒而顫抖。","word":"sob"}},"sober":{"createdAt":1781746685518,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"sober指的是清醒的、冷靜的，當用作動詞時表示使清醒、使冷靜或恢復正常狀態。","options":["sober","terminate","affirm","cooperate"],"sentence":"After drinking too much at the party, he needed to ______ up before driving home. He drank coffee and took a walk in the fresh air to clear his mind.","translation":"在派對上喝了太多酒後，他需要清醒一下才能開車回家。他喝了咖啡並在新鮮空氣中散步以清醒頭腦。","word":"sober"}},"sociable":{"createdAt":1784451184441,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sociable 表示「善於交際的」或「喜歡社交的」，描述喜歡與他人互動和交流的個性特徵。","options":["quiet","withdrawn","sociable","reserved"],"sentence":"Unlike his introverted brother, Tom is naturally ______ and loves attending parties. He always makes new friends easily wherever he goes.","translation":"與性格內向的哥哥不同，湯姆天生善於交際，喜歡參加聚會。他無論走到哪裡都很容易交到新朋友。","word":"sociable"}},"social":{"createdAt":1784345268155,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"social 是指涉及與他人互動、交流或共同活動的；在這個句子中指的是與他人聚在一起互動的活動。","options":["private","online","social","solo"],"sentence":"Sarah enjoys ______ events where she can meet new people and make friends. She attends networking parties and community gatherings every weekend.","translation":"莎拉喜歡社交活動，在那裡她可以認識新朋友。她每個週末都參加聯誼會和社區聚會。","word":"social"}},"socialism":{"createdAt":1782265565185,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"socialism 是一種政治經濟制度，主張生產資料由社會或國家共同擁有，強調平等和集體利益。","options":["capitalism","socialism","monarchy","fascism"],"sentence":"The professor explained ______ as an economic system to her students. The theory emphasizes collective ownership of resources and equal distribution of wealth among all citizens.","translation":"教授向學生解釋了社會主義作為一種經濟制度。該理論強調資源的集體所有制和財富在全體公民中的平均分配。","word":"socialism"}},"socialist":{"createdAt":1783255892320,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"socialist 是名詞，指支持或倡導社會主義理論和制度的人，相信共同所有制和財富平等分配。","options":["socialist","librarian","historian","pediatrician"],"sentence":"The political candidate identified herself as a ______ during the campaign debate. She advocated for collective ownership of resources and equal distribution of wealth among all citizens.","translation":"這位政治候選人在競選辯論中自認為是______。她主張資源的集體所有權和財富在所有公民之間的平等分配。","word":"socialist"}},"socialize":{"createdAt":1783996545978,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"socialize 是指與他人交際和互動的社交活動，通常涉及非正式的聚集和交談。","options":["work","socialize","study","exercise"],"sentence":"After work, Maria likes to ______ with her colleagues at the coffee shop. They gather every Friday to chat, laugh, and enjoy each other's company.","translation":"下班後，瑪麗亞喜歡在咖啡館和同事交際。他們每個星期五聚集在一起聊天、笑和享受彼此的陪伴。","word":"socialize"}},"socially":{"createdAt":1781693264936,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"socially 是副詞，表示「以社交的方式」或「在社交方面」，用來修飾與他人互動的方式。","options":["temporarily","valueless","socially","vanish"],"sentence":"My shy cousin doesn't enjoy attending parties and prefers to spend time alone rather than interact ______ with others. She finds large gatherings overwhelming and would rather read books at home.","translation":"我害羞的表妹不喜歡參加派對，寧願獨自度過時光而不是與他人社交互動。她發現大型聚會令人感到不適，寧願在家裡讀書。","word":"socially"}},"society":{"createdAt":1784078619500,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"society是名詞，指「社會」或「社群」，泛指由許多人組成的集體或組織系統。","options":["culture","community","society","generation"],"sentence":"Modern ______ places great emphasis on technology and digital communication. People rely on smartphones and the internet to connect with one another every day.","translation":"現代社會非常強調技術和數位通信。人們每天都依靠智慧型手機和網際網路互相連結。","word":"society"}},"sociological":{"createdAt":1786775304194,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sociological 是指與社會學相關的，專門研究社會結構、群體互動和文化現象的學科角度。","options":["psychological","sociological","biological","geographical"],"sentence":"The researcher conducted a ______ study on how social media affects community relationships. Her analysis focused on group behavior patterns and cultural institutions rather than individual psychology.","translation":"研究人員進行了一項社會學研究，探討社群媒體如何影響社區關係。她的分析著重於群體行為模式和文化機構，而非個人心理學。","word":"sociological"}},"sociology":{"createdAt":1783927689728,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sociology 是研究人類社會、社會結構、社會機構和社會行為的學科。","options":["psychology","anthropology","sociology","philosophy"],"sentence":"My friend is studying ______ at university because she wants to understand human behavior and society. She attends classes on culture, institutions, and social change.","translation":"我的朋友在大學裡學習社會學，因為她想理解人類行為和社會。她參加了有關文化、社會制度和社會變遷的課程。","word":"sociology"}},"sodium":{"createdAt":1786939022433,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"鈉是一種鹼性金屬元素，廣泛存在於食鹽和許多加工食品中，是人體必需的礦物質，但過量攝入會導致健康問題。","options":["potassium","sodium","calcium","magnesium"],"sentence":"Table salt contains ______, which is an essential mineral for maintaining proper nerve and muscle function. People with high blood pressure are often advised to reduce their intake of this chemical element.","translation":"食鹽含有鈉，這是維持適當神經和肌肉功能所必需的礦物質。高血壓患者通常被建議減少攝入這種化學元素。","word":"sodium"}},"soften":{"createdAt":1788130000118,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"soften 表示使某物變軟或變得更柔軟，常用於描述物體的質地改變或情感態度的緩和。","options":["harden","soften","stretch","shrink"],"sentence":"The warm water will help ______ the stiff fabric before washing. After soaking it for a few minutes, the material becomes much more flexible and easier to work with.","translation":"溫水將幫助軟化洗滌前的硬布料。浸泡幾分鐘後，材料變得更加柔軟靈活，更容易處理。","word":"soften"}},"solar":{"createdAt":1782529318042,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"solar 意為太陽的，用於形容與太陽或利用太陽能量相關的事物。","options":["wind","solar","geothermal","nuclear"],"sentence":"Installing ______ panels on the roof can significantly reduce your monthly electricity bills. These systems convert sunlight into clean energy for residential and commercial use.","translation":"在屋頂上安裝太陽能電板可以大幅降低你的月電費。這些系統將陽光轉換為清潔能源供住宅和商業使用。","word":"solar"}},"sole":{"createdAt":1781951900954,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sole表示唯一的、獨享的，強調沒有其他目的或責任，與「單一使命」相符。","options":["multiple","dual","sole","primary"],"sentence":"The ______ purpose of the charity organization is to help homeless people find shelter and employment. Everything they do is dedicated to this single mission.","translation":"慈善組織的唯一目的是幫助無家可歸者找到住所和工作。他們所做的一切都致力於這個單一使命。","word":"sole"}},"solemn":{"createdAt":1783870466424,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"solemn 形容詞表示「莊重的」、「神聖的」，形容正式、嚴肅且充滿敬畏的氛圍或態度。","options":["cheerful","festive","solemn","lighthearted"],"sentence":"The funeral service had a ______ atmosphere as mourners gathered to pay their final respects. Everyone spoke in hushed voices and observed a moment of silence to honor the deceased.","translation":"葬禮服務有著莊嚴的氣氛，哀悼者聚集在一起表達最後的敬意。每個人都用低聲說話，並保持沉默片刻以紀念逝者。","word":"solemn"}},"solid":{"createdAt":1784818655888,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"solid 表示堅硬、牢固的材料或結構，與能承受重量和不會彎曲的特性相符。","options":["liquid","solid","flexible","fragile"],"sentence":"The bridge was built with ______ materials that could support heavy traffic. Engineers tested it to ensure it would not collapse or bend under extreme weight.","translation":"這座橋是用堅固的材料建造的，可以支撐繁重的交通。工程師們進行了測試，以確保它在極端重量下不會倒塌或彎曲。","word":"solid"}},"solidarity":{"createdAt":1781451343281,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"團結是指人們為了共同的目標而聯合在一起，這個詞強調集體的凝聚力和互相支持的精神。","options":["competition","solidarity","indifference","confusion"],"sentence":"The workers showed ______ by refusing to work until their demands were met. All of them stood together as one unified group, demonstrating their commitment to supporting each other's cause.","translation":"工人們通過拒絕工作直到滿足他們的要求來表達團結。他們全都作為一個統一的整體站在一起，展示了他們相互支持的承諾。","word":"solidarity"}},"solidly":{"createdAt":1783614952358,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"solidly（堅固地）是副詞，表示以牢固、穩定的方式進行，強調結構的穩定性和耐久性。","options":["quickly","solidly","carefully","temporarily"],"sentence":"The construction team built the foundation ______ to ensure it would support the entire building. The engineer verified that every layer was packed tightly and would not shift even under extreme pressure.","translation":"施工隊堅固地建造了地基，以確保它能支撐整棟建築。工程師驗證了每一層都緊密堆積，即使在極端壓力下也不會移動。","word":"solidly"}},"solitarily":{"createdAt":1783255892320,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"solitarily 是副詞，表示獨自地、孤獨地進行某項活動，用來描述一個人單獨行動的方式。","options":["anxiously","solitarily","carelessly","nervously"],"sentence":"The old painter worked ______ in his studio, rarely inviting others to visit. He preferred to create his masterpieces without any companions or distractions around him.","translation":"老畫家在工作室裡______工作，很少邀請他人來訪。他更喜歡在沒有任何同伴或干擾的情況下創作他的傑作。","word":"solitarily"}},"solitary":{"createdAt":1781402539335,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"solitary 表示獨自一人的、孤獨的或喜歡獨居的狀態，通常指不與他人互動。","options":["social","solitary","friendly","crowded"],"sentence":"The ______ hiker preferred to walk through the mountains alone. He avoided group tours and deliberately chose trails where he would not encounter other people.","translation":"這個孤獨的登山者喜歡獨自走過山脈。他避免參加團體遊覽，刻意選擇不會遇到其他人的登山道。","word":"solitary"}},"solitude":{"createdAt":1787713348984,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"solitude是名詞，意思是孤獨或獨處的狀態，指的是遠離他人、享受寧靜和內心平靜的時光。","options":["excitement","solitude","adventure","luxury"],"sentence":"After months of dealing with noisy crowds and demanding schedules, Maria craved ______ in the quiet mountains. She rented a remote cabin with no internet or phone signal, where she could finally be alone with her thoughts.","translation":"經過幾個月來處理吵鬧的人群和繁忙的日程安排後，瑪麗亞渴望在寧靜的山區中獨處。她租了一間遠離的小屋，沒有網際網路或電話信號，這樣她終於可以獨自思考。","word":"solitude"}},"solo":{"createdAt":1784341548262,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"solo 是指由單一表演者獨自演奏或演唱的表演形式，不涉及他人的參與或伴奏。","options":["collaborative","ensemble","solo","orchestral"],"sentence":"The jazz musician performed a beautiful ______ saxophone piece at the concert last night. The spotlight was on him alone as he played without any accompaniment from the band.","translation":"爵士樂手昨晚在音樂會上演奏了一首優美的獨奏薩克斯風樂曲。當他演奏時，聚光燈只照在他身上，沒有樂隊的伴奏。","word":"solo"}},"somehow":{"createdAt":1781337343697,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"somehow用於表達對某事發生方式的不確定或驚訝，意為不知怎麼的。","options":["obviously","somehow","certainly","slowly"],"sentence":"She ______ managed to finish the entire project before the deadline, despite facing numerous obstacles. Nobody understood how she did it with so many interruptions.","translation":"她不知怎麼的在截止日期前完成了整個項目，儘管面臨了許多障礙。沒有人明白她在這麼多中斷的情況下是如何做到的。","word":"somehow"}},"soothe":{"createdAt":1786065304952,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"soothe 意為安慰或撫慰，特別是指用溫柔、舒適的方式來減輕他人的不安或痛苦。","options":["alarm","soothe","excite","confuse"],"sentence":"The soft lullaby helped to ______ the crying baby after a long day. The gentle melody gradually calmed the infant's distress and brought peace.","translation":"溫柔的搖籃曲幫助撫慰哭泣的嬰兒度過漫長的一天。這段溫和的旋律逐漸平靜了嬰兒的痛苦，帶來了安寧。","word":"soothe"}},"soothing":{"createdAt":1781452134699,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"soothing形容詞用來描述能夠安撫、舒緩或使人平靜的事物或環境。","options":["chaotic","soothing","loud","confusing"],"sentence":"The ______ music helped calm the anxious patient before surgery. The hospital specifically chose instrumental pieces known for their relaxing and comforting effects.","translation":"舒緩的音樂幫助手術前焦慮的病人平靜下來。醫院特別選擇了以其放鬆和舒適效果而聞名的器樂作品。","word":"soothing"}},"sophisticate":{"createdAt":1785282834743,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sophisticate是及物動詞，表示使某人變得世故、老練或使某事變得更加精巧複雜；在這裡指透過經驗使人變得更加世故和精煉。","options":["complicate","sophisticate","accelerate","frustrate"],"sentence":"Years of travel and education will ______ even the most provincial person. By exposing oneself to diverse cultures and refined experiences, one naturally develops worldly manners and refined tastes.","translation":"多年的旅遊和教育將使最偏遠的人變得世故。通過接觸多元文化和精巧的經驗，人自然會發展出世界化的舉止和精緻的品味。","word":"sophisticate"}},"sophisticated":{"createdAt":1781403377829,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sophisticated 形容一個人見多識廣、經驗豐富、具有高度的文化修養和世故的態度。","options":["naive","young","sophisticated","inexperienced"],"sentence":"The ______ diplomat navigated the complex international negotiations with ease and grace. After decades of experience working with world leaders, she understood the subtle protocols and unwritten rules.","translation":"這位老練的外交官輕鬆優雅地應對複雜的國際談判。經過幾十年與世界領導人合作的經驗，她深諳細微的外交禮節和不成文的規則。","word":"sophisticated"}},"sophomore":{"createdAt":1786511821575,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sophomore 是指美國高中或大學的二年級學生，字面上對應「第二年」的含義。","options":["freshman","sophomore","senior","graduate"],"sentence":"Maria is a ______ at Lincoln High School, so she has one more year before she becomes a junior. She is currently in her second year of high school.","translation":"瑪麗亞是林肯高中的二年級學生，所以她還有一年才會升上三年級。她目前在高中的第二年。","word":"sophomore"}},"sore":{"createdAt":1782610887957,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sore是指疼痛的或痛楚的，特別是指身體某部分因運動、傷害或疾病而感到疼痛。","options":["tired","sore","weak","swollen"],"sentence":"After running a marathon, the athlete complained that her legs were very ______. She needed ice baths and rest to recover from the intense physical exertion.","translation":"跑完馬拉松後，運動員抱怨她的腿非常疼痛。她需要冰浴和休息來恢復劇烈的身體運動。","word":"sore"}},"sorrow":{"createdAt":1783760354084,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sorrow 意為「悲傷、哀傷」，用來表達深層的情感痛苦和悲慟。","options":["joy","sorrow","anger","confusion"],"sentence":"The widow's ______ was evident on her face as she attended her husband's funeral. She could barely speak to friends and family members who came to offer their condolences.","translation":"寡婦在參加丈夫葬禮時，臉上顯露出悲傷。她幾乎無法與前來致哀的朋友和家人交談。","word":"sorrow"}},"sorrowful":{"createdAt":1786018506465,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sorrowful 是形容詞，表示充滿悲傷、哀痛的情感狀態，常用於描述因失去或遭受不幸而感到悲傷的人或表情。","options":["cheerful","sorrowful","curious","confident"],"sentence":"The widow's ______ expression revealed the deep pain of losing her beloved husband. She had not smiled or spoken much since his funeral three weeks ago.","translation":"寡婦的悲痛表情流露出失去摯愛丈夫的深切痛苦。自從三週前他的葬禮以來，她幾乎沒有微笑或多說話。","word":"sorrowful"}},"sort":{"createdAt":1784981439742,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sort作為動詞表示把東西分類或整理，通常涉及按照特定的標準或方式將物品分組。","options":["borrow","damage","sort","display"],"sentence":"The teacher asked the students to ______ the books by subject and size for the library reorganization. Each student carefully grouped the mathematics, history, and science books into different piles according to the assigned system.","translation":"老師要求學生按照主題和大小來分類書籍以便圖書館重新整理。每個學生都根據指定的系統仔細地將數學、歷史和科學書籍分組到不同的堆裡。","word":"sort"}},"soulful":{"createdAt":1781431278560,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"soulful形容充滿深厚感情和靈魂的藝術表達或表現。","options":["technical","soulful","casual","brief"],"sentence":"The jazz musician's ______ performance moved everyone in the audience to tears. His deep emotional expression and passionate playing connected with the hearts of all who listened.","translation":"爵士樂音樂家充滿情感的表演使觀眾中的每個人都感動到流淚。他深刻的情感表達和充滿激情的演奏與所有傾聽者的心靈相連。","word":"soulful"}},"sound":{"createdAt":1784114470552,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sound 作為形容詞時表示「健康的；無恙的」，常用於描述身體或狀況良好的狀態。","options":["noise","sound","voice","tone"],"sentence":"The doctor confirmed that the patient's health was ______ after the surgery. The patient's vital signs were normal, and there were no complications.","translation":"醫生確認病人手術後的健康狀況是無恙的。病人的生命跡象正常，沒有任何併發症。","word":"sound"}},"source":{"createdAt":1785281850797,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"source指的是來源、出處，在這裡指信息的原始出自何處或來自哪個地方。","options":["credibility","source","validity","accuracy"],"sentence":"The journalist carefully verified the ______ of the breaking news before publishing the story. She confirmed that the information came directly from an official government statement.","translation":"記者在發佈故事前仔細核實了突發新聞的出處。她確認該資訊直接來自官方政府聲明。","word":"source"}},"souvenir":{"createdAt":1781849622418,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"紀念品是指人們為了紀念特定的事件、地點或時刻而購買或保留的物品。","options":["textbook","souvenir","equipment","ingredient"],"sentence":"She bought a ______ from the museum gift shop to remember her visit. The small wooden figurine now sits on her shelf at home as a lasting memento.","translation":"她從博物館禮品店買了一個紀念品來紀念她的訪問。這個小木製雕像現在放在她家的架子上作為永久的紀念。","word":"souvenir"}},"sovereign":{"createdAt":1781961517452,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sovereign 在這裡指的是擁有至高權力的統治者或君主。","options":["minister","sovereign","ambassador","advisor"],"sentence":"The ______ of the kingdom made the final decision regarding trade agreements. As the absolute monarch, this ruler had the power to bind the entire nation to international contracts.","translation":"這個王國的元首對貿易協議做出了最終決定。作為絕對君主，這位統治者有權將整個國家與國際契約綁定。","word":"sovereign"}},"sovereignty":{"createdAt":1784106475776,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sovereignty 是指一個國家或政權的最高權力和獨立自主權，不受其他國家或外力的控制。","options":["authority","sovereignty","freedom","territory"],"sentence":"The nation fought hard to establish its ______ and independence from colonial rule. After centuries of foreign domination, the people finally gained the right to govern themselves without external interference.","translation":"這個國家奮力建立其主權和獨立，擺脫殖民統治。在數個世紀的外國統治後，人民終於獲得了在沒有外部干涉的情況下自我治理的權利。","word":"sovereignty"}},"spacecraft":{"createdAt":1783845443805,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spacecraft是指能夠進行太空探索任務的載人或無人飛行器，與「登陸火星」和「發送照片」的功能相符。","options":["satellite","spacecraft","telescope","shuttle"],"sentence":"The ______ successfully landed on Mars after traveling through space for eight months. Scientists were amazed by the detailed photos it sent back to Earth.","translation":"這艘太空船在經過八個月的太空旅行後成功登陸火星。科學家對它發回地球的詳細照片感到驚訝。","word":"spacecraft"}},"spacious":{"createdAt":1782529318043,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spacious 意為寬敞的或寬闊的，用於形容有足夠空間的地方。","options":["cramped","spacious","dark","outdated"],"sentence":"The new office building is surprisingly ______ with high ceilings and open floor plans. Employees feel comfortable working in such an airy and roomy environment.","translation":"新辦公大樓出人意料地寬敞，天花板高聳，採用開放式平面圖。員工在這樣通風寬敞的環境中工作感到舒適。","word":"spacious"}},"span":{"createdAt":1783946029660,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"span 在此指橋樑或拱的跨度，即從一端到另一端的距離或寬度。","options":["length","span","width","depth"],"sentence":"The bridge has a ______ of 500 meters across the river. Engineers designed it to extend from one bank to the other without any supporting pillars in between.","translation":"這座橋跨越河流的寬度為 500 公尺。工程師設計它從一岸延伸到另一岸，中間沒有任何支柱。","word":"span"}},"spare":{"createdAt":1783760526716,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spare作為形容詞指多餘的或備用的，通常指為了應急目的保留的備用物品。","options":["broken","spare","flat","damaged"],"sentence":"I always keep a ______ tire in my car trunk in case I get a flat tire on the highway. Having this backup wheel has saved me several times when I couldn't reach a repair shop immediately.","translation":"我的車後備箱裡總是備著一個備用輪胎，以防我在高速公路上爆胎。在無法立即到達修理店時，備用輪胎救過我好幾次。","word":"spare"}},"spark":{"createdAt":1787238219836,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spark 指微小的火星或火花，是引發更大火焰的初始點，這裡強調的是微小但能引燃的火星。","options":["flame","spark","blaze","ember"],"sentence":"A single ______ from the campfire landed on the dry leaves. The small ember was enough to ignite a dangerous wildfire that spread rapidly through the forest.","translation":"營火中的單一火花落在乾燥的樹葉上。這個小火星足以點燃危險的野火，迅速蔓延整片森林。","word":"spark"}},"sparkle":{"createdAt":1786180384525,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sparkle 是動詞，表示發出閃爍的光芒或充滿活力，通常用來描述光線的反射或眼睛中表現出的生動情感。","options":["fade","sparkle","dim","darken"],"sentence":"The diamond ring began to ______ as the sunlight hit its facets. Her eyes seemed to ______ with joy and excitement when she received the gift.","translation":"當陽光照射到鑽戒的切面時，它開始閃耀。當她收到禮物時，她的眼睛似乎閃爍著喜悅和興奮。","word":"sparkle"}},"sparrow":{"createdAt":1787022466039,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sparrow 是一種常見的小型鳥類，體型遠小於其他大型鳥類，經常在人類居住的地方活動。","options":["eagle","sparrow","penguin","ostrich"],"sentence":"The small brown ______ landed on the garden fence and chirped loudly. This tiny bird is commonly found in cities and countryside, and is much smaller than a pigeon or hawk.","translation":"這隻小棕色的麻雀落在花園的籬笆上，大聲鳴叫。這種小鳥在城市和鄉村都很常見，比鴿子或鷹小得多。","word":"sparrow"}},"spear":{"createdAt":1784078512100,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"spear 是一種古老的武器，由長軸和尖銳的矛頭組成，可以投擲或刺穿，不是箭、劍或棍棒。","options":["arrow","sword","spear","club"],"sentence":"The ancient warrior threw his ______ at the enemy during the battle. This long-shafted weapon with a sharp pointed tip was a common tool for both hunting and warfare.","translation":"古代戰士在戰鬥中向敵人投擲他的矛。這種長軸長柄、頂端尖銳的武器在狩獵和戰爭中都很常見。","word":"spear"}},"specialist":{"createdAt":1784293587906,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"specialist指的是在某一特定領域或專業有深入知識和豐富經驗的專家或專業人士。","options":["specialist","competitor","volunteer","journalist"],"sentence":"When Maria developed a serious heart condition, her doctor referred her to a ______ for advanced treatment options. This medical professional had spent over fifteen years focusing exclusively on cardiovascular disease.","translation":"當瑪麗亞患上嚴重的心臟病時，她的醫生將她轉診給一位專家進行先進的治療方案。這位醫療專業人士花了超過十五年的時間專注於心血管疾病。","word":"specialist"}},"specialize":{"createdAt":1781345746904,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"specialize 作動詞，表示專門研究或專攻某個領域，通常需要深入的學習和經驗。","options":["generalize","specialize","graduate","practice"],"sentence":"Dr. Chen decided to ______ in pediatric cardiology after completing her general medical training. She attended advanced courses and spent years studying heart conditions in children.","translation":"陳醫生在完成普通醫學培訓後決定專門研究小兒心臟病學。她參加了高級課程，並花費多年研究兒童心臟疾病。","word":"specialize"}},"specialty":{"createdAt":1784486409660,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"specialty表示地方特產或某人/某機構最擅長或最著名的事物，在這裡指餐廳的招牌菜。","options":["weakness","specialty","hobby","talent"],"sentence":"The ______ of this restaurant is handmade pasta made with fresh ingredients. The chef has been perfecting this particular dish for over twenty years and it's what the restaurant is most famous for.","translation":"這家餐廳的特產是用新鮮食材製作的手工義大利麵。這位主廚花了二十多年完善這道特別菜餚，這正是餐廳最著名的地方。","word":"specialty"}},"species":{"createdAt":1781362281653,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"species是指同一類型的生物，具有相同的遺傳特徵，可以相互繁殖。","options":["type","species","variety","category"],"sentence":"Scientists discovered a new ______ of butterfly in the Amazon rainforest. This previously unknown insect has unique colorful patterns never seen before.","translation":"科學家在亞馬遜雨林中發現了一種新的蝴蝶物種。這種以前未知的昆蟲有著從未見過的獨特彩色圖案。","word":"species"}},"specific":{"createdAt":1783840979882,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"specific 是形容詞，表示明確的、詳細的或特別的，與籠統、模糊的概念相對，指的是清楚界定的事物或細節。","options":["vague","lengthy","specific","creative"],"sentence":"The teacher asked for a ______ answer, not just a general overview of the topic. She wanted students to provide exact examples from the textbook and cite particular page numbers.","translation":"老師要求學生給出明確的答案，而不僅僅是對主題的籠統概述。她希望學生提供教科書中的確切例子並引用特定的頁碼。","word":"specific"}},"specification":{"createdAt":1784397065539,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"specification 是指產品或工程的詳細規格書或說明書，通常包含具體的技術要求和標準，而非一般的描述或建議。","options":["suggestion","specification","description","opinion"],"sentence":"The engineer provided a detailed ______ for the new building project. The document included exact measurements, materials, and construction standards that all contractors must follow.","translation":"工程師為新建築專案提供了詳細的規格說明。該文件包括所有承包商必須遵守的確切尺寸、材料和建築標準。","word":"specification"}},"specify":{"createdAt":1781840659326,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"specify 是指詳細說明或明確指出某些事物，在這裡表示需要清楚地陳述截止日期和具體細節。","options":["ignore","specify","delay","announce"],"sentence":"The project manager asked the team to ______ the exact deadline for the next phase. Without clear dates and milestones, everyone would be working toward different goals.","translation":"專案經理要求團隊明確指出下一階段的確切截止日期。如果沒有清楚的日期和里程碑，每個人都會朝向不同的目標工作。","word":"specify"}},"specimen":{"createdAt":1782292020652,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"specimen指為了研究、檢驗或展示目的而採集的單個樣本或代表性例子。","options":["colony","specimen","harvest","population"],"sentence":"The biologist collected a ______ of the rare plant species from the rainforest. She carefully preserved it in a sealed container for laboratory analysis.","translation":"生物學家從雨林中採集了稀有植物物種的樣本。她小心地將其保存在密閉容器中進行實驗室分析。","word":"specimen"}},"spectacle":{"createdAt":1785328424125,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spectacle 指的是壯觀的場景或奇觀，通常是大規模、令人印象深刻的視覺展示，強調其壯麗和驚人的程度。","options":["performance","spectacle","event","ceremony"],"sentence":"The fireworks display was a magnificent ______ that lit up the entire night sky. The crowd gathered from miles around to witness this breathtaking visual phenomenon.","translation":"煙火表演是一場令人驚嘆的奇觀，照亮了整個夜空。人群從四面八方聚集來見證這個令人屏息的視覺現象。","word":"spectacle"}},"spectacular":{"createdAt":1782352245060,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"spectacular形容某事物非常壯觀、令人印象深刻或精彩絕倫。","options":["quiet","ordinary","spectacular","disappointing"],"sentence":"The fireworks display at the New Year's celebration was absolutely ______. The entire city stopped to watch the brilliant colors light up the sky.","translation":"新年慶祝活動的煙火表演絕對壯觀。整個城市停下來觀看燦爛的色彩照亮天空。","word":"spectacular"}},"spectator":{"createdAt":1782550057063,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"spectator是名詞，表示觀看比賽或活動的旁觀者或觀眾，區別於參加者。","options":["player","coach","spectator","referee"],"sentence":"Every ______ in the stadium stood up and cheered when the home team scored the winning goal. Thousands of people had paid for tickets to watch this crucial playoff match.","translation":"當主隊打進致勝球時，體育館裡的每一位觀眾都站起來歡呼。數千人為了看這場關鍵的季後賽買了票。","word":"spectator"}},"spectrum":{"createdAt":1783927689737,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"spectrum 可引申表示某事物按程度或類型排列的全部範圍，不僅限於光學領域。","options":["scale","range","spectrum","variety"],"sentence":"The political ______ includes candidates ranging from far left to far right. This diversity of viewpoints represents the complete range of ideological positions in the election.","translation":"政治光譜包括從極左到極右的候選人。這種觀點的多樣性代表了選舉中意識形態立場的完整範圍。","word":"spectrum"}},"speculate":{"createdAt":1781746848182,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"speculate 表示「推測」或「投機」，指基於不完全信息進行猜測或假設。","options":["ignore","speculate","calculate","document"],"sentence":"Investors like to ______ about the stock market's future direction. However, without concrete data and analysis, such predictions are often just guesses.","translation":"投資者喜歡推測股票市場的未來方向。不過，沒有具體的數據和分析，這樣的預測往往只是猜測。","word":"speculate"}},"speculation":{"createdAt":1785897634315,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"speculation指的是基於不確定信息的推測、思索或投機，當無法確定事實時進行的猜測性思考或行為。","options":["certainty","speculation","knowledge","evidence"],"sentence":"The businessman's ______ about future market trends led him to invest heavily in tech stocks. However, he based his decisions purely on guesses rather than solid research or data analysis.","translation":"這位商人對未來市場趨勢的推測使他大量投資科技股。然而，他的決定完全基於猜測，而非堅實的研究或數據分析。","word":"speculation"}},"speculative":{"createdAt":1787757574261,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"speculative 意為「推測的、基於猜測的」，用來形容缺乏確實證據、只是基於假設或猜測的想法或陳述。","options":["factual","speculative","documented","verified"],"sentence":"The article about the CEO's resignation was purely ______ and contained no verified information. The journalists admitted they were guessing based on rumours, not facts.","translation":"關於首席執行官辭職的文章純粹是推測性的，不包含任何經核實的信息。記者們承認他們是基於謠言猜測，而不是事實。","word":"speculative"}},"spell":{"createdAt":1781481311492,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spell作名詞指的是魔法、符咒或咒語。","options":["contract","spell","proposal","agreement"],"sentence":"The magician cast a ______ and made the rabbit disappear from the stage. The audience was amazed by the mysterious incantation and magical effects that followed.","translation":"魔術師施展了一個符咒，使兔子從舞台上消失了。觀眾為神祕的咒語和隨之而來的魔法效果感到驚訝。","word":"spell"}},"sphere":{"createdAt":1783391421680,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sphere（名詞）指「球形、球體」，是一種完全圓形的三維幾何形狀。","options":["cube","sphere","pyramid","cylinder"],"sentence":"The Earth is shaped like a perfect ______ as it rotates around the sun. This round geometric form is what gives our planet its distinctive appearance in space.","translation":"地球在繞太陽旋轉時呈現完美的球形。這種圓形的幾何形狀是地球在太空中具有獨特外觀的原因。","word":"sphere"}},"spice":{"createdAt":1784601855840,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spice 是指用於調味的香料植物或其製品，如黑胡椒、肉桂等，能使食物更有風味。","options":["ingredient","spice","seasoning","flavor"],"sentence":"The chef added ______ to the bland soup to enhance its flavor. Without pepper, cinnamon, and cumin, the dish would have tasted very dull.","translation":"主廚在平淡的湯中加入香料來增強其風味。沒有黑胡椒、肉桂和孜然，這道菜的味道會非常乏味。","word":"spice"}},"spicy":{"createdAt":1784442516766,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spicy 是形容詞，用來描述食物含有大量香料或辣椒，帶有強烈的辛辣味道。","options":["sweet","spicy","bitter","salty"],"sentence":"The curry dish was so ______ that it made my mouth burn with heat. I had to drink several glasses of water to cool down the intense pepper flavor.","translation":"咖哩菜餚是那麼辛辣，使我的嘴被熱燒傷。我不得不喝幾杯水來冷卻濃烈的辣椒味道。","word":"spicy"}},"spill":{"createdAt":1783566294632,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spill表示溢出或灑出液體，動詞形式表示不小心讓液體流出容器。","options":["drink","spill","pour","drop"],"sentence":"Be careful not to ______ your coffee on the white carpet! I just bought this rug last week and want to keep it clean.","translation":"小心不要把咖啡灑在白色地毯上！我上週剛買了這塊地毯，想保持它乾淨。","word":"spill"}},"spin":{"createdAt":1782475559555,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"spin表示快速旋轉或使某物旋轉，特別是指物體或身體圍繞軸進行圓周運動","options":["walk","jump","spin","slide"],"sentence":"The figure skater began to ______ across the ice with remarkable speed and grace. Her body rotated rapidly as she executed the difficult maneuver.","translation":"花式滑冰選手以非凡的速度和優雅開始在冰面上旋轉。當她執行這個困難的動作時，她的身體快速旋轉。","word":"spin"}},"spine":{"createdAt":1781693254769,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spine指的是脊柱或脊椎，是人體中央的骨骼結構，保護脊髓。","options":["lung","spine","stomach","liver"],"sentence":"The doctor examined the patient's ______ to check for any injuries or misalignment. X-rays revealed a serious fracture in the lower vertebrae.","translation":"醫生檢查了患者的脊椎以檢查是否有任何傷害或錯位。X光片顯示下部椎骨有嚴重骨折。","word":"spine"}},"spiral":{"createdAt":1784106475787,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spiral 是指呈螺旋形的結構或運動，像許多樓梯、DNA分子或銀河系一樣，以旋轉的方式逐漸向上或向外延伸。","options":["circular","spiral","vertical","diagonal"],"sentence":"The staircase twisted in a ______ shape, climbing higher and higher toward the tower's peak. Each step circled around the central column in a continuous rotating pattern.","translation":"樓梯以螺旋形扭曲，不斷向上螺旋到塔樓的頂端。每一步都在中央柱周圍以連續旋轉的方式環繞。","word":"spiral"}},"spirit":{"createdAt":1781848330190,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spirit指人的精神狀態、士氣、心靈或內在的勇氣和決心。","options":["injury","spirit","salary","complaint"],"sentence":"Despite losing the championship game, the team maintained a strong ______ and remained optimistic about their future. Their determination and positive attitude showed they had not been defeated mentally or emotionally.","translation":"儘管輸掉了錦標賽，球隊保持著強大的精神並對未來保持樂觀。他們的決心和積極態度表明他們在精神和情感上沒有被打敗。","word":"spirit"}},"spirits":{"createdAt":1786617863982,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spirits在此句中指人的精神狀態或士氣，特別是指心情和鬥志，與慶祝勝利的語境相符。","options":["morale","spirits","energy","confidence"],"sentence":"After winning the championship, the team's ______ were incredibly high and everyone celebrated with joy. They drank champagne to toast their victory and lifted each other up in triumph.","translation":"贏得冠軍後，球隊的精神士氣非常高漲，每個人都歡慶勝利。他們喝香檳慶祝他們的勝利，互相扶持歡呼雀躍。","word":"spirits"}},"spiritual":{"createdAt":1784615297704,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spiritual 是指與靈魂、精神或宗教信仰相關的，而不是身體或物質方面的","options":["physical","spiritual","emotional","financial"],"sentence":"Many people find ______ fulfillment through meditation and prayer. These practices focus on the soul and inner peace rather than material possessions.","translation":"許多人通過冥想和祈禱找到精神上的滿足感。這些做法關注靈魂和內心的平靜，而不是物質財富。","word":"spiritual"}},"spit":{"createdAt":1783572474511,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spit作為動詞意為「怒斥、猛烈抨擊」，通常用於表達強烈的憤怒和不滿的言語。","options":["praise","spit","whisper","sing"],"sentence":"The angry customer began to ______ insults at the cashier during the argument. His harsh words were so offensive that everyone in the store fell silent.","translation":"那位憤怒的顧客在爭執中開始對著收銀員怒斥辱罵。他刻薄的言語是如此冒犯，以至於店裡的每個人都沉默了。","word":"spit"}},"spite":{"createdAt":1782646761055,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"spite 表示懷著惡意或恨意去做某事，目的是使他人難堪或傷害他人。","options":["kindness","confusion","spite","curiosity"],"sentence":"He made that rude comment out of ______ because she had rejected his invitation. His intention was clearly to hurt her feelings in retaliation.","translation":"他出於怨恨而說出那句粗魯的評論，因為她拒絕了他的邀請。他的目的顯然是報復性地傷害她的感受。","word":"spite"}},"splash":{"createdAt":1781274836863,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"splash作為名詞表示液體濺起的動作或聲音，通常伴隨水四處飛濺。","options":["splash","silence","movement","dive"],"sentence":"The child made a big ______ when she jumped into the swimming pool. Water flew everywhere and soaked everyone standing nearby.","translation":"當女孩跳進游泳池時，她激起了很大的水花。水到處飛濺，浸濕了附近站著的每個人。","word":"splash"}},"splendid":{"createdAt":1785893098098,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"splendid 是形容詞，意為輝煌的、壯麗的、優秀的，用來描述令人印象深刻、華麗或傑出的事物。","options":["ordinary","splendid","simple","broken"],"sentence":"The palace's ______ architecture impressed every visitor who walked through its golden gates. The intricate carvings and brilliant jewels adorning the walls made it truly magnificent.","translation":"宮殿的輝煌建築令每位走過其金色大門的訪客印象深刻。牆上精緻的雕刻和閃耀的珠寶使其真正壯麗非凡。","word":"splendid"}},"splendor":{"createdAt":1784438808445,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"splendor 意指光彩、壯麗或顯赫，用來形容華麗、雄偉、令人印象深刻的外觀或場景。","options":["clutter","darkness","splendor","simplicity"],"sentence":"The royal palace was filled with ______ and grandeur, featuring golden chandeliers and marble floors. Visitors were amazed by the sheer beauty and magnificence of every room they entered.","translation":"皇家宮殿充滿了光彩和壯麗，擁有金色吊燈和大理石地板。遊客對他們進入的每個房間的純粹美麗和宏偉感到驚嘆。","word":"splendor"}},"split":{"createdAt":1783256139029,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"split 指的是物體被分開或產生的裂縫。","options":["coating","split","seal","layer"],"sentence":"The deep ______ in the foundation wall was growing wider each month and threatened the building's stability. Engineers warned that immediate repairs were necessary to prevent catastrophic collapse.","translation":"地基牆上的深裂縫每個月都在加寬，威脅著建築物的穩定性。工程師警告說需要立即進行維修以防止災難性的倒塌。","word":"split"}},"spoil":{"createdAt":1783063953962,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"spoil表示「寵壞、溺愛」，指過度縱容使某人（通常是孩子）變得任性或不負責任。","options":["discipline","train","spoil","strengthen"],"sentence":"Parents who constantly give their children whatever they want risk to ______ them for future responsibilities. Children who never face consequences struggle to develop self-discipline.","translation":"經常給孩子任何他們想要的東西的父母有可能寵壞他們，影響他們未來的責任感。從不面臨後果的孩子難以養成自律精神。","word":"spoil"}},"spoilt":{"createdAt":1781842254312,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"spoilt 作為形容詞表示被寵壞的，指由於過度縱容而變得性格不好、任性或不知感恩的人。","options":["determined","humble","spoilt","disciplined"],"sentence":"The ______ teenager demanded an expensive sports car for his birthday, having been given everything he wanted since childhood. His parents had never refused him anything, which created his ungrateful and demanding attitude.","translation":"這個被寵壞的少年要求在他生日時得到一輛昂貴的跑車，因為他從小就被給予了他想要的一切。他的父母從未拒絕過他，這創造了他不感恩和苛刻的態度。","word":"spoilt"}},"spokesman":{"createdAt":1784516105917,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spokesman 是指代表公司、政府或組織發言的官方發言人，負責向媒體和公眾傳達官方訊息。","options":["journalist","spokesman","customer","employee"],"sentence":"The company's ______ announced the new product launch at the press conference. He was carefully chosen because he represents the organization's official position on all major announcements.","translation":"公司的代言人在新聞發布會上宣布了新產品發布。他被精心選中，因為他代表組織對所有重大公告的官方立場。","word":"spokesman"}},"sponge":{"createdAt":1784176210343,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sponge是指一種多孔的吸水物質，常用於清潔，能吸收和釋放液體。","options":["cloth","sponge","brush","mop"],"sentence":"She used a wet ______ to clean the dishes and wipe down the kitchen counter. The absorbent material easily soaked up water and soap.","translation":"她用濕海綿清洗餐具並擦拭廚房檯面。這種吸水材料很容易吸收水和肥皂。","word":"sponge"}},"spongy":{"createdAt":1783851650431,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"spongy 形容物質具有海綿的特性，柔軟、吸收性強、富有彈性，能被輕易壓縮又能快速恢復。","options":["firm","rigid","spongy","solid"],"sentence":"The mattress felt ______ when I pressed my hand into it. The material compressed easily and quickly returned to its original shape, absorbing the pressure without firmness.","translation":"當我用手按壓床墊時，它摸起來像海綿一樣。這種材料容易被壓縮，並迅速恢復到原來的形狀，吸收壓力而沒有硬度。","word":"spongy"}},"sponsor":{"createdAt":1783262026081,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sponsor 作為動詞表示「贊助」，指提供經費或資源支持某項活動或機構。","options":["attend","sponsor","join","watch"],"sentence":"The local bank agreed to ______ the youth soccer league for the upcoming season. Without their financial support, the team would not have been able to purchase uniforms and equipment.","translation":"當地銀行同意在即將到來的賽季贊助青年足球聯盟。沒有他們的財務支持，球隊將無法購買制服和設備。","word":"sponsor"}},"sponsorship":{"createdAt":1781403377828,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sponsorship 指的是公司或個人為了獲得宣傳權而投資支持某個活動或組織。","options":["ticket","sponsorship","membership","donation"],"sentence":"The tech company secured a lucrative ______ of the international soccer tournament. Their logo appeared on every advertisement and broadcast throughout the entire event.","translation":"這家科技公司獲得了國際足球錦標賽的有利可圖的主辦權。他們的標誌出現在整個賽事的每個廣告和播放中。","word":"sponsorship"}},"spontaneous":{"createdAt":1781738724027,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spontaneous指的是未經計劃或思考而自然而然發生的行為或反應。","options":["rehearsed","spontaneous","scheduled","deliberate"],"sentence":"Her ______ laughter erupted from the audience during the comedian's performance. No one had prepared or planned for the moment; everyone simply burst out laughing naturally at the funny joke.","translation":"在喜劇演員的表演中，她自發的笑聲從觀眾席中爆發出來。沒有人為這一刻做過準備或計劃；每個人都自然而然地對這個有趣的笑話突然大笑。","word":"spontaneous"}},"sporadic":{"createdAt":1789363793856,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sporadic 形容事物零星地、偶爾地或不規則地發生，而不是持續或定期發生。","options":["constant","heavy","sporadic","seasonal"],"sentence":"The region experienced only ______ rainfall during the dry season, making agriculture extremely difficult. Farmers could not rely on consistent water supply for their crops.","translation":"該地區在乾季只經歷了零星降雨，使農業變得非常困難。農民無法依賴穩定的水供來灌溉作物。","word":"sporadic"}},"sportsman":{"createdAt":1784614286374,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sportsman 不僅指參加運動的人，更強調具有體育精神和良好品德的運動員，體現公平競爭和尊重精神。","options":["athlete","sportsman","player","competitor"],"sentence":"He was a true ______, always showing respect to his opponents and accepting both victories and defeats with grace. His conduct both on and off the field inspired young athletes everywhere.","translation":"他是一位真正的運動愛好者，總是尊重對手，優雅地接受勝利和失敗。他在場上和場外的表現激勵了世界各地的年輕運動員。","word":"sportsman"}},"sportsmanship":{"createdAt":1784176210342,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sportsmanship是指運動員應有的品德和精神，包括誠實、尊重對手和優雅面對勝敗。","options":["fitness","coaching","sportsmanship","equipment"],"sentence":"Even though he lost the game, his excellent ______ earned him respect from everyone. He congratulated the winner and accepted defeat gracefully.","translation":"儘管他輸了比賽，他出色的運動員風範贏得了所有人的尊重。他祝賀勝者並優雅地接受了失敗。","word":"sportsmanship"}},"spot":{"createdAt":1783557858056,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spot作為動詞表示發現、看到或注意到某人或某物，特別是在困難的情況下識別出目標。","options":["ignore","spot","understand","remember"],"sentence":"The detective managed to ______ the criminal in the crowded market. Her trained eye recognized him immediately despite the disguise he was wearing.","translation":"偵探在擁擠的市場中發現了那名罪犯。儘管他穿著偽裝，她訓練有素的眼睛還是立即認出了他。","word":"spot"}},"spotlight":{"createdAt":1781565657693,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spotlight 名詞指舞台或攝影中使用的聚光燈設備，也引伸為大眾關注或媒體注意的焦點。","options":["curtain","spotlight","microphone","backdrop"],"sentence":"The theater director positioned the ______ to illuminate the lead actor on stage. The bright beam of light created a visible circle around the performer, drawing all audience attention to him.","translation":"劇院導演將聚光燈放置在舞台上來照亮主演員。這束明亮的光線在演員周圍創造了一個可見的圓圈，將所有觀眾的注意力吸引到他身上。","word":"spotlight"}},"spotlit":{"createdAt":1781582251996,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spotlit 是形容詞，表示被聚光燈或集中光源直接照射的狀態。","options":["shadowed","spotlit","hidden","obscured"],"sentence":"The ______ actor stood alone on the dark stage, with only a single bright light illuminating his face. The rest of the theater remained in complete darkness.","translation":"那位被聚光燈照射的演員獨自站在黑暗的舞台上，只有一束明亮的光線照射著他的臉。劇院的其他部分保持完全黑暗。","word":"spotlit"}},"spotted":{"createdAt":1783479823220,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spotted 作為動詞表示「發現、注意到」，特別是指無意中看到或識別出某物。","options":["ignored","spotted","passed","avoided"],"sentence":"The detective ______ a suspicious car near the crime scene yesterday. The vehicle matched the exact description that witnesses had reported.","translation":"偵探昨天在犯罪現場附近發現了一輛可疑的車。那輛車與證人報告的確切描述相符。","word":"spotted"}},"spouse":{"createdAt":1782883637407,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"spouse是正式的法律用語，指已婚的丈夫或妻子，強調婚姻的法律關係。","options":["spouse","partner","companion","friend"],"sentence":"After the wedding ceremony, Sarah introduced her new ______ to all the guests. They had just exchanged vows and legally became married partners.","translation":"婚禮後，莎拉向所有賓客介紹了她的新配偶。他們剛剛交換了誓言，在法律上成為了已婚伴侶。","word":"spouse"}},"sprain":{"createdAt":1784454261444,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sprain 是指韌帶或肌腱因過度伸展而受到的傷害，導致扭傷。","options":["fracture","bruise","sprain","cramp"],"sentence":"The athlete suffered a serious ______ of her ankle during the basketball game. She couldn't put weight on her foot and had to be carried off the court.","translation":"運動員在籃球比賽中腳踝嚴重扭傷。她無法用腳著地，不得不被抬出球場。","word":"sprain"}},"sprang":{"createdAt":1781849847399,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sprang是spring的過去式，表示迅速地跳或突然出現，與「快速移動」的線索相符。","options":["walked","sprang","sat","climbed"],"sentence":"The cat ______ from the windowsill without any warning. It moved so quickly that nobody saw it coming.","translation":"貓從窗台上跳躍而下，完全沒有任何警告。它移動得如此之快，以至於沒有人看到它的動作。","word":"sprang"}},"sprawl":{"createdAt":1789363793854,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sprawl 指城市或城鎮無計畫地向外擴張，也可指東西無序地散開或蔓延。","options":["shrink","sprawl","collapse","retreat"],"sentence":"The suburbs continue to ______ across the countryside, consuming farmland at an alarming rate. City planners worry that this uncontrolled expansion will eventually destroy the natural landscape.","translation":"郊區持續蔓延到鄉村地區，以驚人的速度吞併農地。城市規劃者擔心這種無節制的擴張最終會摧毀自然景觀。","word":"sprawl"}},"sprawling":{"createdAt":1783005778370,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sprawling 意為「蔓延的」或「無序擴展的」，形容某物無計劃地向四面八方延伸擴張。","options":["compact","organized","sprawling","vertical"],"sentence":"The ______ metropolis covered hundreds of square kilometers with scattered neighborhoods and shopping districts. Urban planners struggled to coordinate transportation and utilities across such a vast, disorganized area.","translation":"這座蔓延的大都市覆蓋數百平方公里，散落著街區和購物區。城市規劃者努力在如此廣闊、無序的地區協調運輸和公用事業。","word":"sprawling"}},"spray":{"createdAt":1781425096277,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spray 作名詞時指細小的液體顆粒或霧狀物質被噴出；作動詞時指噴灑或噴霧，通常產生細小的水珠或液體微粒。","options":["stream","spray","puddle","wave"],"sentence":"The child ran through the garden and felt the cool ______ from the watering can on a hot summer afternoon. Each fine mist of tiny water droplets refreshed her skin as she played near the flowers.","translation":"孩子在花園裡奔跑，在炎熱的夏日午後感受到澆水罐的清涼噴霧。細小的水滴霧氣在她靠近花朵時讓她的皮膚感到清爽。","word":"spray"}},"spread":{"createdAt":1783256139027,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spread 表示某物向周圍擴散、蔓延或傳播開去。","options":["contract","spread","settle","concentrate"],"sentence":"The disease began to ______ rapidly throughout the city in early spring. Health officials warned that the infection rate doubled every week.","translation":"這種疾病在早春開始迅速在整個城市蔓延。衛生官員警告感染率每周翻倍。","word":"spread"}},"spring":{"createdAt":1781849511877,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"春天是一年中的季節，介於冬天和夏天之間，特點是溫度上升、花草生長。","options":["summer","winter","spring","autumn"],"sentence":"Every ______, the flowers bloom and the weather becomes warmer after a long, cold winter. The season brings new life to gardens and parks around the city.","translation":"每到春天，花朵盛開，經過漫長寒冷的冬天後天氣變得溫暖。這個季節為城市周圍的花園和公園帶來新的生命。","word":"spring"}},"sprint":{"createdAt":1784355209441,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sprint是指在短距離內以最快速度奔跑，通常用於比賽中快速衝過終點或短距離比賽。","options":["jog","sprint","walk","stumble"],"sentence":"The Olympic athlete decided to ______ the final 100 meters to cross the finish line first. She had saved all her energy for this short burst of maximum speed.","translation":"那位奧運選手決定在最後100公尺進行短距離快速奔跑以率先越過終點線。她為了這段短暫的最大速度爆發而保留了所有體力。","word":"sprint"}},"spur":{"createdAt":1783392139526,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"spur 在此用作名詞，表示激勵或刺激某人採取行動的東西。","options":["obstacle","spur","distraction","burden"],"sentence":"The coach's encouraging words acted as a ______ for the athlete to train harder. His motivation increased dramatically after receiving that praise.","translation":"教練鼓勵的話語成為了運動員更努力訓練的刺激。在得到那讚美後，他的動力大幅增加。","word":"spur"}},"squad":{"createdAt":1783774320515,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"squad 指的是為特定任務組成的小型職業團隊，通常具有專門的訓練和角色。","options":["construction","kit","squad","team"],"sentence":"The police ______ responded quickly to the bank robbery call last night. Their specialized unit, trained in tactical response and hostage negotiation, arrived within five minutes.","translation":"警察小隊昨晚迅速回應了銀行搶劫的報警電話。他們經過戰術應對和人質談判培訓的特殊單位在五分鐘內到達。","word":"squad"}},"square":{"createdAt":1781429810253,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"square作為形容詞表示四邊相等、四個角都是直角的正方形形狀。","options":["swift","symbol","square","rite"],"sentence":"The carpenter cut the wood into a ______ shape with equal sides and right angles at each corner. This geometric form is often used in construction and design.","translation":"木匠將木頭切成正方形，邊長相等，每個角都是直角。這種幾何形狀經常用於建築和設計。","word":"square"}},"squash":{"createdAt":1786371505536,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"squash 作為動詞，表示用力把東西壓扁或擠扁，特別是指施加壓力使其變形。","options":["lift","squash","carry","drop"],"sentence":"The heavy box began to ______ the delicate flowers underneath it. By the time we removed the box, the petals were completely flattened and destroyed.","translation":"那個沉重的盒子開始把下面的嬌嫩花朵壓扁。當我們移開盒子時，花瓣已經完全被壓平並毀損了。","word":"squash"}},"squat":{"createdAt":1781950727566,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"squat 指蹲下或坐在腳跟上，身體接近地面。","options":["run","squat","jump","lie"],"sentence":"The firefighters had to ______ down to avoid the thick smoke while searching for survivors. Their low position helped them breathe fresher air near the floor.","translation":"消防員不得不蹲下以避開濃煙，同時搜尋倖存者。他們較低的位置幫助他們呼吸靠近地板的新鮮空氣。","word":"squat"}},"squeeze":{"createdAt":1782228779948,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"squeeze在此指透過威脅或強迫手段非法榨取他人的金錢或利益，是一種欺詐行為。","options":["borrow","squeeze","donate","negotiate"],"sentence":"The corrupt officials tried to ______ money from local businesses by threatening to shut them down. Shop owners were forced to pay illegal fees or face closure.","translation":"貪污官員試圖通過威脅關閉企業來從當地商家勒索金錢。店主被迫支付非法費用，否則面臨關閉。","word":"squeeze"}},"stab":{"createdAt":1783572474514,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stab作為動詞意為「刺、戳」，表示用尖銳的物體快速地刺穿或戳入某物。","options":["slice","stab","mince","chop"],"sentence":"The cook used a knife to ______ holes into the meat before seasoning it. This technique allows the marinade to penetrate deep into the flesh more effectively.","translation":"廚師用刀在肉上戳洞，然後才調味。這種技術讓醃料能更有效地深入肉中。","word":"stab"}},"stability":{"createdAt":1781345237584,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stability指事物保持穩定、平衡且不易改變的特性或狀態。","options":["chaos","stability","uncertainty","volatility"],"sentence":"Economic ______ is essential for a country's long-term growth and development. A reliable government and consistent policies help maintain this important condition.","translation":"經濟穩定性對國家的長期增長和發展至關重要。可靠的政府和一致的政策有助於維持這一重要條件。","word":"stability"}},"stabilize":{"createdAt":1784723233352,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stabilize 作為動詞，表示使某物變得穩定、堅固或平穩，防止其惡化或崩潰。","options":["decorate","stabilize","relocate","demolish"],"sentence":"After the earthquake, engineers worked quickly to ______ the damaged building. Their structural repairs prevented it from collapsing further.","translation":"地震後，工程師們快速工作以穩固受損的建築。他們的結構修復阻止了它進一步坍塌。","word":"stabilize"}},"stable":{"createdAt":1783843483368,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stable表示「穩定的」或「保持不變的」，特別強調事物在一段時間內保持一致、不易波動的特性。","options":["strong","stable","impressive","growing"],"sentence":"The company's ______ financial performance over the past five years has attracted many investors. The profits remained consistent and predictable throughout all market conditions.","translation":"該公司過去五年穩定的財務表現吸引了許多投資者。在所有市場條件下，利潤始終保持一致且可預測。","word":"stable"}},"stack":{"createdAt":1782352245067,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"stack指的是將物品整齊地堆疊在一起形成的堆或疊。","options":["single sheet","scattering","stack","archive"],"sentence":"The office worker had a ______ of papers on her desk waiting to be filed. She organized them into neat piles according to their importance.","translation":"辦公室工作人員的桌子上有一堆等待歸檔的文件。她根據重要性將它們整理成整齊的堆。","word":"stack"}},"stadium":{"createdAt":1781746685501,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"stadium指的是露天運動場、體育場館，是舉辦各類運動比賽和大型活動的場所。","options":["stadium","duration","editorials","sober"],"sentence":"Thousands of fans gathered in the ______ to watch the championship game. The massive structure had seating for over fifty thousand spectators.","translation":"數千名球迷聚集在運動場觀看冠軍賽。這座龐大的建築可容納超過五萬名觀眾。","word":"stadium"}},"staff":{"createdAt":1784193612984,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"staff在這裡指的是學校的全體教職員，包括教師和行政人員，而不是學生或家長。","options":["students","staff","parents","board"],"sentence":"The principal met with the entire ______ to discuss the new school policies. All the teachers and administrators gathered in the conference room to hear the announcements.","translation":"校長與全體教職員開會討論新的學校政策。所有的教師和行政人員都聚集在會議室聽取公告。","word":"staff"}},"stage":{"createdAt":1783656305276,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"stage在此指劇院或表演場所中供演員表演的舞台，是演出的中心區域。","options":["stage","platform","screen","hall"],"sentence":"The actors performed on the ______ while the audience watched from their seats. The lighting and sound system were positioned to enhance the show.","translation":"演員在舞台上表演，而觀眾從座位上觀看。照明和音響系統被放置以增強演出效果。","word":"stage"}},"stagger":{"createdAt":1784683301268,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stagger是指不穩定地搖晃或蹌踉地走路，通常因為身體不穩定或失去平衡。","options":["impress","stagger","celebrate","organize"],"sentence":"After drinking too much at the party, he began to ______ across the room. His friends were concerned because he could barely keep his balance and nearly fell several times.","translation":"派對上喝太多酒後，他開始蹣跚地穿過房間。他的朋友們很擔心，因為他幾乎無法保持平衡，好幾次差點跌倒。","word":"stagger"}},"stain":{"createdAt":1781626081103,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"stain 作為動詞表示玷污、損害或留下不良印象，特別是用於描述對聲譽、名譽或品格的損害。","options":["polish","enhance","stain","improve"],"sentence":"The scandal would ______ his reputation forever in the eyes of the public. His involvement in the corruption case left a permanent mark on his career that could never be erased.","translation":"這樁醜聞將在公眾眼中永遠玷污他的聲譽。他涉及貪污案件在他的職業生涯中留下了永久的污點，永遠無法消除。","word":"stain"}},"staircase":{"createdAt":1782533789134,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"staircase 名詞意思是樓梯，是連接不同樓層的建築結構。","options":["corridor","staircase","hallway","entrance"],"sentence":"The grand ______ in the mansion featured marble steps and ornate railings. Visitors could see the architectural beauty displayed in every detail of its design.","translation":"宅邸中的宏偉樓梯以大理石階梯和華麗的欄杆為特色。遊客可以看到建築美學在其設計的每個細節中展現。","word":"staircase"}},"stake":{"createdAt":1782016805982,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stake 是名詞，在商業語境中表示投資或股份，即對企業的所有權比例。","options":["debt","stake","loss","expense"],"sentence":"He decided to increase his ______ in the business venture by investing an additional $50,000. This meant he now owned a larger percentage of the company than before.","translation":"他決定通過額外投資五萬美元來增加他在商業企業中的股份。這意味著他現在擁有該公司比以前更大的百分比。","word":"stake"}},"stale":{"createdAt":1784042974327,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"stale 形容詞表示「不新鮮的、走味的」，用來描述食物失去新鮮度或質地變乾變硬的狀態。","options":["stale","fresh","delicious","soft"],"sentence":"The bread had become ______ after sitting on the shelf for two weeks without proper storage. Even though it smelled fine, it was hard as a rock and completely inedible.","translation":"麵包在架子上放了兩週而沒有妥善保存後變得不新鮮了。雖然聞起來沒問題，但它硬得像石頭一樣，完全不能吃。","word":"stale"}},"stall":{"createdAt":1781311922063,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stall 是指在市場或展覽會上的臨時販賣攤位或小亭子。","options":["store","stall","warehouse","garden"],"sentence":"At the farmer's market, the elderly woman sold fresh vegetables from her ______. Customers lined up every Saturday morning to buy tomatoes and lettuce from her small booth.","translation":"在農夫市集裡，那位老婦人從她的攤位上販賣新鮮蔬菜。顧客每個星期六早上都排隊到她的小販賣處購買番茄和生菜。","word":"stall"}},"stalled":{"createdAt":1782352245064,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"stalled形容引擎突然停止運轉或車輛無法繼續前進。","options":["accelerated","started","stalled","sped up"],"sentence":"The car engine ______ in the middle of the intersection during rush hour. The driver had to call for roadside assistance to get the vehicle restarted.","translation":"汽車引擎在交通高峰期間在十字路口熄火。司機不得不致電路邊援助以重新啟動車輛。","word":"stalled"}},"stamen":{"createdAt":1783243988713,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stamen是花的雄蕊，負責產生花粉，是花的雄性生殖器官","options":["petal","stamen","sepal","pistil"],"sentence":"The ______ is the male reproductive organ of a flower. It produces pollen that is essential for plant reproduction.","translation":"花的______ 是花的雄性繁殖器官。它產生對植物繁殖至關重要的花粉。","word":"stamen"}},"stance":{"createdAt":1781402154552,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"stance表示對某個議題的觀點或立場，在這句話中指政府對氣候變遷採取的官方立場。","options":["lottery","lack","stance","hijack"],"sentence":"The government's ______ on climate change has become much stricter in recent years. Officials have publicly declared their commitment to reducing carbon emissions by 50% within the next decade.","translation":"近年來政府在氣候變遷上的立場變得嚴格得多。官員們已公開宣布他們承諾在未來十年內減少50%的碳排放。","word":"stance"}},"stand":{"createdAt":1781838276307,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"stand作為動詞表示容忍或忍受某事。","options":["compress","claim","stand","toll"],"sentence":"I cannot ______ the bitter taste of black coffee without any sugar or cream. Every time I try to drink it, I have to add sweetener immediately.","translation":"我無法忍受黑咖啡不加糖或奶油的苦味。每次我試著喝它時，我都得立即加入甜味劑。","word":"stand"}},"standard":{"createdAt":1783400753212,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"standard 作為名詞指的是規範或基準；作為形容詞表示符合普遍認可的品質或規範的。","options":["unique","standard","optional","temporary"],"sentence":"The new product must meet the ______ requirements set by the industry. These specifications ensure that all items maintain consistent quality and safety.","translation":"新產品必須達到業界制定的標準要求。這些規格確保所有物品都保持一致的品質和安全性。","word":"standard"}},"stank":{"createdAt":1782374070902,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stank 是 stink 的過去式，表示「發出惡臭」，用來形容某物散發出令人不快的氣味。","options":["sparkled","stank","overflowed","rattled"],"sentence":"The garbage that sat in the sun for a week ______ terribly. We had to hold our noses and quickly dispose of the rotting waste.","translation":"在陽光下放了一週的垃圾發出了可怕的惡臭。我們必須捂住鼻子，迅速處理腐爛的廢物。","word":"stank"}},"staple":{"createdAt":1781832549169,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"staple 作為名詞時指某物的主要或必需的部分，特別是指日常飲食中的基本食物。","options":["luxury","staple","exotic","expensive"],"sentence":"Rice is a ______ food in many Asian countries and has been for thousands of years. In China, Japan, and Vietnam, it appears on nearly every dinner table as the main carbohydrate source.","translation":"米飯是許多亞洲國家的主要食物，已有數千年的歷史。在中國、日本和越南，它幾乎出現在每個餐桌上，作為主要的碳水化合物來源。","word":"staple"}},"stare":{"createdAt":1786432445299,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stare 是指長時間直視某人或某物，通常帶有強烈的情感或注意力，與短暫的瞥視不同。","options":["glance","stare","wink","gaze"],"sentence":"The angry customer gave the waiter a cold ______ when he brought the wrong order. His eyes didn't blink or look away, expressing his displeasure through intense, uninterrupted eye contact.","translation":"當服務生端上錯誤的餐點時，憤怒的顧客給了他一個冷淡的凝視。他的眼睛沒有眨眼或移開，透過強烈而不中斷的眼神接觸表達他的不滿。","word":"stare"}},"startle":{"createdAt":1783693741506,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"startle表示突然使某人感到驚訝或害怕，通常是因為意外的事件或聲音。","options":["relax","frighten","startle","comfort"],"sentence":"The loud noise did not ______ Maria because she had expected the alarm to go off. She remained calm and composed throughout the entire fire drill.","translation":"巨大的噪音沒有使瑪麗亞大吃一驚，因為她預料到警報會響起。她在整個消防演習中始終保持冷靜和沉著。","word":"startle"}},"startling":{"createdAt":1782303071291,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"startling 意為令人吃驚的、驚人的，用來形容令人感到意外和震驚的事物","options":["distant","startling","compass","doctrine"],"sentence":"The ______ announcement about the company's bankruptcy shocked everyone in the room. Nobody had expected such unexpected news.","translation":"關於公司破產的令人吃驚的宣佈震驚了房間裡的每個人。沒有人預料到這樣的意外消息。","word":"startling"}},"starvation":{"createdAt":1781531595650,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"starvation 表示因缺乏食物而導致的嚴重飢荒狀態，甚至可能導致死亡。","options":["migration","starvation","poverty","disease"],"sentence":"The famine led to widespread ______ in the region. Thousands of people died because food supplies had completely run out.","translation":"飢荒導致該地區普遍挨餓。由於食物供應完全耗盡，數千人死亡。","word":"starvation"}},"starve":{"createdAt":1782140283167,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"starve是動詞，表示使某人挨餓或死於飢餓，也可表達對某事物的強烈渴望。","options":["feast","thrive","starve","flourish"],"sentence":"After being stranded on the island for weeks, the survivors began to ______ without any food supplies. They desperately needed rescue to avoid dying of hunger.","translation":"在島上被困了幾週後，倖存者開始因為沒有食物供應而挨餓。他們迫切需要救援以避免餓死。","word":"starve"}},"stasis":{"createdAt":1783489104907,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"停滯是指事物處於靜止或不動的狀態，在經濟學中指經濟增長停止，毫無進展。","options":["expansion","stasis","prosperity","boom"],"sentence":"The economy fell into ______ as businesses refused to invest and consumers stopped spending. Economic growth came to a complete standstill.","translation":"隨著企業拒絕投資和消費者停止消費，經濟陷入停滯。經濟增長完全停頓。","word":"stasis"}},"state":{"createdAt":1784431968390,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"state（狀態）在此指事物或地區的現有條件或情況，經常用於描述某地區、國家或系統的整體狀況。","options":["color","state","opinion","question"],"sentence":"The governor gave a speech outlining the economic ______ of the region during the press conference. He discussed unemployment rates, business growth, and the overall financial conditions affecting citizens.","translation":"州長在新聞發佈會上發表演講，概述該地區的經濟______。他討論了失業率、商業增長以及影響公民的整體財務狀況。","word":"state"}},"statement":{"createdAt":1782921669883,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"statement是名詞，指正式的陳述或聲明，通常是官方的、正式發布的言論或文件。","options":["question","statement","rumor","opinion"],"sentence":"The company issued an official ______ regarding the product recall. The document was signed by the CEO and distributed to all media outlets.","translation":"該公司就產品召回發布了正式聲明。該文件由執行長簽署並分發給所有媒體機構。","word":"statement"}},"statesman":{"createdAt":1785239658852,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"statesman是指在政治領域中經驗豐富、具有高度政治智慧和外交才能的政治人物，通常擁有長期的政治生涯和國際影響力。","options":["businessman","statesman","journalist","soldier"],"sentence":"The experienced ______ negotiated the peace treaty between the two nations. His decades of diplomatic service and political wisdom earned him respect from leaders across the globe.","translation":"這位資深的政治家在兩個國家之間談判和平條約。他數十年的外交服務和政治智慧贏得了全球領導人的尊重。","word":"statesman"}},"static":{"createdAt":1785242681790,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"static 指靜止的、不變的、停滯的狀態，在商業語境中表示沒有變化的數據或現象","options":["volatile","increasing","static","declining"],"sentence":"The company's revenue remained ______ throughout the entire year. There was no growth or decline; the numbers stayed exactly the same every quarter.","translation":"整個年度公司的收入保持停滯不變。沒有增長也沒有下降；每個季度的數字都完全相同。","word":"static"}},"station":{"createdAt":1782552499018,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"station 是指火車、巴士等交通工具的停靠點或樞紐，用來上下乘客的場所。","options":["terminal","station","depot","platform"],"sentence":"I need to catch a train at the railway ______ this morning. The platform number is posted on the electronic board at the entrance.","translation":"我今天早上需要在火車站趕上火車。月台號碼貼在入口處的電子看板上。","word":"station"}},"stationary":{"createdAt":1788060617387,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stationary 是形容詞，表示某物保持在固定位置、不移動或靜止不動的狀態。","options":["mobile","stationary","traveling","moving"],"sentence":"The ______ bicycle was locked to the fence and did not move at all. The mechanic confirmed that all parts remained in a fixed position without any motion.","translation":"那輛靜止的自行車被鎖在柵欄上，完全不動。機械師確認所有零件都保持在固定位置，沒有任何運動。","word":"stationary"}},"stationery":{"createdAt":1783945686781,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stationery 是名詞，指書寫和辦公用的各類文具用品，包括筆、紙張、信封等。","options":["furniture","stationery","decoration","equipment"],"sentence":"I need to buy some ______ for my office before the new school year begins. I'm looking for pens, notebooks, and folders at the supply store.","translation":"在新學年開始前，我需要為我的辦公室購買一些文具。我在文具店裡尋找筆、筆記本和資料夾。","word":"stationery"}},"statistical":{"createdAt":1784176210340,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"statistical是指與統計學或統計數據相關的，涉及數據收集、分析和解釋。","options":["emotional","historical","statistical","fictional"],"sentence":"The ______ analysis showed that 70% of surveyed customers preferred the new product. The researchers used actual data and numbers to reach this conclusion.","translation":"統計分析顯示，70%的受調查客戶更喜歡新產品。研究人員使用實際的數據和數字得出了這個結論。","word":"statistical"}},"statistics":{"createdAt":1786518060346,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"statistics 是指數據和數字分析，用於描述和解釋現象；在此句中特別指代具體的測試成績數據和相關分析。","options":["literature","statistics","hypotheses","theories"],"sentence":"The research team collected ______ about student test scores across all schools in the district. These numerical data and analysis will help educators identify trends and make informed decisions about curriculum improvements.","translation":"研究團隊收集了全區所有學校學生考試成績的統計數據。這些數字數據和分析將幫助教育工作者發現趨勢並做出有關課程改進的明智決定。","word":"statistics"}},"statue":{"createdAt":1781917052436,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"statue指的是用石頭、金屬或其他材料製作的立體雕刻作品，常放置在公共場所供人欣賞。","options":["painting","statue","monument","sculpture"],"sentence":"The museum displayed a marble ______ of the famous general in the center of the hall. Visitors admired how the sculptor had captured every detail of his facial features and military uniform.","translation":"博物館在大廳中央展示了這位著名將軍的大理石雕像。遊客們讚賞雕塑家如何捕捉了他臉部特徵和軍裝的每一個細節。","word":"statue"}},"stature":{"createdAt":1785242681788,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stature 指身高或身材，也可指聲望和地位；在這裡搭配 modest，指身材不高但名聲和地位卻很高","options":["height","stature","appearance","character"],"sentence":"The general commanded respect despite his modest ______. His leadership and wisdom made him influential across the entire nation.","translation":"將軍儘管身材矮小卻受人尊敬。他的領導力和智慧使他在整個國家都很有影響力。","word":"stature"}},"status":{"createdAt":1783760354084,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"status 意為「身份、地位、狀態」，指一個人在社會或專業領域中的地位和認可程度。","options":["status","health","age","nationality"],"sentence":"After winning the Nobel Prize, the scientist's ______ in the academic community changed dramatically. Universities around the world suddenly invited her to speak at major conferences and head research departments.","translation":"在贏得諾貝爾獎後，這位科學家在學術界的地位發生了劇烈變化。世界各地的大學突然邀請她在重要會議上演講並領導研究部門。","word":"status"}},"statute":{"createdAt":1782016805981,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"statute 是名詞，指由政府或立法機構正式制定的法律或法規。","options":["rumor","tradition","statute","suggestion"],"sentence":"The new traffic ______ requires all drivers to wear seatbelts on highways. The government enforced this law to reduce serious injuries and fatalities in vehicle accidents.","translation":"新的交通法令要求所有駕駛在高速公路上繫安全帶。政府制定這項法律以減少車禍中的重傷和死亡事故。","word":"statute"}},"steadily":{"createdAt":1781849847408,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"steadily表示平穩地或穩固地，與「一致的步伐、不減速」的線索相符。","options":["frantically","steadily","erratically","unevenly"],"sentence":"The runner moved ______ throughout the marathon without slowing down. Her consistent pace and endurance impressed all the spectators.","translation":"跑步者在整個馬拉松比賽中平穩地前進，沒有放慢速度。她一致的步伐和耐力給所有觀眾留下了深刻印象。","word":"steadily"}},"steady":{"createdAt":1782401868809,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"steady 作為動詞表示使某物穩固或保持穩定。","options":["strengthen","steady","prepare","protect"],"sentence":"The mountain climber used a rope to ______ himself as he ascended the steep cliff. This safety measure prevented him from falling.","translation":"登山者在攀登陡峭的懸崖時用繩子使自己穩固。這一安全措施防止了他跌落。","word":"steady"}},"steam":{"createdAt":1782106346910,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"steam（蒸汽）是加熱後水或液體產生的無色氣體。","options":["smoke","steam","heat","water"],"sentence":"The ______ rose from the boiling pot of water on the stove. It was hot enough to fog up all the kitchen windows within seconds.","translation":"蒸汽從爐子上沸騰的一鍋水中升起。它足夠熱，在幾秒鐘內就能使所有廚房窗戶起霧。","word":"steam"}},"steel":{"createdAt":1784428748136,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"steel 是名詞，指鋼鐵，是一種由鐵和碳組成的合金，具有高強度和耐久性，廣泛用於建築和製造業。","options":["concrete","wood","steel","plastic"],"sentence":"The bridge was constructed from ______ to ensure it could withstand heavy traffic and extreme weather. This strong alloy of iron and carbon provides exceptional durability and strength.","translation":"這座橋是由鋼鐵建造的，以確保它能承受繁重的交通和極端天氣。這種由鐵和碳組成的強合金提供了卓越的耐久性和強度。","word":"steel"}},"steep":{"createdAt":1782980805885,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"steep 作形容詞，表示傾斜度很大、非常陡峭的地形或表面。","options":["gentle","steep","narrow","winding"],"sentence":"The mountain path was so ______ that hikers needed to use ropes and climbing equipment. The angle of the incline made it nearly vertical in some sections.","translation":"山路非常陡峭，登山者需要使用繩索和攀登設備。在某些路段，斜坡的角度幾乎是垂直的。","word":"steep"}},"steer":{"createdAt":1784176210341,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"steer是指駕駛或控制交通工具的方向，特別是通過掌方向盤或操控裝置。","options":["anchor","steer","repair","load"],"sentence":"The captain used the wheel to ______ the ship through the narrow channel. He carefully controlled the direction of the vessel.","translation":"船長用輪盤來操控船隻通過狹窄的航道。他小心地控制了船隻的方向。","word":"steer"}},"stem":{"createdAt":1781677018340,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stem作名詞，表示植物的「莖」，是連接根和葉子、花朵的主要結構，提供支撐和營養輸送。","options":["root","stem","flower","leaf"],"sentence":"The plant's ______ grows upward toward the sunlight and provides support for the leaves. Without this central structure, the flower would collapse to the ground.","translation":"植物的莖向上生長朝向陽光，為葉子提供支撐。沒有這個中央結構，花朵會倒在地上。","word":"stem"}},"stench":{"createdAt":1786111147345,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"stench 是指一種令人厭惡和難以忍受的強烈惡臭，通常來自於腐爛、污垢或不衛生的物質。","options":["fragrance","decoration","stench","sound"],"sentence":"An unbearable ______ filled the alley after the garbage trucks failed to collect waste for two weeks. Even from a distance, people could barely tolerate the overwhelming foul odor.","translation":"在垃圾車兩週未清運垃圾後，一股難以忍受的惡臭充滿了小巷。即使距離很遠，人們也幾乎無法忍受這股壓倒性的惡臭。","word":"stench"}},"stepchild":{"createdAt":1784114470553,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stepchild 指的是因父母再婚而產生的關係，即繼父或繼母與其前一段婚姻所生的子女。","options":["cousin","stepchild","nephew","sibling"],"sentence":"Sarah's mother remarried last year, and now Sarah has a ______ who is the same age as her. The child is her mother's new husband's son from his previous marriage.","translation":"莎拉的母親去年再婚了，現在莎拉有一個和她同齡的繼子。這個孩子是她母親新丈夫前一段婚姻中的兒子。","word":"stepchild"}},"stepfather":{"createdAt":1781713470382,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"繼父是指與某人的母親或父親再婚的男性配偶，不是親生父親。","options":["uncle","stepfather","grandfather","cousin"],"sentence":"After my mother remarried, my ______ helped me with my homework every evening. He was not my biological father, but he had been married to my mother for five years.","translation":"我母親再婚後，我的繼父每晚幫助我做功課。他不是我的親生父親，但他已經和我母親結婚五年了。","word":"stepfather"}},"stepmother":{"createdAt":1781850347299,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"繼母是指一個人的父親或母親與某人結婚後所帶來的配偶，通常是在原配偶去世或離婚後再婚。","options":["guardian","stepmother","nanny","tutor"],"sentence":"After her father remarried, Sarah had to adjust to living with her new ______. The woman had been married to Sarah's father for three years and was raising her alongside her biological children.","translation":"在她父親再婚後，莎拉必須適應與她的繼母一起生活。這位女性已經與莎拉的父親結婚三年，並與她的親生子女一起撫養她。","word":"stepmother"}},"stereotype":{"createdAt":1781839703148,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"eliminate意為排除、消除，與work to break down outdated beliefs（努力打破過時信念）語境相符。","options":["reinforce","promote","stereotype","eliminate"],"sentence":"We must work to ______ outdated beliefs about different cultures and communities. Education and exposure to diverse perspectives are essential tools.","translation":"我們必須努力消除對不同文化和社區的過時信念。教育和接觸不同的觀點是必要的工具。","word":"stereotype"}},"stick":{"createdAt":1784365643299,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"stick 在這裡指樹枝或木棒，是一種細長的木質物體，可以用來在沙地上畫畫。","options":["stone","rope","stick","bucket"],"sentence":"The child used a wooden ______ to draw pictures in the sand at the beach. He picked it up from the ground and dragged it along to create interesting patterns.","translation":"孩子用一根木棒在海灘的沙地上畫圖。他從地上撿起來，沿著地面拖動以創造有趣的圖案。","word":"stick"}},"sticky":{"createdAt":1783063660616,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sticky 表示有黏性或塗有黏膠的物質，能夠黏在其他東西上。","options":["smooth","sticky","fragile","colorful"],"sentence":"The envelope was ______ and difficult to open without tearing it. I had to carefully peel apart the edges because they were coated with adhesive.","translation":"信封是黏的，很難不撕破就打開它。我必須小心地剝開邊緣，因為它們被塗上了黏合劑。","word":"sticky"}},"stiff":{"createdAt":1783063953962,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"stiff表示「硬的、僵硬的」，描述身體或物體不能輕易彎曲或移動的狀態。","options":["flexible","relaxed","stiff","loose"],"sentence":"After sitting in the same position for hours, her muscles felt ______ and painful. She needed to stretch and move around to regain flexibility.","translation":"坐了幾個小時後，她的肌肉感到僵硬和疼痛。她需要伸展和活動以恢復靈活性。","word":"stiff"}},"stimulant":{"createdAt":1781425078613,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"興奮劑是能刺激神經系統、增強警覺性和活力但可能有負面副作用的物質。","options":["water","vitamin","stimulant","protein"],"sentence":"Many athletes avoid consuming ______ before competitions because it can cause jitteriness and elevated heart rate. The coach warned the team that such substances could affect their performance negatively.","translation":"許多運動員在比賽前避免服用興奮劑，因為它會導致發抖和心率升高。教練警告球隊這些物質可能會對他們的表現產生負面影響。","word":"stimulant"}},"stimulate":{"createdAt":1781939439465,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"stimulate作動詞表示刺激、激發或促進，使某人或某物變得更活躍或感興趣。","options":["reduce","ignore","stimulate","forget"],"sentence":"The teacher used games and interactive activities to ______ the students' interest in mathematics. By making lessons engaging and fun, she saw their participation and enthusiasm grow significantly.","translation":"老師用遊戲和互動活動刺激學生對數學的興趣。通過讓課程引人入勝且有趣，她看到他們的參與度和熱情大幅增長。","word":"stimulate"}},"stimulation":{"createdAt":1784345268152,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stimulation 是指能夠激發興趣、引起注意或產生反應的事物；在這個句子中指的是讓孩子們感到興奮和投入的各種活動。","options":["boredom","stimulation","silence","sadness"],"sentence":"The bright colors and loud music provided ______ for the children at the party. Without such engaging activities, the kids would have felt bored and restless.","translation":"派對上明亮的色彩和大聲的音樂為孩子們提供了刺激。沒有這樣引人入勝的活動，孩子們會感到無聊和不安。","word":"stimulation"}},"stimulus":{"createdAt":1783690944506,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stimulus表示「刺激、刺激物」，指能夠引起反應或引起行動的事物或因素。","options":["motivation","stimulus","interest","curiosity"],"sentence":"The teacher used a visual ______ to help students understand the difficult concept. Showing them a real-world example sparked immediate engagement and made the abstract idea concrete.","translation":"老師使用視覺刺激來幫助學生理解這個困難的概念。展示他們現實世界的例子激發了立即的參與度，使抽象觀念變得具體。","word":"stimulus"}},"sting":{"createdAt":1783558795710,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sting 作為動詞表示被昆蟲或其他生物刺傷、蟄傷，會引起尖銳的疼痛感。","options":["comfort","sting","heal","soothe"],"sentence":"The bee's venom will ______ your arm if you get too close to the hive. The sharp, burning pain lasted for several hours after the attack.","translation":"如果你靠近蜂巢，蜜蜂的毒液會刺痛你的手臂。在攻擊後，那種尖銳灼熱的疼痛持續了好幾個小時。","word":"sting"}},"stingy":{"createdAt":1781323901185,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stingy意為「吝嗇的」或「小氣的」，用來形容不願意花錢或分享金錢的人。","options":["generous","stingy","wealthy","careless"],"sentence":"My uncle has a reputation for being ______ with his money. He refuses to leave a tip at restaurants and always finds excuses to avoid sharing expenses.","translation":"我叔叔以對金錢小氣而聞名。他拒絕在餐廳留小費，總是找藉口避免分擔費用。","word":"stingy"}},"stink":{"createdAt":1781653278518,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stink是動詞，表示散發異味或發出難聞的氣味，通常用於描述令人不快的臭味，比一般的smell更強調不愉快的感受。","options":["smell","stink","appear","disappear"],"sentence":"The garbage in the alley began to ______ after sitting in the hot sun for several days. Neighbors complained about the horrible smell and demanded immediate cleanup.","translation":"在烈日下放置數天後，小巷中的垃圾開始______。鄰居們抱怨難聞的氣味，並要求立即清理。","word":"stink"}},"stitch":{"createdAt":1785487324251,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stitch是指縫紉中的單一針腳或針迹，是構成接縫的基本單位。","options":["button","stitch","seam","fold"],"sentence":"The tailor carefully made each ______ by hand to ensure the seam was strong. Without these individual loops of thread pulling the fabric together, the dress would fall apart.","translation":"裁縫師傅小心翼翼地手工製作每一針，確保接縫牢固。如果沒有這些線圈將布料拉在一起，這件連衣裙就會散開。","word":"stitch"}},"stock":{"createdAt":1783690944505,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"stock作動詞表示「進貨、儲備」，常與up搭配使用stock up，意思是準備充足的物品供應。","options":["stock","supply","gather","arrange"],"sentence":"The store needs to ______ up on fresh produce before the weekend rush. The warehouse manager checked the inventory system to see how many boxes could be delivered and shelved in time.","translation":"這家商店需要在週末繁忙時段前儲備新鮮蔬菜。倉庫經理檢查了庫存系統，看有多少箱貨物可以在時間內運送和上架。","word":"stock"}},"stool":{"createdAt":1781402539334,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stool 是一種沒有靠背和扶手的簡單座位，通常用來坐著或踩踏以達到高處。","options":["ladder","stool","wall","desk"],"sentence":"The painter stood on a small ______ to reach the ceiling. He needed something portable that he could move from room to room easily.","translation":"畫家站在一個小凳子上去接觸天花板。他需要一些他可以輕易地從一個房間移到另一個房間的東西。","word":"stool"}},"storage":{"createdAt":1781884659836,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"storage 指專門用於保存和存放物品的地點或設施，在農業語境中特別適用。","options":["greenhouse","storage","barn","cellar"],"sentence":"The farmer built a large ______ to keep grain dry and protected from pests throughout the winter. This facility prevents food spoilage and ensures supplies last until the next harvest.","translation":"農民建造了一個大型儲存設施來保持穀物乾燥並在整個冬天防止害蟲。這個設施防止食物腐爛並確保供應能持續到下一個收穫季節。","word":"storage"}},"storm":{"createdAt":1784773941953,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"storm 是指伴有強風、雨、雷電或雪的惡劣天氣現象，通常造成破壞。","options":["sunshine","breeze","storm","cloud"],"sentence":"The violent ______ knocked down trees and caused flooding throughout the city. The weather forecasters had warned residents to seek shelter before the heavy winds arrived.","translation":"暴風雨摧毀了樹木並在城市各地造成洪水。氣象預報員在狂風到達前警告居民尋求庇護。","word":"storm"}},"stout":{"createdAt":1782401868815,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stout 表示粗壯、堅固或肥胖的特徵。","options":["thin","stout","brittle","hollow"],"sentence":"The old oak tree had a ______ trunk that had been growing for hundreds of years. Its thick, powerful wood could withstand strong storms.","translation":"這棵古老的橡樹有一個粗壯的樹幹，已經生長了幾百年。它厚重有力的木質可以承受強風暴。","word":"stout"}},"straight":{"createdAt":1781775363748,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"straight 表示筆直的，沒有彎曲的形狀，用來描述沒有彎曲的道路。","options":["narrow","straight","empty","flat"],"sentence":"The road ahead appeared ______ and clear with no curves or intersections. We could see all the way to the horizon without any obstacles blocking our view.","translation":"前面的路看起來______，沒有彎曲或十字路口。我們可以一直看到地平線，沒有任何障礙物阻擋我們的視線。","word":"straight"}},"straighten":{"createdAt":1782092862165,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"straighten意思是使某物變直或恢復正常位置，特別是用來修正彎曲或不正確的位置。","options":["adjust","straighten","tighten","secure"],"sentence":"Please ______ that crooked painting on the wall before the guests arrive. The frame is currently tilted at a 45-degree angle to the right.","translation":"在客人到達前，請把牆上那幅歪斜的畫弄直。這個相框目前向右傾斜了45度角。","word":"straighten"}},"straightforward":{"createdAt":1781449095512,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"straightforward意為率直的、坦率的，用來形容清楚直接、沒有隱瞞的表達或方式。","options":["complicated","straightforward","vague","mysterious"],"sentence":"The manager gave a ______ answer to the employee's question. There was no ambiguity or hidden meaning in what he said.","translation":"經理對員工的問題給出了率直的答案。他所說的話沒有任何歧義或隱含意思。","word":"straightforward"}},"strain":{"createdAt":1783389641948,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"strain是指肌肉或肌腱因過度使用或拉傷而造成的損傷，通常不如骨折嚴重。","options":["break","strain","fracture","injury"],"sentence":"She felt a terrible ______ in her lower back after lifting the heavy box. The doctor said she had overstretched the muscles and needed rest to recover.","translation":"她在抬起重箱子後感到下背部有一陣恐怖的拉傷。醫生說她過度拉傷了肌肉，需要休息才能恢復。","word":"strain"}},"strained":{"createdAt":1781746848180,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"strained 表示「拉傷」或「扭傷」，描述肌肉或肌腱受傷的狀態。","options":["relaxed","strong","strained","flexible"],"sentence":"After lifting the heavy box incorrectly, his back felt ______. The doctor recommended rest and physical therapy for the next few weeks.","translation":"在不正確地抬起重箱後，他的背感到拉傷。醫生建議他在接下來的幾週內休息和進行物理治療。","word":"strained"}},"strait":{"createdAt":1783748418493,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"strait 是指兩塊陸地之間狹窄的海水通道，特別強調地理位置上被陸地所限制的特性。","options":["channel","strait","passage","waterway"],"sentence":"The ship had to navigate through a narrow ______ to reach the open ocean. The captain carefully steered through the passage between two large landmasses.","translation":"這艘船必須通過狹窄的海峽才能到達開放的大洋。船長小心地操舵通過兩個大陸地之間的通道。","word":"strait"}},"strand":{"createdAt":1781566055843,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"strand 指的是線、繩或頭髮等細長物體的單一條狀部分，常用於編織或組合的語境中。","options":["bunch","strand","lock","piece"],"sentence":"She carefully braided each ______ of hair to create an intricate hairstyle. The salon stylist twisted together three separate sections from root to tip.","translation":"她小心地編織每一縷頭髮來創造一個複雜的髮型。沙龍髮型師從髮根到髮尾把三個不同的部分絞在一起。","word":"strand"}},"strangle":{"createdAt":1786893788105,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"strangle 意為通過壓迫或掐住喉嚨來使人窒息死亡，通常帶有暴力或犯罪的含義。","options":["comfort","strangle","embrace","support"],"sentence":"The villain tried to ______ the hero by wrapping a rope around his neck. The detective found evidence that the victim had been killed by someone pressing their hands against his throat.","translation":"壞人試圖用繩子纏繞在英雄的脖子上來勒死他。偵探發現受害者是被某人用雙手按住喉嚨而殺害的。","word":"strangle"}},"strap":{"createdAt":1783583999743,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"strap 是一條細長的帶狀物，通常由皮革、布料或塑膠製成，用來綁縛或固定物品。","options":["buckle","knot","strap","handle"],"sentence":"He fastened the ______ tightly around the suitcase to keep it closed during travel. Without this piece of material, the luggage would have fallen open at the airport.","translation":"他緊緊地繫上帶子以保持行李箱在旅行中關閉。沒有這條帶狀物，行李會在機場打開。","word":"strap"}},"strategic":{"createdAt":1781664082527,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"strategic 表示與戰略、策略或計劃有關的，指經過深思熟慮的長期方向。","options":["random","strategic","tactical","routine"],"sentence":"The company's ______ plan involves acquiring smaller competitors to strengthen market position. This long-term approach aims to ensure competitive advantage for the next five years.","translation":"該公司的戰略計畫涉及收購較小的競爭對手以加強市場地位。這種長期方法旨在確保未來五年的競爭優勢。","word":"strategic"}},"strategy":{"createdAt":1781345237581,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"strategy指為達成目標而制定的周密計畫或方案。","options":["equipment","strategy","schedule","uniform"],"sentence":"The coach developed a new ______ to help the team win the championship. The plan focused on improving defense and creating more scoring opportunities in the second half.","translation":"教練制定了新的策略來幫助球隊贏得冠軍。該計畫著重於改進防守和在下半場創造更多得分機會。","word":"strategy"}},"stray":{"createdAt":1781693303268,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stray 作為形容詞表示「走失的」或「迷路的」，用來描述沒有主人、在街上流浪的動物。","options":["trained","stray","aggressive","loyal"],"sentence":"The ______ dog wandered through the neighborhood looking for food and shelter. Without an owner or identification tag, it had been lost for several weeks.","translation":"這隻走失的狗在社區裡流浪，尋找食物和住處。沒有主人或身份標籤，它已經失蹤好幾週了。","word":"stray"}},"stream":{"createdAt":1788959648576,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"stream 是指小河或溪流，題目中第二句提到「狹窄、流動的水體、淺到可涉水」完全吻合 stream 的特徵。","options":["stream","ocean","lake","waterfall"],"sentence":"The hikers followed a clear ______ deeper into the forest to find fresh water. The narrow body of moving water was shallow enough to wade across.","translation":"登山者跟著清澈的溪流深入森林去尋找新鮮水源。這條狹窄的流動水體淺到可以涉水而過。","word":"stream"}},"strength":{"createdAt":1783947021212,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"strength 是指身體或精神上的力量和能力，在此句中表示舉重時所需的體力。","options":["weakness","strength","speed","height"],"sentence":"The athlete demonstrated remarkable ______ by lifting the heavy weights with ease. His muscular build and years of training gave him the power needed for such an impressive performance.","translation":"運動員通過輕鬆地舉起重物展示了非凡的力氣。他強壯的身體和多年的訓練使他具備了進行這種令人印象深刻的表演所需的力量。","word":"strength"}},"strengthen":{"createdAt":1781837419095,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"Strengthen表示使某物變得更強大、更有力或更堅實。","options":["weaken","stretch","strengthen","relax"],"sentence":"Regular exercise will ______ your muscles and improve your overall fitness. By consistently working out, you'll notice increased physical power and endurance.","translation":"定期運動將加強你的肌肉並改善你的整體健康狀況。通過持續鍛煉，你會注意到身體力量和耐力的增加。","word":"strengthen"}},"stress":{"createdAt":1782549250478,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stress 在這裡是動詞，意為「強調」或「著重強調」某事的重要性。","options":["ignore","stress","minimize","dismiss"],"sentence":"The teacher decided to ______ the importance of studying hard by assigning extra homework to all students. She wanted them to understand that preparation was crucial for passing the final exam.","translation":"老師決定通過給所有學生分配額外功課來____課程學習的重要性。她想讓他們明白準備對於通過期末考試至關重要。","word":"stress"}},"stretch":{"createdAt":1783661880044,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stretch 作為動詞表示伸展身體或使某物變長，是解決肌肉僵硬的最佳動作。","options":["compress","stretch","fold","twist"],"sentence":"After sitting for hours, I need to ______ my legs and arms. The muscles feel tight and stiff from lack of movement.","translation":"坐了幾個小時後，我需要伸展我的腿和手臂。肌肉因為缺乏運動而感到緊繃和僵硬。","word":"stretch"}},"strict":{"createdAt":1782410027825,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"strict指嚴格的、不容寬鬆的；第二句提到「不容例外」和「嚴厲處分」，強調該政策的執行絲毫不容妥協。","options":["fair","flexible","strict","reasonable"],"sentence":"The headmaster has a ______ policy that forbids students from using mobile phones in school. Any student caught with a phone will face serious disciplinary action without exception.","translation":"校長實施嚴格的政策，禁止學生在學校使用手機。任何被發現攜帶手機的學生都將面臨嚴厲的紀律處分，不容例外。","word":"strict"}},"stride":{"createdAt":1783482972494,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"stride 作為名詞表示「進展、進步」，通常用於強調顯著的發展或前進的步伐。","options":["stride","stride","progress","advance"],"sentence":"The company has made great ______ in developing new technology over the past year. Their recent breakthrough in artificial intelligence shows how far they have progressed.","translation":"過去一年，該公司在開發新技術方面取得了巨大的進展。他們最近在人工智能方面的突破顯示了他們已經進步了多遠。","word":"stride"}},"strike":{"createdAt":1783310403306,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"strike在此作名詞，指勞工集體停止工作以抗議或爭取權益的罷工行動。","options":["agreement","strike","meeting","promotion"],"sentence":"The workers organized a ______ to demand better working conditions and higher wages. Management had to negotiate after the employees refused to work for two weeks.","translation":"工人組織了罷工以要求更好的工作條件和更高的薪資。在員工拒絕工作兩週後，管理層不得不進行談判。","word":"strike"}},"striking":{"createdAt":1781950727561,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"striking 指非常明顯、引人注目或給人深刻印象的。","options":["hidden","striking","expensive","small"],"sentence":"The ______ difference between the two paintings made them easy to compare. One was vibrant and colorful while the other was dull and gray.","translation":"這兩幅畫之間的顯著差異使它們易於比較。一幅色彩鮮豔，而另一幅則暗淡無光。","word":"striking"}},"string":{"createdAt":1781362281722,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"string指的是細繩、帶子，也可以表示一系列或一連串事物。","options":["rope","string","chain","belt"],"sentence":"He tied a ______ around the package to keep it securely closed. The thin cord held everything together during transport.","translation":"他用細繩在包裝周圍綁了一圈以保持其安全閉合。這根細繩在運輸過程中將所有東西連在一起。","word":"string"}},"strip":{"createdAt":1783063953961,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"strip表示「剝奪、奪去」，指強制地移除某人所擁有的東西或權利。","options":["award","present","strip","gift"],"sentence":"The court decided to ______ the athlete of his medals after discovering he had used banned substances. All his records from the past five years have been erased from official databases.","translation":"法院決定在發現該運動員使用禁用物質後，剝奪他的獎牌。他過去五年的所有記錄已從官方數據庫中刪除。","word":"strip"}},"stripe":{"createdAt":1782379142279,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stripe指的是條紋或帶狀的標記，在這裡用來描述斑馬身上的黑白線條圖案。","options":["pattern","stripe","color","mark"],"sentence":"The zebra has bold black and white ______ running across its body. These distinctive markings help the animal blend into the tall grass of the savanna.","translation":"斑馬身上有大膽的黑白條紋。這些獨特的標記幫助動物融入草原的高草中。","word":"stripe"}},"stripes":{"createdAt":1785462383199,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stripes指的是在物體表面呈條狀或條帶狀的標記或圖案，常見於旗幟、服裝和其他設計中。","options":["patches","stripes","borders","sections"],"sentence":"The American flag features red and white ______ arranged horizontally across its surface. Each band of color represents a former state that was part of the original thirteen colonies.","translation":"美國國旗的表面上有紅白相間的條紋，以水平方向排列。每一條顏色帶代表曾經是最初十三個殖民地之一的一個州。","word":"stripes"}},"strive":{"createdAt":1782410027829,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"strive指奮鬥、努力爭取；第二句強調「推向極限」和「每天改進」，表達了為達成目標而付出艱苦努力的決心，完全符合strive的含義。","options":["refuse","strive","manage","hesitate"],"sentence":"Professional athletes ______ to achieve excellence through years of hard training and dedication. They push themselves to their limits every single day to improve their performance.","translation":"職業運動員通過多年的艱苦訓練和奉獻精神奮力爭取卓越。他們每天都將自己推向極限以提高表現。","word":"strive"}},"stroke":{"createdAt":1781275226786,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"此處stroke指「中風」，一種醫學上的腦血管疾病","options":["feast","stroke","dazzle","fume"],"sentence":"He suffered a ______ that left him partially paralyzed. The doctor explained that a blood clot had blocked oxygen to his brain.","translation":"他中風了，導致身體部分癱瘓。醫生解釋說血栓阻礙了氧氣進入他的大腦。","word":"stroke"}},"stroll":{"createdAt":1784794111751,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stroll 是指緩慢而悠閒地散步，強調步伐輕鬆、沒有特定目的地的行走方式。","options":["sprint","stroll","drive","climb"],"sentence":"After dinner, the elderly couple decided to take a leisurely ______ through the park. They walked slowly hand in hand, enjoying the evening breeze and watching the sunset together.","translation":"晚餐後，這對老年夫婦決定在公園裡悠閒地漫步。他們牽著手緩慢行走，享受著晚風，一起欣賞日落。","word":"stroll"}},"strove":{"createdAt":1787190474429,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"strove 是 strive 的過去式，表示為了達成目標而付出努力和奮鬥，通常帶有堅持不懈的意涵。","options":["relaxed","strove","ignored","abandoned"],"sentence":"Throughout her career, she ______ to improve her skills and achieve excellence in her field. Despite facing numerous obstacles and setbacks, her determination never wavered.","translation":"在她的職業生涯中，她努力提高自己的技能並在她的領域中追求卓越。儘管面臨許多障礙和挫折，她的決心從未動搖。","word":"strove"}},"structural":{"createdAt":1781664082526,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"structural 表示與結構有關的，指涉及或影響事物基本框架或組織的。","options":["minor","structural","cosmetic","temporary"],"sentence":"The building has ______ damage from the earthquake that requires immediate repair. Engineers need to reinforce the beams and walls to ensure stability.","translation":"該建築有地震造成的結構損傷，需要立即修復。工程師需要加強梁和牆以確保穩定性。","word":"structural"}},"structure":{"createdAt":1784071822269,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"structure 作名詞表示「結構、組織、建築」，指事物的組織方式、組成方式或物理框架。","options":["location","structure","schedule","budget"],"sentence":"The architect designed a unique ______ for the new museum downtown. The building's framework was made of steel and glass, with multiple levels supporting the entire framework.","translation":"建築師為市中心的新博物館設計了一個獨特的結構。這座建築的框架由鋼鐵和玻璃製成，多層樓層支撐著整個框架。","word":"structure"}},"struggle":{"createdAt":1781787229335,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"struggle 作為名詞表示艱難的努力或對抗，通常指長期的困難經歷。","options":["victory","struggle","vacation","celebration"],"sentence":"After years of ______ against poverty, the family finally achieved financial stability. Their perseverance and hard work eventually paid off.","translation":"經過多年與貧困的抗爭，這個家庭終於獲得了財務穩定。他們的毅力和辛勤工作最終得到了回報。","word":"struggle"}},"stubborn":{"createdAt":1782475871716,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"stubborn 表示「固執的」，指人或性格非常頑固、不願改變主意或聽從勸告","options":["obedient","cheerful","stubborn","curious"],"sentence":"The ______ child refused to eat vegetables no matter what his parents tried. His determination to avoid them was unshakeable.","translation":"這個固執的孩子無論父母怎麼試都拒絕吃蔬菜。他避免吃蔬菜的決心是堅定不移的。","word":"stubborn"}},"stuck":{"createdAt":1782552550803,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stuck 表示被卡住或困住，在這裡指抽屜因為內部障礙物而無法開啟的狀態。","options":["broken","stuck","damaged","locked"],"sentence":"The drawer was ______ and wouldn't open no matter how hard I pulled. I had to call a repairman because something inside was blocking the mechanism completely.","translation":"抽屜卡住了，無論我多用力拉都打不開。我必須打電話給維修工，因為裡面有東西完全堵住了機關。","word":"stuck"}},"studio":{"createdAt":1784450903139,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"studio是指藝術家、攝影師或音樂人進行創作工作的專業工作場所。","options":["warehouse","classroom","studio","hotel"],"sentence":"The photographer rented a ______ downtown to display her portfolio and meet with clients. The space included professional lighting equipment, a backdrop wall, and a comfortable consultation area.","translation":"攝影師在市中心租了一個工作室來展示她的作品集並與客戶見面。這個空間包括專業的照明設備、背景牆和舒適的諮詢區域。","word":"studio"}},"stuff":{"createdAt":1781499075059,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"填充物是用來填滿或塞進容器或物體內部的材料。","options":["fabric","thread","stuff","pattern"],"sentence":"The seamstress used soft cotton ______ to fill the pillows before sewing them shut. The material she chose was comfortable and long-lasting for customers.","translation":"女裁縫在縫製枕頭之前用柔軟的棉質填充物填充枕頭。她選擇的材料舒適耐用，適合顧客使用。","word":"stuff"}},"stuffy":{"createdAt":1786059240410,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stuffy 形容空氣不流通、令人感到窒息或悶得難受的環境，通常需要通風或換氣才能改善。","options":["comfortable","stuffy","spacious","modern"],"sentence":"The office felt ______ because no one had opened a window all day. After turning on the air conditioning and opening the doors, everyone felt much more comfortable and could breathe easily.","translation":"辦公室整天沒人開窗，感覺很悶。打開空調和門後，每個人都感到舒適得多，可以輕鬆呼吸。","word":"stuffy"}},"stumble":{"createdAt":1785234548698,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stumble 表示因為腳被東西絆住或踩不穩而踉蹌行走或幾乎跌倒的動作。","options":["leap","stumble","sprint","climb"],"sentence":"The tired hiker began to ______ over the rocks on the mountain path. His feet caught on the uneven ground, causing him to nearly fall to the ground.","translation":"疲憊的登山者開始在山路上的岩石上絆倒。他的腳被不平的地面絆住，導致他差點摔到地上。","word":"stumble"}},"stun":{"createdAt":1785040900129,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stun 的意思是使某人感到震驚或吃驚，通常因為某件出人意料的事情而導致暫時的無言或無反應。","options":["bore","stun","entertain","confuse"],"sentence":"The magician's incredible disappearing act managed to ______ the entire audience. Everyone sat in complete silence, unable to believe what they had just witnessed.","translation":"魔術師不可思議的消失魔術設法使整個觀眾大吃一驚。每個人都坐在那裡完全沉默，無法相信他們剛才看到的東西。","word":"stun"}},"stunned":{"createdAt":1781311922062,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stunned 表示被某事驚嚇或震驚到無法反應的狀態，通常伴隨著沈默和呆滯的反應。","options":["amused","stunned","bored","confused"],"sentence":"When the magician made the elephant disappear, the entire audience was ______. Everyone sat in complete silence, unable to move or speak for several minutes.","translation":"當魔術師讓大象消失時，整個觀眾席都被震驚了。每個人都靜靜地坐著，幾分鐘內無法移動或說話。","word":"stunned"}},"stunning":{"createdAt":1781311922064,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"stunning 形容某人或某物非常美麗或令人印象深刻，足以令人驚嘆。","options":["plain","ordinary","stunning","casual"],"sentence":"The bride looked absolutely ______ in her white wedding dress on her special day. Her elegant appearance left all the guests breathless and amazed.","translation":"新娘在她的特殊日子穿著潔白的婚禮服看起來絕對是驚人地美麗。她優雅的外表讓所有客人都驚嘆不已。","word":"stunning"}},"sturdy":{"createdAt":1781425096276,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sturdy 意為堅實、結實、耐用，用來形容物品或人身體強健，能夠承受長期使用或壓力而不易損壞。","options":["fragile","sturdy","decorative","antique"],"sentence":"The old wooden table was ______ enough to support the weight of the heavy books. After fifty years of daily use without any damage or wear, it remained as reliable as the day it was built.","translation":"那張老木桌足夠堅固，能夠承受重書的重量。經過五十年的日常使用而沒有任何損傷或磨損，它仍然像製造的那天一樣可靠。","word":"sturdy"}},"stutter":{"createdAt":1784531912959,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"stutter指的是說話時由於緊張或語言障礙而重複或停頓，結結巴巴地表達","options":["shout","whisper","stutter","sing"],"sentence":"The nervous speaker began to ______ when facing the large audience for the first time. His words came out in broken, repetitive fragments as his anxiety took over.","translation":"這位緊張的演講者在第一次面對大眾時開始結結巴巴地說話。當他的焦慮控制了他時，他的言語變成了破碎的、重複的片段。","word":"stutter"}},"style":{"createdAt":1782476385141,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"style 是名詞，指一個人、藝術家或創作者的獨特風格或方法，可以用來描述其特有的審美或表現方式。","options":["color","style","texture","material"],"sentence":"The designer's ______ is recognized worldwide for its minimalist aesthetic. Fashion critics praise how her distinctive approach to clothing design sets her apart from competitors.","translation":"該設計師的風格在世界各地享有盛譽，以其極簡主義美學著稱。時尚評論家讚揚她獨特的服裝設計方法如何使她與競爭對手區別開來。","word":"style"}},"stylish":{"createdAt":1781939439464,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"stylish是形容詞，表示時尚的、格調優雅的、很有氣派的，通常形容衣著或設計。","options":["torn","stylish","casual","simple"],"sentence":"He wore a ______ suit to the gala that turned heads as he walked through the room. His tailored jacket and designer accessories demonstrated impeccable taste and elegance.","translation":"他穿著一套氣派的西裝參加慶典，當他走過房間時吸引了眾人的目光。他剪裁得體的夾克和名牌配飾展現了無可挑剔的品味和優雅。","word":"stylish"}},"subdue":{"createdAt":1783005778364,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"subdue 意為「制服」或「鎮壓」，指通過力量或權威控制或征服某人或某物。","options":["celebrate","subdue","encourage","document"],"sentence":"The military forces worked to ______ the rebellion and restore peace to the region. By using strategic tactics and overwhelming force, they eventually brought the uprising under control.","translation":"軍隊致力於制服叛亂並恢復該地區的和平。通過使用戰略戰術和壓倒性力量，他們最終將起義控制在了控制之下。","word":"subdue"}},"subject":{"createdAt":1782823456544,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"subject 在這裡是名詞，指的是在學校裡教授的學習科目或課程。","options":["teacher","subject","classroom","textbook"],"sentence":"Mathematics is my favorite ______ at school. I enjoy solving problems and understanding how numbers work together to create patterns.","translation":"數學是我在學校最喜歡的科目。我喜歡解決問題，理解數字如何協力工作以創建模式。","word":"subject"}},"subjective":{"createdAt":1783476327938,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"subjective 是形容詞，意為主觀的，基於個人觀點、感受或偏好而非客觀事實。","options":["subjective","factual","objective","universal"],"sentence":"The movie critic's review was highly ______, filled with personal opinions about the film's artistic merit. Different viewers had completely opposite reactions to the same scenes based on their individual tastes and experiences.","translation":"電影評論家的評論非常主觀，充滿了對影片藝術價值的個人見解。不同的觀眾根據各自的品味和經驗對相同的場景有完全相反的反應。","word":"subjective"}},"submarine":{"createdAt":1781431278561,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"submarine是能在水下航行的軍事或探險用船隻，其主要特點是能夠潛入水下。","options":["airplane","submarine","boat","train"],"sentence":"The military ______ descended silently into the ocean depths to avoid enemy detection. The vessel's special design allowed it to operate completely underwater without surfacing.","translation":"軍事潛水艇無聲地潛入海洋深處以避免敵人發現。該船的特殊設計允許它完全在水下運作而無需浮出水面。","word":"submarine"}},"submit":{"createdAt":1784103984091,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"submit 表示「提交、呈交」，指將某物交給他人或權威機構以供審查或處理。","options":["reject","receive","submit","delay"],"sentence":"All students must ______ their assignments by Friday at midnight. The professor will not accept any work that arrives after the deadline has passed.","translation":"所有學生必須在星期五午夜前______ 他們的作業。教授不會接受任何在截止日期後提交的作業。","word":"submit"}},"subordinate":{"createdAt":1784601855845,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"subordinate 是指職位或地位較低的人，在組織中處於下級位置，需要向上級報告並接受指導。","options":["colleague","superior","subordinate","partner"],"sentence":"The manager assigned tasks to her ______, who reported directly to her at the office. These employees held lower positions and had to follow her directions on daily projects.","translation":"經理將任務分配給她的下屬，他們在辦公室直接向她匯報。這些員工職位較低，必須在日常項目上遵循她的指示。","word":"subordinate"}},"subscribe":{"createdAt":1781837419095,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Subscribe指的是為了定期接收報紙、雜誌或服務而支付費用並簽署協議。","options":["ignore","subscribe","return","donate"],"sentence":"Many readers ______ to the magazine to receive it every month at their home. They paid an annual fee to access all the latest articles and exclusive content.","translation":"許多讀者訂閱該雜誌，以便每月在家中收到。他們支付年費以訪問所有最新文章和獨家內容。","word":"subscribe"}},"subscription":{"createdAt":1782475871714,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"subscription 表示「訂閱」，指按期購買或定期接收某項服務或出版物","options":["purchase","subscription","collection","delivery"],"sentence":"She decided to cancel her magazine ______ because she no longer reads the monthly issues. She will not receive any more copies after this month ends.","translation":"她決定取消她的雜誌訂閱，因為她不再閱讀月刊。在這個月結束後，她將不會再收到任何副本。","word":"subscription"}},"subsequent":{"createdAt":1783747867972,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"subsequent 是形容詞，表示在某事之後發生或出現的事物，用來描述時間上的先後順序。","options":["previous","subsequent","initial","original"],"sentence":"The first movie in the series was a huge success, and all ______ films were even more popular with audiences. Each new release that came after the original broke box office records.","translation":"該系列的第一部電影取得了巨大成功，所有隨後的電影在觀眾中更加受歡迎。每部在原始作品之後發行的新片都打破了票房紀錄。","word":"subsequent"}},"subsequently":{"createdAt":1784451184441,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"subsequently 表示「隨後」或「之後」，用於表達時間順序中發生在另一事件之後的事件。","options":["previously","subsequently","occasionally","rarely"],"sentence":"The company launched its first product in 2010, and ______ expanded into five new markets. By 2020, it had become a global enterprise.","translation":"該公司在2010年推出了第一個產品，隨後進入了五個新市場。到2020年，它已成為全球企業。","word":"subsequently"}},"subsidiary":{"createdAt":1787049198632,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"subsidiary指附屬於較大公司的子公司或分支機構，在法律上受母公司控制。","options":["competing","subsidiary","independent","bankrupt"],"sentence":"The large tech corporation owns several ______ companies throughout Europe. Each of these smaller operations reports directly to the parent company's headquarters.","translation":"這家大型科技公司在整個歐洲擁有多家子公司。這些較小的分公司直接向母公司總部報告。","word":"subsidiary"}},"subsidize":{"createdAt":1782040742473,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"subsidize 動詞意為「給予津貼、補貼、資助」，指政府或組織向個人或企業提供財政支持。","options":["subsidize","punish","abandon","investigate"],"sentence":"The government decided to ______ farmers by providing financial aid for their crops. This support helped reduce the cost of food for ordinary citizens.","translation":"政府決定通過提供農作物財政援助來資助農民。這項支持幫助降低了普通公民的食品成本。","word":"subsidize"}},"subsidized":{"createdAt":1781362281661,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"subsidized表示獲得政府或組織的補助或財務支持。","options":["expensive","subsidized","private","luxury"],"sentence":"The ______ housing program helps low-income families afford homes. The government provides financial support to reduce the rent burden.","translation":"這個獲得補助的住房計畫幫助低收入家庭買得起房子。政府提供財務支持以減輕租金負擔。","word":"subsidized"}},"subsidy":{"createdAt":1783395908744,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"subsidy 是指政府或機構提供的資金補助，用來幫助特定產業或人群度過困難時期。","options":["loan","subsidy","tax","fine"],"sentence":"The government provided a ______ to help farmers during the drought. Without this financial aid, many small farms would have gone out of business.","translation":"政府在乾旱期間向農民提供了津貼。沒有這種財政援助，許多小農場就會倒閉。","word":"subsidy"}},"substance":{"createdAt":1781661288526,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"substance 是指具有物質形式的東西，可以是固體、液體或氣體等具體的物質","options":["theory","substance","idea","method"],"sentence":"The chemist analyzed the unknown ______ in the laboratory. After testing, she determined it was made of hydrogen and oxygen molecules.","translation":"化學家在實驗室裡分析了這種未知物質。經過測試後，她確定它是由氫分子和氧分子組成的。","word":"substance"}},"substantial":{"createdAt":1781402539337,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"substantial 表示數量大的、相當可觀的或具有實質意義的，通常指重要或重量級的東西。","options":["minimal","substantial","light","trace"],"sentence":"The ______ amount of rain caused flooding in several neighborhoods. The weather report showed that over 200 millimeters fell in just 24 hours.","translation":"大量的降雨在幾個社區造成了洪水。天氣報告顯示在短短24小時內下降了超過200毫米。","word":"substantial"}},"substantiate":{"createdAt":1783947243480,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"substantiate意思是用證據或事實來證實、驗證某個說法或理論。","options":["ignore","substantiate","question","reject"],"sentence":"The scientist needed to ______ her groundbreaking theory with solid experimental data. Without publishing peer-reviewed research and detailed test results, her claims would remain unproven.","translation":"這位科學家需要用紮實的實驗數據來證實她的突破性理論。如果沒有發表同儕評審的研究和詳細的測試結果，她的主張將保持未經證實。","word":"substantiate"}},"substitute":{"createdAt":1784173464331,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"substitute 指代替或取代某人或某物，使用替代品或替代者。","options":["train","substitute","recruit","dismiss"],"sentence":"The teacher asked if anyone could ______ for the injured player in tomorrow's basketball game. The assistant coach immediately volunteered to take his place on the court.","translation":"老師詢問是否有人可以代替明天籃球賽中受傷的球員。助理教練立即自願在球場上代替他。","word":"substitute"}},"subtle":{"createdAt":1781693271585,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"subtle用來形容細微、不易察覺的差異或變化，與obvious和bold等詞形成對比。","options":["obvious","subtle","dramatic","bold"],"sentence":"The artist made ______ changes to the painting that only experts could notice. Most people walked past without seeing any difference at all.","translation":"藝術家對這幅畫進行了微妙的改變，只有專家才能注意到。大多數人走過時根本看不出有什麼不同。","word":"subtle"}},"subtly":{"createdAt":1785487324257,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"subtly是副詞，表示以微妙、細緻或不易察覺的方式進行，強調變化的隱蔽性。","options":["dramatically","obviously","subtly","carelessly"],"sentence":"The artist ______ changed the painting's color palette over several weeks. Most viewers never noticed the shift, but art critics recognized the sophisticated technique.","translation":"藝術家在幾週內巧妙地改變了畫作的色調。大多數觀眾沒有注意到這種變化，但藝術評論家認出了這種高超的技巧。","word":"subtly"}},"subtract":{"createdAt":1782491138496,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"subtract 是一個數學動詞，表示從一個數字中減去另一個數字的算術運算。","options":["subtract","generate","reclaim","glow"],"sentence":"If you ______ 15 from 42, you will get the correct answer to this math problem. The operation requires removing the smaller number from the larger one.","translation":"如果你從42中減去15，你將得到這個數學問題的正確答案。這個運算需要從較大的數字中去掉較小的數字。","word":"subtract"}},"suburb":{"createdAt":1782476098663,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"suburb 是指城市邊緣的住宅區，位於城市中心外，通常更安靜、居住密度較低。","options":["downtown","suburb","metropolis","district"],"sentence":"Many families prefer to live in a quiet ______ rather than in the busy city center. These residential areas are located just outside the city limits, offering more space and lower costs.","translation":"許多家庭寧願住在安靜的郊區而不是繁忙的市中心。這些住宅區位於城市邊界外，提供更多空間和較低成本。","word":"suburb"}},"suburban":{"createdAt":1783332861013,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「suburban」形容詞表示「郊區的、近郊的」，特指城市邊緣的居住區。","options":["urban","suburban","industrial","rural"],"sentence":"My family recently moved to a ______ neighborhood outside the city. We now have a large backyard and quieter streets compared to downtown living.","translation":"我家最近搬到城市外的郊區鄰近區域。與市中心生活相比，我們現在有一個大後院和更安靜的街道。","word":"suburban"}},"succeed":{"createdAt":1781362281642,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"succeed表示成功或達成目標，通常與努力、堅持等正面詞彙搭配使用。","options":["fail","succeed","struggle","delay"],"sentence":"If you work hard and stay focused, you will ______ in your goals. Your determination and effort will eventually lead to achieving what you set out to do.","translation":"如果你努力工作並保持專注，你將會在目標上成功。你的決心和努力最終會導致實現你的目標。","word":"succeed"}},"success":{"createdAt":1781794866349,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"success指成功、成就，用來形容達到預期目標或取得成果的情況。","options":["failure","struggle","success","loss"],"sentence":"Her ______ in the business world came after years of hard work and dedication. She started from nothing and built a multi-million dollar company through perseverance.","translation":"她在商界的______ 來自多年的努力和奉獻。她從無到有，通過堅持不懈建立了一家價值數百萬美元的公司。","word":"success"}},"successful":{"createdAt":1781625891346,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"successful表示達到預期目標或取得良好成果","options":["failed","successful","controversial","forgotten"],"sentence":"The marketing campaign proved to be ______ beyond all expectations. Sales increased by 150% within just two months.","translation":"行銷活動的效果超出了所有預期的成功。銷售額在短短兩個月內增長了150%。","word":"successful"}},"succession":{"createdAt":1783737904099,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"succession 強調按照既定順序或傳統進行的連續繼承過程。","options":["succession","transition","inheritance","change"],"sentence":"The king's ______ was carefully planned to ensure stability for the next generation. His eldest son would inherit the throne following a long line of firstborn heirs.","translation":"國王的繼承經過精心規劃，以確保下一代的穩定。他的長子將按照長子繼承的悠久傳統繼承王位。","word":"succession"}},"successive":{"createdAt":1781693266945,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"successive表示連續發生的、相繼的，用來描述一個接著一個發生的事件或現象。","options":["occasional","successive","previous","simultaneous"],"sentence":"The team won ______ championships in 2020, 2021, and 2022. Each victory came one right after the other without any interruption.","translation":"該隊在2020年、2021年和2022年贏得了連續的冠軍。每次勝利都一個接一個地到來，沒有任何中斷。","word":"successive"}},"successor":{"createdAt":1781515329266,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"successor 名詞，意思是接替者、繼承人，指接替某人職位或地位的人。","options":["predecessor","successor","rival","employee"],"sentence":"The retiring CEO named his ______ during the board meeting yesterday. The company announced that this experienced executive would take over as the new leader next month.","translation":"退休的首席執行官在昨天的董事會會議上任命了他的繼承人。該公司宣布這位經驗豐富的主管將於下個月成為新領導人。","word":"successor"}},"suck":{"createdAt":1784365643293,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"suck 表示通過吸引力將物質吸入，這是吸塵機的基本工作原理。","options":["push","suck","blow","spread"],"sentence":"The vacuum cleaner will ______ up all the dust and dirt from the carpet. Make sure the hose is properly attached so it can create the necessary suction.","translation":"吸塵機會從地毯上吸起所有的灰塵和污垢。確保軟管正確連接，這樣它才能產生必要的吸力。","word":"suck"}},"sue":{"createdAt":1781484415229,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sue是指在法律上向某人或某組織提起訴訟，要求賠償或尋求司法救濟。","options":["praise","hire","sue","congratulate"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ the manufacturer for selling defective products. They filed a legal complaint in court seeking compensation for damages.","translation":"該公司決定起訴製造商銷售有缺陷的產品。他們在法院提出法律訴狀，尋求損害賠償。","word":"sue"}},"suffer":{"createdAt":1781832508017,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"suffer 表示「遭受；受難」，指經歷痛苦、傷害或困難，常與 from 搭配使用。","options":["recover","suffer","benefit","heal"],"sentence":"Many people continue to ______ from the effects of the natural disaster years later. The psychologists are now treating their post-traumatic stress disorder.","translation":"許多人在多年後仍然遭受自然災害的影響。心理學家現在正在治療他們的創傷後壓力症。","word":"suffer"}},"suffering":{"createdAt":1785815645918,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"suffering是指身體或心理上的痛苦、苦難，與hardship（困難）和pain（痛苦）等概念相關。","options":["happiness","suffering","confusion","celebration"],"sentence":"The charity organization dedicated itself to alleviating the ______ of homeless people in the city. They provided shelter, food, and medical care to reduce their pain and hardship.","translation":"慈善組織致力於減輕城市中無家可歸者的苦難。他們提供庇護所、食物和醫療護理來減少他們的痛苦和困難。","word":"suffering"}},"suffice":{"createdAt":1781424137069,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"suffice 意為「足夠」，用來表示某物在數量或質量上能滿足需求。","options":["complicate","suffice","enhance","spoil"],"sentence":"A simple meal will ______ for our picnic lunch today. We don't need anything fancy since we're just going to a nearby park for a few hours.","translation":"一份簡單的餐點對於我們今天的野餐午餐就夠了。我們不需要任何花俏的東西，因為我們只是去附近的公園幾個小時。","word":"suffice"}},"sufficiency":{"createdAt":1784701140002,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sufficiency 表示充足或足夠的數量或程度，能夠滿足需求而不過多也不不足。","options":["abundance","scarcity","sufficiency","deficit"],"sentence":"The charity organization assured donors that even a small contribution would provide ______ to feed the entire village for a month. Their careful budgeting meant that limited resources could stretch far enough to meet all basic needs.","translation":"慈善機構向捐獻者保證，即使是少量捐款也足以在一個月內為整個村莊提供充足的食物。他們精心的預算意味著有限的資源足以滿足所有基本需求。","word":"sufficiency"}},"sufficient":{"createdAt":1783262026083,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sufficient 作為形容詞表示「充足的、足夠的」，指數量或程度足以滿足需要。","options":["insufficient","adequate","sufficient","meager"],"sentence":"The budget provided ______ funds to complete all the necessary repairs to the school building. The superintendent confirmed that no additional money would be needed.","translation":"預算為學校建築的所有必要維修提供了充足的資金。督導確認不需要額外的資金。","word":"sufficient"}},"suffocate":{"createdAt":1781837601403,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"suffocate 作為動詞表示「使窒息而死」，指因缺氧或有害氣體導致無法呼吸而喪命。","options":["trap","suffocate","separate","injure"],"sentence":"The firefighters worked quickly to rescue the trapped miners before the toxic gas could ______ them in the deep shaft. Every second counted as the oxygen levels continued to drop dangerously low.","translation":"消防隊員們迅速工作，在有毒氣體在深井中使被困的礦工窒息身亡之前將他們救出。隨著氧氣水平危險地不斷下降，每一秒都至關重要。","word":"suffocate"}},"suggest":{"createdAt":1781798927525,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"suggest 表示提出建議或想法供他人考慮，語氣較為溫和，不具強制性。","options":["demand","suggest","require","force"],"sentence":"I ______ that we go to the new Italian restaurant downtown for dinner tonight. Based on the rave reviews and five-star ratings online, it seems like an excellent choice.","translation":"我建議我們今晚去市中心的新義大利餐廳用餐。根據網上的好評和五星評級，這似乎是一個絕佳的選擇。","word":"suggest"}},"suggestion":{"createdAt":1781848934136,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"suggestion指提出來供他人考慮或接納的想法或建議","options":["complaint","threat","suggestion","joke"],"sentence":"I made a ______ to improve the company's sales strategy during the meeting. My boss thanked me for proposing such a practical idea.","translation":"我在會議中提出了改進公司銷售策略的建議。我的老闆感謝我提出了這個實用的想法。","word":"suggestion"}},"suicidal":{"createdAt":1784968599773,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"suicidal在此處用作形容詞，意指某個行為或決定極其危險，會導致自我毀滅或死亡的後果。","options":["cautious","suicidal","heroic","adventurous"],"sentence":"Driving at 200 kilometers per hour on a busy highway would be ______ and extremely dangerous. Such reckless behavior would certainly result in a fatal accident.","translation":"在繁忙的高速公路上以每小時200公里的速度駕駛是極為冒險的，而且非常危險。這種魯莽的行為肯定會導致致命事故。","word":"suicidal"}},"suicide":{"createdAt":1782401868813,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"suicide 表示自殺行為或結束自己生命的行為。","options":["happiness","suicide","recovery","wellness"],"sentence":"The mental health organization provides crisis support to prevent ______. Their counselors are trained to help people facing depression and suicidal thoughts.","translation":"這個心理健康機構提供危機支持以預防自殺。他們的心理諮詢師經過培訓可以幫助面對抑鬱症和自殺思想的人。","word":"suicide"}},"suitability":{"createdAt":1781832508019,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"suitability 表示「適合；適當」，指某事物是否符合特定目的或需求。","options":["beauty","suitability","history","popularity"],"sentence":"The architect questioned the ______ of the location for building a hospital. The site was too far from major roads and public transportation, making it impractical for emergency services.","translation":"建築師質疑該地點對於建造醫院的適合性。該地點離主要道路和公共交通太遠，對於緊急服務來說不切實際。","word":"suitability"}},"suitable":{"createdAt":1783841701034,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"suitable 表示「合適的、恰當的」，指符合特定情況或需求的事物。","options":["comfortable","suitable","fashionable","expensive"],"sentence":"This formal black tie event requires ______ attire, so casual clothes would not be appropriate. The dress code specifically states that tuxedos or evening gowns are expected.","translation":"這個正式的黑領結活動需要合適的服裝，所以休閒衣著是不恰當的。著裝規範明確規定需要穿禮服或晚禮服。","word":"suitable"}},"suite":{"createdAt":1781783820685,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"suite是指由多個房間組成的一套房間，通常用於飯店或公寓，各房間相互連接。","options":["suite","floor","room","building"],"sentence":"The hotel offers a luxurious ______ with a bedroom, living room, and private bathroom. When we checked in, the receptionist explained that all the rooms were interconnected as one accommodation.","translation":"飯店提供豪華套房，包括臥室、客廳和獨立浴室。我們辦理入住時，前台人員解釋所有房間都連接在一起作為一個住宿。","word":"suite"}},"sum":{"createdAt":1783063953963,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sum表示「總數、金額」，通常指把多個數字或金額加在一起得到的結果。","options":["piece","amount","sum","portion"],"sentence":"The charity successfully raised a large ______ of money for disaster relief efforts. The total amount collected exceeded two million dollars.","translation":"慈善機構成功為災難救援工作籌集了一大筆金錢。收集的總金額超過了200萬美元。","word":"sum"}},"summarize":{"createdAt":1783483020018,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"summarize 意為將信息或內容簡要地陳述或概述，提取最主要的要點。","options":["expand","summarize","analyze","critique"],"sentence":"The professor asked the students to ______ the main points of the long research paper in just one paragraph. By condensing hundreds of pages into a few key ideas, they demonstrated their understanding of the most important findings.","translation":"教授要求學生將這篇冗長的研究論文的要點在一個段落中概述。通過將數百頁濃縮成幾個關鍵想法，他們展示了對最重要發現的理解。","word":"summarize"}},"summary":{"createdAt":1781849622419,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"摘要是指對某段文本、事件或主題的簡潔概述，保留主要信息但省略細枝末節。","options":["extension","summary","criticism","analysis"],"sentence":"The professor asked students to write a brief ______ of the novel. The one-page overview should capture the main plot points and character development without including unnecessary details.","translation":"教授要求學生寫一份簡短的小說摘要。這份一頁的概述應該涵蓋主要的情節點和角色發展，而不包括不必要的細節。","word":"summary"}},"summit":{"createdAt":1781839703150,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"summit指山峰或最高點，與reached the top at 8,848 meters（到達8848米的頂部）完全相符。","options":["valley","base","foothill","summit"],"sentence":"The mountain climbers reached the ______ after eight days of arduous climbing. They stood at 8,848 meters above sea level, at the top of the world.","translation":"登山者經過八天艱苦的攀登後到達了山頂。他們站在海拔8848米處，在世界之巔。","word":"summit"}},"summon":{"createdAt":1784793793116,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"summon 是動詞，表示正式地命令某人到某地，特別是在法律或權威的情況下傳喚或召集。","options":["invite","suggest","summon","encourage"],"sentence":"The judge decided to ______ all the witnesses to appear in court on Monday morning. The bailiff immediately handed each witness an official court notice requiring their attendance.","translation":"法官決定傳喚所有證人於星期一上午出庭。執行官立即向每位證人遞交了一份官方法庭傳票，要求他們出席。","word":"summon"}},"superb":{"createdAt":1781449095500,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"superb意為極好的、傑出的，用來形容某事物品質優異或令人印象深刻。","options":["terrible","superb","average","mediocre"],"sentence":"The restaurant received a ______ review from the food critic. He praised every aspect of the meal and gave it five stars.","translation":"這家餐廳收到美食評論家的極好評價。他稱讚了這頓飯的每一個方面，並給了它五顆星。","word":"superb"}},"supercalifragilisticexpialidocious":{"createdAt":1783489104903,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"supercalifragilisticexpialidocious是一個虛構的形容詞，表示極其奇妙、令人驚奇或非常棒的意思。","options":["ordinary","supercalifragilisticexpialidocious","disappointing","predictable"],"sentence":"The children found the amusement park absolutely ______. Every attraction, from the roller coaster to the carousel, exceeded their wildest expectations.","translation":"孩子們發現遊樂園絕對極其奇妙。從過山車到旋轉木馬的每個遊樂設施都超出了他們最狂野的期望。","word":"supercalifragilisticexpialidocious"}},"superficial":{"createdAt":1784110946848,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"superficial 表示只涉及表面、不深入的，與「膚淺」同義，用來描述缺乏深度或細節的知識或理解。","options":["thorough","superficial","comprehensive","profound"],"sentence":"His ______ understanding of the topic was evident when he couldn't answer any detailed questions. He had only skimmed the textbook for five minutes before the exam.","translation":"他對這個主題的膚淺理解在他無法回答任何詳細問題時顯而易見。他在考試前只是瀏覽了五分鐘的教科書。","word":"superficial"}},"superintendent":{"createdAt":1781664082517,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"superintendent 是指負責管理和維護建築物或機構的人，特別是看管大樓的工作人員。","options":["owner","superintendent","architect","tenant"],"sentence":"The building ______ manages all maintenance and repairs for the apartment complex. He is responsible for fixing broken pipes, replacing light bulbs, and ensuring security.","translation":"大樓看管人負責管理公寓大樓的所有維修和保養工作。他負責修復破損的水管、更換燈泡以及確保安全。","word":"superintendent"}},"superior":{"createdAt":1781710289366,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"superior 是形容詞，表示「上等的；較優越的」，用來描述比其他事物更好或更高質量的東西。","options":["inferior","ordinary","superior","average"],"sentence":"This new smartphone model is considered ______ because it has better processing power and a longer battery life than its competitors. The technology reviewers consistently ranked it at the top of their comparison tests.","translation":"這款新智慧型手機因為處理能力更強和電池續航時間更長而被認為是上等的。科技評論家在比較測試中一致將其列為首選。","word":"superior"}},"superiority":{"createdAt":1786244771292,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"「superiority」指的是認為自己比他人更優越、更高級的感覺或態度，通常帶有傲慢和輕視他人的含義。","options":["inferiority","equality","superiority","modesty"],"sentence":"The wealthy CEO often displayed a sense of ______ toward his employees, treating them as lesser people. His condescending attitude and dismissive remarks made everyone feel small and undervalued in the workplace.","translation":"這位富有的首席執行官經常對他的員工表現出一種優越感，把他們當作劣等人對待。他傲慢的態度和輕蔑的言論使每個人在工作場所都感到渺小和不被重視。","word":"superiority"}},"supermassive":{"createdAt":1787291156702,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"supermassive用來形容物體具有超大或特大的質量，特別常用於描述宇宙中最龐大的黑洞。","options":["tiny","supermassive","distant","invisible"],"sentence":"The ______ black hole at the center of our galaxy has a mass equivalent to 4 million suns. Scientists have measured its gravitational influence on nearby stars and confirmed its enormous size.","translation":"位於銀河系中心的______黑洞質量相當於400萬個太陽。科學家已測量了它對附近恆星的引力影響，並確認了它的巨大規模。","word":"supermassive"}},"supernova":{"createdAt":1784818310068,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"supernova 是指星體的巨大爆炸現象，會產生極其耀眼的光芒，是宇宙中最明亮的事件之一。","options":["asteroid","meteor","supernova","constellation"],"sentence":"The astronomers observed a ______ in the distant galaxy through their powerful telescopes. The explosion was so brilliant that it briefly outshone all the other billions of stars in that galaxy combined.","translation":"天文學家通過他們的強大望遠鏡觀察到遠處星系中的超新星。這次爆炸極其燦爛，一度比該星系中所有其他數十億顆星星的光芒還要亮。","word":"supernova"}},"superstition":{"createdAt":1784055301401,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"迷信是指對無科學根據的事物的盲目相信，通常基於傳統、習俗或對未知的恐懼。","options":["science","superstition","knowledge","reason"],"sentence":"Many people avoid walking under ladders due to ______, believing it will bring bad luck. This belief has no logical basis in reality, yet countless individuals continue to follow such unfounded practices passed down through generations.","translation":"許多人由於迷信而避免在梯子下行走，相信這樣會帶來厄運。這種信念在現實中沒有邏輯依據，但無數人仍然遵循這些代代相傳的無根據的做法。","word":"superstition"}},"superstitious":{"createdAt":1781428458261,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"superstitious形容相信迷信的人，認為某些行為或對象會帶來好運或壞運。","options":["normal","superstitious","contain","lecture"],"sentence":"The ______ old woman refused to walk under ladders or open umbrellas indoors. She believed these actions would bring her bad luck and cause misfortune.","translation":"迷信的老婦人拒絕在梯子下走過或在室內打開傘。她相信這些行為會給她帶來厄運和不幸。","word":"superstitious"}},"supervise":{"createdAt":1781565657693,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"supervise 動詞表示監督或管理他人的工作，確保按照標準和指示進行。","options":["ignore","supervise","hire","promote"],"sentence":"The manager needed to ______ the new employees during their first week of work. She checked their progress daily and provided guidance to ensure they followed proper procedures.","translation":"經理需要在新員工的第一週工作期間監督他們。她每天檢查他們的進度，並提供指導以確保他們遵循適當的程序。","word":"supervise"}},"supervision":{"createdAt":1785240153911,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"supervision指的是對某人或某事的監督、管理和指導，通常涉及檢查和確保遵守規則。","options":["supervision","cooperation","communication","production"],"sentence":"The factory operates under strict environmental ______ to ensure compliance with pollution regulations. Government inspectors conduct regular audits and monitor all operations carefully.","translation":"工廠在嚴格的環境監督下運營，以確保符合污染法規。政府檢查員定期進行審計並仔細監控所有操作。","word":"supervision"}},"supervisor":{"createdAt":1781425122881,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"supervisor 指監督人或管理者，與定期審查工作和監督員工這個脈絡相符。","options":["inferior","colleague","supervisor","competitor"],"sentence":"My ______ reviewed my work performance every quarter and provided helpful feedback. He was responsible for monitoring all employees in our department.","translation":"我的主管每季度都會審查我的工作表現並提供有幫助的反饋。他負責監督我們部門的所有員工。","word":"supervisor"}},"supplement":{"createdAt":1785994363437,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"supplement是指用來補充不足的物品或營養物質，在這句話中指的是為了彌補飲食營養缺陷而額外添加的營養品。","options":["meal","supplement","medicine","snack"],"sentence":"The doctor recommended that I take a vitamin ______ every morning to improve my health. Since my diet lacks certain essential nutrients, this additional product will help fill the nutritional gaps.","translation":"醫生建議我每天早上服用維生素補充物來改善健康。由於我的飲食缺乏某些必需營養素，這種額外的產品將幫助填補營養空缺。","word":"supplement"}},"supply":{"createdAt":1782480892555,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"supply 作為名詞表示「供應」或「供應量」，指可用的商品或資源的數量。","options":["demand","supply","purchase","expense"],"sentence":"The factory had a large ______ of raw materials stored in the warehouse. Without this stockpile, they would not have been able to meet the increased demand from their customers.","translation":"工廠在倉庫裡儲存了大量的原材料供應。沒有這個庫存，他們將無法滿足客戶日益增加的需求。","word":"supply"}},"suppose":{"createdAt":1783845443801,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"suppose表示基於不完全信息進行的推測或假設，與後句「還沒有收到正式確認」相符。","options":["know","suppose","confirm","schedule"],"sentence":"I ______ that the meeting will start at 9 AM tomorrow. However, I haven't received official confirmation from the organizers yet.","translation":"我假設明天的會議將在上午9點開始。但是，我還沒有收到主辦單位的正式確認。","word":"suppose"}},"supposedly":{"createdAt":1781950727566,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"supposedly 表示據說或推測某事為真，但並非確定無疑。","options":["certainly","supposedly","actually","obviously"],"sentence":"He is ______ the best player on the team, but he rarely gets playing time. The coach seems to prefer other athletes despite his reputation.","translation":"他據說是隊上最好的球員，但他很少有上場時間。儘管他名譽很高，教練似乎更喜歡其他運動員。","word":"supposedly"}},"suppress":{"createdAt":1781532967171,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"suppress 表示鎮壓、壓制，與「阻止進入、防止集聚」的描述相符。","options":["encourage","suppress","announce","support"],"sentence":"The government tried to ______ the protest by blocking access to the city center. The authorities prevented demonstrators from gathering in public spaces.","translation":"政府試圖通過阻止進入市中心來______(鎮壓)抗議活動。當局阻止示威者在公共場所集聚。","word":"suppress"}},"suppression":{"createdAt":1781775598767,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"suppression作為名詞表示「鎮壓；隱瞞；抑制」，通常指權力機構對人民自由或權利的強力限制。","options":["promotion","protection","celebration","suppression"],"sentence":"The government's ______ of free speech angered many citizens who demanded their right to express opinions freely. Journalists were arrested and media outlets were shut down without any legal justification.","translation":"政府對言論自由的鎮壓激怒了許多公民，他們要求享有自由表達意見的權利。記者被逮捕，媒體機構無故關閉。","word":"suppression"}},"supreme":{"createdAt":1783852040585,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"supreme是指最高級別或權力最大的，表示沒有任何東西或機構在其上方。","options":["local","supreme","temporary","advisory"],"sentence":"The ______ court in the country has the final authority to interpret the constitution. Its decisions cannot be overturned by any lower court or government body.","translation":"該國的最高法院擁有解釋憲法的最終權力。它的判決不能被任何下級法院或政府機構推翻。","word":"supreme"}},"surface":{"createdAt":1782552550804,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"surface 是指物體的外部或最上層，在這裡指桌子看得見的外表。","options":["interior","structure","surface","bottom"],"sentence":"The ______ of the table was smooth and shiny before I spilled coffee on it. After cleaning away the liquid, I could see the polished wood grain on the top layer.","translation":"在我潑灑咖啡之前，桌子的表面光滑而有光澤。清掉液體後，我可以看到頂層拋光木紋。","word":"surface"}},"surge":{"createdAt":1783260805489,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"surge表示「急速上升」或「陡增」，指數量或強度的突然大幅增加。","options":["decline","surge","delay","pause"],"sentence":"There was a sudden ______ in online shopping during the holiday season. Sales figures jumped dramatically as consumers made their seasonal purchases in massive numbers.","translation":"在假日季節期間，線上購物出現了突然的激增。隨著消費者大量進行季節性購買，銷售數字急劇上升。","word":"surge"}},"surgeon":{"createdAt":1781619188928,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"surgeon 指進行手術的醫療專家，特別是進行外科手術的醫師。","options":["pharmacist","surgeon","therapist","dentist"],"sentence":"The skilled ______ spent ten hours performing the complex operation on the patient's spine. Only a specialist with years of training could handle such delicate work.","translation":"這位熟練的外科醫師花費十個小時為患者進行複雜的脊椎手術。只有經過多年培訓的專家才能進行這種精細的工作。","word":"surgeon"}},"surgery":{"createdAt":1785816113551,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"surgery是指通過醫學干預（如切開身體）來治療疾病或傷害的醫療程序，通常由外科醫生在醫院進行。","options":["examination","surgery","medication","therapy"],"sentence":"The patient underwent ______ to remove the tumor from her kidney. The procedure lasted three hours and required a team of specialized doctors in the operating room.","translation":"患者接受了手術以切除她腎臟上的腫瘤。該手術耗時三小時，需要手術室中一支專科醫生團隊。","word":"surgery"}},"surgical":{"createdAt":1781449095507,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"surgical意為與外科手術相關的，用來形容手術用的工具、技術或程序。","options":["dental","surgical","cooking","gardening"],"sentence":"The doctor used ______ instruments to perform the operation. These specialized tools were sterilized in preparation for the procedure.","translation":"醫生使用外科手術器械進行手術。這些專門工具在手術前進行了消毒。","word":"surgical"}},"surname":{"createdAt":1781835517796,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"surname 意為姓氏，是一個人的家族名字，通常在全名的最後。","options":["nickname","surname","title","initial"],"sentence":"My ______ is Smith, which I inherited from my father's side of the family. It appears on all my official documents and is shared with all my relatives.","translation":"我的姓是史密斯，這是我從父親那一方繼承下來的。它出現在我所有的官方文件上，並且與我所有的親戚共享。","word":"surname"}},"surpass":{"createdAt":1786499741923,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"surpass 意思是超過或優於某人或某事物，表示在某方面比他人表現得更好或成就更高。","options":["match","surpass","equal","follow"],"sentence":"Her academic achievements ______ those of her peers in every subject. She consistently scored higher than everyone else in the class and earned the top prize at the national competition.","translation":"她的學術成就超越了同齡人。她在每門科目上的成績都始終高於班上其他所有人，並在全國競賽中獲得最高獎項。","word":"surpass"}},"surplus":{"createdAt":1783395908750,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"surplus 表示超過所需的數量，指剩餘或過剩的東西。","options":["shortage","surplus","shipment","loss"],"sentence":"After the harvest, the farmer had a ______ of wheat that he could not sell. He decided to donate the excess grain to the local food bank.","translation":"收穫後，農民有過剩的小麥無法出售。他決定將多餘的穀物捐贈給當地食物銀行。","word":"surplus"}},"surrender":{"createdAt":1785110904569,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"surrender表示屈服、沉迷於，指主動放棄抵抗而讓自己陷入某種狀態，與後句提到無法控制的行為相對應","options":["resist","surrender","escape","object"],"sentence":"Over time, he began to ______ to his addiction and spent all his free time on it. His friends noticed that he could no longer control this behavior despite recognizing its harm.","translation":"隨著時間推移，他開始沉迷於他的成癮行為，並將所有空閒時間都花在上面。他的朋友們注意到儘管他認識到它的危害，但他已經無法控制這種行為。","word":"surrender"}},"surround":{"createdAt":1781693265627,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"圍繞是指在四周形成一個圓圈或邊界，將某物包圍在中心。","options":["abandon","surround","connect","attack"],"sentence":"Tall mountains ______ the small village on all sides. Visitors must travel through narrow mountain passes to reach this remote location.","translation":"高山從四面八方圍繞著這個小村莊。遊客必須通過狹窄的山口才能到達這個偏遠地點。","word":"surround"}},"surroundings":{"createdAt":1784630495575,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"surroundings 是指某人或某物周圍的所有事物和環境，特別強調完整的360度環境。","options":["background","surroundings","landscape","scenery"],"sentence":"The artist felt inspired by the natural ______ of the forest, with tall trees and flowing streams all around her. She decided to paint exactly what she observed in this peaceful environment.","translation":"藝術家受到森林的自然周圍環境啟發，四周都是高大的樹木和流淌的溪流。她決定畫出她在這個寧靜環境中所觀察到的一切。","word":"surroundings"}},"surveillance":{"createdAt":1781443653222,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"surveillance指的是對人員或場所的持續監視和盯梢，通常用於安全或執法目的。","options":["entertainment","decoration","surveillance","advertisement"],"sentence":"The security team installed multiple cameras throughout the building as part of their ______ system. Every hallway and entrance was monitored continuously to detect and prevent unauthorized access.","translation":"安全團隊在整個建築物內安裝了多個攝像頭作為監視系統的一部分。每條走廊和入口都被持續監控以檢測和防止未經授權的進入。","word":"surveillance"}},"survey":{"createdAt":1783179414639,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"survey是名詞，指通過向大量人群提問以蒐集意見或資訊的調查或民調。","options":["report","survey","debate","lecture"],"sentence":"The government conducted a ______ to understand public opinion on climate change. Thousands of residents were randomly selected and asked detailed questions about their environmental concerns.","translation":"政府進行了一項民調以瞭解公眾對氣候變化的看法。數千名居民被隨機選中，並被問及關於他們環保關切的詳細問題。","word":"survey"}},"survival":{"createdAt":1781564440924,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"survival 表示倖存、生存，指在困難環境中活著和繼續生存的能力。","options":["luxury","survival","entertainment","decoration"],"sentence":"The climber brought a first aid kit as essential equipment for ______ in the harsh mountain environment. Without proper supplies, his chances of staying safe would be greatly reduced.","translation":"登山者帶了一個急救箱作為在惡劣山地環境中倖存的必要設備。沒有適當的物資，他保持安全的機會會大大降低。","word":"survival"}},"survive":{"createdAt":1784461444997,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"survive（生存；倖存）指的是在困難或危險的情況下保持活著或繼續存在。","options":["perish","survive","explore","wander"],"sentence":"The explorer managed to ______ in the harsh desert for three weeks without any supplies. He was rescued by a search team who found him weakened but still alive.","translation":"這位探險家在沒有任何補給的情況下，在嚴酷的沙漠中成功地活了下來三週。搜救隊找到他時，他雖然虛弱但仍然活著。","word":"survive"}},"survivor":{"createdAt":1784959188585,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"survivor是指在災難或危險事件中活下來的人，強調生存下來的事實。","options":["witness","survivor","passenger","captain"],"sentence":"After the shipwreck, the only ______ was found clinging to a piece of driftwood three days later. The rescue team was amazed that someone had managed to stay alive through such a terrible disaster at sea.","translation":"在沉船事件後，唯一的生還者在三天後被發現緊緊抱著一塊浮木。救援隊對於有人能夠在這場可怕的海上災難中活下來感到驚訝。","word":"survivor"}},"suspect":{"createdAt":1781402154555,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"suspect作為動詞表示懷疑或對某人或某事產生疑心，通常基於某些證據或跡象。","options":["lack","hijack","suspect","possess"],"sentence":"The detective began to ______ that the butler was not telling the truth about his whereabouts. Evidence from security cameras showed he was in the mansion during the time of the crime.","translation":"偵探開始懷疑管家對自己行蹤的說法並不真實。安全攝像機的證據顯示他在犯罪時間正在宅邸內。","word":"suspect"}},"suspend":{"createdAt":1781414438958,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"suspend表示暫時停止、中止某項活動或服務","options":["increase","suspend","accelerate","redirect"],"sentence":"The bridge had to ______ traffic for several hours due to emergency repairs. Workers blocked off the entire roadway to ensure public safety.","translation":"由於緊急維修，大橋必須暫停交通數小時。工人們封閉了整條道路以確保公眾安全。","word":"suspend"}},"suspense":{"createdAt":1783852040584,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"suspense是指因不確定而產生的懸念或期待感，通常在故事或事件中會引起觀眾或讀者的興趣。","options":["boredom","suspense","comfort","clarity"],"sentence":"The mystery novel kept readers in ______ until the very last page. No one could predict who the real criminal was until the final chapter's revelation.","translation":"這部推理小說讓讀者直到最後一頁都充滿懸念。在最後一章揭露之前，沒有人能預測真正的犯人是誰。","word":"suspense"}},"suspension":{"createdAt":1783667392057,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"suspension 作為名詞，指的是暫時停止某人的職位或權利，特別是作為懲罰措施。","options":["promotion","suspension","graduation","enrollment"],"sentence":"The ______ of the student lasted two weeks due to his repeated misbehavior in class. He was forbidden from attending school during this disciplinary period.","translation":"由於學生在課堂上的重複不當行為，他被停學兩週。在這個紀律處分期間，他被禁止上學。","word":"suspension"}},"suspicion":{"createdAt":1781798927522,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"suspicion 表示對某人或某事的懷疑和不信任，通常源於令人困惑或矛盾的證據。","options":["trust","suspicion","sympathy","admiration"],"sentence":"The police officer viewed the suspect with great ______ when he found contradictions in his story. The witness's account did not match any of the facts presented by the accused.","translation":"當警官發現嫌疑人的故事中有矛盾之處時，對他產生了極大的懷疑。證人的陳述與被告提出的任何事實都不相符。","word":"suspicion"}},"suspicious":{"createdAt":1784516105918,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"suspicious 表示令人懷疑、值得懷疑或可疑的，通常用於描述讓人感到不信任或需要進一步檢查的事物。","options":["interesting","detailed","suspicious","historical"],"sentence":"The detective found the witness's story ______ and decided to investigate further. Several details contradicted the evidence collected at the crime scene, which made her doubt the truthfulness of the account.","translation":"偵探發現目擊者的故事令人懷疑，決定進一步調查。幾個細節與在犯罪現場收集的證據相矛盾，這使她懷疑該說法的真實性。","word":"suspicious"}},"suspiciously":{"createdAt":1783557858058,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"suspiciously是副詞，表示以懷疑、不信任的態度或方式去看待或對待某事物。","options":["happily","suspiciously","quickly","carelessly"],"sentence":"The man looked at the contract ______ before signing it. He wanted to read every clause carefully because he didn't trust the other party's intentions.","translation":"那名男子在簽署合約前用可疑的眼光看著它。他想仔細閱讀每一條款，因為他不信任對方的意圖。","word":"suspiciously"}},"sustain":{"createdAt":1784961185442,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sustain是指支撐或承受住某種重量、壓力或負荷；在此句中表示橋樑承受不了現代交通的重量。","options":["hold","sustain","carry","support"],"sentence":"The old wooden bridge could no longer ______ the weight of modern vehicles crossing it. Engineers warned that it would collapse if heavy trucks continued to use it.","translation":"這座老木橋再也無法承受現代車輛通行的重量。工程師警告說，如果重型卡車繼續使用它，它就會倒塌。","word":"sustain"}},"sustainable":{"createdAt":1781965320892,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"sustainable 表示能夠長期維持和保持，不會耗盡資源或造成環保問題。","options":["temporary","wasteful","sustainable","harmful"],"sentence":"The company developed a ______ farming method that protects the environment. By maintaining soil quality and using renewable resources, farmers can continue producing crops for generations.","translation":"該公司開發了一種可持續的農業方法來保護環境。通過保持土壤品質和使用可再生資源，農民可以為後代繼續生產農作物。","word":"sustainable"}},"sustenance":{"createdAt":1783685028741,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sustenance是指食物或營養品，特別是維持生命和健康所需的營養物質。","options":["shelter","sustenance","medicine","clothing"],"sentence":"After days without food, the travelers gratefully accepted the ______ offered by the village. The bread and water provided by the locals helped them survive until they reached the next town.","translation":"經過數天沒有食物之後，旅行者感激地接受了村民提供的食物。當地人提供的麵包和水幫助他們生存到達到下一個城鎮。","word":"sustenance"}},"swa":{"createdAt":1786404432853,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"swa 是動詞，意思是搖擺或說服；在這個句子中，它表示通過言語或論據來改變某人的想法或態度。","options":["confuse","swa","ignore","anger"],"sentence":"The politician tried to ______ the voters with promises of lower taxes and better schools. His skillful speech managed to convince even the skeptics in the audience.","translation":"這位政治人物試圖用減稅和更好學校的承諾來說服選民。他的巧妙演講設法說服了甚至觀眾中的懷疑者。","word":"swa"}},"swallow":{"createdAt":1782550057060,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"swallow用作動詞表示收回或否認之前說過的話，通常用於不願承認自己說錯了。","options":["shout","swallow","repeat","defend"],"sentence":"The proud athlete refused to ______ his words after the embarrassing loss. He stood by his prediction that his team would win the championship.","translation":"這位驕傲的運動員在令人尷尬的失敗後拒絕收回他的言論。他堅持他預測球隊會贏得冠軍的預言。","word":"swallow"}},"swamp":{"createdAt":1781580511755,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"swamp 是指充滿水和泥濘的濕地或沼澤地","options":["canyon","mountain","swamp","valley"],"sentence":"The explorer had to wade through the murky ______ to reach the other side of the forest. The waterlogged ground made every step difficult and muddy.","translation":"探險家必須涉過黑暗的沼澤地才能到達森林的另一邊。浸水的地面使每一步都困難且泥濘。","word":"swamp"}},"swap":{"createdAt":1781798927518,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"swap 表示兩方互相交換物品，使得原本屬於A的東西現在屬於B，反之亦然。","options":["share","swap","steal","compare"],"sentence":"The two friends decided to ______ their lunch boxes because they both wanted to try each other's food. By the end of lunch, each person had the other's original meal.","translation":"兩個朋友決定交換他們的午餐盒，因為他們都想嘗試彼此的食物。午餐結束時，每個人都擁有了對方原本的餐點。","word":"swap"}},"swarm":{"createdAt":1784187965382,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"swarm 表示大量事物或生物湧動或聚集在一起的樣子，通常帶有動態和密集的感覺。","options":["cluster","swarm","nest","colony"],"sentence":"A ______ of bees descended upon the garden, covering every flower in seconds. The massive group moved together as a single unit, creating a buzzing cloud that darkened the sky.","translation":"一大群蜜蜂湧向花園，在幾秒內覆蓋了每一朵花。這個龐大的群體作為一個整體移動，形成了一片嗡嗡作響的雲，遮暗了天空。","word":"swarm"}},"sway":{"createdAt":1785316511763,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sway 作為動詞意指說服或影響某人改變想法，強調透過言語或力量使他人傾向於支持自己的立場。","options":["convince","sway","inform","confuse"],"sentence":"The politician managed to ______ many voters with her compelling speech about economic reform. Her argument was so persuasive that even skeptics in the audience began nodding in agreement.","translation":"這位政治家設法用她關於經濟改革的有力演講說服了許多選民。她的論點非常具有說服力，甚至連觀眾中的懷疑者也開始點頭同意。","word":"sway"}},"swear":{"createdAt":1781775276771,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"swear指發誓或作莊嚴的承諾，尤其是在法律或宗教背景下進行。","options":["whisper","deny","swear","ignore"],"sentence":"The witness will ______ to tell the truth in court today. He will place his hand on the Bible and make a solemn legal promise.","translation":"證人今天將在法庭上發誓說真話。他將把手放在聖經上並做出莊嚴的法律承諾。","word":"swear"}},"swell":{"createdAt":1781709984198,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"swell 動詞表示身體部位因受傷或炎症而腫起或隆起。","options":["ache","swell","hurt","throb"],"sentence":"My ankle began to ______ after I twisted it during the soccer match. By the next morning, it had doubled in size and turned purple with bruising.","translation":"我在足球比賽中扭傷腳踝後，踝部開始腫脹。到了第二天早上，它的大小增加了一倍，並因瘀傷而變成紫色。","word":"swell"}},"swift":{"createdAt":1781429810263,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"swift是指速度快、動作敏捷的，形容人或事物移動迅速。","options":["symbol","detail","swift","temperature"],"sentence":"The ______ runner crossed the finish line in record time, leaving all competitors far behind. His incredible speed made him the undisputed champion of the race.","translation":"迅速的跑步者以創紀錄的時間衝過終點線，將所有競爭對手遠遠甩在身後。他的驚人速度使他成為這場比賽的無可爭議的冠軍。","word":"swift"}},"swiftest":{"createdAt":1784624872947,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"swiftest 是 swift 的最高級形式，用來表示在某個群體或範圍內速度最快的對象，通常帶有文學或正式的語氣。","options":["fastest","swiftest","quickest","speediest"],"sentence":"The ______ runner in the Olympic Games set a new world record. Among all the competitors across every nation, no one could match her incredible speed.","translation":"奧運會中最快的跑者創造了新的世界紀錄。在所有國家的競爭者中，沒有人能夠匹配她不可思議的速度。","word":"swiftest"}},"swiftly":{"createdAt":1784962580675,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"swiftly 是副詞，表示以極快的速度或迅速地進行某個動作，強調動作的快速性質。","options":["slowly","gracefully","swiftly","carefully"],"sentence":"The cheetah moved ______ across the savanna, reaching speeds of over 70 miles per hour in pursuit of its prey. Its incredible acceleration and pace made it the fastest land animal on Earth.","translation":"獵豹在草原上迅速移動，在追捕獵物時速度超過時速70英里。它的驚人加速度和速度使其成為地球上最快的陸地動物。","word":"swiftly"}},"swing":{"createdAt":1785728939598,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"swing 在這裡表示揮動球棒或其他器物進行打擊的動作，是棒球運動中的基本技術。","options":["catch","swing","watch","throw"],"sentence":"The baseball player tried to ______ at the pitch, but he missed it completely. He stepped out of the batter's box frustrated, knowing he had misjudged the ball's speed.","translation":"那位棒球運動員試圖揮動球棒打那一球，但他完全沒有打中。他沮喪地走出打擊區，知道自己判斷了球的速度。","word":"swing"}},"switch":{"createdAt":1781836375367,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"switch作動詞表示突然改變或調換，特別是從一種方式改為另一種方式。","options":["adjust","switch","transfer","switch"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ from using plastic packaging to recyclable materials. This major change was implemented across all their factories worldwide.","translation":"公司決定改變策略，從使用塑膠包裝轉為可回收材料。這項重大改變在全球所有工廠實施。","word":"switch"}},"swollen":{"createdAt":1781950727563,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"swollen 表示因液體積累或腫脹而膨脹的。","options":["broken","swollen","skinny","pale"],"sentence":"After the injury, his ______ ankle made it difficult to walk. The swelling was so pronounced that his foot looked twice its normal size.","translation":"受傷後，他腫脹的腳踝使行走困難。腫脹非常明顯，以至於他的腳看起來是正常尺寸的兩倍。","word":"swollen"}},"symbol":{"createdAt":1781429810259,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"symbol是指代表特定概念或事物的標誌或象徵，具有特殊的象徵意義。","options":["rite","symbol","firecracker","trustee"],"sentence":"The dove is a universal ______ of peace and hope, appearing in artworks and literature across many cultures. Nations often use this image in their official seals and monuments.","translation":"鴿子是和平與希望的普遍象徵，在許多文化的藝術作品和文學中出現。國家經常在其官方印章和紀念碑中使用這一形象。","word":"symbol"}},"symbolic":{"createdAt":1784532099869,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"symbolic 是形容詞，表示某物代表或象徵著某個特定的觀念、概念或品質，而不是字面上的含義。","options":["realistic","symbolic","decorative","abstract"],"sentence":"The dove in the painting is ______ of peace and hope. Artists have used this bird for centuries to represent these ideals in their work.","translation":"畫中的鴿子是和平與希望的象徵。藝術家們幾個世紀以來一直使用這隻鳥在他們的作品中代表這些理想。","word":"symbolic"}},"symbolize":{"createdAt":1786662858345,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"symbolize 意為象徵或標誌，表示用某物來代表特定的想法、品質或概念。","options":["represent","symbolize","describe","illustrate"],"sentence":"The dove is often used to ______ peace and harmony in many cultures. In religious art and literature throughout history, this bird has consistently represented these concepts across different civilizations.","translation":"鴿子經常被用來象徵許多文化中的和平與和諧。在整個歷史的宗教藝術和文學中，這隻鳥在不同的文明中一直代表著這些概念。","word":"symbolize"}},"symmetry":{"createdAt":1781848934135,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"symmetry指事物兩邊完全相同或相似的特性，具有平衡和和諧的視覺效果","options":["complexity","symmetry","height","color"],"sentence":"The building's design displays perfect ______ on both sides of its facade. Each architectural element on the left mirrors exactly what appears on the right.","translation":"建築物的設計在其正面的兩側呈現完美的對稱。左邊的每個建築元素都與右邊出現的完全相同。","word":"symmetry"}},"sympathetic":{"createdAt":1782610887956,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sympathetic是指有同情心的或能引起共鳴的，表示能夠理解和同情他人的感受。","options":["strict","sympathetic","distant","busy"],"sentence":"The doctor was very ______ to her patients' concerns and always listened carefully. Her compassionate approach made patients feel understood and cared for.","translation":"醫生對她患者的關注非常有同情心，總是仔細傾聽。她富有同情心的態度讓患者感到被理解和關心。","word":"sympathetic"}},"sympathize":{"createdAt":1785503617652,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sympathize 意為同情或憐憫，表示對他人的痛苦或困難表示理解和同情的感受。","options":["criticize","sympathize","ignore","celebrate"],"sentence":"I really ______ with you after hearing about the loss of your beloved pet. It's natural to feel sad when someone close to us experiences such grief.","translation":"聽到你心愛的寵物去世後，我真的很同情你。當我們親近的人經歷這樣的悲傷時，感到難過是很自然的。","word":"sympathize"}},"sympathy":{"createdAt":1784004063897,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"sympathy 表示「同情心」，是對他人困難或痛苦的理解和同情，通常伴隨著提供幫助或支持的行動。","options":["curiosity","sympathy","indifference","skepticism"],"sentence":"When her friend lost her job, Maria showed genuine ______ by listening without judgment and offering practical help. This emotional support made her friend feel less alone during a difficult time.","translation":"當她的朋友失業時，瑪麗亞表現出真誠的同情心，耐心傾聽並提供實際幫助。這種情感支持讓她的朋友在困難時期感到不那麼孤獨。","word":"sympathy"}},"symphony":{"createdAt":1781337343697,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"symphony是指由多個樂章組成、為大型樂隊創作的長篇交響樂作品。","options":["poem","sandwich","symphony","painting"],"sentence":"The orchestra performed a beautiful ______ that lasted over an hour during the concert. The composer had skillfully arranged multiple instrumental sections to create a complex and harmonious piece.","translation":"樂隊在音樂會中演奏了一部持續超過一小時的美麗交響樂。作曲家巧妙地編排了多個樂器部分來創作這個複雜和諧的樂曲。","word":"symphony"}},"symptom":{"createdAt":1782352245067,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"symptom指的是疾病或身體異常的表現或跡象。","options":["cure","treatment","symptom","vaccine"],"sentence":"A persistent cough is a common ______ of the flu virus. The doctor asked the patient when this sign first appeared.","translation":"持續咳嗽是流感病毒的常見症狀。醫生詢問患者這個症狀何時首次出現。","word":"symptom"}},"syndrome":{"createdAt":1781311983486,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"syndrome 指一組相關症狀的集合，在醫學上表示特定疾病的特徵表現。","options":["arena","syndrome","mature","timer"],"sentence":"The patient was diagnosed with a rare ______ that caused multiple physical and neurological symptoms. The doctor explained that this collection of symptoms typically appear together as a recognizable pattern.","translation":"患者被診斷患有一種罕見的症候群，導致多種生理和神經症狀。醫生解釋說這一系列症狀通常作為可識別的模式一起出現。","word":"syndrome"}},"synonym":{"createdAt":1781842656773,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"同義字是指意思相同或非常相似的詞彙，可以在許多情況下互相替代而不改變句子的主要意思。","options":["homonym","antonym","synonym","acronym"],"sentence":"The word \"happy\" is a ______ for \"joyful\" because they have almost the same meaning. When you replace one word with the other in a sentence, the overall message remains virtually unchanged.","translation":"「開心」是「快樂」的同義字，因為它們的意思幾乎相同。當你在句子中用其中一個詞替換另一個詞時，整體意思基本保持不變。","word":"synonym"}},"synthesis":{"createdAt":1781849622416,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"綜合是指將多個部分或元素組合在一起形成一個整體，特別是將不同的信息或想法整合成一個統一的整體。","options":["division","synthesis","criticism","isolation"],"sentence":"The researcher combined multiple studies to create a ______ of recent findings. The final report integrated data from ten different experiments into one comprehensive document.","translation":"研究人員結合多項研究來創建最近發現的綜合。最終報告將來自十個不同實驗的數據整合為一份綜合文件。","word":"synthesis"}},"synthetic":{"createdAt":1781950727560,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"synthetic 指由人工製造的合成物質，通常不是天然來源的。","options":["organic","authentic","synthetic","rare"],"sentence":"This fabric is made from ______ materials rather than natural fibers. The manufacturer uses petroleum-based chemicals in the production process.","translation":"這種織物由合成材料製成，而不是天然纖維。製造商在生產過程中使用石油基化學物質。","word":"synthetic"}},"syrup":{"createdAt":1781848330181,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"syrup是濃稠的糖水或蜂蜜類液體，常用於甜點和飲料中增加甜味。","options":["butter","syrup","cream","milk"],"sentence":"I poured thick ______ over my pancakes at breakfast this morning. The sweet, sticky liquid made every bite taste delicious and covered the entire surface of my meal.","translation":"今天早上早餐時，我在我的煎餅上倒了厚厚的糖漿。這種甜蜜、粘稠的液體讓每一口都味道美妙，覆蓋了我整餐的表面。","word":"syrup"}},"system":{"createdAt":1785454917954,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"system 指為實現特定目的而組織在一起的相互關聯的事物或部分，是一個整體性的概念而不限於單一工具。","options":["software","system","computer","database"],"sentence":"The company implemented a new ______ to manage employee records and payroll processing. This organized framework replaced the outdated paper-based method that had been used for decades.","translation":"公司實施了一套新的系統來管理員工記錄和薪資處理。這個有組織的框架取代了使用了數十年的過時紙質方法。","word":"system"}},"systematic":{"createdAt":1781849847406,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"systematic表示有系統的或有組織的，與「清楚分類、妥善記錄、提高效率」的線索相符。","options":["random","systematic","chaotic","haphazard"],"sentence":"Her ______ approach to organizing the files made the office much more efficient. Everything was categorized clearly and documented properly.","translation":"她對文件進行組織的有系統的方法使辦公室效率更高。所有東西都被清楚地分類並妥善記錄。","word":"systematic"}},"systematically":{"createdAt":1785244147965,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"systematically表示按照有條理、有計畫的方式進行，強調有組織性和按部就班的特點。","options":["randomly","systematically","hastily","casually"],"sentence":"The researcher ______ collected data from hundreds of participants over several months. She followed a detailed plan, recording information in the exact same way each time to ensure consistency.","translation":"研究人員有系統地從數百名參與者那裡收集了數個月的數據。她遵循詳細的計畫，每次以完全相同的方式記錄信息以確保一致性。","word":"systematically"}},"tablet":{"createdAt":1788135999095,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tablet在這裡指的是藥片，是一種小的、固體的醫療藥物形式，可以吞服。","options":["device","tablet","board","frame"],"sentence":"The doctor prescribed a ______ to help reduce my fever. I took it with water before going to bed last night.","translation":"醫生開了一種藥片來幫助我退燒。我昨晚睡前用水吞下去了。","word":"tablet"}},"tackle":{"createdAt":1785733870994,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tackle 在此處作為動詞，表示「著手處理」或「解決」某個問題或困難的任務，強調主動採取行動來面對挑戰。","options":["ignore","tackle","promote","discuss"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ the problem of low employee morale by implementing new wellness programs. The team has already begun working on this initiative and expects to see improvements within the next quarter.","translation":"公司決定通過實施新的員工健康計劃來著手解決員工士氣低落的問題。該團隊已經開始進行這項工作，預計在下個季度內會看到改善。","word":"tackle"}},"tactic":{"createdAt":1784176210332,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tactic是指在競賽或戰爭中採用的策略或手法，用來達成目標。","options":["equipment","tactic","penalty","roster"],"sentence":"The coach explained the winning ______ to the team before the match. The players needed to understand this specific strategy of attacking from the left side.","translation":"教練在比賽前向隊伍解釋了這個獲勝的策略。球員們需要理解這個從左側進攻的具體手法。","word":"tactic"}},"tag":{"createdAt":1783228002795,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tag 在此處指的是貼在商品上用來標示信息的標籤或簽牌。","options":["label","tag","sticker","mark"],"sentence":"The store manager placed a ______ on the new product to display its price. The ______ was printed with a barcode so customers could scan it at checkout.","translation":"店經理在新產品上貼了一個標籤來顯示價格。標籤上印著條碼，顧客可以在結帳時掃描它。","word":"tag"}},"tailored":{"createdAt":1784950578949,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tailored 作形容詞表示「量身訂製的、特別設計的」，指根據特定個人或情況的需求而製作或調整的東西。","options":["standard","tailored","popular","challenging"],"sentence":"The fitness program was ______ to meet each athlete's specific needs and goals. The coach designed different training schedules for sprinters, long-distance runners, and jumpers.","translation":"健身計畫是量身訂製的，以滿足每位運動員的具體需求和目標。教練為短跑選手、長跑選手和跳躍選手設計了不同的訓練時間表。","word":"tailored"}},"tame":{"createdAt":1782902185116,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"tame 作動詞表示「馴服」或「馴化」，指通過訓練使野生或兇猛的動物變得溫順。","options":["tame","released","abandoned","excited"],"sentence":"The wild horse was ______ through patient training and daily interaction with handlers. Once domesticated, it could be safely ridden by experienced riders without any resistance.","translation":"這匹野馬通過耐心的訓練和與馴馬師的日常互動而被馴服。一旦被馴化，它可以被有經驗的騎手安全地騎乘，沒有任何反抗。","word":"tame"}},"tan":{"createdAt":1784426633474,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"tan 指皮膚因陽光照射而變成棕褐色，這是一種正常的曬黑現象而非曬傷。","options":["tan","burn","scar","freckle"],"sentence":"After spending two weeks at the beach, she had developed a beautiful ______ from the sun. Her previously pale skin was now a warm, golden-brown color.","translation":"在海灘待了兩週後，她的皮膚曬成了漂亮的棕褐色。她之前蒼白的皮膚現在呈現溫暖的金褐色。","word":"tan"}},"tangible":{"createdAt":1789363793856,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"tangible 指有形的、可觸摸的或具體的事物，可以被感知或測量。","options":["invisible","theoretical","tangible","disputed"],"sentence":"The company's new marketing strategy produced ______ results that were clearly measurable. Sales figures and customer satisfaction scores both increased significantly within six months.","translation":"公司新的行銷策略產生了明確可衡量的有形成果。銷售數字和客戶滿意度評分都在六個月內大幅提高。","word":"tangible"}},"tangle":{"createdAt":1786197594570,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tangle是指東西纏繞在一起形成的複雜糾結狀，通常需要花時間慢慢解開。","options":["knot","tangle","mess","problem"],"sentence":"The fishing line fell into a ______ after being caught on the rocks. My brother spent twenty minutes carefully pulling and twisting the knots apart to free it.","translation":"釣魚線被岩石纏住後陷入了一團亂麻。我哥哥花了二十分鐘仔細拉扯和轉動結點來解開它。","word":"tangle"}},"tap":{"createdAt":1783063660623,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tap 在現代語境中指用手指在觸摸屏上輕敲或輕觸以給予指令。","options":["press","tap","swipe","hold"],"sentence":"She used her finger to ______ the screen of her smartphone to open the app. The device responded immediately to her touch and launched the program.","translation":"她用手指輕觸她的智能手機屏幕來打開應用程序。設備立即對她的觸摸做出反應並啟動了程序。","word":"tap"}},"target":{"createdAt":1783843483363,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"target在這裡表示「靶子」，是射擊或投擲運動中設置的標記物，射手需要擊中它。","options":["goal","target","object","point"],"sentence":"The archer aimed her arrow at the ______ on the wall. She was practicing for a competitive shooting event where accuracy within a specific distance was essential.","translation":"弓箭手將她的箭瞄準牆上的靶子。她正在為一項需要在特定距離內準確性的競技射擊比賽做練習。","word":"target"}},"task":{"createdAt":1783670406867,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"task 指需要完成的工作或任務，尤其是困難、耗時或費力的工作。","options":["achievement","privilege","task","blessing"],"sentence":"Organizing the company's entire filing system proved to be a difficult ______ that required weeks of hard work. The mountain of documents was so overwhelming that even experienced employees found it exhausting.","translation":"整理公司的整個歸檔系統被證明是一項需要數週努力工作的艱難任務。堆積如山的文件非常龐大，甚至經驗豐富的員工都感到疲憊。","word":"task"}},"tax":{"createdAt":1781437220551,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「Tax」作動詞表示政府對收入或商品徵稅。","options":["exempt","tax","reduce","eliminate"],"sentence":"The government will ______ all income above $50,000 at a rate of 25%. Citizens must file their annual returns by April 15th to pay what they owe.","translation":"政府將對超過5萬美元的所有收入按25%的稅率徵稅。公民必須在4月15日之前提交年度申報表以支付應納稅款。","word":"tax"}},"tear":{"createdAt":1785668299875,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"tear在此指從眼睛流出的液體水滴，通常由情感（如悲傷、喜悅或感動）引起，與「液體水珠」和「金色光芒」相符。","options":["rip","scar","tear","bruise"],"sentence":"A single ______ rolled down her cheek as she watched the sunset. The liquid drop reflected the golden light while she remained silent and still.","translation":"當她看著日落時，一滴眼淚沿著她的臉頰滑下。這個液體水珠反射著金色的光芒，而她保持沉默不動。","word":"tear"}},"tease":{"createdAt":1781431278557,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tease指以玩樂的方式嘲笑或戲弄某人，通常帶有友善的意圖。","options":["encourage","tease","praise","ignore"],"sentence":"The older siblings love to ______ their younger brother about his new haircut. They laugh and make jokes whenever he comes into the room, but he knows they're just playing around.","translation":"年長的兄弟姐妹喜歡因為弟弟的新髮型而嘲笑他。每當他進入房間時，他們都會大笑並開玩笑，但他知道他們只是在玩耍。","word":"tease"}},"technical":{"createdAt":1784818655893,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"technical 形容與技術、科技、機械或專業知識相關的事物或問題。","options":["emotional","social","technical","personal"],"sentence":"The ______ difficulties with the software required an expert programmer to fix the bugs. The team needed someone with deep knowledge of coding to resolve the issues.","translation":"軟體的技術困難需要專家程序員來修復漏洞。該團隊需要有深厚編碼知識的人來解決這些問題。","word":"technical"}},"technique":{"createdAt":1783391421678,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"technique（名詞）指「技術、方法、技巧」，特別是指執行某項任務或藝術所使用的特定方式或方法。","options":["melody","concert","technique","composer"],"sentence":"The pianist used an advanced ______ to produce such beautiful music from the instrument. Years of practice and specific finger movements allowed her to achieve this distinctive sound.","translation":"鋼琴家使用先進的技術從樂器中產生出如此優美的音樂。多年的練習和特定的手指動作使她能夠達到這種獨特的聲音。","word":"technique"}},"technological":{"createdAt":1781601735994,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"「technological」指與工業技術和科技相關的，常用來描述涉及機器、軟體或科學進步的事物。","options":["cultural","educational","technological","political"],"sentence":"The company invested millions in ______ advancement to stay competitive in the market. Their research team developed new software and machinery that revolutionized production efficiency.","translation":"該公司投入數百萬美元進行技術進步以保持市場競爭力。他們的研究團隊開發了革命性的新軟體和機器，改善了生產效率。","word":"technological"}},"technology":{"createdAt":1785252384392,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"technology（科技）指的是應用於實際問題的科學知識和工具，例如電腦、機械等設備。","options":["strategy","technology","investment","management"],"sentence":"The company invested heavily in new ______ to improve its manufacturing process. Without computers, artificial intelligence, and advanced machinery, they could not have achieved such efficiency gains.","translation":"該公司投入大量資金開發新的科技以改進其製造過程。沒有電腦、人工智慧和先進機械，他們就無法取得如此的效率提升。","word":"technology"}},"tedious":{"createdAt":1781831848727,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tedious 是形容詞，表示「乏味的」或「令人厭倦的」，強調內容或活動的單調無趣。","options":["complex","tedious","thick","lengthy"],"sentence":"Reading that ______ instruction manual made me feel exhausted and bored. I nearly fell asleep by the time I finished the third chapter.","translation":"閱讀那份乏味的說明書讓我感到疲憊和無聊。當我讀完第三章時，我幾乎要睡著了。","word":"tedious"}},"tedium":{"createdAt":1781738392787,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"「tedium」指令人厭煩和沉悶的感覺，與長時間無趣的演講和與會者昏昏欲睡的狀態完全相符。","options":["obligation","offense","tedium","trophy"],"sentence":"The long meeting filled everyone with a sense of ______ as the speaker droned on endlessly. By the third hour, most attendees were struggling to stay awake.","translation":"隨著演講者沒完沒了地講話，冗長的會議使每個人都感到沉悶。到了第三個小時，大多數與會者都在努力保持清醒。","word":"tedium"}},"telecommunications":{"createdAt":1787900518683,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"telecommunications指的是遠距離的信息傳輸和通訊系統，包括電話、網際網路、衛星通訊等技術。","options":["transportation","telecommunications","manufacturing","agriculture"],"sentence":"The company invested heavily in ______ infrastructure to connect remote villages with high-speed internet. Without advanced satellite and fiber optic networks, people in isolated areas would have no way to communicate across long distances.","translation":"該公司投入大量資金於遠距離通訊基礎設施，以便將偏遠村莊與高速網際網路連接。如果沒有先進的衛星和光纖網絡，孤立地區的人們將無法進行遠距離通訊。","word":"telecommunications"}},"teller":{"createdAt":1781424356416,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"teller指的是在銀行或金融機構中直接與顧客進行交易的工作人員。","options":["manager","guard","teller","accountant"],"sentence":"The bank ______ counted the cash drawer at the end of her shift. She worked behind the counter handling customer deposits and withdrawals all day long.","translation":"銀行出納員在她班次結束時清點現金抽屜。她整天在櫃檯後面工作，處理客户的存款和取款。","word":"teller"}},"temper":{"createdAt":1783685293800,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"temper意思是「脾氣」，指一個人容易生氣或情緒波動的傾向。","options":["voice","schedule","temper","strategy"],"sentence":"The coach has a volatile ______ and often yells at players during practice. Everyone knows to stay away from him when things are not going well.","translation":"教練的脾氣很不穩定，在訓練中經常對球員大喊大叫。每個人都知道當事情不順利時要遠離他。","word":"temper"}},"temperament":{"createdAt":1784372634559,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"temperament 指一個人的性情、氣質或天生的情緒傾向，反映了一個人對事物的穩定態度和反應方式。","options":["schedule","temperament","appearance","background"],"sentence":"Sarah's calm and patient ______ made her an excellent teacher for young children. She never lost her composure even when her students were being difficult.","translation":"莎拉平靜且耐心的氣質使她成為年幼孩童的優秀教師。即使學生表現困難，她也從未失去鎮定。","word":"temperament"}},"temperate":{"createdAt":1782096279659,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"temperate用來形容既不過熱也不過冷的氣候，溫度適中且穩定。","options":["tropical","arctic","temperate","humid"],"sentence":"The ______ climate of the Mediterranean region makes it ideal for growing olives and grapes. The area rarely experiences extreme temperatures, with mild winters and warm summers.","translation":"地中海地區溫和的氣候非常適合種植橄欖和葡萄。該地區很少經歷極端溫度，冬天溫和，夏天溫暖。","word":"temperate"}},"temperature":{"createdAt":1781429810256,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"temperature是指物質或人體的冷熱程度，通常用攝氏度或華氏度來測量。","options":["objection","temperature","trustee","square"],"sentence":"The doctor measured the patient's ______ and found it was 39 degrees Celsius, indicating a high fever. This reading showed that the infection was serious.","translation":"醫生測量了患者的體溫，發現是攝氏39度，表示高燒。這個讀數顯示感染很嚴重。","word":"temperature"}},"temple":{"createdAt":1781337343694,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"temple是指廟宇或寺廟，是宗教信仰者進行祈禱和祭祀的地方。","options":["hospital","temple","museum","castle"],"sentence":"The ancient ______ stood on the hilltop, attracting thousands of pilgrims each year. Visitors came to pray and make offerings at this sacred religious site.","translation":"古老的廟宇聳立在山頂上，每年吸引數千名朝聖者。遊客來到這個神聖的宗教場所祈禱和獻祭。","word":"temple"}},"tempo":{"createdAt":1782902371512,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tempo 指音樂的節奏或步調，即音樂演奏的速度快慢。","options":["volume","tempo","melody","harmony"],"sentence":"The conductor increased the ______ of the orchestra during the final movement. The musicians played faster and faster as the piece reached its dramatic climax.","translation":"指揮在最後樂章增加了管弦樂隊的節奏。當樂曲達到戲劇性的高潮時，樂手們演奏得越來越快。","word":"tempo"}},"temporarily":{"createdAt":1781693264939,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"temporarily 是副詞，表示「暫時地」或「短期地」，用來修飾某個動作或狀態是不永久的。","options":["socially","valueless","temporarily","vanish"],"sentence":"The store closed its doors ______ due to renovations and construction work. The manager announced that it would reopen in three weeks after all the improvements were completed.","translation":"這家商店因為裝修和施工工作暫時關閉。經理宣布在所有改善完成後三週內將重新開放。","word":"temporarily"}},"temporary":{"createdAt":1781704395605,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"temporary表示「暫時的」，用來形容預期會改變或被移除的事物","options":["permanent","temporary","threatening","threshold"],"sentence":"The construction company set up ______ barriers around the work site. However, they plan to remove everything by next month when the project is completed.","translation":"建築公司在工地周圍設置了暫時性的障礙物。不過，當專案在下個月完成時，他們計畫將所有東西都移除。","word":"temporary"}},"tempt":{"createdAt":1781693264938,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"tempt 是動詞，表示「誘惑」或「慫恿」，指引誘某人做出某個行為，通常帶有吸引力的承諾。","options":["vanish","temporarily","tempt","socially"],"sentence":"The advertisement tried to ______ consumers with promises of free gifts and huge discounts on luxury products. Many people were unable to resist the attractive offer and immediately made purchases.","translation":"廣告試圖以免費禮物和奢侈品大幅折扣的承諾誘惑消費者。許多人無法抗拒這個吸引人的優惠，立即進行購買。","word":"tempt"}},"temptation":{"createdAt":1781842419966,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"temptation指一種難以抗拒的欲望或引人犯錯的事物；在這裡特別指應該被抗拒的不良衝動。","options":["opportunity","temptation","motivation","permission"],"sentence":"The ______ to eat dessert was strong after dinner, but I managed to resist it. My doctor had warned me that sugar would worsen my health condition.","translation":"晚餐後吃甜點的誘惑很強，但我還是抵抗住了。我的醫生警告我說糖會惡化我的健康狀況。","word":"temptation"}},"tempting":{"createdAt":1781841742851,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"tempting 作形容詞表示「誘人的、吸引人的」，指某物令人想要嘗試或擁有。","options":["repulsive","boring","tempting","ordinary"],"sentence":"The dessert looked so ______ with its rich chocolate and fresh berries that I almost forgot my diet. I had to resist the urge to order it immediately.","translation":"那道甜點看起來誘人極了，有豐富的巧克力和新鮮的漿果，我幾乎忘記了我的飲食計劃。我不得不抗拒立即訂購它的衝動。","word":"tempting"}},"tenant":{"createdAt":1781565657694,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tenant 名詞指租賃房產的人，他們向房東支付租金以換取居住權。","options":["landlord","tenant","neighbor","contractor"],"sentence":"The ______ paid rent to the landlord every month for living in the apartment. Without this person's monthly payment, the property owner would not receive income from the unit.","translation":"租戶每個月向房東支付租金以居住在公寓中。沒有這個人的月度付款，房產所有者將無法從該單位獲得收入。","word":"tenant"}},"tend":{"createdAt":1783945487820,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"tend 表示「有…的傾向」或「習慣性地表現出某種行為」，描述一種普遍的習慣或趨勢。","options":["resume","intensify","tend","range"],"sentence":"Young people ______ to spend more time on social media than older generations. Research shows that teenagers check their phones an average of 150 times per day.","translation":"年輕人比年長一代更傾向於花更多時間在社群媒體上。研究顯示青少年平均每天查看手機150次。","word":"tend"}},"tendency":{"createdAt":1781950727558,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tendency 指一種經常性的傾向或習慣，用來描述某人或某事物經常發生的行為模式。","options":["achievement","tendency","location","emotion"],"sentence":"She has a ______ to arrive late to every meeting. Her colleagues have noticed this pattern happening consistently for months.","translation":"她有一種經常遲到開會的傾向。她的同事已經注意到這種模式持續了幾個月。","word":"tendency"}},"tender":{"createdAt":1782228491199,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tender 作形容詞，指食物柔軟、嫩滑，容易咀嚼，通常用來形容肉類或蔬菜。","options":["tough","tender","dry","rare"],"sentence":"The chef prepared a ______ steak that melted in my mouth instantly. The meat had been aged and cooked to perfection, making it extremely soft and easy to chew.","translation":"廚師準備了一份______的牛排，在我嘴裡瞬間融化。這塊肉經過陳年和完美烹飪，使其極其柔軟易咀嚼。","word":"tender"}},"tenderly":{"createdAt":1782831931929,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"tenderly 是副詞，表示「溫柔地」或「溫和地」，強調以關切和溫暖的方式對待某人。","options":["roughly","harshly","tenderly","coldly"],"sentence":"The nurse ______ cared for the elderly patient in the hospital bed. She held his frail hand with gentleness and spoke in soft, reassuring whispers.","translation":"護士溫柔地照顧了病床上的老年患者。她輕輕地握著他虛弱的手，用溫柔而令人安心的低語說話。","word":"tenderly"}},"tense":{"createdAt":1781824968064,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"tense 作為形容詞表示緊張的、焦慮的或充滿壓力的氣氛或情緒狀態。","options":["relaxed","cheerful","tense","comfortable"],"sentence":"The atmosphere in the courtroom became very ______ as the judge was about to announce the verdict. Everyone held their breath waiting to hear the final decision.","translation":"當法官即將宣佈判決時，法庭裡的氣氛變得非常緊張。每個人都屏住呼吸等待聽到最終決定。","word":"tense"}},"tension":{"createdAt":1781704395611,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"tension表示「緊張」或「不安的狀態」，指人與人之間或群體內部因為衝突或分歧而產生的不和諧氣氛","options":["thesis","adoption","temporary","tension"],"sentence":"The ______ in the negotiation room grew as both parties refused to compromise on key issues. Eventually, the meeting was postponed until cooler heads could revisit the discussion.","translation":"隨著雙方在關鍵問題上拒絕妥協，談判室內的緊張局勢不斷升高。最終，會議被推遲到雙方能夠冷靜地重新討論該問題時。","word":"tension"}},"tentative":{"createdAt":1783661880055,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"tentative 是形容詞，表示試驗性的或暫時性的，與第二句中「尚未最終確定」相符。","options":["permanent","definitive","tentative","final"],"sentence":"The company made a ______ plan for the project expansion, pending approval from the board. They would finalize the details once they received official confirmation.","translation":"公司為專案擴展制定了暫定計劃，等待董事會的批准。一旦獲得正式確認，他們就會最終確定詳細信息。","word":"tentative"}},"tentatively":{"createdAt":1781824968060,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tentatively 表示暫時性的、保留態度的或試驗性的同意，意味著還沒有做出最終決定。","options":["firmly","tentatively","enthusiastically","immediately"],"sentence":"The company ______ agreed to the merger proposal during the initial negotiations. However, they wanted to review all the documents carefully before making a final commitment.","translation":"公司在初步談判中試驗性地同意了合併提案。然而，他們希望在做出最終承諾之前仔細審查所有文件。","word":"tentatively"}},"term":{"createdAt":1782569936438,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"term 作為名詞，可表示學校或大學的學期，即教學活動進行的固定時間段。","options":["holiday","break","term","vacation"],"sentence":"During the autumn ______, students attend classes and complete their assignments. This period typically lasts for several months at a school or university.","translation":"在秋季學期期間，學生上課並完成作業。這個時期在學校或大學通常持續幾個月。","word":"term"}},"terminal":{"createdAt":1783391421677,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"terminal（形容詞）表示「末端的、終點的」，用來描述某事物的最後或最終階段。","options":["initial","terminal","moderate","temporary"],"sentence":"The ______ stage of the disease is very serious and requires immediate medical attention. Doctors told him that his condition had reached its final phase with no cure available.","translation":"這種疾病的末期非常嚴重，需要立即就醫。醫生告訴他，他的病情已經到達最後階段，無法治癒。","word":"terminal"}},"terminate":{"createdAt":1781746685520,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"terminate指的是終止、結束，表示使某事物停止或結束，特別是指正式或官方的結束。","options":["terminate","mentality","moisture","medal"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ the contract after discovering the vendor's poor quality work. All business relations between the two parties ended immediately.","translation":"公司在發現供應商工作質量差後決定終止合同。兩方之間的所有業務關係立即結束。","word":"terminate"}},"termination":{"createdAt":1782648229308,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"termination 意指結束、終止或停止，通常用於描述協議、合約或工作關係的正式結束。","options":["beginning","termination","continuation","expansion"],"sentence":"The company announced the ______ of its partnership with the supplier after five years of collaboration. The decision took effect immediately, and all contracts were dissolved by the end of the month.","translation":"公司宣佈與供應商的合作關係終止，此合作已進行五年。該決定立即生效，所有合約在月底前已解除。","word":"termination"}},"terms":{"createdAt":1781843207978,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"此字在法律或商業文件中指的是雙方必須遵守的條件和規定。","options":["signatures","terms","dates","names"],"sentence":"Before signing the contract, both parties must agree on all the ______. The document specifies payment amounts, deadlines, and conditions that each side must follow.","translation":"簽署合約前，雙方必須同意所有條款。該文件規定了每一方必須遵守的付款金額、截止日期和條件。","word":"terms"}},"terrace":{"createdAt":1781843207979,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"此字指的是建築物外的露天平臺或陽台，通常用於戶外活動。","options":["basement","terrace","hallway","kitchen"],"sentence":"The restaurant features a beautiful outdoor ______ where guests can dine under the stars. Tables and chairs are arranged on this elevated, flat area overlooking the city skyline.","translation":"這家餐廳有一個美麗的戶外露台，客人可以在星空下用餐。桌椅排列在這個俯瞰城市天際線的升起平臺上。","word":"terrace"}},"terrain":{"createdAt":1782401868814,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"terrain 表示地形或地勢的特徵。","options":["weather","terrain","distance","population"],"sentence":"The hikers had to navigate the difficult ______ of the mountain range. The rocky landscape and steep slopes made their journey extremely challenging.","translation":"登山者必須在山脈的困難地形中導航。岩石地貌和陡坡使他們的旅程極其艱難。","word":"terrain"}},"terrific":{"createdAt":1781843207979,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"此形容詞表示極好的、出色的，通常用於讚美某件事物的品質。","options":["boring","terrible","confusing","terrific"],"sentence":"The performance was absolutely ______, and the audience gave the actors a standing ovation. Everyone in the theater agreed it was one of the best shows they had ever seen.","translation":"這場演出絕對精彩，觀眾給了演員們起立鼓掌。劇院裡的每個人都同意這是他們看過的最好的演出之一。","word":"terrific"}},"terrified":{"createdAt":1782569936441,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"terrified 是形容詞，表示極度害怕或恐懼的狀態，通常用來描述非常強烈的恐怖感受。","options":["surprised","confused","terrified","curious"],"sentence":"The child was ______ when she saw the large dog running towards her. Her hands were shaking and she could barely speak from the intense fear.","translation":"當小女孩看到大狗向她跑來時，她嚇壞了。她的雙手在顫抖，因為極度害怕幾乎說不出話來。","word":"terrified"}},"terrify":{"createdAt":1782007196629,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"「使驚恐」表示引起極端的恐懼或驚慌，通常是突然和強烈的情感反應。","options":["entertain","inspire","terrify","bore"],"sentence":"The horror movie was designed to ______ audiences with its graphic scenes and sudden jumps. When the killer appeared on screen without warning, people in the theater screamed and covered their eyes.","translation":"這部恐怖電影旨在通過其血腥的場景和突然的驚嚇來使觀眾感到驚恐。當殺手在沒有任何警告的情況下出現在螢幕上時，影院裡的人尖叫並掩住眼睛。","word":"terrify"}},"territory":{"createdAt":1782491138493,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"territory 表示動物或國家所控制、佔據或宣稱的地理區域或領土。","options":["generate","ownership","territory","dividend"],"sentence":"The lion marked its ______ by spraying scent markers on trees and rocks throughout the savanna. Other males knew better than to enter this area, as it was clearly claimed and defended.","translation":"獅子通過在稀樹草原的樹木和岩石上噴灑氣味標記來標記它的領土。其他雄性獅子知道不要進入這個區域，因為這裡已經被明確聲稱和保護。","word":"territory"}},"terror":{"createdAt":1783243598912,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"terror 是指由暴力行為或恐怖活動引起的極端恐懼和驚駭感。","options":["excitement","terror","confusion","sadness"],"sentence":"The bombing campaign spread ______ throughout the city as residents feared for their safety. Families huddled in shelters, their hearts pounding with intense dread caused by the violent attacks.","translation":"轟炸活動在整個城市傳播恐懼，因為居民擔心他們的安全。家庭聚集在避難所裡，他們的心因暴力襲擊造成的強烈恐懼而狂跳。","word":"terror"}},"testament":{"createdAt":1781849847409,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"testament表示證明或驗證，與「證明品格、說明價值觀」的線索相符。","options":["contradiction","testament","denial","refusal"],"sentence":"His dedication to charity is a ______ to his generous character. His years of volunteer work speak volumes about his values.","translation":"他對慈善事業的奉獻證明了他慷慨的品格。他多年的志願工作充分說明了他的價值觀。","word":"testament"}},"testify":{"createdAt":1784376501497,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"testify 的意思是在法律程序中作正式的證詞或宣誓陳述，特別是在法庭上。","options":["observe","testify","remember","describe"],"sentence":"The witness agreed to ______ in court about what she had seen on the night of the accident. Her detailed account and sworn statement would be crucial evidence for the judge to make a fair decision.","translation":"那位證人同意在法庭上為她在事故發生那晚所看到的情況作證。她詳細的陳述和宣誓聲明對於法官做出公正的判決至關重要。","word":"testify"}},"text":{"createdAt":1781402539336,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"text 指書籍、雜誌或文章中的正文內容，即主要的文字材料部分。","options":["margin","text","cover","spine"],"sentence":"The student highlighted important passages in the ______ of her history book. She focused on the words and paragraphs rather than the photographs and diagrams.","translation":"學生在她的歷史書的正文中突出顯示了重要段落。她專注於文字和段落，而不是照片和圖表。","word":"text"}},"textile":{"createdAt":1781693347905,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"textile指的是紡織品或織品，通常指用纖維製成的布料或衣物材料。","options":["wage","textile","tuition","villain"],"sentence":"The factory specializes in producing high-quality ______ such as cotton and silk fabrics. These materials are then sold to clothing manufacturers around the world.","translation":"這家工廠專門生產高品質的紡織品，如棉布和絲綢布料。這些材料隨後被賣給世界各地的服裝製造商。","word":"textile"}},"texture":{"createdAt":1781848330173,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"texture指物體表面的觸覺感受和質地，包括光滑、粗糙、柔軟等特性。","options":["color","texture","weight","smell"],"sentence":"The ______ of the silk fabric felt incredibly smooth against my skin. Running my fingers across it, I noticed it had a soft and delicate quality rather than a rough or bumpy surface.","translation":"絲綢布料的觸感對我的皮膚來說感覺異常光滑。用手指在它上面劃過時，我注意到它有柔軟精緻的特質，而不是粗糙或凹凸不平的表面。","word":"texture"}},"the_rest_of":{"createdAt":1789080502642,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「the rest of」表示「其餘的；剩下的部分」，用來指代所有剩餘的東西，強調完全消耗了剩下的部分。","options":["most of","the rest of","some of","half of"],"sentence":"I ate two slices of pizza, and my friend finished ______ the pizza that was left on the plate. He was still hungry after the meal.","translation":"我吃了兩片披薩，我的朋友吃完了盤子上剩下的披薩。他在餐後仍然感到飢餓。","word":"the rest of"}},"theft":{"createdAt":1783927689730,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"theft 是指非法竊取他人財產的犯罪行為。","options":["loss","theft","mistake","accident"],"sentence":"The store manager reported a ______ to the police after discovering items were missing from the shelves. Security cameras showed someone putting merchandise into their bag without paying.","translation":"店經理在發現架子上有物品丟失後向警察報告了盜竊案。安全攝像頭顯示有人將商品放入包裡而沒有付款。","word":"theft"}},"theme":{"createdAt":1785039332108,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"theme指的是文學、藝術或故事作品中反覆出現的主要思想或概念，是貫穿整個作品的核心理念。","options":["setting","theme","character","conflict"],"sentence":"The ______ of the movie revolves around the struggle between good and evil. Throughout the film, this central idea is reinforced through the characters' choices and the plot's progression.","translation":"電影的主題圍繞著善惡之爭展開。整部電影中，這個中心思想通過角色的選擇和情節的發展而得到強化。","word":"theme"}},"theology":{"createdAt":1781848934148,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"theology指研究宗教、信仰和上帝的學科","options":["biology","theology","chemistry","psychology"],"sentence":"Professor Harrison teaches ______ at the university and specializes in religious philosophy. His lectures examine the nature of God and faith across different traditions.","translation":"哈里森教授在大學教授神學並專門研究宗教哲學。他的講座探討了不同傳統中上帝的本質和信仰。","word":"theology"}},"theoretical":{"createdAt":1781839950961,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"theoretical 指的是基於理論的,與實際情況相對,強調基於原則而非實踐。","options":["practical","experimental","theoretical","accurate"],"sentence":"The professor presented ______ models of how markets should function in perfect conditions. However, real-world economics often behaves very differently due to unpredictable consumer behavior.","translation":"教授展示了市場在完美條件下應該如何運作的理論模型。然而,現實世界的經濟學通常因為無法預測的消費者行為而表現得非常不同。","word":"theoretical"}},"theoretically":{"createdAt":1782921344555,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"theoretically 是副詞，表示根據理論或假設而言，與實際情況可能不同。","options":["definitely","theoretically","unfortunately","obviously"],"sentence":"______, your plan should work perfectly because all the calculations are correct. However, in practice, there are many unexpected variables that could cause problems.","translation":"理論上，你的計畫應該完美運作，因為所有的計算都是正確的。然而，在實踐中，有許多意想不到的變數可能會造成問題。","word":"theoretically"}},"theorize":{"createdAt":1785136069831,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"theorize 意思是提出或形成一個理論來解釋某些現象，通常基於推理和推測而非確定的事實。","options":["measure","theorize","discover","observe"],"sentence":"Scientists ______ that dark matter makes up most of the universe's mass. Their hypothesis is based on gravitational observations rather than direct evidence.","translation":"科學家理論化暗物質構成宇宙大部分質量。他們的假說是基於重力觀測而非直接證據。","word":"theorize"}},"theory":{"createdAt":1782352245062,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"theory指的是基於觀察和實驗的科學解釋或假說。","options":["opinion","guess","theory","rumor"],"sentence":"Einstein's ______ of relativity revolutionized our understanding of space and time. Scientists conducted numerous experiments that confirmed his mathematical predictions.","translation":"愛因斯坦的相對論理論徹底改變了我們對空間和時間的理解。科學家進行了許多實驗確認了他的數學預測。","word":"theory"}},"therapist":{"createdAt":1782921344554,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"therapist 是指提供治療服務的專業人士，可以是物理治療師、心理治療師或其他類型的治療師。","options":["teacher","therapist","chef","scientist"],"sentence":"After the accident, Sarah visited a ______ to help her recover from her injuries. The professional used physical exercises and stretching techniques to restore her mobility.","translation":"車禍後，莎拉去看治療師幫助她從傷害中恢復。這位專業人士使用物理練習和伸展技巧來恢復她的活動能力。","word":"therapist"}},"therapy":{"createdAt":1782352245068,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"therapy指的是幫助治療或緩解疾病、心理問題或傷害的治療方法。","options":["medication only","rest","therapy","surgery"],"sentence":"The patient underwent ______ for six months to help manage her anxiety disorder. The treatment sessions included counseling and relaxation techniques.","translation":"患者接受了六個月的治療以幫助控制她的焦慮症。治療課程包括諮詢和放鬆技巧。","word":"therapy"}},"thereafter":{"createdAt":1781935654223,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"thereafter 是副詞，表示「之後」或「從那時以後」，指某個時間點之後發生的事情。","options":["before","thereafter","previously","currently"],"sentence":"The company was founded in 1995, and ______ it became one of the largest manufacturers in Asia. From that point on, they never stopped growing.","translation":"這家公司成立於1995年，之後它成為亞洲最大的製造商之一。從那時起，他們從未停止增長。","word":"thereafter"}},"thereby":{"createdAt":1783852021572,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"thereby 是副詞，表示透過某個行動或方式而導致某個結果，強調因果關係和行動帶來的直接影響。","options":["therefore","thereby","however","meanwhile"],"sentence":"The new safety regulations require all workers to wear helmets on construction sites, ______ reducing workplace injuries by 40%. The company's insurance premiums dropped significantly as a direct result of this accident prevention measure.","translation":"新的安全法規要求所有建築工地的工人都要戴頭盔，由此減少了40%的工傷事故。由於這項事故預防措施，公司的保險費大幅下降。","word":"thereby"}},"therefore":{"createdAt":1785462383195,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"therefore是一個連接詞，用來表示因果關係或邏輯推論的結果，在這裡用來說明前面的原因導致了後面的結果。","options":["however","therefore","meanwhile","unless"],"sentence":"The weather forecast predicted heavy rain all day, ______ we decided to postpone our outdoor picnic. Since we wanted to enjoy the event without getting wet, staying home was the logical choice.","translation":"天氣預報預測整天都會下大雨，因此我們決定延後我們的戶外野餐。既然我們想在不淋雨的情況下享受這個活動，待在家裡是合理的選擇。","word":"therefore"}},"thermometer":{"createdAt":1783263708587,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"thermometer是用來測量溫度的儀器，醫療人員經常用它來檢查患者的體溫。","options":["stethoscope","thermometer","syringe","bandage"],"sentence":"The doctor used a ______ to check if the patient had a fever. The reading showed 38.5 degrees Celsius, which indicated a high body temperature.","translation":"醫生用溫度計檢查病人是否發燒。讀數顯示攝氏38.5度，表示體溫很高。","word":"thermometer"}},"thesis":{"createdAt":1781704395609,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"thesis表示「論文」，指學生完成學位課程時提交的正式學術文件","options":["barrier","threshold","thesis","tension"],"sentence":"The university required each doctoral student to submit a ______ demonstrating their original research findings. The committee would carefully review it over several months before granting the degree.","translation":"大學要求每位博士學位候選人提交一份論文，展示他們的原創研究發現。委員會將在數個月內仔細審查，然後才授予學位。","word":"thesis"}},"theta":{"createdAt":1781228443754,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"Theta是希臘字母表中的第八個字母，在數學和物理學中最常用來代表角度或相位角。","options":["theta","iota","zeta","kappa"],"sentence":"The eighth letter of the Greek alphabet is ______. Engineers and mathematicians use this symbol extensively to denote angles in trigonometry and calculus problems.","translation":"希臘字母表中的第八個字母是______。工程師和數學家廣泛使用這個符號來表示三角學和微積分問題中的角度。","word":"theta"}},"thigh":{"createdAt":1784343574885,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"thigh是指人體兩條腿中上面的部分，位於臀部和膝蓋之間。","options":["arm","thigh","ankle","shoulder"],"sentence":"The athlete suffered a muscle strain in his ______ during the marathon. The injury affected the upper part of his leg between his hip and knee.","translation":"這位運動員在馬拉松比賽中大腿肌肉拉傷。受傷位置在他的臀部和膝蓋之間的腿部上方。","word":"thigh"}},"thorough":{"createdAt":1783489104906,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"thorough表示徹底的、完全的、非常仔細的，指檢查或工作涵蓋所有細節，不遺漏任何方面。","options":["quick","thorough","superficial","cursory"],"sentence":"The inspector conducted a ______ examination of the building for structural damage. Every wall, floor, and ceiling was carefully inspected.","translation":"檢查員對建築物進行了徹底檢查以尋找結構性損傷。每面牆、每個樓層和天花板都被仔細檢查。","word":"thorough"}},"thoroughly":{"createdAt":1782408103447,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"thoroughly 是副詞，表示以完全、詳細和周密的方式做某事，不留遺漏。","options":["quickly","thoroughly","casually","partially"],"sentence":"The detective ______ investigated every detail of the crime scene to find clues about the suspect. She spent hours examining the evidence and interviewing witnesses.","translation":"偵探徹底調查了犯罪現場的每一個細節以尋找關於嫌疑人的線索。她花了數小時檢查證據並訪問證人。","word":"thoroughly"}},"thought":{"createdAt":1785812071999,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"thought 在此處指念頭或想法，表示在頭腦中産生的最初想法或思想，通常發生在採取行動之前。","options":["action","thought","plan","decision"],"sentence":"Her first ______ was to call for help when she saw the accident. The immediate impulse to assist the injured person showed her compassion and quick instinct.","translation":"當她看到事故時，她的第一個思想是呼救。立即幫助傷者的本能反應展示了她的同情心和敏捷的反應。","word":"thought"}},"thoughtful":{"createdAt":1781257238301,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"thoughtful形容人具有體貼、周到的品質，或者深思熟慮的態度。","options":["careless","thoughtful","lazy","rude"],"sentence":"Marcus was a ______ friend who always remembered his friends' birthdays and called to check on them. His actions showed he genuinely cared about others' feelings and wellbeing.","translation":"馬可是一位體貼的朋友，他總是記得朋友的生日，並打電話看望他們。他的行動表明他真心關心他人的感受和幸福。","word":"thoughtful"}},"thoughtfully":{"createdAt":1785233957111,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"thoughtfully 是副詞，表示以體貼、考慮周到的方式行動，強調對他人感受和想法的關注。","options":["carlessly","thoughtfully","loudly","briefly"],"sentence":"She listened to her friend's problems ______ and offered genuine advice. Her response showed that she had carefully considered every detail of what was said.","translation":"她體貼地聽著朋友的問題並提供了真誠的建議。她的回應表明她已經仔細考慮了所說的每一個細節。","word":"thoughtfully"}},"thoughtless":{"createdAt":1782554388869,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"thoughtless 表示缺乏考慮他人感受、輕率且不體貼的言行。","options":["thoughtless","humorous","clever","interesting"],"sentence":"Her ______ comment about his weight hurt his feelings deeply, even though she didn't mean to be cruel. She hadn't considered how her words would affect him before speaking.","translation":"她關於他體重的不體貼評論深深傷害了他的感受，儘管她無意傷害他。她在說話之前沒有考慮她的話會如何影響他。","word":"thoughtless"}},"threat":{"createdAt":1781704395608,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"threat表示「威脅」或「危險」，指可能造成傷害或損失的事物","options":["solution","thesis","threshold","threat"],"sentence":"The rising sea levels posed a serious ______ to coastal communities worldwide. Governments began investing in defense systems and relocation programs to protect their citizens.","translation":"海平面上升對全球沿海社區構成了嚴重的威脅。各國政府開始投資防禦系統和搬遷計畫來保護其公民。","word":"threat"}},"threaten":{"createdAt":1784341548260,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"threaten 意指用言語或行動恐嚇他人，表達造成傷害或不利後果的意圖，帶有強制性和恐嚇的含義。","options":["inform","assist","threaten","congratulate"],"sentence":"The aggressive customer began to ______ the store manager with legal action. The manager immediately called security because such intimidating language could not be tolerated in the workplace.","translation":"這位咄咄逼人的顧客開始用法律訴訟來恐嚇店經理。經理立即呼叫安全人員，因為這種威脅性的言語在工作場所無法被接受。","word":"threaten"}},"threatening":{"createdAt":1781704395608,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"threatening作為形容詞表示「有威脅性的」或「危險的」，用來形容看起來可能造成傷害的情況","options":["temporary","thesis","threatening","adopt"],"sentence":"The sky turned dark and ______, with heavy clouds rolling in from the west. The weather forecast warned that a severe storm would arrive within the next two hours.","translation":"天空變得黑暗且具有威脅性，濃厚的烏雲從西邊滾滾而來。氣象預報警告說，一場暴風雨將在接下來的兩小時內到達。","word":"threatening"}},"threshold":{"createdAt":1781704395612,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"threshold表示「門檻」或「起點」，指進入新階段或達到新水準的關鍵點","options":["threat","temporary","threshold","tension"],"sentence":"The athlete finally crossed the ______ into professional sports after years of training and dedication. She signed her first major contract with a leading international team.","translation":"經過多年的訓練和奉獻，運動員終於進入了職業體育的門檻。她與一支領先的國際隊簽署了她的第一份重要合約。","word":"threshold"}},"thrill":{"createdAt":1784793793108,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"thrill 是動詞，表示使某人感到極大的興奮或激動，特別是伴隨著快感或冒險的感覺。","options":["bore","thrill","confuse","disappoint"],"sentence":"The roller coaster ride never failed to ______ the passengers with its steep drops and fast turns. Every time they screamed with joy during the ride, it was clear they were experiencing intense excitement and joy.","translation":"過山車的快速下降和急速轉彎從未令乘客感到興奮。每次他們在乘坐時尖叫歡呼，很明顯他們正在經歷強烈的興奮和喜悅。","word":"thrill"}},"thrilled":{"createdAt":1782644423628,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"thrilled是形容詞，意為激動的、興奮的，形容一個人因為好消息或愉快的事件而感到的強烈正面情感。","options":["disappointed","confused","thrilled","worried"],"sentence":"Sarah was absolutely ______ when she received the acceptance letter from her dream university. Her face lit up with pure joy and excitement.","translation":"當莎拉收到來自她夢想大學的錄取信時，她感到非常興奮。她的臉上閃耀著純粹的喜悅和興奮。","word":"thrilled"}},"thriller":{"createdAt":1783836292879,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"thriller 是指能引起緊張、驚悚和懸念情感的故事作品，通常包含神祕、危險或令人意外的元素。","options":["romance","thriller","comedy","fantasy"],"sentence":"My sister loves reading psychological ______ novels that keep her guessing until the final pages. Books like Gone Girl and The Girl on the Train are her favorites because they have shocking plot twists.","translation":"我妹妹喜歡閱讀心理驚悚小說，這些小說讓她一直猜測到最後幾頁。《消失的愛人》和《列車上的女孩》是她最喜歡的，因為它們有令人震驚的情節轉折。","word":"thriller"}},"thrilling":{"createdAt":1785111765348,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「thrilling」是形容詞，表示某事物令人興奮、激動或充滿刺激感，通常帶有正面的情感體驗。","options":["boring","thrilling","expensive","crowded"],"sentence":"The roller coaster ride was absolutely ______ and left all the passengers screaming with excitement. The amusement park's newest attraction has been designed to give visitors an adrenaline rush and intense excitement from start to finish.","translation":"雲霄飛車之旅絕對令人激動，讓所有乘客都興奮地尖叫。遊樂園最新的景點被設計成給遊客從頭到尾都能獲得腎上腺素飆升和強烈刺激的體驗。","word":"thrilling"}},"thrive":{"createdAt":1781566460880,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"thrive表示在良好條件下生長繁榮，與後句提到的植物不會枯萎形成對比。","options":["wilt","thrive","fade","shrink"],"sentence":"Plants ______ in warm sunlight and rich soil. Without proper nutrients, they would wither and die instead.","translation":"植物在溫暖的陽光和肥沃的土壤中茂盛生長。沒有適當的營養，它們會枯萎和死亡。","word":"thrive"}},"throne":{"createdAt":1784820300720,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"throne 指的是君主或統治者坐的正式座位，象徵權力和統治的地位。","options":["chair","throne","seat","furniture"],"sentence":"The king sat upon his magnificent ______ made of gold and jewels. When he abdicated, his son inherited the ______ and became the new ruler.","translation":"國王坐在由黃金和珠寶製成的宏偉王座上。當他退位時，他的兒子繼承了王座並成為新的統治者。","word":"throne"}},"throughout":{"createdAt":1784078619499,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"throughout是介詞，表示「始終」或「自始至終」，強調在某段時間的每個部分都發生。","options":["during","throughout","within","beyond"],"sentence":"She worked on the project ______ the entire year without taking a break. From January to December, her dedication never wavered.","translation":"她整年都在進行這個項目，沒有休息過。從一月到十二月，她的投入始終不變。","word":"throughout"}},"thrust":{"createdAt":1781664082520,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"thrust 是指猛烈地推、刺或插入某物，通常涉及快速有力的動作。","options":["withdrew","thrust","lifted","rotated"],"sentence":"The fencer ______ his sword forward with great force to attack his opponent. The blade pierced through the air in a quick, aggressive stabbing motion.","translation":"擊劍手用很大的力量向前推進他的劍去攻擊對手。劍刃以快速、具有侵略性的刺戳動作穿過空氣。","word":"thrust"}},"thumbprint":{"createdAt":1782533789089,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"thumbprint 是拇指指紋，由於每個人的拇指紋路獨一無二，常被用作法律證據。","options":["trace","thumbprint","stain","mark"],"sentence":"The detective found a ______ on the stolen painting that matched the suspect's database record. This physical evidence linked him directly to the crime scene.","translation":"偵探在被盜畫作上發現了一個與嫌疑人資料庫記錄相符的拇指指紋。這個物理證據將他與犯罪現場直接聯繫起來。","word":"thumbprint"}},"thunder":{"createdAt":1783841864098,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"thunder 作為名詞，指打雷時產生的聲音，即雷聲，通常伴隨閃電出現。","options":["wind","thunder","hail","rain"],"sentence":"During the storm, the sound of ______ echoed loudly across the sky. The noise followed the lightning flash by just a few seconds.","translation":"在暴風雨中，雷聲在天空中大聲迴盪。這個聲音在閃電出現後幾秒鐘響起。","word":"thunder"}},"thunderous":{"createdAt":1785069134057,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"thunderous 形容聲音非常大且深沉，就像雷鳴一樣的聲響，通常用來形容令人震撼的巨大聲音。","options":["quiet","thunderous","polite","scattered"],"sentence":"The crowd erupted in ______ applause when the champion was announced. The noise was so deafening that people had to cover their ears to protect their hearing.","translation":"當冠軍被宣布時，觀眾爆發出轟隆隆的掌聲。噪音非常刺耳，人們不得不捂住耳朵來保護聽力。","word":"thunderous"}},"thunderstorm":{"createdAt":1784713618154,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"thunderstorm 是指伴隨著雷電和暴雨的劇烈天氣現象，通常會造成危險和不便。","options":["breeze","thunderstorm","snowfall","rainbow"],"sentence":"We had to cancel the outdoor picnic because a severe ______ was approaching our area. The weather forecast warned of heavy rain, lightning, and loud thunder expected within the hour.","translation":"我們必須取消戶外野餐，因為一場嚴重的雷雨正在接近我們的地區。氣象預報警告說在一小時內會有大雨、閃電和響亮的雷鳴。","word":"thunderstorm"}},"tick":{"createdAt":1782467634136,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"tick 表示在某物上打上勾號或核對號，通常用於標記或確認。","options":["attach","attack","tick","alike"],"sentence":"Please ______ the correct answers on the test paper with a pen or pencil. The teacher will count only the marked boxes as your responses.","translation":"請用筆或鉛筆在測試卷上的正確答案旁標記。老師只會計算標記的框格作為你的答案。","word":"tick"}},"tide":{"createdAt":1783063660624,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tide 指的是由月球重力引起的海洋水位定期上升和下降的現象。","options":["current","tide","storm","wave"],"sentence":"The fishermen waited for the ______ to go out before launching their boats. The ocean's water level would recede, making it easier to navigate the shallow harbor.","translation":"漁民們在潮汐退出之前等待才啟動他們的船隻。海水水位會下降，更容易在淺港中航行。","word":"tide"}},"tidy":{"createdAt":1781503378968,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"tidy 表示整齊、清潔和井井有條的狀態，或整理和收拾的動作。","options":["messy","dirty","tidy","chaotic"],"sentence":"After the party ended, she spent hours making the house ______ again. Every cushion was straightened, the floor was swept, and all items were returned to their proper places.","translation":"派對結束後，她花了幾個小時使房子再次整潔。每個墊子都被整理好，地板被掃乾淨，所有物品都被放回原位。","word":"tidy"}},"tight":{"createdAt":1786167316736,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tight 在這裡表示蓋子密封得很牢固，難以打開，正是這個單字的核心意義。","options":["loose","tight","broken","clean"],"sentence":"The lid on the jar was ______ and wouldn't come off easily. I had to use a cloth for extra grip to twist it open.","translation":"罐子上的蓋子很緊，不容易打開。我必須用布來增加握力才能把它旋開。","word":"tight"}},"tile":{"createdAt":1781564440923,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tile 作名詞表示瓷磚、瓦片，指用於鋪地或牆面的平方形陶瓷製品。","options":["brick","tile","wood","carpet"],"sentence":"The bathroom floor was covered with small ceramic ______ in a blue and white pattern. Each individual piece was carefully arranged to create an attractive mosaic design.","translation":"浴室地板上覆蓋著藍白相間圖案的小陶瓷瓷磚。每一塊都被仔細排列成有吸引力的馬賽克設計。","word":"tile"}},"tilt":{"createdAt":1781950727563,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tilt 指使某物傾斜或以角度移動。","options":["lower","tilt","spin","straighten"],"sentence":"He had to ______ his head back to see the top of the tall building. Leaning backward at an angle was the only way to view it completely.","translation":"他不得不向後傾斜頭部以看到高樓的頂部。向後傾斜是完全看到它的唯一方式。","word":"tilt"}},"tilted":{"createdAt":1781515329260,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tilted 形容詞，意思是傾斜的、歪斜的，描述物體不平直的狀態。","options":["straight","tilted","centered","aligned"],"sentence":"The picture frame hung ______ on the wall, creating an uncomfortable visual effect. We adjusted it so that the top edge was perfectly level with the ceiling.","translation":"相框在牆上掛得歪斜，產生了令人不舒適的視覺效果。我們調整它，使上邊緣與天花板完全水平。","word":"tilted"}},"timber":{"createdAt":1781362281727,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"timber指的是木材，特別是用於建築或製造的木料。","options":["metal","timber","plastic","concrete"],"sentence":"The construction company ordered high-quality ______ for the new building project. The wood was carefully selected for its strength and durability.","translation":"建築公司為新建築項目訂購了高質量的木材。木頭因其強度和耐久性而被仔細選擇。","word":"timber"}},"timer":{"createdAt":1781311983484,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"timer 是計時或定時的裝置，用來測量特定時間段的流逝。","options":["evolution","average","timer","syndrome"],"sentence":"I set the kitchen ______ to remind me when the cookies were done baking. After fifteen minutes, the device beeped loudly to alert me that time was up.","translation":"我設置廚房定時器提醒我餅乾何時烤好。十五分鐘後，該裝置發出大聲嗶聲警告我時間到了。","word":"timer"}},"timid":{"createdAt":1781503378970,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"timid 表示容易害怕、缺乏勇氣或自信，特別是在面對陌生人或新情況時。","options":["brave","bold","timid","confident"],"sentence":"The ______ child hid behind his mother when strangers approached him. He was too fearful and shy to speak to people he didn't know.","translation":"這個膽小的孩子當陌生人靠近時躲在媽媽身後。他太害怕和羞怯，不敢和陌生人說話。","word":"timid"}},"tin":{"createdAt":1783261169964,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tin是名詞，指錫金屬製成的罐頭或金屬容器，常用於儲存食物。","options":["bottle","tin","bag","box"],"sentence":"The old sailor stored his biscuits in a rusty metal ______ to keep them dry during the long voyage. This sealed container had protected his food supplies from moisture and spoilage for decades.","translation":"老水手把他的餅乾儲存在一個生鏽的金屬罐頭裡，以在漫長的航海中保持它們乾燥。這個密封容器幾十年來保護了他的食物供應免受濕氣和腐敗。","word":"tin"}},"tip":{"createdAt":1782084127074,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"tip 作為動詞可表示給予小費或服務費，通常用在餐飲、計程車或其他服務行業的語境中。","options":["punch","blame","tip","ignore"],"sentence":"He decided to ______ the waiter generously after receiving excellent service at the restaurant. The gratuity of twenty percent was well-deserved.","translation":"在餐廳獲得優質服務後，他決定慷慨地給服務生小費。百分之二十的小費是當之無愧的。","word":"tip"}},"tiptoe":{"createdAt":1781950727563,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tiptoe 指用腳尖輕輕地行走，通常是為了保持安靜。","options":["wheels","tiptoe","stilts","ladders"],"sentence":"She walked on ______ through the library to avoid disturbing the other readers. Her quiet, delicate steps made no sound on the carpet.","translation":"她踮著腳尖走過圖書館，以免打擾其他讀者。她安靜而細膩的步伐在地毯上沒有發出任何聲音。","word":"tiptoe"}},"tiresome":{"createdAt":1785734087406,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tiresome 是形容詞，用來描述令人感到疲倦、厭倦或不耐煩的人、事物或行為，特別是指長時間重複或單調的情況。","options":["energetic","tiresome","entertaining","refreshing"],"sentence":"After listening to the same complaints for hours, I found his repetitive behavior absolutely ______. I was exhausted and desperate for a break from his constant whining.","translation":"經過幾小時聽著相同的抱怨後，我發現他重複的行為絕對令人厭倦。我已經精疲力盡，急切地想要從他的不斷牢騷中休息一下。","word":"tiresome"}},"tissue":{"createdAt":1783558795713,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tissue 名詞表示組織或面紙，在這個語境中指的是一次性使用的薄紙。","options":["bandage","tissue","gauze","cloth"],"sentence":"When I caught a cold, I went through an entire box of ______ in just two days. I used it to blow my nose and wipe away my tears.","translation":"當我感冒時，我只用了兩天就用完了整整一盒面紙。我用它來擤鼻涕和擦淚水。","word":"tissue"}},"tobacco":{"createdAt":1783434356332,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"tobacco 是名詞，指煙草植物的葉子或製成的煙草製品，含有尼古丁成分，常用於製作香菸。","options":["alcohol","caffeine","tobacco","sugar"],"sentence":"The government implemented strict regulations on the sale and marketing of ______ products to minors. Research has consistently shown that nicotine in these products is highly addictive.","translation":"政府對向未成年人銷售和推銷煙草產品實施了嚴格的監管。研究一致表明這些產品中的尼古丁具有高度成癮性。","word":"tobacco"}},"token":{"createdAt":1782304661033,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"token作為形容詞表示只是表面上的、象徵性的，而不是真實或實質的。","options":["genuine","substantial","token","meaningful"],"sentence":"The company offered only a ______ gesture of goodwill after the scandal. Their half-hearted apology and small donation fooled nobody.","translation":"公司在醜聞之後只做出了象徵性的善意姿態。他們敷衍的道歉和小額捐款欺騙不了任何人。","word":"token"}},"tolerable":{"createdAt":1783583999738,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tolerable 意指某事物可以被接受或忍受，雖然不一定是最好的，但在可接受的範圍內。","options":["excellent","tolerable","comfortable","perfect"],"sentence":"The working conditions at the factory were ______, though far from ideal. The employees could manage their daily tasks without serious complaints or safety concerns.","translation":"工廠的工作條件是可容忍的，雖然遠非理想。員工可以在沒有嚴重投訴或安全隱患的情況下完成日常工作。","word":"tolerable"}},"tolerance":{"createdAt":1781746685500,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tolerance指的是寬容、忍耐，表示對他人缺點或過錯的理解和接納態度。","options":["consequence","tolerance","laborious","affirm"],"sentence":"The teacher showed great ______ towards her students' mistakes during the learning process. She understood that errors were natural and important for growth.","translation":"老師在學生的學習過程中對他們的錯誤表現出很大的寬容。她明白錯誤是成長過程中自然且重要的一部分。","word":"tolerance"}},"tolerant":{"createdAt":1781503378963,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"tolerant 表示能夠忍受、接納或寬恕與自己不同的事物或觀點。","options":["judgmental","biased","tolerant","narrow-minded"],"sentence":"His ______ attitude toward different cultures made him a respected leader. He actively listened to people with opposing viewpoints and never dismissed their beliefs.","translation":"他對不同文化的寬容態度使他成為受尊敬的領導者。他積極傾聽持相反觀點的人，從不否定他們的信念。","word":"tolerant"}},"tolerate":{"createdAt":1785820660996,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tolerate 意為「容忍或接受某事」，通常用於描述忍受不愉快或令人厭煩的情況。","options":["ignore","tolerate","hear","avoid"],"sentence":"Many people find it difficult to ______ loud noises in crowded public spaces. However, with consistent exposure and practice, they can gradually become more accepting of such sounds.","translation":"許多人發現很難容忍在擁擠的公共場所裡的大聲噪音。但是，通過持續的接觸和練習，他們可以逐漸變得更能接受這些聲音。","word":"tolerate"}},"toll":{"createdAt":1781838276302,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"toll在此指因災難造成的死傷人數或損失。","options":["volume","toll","claim","ordeal"],"sentence":"The ______ of the earthquake was devastating, with thousands of lives lost. Emergency officials announced the final death count after three weeks of search and rescue operations.","translation":"地震的死傷人數是毀滅性的，有數千人喪生。急難救助官員在三週的搜救行動後宣佈了最終的死亡人數。","word":"toll"}},"tomb":{"createdAt":1784293496178,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tomb是指埋葬死者的地下室或陵墓，在這裡特別指放置國王遺體的地方。","options":["palace","tomb","temple","monument"],"sentence":"The ancient king was buried in a grand ______ decorated with precious stones and hieroglyphics. Archaeologists carefully excavated the underground chamber where his body had rested for thousands of years.","translation":"古代國王被埋在一座用寶石和象形文字裝飾的宏偉墓穴中。考古學家仔細挖掘了他的遺體安息數千年的地下室。","word":"tomb"}},"ton":{"createdAt":1782894607719,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ton是計量重量的單位，特別用於測量大量貨物或物質的重量，通常用於工業和運輸領域。","options":["weight","ton","load","cargo"],"sentence":"The cargo ship was carrying over 500 ______ of steel and iron ore. The weight was so enormous that the crane had to work all day to unload it piece by piece.","translation":"這艘貨輪運載了超過500公噸的鋼鐵和鐵礦石。重量非常龐大，起重機必須花整天時間才能逐件卸載。","word":"ton"}},"tore":{"createdAt":1781503378958,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tore 是 tear 的過去式，表示用力撕裂或扯破某物。","options":["cut","tore","burned","folded"],"sentence":"He ______ the letter into small pieces in anger. The paper was destroyed completely, leaving no way to read what was written.","translation":"他憤怒地把信撕成小片。紙被完全破壞了，沒有辦法閱讀上面寫的內容。","word":"tore"}},"torment":{"createdAt":1783005778372,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"torment 意為「折磨」或「痛苦」，指持續的身心痛苦或煩擾。","options":["benefit","blessing","torment","gift"],"sentence":"The constant noise from the construction site became a ______ for the residents living nearby. They couldn't sleep or concentrate on their work due to the relentless loud sounds.","translation":"來自建築工地的持續噪音成為附近居民的折磨。由於不停的大聲噪音，他們無法睡眠或專心工作。","word":"torment"}},"tornado":{"createdAt":1781693471557,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tornado 是指一種猛烈的旋轉風暴，具有漏斗形狀，威力極強且具有破壞性。","options":["hurricane","tornado","blizzard","flood"],"sentence":"A devastating ______ swept through the small town, destroying buildings and uprooting trees in its path. The weather service had issued a warning just minutes before the funnel cloud touched down.","translation":"一場毀滅性的龍捲風襲擊了小鎮，摧毀了建築物並連根拔起樹木。氣象部門在漏斗形雲團接觸地面前幾分鐘發出了警告。","word":"tornado"}},"torrent":{"createdAt":1784711595413,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"torrent 是名詞，指「激流」或「狂潮」，通常形容大量快速流動的液體或比喻性的大量事物迸發而出。","options":["breeze","stream","torrent","puddle"],"sentence":"When the dam broke, a massive ______ of water rushed down the valley with tremendous force. The flood destroyed everything in its path, sweeping away houses and trees alike.","translation":"當大壩決堤時，大量激流沖下山谷，勢力驚人。洪水摧毀了沿途的一切，沖走房屋和樹木。","word":"torrent"}},"tortoise":{"createdAt":1782401868817,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tortoise 表示陸地烏龜，是移動緩慢的爬行動物。","options":["hare","tortoise","eagle","dolphin"],"sentence":"The ancient ______ slowly made its way across the garden, taking hours to travel just a few meters. Its shell protected it from predators.","translation":"這只古老的烏龜緩慢地穿過花園，花費數小時只走了幾米。它的殼保護它免受掠食者的傷害。","word":"tortoise"}},"torture":{"createdAt":1781424137078,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"torture 動詞意為「拷打；折磨」，指對某人造成極度身心痛苦以獲取信息或懲罰。","options":["question","convince","torture","persuade"],"sentence":"The villain threatened to ______ the hero if he didn't reveal the secret location. The cruel interrogator used various painful methods to extract information.","translation":"惡棍威脅要折磨主角，如果他不透露秘密地點的話。殘忍的審訊者用各種痛苦的方式來榨取信息。","word":"torture"}},"torturous":{"createdAt":1781843396462,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"torturous表示極其痛苦和難受的，在此指牙科治療帶來的身體和心理上的折磨。","options":["pleasant","comfortable","torturous","relaxing"],"sentence":"The patient described the dental procedure as absolutely ______. She winced throughout the entire appointment because of the intense discomfort and pain.","translation":"患者將牙科治療描述為絕對令人難受的。由於極度的不適和疼痛，她在整個治療過程中都在皺眉。","word":"torturous"}},"toss":{"createdAt":1783660470996,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"toss 在烹飪中指「攪拌」或「翻動」食物，使其受熱均勻。slice（切片）、boil（煮沸）、freeze（冷凍）都不是在鍋裡進行的攪拌動作。","options":["slice","toss","boil","freeze"],"sentence":"The chef will ______ the vegetables in the hot pan for even cooking. The ingredients need to be stirred constantly so they don't burn.","translation":"廚師會在熱鍋裡攪拌蔬菜以確保均勻烹飪。需要不斷攪拌食材，以防它們燒焦。","word":"toss"}},"tough":{"createdAt":1782627743497,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tough（堅韌的）形容物品或人具有強大的抵抗力和耐久性，能夠經受困難或惡劣的條件而不會損壞。","options":["soft","tough","fragile","delicate"],"sentence":"The leather jacket is very ______ and can withstand years of wear and tear. Even after being exposed to harsh weather conditions, it remains intact and doesn't tear easily.","translation":"這件皮夾克非常堅韌，能夠經受多年的磨損。即使暴露在惡劣的天氣條件下，它仍然完好無損，不易撕裂。","word":"tough"}},"tourism":{"createdAt":1785050558538,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tourism 是指旅遊業或觀光業，特別是指遊客到訪某地並進行旅遊活動所帶動的經濟活動。","options":["agriculture","tourism","manufacturing","mining"],"sentence":"The country's economy depends heavily on ______ as visitors from around the world spend billions of dollars annually. Hotels, restaurants, and attractions have all expanded to accommodate the growing number of international travelers.","translation":"該國的經濟在很大程度上依賴於觀光業，因為來自世界各地的遊客每年花費數十億美元。飯店、餐廳和景點都已擴展以容納越來越多的國際旅客。","word":"tourism"}},"tourist":{"createdAt":1782894607725,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"tourist指的是為了休閒或觀光而暫時訪問某個地方的人，通常來自其他城市或國家。","options":["guide","resident","tourist","vendor"],"sentence":"Every summer, thousands of ______ visit the ancient temples and museums in the city center. These visitors from abroad come specifically to see the famous landmarks and take photographs.","translation":"每年夏天，成千上萬的觀光客造訪市中心的古老寺廟和博物館。這些來自國外的遊客特別前來欣賞著名地標並拍照。","word":"tourist"}},"tournament":{"createdAt":1781425122879,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tournament 指正式的比賽或競技會，與運動員和國際競爭的脈絡相符。","options":["exhibition","tournament","discount","fiber"],"sentence":"She trained for months to prepare for the ______ next spring. The competition would feature the best athletes from twenty different countries.","translation":"她花了幾個月時間為明年春天的錦標賽做準備。這項比賽將有來自二十個不同國家的最優秀運動員參加。","word":"tournament"}},"tower":{"createdAt":1783476327937,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tower 是動詞，意為聳立、高聳，表示某物高高地站立或超越其他事物。","options":["sink","tower","hide","crouch"],"sentence":"The skyscraper began to ______ above the surrounding buildings as construction progressed toward completion. Its impressive height and commanding presence made it one of the most recognizable landmarks in the city.","translation":"隨著施工向完成推進，摩天大樓開始聳立在周圍建築物之上。它令人印象深刻的高度和雄偉的外觀使其成為城市中最容易辨認的地標之一。","word":"tower"}},"toxic":{"createdAt":1781738724027,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"toxic意指有毒的或含有毒物質的，能夠對生命造成傷害或死亡。","options":["nutritious","toxic","fragrant","beneficial"],"sentence":"The factory's ______ waste was dumped illegally into the river. Scientists discovered that fish in the water were dying within hours of exposure to the contaminated water.","translation":"工廠的有毒廢料被非法傾倒到河裡。科學家發現河裡的魚在接觸被污染的水後數小時內就死亡了。","word":"toxic"}},"trace":{"createdAt":1781773623444,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"trace作為名詞表示「蹤跡」或「痕跡」，指留下來的少量印記或線索。","options":["clue","trace","evidence","sample"],"sentence":"The detective found a ______ of blood at the crime scene that helped solve the case. By analyzing the DNA evidence from this mark, they were able to identify the suspect.","translation":"偵探在犯罪現場發現了一絲血跡，幫助破案。通過分析這個痕跡的DNA證據，他們能夠識別出嫌疑人。","word":"trace"}},"track":{"createdAt":1784473552373,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"track作為動詞表示「追蹤」或「跟隨」，指密切關注某事物的位置或進展。","options":["ignore","track","question","report"],"sentence":"The detective worked to ______ the suspect's movements across the city. Security cameras helped him follow the criminal's path and identify every location where he had been.","translation":"偵探努力追蹤嫌疑人在城市各地的活動。安全攝像頭幫助他跟隨罪犯的路線，並確認他去過的每個地點。","word":"track"}},"tracker":{"createdAt":1786111147344,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tracker 是指用來追蹤或監測某物或某人位置的設備或工具，能夠持續記錄和報告位置信息。","options":["jacket","tracker","compass","map"],"sentence":"The hunter wore a GPS ______ on his wrist to monitor his location in the wilderness. This device sent real-time signals back to his family so they could follow his exact position.","translation":"獵人在手腕上戴著一個GPS追蹤器，用來監測他在野外的位置。這個設備將實時信號發送回給他的家人，以便他們可以跟蹤他的確切位置。","word":"tracker"}},"trade":{"createdAt":1781935654224,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"trade 是名詞，表示「貿易」，指國家或地區之間買賣商品的商業活動。","options":["conflict","alliance","trade","communication"],"sentence":"International ______ between China and the United States has grown significantly over the past decade. Both nations export and import billions of dollars in goods annually.","translation":"過去十年間，中國與美國之間的貿易顯著增長。兩國每年出口和進口數十億美元的商品。","word":"trade"}},"trademark":{"createdAt":1783423026255,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"trademark 是指公司或品牌的獨特標誌或符號，受法律保護以區別其產品或服務，而 employee、advertisement、warehouse（員工、廣告、倉庫）都不具有識別和保護品牌的功能。","options":["employee","trademark","advertisement","warehouse"],"sentence":"The company spent years developing their distinctive logo as their ______ in the cosmetics industry. The symbol has become instantly recognizable and legally protected across all major markets.","translation":"該公司花費多年時間開發其獨特的標誌作為他們在化妝品產業的商標。該符號已成為即時可識別且在所有主要市場上受法律保護。","word":"trademark"}},"tradition":{"createdAt":1781696018690,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"tradition 意為傳統，指代代相傳、具有歷史和文化意義的習俗和做法。","options":["rule","law","tradition","invention"],"sentence":"The ______ of exchanging gifts on Christmas has been passed down through the family for generations. Every year, relatives gather together to honor this long-standing practice.","translation":"在聖誕節交換禮物的傳統已經在家族中傳承了好幾代。每年，親戚們聚在一起來遵守這項由來已久的習俗。","word":"tradition"}},"traditional":{"createdAt":1783760526716,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"traditional指遵循或保持已有久遠歷史的風俗、做法或信念的，與現代或創新相對。","options":["modern","digital","traditional","electronic"],"sentence":"The family still celebrates Christmas using ______ methods that have been passed down through generations. They decorate with handmade ornaments and follow the same customs their grandparents used decades ago.","translation":"這個家族仍然使用代代相傳的傳統方式慶祝聖誕節。他們用手工製作的裝飾品裝飾，並遵循祖父母幾十年前使用的相同習俗。","word":"traditional"}},"tragedy":{"createdAt":1781661288529,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"tragedy 是指引起悲傷或不幸的重大事件，通常涉及死亡、痛苦或失敗","options":["comedy","event","tragedy","story"],"sentence":"The sinking of the ship was a terrible ______ that claimed thousands of lives. Historians still study this disaster today as one of the worst maritime catastrophes in history.","translation":"船的沉沒是一場可怕的悲劇，奪走了數千人的生命。歷史學家至今仍將其視為歷史上最嚴重的海上災難之一進行研究。","word":"tragedy"}},"tragic":{"createdAt":1781832508020,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tragic 表示「悲慘的；不幸的」，形容造成死亡、傷害或嚴重損失的事件。","options":["comedic","tragic","fortunate","amusing"],"sentence":"The ______ accident claimed the lives of an entire family traveling home for the holidays. The investigation revealed that faulty brakes had caused their vehicle to collide with an oncoming truck.","translation":"這場悲慘的事故奪去了一個準備回家度假的家庭的生命。調查顯示，制動器故障導致他們的車輛與迎面而來的卡車相撞。","word":"tragic"}},"training":{"createdAt":1781362281728,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"training指的是訓練或培訓，通過系統的教學使人獲得新的知識和技能。","options":["vacation","training","entertainment","competition"],"sentence":"The ______ program at the company helps employees develop new skills. New staff members complete several weeks of instruction before starting their roles.","translation":"公司的培訓計畫幫助員工發展新技能。新員工在開始工作前完成數週的指導。","word":"training"}},"trait":{"createdAt":1782187611203,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"trait 指的是一個人或事物具有的特點或特徵，通常是天生或長期形成的品質。","options":["skill","trait","hobby","weakness"],"sentence":"Honesty is a valuable ______ that many employers look for in their employees. This characteristic helped her succeed in building trust with her team members.","translation":"誠實是許多雇主在員工身上尋找的寶貴特徵。這種品質幫助她在與團隊成員建立信任方面取得成功。","word":"trait"}},"traitor":{"createdAt":1782352245066,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"traitor指的是背叛自己國家、組織或信任的人。","options":["hero","patriot","traitor","ally"],"sentence":"The general was considered a ______ for selling military secrets to the enemy during wartime. His betrayal led to the loss of thousands of soldiers' lives.","translation":"這位將軍因在戰時向敵人洩露軍事機密而被視為背叛者。他的背叛導致數千名士兵喪生。","word":"traitor"}},"trample":{"createdAt":1785451790338,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"trample 特別指用腳反覆踩踏或踐踏某物，暗示暴力且重複的踩踏動作。","options":["destroy","trample","break","damage"],"sentence":"The angry crowd began to ______ the fallen sign during the protest. Their footsteps crushed it repeatedly until it was completely destroyed and flattened.","translation":"憤怒的人群在抗議期間開始踐踏倒下的標誌。他們的腳步反覆踩踏它，直到它被完全摧毀並壓平。","word":"trample"}},"tranquility":{"createdAt":1785140695721,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tranquility 指的是一種平靜、安詳的狀態，是內心的寧靜與安寧。","options":["anxiety","tranquility","confusion","excitement"],"sentence":"After years of stress and chaos, Maria finally found ______ in her meditation practice. She now wakes up each morning feeling completely calm and peaceful.","translation":"經過多年的壓力和混亂，瑪麗亞終於在冥想練習中找到了寧靜。她現在每天早上醒來都感到完全平靜祥和。","word":"tranquility"}},"transaction":{"createdAt":1786336581721,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"transaction指的是商業或金融上的交易、處理，特別是涉及金錢的買賣或交換行為。","options":["relationship","transaction","conversation","investigation"],"sentence":"The bank recorded every ______ made by the customer throughout the month. The receipt showed the exact date, time, amount, and merchant information for each exchange of money.","translation":"銀行記錄了該客戶整個月內進行的每筆交易。收據上顯示了每次金錢交換的確切日期、時間、金額和商家信息。","word":"transaction"}},"transcend":{"createdAt":1789363793855,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"transcend 意指超越或優於某事物，突破既有的限制或界限。","options":["follow","transcend","copy","imitate"],"sentence":"Her artistic vision seemed to ______ the limitations of traditional painting techniques. Critics praised how her work went far beyond what was previously thought possible in the medium.","translation":"她的藝術願景似乎超越了傳統繪畫技法的局限性。評論家讚揚她的作品遠遠超越了這個媒介中以前認為可能的範圍。","word":"transcend"}},"transcribe":{"createdAt":1781775276773,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"transcribe指將口頭內容或錄音轉換成書面文字的過程。","options":["erase","transcribe","delete","lose"],"sentence":"The secretary will ______ the recording of the meeting into a written document. She will convert every spoken word into typed text for the official record.","translation":"秘書將把會議的錄音謄寫成書面文件。她將把每句話轉換成打字文本供正式記錄之用。","word":"transcribe"}},"transcript":{"createdAt":1783243598911,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"transcript 是指詳細記錄學生成績、課程和成績的正式文件，通常由學校發行。","options":["diploma","transcript","certificate","resume"],"sentence":"Maria requested a ______ of her university grades to send to her new employer. The document listed every course she completed, her marks, and her overall GPA.","translation":"瑪麗亞要求一份她大學成績的文字記錄，以寄給她的新雇主。該文件列出了她完成的每門課程、她的分數和她的總平均績點。","word":"transcript"}},"transcription":{"createdAt":1784438746555,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"transcription 是指將口頭或音頻內容轉換成書面文本的記錄，例如法庭謄本、採訪記錄等，強調的是文字轉錄的過程和結果。","options":["recording","transcription","photograph","summary"],"sentence":"The court reporter provided a detailed ______ of the entire trial proceedings for the legal record. Every word spoken by the judge, lawyers, and witnesses was carefully documented in written form so that it could be reviewed later.","translation":"法庭記者為整個審判程序的法律記錄提供了詳細的謄本。法官、律師和證人所說的每一句話都被小心翼翼地記錄成書面形式，以便日後查閱。","word":"transcription"}},"transfer":{"createdAt":1781746848182,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"transfer 表示「調動」或「遷移」，指將某人從一個地點或職位調換到另一個地點或職位。","options":["promote","transfer","retire","dismiss"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ him to their new branch office in Shanghai. He packed his belongings and relocated with his entire family last month.","translation":"公司決定將他調動到上海的新分公司。他上個月收拾行李並和家人一起搬遷了。","word":"transfer"}},"transform":{"createdAt":1781746848183,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"transform 表示「轉變」或「改造」，指將某物改變成完全不同的樣子。","options":["damage","transform","preserve","demolish"],"sentence":"The architect's innovative design will ______ this abandoned warehouse into a modern art gallery. The project will take two years to complete the renovation.","translation":"建築師的創新設計將把這個廢棄的倉庫改造成現代藝術館。這個項目需要兩年時間來完成翻新。","word":"transform"}},"transformation":{"createdAt":1781665727112,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"transformation 指從一種狀態、形式或外觀完全改變成另一種，強調根本性的轉變。","options":["destruction","transportation","transformation","conversation"],"sentence":"The ______ of the old warehouse into a modern art gallery took two years to complete. The rundown building was now filled with contemporary paintings and sculptures.","translation":"老倉庫改造成現代藝術畫廊花了兩年時間完成。這棟破舊的建築現在充滿了當代繪畫和雕塑。","word":"transformation"}},"transit":{"createdAt":1782644423627,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"transit是名詞，意為運輸或過境，指物品或人員在從一個地點移動到另一個地點的過程中。","options":["storage","transit","distribution","delivery"],"sentence":"The package is currently in ______ from the warehouse to the customer's address. It should arrive within three to five business days.","translation":"這個包裹目前正在從倉庫運輸到客戶地址的途中。它應該在三到五個工作日內送達。","word":"transit"}},"transition":{"createdAt":1784113849032,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"transition 指的是從一種狀態或時期變化到另一種狀態或時期的過程，通常需要時間來完成適應。","options":["crisis","transition","decision","expansion"],"sentence":"The company went through a difficult ______ when it switched from manufacturing to digital services. The period lasted three years, during which many employees had to learn completely new skills.","translation":"當公司從製造業轉向數位服務時經歷了一個困難的過渡期。這個時期持續了三年，期間許多員工必須學習全新的技能。","word":"transition"}},"translate":{"createdAt":1781693471557,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"translate 意指將一種語言的文字轉換成另一種語言，特別強調按字面意思和風格進行轉換。","options":["summarize","translate","interpret","pronounce"],"sentence":"The student must ______ the French text into English for her homework assignment. Her teacher specifically requested that she convert each paragraph while maintaining the original meaning and style.","translation":"該學生必須為她的家庭作業將法文文本翻譯成英文。她的老師特別要求她在保持原意和風格的同時轉換每個段落。","word":"translate"}},"translation":{"createdAt":1785898016298,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"translation 是指將一種語言的文字或內容轉換為另一種語言的過程或結果，通常需要時間和專業技能。","options":["publication","translation","illustration","promotion"],"sentence":"The ______ of the novel from Japanese to English took the team six months to complete. The translator carefully preserved the author's unique writing style throughout the entire project.","translation":"將這部小說從日文翻譯成英文耗費了團隊六個月的時間才完成。譯者在整個項目中仔細保留了作者獨特的寫作風格。","word":"translation"}},"transmission":{"createdAt":1784341548259,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"transmission 是指車輛中將動力從引擎傳遞到輪子的機械系統，也可用於指任何形式的傳送或廣播。","options":["reception","transmission","suspension","ignition"],"sentence":"The car's ______ needs to be repaired because it cannot shift gears properly. Without fixing this mechanical component, the vehicle will not be able to transfer power from the engine to the wheels.","translation":"汽車的傳動系統需要修理，因為它無法正確換檔。不修理這個機械部件，汽車就無法將引擎的動力傳遞到車輪。","word":"transmission"}},"transmit":{"createdAt":1781598671064,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"transmit 作動詞表示傳播或傳遞，特別是指傳播疾病或信息","options":["cure","transmit","eliminate","predict"],"sentence":"Mosquitoes can ______ malaria to humans through their bites. Scientists have developed new vaccines to prevent this specific pathway of infection.","translation":"蚊子可以通過叮咬將瘧疾傳播給人類。科學家已開發出新疫苗來防止這種特定的感染途徑。","word":"transmit"}},"transparency":{"createdAt":1785668299871,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"transparency指的是公開、清晰、易於理解的特質，使得信息對所有人都是可見和可接近的，這裡與「詳細公開披露」形成對應。","options":["secrecy","transparency","complexity","efficiency"],"sentence":"The company's ______ in financial reporting has earned the trust of investors. Their detailed public disclosures make it impossible for anyone to hide unfavorable information.","translation":"該公司在財務報告中的透明度贏得了投資者的信任。他們詳細的公開披露使任何人都無法隱瞞不利的資訊。","word":"transparency"}},"transparent":{"createdAt":1784451184438,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"transparent 意為「透明的」或「易懂的」，既可指物理上的透光性，也可指信息或意圖的清晰易懂。","options":["opaque","fragile","transparent","reflective"],"sentence":"The glass door in the office is ______, allowing everyone to see through it clearly. The management also values ______ communication, so all decisions are openly discussed with staff.","translation":"辦公室的玻璃門是透明的，讓每個人都能清楚地看穿它。管理部門也重視透明的溝通，所以所有決定都會公開與員工討論。","word":"transparent"}},"transplant":{"createdAt":1781693347920,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"transplant在醫學中指的是將器官或組織從一個人身體移植到另一個人身體內的手術。","options":["textile","tuition","transplant","wage"],"sentence":"The patient underwent a heart ______ after waiting on the donor list for two years. The surgical procedure was performed by the hospital's top cardiac team.","translation":"這名患者在等待捐贈者名單兩年後進行了心臟移植。這個手術由醫院頂級的心臟病專家團隊進行。","word":"transplant"}},"transport":{"createdAt":1781746848183,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"transport 表示「運輸」或「運送」，指將物品或人從一個地方移動到另一個地方。","options":["store","transport","display","recycle"],"sentence":"The company uses large trucks to ______ goods from the warehouse to retail stores across the country. This logistics network ensures products reach customers within one week.","translation":"該公司用大型卡車將貨物從倉庫運送到全國各地的零售店。這個物流網絡確保產品在一週內送達客戶。","word":"transport"}},"transportation":{"createdAt":1786338116315,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"transportation指的是運輸系統或服務，用於將人或物品從一個地方運送到另一個地方，包括各種車輛和基礎設施。","options":["communication","transportation","education","entertainment"],"sentence":"The city invested millions of dollars in improving public ______ to reduce traffic congestion. Buses, trains, and subway systems are all examples of the different modes they now offer.","translation":"這座城市投資了數百萬美元來改善公共運輸，以減少交通擁堵。公交車、火車和地鐵系統都是他們現在提供的不同運輸方式的例子。","word":"transportation"}},"trap":{"createdAt":1784000916724,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"trap 在此指的是用來捕捉或傷害他人或動物的裝置，是一種欺騙性的陷阱或圈套。","options":["net","trap","cage","snare"],"sentence":"The hunter set a ______ in the forest to catch wild animals. He carefully concealed it with leaves and branches so that unsuspecting deer would step into it.","translation":"獵人在森林裡設置了一個陷阱來捕捉野生動物。他小心地用樹葉和樹枝隱藏它，這樣毫無防備的鹿就會踩進去。","word":"trap"}},"trauma":{"createdAt":1783488892614,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"trauma指的是對心理或身體造成的嚴重創傷或傷害，特別是指那些會對人的心理造成長期影響的事件。","options":["injury","trauma","accident","pain"],"sentence":"The car accident left him with both physical injuries and psychological ______. His therapist explained that the emotional wounds from that experience would take months of counseling to heal.","translation":"那場車禍讓他既有身體傷害也有心理上的創傷。他的治療師解釋說，那次經歷造成的情感創傷需要數個月的諮詢才能癒合。","word":"trauma"}},"traumatic":{"createdAt":1784176328503,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"traumatic 是形容詞，用來描述令人震驚或造成心理傷害的事件，通常會對人產生長期的負面影響。","options":["pleasant","traumatic","brief","common"],"sentence":"The car accident was a ______ experience that left her with nightmares for months. She required therapy to process the emotional wounds from that devastating event.","translation":"這場車禍是一次衝擊性的經歷，讓她數個月都做惡夢。她需要治療來處理那次毀滅性事件所造成的情感創傷。","word":"traumatic"}},"treasure":{"createdAt":1782751548885,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"treasure 是指金銀財寶或珍貴的物品，通常具有高經濟價值或歷史意義。","options":["garbage","treasure","furniture","documents"],"sentence":"The old pirate map showed where the ______ was buried on the island. Archaeologists discovered gold coins, jewels, and precious artifacts worth millions of dollars at that location.","translation":"老海盜地圖顯示島上埋藏著____的地點。考古學家在該地點發現了價值數百萬美元的金幣、珠寶和珍貴文物。","word":"treasure"}},"treasury":{"createdAt":1781651261374,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"treasury在此表示珍貴物品的收藏地或寶庫，引申為珍貴事物的集合。","options":["projection","overtake","treasury","rod"],"sentence":"The museum's ______ contained priceless artifacts dating back thousands of years. Each item in the collection was carefully preserved and considered invaluable to historians.","translation":"博物館的寶庫裡收藏著可追溯至數千年前的無價文物。收藏品中的每件物品都被小心保存，被歷史學家認為無價之寶。","word":"treasury"}},"treat":{"createdAt":1782807020087,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"treat 作為名詞表示「請客」或「款待」，通常指用金錢或物品來招待或獎勵他人。","options":["reward","treat","give","provide"],"sentence":"My parents decided to ______ us to ice cream after we finished our exams. They wanted to reward our hard work and effort throughout the semester.","translation":"我的父母決定在我們考試結束後請我們吃冰淇淋。他們想要獎勵我們整個學期的努力和工作。","word":"treat"}},"treatment":{"createdAt":1783262131290,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"treatment在此指對某人的對待方式或待遇，涉及如何對待他人。","options":["appreciation","care","treatment","respect"],"sentence":"The company's ______ of its employees was harsh and unfair for many years. Workers complained about low wages, long hours, and poor working conditions.","translation":"該公司多年來對員工的對待是苛刻且不公平的。工人們抱怨低薪、長工時和惡劣的工作條件。","word":"treatment"}},"treaty":{"createdAt":1783400753216,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"treaty 是指兩個或多個國家之間達成的正式書面協議或盟約，具有法律效力。","options":["letter","treaty","rumor","speech"],"sentence":"The two countries signed a ______ to establish peaceful relations and end the conflict. This formal written agreement was ratified by both governments and became binding law.","translation":"兩個國家簽署了一項條約以建立和平關係並結束衝突。這份正式的書面協議得到了兩國政府的批准，成為了具有約束力的法律。","word":"treaty"}},"trek":{"createdAt":1783419789620,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"trek 指的是一次艱苦且費時的遠途步行或旅程，通常涉及困難的地形和惡劣的條件。","options":["journey","trek","trip","walk"],"sentence":"The explorers began their difficult ______ through the dense jungle toward the mountain peak. It took them weeks of walking through challenging terrain, crossing rivers, and climbing steep hills.","translation":"探險家開始了他們穿過茂密叢林前往山峰的艱苦跋涉。他們花了數週時間步行穿過挑戰性的地形、跨越河流和攀登陡峭的山丘。","word":"trek"}},"tremble":{"createdAt":1785110904567,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"tremble作為名詞表示顫抖，指身體因驚嚇或情感而產生的震動，與後句中手部搖晃的現象相符","options":["tremble","strength","warmth","relief"],"sentence":"The old woman felt a ______ run through her body when she received the unexpected news. Her hands shook uncontrollably for several minutes afterward.","translation":"那位老婦人收到意外的消息時，身體經歷了一陣顫抖。她的雙手隨後不由自主地搖晃了幾分鐘。","word":"tremble"}},"tremendous":{"createdAt":1781664082523,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tremendous 表示非常大的、驚人的或令人印象深刻的，通常用於表達強烈程度。","options":["quiet","tremendous","scattered","brief"],"sentence":"The athletes received a ______ ovation from the crowd after winning the championship. The audience stood and cheered loudly for several minutes in celebration.","translation":"運動員在贏得冠軍後獲得了觀眾的巨大掌聲。觀眾站起來並為慶祝大聲歡呼了幾分鐘。","word":"tremendous"}},"trench":{"createdAt":1784961185442,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"trench是指為軍事目的而挖的長溝或戰壕，用於掩護和防禦；在軍事背景中特別指戰爭中的防禦工事。","options":["ditch","pit","trench","hole"],"sentence":"The soldiers dug a deep ______ along the battlefield to protect themselves from enemy fire. This fortification served as their primary defense line.","translation":"士兵們在戰場沿線挖了一條深溝來保護自己免受敵人砲火。這個防禦工事成了他們的主要防線。","word":"trench"}},"trend":{"createdAt":1781401361943,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"trend指在短期內廣泛流行的風潮或傾向，通常是暫時性的而非長期固定的習慣。","options":["habit","tradition","trend","rule"],"sentence":"Social media influencers often start a new ______ that millions of people follow online. Right now, everyone is dancing to that viral song challenge that took off just two weeks ago.","translation":"社群媒體網紅經常開始一種新的趨勢，數百萬人在線上追隨。現在，每個人都在跳那個兩週前爆紅的病毒舞蹈挑戰。","word":"trend"}},"trending":{"createdAt":1783423026252,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"trending 意指某事物當前受歡迎、流行或引起廣泛關注，與 forgotten、outdated、ignored（被遺忘、過時、被忽視）相反，句子提到數百萬使用者積極參與。","options":["forgotten","trending","outdated","ignored"],"sentence":"The hashtag about environmental conservation is currently ______ on social media platforms worldwide. Millions of users are sharing posts and engaging with this topic every day.","translation":"關於環境保護的標籤標題目前在全球社群媒體平台上很流行。數百萬使用者每天都在分享貼文並參與這個話題。","word":"trending"}},"trial":{"createdAt":1781935654227,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"trial 是名詞，在此指「試用」或「試驗期」，允許用戶在購買之前測試產品。","options":["purchase","demonstration","trial","warranty"],"sentence":"The company offered a free two-week ______ of their new software before requiring customers to purchase a subscription. Users could test all features without paying any money.","translation":"該公司在要求客戶購買訂閱之前，提供新軟體免費兩週的試用期。用戶可以在不付款的情況下測試所有功能。","word":"trial"}},"triangle":{"createdAt":1785904437499,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"triangle是指有三條邊和三個角的多邊形，在幾何學和工程中應用廣泛。","options":["circle","triangle","rectangle","pentagon"],"sentence":"The architect drew a ______ with three equal sides on the blueprint. This shape is the most basic polygon and is commonly used in structural engineering because of its stability.","translation":"建築師在藍圖上畫了一個三邊相等的三角形。這種形狀是最基本的多邊形，因為它的穩定性而常用於結構工程中。","word":"triangle"}},"tribal":{"createdAt":1782475559555,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"tribal指與部落或部族相關的，涉及某個部族或民族群體的文化和社會結構","options":["modern","urban","tribal","industrial"],"sentence":"The museum displayed artifacts from various ______ cultures across Africa. Each exhibit showed the unique traditions and customs of different groups.","translation":"博物館展示了來自非洲各個部落文化的文物。每個展品都展示了不同群體的獨特傳統和習俗。","word":"tribal"}},"tribe":{"createdAt":1781503378960,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tribe 指的是由共同血統、文化或領導人統治的小型社區或民族群體。","options":["nation","tribe","kingdom","empire"],"sentence":"The ______ lived in the remote forest for thousands of years. The indigenous group had its own unique language, customs, and governance system.","translation":"這個部落在偏遠的森林裡生活了數千年。這個土著民族有自己獨特的語言、習俗和治理制度。","word":"tribe"}},"tribute":{"createdAt":1783005778379,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"tribute 意為「敬意」或「貢獻」，指為了表示對某人或某事的尊敬和感謝所做的特別安排或獻禮。","options":["criticism","argument","tribute","complaint"],"sentence":"The concert was organized as a ______ to the legendary musician who passed away last year. All proceeds from ticket sales were donated to music education programs in his honor.","translation":"這場音樂會被組織作為對去年去世的傳奇音樂家的敬意。所有門票銷售所得都被捐獻給以他名義的音樂教育項目。","word":"tribute"}},"trick":{"createdAt":1783993252114,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"trick 作為名詞表示詭計或欺騙，指用來迷惑或愚弄他人的巧妙方法","options":["skill","trick","illusion","performance"],"sentence":"The magician used a clever ______ to make the coin disappear from the audience's view. The audience was amazed by this deceptive sleight of hand.","translation":"魔術師使用了一個巧妙的詭計讓硬幣在觀眾的視線中消失。觀眾對這種欺騙性的手法感到驚訝。","word":"trick"}},"trickery":{"createdAt":1786177624537,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"trickery（詭計）指的是使用欺騙或狡猾的手段來迷惑或欺騙他人的行為或計謀。","options":["honesty","trickery","simplicity","transparency"],"sentence":"The magician's performance was full of ______, with hidden mechanisms and misdirection keeping the audience amazed. The investigators later discovered that all the illusions were created through clever sleight of hand and optical illusions, not supernatural powers.","translation":"魔術師的表演充滿了詭計，隱藏的機關和轉移注意力的技巧讓觀眾驚嘆不已。調查人員後來發現所有的幻覺都是通過巧妙的手法和視覺幻覺製造出來的，而不是超自然力量。","word":"trickery"}},"tricky":{"createdAt":1782007196630,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"「狡猾的；微妙的」用來形容不容易處理或容易使人誤解的事物，需要特別注意細節。","options":["easy","straightforward","tricky","obvious"],"sentence":"The math problem seemed simple at first, but it was actually quite ______ and required careful thinking. Many students made mistakes because they didn't read all the conditions in the fine print.","translation":"這道數學題乍一看很簡單，但實際上相當微妙，需要仔細思考。許多學生犯了錯誤，因為他們沒有仔細閱讀小字部分的所有條件。","word":"tricky"}},"trifle":{"createdAt":1781784283024,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"trifle是名詞，指微不足道的瑣事或浪費時間的事情；句子強調了這件事情的微不足道性質和時間的浪費。","options":["achievement","trifle","concern","responsibility"],"sentence":"He spent the entire afternoon on such a ______, arguing about something completely unimportant. His friends were amazed that he wasted so much energy on such a minor matter.","translation":"他整個下午都花在這樣一件______ 上，爭論一些完全不重要的事情。他的朋友們對他在這樣一件小事上浪費這麼多精力感到驚訝。","word":"trifle"}},"trigger":{"createdAt":1781452134703,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"trigger動詞表示引起、誘發或激發某種反應、事件或情況。","options":["prevent","soothe","trigger","eliminate"],"sentence":"Certain loud noises can ______ anxiety attacks in people with PTSD. Understanding these specific sounds helps therapists develop better treatment strategies for their patients.","translation":"某些大聲的噪音可能會引發患有創傷後壓力症候群的人的焦慮發作。了解這些特定聲音幫助治療師為患者制定更好的治療策略。","word":"trigger"}},"trillion":{"createdAt":1781449588285,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"trillion作為名詞表示「兆、萬億」，是一個極大的數字單位，等於一百萬個百萬。","options":["phenomenon","sensibly","trillion","improve"],"sentence":"The national debt has exceeded one ______ dollars, making it one of the largest financial obligations in the world. This astronomical figure represents a thousand billion dollars, which is difficult for most people to comprehend.","translation":"國家債務已超過一兆美元，使其成為世界上最大的財務債務之一。這個天文數字代表一千億美元，大多數人很難理解。","word":"trillion"}},"trim":{"createdAt":1783946029660,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"trim 作為動詞表示修剪或修整，通常用於頭髮、樹木或邊緣的整理。","options":["style","trim","wash","dye"],"sentence":"The barber will ______ your hair to make it look neater and shorter. He'll use scissors to remove the split ends from the sides.","translation":"理髮師會修剪你的頭髮，使它看起來更整潔和更短。他會用剪刀從兩側去除分叉。","word":"trim"}},"triple":{"createdAt":1781362281655,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"triple表示三倍的，即原數量乘以三。","options":["double","triple","half","quarter"],"sentence":"The ______ amount of revenue means the business grew significantly this year. What was earned last year is now multiplied by three.","translation":"三倍的收入意味著今年業務大幅增長。去年賺取的金額現在乘以三。","word":"triple"}},"triumph":{"createdAt":1781478568770,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"triumph 表示重大的勝利或成功。","options":["defeat","struggle","triumph","attempt"],"sentence":"Their ______ in the championship game was celebrated by thousands of cheering fans. The team's hard work and dedication had finally paid off.","translation":"他們在冠軍賽中的勝利受到數千名歡呼球迷的慶祝。球隊的努力和奉獻終於有了回報。","word":"triumph"}},"trivial":{"createdAt":1783841824501,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"trivial 意為微不足道的、瑣碎的，用來形容看似不重要或沒有實質價值的事物，但在此句中首先呈現微不足道的表象，接著揭示其實有重要影響。","options":["serious","trivial","complicated","obvious"],"sentence":"The argument between the two colleagues seemed ______ at first, but it actually revealed deep disagreements about the company's future direction. What initially appeared unimportant turned out to have significant consequences for the entire team.","translation":"這場同事之間的爭執起初看似微不足道，但實際上揭露了他們對公司未來方向的深層分歧。最初看似不重要的事情最後卻對整個團隊產生了重大影響。","word":"trivial"}},"troop":{"createdAt":1782476098662,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"troop 是指一個有組織的軍事單位，特別是指步兵或騎兵的一個連隊或分隊。","options":["crowd","troop","band","group"],"sentence":"The military ______ marched through the town in formation. Hundreds of soldiers moved together in organized ranks, ready for deployment.","translation":"軍隊以編隊的方式在城鎮中行進。數百名士兵以有組織的隊伍一起移動，準備部署。","word":"troop"}},"troops":{"createdAt":1781595752102,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"troops 指軍隊或部隊，通常指大量的士兵組成的軍事單位。","options":["supplies","troops","vehicles","equipment"],"sentence":"The military ______ marched through the city streets in formation. Thousands of soldiers wearing uniforms moved together as one organized unit.","translation":"軍隊在城市街道上排隊行進。成千上萬穿著制服的士兵作為一個有組織的單位一起行動。","word":"troops"}},"trophy":{"createdAt":1781738392786,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「trophy」指的是獲勝或成就的象徵物，通常是獎盃或獎品，與刻有名字的金杯完全符合。","options":["tedium","trophy","offense","obligation"],"sentence":"The winning team proudly displayed their ______ in the school's main hall. The gold cup had their names engraved on it as a permanent record of their championship victory.","translation":"獲勝的球隊在學校的大廳裡驕傲地展示他們的獎盃。金杯上刻著他們的名字，作為他們獲得冠軍勝利的永久記錄。","word":"trophy"}},"tropic":{"createdAt":1783845443804,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"tropic指赤道附近炎熱潮濕的地帶，與「全年炎熱潮濕」和「靠近赤道」的描述完全相符。","options":["desert","arctic","tropic","mountain"],"sentence":"Many exotic animals and dense rainforests are found in the ______, where it is hot and humid year-round. This region includes countries like Brazil and Indonesia that lie near the equator.","translation":"許多異國動物和茂密的雨林位於熱帶地區，那裡全年炎熱潮濕。這個地區包括靠近赤道的巴西和印尼等國家。","word":"tropic"}},"tropical":{"createdAt":1781449095513,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tropical意為熱帶的，用來形容靠近赤道、溫暖潮濕的地理區域或氣候。","options":["arctic","tropical","temperate","desert"],"sentence":"The ______ climate of Thailand makes it very hot and humid throughout the year. The weather there is typical of regions near the equator.","translation":"泰國的熱帶氣候使其全年都非常炎熱潮濕。那裡的天氣是赤道附近地區的典型特徵。","word":"tropical"}},"trout":{"createdAt":1781842000006,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"鱒魚是一種生活在冷水中的淡水魚，以難以捕捉和美味而聞名。","options":["salmon","trout","pike","bass"],"sentence":"The fisherman caught a large ______ in the cold mountain stream. He was excited because this freshwater fish is known for being difficult to catch and is prized for its delicate flavor.","translation":"漁夫在冷山溪中捕獲了一條大的______。他很興奮，因為這種淡水魚以難以捕捉和其細膩的味道而聞名。","word":"trout"}},"trustee":{"createdAt":1781429810261,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"trustee是指被委托管理他人財產或事務的人，需要承擔法律責任。","options":["firecracker","disappearance","trustee","swift"],"sentence":"The bank appointed a ______ to manage the estate funds and make financial decisions on behalf of the beneficiaries. This person is legally responsible for protecting the assets.","translation":"銀行任命了一名受託人來管理房產基金並代表受益人做出財務決定。這個人在法律上有責任保護資產。","word":"trustee"}},"trustworthy":{"createdAt":1785761117555,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"trustworthy 意指值得信任和可靠的，用來形容可以依賴其言行和品格的人或事物。","options":["secretive","jealous","trustworthy","careless"],"sentence":"Sarah has proven herself to be a ______ friend over many years of our relationship. Even when I shared my deepest secrets with her, she never betrayed my confidence or told anyone else.","translation":"多年來，莎拉已經證明自己是一位______的朋友。即使我與她分享最深的秘密，她也從未背叛我的信任或告訴任何人。","word":"trustworthy"}},"tuck":{"createdAt":1786065534130,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tuck 是指將布料或物品摺疊並塞進去，使其緊貼或整齊，常用於衣服或床單的整理。","options":["pull","tuck","stretch","iron"],"sentence":"She decided to ______ her shirt into her pants to make her outfit look neater. The tailor carefully folded and secured the excess fabric at the seams.","translation":"她決定把襯衫塞進褲子裡，使她的服裝看起來更整潔。裁縫師仔細地在接縫處摺疊並固定多餘的布料。","word":"tuck"}},"tuition":{"createdAt":1781693347919,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"tuition指的是上學或接受教育所需支付的費用，通常特指大學或學校的學費。","options":["villain","wage","transplant","tuition"],"sentence":"She needed to save money for her child's university ______ which costs thousands of dollars each year. The school's education fees represent a significant financial burden for the family.","translation":"她需要為孩子的大學學費存錢，每年要花費數千美元。學校的教育費用對這個家庭來說是一筆巨大的經濟負擔。","word":"tuition"}},"tumble":{"createdAt":1781515329261,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tumble 動詞，在這裡意思是價值暴跌、驟降，形容股票或物價迅速下降。","options":["rise","tumble","stabilize","fluctuate"],"sentence":"Stock prices began to ______ after the scandal was revealed to the public. Within weeks, the company's market value dropped by 40%, alarming all shareholders.","translation":"醜聞被公開後，股票價格開始暴跌。在幾週內，該公司的市值下降了40%，使所有股東感到震驚。","word":"tumble"}},"tumor":{"createdAt":1783227763258,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tumor是指身體內由於細胞異常增殖而形成的腫塊，可能是良性或惡性，通常需要醫學診斷和治療。","options":["infection","tumor","fracture","inflammation"],"sentence":"The doctor discovered a ______ in the patient's lung during the X-ray examination. The biopsy results showed that the abnormal growth of cells was malignant and required immediate surgical intervention.","translation":"醫生在X光檢查中發現患者肺部有一個腫瘤。活檢結果顯示這種異常的細胞增殖是惡性的，需要立即進行手術治療。","word":"tumor"}},"tumour":{"createdAt":1781770031234,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"腫瘤是指身體組織中不正常生長的細胞塊，可以是良性或惡性的。","options":["fracture","infection","tumour","scar"],"sentence":"The doctor discovered a ______ in the patient's lung during the routine medical examination. The biopsy results showed that it was benign and did not require immediate surgical intervention.","translation":"醫生在例行健康檢查中發現患者肺部有一個腫瘤。活檢結果顯示它是良性的，不需要立即進行手術治療。","word":"tumour"}},"tune":{"createdAt":1783063660623,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tune 指的是一首歌或樂曲的曲調或旋律，是可以識別和記憶的音樂序列。","options":["sound","tune","voice","note"],"sentence":"The musician hummed a pleasant ______ while walking down the street. Everyone recognized the familiar melody that had been popular for decades.","translation":"這位音樂家在街上行走時哼著愉快的曲調。每個人都認出了這個流行了幾十年的熟悉旋律。","word":"tune"}},"tunnel":{"createdAt":1785164951820,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"隧道是指在山脈或地下開鑿的通道，專門用於讓火車、汽車或行人通過。","options":["bridge","tunnel","tower","corridor"],"sentence":"The train passed through a long ______ carved deep beneath the mountain. Engineers spent three years drilling through solid rock to create this underground passage for transportation.","translation":"火車通過了穿過山下深處的一條長隧道。工程師花了三年時間鑽過堅硬的岩石，為運輸創造了這條地下通道。","word":"tunnel"}},"turmoil":{"createdAt":1784723233353,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"turmoil 作為名詞，指混亂、動盪或混亂的狀態，通常涉及組織或局勢的不穩定。","options":["progress","turmoil","celebration","expansion"],"sentence":"The company experienced great ______ when three senior executives resigned on the same day. The leadership crisis threw the entire organization into chaos.","translation":"當三位高管在同一天辭職時，公司經歷了巨大的混亂。這場領導力危機讓整個組織陷入了混亂之中。","word":"turmoil"}},"tutor":{"createdAt":1783656026743,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"tutor 指的是提供一對一教學的家庭教師或私人教師，通常進行個性化指導。","options":["teacher","tutor","professor","mentor"],"sentence":"My younger brother hired a ______ to help him prepare for his college entrance exam. This private instructor meets with him three times a week to review difficult concepts.","translation":"我的弟弟聘請了一位家教來幫助他準備大學入學考試。這位私人教師每週與他見面三次，複習困難的概念。","word":"tutor"}},"tutoring":{"createdAt":1783259812518,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"tutoring 特指私人或一對一的教學輔導，通常是針對特定學生的個別化指導。","options":["tutoring","teaching","lecturing","broadcasting"],"sentence":"Sarah struggled with mathematics until she began ______ sessions with a private instructor. Meeting one-on-one each week helped her understand complex concepts much better.","translation":"莎拉在數學上苦苦掙扎，直到她開始與私人教師進行一對一輔導課程。每週一對一的會面幫助她更好地理解複雜的概念。","word":"tutoring"}},"twilight":{"createdAt":1781966009084,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"twilight 作為名詞除了表示黃昏時刻，還引申表示人生的晚年時期或事物走向衰落的階段。","options":["morning","twilight","summer","childhood"],"sentence":"The old man spent his ______ years sitting on the porch, reflecting on a lifetime of memories. He was in the final period of his existence, no longer young or working.","translation":"這位老人在他的晚年坐在門廊上，反思著一生的記憶。他正處於生命的最後時期，不再年輕或工作。","word":"twilight"}},"twinkle":{"createdAt":1785910592143,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"twinkle指的是星星或光點間歇性、有節奏地閃爍，強調那種斷斷續續、明亮和昏暗交替出現的效果。","options":["shine","twinkle","glow","beam"],"sentence":"The stars ______ in the night sky, creating a beautiful display of light. Each one flickers and shimmers with a rhythmic on-and-off pattern that has captivated observers for centuries.","translation":"星星在夜空中閃爍，創造出美麗的光芒展示。每一顆星星都以一種有節奏的開關模式閃爍和微微發光，幾個世紀以來一直吸引著觀察者。","word":"twinkle"}},"twirl":{"createdAt":1785111164619,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"twirl動詞意為「使旋轉、使轉動」，通常指快速地旋轉身體或物體，在舞蹈和體操中常見。","options":["jump","twirl","stretch","glide"],"sentence":"The figure skater began to ______ her body rapidly as the music reached its climax. She spun so fast that her sequined dress flared out in a beautiful circle around her.","translation":"當音樂達到高潮時，花式溜冰運動員開始快速地旋轉她的身體。她轉得非常快，以至於她的亮片連衣裙在她周圍漂亮地旋展開來。","word":"twirl"}},"twist":{"createdAt":1783573046430,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"twist作為名詞表示轉動、彎曲或扭轉的動作，常用來形容身體或物體的螺旋形或轉動運動。","options":["jump","spin","twist","leap"],"sentence":"The dancer performed an elegant ______ of her body to the rhythm of the music. Her spine bent gracefully in a spiral motion that amazed the audience.","translation":"舞者隨著音樂節奏優雅地轉動她的身體。她的脊椎以螺旋運動優雅彎曲，令觀眾驚嘆。","word":"twist"}},"twister":{"createdAt":1785734820008,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"twister 是指龍捲風，一種由強烈旋轉氣流形成的自然災害現象。","options":["puzzle","twister","riddle","breeze"],"sentence":"The storm chaser drove directly into the ______ to collect data on wind speeds and rotation patterns. The meteorologists were studying this violent rotating column of air that had touched down near the town.","translation":"風暴追蹤者開車直接進入龍捲風以收集風速和旋轉模式的數據。氣象學家正在研究這股在鎮附近接觸地面的猛烈旋轉氣柱。","word":"twister"}},"typical":{"createdAt":1785120157989,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"typical形容詞表示符合常規、常見或代表性的，在此句中形容莎拉每天都重複的日常習慣。","options":["unusual","rare","typical","extraordinary"],"sentence":"A ______ day for Sarah starts with coffee and checking her emails. She follows the same routine every morning without any exceptions.","translation":"莎拉的典型一天從喝咖啡和查看電子郵件開始。她每天早上都遵循相同的日程，沒有任何例外。","word":"typical"}},"typically":{"createdAt":1784599323832,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"typically表示「通常地；一般來說」，用來描述通常或慣常發生的情況，符合這句話中咖啡館常規的營業模式。","options":["rarely","typically","never","occasionally"],"sentence":"Coffee shops ______ open early in the morning and stay busy until afternoon. In my neighborhood, most cafés start serving at 6 AM and see their peak customers between 8 and 11 AM.","translation":"咖啡館通常在早上開門營業，直到下午都很忙碌。在我的社區裡，大多數咖啡館在上午6點開始營業，並在上午8點至11點之間看到客流高峰。","word":"typically"}},"ultimate":{"createdAt":1781478568765,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ultimate 表示最終的、最後的、最高的目標或結果。","options":["preliminary","ultimate","secondary","temporary"],"sentence":"After years of training and competition, winning an Olympic gold medal was his ______ goal. He had worked toward this achievement since childhood.","translation":"經過多年的訓練和比賽後，贏得奧運金牌是他最終的目標。他自童年以來就為這個成就而努力。","word":"ultimate"}},"ultimately":{"createdAt":1784173464334,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"ultimately 指最終或最後，表示在經過一系列事件或時間後的最終結果或結論。","options":["initially","ultimately","frequently","rarely"],"sentence":"The young athlete trained hard for years with the dream of winning a medal. ______, all her dedication paid off when she stood on the podium at the Olympic Games.","translation":"年輕運動員為了贏得獎牌的夢想努力訓練多年。最終，當她站在奧運會的領獎台上時，她所有的奉獻都得到了回報。","word":"ultimately"}},"umbrage":{"createdAt":1783870466423,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"umbrage 作為名詞表示不滿或生氣，常與 take umbrage at 搭配使用，表示因某事而感到被冒犯或不快。","options":["pride","umbrage","pleasure","comfort"],"sentence":"She took ______ at his casual remark about her work performance during the team meeting. His dismissive tone suggested he didn't respect the effort she had invested in the project.","translation":"她對他在團隊會議上對她工作表現的隨意評論感到不滿。他的輕蔑語氣表明他不尊重她為該項目投入的努力。","word":"umbrage"}},"unabated":{"createdAt":1783402916390,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"unabated 表示某種情況或強度保持不變或持續不減，沒有減弱或改善。","options":["reduced","weakened","unabated","improved"],"sentence":"The rainfall continued with ______ intensity throughout the entire week. Meteorologists warned that flooding would worsen if the heavy precipitation did not decrease soon.","translation":"降雨以未減弱的強度持續整個星期。氣象學家警告說，如果暴雨不減少，洪水將會惡化。","word":"unabated"}},"unanimous":{"createdAt":1781359980247,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"unanimous指全體一致、意見完全相同的；強調所有參與者都同意某個決定或觀點。","options":["narrow","unanimous","preliminary","delayed"],"sentence":"The committee reached a ______ decision to approve the new project without any opposing votes. All twelve members voted in favour of the proposal.","translation":"委員會一致決定批准這個新項目，沒有任何反對票。所有十二名成員都投票贊成該提案。","word":"unanimous"}},"unbiased":{"createdAt":1781693265626,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"公正是指沒有偏見或偏袒，能夠公平對待所有相關方。","options":["confused","unbiased","tired","suspicious"],"sentence":"The jury must remain ______ when evaluating evidence in the courtroom. Both the prosecution and defense teams are monitored to ensure fair treatment of the case.","translation":"陪審團在評估法庭證據時必須保持公正。控方和辯方團隊都受到監督以確保對案件進行公平處理。","word":"unbiased"}},"uncertain":{"createdAt":1783516555628,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"uncertain 是形容詞，表示對某事不確定、不明確或存有疑慮的狀態。","options":["confident","certain","uncertain","determined"],"sentence":"She felt ______ about which university to attend after graduation. Since she had received acceptance letters from three different schools with different programs, she needed more time to make her decision.","translation":"她對畢業後應該選擇哪所大學感到不確定。因為她收到了三所不同學校的錄取通知書，每所學校有不同的課程，她需要更多時間來做決定。","word":"uncertain"}},"unconditional":{"createdAt":1785249134529,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"unconditional 表示無條件的、不受限制的，通常用來形容沒有任何保留或附加條件的感情、支持或承諾。","options":["temporary","unconditional","selective","partial"],"sentence":"A parent's ______ love means they accept their children no matter what mistakes they make. This type of affection comes without any requirements, restrictions, or demands attached to it.","translation":"父母無條件的愛意味著他們無論孩子犯什麼錯誤都接納他們。這種感情沒有任何附加的要求、限制或條件。","word":"unconditional"}},"unconsciously":{"createdAt":1782361629311,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"unconsciously 副詞表示「無意識地」或「下意識地」，指某個行為不是有意識地進行的。","options":["deliberately","unconsciously","reluctantly","eagerly"],"sentence":"When she was nervous, she would ______ tap her fingers on the desk during the meeting. She didn't realize she was doing it until her colleague pointed it out.","translation":"當她緊張時，她在會議期間會無意識地用手指點擊桌子。直到她的同事指出來，她才意識到自己在做這件事。","word":"unconsciously"}},"unconventional":{"createdAt":1785574068358,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"unconventional 表示不遵循標準或傳統做法的，強調與既定規範或慣例的偏離。","options":["informal","unconventional","creative","unusual"],"sentence":"Her ______ approach to teaching surprised many colleagues who preferred traditional methods. Instead of textbooks, she used games and real-world scenarios to engage her students.","translation":"她不依傳統的教學方法讓許多偏好傳統方法的同事感到驚訝。她用遊戲和真實場景來吸引學生，而不是使用課本。","word":"unconventional"}},"uncover":{"createdAt":1785574068348,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"uncover 是指揭開或移除覆蓋物以顯露下面隱藏的東西，引申為揭露或發現隱藏的事實。","options":["discover","uncover","expose","reveal"],"sentence":"The detective worked hard to ______ the truth behind the mysterious crime. After months of investigation, he finally revealed what had been hidden from the public all along.","translation":"偵探努力工作以揭開神祕犯罪背後的真相。經過數月的調查，他終於揭露了一直對公眾隱瞞的事情。","word":"uncover"}},"underestimate":{"createdAt":1782529318037,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"underestimate 意為低估，用於表達對某事物的難度、重要性或能力的評價過低。","options":["overvalue","underestimate","acknowledge","recognize"],"sentence":"Do not ______ the difficulty of learning a new language; it requires years of consistent practice. Many students fail because they believe it will be easy and do not prepare adequately.","translation":"不要低估學習新語言的難度，它需要多年的持續練習。許多學生失敗是因為他們認為這很容易，沒有做充分準備。","word":"underestimate"}},"undergo":{"createdAt":1781481072316,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"undergo 表示「接受、經歷」，特別是指經歷醫療手術或治療的過程。","options":["observe","undergo","postpone","avoid"],"sentence":"The patient will ______ surgery next week to repair the damaged knee ligament. The doctor explained that this procedure is necessary to restore full mobility.","translation":"患者下週將接受手術以修復受損的膝蓋韌帶。醫生解釋說這個手術是恢復完全活動能力所必需的。","word":"undergo"}},"undergraduate":{"createdAt":1782352245063,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"undergraduate指的是還在修習大學本科課程的學生。","options":["graduate student","professor","undergraduate","advisor"],"sentence":"My sister is an ______ at the university studying engineering. She will complete her four-year degree program next year.","translation":"我妹妹是大學的本科生，主修工程學。她將在明年完成四年的學位課程。","word":"undergraduate"}},"underline":{"createdAt":1781708461108,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"underline作為動詞，表示在詞語下面畫線，同時也引申為強調或突出某事物的重要性。","options":["circle","underline","erase","translate"],"sentence":"The teacher asked students to ______ the key vocabulary words in their textbooks. This technique helps readers focus on the most important concepts for the exam.","translation":"老師要求學生在教科書中重要的詞彙下面畫線。這種技巧幫助讀者專注於考試中最重要的概念。","word":"underline"}},"underlying":{"createdAt":1783256139028,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"underlying 指的是隱藏在表面下的、根本的或潛在的。","options":["obvious","underlying","recent","external"],"sentence":"The report revealed the ______ causes of the company's failure that nobody had noticed before. Investigators discovered that poor management and outdated technology had been the real problems all along.","translation":"這份報告揭露了公司失敗的潛在原因，是沒有人之前注意到的。調查人員發現差勁的管理和過時的技術一直都是真正的問題。","word":"underlying"}},"undermine":{"createdAt":1785240401983,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"undermine（削弱）在這裡表示逐漸損害或減弱信心、信任或權威，通常通過消極的行動或證據來實現。","options":["strengthen","undermine","clarify","encourage"],"sentence":"The corruption scandal began to ______ the public's trust in the government. As more evidence emerged, citizens lost confidence in their leaders' integrity and honesty.","translation":"貪污醜聞開始削弱公眾對政府的信任。隨著更多證據浮現，市民對領導人的誠信和誠實失去了信心。","word":"undermine"}},"underneath":{"createdAt":1781431278562,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"underneath表示在某物的下方或下面，是一個表示空間位置的介詞。","options":["above","underneath","beside","within"],"sentence":"The cat was hiding ______ the bed where it felt safe and secure. When we looked down at the floor, we could see its eyes glowing in the darkness under the furniture.","translation":"貓躲在床下，那裡它感到安全和有保障。當我們向下看時，我們可以看到它的眼睛在家具下的黑暗中閃閃發光。","word":"underneath"}},"underpass":{"createdAt":1783310579948,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"underpass 指位於地面下方的通道或隧道，用於行人或車輛穿過另一條道路或障礙物。","options":["overpass","underpass","pathway","intersection"],"sentence":"To avoid the busy traffic above, pedestrians can walk through the ______ that connects the two sides of the highway. This tunnel-like structure runs beneath the road surface and keeps foot traffic completely separate from vehicles.","translation":"為了避開上方繁忙的交通，行人可以穿過連接高速公路兩側的地下通道。這個隧道狀的結構在道路下方運行，使行人交通與車輛完全分離。","word":"underpass"}},"understandably":{"createdAt":1781693295124,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"understandably 是副詞，表示可以理解地或合乎情理地，修飾形容詞 stressed。","options":["mysteriously","understandably","fortunately","carelessly"],"sentence":"The students were ______ stressed about their final exams after months of intensive studying. Many of them had sleepless nights leading up to the test dates.","translation":"經過數月的密集學習後，學生們對期末考試感到可以理解的緊張。許多人在考試日期前都經歷了許多不眠之夜。","word":"understandably"}},"undertake":{"createdAt":1782141359231,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"undertake 是指承擔或從事某項任務或工作，通常指承諾完成某個重要的或複雜的項目。","options":["complete","undertake","postpone","observe"],"sentence":"The government agreed to ______ a major infrastructure project that would benefit the entire region. The ambitious plan involved building new roads, bridges, and public transportation systems over the next five years.","translation":"政府同意承擔一項將惠及整個地區的重大基礎設施項目。這項雄心勃勃的計劃涉及在未來五年內建設新道路、橋樑和公共交通系統。","word":"undertake"}},"underway":{"createdAt":1785252368087,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"underway是形容詞，表示某事正在進行或發生中，常用來描述正在進行的活動或過程。","options":["completed","underway","cancelled","delayed"],"sentence":"The renovation project has been ______ for three months already. The workers are still installing new fixtures, and they expect to finish within the next two weeks.","translation":"翻新項目已經進行了三個月。工人們仍在安裝新的裝置，預計在接下來兩週內完成。","word":"underway"}},"underwent":{"createdAt":1781345746902,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"underwent 是 undergo 的過去式，表示經歷或承受某事，在此指承受手術治療。","options":["avoided","underwent","postponed","cancelled"],"sentence":"The patient ______ a serious surgical procedure last month. The doctors successfully repaired the damage, and she is now recovering well.","translation":"患者上個月經歷了一次嚴重的手術。醫生成功修復了損傷，她現在正在康復中。","word":"underwent"}},"undo":{"createdAt":1788788231277,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"undo 是動詞，意思是「消除行為的效果」或「解開」，在計算機中常用來表示撤銷最近的操作。","options":["redo","delete","undo","save"],"sentence":"If you made a mistake in the document, you can ______ it by pressing Ctrl+Z. This action will reverse your last keystroke and restore the previous version.","translation":"如果你在文檔中犯了一個錯誤，你可以通過按 Ctrl+Z 來撤銷它。此操作將撤回你的上一次按鍵並恢復之前的版本。","word":"undo"}},"undoubted":{"createdAt":1785462634089,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"undoubted 表示「毫無疑問的；確定無疑的」，用來描述無需懷疑或爭議的事實或結果，與後句強調「沒有人可以質疑」的語境完全相符。","options":["questionable","undoubted","partial","temporary"],"sentence":"The ______ success of the new product launch exceeded all expectations and projections. Every metric—sales, customer satisfaction, and market share—demonstrated clear positive results that no one could dispute.","translation":"新產品發佈的毫無疑問的成功超出了所有預期和預測。每個指標——銷售額、客戶滿意度和市場份額——都展示了明確的積極結果，沒有人可以質疑。","word":"undoubted"}},"undoubtedly":{"createdAt":1782092862165,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"undoubtedly是副詞，表示絕對確定、無可置疑，用來加強對某事物確實性的陳述。","options":["probably","undoubtedly","possibly","seemingly"],"sentence":"She is ______ the most talented musician in our orchestra. Every performance she delivers demonstrates exceptional skill that no one can question.","translation":"她無庸置疑是我們樂團中最有才華的音樂家。她每次表演都展示出無人能質疑的卓越技能。","word":"undoubtedly"}},"unemployed":{"createdAt":1783243350909,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"unemployed 意為失業的、未被僱用的，用來形容沒有工作的人的狀態。","options":["retired","unemployed","promoted","transferred"],"sentence":"After the factory closed, thousands of workers became ______. Many of them struggled to find new jobs in the difficult economic situation.","translation":"工廠關閉後，數千名工人變成了失業狀態。許多人在困難的經濟形勢下難以找到新工作。","word":"unemployed"}},"unemployment":{"createdAt":1781832508021,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"unemployment 表示「失業；失業人數」，指失去工作或無法找到工作的狀況。","options":["employment","unemployment","inflation","investment"],"sentence":"The economic crisis caused ______ to rise dramatically across the country last year. Statistics showed that over two million workers had lost their jobs within a six-month period.","translation":"經濟危機導致去年全國失業人數急劇上升。統計數據顯示，在六個月內有超過兩百萬名工人失業。","word":"unemployment"}},"unequivocal":{"createdAt":1789363793857,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"unequivocal 形容明確、清楚、毫無疑問的，不含任何含糊或模稜兩可。","options":["hesitant","confused","unequivocal","vague"],"sentence":"The witness gave an ______ statement identifying the suspect as the person who committed the crime. There was absolutely no doubt or ambiguity in her testimony.","translation":"證人明確地表示被告是犯罪人。她的證詞絕對沒有疑問或歧義。","word":"unequivocal"}},"uneven":{"createdAt":1783841299321,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"uneven 是形容詞，表示表面不平坦、參差不齊或不規則，與 smooth 和 flat 相反，正確描述有缺陷和不規則的表面。","options":["smooth","uneven","polished","flat"],"sentence":"The basketball court has an ______ surface with several cracks and bumps. Players complained that the floor made it difficult to dribble the ball smoothly in certain areas.","translation":"籃球場的表面不平整，有幾條裂縫和凸起。球員們抱怨地板使他們很難在某些區域順暢地運球。","word":"uneven"}},"unfold":{"createdAt":1783159252223,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"unfold 在這裡表示「逐漸揭露」或「逐步發展」，意指一個謎團或故事隨著時間推進而逐漸被揭示。","options":["collapse","unfold","disappear","strengthen"],"sentence":"As the detective continued to investigate, the mystery began to ______. The clues she discovered revealed new details about what actually happened that night.","translation":"隨著偵探繼續調查，謎團開始展開。她發現的線索揭示了那晚實際發生的事情的新細節。","word":"unfold"}},"unification":{"createdAt":1782040742473,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"unification 名詞意為「統一、合一、聯合」，指將分散的事物或組織合併成一個整體。","options":["separation","unification","competition","conflict"],"sentence":"The ______ of the two companies created a powerful business empire in the technology sector. The merger combined their resources, expertise, and market share into one organization.","translation":"這兩家公司的統一在科技部門創造了一個強大的商業帝國。這次合併將他們的資源、專業知識和市場份額結合成一個組織。","word":"unification"}},"uniform":{"createdAt":1783516555628,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"uniform 作為形容詞時，表示所有事物看起來相同或保持一致的狀態。","options":["different","colorful","unique","uniform"],"sentence":"All students in the school wear a ______ dress code consisting of a blue shirt and black pants. This policy ensures that every student looks the same regardless of their family's wealth.","translation":"學校的所有學生都穿著相同的服裝規範，包括藍色襯衫和黑色褲子。這項政策確保每個學生看起來都一樣，不管他們家庭的經濟狀況如何。","word":"uniform"}},"unify":{"createdAt":1781503378961,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"unify 表示使分散的事物合併或連接成一個整體或統一體。","options":["separate","divide","unify","fragment"],"sentence":"The president's goal was to ______ the divided country under one vision. By promoting shared values and working toward common goals, he successfully brought the separated regions together.","translation":"總統的目標是在一個願景下統一分裂的國家。通過推動共同的價值觀並朝著共同目標努力，他成功地將分離的地區團結在一起。","word":"unify"}},"union":{"createdAt":1781503378962,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"union 表示兩個或更多事物的結合或聯合，形成一個統一的整體。","options":["separation","division","union","split"],"sentence":"The ______ of the two companies created a stronger business entity. After the merger was completed, they combined their resources and operations into one organization.","translation":"這兩家公司的結合創造了一個更強大的商業實體。合併完成後，他們將資源和業務合併為一個組織。","word":"union"}},"unique":{"createdAt":1781582424690,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"unique表示獨一無二的或特殊的，強調與眾不同，與unlike anything和no other artist相對應。","options":["popular","unique","traditional","colorful"],"sentence":"Her painting style was completely ______ and unlike anything anyone had ever seen before. No other artist in the world created work quite like hers.","translation":"她的繪畫風格完全獨一無二，與任何人之前見過的都不同。世界上沒有其他藝術家創作出像她那樣的作品。","word":"unique"}},"unite":{"createdAt":1783260805488,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"unite意為「合併」或「聯合」，指多個不同的部分或群體結合成一個整體。","options":["divide","unite","separate","weaken"],"sentence":"The two rival companies decided to ______ their efforts to create a stronger market presence. By joining together as one organization, they could compete more effectively against larger competitors.","translation":"兩家競爭對手公司決定合併他們的力量以創造更強大的市場存在。通過作為一個組織聯合在一起，他們可以更有效地與更大的競爭對手競爭。","word":"unite"}},"unity":{"createdAt":1782374070903,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"unity 表示「統一；團結」，指人們為了共同目標而團結一致、和諧合作的狀態。","options":["division","rivalry","unity","confusion"],"sentence":"Despite their different political beliefs, the community demonstrated strong ______ when facing the natural disaster. All the residents worked together selflessly to rebuild their neighborhood.","translation":"儘管政治信仰不同，但在面對自然災害時，該社區展現了強大的團結。所有居民無私地合作重建社區。","word":"unity"}},"universal":{"createdAt":1781484415209,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"universal意指普遍存在於所有地方或所有人身上，不限於特定的群體或地區。","options":["rare","unique","universal","personal"],"sentence":"The desire to be loved and accepted is a ______ human experience. People from every culture and country throughout history have felt this same need.","translation":"被愛和接納的慾望是普遍的人類體驗。來自世界各地的人們在歷史上都感受到了這種相同的需要。","word":"universal"}},"universally":{"createdAt":1781862799294,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「universally」表示在所有地方或對所有人都普遍適用，強調某事物具有廣泛的、無處不在的適用性或接受度。","options":["occasionally","universally","rarely","theoretically"],"sentence":"The principle of gravity is ______ accepted by scientists across all countries and cultures. Even in remote villages without modern education, people observe objects falling down, confirming this law works everywhere on Earth.","translation":"重力原理被世界各地的科學家普遍接受。即使在沒有現代教育的偏遠村莊，人們也觀察到物體向下墜落，證實這個定律在地球上到處都有效。","word":"universally"}},"universe":{"createdAt":1785239428902,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"universe 是指包含所有星系、恆星、行星和其他天體的整個存在空間，是最廣泛的天文學概念。","options":["planet","universe","atmosphere","solar system"],"sentence":"Scientists study the ______ to understand the origin of stars, planets, and galaxies. The Hubble Space Telescope has revealed billions of galaxies scattered throughout this vast expanse.","translation":"科學家研究宇宙以了解恆星、行星和星系的起源。哈勃太空望遠鏡已經在這個廣闊的空間中發現了數十億個星系。","word":"universe"}},"university":{"createdAt":1781693295127,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"university 是名詞，表示高等教育機構，學生在此進行大學程度的學習。","options":["kindergarten","university","restaurant","hospital"],"sentence":"She was accepted to a prestigious ______ with a full scholarship to study engineering. The institution is ranked among the top 10 in the world and offers world-class research facilities.","translation":"她憑全額獎學金被一所著名大學錄取以學習工程學。該機構在全球排名前10，並提供世界一流的研究設施。","word":"university"}},"unless":{"createdAt":1782706784004,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"unless表示「除非」，引入一個必要的條件來否定或改變前面陳述的結果。","options":["if","unless","because","when"],"sentence":"You will fail the exam ______ you study hard for the next two weeks. The teacher announced that everyone who doesn't prepare thoroughly will definitely not pass.","translation":"除非你在接下來的兩週內努力讀書，否則你會在考試中不及格。老師宣布所有沒有充分準備的人肯定不會通過。","word":"unless"}},"unlimited":{"createdAt":1785166231752,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"unlimited 意為「無限的；不受限制的」，用來描述沒有上限或約束的事物。","options":["restricted","unlimited","expensive","popular"],"sentence":"The streaming service offers ______ access to thousands of movies and TV shows. You can watch as much as you want without any restrictions or monthly viewing limits.","translation":"該串流服務提供對數千部電影和電視節目的無限制存取。您可以隨意觀看，不受任何限制或每月觀看次數的限制。","word":"unlimited"}},"unnecessary":{"createdAt":1785135254498,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"unnecessary（不必要的）用來形容某事物並非必須或可以省略，在此句指裝飾品是多餘的。","options":["essential","unnecessary","important","crucial"],"sentence":"Adding extra decorations to the room seemed ______ since the space was already beautiful. We decided to keep the design simple and minimal without any additional embellishments.","translation":"在房間裡添加額外的裝飾似乎是不必要的，因為空間已經很漂亮了。我們決定保持設計簡單和極簡，不添加任何額外的裝飾。","word":"unnecessary"}},"unparalleled":{"createdAt":1783005778372,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"unparalleled 意為「無與倫比」或「獨一無二」，形容某物優秀到無法與其他任何東西相比的程度。","options":["average","common","unparalleled","typical"],"sentence":"The pianist's ______ virtuosity amazed audiences around the world with performances that had never been witnessed before. Music critics praised his technical precision and emotional depth.","translation":"這位鋼琴家無與倫比的高超技藝在世界各地的觀眾中引起了驚嘆，這些表演是前所未見的。音樂評論家讚揚他的技術精準度和情感深度。","word":"unparalleled"}},"unpleasant":{"createdAt":1785574068360,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"unpleasant 是形容詞，表示令人不適或不滿的，使人感到厭惡或不舒服。","options":["foul","unpleasant","bad","awful"],"sentence":"The ______ smell coming from the old refrigerator made everyone hold their breath. It was so bad that they had to open all the windows immediately.","translation":"從舊冰箱散發出來的令人不悅的氣味讓每個人都屏住呼吸。臭得他們不得不立即打開所有窗戶。","word":"unpleasant"}},"unprecedented":{"createdAt":1784450704023,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"unprecedented 意為「前所未有的；空前的」，強調完全沒有先例的新情況，與 remarkable、significant、impressive 等詞單純表示「顯著的」有本質區別。","options":["remarkable","unprecedented","significant","impressive"],"sentence":"The company achieved ______ growth this year, breaking all previous sales records by a massive margin. Nothing like this remarkable expansion had ever been recorded in the entire history of the industry.","translation":"該公司今年實現了前所未有的增長，以巨大的幅度打破了所有先前的銷售紀錄。在整個行業的歷史上，從未有過如此卓越的擴張。","word":"unprecedented"}},"unrealistic":{"createdAt":1783262131289,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"unrealistic指不符合現實、缺乏合理性或不可能實現的想法或計畫。","options":["ambitious","practical","unrealistic","achievable"],"sentence":"His plan to become a millionaire by next month was completely ______. He had no source of income and no business experience whatsoever.","translation":"他在下個月成為百萬富翁的計畫完全不切實際。他沒有任何收入來源，也沒有任何商業經驗。","word":"unrealistic"}},"unstable":{"createdAt":1781345237585,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"unstable作形容詞表示容易改變、不穩定或可能危險的狀態。","options":["solid","unstable","permanent","secure"],"sentence":"The chemical mixture became ______ when exposed to high temperatures. Scientists had to work quickly to prevent an explosive reaction.","translation":"當暴露在高溫下時，化學混合物變得不穩定。科學家必須快速行動以防止爆炸性反應。","word":"unstable"}},"untangle":{"createdAt":1781345564014,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"untangle 表示解開、鬆開或整理複雜纏繞的物品，強調耐心地逐步分離糾結的東西。","options":["braid","untangle","curl","trim"],"sentence":"She spent an hour trying to ______ the knot in her daughter's hair. By carefully working through it section by section, she finally managed to free the strands without cutting them.","translation":"她花了一個小時試圖解開女兒頭髮中的結。通過小心地逐段處理，她最終設法在不剪斷髮絲的情況下鬆開了它們。","word":"untangle"}},"unusual":{"createdAt":1781503378960,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"unusual 表示不同尋常、罕見或與通常情況不同的事物。","options":["normal","usual","unusual","common"],"sentence":"The weather this winter has been ______ for our region. We have experienced temperatures far below our historical average and record-breaking snowfall.","translation":"今年冬天我們地區的天氣非同尋常。我們經歷了遠低於歷史平均值的溫度和創紀錄的降雪。","word":"unusual"}},"unveil":{"createdAt":1781848934139,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"unveil指正式向公眾展示或公開某個新事物或真相","options":["hide","unveil","delay","cancel"],"sentence":"The company will ______ its new product line at the annual conference next week. Hundreds of journalists are expected to attend and report on the announcement.","translation":"公司將在下週的年度會議上揭露其新產品線。預計有數百名記者將出席並報導該公告。","word":"unveil"}},"up_to_date":{"createdAt":1781775276769,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"up-to-date指保持在最新狀態，與立即安裝最新補丁和更新的做法相符。","options":["obsolete","broken","up-to-date","outdated"],"sentence":"Our company keeps all software ______ to ensure we have the latest security features. We install every new patch and update as soon as it becomes available.","translation":"我們的公司保持所有軟體最新，以確保我們擁有最新的安全功能。我們在每個新補丁和更新可用時立即安裝。","word":"up-to-date"}},"upbeat":{"createdAt":1783839725046,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"upbeat 是形容詞，表示充滿樂觀精神、令人愉快或充滿能量的氣氛或音樂。","options":["calm","upbeat","serious","tense"],"sentence":"The party had an ______ atmosphere that made everyone want to dance and celebrate. The DJ played energetic music and people were smiling and laughing throughout the evening.","translation":"派對有一種歡快的氛圍，讓每個人都想跳舞和慶祝。DJ播放了充滿活力的音樂，整個晚上人們都在微笑和歡笑。","word":"upbeat"}},"update":{"createdAt":1783392652430,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"update 表示使某物更新或改進至最新狀態，在此指軟體程式的改進和升級。","options":["delete","update","downgrade","abandon"],"sentence":"The software company decided to ______ its application with new features and security improvements. The latest version was released last week to fix bugs and make the program compatible with the newest operating systems.","translation":"該軟體公司決定透過新功能和安全改進來更新其應用程式。最新版本於上週發佈，以修復錯誤並使程式與最新的作業系統相容。","word":"update"}},"upgrade":{"createdAt":1781515634902,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"「upgrade」表示將某物改善或提升到更高的標準或版本。","options":["maintain","downgrade","upgrade","repair"],"sentence":"We decided to ______ our old computer system to improve efficiency at work. The new software and hardware will be installed next week.","translation":"我們決定升級舊的電腦系統以提高工作效率。新的軟體和硬體將在下週安裝。","word":"upgrade"}},"upper":{"createdAt":1783993252115,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"upper 是形容詞，表示位置或水準較高的、在上面的","options":["ground","lower","upper","middle"],"sentence":"The ______ floors of the building offer a spectacular view of the city skyline. Residents on these higher levels enjoy better ventilation and natural light.","translation":"建築物的上層樓層提供了對城市天際線的壯觀景觀。這些較高樓層的居民享受更好的通風和自然光。","word":"upper"}},"upright":{"createdAt":1781437435164,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"upright 表示直立的、挺直的姿態，與垂直或水平對齊的位置有關。","options":["crooked","fallen","upright","tilted"],"sentence":"The old oak tree stood ______ in the garden despite the strong winds that night. Its trunk never bent or leaned, maintaining a perfectly vertical position.","translation":"儘管那晚有強風，那棵老橡樹在花園裡挺直地站著。它的樹幹從不彎曲或傾斜，保持完全垂直的位置。","word":"upright"}},"uprising":{"createdAt":1781565657698,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"uprising 名詞指人民反抗政府或權力機構的暴動或起義，通常涉及大規模的公開抗爭。","options":["celebration","uprising","election","conference"],"sentence":"The ______ against the oppressive government began when citizens took to the streets demanding change. Thousands of people participated in protests and demonstrations that lasted for several weeks.","translation":"反對壓制性政府的起義開始於公民走上街頭要求改變之時。數千人參加了持續數週的抗議和示威活動。","word":"uprising"}},"upset":{"createdAt":1788028661422,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"upset 作為動詞是「打翻或推翻」的意思，在這裡指把容器翻倒導致內容物灑出來。","options":["cleaned","upset","arranged","polished"],"sentence":"The child accidentally knocked over the vase and ______ its contents all over the floor. Her mother was so angry about the broken dish that she grounded her for a week.","translation":"小孩不小心打翻花瓶，把裡面的東西灑得滿地都是。她媽媽因為碎盤子非常生氣，禁足她一個星期。","word":"upset"}},"urban":{"createdAt":1781337343699,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"urban意為城市的或與城市相關的，用於形容城市地區及其特徵。","options":["rural","agricultural","urban","natural"],"sentence":"The ______ development project transformed the rural farmland into a bustling city center with skyscrapers and shopping malls. The construction dramatically changed the landscape of the once-quiet countryside.","translation":"城市發展項目將農村農田改造為擁有摩天大樓和購物商場的繁華市中心。這項建設大幅改變了曾經寧靜鄉村的面貌。","word":"urban"}},"urge":{"createdAt":1781775363749,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"urge 是指內在的衝動或強烈的欲望，驅使一個人立即採取行動。","options":["obligation","urge","reason","plan"],"sentence":"He felt a strong ______ to call his mother and tell her the good news. Despite being late at night, he couldn't resist the impulse any longer.","translation":"他感到一種強烈的______想要打電話給他的媽媽並告訴她這個好消息。儘管已經很晚了，他再也無法抗拒這個衝動。","word":"urge"}},"urgency":{"createdAt":1785451790332,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"urgency 表示某事物需要立即處理的迫切程度，特別強調時間的緊迫性和必須立即行動的必要性。","options":["importance","urgency","concern","necessity"],"sentence":"The doctor emphasized the ______ of getting the patient to the hospital immediately. Without quick action, the patient's condition could become life-threatening within minutes.","translation":"醫生強調了立即將患者送往醫院的緊迫性。如果不迅速採取行動，患者的情況可能在幾分鐘內危及生命。","word":"urgency"}},"urgent":{"createdAt":1781431278561,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"urgent表示需要立即關注和行動的緊迫情況。","options":["routine","urgent","weekly","scheduled"],"sentence":"The hospital received an ______ call about a patient in critical condition needing immediate surgery. The medical team dropped everything they were doing and rushed to the operating room.","translation":"醫院收到了一個緊急電話，告知一名患者情況危急，需要立即進行手術。醫療團隊放下手頭的工作，匆忙趕往手術室。","word":"urgent"}},"urgently":{"createdAt":1785240075973,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"urgently 是副詞，表示以緊迫、急迫的方式進行某事，強調時間緊急和事情的重要性。","options":["slowly","urgently","happily","quietly"],"sentence":"The doctor called the patient ______ to come to the hospital immediately. The situation was critical and every minute could make a difference in saving the patient's life.","translation":"醫生催促患者立即趕到醫院。情況很嚴重，每一分鐘都可能對拯救患者的生命造成影響。","word":"urgently"}},"urinate":{"createdAt":1782491138501,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"urinate 是一個醫學或生理術語，表示排放尿液或小便的生理過程。","options":["urinate","glowing","reclaim","mischievous"],"sentence":"After drinking three cups of coffee, he had to ______ urgently and rushed to the restroom. The caffeine had a strong diuretic effect on his body.","translation":"喝了三杯咖啡後，他急著要去排尿，匆匆趕向洗手間。咖啡因對他的身體有很強的利尿作用。","word":"urinate"}},"urine":{"createdAt":1781503378965,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"urine 是由腎臟產生並排出體外的液態廢物，含有水和代謝產物。","options":["blood","saliva","urine","sweat"],"sentence":"The doctor requested a ______ sample for the medical test. The laboratory would analyze this bodily fluid to check for any abnormalities or infections.","translation":"醫生要求提供尿液樣本進行醫療檢查。實驗室將分析這種體液以檢查是否有任何異常或感染。","word":"urine"}},"usher":{"createdAt":1782395163845,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"usher 作為動詞表示引導或引領某人到特定的地點，在劇院、活動場所中特別常見。","options":["welcome","usher","greet","accompany"],"sentence":"The theater staff will ______ guests to their seats when they arrive. The employee wearing the uniform and holding a flashlight is responsible for this task.","translation":"劇院工作人員在客人到達時會把他們引領到座位。穿著制服並拿著手電筒的員工負責這項任務。","word":"usher"}},"utensil":{"createdAt":1783468712842,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"器具（utensil）是指用於烹飪、進食或其他日常活動的工具，例如刀、勺子或鍋。","options":["plate","utensil","napkin","chair"],"sentence":"The chef grabbed a sharp ______ from the kitchen drawer to prepare the vegetables. This tool was essential for cutting the carrots and onions into fine pieces.","translation":"廚師從廚房抽屜裡拿出一把尖銳的器具來準備蔬菜。這個工具對於將胡蘿蔔和洋蔥切成細片至關重要。","word":"utensil"}},"utility":{"createdAt":1786804561558,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"utility指的是某物的使用價值或實際用途，強調它的功能性和實用價值。","options":["beauty","utility","rarity","complexity"],"sentence":"The ______ of a smartphone lies in its ability to handle multiple tasks. Modern phones combine communication, navigation, entertainment, and productivity features into one device.","translation":"智慧型手機的實用性在於它能夠處理多項任務。現代手機將通訊、導航、娛樂和生產力功能結合在一個設備中。","word":"utility"}},"utilize":{"createdAt":1782141359230,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"utilize 是指充分發揮或有效地運用某樣東西，特別是指將其作為工具或資源來達到某個目的。","options":["abandon","utilize","ignore","reject"],"sentence":"The company decided to ______ the new technology to improve their production efficiency. By implementing this advanced system, they were able to reduce costs and increase output significantly.","translation":"該公司決定利用新技術來提高生產效率。通過實施這個先進的系統，他們能夠顯著降低成本並增加產量。","word":"utilize"}},"utter":{"createdAt":1783392139527,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"utter 作為動詞表示發出或說出聲音、言語。","options":["suppress","utter","write","remember"],"sentence":"After hearing the shocking news, she could barely ______ a single word in response. Her complete silence showed how stunned and speechless she felt.","translation":"聽到令人震驚的消息後，她幾乎無法說出任何回應的話。她完全的沉默表明她感到多麼震驚和啞口無言。","word":"utter"}},"utterance":{"createdAt":1782475559552,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"utterance指說話或聲音的表達方式，特別是指一段話或言論的內容和風格","options":["silence","utterance","gesture","movement"],"sentence":"The politician's ______ was carefully crafted to appeal to voters. Every word he spoke had been reviewed by his communications team.","translation":"政治家的言辭是精心設計來吸引選民的。他所說的每一個字都經過他的通訊團隊審查。","word":"utterance"}},"utterly":{"createdAt":1781693271586,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"utterly是副詞，用來強調程度是完全的、絕對的，比somewhat和slightly等程度副詞表達更強的intensity。","options":["somewhat","utterly","slightly","mildly"],"sentence":"After hearing the terrible news, Sarah felt ______ devastated and couldn't stop crying. Her emotional state was complete and absolute with no room for hope.","translation":"聽到這個可怕的消息後，莎拉感到完全崩潰，無法停止哭泣。她的情緒狀態是完全和絕對的，沒有一絲希望。","word":"utterly"}},"vacancy":{"createdAt":1781503378969,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"vacancy 表示空位或空房間，指可用或未被佔據的位置。","options":["guest","booking","vacancy","reservation"],"sentence":"The hotel had one ______ available for the weekend. The front desk clerk confirmed that only one room remained unoccupied for guests seeking accommodation.","translation":"酒店週末有一個空房間。前台職員確認只有一個房間仍未被占用，可供客人入住。","word":"vacancy"}},"vacant":{"createdAt":1781449095515,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vacant意為空的或無人居住的，用來形容沒有人使用或未被佔據的空間。","options":["occupied","vacant","furnished","renovated"],"sentence":"The apartment had been ______ for several months before a new tenant moved in. The landlord finally found someone to rent the empty space.","translation":"在新房客搬進來之前，這間公寓已經空置了好幾個月。房東終於找到了一個租賃這個空房間的人。","word":"vacant"}},"vaccinate":{"createdAt":1781503378966,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"vaccinate 表示給人注射疫苗以激發免疫系統產生對特定疾病的抵抗力。","options":["infect","treat","vaccinate","isolate"],"sentence":"The health campaign decided to ______ all children against measles before school started. The vaccination program aimed to prevent disease outbreaks in the community.","translation":"健康運動決定在開學前為所有兒童接種麻疹疫苗。疫苗接種計劃旨在預防社區中的疾病爆發。","word":"vaccinate"}},"vaccinated":{"createdAt":1781479123531,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"vaccinated 表示已經接種過疫苗的狀態，醫療機構會根據接種情況決定防護措施。","options":["vaccinated","frustrated","educated","isolated"],"sentence":"The ______ patients were allowed to enter the hospital without wearing a mask. The medical staff verified their vaccination records before admitting them to the ward.","translation":"已接種疫苗的患者被允許不戴口罩進入醫院。醫療人員在將他們錄入病房前驗證了他們的疫苗接種記錄。","word":"vaccinated"}},"vaccine":{"createdAt":1781864339054,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vaccine是預防性的醫學製劑，通過注射或口服來幫助身體建立對特定疾病的免疫力。","options":["medicine","vaccine","treatment","cure"],"sentence":"Everyone in our school received a ______ against the flu virus this year. The nurse gave us injections to protect us from getting sick during the winter season.","translation":"今年我們學校的每個人都接受了流感病毒的疫苗接種。護士給我們注射疫苗，以保護我們在冬季不會生病。","word":"vaccine"}},"vacuum":{"createdAt":1781933311792,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"vacuum（真空吸塵器）是能發出巨大噪音並用於清理地板的電動機器，而掃帚、拖把和海綿都是無聲的手動工具。","options":["broom","mop","vacuum","sponge"],"sentence":"After the party ended, Sarah used a ______ to clean up all the crumbs and dust from the living room floor. The loud noise from the machine echoed throughout the house.","translation":"派對結束後，莎拉用真空吸塵器清理客廳地板上的所有麵包屑和灰塵。機器發出的巨大噪音在整棟房子裡迴盪。","word":"vacuum"}},"vague":{"createdAt":1781653278516,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vague是形容詞，表示模糊的、不清楚的，與具體和明確的意思相反，常用於描述不明確的說法或指示。","options":["clear","vague","detailed","precise"],"sentence":"His ______ instructions confused the team members about what to do. When he finally provided specific details and clear deadlines, everyone understood the project perfectly.","translation":"他的______指示讓團隊成員對該做什麼感到困惑。當他最後提供具體的細節和明確的截止日期時，每個人都完美地理解了這個項目。","word":"vague"}},"vain":{"createdAt":1781935654225,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vain 是形容詞，表示「自負的」或「虛榮的」，指過分關注自己的外表或自我形象的人。","options":["humble","vain","quiet","friendly"],"sentence":"He spent hours in front of the mirror admiring his appearance because of his ______ nature. His constant need for compliments annoyed everyone around him.","translation":"由於他自負的性格，他花了好幾個小時在鏡子前欣賞自己的外表。他不斷尋求讚美的需求惹惱了周圍的人。","word":"vain"}},"valentine":{"createdAt":1784773941956,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"valentine 是情人節送給心愛的人的禮物或卡片，表達愛意和浪漫情感。","options":["textbook","valentine","newspaper","contract"],"sentence":"On February 14th, he gave his girlfriend a beautiful ______ with a handwritten love note. She smiled and gave him a chocolate heart in return as their romantic gesture.","translation":"在2月14日，他給女友一份漂亮的情人節禮物，附帶手寫的愛情便條。她微笑著給他一顆巧克力心形作為回報，表示他們的浪漫姿態。","word":"valentine"}},"valid":{"createdAt":1782021524331,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"valid 表示某事物在法律上或邏輯上站得住腳、合理且有約束力。","options":["valid","broken","signed","printed"],"sentence":"The contract is not ______ because it was signed without the witness's consent. The lawyer explained that the missing signature makes it legally unenforceable.","translation":"這份合約無效，因為它是在沒有證人同意的情況下簽署的。律師解釋說，缺少簽名使其在法律上無法執行。","word":"valid"}},"valley":{"createdAt":1788959648570,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"valley 指的是兩座山峰之間的低窪地帶或溪谷，題目中第二句強調「在山峰之間的低地」正是 valley 的定義。","options":["plateau","valley","canyon","ridge"],"sentence":"The small town was nestled in a peaceful ______ surrounded by tall mountains. The river flowed through the low-lying land between the peaks.","translation":"這個小鎮坐落在被高山環繞的寧靜山谷中。河流流經山峰之間的低地。","word":"valley"}},"valuable":{"createdAt":1784204756948,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"valuable表示「有價值的；珍貴的」，指物品因其重要性或金錢價值而被認為重要。","options":["common","valuable","fragile","ancient"],"sentence":"The museum's collection includes many ______ artifacts that are worth millions of dollars. These ancient items are carefully protected because of their high monetary and historical significance.","translation":"博物館的收藏品中有許多珍貴的文物，價值數百萬美元。這些古代物品因為其高度的經濟和歷史意義而受到仔細保護。","word":"valuable"}},"value":{"createdAt":1781503378964,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"value 作為動詞表示認為某事物很重要或有價值，高度尊重或珍惜它。","options":["ignore","neglect","value","despise"],"sentence":"She ______ her family above all else in her life. Their love and support meant more to her than any amount of money or possessions.","translation":"她在生活中最重視她的家人。他們的愛和支持對她來說比任何金錢或財產都重要。","word":"value"}},"valueless":{"createdAt":1781693264937,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"valueless 是形容詞，表示「沒有價值的」或「毫無用處的」，用來描述物品或事物的價值狀態。","options":["vanish","valueless","tempt","temporarily"],"sentence":"The old coins appeared to have no worth and seemed ______ at first glance. However, after the appraiser examined them, she discovered they were actually rare collectibles worth thousands of dollars.","translation":"這些舊硬幣乍看之下似乎沒有價值，顯得一文不值。然而，在鑑定師檢查後，她發現它們實際上是價值數千美元的稀有收藏品。","word":"valueless"}},"vanilla":{"createdAt":1781403377829,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"vanilla 可作為形容詞表示「普通的、基本的、沒有特色的」，除了指香草精的風味外，也用於描述簡單或平凡的事物。","options":["chocolate","exotic","vanilla","spiced"],"sentence":"She didn't want anything fancy for her birthday party, just a ______ cake with simple white frosting. Her preference for basic, uncomplicated flavors reflected her understated style.","translation":"她不想在生日派對上要任何花俏的東西，只是想要一個普通的香草蛋糕配簡單的白色糖霜。她對基本、單純口味的偏好反映了她低調的風格。","word":"vanilla"}},"vanish":{"createdAt":1781693264938,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"vanish 是動詞，表示「消失」或「突然不見了」，通常用來描述物體或人突然從視野中消失。","options":["tempt","socially","temporarily","vanish"],"sentence":"The magician performed an incredible trick where the rabbit seemed to ______ into thin air. The audience gasped in amazement as the animal completely disappeared from the locked box within seconds.","translation":"魔術師表演了一個不可思議的魔術，兔子似乎憑空消失。當動物在幾秒鐘內從鎖著的盒子裡完全消失時，觀眾們驚呼不已。","word":"vanish"}},"vanity":{"createdAt":1781849847405,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vanity表示虛榮或過度關注外表，與「常看鏡子、注重外表」的線索相符。","options":["humility","vanity","modesty","simplicity"],"sentence":"His ______ was evident in the way he constantly admired his reflection in every mirror. He seemed more concerned with appearance than substance.","translation":"他的虛榮心在他不斷在每面鏡子前欣賞自己的倒影的方式中表現得很明顯。他似乎更關心外表而不是內涵。","word":"vanity"}},"vapor":{"createdAt":1781966009083,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vapor 是物質從液體或固體狀態轉化為氣態時所產生的氣體或霧氣，通常在加熱時出現。","options":["liquid","vapor","solid","frost"],"sentence":"The hot water turned into ______ and rose into the air. We could see the invisible gas floating above the boiling pot.","translation":"熱水變成了蒸氣並上升到空中。我們可以看到在沸騰的鍋上方漂浮的無形氣體。","word":"vapor"}},"variable":{"createdAt":1781424356417,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"variable用來形容容易改變或不穩定的事物，特別是在不同時間或情況下表現不同。","options":["consistent","warm","variable","humid"],"sentence":"The weather in spring is quite ______ and unpredictable. One day it might be sunny and warm, but the next day could bring rain and cold temperatures.","translation":"春天的天氣相當多變和難以預測。某一天可能晴朗溫暖，但第二天卻可能帶來雨水和寒冷溫度。","word":"variable"}},"variance":{"createdAt":1783419789623,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"variance 是名詞，表示數據或事物之間的差異程度、變異程度，在統計學中特指數據分散的程度。","options":["consistency","variance","accuracy","correlation"],"sentence":"The data analysis showed significant ______ in the test results across different age groups. Some participants scored much higher while others performed considerably lower than the average.","translation":"數據分析顯示不同年齡組的測試結果存在顯著差異。一些參與者得分遠高於平均水準，而其他參與者的表現明顯低於平均水準。","word":"variance"}},"variant":{"createdAt":1781564440929,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"variant 作名詞表示變體、變種，指同一事物的不同版本或形式。","options":["origin","variant","cure","symptom"],"sentence":"The scientist discovered a new ______ of the virus that had different characteristics. This mutated form showed resistance to certain medications.","translation":"科學家發現了病毒的一個新變體，具有不同的特徵。這種變異形式對某些藥物表現出耐藥性。","word":"variant"}},"variation":{"createdAt":1781840667144,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"variation指的是對原物的改變或變化版本，在音樂中特指根據主題進行的變奏。","options":["repetition","melody","variation","arrangement"],"sentence":"The composer created a beautiful ______ on the original melody. He kept the same basic theme but changed the rhythm, tempo, and instrumentation.","translation":"作曲家根據原始旋律創作了一個美妙的變奏曲。他保留了相同的基本主題，但改變了節奏、速度和樂器編排。","word":"variation"}},"varied":{"createdAt":1781926464746,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"varied 表示多樣化的、種類繁多的，強調有許多不同種類或類型的事物。","options":["limited","varied","identical","boring"],"sentence":"The restaurant offers a ______ menu with options from different cuisines around the world. Customers can choose from Italian, Thai, Mexican, Japanese, and Indian dishes.","translation":"這家餐廳提供各種各樣的菜單，包括來自世界各地不同菜系的選項。顧客可以選擇義大利、泰國、墨西哥、日本和印度菜肴。","word":"varied"}},"variety":{"createdAt":1781693591740,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"variety 意為多樣化或多種選擇，強調不同種類或品種的豐富性。","options":["scarcity","selection","variety","limitation"],"sentence":"The restaurant menu offers a wide ______ of dishes from different cuisines around the world. You can find Italian pasta, Japanese sushi, Thai curry, and Mexican tacos all in one place.","translation":"餐廳菜單提供來自世界各地不同菜系的多種菜餚。你可以在一個地方找到義大利麵、日本壽司、泰國咖哩和墨西哥塔可。","word":"variety"}},"various":{"createdAt":1781401361944,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"various表示多種多樣、種類繁多，用來描述具有差異性和多樣性的事物。","options":["similar","various","ancient","rare"],"sentence":"The museum's collection includes ______ paintings from different countries and time periods. You can see works by Italian Renaissance masters, Japanese ukiyo-e artists, and contemporary African painters all in one building.","translation":"博物館的收藏包括來自不同國家和時期的各種繪畫。你可以在同一棟建築內看到義大利文藝復興大師、日本浮世繪藝術家和當代非洲畫家的作品。","word":"various"}},"vary":{"createdAt":1782401868807,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vary 表示發生變化或不同，在此指溫度在不同時間呈現巨大差異。","options":["remain","vary","stabilize","balance"],"sentence":"The temperature in the desert can ______ dramatically between day and night. It might be extremely hot during the day but freezing cold after sunset.","translation":"沙漠中的溫度在白天和夜間之間可以變化很大。白天可能非常炎熱，但日落後會冷得刺骨。","word":"vary"}},"vast":{"createdAt":1782021522931,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vast 表示面積、範圍或規模極其龐大，通常用來形容無法一眼看盡的寬闊空間。","options":["tiny","vast","narrow","shallow"],"sentence":"The Amazon rainforest covers a ______ area of South America. Scientists estimate it spans over 5.5 million square kilometers, making it nearly impossible to explore in a lifetime.","translation":"亞馬遜雨林覆蓋了南美洲的廣大地區。科學家估計它跨越超過550萬平方公里，使得在一生中幾乎不可能完全探索。","word":"vast"}},"vegan":{"createdAt":1785724429622,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「vegan」指的是不食用或不使用任何動物產品的人，包括肉類、乳製品、蛋類和動物衍生物，這是最嚴格的素食主義形式。","options":["vegetarian","vegan","pescatarian","omnivore"],"sentence":"My friend is a strict ______ who refuses to eat meat, dairy, or any animal products. She even avoids wearing leather shoes and uses only plant-based cosmetics.","translation":"我的朋友是一位嚴格的嚴格素食主義者，她拒絕吃肉、乳製品或任何動物產品。她甚至避免穿著皮鞋，並且只使用植物性化妝品。","word":"vegan"}},"vegetarian":{"createdAt":1781775276775,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"vegetarian指不食用肉類但可能食用奶製品或雞蛋的飲食方式和遵循此飲食的人。","options":["carnivorous","omnivorous","vegetarian","vegan"],"sentence":"Tom follows a ______ diet and refuses to eat any meat products. He gets his protein from beans, nuts, tofu, and other plant-based sources instead.","translation":"湯姆遵循素食飲食，拒絕食用任何肉類產品。他從豆類、堅果、豆腐和其他植物性來源獲取蛋白質。","word":"vegetarian"}},"vehicle":{"createdAt":1783660471003,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vehicle 指「車輛」或「交通工具」。句子涉及汽車製造商生產的電動型號，這明確指的是運輸工具，而不是建築物、技術或貨幣。","options":["building","vehicle","technology","currency"],"sentence":"The electric ______ is becoming increasingly popular as people seek sustainable transportation options. Many car manufacturers are now producing models that run entirely on battery power.","translation":"隨著人們尋求永續運輸選擇，電動車輛變得越來越受歡迎。許多汽車製造商現在正在生產完全由電池驅動的車型。","word":"vehicle"}},"veil":{"createdAt":1781619188930,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"veil 指透明或半透明的面罩或布料，常用於婚禮或宗教場合。","options":["crown","veil","tiara","headpiece"],"sentence":"The bride wore a delicate ______ decorated with pearls and lace. It covered her face until the moment the groom lifted it during the ceremony.","translation":"新娘戴著一條用珍珠和蕾絲裝飾的精緻面紗。在儀式中新郎掀起面紗的那一刻之前，它一直覆蓋著她的臉。","word":"veil"}},"veiled":{"createdAt":1782920661035,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"veiled表示遮蔽或掩蓋的，指事物被間接表達或隱喻地表達而不是直接說出","options":["veiled","subtle","hidden","concealed"],"sentence":"The politician made ______ criticisms of his opponent without directly naming him. Observers understood that his comments were indirect attacks on the rival's policies.","translation":"政治家對他的對手做出了隱蔽的批評，而沒有直接點名。觀察者明白他的評論是對對手政策的間接攻擊。","word":"veiled"}},"vein":{"createdAt":1782021524831,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vein 是指將血液運回心臟的血管，通常在皮膚下呈現藍色或紫色，用於醫療抽血。","options":["artery","vein","muscle","bone"],"sentence":"The doctor used an ultrasound to locate the patient's ______ before drawing blood. The medical technician inserted the needle into the blue line running along the patient's arm.","translation":"醫生在抽血前用超音波定位患者的靜脈。醫療技術員將針頭插入沿著患者手臂延伸的藍色管線中。","word":"vein"}},"velvet":{"createdAt":1784543009912,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"velvet是名詞，指一種柔軟的絲絨布料，具有獨特的蓬鬆和光澤質感，正是題目中「平滑的觸感」所描述的特點。","options":["silk","velvet","cotton","leather"],"sentence":"The luxury sofa was covered in soft ______ fabric that felt smooth to the touch. When she ran her hand across it, the material had a distinctive plush texture.","translation":"這張豪華沙發覆蓋著柔軟的絲絨布料，觸感光滑。當她用手輕撫它時，這種材料有獨特的蓬鬆質感。","word":"velvet"}},"venture":{"createdAt":1781424356418,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"venture指的是具有風險或不確定性的商業活動或冒險嘗試。","options":["hobby","vacation","venture","tradition"],"sentence":"Starting a new business is a risky ______ that requires careful planning and investment. Many entrepreneurs lose money on their first startup because they underestimate the challenges involved.","translation":"開設新企業是一項需要仔細規劃和投資的冒險事業。許多企業家在他們的第一次創業中虧損，因為他們低估了所涉及的挑戰。","word":"venture"}},"venue":{"createdAt":1783068673124,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"venue 表示「發生場所；舉行地點；會場」，指事件或活動舉行的地點。","options":["date","venue","ticket","performer"],"sentence":"The concert organizers changed the ______ from the outdoor park to the indoor arena. Due to bad weather forecasts, an indoor location was necessary to protect the audience.","translation":"音樂會組織者將舉辦地點從戶外公園改為室內場館。由於惡劣的天氣預報，室內地點對於保護觀眾是必要的。","word":"venue"}},"verbal":{"createdAt":1785977477059,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"verbal 是指以言語或口頭方式進行的，而不是書面形式；在此句中與「錄製的口頭對話」相符。","options":["written","verbal","signed","formal"],"sentence":"The contract included both written terms and ______ agreements that were discussed in the meeting. The lawyer recorded the spoken conversation to ensure there was documentation of what was agreed upon orally.","translation":"合約包括書面條款和在會議中討論的口頭協議。律師錄製了這段口頭對話，以確保有對口頭同意內容的文件記錄。","word":"verbal"}},"verbally":{"createdAt":1781425122881,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"verbally 指用言語或口頭方式，與不是書面形式和員工記筆記的脈絡相符。","options":["physically","visually","verbally","digitally"],"sentence":"The boss gave instructions ______ during the morning meeting rather than in writing. Employees had to take notes carefully to remember all the details.","translation":"老闆在早會上口頭給出指示，而不是書面形式。員工必須仔細記筆記以記住所有細節。","word":"verbally"}},"verdict":{"createdAt":1782274431077,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"verdict 在法律語境中特指法庭或陪審團的正式判決結果，而其他選項雖然含義相近，但不具有法律判決的特定含義。","options":["opinion","verdict","decision","conclusion"],"sentence":"After weeks of testimony and deliberation, the jury finally reached a ______ in the high-profile case. The judge announced that the defendant was found guilty of all charges.","translation":"經過數週的證詞和審議後，陪審團終於在這起備受矚目的案件中得出了判決。法官宣布被告被判所有罪名成立。","word":"verdict"}},"verge":{"createdAt":1781824968061,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"verge 作為名詞表示「邊緣」，通常用在「on the verge of」這個片語中，表示即將發生某事。","options":["peak","edge","verge","center"],"sentence":"The patient was on the ______ of losing consciousness as his blood pressure continued to drop dangerously. The doctors rushed to stabilize him before it was too late.","translation":"隨著血壓持續危險地下降，患者接近於失去意識。醫生們急忙穩定他的狀況以免太遲。","word":"verge"}},"verify":{"createdAt":1784467906867,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"verify 意思是確認或證實某件事的真實性，通常需要檢查證據或文件來確保資訊的正確性。","options":["ignore","verify","assume","memorize"],"sentence":"The bank needs to ______ your identity before processing the loan application. They will check your documents and confirm all the information matches their records.","translation":"銀行在處理貸款申請前需要驗證你的身份。他們會檢查你的文件並確認所有資訊與他們的紀錄相符。","word":"verify"}},"versatile":{"createdAt":1785723942798,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"versatile 意指能夠適應多種不同的情況或用途，具有多種才能或功能，在這裡形容演員能勝任多種不同類型的角色。","options":["talented","versatile","famous","experienced"],"sentence":"A ______ actor can perform in comedies, dramas, and action films with equal skill. His ability to excel in completely different genres proves his range and adaptability.","translation":"一位多才多藝的演員可以在喜劇、戲劇和動作電影中表現得同樣出色。他在完全不同的類型中表現卓越的能力證明了他的多面性和適應力。","word":"versatile"}},"versatility":{"createdAt":1781840892406,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"versatility指事物的多用途和多功能特性，能夠適應多種用途。","options":["durability","versatility","simplicity","fragility"],"sentence":"The ______ of this smartphone makes it an excellent choice for both work and entertainment. Users can seamlessly switch between professional applications, gaming, photography, and streaming without any lag.","translation":"這款智慧型手機的多功能性使其成為工作和娛樂的絕佳選擇。用戶可以在專業應用、遊戲、攝影和串流之間無縫切換，毫無延遲。","word":"versatility"}},"verse":{"createdAt":1785331076821,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"詩歌或韻文是具有節奏和押韻特徵的文學形式，與散文不同。","options":["prose","verse","essay","novel"],"sentence":"The poet wrote a beautiful ______ about the changing seasons and the passage of time. The composition was structured with rhyming lines and a rhythmic pattern throughout.","translation":"這位詩人寫了一首關於季節變化和時間流逝的美麗詩歌。這首作品採用押韻的行和貫穿始終的節奏模式結構。","word":"verse"}},"version":{"createdAt":1781503378963,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"version 表示某物的不同形式、變體或詮釋，特別是在內容或形式上有所改變。","options":["copy","duplicate","version","clone"],"sentence":"The director released a new ______ of the classic film with improved special effects. This updated adaptation was filmed using modern technology and techniques.","translation":"導演發布了經典電影的新版本，改進了特效。這個更新的改編版本使用現代技術和技巧拍攝。","word":"version"}},"versus":{"createdAt":1781847052507,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"versus用來表示兩個對手之間的對比或對抗，常用於體育比賽或法律訴訟中表示雙方對陣。","options":["alongside","versus","within","beyond"],"sentence":"The championship game will feature Team A ______ Team B in an exciting matchup. Both teams have won all their previous games this season, making this competition especially fierce.","translation":"冠軍賽將以A隊對陣B隊，這是一場令人興奮的比賽。兩隊在本賽季都贏得了所有先前的比賽，使得這場比賽特別激烈。","word":"versus"}},"vertical":{"createdAt":1782352245066,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"vertical形容直線或方向垂直於地面，即上下方向而非左右方向。","options":["horizontal","diagonal","vertical","curved"],"sentence":"The ______ line on the whiteboard ran straight up and down from top to bottom. The teacher drew it perpendicular to the horizontal line she had drawn earlier.","translation":"白板上的垂直線從上到下垂直運行。老師將其畫成與她之前繪製的水平線垂直。","word":"vertical"}},"vessel":{"createdAt":1787794132948,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vessel作為名詞可指身體內運輸血液的血管或脈管，是醫學中的重要解剖學概念。","options":["organ","vessel","bone","tissue"],"sentence":"The doctor examined the patient's blood ______ to check for any blockages. A healthy circulatory system depends on these tubes remaining clear and flexible.","translation":"醫生檢查病人的血管是否有任何堵塞。健康的循環系統取決於這些管道保持暢通和有彈性。","word":"vessel"}},"vet":{"createdAt":1782831931934,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"vet 是名詞，表示「獸醫」，是專門診療和照顧動物健康的醫療專業人士。","options":["mechanic","pharmacist","vet","dentist"],"sentence":"When Sarah's cat fell ill, she immediately took her to the ______ for a thorough examination. The animal doctor prescribed antibiotics and scheduled a follow-up appointment.","translation":"當莎拉的貓生病時，她立即帶牠去看獸醫進行徹底檢查。那位動物醫生開了抗生素處方並安排了後續預約。","word":"vet"}},"veteran":{"createdAt":1785463654217,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"veteran 表示在某個領域有豐富經驗和深厚知識的人，也可指退伍軍人。","options":["novice","student","veteran","intern"],"sentence":"As a ______ of the software industry with over thirty years of experience, she was hired as the lead architect. Her deep knowledge of legacy systems and modern technologies made her invaluable to the project.","translation":"作為擁有超過三十年經驗的軟體行業老手，她被聘為首席架構師。她對舊系統和現代技術的深入了解使她對該項目至關重要。","word":"veteran"}},"veto":{"createdAt":1781478568766,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"veto 是指有權力的人或機構對提案的否決或禁止。","options":["veto","approval","amendment","revision"],"sentence":"The president used his ______ power to block the controversial legislation. Congress was unable to override his decision.","translation":"總統使用他的否決權來阻止這項有爭議的立法。國會無法推翻他的決定。","word":"veto"}},"via":{"createdAt":1783488708965,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"via 是介詞，表示經過某種方式或途徑，常用於表達通過特定的媒介、交通工具或方法傳遞或進行某事。","options":["by","via","with","through"],"sentence":"I sent the package to my friend ______ express mail. The delivery company used their fastest shipping method to ensure it arrived within two days.","translation":"我通過快遞郵件把包裹寄給我的朋友。快遞公司用他們最快的運輸方式確保它在兩天內送達。","word":"via"}},"viable":{"createdAt":1785118914477,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"viable 意指某項計畫、想法或方案在實際上是可行的、可能成功的，但不一定能帶來利潤或創新。","options":["profitable","viable","innovative","ambitious"],"sentence":"The startup's business plan seemed ______ at first, but after the market analysis revealed declining demand, investors realized it was too risky. The company had already spent months developing a product that nobody wanted to buy.","translation":"這家新創公司的商業計畫起初似乎是可實行的，但在市場分析顯示需求下降後，投資者意識到它的風險太大了。該公司已經花費數月時間開發一種沒有人想購買的產品。","word":"viable"}},"vibrant":{"createdAt":1784986981430,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vibrant 形容充滿活力、生動、鮮豔而有生氣的狀態，用來描述顏色鮮豔、氣氛活躍的環境。","options":["dull","vibrant","pale","muted"],"sentence":"The street market was filled with ______ colors and energetic crowds shopping for fresh produce. Every corner seemed alive with movement and enthusiasm that made the atmosphere feel electrifying.","translation":"街道市場充滿了充滿生氣的顏色和熱情購物的人群。每個角落似乎都洋溢著生命力和熱情，使氣氛感到令人興奮。","word":"vibrant"}},"vibrate":{"createdAt":1783488708966,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vibrate 是動詞，表示迅速而連續地來回震動或顫動，通常描述物體因外力或內在原因而產生的快速、規律的運動。","options":["shake","vibrate","move","sway"],"sentence":"When the earthquake struck, the entire building began to ______ violently. The tremors were so intense that pictures fell off the walls and dishes rattled in the cabinets.","translation":"地震發生時，整棟建築開始劇烈地振動。震波是如此強烈，以至於圖片從牆上掉下來，盤子在櫥櫃裡搖晃作響。","word":"vibrate"}},"vibration":{"createdAt":1785831790337,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vibration是指物體快速反覆的搖晃或震動運動，通常由外部力量引起。","options":["sound","vibration","movement","tremor"],"sentence":"The earthquake caused a strong ______ that shook buildings and made objects fall from shelves. Scientists measured the intensity of this shaking using specialized seismometers.","translation":"地震造成了強烈的振動，搖動了建築物，使物體從架子上掉下來。科學家們用專門的地震儀測量了這種搖晃的強度。","word":"vibration"}},"vicarious":{"createdAt":1784795329363,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vicarious 意為「代理的、間接的、代人感受的」，用來描述通過他人的經歷而間接地體驗或感受某種情感或經驗。","options":["direct","vicarious","personal","competitive"],"sentence":"Sarah experienced a ______ thrill watching her friend compete in the Olympic games from the audience. She had trained for years but couldn't participate due to an injury, so she lived through her friend's success instead.","translation":"莎拉從觀眾席上觀看她的朋友參加奧運競賽時，體驗到了代理性的刺激感。她多年來一直在訓練，但由於受傷無法參加比賽，所以她只能通過朋友的成功來間接體驗。","word":"vicarious"}},"vicariously":{"createdAt":1785462634091,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vicariously 表示「間接感受到地；替代地」，指通過他人的經歷而非直接親身體驗來獲得感受，與後句「從未爬過山，但感覺彷彿親身經歷」的轉承關係相符。","options":["directly","vicariously","reluctantly","gradually"],"sentence":"She experienced the thrill of mountain climbing ______ through her friend's detailed stories and adventure videos. Although she had never climbed a mountain herself, she felt as if she had lived through every challenging moment.","translation":"她通過朋友詳細的故事和冒險視頻間接感受到了登山的刺激。雖然她本人從未登過山，但她感覺彷彿親身經歷了每一個艱難時刻。","word":"vicariously"}},"vice":{"createdAt":1784105049120,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vice 作為名詞意指惡習或邪惡的行為，在此句中指吸菸和飲酒等不良習慣；vice 也可作為前綴詞表示「副」，如副總裁（vice president），但在填空句中應填入名詞 vice，指的是邪惡或不良習慣。","options":["virtue","vice","role","position"],"sentence":"Smoking and excessive drinking are considered serious ______ that damage both physical and mental health. The company appointed a new ______ president to oversee operations while the main president focused on strategy.","translation":"吸菸和過度飲酒被認為是損害身心健康的嚴重惡習。該公司任命了一位新的副總裁監督業務，而主席則專注於戰略。","word":"vice"}},"vicious":{"createdAt":1783262131290,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vicious表示兇狠、惡毒、品行不良或具有攻擊性，常用來形容危險的動物或行為。","options":["friendly","vicious","playful","gentle"],"sentence":"The ______ dog attacked the mailman without any provocation. The animal had a history of aggressive behavior and had bitten several people before.","translation":"那隻兇狠的狗無故攻擊郵差。這隻動物有著好鬥的歷史記錄，之前已經咬傷過幾個人。","word":"vicious"}},"victim":{"createdAt":1781503378952,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"victim 指的是遭受傷害或損失的人，在這個句子中指的是被車撞傷的人。","options":["survivor","victim","witness","driver"],"sentence":"The ______ of the accident was rushed to the hospital immediately. The injured person had been hit by a car while crossing the street.","translation":"車禍的受害者被立即送往醫院。那個受傷的人在過馬路時被汽車撞到。","word":"victim"}},"victor":{"createdAt":1782746247857,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"victor 是指在比賽或競爭中獲勝的人，通常用來形容成功者或戰勝者。","options":["loser","victor","spectator","coach"],"sentence":"The ______ of the championship game celebrated with their teammates on the field. They had trained for months and finally achieved their goal of winning the tournament.","translation":"冠軍賽的獲勝者與隊友在球場上慶祝。他們訓練了幾個月，終於達成了贏得錦標賽的目標。","word":"victor"}},"victory":{"createdAt":1782373576503,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"victory 表示在競賽、戰鬥或比賽中獲勝，是戰勝對手的結果","options":["defeat","accident","victory","confusion"],"sentence":"The team celebrated their ______ after the championship game. Their opponents acknowledged the superior performance that led to this triumph.","translation":"球隊在錦標賽後慶祝他們的勝利。他們的對手承認導致這一勝利的優異表現。","word":"victory"}},"viewer":{"createdAt":1786167316742,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"viewer 是指觀看節目或電影的人，這裡指提交評論的普通觀眾，而不是專業的影評人。","options":["actor","director","viewer","critic"],"sentence":"Each ______ who watched the film submitted their own review online. The total number of people who gave feedback reached over one thousand.","translation":"每個觀看這部電影的觀眾都在網上提交了自己的評論。提交反饋的人總數超過一千人。","word":"viewer"}},"viewpoint":{"createdAt":1783850528607,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"viewpoint表示觀察或思考問題的角度或立場，指的是不同的評估和理解事物的方式。","options":["painting","viewpoint","canvas","color"],"sentence":"From an artistic ______, the painting was considered a masterpiece. However, critics who valued traditional techniques disagreed strongly.","translation":"從藝術的角度來看，這幅畫被認為是傑作。然而，重視傳統技法的評論家們強烈不同意。","word":"viewpoint"}},"vigor":{"createdAt":1784438746550,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vigor 是指活力和精力，通常用來形容某人充滿能量、精神飽滿的狀態，尤其是在面對挑戰時展現出來的強大動力。","options":["laziness","vigor","confusion","sadness"],"sentence":"The young athlete approached the competition with remarkable ______, displaying intense energy and determination. Despite being tired from training all week, he refused to slow down because he was driven by such infectious enthusiasm.","translation":"年輕運動員以非凡的精力投入比賽，展現出強烈的能量和決心。儘管經過一週的訓練感到疲倦，他仍然拒絕放慢速度，因為他被這種充滿感染力的熱情所驅動。","word":"vigor"}},"vigorous":{"createdAt":1781839950957,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vigorous 表示充滿精力和力量的,通常用來形容活動或運動的強度很高。","options":["lazy","vigorous","theoretical","relaxing"],"sentence":"The athletes performed a ______ exercise routine that left them exhausted. They maintained high intensity throughout the entire two-hour training session without stopping.","translation":"運動員進行了一項精力充沛的運動訓練,讓他們筋疲力盡。他們在整個兩小時的訓練課程中保持高強度,沒有停止過。","word":"vigorous"}},"villain":{"createdAt":1781693347920,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"villain指的是故事或現實中的壞人、惡棍或反派角色，通常與邪惡或犯罪行為有關。","options":["tuition","villain","wage","textile"],"sentence":"The ______ in the movie kidnapped the princess and stole the royal treasure. The antagonist was eventually defeated by the hero in the final battle.","translation":"電影中的惡棍綁架了公主並偷走了皇家寶藏。這個反派角色最終在最後的戰鬥中被英雄擊敗。","word":"villain"}},"vinegar":{"createdAt":1785135014040,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vinegar 是一種酸性液體調味料，由水果或穀物發酵而成，具有酸味，常用於烹飪和調味。","options":["oil","vinegar","honey","butter"],"sentence":"She added a splash of ______ to the salad dressing to give it a tangy flavor. The acidic liquid is made from fermented grapes or apples and is commonly used in cooking.","translation":"她在沙拉醬中加入一點醋來增添酸味。這種酸性液體由發酵的葡萄或蘋果製成，常用於烹飪。","word":"vinegar"}},"violate":{"createdAt":1781798927526,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"violate 表示違反、違背或破壞法律、規則或協議。","options":["support","violate","promote","ignore"],"sentence":"The company was fined heavily for ______ environmental protection laws. They had been illegally dumping toxic waste into the river for several months.","translation":"該公司因違反環境保護法而被罰款巨大。他們已經非法傾倒有毒廢物到河裡好幾個月了。","word":"violate"}},"violation":{"createdAt":1781824444585,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"violation 表示對法律、規則或協議的違背或侵犯，通常帶有負面的法律含義。","options":["compliance","violation","agreement","cooperation"],"sentence":"The company faced serious legal penalties for its ______ of environmental protection laws. The government discovered they had been illegally dumping toxic waste into the river for months.","translation":"該公司因違反環境保護法律而面臨嚴厲的法律處罰。政府發現他們數個月來一直在向河流中非法傾倒有毒廢物。","word":"violation"}},"violence":{"createdAt":1781961517451,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"violence 指的是具體的暴力行為和身體傷害，而不僅僅是混亂或不安。","options":["chaos","violence","disorder","unrest"],"sentence":"The protest escalated into ______ when angry crowds began throwing objects at police. Authorities had to deploy riot control measures to prevent further injuries.","translation":"當憤怒的群眾開始向警察扔物體時，抗議升級為暴力。當局不得不部署防暴措施來防止進一步的傷害。","word":"violence"}},"violent":{"createdAt":1784092177144,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"violent 表示具有強大破壞力的、猛烈的或暴力的，用來形容極端激烈的自然現象或行為。","options":["gentle","violent","mild","calm"],"sentence":"The ______ storm caused severe damage to homes and trees in the neighborhood. The wind speed exceeded 150 kilometers per hour, and debris was flying everywhere.","translation":"那場____的暴風雨對社區的房屋和樹木造成了嚴重破壞。風速超過每小時150公里，碎片到處飛揚。","word":"violent"}},"violently":{"createdAt":1784431968385,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"violently（猛烈地）用來形容暴力、激烈或強有力的動作，在此句中描述暴風雨的強大破壞力。","options":["gently","violently","quietly","slowly"],"sentence":"The storm ______ shook the trees and knocked down power lines throughout the neighborhood. The wind was so intense that it caused significant damage to homes and infrastructure.","translation":"暴風雨______搖晃了樹木，並在整個鄰里範圍內吹倒了電力線。風是如此猛烈，以至於對房屋和基礎設施造成了重大損壞。","word":"violently"}},"virginity":{"createdAt":1783005778376,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"virginity 意為「處女之身」或「未曾有性經驗的狀態」，指一個人未曾有過性經驗的狀態。","options":["career","wealth","virginity","independence"],"sentence":"She made the personal decision to preserve her ______ until marriage, a choice that was deeply important to her cultural and religious beliefs. This value guided many of her life decisions.","translation":"她做出了個人決定在結婚前保持處女之身，這一選擇對她的文化和宗教信仰非常重要。這個價值觀引導了她許多人生決定。","word":"virginity"}},"virtual":{"createdAt":1783042345889,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"virtual 指的是透過電腦或網路進行的、不在實體空間中進行的活動或環境。","options":["actual","virtual","formal","annual"],"sentence":"The company held a ______ meeting with employees from five different countries using video conference software. Everyone participated remotely from their own offices without traveling to a physical location.","translation":"公司透過視訊會議軟體與來自五個不同國家的員工舉行虛擬會議。每個人都在自己的辦公室遠端參與，無需前往實體地點。","word":"virtual"}},"virtually":{"createdAt":1781693591740,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"virtually 是副詞，表示「幾乎」或「實質上地」，用來強調某事物已經發生了根本性的轉變。","options":["slightly","marginally","virtually","partially"],"sentence":"The new technology has ______ changed the way we communicate with each other. Almost everyone now uses smartphones and social media platforms daily instead of traditional mail.","translation":"新技術幾乎改變了我們相互溝通的方式。幾乎每個人現在都每天使用智慧型手機和社群媒體平台，而不是傳統郵件。","word":"virtually"}},"virtue":{"createdAt":1782140900231,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"virtue 指的是道德上的優點或美德，特別是能夠建立信任和受人尊敬的品格特徵。","options":["weakness","virtue","hobby","talent"],"sentence":"Honesty is a ______ that many people admire in their friends and colleagues. Without this quality, it would be impossible to build trust in any relationship.","translation":"誠實是許多人在朋友和同事身上欣賞的美德。沒有這種品質，就不可能在任何關係中建立信任。","word":"virtue"}},"virtuous":{"createdAt":1782040742468,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"virtuous 形容詞意為「品德高尚的、有道德的、廉潔的」，用來描述一個人的道德品質和行為準則。","options":["luxurious","virtuous","reckless","mundane"],"sentence":"The monk lived a ______ life, dedicated to helping the poor and never accepting bribes. His reputation for honesty and moral integrity earned him respect throughout the entire village.","translation":"這位僧侶過著品德高尚的生活，致力於幫助窮人，從不接受賄賂。他因誠實和道德廉潔而在整個村莊贏得尊敬。","word":"virtuous"}},"virus":{"createdAt":1783823805984,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"virus 是一種微生物病原體，會導致傳染病，無法用抗生素治療。","options":["vaccine","virus","symptom","allergy"],"sentence":"The doctor explained that the patient's illness was caused by a ______ rather than bacteria. She prescribed rest and fluids, noting that antibiotics would not work against this type of infection.","translation":"醫生解釋說患者的疾病是由病毒而不是細菌引起的。她開出休息和液體，注意到抗生素對這種類型的感染無效。","word":"virus"}},"visa":{"createdAt":1783395908755,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"visa 是簽證，指由國家政府簽發的官方許可文件，允許持有人進入該國。","options":["passport","visa","ticket","map"],"sentence":"Before traveling to Japan, she had to apply for a ______ at the embassy to gain legal entry into the country. Without this official stamp in her passport, she would not be allowed to cross the border.","translation":"在前往日本之前，她必須在大使館申請簽證以獲得合法進入該國的許可。沒有她護照上的官方蓋章，她將無法越過邊界。","word":"visa"}},"visible":{"createdAt":1782228357819,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"visible 表示能夠被看到的或顯而易見的，與隱藏或看不見相對。","options":["hidden","internal","visible","minor"],"sentence":"The ______ damage to the car made it clear the accident had been severe. The dented hood and shattered windows were apparent to everyone who looked at it.","translation":"汽車的明顯損傷清楚地表明事故很嚴重。凹陷的引擎蓋和破碎的窗戶對看到它的每個人都是顯而易見的。","word":"visible"}},"vision":{"createdAt":1785281292786,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"vision 在此指的是遠見卓識或對未來的長期規劃和目標設想，代表對事業發展的戰略眼光。","options":["sight","goal","vision","idea"],"sentence":"The entrepreneur presented her ______ for expanding the company into five new markets within three years. Her detailed plan impressed all the investors in the boardroom.","translation":"創業家提出了她在三年內將公司擴展到五個新市場的願景。她詳細的計劃給董事會的所有投資者留下了深刻印象。","word":"vision"}},"visionary":{"createdAt":1782308456163,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Visionary 意指具有遠見和預見未來能力的人，能想像和預見未來發展的方向。","options":["practical","visionary","conservative","cautious"],"sentence":"The company's ______ leader proposed an innovative technology that didn't exist yet. His bold predictions about the future turned out to be accurate ten years later.","translation":"這家公司的遠見卓識領導者提出了一項尚不存在的創新技術。他大膽的未來預測十年後被證明是準確的。","word":"visionary"}},"visual":{"createdAt":1783667392048,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"visual 是指與視覺有關的，涉及看見或用眼睛觀看的事物。","options":["auditory","visual","verbal","textual"],"sentence":"The artist created a stunning ______ display using bright colors and intricate patterns. The presentation relied entirely on images and graphics rather than spoken words.","translation":"藝術家用鮮豔的色彩和複雜的圖案創造了一個令人驚嘆的視覺展示。這個展示完全依靠圖像和圖形，而不是口語。","word":"visual"}},"visualize":{"createdAt":1781414438957,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"visualize指在腦海中形成心像或圖像，想像看到某物的樣子","options":["forget","visualize","criticize","minimize"],"sentence":"Before starting the project, the architect asked the team to ______ the final building design in their minds. They closed their eyes and imagined what the completed structure would look like.","translation":"在開始專案之前，建築師要求團隊在腦海中想像最終的建築設計。他們閉上眼睛，想像完成後的建築物會是什麼樣子。","word":"visualize"}},"vital":{"createdAt":1784110946857,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vital 意為維持生命所必需的、極為重要的，用來描述對生存或成功不可或缺的事物。","options":["optional","vital","trivial","interesting"],"sentence":"Oxygen is ______ to human survival; without it, a person can only live a few minutes. The body's organs cannot function without this essential element.","translation":"氧氣對人類生存是至關重要的；沒有它，一個人只能活幾分鐘。身體的器官沒有這種基本元素無法運作。","word":"vital"}},"vitality":{"createdAt":1782308772649,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"vitality指生命力、活力，通常用來形容某人重新獲得的精力和生氣。","options":["vitality","confusion","sarcasm","reluctance"],"sentence":"The elderly man's ______ returned after he started exercising regularly and eating healthier foods. His family was amazed to see him full of energy and enthusiasm again.","translation":"這位老人在開始定期運動並進食更健康食物後，他的生命力恢復了。他的家人對看到他再次充滿精力和熱情感到驚訝。","word":"vitality"}},"vivid":{"createdAt":1785249134539,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vivid 表示生動的、鮮豔的、清晰明亮的，用來形容色彩、圖像或描述非常明確、逼真且令人印象深刻。","options":["dull","vivid","abstract","faded"],"sentence":"The painter created a ______ portrait of the sunset with brilliant oranges, reds, and purples. The colors were so bright and detailed that viewers felt they could almost feel the warmth of the setting sun.","translation":"畫家用耀眼的橙色、紅色和紫色創作了一幅生動的夕陽肖像。這些顏色是如此明亮和詳細，使觀眾幾乎感覺能感受到落日的溫暖。","word":"vivid"}},"vividly":{"createdAt":1784908375543,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vividly 是副詞，表示「生動地、鮮明地」描述某事，使聽者能清楚地想像出場景。","options":["quietly","vividly","briefly","carefully"],"sentence":"The witness described the accident ______ to the police officer. Every detail she mentioned—the color of the car, the sound of the crash, the exact positions of the vehicles—was so clear and graphic that the officer could almost see it happening.","translation":"證人向警察生動地描述了這場事故。她提到的每一個細節——汽車的顏色、碰撞的聲音、車輛的確切位置——都是那麼清晰逼真，以至於警察幾乎可以看到它正在發生。","word":"vividly"}},"vocal":{"createdAt":1785812258815,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vocal作為形容詞表示「與聲音或唱歌有關的」，特別是指主唱或發音的表演。","options":["instrumental","vocal","silent","visual"],"sentence":"The ______ performance by the lead singer was absolutely stunning. The audience was mesmerized by her incredible voice and stage presence.","translation":"主唱的演唱表演絕對令人驚艷。觀眾被她令人難以置信的聲音和舞台表現所吸引。","word":"vocal"}},"vocalize":{"createdAt":1781693269014,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vocalize 意思是用聲音表達或發聲，在這個句子中指的是通過唱歌來表達情感。","options":["hide","vocalize","write","ignore"],"sentence":"The singer will ______ her emotions through a powerful performance. She plans to express her feelings by singing a heartfelt ballad at the concert.","translation":"這位歌手將透過強有力的表演來發聲表達她的情感。她計劃在演唱會上唱一首深情的民謠來表達她的感受。","word":"vocalize"}},"vocation":{"createdAt":1783259812521,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vocation 指一個人認為最適合或最有意義的職業，通常涉及對工作的熱情和使命感。","options":["hobby","vocation","requirement","mistake"],"sentence":"Marcus discovered his true ______ when he started volunteering at the animal shelter. He realized that working with animals was not just a job but his true calling.","translation":"馬庫斯在動物收容所做志願者時發現了他真正的職業天命。他意識到與動物一起工作不只是工作，而是他真正的使命。","word":"vocation"}},"vocational":{"createdAt":1784293586481,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vocational是形容詞，意指與特定職業或工作技能相關的教育或培訓，強調實踐性而非學術性理論。","options":["academic","vocational","theoretical","recreational"],"sentence":"My sister enrolled in a ______ school to learn practical skills in carpentry and plumbing. She wanted to start working immediately after graduation rather than attending a traditional four-year university.","translation":"我妹妹進入了一所職業學校學習木工和水管等實用技能。她想在畢業後立即開始工作，而不是參加傳統的四年制大學。","word":"vocational"}},"volatile":{"createdAt":1787757574262,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"volatile 意為「易變的、不穩定的」，用來形容容易迅速變化或波動的情況，特別是在市場、情緒或物質性質方面。","options":["stable","volatile","predictable","consistent"],"sentence":"The stock market has been extremely ______ this year, with prices swinging wildly from day to day. Investors cannot predict what will happen next because conditions change so rapidly.","translation":"今年股票市場極其不穩定，價格日日波動劇烈。投資者無法預測接下來會發生什麼，因為條件變化得非常迅速。","word":"volatile"}},"volcano":{"createdAt":1783470930349,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"volcano是指會噴發出熔岩、火山灰和火山氣體的地質構造，是由於地殼活動而形成的。","options":["mountain","volcano","island","cave"],"sentence":"Mount Vesuvius is a famous ______ located near Naples, Italy. When it erupted in 79 AD, it buried the ancient city of Pompeii under ash and lava.","translation":"維蘇威火山是位於義大利那不勒斯附近的著名火山。當它在西元79年爆發時，它用火山灰和熔岩埋沒了古城龐貝。","word":"volcano"}},"volume":{"createdAt":1781838276305,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"volume在此指聲音的大小或響度。","options":["toll","proponent","volume","ordeal"],"sentence":"Please turn down the ______ on the television; it is too loud for everyone in the room. My elderly grandmother can barely hear the dialogue at lower levels.","translation":"請把電視的音量調小；對房間裡的每個人來說都太大聲了。我年邁的祖母在較低音量時幾乎聽不到對白。","word":"volume"}},"voluntary":{"createdAt":1783310403307,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"voluntary是形容詞，表示出於自願而非強制的、自發的行為或決定。","options":["mandatory","voluntary","corporate","anonymous"],"sentence":"The charity relies on ______ donations from generous community members. These contributions are completely optional, and no one is obligated or forced to participate.","translation":"慈善機構依靠來自慷慨社區成員的自願捐款。這些貢獻完全是自願的，沒有人被迫或必須參與。","word":"voluntary"}},"volunteer":{"createdAt":1782228491200,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"volunteer 作動詞，指自願無償地做某事，特別是在社區服務或慈善工作中。","options":["donate","volunteer","sell","rent"],"sentence":"Many people ______ their time to help at the community center every weekend. They receive no payment but are motivated by a desire to serve others.","translation":"許多人每個週末______他們的時間幫助社區中心。他們沒有獲得報酬，但被為他人服務的願望所驅動。","word":"volunteer"}},"vomit":{"createdAt":1783760192895,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"vomit 是指身體將胃裡的食物或液體強行排出口腔的生理現象，通常是由於生病、中毒或不適引起的。","options":["breathe","vomit","digest","swallow"],"sentence":"After eating the spoiled food, he felt sick and began to ______ into the bathroom sink. The doctor confirmed that his body was rejecting the contaminated meal through this involuntary physical response.","translation":"吃了變質的食物後，他感到不適，開始在浴室洗手槽裡______。醫生確認他的身體通過這種非自願的生理反應排斥了受污染的食物。","word":"vomit"}},"voucher":{"createdAt":1782352245060,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"voucher是一種現金券或代金券，可以用來兌換商品或折扣。","options":["coupon","receipt","voucher","invoice"],"sentence":"I received a discount ______ for shopping at the supermarket yesterday. I can exchange it for ten dollars off my next purchase.","translation":"我昨天在超市購物時收到了折扣代金券。我可以用它在下次購物時獲得十元折扣。","word":"voucher"}},"vow":{"createdAt":1786017950561,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"vow 作名詞時指莊嚴的誓言或承諾，作動詞時指鄭重地發誓或承諾做某事。","options":["complaint","request","vow","suggestion"],"sentence":"At the wedding ceremony, the couple made a solemn ______ to love and support each other for the rest of their lives. This sacred promise, publicly declared before witnesses, represents their deepest commitment to one another.","translation":"在婚禮上，這對新人莊嚴地發誓要在餘生中相愛和相互扶持。這個在證人面前公開宣布的神聖誓言代表了他們彼此最深的承諾。","word":"vow"}},"vowel":{"createdAt":1784340894477,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"vowel 是指英文字母中代表開放聲音的字母，包括 A、E、I、O、U 五個基本母音。","options":["consonant","punctuation","vowel","syllable"],"sentence":"In English, the letter 'A' is classified as a ______ because it represents an open vocal sound. The other letters in this category include E, I, O, and U.","translation":"在英文中，字母「A」被分類為母音，因為它代表一個開放的聲音。這個類別中的其他字母包括 E、I、O 和 U。","word":"vowel"}},"voyage":{"createdAt":1781661288532,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"voyage 是指長途的船舶或太空旅行，強調航海或太空中的旅程","options":["walk","voyage","flight","drive"],"sentence":"The explorer embarked on a long ______ across the Atlantic Ocean in the 1800s. The journey took several months as the ship battled storms and unpredictable weather at sea.","translation":"這位探險家在1800年代開始了一次跨越大西洋的漫長航行。這次旅行花了數個月，船隻在海上與暴風雨和不可預測的天氣搏鬥。","word":"voyage"}},"vulnerability":{"createdAt":1782292020651,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"vulnerability指某人或某物容易受到傷害、攻擊或不利影響的狀態或特性。","options":["strength","resistance","vulnerability","resilience"],"sentence":"The elderly population faces greater ______ during extreme weather conditions. Without proper assistance and shelter, they are at higher risk of serious health problems.","translation":"老年人口在極端天氣條件下面臨更大的脆弱性。沒有適當的協助和庇護，他們面臨更高的嚴重健康問題風險。","word":"vulnerability"}},"vulnerable":{"createdAt":1783402916388,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"vulnerable 形容某人或某物容易受到傷害、攻擊或負面影響的狀態。","options":["strong","confident","vulnerable","resistant"],"sentence":"The elderly residents in the nursing home are particularly ______ during harsh winter months. They require extra medical attention and care to prevent serious health complications.","translation":"養老院裡的老年居民在嚴寒的冬季特別容易受傷害。他們需要額外的醫療關注和照顧以防止嚴重的健康併發症。","word":"vulnerable"}},"waffle":{"createdAt":1784773941958,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"waffle 作為動詞表示猶豫不決、含糊其辭或迴避直接回答問題。","options":["answer","waffle","explain","clarify"],"sentence":"The candidate continued to ______ on the important policy question during the debate. The moderator pressed him repeatedly for a clear yes or no answer, but he kept giving vague responses.","translation":"候選人在辯論中對重要的政策問題猶豫不決。主持人反覆要求他給出明確的是或否的答案，但他不斷給出模糊的回應。","word":"waffle"}},"wag":{"createdAt":1785228368472,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wag 是指以短而快的動作反覆搖動某物，特別常用來描述動物搖動尾巴的動作。","options":["shake","wag","swing","twist"],"sentence":"The dog began to ______ its tail excitedly when its owner came home. The quick back-and-forth movement showed how happy the pet was to see them.","translation":"當主人回家時，狗開始興奮地搖動尾巴。這種快速的前後移動表明寵物有多高興看到他們。","word":"wag"}},"wage":{"createdAt":1781693347919,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"wage是指定期支付給員工的薪資或工資，特別是按小時或日計算的報酬。","options":["transplant","tuition","wage","textile"],"sentence":"The workers demanded a higher ______ to support their families and pay for living expenses. The factory owner refused to increase their hourly pay rate.","translation":"工人要求提高薪資以養家糊口並支付生活開支。工廠老闆拒絕增加他們的時薪。","word":"wage"}},"wander":{"createdAt":1781939898050,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"wander指沒有目的或方向地走動，強調漫遊和沒有具體目標。","options":["pursue","render","wander","target"],"sentence":"After the concert ended, the lost tourists began to ______ aimlessly through the unfamiliar city streets. They had no map and no destination in mind, just walking randomly wherever their feet took them.","translation":"音樂會結束後，迷路的遊客開始在陌生的城市街道上漫無目的地徘徊。他們沒有地圖，也沒有目的地，只是隨意地走著。","word":"wander"}},"wanderer":{"createdAt":1784962580678,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"wanderer 是名詞，指那些沒有固定住所而不斷遊蕩、流浪或四處漂泊的人，通常強調無目的和無定居點的特徵。","options":["pilgrim","scholar","wanderer","tourist"],"sentence":"The old ______ had traveled through dozens of countries without a permanent home or fixed destination for thirty years. He carried only a backpack and relied on the kindness of strangers as he journeyed from village to village.","translation":"這位老流浪者在三十年間沒有固定住所或既定目的地而遊歷了數十個國家。他只帶著一個背包，在從一個村莊遊蕩到另一個村莊時依靠陌生人的善意。","word":"wanderer"}},"wandering":{"createdAt":1781332009067,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wandering 作為形容詞表示蜿蜒的、曲折的，通常用來描述路線或水流的形狀","options":["straight","wandering","fast","deep"],"sentence":"The ______ river creates a beautiful and scenic landscape as it flows through the valley. The water meanders back and forth rather than flowing in a straight line.","translation":"蜿蜒的河流在流經山谷時創造了美麗的景觀。水流來回迂迴流動，而不是直線流動。","word":"wandering"}},"ward":{"createdAt":1782477376589,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"ward（搭配off）是指避開、躲避或防止某事發生，通常用於危險或不想要的情況。","options":["encourage","promote","ward","invite"],"sentence":"The goalkeeper managed to ______ off the opponent's attack with a perfect save. His quick reflexes prevented the ball from entering the net.","translation":"守門員以完美的撲救成功避開對手的進攻。他敏捷的反應阻止球進入球門。","word":"ward"}},"warden":{"createdAt":1783961993179,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"warden 是指監獄或監管機構的最高管理人或典獄長，擁有整個設施的管理權。","options":["guard","warden","officer","director"],"sentence":"The ______ of the prison implemented strict new security measures after the recent escape attempt. He reported directly to the government and was responsible for all operations within the facility.","translation":"監獄的典獄長在最近一次越獄企圖後實施了嚴格的新安全措施。他直接向政府報告，負責設施內的所有運作。","word":"warden"}},"wardrobe":{"createdAt":1781955529032,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wardrobe 指的是一個人擁有的所有衣服和相關服飾的總稱。","options":["apartment","wardrobe","bedroom","closet"],"sentence":"Sarah spent thousands of dollars updating her ______ with designer clothes and accessories. She now has an entire room dedicated to storing her extensive collection of outfits for every occasion.","translation":"莎拉花了數千美元用設計師服裝和配飾更新她的衣櫃。她現在有一整個房間專門用來存放她為各種場合準備的廣泛服裝收藏。","word":"wardrobe"}},"warehouse":{"createdAt":1783262131291,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"warehouse是指用於存儲和存放大量貨物或商品的建築物或設施。","options":["office","warehouse","factory","showroom"],"sentence":"The company stored thousands of boxes of merchandise in their large ______ near the port. This facility allowed them to distribute products quickly to stores across the region.","translation":"該公司在港口附近的大倉庫中存放了數千箱商品。這個設施使他們能夠迅速將產品分配到整個地區的商店。","word":"warehouse"}},"warrant":{"createdAt":1782228491198,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"warrant 在此作名詞，指法律上的搜查令或逮捕狀，是由法官簽發的正式文件。","options":["permit","warrant","license","certificate"],"sentence":"The police officer showed me a ______ that gave him legal authority to search my home. Without this official document signed by a judge, he would not have been allowed to enter.","translation":"警察官員向我出示了一份______，它賦予他搜查我家的法律權力。沒有這份由法官簽署的官方文件，他是不被允許進入的。","word":"warrant"}},"warranty":{"createdAt":1784190145230,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"warranty 是指製造商或賣家對商品質量的保證，承諾在特定期間內修理或更換有缺陷的商品。","options":["receipt","guarantee","warranty","invoice"],"sentence":"The manufacturer provided a ______ with the new refrigerator to protect against defects. If any mechanical problems arise within two years, the company will repair or replace it at no cost.","translation":"製造商為新冰箱提供了保用卡，以防止出現缺陷。如果在兩年內出現任何機械問題，公司將免費維修或更換。","word":"warranty"}},"warrior":{"createdAt":1785834138213,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"warrior 是指專門從事戰鬥和軍事活動的人，通常需要經過訓練並參與戰爭。","options":["scholar","warrior","merchant","farmer"],"sentence":"The ancient ______ trained for years to master combat skills. He was a skilled fighter who fought bravely in countless battles throughout his life.","translation":"這位古代的戰士訓練多年來掌握格鬥技能。他是一位熟練的戰鬥人員，在他一生中的無數場戰役中英勇作戰。","word":"warrior"}},"wary":{"createdAt":1781966009083,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"wary 表示謹慎小心或警惕，通常指對潛在危險保持警覺態度。","options":["happy","tired","wary","curious"],"sentence":"The dog became ______ when the stranger approached the gate. It barked loudly and kept its distance, clearly distrusting the unfamiliar person.","translation":"當陌生人靠近大門時，狗變得警惕。它大聲吠叫並保持距離，明顯不信任這個不熟悉的人。","word":"wary"}},"wasteland":{"createdAt":1781926370998,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wasteland 意思是荒地、荒蕪之地，指被破壞或長期未開發的土地。","options":["garden","wasteland","sanctuary","reserve"],"sentence":"After the factory closed down, the surrounding area became a barren ______ with no signs of life. Nothing could grow there because the soil had been heavily polluted by decades of industrial waste.","translation":"工廠關閉後，周圍地區變成了荒蕪的荒地，沒有生命跡象。因為土壤被幾十年的工業廢料嚴重污染，所以什麼都不能在那裡生長。","word":"wasteland"}},"water":{"createdAt":1784899764058,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"water是一種透明的液體，是生命和生長的基本要素。","options":["sunlight","soil","water","air"],"sentence":"The plants need ______ to survive during the dry season. Without this essential liquid, they will wither and die within weeks.","translation":"在乾旱季節，植物需要水才能存活。沒有這種必要的液體，它們將在幾週內枯萎死亡。","word":"water"}},"waterproof":{"createdAt":1781847052511,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"waterproof是形容詞，用來描述物品能夠防止水進入或滲透，特別是在衣服、容器或其他產品上。","options":["comfortable","waterproof","fashionable","lightweight"],"sentence":"I bought a new ______ jacket for my hiking trip next week. Since I'll be trekking through a rainy mountain area, I need clothing that won't let water seep through the fabric.","translation":"我為下週的登山旅行買了一件新的防水夾克。因為我將在多雨的山區徒步旅行，我需要衣服不會讓水滲透布料。","word":"waterproof"}},"wax":{"createdAt":1781926464744,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wax 作為動詞或名詞，表示月亮逐漸變滿，與 waning（虧缺）相反。","options":["waning","wax","eclipse","orbit"],"sentence":"The moon enters its ______ phase when it grows larger each night. Astronomers can predict these cycles precisely because they follow predictable patterns.","translation":"當月球每晚變得越來越大時，它進入了蠟（漸盈）階段。天文學家能夠精確預測這些週期，因為它們遵循可預測的規律。","word":"wax"}},"weak":{"createdAt":1784173464331,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"weak 形容身體或精神上缺乏力量或強度，是 strong 的反義詞。","options":["strong","weak","energetic","capable"],"sentence":"After weeks of illness, he felt ______ and could barely climb the stairs. His doctor recommended rest and nutritious meals to help him regain his strength.","translation":"經過數週的病痛，他感到虛弱，幾乎無法爬樓梯。他的醫生建議他休息和營養膳食來幫助他恢復體力。","word":"weak"}},"weaken":{"createdAt":1783419789620,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"weaken 是動詞，表示使某事物變得更脆弱、更虛弱或力量減少，降低其強度或效能。","options":["strengthen","damage","weaken","affect"],"sentence":"The prolonged illness began to ______ his body's immune system. After months of fighting the infection, he became increasingly vulnerable to other diseases.","translation":"長期的疾病開始削弱他身體的免疫系統。經過幾個月與感染的對抗，他變得越來越容易患其他疾病。","word":"weaken"}},"weaker":{"createdAt":1782807020088,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"weaker 是形容詞，表示「虛弱的」或「軟弱的」，用來形容身體狀況或力量不如他人的狀態。","options":["slower","weaker","tired","younger"],"sentence":"The older athlete felt ______ than his younger competitors during the marathon. His muscles had less stamina and endurance compared to theirs.","translation":"這位年長的運動員在馬拉松比賽中感到比年輕對手更虛弱。他的肌肉耐力和耐受力不如他們。","word":"weaker"}},"weakness":{"createdAt":1781767999782,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"weakness 指的是個人的缺點或弱點，通常在自我評估或職業發展的背景下討論。","options":["strength","weakness","achievement","quality"],"sentence":"During the job interview, the candidate was asked to discuss her greatest ______ in the workplace. She honestly explained that she sometimes struggled with time management but had been taking courses to improve.","translation":"在工作面試中，候選人被要求討論她在職場中最大的弱點。她誠實地解釋說她有時在時間管理上有困難，但一直在上課以改進。","word":"weakness"}},"wealth":{"createdAt":1784683852169,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wealth 表示金錢、財產和經濟資源的豐富，通常指一個人或組織擁有的總資產和金錢數量。","options":["poverty","wealth","wisdom","health"],"sentence":"The old man had accumulated considerable ______ through decades of hard work and smart investments. His bank accounts, real estate holdings, and stock portfolio made him one of the richest people in the community.","translation":"那位老人通過數十年的辛勤工作和聰明投資積累了相當的財富。他的銀行帳戶、房地產控股和股票投資組合使他成為社區中最富有的人之一。","word":"wealth"}},"wealthy":{"createdAt":1784818655891,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"wealthy 表示擁有大量財富和資源的富有狀態，與能夠捐獻數百萬相符。","options":["poor","famous","wealthy","educated"],"sentence":"The ______ businessman donated millions to build a new hospital in the city. His enormous fortune and financial resources made this generous contribution possible.","translation":"這位富有的商人捐獻了數百萬來在城市裡建造一家新醫院。他龐大的財富和財務資源使這筆慷慨的捐獻成為可能。","word":"wealthy"}},"weapon":{"createdAt":1783063953963,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"weapon表示「武器」，指被設計或使用來造成傷害或殺害他人的物品。","options":["tool","device","weapon","instrument"],"sentence":"The detective discovered an illegal ______ hidden in the suspect's apartment during the search. The gun was later confirmed to be used in the robbery.","translation":"偵探在搜查嫌疑人的公寓時發現了一把藏匿的非法武器。該槍支後來被證實用於搶劫案。","word":"weapon"}},"weary":{"createdAt":1781746848183,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"weary 表示「疲倦」或「疲憊」，描述身體或精神上的極度疲勞狀態。","options":["energetic","weary","excited","motivated"],"sentence":"After hiking for eight hours in the mountains, the entire group felt ______. They all collapsed on their beds immediately upon returning to the lodge.","translation":"在山裡徒步八小時後，整個小組都感到疲倦。他們回到小屋後立即倒在床上。","word":"weary"}},"weather":{"createdAt":1787118100431,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"weather 作為動詞表示經受住困難或危險，安全度過難關。","options":["accelerate","weather","ignore","welcome"],"sentence":"The small company managed to ______ the economic recession and remained profitable throughout the crisis. Their smart financial decisions saved them from bankruptcy.","translation":"這家小公司設法度過了經濟衰退，在整個危機期間仍保持盈利。他們聰明的財務決策使他們免於破產。","word":"weather"}},"weave":{"createdAt":1786586292655,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"weave是指透過交叉編織纖維或線條來製作織物或圖案，強調線條之間的相互交錯和穿插的動作。","options":["spin","weave","construct","build"],"sentence":"The spider will ______ its web between the two branches. By carefully interlocking the silk threads in a intricate pattern, it creates a strong trap for insects.","translation":"蜘蛛將在兩根樹枝之間____織它的網。通過以複雜的圖案仔細交織絲線，它為昆蟲創造了一個強大的陷阱。","word":"weave"}},"weep":{"createdAt":1783259812523,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"weep 是「哭泣」的正式或文學用詞，指流淚哭泣的行為，通常表示深刻的悲傷或感動。","options":["laugh","weep","speak","sleep"],"sentence":"The widow began to ______ as she watched her late husband's old photograph. Her tears flowed uncontrollably as memories of their life together overwhelmed her.","translation":"寡婦在看到已故丈夫的舊照片時開始哭泣。當對他們共同生活的回憶壓倒她時，她的淚水不由自主地流出。","word":"weep"}},"weigh":{"createdAt":1785281292785,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"weigh 是指用秤或體重計測量某物或某人的重量，結果通常以公斤或磅為單位表示。","options":["measure","weigh","count","calculate"],"sentence":"The doctor asked me to ______ myself on the scale to check my health progress. The numbers on the display showed exactly 72 kilograms.","translation":"醫生要求我在體重計上稱量自己以檢查我的健康進展。顯示屏上的數字顯示正好是72公斤。","word":"weigh"}},"weight":{"createdAt":1781747745753,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"weight 指的是物體或人的重量，通常用磅或公斤來測量，可以通過運動和飲食改變。","options":["height","weight","age","temperature"],"sentence":"The doctor told me to monitor my ______ by stepping on the scale every morning. Since I started exercising regularly, the number has decreased by ten pounds.","translation":"醫生告訴我要通過每天早上站在體重計上來監測我的體重。自從我開始定期運動以來，這個數字已經減少了十磅。","word":"weight"}},"weird":{"createdAt":1781935654226,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"weird 是形容詞，表示「怪異的」或「不尋常的」，指令人感到陌生、奇怪或超自然的事物。","options":["normal","pleasant","weird","familiar"],"sentence":"The ______ sound coming from the old mansion at midnight frightened all the neighborhood children. Nobody could explain the mysterious origin of these unexplainable noises.","translation":"午夜時分從舊宅邸傳來的怪異聲音嚇到了所有鄰近的孩子。沒有人能解釋這些無法解釋的噪音的神秘來源。","word":"weird"}},"welfare":{"createdAt":1784002728418,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"welfare（福利）指的是政府或組織為了保護人民生活和幸福而提供的社會援助和福利制度。","options":["entertainment","welfare","punishment","decoration"],"sentence":"The government launched a new ______ program to support low-income families. The initiative includes healthcare, housing assistance, and unemployment benefits for those in need.","translation":"政府推出了一項新的福利計畫來支持低收入家庭。該計畫包括為有需要的人提供醫療保健、住房協助和失業救濟。","word":"welfare"}},"well":{"createdAt":1783516555625,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"well 在這裡作為名詞，指的是從地下挖出來的水井，是一個重要的水源設施。","options":["fountain","well","spring","stream"],"sentence":"The village depended on a deep ______ to provide fresh water for drinking and farming. Without this source, the community would have had no access to clean water.","translation":"村莊依靠一口深井來提供飲用水和農業用水。沒有這個水源，社區將無法獲得乾淨的水。","word":"well"}},"wept":{"createdAt":1785463654216,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wept 是 weep 的過去式，表示因悲傷或其他強烈情感而流淚、哭泣。","options":["laughed","wept","smiled","shouted"],"sentence":"When she heard the tragic news about her best friend, she ______ uncontrollably for hours. Tears streamed down her face as her body shook with deep sorrow.","translation":"當她聽到關於摯友的悲慘消息時，她無法控制地哭泣了數小時。淚水從她的臉上流下來，她的身體因深深的悲傷而顫抖。","word":"wept"}},"wharf":{"createdAt":1785033795929,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wharf是指船隻停靠和裝卸貨物的水邊結構，通常有木樁或混凝土柱子。","options":["market","wharf","bridge","warehouse"],"sentence":"The cargo ship pulled up to the ______ to unload its containers. Sailors tied the massive vessel to the wooden posts that lined the dock.","translation":"貨船靠到碼頭卸下集裝箱。水手們把這艘巨大的船隻繫在碼頭兩旁的木樁上。","word":"wharf"}},"whatsoever":{"createdAt":1785041538295,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"whatsoever 用於否定句後，表示「絲毫、任何」，強調完全沒有或一點也沒有的意思。","options":["therefore","whatsoever","otherwise","meanwhile"],"sentence":"The company showed no interest ______ in the merger proposal. The board rejected it without even reviewing the documents.","translation":"該公司對合併提案毫無興趣。董事會甚至沒有審查文件就拒絕了。","word":"whatsoever"}},"wheat":{"createdAt":1785135682098,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"小麥是一種重要的穀類作物，可以磨成麵粉製作麵包和其他食品。","options":["rice","wheat","corn","barley"],"sentence":"The farmer grows ______ in large fields every spring and harvests it in the summer. This golden grain is one of the most important crops worldwide and is commonly ground into flour for making bread.","translation":"農民每年春天在大田裡種植小麥，並在夏天收割。這種金黃色的穀物是世界上最重要的農作物之一，通常被磨成麵粉用於製作麵包。","word":"wheat"}},"wheelchair":{"createdAt":1783326581744,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"輪椅是一種有四個輪子的座椅，供行動不便的人坐著使用，可以自己推動或由他人推動。","options":["crutch","wheelchair","stretcher","cane"],"sentence":"After his accident, John had to use a ______ to move around the hospital. The device has four wheels and a seat, allowing him to be pushed or propelled by hand.","translation":"在他的事故後，約翰不得不使用輪椅在醫院周圍活動。這個裝置有四個輪子和一個座位，允許他被推動或用手推動。","word":"wheelchair"}},"whenever":{"createdAt":1782006620281,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"whenever用來表示「每當...時」，表示一個反覆發生的時間關係，適合搭配「many times」這類表示重複的語境。","options":["Although","Whenever","Unless","Because"],"sentence":"______ it rains heavily, the local river overflows and floods the nearby villages. The residents have learned to evacuate immediately because this pattern has occurred many times over the past decade.","translation":"每當下大雨時，當地河流就會氾濫並淹沒附近的村莊。居民已經學會立即撤離，因為這種情況在過去十年中已經發生過很多次。","word":"whenever"}},"whereabouts":{"createdAt":1783068673124,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"whereabouts 表示「行蹤；所在地」，指某人或某物現在或曾經所在的位置或地點。","options":["identity","motive","whereabouts","weapon"],"sentence":"The police officer asked the witness about the suspect's ______ on the night of the crime. It was crucial to establish whether the person had an alibi during that time.","translation":"警察詢問證人嫌疑人在犯罪當晚的行蹤。確定該人在那個時間是否有不在場證明至關重要。","word":"whereabouts"}},"whereas":{"createdAt":1781693269015,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"whereas 是連接詞，用來表示兩件事物之間的對比或相反的情況。","options":["because","whenever","whereas","unless"],"sentence":"Tom enjoys spending time indoors playing video games, ______ his brother prefers outdoor activities like hiking and camping. This contrast shows how different their personalities and interests truly are.","translation":"湯姆喜歡在室內玩電子遊戲，然而他的哥哥卻更喜歡登山和露營等戶外活動。這個對比顯示了他們的性格和興趣有多麼不同。","word":"whereas"}},"whine":{"createdAt":1781927792730,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"whine指的是一種帶有抱怨或不滿情緒的尖銳聲音，特別是用來表達不開心或乞求什麼。","options":["bark","whine","growl","howl"],"sentence":"The puppy started to ______ whenever its owner left the house. The continuous high-pitched complaint lasted for hours until someone returned home.","translation":"當主人離開房子時，小狗開始發牢騷。這種持續的尖銳抱怨一直持續到有人回家為止。","word":"whine"}},"whiplash":{"createdAt":1784818310064,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"whiplash 是指因突然的頭頸部往返運動（如車禍）所造成的傷害，特別是頸部損傷。","options":["bruise","fracture","whiplash","sprain"],"sentence":"The car accident caused her to suffer severe ______ in her neck and upper spine. The sudden jerking motion had left her with persistent pain and limited mobility that required months of physical therapy.","translation":"車禍導致她的頸部和上脊椎遭受嚴重的頸部損傷。突然的甩動已經使她陷入持久的疼痛和活動受限，需要幾個月的物理治療。","word":"whiplash"}},"whisper":{"createdAt":1784426633472,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"whisper 是指非常輕聲的說話方式，通常用來傳遞隱密或私人的信息。","options":["shout","scream","whisper","announcement"],"sentence":"She leaned close and spoke in a soft ______ so that only he could hear her secret. The quiet, intimate tone made it clear she didn't want anyone else to know.","translation":"她靠近並用柔和的低語說話，只有他能聽到她的秘密。那安靜親密的語調清楚地表明她不想讓任何人知道。","word":"whisper"}},"whistle":{"createdAt":1781503378961,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"whistle 表示通過嘴唇發出高音調的聲音，通常是吹出的曲調。","options":["sing","hum","whistle","shout"],"sentence":"The old man loved to ______ while he walked through the park. His cheerful tune filled the morning air and made passersby smile.","translation":"老人喜歡在公園散步時吹口哨。他歡快的曲調充滿了清晨的空氣，讓路人微笑。","word":"whistle"}},"wholesale":{"createdAt":1781503378969,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"wholesale 表示以批發方式銷售或購買大量商品，通常價格比零售便宜。","options":["retail","expensive","wholesale","premium"],"sentence":"The company purchased office supplies at ______ prices from the distributor. They bought large quantities of items in bulk to reduce costs significantly.","translation":"該公司從經銷商以批發價格購買辦公用品。他們大量購買商品以顯著降低成本。","word":"wholesale"}},"wholesome":{"createdAt":1783693741508,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"wholesome形容對健康有益的食物、活動或內容，強調其營養價值和對身心的積極影響。","options":["greasy","processed","wholesome","sugary"],"sentence":"The ______ meal that grandmother prepared contained fresh vegetables, lean protein, and whole grains. Every ingredient was chosen to promote good health and nutrition.","translation":"祖母準備的有益健康的飯菜包含新鮮蔬菜、瘦肉和全穀物。每一種食材都是為了促進健康和營養而精選的。","word":"wholesome"}},"wicked":{"createdAt":1783395908753,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"wicked 是形容詞，表示邪惡的、淘氣的或令人不快的，描述道德上的缺陷。","options":["virtuous","honest","wicked","kind"],"sentence":"The villain in the movie was portrayed as a ______ character who enjoyed causing suffering to innocent people. His cruel and evil nature made him the perfect antagonist for the hero.","translation":"電影中的反派被描繪成一個邪惡的角色，他享受對無辜者造成痛苦。他的殘酷和邪惡本質使他成為英雄的完美對手。","word":"wicked"}},"widely":{"createdAt":1782200614311,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"widely 是副詞，表示「廣泛地」，用來形容某事物在大範圍內被接受、使用或認可。","options":["narrowly","widely","rarely","occasionally"],"sentence":"Smartphones are used ______ around the world by billions of people every day. From rural villages in Africa to major cities in Asia, almost everyone has access to this technology.","translation":"智慧型手機在世界各地被數十億人每天廣泛使用。從非洲的偏遠村莊到亞洲的主要城市，幾乎每個人都能使用這項技術。","word":"widely"}},"widespread":{"createdAt":1782037869759,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"widespread是形容詞，表示某事物分佈廣泛、到處都有，影響範圍很大。","options":["localized","isolated","widespread","contained"],"sentence":"The flu virus became ______ across the entire country during the winter months. Schools, offices, and hospitals all reported high numbers of infected patients.","translation":"在冬季月份，流感病毒在整個國家變得普遍。學校、辦公室和醫院都報告了大量的感染患者。","word":"widespread"}},"widow":{"createdAt":1782549250472,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"widow 是指丈夫已去世的已婚女性，這個詞專指失去丈夫的女性。","options":["orphan","widow","divorcée","spinster"],"sentence":"After her husband passed away twenty years ago, the ______ decided to dedicate her life to raising their three children alone. She never remarried and became known in the community for her strength and resilience.","translation":"她丈夫在二十年前去世後，那位____決定獨自撫養她們的三個孩子。她從未再婚，並因其堅強和韌性在社區中聞名。","word":"widow"}},"widowed":{"createdAt":1782550983735,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"widowed 是形容詞，特指因配偶去世而失去伴侶的人，通常帶有悲傷的含義","options":["divorced","separated","widowed","estranged"],"sentence":"After her husband passed away five years ago, she became ______ and had to raise three children alone. The loss of her spouse left her as the sole provider for the family.","translation":"五年前她的丈夫去世後，她成為了喪偶者，必須獨自撫養三個孩子。失去配偶的她成為了家庭的唯一經濟來源。","word":"widowed"}},"widower":{"createdAt":1782140900232,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"widower 是指妻子已去世且未再婚的男性，與 widow（寡婦，指丈夫已去世的女性）相對。","options":["widow","bachelor","widower","divorcee"],"sentence":"After his wife passed away fifteen years ago, Mr. Chen became a ______ who raised his three children alone. He never remarried and devoted his life entirely to his family.","translation":"在他的妻子十五年前去世後，陳先生成為了一位鰥夫，獨自撫養他的三個孩子。他從未再婚，將一生奉獻給了家庭。","word":"widower"}},"wig":{"createdAt":1785282491562,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wig是指戴在頭上的假髮，用來改變外表或作為化裝的一部分。","options":["hat","wig","scarf","mask"],"sentence":"She wore a colorful ______ to the costume party to transform her appearance completely. The fake hairpiece covered her real hair entirely and made her look like a different person.","translation":"她在化裝舞會上戴著一頂彩色的假髮來完全改變她的外表。這頂假髮完全蓋住了她的真實頭髮，讓她看起來像另一個人。","word":"wig"}},"wild":{"createdAt":1782202151140,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wild 表示未經馴化、處於自然狀態的動物或環境，與 tame、domestic 和 gentle 相反。","options":["tame","wild","domestic","gentle"],"sentence":"The ______ animals roamed freely across the African savanna. Scientists had to wear protective gear because these creatures had never been trained or domesticated by humans.","translation":"野生動物自由地在非洲草原上漫遊。科學家們必須穿著防護裝備，因為這些生物從未被人類馴化或馴養過。","word":"wild"}},"wilderness":{"createdAt":1782056686165,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wilderness 指完全未開發、未經人類文明接觸的荒涼自然地區。","options":["park","wilderness","garden","village"],"sentence":"The hikers ventured deep into the ______ where civilization was nowhere to be found. They encountered wild animals, dense forests, and no roads or buildings for miles.","translation":"登山者深入荒野，在那裡找不到任何文明跡象。他們遇到了野生動物、茂密的森林，方圓數英里內沒有道路或建築物。","word":"wilderness"}},"wildlife":{"createdAt":1785134517462,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wildlife是指生活在自然環境中的野生動植物和野生生物，特別是指野生動物群體。","options":["landscape","wildlife","ecosystem","environment"],"sentence":"The national park is home to diverse ______ including lions, elephants, and zebras. The conservation team works to protect these animals and their natural habitats from human development.","translation":"國家公園是獅子、大象和斑馬等各種動物的家園。保護團隊致力於保護這些動物和它們的自然棲息地免受人類開發的影響。","word":"wildlife"}},"will":{"createdAt":1781696018692,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"will 作名詞意為意志、決心，指克服困難和實現目標的精神力量。","options":["luck","wealth","will","genetics"],"sentence":"Through sheer ______ and determination, the athlete overcame every obstacle on her path to becoming an Olympic champion. Her mental strength was as important as her physical abilities.","translation":"通過純粹的意志和決心，這位運動員克服了成為奧運冠軍道路上的每一個障礙。她的心理素質與體能一樣重要。","word":"will"}},"willing":{"createdAt":1781566055842,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"willing 表示一個人樂意或同意做某事，反映了個人的主動態度和接受度。","options":["unwilling","able","willing","hesitant"],"sentence":"He was ______ to help his friend move to a new apartment on Sunday. However, he made it clear he could only stay for two hours due to other commitments.","translation":"他願意在星期天幫助他的朋友搬到新公寓。然而，他明確表示由於其他承諾，他只能待兩個小時。","word":"willing"}},"wind":{"createdAt":1782308772650,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wind作為名詞意為風，指空氣的自然流動，可以造成物理上的影響和破壞。","options":["rumor","wind","silence","breath"],"sentence":"The ______ was so strong that day that it knocked over several trees in the park. The weather forecast had warned residents about the incoming storm hours before it arrived.","translation":"那天的風非常強勁，公園裡的幾棵樹被吹倒了。天氣預報在暴風雨到來前幾小時就警告了居民。","word":"wind"}},"wind_down":{"createdAt":1785339147826,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wind down表示逐漸放鬆、平靜下來，或者使某事物逐漸停止或結束。","options":["speed up","wind down","wrap up","settle in"],"sentence":"After a hectic day of meetings, Sarah decided to ______ by taking a warm bath and listening to soft music. By evening, she felt completely relaxed and at peace.","translation":"經過忙碌的會議日程後，莎拉決定通過洗溫水澡和聽柔和的音樂來逐漸放鬆。到了晚上，她感到完全放鬆和平靜。","word":"wind down"}},"winded":{"createdAt":1782823456543,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"winded 是形容詞，表示因為運動而呼吸急促、喘不過氣的狀態。","options":["tired","winded","confused","angry"],"sentence":"After running up the stairs, I felt completely ______. I had to sit down for a few minutes to catch my breath and calm my racing heart.","translation":"跑上樓梯後，我感到完全呼吸急促。我不得不坐下幾分鐘來恢復呼吸並平復急速跳動的心臟。","word":"winded"}},"windshield":{"createdAt":1783005778368,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"windshield 意為「擋風玻璃」或「風擋」，指車輛前部用來保護駕駛員和乘客的玻璃。","options":["mirror","windshield","tire","bumper"],"sentence":"A rock hit the car's ______ while driving on the highway, creating a long crack across the glass. The driver had to pull over and call a glass repair service immediately.","translation":"一塊石頭在高速公路上行駛時擊中了汽車的擋風玻璃，在玻璃上造成了一道長裂紋。駕駛員不得不靠邊停車並立即致電玻璃維修服務。","word":"windshield"}},"wipe":{"createdAt":1783505687425,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wipe是指用柔軟的布或物質輕輕地擦拭或抹去表面的東西。","options":["polish","wipe","scrub","brush"],"sentence":"She used a cloth to ______ the dust off the table. The gentle motion removed every speck without scratching the surface.","translation":"她用布來擦拭桌子上的灰塵。溫和的動作清除了每一粒灰塵，卻沒有刮傷表面。","word":"wipe"}},"wire":{"createdAt":1784540125093,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wire是指金屬線或電線，特別是用於傳輸電力或信號的導電金屬線。","options":["cable","wire","rope","string"],"sentence":"The electrician used a copper ______ to connect the light fixture to the power source. The thin, conductive metal strand needed to be properly insulated to prevent electrical hazards.","translation":"電工用銅製金屬線將燈具連接到電源。這根細的導電金屬線需要適當絕緣以防止電氣危害。","word":"wire"}},"wireless":{"createdAt":1783039485904,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"wireless 形容詞意為無線的，指無需用線纜連接就能傳輸信號或數據的技術或設備。","options":["wired","digital","wireless","encrypted"],"sentence":"The office installed a new ______ network system for all employees. Staff members no longer need to connect cables to their computers to access the internet.","translation":"辦公室為所有員工安裝了新的無線網絡系統。員工不再需要將電纜連接到他們的電腦就可以訪問互聯網。","word":"wireless"}},"wisdom":{"createdAt":1781565657696,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wisdom 名詞指深刻的知識和判斷力，通常通過經驗和深思熟慮而獲得。","options":["fortune","wisdom","education","luck"],"sentence":"Her ______ came from decades of experience and careful reflection on life's challenges. The elderly mentor shared insights that helped younger colleagues avoid making the same mistakes she had made.","translation":"她的智慧來自數十年的經驗和對人生挑戰的仔細反思。這位年長的導師分享了洞察力，幫助年輕同事避免犯她曾經犯過的同樣錯誤。","word":"wisdom"}},"wise":{"createdAt":1781738105691,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wise 表示具有智慧、判斷力強和經驗豐富，能夠給出好的建議。","options":["foolish","wise","inexperienced","hasty"],"sentence":"The elderly teacher was known as ______ for her thoughtful advice and deep understanding of human nature. Her students often sought her guidance when facing difficult personal decisions.","translation":"這位老教師以她的深思熟慮的建議和對人性的深刻理解而聞名為聰慧的人。她的學生在面臨困難的個人決定時經常尋求她的指導。","word":"wise"}},"wit":{"createdAt":1781840659329,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wit 指機智、聰慧的言語表達能力，特別是能夠快速、巧妙地說出有趣的話。","options":["strength","wit","patience","knowledge"],"sentence":"The comedian impressed the audience with his quick ______ and clever jokes. His ability to make sharp, funny remarks kept everyone laughing throughout the show.","translation":"這位喜劇演員以他的機智和聰明笑話給觀眾留下了深刻印象。他快速做出尖銳、有趣評論的能力讓大家全程歡笑。","word":"wit"}},"withdraw":{"createdAt":1783945015693,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"withdraw在銀行業務中表示「提款」，即從帳戶中取出金錢。","options":["deposit","withdraw","transfer","freeze"],"sentence":"The customer decided to ______ $500 from her savings account at the bank. She needed cash for her grocery shopping and bills.","translation":"這位顧客決定從銀行的儲蓄帳戶中提款500元。她需要現金來支付雜貨和帳單。","word":"withdraw"}},"withdrawn":{"createdAt":1784732185843,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"withdrawn 意指某人性格孤僻、內向，或指某物被撤回；在這個句子中用來形容人因為避免社交而變得孤僻的狀態。","options":["outgoing","withdrawn","confident","cheerful"],"sentence":"After the scandal, the celebrity became ______ and rarely appeared in public. She spent most of her time alone at home, avoiding social events and interviews.","translation":"在醜聞發生後，這位名人變得孤僻，很少在公開場合露面。她大部分時間都獨自在家，避免參加社交活動和接受採訪。","word":"withdrawn"}},"wither":{"createdAt":1784531912963,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wither表示植物或生物體因缺水或衰老而逐漸枯萎、凋謝，失去生命力","options":["bloom","wither","spread","multiply"],"sentence":"The beautiful flowers began to ______ after the gardener forgot to water them for two weeks. By the end of the month, nothing but dry, brittle stems remained in the vase.","translation":"園丁忘記澆水兩週後，美麗的花朵開始枯萎。到月底時，花瓶裡只剩下乾枯易碎的莖。","word":"wither"}},"withhold":{"createdAt":1785812071994,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"withhold 意為保留或抑制，表示刻意不透露或不提供某物，特別是在有意隱瞞或延遲的情況下。","options":["reveal","withhold","publish","distribute"],"sentence":"The government decided to ______ critical information from the public until the investigation was complete. Officials refused to release any details that might compromise the ongoing inquiry.","translation":"政府決定從公眾那裡保留關鍵資訊，直到調查完成。官員們拒絕發布任何可能危害進行中調查的細節。","word":"withhold"}},"within":{"createdAt":1785487324261,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"within是介詞，表示在某個範圍或限制之內，這裡指時間限制的內部。","options":["beyond","outside","within","before"],"sentence":"The hospital must complete the surgery ______ the next two hours to ensure the patient's safety. Any delay beyond this timeframe could jeopardize the medical outcome.","translation":"醫院必須在接下來的兩個小時內完成手術以確保患者的安全。超過這個時間範圍的任何延遲都可能危及醫療結果。","word":"within"}},"witness":{"createdAt":1781661288534,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"witness 是指目睹了某件事發生的人，可以提供目擊證詞或作為證人","options":["suspect","victim","witness","officer"],"sentence":"The only ______ to the accident was a woman who was waiting at the bus stop. She provided detailed information to the police about what she saw happen between the two vehicles.","translation":"這起事故唯一的目擊者是一名在公車站等車的女性。她向警察提供了關於她看到兩輛車之間發生事故的詳細信息。","word":"witness"}},"witty":{"createdAt":1781424574163,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"witty 形容說話或寫作充滿機智、風趣和聰慧的幽默。","options":["boring","witty","rude","confusing"],"sentence":"The comedian's ______ remarks had the entire audience laughing throughout the show. His clever wordplay and humorous observations were perfectly timed.","translation":"喜劇演員機智的評論讓整個觀眾在整場演出中笑聲不斷。他聰明的文字遊戲和幽默的觀察完美契合時機。","word":"witty"}},"woe":{"createdAt":1781414884516,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"woe是指深深的悲傷和不幸，通常用來形容因災難或重大失業而帶來的痛苦。","options":["wealth","woe","joy","anger"],"sentence":"The refugee family faced endless ______ after losing their home in the earthquake. Their pain and suffering continued for months as they struggled to rebuild their lives.","translation":"難民家庭在地震中失去家園後面臨無盡的悲哀。他們的痛苦和苦難持續了數月，因為他們努力重建生活。","word":"woe"}},"wonder":{"createdAt":1781841505536,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"wonder 作為名詞可指奇觀或令人驚嘆的事物，也可表示極其傑出或不可思議的人或事。","options":["wonder","pollution","entitle","healthcare"],"sentence":"The Great Wall of China is considered one of the world's greatest ______ due to its massive scale and architectural brilliance. Engineers and historians still marvel at how ancient civilizations managed to build such a magnificent structure without modern technology.","translation":"由於其龐大的規模和建築的精湛，中國長城被認為是世界上最偉大的奇觀之一。工程師和歷史學家仍然對古代文明如何在沒有現代技術的情況下建造如此宏偉的建築物感到驚嘆。","word":"wonder"}},"wooden":{"createdAt":1784078210973,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wooden（呆板的）用來形容人的表現、態度或動作缺乏自然感、生動感或情感，顯得僵硬且無趣。","options":["talented","wooden","impressive","engaging"],"sentence":"The actor's ______ performance on stage failed to engage the audience throughout the entire play. His lack of emotion and stiff movements made it difficult for viewers to connect with his character.","translation":"這位演員在舞台上呆板的表演未能在整場演出中吸引觀眾。他缺乏情感和僵硬的動作使觀眾難以與他的角色產生共鳴。","word":"wooden"}},"woodpecker":{"createdAt":1781709984198,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"woodpecker 名詞指的是以啄食樹皮中的昆蟲為生的鳥類，以其啄木的聲音而聞名。","options":["sparrow","woodpecker","robin","finch"],"sentence":"A ______ was tapping loudly on the old oak tree in my backyard every morning. The distinctive sound of its rapid pecking echoed through the quiet neighborhood at dawn.","translation":"每天早上，一隻啄木鳥在我後院的老橡樹上大聲敲擊。它快速啄木的獨特聲音在黎明時分迴盪在安靜的社區。","word":"woodpecker"}},"workforce":{"createdAt":1781661288533,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"workforce 是指一個公司或組織的全體員工或勞動力，代表組織的人力資源總和","options":["budget","productivity","workforce","revenue"],"sentence":"The company's ______ has grown significantly over the past five years. They now employ over 5,000 people across their factories and offices in multiple countries.","translation":"該公司在過去五年中的勞動力大幅增長。他們現在在多個國家的工廠和辦公室僱用了5,000多人。","word":"workforce"}},"workout":{"createdAt":1781917052440,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"workout指的是一段時間內的體育鍛煉或訓練活動，目的是增強體能或保持健康。","options":["conversation","workout","meeting","argument"],"sentence":"Sarah completed an intense ______ at the gym this morning, lifting weights and running on the treadmill. Her muscles were sore and she felt exhausted but energized by the physical exertion.","translation":"莎拉今早在健身房完成了一次激烈的鍛煉，舉重並在跑步機上跑步。她的肌肉酸痛，因為體力消耗感到疲憊但精力充沛。","word":"workout"}},"workshop":{"createdAt":1783243350911,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"workshop 意為研討會、工作坊或作坊，是進行實踐性學習或培訓的場所或活動。","options":["lecture","seminar","workshop","convention"],"sentence":"The company organized a ______ on digital marketing skills for all employees. Experienced professionals led interactive training sessions over three days.","translation":"公司為全體員工組織了一場關於數位行銷技能的研討會。經驗豐富的專業人士帶領為期三天的互動培訓課程。","word":"workshop"}},"worm":{"createdAt":1784899764059,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"worm是一種細長的無脊椎動物，通常生活在土壤中，常用作釣魚的魚餌。","options":["beetle","worm","spider","ant"],"sentence":"The fisherman dug in the soil to find a ______ to use as bait. This small creature would wiggle on the hook and attract the fish.","translation":"漁夫在土壤中挖掘以找到蠕蟲作為魚餌。這個小生物會在魚鉤上蠕動並吸引魚類。","word":"worm"}},"worship":{"createdAt":1783468712841,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"崇拜（worship）是指宗教信徒聚集在一起進行的宗教儀式和虔誠活動。","options":["celebrate","worship","complain","exercise"],"sentence":"Every Sunday morning, the congregation would gather at the temple to ______ together. They sang hymns, prayed, and listened to the priest's sermon.","translation":"每個星期日早上，信眾都會聚集在寺廟裡一起崇拜。他們唱聖歌、祈禱，並聽牧師的佈道。","word":"worship"}},"worth":{"createdAt":1784598868129,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"「worth」是介詞，用來表示某物的價值或金額，常用於「be worth + 金額」的句型中，表示值得或等於某個價值。","options":["worthy","worth","valuable","precious"],"sentence":"This antique painting is ______ thousands of dollars, according to the expert appraiser. The museum decided to purchase it because of its significant monetary and historical value.","translation":"這幅古董畫價值數千美元，根據專家鑑定師的說法。博物館決定購買它是因為它具有重要的金錢和歷史價值。","word":"worth"}},"worthwhile":{"createdAt":1781619188933,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"worthwhile 指值得花時間和精力去做的，具有價值和意義的。","options":["tedious","worthwhile","pointless","exhausting"],"sentence":"Despite the initial challenges, the volunteer project proved to be ______ and deeply fulfilling. The team members reported that helping the community made all their efforts worthwhile.","translation":"儘管最初面臨挑戰，這個志願者項目被證明是值得做的，也很有意義。團隊成員表示，幫助社區使他們的所有努力都值得。","word":"worthwhile"}},"worthy":{"createdAt":1785996173813,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"worthy 意思是「值得的」，通常用來形容某人或某事值得被給予時間、注意力或資源；在此句中表示該慈善機構因其良好的成績和透明度而值得被捐款支持。","options":["famous","worthy","expensive","popular"],"sentence":"That charity organization is ______ of our donation because it has helped thousands of families in need. Their transparent financial reports and proven track record demonstrate that every dollar we contribute will make a real difference.","translation":"那個慈善組織值得我們捐款，因為它已經幫助了數千個需要幫助的家庭。他們透明的財務報告和經過驗證的成績表明，我們貢獻的每一美元都會產生真實的影響。","word":"worthy"}},"wound":{"createdAt":1784975642497,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wound是名詞，表示皮膚或身體因外傷而造成的創傷或傷口，通常需要醫療護理。","options":["scar","wound","bruise","fracture"],"sentence":"The soldier received a serious ______ during the battle and had to be rushed to the hospital for surgery. The doctor carefully cleaned and bandaged the injury to prevent infection.","translation":"這名士兵在戰鬥中受到了嚴重的傷口，必須被緊急送往醫院進行手術。醫生仔細清潔並包紮了傷口以防止感染。","word":"wound"}},"woven":{"createdAt":1781503378971,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"woven 是 weave 的過去分詞，表示通過交織纖維或線條製成的織物。","options":["carved","painted","woven","carved"],"sentence":"The ______ basket was made from colorful strands of natural fibers. Each strand had been carefully interlaced to create a durable and beautiful pattern.","translation":"這個編織的籃子是由彩色的天然纖維製成的。每條纖維都被仔細交織在一起，以創造一個耐用而美麗的圖案。","word":"woven"}},"wrap":{"createdAt":1782533789101,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wrap 名詞意思是圍巾或披肩，是一種穿著在肩膀或身體外部的輕薄覆蓋物。","options":["blanket","wrap","coat","shawl"],"sentence":"She wore a silk ______ around her shoulders to stay warm during the outdoor evening gala. The elegant fabric complemented her formal dress perfectly.","translation":"她在肩膀上披著絲綢圍巾以在戶外晚宴上保持溫暖。優雅的面料完美地補足了她的正式禮服。","word":"wrap"}},"wrestle":{"createdAt":1782305067261,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wrestle是指與某人進行摔跤運動，涉及身體接觸、扭打和力量比較。","options":["compete","wrestle","train","practice"],"sentence":"The two athletes will ______ each other in the championship match next week. They will grapple, use strength, and try to pin each other to the mat according to the sport's rules.","translation":"這兩名運動員將在下週的錦標賽中互相摔跤。他們將會扭打、用力，並根據運動規則試圖將彼此壓制在墊子上。","word":"wrestle"}},"wrinkle":{"createdAt":1781425078612,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"皺褶是布料或皮膚上形成的褶痕，可以通過熨燙或拉扯來消除。","options":["stain","wrinkle","hem","button"],"sentence":"When she washed the shirt, it developed a deep ______ down the front that needed to be ironed out. She placed it on the board and used the hot iron to smooth it flat.","translation":"當她洗襯衫時，前面產生了一道深深的皺褶，需要燙平。她把它放在燙衣板上，用熱熨斗把它燙平整。","word":"wrinkle"}},"wrist":{"createdAt":1784527683542,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wrist是指連接前臂和手的關節，通常用來佩戴手錶或手鐲。","options":["ankle","wrist","elbow","shoulder"],"sentence":"She wore a delicate silver bracelet around her ______ at the party. The jewelry sat just above her hand, securing it tightly to her arm.","translation":"她在派對上在她的手腕上戴著一個精緻的銀色手鐲。這件珠寶坐在她的手上方，將其緊緊固定在她的手臂上。","word":"wrist"}},"written_off":{"createdAt":1782529318035,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"written off 意為註銷或沖銷，用於會計術語，表示從帳冊上移除或認為損失。","options":["reopened","sold","written off","restructured"],"sentence":"After the company suffered major losses, several unprofitable divisions were ______ in the annual financial report. Management decided these departments would no longer appear as company assets.","translation":"在公司遭受重大損失後，幾個無利可圖的部門在年度財務報告中被註銷。管理層決定這些部門將不再作為公司資產出現。","word":"written off"}},"wryly":{"createdAt":1784773591302,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"wryly用來形容以挖苦或自嘲的方式說話，通常帶著淡淡的苦笑或諷刺的語氣。","options":["earnestly","wryly","cheerfully","sincerely"],"sentence":"When asked if he enjoyed the three-hour meeting, he smiled ______ and said it was 'absolutely thrilling.' His tone made it clear he found the experience tedious and was being sarcastic about how much fun he had.","translation":"當被問到他是否享受那場三小時的會議時，他帶著苦笑說那「絕對令人興奮」。他的語氣清楚表明他認為這次經歷很乏味，並且在說他有多開心時帶有諷刺。","word":"wryly"}},"yacht":{"createdAt":1783925286802,"q":{"answer":0,"explanation":"yacht 是一種私人所有的高級帆船或動力船，通常用於休閒娛樂和奢華航海。","options":["yacht","canoe","ferry","submarine"],"sentence":"The wealthy businessman sailed his luxury ______ across the Mediterranean Sea during his vacation. The vessel featured multiple decks, a swimming pool, and a professional crew of twenty people.","translation":"這位富有的商人在假期期間駕駛他的豪華______橫跨地中海航行。這艘船擁有多層甲板、游泳池和由二十人組成的專業船員。","word":"yacht"}},"yearn":{"createdAt":1783926166270,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"yearn 是動詞，表示強烈而長久地渴望或思念某人或某事，常用於描述對遠方事物的深切思慕。","options":["forget","yearn","avoid","discover"],"sentence":"After living abroad for five years, she continued to ______ for her hometown and the familiar streets of her childhood. Every night, she would look at old photographs and think about returning home someday.","translation":"在國外生活了五年後，她持續渴望著自己的家鄉和童年熟悉的街道。每晚，她都會看著舊照片，想著有一天要回家。","word":"yearn"}},"yearning":{"createdAt":1783926166271,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"yearning 是形容詞，用來描述充滿渴望、思念或渴慕之情的眼神、表情或態度，通常表達對某人或某物強烈而溫柔的渴望。","options":["indifferent","yearning","cheerful","hostile"],"sentence":"His ______ gaze fixed upon the distant mountains as he stood alone on the hilltop at sunset. It was clear that he deeply missed the village beyond those peaks where his loved ones still lived.","translation":"當他獨自站在日落時的山頂上時，他渴望的目光盯著遠處的山脈。很明顯，他深深思念著那些山峰後面他所愛的人仍然住著的村莊。","word":"yearning"}},"yield":{"createdAt":1782475871717,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"yield 表示「屈服；讓步」，指在壓力或談判中放棄自己的立場或要求","options":["attack","yield","demand","strengthen"],"sentence":"After careful negotiation, both sides agreed to ______ on some key points to reach a compromise. Neither party wanted to continue the conflict.","translation":"經過仔細的談判，雙方同意在一些關鍵點上讓步以達成妥協。任何一方都不想繼續衝突。","word":"yield"}},"yoga":{"createdAt":1781622232184,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"yoga 是一種源自印度的身心修練方式，包括姿勢、呼吸和冥想。","options":["pottery","yoga","cooking","swimming"],"sentence":"Every morning, Michael practices ______ to improve his flexibility and reduce stress. He spends an hour performing various poses and breathing exercises on his mat.","translation":"每天早上，邁克爾練習瑜伽來改善他的柔韌性並減輕壓力。他在墊子上花一小時進行各種姿勢和呼吸練習。","word":"yoga"}},"yogurt":{"createdAt":1783947243479,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"優酪乳是一種發酵乳製品，具有益生菌，通常有多種水果口味。","options":["cheese","yogurt","milk","butter"],"sentence":"I enjoy eating ______ for breakfast because it contains beneficial bacteria. The creamy dairy product I had this morning came in strawberry and vanilla flavors.","translation":"我喜歡在早餐時吃優酪乳，因為它含有有益的細菌。我今早吃的這種奶油狀乳製品有草莓和香草口味。","word":"yogurt"}},"youngster":{"createdAt":1786251614054,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"youngster是指年輕人或少年，特別是指兒童或青少年，通常年紀相對較小。","options":["elderly","youngster","professor","athlete"],"sentence":"The ______ was excited to start his first day of school. He was only ten years old and still learning how to read and write properly.","translation":"那個年輕人很興奮能開始他的第一天上學。他才十歲，仍在學習如何正確地閱讀和寫字。","word":"youngster"}},"youth":{"createdAt":1781582424688,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"youth指的是青春期或年輕時代，通常指青少年時期，與childhood(童年)和adulthood(成年)不同。","options":["childhood","youth","adulthood","career"],"sentence":"During his ______, he was full of energy and dreams for the future. Those teenage years shaped who he would become as an adult.","translation":"在他的青春年代，他充滿了能量和對未來的夢想。那些少年時光塑造了他成為成年人後的樣貌。","word":"youth"}},"youthful":{"createdAt":1781437528474,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"youthful 形容看起來年輕或具有年輕人的特質，通常用來讚美保養得好的外表或年輕的精神。","options":["wrinkled","youthful","serious","tired"],"sentence":"Her ______ appearance surprised everyone at the reunion after thirty years. Despite being in her sixties, she had maintained her energy, smooth skin, and vibrant spirit that made her look decades younger.","translation":"她年輕的外表在三十年後的同學會上讓大家都感到驚訝。儘管她已經六十多歲，但她保持著活力、光滑的皮膚和充滿活力的精神，看起來年輕了好幾十歲。","word":"youthful"}},"zeta":{"createdAt":1781228443745,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"Zeta是希臘字母表中的第六個字母，在科學領域中經常被用於表示物理量和數學變數。","options":["eta","zeta","theta","delta"],"sentence":"The sixth letter of the Greek alphabet is ______. In mathematics and physics, this letter frequently appears in equations involving wave functions and electrical impedance.","translation":"希臘字母表中的第六個字母是______。在數學和物理學中，這個字母經常出現在涉及波函數和電氣阻抗的方程式中。","word":"zeta"}},"zip":{"createdAt":1785135254499,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"zip（尖嘯聲）指快速移動物體發出的尖銳嘶鳴聲，通常伴隨著速度感。","options":["bang","zip","thud","crack"],"sentence":"The arrow flew through the air with a loud ______ as it narrowly missed the target. The sound was so sharp and quick that everyone heard it whistle past their ears.","translation":"箭飛過空氣時發出尖嘯聲，險些擊中目標。聲音是如此尖銳而迅速，每個人都聽到它從耳邊呼嘯而過。","word":"zip"}},"zipper":{"createdAt":1785599812887,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"zipper 是一種衣服或袋子上的閉合裝置，由兩排互鎖的金屬或塑膠齒組成，可以用滑塊上下拉動來打開或關閉。","options":["button","zipper","buckle","latch"],"sentence":"I need to fix the broken ______ on my jacket before winter arrives. The metal teeth no longer slide smoothly up and down the fabric.","translation":"我需要在冬天來臨前修理我夾克上破損的拉鍊。金屬齒不再沿著布料光滑地上下滑動。","word":"zipper"}},"zone":{"createdAt":1781481311490,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"zone是指特定用途或具有特定特徵的地帶或地區。","options":["museum","zone","park","hospital"],"sentence":"The city council designated the waterfront area as a ______ for commercial development. Residential buildings were prohibited from being constructed in this designated area.","translation":"市政委員會將濱水區指定為商業發展區。在這個指定區域禁止建造住宅建築。","word":"zone"}},"zoo":{"createdAt":1783516555627,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"zoo 是名詞，指的是飼養和展示各種動物供公眾參觀的地方。","options":["park","zoo","garden","museum"],"sentence":"Last weekend, my family visited the ______ to see the lions and elephants. The children were excited to spend hours watching the animals in their large enclosures.","translation":"上個週末，我的家人去動物園看獅子和大象。孩子們很興奮地花了幾個小時觀看動物在牠們的大圍欄中活動。","word":"zoo"}},"zoologist":{"createdAt":1781843396461,"q":{"answer":3,"explanation":"zoologist是研究動物和動物學的科學家，在此指專門研究野生動物行為的專家。","options":["botanist","geologist","archaeologist","zoologist"],"sentence":"The ______ spent years studying animal behavior in African savannas. His research focused on predator-prey relationships and wildlife conservation.","translation":"那位動物學家花費多年時間在非洲草原研究動物行為。他的研究專注於捕食者與獵物的關係和野生動物保護。","word":"zoologist"}},"zoology":{"createdAt":1783927689731,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"zoology 是研究動物的科學，包括動物的分類、結構、行為和生活方式。","options":["botany","geology","zoology","ecology"],"sentence":"Professor Chen teaches ______ at the museum and specializes in animal behavior and classification. Her research focuses on how different species interact in their natural habitats.","translation":"陳教授在博物館教授動物學，專門研究動物行為和分類。她的研究重點是不同物種如何在自然棲息地中相互作用。","word":"zoology"}},"zoom":{"createdAt":1781337343696,"q":{"answer":2,"explanation":"zoom作動詞時指飛機等快速上升或突然成功地移動。","options":["descend","crawl","zoom","drift"],"sentence":"The fighter jet began to ______ rapidly into the sky during the aerial demonstration. The pilot pushed the throttle to maximum and climbed at an impressive angle.","translation":"戰鬥機在空中表演中開始迅速急升。飛行員將油門推至最大並以驚人的角度上升。","word":"zoom"}},"zoomed":{"createdAt":1781824968063,"q":{"answer":1,"explanation":"zoomed 表示鏡頭急速拉近或放大，使觀眾能看到更多細節。","options":["panned","zoomed","faded","blurred"],"sentence":"The camera ______ in on the actress's face during the emotional final scene. This close-up shot captured every tear rolling down her cheek perfectly.","translation":"攝影機在感人的最後場景中急速拉近女演員的臉部。這個特寫鏡頭完美地捕捉了她臉頰上的每滴眼淚。","word":"zoomed"}}},"report-recipients":{"U795afcd27f7012e5091e148880346c2e":{"botName":"Ivy's English Calendar","boundAt":1782374979151,"tokenEnvVar":"LINE_CHANNEL_ACCESS_TOKEN_BOT2"}},"sessions":{"-OoYqAum4Co_ZrGofvam":{"articleTitle":"Taiwan High-Speed Rail is giving its tunnel and underground communications a maj","correct":2,"fill":[{"answers":["a","b","c"],"isCorrect":[true,false,false],"sentence":"The project will replace more than 369 old ___ with fiber-optic ___ ___."},{"answers":["d","r"],"isCorrect":[true,false],"sentence":"The ___ stretch from Nangang to Banqiao will see ___ connectivity by year-end."}],"level":"B2","mcq":[{"correctAnswer":"To improve mobile connectivity in tunnels","isCorrect":true,"question":"What is the main purpose of Taiwan High-Speed Rail's new project?","studentAnswer":"To improve mobile connectivity in tunnels"},{"correctAnswer":"NT$2 billion","isCorrect":true,"question":"How much will the technology upgrade project cost?","studentAnswer":"NT$2 billion"},{"correctAnswer":"It transmits data using light","isCorrect":false,"question":"What is the main advantage of fiber-optic technology over conventional cables?","studentAnswer":"It requires less maintenance"},{"correctAnswer":"19%","isCorrect":false,"question":"What percentage of the rail track is underground or in tunnels?","studentAnswer":"68%"},{"correctAnswer":"By 2027","isCorrect":false,"question":"When is the entire project expected to be completed?","studentAnswer":"In February"}],